:1171055000","region:1171056100","region:1171056200","region:1171056600","region:1171057000","region:1171058000","region:1171059000","region:1171060000","region:1171061000","region:1171062000","region:1171063100","region:1171063200","region:1171064100","region:1171064200","region:1171064600","region:1171064700","region:1171065000","region:1171067000","region:1171068000","region:1171069000","region:1171071000","region:1171072000"],"basis":"2026-10-22 territorial title allocation (owner:seoul-faction-consolidation-20261022). King of the Arc. Basis for holding the Arc kingdom s04 and its duchies.","parentTitle":null},{"id":"title:kingdom-geography:seoul:06","name":"Southeast Kingdom","rank":"kingdom","holderPersonId":"K423","stateId":"S04","geographicTitleId":"geography:kingdom:seoul:06","basis":"2026-10-22 Territorial title distribution (owner:seoul-faction-consolidation-20261022). King of the Arc. Holds the Gangnam Duchy and the kingdom s04, which is the basis for the Arc''s Gangnam-centered region.","parentTitle":null}],"clan":{"id":"c624-d574-c8fc","name":"Haeju O Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c624-d574-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":-10,"Force":-20,"Material":10,"Communal":40,"Principle":30,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":-10,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-20,"Display":-10,"Sustained":40,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Arc","Livelihood":"General Assembly Duty Roster · Custody of Original Will","Rank":"Key","Title":"General Assembly Duty Roster · Custody of Original Will"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. O Gyeongjae was the last duty apprentice at the General Assembly Hall at 29 Daehangno 3-gil, Jongno-gu. After Im Hajun disappeared in the winter of 2125, he took over the pump maintenance records between the Ttukseom heat source and the General Assembly in Yeonji-dong. Im Chowon learned pump maintenance, and O Gyeongjae, as a member of the O clan, received the General Assembly''s ratification in 2126 and took over the duty roster and the custody of the original wills. O Gyeongjae did not ratify Han Jaemok''s plan for westward expansion. It was agreed that the original box of the pump maintenance process would be jointly sealed with the Floodgate Bureau.\nOffice. Rank: Key. Title: General Assembly Duty Roster · Custody of Original Will.\nAnecdote. Right after taking office, he took Im Hajun''s three wills out of the box and made them public in the General Assembly meeting room. The disclosure became a strong signal that broke Yun Seorin''s withholding of ratification.\nFamily. O Gyeongjae comes from the O clan. Jang Pilgyu holds the HC14 Yeouido ledger house.\nRelations. Pump technology alliance with Im Chowon. Water purification process trade with Han Jaemok. Checks Yun Seorin''s ratification authority.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Occupation: General Assembly duty and custody of the original wills\n- Rank: Key\n- Title: General Assembly Duty Roster · Custody of Original Will\n- O Gyeongjae''s work in the Arc duchy is connected to Samseong 1-dong.\n- O Gyeongjae''s work in duty service and custody of the original wills is connected to Jongno 5·6-ga-dong."},"biography":"**Life.** Generation of 2126. O Gyeongjae was the last duty apprentice at the General Assembly Hall at 29 Daehangno 3-gil, Jongno-gu. After Im Hajun disappeared in the winter of 2125, he took over the pump maintenance records between the Ttukseom heat source and the General Assembly in Yeonji-dong. Im Chowon learned pump maintenance, and O Gyeongjae, as a member of the O clan, received the General Assembly''s ratification in 2126 and took over the duty roster and the custody of the original wills. O Gyeongjae did not ratify Han Jaemok''s plan for westward expansion. It was agreed that the original box of the pump maintenance process would be jointly sealed with the Floodgate Bureau.\nOffice. Rank: Key. Title: General Assembly Duty Roster · Custody of Original Will.\nAnecdote. Right after taking office, he took Im Hajun''s three wills out of the box and made them public in the General Assembly meeting room. The disclosure became a strong signal that broke Yun Seorin''s withholding of ratification.\nFamily. O Gyeongjae comes from the O clan. Jang Pilgyu holds the HC14 Yeouido ledger house.\nRelations. Pump technology alliance with Im Chowon. Water purification process trade with Han Jaemok. Checks Yun Seorin''s ratification authority.\n\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Occupation: General Assembly duty and custody of the original wills\n- Rank: Key\n- Title: General Assembly Duty Roster · Custody of Original Will\n- O Gyeongjae''s work in the Arc duchy is connected to Samseong 1-dong.\n- O Gyeongjae''s work in duty service and custody of the original wills is connected to Jongno 5·6-ga-dong.","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"O Gyeongjae","type":"Contract","to":"Im Hajun","basis":"Took office in 2126 after ratification by the General Assembly"},{"from":"O Gyeongjae","type":"Contract","to":"Im Chowon","basis":"Formed the pump technical alliance through General Assembly ratification"},{"from":"O Gyeongjae","type":"Contract","to":"Han Jae-mok","basis":"Refused to ratify the western expansion proposal and agreed to the joint sealing of the box of original pump-maintenance process records"},{"from":"O Gyeongjae","type":"Rivalry","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Checks the president''s ratification authority by disclosing the three wills"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0088","name":"오경재","title":"","position":"","characterId":"K423","rank":"없음","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"총회 당직·유언 원본 관리","gender":"남성","stage":"주요","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-04#인물-오경재","detailRoute":"/people/person-0088","birthDate":"2104-08-22","birthday":"08-22","age":22,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"per