egion:1141052000","region:1141055500","region:1141056500","region:1141065500","region:1141066000","region:1141068500","region:1165051000","region:1165053000","region:1165053100","region:1174051500","region:1174052500","region:1174052600","region:1174053000","region:1174054000","region:1174055000","region:1174056000","region:1174057000","region:1174058000","region:1174059000","region:1174060000","region:1174061000","region:1174062000","region:1174064000","region:1174065000","region:1174066000","region:1174068500","region:1174069000","region:1174070000"],"basis":"개막 왕국 루트 결정(2026-10-11 사용자 승인)","parentTitle":null},{"id":"title:kingdom-geography:seoul:01","name":"중앙 왕국","rank":"kingdom","holderPersonId":"K144","stateId":"S06","geographicTitleId":"geography:kingdom:seoul:01","basis":"2026-10-22 영토 작위 배분(owner:seoul-faction-consolidation-20261022). 대한민국정부 대통령. 청와대·광화문 중심의 강북 권역과 종로 공작령 보유 근거.","parentTitle":null}],"clan":{"id":"c724-d30c-d3c9","name":"파평 윤씨","crest":"clan-crests/c724-d30c-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"권위":20,"개방":-10,"무력":-30,"물질":-20,"공동":10,"원칙":40,"공개":-30,"자격":0,"분산":-40,"변혁":-50},"desire":{"갈망":-10,"독점":10,"위험":-40,"과시":-20,"지속":40,"지향":"무성향","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"도장함 봉인·인준 보류 관리","헌법기관":"대한민국 대통령","관직":"대한민국 대통령"},"sections":{"생애":"윤서린은 종로구 세종대로 209 정부서울청사 본관에서 등기 당직을 맡으며 기록을 다뤘다. 기록 위조는 금지된다. 정부 도장이 없으면 도심의 급수계약은 효력이 없다. 윤서린이 대통령이 된 것은 북한산보국문기록가의 도장함을 끊기지 않게 지킨 뒤였다. 서울역기록법가의 도장함은 여리안의 것이다. 2126년 정부는 청와대에서 종로·중구의 주민 명부와 배급·인준 업무를 맡고, 정부서울청사 경비대는 도심 역을 지킨다. 한재목의 서부안을 멈추면 빚이 쌓이고, 찍으면 양천의 거부권이 죽는다.","관직":"품계 대통령. 관직은 대한민국 대통령. 생업 별명은 기록청장(대통령 직위와 별개).","일화":"세 유언이 접수됐을 때, 윤서린은 인준을 보류하고 함의 봉인만 확인했다.","가문":"북한산보국문기록가(HC05). 관리인. 서울역기록법가(HP04) 관리인은 여리안이다.","관계":"한재목과 인준권 분쟁. 남윤경과 배급 원장 교환. 정유라와 인준 경쟁.\n\n- 생업: 도장함 봉인·인준 보류 관리\n- 헌법기관: 대한민국 대통령\n- 헌법기관: 대한민국 대통령\n- 관직: 대한민국 대통령\n- 윤서린이 맡는 정부서울청사 등기 당직과 도장함 봉인·인준 보류 관리는 사직동의 업무와 이어진다.\n- 윤서린이 맡는 청와대의 종로·중구 주민 명부와 배급·인준 업무는 청운효자동과 이어진다.\n- 윤서린이 맡는 북한산보국문기록가의 도장함을 돌보는 일은 정릉4동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n기록청장 윤서린 곁에서 인준·공증·지도와 의료 이송 장부를 실제로 굴리는 실세다."},"biography":"**생애.** 윤서린은 종로구 세종대로 209 정부서울청사 본관에서 등기 당직을 맡으며 기록을 다뤘다. 기록 위조는 금지된다. 정부 도장이 없으면 도심의 급수계약은 효력이 없다. 윤서린이 대통령이 된 것은 북한산보국문기록가의 도장함을 끊기지 않게 지킨 뒤였다. 서울역기록법가의 도장함은 여리안의 것이다. 2126년 정부는 청와대에서 종로·중구의 주민 명부와 배급·인준 업무를 맡고, 정부서울청사 경비대는 도심 역을 지킨다. 한재목의 서부안을 멈추면 빚이 쌓이고, 찍으면 양천의 거부권이 죽는다.\n**관직.** 품계 대통령. 관직은 대한민국 대통령. 생업 별명은 기록청장(대통령 직위와 별개).\n**일화.** 세 유언이 접수됐을 때, 윤서린은 인준을 보류하고 함의 봉인만 확인했다.\n**가문.** 북한산보국문기록가(HC05). 관리인. 서울역기록법가(HP04) 관리인은 여리안이다.\n**관계.** 한재목과 인준권 분쟁. 남윤경과 배급 원장 교환. 정유라와 인준 경쟁.\n\n- 생업: 도장함 봉인·인준 보류 관리\n- 헌법기관: 대한민국 대통령\n- 헌법기관: 대한민국 대통령\n- 관직: 대한민국 대통령\n- 윤서린이 맡는 정부서울청사 등기 당직과 도장함 봉인·인준 보류 관리는 사직동의 업무와 이어진다.\n- 윤서린이 맡는 청와대의 종로·중구 주민 명부와 배급·인준 업무는 청운효자동과 이어진다.\n- 윤서린이 맡는 북한산보국문기록가의 도장함을 돌보는 일은 정릉4동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n기록청장 윤서린 곁에서 인준·공증·지도와 의료 이송 장부를 실제로 굴리는 실세다.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"김연규","type":"계약","to":"윤서린","basis":"온민의 문서 등재"},{"from":"김연규","type":"경쟁","to":"윤서린","basis":"온민의 문서 등재는 허락되고 인준은 거부됨"},{"from":"오경재","type":"경쟁","to":"윤서린","basis":"세 유언 공개로 대통령 인준권을 견제"},{"from":"정가온","type":"계약","to":"윤서린","basis":"유언 사본을 기록청에 넘김"},{"from":"강예준","type":"지휘","to":"윤서린","basis":"당회장 인준을 대통령 지휘로 심사"},{"from":"조하린","type":"지휘","to":"윤서린","basis":"임하준 유언 삼본을 문서고에서 지킴"},{"from":"윤지율","type":"지휘","to":"윤서린","basis":"대통령 추대 세력의 의료이송 기록"},{"from":"오서율","type":"지휘","to":"윤서린","basis":"공증 권한을 위임받아 급수문안을 심사"},{"from":"전나경","type":"계약","to":"윤서린","basis":"배급 원장 사본을 기록청에 넘김"},{"from":"장필규","type":"경쟁","to":"윤서린","basis":"급수계약 인준 사본의 해석권 경쟁"},{"from":"나봄결","type":"계약","to":"윤서린","basis":"윤서린의 교차검증에는 복종하되 은폐 배전은 거부한다"},{"from":"류한뫼","type":"맹세","to":"윤서린","basis":"윤서린의 인준 심사에 서부 사본을 넘기고"},{"from":"홍예준","type":"계약","to":"윤서린","basis":"윤서린의 인준 심사에 서기 원장을 바치고"},{"from":"섭달호","type":"계약","to":"윤서린","basis":"윤서린에게 음성·문서 교차 사본을 전하며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0146', 'ac15-c9c4-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0146","name":"Gang Ye-jun","title":"Ratification Examiner","position":"Ratification Examiner","characterId":"K145","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Will Handwriting Comparison and Ratification Examination","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#inmul-gangyejun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0146","birthDate":"2070-05-22","birthday":"05-22","age":56,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k145-handwriting-comparison","name":"Handwriting comparison","rating":65},{"id":"k145-approval-review","name":"Approval review","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k145-choice","name":"Reluctant to certify","description":"He spared words and weighed the stamp before the person. He believed that reversing a ratification once would shake all of Seoul Station.","behavior":"Anecdote. When three different wills of Im Hajun were received on the same day, he stopped the ratification examination and declared a handwriting comparison.","stress":"Fear. That one forged testament would pass and Seoul Station would sink into a great power''s stamp subcontract. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Took Yun Seorin''s command and examined Im Chowon''s Superintendent-succession ratification. Promised cross-verification of voice and documents with Hwang Eunseol, and deliberately delayed Jeong Yura''s joint-negotiation ratification claim.","effects":[]},{"id":"k145-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: ratification examiner. He spread the public original and the private testimony on one desk and suspended ratification with fewer than two witnesses.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: ratification examiner. He spread the public original and the private testimony on one desk and suspended ratification with fewer than two witnesses.","stress":"Fear. That one forged testament would pass and Seoul Station would sink into a great power''s stamp subcontract. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Took Yun Seorin''s command and examined Im Chowon''s Superintendent-succession ratification. Promised cross-verification of voice and documents with Hwang Eunseol, and deliberately delayed Jeong Yura''s joint-negotiation ratification claim.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Suspended review when three wills conflicted, yet deliberately delays a joint negotiation claim. Verification and institutional control coexist. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41800-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K145","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41800-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ac15-c9c4-c8fc","name":"Jinju Gang Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ac15-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":-5,"Force":-35,"Material":-30,"Communal":10,"Principle":60,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-30,"Transformative":-35},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":0,"Risk":-30,"Display":10,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Will Handwriting Comparison and Ratification Examination","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)","Assigned Duties":"Ratification Examiner","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness −5 | Force −35 | Materiality −30 | Communality 10 | Principle 60 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 10 | Dispersion −30 | Transformation −35","Desires":"Longing 10 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −30 | Display 10 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Monogamy"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry. The post of ratification examiner opened up through the deletion of a single line from the double ledger.\n- Comparing the handwriting on Gang Yejun''s will and reviewing its ratification is tied to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9). Assigned duties: Ratification Examiner.","Anecdote":"When three different wills of Im Hajun were filed on the same day, suspended the ratification review and declared a handwriting comparison.","Relationships":"Under Yun Seorin''s command, reviews the ratification of Im Chowon''s succession as chief steward. Promised voice-and-document cross-verification with Hwang Eunseol, and deliberately delays Jeong Yura''s petition for ratification of joint negotiation.","Ambition":"Makes succession and water-supply and repair treaties ineffective without Records Office ratification, thereby fixing Yun Seorin''s ratification veto inside the Records Office.","Fear":"That a single forged will gets through and Seoul Station is reduced to a seal-stamping subcontractor for the great powers.","Intervention":"You can escort a witness all the way to the document vault, or find the fourth handwriting that the examiner hid and force the ratification."},"biography":"Sparing with words, and weighs the seal before the person. Believes that if a ratification once stamped is reversed, the whole of Seoul Station will be shaken.\n\n- Livelihood: Handwriting comparison of wills and ratification review\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization\n- Position and grade: The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)\n- Assigned duties: Ratification Examiner\n**Life.** Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry. The post of ratification examiner opened up through the deletion of a single line from the double ledger.\n- Comparing the handwriting on Gang Yejun''s will and reviewing its ratification is tied to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Servant Position and Grade.** The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9). Assigned duties: Ratification Examiner.\n\n**Anecdote.** When three different wills of Im Hajun were filed on the same day, suspended the ratification review and declared a handwriting comparison.\n\n**Relationships.** Under Yun Seorin''s command, reviews the ratification of Im Chowon''s succession as chief steward. Promised voice-and-document cross-verification with Hwang Eunseol, and deliberately delays Jeong Yura''s petition for ratification of joint negotiation.\n\n**Ambition.** Makes succession and water-supply and repair treaties ineffective without Records Office ratification, thereby fixing Yun Seorin''s ratification veto inside the Records Office.\n\n**Fear.** That a single forged will gets through and Seoul Station is reduced to a seal-stamping subcontractor for the great powers.\n\n**Intervention.** You can escort a witness all the way to the document vault, or find the fourth handwriting that the examiner hid and force the ratification.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness −5 | Force −35 | Materiality −30 | Communality 10 | Principle 60 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 10 | Dispersion −30 | Transformation −35\n- Desires: Longing 10 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −30 | Display 10 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Monogamy\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gang Ye-jun","type":"Command","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Reviews the ratification of the Session Chair under the President''s command"},{"from":"Gang Ye-jun","type":"Oath","to":"Hwang Eunseol","basis":"Promised voice-and-document cross-verification"},{"from":"Gang Ye-jun","type":"Contract","to":"Im Chowon","basis":"Examined the Session Head ratification petition"},{"from":"Gang Ye-jun","type":"Rivalry","to":"Jeong Yura","basis":"Deliberately delays the joint negotiation ratification petition"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Hwang Eunseol","type":"Oath","to":"Gang Ye-jun","basis":"Swears cross-verification and ratification review"},{"from":"Yun Choa","type":"Contract","to":"Gang Ye-jun","basis":"Petitions the Records Office for citizenship ratification"},{"from":"Yang Haeon","type":"Command","to":"Gang Ye-jun","basis":"Is the commander who carries Gang Yejun''s declaration of review suspension only in sealed condition, and"},{"from":"Cha Se-on","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Gang Ye-jun","basis":"Is the priest who transfers Gang Yejun''s handwriting comparison into the ledger, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0146","name":"강예준","title":"인준 심사관","position":"인준 심사관","characterId":"K145","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"유언장 필적 대조·인준 심사","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-강예준","detailRoute":"/people/person-0146","birthDate":"2070-05-22","birthday":"05-22","age":56,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k145-handwriting-comparison","name":"필적 대조","rating":65},{"id":"k145-approval-review","name":"인준 심사","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k145-choice","name":"확정에 신중함","description":"말수를 아끼고 사람보다 도장을 먼저 따진다. 한 번 찍은 인준을 번복하면 서울역 전체가 흔들린다고 믿는다.","behavior":"일화. 서로 다른 세 장의 임하준 유언장이 같은 날 접수되자 인준 심사를 정지하고 필적 대조를 선언했다.","stress":"공포. 위조 유언장 한 장이 통과돼 서울역이 강국의 도장 하청으로 전락하는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 지휘를 받으며 임초원의 총관 계승 인준을 심사한다. 황은설과 음성·문서 교차검증을 약속했고, 정유라의 공동교섭 인준 청구는 고의로 늦춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k145-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 인준 심사관. 공개 원본과 비공개 증언을 같은 책상에 펼치고, 증인이 두 명 미만이면 인준을 보류한다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 인준 심사관. 공개 원본과 비공개 증언을 같은 책상에 펼치고, 증인이 두 명 미만이면 인준을 보류한다.","stress":"공포. 위조 유언장 한 장이 통과돼 서울역이 강국의 도장 하청으로 전락하는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 지휘를 받으며 임초원의 총관 계승 인준을 심사한다. 황은설과 음성·문서 교차검증을 약속했고, 정유라의 공동교섭 인준 청구는 고의로 늦춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"세 유언장이 충돌하자 심사를 멈췄지만 공동교섭 청구는 고의로 늦춘다. 검증 원칙과 기록청 권한 집중을 함께 반영한다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41800-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K145","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41800-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ac15-c9c4-c8fc","name":"진주 강씨","crest":"clan-crests/ac15-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":-5,"무력":-35,"물질":-30,"공동":10,"원칙":60,"공개":-20,"자격":10,"분산":-30,"변혁":-35},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":0,"위험":-30,"과시":10,"지속":0,"지향":"양성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"유언장 필적 대조·인준 심사","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"인준 심사관","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 −5 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −30 | 공동 10 | 원칙 60 | 공개 −20 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −35","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 0 | 위험 −30 | 과시 10 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 인준 심사관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 강예준의 유언장 필적을 대조하고 인준을 심사하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 인준 심사관.","일화":"서로 다른 세 장의 임하준 유언장이 같은 날 접수되자 인준 심사를 정지하고 필적 대조를 선언했다.","관계":"윤서린의 지휘를 받으며 임초원의 총관 계승 인준을 심사한다. 황은설과 음성·문서 교차검증을 약속했고, 정유라의 공동교섭 인준 청구는 고의로 늦춘다.","야망":"계승과 급수·수리 조약을 기록청 인준 없이는 효력이 없게 만들어 윤서린의 인준 거부권을 기록청 안에 고정한다.","공포":"위조 유언장 한 장이 통과돼 서울역이 강국의 도장 하청으로 전락하는 것.","개입":"증인을 문서고까지 호송하거나, 심사관이 숨긴 네 번째 필적을 찾아 인준을 강제할 수 있다."},"biography":"말수를 아끼고 사람보다 도장을 먼저 따진다. 한 번 찍은 인준을 번복하면 서울역 전체가 흔들린다고 믿는다.\n\n- 생업: 유언장 필적 대조·인준 심사\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 인준 심사관\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 인준 심사관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 강예준의 유언장 필적을 대조하고 인준을 심사하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 인준 심사관.\n\n**일화.** 서로 다른 세 장의 임하준 유언장이 같은 날 접수되자 인준 심사를 정지하고 필적 대조를 선언했다.\n\n**관계.** 윤서린의 지휘를 받으며 임초원의 총관 계승 인준을 심사한다. 황은설과 음성·문서 교차검증을 약속했고, 정유라의 공동교섭 인준 청구는 고의로 늦춘다.\n\n**야망.** 계승과 급수·수리 조약을 기록청 인준 없이는 효력이 없게 만들어 윤서린의 인준 거부권을 기록청 안에 고정한다.\n\n**공포.** 위조 유언장 한 장이 통과돼 서울역이 강국의 도장 하청으로 전락하는 것.\n\n**개입.** 증인을 문서고까지 호송하거나, 심사관이 숨긴 네 번째 필적을 찾아 인준을 강제할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 −5 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −30 | 공동 10 | 원칙 60 | 공개 −20 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −35\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 0 | 위험 −30 | 과시 10 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"강예준","type":"지휘","to":"윤서린","basis":"당회장 인준을 대통령 지휘로 심사"},{"from":"강예준","type":"맹세","to":"황은설","basis":"음성·문서 교차검증을 약속"},{"from":"강예준","type":"계약","to":"임초원","basis":"당회장 인준 청구를 심사"},{"from":"강예준","type":"경쟁","to":"정유라","basis":"공동교섭 인준 청구를 고의로 늦춤"}],"incoming":[{"from":"황은설","type":"맹세","to":"강예준","basis":"교차검증을 인준 심사와 맹세"},{"from":"윤초아","type":"계약","to":"강예준","basis":"시민권 인준을 기록청에 청구"},{"from":"양해온","type":"지휘","to":"강예준","basis":"강예준의 심사 정지 선언을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘이고"},{"from":"차세온","type":"신도","to":"강예준","basis":"강예준의 필적 대조를 원장으로 옮기는 신도이고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0147', 'c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99', '{"id":"person-0147","name":"Jo Ha-rin","title":"Archive Librarian","position":"Archive Librarian","characterId":"K146","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Archive Key and Reading Record Management","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#inmul-joharin","detailRoute":"/people/person-0147","birthDate":"2095-01-20","birthday":"01-20","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k146-access-log","name":"Access time logging","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k146-choice","name":"Keeps hold of originals","description":"Quiet, persistent, sensitive to humidity. She remembered even the finger marks of whoever borrowed a ledger.","behavior":"Anecdote. Right after the three testaments were received, the archive''s dehumidifier stopped and the pages began sticking together.","stress":"Fear. That on a night of cut power a candle would catch the archive''s paper and leave continuity as ash. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Kept, with her own hands, the three testament copies of Im Hajun that Yun Seorin had entrusted. Owed Song Jaemin the keeping of the cipher original and disliked Gang Yejun''s midnight reading.","effects":[]},{"id":"k146-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: archive librarian. Reading opened only with two librarians'' keys together, and she wrote the removal hour to the minute on the wall.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: archive librarian. Reading opened only with two librarians'' keys together, and she wrote the removal hour to the minute on the wall.","stress":"Fear. That on a night of cut power a candle would catch the archive''s paper and leave continuity as ash. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Kept, with her own hands, the three testament copies of Im Hajun that Yun Seorin had entrusted. Owed Song Jaemin the keeping of the cipher original and disliked Gang Yejun''s midnight reading.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Protects three originals with two keys and minute-level logs. A failed dehumidifier records a crisis, not a successful repair. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41820-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K146","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41820-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99","name":"Baecheon Jo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":-20,"Force":-25,"Material":-40,"Communal":0,"Principle":50,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-25,"Transformative":-45},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":-35,"Risk":10,"Display":20,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Archive Key and Reading Record Management","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"Local Records Research Officer, or a Local Administrative Jusa or Local Administrative Jusabo whose grade fits a Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management post","Assigned Duties":"Archive Librarian","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness −20 | Force −25 | Materialism −40 | Communality 0 | Principle 50 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −25 | Transformation −45","Desires":"Craving 10 | Exclusivity −35 | Risk 10 | Display 20 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The Archive Librarian post opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Jo Harin''s work of tending the archive keys and viewing records connects to the duties of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"Local Records Research Officer, or a Local Administrative Jusa or Local Administrative Jusabo whose grade fits a Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management post. Duties: Archive Librarian.","Anecdote":"Right after the three wills were received, the archive dehumidifier stopped and the carbon paper began to stick together.","Relationships":"Personally guards the three copies of Im Hajun''s will entrusted by Yun Seorin. Owes Song Jaemin a debt for safekeeping the cipher original, and dislikes Gang Yejun''s late-night viewings.","Ambition":"To put the Chief Steward''s will and the draft Sumun Charter into the same iron chest, making Seoul Station the final repository of Seoul''s records.","Fear":"On a night when the power ration is cut, a candle burns the archive''s hanji and continuity is left as ash.","Intervention":"Can obtain dehumidifier parts, or expose night entries that are not in the viewing ledger."},"biography":"Quiet and tenacious, and sensitive to humidity. Remembers even the hand grime of whoever borrowed a ledger.\n\n- Livelihood: Managing archive keys and viewing records\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service\n- Position/Grade: Local Records Research Officer, or a Local Administrative Jusa or Local Administrative Jusabo whose grade fits a Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management post\n- Duties: Archive Librarian\n**Life.** Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The Archive Librarian post opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Jo Harin''s work of tending the archive keys and viewing records connects to the duties of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Service Position/Grade.** Local Records Research Officer, or a Local Administrative Jusa or Local Administrative Jusabo whose grade fits a Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management post. Duties: Archive Librarian.\n\n**Anecdote.** Right after the three wills were received, the archive dehumidifier stopped and the carbon paper began to stick together.\n\n**Relationships.** Personally guards the three copies of Im Hajun''s will entrusted by Yun Seorin. Owes Song Jaemin a debt for safekeeping the cipher original, and dislikes Gang Yejun''s late-night viewings.\n\n**Ambition.** To put the Chief Steward''s will and the draft Sumun Charter into the same iron chest, making Seoul Station the final repository of Seoul''s records.\n\n**Fear.** On a night when the power ration is cut, a candle burns the archive''s hanji and continuity is left as ash.\n\n**Intervention.** Can obtain dehumidifier parts, or expose night entries that are not in the viewing ledger.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness −20 | Force −25 | Materialism −40 | Communality 0 | Principle 50 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −25 | Transformation −45\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Exclusivity −35 | Risk 10 | Display 20 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Jo Ha-rin","type":"Command","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Guards the three copies of Im Hajun''s will in the archive"},{"from":"Jo Ha-rin","type":"Debt","to":"Song Jaemin","basis":"Debt for Safekeeping the Cipher Original"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Hwang Eunseol","type":"Debt","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"Debt for Safekeeping the Cipher Original"},{"from":"Song Jaemin","type":"Contract","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"Cipher Original Chest Entrusted to the Archive"},{"from":"Yang Santae","type":"Contract","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"After screening out the forged copies, Yang Santae hands the safekept original and the receipt records over to Jo Harin. Jo Harin opens viewing with both librarians'' keys and records the removal time, so that the original does not vanish along with the discarded copies."},{"from":"Ji Seo-yun","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"is a priest who backs Jo Harin''s dual-key rule on site, and"},{"from":"Na Seonjae","type":"Command","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"enforces Jo Harin''s removal-time schedule through patrols, and"},{"from":"Cha Se-on","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"receives the three copies taken from Jo Harin''s iron chest, and"},{"from":"Ji Hansol","type":"Command","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"is under orders to guard Jo Harin''s chest of three copies at the base, and"},{"from":"Eo Taesan","type":"Contract","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"matches the humidity and storage cycle of Jo Harin''s iron chest, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0147","name":"조하린","title":"문서고 사서","position":"문서고 사서","characterId":"K146","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"문서고 열쇠·열람 기록 관리","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-조하린","detailRoute":"/people/person-0147","birthDate":"2095-01-20","birthday":"01-20","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k146-access-log","name":"열람 시각 기록","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k146-choice","name":"원본을 놓지 않음","description":"조용하고 집요하며 습도에 민감하다. 장부를 빌려 간 사람의 손때까지 기억한다.","behavior":"일화. 세 유언장 접수 직후 문서고 제습기가 멈춰 먹지가 서로 들러붙기 시작했다.","stress":"공포. 전력 배급이 끊긴 밤에 촛불이 문서고 한지를 태워 연속성이 재로 남는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린이 맡긴 임하준 유언 삼본을 직접 지킨다. 송재민에게 암호문 원본 보관 빚이 있고, 강예준의 심야 열람을 꺼린다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k146-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 문서고 사서. 열람은 두 사서의 열쇠가 동시에 있어야 열고, 반출 시각을 분 단위로 벽에 적는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 문서고 사서. 열람은 두 사서의 열쇠가 동시에 있어야 열고, 반출 시각을 분 단위로 벽에 적는다.","stress":"공포. 전력 배급이 끊긴 밤에 촛불이 문서고 한지를 태워 연속성이 재로 남는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린이 맡긴 임하준 유언 삼본을 직접 지킨다. 송재민에게 암호문 원본 보관 빚이 있고, 강예준의 심야 열람을 꺼린다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"두 열쇠와 분 단위 기록으로 삼본을 지킨다. 제습기 정지는 위기 기록이며 수리나 복구 성공의 증거는 아니다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41820-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K146","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41820-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99","name":"배천 조씨","crest":"clan-crests/c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":-20,"무력":-25,"물질":-40,"공동":0,"원칙":50,"공개":-10,"자격":10,"분산":-25,"변혁":-45},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":-35,"위험":10,"과시":20,"지속":35,"지향":"유동","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"문서고 열쇠·열람 기록 관리","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방기록연구사 또는 지방행정주사·지방행정주사보 중 서울특별시 기록관리 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"문서고 사서","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 −20 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −40 | 공동 0 | 원칙 50 | 공개 −10 | 자격 10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −45","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 −35 | 위험 10 | 과시 20 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 문서고 사서 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 조하린의 문서고 열쇠와 열람 기록을 돌보는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방기록연구사 또는 지방행정주사·지방행정주사보 중 서울특별시 기록관리 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 문서고 사서.","일화":"세 유언장 접수 직후 문서고 제습기가 멈춰 먹지가 서로 들러붙기 시작했다.","관계":"윤서린이 맡긴 임하준 유언 삼본을 직접 지킨다. 송재민에게 암호문 원본 보관 빚이 있고, 강예준의 심야 열람을 꺼린다.","야망":"총관 유언과 수문헌장 초안을 같은 철제 함에 넣어 서울역을 서울 기록의 최종 보관소로 만든다.","공포":"전력 배급이 끊긴 밤에 촛불이 문서고 한지를 태워 연속성이 재로 남는 것.","개입":"제습 부품을 구하거나, 열람 장부에 없는 야간 출입을 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"조용하고 집요하며 습도에 민감하다. 장부를 빌려 간 사람의 손때까지 기억한다.\n\n- 생업: 문서고 열쇠·열람 기록 관리\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방기록연구사 또는 지방행정주사·지방행정주사보 중 서울특별시 기록관리 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 문서고 사서\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 문서고 사서 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 조하린의 문서고 열쇠와 열람 기록을 돌보는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방기록연구사 또는 지방행정주사·지방행정주사보 중 서울특별시 기록관리 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 문서고 사서.\n\n**일화.** 세 유언장 접수 직후 문서고 제습기가 멈춰 먹지가 서로 들러붙기 시작했다.\n\n**관계.** 윤서린이 맡긴 임하준 유언 삼본을 직접 지킨다. 송재민에게 암호문 원본 보관 빚이 있고, 강예준의 심야 열람을 꺼린다.\n\n**야망.** 총관 유언과 수문헌장 초안을 같은 철제 함에 넣어 서울역을 서울 기록의 최종 보관소로 만든다.\n\n**공포.** 전력 배급이 끊긴 밤에 촛불이 문서고 한지를 태워 연속성이 재로 남는 것.\n\n**개입.** 제습 부품을 구하거나, 열람 장부에 없는 야간 출입을 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 −20 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −40 | 공동 0 | 원칙 50 | 공개 −10 | 자격 10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −45\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 −35 | 위험 10 | 과시 20 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"조하린","type":"지휘","to":"윤서린","basis":"임하준 유언 삼본을 문서고에서 지킴"},{"from":"조하린","type":"빚","to":"송재민","basis":"암호문 원본 보관 빚"}],"incoming":[{"from":"황은설","type":"빚","to":"조하린","basis":"암호문 원본 보관 빚"},{"from":"송재민","type":"계약","to":"조하린","basis":"암호 원본 함을 문서고에 맡김"},{"from":"양산태","type":"계약","to":"조하린","basis":"양산태는 위조 사본을 가린 뒤 보관한 원본과 인수 기록을 조하린에게 넘긴다. 조하린은 두 사서의 열쇠로 열람을 열고 반출 시각을 남겨, 원본이 사본 폐기와 함께 사라지지 않게 한다."},{"from":"지서윤","type":"신도","to":"조하린","basis":"조하린의 이중 열쇠 규칙을 현장에서 받치는 신도이고"},{"from":"나선재","type":"지휘","to":"조하린","basis":"조하린의 반출 시각표를 순찰로 집행하고"},{"from":"차세온","type":"신도","to":"조하린","basis":"조하린의 철제 함에서 삼본을 꺼내 받으며"},{"from":"지한솔","type":"지휘","to":"조하린","basis":"조하린의 삼본 함을 기지에서 지키는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"어태산","type":"계약","to":"조하린","basis":"조하린의 철제 함 습도와 보관 주기를 맞추며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0148', 'c724-d30c-d3c9', '{"id":"person-0148","name":"Yun Ji-yul","title":"Medical Transport Recorder","position":"Medical Transport Recorder","characterId":"K147","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Medical Transport Dispatch Management by Severity","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#inmul-yunjiyul","detailRoute":"/people/person-0148","birthDate":"2064-07-24","birthday":"07-24","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k147-medical-dispatch","name":"Severity-based dispatch","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k147-choice","name":"Separates patients from troops","description":"Principled, but she folded procedure before patients. She saw leaving nameless dead in the ledger as her own calling.","behavior":"Anecdote. The refugee families of Bukhansan Bogukmun crowded into the Seoul Station infirmary carrying withdrawal notices bound with Amsa service contracts.","stress":"Fear. That the transfer lists would merge with military registries and the refugees would remain as troop numbers alone. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Belonged to Yun Seorin''s endorsement faction and owed Ryu Eunbi the medicine-allocation ledger. Left Shin Boram''s family transfer as a priority record.","effects":[]},{"id":"k147-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: medical-transfer registrar. She published severity-order dispatches and cancelled a run at once whenever weapons and patients boarded one train.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: medical-transfer registrar. She published severity-order dispatches and cancelled a run at once whenever weapons and patients boarded one train.","stress":"Fear. That the transfer lists would merge with military registries and the refugees would remain as troop numbers alone. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Belonged to Yun Seorin''s endorsement faction and owed Ryu Eunbi the medicine-allocation ledger. Left Shin Boram''s family transfer as a priority record.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Posts severity-based dispatch and cancels mixed weapons and patient transport. Medical records and dispatch do not establish clinical expertise. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51110-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K147","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51110-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c724-d30c-d3c9","name":"Papyeong Yun Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c724-d30c-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":-10,"Force":-35,"Material":-35,"Communal":10,"Principle":70,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":-40,"Transformative":-40},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":-30,"Display":5,"Sustained":40,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical Transport Dispatch Management by Severity","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"Local Health Section","Assigned Duties":"Medical Transport Recorder","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force −35 | Materialism −35 | Communality 10 | Principle 70 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization −40 | Transformation −40","Desires":"Craving 40 | Exclusivity −30 | Risk −30 | Display 5 | Persistence 40 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The Medical Transport Recorder post opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Yun Jiyul''s work of dispatching medical transport by severity connects to the duties of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"Local Health Section. Duties: Medical Transport Recorder.","Anecdote":"A refugee family from Bukhansan Bogungmun swarmed into the Seoul Station infirmary carrying water-ration iron tokens together with an Amsa service contract.","Relationships":"Belongs to Yun Seorin''s backing faction and owes Ryu Eunbi the medicine allocation ledger. Records the transfer of Sin Boram''s family as a priority.","Ambition":"Bring the central disaster-medicine coordination network under Records Office ratification so that the great powers cannot divert ambulance trains to military supply.","Fear":"That the transfer rosters merge with the military household register, leaving refugees remembered only as troop numbers.","Intervention":"Can escort a train carrying only patients, or separate out a transfer roster mixed with military household registers."},"biography":"Principled, yet sets procedure aside in front of a patient. Sees recording nameless corpses in the ledger as their duty.\n\n- Livelihood: Managing medical transport dispatch by severity\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization\n- Position/Rank: Local Health Section\n- Duties: Medical Transport Recorder\n**Life.** Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Medical Transport Recorder opened up through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Dispatching medical transport according to Yun Jiyul''s severity grades connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Service Position/Rank.** Local Health Section. Duties: Medical Transport Recorder.\n\n**Anecdote.** Refugee families from Bukhansan Bogungmun crowded into the Seoul Station infirmary carrying water-ration iron tokens along with their Amsa service contracts.\n\n**Relations.** Belongs to Yun Seorin''s backing faction and owes Ryu Eunbi the medicine allocation ledger. Records the transfer of Sin Boram''s family as a priority.\n\n**Ambition.** Bring the central disaster-medicine coordination network under Records Office ratification so that the great powers cannot divert ambulance trains to military supply.\n\n**Fear.** That the transfer rosters merge with the military household register, leaving refugees remembered only as troop numbers.\n\n**Intervention.** Can escort a train carrying only patients, or separate out a transfer roster mixed with military household registers.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force −35 | Materialism −35 | Community 10 | Principle 70 | Publicity −15 | Credentials 15 | Decentralization −40 | Transformation −40\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −30 | Display 5 | Persistence 40 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Union: Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yun Ji-yul","type":"Command","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Medical Transfer Records of the Presidential Backers"},{"from":"Yun Ji-yul","type":"Debt","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Owes the medicine allocation ledger to the Healing Guild"},{"from":"Yun Ji-yul","type":"Contract","to":"Sin Boram","basis":"Records the transfer of the Bukhansan Bogungmun family as a priority"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Seo Na-yeon","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Ji-yul","basis":"Allocates infirmary ice as a priority"},{"from":"Sin Boram","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Ji-yul","basis":"Asks for a priority transfer record"},{"from":"Yeon Jiu","type":"Command","to":"Yun Ji-yul","basis":"Takes direction to carry out Yun Jiyul''s transfer ledger at the bedside, and"},{"from":"Seol Dahin","type":"Command","to":"Yun Ji-yul","basis":"Carries out Yun Jiyul''s dispatch cancellations on the platform, and"},{"from":"Yeon Taesol","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Yun Ji-yul","basis":"is a priest who translates Yun Jiyul''s medical transport ledger into coordination tables, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0148","name":"윤지율","title":"의료이송 기록관","position":"의료이송 기록관","characterId":"K147","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"중증도별 의료이송 배차 관리","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-윤지율","detailRoute":"/people/person-0148","birthDate":"2064-07-24","birthday":"07-24","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k147-medical-dispatch","name":"중증도 배차","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k147-choice","name":"환자를 병력과 분리","description":"원칙적이지만 환자 앞에서는 절차를 접는다. 이름 없는 시신을 장부에 남기는 일을 자신의 본분으로 본다.","behavior":"일화. 북한산보국문 피난 가족이 암사 복무계약서와 함께 급수권 철표를 들고 서울역 의무실로 몰려왔다.","stress":"공포. 이송 명단이 군사호적과 합쳐져 피난민이 병력 숫자로만 남는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 추대 세력에 속하고 류은비에게 약품 배정 장부를 빚졌다. 신보람의 가족 이송을 우선 기록으로 남긴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k147-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 의료이송 기록관. 중증도 순 배차를 공개하고, 무기와 환자가 한 열차에 타면 즉시 운행을 취소한다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 의료이송 기록관. 중증도 순 배차를 공개하고, 무기와 환자가 한 열차에 타면 즉시 운행을 취소한다.","stress":"공포. 이송 명단이 군사호적과 합쳐져 피난민이 병력 숫자로만 남는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 추대 세력에 속하고 류은비에게 약품 배정 장부를 빚졌다. 신보람의 가족 이송을 우선 기록으로 남긴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"중증도 배차를 공개하고 무기와 환자의 혼승을 취소한다. 의료 기록과 배차의 수행은 진료 전문성을 뜻하지 않는다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51110-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K147","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51110-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c724-d30c-d3c9","name":"파평 윤씨","crest":"clan-crests/c724-d30c-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":-10,"무력":-35,"물질":-35,"공동":10,"원칙":70,"공개":-15,"자격":15,"분산":-40,"변혁":-40},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":-30,"위험":-30,"과시":5,"지속":40,"지향":"이성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"중증도별 의료이송 배차 관리","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방보건계","담당 업무":"의료이송 기록관","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −35 | 공동 10 | 원칙 70 | 공개 −15 | 자격 15 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −40","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −30 | 과시 5 | 지속 40 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 의료이송 기록관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 윤지율의 중증도에 따라 의료이송을 배차하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방보건계. 담당 업무: 의료이송 기록관.","일화":"북한산보국문 피난 가족이 암사 복무계약서와 함께 급수권 철표를 들고 서울역 의무실로 몰려왔다.","관계":"윤서린의 추대 세력에 속하고 류은비에게 약품 배정 장부를 빚졌다. 신보람의 가족 이송을 우선 기록으로 남긴다.","야망":"중앙 재난의료 조정망을 기록청 인준 아래 두어 강국이 구급 열차를 군수로 돌리지 못하게 한다.","공포":"이송 명단이 군사호적과 합쳐져 피난민이 병력 숫자로만 남는 것.","개입":"환자만 태운 열차를 호송하거나, 군사호적이 섞인 이송 명단을 분리해 줄 수 있다."},"biography":"원칙적이지만 환자 앞에서는 절차를 접는다. 이름 없는 시신을 장부에 남기는 일을 자신의 본분으로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 중증도별 의료이송 배차 관리\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방보건계\n- 담당 업무: 의료이송 기록관\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 의료이송 기록관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 윤지율의 중증도에 따라 의료이송을 배차하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방보건계. 담당 업무: 의료이송 기록관.\n\n**일화.** 북한산보국문 피난 가족이 암사 복무계약서와 함께 급수권 철표를 들고 서울역 의무실로 몰려왔다.\n\n**관계.** 윤서린의 추대 세력에 속하고 류은비에게 약품 배정 장부를 빚졌다. 신보람의 가족 이송을 우선 기록으로 남긴다.\n\n**야망.** 중앙 재난의료 조정망을 기록청 인준 아래 두어 강국이 구급 열차를 군수로 돌리지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 이송 명단이 군사호적과 합쳐져 피난민이 병력 숫자로만 남는 것.\n\n**개입.** 환자만 태운 열차를 호송하거나, 군사호적이 섞인 이송 명단을 분리해 줄 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −35 | 공동 10 | 원칙 70 | 공개 −15 | 자격 15 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −40\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −30 | 과시 5 | 지속 40 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"윤지율","type":"지휘","to":"윤서린","basis":"대통령 추대 세력의 의료이송 기록"},{"from":"윤지율","type":"빚","to":"류은비","basis":"약품 배정 장부를 치료길드에 빚짐"},{"from":"윤지율","type":"계약","to":"신보람","basis":"북한산보국문 가족 이송을 우선 기록으로 남김"}],"incoming":[{"from":"서나연","type":"계약","to":"윤지율","basis":"의무실 얼음을 우선 배정"},{"from":"신보람","type":"계약","to":"윤지율","basis":"이송 우선 기록을 부탁"},{"from":"연지우","type":"지휘","to":"윤지율","basis":"윤지율의 이송 장부를 침상에서 집행하는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"설다흰","type":"지휘","to":"윤지율","basis":"윤지율의 배차 취소를 승강장에서 집행하며"},{"from":"연태솔","type":"신도","to":"윤지율","basis":"윤지율의 의료이송 원장을 조정표로 번역하는 신도이고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0149', 'c624-d574-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0149","name":"O Seo-yul","title":"Contract Notary","position":"Contract Notary","characterId":"K148","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Notarizing Contract Termination Conditions and Witness Fields","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#person-oseoyul","detailRoute":"/people/person-0149","birthDate":"2067-11-29","birthday":"11-29","age":59,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k148-clause-checking","name":"Termination clause checking","rating":65},{"id":"k148-notarial-copy","name":"Notarial copy checking","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k148-choice","name":"Rejects empty clauses","description":"Quick of arithmetic, he hated blanks in wording. He repeated that a verbal promise was not a promise.","behavior":"Anecdote. With the Ttukseom water contract''s expiry day marked red on the notary ledger, three great powers'' different drafts arrived at once.","stress":"Fear. That after he notarized a collective cutoff clause, that water would stop at Seoul Station itself. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Received notary authority delegated from Yun Seorin and was reviewing Han Jaemok''s western water draft. Traded the notarization of the Yongsan rail contract with Gwon Sion.","effects":[]},{"id":"k148-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: contract notary. He forced exit conditions and witness lines into every clause and gave out copies only after the stamps dried.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: contract notary. He forced exit conditions and witness lines into every clause and gave out copies only after the stamps dried.","stress":"Fear. That after he notarized a collective cutoff clause, that water would stop at Seoul Station itself. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Received notary authority delegated from Yun Seorin and was reviewing Han Jaemok''s western water draft. Traded the notarization of the Yongsan rail contract with Gwon Sion.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Requires termination conditions and witnesses before releasing sealed copies. Receiving three drafts is not a negotiated settlement or constitution-making. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51130-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K148","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51130-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c624-d574-c8fc","name":"Haeju O Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c624-d574-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":30,"Openness":-15,"Force":-25,"Material":-25,"Communal":20,"Principle":45,"Public":-25,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-30,"Transformative":-50},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":25,"Risk":35,"Display":25,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Notarizing Contract Termination Conditions and Witness Fields","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)","Assigned Duties":"Contract Notary","Values":"Authority 30 | Openness −15 | Force −25 | Materialism −25 | Community 20 | Principle 45 | Publicity −25 | Credentials 10 | Decentralization −30 | Transformation −50","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly 25 | Risk 35 | Display 25 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: Same-sex | Union: Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Contract Notary opened up through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Notarizing O Seoyul''s contract termination conditions and witness columns connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"A grade among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Clerk (Grade 8), and Assistant Clerk (Grade 9), whichever fits the post at a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office. Duties: Contract Notary.","Anecdote":"With the expiry date of the Ttukseom water-supply contract marked red in the notarial ledger, three powers'' differing drafts arrived at the same time.","Relationships":"Was delegated notarial authority by Yun Seorin and is reviewing Han Jaemok''s western water-supply draft. Trades Yongsan railway contract notarization with Gwon Sion.","Ambition":"Bind both Han Jaemok''s Sluice Charter and the joint bargaining text of the Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization under Seoul Station notarization, so that the Records Office holds the authority to audit water supply.","Fear":"That after notarizing a mass water-cutoff clause, that cutoff will turn on Seoul Station itself.","Intervention":"Can bring in a revised draft that removes the water-cutoff clause, or enter in the ledger the water bribes the notary has received."},"biography":"Quick with numbers and hates blanks in the wording. Repeats that an oral promise is not a promise.\n\n- Livelihood: Notarizing contract termination conditions and witness columns\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization\n- Position/Rank: A grade among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Clerk (Grade 8), and Assistant Clerk (Grade 9), whichever fits the post at a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office\n- Duties: Contract Notary\n**Life.** Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Contract Notary opened up through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Notarizing O Seoyul''s contract termination conditions and witness columns connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Service Position/Rank.** A grade among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Clerk (Grade 8), and Assistant Clerk (Grade 9), whichever fits the post at a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office. Duties: Contract Notary.\n\n**Anecdote.** With the expiry date of the Ttukseom water-supply contract marked red in the notarial ledger, three powers'' differing drafts arrived at the same time.\n\n**Relations.** Was delegated notarial authority by Yun Seorin and is reviewing Han Jaemok''s western water-supply draft. Trades Yongsan railway contract notarization with Gwon Sion.\n\n**Ambition.** Bind both Han Jaemok''s Sluice Charter and the joint bargaining text of the Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization under Seoul Station notarization, so that the Records Office holds the authority to audit water supply.\n\n**Fear.** That after notarizing a mass water-cutoff clause, that cutoff will turn on Seoul Station itself.\n\n**Intervention.** Can bring in a revised draft that removes the water-cutoff clause, or enter in the ledger the water bribes the notary has received.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 30 | Openness −15 | Force −25 | Materialism −25 | Community 20 | Principle 45 | Publicity −25 | Credentials 10 | Decentralization −30 | Transformation −50\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Monopoly 25 | Risk 35 | Display 25 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: Same-sex | Union: Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"O Seo-yul","type":"Command","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Reviewing the water-supply drafts under delegated notarial authority"},{"from":"O Seo-yul","type":"Contract","to":"Han Jae-mok","basis":"Notarization review of the western water supply draft"},{"from":"O Seo-yul","type":"Contract","to":"Eva Novakova","basis":"Trades Yongsan railway contract notarization"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Eva Novakova","type":"Contract","to":"O Seo-yul","basis":"Entrusts railway contract notarization to the Records Office"},{"from":"Ma Dohan","type":"Contract","to":"O Seo-yul","basis":"is a contract that transports only O Seoyul''s dried seals, and"},{"from":"Ma Eungyeol","type":"Contract","to":"O Seo-yul","basis":"Verifies O Seoyul''s notarial seal before the auction, and"},{"from":"Chu Seoyun","type":"Oath","to":"O Seo-yul","basis":"Backs O Seoyul''s notarization requests from the witness stand, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0149","name":"오서율","title":"계약 공증관","position":"계약 공증관","characterId":"K148","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"계약 종료 조건·증인란 공증","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-오서율","detailRoute":"/people/person-0149","birthDate":"2067-11-29","birthday":"11-29","age":59,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k148-clause-checking","name":"종료 조항 점검","rating":65},{"id":"k148-notarial-copy","name":"공증 사본 확인","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k148-choice","name":"빈 조항을 거부","description":"계산이 빠르고 문구의 빈칸을 싫어한다. 구두 약속은 약속이 아니라고 반복한다.","behavior":"일화. 뚝섬 급수계약 만료일이 공증 원장에 빨갛게 표시된 채 세 강국의 서로 다른 문안이 동시에 들어왔다.","stress":"공포. 집단 단수 조항을 공증한 뒤 그 물이 서울역 자체에 꺼지는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린에게 공증 권한을 위임받았고 한재목의 서부 급수문안을 심사 중이다. 권시온과는 용산 철도계약 공증을 거래한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k148-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 계약 공증관. 조항마다 종료 조건과 증인란을 강제하고, 인장이 마른 뒤에만 사본을 내준다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 계약 공증관. 조항마다 종료 조건과 증인란을 강제하고, 인장이 마른 뒤에만 사본을 내준다.","stress":"공포. 집단 단수 조항을 공증한 뒤 그 물이 서울역 자체에 꺼지는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린에게 공증 권한을 위임받았고 한재목의 서부 급수문안을 심사 중이다. 권시온과는 용산 철도계약 공증을 거래한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"종료 조건과 증인란을 요구하고 마른 인장 뒤에 사본을 내준다. 세 문안 접수는 교섭 타결이나 헌법 제정의 성과가 아니다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51130-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K148","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51130-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c624-d574-c8fc","name":"해주 오씨","crest":"clan-crests/c624-d574-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":30,"개방":-15,"무력":-25,"물질":-25,"공동":20,"원칙":45,"공개":-25,"자격":10,"분산":-30,"변혁":-50},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":25,"위험":35,"과시":25,"지속":-15,"지향":"동성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"계약 종료 조건·증인란 공증","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"계약 공증관","가치관":"권위 30 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −25 | 공동 20 | 원칙 45 | 공개 −25 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −50","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 25 | 위험 35 | 과시 25 | 지속 −15 | 지향 동성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 계약 공증관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 오서율의 계약 종료 조건과 증인란을 공증하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 계약 공증관.","일화":"뚝섬 급수계약 만료일이 공증 원장에 빨갛게 표시된 채 세 강국의 서로 다른 문안이 동시에 들어왔다.","관계":"윤서린에게 공증 권한을 위임받았고 한재목의 서부 급수문안을 심사 중이다. 권시온과는 용산 철도계약 공증을 거래한다.","야망":"한재목의 수문헌장과 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직 공동교섭문을 모두 서울역 공증으로 묶어 급수 감사권을 기록청이 쥐게 한다.","공포":"집단 단수 조항을 공증한 뒤 그 물이 서울역 자체에 꺼지는 것.","개입":"단수 조항을 빼는 수정본을 들고 오거나, 공증관이 받은 급수 뇌물을 원장에 올릴 수 있다."},"biography":"계산이 빠르고 문구의 빈칸을 싫어한다. 구두 약속은 약속이 아니라고 반복한다.\n\n- 생업: 계약 종료 조건·증인란 공증\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 계약 공증관\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 계약 공증관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 오서율의 계약 종료 조건과 증인란을 공증하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 계약 공증관.\n\n**일화.** 뚝섬 급수계약 만료일이 공증 원장에 빨갛게 표시된 채 세 강국의 서로 다른 문안이 동시에 들어왔다.\n\n**관계.** 윤서린에게 공증 권한을 위임받았고 한재목의 서부 급수문안을 심사 중이다. 권시온과는 용산 철도계약 공증을 거래한다.\n\n**야망.** 한재목의 수문헌장과 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직 공동교섭문을 모두 서울역 공증으로 묶어 급수 감사권을 기록청이 쥐게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 집단 단수 조항을 공증한 뒤 그 물이 서울역 자체에 꺼지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 단수 조항을 빼는 수정본을 들고 오거나, 공증관이 받은 급수 뇌물을 원장에 올릴 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 30 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −25 | 공동 20 | 원칙 45 | 공개 −25 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −50\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 25 | 위험 35 | 과시 25 | 지속 −15 | 지향 동성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"오서율","type":"지휘","to":"윤서린","basis":"공증 권한을 위임받아 급수문안을 심사"},{"from":"오서율","type":"계약","to":"한재목","basis":"서부 급수문안 공증 심사"},{"from":"오서율","type":"계약","to":"에바 노바코바","basis":"용산 철도계약 공증을 거래"}],"incoming":[{"from":"에바 노바코바","type":"계약","to":"오서율","basis":"철도계약 공증을 기록청에 맡김"},{"from":"마도한","type":"계약","to":"오서율","basis":"오서율의 마른 인장만 운송하는 계약이고"},{"from":"마은결","type":"계약","to":"오서율","basis":"오서율의 공증 날인을 경매 전 확인하며"},{"from":"추서윤","type":"맹세","to":"오서율","basis":"오서율의 공증 청구를 증인석에서 받치고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0150', 'c11c-b2ec-c131', '{"id":"person-0150","name":"Seo Ra-on","title":"Map Restoration Librarian","position":"Map Restoration Librarian","characterId":"K149","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Field Surveying and Water Supply Map Restoration","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#person-seoraon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0150","birthDate":"2080-06-20","birthday":"06-20","age":46,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k149-field-survey","name":"Field surveying","rating":65},{"id":"k149-map-crosscheck","name":"Map cross-checking","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k149-choice","name":"Marks uncertainty","description":"Curious, she could not stand people losing their way. She saw distributing a wrong map as close to murder.","behavior":"Anecdote. After water-supply handovers in the northern city center were interrupted, maps still printed with the old water-supply districts spread over the Sangam airwaves.","stress":"Fear. That great powers would buy up the master plates and print the water-dispute zones as their own territory. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Matched map-renewal times with Choi Jiwoo and received transmission tower coordinates from Gwon Mirae. Yun Seorin used his master plate as a ratification annex.","effects":[]},{"id":"k149-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: map-restoration librarian. He drew field surveys overlaid with transmission bulletins and left roads with a single source only as dotted lines.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: map-restoration librarian. He drew field surveys overlaid with transmission bulletins and left roads with a single source only as dotted lines.","stress":"Fear. That great powers would buy up the master plates and print the water-dispute zones as their own territory. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Matched map-renewal times with Choi Jiwoo and received transmission tower coordinates from Gwon Mirae. Yun Seorin used his master plate as a ratification annex.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Cross-checks surveys with reports and marks single-source roads as dotted lines. No recovery of obsolete maps or territorial authority is established. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51150-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K149","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51150-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c11c-b2ec-c131","name":"Dalseong Seo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c11c-b2ec-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":-10,"Force":-35,"Material":-40,"Communal":5,"Principle":55,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":-40,"Transformative":-50},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-35,"Display":30,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Field Surveying and Water Supply Map Restoration","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"Local Records Research Officer, or a Local Administrative Jusa or Local Administrative Jusabo whose grade fits a Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management post","Assigned Duties":"Map Restoration Librarian","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force −35 | Material −40 | Communal 5 | Principle 55 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion −40 | Transformation −50","Desires":"Longing 0 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −35 | Display 30 | Sustainability −15 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up on the waiting-room watch. The Map Restoration Librarian post opened as a substitute duty after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Matching Seo Raon''s field surveys to the water-supply map connects to work in Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"A grade suited to a Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management post, among Local Records Researcher or Local Administrative Officer / Assistant Local Administrative Officer. Duties: Map Restoration Librarian.","Anecdote":"Even after the northern downtown water-supply handover broke off, maps printed with the old water districts spread over the Sangam radio waves.","Relationships":"Syncs map update times with Choe Jiu and receives transmission tower coordinates from Gwon Mirae. Yun Seorin uses their plate as a ratification attachment.","Ambition":"To gather the severed northern water purification and the living pipes into a single public map and submit it as verification material to the Director of the Joint Technical Institute.","Fear":"A great power buying up the map plates and printing the disputed water-supply sections as its own territory.","Intervention":"Can bring in actual pipe surveys, or track down the print shop of a forged map plate."},"biography":"Curious, and cannot stand people getting lost. Considers distributing a wrong map close to murder.\n\n- Livelihood: field surveying, water-supply map restoration\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service organization\n- Position and grade: a grade suited to a Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management post, among Local Records Researcher or Local Administrative Officer / Assistant Local Administrative Officer\n- Duties: Map Restoration Librarian\n**Life.** Grew up on the waiting-room watch. The Map Restoration Librarian post opened as a substitute duty after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Matching Seo Raon''s field surveys to the water-supply map connects to work in Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Service Position and Grade.** A grade suited to a Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management post, among Local Records Researcher or Local Administrative Officer / Assistant Local Administrative Officer. Duties: Map Restoration Librarian.\n\n**Anecdote.** Even after the northern downtown water-supply handover broke off, maps printed with the old water districts spread over the Sangam radio waves.\n\n**Relations.** Syncs map update times with Choe Jiu and receives transmission tower coordinates from Gwon Mirae. Yun Seorin uses their plate as a ratification attachment.\n\n**Ambition.** To gather the severed northern water purification and the living pipes into a single public map and submit it as verification material to the Director of the Joint Technical Institute.\n\n**Fear.** A great power buying up the map plates and printing the disputed water-supply sections as its own territory.\n\n**Intervention.** Can bring in actual pipe surveys, or track down the print shop of a forged map plate.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force −35 | Material −40 | Communal 5 | Principle 55 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion −40 | Transformation −50\n- Desires: Longing 0 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −35 | Display 30 | Sustainability −15 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seo Ra-on","type":"Contract","to":"Choe Ji-u","basis":"Syncs map update times with transmissions"},{"from":"Seo Ra-on","type":"Contract","to":"Gwon Mi-rae","basis":"Receives transmission tower coordinates and attaches them to the plate"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gwon Mi-rae","type":"Contract","to":"Seo Ra-on","basis":"Passes transmission tower coordinates to the map plate"},{"from":"Jo Seowon","type":"Contract","to":"Seo Ra-on","basis":"Jo Seowon relays news of the closure of the flooded, collapsed section to Seo Raon. Seo Raon checks the field survey and the bulletin together to update the map, and leaves unconfirmed detour roads as dotted lines."},{"from":"Ju Rian","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Seo Ra-on","basis":"A priest who hands field coordinates to Seo Raon''s plate, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0150","name":"서라온","title":"지도 복구 사서","position":"지도 복구 사서","characterId":"K149","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"현장 측량·급수지도 복구","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-서라온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0150","birthDate":"2080-06-20","birthday":"06-20","age":46,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k149-field-survey","name":"현장 측량","rating":65},{"id":"k149-map-crosscheck","name":"지도 대조","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k149-choice","name":"불확실성을 표시","description":"호기심이 많고 길을 잃는 사람을 참지 못한다. 틀린 지도를 배포하는 일을 살인에 가깝다고 여긴다.","behavior":"일화. 도심 북부 급수 인계가 끊긴 뒤에도 옛 급수구역이 인쇄된 지도가 상암 전파로 퍼졌다.","stress":"공포. 강국이 지도 원판을 사들여 급수 분쟁 구간을 자기 영토로 인쇄하는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 최지우과 지도 갱신 시각을 맞추고 권미래에게 송신탑 좌표를 받는다. 윤서린은 그의 원판을 인준 첨부물로 쓴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k149-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 지도 복구 사서. 현장 측량과 송신 속보를 겹쳐 그리고, 출처가 하나뿐인 도로는 점선으로만 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 지도 복구 사서. 현장 측량과 송신 속보를 겹쳐 그리고, 출처가 하나뿐인 도로는 점선으로만 남긴다.","stress":"공포. 강국이 지도 원판을 사들여 급수 분쟁 구간을 자기 영토로 인쇄하는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 최지우과 지도 갱신 시각을 맞추고 권미래에게 송신탑 좌표를 받는다. 윤서린은 그의 원판을 인준 첨부물로 쓴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"현장 측량과 속보를 대조하고 단일 출처 도로를 점선으로 남긴다. 낡은 지도를 회수한 결말이나 영토 결정권은 없다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51150-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K149","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51150-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c11c-b2ec-c131","name":"달성 서씨","crest":"clan-crests/c11c-b2ec-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":-10,"무력":-35,"물질":-40,"공동":5,"원칙":55,"공개":-10,"자격":20,"분산":-40,"변혁":-50},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-20,"위험":-35,"과시":30,"지속":-15,"지향":"양성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"현장 측량·급수지도 복구","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방기록연구사 또는 지방행정주사·지방행정주사보 중 서울특별시 기록관리 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"지도 복구 사서","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −40 | 공동 5 | 원칙 55 | 공개 −10 | 자격 20 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −50","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −35 | 과시 30 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 지도 복구 사서 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 서라온의 현장 측량을 급수지도에 맞추는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방기록연구사 또는 지방행정주사·지방행정주사보 중 서울특별시 기록관리 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 지도 복구 사서.","일화":"도심 북부 급수 인계가 끊긴 뒤에도 옛 급수구역이 인쇄된 지도가 상암 전파로 퍼졌다.","관계":"최지우와 지도 갱신 시각을 맞추고 권미래에게 송신탑 좌표를 받는다. 윤서린은 그의 원판을 인준 첨부물로 쓴다.","야망":"끊긴 북부 정수와 살아있는 배관을 한 장의 공개 지도로 모아 공동기술원장의 검증 자료로 바친다.","공포":"강국이 지도 원판을 사들여 급수 분쟁 구간을 자기 영토로 인쇄하는 것.","개입":"실제 배관 측량을 가져오거나, 위조 지도 원판의 인쇄소를 찾아낼 수 있다."},"biography":"호기심이 많고 길을 잃는 사람을 참지 못한다. 틀린 지도를 배포하는 일을 살인에 가깝다고 여긴다.\n\n- 생업: 현장 측량·급수지도 복구\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방기록연구사 또는 지방행정주사·지방행정주사보 중 서울특별시 기록관리 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 지도 복구 사서\n**생애.** 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 지도 복구 사서 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 서라온의 현장 측량을 급수지도에 맞추는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방기록연구사 또는 지방행정주사·지방행정주사보 중 서울특별시 기록관리 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 지도 복구 사서.\n\n**일화.** 도심 북부 급수 인계가 끊긴 뒤에도 옛 급수구역이 인쇄된 지도가 상암 전파로 퍼졌다.\n\n**관계.** 최지우와 지도 갱신 시각을 맞추고 권미래에게 송신탑 좌표를 받는다. 윤서린은 그의 원판을 인준 첨부물로 쓴다.\n\n**야망.** 끊긴 북부 정수와 살아있는 배관을 한 장의 공개 지도로 모아 공동기술원장의 검증 자료로 바친다.\n\n**공포.** 강국이 지도 원판을 사들여 급수 분쟁 구간을 자기 영토로 인쇄하는 것.\n\n**개입.** 실제 배관 측량을 가져오거나, 위조 지도 원판의 인쇄소를 찾아낼 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −40 | 공동 5 | 원칙 55 | 공개 −10 | 자격 20 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −50\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −35 | 과시 30 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"서라온","type":"계약","to":"최지우","basis":"지도 갱신 시각을 송신과 맞춤"},{"from":"서라온","type":"계약","to":"권미래","basis":"송신탑 좌표를 받아 원판에 붙임"}],"incoming":[{"from":"권미래","type":"계약","to":"서라온","basis":"송신탑 좌표를 지도 원판에 넘김"},{"from":"조서원","type":"계약","to":"서라온","basis":"조서원은 침수 붕괴 구간의 폐쇄 소식을 서라온에게 전달한다. 서라온은 현장 측량과 속보를 함께 확인해 지도를 갱신하고, 확인되지 않은 우회 도로는 점선으로 남긴다."},{"from":"주리안","type":"신도","to":"서라온","basis":"서라온의 원판에 현장 좌표를 넘기는 신도이고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0151', 'c9c0-cda9-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0151","name":"Ji Seo-yun","title":"Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician","position":"Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician","characterId":"K150","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Archive dehumidifier humidity and filter maintenance","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#person-ji-seoyun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0151","birthDate":"2096-09-19","birthday":"09-19","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k150-filter-maintenance","name":"Filter maintenance","rating":65},{"id":"k150-humidity-log","name":"Humidity logging","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k150-choice","name":"Checks component reliability","description":"She read humidity from the dehumidifier''s vibration and distrusted anyone who brought candles into the archive. She answered with filter-replacement noise rather than words.","behavior":"Anecdote. In 2125 he turned back a box of defective parts just before release. By this deed the signature of the Seoul Station archive dehumidification mechanic post rose into the ledger.","stress":"Fear. That on a ration-cut night the dehumidifier would stop and a candle would turn continuity into ash. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice backing Jo Harin''s double-key rule in the field, he matched dehumidification power to Na Bomgyeol''s emergency generators and inspected Gang Minseo''s filter standards.","effects":[]},{"id":"k150-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: Seoul Station archive dehumidification mechanic. Each rotation he wrote humidity and filter thickness on the wall and fitted no part without the Record Bureau stamp.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: Seoul Station archive dehumidification mechanic. Each rotation he wrote humidity and filter thickness on the wall and fitted no part without the Record Bureau stamp.","stress":"Fear. That on a ration-cut night the dehumidifier would stop and a candle would turn continuity into ash. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice backing Jo Harin''s double-key rule in the field, he matched dehumidification power to Na Bomgyeol''s emergency generators and inspected Gang Minseo''s filter standards.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Logs humidity and filter thickness and rejected defective parts. Inspection and power-cycle coordination do not imply universal engineering expertise. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51170-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K150","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51170-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c9c0-cda9-c8fc","name":"Chungju Ji Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c9c0-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":-10,"Force":-25,"Material":-25,"Communal":5,"Principle":40,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":40,"Dispersed":-20,"Transformative":-45},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-35,"Risk":-35,"Display":10,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Archive dehumidifier humidity and filter maintenance","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"A grade suited to a Seoul Metropolitan Government business-office post, among Local Industrial Officer / Assistant Local Industrial Officer or Local Facilities Officer / Assistant Local Facilities Officer","Assigned Duties":"Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness −10 | Force −25 | Material −25 | Communal 5 | Principle 40 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 40 | Dispersion −20 | Transformation −45","Desires":"Longing 30 | Monopoly −35 | Risk −35 | Display 10 | Sustainability 5 | Orientation Fluid | Union Monogamy"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at Sinjeong Rail Depot. The post of Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician opened after a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- Maintaining the humidity and dehumidifier filters of the archive that Ji Seoyun oversees connects to work in Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"A grade suited to a Seoul Metropolitan Government business-office post, among Local Industrial Officer / Assistant Local Industrial Officer or Local Facilities Officer / Assistant Local Facilities Officer. Duties: Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician.","Anecdote":"In 2125, sent back a box of defective parts just before shipment. Because of this, the signature for the post of Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"A priest who supports Jo Harin''s double-key rule in the field, matches dehumidification power to Na Bomgyeol''s emergency generation, and inspects Gang Minseo''s filter specifications.","Ambition":"Tie the archive''s dehumidification and power cycles into a public maintenance schedule so the three copies of the will never stick to the hanji paper.","Fear":"A night when rations are cut off, the dehumidifiers stop, and candles turn continuity to ash.","Intervention":"Can obtain dehumidifier parts to save the stacks, or expose maintenance entries missing from the reading ledger."},"biography":"Reads humidity by the vibration of the dehumidifiers and distrusts anyone who brings a candle into the stacks. Answers with the noise of a filter change rather than with words.\n\n- Livelihood: Archive dehumidifier humidity and filter maintenance\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service organization\n- Position and grade: Local Technical Officer or Assistant Local Technical Officer, or Local Facilities Officer or Assistant Local Facilities Officer, whichever grade fits a post at a Seoul Metropolitan Government business office\n- Duties: Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician\n**Life.** Grew up at Sinjeong Depot. The post of Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician opened after a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- Maintaining the archive humidity and dehumidifier filters that Ji Seoyun is responsible for connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil service position and grade.** Local Technical Officer or Assistant Local Technical Officer, or Local Facilities Officer or Assistant Local Facilities Officer, whichever grade fits a post at a Seoul Metropolitan Government business office. Duties: Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, sent a box of defective parts back just before it shipped. Because of this, the signature for the post of Seoul Station Archive Dehumidification Technician went into the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** A disciple who supports Jo Harin''s double-key rule in the field, matches the dehumidification power to Na Bomgyeol''s emergency generation, and inspects Gang Minseo''s filter specifications.\n\n**Ambition.** Tie the archive''s dehumidification and power cycles into a public maintenance schedule so the three copies of the will never stick to the hanji paper.\n\n**Fear.** A night when rations are cut off, the dehumidifiers stop, and candles turn continuity to ash.\n\n**Intervention.** Can obtain dehumidifier parts to save the stacks, or expose maintenance entries missing from the reading ledger.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness −10 | Force −25 | Materialism −25 | Communal 5 | Principle 40 | Transparency −10 | Qualification 40 | Decentralization −20 | Transformation −45\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Monopoly −35 | Risk −35 | Display 10 | Persistence 5 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ji Seo-yun","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"is a priest who backs Jo Harin''s dual-key rule on site, and"},{"from":"Ji Seo-yun","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Na Bomgyeol","basis":"matching the dehumidification power to Na Bomgyeol''s emergency generation"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Ji Hansol","type":"Command","to":"Ji Seo-yun","basis":"matching Ji Seoyun''s dehumidification cycle to the box temperature"},{"from":"Na Bomgyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Ji Seo-yun","basis":"matching output to Ji Seoyun''s dehumidifier"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0151","name":"지서윤","title":"서울역 문서고 제습 정비사","position":"서울역 문서고 제습 정비사","characterId":"K150","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"문서고 제습기 습도·필터 정비","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-지서윤","detailRoute":"/people/person-0151","birthDate":"2096-09-19","birthday":"09-19","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k150-filter-maintenance","name":"필터 정비","rating":65},{"id":"k150-humidity-log","name":"습도 기록","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k150-choice","name":"부품 신뢰를 따짐","description":"제습기 진동으로 습도를 읽고, 촛불을 서고에 들이는 사람을 불신한다. 말보다 필터 교체 소음으로 대답한다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 서울역 문서고 제습 정비사 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"공포. 배급이 끊긴 밤에 제습기가 멈추고 촛불이 연속성을 재로 만드는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 조하린의 이중 열쇠 규칙을 현장에서 받치는 신도이고, 나봄결의 비상 발전에 제습 전력을 맞추며, 강민서의 필터 규격을 검수한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k150-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 서울역 문서고 제습 정비사. 교대마다 습도와 필터 두께를 벽에 쓰고, 기록청 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 서울역 문서고 제습 정비사. 교대마다 습도와 필터 두께를 벽에 쓰고, 기록청 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 배급이 끊긴 밤에 제습기가 멈추고 촛불이 연속성을 재로 만드는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 조하린의 이중 열쇠 규칙을 현장에서 받치는 신도이고, 나봄결의 비상 발전에 제습 전력을 맞추며, 강민서의 필터 규격을 검수한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"교대마다 습도와 필터 두께를 기록하고 불량 부품을 돌려보냈다. 부품 검수와 전력 주기 협력을 만능 공학으로 확대하지 않는다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51170-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K150","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51170-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c9c0-cda9-c8fc","name":"충주 지씨","crest":"clan-crests/c9c0-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":-10,"무력":-25,"물질":-25,"공동":5,"원칙":40,"공개":-10,"자격":40,"분산":-20,"변혁":-45},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-35,"위험":-35,"과시":10,"지속":5,"지향":"유동","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"문서고 제습기 습도·필터 정비","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방공업주사·지방공업주사보 또는 지방시설주사·지방시설주사보 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"서울역 문서고 제습 정비사","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −25 | 공동 5 | 원칙 40 | 공개 −10 | 자격 40 | 분산 −20 | 변혁 −45","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −35 | 과시 10 | 지속 5 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 서울역 문서고 제습 정비사 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 지서윤이 맡는 문서고의 습도와 제습기 필터를 정비하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방공업주사·지방공업주사보 또는 지방시설주사·지방시설주사보 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 서울역 문서고 제습 정비사.","일화":"2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 서울역 문서고 제습 정비사 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"조하린의 이중 열쇠 규칙을 현장에서 받치는 신도이고, 나봄결의 비상 발전에 제습 전력을 맞추며, 강민서의 필터 규격을 검수한다.","야망":"문서고 제습과 전력 주기를 공개 정비표로 묶어 유언 삼본이 한지에 들러붙지 않게 한다.","공포":"배급이 끊긴 밤에 제습기가 멈추고 촛불이 연속성을 재로 만드는 것.","개입":"제습 부품을 구해 서고를 살리거나, 열람 장부에 없는 정비 출입을 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"제습기 진동으로 습도를 읽고, 촛불을 서고에 들이는 사람을 불신한다. 말보다 필터 교체 소음으로 대답한다.\n\n- 생업: 문서고 제습기 습도·필터 정비\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방공업주사·지방공업주사보 또는 지방시설주사·지방시설주사보 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 서울역 문서고 제습 정비사\n**생애.** 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 서울역 문서고 제습 정비사 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 지서윤이 맡는 문서고의 습도와 제습기 필터를 정비하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방공업주사·지방공업주사보 또는 지방시설주사·지방시설주사보 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 서울역 문서고 제습 정비사.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 서울역 문서고 제습 정비사 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 조하린의 이중 열쇠 규칙을 현장에서 받치는 신도이고, 나봄결의 비상 발전에 제습 전력을 맞추며, 강민서의 필터 규격을 검수한다.\n\n**야망.** 문서고 제습과 전력 주기를 공개 정비표로 묶어 유언 삼본이 한지에 들러붙지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 배급이 끊긴 밤에 제습기가 멈추고 촛불이 연속성을 재로 만드는 것.\n\n**개입.** 제습 부품을 구해 서고를 살리거나, 열람 장부에 없는 정비 출입을 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −25 | 공동 5 | 원칙 40 | 공개 −10 | 자격 40 | 분산 −20 | 변혁 −45\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −35 | 과시 10 | 지속 5 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"지서윤","type":"신도","to":"조하린","basis":"조하린의 이중 열쇠 규칙을 현장에서 받치는 신도이고"},{"from":"지서윤","type":"신도","to":"나봄결","basis":"나봄결의 비상 발전에 제습 전력을 맞추며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"지한솔","type":"지휘","to":"지서윤","basis":"지서윤의 제습 주기와 함 온도를 맞추며"},{"from":"나봄결","type":"계약","to":"지서윤","basis":"지서윤의 제습기에 출력을 맞추고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0152', 'b9c8-c7a5-d765', '{"id":"person-0152","name":"Ma Dohan","title":"","position":"","characterId":"K151","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Notarized copy weighing and removal management","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#person-ma-dohan","detailRoute":"/people/person-0152","birthDate":"2071-07-30","birthday":"07-30","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k151-copy-weighing","name":"Copy box weighing","rating":65},{"id":"k151-shipment-log","name":"Shipment logging","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k151-choice","name":"Records discrepancies in trade","description":"He called anyone who moved copies before the stamps dried a forger, and when a box''s weight differed from the ledger he swapped the scales at once. He ended bargains low and honored no verbal freight.","behavior":"Anecdote. A crate of copies with O Seoyul''s witness box empty and a weight that disagrees with the shipping ledger stands at the Seoul Station berth. Ma Dohan swaps the scale and weighs it again, notes the difference beside the release time, and keeps the crate outside the berth.","stress":"Fear. That one forged testament copy, loaded into a great power''s convoy car, would sink Seoul Station into a stamp subcontract. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Held a contract carrying O Seoyul''s dry stamps only, split seals and order with Yang Haeon''s dispatches, and competed whenever O Haerin''s settlement right tried to swallow the notary freight.","effects":[]},{"id":"k151-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: Seoul Station notarized-copy logistics merchant. He wrote the morning scales and removal hours on the wall and took no copy with O Seoyul''s witness line empty into the berth.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: Seoul Station notarized-copy logistics merchant. He wrote the morning scales and removal hours on the wall and took no copy with O Seoyul''s witness line empty into the berth.","stress":"Fear. That one forged testament copy, loaded into a great power''s convoy car, would sink Seoul Station into a stamp subcontract. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Held a contract carrying O Seoyul''s dry stamps only, split seals and order with Yang Haeon''s dispatches, and competed whenever O Haerin''s settlement right tried to swallow the notary freight.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Reweighed a box with missing witnesses and logged its discrepancy before keeping it off the berth. Ledger monopoly remains an ambition. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:barony-K151-sea","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"barony","holderPersonId":"K151","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:sea-K151","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false},{"id":"title:duchy-28710-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K151","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-28710-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b9c8-c7a5-d765","name":"Jangheung Ma Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b9c8-c7a5-d765.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":30,"Openness":-10,"Force":-40,"Material":-20,"Communal":20,"Principle":35,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-35,"Transformative":-50},"desire":{"Longing":-10,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-25,"Display":-25,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Notarized copy weighing and removal management","Status":"Functional/Livelihood Role (Not a Government Appointment)","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"None","Livelihood Role":"Seoul Station Notarized Copy Logistics Merchant","Values":"Authority 30 | Openness −10 | Force −40 | Materialism −20 | Communal 20 | Principle 35 | Transparency −10 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −35 | Transformation −50","Desires":"Craving −10 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −25 | Display −25 | Persistence 30 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Seoul Station registry office. The post of Seoul Station Notarized Copy Logistics Merchant opened after a single line was deleted from a double ledger.\n- Weighing Ma Dohan''s notarized copies and checking their removal times connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Duty":"Official rank: Officer (Jusa). Livelihood title: Seoul Station Notarized Copy Logistics Merchant. Writes the morning weight and removal time on the wall, and does not admit to the handover zone any copy whose witness column from O Seoyul is empty.","Anecdote":"A copy box with an empty witness column from O Seoyul, and with a weight that also disagrees with the transport ledger, stops in front of the Seoul Station handover zone. Ma Dohan replaces the scale and weighs it again, writes the discrepancy beside the removal time, and leaves the box outside the handover zone.","Relationships":"A contract to transport only O Seoyul''s dried seals; shares turn order with Yang Haeon''s courier seals, and competes if O Haerin''s settlement authority tries to swallow the notarial freight charges.","Ambition":"Bind the succession, water-supply, and repair treaties so that they are valid only on the notarized copy transport ledger, giving the Records Agency a real veto.","Fear":"A single forged will copy loaded into a great power''s escort car, reducing Seoul Station to a seal subcontractor.","Intervention":"Can take on witness escort and resume copy transport, or expose unrecorded night removals."},"biography":"Calls anyone who moves a copy before the seal has dried a forger, and replaces the scale at once if a box''s weight differs from the ledger. Ends bargaining low and does not recognize verbal freight charges.\n\n- Livelihood: Notarized copy weighing and removal management\n- Status: Functional/Livelihood Role (Not a Government Appointment)\n- Civil service position and grade: None\n- Livelihood role: Seoul Station Notarized Copy Logistics Merchant\n**Life.** Grew up at the Seoul Station registry office. The post of Seoul Station Notarized Copy Logistics Merchant opened after a single line was deleted from a double ledger.\n- Weighing Ma Dohan''s notarized copies and checking their removal times connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Work.** Official rank: Officer (Jusa). Livelihood title: Seoul Station Notarized Copy Logistics Merchant. Writes the morning weight and removal time on the wall, and does not admit to the handover zone any copy whose witness column from O Seoyul is empty.\n\n**Anecdote.** A copy box with an empty witness column from O Seoyul, and with a weight that also disagrees with the transport ledger, stops in front of the Seoul Station handover zone. Ma Dohan replaces the scale and weighs it again, writes the discrepancy beside the removal time, and leaves the box outside the handover zone.\n\n**Relationships.** A contract to transport only O Seoyul''s dried seals; shares turn order with Yang Haeon''s courier seals, and competes if O Haerin''s settlement authority tries to swallow the notarial freight charges.\n\n**Ambition.** Bind the succession, water-supply, and repair treaties so that they are valid only on the notarized copy transport ledger, giving the Records Agency a real veto.\n\n**Fear.** A single forged will copy loaded into a great power''s escort car, reducing Seoul Station to a seal subcontractor.\n\n**Intervention.** Can take on witness escort and resume copy transport, or expose unrecorded night removals.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 30 | Openness −10 | Force −40 | Materialism −20 | Communal 20 | Principle 35 | Transparency −10 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −35 | Transformation −50\n- Desires: Craving −10 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −25 | Display −25 | Persistence 30 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ma Dohan","type":"Contract","to":"O Seo-yul","basis":"is a contract that transports only O Seoyul''s dried seals, and"},{"from":"Ma Dohan","type":"Contract","to":"Yang Haeon","basis":"sharing turn order with Yang Haeon''s courier seals"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Yang Haeon","type":"Contract","to":"Ma Dohan","basis":"sharing turn order with Ma Dohan''s copy boxes by contract"},{"from":"Ma Eungyeol","type":"Command","to":"Ma Dohan","basis":"a contract that enforces Ma Dohan''s transport turn order by auction"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0152","name":"마도한","title":"","position":"","characterId":"K151","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"공증사본 계량·반출 관리","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-마도한","detailRoute":"/people/person-0152","birthDate":"2071-07-30","birthday":"07-30","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k151-copy-weighing","name":"사본 상자 계량","rating":65},{"id":"k151-shipment-log","name":"반출 기록","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k151-choice","name":"차이를 남기는 거래","description":"인장이 마르기 전에 사본을 움직이는 사람을 위조로 부르고, 상자 무게가 장부와 다르면 즉시 저울을 갈아 끼운다. 흥정은 낮게 끝내고 구두 운임을 인정하지 않는다.","behavior":"일화. 오서율의 증인란이 비고 무게마저 운송 장부와 어긋나는 사본 상자가 서울역 선석 앞에 선다. 마도한은 저울을 갈아 끼워 다시 달고, 반출 시각 옆에 차이를 적은 뒤 상자를 선석 밖에 둔다.","stress":"공포. 위조 유언 사본 한 장이 강국 호송칸에 실려 서울역이 도장 하청으로 전락하는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 오서율의 마른 인장만 운송하는 계약이고, 양해온의 전령 봉인과 순번을 나누며, 오해린의 결제권이 공증 운임을 삼키려 하면 경쟁한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k151-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 서울역 공증사본 물류상. 아침 저울과 반출 시각을 벽에 적고, 오서율의 증인란이 빈 사본은 선석에 들이지 않는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 서울역 공증사본 물류상. 아침 저울과 반출 시각을 벽에 적고, 오서율의 증인란이 빈 사본은 선석에 들이지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 위조 유언 사본 한 장이 강국 호송칸에 실려 서울역이 도장 하청으로 전락하는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 오서율의 마른 인장만 운송하는 계약이고, 양해온의 전령 봉인과 순번을 나누며, 오해린의 결제권이 공증 운임을 삼키려 하면 경쟁한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"빈 증인란과 무게 차이를 확인하고 상자를 선석 밖에 뒀다. 운송 거부는 확인되지만 원장 독점은 야망으로 남는다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:barony-K151-sea","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"barony","holderPersonId":"K151","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:sea-K151","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false},{"id":"title:duchy-28710-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K151","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-28710-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b9c8-c7a5-d765","name":"장흥 마씨","crest":"clan-crests/b9c8-c7a5-d765.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":30,"개방":-10,"무력":-40,"물질":-20,"공동":20,"원칙":35,"공개":-10,"자격":10,"분산":-35,"변혁":-50},"desire":{"갈망":-10,"독점":-10,"위험":-25,"과시":-25,"지속":30,"지향":"양성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"공증사본 계량·반출 관리","지위":"기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)","공무원 직위·직급":"없음","생업 역할":"서울역 공증사본 물류상","가치관":"권위 30 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −20 | 공동 20 | 원칙 35 | 공개 −10 | 자격 10 | 분산 −35 | 변혁 −50","욕망":"갈망 −10 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −25 | 과시 −25 | 지속 30 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 서울역 공증사본 물류상 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 마도한의 공증사본을 달고 반출 시각을 확인하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","업무":"직무상 품계는 주사. 생업상 직함은 서울역 공증사본 물류상. 아침 저울과 반출 시각을 벽에 적고, 오서율의 증인란이 빈 사본은 인계 구역에 들이지 않는다.","일화":"오서율의 증인란이 비고 무게마저 운송 장부와 어긋나는 사본 상자가 서울역 인계 구역 앞에 선다. 마도한은 저울을 갈아 끼워 다시 달고, 반출 시각 옆에 차이를 적은 뒤 상자를 인계 구역 밖에 둔다.","관계":"오서율의 마른 인장만 운송하는 계약이고, 양해온의 전령 봉인과 순번을 나누며, 오해린의 결제권이 공증 운임을 삼키려 하면 경쟁한다.","야망":"계승·급수·수리 조약을 공증 사본 운송 원장에만 유효하게 묶어 기록청이 실제 거부권을 갖게 한다.","공포":"위조 유언 사본 한 장이 강국 호송칸에 실려 서울역이 도장 하청으로 전락하는 것.","개입":"증인 호송을 맡아 사본 운송을 재개하거나, 장부 없는 야간 반출을 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"인장이 마르기 전에 사본을 움직이는 사람을 위조로 부르고, 상자 무게가 장부와 다르면 즉시 저울을 갈아 끼운다. 흥정은 낮게 끝내고 구두 운임을 인정하지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 공증사본 계량·반출 관리\n- 지위: 기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)\n- 공무원 직위·직급: 없음\n- 생업 역할: 서울역 공증사본 물류상\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 서울역 공증사본 물류상 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 마도한의 공증사본을 달고 반출 시각을 확인하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**업무.** 직무상 품계는 주사. 생업상 직함은 서울역 공증사본 물류상. 아침 저울과 반출 시각을 벽에 적고, 오서율의 증인란이 빈 사본은 인계 구역에 들이지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 오서율의 증인란이 비고 무게마저 운송 장부와 어긋나는 사본 상자가 서울역 인계 구역 앞에 선다. 마도한은 저울을 갈아 끼워 다시 달고, 반출 시각 옆에 차이를 적은 뒤 상자를 인계 구역 밖에 둔다.\n\n**관계.** 오서율의 마른 인장만 운송하는 계약이고, 양해온의 전령 봉인과 순번을 나누며, 오해린의 결제권이 공증 운임을 삼키려 하면 경쟁한다.\n\n**야망.** 계승·급수·수리 조약을 공증 사본 운송 원장에만 유효하게 묶어 기록청이 실제 거부권을 갖게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 위조 유언 사본 한 장이 강국 호송칸에 실려 서울역이 도장 하청으로 전락하는 것.\n\n**개입.** 증인 호송을 맡아 사본 운송을 재개하거나, 장부 없는 야간 반출을 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 30 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −20 | 공동 20 | 원칙 35 | 공개 −10 | 자격 10 | 분산 −35 | 변혁 −50\n- 욕망: 갈망 −10 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −25 | 과시 −25 | 지속 30 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"마도한","type":"계약","to":"오서율","basis":"오서율의 마른 인장만 운송하는 계약이고"},{"from":"마도한","type":"계약","to":"양해온","basis":"양해온의 전령 봉인과 순번을 나누며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"양해온","type":"계약","to":"마도한","basis":"마도한의 사본 상자와 순번을 계약으로 나누며"},{"from":"마은결","type":"지휘","to":"마도한","basis":"마도한의 운송 순번을 경매로 집행하는 계약이고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0153', 'c5f0-ace1-c0b0', '{"id":"person-0153","name":"Yeon Jiu","title":"Seoul Station Infirmary Medic","position":"Seoul Station Infirmary Medic","characterId":"K152","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Infirmary bed assignment and medicine distribution","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#person-yeon-jiu","detailRoute":"/people/person-0153","birthDate":"2082-02-22","birthday":"02-22","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k152-bed-allocation","name":"Bed allocation","rating":60},{"id":"k152-medicine-allocation","name":"Medicine allocation","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k152-choice","name":"Flexibility for severe cases","description":"She checked breath before the wrist tag of a nameless body and tore up any note telling her to load weapons and patients onto one train. Principled, she folded procedure before severity.","behavior":"Anecdote. In 2125, short of herbs, she halved the prescriptions and divided them among everyone. By this deed the signature of the Seoul Station infirmary medic post rose into the ledger.","stress":"Fear. That the transfer lists would merge with military registries and the refugees would remain as troop numbers alone. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Under command to execute Yun Jiyul''s transfer ledger at the sickbed, she owed Ryu Eunbi bundles of medicine and left Baek On''s family transfer in the priority sickbeds.","effects":[]},{"id":"k152-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: Seoul Station infirmary medic. She published severity-order sickbeds and took patients with service contracts attached separately from the administrative roster.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: Seoul Station infirmary medic. She published severity-order sickbeds and took patients with service contracts attached separately from the administrative roster.","stress":"Fear. That the transfer lists would merge with military registries and the refugees would remain as troop numbers alone. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Under command to execute Yun Jiyul''s transfer ledger at the sickbed, she owed Ryu Eunbi bundles of medicine and left Baek On''s family transfer in the priority sickbeds.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Checks breathing first and shared scarce medicine. This protects access to care; treatment success after reduced doses is unconfirmed. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51190-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K152","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51190-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5f0-ace1-c0b0","name":"Yeon of Goksan","crest":"clan-crests/c5f0-ace1-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":25,"Openness":0,"Force":-50,"Material":-20,"Communal":0,"Principle":70,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-30,"Transformative":-50},"desire":{"Longing":50,"Monopoly":5,"Risk":25,"Display":-5,"Sustained":10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Infirmary bed assignment and medicine distribution","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"Local Health Section","Assigned Duties":"Seoul Station Infirmary Medic","Values":"Authority 25 | Openness 0 | Force −50 | Materialism −20 | Communal 0 | Principle 70 | Publicity −20 | Credentials 10 | Dispersion −30 | Transformation −50","Desires":"Craving 50 | Possessiveness 5 | Risk 25 | Display −5 | Persistence 10 | Orientation: opposite-sex | Bonding: non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"She grew up in the Jegi-dong infirmary. The post of Medical Officer at the Seoul Station Infirmary opened to her through the seal on a counterfeit medicine.\n- Assigning Yeon Jiu''s infirmary beds and distributing medicine ties into the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"Local Health Section. Duties: Medical Officer of the Seoul Station Infirmary.","Anecdote":"In 2125, when medicine ran short, she halved the prescribed doses and shared them among everyone. For this, her signature for the post of Medical Officer at the Seoul Station Infirmary was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"She takes direction from Yun Jiyul to carry out the transfer ledger at the bedside, owes Ryu Eunbi a bundle of medicines, and keeps Baek On''s family transfer as a priority bed.","Ambition":"To place the field treatment of the central disaster medical coordination network under Records Bureau ratification, so that ambulance trains cannot be diverted to military supply.","Fear":"That the transfer rosters merge with the military household register, leaving refugees remembered only as troop numbers.","Intervention":"She can escort a train carrying only patients, or separate a bed roster mixed with military household registers."},"biography":"Checks for breath before the tag on the wrist of a nameless corpse, and tears up the note ordering weapons and patients onto the same train. She is a person of principle, but she sets procedure aside when faced with the critically ill.\n\n- Livelihood: infirmary bed assignment and medicine distribution\n- Affiliation: Seoul Special City local civil service organization\n- Position and grade: Local Health Section\n- Duties: Medical Officer of the Seoul Station Infirmary\n**Life.** She grew up in the Jegi-dong infirmary. The post of Medical Officer at the Seoul Station Infirmary opened to her through the seal on a counterfeit medicine.\n- Assigning Yeon Jiu''s infirmary beds and distributing medicine ties into the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Servant Position and Grade.** Local Health Section. Duties: Medical Officer of the Seoul Station Infirmary.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, when medicine ran short, she halved the prescribed doses and shared them among everyone. For this, her signature for the post of Medical Officer at the Seoul Station Infirmary was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** She takes direction from Yun Jiyul to carry out the transfer ledger at the bedside, owes Ryu Eunbi a bundle of medicines, and keeps Baek On''s family transfer as a priority bed.\n\n**Ambition.** To place the field treatment of the central disaster medical coordination network under Records Bureau ratification, so that ambulance trains cannot be diverted to military supply.\n\n**Fear.** That transfer rosters will be merged with military household registers, leaving refugees remembered only as troop numbers.\n\n**Intervention.** She can escort a train carrying only patients, or separate a bed roster mixed with military household registers.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 25 | Openness 0 | Force −50 | Materialism −20 | Communal 0 | Principle 70 | Publicity −20 | Credentials 10 | Dispersion −30 | Transformation −50\n- Desires: Craving 50 | Possessiveness 5 | Risk 25 | Display −5 | Persistence 10 | Orientation: opposite-sex | Bonding: non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yeon Jiu","type":"Command","to":"Yun Ji-yul","basis":"Takes direction to carry out Yun Jiyul''s transfer ledger at the bedside, and"},{"from":"Yeon Jiu","type":"Debt","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"owes Ryu Eunbi a bundle of medicines"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gwon Harin","type":"Contract","to":"Yeon Jiu","basis":"Gwon Harin hands over the wounded she carried from the cleared transfer passage to Yeon Jiu. Yeon Jiu checks their breathing and severity, assigns beds, and does not push slow-moving patients aside through administrative records alone."},{"from":"Seol Dahin","type":"Contract","to":"Yeon Jiu","basis":"an ally who announces the lockdown of Yeon Jiu''s infirmary by broadcast, and"},{"from":"Yeon Taesol","type":"Contract","to":"Yeon Jiu","basis":"covers Yeon Jiu''s shortage of beds with train dispatches"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0153","name":"연지우","title":"서울역 의무실 의무원","position":"서울역 의무실 의무원","characterId":"K152","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"의무실 침상 배정·약재 배분","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-연지우","detailRoute":"/people/person-0153","birthDate":"2082-02-22","birthday":"02-22","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k152-bed-allocation","name":"침상 배정","rating":60},{"id":"k152-medicine-allocation","name":"약재 배분","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k152-choice","name":"중증 앞의 유연함","description":"이름 없는 시신의 손목 표보다 호흡을 먼저 확인하고, 무기와 환자를 한 열차에 태우라는 쪽지를 찢는다. 원칙적이지만 중증 앞에서는 절차를 접는다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 이 일로 서울역 의무실 의무원 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"공포. 이송 명단이 군사호적과 합쳐져 피난민이 병력 숫자로만 남는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 윤지율의 이송 장부를 침상에서 집행하는 지휘를 받고, 류은비에게 약품 묶음을 빚지며, 백온의 가족 이송을 우선 침상으로 남긴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k152-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 서울역 의무실 의무원. 중증도 순 침상을 공개하고, 복무계약서가 붙은 환자는 행정 명부와 분리해 받는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 서울역 의무실 의무원. 중증도 순 침상을 공개하고, 복무계약서가 붙은 환자는 행정 명부와 분리해 받는다.","stress":"공포. 이송 명단이 군사호적과 합쳐져 피난민이 병력 숫자로만 남는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 윤지율의 이송 장부를 침상에서 집행하는 지휘를 받고, 류은비에게 약품 묶음을 빚지며, 백온의 가족 이송을 우선 침상으로 남긴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"호흡을 먼저 확인하고 부족한 약재를 나눴다. 치료 접근을 지키는 선택이며 처방량 감소의 치료 성공은 미확인이다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51190-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K152","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51190-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5f0-ace1-c0b0","name":"곡산 연씨","crest":"clan-crests/c5f0-ace1-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":25,"개방":0,"무력":-50,"물질":-20,"공동":0,"원칙":70,"공개":-20,"자격":10,"분산":-30,"변혁":-50},"desire":{"갈망":50,"독점":5,"위험":25,"과시":-5,"지속":10,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"의무실 침상 배정·약재 배분","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방보건계","담당 업무":"서울역 의무실 의무원","가치관":"권위 25 | 개방 0 | 무력 −50 | 물질 −20 | 공동 0 | 원칙 70 | 공개 −20 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −50","욕망":"갈망 50 | 독점 5 | 위험 25 | 과시 −5 | 지속 10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 서울역 의무실 의무원 자리는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 연지우의 의무실 침상을 배정하고 약재를 나누는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방보건계. 담당 업무: 서울역 의무실 의무원.","일화":"2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 이 일로 서울역 의무실 의무원 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"윤지율의 이송 장부를 침상에서 집행하는 지휘를 받고, 류은비에게 약품 묶음을 빚지며, 백온의 가족 이송을 우선 침상으로 남긴다.","야망":"중앙 재난의료 조정망의 현장 진료를 기록청 인준 아래 두어 구급 열차가 군수로 돌지 못하게 한다.","공포":"이송 명단이 군사호적과 합쳐져 피난민이 병력 숫자로만 남는 것.","개입":"환자만 태운 열차를 호송하거나, 군사호적이 섞인 침상 명단을 분리해 줄 수 있다."},"biography":"이름 없는 시신의 손목 표보다 호흡을 먼저 확인하고, 무기와 환자를 한 열차에 태우라는 쪽지를 찢는다. 원칙적이지만 중증 앞에서는 절차를 접는다.\n\n- 생업: 의무실 침상 배정·약재 배분\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방보건계\n- 담당 업무: 서울역 의무실 의무원\n**생애.** 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 서울역 의무실 의무원 자리는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 연지우의 의무실 침상을 배정하고 약재를 나누는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방보건계. 담당 업무: 서울역 의무실 의무원.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 이 일로 서울역 의무실 의무원 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 윤지율의 이송 장부를 침상에서 집행하는 지휘를 받고, 류은비에게 약품 묶음을 빚지며, 백온의 가족 이송을 우선 침상으로 남긴다.\n\n**야망.** 중앙 재난의료 조정망의 현장 진료를 기록청 인준 아래 두어 구급 열차가 군수로 돌지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 이송 명단이 군사호적과 합쳐져 피난민이 병력 숫자로만 남는 것.\n\n**개입.** 환자만 태운 열차를 호송하거나, 군사호적이 섞인 침상 명단을 분리해 줄 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 25 | 개방 0 | 무력 −50 | 물질 −20 | 공동 0 | 원칙 70 | 공개 −20 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −50\n- 욕망: 갈망 50 | 독점 5 | 위험 25 | 과시 −5 | 지속 10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"연지우","type":"지휘","to":"윤지율","basis":"윤지율의 이송 장부를 침상에서 집행하는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"연지우","type":"빚","to":"류은비","basis":"류은비에게 약품 묶음을 빚지며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"권하린","type":"계약","to":"연지우","basis":"권하린은 제설한 환승 통로에서 옮긴 부상자를 연지우에게 인계한다. 연지우는 호흡과 중증도를 확인해 침상을 배정하고 이동이 늦은 환자를 행정 기록만으로 밀어내지 않는다."},{"from":"설다흰","type":"계약","to":"연지우","basis":"연지우의 의무실 봉쇄를 방송으로 알리는 동맹이고"},{"from":"연태솔","type":"계약","to":"연지우","basis":"연지우의 침상 부족을 배차로 메운다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0154', 'b098-b098-c8fc-7f85', '{"id":"person-0154","name":"Na Seonjae","title":"Archive Defense Patrol Squad Leader","position":"Archive Defense Patrol Squad Leader","characterId":"K153","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Archive key verification and defensive patrols","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#Character-Na-Seonjae","detailRoute":"/people/person-0154","birthDate":"2098-04-09","birthday":"04-09","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"k153-archive-patrol","name":"Archive patrol","rating":60},{"id":"k153-document-preservation","name":"Document preservation","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k153-choice","name":"Key rules also bind guards","description":"He gauged footsteps before the archive''s humidity and saw night entries missing from the reading ledger as intent rather than accident. When his men''s water chits fell behind, he led the patrol himself.","behavior":"Anecdote. In 2125 he dried ratification papers soaked on the platform and left a hand copy. By this deed the signature of the archive defense patrol squad leader post rose into the ledger.","stress":"Fear. That one forged reading pass would carry the three testament copies outside. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Executed Jo Harin''s removal schedule by patrol, split the archive-depot seals and rotations with Ji Hansol, and guarded Yun Seorin''s protocol routes.","effects":[]},{"id":"k153-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: archive defense patrol squad leader. He wrote the patrol hours on the wall, but even the inside patrol stopped unless the two librarians'' keys turned together.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: archive defense patrol squad leader. He wrote the patrol hours on the wall, but even the inside patrol stopped unless the two librarians'' keys turned together.","stress":"Fear. That one forged reading pass would carry the three testament copies outside. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Executed Jo Harin''s removal schedule by patrol, split the archive-depot seals and rotations with Ji Hansol, and guarded Yun Seorin''s protocol routes.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Stops even internal patrol without both keys and preserved wet documents. Patrol responsibility is not evidence of war command or exceptional combat. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41150-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K153","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41150-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b098-b098-c8fc-7f85","name":"Naju Na Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b098-b098-c8fc-7f85.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":30,"Openness":-25,"Force":0,"Material":-35,"Communal":15,"Principle":40,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-40,"Transformative":-40},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":0,"Risk":20,"Display":-20,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Archive key verification and defensive patrols","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"A grade among Local Protection Clerk Assistant (Grade 9), Local Protection Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Protection Senior Clerk Assistant (Grade 7), matching a post at a Seoul Special City office","Assigned Duties":"Archive Defense Patrol Squad Leader","Values":"Authority 30 | Openness −25 | Force 0 | Materialism −35 | Communal 15 | Principle 40 | Publicity −15 | Credentials 10 | Dispersion −40 | Transformation −40","Desires":"Craving 0 | Possessiveness 0 | Risk 20 | Display −20 | Persistence 30 | Orientation: bisexual | Bonding: contract cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"He grew up in the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Squad Leader of the Archive Guard Patrol opened to him through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Checking and patrolling Na Seonjae''s archive keys ties into the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"A grade among Local Protection Clerk Assistant (Grade 9), Local Protection Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Protection Senior Clerk Assistant (Grade 7), matching a post at a Seoul Special City office. Duties: Squad Leader of the Archive Guard Patrol.","Anecdote":"In 2125, on a platform, he dried waterlogged ratification documents and preserved them as transcribed copies. For this, his signature for the post of Squad Leader of the Archive Guard Patrol was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"He carries out Jo Harin''s removal timetable through patrols, shares shifts with the seal of Ji Hansol''s archive base, and protects Yun Seorin''s ceremonial route.","Ambition":"To move archive defense and small-scale ceremonial security only by the official cipher tablet, so that the envoys of the great powers cannot seize the archive.","Fear":"That a single forged reading pass will send the three copies of the will outside.","Intervention":"He can trace the origin of the night entries and lift the lockdown, or hand over the cipher tablet leak and have the squad leader replaced."},"biography":"He gauges footsteps before the humidity of the stacks, and treats night entries absent from the reading ledger as deliberate rather than accidental. When a subordinate''s water ration schedule slips behind, he takes the patrol himself.\n\n- Livelihood: archive key checks and guard patrol\n- Affiliation: Seoul Special City local civil service organization\n- Position and grade: a grade among Local Protection Clerk Assistant (Grade 9), Local Protection Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Protection Senior Clerk Assistant (Grade 7), matching a post at a Seoul Special City office\n- Duties: Squad Leader of the Archive Guard Patrol\n**Life.** He grew up in the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Squad Leader of the Archive Guard Patrol opened to him through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Checking and patrolling Na Seonjae''s archive keys ties into the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Servant Position and Grade.** A grade among Local Protection Clerk Assistant (Grade 9), Local Protection Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Protection Senior Clerk Assistant (Grade 7), matching a post at a Seoul Special City office. Duties: Squad Leader of the Archive Guard Patrol.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, on a platform, he dried waterlogged ratification documents and preserved them as transcribed copies. For this, his signature for the post of Squad Leader of the Archive Guard Patrol was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** He carries out Jo Harin''s removal timetable through patrols, shares shifts with the seal of Ji Hansol''s archive base, and protects Yun Seorin''s ceremonial route.\n\n**Ambition.** To move archive defense and small-scale ceremonial security only by the official cipher tablet, so that the envoys of the great powers cannot seize the archive.\n\n**Fear.** That a single forged reading pass will send the three copies of the will outside.\n\n**Intervention.** He can trace the origin of the night entries and lift the lockdown, or hand over the cipher tablet leak and have the squad leader replaced.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 30 | Openness −25 | Force 0 | Materialism −35 | Communal 15 | Principle 40 | Publicity −15 | Credentials 10 | Dispersion −40 | Transformation −40\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Possessiveness 0 | Risk 20 | Display −20 | Persistence 30 | Orientation: bisexual | Bonding: contract cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Na Seonjae","type":"Command","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"enforces Jo Harin''s removal-time schedule through patrols, and"},{"from":"Na Seonjae","type":"Command","to":"Ji Hansol","basis":"shares shifts with the seal of Ji Hansol''s archive base"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0154","name":"나선재","title":"문서고 수비 순찰대 조장","position":"문서고 수비 순찰대 조장","characterId":"K153","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"문서고 열쇠 확인·수비 순찰","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-나선재","detailRoute":"/people/person-0154","birthDate":"2098-04-09","birthday":"04-09","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"k153-archive-patrol","name":"서고 순찰","rating":60},{"id":"k153-document-preservation","name":"문서 보전","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k153-choice","name":"수비에도 열쇠 규칙","description":"서고 습도보다 발소리를 먼저 가늠하고, 열람 장부에 없는 야간 출입을 사고보다 고의로 본다. 부하의 급수표가 밀리면 자신이 순찰을 선다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 승강장에서 물에 젖은 인준 문서를 말려 필사본으로 남겼다. 이 일로 문서고 수비 순찰대 조장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"공포. 위조 열람증 한 장이 유언 삼본을 밖으로 내보내는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 조하린의 반출 시각표를 순찰로 집행하고, 지한솔의 서고기지 봉인과 교대를 나누며, 윤서린의 의전 경로를 지킨다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k153-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 문서고 수비 순찰대 조장. 순찰 시각을 벽에 쓰되, 두 사서의 열쇠가 동시에 열리지 않으면 내부 순찰도 멈춘다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 문서고 수비 순찰대 조장. 순찰 시각을 벽에 쓰되, 두 사서의 열쇠가 동시에 열리지 않으면 내부 순찰도 멈춘다.","stress":"공포. 위조 열람증 한 장이 유언 삼본을 밖으로 내보내는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 조하린의 반출 시각표를 순찰로 집행하고, 지한솔의 서고기지 봉인과 교대를 나누며, 윤서린의 의전 경로를 지킨다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"열쇠 둘이 없으면 내부 순찰도 멈추고 젖은 문서를 보전했다. 순찰 책임은 전쟁 지휘나 뛰어난 개인 전투의 근거가 아니다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41150-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K153","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41150-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b098-b098-c8fc-7f85","name":"나주 나씨","crest":"clan-crests/b098-b098-c8fc-7f85.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":30,"개방":-25,"무력":0,"물질":-35,"공동":15,"원칙":40,"공개":-15,"자격":10,"분산":-40,"변혁":-40},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":0,"위험":20,"과시":-20,"지속":30,"지향":"양성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"문서고 열쇠 확인·수비 순찰","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방방호서기보(9급)·지방방호서기(8급)·지방방호주사보(7급) 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"문서고 수비 순찰대 조장","가치관":"권위 30 | 개방 −25 | 무력 0 | 물질 −35 | 공동 15 | 원칙 40 | 공개 −15 | 자격 10 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −40","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 0 | 위험 20 | 과시 −20 | 지속 30 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 문서고 수비 순찰대 조장 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 나선재의 문서고 열쇠를 확인하고 순찰하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방방호서기보(9급)·지방방호서기(8급)·지방방호주사보(7급) 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 문서고 수비 순찰대 조장.","일화":"2125년 승강장에서 물에 젖은 인준 문서를 말려 필사본으로 남겼다. 이 일로 문서고 수비 순찰대 조장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"조하린의 반출 시각표를 순찰로 집행하고, 지한솔의 서고기지 봉인과 교대를 나누며, 윤서린의 의전 경로를 지킨다.","야망":"문서고 수비와 소규모 의전경비를 공식 암호패로만 움직여 강국 사신이 서고를 빼앗지 못하게 한다.","공포":"위조 열람증 한 장이 유언 삼본을 밖으로 내보내는 것.","개입":"야간 출입의 진원을 밝혀 봉쇄를 풀거나, 암호패 유출을 넘겨 조장을 교체하게 할 수 있다."},"biography":"서고 습도보다 발소리를 먼저 가늠하고, 열람 장부에 없는 야간 출입을 사고보다 고의로 본다. 부하의 급수표가 밀리면 자신이 순찰을 선다.\n\n- 생업: 문서고 열쇠 확인·수비 순찰\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방방호서기보(9급)·지방방호서기(8급)·지방방호주사보(7급) 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 문서고 수비 순찰대 조장\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 문서고 수비 순찰대 조장 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 나선재의 문서고 열쇠를 확인하고 순찰하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방방호서기보(9급)·지방방호서기(8급)·지방방호주사보(7급) 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 문서고 수비 순찰대 조장.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 승강장에서 물에 젖은 인준 문서를 말려 필사본으로 남겼다. 이 일로 문서고 수비 순찰대 조장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 조하린의 반출 시각표를 순찰로 집행하고, 지한솔의 서고기지 봉인과 교대를 나누며, 윤서린의 의전 경로를 지킨다.\n\n**야망.** 문서고 수비와 소규모 의전경비를 공식 암호패로만 움직여 강국 사신이 서고를 빼앗지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 위조 열람증 한 장이 유언 삼본을 밖으로 내보내는 것.\n\n**개입.** 야간 출입의 진원을 밝혀 봉쇄를 풀거나, 암호패 유출을 넘겨 조장을 교체하게 할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 30 | 개방 −25 | 무력 0 | 물질 −35 | 공동 15 | 원칙 40 | 공개 −15 | 자격 10 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −40\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 0 | 위험 20 | 과시 −20 | 지속 30 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"나선재","type":"지휘","to":"조하린","basis":"조하린의 반출 시각표를 순찰로 집행하고"},{"from":"나선재","type":"지휘","to":"지한솔","basis":"지한솔의 서고기지 봉인과 교대를 나누며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0155', 'c591-b0a8-c6d0-694a', '{"id":"person-0155","name":"Yang Haeon","title":"Ratification Review Herald","position":"Ratification Review Herald","characterId":"K154","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Delivery of ratification hold messages and custody confirmations","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#Character-Yang-Haeon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0155","birthDate":"2091-09-25","birthday":"09-25","age":35,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k154-sealed-delivery","name":"Sealed dispatch delivery","rating":65},{"id":"k154-delivery-order","name":"Dispatch sequencing","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k154-choice","name":"Departs after confirmation","description":"She refused departure whenever a seal cord sat loose and read any envoy who did not record verbal dispatches as a potential forger. Short of breath or not, she held two copies in one hand.","behavior":"Anecdote. Gang Yejun''s suspension of review and Ji Mokhyeon''s eastern dispatch message end up in the courier bag on the same day. Yang Haeon first obtains Jo Harin''s custody confirmation to post the ratification hold, then weighs the ratification timing to decide which message goes into the archive first.","stress":"Fear. That one forged ratification dispatch would pass a testament and the courier network would sink into a great power''s subcontract. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Under command to carry Gang Yejun''s examination-suspension declaration only under seal, split boxes and order with Ma Dohan by contract, and weighed ratification timing against Ji Mokhyeon''s eastern dispatches.","effects":[]},{"id":"k154-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: ratification examination courier. He sent the dispatches to the examiner and the archive at once, and a ratification hold ran only with both Gang Yejun''s stamp and Jo Harin''s custody confirmation.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: ratification examination courier. He sent the dispatches to the examiner and the archive at once, and a ratification hold ran only with both Gang Yejun''s stamp and Jo Harin''s custody confirmation.","stress":"Fear. That one forged ratification dispatch would pass a testament and the courier network would sink into a great power''s subcontract. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Under command to carry Gang Yejun''s examination-suspension declaration only under seal, split boxes and order with Ma Dohan by contract, and weighed ratification timing against Ji Mokhyeon''s eastern dispatches.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Obtains custody confirmation before a suspension notice and orders messages around approval timing. Delivery judgment is not independent diplomatic authority. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51210-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K154","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51210-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c591-b0a8-c6d0-694a","name":"Namwon Yang Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c591-b0a8-c6d0-694a.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":30,"Openness":10,"Force":-35,"Material":-30,"Communal":20,"Principle":60,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":0,"Dispersed":-35,"Transformative":-40},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":25,"Display":10,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Delivery of ratification hold messages and custody confirmations","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)","Assigned Duties":"Ratification Review Herald","Values":"Authority 30 | Openness 10 | Force −35 | Materialism −30 | Communal 20 | Principle 60 | Publicity −10 | Credentials 0 | Decentralization −35 | Transformation −40","Desires":"Craving 30 | Monopoly −10 | Risk 25 | Display 10 | Persistence 30 | Orientation: No Orientation | Bonding: Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Raised at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The Approval Review Courier post opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Delivering Yang Haeon''s approval-hold messages and custody confirmations connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"A grade suited to a post at the Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field offices, among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9). Duties: Approval Review Courier.","Anecdote":"Gang Yejun''s review-suspension declaration and Ji Mokhyeon''s eastern dispatch message end up in the courier bag on the same day. Yang Haeon first obtains Jo Harin''s custody confirmation and attaches the approval hold, then decides which of the two messages goes into the archive first by weighing the timing of approval.","Relationships":"A command role that carries Gang Yejun''s review-suspension declaration only in sealed condition, divides Ma Dohan''s copy boxes and turn order by contract, and weighs the timing of approval against Ji Mokhyeon''s eastern dispatch message.","Ambition":"To make approval notices for succession and the water supply and repair treaties valid only in the courier ledger that he himself seals.","Fear":"That a single forged approval message will push a will through and the courier network will collapse into a subcontractor of a great power.","Intervention":"Can hunt down a forged message and protect the seal, or expose the hold documents in the bag to force approval through."},"biography":"If the seal cord is slack, he refuses to depart, and he suspects that a messenger who does not record oral messages may be a forgery. Even when out of breath, he holds two copies in one hand.\n\n- Livelihood: Delivering approval-hold messages and custody confirmations\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service organization\n- Position and grade: A grade suited to a post at the Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field offices, among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)\n- Duties: Approval Review Courier\n**Life.** Raised at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The Approval Review Courier post opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Delivering Yang Haeon''s approval-hold messages and custody confirmations connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Service Position and Grade.** A grade suited to a post at the Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field offices, among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9). Duties: Approval Review Courier.\n\n**Anecdote.** Gang Yejun''s review-suspension declaration and Ji Mokhyeon''s eastern dispatch message end up in the courier bag on the same day. Yang Haeon first obtains Jo Harin''s custody confirmation and attaches the approval hold, then decides which of the two messages goes into the archive first by weighing the timing of approval.\n\n**Relations.** A command role that carries Gang Yejun''s review-suspension declaration only in sealed condition, divides Ma Dohan''s copy boxes and turn order by contract, and weighs the timing of approval against Ji Mokhyeon''s eastern dispatch message.\n\n**Ambition.** To make approval notices for succession and the water supply and repair treaties valid only in the courier ledger that he himself seals.\n\n**Fear.** That a single forged approval message will push a will through and the courier network will collapse into a subcontractor of a great power.\n\n**Intervention.** Can hunt down a forged message and protect the seal, or expose the hold documents in the bag to force approval through.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 30 | Openness 10 | Force −35 | Materialism −30 | Communal 20 | Principle 60 | Publicity −10 | Credentials 0 | Decentralization −35 | Transformation −40\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Monopoly −10 | Risk 25 | Display 10 | Persistence 30 | Orientation: No Orientation | Bonding: Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yang Haeon","type":"Command","to":"Gang Ye-jun","basis":"Is the commander who carries Gang Yejun''s declaration of review suspension only in sealed condition, and"},{"from":"Yang Haeon","type":"Contract","to":"Ma Dohan","basis":"sharing turn order with Ma Dohan''s copy boxes by contract"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Im Bit-na","type":"Contract","to":"Yang Haeon","basis":"Im Bitna hands over the continuous record of approval receipt times and hold status to Yang Haeon. Yang Haeon checks the reviewer''s seal and the archive custody confirmation, and delivers a message with no omitted hold on the next shift."},{"from":"Ryu Dalhyeon","type":"Contract","to":"Yang Haeon","basis":"Ryu Dalhyeon hands over to Yang Haeon the seal times and approval-hold order that he confirmed at each shift. Yang Haeon checks the review seal and the custody confirmation so that the hold status does not vanish from the next message."},{"from":"Mun Maeun","type":"Contract","to":"Yang Haeon","basis":"Mun Maeun hands over to Yang Haeon the copies under approval hold and the continuous record of the sections where validity has stopped. Yang Haeon checks the review seal and custody confirmation and links up messages with no omitted hold."},{"from":"Ma Dohan","type":"Contract","to":"Yang Haeon","basis":"sharing turn order with Yang Haeon''s courier seals"},{"from":"Sofia Rossi","type":"Contract","to":"Yang Haeon","basis":"Syncs timing with Yang Haeon''s approval messages"},{"from":"Seop Do-yun","type":"Contract","to":"Yang Haeon","basis":"Splits turn order with Yang Haeon''s approval messages"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0155","name":"양해온","title":"인준 심사 전령","position":"인준 심사 전령","characterId":"K154","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"인준 보류 전갈·보관 확인 전달","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-양해온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0155","birthDate":"2091-09-25","birthday":"09-25","age":35,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k154-sealed-delivery","name":"봉인 전갈 전달","rating":65},{"id":"k154-delivery-order","name":"전갈 순서 판단","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k154-choice","name":"확인을 받은 뒤 출발","description":"봉인 끈이 느슨하면 출발을 거부하고, 구두 전갈을 기록하지 않는 사신을 위조일 수 있다고 본다. 숨이 차도 사본 두 장을 한 손에 쥔다.","behavior":"일화. 강예준의 심사 정지 선언과 지목현의 동부 파견 전갈이 같은 날 전령 가방에 함께 든다. 양해온은 조하린의 보관 확인을 먼저 받아 인준 보류를 달고, 두 전갈 가운데 어느 쪽을 먼저 문서고에 넣을지 인준 시점을 따져 정한다.","stress":"공포. 위조 인준 전갈 한 장이 유언을 통과시켜 전령망이 강국 하청으로 몰락하는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 강예준의 심사 정지 선언을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘이고, 마도한의 사본 상자와 순번을 계약으로 나누며, 지목현의 동부 파견 전갈과 인준 시점을 저울질한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k154-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 인준 심사 전령. 전갈을 심사관과 문서고에 동시에 보내고, 인준 보류는 강예준의 날인과 조하린의 보관 확인이 둘 다 있어야 달린다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 인준 심사 전령. 전갈을 심사관과 문서고에 동시에 보내고, 인준 보류는 강예준의 날인과 조하린의 보관 확인이 둘 다 있어야 달린다.","stress":"공포. 위조 인준 전갈 한 장이 유언을 통과시켜 전령망이 강국 하청으로 몰락하는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 강예준의 심사 정지 선언을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘이고, 마도한의 사본 상자와 순번을 계약으로 나누며, 지목현의 동부 파견 전갈과 인준 시점을 저울질한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"보관 확인을 먼저 받아 보류 통지를 달고 인준 시점을 따져 전갈 순서를 정한다. 전달 판단을 독립 외교권으로 바꾸지 않는다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51210-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K154","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51210-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c591-b0a8-c6d0-694a","name":"남원 양씨","crest":"clan-crests/c591-b0a8-c6d0-694a.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":30,"개방":10,"무력":-35,"물질":-30,"공동":20,"원칙":60,"공개":-10,"자격":0,"분산":-35,"변혁":-40},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-10,"위험":25,"과시":10,"지속":30,"지향":"무성향","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"인준 보류 전갈·보관 확인 전달","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"인준 심사 전령","가치관":"권위 30 | 개방 10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −30 | 공동 20 | 원칙 60 | 공개 −10 | 자격 0 | 분산 −35 | 변혁 −40","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 −10 | 위험 25 | 과시 10 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 인준 심사 전령 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 양해온의 인준 보류 전갈과 보관 확인을 전하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 인준 심사 전령.","일화":"강예준의 심사 정지 선언과 지목현의 동부 파견 전갈이 같은 날 전령 가방에 함께 든다. 양해온은 조하린의 보관 확인을 먼저 받아 인준 보류를 달고, 두 전갈 가운데 어느 쪽을 먼저 문서고에 넣을지 인준 시점을 따져 정한다.","관계":"강예준의 심사 정지 선언을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘이고, 마도한의 사본 상자와 순번을 계약으로 나누며, 지목현의 동부 파견 전갈과 인준 시점을 저울질한다.","야망":"계승과 급수·수리 조약의 인준 통지를 자신이 날인하는 전령 원장에만 유효하게 만든다.","공포":"위조 인준 전갈 한 장이 유언을 통과시켜 전령망이 강국 하청으로 몰락하는 것.","개입":"위조 전갈을 찾아 봉인을 지키거나, 가방 속 보류 문서를 폭로해 인준을 강제할 수 있다."},"biography":"봉인 끈이 느슨하면 출발을 거부하고, 구두 전갈을 기록하지 않는 사신을 위조일 수 있다고 본다. 숨이 차도 사본 두 장을 한 손에 쥔다.\n\n- 생업: 인준 보류 전갈·보관 확인 전달\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 인준 심사 전령\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 인준 심사 전령 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 양해온의 인준 보류 전갈과 보관 확인을 전하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 인준 심사 전령.\n\n**일화.** 강예준의 심사 정지 선언과 지목현의 동부 파견 전갈이 같은 날 전령 가방에 함께 든다. 양해온은 조하린의 보관 확인을 먼저 받아 인준 보류를 달고, 두 전갈 가운데 어느 쪽을 먼저 문서고에 넣을지 인준 시점을 따져 정한다.\n\n**관계.** 강예준의 심사 정지 선언을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘이고, 마도한의 사본 상자와 순번을 계약으로 나누며, 지목현의 동부 파견 전갈과 인준 시점을 저울질한다.\n\n**야망.** 계승과 급수·수리 조약의 인준 통지를 자신이 날인하는 전령 원장에만 유효하게 만든다.\n\n**공포.** 위조 인준 전갈 한 장이 유언을 통과시켜 전령망이 강국 하청으로 몰락하는 것.\n\n**개입.** 위조 전갈을 찾아 봉인을 지키거나, 가방 속 보류 문서를 폭로해 인준을 강제할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 30 | 개방 10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −30 | 공동 20 | 원칙 60 | 공개 −10 | 자격 0 | 분산 −35 | 변혁 −40\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 −10 | 위험 25 | 과시 10 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"양해온","type":"지휘","to":"강예준","basis":"강예준의 심사 정지 선언을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘이고"},{"from":"양해온","type":"계약","to":"마도한","basis":"마도한의 사본 상자와 순번을 계약으로 나누며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"임빛나","type":"계약","to":"양해온","basis":"임빛나는 인준 접수 시각과 보류 상태의 연속 기록을 양해온에게 넘긴다. 양해온은 심사관 날인과 문서고 보관 확인을 살펴 다음 교대에 보류가 누락되지 않은 전갈을 전한다."},{"from":"류달현","type":"계약","to":"양해온","basis":"류달현은 교대마다 확인한 봉인 시각과 인준 보류 순서를 양해온에게 넘긴다. 양해온은 심사 날인과 보관 확인을 살펴 보류 상태가 다음 전갈에서 사라지지 않게 한다."},{"from":"문마은","type":"계약","to":"양해온","basis":"문마은은 인준 보류 중인 사본과 효력이 멈춘 구간의 연속 기록을 양해온에게 넘긴다. 양해온은 심사 날인·보관 확인을 살펴 보류가 누락되지 않은 전갈을 잇는다."},{"from":"마도한","type":"계약","to":"양해온","basis":"양해온의 전령 봉인과 순번을 나누며"},{"from":"소피아 로시","type":"계약","to":"양해온","basis":"양해온의 인준 전갈과 시점을 맞춘다"},{"from":"섭도윤","type":"계약","to":"양해온","basis":"양해온의 인준 전갈과 순번을 나누며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0156', 'c8fc-c2e0-c548', '{"id":"person-0156","name":"Ju Rian","title":"Northern Water Purification Pipeline Surveyor","position":"Northern Water Purification Pipeline Surveyor","characterId":"K155","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Northern purification pipeline water sampling and bypass water supply","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#Inmul-Jurian","detailRoute":"/people/person-0156","birthDate":"2078-07-29","birthday":"07-29","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k155-water-sampling","name":"Pipe water sampling","rating":60},{"id":"k155-bypass-opening","name":"Water bypass opening","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k155-choice","name":"Responsibility for solid lines","description":"He read time from the cut pipes'' water temperature and saw anyone who drew a single-source road as a solid line as close to murder. He counted a late survey a fault.","behavior":"Anecdote. In 2125, instead of thawing the frozen pipes, he opened a bypass waterway. By this deed the signature of the northern purification pipeline surveyor post rose into the ledger.","stress":"Fear. That the survey master plate would be bought up by great powers and the water-dispute zones printed as someone else''s territory. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice handing field coordinates to Seo Raon''s master plate, he matched map-renewal times with Choi Jiwoo and split bridge underside surveys and bypass dotted lines with Ma Gilsang by contract.","effects":[]},{"id":"k155-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: northern purification pipeline surveyor. He drew intake overlaid with transmission bulletins and left single-source sections only as dotted lines.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: northern purification pipeline surveyor. He drew intake overlaid with transmission bulletins and left single-source sections only as dotted lines.","stress":"Fear. That the survey master plate would be bought up by great powers and the water-dispute zones printed as someone else''s territory. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice handing field coordinates to Seo Raon''s master plate, he matched map-renewal times with Choi Jiwoo and split bridge underside surveys and bypass dotted lines with Ma Gilsang by contract.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Opened bypass supply rather than thawing frozen pipes and cross-checks samples with reports. Route certainty does not imply railway construction experience. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51230-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K155","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51230-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c8fc-c2e0-c548","name":"Sinan Ju Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c8fc-c2e0-c548.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":0,"Force":-25,"Material":-30,"Communal":0,"Principle":45,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":-40,"Transformative":-30},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":15,"Risk":0,"Display":-25,"Sustained":25,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Northern purification pipeline water sampling and bypass water supply","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"A grade suited to a post at a waterworks field office of the Seoul Arisu Headquarters, among Local Industrial Senior Clerk and Local Industrial Assistant Senior Clerk, or Local Facilities Senior Clerk and Local Facilities Assistant Senior Clerk","Assigned Duties":"Northern Water Purification Pipeline Surveyor","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness 0 | Force −25 | Materialism −30 | Communality 0 | Principle 45 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization −40 | Transformation −30","Desires":"Craving 30 | Possessiveness 15 | Risk 0 | Display −25 | Persistence 25 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding Multi-partner"},"sections":{"Life":"Raised on the Yeongdeungpo water purification duty watch. The post of Northern Water Purification Pipe Surveyor opened through a valve signature on the Turbid Water Night.\n- Handing over Ju Ri-an''s pipe water-sampling and bypass water-supply survey records connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"Rank suited to a post at a waterworks office under the Seoul Arisu Headquarters, among Local Industrial Officer, Assistant Local Industrial Officer, Local Facilities Officer, or Assistant Local Facilities Officer. Duties: Northern Water Purification Pipe Surveyor.","Anecdote":"In 2125, instead of thawing the frozen-burst pipeline, opened a bypass water channel. Because of this, the signature for the post of Northern Water Purification Pipe Surveyor entered the ledger.","Relationships":"Is the transcriber who hands field coordinates to Seo Ra-on''s master plate, syncs map update times with Choe Ji-u, and divides Ma Gil-sang''s under-bridge survey and bypass dotted lines by contract.","Ambition":"Gathers the severed northern water purification lines and the living pipes through field surveys, turning them into verification material for the Director of the Joint Technology Institute.","Fear":"That the survey plate will be bought by a great power and the disputed water-supply sections will be printed as another''s territory.","Intervention":"Can take charge of an actual pipe escort to guard the plate, or track down the print shop that makes forged solid lines."},"biography":"Reads time from the water temperature of severed pipes, and regards anyone who draws a road as a solid line on a single source as close to a murderer. Sees late surveying as a sin.\n\n- Livelihood: Northern water purification pipe water sampling and bypass water supply\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service organization\n- Position and rank: Rank suited to a post at a waterworks office under the Seoul Arisu Headquarters, among Local Industrial Officer, Assistant Local Industrial Officer, Local Facilities Officer, or Assistant Local Facilities Officer\n- Duties: Northern Water Purification Pipe Surveyor\n**Life.** Raised on the Yeongdeungpo water purification duty watch. The post of Northern Water Purification Pipe Surveyor opened through a valve signature on the Turbid Water Night.\n- Handing over Ju Ri-an''s pipe water-sampling and bypass water-supply survey records connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Service Position and Rank.** Rank suited to a post at a waterworks office under the Seoul Arisu Headquarters, among Local Industrial Officer, Assistant Local Industrial Officer, Local Facilities Officer, or Assistant Local Facilities Officer. Duties: Northern Water Purification Pipe Surveyor.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, instead of thawing the frozen-burst pipeline, opened a bypass water channel. Because of this, the signature for the post of Northern Water Purification Pipe Surveyor entered the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Is the transcriber who hands field coordinates to Seo Ra-on''s master plate, syncs map update times with Choe Ji-u, and divides Ma Gil-sang''s under-bridge survey and bypass dotted lines by contract.\n\n**Ambition.** Gathers the severed northern water purification lines and the living pipes through field surveys, turning them into verification material for the Director of the Joint Technology Institute.\n\n**Fear.** That the survey plate will be bought by a great power and the disputed water-supply sections will be printed as another''s territory.\n\n**Intervention.** Can take charge of an actual pipe escort to guard the plate, or track down the print shop that makes forged solid lines.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness 0 | Force −25 | Materialism −30 | Communality 0 | Principle 45 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization −40 | Transformation −30\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Possessiveness 15 | Risk 0 | Display −25 | Persistence 25 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding Multi-partner\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ju Rian","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Seo Ra-on","basis":"A priest who hands field coordinates to Seo Raon''s plate, and"},{"from":"Ju Rian","type":"Contract","to":"Ma Gilsang","basis":"Divides Ma Gilsang''s bridge underside surveys and detour dotted lines by contract"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Patrick O''Connor","type":"Contract","to":"Ju Rian","basis":"Aligning Ju Ri-an''s northern pipe dotted line with the riverbank"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0156","name":"주리안","title":"북부 정수 배관 탐사원","position":"북부 정수 배관 탐사원","characterId":"K155","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"북부 정수 배관 채수·우회 급수","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-주리안","detailRoute":"/people/person-0156","birthDate":"2078-07-29","birthday":"07-29","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k155-water-sampling","name":"배관 채수","rating":60},{"id":"k155-bypass-opening","name":"우회 급수 개통","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k155-choice","name":"실선의 책임","description":"끊긴 배관의 수온으로 시간을 읽고, 출처가 하나뿐인 도로를 실선으로 그리는 사람을 살인에 가깝다고 여긴다. 늦은 측량을 죄로 본다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 동파 관로를 녹이는 대신 우회 급수로를 열었다. 이 일로 북부 정수 배관 탐사원 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"공포. 탐사 원판이 강국에 사들여져 급수 분쟁 구간이 남의 영토로 인쇄되는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 서라온의 원판에 현장 좌표를 넘기는 신도이고, 최지우과 지도 갱신 시각을 맞추며, 마길상의 교량 하부 측량과 우회 점선을 계약으로 나눈다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k155-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 북부 정수 배관 탐사원. 채수와 송신 속보를 겹쳐 그리고, 출처가 하나뿐인 구간은 점선으로만 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 북부 정수 배관 탐사원. 채수와 송신 속보를 겹쳐 그리고, 출처가 하나뿐인 구간은 점선으로만 남긴다.","stress":"공포. 탐사 원판이 강국에 사들여져 급수 분쟁 구간이 남의 영토로 인쇄되는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 서라온의 원판에 현장 좌표를 넘기는 신도이고, 최지우과 지도 갱신 시각을 맞추며, 마길상의 교량 하부 측량과 우회 점선을 계약으로 나눈다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"동파 관로 대신 우회 급수를 열고 채수와 속보를 대조한다. 경로의 확실성을 표시하지만 철도 건설 경력은 없다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51230-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K155","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51230-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c8fc-c2e0-c548","name":"신안 주씨","crest":"clan-crests/c8fc-c2e0-c548.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":0,"무력":-25,"물질":-30,"공동":0,"원칙":45,"공개":-15,"자격":20,"분산":-40,"변혁":-30},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":15,"위험":0,"과시":-25,"지속":25,"지향":"양성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"북부 정수 배관 채수·우회 급수","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방공업주사·지방공업주사보 또는 지방시설주사·지방시설주사보 중 서울아리수본부 상수도 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"북부 정수 배관 탐사원","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 0 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −30 | 공동 0 | 원칙 45 | 공개 −15 | 자격 20 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −30","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 15 | 위험 0 | 과시 −25 | 지속 25 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"영등포 정수 당직에서 자랐다. 북부 정수 배관 탐사원 자리는 탁수 밤의 밸브 서명으로 열렸다.\n- 주리안의 배관 채수와 우회 급수 측량 기록을 인계하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방공업주사·지방공업주사보 또는 지방시설주사·지방시설주사보 중 서울아리수본부 상수도 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 북부 정수 배관 탐사원.","일화":"2125년 동파 관로를 녹이는 대신 우회 급수로를 열었다. 이 일로 북부 정수 배관 탐사원 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"서라온의 원판에 현장 좌표를 넘기는 신도이고, 최지우와 지도 갱신 시각을 맞추며, 마길상의 교량 하부 측량과 우회 점선을 계약으로 나눈다.","야망":"끊긴 북부 정수와 살아있는 배관을 현장 측량으로 모아 공동기술원장의 검증 자료가 되게 한다.","공포":"탐사 원판이 강국에 사들여져 급수 분쟁 구간이 남의 영토로 인쇄되는 것.","개입":"실제 배관 호위를 맡아 원판을 지키거나, 위조 실선 인쇄소를 찾아낼 수 있다."},"biography":"끊긴 배관의 수온으로 시간을 읽고, 출처가 하나뿐인 도로를 실선으로 그리는 사람을 살인에 가깝다고 여긴다. 늦은 측량을 죄로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 북부 정수 배관 채수·우회 급수\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방공업주사·지방공업주사보 또는 지방시설주사·지방시설주사보 중 서울아리수본부 상수도 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 북부 정수 배관 탐사원\n**생애.** 영등포 정수 당직에서 자랐다. 북부 정수 배관 탐사원 자리는 탁수 밤의 밸브 서명으로 열렸다.\n- 주리안의 배관 채수와 우회 급수 측량 기록을 인계하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방공업주사·지방공업주사보 또는 지방시설주사·지방시설주사보 중 서울아리수본부 상수도 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 북부 정수 배관 탐사원.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 동파 관로를 녹이는 대신 우회 급수로를 열었다. 이 일로 북부 정수 배관 탐사원 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 서라온의 원판에 현장 좌표를 넘기는 신도이고, 최지우와 지도 갱신 시각을 맞추며, 마길상의 교량 하부 측량과 우회 점선을 계약으로 나눈다.\n\n**야망.** 끊긴 북부 정수와 살아있는 배관을 현장 측량으로 모아 공동기술원장의 검증 자료가 되게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 탐사 원판이 강국에 사들여져 급수 분쟁 구간이 남의 영토로 인쇄되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 실제 배관 호위를 맡아 원판을 지키거나, 위조 실선 인쇄소를 찾아낼 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 0 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −30 | 공동 0 | 원칙 45 | 공개 −15 | 자격 20 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −30\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 15 | 위험 0 | 과시 −25 | 지속 25 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"주리안","type":"신도","to":"서라온","basis":"서라온의 원판에 현장 좌표를 넘기는 신도이고"},{"from":"주리안","type":"계약","to":"마길상","basis":"마길상의 교량 하부 측량과 우회 점선을 계약으로 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"패트릭 오코너","type":"계약","to":"주리안","basis":"주리안의 북부 배관 점선과 강변을 맞추며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0157', 'cc28-c5f0-c548', '{"id":"person-0157","name":"Cha Se-on","title":"Will Handwriting Recorder","position":"Will Handwriting Recorder","characterId":"K156","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Will handwriting and testimony comparison records","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#character-cha-se-on","detailRoute":"/people/person-0157","birthDate":"2101-04-05","birthday":"04-05","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k156-handwriting-record","name":"Handwriting record comparison","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k156-choice","name":"Keeps interpretation in margins","description":"She gauged handwriting from the slant of letters and read any ratification lacking two witnesses as a blank. She published the numbers but left the readings in the margin.","behavior":"Anecdote. In 2125, caught with a forged stamp, she burned the copies and kept the original column. By this deed the signature of the testament handwriting registrar post rose into the ledger.","stress":"Fear. That a fourth handwriting would pass in secret and the Record Bureau would become forgery''s accomplice. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice moving Gang Yejun''s handwriting comparisons into the ledger, she received the three copies out of Jo Harin''s iron box and took the writing of Im Hajun''s pre-disappearance maintenance log as the standard.","effects":[]},{"id":"k156-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: testament handwriting registrar. She spread the public original and the private testimony on one desk and struck pages stuck together from the comparison.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: testament handwriting registrar. She spread the public original and the private testimony on one desk and struck pages stuck together from the comparison.","stress":"Fear. That a fourth handwriting would pass in secret and the Record Bureau would become forgery''s accomplice. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice moving Gang Yejun''s handwriting comparisons into the ledger, she received the three copies out of Jo Harin''s iron box and took the writing of Im Hajun''s pre-disappearance maintenance log as the standard.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Excludes damaged carbon sheets and compares wills with log handwriting. Destroyed forged copies support preservation, not identification of the forger. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51720-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K156","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51720-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc28-c5f0-c548","name":"Yeonan Cha Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cc28-c5f0-c548.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":30,"Openness":0,"Force":-20,"Material":-30,"Communal":15,"Principle":65,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-30,"Transformative":-50},"desire":{"Longing":20,"Monopoly":-40,"Risk":5,"Display":-10,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Will handwriting and testimony comparison records","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)","Assigned Duties":"Will Handwriting Recorder","Values":"Authority 30 | Openness 0 | Force −20 | Materialism −30 | Communality 15 | Principle 65 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −30 | Transformation −50","Desires":"Craving 20 | Possessiveness −40 | Risk 5 | Display −10 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Same-sex | Bonding Multi-partner"},"sections":{"Life":"Raised at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Testamentary Handwriting Archivist opened through the deletion of a single line from a double ledger.\n- Collating and recording Cha Se-on''s testamentary handwriting and testimony connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"Rank suited to a headquarters or office post in the Seoul Metropolitan Government, among Local Administrative Official (Grade 5), Local Administrative Officer (Grade 6), Assistant Local Administrative Officer (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), or Assistant Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 9). Duties: Testamentary Handwriting Archivist.","Anecdote":"In 2125, the forged seal was exposed; the copies were burned and the original column was protected. Because of this, the signature for the post of Testamentary Handwriting Archivist entered the ledger.","Relationships":"Is the transcriber who moves Gang Ye-jun''s handwriting collation into the ledger, receives the triple copy taken out of Jo Ha-rin''s iron box, and uses the handwriting in Im Ha-jun''s pre-disappearance maintenance log as the standard.","Ambition":"To make the Chief Steward''s will and the draft Watergate Charter valid only in the handwriting ledger that Cha Se-on has personally reviewed, turning Seoul Station into the final repository of Seoul''s records.","Fear":"That a fourth handwriting will pass in secret and make the Records Office an accomplice to forgery.","Intervention":"Can find the hidden fourth handwriting and force ratification, or expose the marginal notes to get the archivist replaced."},"biography":"Gauges handwriting by the slant of the letters, and treats a ratification lacking two witnesses as a blank. Numbers are made public, but interpretation is left in the margin.\n\n- Livelihood: Collating and recording testamentary handwriting and testimony\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service organization\n- Position and rank: Rank suited to a headquarters or office post in the Seoul Metropolitan Government, among Local Administrative Official (Grade 5), Local Administrative Officer (Grade 6), Assistant Local Administrative Officer (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), or Assistant Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 9)\n- Duties: Testamentary Handwriting Archivist\n**Life.** Raised at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Testamentary Handwriting Archivist opened through the deletion of a single line from a double ledger.\n- Collating and recording Cha Se-on''s testamentary handwriting and testimony connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Service Position and Rank.** Rank suited to a headquarters or office post in the Seoul Metropolitan Government, among Local Administrative Official (Grade 5), Local Administrative Officer (Grade 6), Assistant Local Administrative Officer (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), or Assistant Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 9). Duties: Testamentary Handwriting Archivist.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, the forged seal was exposed; the copies were burned and the original column was protected. Because of this, the signature for the post of Testamentary Handwriting Archivist entered the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Is the transcriber who moves Gang Ye-jun''s handwriting collation into the ledger, receives the triple copy taken out of Jo Ha-rin''s iron box, and uses the handwriting in Im Ha-jun''s pre-disappearance maintenance log as the standard.\n\n**Ambition.** To make the Chief Steward''s will and the draft Watergate Charter valid only in the handwriting ledger that Cha Se-on has personally reviewed, turning Seoul Station into the final repository of Seoul''s records.\n\n**Fear.** That a fourth handwriting will pass in secret and make the Records Office an accomplice to forgery.\n\n**Intervention.** Can find the hidden fourth handwriting and force ratification, or expose the marginal notes to get the archivist replaced.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 30 | Openness 0 | Force −20 | Materialism −30 | Communality 15 | Principle 65 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −30 | Transformation −50\n- Desires: Craving 20 | Possessiveness −40 | Risk 5 | Display −10 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Same-sex | Bonding Multi-partner\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Cha Se-on","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Gang Ye-jun","basis":"Is the priest who transfers Gang Yejun''s handwriting comparison into the ledger, and"},{"from":"Cha Se-on","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"receives the three copies taken from Jo Harin''s iron chest, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Jo Yejun","type":"Contract","to":"Cha Se-on","basis":"Jo Ye-jun brings testimony that diverged during the public confrontation to Cha Se-on to compare against the handwriting and testimony collation records. When Jo Ye-jun leaves a witness''s words, Cha Se-on lays the original and the testimony side by side and distinguishes where the words changed from where the documents conflict."},{"from":"Gwon Geumyun","type":"Contract","to":"Cha Se-on","basis":"Gwon Geum-yun takes the register of persons, saved from the fire and kept safe, to Cha Se-on. Cha Se-on examines the testimony about the register and the handwriting of the original, leaving a basis for distinguishing records lost during the rescue from records added later."},{"from":"Yang Katae","type":"Contract","to":"Cha Se-on","basis":"Yang Ka-tae takes the register of persons saved from the fire to Cha Se-on and reports the damaged condition of the records. Cha Se-on examines the original handwriting and the testimony, does not arbitrarily fill in the illegible parts, and leaves a basis for verification."},{"from":"Min Dahyeon","type":"Contract","to":"Cha Se-on","basis":"Min Da-hyeon takes testimony confirmed through the confrontation to Cha Se-on. Cha Se-on examines the original and the handwriting together and distinguishes where the testimony changed from what was added to the document afterward."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0157","name":"차세온","title":"유언 필적 기록관","position":"유언 필적 기록관","characterId":"K156","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"유언 필적·증언 대조 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-차세온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0157","birthDate":"2101-04-05","birthday":"04-05","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k156-handwriting-record","name":"필적 기록 대조","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k156-choice","name":"해석을 난외에 남김","description":"글씨 기울기로 필적을 가늠하고, 증인 두 명이 차지 않은 인준을 빈칸으로 본다. 숫자는 공개하되 해석은 난외에 남긴다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 위조 도장을 들켜 사본을 불사르고 원본 칸을 지켰다. 이 일로 유언 필적 기록관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"공포. 네 번째 필적이 몰래 통과되어 기록청이 위조의 공범이 되는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 강예준의 필적 대조를 원장으로 옮기는 신도이고, 조하린의 철제 함에서 삼본을 꺼내 받으며, 임하준의 실종 전 정비일지 글씨를 기준으로 삼는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k156-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 유언 필적 기록관. 공개 원본과 비공개 증언을 같은 책상에 펼치고, 먹지가 들러붙은 장은 대조에서 제외한다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 유언 필적 기록관. 공개 원본과 비공개 증언을 같은 책상에 펼치고, 먹지가 들러붙은 장은 대조에서 제외한다.","stress":"공포. 네 번째 필적이 몰래 통과되어 기록청이 위조의 공범이 되는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 강예준의 필적 대조를 원장으로 옮기는 신도이고, 조하린의 철제 함에서 삼본을 꺼내 받으며, 임하준의 실종 전 정비일지 글씨를 기준으로 삼는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"훼손된 먹지를 제외하고 일지 글씨와 유언을 대조한다. 위조 사본 폐기는 원본 보전의 근거지만 위조 제작자를 확정하지 않는다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51720-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K156","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51720-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc28-c5f0-c548","name":"연안 차씨","crest":"clan-crests/cc28-c5f0-c548.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":30,"개방":0,"무력":-20,"물질":-30,"공동":15,"원칙":65,"공개":-10,"자격":10,"분산":-30,"변혁":-50},"desire":{"갈망":20,"독점":-40,"위험":5,"과시":-10,"지속":35,"지향":"동성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"유언 필적·증언 대조 기록","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"유언 필적 기록관","가치관":"권위 30 | 개방 0 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −30 | 공동 15 | 원칙 65 | 공개 −10 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −50","욕망":"갈망 20 | 독점 −40 | 위험 5 | 과시 −10 | 지속 35 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 유언 필적 기록관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 차세온의 유언 필적과 증언을 대조해 기록하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 유언 필적 기록관.","일화":"2125년 위조 도장을 들켜 사본을 불사르고 원본 칸을 지켰다. 이 일로 유언 필적 기록관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"강예준의 필적 대조를 원장으로 옮기는 신도이고, 조하린의 철제 함에서 삼본을 꺼내 받으며, 임하준의 실종 전 정비일지 글씨를 기준으로 삼는다.","야망":"총관 유언과 수문헌장 초안을 자신이 감수한 필적 원장에만 유효하게 해 서울역을 서울 기록의 최종 보관소로 만든다.","공포":"네 번째 필적이 몰래 통과되어 기록청이 위조의 공범이 되는 것.","개입":"숨긴 네 번째 필적을 찾아 인준을 강제하거나, 난외 노트를 폭로해 기록관을 교체하게 할 수 있다."},"biography":"글씨 기울기로 필적을 가늠하고, 증인 두 명이 차지 않은 인준을 빈칸으로 본다. 숫자는 공개하되 해석은 난외에 남긴다.\n\n- 생업: 유언 필적·증언 대조 기록\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 유언 필적 기록관\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 유언 필적 기록관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 차세온의 유언 필적과 증언을 대조해 기록하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 유언 필적 기록관.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 위조 도장을 들켜 사본을 불사르고 원본 칸을 지켰다. 이 일로 유언 필적 기록관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 강예준의 필적 대조를 원장으로 옮기는 신도이고, 조하린의 철제 함에서 삼본을 꺼내 받으며, 임하준의 실종 전 정비일지 글씨를 기준으로 삼는다.\n\n**야망.** 총관 유언과 수문헌장 초안을 자신이 감수한 필적 원장에만 유효하게 해 서울역을 서울 기록의 최종 보관소로 만든다.\n\n**공포.** 네 번째 필적이 몰래 통과되어 기록청이 위조의 공범이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 숨긴 네 번째 필적을 찾아 인준을 강제하거나, 난외 노트를 폭로해 기록관을 교체하게 할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 30 | 개방 0 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −30 | 공동 15 | 원칙 65 | 공개 −10 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −50\n- 욕망: 갈망 20 | 독점 −40 | 위험 5 | 과시 −10 | 지속 35 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"차세온","type":"신도","to":"강예준","basis":"강예준의 필적 대조를 원장으로 옮기는 신도이고"},{"from":"차세온","type":"신도","to":"조하린","basis":"조하린의 철제 함에서 삼본을 꺼내 받으며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"조예준","type":"계약","to":"차세온","basis":"조예준은 공개 대질에서 갈린 증언을 차세온에게 전해 필적·증언 대조 기록과 맞춰 본다. 조예준이 증인의 말을 남기면 차세온은 원본과 증언을 나란히 펼쳐, 말이 달라진 부분과 문서가 어긋난 부분을 구분한다."},{"from":"권금윤","type":"계약","to":"차세온","basis":"권금윤은 화재에서 구해 보관한 인명 장부를 차세온에게 가져간다. 차세온은 장부에 관한 증언과 원본의 필적을 살펴, 구조 과정에서 사라진 기록과 나중에 덧쓴 기록을 구분할 근거를 남긴다."},{"from":"양카태","type":"계약","to":"차세온","basis":"양카태는 화재에서 구한 인명 장부를 차세온에게 가져가 기록의 손상 상태를 알린다. 차세온은 원본 필적과 증언을 살펴 읽히지 않는 부분을 임의로 채우지 않고 확인 근거를 남긴다."},{"from":"민다현","type":"계약","to":"차세온","basis":"민다현은 대질로 확인한 증언을 차세온에게 가져간다. 차세온은 원본과 필적을 함께 살펴 증언이 달라진 부분과 문서에 덧쓴 부분을 구분한다."}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0158', 'c124-c21c-cc3d', '{"id":"person-0158","name":"Seol Dahin","title":"Seoul Station Concourse Stationmaster","position":"Seoul Station Concourse Stationmaster","characterId":"K157","rank":"Unregistered","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Concourse medical waiting tickets and notary window operations","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#character-seol-da-huin","detailRoute":"/people/person-0158","birthDate":"2083-12-14","birthday":"12-14","age":43,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k157-queue-posting","name":"Queue posting","rating":65},{"id":"k157-platform-announcement","name":"Platform announcements","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k157-choice","name":"Patients first","description":"She gauged crowds by platform humidity and heard as an insult any order to pull the protocol train ahead of the patient waiting line. Mild in manner, she took the broadcast herself whenever a transfer cancellation rose.","behavior":"Anecdote. In 2125 she sent a private petition back and passed it to the public window. By this deed the signature of the Seoul Station concourse stationmaster post rose into the ledger.","stress":"Fear. That turbid water and service rumor alone would blockade the concourse and scatter the refugees into smuggler boats. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. An alliance announcing Yeon Jiwoo''s infirmary lockdown by broadcast, she executed Yun Jiyul''s dispatch cancellations at the platform and kept Ma Dohan''s copy boxes in the concourse sealed rack.","effects":[]},{"id":"k157-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: bureau director. Title: Seoul Station concourse stationmaster. She published the concourse care waiting lists and the notary window daily and coupled munitions cars to the platform only after the medical transfer had left.","behavior":"Office. Rank: bureau director. Title: Seoul Station concourse stationmaster. She published the concourse care waiting lists and the notary window daily and coupled munitions cars to the platform only after the medical transfer had left.","stress":"Fear. That turbid water and service rumor alone would blockade the concourse and scatter the refugees into smuggler boats. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. An alliance announcing Yeon Jiwoo''s infirmary lockdown by broadcast, she executed Yun Jiyul''s dispatch cancellations at the platform and kept Ma Dohan''s copy boxes in the concourse sealed rack.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Medical transfers precede military wagons, and private requests go to the public desk. An integrated hub remains an ambition. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51730-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K157","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51730-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c124-c21c-cc3d","name":"Sunchang Seol Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c124-c21c-cc3d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":-15,"Force":-35,"Material":-40,"Communal":15,"Principle":50,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":-35,"Transformative":-40},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-25,"Risk":35,"Display":30,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Concourse medical waiting tickets and notary window operations","Status":"Functional/Livelihood Role (Not a Government Appointment)","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"None","Livelihood Role":"Seoul Station Concourse Stationmaster","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness −15 | Force −35 | Material −40 | Communal 15 | Principle 50 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 15 | Dispersal −35 | Transformation −40","Desires":"Craving 30 | Possessiveness −25 | Risk 35 | Display 30 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: heterosexual | Bonding: contract cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up on concourse night duty. The Seoul Station Concourse Stationmaster post opened as a replacement duty after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Running the concourse''s medical waiting tickets and notarization window, which Seol Dahin oversees, is tied to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Functional/Livelihood Role":"Seoul Station Concourse Stationmaster. Not an office, position, or rank in the Government or the Seoul Metropolitan Government.","Anecdote":"In 2125, sent a private solicitation back and redirected it to the public window. Because of this, the signature for the Seoul Station Concourse Stationmaster post was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"An ally who announces Yeon Jiu''s infirmary lockdown over the broadcast, enforces Yun Jiyul''s dispatch cancellations at the platform, and keeps Ma Dohan''s copy boxes in the concourse''s sealed bay.","Ambition":"To make the Seoul Station concourse the Seoul Station Hub, where confirmation, treatment, and notarization are signed under one roof, and become the face-to-face window for downtown confirmation.","Fear":"That the concourse will be sealed off on muddy water and duty rumors alone, and the refugees scattered onto clandestine boats.","Intervention":"Can block the order to seal the waiting hall and defend the counter, or expose the manipulation of queue tickets and have the stationmaster demoted."},"biography":"Gauges the crowd by platform humidity and takes an order to pull a ceremonial train ahead of the patient queue as an insult. Gentle, but when a transfer cancellation appears, takes over the broadcast personally.\n\n- Livelihood: Runs the concourse''s medical waiting tickets and notarization window\n- Status: Functional/livelihood role (not a government appointment)\n- Civil service position/rank: None\n- Livelihood role: Seoul Station Concourse Stationmaster\n**Life.** Grew up on concourse night duty. The Seoul Station Concourse Stationmaster post opened as a replacement duty after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Running the concourse''s medical waiting tickets and notarization window, which Seol Dahin oversees, is tied to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Functional/Livelihood Role.** Seoul Station Concourse Stationmaster. Not an office, position, or rank in the Government or the Seoul Metropolitan Government.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, sent a private solicitation back and redirected it to the public window. Because of this, the signature for the Seoul Station Concourse Stationmaster post was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** An ally who announces Yeon Jiu''s infirmary lockdown over the broadcast, enforces Yun Jiyul''s dispatch cancellations at the platform, and keeps Ma Dohan''s copy boxes in the concourse''s sealed bay.\n\n**Ambition.** To make the Seoul Station concourse the Seoul Station Hub, where confirmation, treatment, and notarization are signed under one roof, and become the face-to-face window for downtown confirmation.\n\n**Fear.** That the concourse will be sealed off on muddy water and duty rumors alone, and the refugees scattered onto clandestine boats.\n\n**Intervention.** You can block the concourse lockdown order to protect the window, or expose the manipulation of waiting tickets to demote the stationmaster.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness −15 | Force −35 | Material −40 | Communal 15 | Principle 50 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 15 | Dispersal −35 | Transformation −40\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Possessiveness −25 | Risk 35 | Display 30 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: heterosexual | Bonding: contract cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seol Dahin","type":"Command","to":"Yun Ji-yul","basis":"Carries out Yun Jiyul''s dispatch cancellations on the platform, and"},{"from":"Seol Dahin","type":"Contract","to":"Yeon Jiu","basis":"an ally who announces the lockdown of Yeon Jiu''s infirmary by broadcast, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"No Saho","type":"Contract","to":"Seol Dahin","basis":"No Saho passes to Seol Dahin the intake details and testimony of the solicitation redirected to the public window. Seol Dahin obtains the confirmations needed for the notarization window and the medical waiting tickets, so that no private transfer request is processed ahead of the patient queue."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0158","name":"설다흰","title":"서울역 대합실 역장","position":"서울역 대합실 역장","characterId":"K157","rank":"미등록","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"대합실 의무 대기표·공증 창구 운영","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-설다흰","detailRoute":"/people/person-0158","birthDate":"2083-12-14","birthday":"12-14","age":43,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k157-queue-posting","name":"대기표 게시","rating":65},{"id":"k157-platform-announcement","name":"승강장 방송","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k157-choice","name":"환자 먼저","description":"승강장 습기로 인파를 가늠하고, 의전 열차를 환자 대기열 앞으로 끌어오라는 명령을 모욕으로 듣는다. 온화하나 이송 취소가 뜨면 방송을 직접 잡는다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다. 이 일로 서울역 대합실 역장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"공포. 탁수와 복무 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 피난민이 밀선으로 흩어지는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 연지우의 의무실 봉쇄를 방송으로 알리는 동맹이고, 윤지율의 배차 취소를 승강장에서 집행하며, 마도한의 사본 상자를 대합실 봉인 칸에 둔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k157-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 국장. 직함은 서울역 대합실 역장. 대합실 의무 대기표와 공증 창구를 매일 공개하고, 군수 화차는 의료 이송이 떠난 뒤에만 승강장에 붙인다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 국장. 직함은 서울역 대합실 역장. 대합실 의무 대기표와 공증 창구를 매일 공개하고, 군수 화차는 의료 이송이 떠난 뒤에만 승강장에 붙인다.","stress":"공포. 탁수와 복무 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 피난민이 밀선으로 흩어지는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 연지우의 의무실 봉쇄를 방송으로 알리는 동맹이고, 윤지율의 배차 취소를 승강장에서 집행하며, 마도한의 사본 상자를 대합실 봉인 칸에 둔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"의료 이송 뒤에 군수 화차를 붙이고 사적 청탁을 공개 창구로 돌린다. 창구 통합은 야망이지 이미 완성한 제도가 아니다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51730-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K157","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51730-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c124-c21c-cc3d","name":"순창 설씨","crest":"clan-crests/c124-c21c-cc3d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":-15,"무력":-35,"물질":-40,"공동":15,"원칙":50,"공개":-20,"자격":15,"분산":-35,"변혁":-40},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-25,"위험":35,"과시":30,"지속":-10,"지향":"이성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"대합실 의무 대기표·공증 창구 운영","지위":"기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)","공무원 직위·직급":"없음","생업 역할":"서울역 대합실 역장","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −40 | 공동 15 | 원칙 50 | 공개 −20 | 자격 15 | 분산 −35 | 변혁 −40","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 −25 | 위험 35 | 과시 30 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 서울역 대합실 역장 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 설다흰이 맡는 대합실의 의무 대기표와 공증 창구를 운영하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","기능·생업 역할":"서울역 대합실 역장. 정부 또는 서울특별시 공무원 관직·직위·직급이 아니다.","일화":"2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다. 이 일로 서울역 대합실 역장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"연지우의 의무실 봉쇄를 방송으로 알리는 동맹이고, 윤지율의 배차 취소를 승강장에서 집행하며, 마도한의 사본 상자를 대합실 봉인 칸에 둔다.","야망":"서울역 대합실을 인준·진료·공증이 한 지붕에서 서명되는 서울역 허브로 만들어 도심 인준의 대면 창구가 된다.","공포":"탁수와 복무 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 피난민이 밀선으로 흩어지는 것.","개입":"대합실 봉쇄 명령을 막아 창구를 지키거나, 대기표 조작을 밝혀 역장을 강등시킬 수 있다."},"biography":"승강장 습기로 인파를 가늠하고, 의전 열차를 환자 대기열 앞으로 끌어오라는 명령을 모욕으로 듣는다. 온화하나 이송 취소가 뜨면 방송을 직접 잡는다.\n\n- 생업: 대합실 의무 대기표·공증 창구 운영\n- 지위: 기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)\n- 공무원 직위·직급: 없음\n- 생업 역할: 서울역 대합실 역장\n**생애.** 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 서울역 대합실 역장 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 설다흰이 맡는 대합실의 의무 대기표와 공증 창구를 운영하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**기능·생업 역할.** 서울역 대합실 역장. 정부 또는 서울특별시 공무원 관직·직위·직급이 아니다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다. 이 일로 서울역 대합실 역장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 연지우의 의무실 봉쇄를 방송으로 알리는 동맹이고, 윤지율의 배차 취소를 승강장에서 집행하며, 마도한의 사본 상자를 대합실 봉인 칸에 둔다.\n\n**야망.** 서울역 대합실을 인준·진료·공증이 한 지붕에서 서명되는 서울역 허브로 만들어 도심 인준의 대면 창구가 된다.\n\n**공포.** 탁수와 복무 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 피난민이 밀선으로 흩어지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 대합실 봉쇄 명령을 막아 창구를 지키거나, 대기표 조작을 밝혀 역장을 강등시킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −40 | 공동 15 | 원칙 50 | 공개 −20 | 자격 15 | 분산 −35 | 변혁 −40\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 −25 | 위험 35 | 과시 30 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"설다흰","type":"지휘","to":"윤지율","basis":"윤지율의 배차 취소를 승강장에서 집행하며"},{"from":"설다흰","type":"계약","to":"연지우","basis":"연지우의 의무실 봉쇄를 방송으로 알리는 동맹이고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"노사호","type":"계약","to":"설다흰","basis":"노사호는 공개 창구로 돌린 청탁의 접수 내용과 증언을 설다흰에게 전한다. 설다흰은 공증 창구와 의무 대기표에 필요한 확인을 받아, 사적인 이송 요청이 환자 대기열보다 먼저 처리되지 않게 한다."}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0159', 'c9c0-cda9-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0159","name":"Ji Hansol","title":"Seoul Station Stacks Base Supervisor","position":"Seoul Station Stacks Base Supervisor","characterId":"K158","rank":"Unregistered","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Supervision of stacks vault temperature and key rotation","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#person-ji-hansol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0159","birthDate":"2095-02-05","birthday":"02-05","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k158-archive-monitoring","name":"Archive case monitoring","rating":65},{"id":"k158-parts-rejection","name":"Parts inspection","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k158-choice","name":"Defends the purpose of storage","description":"He read overload from the iron box''s temperature and burned any note telling him to give a column to munitions storage over the testament box. Taciturn, he shaved no removal log.","behavior":"Anecdote. In 2125 he turned back a box of defective parts just before release. By this deed the signature of the Seoul Station archive-depot supervisor post rose into the ledger.","stress":"Fear. That on a power-less night the boxes would open, and the protection zone would use that gap as occupation storage. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Under command to guard Jo Harin''s three-copy box at the depot, he matched Ji Seoyun''s dehumidification cycles with the box temperature and backed Na Seonjae''s lockdown from inside.","effects":[]},{"id":"k158-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: bureau director. Title: Seoul Station archive-depot supervisor. He left the box temperature and key rotations on the public chalkboard and allowed munitions storage only when the medical transfer inventory crossed the minimum line.","behavior":"Office. Rank: bureau director. Title: Seoul Station archive-depot supervisor. He left the box temperature and key rotations on the public chalkboard and allowed munitions storage only when the medical transfer inventory crossed the minimum line.","stress":"Fear. That on a power-less night the boxes would open, and the protection zone would use that gap as occupation storage. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Under command to guard Jo Harin''s three-copy box at the depot, he matched Ji Seoyun''s dehumidification cycles with the box temperature and backed Na Seonjae''s lockdown from inside.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Rejected parts and recorded case temperatures and key shifts support careful storage. They establish neither artistic nor combat expertise. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51750-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K158","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51750-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c9c0-cda9-c8fc","name":"Chungju Ji Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c9c0-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":0,"Force":-40,"Material":-20,"Communal":10,"Principle":50,"Public":-30,"Eligibility":5,"Dispersed":-40,"Transformative":-50},"desire":{"Longing":-5,"Monopoly":20,"Risk":-15,"Display":25,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Supervision of stacks vault temperature and key rotation","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"Post of Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5) in charge of the archive, Seoul Metropolitan Records Management Office","Assigned Duties":"Seoul Station Stacks Base Supervisor","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness 0 | Force −40 | Material −20 | Communal 10 | Principle 50 | Publicity −30 | Qualification 5 | Dispersal −40 | Transformation −50","Desires":"Craving −5 | Possessiveness 20 | Risk −15 | Display 25 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: none | Bonding: monogamy"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Sinjeong Rail Depot. The Seoul Station Archive Depot Supervisor post opened with a defect report just before a derailment.\n- Supervising the archive chest temperatures and key rotations, which Ji Hansol oversees, is tied to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"Post of Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5) in charge of the archive, Seoul Metropolitan Records Management Office. Assigned duty: Seoul Station Archive Depot Supervisor.","Anecdote":"In 2125, sent a box of defective parts back just before shipment. Because of this, the signature for the Seoul Station Archive Depot Supervisor post was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"Takes orders from Jo Harin to guard her three-copy chest at the depot, matches Ji Seoyun''s dehumidifying cycle with the chest temperature, and supports Na Seonjae''s lockdown from the inside.","Ambition":"To fix the depot''s chests and reserve paper for records use only, so that Seoul Station does not become a great power''s warehouse.","Fear":"That the chests will be opened on a night without power, and the protectorate will use that gap as occupation storage.","Intervention":"You can obtain replacement storage batteries to protect the chest temperature, or expose the falsified logs to have the supervisor replaced."},"biography":"Reads overload from the temperature of the iron chests and burns the note ordering a compartment given to military supply storage over the will chest. Taciturn, and never trims the removal log.\n\n- Livelihood: Supervises archive chest temperatures and key rotations\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service organization\n- Position/rank: Post of Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5) in charge of the archive, Seoul Metropolitan Records Management Office\n- Assigned duty: Seoul Station Archive Depot Supervisor\n**Life.** Grew up at the Sinjeong Rail Depot. The Seoul Station Archive Depot Supervisor post opened with a defect report just before a derailment.\n- Supervising the archive chest temperatures and key rotations, which Ji Hansol oversees, is tied to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Service Position/Rank.** Post of Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5) in charge of the archive, Seoul Metropolitan Records Management Office. Assigned duty: Seoul Station Archive Depot Supervisor.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, sent a box of defective parts back just before shipment. Because of this, the signature for the Seoul Station Archive Depot Supervisor post was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Takes orders from Jo Harin to guard her three-copy chest at the depot, matches Ji Seoyun''s dehumidifying cycle with the chest temperature, and supports Na Seonjae''s lockdown from the inside.\n\n**Ambition.** To fix the depot''s chests and reserve paper for records use only, so that Seoul Station does not become a great power''s warehouse.\n\n**Fear.** That the chests will be opened on a night without power, and the protectorate will use that gap as occupation storage.\n\n**Intervention.** You can obtain replacement storage batteries to protect the chest temperature, or expose the falsified logs to have the supervisor replaced.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness 0 | Force −40 | Material −20 | Communal 10 | Principle 50 | Publicity −30 | Qualification 5 | Dispersal −40 | Transformation −50\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Possessiveness 20 | Risk −15 | Display 25 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: none | Bonding: monogamy\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ji Hansol","type":"Command","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"is under orders to guard Jo Harin''s chest of three copies at the base, and"},{"from":"Ji Hansol","type":"Command","to":"Ji Seo-yun","basis":"matching Ji Seoyun''s dehumidification cycle to the box temperature"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Na Seonjae","type":"Command","to":"Ji Hansol","basis":"shares shifts with the seal of Ji Hansol''s archive base"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0159","name":"지한솔","title":"서울역 서고기지 감독","position":"서울역 서고기지 감독","characterId":"K158","rank":"미등록","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"서고 함 온도·열쇠 교대 감독","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-지한솔","detailRoute":"/people/person-0159","birthDate":"2095-02-05","birthday":"02-05","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k158-archive-monitoring","name":"서고 함 점검","rating":65},{"id":"k158-parts-rejection","name":"부품 검수","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k158-choice","name":"보관 목적을 지킴","description":"철제 함의 온도로 과부하를 읽고, 유언함보다 군수 보관에 칸을 내주라는 쪽지를 태운다. 과묵하고 반출 일지를 깎지 않는다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 서울역 서고기지 감독 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"공포. 전력 없는 밤에 함이 열리고, 그 공백을 보호권이 점령 보관으로 쓰는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 조하린의 삼본 함을 기지에서 지키는 지휘를 받고, 지서윤의 제습 주기와 함 온도를 맞추며, 나선재의 봉쇄를 내부에서 받친다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k158-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 국장. 직함은 서울역 서고기지 감독. 함 온도와 열쇠 교대를 공개 칠판에 남기고, 군수 보관은 의료 이송 재고가 최저선을 넘을 때만 허용한다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 국장. 직함은 서울역 서고기지 감독. 함 온도와 열쇠 교대를 공개 칠판에 남기고, 군수 보관은 의료 이송 재고가 최저선을 넘을 때만 허용한다.","stress":"공포. 전력 없는 밤에 함이 열리고, 그 공백을 보호권이 점령 보관으로 쓰는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 조하린의 삼본 함을 기지에서 지키는 지휘를 받고, 지서윤의 제습 주기와 함 온도를 맞추며, 나선재의 봉쇄를 내부에서 받친다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"불량 부품을 되돌리고 함 온도와 열쇠 교대를 남긴다. 기록 전용 보관을 지키지만 문화 창작이나 전투 경력은 없다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51750-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K158","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51750-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c9c0-cda9-c8fc","name":"충주 지씨","crest":"clan-crests/c9c0-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":0,"무력":-40,"물질":-20,"공동":10,"원칙":50,"공개":-30,"자격":5,"분산":-40,"변혁":-50},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":20,"위험":-15,"과시":25,"지속":-15,"지향":"무성향","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"서고 함 온도·열쇠 교대 감독","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"서울특별시 기록관리 사업소 서고 담당 지방행정사무관(5급) 보직","담당 업무":"서울역 서고기지 감독","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 0 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −20 | 공동 10 | 원칙 50 | 공개 −30 | 자격 5 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −50","욕망":"갈망 −5 | 독점 20 | 위험 −15 | 과시 25 | 지속 −15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 서울역 서고기지 감독 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 지한솔이 맡는 서고 함의 온도와 열쇠 교대를 감독하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"서울특별시 기록관리 사업소 서고 담당 지방행정사무관(5급) 보직. 담당 업무: 서울역 서고기지 감독.","일화":"2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 서울역 서고기지 감독 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"조하린의 삼본 함을 기지에서 지키는 지휘를 받고, 지서윤의 제습 주기와 함 온도를 맞추며, 나선재의 봉쇄를 내부에서 받친다.","야망":"서고기지의 함과 예비 용지를 기록 전용으로 고정해 서울역이 강국의 창고가 되지 않게 한다.","공포":"전력 없는 밤에 함이 열리고, 그 공백을 보호권이 점령 보관으로 쓰는 것.","개입":"대체 축전지를 구해 함 온도를 지키거나, 일지 조작을 폭로해 감독을 교체할 수 있다."},"biography":"철제 함의 온도로 과부하를 읽고, 유언함보다 군수 보관에 칸을 내주라는 쪽지를 태운다. 과묵하고 반출 일지를 깎지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 서고 함 온도·열쇠 교대 감독\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 서울특별시 기록관리 사업소 서고 담당 지방행정사무관(5급) 보직\n- 담당 업무: 서울역 서고기지 감독\n**생애.** 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 서울역 서고기지 감독 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 지한솔이 맡는 서고 함의 온도와 열쇠 교대를 감독하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 서울특별시 기록관리 사업소 서고 담당 지방행정사무관(5급) 보직. 담당 업무: 서울역 서고기지 감독.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 서울역 서고기지 감독 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 조하린의 삼본 함을 기지에서 지키는 지휘를 받고, 지서윤의 제습 주기와 함 온도를 맞추며, 나선재의 봉쇄를 내부에서 받친다.\n\n**야망.** 서고기지의 함과 예비 용지를 기록 전용으로 고정해 서울역이 강국의 창고가 되지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 전력 없는 밤에 함이 열리고, 그 공백을 보호권이 점령 보관으로 쓰는 것.\n\n**개입.** 대체 축전지를 구해 함 온도를 지키거나, 일지 조작을 폭로해 감독을 교체할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 0 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −20 | 공동 10 | 원칙 50 | 공개 −30 | 자격 5 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −50\n- 욕망: 갈망 −5 | 독점 20 | 위험 −15 | 과시 25 | 지속 −15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"지한솔","type":"지휘","to":"조하린","basis":"조하린의 삼본 함을 기지에서 지키는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"지한솔","type":"지휘","to":"지서윤","basis":"지서윤의 제습 주기와 함 온도를 맞추며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"나선재","type":"지휘","to":"지한솔","basis":"지한솔의 서고기지 봉인과 교대를 나누며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0160', 'b9c8-c7a5-d765', '{"id":"person-0160","name":"Ma Eungyeol","title":"Jongno Notarized Copy Market Auctioneer","position":"Jongno Notarized Copy Market Auctioneer","characterId":"K159","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Notarized copy seal verification and auctions","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#person-ma-eungyeol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0160","birthDate":"2064-07-30","birthday":"07-30","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k159-copy-auction","name":"Notarized copy auction","rating":65},{"id":"k159-seal-check","name":"Notarial seal checking","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k159-choice","name":"Sets limits on prices","description":"She read copy prices faster than the river wind and struck out at once from the morning lottery any merchant who tried to put empty iron boxes up at high prices. She bargained like a song but never raised the price of testament copies.","behavior":"Anecdote. A trader who wants to push empty steel cases at will-copy prices enters the morning lottery at the Jongno notarized-copy market. Ma Eungyeol strikes that name from the lottery and loads onto Ma Dohan''s shipping order only the copies whose notarial seal from O Seoyul was checked before the auction.","stress":"Fear. That Garak''s price ledger would swallow the Jongno window and treaty copies would sell at ration prices. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Held a contract executing Ma Dohan''s transport order by auction, checked O Seoyul''s notary stamps before the auction, and sent Nam Yungyeong''s emergency price offer back as a grudge.","effects":[]},{"id":"k159-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: Jongno notarized-copy market auctioneer. She checked stamp stickers before the auction opened and let no copy with an empty witness line leave even after a winning bid.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: Jongno notarized-copy market auctioneer. She checked stamp stickers before the auction opened and let no copy with an empty witness line leave even after a winning bid.","stress":"Fear. That Garak''s price ledger would swallow the Jongno window and treaty copies would sell at ration prices. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Held a contract executing Ma Dohan''s transport order by auction, checked O Seoyul''s notary stamps before the auction, and sent Nam Yungyeong''s emergency price offer back as a grudge.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Excluded a trader pricing empty metal as copies and admitted only notarized copies to shipment. Market judgment establishes no investment career. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41310-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K159","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41310-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b9c8-c7a5-d765","name":"Jangheung Ma Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b9c8-c7a5-d765.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":30,"Openness":-15,"Force":-30,"Material":-5,"Communal":5,"Principle":30,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":-30,"Transformative":-40},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":-35,"Display":40,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Notarized copy seal verification and auctions","Status":"Functional/Livelihood Role (Not a Government Appointment)","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"None","Livelihood Role":"Jongno Notarized Copy Market Auctioneer","Values":"Authority 30 | Openness −15 | Force −30 | Materialism −5 | Community 5 | Principle 30 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization −30 | Transformation −40","Desires":"Craving 40 | Possessiveness −15 | Risk −35 | Display 40 | Endurance 20 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bond Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry. The post of Auctioneer of the Jongno Notarized Copy Market opened up when a single line of a double ledger was deleted.\n- Ma Eungyeol''s work of verifying the seals on notarized copies and opening auctions is connected to the affairs of Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong.","Functional/Livelihood Role":"Auctioneer of the Jongno Notarized Copy Market. This is not an office, position, or rank in the Government or the Seoul Metropolitan Government.","Anecdote":"A merchant who tries to pass off empty ironware at the price of a will copy puts his name into the morning lottery at the Jongno Notarized Copy Market. Ma Eungyeol removes the name from the lottery and loads onto Ma Dohan''s transport queue only the copies whose notarial seals from O Seoyul were verified before the auction.","Relationships":"A contract that enforces Ma Dohan''s transport queue through auction; he verifies O Seoyul''s notarial seals before the auction and sends Nam Yungyeong''s emergency price proposal back as a grievance.","Ambition":"To open auctions of notarized copies and original map plates only together with the Records Office seal, so that Seoul Station''s prices become the public ledger of ratification.","Fear":"That Garak''s price ledger will swallow even the Jongno counter, so that treaty copies are sold at military-ration prices.","Intervention":"He can expose the smuggler-boat winning-bid ledger, or escort the sealed samples to protect his public auction."},"biography":"He reads copy prices faster than the river wind and immediately strikes from the morning lottery any merchant trying to sell empty ironware at a high price. He haggles like singing, but never raises the price of a will copy.\n\n- Livelihood: notarized-copy seal verification and auctions\n- Status: functional/livelihood role (not a government appointment)\n- Civil-service position or rank: none\n- Livelihood role: Auctioneer of the Jongno Notarized Copy Market\n**Life.** Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry. The post of Auctioneer of the Jongno Notarized Copy Market opened up when a single line of a double ledger was deleted.\n- Ma Eungyeol''s work of verifying the seals on notarized copies and opening auctions is connected to the affairs of Jongno 1·2·3·4-ga-dong.\n\n**Functional/Livelihood Role.** Auctioneer of the Jongno Notarized Copy Market. This is not an office, position, or rank in the Government or the Seoul Metropolitan Government.\n\n**Anecdote.** A merchant who tries to pass off empty ironware at the price of a will copy puts his name into the morning lottery at the Jongno Notarized Copy Market. Ma Eungyeol removes the name from the lottery and loads onto Ma Dohan''s transport queue only the copies whose notarial seals from O Seoyul were verified before the auction.\n\n**Relationships.** A contract that enforces Ma Dohan''s transport queue through auction; he verifies O Seoyul''s notarial seals before the auction and sends Nam Yungyeong''s emergency price proposal back as a grievance.\n\n**Ambition.** To open auctions of notarized copies and original map plates only together with the Records Office seal, so that Seoul Station''s prices become the public ledger of ratification.\n\n**Fear.** That Garak''s price ledger will swallow even the Jongno counter, so that treaty copies are sold at military-ration prices.\n\n**Intervention.** You can expose the smuggler''s winning-bid ledger, or escort the sealed samples to protect his public auction.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 30 | Openness −15 | Force −30 | Materialism −5 | Community 5 | Principle 30 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization −30 | Transformation −40\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Possessiveness −15 | Risk −35 | Display 40 | Endurance 20 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bond Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ma Eungyeol","type":"Contract","to":"O Seo-yul","basis":"Verifies O Seoyul''s notarial seal before the auction, and"},{"from":"Ma Eungyeol","type":"Command","to":"Ma Dohan","basis":"a contract that enforces Ma Dohan''s transport turn order by auction"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Ran Jiho","type":"Contract","to":"Ma Eungyeol","basis":"Hoping his rank will not become a commodity in Ma Eungyeol''s copy auction"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0160","name":"마은결","title":"종로 공증사본 시장 경매사","position":"종로 공증사본 시장 경매사","characterId":"K159","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"공증사본 인장 확인·경매","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-마은결","detailRoute":"/people/person-0160","birthDate":"2064-07-30","birthday":"07-30","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k159-copy-auction","name":"공증 사본 경매","rating":65},{"id":"k159-seal-check","name":"공증 인장 확인","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k159-choice","name":"가격에도 경계","description":"사본 시세를 강바람보다 빨리 읽고, 빈 철제를 고가에 올리려는 상인을 아침 추첨에서 즉시 뺀다. 흥정을 노래처럼 하지만 유언 사본의 가격은 올리지 않는다.","behavior":"일화. 빈 철제를 유언 사본 값으로 올리려는 상인이 종로 공증사본 시장의 아침 추첨에 이름을 넣는다. 마은결은 그 이름을 추첨에서 빼고, 오서율의 공증 날인을 경매 전에 확인한 사본만 마도한의 운송 순번에 싣는다.","stress":"공포. 가락의 가격 원장이 종로 창구까지 삼켜 조약 사본이 군량 시세로 팔리는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 마도한의 운송 순번을 경매로 집행하는 계약이고, 오서율의 공증 날인을 경매 전 확인하며, 남윤경의 비상 시세 제의를 원한으로 돌려보낸다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k159-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 종로 공증사본 시장 경매사. 경매 시작 전 인장 스티커를 확인하고, 증인란이 빈 사본은 낙찰이 되어도 반출시키지 않는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 종로 공증사본 시장 경매사. 경매 시작 전 인장 스티커를 확인하고, 증인란이 빈 사본은 낙찰이 되어도 반출시키지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 가락의 가격 원장이 종로 창구까지 삼켜 조약 사본이 군량 시세로 팔리는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 마도한의 운송 순번을 경매로 집행하는 계약이고, 오서율의 공증 날인을 경매 전 확인하며, 남윤경의 비상 시세 제의를 원한으로 돌려보낸다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"빈 철제를 사본 값으로 올리는 상인을 빼고 공증 사본만 운송 순번에 넣었다. 거래 제한과 시세 판단을 반영하되 투자 경력은 없다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41310-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K159","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41310-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b9c8-c7a5-d765","name":"장흥 마씨","crest":"clan-crests/b9c8-c7a5-d765.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":30,"개방":-15,"무력":-30,"물질":-5,"공동":5,"원칙":30,"공개":-20,"자격":20,"분산":-30,"변혁":-40},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":-15,"위험":-35,"과시":40,"지속":20,"지향":"이성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"공증사본 인장 확인·경매","지위":"기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)","공무원 직위·직급":"없음","생업 역할":"종로 공증사본 시장 경매사","가치관":"권위 30 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −5 | 공동 5 | 원칙 30 | 공개 −20 | 자격 20 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −40","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −35 | 과시 40 | 지속 20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 종로 공증사본 시장 경매사 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 마은결이 맡는 공증사본의 인장을 확인하고 경매를 여는 일은 종로1·2·3·4가동의 업무와 이어진다.","기능·생업 역할":"종로 공증사본 시장 경매사. 정부 또는 서울특별시 공무원 관직·직위·직급이 아니다.","일화":"빈 철제를 유언 사본 값으로 올리려는 상인이 종로 공증사본 시장의 아침 추첨에 이름을 넣는다. 마은결은 그 이름을 추첨에서 빼고, 오서율의 공증 날인을 경매 전에 확인한 사본만 마도한의 운송 순번에 싣는다.","관계":"마도한의 운송 순번을 경매로 집행하는 계약이고, 오서율의 공증 날인을 경매 전 확인하며, 남윤경의 비상 시세 제의를 원한으로 돌려보낸다.","야망":"공증 사본과 지도 원판 경매를 기록청 봉인과 함께만 열어 서울역 시세가 인준의 공개 장부가 되게 한다.","공포":"가락의 가격 원장이 종로 창구까지 삼켜 조약 사본이 군량 시세로 팔리는 것.","개입":"밀선 낙찰 장부를 폭로하거나, 봉인 표본을 호송해 그의 공개 경매를 지킬 수 있다."},"biography":"사본 시세를 강바람보다 빨리 읽고, 빈 철제를 고가에 올리려는 상인을 아침 추첨에서 즉시 뺀다. 흥정을 노래처럼 하지만 유언 사본의 가격은 올리지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 공증사본 인장 확인·경매\n- 지위: 기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)\n- 공무원 직위·직급: 없음\n- 생업 역할: 종로 공증사본 시장 경매사\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 종로 공증사본 시장 경매사 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 마은결이 맡는 공증사본의 인장을 확인하고 경매를 여는 일은 종로1·2·3·4가동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**기능·생업 역할.** 종로 공증사본 시장 경매사. 정부 또는 서울특별시 공무원 관직·직위·직급이 아니다.\n\n**일화.** 빈 철제를 유언 사본 값으로 올리려는 상인이 종로 공증사본 시장의 아침 추첨에 이름을 넣는다. 마은결은 그 이름을 추첨에서 빼고, 오서율의 공증 날인을 경매 전에 확인한 사본만 마도한의 운송 순번에 싣는다.\n\n**관계.** 마도한의 운송 순번을 경매로 집행하는 계약이고, 오서율의 공증 날인을 경매 전 확인하며, 남윤경의 비상 시세 제의를 원한으로 돌려보낸다.\n\n**야망.** 공증 사본과 지도 원판 경매를 기록청 봉인과 함께만 열어 서울역 시세가 인준의 공개 장부가 되게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 가락의 가격 원장이 종로 창구까지 삼켜 조약 사본이 군량 시세로 팔리는 것.\n\n**개입.** 밀선 낙찰 장부를 폭로하거나, 봉인 표본을 호송해 그의 공개 경매를 지킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 30 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −5 | 공동 5 | 원칙 30 | 공개 −20 | 자격 20 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −40\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −35 | 과시 40 | 지속 20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"마은결","type":"계약","to":"오서율","basis":"오서율의 공증 날인을 경매 전 확인하며"},{"from":"마은결","type":"지휘","to":"마도한","basis":"마도한의 운송 순번을 경매로 집행하는 계약이고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"란지호","type":"계약","to":"마은결","basis":"마은결의 사본 경매에서 자신의 관작이 물건이 되지 않기를 바라며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0161', 'c5f0-ace1-c0b0', '{"id":"person-0161","name":"Yeon Taesol","title":"Central Disaster Medicine Coordination Officer","position":"Central Disaster Medicine Coordination Officer","characterId":"K160","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Disaster medicine triage dispatch and medicine coordination","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#inmul-yeontaesol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0161","birthDate":"2101-02-19","birthday":"02-19","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k160-medical-coordination","name":"Medical dispatch coordination","rating":60},{"id":"k160-medicine-sharing","name":"Medicine portion allocation","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k160-choice","name":"Rejects military scheduling","description":"He filled severity numbers before people and refused any note telling him to attach ambulance trains to munitions formations. Merciful, he cancelled a run whenever weapons and patients shared one car.","behavior":"Anecdote. In 2125, short of herbs, he halved the prescriptions and divided them among everyone. By this deed the signature of the central disaster-medical coordination duty officer post rose into the ledger.","stress":"Fear. That the coordination would stop only after counterfeit drugs spread through the Bukhansan Bogukmun lists, and Seoul Station would become the protection state''s indulgence. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice translating Yun Jiyul''s medical-transfer ledger into coordination tables, he backed Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy neutrality at the Seoul Station window and had filled Yeon Jiwoo''s sickbed shortage with dispatches.","effects":[]},{"id":"k160-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: central disaster-medical coordination duty officer. He posted severity-order dispatches and overlaid Ryu Eunbi''s contribution ledger and Yun Jiyul''s transfer ledger on one chalkboard.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: central disaster-medical coordination duty officer. He posted severity-order dispatches and overlaid Ryu Eunbi''s contribution ledger and Yun Jiyul''s transfer ledger on one chalkboard.","stress":"Fear. That the coordination would stop only after counterfeit drugs spread through the Bukhansan Bogukmun lists, and Seoul Station would become the protection state''s indulgence. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice translating Yun Jiyul''s medical-transfer ledger into coordination tables, he backed Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy neutrality at the Seoul Station window and had filled Yeon Jiwoo''s sickbed shortage with dispatches.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Combines transport and medicine records to adjust dispatch for bed shortages. Sharing scarce drugs proves neither specialist diagnosis nor teaching. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51760-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K160","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51760-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5f0-ace1-c0b0","name":"Yeon of Goksan","crest":"clan-crests/c5f0-ace1-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":-10,"Force":-25,"Material":-35,"Communal":5,"Principle":50,"Public":-30,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-25,"Transformative":-35},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":0,"Risk":0,"Display":25,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Disaster medicine triage dispatch and medicine coordination","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"Local Health Section","Assigned Duties":"Central Disaster Medicine Coordination Officer","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force −25 | Materialism −35 | Community 5 | Principle 50 | Publicity −30 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −25 | Transformation −35","Desires":"Craving 40 | Possessiveness 0 | Risk 0 | Display 25 | Endurance 35 | Orientation Fluid | Bond Monogamy"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Jegi-dong Infirmary. The post of Central Disaster Medical Coordination Officer opened up through a seal on counterfeit medicine.\n- Yeon Taesol''s work of coordinating disaster-medical dispatch and medicine allocation is connected to the affairs of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"Local Health Section. Duties: Central Disaster Medical Coordination Officer.","Anecdote":"In 2125, during a medicine shortage, she halved the prescribed doses and shared them among everyone. Because of this, her signature for the post of Central Disaster Medical Coordination Officer was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"A mentor who translates Yun Jiyul''s medical transport ledger into a coordination table; she supports Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy neutrality at the Seoul Station counter, and has made up for Yeon Jiu''s bed shortage with dispatches.","Ambition":"To place the disaster-medical coordination network under Records Office ratification so that great powers cannot use medicine allocation as spoils of war.","Fear":"That coordination will stop only after counterfeit medicine has spread through the Bukhansan Bogukmun roster, making Seoul Station a protectorate''s absolution.","Intervention":"Escort the medicine bundles to keep the coordination running, or uncover the munitions-trainset collusion and put the officer in jeopardy."},"biography":"Fills in the triage numbers before the people, and refuses notes ordering ambulance trains to be attached to munitions consists. Merciful, but cancels the run if weapons and patients share one car.\n\n- Occupation: Disaster-medicine triage dispatch and medicine coordination\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service\n- Post and grade: Local Health Section\n- Duties: Central Disaster-Medicine Coordination Officer\n**Life.** Grew up in the Jegi-dong infirmary. The post of Central Disaster-Medicine Coordination Officer opened through a forged medicine seal.\n- Yeon Taesol''s work of coordinating disaster-medicine dispatch and medicine allocation connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil service post and grade.** Local Health Section. Duties: Central Disaster-Medicine Coordination Officer.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, when medicine ran short, split the prescribed doses in half and shared them among everyone. Because of this, the signature for the post of Central Disaster-Medicine Coordination Officer went into the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** The priest who translates Yun Jiyul''s medical-transport ledger into coordination tables, supports Jang Sehwa''s medical-convoy neutrality from the Seoul Station counter, and has filled Yeon Jiu''s bed shortages through dispatch.\n\n**Ambition.** Place the disaster-medicine coordination network under the ratification of the Records Office so that the great powers cannot use medicine allocation as spoils.\n\n**Fear.** That coordination stops only after counterfeit medicine has spread onto the Bukhansan Bogukmun list, making Seoul Station a protectorate''s absolution.\n\n**Intervention.** Escort the medicine bundles to keep the coordination running, or uncover the munitions-trainset collusion and put the officer in jeopardy.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force −25 | Materialism −35 | Communal 5 | Principle 50 | Publicity −30 | Credentials 10 | Dispersion −25 | Transformation −35\n- Desires: Longing 40 | Monopoly 0 | Risk 0 | Display 25 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Fluid | Bond Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yeon Taesol","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Yun Ji-yul","basis":"is a priest who translates Yun Jiyul''s medical transport ledger into coordination tables, and"},{"from":"Yeon Taesol","type":"Contract","to":"Yeon Jiu","basis":"covers Yeon Jiu''s shortage of beds with train dispatches"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0161","name":"연태솔","title":"중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관","position":"중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관","characterId":"K160","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"재난의료 중증도 배차·약재 조정","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-연태솔","detailRoute":"/people/person-0161","birthDate":"2101-02-19","birthday":"02-19","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k160-medical-coordination","name":"의료 배차 조정","rating":60},{"id":"k160-medicine-sharing","name":"약재 분량 배분","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k160-choice","name":"군수 편성을 거부","description":"중증도 숫자를 사람보다 먼저 메우고, 구급 열차를 군수 편성에 붙이라는 쪽지를 거부한다. 자비롭지만 무기와 환자가 한 칸이면 운행을 취소한다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 이 일로 중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"공포. 가짜 약품이 북한산보국문 명단에 퍼진 뒤에야 조정이 멈춰, 서울역이 보호국의 면죄부가 되는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 윤지율의 의료이송 원장을 조정표로 번역하는 신도이고, 장세화의 의료호송 중립을 서울역 창구에서 받치며, 연지우의 침상 부족을 배차로 메워 왔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k160-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관. 중증도 순 배차를 게시하고, 류은비의 기여도 장부와 윤지율의 이송 원장을 같은 칠판에 겹친다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관. 중증도 순 배차를 게시하고, 류은비의 기여도 장부와 윤지율의 이송 원장을 같은 칠판에 겹친다.","stress":"공포. 가짜 약품이 북한산보국문 명단에 퍼진 뒤에야 조정이 멈춰, 서울역이 보호국의 면죄부가 되는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 윤지율의 의료이송 원장을 조정표로 번역하는 신도이고, 장세화의 의료호송 중립을 서울역 창구에서 받치며, 연지우의 침상 부족을 배차로 메워 왔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"이송 원장과 약품 장부를 겹쳐 침상 부족을 배차로 조정한다. 부족한 약재를 나눈 일화는 전문 진단이나 교육 능력을 증명하지 않는다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51760-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K160","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51760-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5f0-ace1-c0b0","name":"곡산 연씨","crest":"clan-crests/c5f0-ace1-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":-10,"무력":-25,"물질":-35,"공동":5,"원칙":50,"공개":-30,"자격":10,"분산":-25,"변혁":-35},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":0,"위험":0,"과시":25,"지속":35,"지향":"유동","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"재난의료 중증도 배차·약재 조정","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방보건계","담당 업무":"중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −35 | 공동 5 | 원칙 50 | 공개 −30 | 자격 10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −35","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 0 | 위험 0 | 과시 25 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관 자리는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 연태솔의 재난의료 배차와 약재 배정을 조정하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방보건계. 담당 업무: 중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관.","일화":"2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 이 일로 중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"윤지율의 의료이송 원장을 조정표로 번역하는 신도이고, 장세화의 의료호송 중립을 서울역 창구에서 받치며, 연지우의 침상 부족을 배차로 메워 왔다.","야망":"재난의료 조정망을 기록청 인준 아래 두어 강국이 약품 배정을 전리품으로 쓰지 못하게 한다.","공포":"가짜 약품이 북한산보국문 명단에 퍼진 뒤에야 조정이 멈춰, 서울역이 보호국의 면죄부가 되는 것.","개입":"약품 묶음을 호송해 조정을 유지하거나, 군수 편성 밀약을 찾아 실무관을 위태롭게 할 수 있다."},"biography":"중증도 숫자를 사람보다 먼저 메우고, 구급 열차를 군수 편성에 붙이라는 쪽지를 거부한다. 자비롭지만 무기와 환자가 한 칸이면 운행을 취소한다.\n\n- 생업: 재난의료 중증도 배차·약재 조정\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방보건계\n- 담당 업무: 중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관\n**생애.** 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관 자리는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 연태솔의 재난의료 배차와 약재 배정을 조정하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방보건계. 담당 업무: 중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 이 일로 중앙 재난의료 조정 실무관 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 윤지율의 의료이송 원장을 조정표로 번역하는 신도이고, 장세화의 의료호송 중립을 서울역 창구에서 받치며, 연지우의 침상 부족을 배차로 메워 왔다.\n\n**야망.** 재난의료 조정망을 기록청 인준 아래 두어 강국이 약품 배정을 전리품으로 쓰지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 가짜 약품이 북한산보국문 명단에 퍼진 뒤에야 조정이 멈춰, 서울역이 보호국의 면죄부가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 약품 묶음을 호송해 조정을 유지하거나, 군수 편성 밀약을 찾아 실무관을 위태롭게 할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −35 | 공동 5 | 원칙 50 | 공개 −30 | 자격 10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −35\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 0 | 위험 0 | 과시 25 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"연태솔","type":"신도","to":"윤지율","basis":"윤지율의 의료이송 원장을 조정표로 번역하는 신도이고"},{"from":"연태솔","type":"계약","to":"연지우","basis":"연지우의 침상 부족을 배차로 메운다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0162', 'b098-b098-c8fc-7f85', '{"id":"person-0162","name":"Na Bomgyeol","title":"Archive Emergency Power Chief Operator","position":"Archive Emergency Power Chief Operator","characterId":"K161","rank":"Unregistered","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Archive generator fuel and output operation","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#Person-Na-Bomgyeol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0162","birthDate":"2093-03-25","birthday":"03-25","age":33,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k161-generator-operation","name":"Generator output operation","rating":65},{"id":"k161-document-copying","name":"Copying wet documents","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k161-choice","name":"Essential output first","description":"Sensitive to the smell of fuel, she hated verbal power routing. She took the political pressure to divert power from the dehumidifiers to the protocol lighting as an insult.","behavior":"Anecdote. In 2125 he dried ratification papers soaked on the platform and left a hand copy. By this deed the signature of the archive emergency generator operator post rose into the ledger.","stress":"Fear. That on a night when the fuel ran dry the boxes would open by hand alone, and the eastern protection zone would fill the gap. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Matched output to Ji Seoyun''s dehumidifiers, backed Ji Hansol''s box temperature from the generation side, and had obeyed Yun Seorin''s cross-verification but refused concealed power routing.","effects":[]},{"id":"k161-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: bureau director. Title: archive emergency generator operator. Every shift he sealed the fuel remainder and output logs and sent them to Ji Hansol, and below minimum output he cut the protocol power even under the bureau chief''s urging.","behavior":"Office. Rank: bureau director. Title: archive emergency generator operator. Every shift he sealed the fuel remainder and output logs and sent them to Ji Hansol, and below minimum output he cut the protocol power even under the bureau chief''s urging.","stress":"Fear. That on a night when the fuel ran dry the boxes would open by hand alone, and the eastern protection zone would fill the gap. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Matched output to Ji Seoyun''s dehumidifiers, backed Ji Hansol''s box temperature from the generation side, and had obeyed Yun Seorin''s cross-verification but refused concealed power routing.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Cuts ceremonial power at minimum output and preserved wet approval papers through copying. A unified power network is a goal, not an invention. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51770-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K161","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51770-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b098-b098-c8fc-7f85","name":"Naju Na Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b098-b098-c8fc-7f85.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":-15,"Force":-30,"Material":-35,"Communal":15,"Principle":60,"Public":-25,"Eligibility":5,"Dispersed":-25,"Transformative":-40},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":-35,"Display":5,"Sustained":25,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Archive generator fuel and output operation","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"A grade suited to a Seoul Metropolitan Government business-office post, among Local Industrial Officer / Assistant Local Industrial Officer or Local Facilities Officer / Assistant Local Facilities Officer","Assigned Duties":"Archive Emergency Power Chief Operator","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness −15 | Force −30 | Materialism −35 | Communal 15 | Principle 60 | Publicity −25 | Credentials 5 | Dispersion −25 | Transformation −40","Desires":"Longing 0 | Monopoly −15 | Risk −35 | Display 5 | Persistence 25 | Orientation None | Bond Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up in the Seoul Station registry office. The post of Archive Emergency Power Operations Chief opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Na Bomgyeol''s work of operating archive generator fuel and output connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"A rank fitting a Seoul Metropolitan Government office post, among Local Industrial Officer and Assistant Local Industrial Officer, or Local Facilities Officer and Assistant Local Facilities Officer. Duties: Archive Emergency Power Operations Chief.","Anecdote":"In 2125, dried a water-soaked ratification document on the platform and preserved it as a transcribed copy. Because of this, the signature for the post of Archive Emergency Power Operations Chief went into the ledger.","Relationships":"Matches output to Ji Seoyun''s dehumidifier, supports Ji Hansol''s vault temperature from the generation side, and has obeyed Yun Seorin''s cross-verification but refused concealed power distribution.","Ambition":"Bind archive emergency power and infirmary power into a single public distribution network to protect the quality sovereignty of records and medical care.","Fear":"That on a night when the fuel runs out, the vault can only be opened manually and the Eastern Protectorate fills that void.","Intervention":"He can secure substitute fuel to open a dual distribution grid, or expose the tampering with the output logs so that the operations chief is replaced."},"biography":"Sensitive to the smell of fuel and hates verbal power distribution. Regards political pressure to divert power to ceremonial lighting rather than dehumidifiers as an insult.\n\n- Occupation: Archive generator fuel and output operations\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service\n- Post and grade: A rank fitting a Seoul Metropolitan Government office post, among Local Industrial Officer and Assistant Local Industrial Officer, or Local Facilities Officer and Assistant Local Facilities Officer\n- Duties: Archive Emergency Power Operations Chief\n**Life.** Grew up in the Seoul Station registry office. The post of Archive Emergency Power Operations Chief opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Na Bomgyeol''s work of operating archive generator fuel and output connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil service post and grade.** A rank fitting a Seoul Metropolitan Government office post, among Local Industrial Officer and Assistant Local Industrial Officer, or Local Facilities Officer and Assistant Local Facilities Officer. Duties: Archive Emergency Power Operations Chief.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, dried a water-soaked ratification document on the platform and preserved it as a transcribed copy. Because of this, the signature for the post of Archive Emergency Power Operations Chief went into the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Matches output to Ji Seoyun''s dehumidifier, supports Ji Hansol''s vault temperature from the generation side, and has obeyed Yun Seorin''s cross-verification but refused concealed power distribution.\n\n**Ambition.** Bind archive emergency power and infirmary power into a single public distribution network to protect the quality sovereignty of records and medical care.\n\n**Fear.** That on a night when the fuel runs out, the vault can only be opened manually and the Eastern Protectorate fills that void.\n\n**Intervention.** Obtain alternative fuel to open dual power distribution, or expose the tampering with the output log and replace the operations chief.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness −15 | Force −30 | Materialism −35 | Communal 15 | Principle 60 | Publicity −25 | Credentials 5 | Dispersion −25 | Transformation −40\n- Desires: Longing 0 | Monopoly −15 | Risk −35 | Display 5 | Persistence 25 | Orientation None | Bond Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Na Bomgyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Obeys Yun Seorin''s cross-verification but refuses concealed power distribution"},{"from":"Na Bomgyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Ji Seo-yun","basis":"matching output to Ji Seoyun''s dehumidifier"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Ji Seo-yun","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Na Bomgyeol","basis":"matching the dehumidification power to Na Bomgyeol''s emergency generation"},{"from":"Pyeong Ye-jun","type":"Oath","to":"Na Bomgyeol","basis":"Syncing the time with Na Bomgyeol''s emergency generation log"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0162","name":"나봄결","title":"문서고 비상발전 운전장","position":"문서고 비상발전 운전장","characterId":"K161","rank":"미등록","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"문서고 발전 연료·출력 운전","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-나봄결","detailRoute":"/people/person-0162","birthDate":"2093-03-25","birthday":"03-25","age":33,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k161-generator-operation","name":"발전 출력 운전","rating":65},{"id":"k161-document-copying","name":"젖은 문서 필사","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k161-choice","name":"필수 출력 우선","description":"연료 냄새에 예민하고 구두 배전을 싫어한다. 제습기보다 의전 조명에 전력을 돌리라는 정치적 압박을 모욕으로 여긴다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 승강장에서 물에 젖은 인준 문서를 말려 필사본으로 남겼다. 이 일로 문서고 비상발전 운전장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"공포. 연료가 바닥난 밤에 함이 수동으로만 열리고, 그 공백을 동부 보호권이 메우는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 지서윤의 제습기에 출력을 맞추고, 지한솔의 함 온도를 발전 쪽에서 받치며, 윤서린의 교차검증에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k161-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 국장. 직함은 문서고 비상발전 운전장. 매 교대 연료 잔량과 출력 일지를 봉인해 지한솔에게 보내고, 최저 출력 이하면 청장의 독촉이 있어도 의전 배전을 끊는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 국장. 직함은 문서고 비상발전 운전장. 매 교대 연료 잔량과 출력 일지를 봉인해 지한솔에게 보내고, 최저 출력 이하면 청장의 독촉이 있어도 의전 배전을 끊는다.","stress":"공포. 연료가 바닥난 밤에 함이 수동으로만 열리고, 그 공백을 동부 보호권이 메우는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 지서윤의 제습기에 출력을 맞추고, 지한솔의 함 온도를 발전 쪽에서 받치며, 윤서린의 교차검증에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"최저 출력에서 의전 배전을 끊고 젖은 인준 문서를 필사로 남겼다. 발전망 통합은 목표이며 발명 경력으로 보지 않는다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51770-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K161","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51770-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b098-b098-c8fc-7f85","name":"나주 나씨","crest":"clan-crests/b098-b098-c8fc-7f85.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":-15,"무력":-30,"물질":-35,"공동":15,"원칙":60,"공개":-25,"자격":5,"분산":-25,"변혁":-40},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-15,"위험":-35,"과시":5,"지속":25,"지향":"무성향","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"문서고 발전 연료·출력 운전","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방공업주사·지방공업주사보 또는 지방시설주사·지방시설주사보 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"문서고 비상발전 운전장","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −35 | 공동 15 | 원칙 60 | 공개 −25 | 자격 5 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −40","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −35 | 과시 5 | 지속 25 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 문서고 비상발전 운전장 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 나봄결의 문서고 발전 연료와 출력을 운전하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방공업주사·지방공업주사보 또는 지방시설주사·지방시설주사보 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 문서고 비상발전 운전장.","일화":"2125년 승강장에서 물에 젖은 인준 문서를 말려 필사본으로 남겼다. 이 일로 문서고 비상발전 운전장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"지서윤의 제습기에 출력을 맞추고, 지한솔의 함 온도를 발전 쪽에서 받치며, 윤서린의 교차검증에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.","야망":"문서고 비상 발전과 의무실 전력을 하나의 공개 배전망으로 묶어 기록과 진료의 품질 주권을 지킨다.","공포":"연료가 바닥난 밤에 함이 수동으로만 열리고, 그 공백을 동부 보호권이 메우는 것.","개입":"대체 연료를 구해 이중 배전을 열거나, 출력 일지 조작을 밝혀 운전장을 교체할 수 있다."},"biography":"연료 냄새에 예민하고 구두 배전을 싫어한다. 제습기보다 의전 조명에 전력을 돌리라는 정치적 압박을 모욕으로 여긴다.\n\n- 생업: 문서고 발전 연료·출력 운전\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방공업주사·지방공업주사보 또는 지방시설주사·지방시설주사보 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 문서고 비상발전 운전장\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 문서고 비상발전 운전장 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 나봄결의 문서고 발전 연료와 출력을 운전하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방공업주사·지방공업주사보 또는 지방시설주사·지방시설주사보 중 서울특별시 사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 문서고 비상발전 운전장.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 승강장에서 물에 젖은 인준 문서를 말려 필사본으로 남겼다. 이 일로 문서고 비상발전 운전장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 지서윤의 제습기에 출력을 맞추고, 지한솔의 함 온도를 발전 쪽에서 받치며, 윤서린의 교차검증에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.\n\n**야망.** 문서고 비상 발전과 의무실 전력을 하나의 공개 배전망으로 묶어 기록과 진료의 품질 주권을 지킨다.\n\n**공포.** 연료가 바닥난 밤에 함이 수동으로만 열리고, 그 공백을 동부 보호권이 메우는 것.\n\n**개입.** 대체 연료를 구해 이중 배전을 열거나, 출력 일지 조작을 밝혀 운전장을 교체할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −35 | 공동 15 | 원칙 60 | 공개 −25 | 자격 5 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −40\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −35 | 과시 5 | 지속 25 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"나봄결","type":"계약","to":"윤서린","basis":"윤서린의 교차검증에는 복종하되 은폐 배전은 거부한다"},{"from":"나봄결","type":"계약","to":"지서윤","basis":"지서윤의 제습기에 출력을 맞추고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"지서윤","type":"신도","to":"나봄결","basis":"나봄결의 비상 발전에 제습 전력을 맞추며"},{"from":"평예준","type":"맹세","to":"나봄결","basis":"나봄결의 비상 발전 일지와 시각을 맞추며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0163', 'd64d-b0a8-c591', '{"id":"person-0163","name":"Hong Yejun","title":"Will Verification Clerk","position":"Will Verification Clerk","characterId":"K162","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Will handwriting and waveform comparison verification","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#Person-Hong-Yejun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0163","birthDate":"2097-04-25","birthday":"04-25","age":29,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k162-will-crosscheck","name":"Will cross-checking","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k162-choice","name":"Withholds authenticity declarations","description":"He read ink smears before human words and counted one witness''s certainty as no record. Quiet, he did not rise from his seat for anything but a handwriting mismatch.","behavior":"Anecdote. When the spring''s three testaments were received on the same day, Hong Yejun spread the three sheets side by side and suspended the declaration of originals.","stress":"Fear. That one edited fragment of voice would go out before the document ratification, and the clerk would become the procession of forgery. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Offered the clerk''s ledger to Yun Seorin''s ratification examination, moved Cha Seon''s handwriting margin by day, and took Ran Seon''s inside exposure only as sealed testimony.","effects":[]},{"id":"k162-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: testament verification clerk. He laid handwriting and waveform overlaid in one book and covered the verification stamp with fewer than two independent testimonies.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: testament verification clerk. He laid handwriting and waveform overlaid in one book and covered the verification stamp with fewer than two independent testimonies.","stress":"Fear. That one edited fragment of voice would go out before the document ratification, and the clerk would become the procession of forgery. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Offered the clerk''s ledger to Yun Seorin''s ratification examination, moved Cha Seon''s handwriting margin by day, and took Ran Seon''s inside exposure only as sealed testimony.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Sets three wills side by side and requires two independent witnesses. Authenticity remains unresolved, and rumor is not accepted as fact. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51780-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K162","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51780-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d64d-b0a8-c591","name":"Namyang Hong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/d64d-b0a8-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":-5,"Force":-20,"Material":-25,"Communal":15,"Principle":55,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":-25,"Transformative":-30},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":10,"Display":-25,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Will handwriting and waveform comparison verification","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)","Assigned Duties":"Will Verification Clerk","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness −5 | Force −20 | Material −25 | Communal 15 | Principle 55 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion −25 | Transformation −30","Desires":"Craving 10 | Monopoly −15 | Risk 10 | Display −25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: None | Union: Monogamy"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up on waiting-room duty. The will-verification clerk post opened through a substitute duty shift for an unexcused absence.\n- Hong Yejun''s task of cross-checking the handwriting and waveforms of wills ties into the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"The grade that fits a post at Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or offices among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5)·Local Administrative Assistant Director (Grade 6)·Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 7)·Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8)·Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9). Duties: Will-Verification Clerk.","Anecdote":"When three wills were filed on the same day, Hong Yejun spread all three side by side and withheld any declaration of authenticity.","Relationships":"Submits the clerk''s ledger to Yun Seorin''s ratification review, moves Cha Se-on''s handwriting marginalia in daylight, and accepts Ran Se-on''s internal exposé only as sealed testimony.","Ambition":"Binds the three Chief Steward wills into a single verification ledger so that the Records Office becomes the final hand that points to the authentic one.","Fear":"That an edited audio fragment goes out before the document''s ratification, making the clerk an accomplice to forgery.","Intervention":"Can escort the second witness to the document archive, or find the fourth carbon sheet the clerk hid and shake the ratification."},"biography":"Reads the carbon-paper smudge before what people say, and does not count one witness''s certainty as a record. Quiet, but if the handwriting does not match, will not rise from the seat.\n\n- Occupation: Verifying wills by cross-checking handwriting and waveforms\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service organization\n- Position and grade: The grade that fits a post at Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or offices among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5)·Local Administrative Assistant Director (Grade 6)·Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 7)·Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8)·Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)\n- Duties: Will-Verification Clerk\n**Life.** Grew up on waiting-room duty. The will-verification clerk post opened through a substitute duty shift for an unexcused absence.\n- Hong Yejun''s task of cross-checking the handwriting and waveforms of wills ties into the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Service Position and Grade.** The grade that fits a post at Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or offices among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5)·Local Administrative Assistant Director (Grade 6)·Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 7)·Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8)·Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9). Duties: Will-Verification Clerk.\n\n**Anecdote.** When three wills were filed on the same day, Hong Yejun spread all three side by side and withheld any declaration of authenticity.\n\n**Relationships.** Submits the clerk''s ledger to Yun Seorin''s ratification review, moves Cha Se-on''s handwriting marginalia in daylight, and accepts Ran Se-on''s internal exposé only as sealed testimony.\n\n**Ambition.** Binds the three Chief Steward wills into a single verification ledger so that the Records Office becomes the final hand that points to the authentic one.\n\n**Fear.** That an edited audio fragment goes out before the document''s ratification, making the clerk an accomplice to forgery.\n\n**Intervention.** Can escort the second witness to the document archive, or find the fourth carbon sheet the clerk hid and shake the ratification.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness −5 | Force −20 | Material −25 | Communal 15 | Principle 55 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion −25 | Transformation −30\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly −15 | Risk 10 | Display −25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: None | Union: Monogamy\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Hong Yejun","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Offering the clerk''s ledger to Yun Seorin''s ratification review, and"},{"from":"Hong Yejun","type":"Contract","to":"Ranseon","basis":"Accepts Ran Se-on''s internal exposé only as sealed testimony"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Ranseon","type":"Oath","to":"Hong Yejun","basis":"Matches waveforms with Hong Yejun''s will verification"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0163","name":"홍예준","title":"유언 검증 서기","position":"유언 검증 서기","characterId":"K162","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"유언 필적·파형 대조 검증","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-홍예준","detailRoute":"/people/person-0163","birthDate":"2097-04-25","birthday":"04-25","age":29,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k162-will-crosscheck","name":"유언 교차검증","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k162-choice","name":"진본 선언을 보류","description":"먹지 번짐을 사람 말보다 먼저 읽고, 증인 한 명의 확신은 기록으로 치지 않는다. 조용하나 필적이 어긋나면 자리에서 일어나지 않는다.","behavior":"일화. 봄의 세 유언이 같은 날 접수되자 홍예준은 세 장을 나란히 펼치고 진본 선언을 보류했다.","stress":"공포. 편집된 음성 한 조각이 문서 인준보다 먼저 나가 서기가 위조의 들러리가 되는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 인준 심사에 서기 원장을 바치고, 차세온의 필적 난외를 낮에 옮기며, 란세온의 내부 폭로를 봉인 증언으로만 받는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k162-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 유언 검증 서기. 필적과 파형을 같은 책에 겹쳐 두고, 독립 증언이 둘 미만이면 검증 도장을 덮는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 유언 검증 서기. 필적과 파형을 같은 책에 겹쳐 두고, 독립 증언이 둘 미만이면 검증 도장을 덮는다.","stress":"공포. 편집된 음성 한 조각이 문서 인준보다 먼저 나가 서기가 위조의 들러리가 되는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 인준 심사에 서기 원장을 바치고, 차세온의 필적 난외를 낮에 옮기며, 란세온의 내부 폭로를 봉인 증언으로만 받는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"세 유언을 나란히 놓고 독립 증언 둘을 요구한다. 진본 판단은 아직 미결이며 소문을 곧 사실로 받아들이지 않는다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51780-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K162","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51780-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d64d-b0a8-c591","name":"남양 홍씨","crest":"clan-crests/d64d-b0a8-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":-5,"무력":-20,"물질":-25,"공동":15,"원칙":55,"공개":-15,"자격":20,"분산":-25,"변혁":-30},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":-15,"위험":10,"과시":-25,"지속":0,"지향":"무성향","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"유언 필적·파형 대조 검증","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"유언 검증 서기","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 −5 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −25 | 공동 15 | 원칙 55 | 공개 −15 | 자격 20 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −30","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 −15 | 위험 10 | 과시 −25 | 지속 0 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 유언 검증 서기 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 홍예준이 맡는 유언의 필적과 파형을 대조하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 유언 검증 서기.","일화":"세 유언이 같은 날 접수되자 홍예준은 세 장을 나란히 펼치고 진본 선언을 보류했다.","관계":"윤서린의 인준 심사에 서기 원장을 바치고, 차세온의 필적 난외를 낮에 옮기며, 란세온의 내부 폭로를 봉인 증언으로만 받는다.","야망":"세 장의 총관 유언을 한 장의 검증 원장으로 묶어 기록청이 진본을 가리키는 마지막 손이 된다.","공포":"편집된 음성 한 조각이 문서 인준보다 먼저 나가 서기가 위조의 들러리가 되는 것.","개입":"두 번째 증인을 문서고까지 호송하거나, 서기가 숨긴 네 번째 먹지를 찾아 인준을 흔들 수 있다."},"biography":"먹지 번짐을 사람 말보다 먼저 읽고, 증인 한 명의 확신은 기록으로 치지 않는다. 조용하나 필적이 어긋나면 자리에서 일어나지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 유언 필적·파형 대조 검증\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 유언 검증 서기\n**생애.** 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 유언 검증 서기 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 홍예준이 맡는 유언의 필적과 파형을 대조하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 유언 검증 서기.\n\n**일화.** 세 유언이 같은 날 접수되자 홍예준은 세 장을 나란히 펼치고 진본 선언을 보류했다.\n\n**관계.** 윤서린의 인준 심사에 서기 원장을 바치고, 차세온의 필적 난외를 낮에 옮기며, 란세온의 내부 폭로를 봉인 증언으로만 받는다.\n\n**야망.** 세 장의 총관 유언을 한 장의 검증 원장으로 묶어 기록청이 진본을 가리키는 마지막 손이 된다.\n\n**공포.** 편집된 음성 한 조각이 문서 인준보다 먼저 나가 서기가 위조의 들러리가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 두 번째 증인을 문서고까지 호송하거나, 서기가 숨긴 네 번째 먹지를 찾아 인준을 흔들 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 −5 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −25 | 공동 15 | 원칙 55 | 공개 −15 | 자격 20 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −30\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 −15 | 위험 10 | 과시 −25 | 지속 0 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"홍예준","type":"계약","to":"윤서린","basis":"윤서린의 인준 심사에 서기 원장을 바치고"},{"from":"홍예준","type":"계약","to":"란세온","basis":"란세온의 내부 폭로를 봉인 증언으로만 받는다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"란세온","type":"맹세","to":"홍예준","basis":"홍예준의 유언 검증과 파형을 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0164', 'cd94-cd94-acc4', '{"id":"person-0164","name":"Chu Seoyun","title":"Water Supply Contract Ratification Claim Witness","position":"Water Supply Contract Ratification Claim Witness","characterId":"K163","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Water supply contract claims and testimony comparison","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#inmul-chu-seoyun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0164","birthDate":"2069-10-18","birthday":"10-18","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k163-claim-testimony","name":"Claim and testimony comparison","rating":60},{"id":"k163-bypass-operation","name":"Bypass supply opening","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k163-choice","name":"Rejects verbal extensions","description":"She counted expiry days on her fingers and sent down from the witness stand any envoy who proposed a verbal extension. She trusted numbers but not blank clauses.","behavior":"Anecdote. In 2125, instead of thawing the frozen pipes, she opened a bypass waterway. By this deed the signature of the water contract ratification claim witness post rose into the ledger.","stress":"Fear. That testimony she signed would become the indulgence of a collective cutoff clause. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Backed O Seoyul''s notarization claim from the witness stand, read Han Jaemok''s western draft aloud, and made the expiry marks Im Hajun left behind after his disappearance the frame of her testimony.","effects":[]},{"id":"k163-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: water contract ratification claim witness. She pasted the claims and witness statements at the same hour and struck copies taken before the stamps dried from her testimony.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: water contract ratification claim witness. She pasted the claims and witness statements at the same hour and struck copies taken before the stamps dried from her testimony.","stress":"Fear. That testimony she signed would become the indulgence of a collective cutoff clause. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Backed O Seoyul''s notarization claim from the witness stand, read Han Jaemok''s western draft aloud, and made the expiry marks Im Hajun left behind after his disappearance the frame of her testimony.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Aligns claims with testimony timing and rejects verbal extensions. Bypass experience is recorded, but treaty authority and dispute resolution are not. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51790-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K163","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51790-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cd94-cd94-acc4","name":"Chugye Chu Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cd94-cd94-acc4.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":-20,"Force":-30,"Material":-20,"Communal":10,"Principle":70,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-20,"Transformative":-45},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":40,"Risk":40,"Display":20,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Water supply contract claims and testimony comparison","Status":"Functional/Livelihood Role (Not a Government Appointment)","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"None","Livelihood Role":"Water Supply Contract Ratification Claim Witness","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness −20 | Force −30 | Material −20 | Communal 10 | Principle 70 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 10 | Dispersion −20 | Transformation −45","Desires":"Craving 5 | Monopoly 40 | Risk 40 | Display 20 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: Same-sex | Union: Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up on Yeongdeungpo water-purification duty. The water-supply-contract ratification petition witness post opened through a valve signature on a turbid-water night.\n- Chu Seoyun''s task of cross-checking water-supply-contract petitions and testimony ties into the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Functional/Livelihood Role":"Water-supply-contract ratification petition witness. Not The Government or Seoul Metropolitan Government civil service office, position, or grade.","Anecdote":"In 2125, instead of thawing the frozen-burst pipeline, opened a bypass water channel. Because of this, the signature for the water-supply-contract ratification petition witness post was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"Backs O Seoyul''s notarization petition from the witness stand, reads Han Jaemok''s western draft aloud, and makes the expiry mark left after Im Hajun''s disappearance the backbone of the testimony.","Ambition":"Fixes the termination conditions of the third water-supply contract through public testimony so that the great powers cannot split the seal with differing texts.","Fear":"That the testimony signed by oneself becomes an indulgence for the collective water-cutoff clause.","Intervention":"Can place a revised draft without the water-cutoff clause on the witness stand, or enter the water-supply remuneration the witness received in the ledger."},"biography":"Counts expiry dates on the fingers and sends envoys proposing verbal extensions down from the witness stand. Trusts numbers but not blank clauses.\n\n- Occupation: Cross-checking water-supply-contract petitions and testimony\n- Status: Functional/occupational role (not a government appointment)\n- Civil service position and grade: None\n- Occupational role: Water-supply-contract ratification petition witness\n**Life.** Grew up on Yeongdeungpo water-purification duty. The water-supply-contract ratification petition witness post opened through a valve signature on a turbid-water night.\n- Chu Seoyun''s task of cross-checking water-supply-contract petitions and testimony ties into the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Functional/Occupational Role.** Water-supply-contract ratification petition witness. Not The Government or Seoul Metropolitan Government civil service office, position, or grade.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, instead of thawing the frozen-burst pipeline, opened a bypass water channel. Because of this, the signature for the water-supply-contract ratification petition witness post was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Backs O Seoyul''s notarization petition from the witness stand, reads Han Jaemok''s western draft aloud, and makes the expiry mark left after Im Hajun''s disappearance the backbone of the testimony.\n\n**Ambition.** Fixes the termination conditions of the third water-supply contract through public testimony so that the great powers cannot split the seal with differing texts.\n\n**Fear.** That the testimony signed by oneself becomes an indulgence for the collective water-cutoff clause.\n\n**Intervention.** Can place a revised draft without the water-cutoff clause on the witness stand, or enter the water-supply remuneration the witness received in the ledger.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness −20 | Force −30 | Material −20 | Communal 10 | Principle 70 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 10 | Dispersion −20 | Transformation −45\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Monopoly 40 | Risk 40 | Display 20 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: Same-sex | Union: Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Chu Seoyun","type":"Oath","to":"O Seo-yul","basis":"Backs O Seoyul''s notarization requests from the witness stand, and"},{"from":"Chu Seoyun","type":"Oath","to":"Han Jae-mok","basis":"While reading out Han Jaemok''s western draft"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0164","name":"추서윤","title":"급수계약 인준 청구 증인","position":"급수계약 인준 청구 증인","characterId":"K163","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"급수계약 청구서·증언 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-추서윤","detailRoute":"/people/person-0164","birthDate":"2069-10-18","birthday":"10-18","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k163-claim-testimony","name":"청구서 증언 대조","rating":60},{"id":"k163-bypass-operation","name":"우회 급수 개통","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k163-choice","name":"구두 연장을 거부","description":"만료일을 손가락으로 세고, 구두로 연장하자는 사신을 증인석에서 내려보낸다. 숫자는 믿되 빈칸 조항은 믿지 않는다.","behavior":"일화. 2125년 동파 관로를 녹이는 대신 우회 급수로를 열었다. 이 일로 급수계약 인준 청구 증인 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","stress":"공포. 자신이 서명한 증언이 집단 단수 조항의 면죄부가 되는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 오서율의 공증 청구를 증인석에서 받치고, 한재목의 서부 문안을 읽어 주며, 임하준의 실종 뒤에 남은 만료 표시를 증언의 뼈대로 삼는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k163-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 급수계약 인준 청구 증인. 청구서와 증인 진술을 같은 시각에 붙이고, 인장이 마르기 전의 사본은 증언에서 뺀다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 급수계약 인준 청구 증인. 청구서와 증인 진술을 같은 시각에 붙이고, 인장이 마르기 전의 사본은 증언에서 뺀다.","stress":"공포. 자신이 서명한 증언이 집단 단수 조항의 면죄부가 되는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 오서율의 공증 청구를 증인석에서 받치고, 한재목의 서부 문안을 읽어 주며, 임하준의 실종 뒤에 남은 만료 표시를 증언의 뼈대로 삼는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"청구서와 증언의 시각을 맞추고 구두 연장을 배제한다. 우회 급수 경험은 있지만 조약 체결이나 분쟁 해결 결과는 없다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51790-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K163","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51790-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cd94-cd94-acc4","name":"추계 추씨","crest":"clan-crests/cd94-cd94-acc4.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":-20,"무력":-30,"물질":-20,"공동":10,"원칙":70,"공개":-20,"자격":10,"분산":-20,"변혁":-45},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":40,"위험":40,"과시":20,"지속":-10,"지향":"동성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"급수계약 청구서·증언 대조","지위":"기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)","공무원 직위·직급":"없음","생업 역할":"급수계약 인준 청구 증인","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 −20 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −20 | 공동 10 | 원칙 70 | 공개 −20 | 자격 10 | 분산 −20 | 변혁 −45","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 40 | 위험 40 | 과시 20 | 지속 −10 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"영등포 정수 당직에서 자랐다. 급수계약 인준 청구 증인 자리는 탁수 밤의 밸브 서명으로 열렸다.\n- 추서윤의 급수계약 청구서와 증언을 대조하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","기능·생업 역할":"급수계약 인준 청구 증인. 정부 또는 서울특별시 공무원 관직·직위·직급이 아니다.","일화":"2125년 동파 관로를 녹이는 대신 우회 급수로를 열었다. 이 일로 급수계약 인준 청구 증인 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"오서율의 공증 청구를 증인석에서 받치고, 한재목의 서부 문안을 읽어 주며, 임하준의 실종 뒤에 남은 만료 표시를 증언의 뼈대로 삼는다.","야망":"세 번째 급수계약의 종료 조건을 공개 증언으로 고정해 강국이 서로 다른 문안으로 도장을 쪼개지 못하게 한다.","공포":"자신이 서명한 증언이 집단 단수 조항의 면죄부가 되는 것.","개입":"단수 조항을 뺀 수정본을 증인석에 올리거나, 증인이 받은 급수 사례를 원장에 올릴 수 있다."},"biography":"만료일을 손가락으로 세고, 구두로 연장하자는 사신을 증인석에서 내려보낸다. 숫자는 믿되 빈칸 조항은 믿지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 급수계약 청구서·증언 대조\n- 지위: 기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)\n- 공무원 직위·직급: 없음\n- 생업 역할: 급수계약 인준 청구 증인\n**생애.** 영등포 정수 당직에서 자랐다. 급수계약 인준 청구 증인 자리는 탁수 밤의 밸브 서명으로 열렸다.\n- 추서윤의 급수계약 청구서와 증언을 대조하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**기능·생업 역할.** 급수계약 인준 청구 증인. 정부 또는 서울특별시 공무원 관직·직위·직급이 아니다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 동파 관로를 녹이는 대신 우회 급수로를 열었다. 이 일로 급수계약 인준 청구 증인 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 오서율의 공증 청구를 증인석에서 받치고, 한재목의 서부 문안을 읽어 주며, 임하준의 실종 뒤에 남은 만료 표시를 증언의 뼈대로 삼는다.\n\n**야망.** 세 번째 급수계약의 종료 조건을 공개 증언으로 고정해 강국이 서로 다른 문안으로 도장을 쪼개지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 자신이 서명한 증언이 집단 단수 조항의 면죄부가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 단수 조항을 뺀 수정본을 증인석에 올리거나, 증인이 받은 급수 사례를 원장에 올릴 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 −20 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −20 | 공동 10 | 원칙 70 | 공개 −20 | 자격 10 | 분산 −20 | 변혁 −45\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 40 | 위험 40 | 과시 20 | 지속 −10 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"추서윤","type":"맹세","to":"오서율","basis":"오서율의 공증 청구를 증인석에서 받치고"},{"from":"추서윤","type":"맹세","to":"한재목","basis":"한재목의 서부 문안을 읽어 주며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0165', 'c5b4-d568-c885', '{"id":"person-0165","name":"Eo Taesan","title":"Custodian of Each State''s Ratifications","position":"Custodian of Each State''s Ratifications","characterId":"K164","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Management of each state''s ratification dates and post-hoc endorsement witnesses","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#inmul-eo-taesan","detailRoute":"/people/person-0165","birthDate":"2084-08-24","birthday":"08-24","age":42,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k164-approval-date-check","name":"Approval date checking","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k164-choice","name":"Blocks backdated certification","description":"He remembered even the fold marks on charter copies and locked the box whenever someone proposed back-dating a late ratification. He kept his manners but never forgave a hand that changed a date.","behavior":"Anecdote. A request comes from Jeong Yura''s joint-bargaining side to backdate a late ratification. Eo Taesan locks the ratification case Yun Seorin entrusted and, beside the per-flag ratification dates on the wall, calls the names of the two original witnesses and sets a day for them to stand again.","stress":"Fear. That the ratification box would be painted over with a great power''s protection clause and the lesser states'' charter would become a subcontract. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Kept the founding ratification box entrusted by Yun Seorin, matched the humidity and custody cycles with Jo Harin''s iron box, and drew out Jeong Yura''s joint-negotiation ratification only so long as it did not cheat the dates.","effects":[]},{"id":"k164-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: states ratification custodian. He wrote each banner''s ratification day on the wall and accepted no after-the-fact countersignature unless the two witnesses of the day signed again.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: states ratification custodian. He wrote each banner''s ratification day on the wall and accepted no after-the-fact countersignature unless the two witnesses of the day signed again.","stress":"Fear. That the ratification box would be painted over with a great power''s protection clause and the lesser states'' charter would become a subcontract. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Kept the founding ratification box entrusted by Yun Seorin, matched the humidity and custody cycles with Jo Harin''s iron box, and drew out Jeong Yura''s joint-negotiation ratification only so long as it did not cheat the dates.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Locked the case against backdating and recalled two original witnesses. Protecting dates and originals establishes no international political career. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51800-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K164","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51800-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5b4-d568-c885","name":"Eo Clan of Hamjong","crest":"clan-crests/c5b4-d568-c885.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":-15,"Force":-40,"Material":-25,"Communal":0,"Principle":65,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-30,"Transformative":-35},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":-40,"Display":20,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Management of each state''s ratification dates and post-hoc endorsement witnesses","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)","Assigned Duties":"Custodian of Each State''s Ratifications","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness −15 | Force −40 | Material −25 | Communal 0 | Principle 65 | Publicity −20 | Credentials 10 | Decentralization −30 | Transformation −35","Desires":"Yearning 25 | Exclusivity −30 | Risk −40 | Display 20 | Persistence 0 | Orientation None | Bonding Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up in the Seoul Station registry office. The post of Keeper of Each Nation''s Ratifications opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Managing Eo Taesan''s ratification dates and after-the-fact endorsement witnesses connects with the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"The grade that fits a post in a headquarters or field office of the Seoul Metropolitan Government, among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Secretary (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Secretary (Grade 9). Duties: Keeper of Each Nation''s Ratifications.","Anecdote":"A claim arrives from Jeong Yura''s side asking for a late-arriving joint-negotiation ratification to be applied retroactively. Eo Taesan locks the ratification chest entrusted by Yun Seorin, and beside the per-banner ratification dates written on the wall, calls out the names of the two witnesses of that time to set a day for them to stand again.","Relationships":"Guards the founding ratification chest entrusted by Yun Seorin, matches the humidity and storage cycle of Jo Harin''s iron chest, and brings out Jeong Yura''s joint-negotiation ratification only so long as the date is not falsified.","Ambition":"To keep each nation''s original ratifications valid only in the Seoul Station chest, so that the government''s ratification cannot be sold off through after-the-fact sealing.","Fear":"That the ratification chest will be painted over with a great power''s protective crest, turning the Charter of the Seoul Metropolitan Local Civil Service Organization into a subcontracted document.","Intervention":"Can disclose the folded list to expose the debts, or escort the originals away before the chest is painted over."},"biography":"Remembers even the fold marks on the charter copy, and locks the chest whenever someone asks to backdate a late ratification. Courteous, but never forgiving of a hand that alters dates.\n\n- Livelihood: Managing each nation''s ratification dates and after-the-fact endorsement witnesses\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Local Civil Service Organization\n- Position and Grade: The grade that fits a post in a headquarters or field office of the Seoul Metropolitan Government, among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Secretary (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Secretary (Grade 9)\n- Duties: Keeper of Each Nation''s Ratifications\n**Life.** Grew up in the Seoul Station registry office. The post of Keeper of Each Nation''s Ratifications opened through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Managing Eo Taesan''s ratification dates and after-the-fact endorsement witnesses connects with the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil Service Position and Grade.** The grade that fits a post in a headquarters or field office of the Seoul Metropolitan Government, among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Secretary (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Secretary (Grade 9). Duties: Keeper of Each Nation''s Ratifications.\n\n**Anecdote.** A claim arrives from Jeong Yura''s side asking for a late-arriving joint-negotiation ratification to be applied retroactively. Eo Taesan locks the ratification chest entrusted by Yun Seorin, and beside the per-banner ratification dates written on the wall, calls out the names of the two witnesses of that time to set a day for them to stand again.\n\n**Relationships.** Guards the founding ratification chest entrusted by Yun Seorin, matches the humidity and storage cycle of Jo Harin''s iron chest, and brings out Jeong Yura''s joint-negotiation ratification only so long as the date is not falsified.\n\n**Ambition.** To keep each nation''s original ratifications valid only in the Seoul Station chest, so that the government''s ratification cannot be sold off through after-the-fact sealing.\n\n**Fear.** That the ratification chest will be painted over with a great power''s protective crest, turning the Charter of the Seoul Metropolitan Local Civil Service Organization into a subcontracted document.\n\n**Intervention.** Can disclose the folded list to expose the debts, or escort the originals away before the chest is painted over.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness −15 | Force −40 | Material −25 | Communal 0 | Principle 65 | Publicity −20 | Credentials 10 | Decentralization −30 | Transformation −35\n- Desires: Yearning 25 | Exclusivity −30 | Risk −40 | Display 20 | Persistence 0 | Orientation None | Bonding Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Eo Taesan","type":"Contract","to":"Jo Ha-rin","basis":"matches the humidity and storage cycle of Jo Harin''s iron chest, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Min Sihyeon","type":"Contract","to":"Eo Taesan","basis":"Min Sihyeon takes the signature on the ledger where the double payment was corrected, along with the related ratification records, to Eo Taesan. Eo Taesan finds the ratification dates written on the wall and the stored originals to verify the dates, and if an after-the-fact endorsement is needed, summons the two witnesses of that time again so that no blank is covered over with retroactive sealing."},{"from":"Jo Saejun","type":"Contract","to":"Eo Taesan","basis":"Jo Saejun takes a transcript of the water-soaked ratification document, together with the original, to Eo Taesan. Eo Taesan finds the stored ratification date to confirm the smudged date, but does not retroactively alter the date on the late-arriving copy."},{"from":"Gwon Supyun","type":"Contract","to":"Eo Taesan","basis":"Gwon Supyun takes the signature that corrected a double payment, along with the related ratification records, to Eo Taesan. Eo Taesan checks the dates and witnesses on the stored originals to find where the same ratification became the basis for payment again under a different date."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0165","name":"어태산","title":"각국 인준 보관인","position":"각국 인준 보관인","characterId":"K164","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"각국 인준일·사후 추인 증인 관리","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-어태산","detailRoute":"/people/person-0165","birthDate":"2084-08-24","birthday":"08-24","age":42,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k164-approval-date-check","name":"인준일 확인","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k164-choice","name":"소급 날인을 막음","description":"헌장 사본의 접힌 자국까지 기억하고, 늦게 온 인준을 소급하자고 하면 함을 잠근다. 예의는 지키되 날짜를 고치는 손은 용서하지 않는다.","behavior":"일화. 정유라 쪽에서 늦게 도착한 공동교섭 인준을 소급해 달라는 청구가 들어온다. 어태산은 윤서린이 맡긴 인준 함을 잠그고, 벽에 적힌 깃발별 인준일 옆에 당시 증인 두 명의 이름을 불러 다시 설 날을 잡는다.","stress":"공포. 인준 함이 강국의 보호 문장으로 덧칠되어 정부 헌장이 하청 문서가 되는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린이 맡긴 건국 인준 함을 지키고, 조하린의 철제 함 습도와 보관 주기를 맞추며, 정유라의 공동교섭 인준은 날짜를 속이지 않는 한에서만 꺼낸다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k164-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 각국 인준 보관인. 깃발별 인준일을 벽에 적고, 사후 추인 청구는 당시 증인 두 명이 다시 서지 않으면 받지 않는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 각국 인준 보관인. 깃발별 인준일을 벽에 적고, 사후 추인 청구는 당시 증인 두 명이 다시 서지 않으면 받지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 인준 함이 강국의 보호 문장으로 덧칠되어 정부 헌장이 하청 문서가 되는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린이 맡긴 건국 인준 함을 지키고, 조하린의 철제 함 습도와 보관 주기를 맞추며, 정유라의 공동교섭 인준은 날짜를 속이지 않는 한에서만 꺼낸다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"늦은 인준의 소급 요구에 함을 잠그고 당시 증인 둘을 다시 부른다. 원본과 날짜를 지키되 국제 정치 경력은 부여하지 않는다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51800-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K164","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51800-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5b4-d568-c885","name":"함종 어씨","crest":"clan-crests/c5b4-d568-c885.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":-15,"무력":-40,"물질":-25,"공동":0,"원칙":65,"공개":-20,"자격":10,"분산":-30,"변혁":-35},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":-30,"위험":-40,"과시":20,"지속":0,"지향":"무성향","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"각국 인준일·사후 추인 증인 관리","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"각국 인준 보관인","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −25 | 공동 0 | 원칙 65 | 공개 −20 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −35","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −40 | 과시 20 | 지속 0 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 각국 인준 보관인 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 어태산의 인준일과 사후 추인 증인을 관리하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 각국 인준 보관인.","일화":"정유라 쪽에서 늦게 도착한 공동교섭 인준을 소급해 달라는 청구가 들어온다. 어태산은 윤서린이 맡긴 인준 함을 잠그고, 벽에 적힌 깃발별 인준일 옆에 당시 증인 두 명의 이름을 불러 다시 설 날을 잡는다.","관계":"윤서린이 맡긴 건국 인준 함을 지키고, 조하린의 철제 함 습도와 보관 주기를 맞추며, 정유라의 공동교섭 인준은 날짜를 속이지 않는 한에서만 꺼낸다.","야망":"각국의 인준 원본을 서울역 함에만 유효하게 남겨 정부의 인준이 사후 날인으로 팔리지 않게 한다.","공포":"인준 함이 강국의 보호 문장으로 덧칠되어 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직 헌장이 하청 문서가 되는 것.","개입":"접힌 목록을 공개해 빚을 드러내거나, 함이 덧칠되기 전에 원본을 호송할 수 있다."},"biography":"헌장 사본의 접힌 자국까지 기억하고, 늦게 온 인준을 소급하자고 하면 함을 잠근다. 예의는 지키되 날짜를 고치는 손은 용서하지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 각국 인준일·사후 추인 증인 관리\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 각국 인준 보관인\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 각국 인준 보관인 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 어태산의 인준일과 사후 추인 증인을 관리하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 각국 인준 보관인.\n\n**일화.** 정유라 쪽에서 늦게 도착한 공동교섭 인준을 소급해 달라는 청구가 들어온다. 어태산은 윤서린이 맡긴 인준 함을 잠그고, 벽에 적힌 깃발별 인준일 옆에 당시 증인 두 명의 이름을 불러 다시 설 날을 잡는다.\n\n**관계.** 윤서린이 맡긴 건국 인준 함을 지키고, 조하린의 철제 함 습도와 보관 주기를 맞추며, 정유라의 공동교섭 인준은 날짜를 속이지 않는 한에서만 꺼낸다.\n\n**야망.** 각국의 인준 원본을 서울역 함에만 유효하게 남겨 정부의 인준이 사후 날인으로 팔리지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 인준 함이 강국의 보호 문장으로 덧칠되어 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직 헌장이 하청 문서가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 접힌 목록을 공개해 빚을 드러내거나, 함이 덧칠되기 전에 원본을 호송할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −25 | 공동 0 | 원칙 65 | 공개 −20 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −35\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −40 | 과시 20 | 지속 0 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"어태산","type":"계약","to":"조하린","basis":"조하린의 철제 함 습도와 보관 주기를 맞추며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"민시현","type":"계약","to":"어태산","basis":"민시현은 이중 지급을 고친 장부의 서명과 관련 인준 기록을 어태산에게 가져간다. 어태산은 벽에 적힌 인준일과 보관 원본을 찾아 날짜를 확인하고, 사후 추인이 필요하면 당시 증인 두 명을 다시 불러 소급 날인으로 빈칸을 덮지 않게 한다."},{"from":"조새준","type":"계약","to":"어태산","basis":"조새준은 젖은 인준 문서의 필사본을 원본과 함께 어태산에게 가져간다. 어태산은 보관한 인준일을 찾아 지워진 날짜를 확인하되 늦게 온 사본의 날짜를 소급해 고치지 않는다."},{"from":"권숲윤","type":"계약","to":"어태산","basis":"권숲윤은 이중 지급을 바로잡은 서명과 관련 인준 기록을 어태산에게 가져간다. 어태산은 보관 원본의 날짜와 증인을 확인해 같은 인준이 다른 날짜로 다시 지급 근거가 된 곳을 찾는다."}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0166', 'creative-b780-b3c4-bd09', '{"id":"person-0166","name":"Ran Jiho","title":"Meritorious Subject Reward Roster Party","position":"Meritorious Subject Reward Roster Party","characterId":"K165","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Reconciling Meritorious Retainer Reward Copies and Ration Tickets","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#inmul-ranjiho","detailRoute":"/people/person-0166","birthDate":"2095-07-21","birthday":"07-21","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k165-reward-comparison","name":"Reward copy comparison","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k165-choice","name":"Requires claimant attendance","description":"He could not forget the winter he received office and ration rights written on one line, and when the hereditary column stood empty he did not lower his voice. Mercy and anger breathed in the same rhythm.","behavior":"Anecdote. The evening check shows a name added to the hereditary box of the merit-compensation copy without the holder present. Ran Jiho files an objection to Yun Seorin''s custody of the merit roll and, before that copy reaches Ma Eungyeol''s auction table, rechecks their own name at Seol Dahuin''s concourse window.","stress":"Fear. That after his name was erased from the roster the stamp would remain, and he would become the guarantor of an office he no longer held. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Left an objection against Yun Seorin''s custody of the merit registry, hoped his own office would not become an item at Ma Eungyeol''s copy auction, and sought to raise his name again at Seol Dahyin''s concourse window.","effects":[]},{"id":"k165-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: merit-compensation roster party. He compared the compensation copies with the actual ration tables every evening and blocked hereditary add-ons from being written without the holder''s attendance.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: merit-compensation roster party. He compared the compensation copies with the actual ration tables every evening and blocked hereditary add-ons from being written without the holder''s attendance.","stress":"Fear. That after his name was erased from the roster the stamp would remain, and he would become the guarantor of an office he no longer held. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Left an objection against Yun Seorin''s custody of the merit registry, hoped his own office would not become an item at Ma Eungyeol''s copy auction, and sought to raise his name again at Seol Dahyin''s concourse window.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Anecdote. The evening check shows a name added to the hereditary box of the merit-compensation copy without the holder present. Ran Jiho files an objection to Yun Seorin''s custody of the merit roll and, before that copy reaches Ma Eungyeol''s auction table, rechecks their own name at Seol Dahuin''s concourse window. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41360-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K165","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41360-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"creative-b780-b3c4-bd09","name":"Ran Clan of Dobong","crest":"clan-crests/creative-b780-b3c4-bd09.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":25,"Openness":-15,"Force":-20,"Material":-25,"Communal":15,"Principle":55,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-25,"Transformative":-45},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-30,"Display":20,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Reconciling Meritorious Retainer Reward Copies and Ration Tickets","Status":"Functional/Livelihood Role (Not a Government Appointment)","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"None","Livelihood Role":"Meritorious Subject Reward Roster Party","Values":"Authority 25 | Openness −15 | Force −20 | Material −25 | Communal 15 | Principle 55 | Publicity −15 | Credentials 10 | Decentralization −25 | Transformation −45","Desires":"Yearning 45 | Exclusivity −10 | Risk −30 | Display 20 | Persistence −15 | Orientation Same-sex | Bonding Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up in the Bogungmun refugee camp. The seat as party to the Meritorious Retainer Reward Register opened through the orphan-register citizenship line.\n- Cross-checking Ran Jiho''s meritorious retainer reward copy against ration tickets connects with the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Functional/Livelihood Role":"Party to the Meritorious Retainer Reward Register. Not an office, position, or grade in the Government or the Seoul Metropolitan Government civil service.","Anecdote":"During the evening cross-check, it comes to light that a name has been added to the hereditary column of the meritorious retainer reward copy without the person attending. Ran Jiho files an objection to Yun Seorin''s custody of the Merit Roll, and before that copy goes up on Ma Eungyeol''s auction block, confirms their own name again at Seol Dahin''s waiting-room window.","Relationships":"Leaves an objection to Yun Seorin''s custody of the Merit Roll, hopes their title will not become a commodity at Ma Eungyeol''s copy auction, and tries to have their name entered again at Seol Dahin''s waiting-room window.","Ambition":"To reclaim from the Records Office ledger the ration columns that were cut for the sake of meritorious retainer rewards, so that the founding rewards do not remain only as the share of the inner guard.","Fear":"Even after the name is struck from the register, the seal remains, and the person becomes the guarantor of a title they no longer hold.","Intervention":"Can bring in a witness to fill an empty register slot, or erase the hereditary column to rescue the person from the ledger."},"biography":"Cannot forget the winter when office and ration rights were handed over written on a single line, and does not lower their voice when the hereditary column is empty. Mercy and anger come out in a single breath.\n\n- Livelihood: Cross-checking merit reward copies against ration slips\n- Status: Functional/livelihood role (not a government appointment)\n- Civil service post/grade: None\n- Livelihood role: Party named in the merit reward register\n**Life.** Grew up in the Bogukmun refugee barracks. The place as a party in the merit reward register opened through a line in the orphan register''s citizenship column.\n- Ran Jiho''s work of cross-checking merit reward copies against ration slips is tied to the duties of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Functional/livelihood role.** Party named in the merit reward register. Not an office, post, or grade in the Government or the Seoul Metropolitan Government civil service.\n\n**Anecdote.** At the evening cross-check, it comes to light that a name was added to the hereditary column of the merit reward copy without the person being present. Ran Jiho files an objection to Yun Seorin''s custody of the Meritorious Subjects Roll, and before that copy goes onto Ma Eungyeol''s auction block, rechecks their own name at Seol Dahin''s waiting-hall window.\n\n**Relationships.** Leaves an objection to Yun Seorin''s custody of the Meritorious Subjects Roll, hopes their title will not become merchandise at Ma Eungyeol''s copy auction, and tries to have their name entered again at Seol Dahin''s waiting-hall window.\n\n**Ambition.** To reclaim the ration slots cut by the merit rewards from the Records Office ledger, so that the founding rewards do not remain only the share of the inner guard.\n\n**Fear.** That even after the name is struck from the register, the seal remains, and they become the guarantor of a title they no longer hold.\n\n**Intervention.** Can bring in a witness to fill an empty register slot, or erase the hereditary column to rescue the person from the ledger.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 25 | Openness −15 | Force −20 | Materialism −25 | Community 15 | Principle 55 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −25 | Transformation −45\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −30 | Display 20 | Persistence −15 | Orientation same-sex | Bonding polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ran Jiho","type":"Contract","to":"Ma Eungyeol","basis":"Hoping his rank will not become a commodity in Ma Eungyeol''s copy auction"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0166","name":"란지호","title":"공신 보상 명부 당사자","position":"공신 보상 명부 당사자","characterId":"K165","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"공신 보상 사본·배급표 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-란지호","detailRoute":"/people/person-0166","birthDate":"2095-07-21","birthday":"07-21","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k165-reward-comparison","name":"보상 사본 대조","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k165-choice","name":"당사자 출석 요구","description":"관직과 배급권을 한 줄에 적힌 채 받은 겨울을 잊지 못하고, 세습 칸이 비면 목소리를 낮추지 않는다. 자비와 분노를 한 호흡에 낸다.","behavior":"일화. 저녁 대조에서 공신 보상 사본의 세습 칸에 본인 출석 없이 이름 하나가 더해진 것이 드러난다. 란지호는 윤서린의 공신록 보관에 이의를 적어 올리고, 그 사본이 마은결의 경매대에 오르기 전에 설다흰의 대합실 창구에서 자기 이름을 다시 확인한다.","stress":"공포. 명부에서 이름이 지워진 뒤에도 도장이 남아 자신이 없는 관작의 보증인이 되는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 공신록 보관에 이의를 남기고, 마은결의 사본 경매에서 자신의 관작이 물건이 되지 않기를 바라며, 설다흰의 대합실 창구에 이름을 다시 올리려 한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k165-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 공신 보상 명부 당사자. 보상 사본과 실제 배급표를 저녁마다 대조하고, 세습 추가는 본인 출석 없이 적지 못하게 막는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 공신 보상 명부 당사자. 보상 사본과 실제 배급표를 저녁마다 대조하고, 세습 추가는 본인 출석 없이 적지 못하게 막는다.","stress":"공포. 명부에서 이름이 지워진 뒤에도 도장이 남아 자신이 없는 관작의 보증인이 되는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 공신록 보관에 이의를 남기고, 마은결의 사본 경매에서 자신의 관작이 물건이 되지 않기를 바라며, 설다흰의 대합실 창구에 이름을 다시 올리려 한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"일화. 저녁 대조에서 공신 보상 사본의 세습 칸에 본인 출석 없이 이름 하나가 더해진 것이 드러난다. 란지호는 윤서린의 공신록 보관에 이의를 적어 올리고, 그 사본이 마은결의 경매대에 오르기 전에 설다흰의 대합실 창구에서 자기 이름을 다시 확인한다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41360-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K165","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41360-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"creative-b780-b3c4-bd09","name":"도봉 란씨","crest":"clan-crests/creative-b780-b3c4-bd09.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":25,"개방":-15,"무력":-20,"물질":-25,"공동":15,"원칙":55,"공개":-15,"자격":10,"분산":-25,"변혁":-45},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":-10,"위험":-30,"과시":20,"지속":-15,"지향":"동성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"공신 보상 사본·배급표 대조","지위":"기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)","공무원 직위·직급":"없음","생업 역할":"공신 보상 명부 당사자","가치관":"권위 25 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −25 | 공동 15 | 원칙 55 | 공개 −15 | 자격 10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −45","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 20 | 지속 −15 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"보국문 피난 막사에서 자랐다. 공신 보상 명부 당사자 자리는 고아 명부 시민권 줄로 열렸다.\n- 란지호의 공신 보상 사본과 배급표를 대조하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","기능·생업 역할":"공신 보상 명부 당사자. 정부 또는 서울특별시 공무원 관직·직위·직급이 아니다.","일화":"저녁 대조에서 공신 보상 사본의 세습 칸에 본인 출석 없이 이름 하나가 더해진 것이 드러난다. 란지호는 윤서린의 공신록 보관에 이의를 적어 올리고, 그 사본이 마은결의 경매대에 오르기 전에 설다흰의 대합실 창구에서 자기 이름을 다시 확인한다.","관계":"윤서린의 공신록 보관에 이의를 남기고, 마은결의 사본 경매에서 자신의 관작이 물건이 되지 않기를 바라며, 설다흰의 대합실 창구에 이름을 다시 올리려 한다.","야망":"공신 보상에 깎인 배급 칸을 기록청 원장에서 되찾아 창건 보상이 친위 몫으로만 남지 않게 한다.","공포":"명부에서 이름이 지워진 뒤에도 도장이 남아 자신이 없는 관작의 보증인이 되는 것.","개입":"빈 명부 칸을 채울 증인을 데려오거나, 세습 칸을 지워 당사자를 원장에서 구출할 수 있다."},"biography":"관직과 배급권을 한 줄에 적힌 채 받은 겨울을 잊지 못하고, 세습 칸이 비면 목소리를 낮추지 않는다. 자비와 분노를 한 호흡에 낸다.\n\n- 생업: 공신 보상 사본·배급표 대조\n- 지위: 기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)\n- 공무원 직위·직급: 없음\n- 생업 역할: 공신 보상 명부 당사자\n**생애.** 보국문 피난 막사에서 자랐다. 공신 보상 명부 당사자 자리는 고아 명부 시민권 줄로 열렸다.\n- 란지호의 공신 보상 사본과 배급표를 대조하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**기능·생업 역할.** 공신 보상 명부 당사자. 정부 또는 서울특별시 공무원 관직·직위·직급이 아니다.\n\n**일화.** 저녁 대조에서 공신 보상 사본의 세습 칸에 본인 출석 없이 이름 하나가 더해진 것이 드러난다. 란지호는 윤서린의 공신록 보관에 이의를 적어 올리고, 그 사본이 마은결의 경매대에 오르기 전에 설다흰의 대합실 창구에서 자기 이름을 다시 확인한다.\n\n**관계.** 윤서린의 공신록 보관에 이의를 남기고, 마은결의 사본 경매에서 자신의 관작이 물건이 되지 않기를 바라며, 설다흰의 대합실 창구에 이름을 다시 올리려 한다.\n\n**야망.** 공신 보상에 깎인 배급 칸을 기록청 원장에서 되찾아 창건 보상이 친위 몫으로만 남지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 명부에서 이름이 지워진 뒤에도 도장이 남아 자신이 없는 관작의 보증인이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 빈 명부 칸을 채울 증인을 데려오거나, 세습 칸을 지워 당사자를 원장에서 구출할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 25 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −25 | 공동 15 | 원칙 55 | 공개 −15 | 자격 10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −45\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 20 | 지속 −15 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"란지호","type":"계약","to":"마은결","basis":"마은결의 사본 경매에서 자신의 관작이 물건이 되지 않기를 바라며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0167', 'c12d-acbd-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0167","name":"Seop Do-yun","title":"Government Council Record Courier of the Government","position":"Government Council Record Courier of the Government","characterId":"K166","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Delivering Council Messages and Confirming Testimony","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#character-seop-doyun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0167","birthDate":"2089-11-29","birthday":"11-29","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k166-meeting-delivery","name":"Meeting dispatch delivery","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k166-choice","name":"Witnesses before rumor","description":"He confirmed council hours before the seals and stood at the door any envoy who tried to turn a verbal agreement into a dispatch. Short of breath or not, he carried two copies.","behavior":"Anecdote. Just before the council, a line of bribery rumor with no witness name is set in front of the courier ledger. Seop Doyun keeps that line out of the ledger, sends Jeong Yura''s joint-bargaining notice still sealed to the records office and the council hall at once, and opens Jang Sehwa''s mutual-escort draft before the session begins.","stress":"Fear. That one forged council dispatch would split the lesser states by great power and the courier network would become bribery''s horn. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Carried Jeong Yura''s joint-negotiation notice under seal, split order with Yang Haeon''s ratification dispatches, and unfolded Jang Sehwa''s mutual convoy draft only before the council.","effects":[]},{"id":"k166-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: lesser-states council record courier. He sent the dispatches to the Record Bureau and the council hall at once and raised assassination or bribery rumors into the ledger without witnesses never.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: lesser-states council record courier. He sent the dispatches to the Record Bureau and the council hall at once and raised assassination or bribery rumors into the ledger without witnesses never.","stress":"Fear. That one forged council dispatch would split the lesser states by great power and the courier network would become bribery''s horn. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Carried Jeong Yura''s joint-negotiation notice under seal, split order with Yang Haeon''s ratification dispatches, and unfolded Jang Sehwa''s mutual convoy draft only before the council.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Anecdote. Just before the council, a line of bribery rumor with no witness name is set in front of the courier ledger. Seop Doyun keeps that line out of the ledger, sends Jeong Yura''s joint-bargaining notice still sealed to the records office and the council hall at once, and opens Jang Sehwa''s mutual-escort draft before the session begins. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51810-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K166","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51810-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c12d-acbd-c8fc","name":"Gyeongju Seop Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c12d-acbd-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":25,"Openness":10,"Force":-25,"Material":-35,"Communal":15,"Principle":75,"Public":-5,"Eligibility":5,"Dispersed":-25,"Transformative":-40},"desire":{"Longing":20,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-40,"Display":10,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Delivering Council Messages and Confirming Testimony","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"The grade matching a post in a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office, among Local Administrative Deputy Director (Grade 5), Local Administrative Senior Clerk (Grade 6), Local Administrative Assistant Senior Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 8), and Local Administrative Assistant Clerk (Grade 9)","Assigned Duties":"Government Council Record Courier of the Government","Values":"Authority 25 | Openness 10 | Force −25 | Materialism −35 | Community 15 | Principle 75 | Publicity −5 | Qualification 5 | Decentralization −25 | Transformation −40","Desires":"Craving 20 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −40 | Display 10 | Persistence 20 | Orientation bisexual | Bonding none"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Council Record Courier in the Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service opened through the deletion of a line in a double ledger.\n- Seop Doyun''s work of delivering council messages and witness confirmations is tied to the duties of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"A grade among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 6), Assistant Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Registrar (Grade 8), and Assistant Local Administrative Registrar (Grade 9) suited to a post at a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office. Duties: Government Council Record Courier of the Government.","Anecdote":"Just before the council, a single line of bribery rumor with no witness''s name is laid before the courier ledger. Seop Doyun keeps that line out of the ledger, sends Jeong Yura''s joint negotiation notice, still sealed, to the Records Office and the council hall at the same time, and unfolds Jang Sehwa''s mutual escort draft before the session opens.","Relationships":"Carries Jeong Yura''s joint negotiation notice under seal, shares turns with Yang Haeon''s ratification messages, and unfolds Jang Sehwa''s mutual escort draft only before the council.","Ambition":"To make the council''s joint negotiation text valid only in the courier ledger that they themselves seal, and thereby delay the spread of notes of divided subjugation.","Fear":"That a single forged council message will split the Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service along great-power lines and turn the courier network into a trumpet of bribery.","Intervention":"Can expose the locked note, or escort a Joint Charter witness to protect the courier ledger."},"biography":"Checks the time of the council before the seal, and stands at the door any envoy who tries to turn a verbal agreement into a message. Even out of breath, there are always two copies.\n\n- Livelihood: Delivering council messages and witness confirmations\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service\n- Post/grade: A grade among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 6), Assistant Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Registrar (Grade 8), and Assistant Local Administrative Registrar (Grade 9) suited to a post at a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office\n- Duties: Government Council Record Courier of the Government\n**Life.** Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Council Record Courier in the Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service opened through the deletion of a line in a double ledger.\n- Seop Doyun''s work of delivering council messages and witness confirmations is tied to the duties of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil service post/grade.** A grade among Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 6), Assistant Local Administrative Clerk (Grade 7), Local Administrative Registrar (Grade 8), and Assistant Local Administrative Registrar (Grade 9) suited to a post at a Seoul Metropolitan Government headquarters or field office. Duties: Government Council Record Courier of the Government.\n\n**Anecdote.** Just before the council, a single line of bribery rumor with no witness''s name is laid before the courier ledger. Seop Doyun keeps that line out of the ledger, sends Jeong Yura''s joint negotiation notice, still sealed, to the Records Office and the council hall at the same time, and unfolds Jang Sehwa''s mutual escort draft before the session opens.\n\n**Relationships.** Carries Jeong Yura''s joint negotiation notice under seal, shares turns with Yang Haeon''s ratification messages, and unfolds Jang Sehwa''s mutual escort draft only before the council.\n\n**Ambition.** To make the council''s joint negotiation text valid only in the courier ledger that they themselves seal, and thereby delay the spread of notes of divided subjugation.\n\n**Fear.** That a single forged council message will split the Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service along great-power lines and turn the courier network into a trumpet of bribery.\n\n**Intervention.** Can expose the locked note, or escort a Joint Charter witness to protect the courier ledger.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 25 | Openness 10 | Force −25 | Materialism −35 | Community 15 | Principle 75 | Publicity −5 | Qualification 5 | Decentralization −25 | Transformation −40\n- Desires: Craving 20 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −40 | Display 10 | Persistence 20 | Orientation bisexual | Bonding none\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seop Do-yun","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Yura","basis":"Carries Jeong Yura''s joint negotiation notice under seal"},{"from":"Seop Do-yun","type":"Contract","to":"Yang Haeon","basis":"Splits turn order with Yang Haeon''s approval messages"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Yang Seohyeon","type":"Contract","to":"Seop Do-yun","basis":"Yang Seohyeon passes to Seop Doyun a copy reporting the collapse and closure of flooded sections. Seop Doyun sends that copy to the Records Office and the council hall together, so that news of the closure does not remain on one side only and an escort does not enter a dangerous section."},{"from":"No Jua","type":"Contract","to":"Seop Do-yun","basis":"When No Jua finds a train missing its dispatch schedule or departure signature, she hands the copy to Seop Doyun. Seop Doyun delivers the omission to the Records Office and the council hall together, so that an unsigned departure is not mixed into the official messages on the strength of one side''s verbal confirmation alone."},{"from":"Min Yeon-u","type":"Contract","to":"Seop Do-yun","basis":"Min Yeonu passes to Seop Doyun the escort casualty ledger and copy taken from the raid. Seop Doyun sends the news to the Records Office and the council hall along with testimony to confirm the missing personnel, so that escort losses are not conveyed merely as cargo figures."},{"from":"Bak Ha-yun","type":"Contract","to":"Seop Do-yun","basis":"Bak Hayun passes to Seop Doyun the casualty ledger and copy that was protected during the escort. Seop Doyun conveys them to the Records Office and the council hall along with confirming testimony, so that human losses do not remain merely as cargo figures."},{"from":"Chu Uchan","type":"Contract","to":"Seop Do-yun","basis":"Lines up with Seop Doyun''s courier copy"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0167","name":"섭도윤","title":"정부 회의 기록 전령","position":"정부 회의 기록 전령","characterId":"K166","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"회의 전갈·증언 확인 전달","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-섭도윤","detailRoute":"/people/person-0167","birthDate":"2089-11-29","birthday":"11-29","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k166-meeting-delivery","name":"회의 전갈 전달","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k166-choice","name":"소문보다 증인","description":"회의 시각을 봉인보다 먼저 확인하고, 구두 합의를 전갈로 바꾸려는 사신을 문 앞에 세운다. 숨이 차도 사본은 두 장이다.","behavior":"일화. 회의 직전, 증인 이름 없는 매수 소문 한 줄이 전령 원장 앞에 놓인다. 섭도윤은 그 줄을 원장 밖에 두고, 정유라의 공동교섭 통지를 봉인째 기록청과 회의장에 동시에 보낸 뒤 장세화의 상호호송 초안을 개회 전에 펼친다.","stress":"공포. 위조 회의 전갈 한 장이 정부를 강국별로 쪼개 전령망이 매수의 나팔이 되는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 정유라의 공동교섭 통지를 봉인 상태로 나르고, 양해온의 인준 전갈과 순번을 나누며, 장세화의 상호호송 초안을 회의 전에만 펼친다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k166-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 정부 회의 기록 전령. 전갈을 기록청과 회의장에 동시에 보내고, 암살·매수 소문은 증인 없이 원장에 올리지 않는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 정부 회의 기록 전령. 전갈을 기록청과 회의장에 동시에 보내고, 암살·매수 소문은 증인 없이 원장에 올리지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 위조 회의 전갈 한 장이 정부를 강국별로 쪼개 전령망이 매수의 나팔이 되는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 정유라의 공동교섭 통지를 봉인 상태로 나르고, 양해온의 인준 전갈과 순번을 나누며, 장세화의 상호호송 초안을 회의 전에만 펼친다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"일화. 회의 직전, 증인 이름 없는 매수 소문 한 줄이 전령 원장 앞에 놓인다. 섭도윤은 그 줄을 원장 밖에 두고, 정유라의 공동교섭 통지를 봉인째 기록청과 회의장에 동시에 보낸 뒤 장세화의 상호호송 초안을 개회 전에 펼친다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51810-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K166","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51810-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c12d-acbd-c8fc","name":"경주 섭씨","crest":"clan-crests/c12d-acbd-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":25,"개방":10,"무력":-25,"물질":-35,"공동":15,"원칙":75,"공개":-5,"자격":5,"분산":-25,"변혁":-40},"desire":{"갈망":20,"독점":-10,"위험":-40,"과시":10,"지속":20,"지향":"양성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"회의 전갈·증언 확인 전달","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급","담당 업무":"정부 회의 기록 전령","가치관":"권위 25 | 개방 10 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −35 | 공동 15 | 원칙 75 | 공개 −5 | 자격 5 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −40","욕망":"갈망 20 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −40 | 과시 10 | 지속 20 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직 회의 기록 전령 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 섭도윤의 회의 전갈과 증언 확인을 전하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 정부 회의 기록 전령.","일화":"회의 직전, 증인 이름 없는 매수 소문 한 줄이 전령 원장 앞에 놓인다. 섭도윤은 그 줄을 원장 밖에 두고, 정유라의 공동교섭 통지를 봉인째 기록청과 회의장에 동시에 보낸 뒤 장세화의 상호호송 초안을 개회 전에 펼친다.","관계":"정유라의 공동교섭 통지를 봉인 상태로 나르고, 양해온의 인준 전갈과 순번을 나누며, 장세화의 상호호송 초안을 회의 전에만 펼친다.","야망":"회의의 공동교섭 문안을 자신이 날인하는 전령 원장에만 유효하게 해 분할 복속의 쪽지를 늦게 퍼뜨린다.","공포":"위조 회의 전갈 한 장이 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직를 강국별로 쪼개 전령망이 매수의 나팔이 되는 것.","개입":"잠긴 쪽지를 폭로하거나, 공동헌장 증인을 호송해 전령 원장을 지킬 수 있다."},"biography":"회의 시각을 봉인보다 먼저 확인하고, 구두 합의를 전갈로 바꾸려는 사신을 문 앞에 세운다. 숨이 차도 사본은 두 장이다.\n\n- 생업: 회의 전갈·증언 확인 전달\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급\n- 담당 업무: 정부 회의 기록 전령\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직 회의 기록 전령 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 섭도윤의 회의 전갈과 증언 확인을 전하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 지방행정사무관(5급)·지방행정주사(6급)·지방행정주사보(7급)·지방행정서기(8급)·지방행정서기보(9급) 중 서울특별시 본부·사업소 보직에 맞는 직급. 담당 업무: 정부 회의 기록 전령.\n\n**일화.** 회의 직전, 증인 이름 없는 매수 소문 한 줄이 전령 원장 앞에 놓인다. 섭도윤은 그 줄을 원장 밖에 두고, 정유라의 공동교섭 통지를 봉인째 기록청과 회의장에 동시에 보낸 뒤 장세화의 상호호송 초안을 개회 전에 펼친다.\n\n**관계.** 정유라의 공동교섭 통지를 봉인 상태로 나르고, 양해온의 인준 전갈과 순번을 나누며, 장세화의 상호호송 초안을 회의 전에만 펼친다.\n\n**야망.** 회의의 공동교섭 문안을 자신이 날인하는 전령 원장에만 유효하게 해 분할 복속의 쪽지를 늦게 퍼뜨린다.\n\n**공포.** 위조 회의 전갈 한 장이 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직를 강국별로 쪼개 전령망이 매수의 나팔이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 잠긴 쪽지를 폭로하거나, 공동헌장 증인을 호송해 전령 원장을 지킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 25 | 개방 10 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −35 | 공동 15 | 원칙 75 | 공개 −5 | 자격 5 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −40\n- 욕망: 갈망 20 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −40 | 과시 10 | 지속 20 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"섭도윤","type":"계약","to":"정유라","basis":"정유라의 공동교섭 통지를 봉인 상태로 나르고"},{"from":"섭도윤","type":"계약","to":"양해온","basis":"양해온의 인준 전갈과 순번을 나누며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"양서현","type":"계약","to":"섭도윤","basis":"양서현은 침수 구간의 붕괴와 폐쇄를 보고한 사본을 섭도윤에게 전달한다. 섭도윤은 그 사본을 기록청과 회의장에 함께 보내, 폐쇄 소식이 한쪽에만 남아 호송이 위험한 구간으로 들어가는 일을 막는다."},{"from":"노주아","type":"계약","to":"섭도윤","basis":"노주아는 배차표나 출발 서명이 빠진 열차를 발견하면 그 사본을 섭도윤에게 넘긴다. 섭도윤은 누락 내용을 기록청과 회의장에 함께 전달해, 한쪽의 구두 확인만으로 서명 없는 출발이 정식 전갈에 섞이지 않게 한다."},{"from":"민연우","type":"계약","to":"섭도윤","basis":"민연우는 습격에서 챙긴 호송 인명 장부와 사본을 섭도윤에게 전달한다. 섭도윤은 인원 누락을 확인할 증언과 함께 기록청과 회의장에 소식을 보내, 호송 손실이 화물 숫자로만 전해지지 않게 한다."},{"from":"박하윤","type":"계약","to":"섭도윤","basis":"박하윤은 호송에서 지킨 인명 장부와 사본을 섭도윤에게 전달한다. 섭도윤은 확인 증언과 함께 기록청·회의장에 전해 인명 손실이 화물 숫자로만 남지 않게 한다."},{"from":"추우찬","type":"계약","to":"섭도윤","basis":"섭도윤의 전령 사본과 줄을 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0168', 'd3c9-cda9-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0168","name":"Pyeong Ye-jun","title":"Emergency Powers Return Witness","position":"Emergency Powers Return Witness","characterId":"K167","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Recording the Time and Jurisdiction of Emergency Powers Return","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#character-pyeong-yejun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0168","birthDate":"2079-09-13","birthday":"09-13","age":47,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k167-authority-return-log","name":"Emergency authority return logging","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k167-choice","name":"Preserves testimony context","description":"He still heard the stamp sounds of the Great Blackout night and could not bear speech that called unreturned emergency powers legitimacy. The longer the silence, the shorter the testimony.","behavior":"Anecdote. On the night of collapse year zero''s Great Blackout, Pyeong Yejun saw, from the archive threshold, the purification, rail, and record chiefs each seize emergency powers.","stress":"Fear. That his testimony would be clipped into one great power''s advertisement of development legitimacy. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Offered the Great Blackout logs to Yun Seorin''s cross-verification, matched hours with Na Bomgyeol''s emergency generation logs, and made Ji Hansol''s box sealing hour the anchor of his testimony.","effects":[]},{"id":"k167-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: emergency power return witness. He wrote the return hours and the unreturned jurisdictions on one chalkboard and accepted later corrections only with the two duty hands of the day signing again.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: emergency power return witness. He wrote the return hours and the unreturned jurisdictions on one chalkboard and accepted later corrections only with the two duty hands of the day signing again.","stress":"Fear. That his testimony would be clipped into one great power''s advertisement of development legitimacy. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Offered the Great Blackout logs to Yun Seorin''s cross-verification, matched hours with Na Bomgyeol''s emergency generation logs, and made Ji Hansol''s box sealing hour the anchor of his testimony.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Anecdote. On the night of collapse year zero''s Great Blackout, Pyeong Yejun saw, from the archive threshold, the purification, rail, and record chiefs each seize emergency powers. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41250-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K167","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41250-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d3c9-cda9-c8fc","name":"Chungju Pyeong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/d3c9-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":-10,"Force":-35,"Material":-30,"Communal":0,"Principle":50,"Public":-25,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-40,"Transformative":-45},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":35,"Risk":40,"Display":20,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Recording the Time and Jurisdiction of Emergency Powers Return","Status":"Functional/Livelihood Role (Not a Government Appointment)","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"None","Livelihood Role":"Emergency Powers Return Witness","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force −35 | Materialism −30 | Community 0 | Principle 50 | Publicity −25 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −40 | Transformation −45","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly 35 | Risk 40 | Display 20 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Bisexual | Bonding: Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up on waiting-hall duty. The post of Emergency Authority Return Witness opened up through a substitute duty for an unauthorized shift absence.\n- Recording Pyeong Yejun''s emergency authority return times and unreturned jurisdictions connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Functional/Livelihood Role":"Emergency Authority Return Witness. Not an office, post, or grade in the Government or the Seoul Metropolitan Government.","Anecdote":"On the night of the Great Blackout in Year 0 of the Collapse, the water-purification, railway, and records chiefs each seized emergency authority.","Relationships":"Offers the Great Blackout log to Yun Seorin''s cross-verification, matches times against Na Bomgyeol''s emergency power-generation log, and uses the sealing time of Ji Hansol''s box as the anchor of the testimony.","Ambition":"By leaving public testimony on who returned emergency authority on the day of the Collapse, keeps the nations'' disputes over orthodox legitimacy from growing as mere rumor.","Fear":"Having one''s testimony cut down into a development-legitimacy advertisement for a single great power.","Intervention":"Can publish the list of unreturned jurisdictions, or recover severed fragments of testimony to protect the witness."},"biography":"Cannot stand it when unreturned emergency authority is called orthodox legitimacy. The longer the silence, the shorter the testimony.\n\n- Livelihood: Recording emergency authority return times and jurisdictions\n- Status: Functional/livelihood role (not a government appointment)\n- Civil servant post/grade: None\n- Livelihood role: Emergency Authority Return Witness\n**Life.** Grew up on waiting-hall duty. The post of Emergency Authority Return Witness opened up through a substitute duty for an unauthorized shift absence.\n- Recording Pyeong Yejun''s emergency authority return times and unreturned jurisdictions connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Functional/livelihood role.** Emergency Authority Return Witness. Not an office, post, or grade in the Government or the Seoul Metropolitan Government.\n\n**Anecdote.** On the night of the Great Blackout in Year 0 of the Collapse, the water-purification, railway, and records chiefs each seized emergency authority.\n\n**Relationships.** Offers the Great Blackout log to Yun Seorin''s cross-verification, matches times against Na Bomgyeol''s emergency power-generation log, and uses the sealing time of Ji Hansol''s box as the anchor of the testimony.\n\n**Ambition.** By leaving public testimony on who returned emergency authority on the day of the Collapse, keeps the nations'' disputes over orthodox legitimacy from growing as mere rumor.\n\n**Fear.** Having one''s testimony cut down into a development-legitimacy advertisement for a single great power.\n\n**Intervention.** Can publish the list of unreturned jurisdictions, or recover severed fragments of testimony to protect the witness.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force −35 | Materialism −30 | Community 0 | Principle 50 | Publicity −25 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −40 | Transformation −45\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Monopoly 35 | Risk 40 | Display 20 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Bisexual | Bonding: Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Pyeong Ye-jun","type":"Oath","to":"Na Bomgyeol","basis":"Syncing the time with Na Bomgyeol''s emergency generation log"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0168","name":"평예준","title":"비상권한 반환 증인","position":"비상권한 반환 증인","characterId":"K167","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"비상권한 반환 시각·관할 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-평예준","detailRoute":"/people/person-0168","birthDate":"2079-09-13","birthday":"09-13","age":47,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k167-authority-return-log","name":"비상권한 반환 기록","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k167-choice","name":"증언의 맥락 보전","description":"대정전 밤의 도장 소리를 아직도 듣고, 반환하지 않은 비상권한을 법통이라고 부르는 말을 참지 못한다. 침묵이 길수록 증언은 짧다.","behavior":"일화. 붕괴 0년 대정전의 밤에 평예준은 정수·철도·기록 책임자가 각자 비상권한을 쥐는 장면을 서고 문턱에서 보았다.","stress":"공포. 자신의 증언이 한 강국의 개발 정통성 광고로 잘려 나가는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 교차검증에 대정전 일지를 바치고, 나봄결의 비상 발전 일지와 시각을 맞추며, 지한솔의 함 봉인 시각을 증언의 닻으로 삼는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k167-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 비상권한 반환 증인. 반환 시각과 미반환 관할을 같은 칠판에 적고, 후일 수정은 당시 당직 두 명의 재서명만 받는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 비상권한 반환 증인. 반환 시각과 미반환 관할을 같은 칠판에 적고, 후일 수정은 당시 당직 두 명의 재서명만 받는다.","stress":"공포. 자신의 증언이 한 강국의 개발 정통성 광고로 잘려 나가는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 교차검증에 대정전 일지를 바치고, 나봄결의 비상 발전 일지와 시각을 맞추며, 지한솔의 함 봉인 시각을 증언의 닻으로 삼는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"일화. 붕괴 0년 대정전의 밤에 평예준은 정수·철도·기록 책임자가 각자 비상권한을 쥐는 장면을 서고 문턱에서 보았다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-41250-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K167","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-41250-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d3c9-cda9-c8fc","name":"충주 평씨","crest":"clan-crests/d3c9-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":-10,"무력":-35,"물질":-30,"공동":0,"원칙":50,"공개":-25,"자격":10,"분산":-40,"변혁":-45},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":35,"위험":40,"과시":20,"지속":0,"지향":"양성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"비상권한 반환 시각·관할 기록","지위":"기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)","공무원 직위·직급":"없음","생업 역할":"비상권한 반환 증인","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −30 | 공동 0 | 원칙 50 | 공개 −25 | 자격 10 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −45","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 35 | 위험 40 | 과시 20 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 비상권한 반환 증인 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 평예준의 비상권한 반환 시각과 미반환 관할을 기록하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","기능·생업 역할":"비상권한 반환 증인. 정부 또는 서울특별시 공무원 관직·직위·직급이 아니다.","일화":"붕괴 0년 대정전의 밤에 정수·철도·기록 책임자는 각자 비상권한을 쥐었다.","관계":"윤서린의 교차검증에 대정전 일지를 바치고, 나봄결의 비상 발전 일지와 시각을 맞추며, 지한솔의 함 봉인 시각을 증언의 닻으로 삼는다.","야망":"붕괴 당일 누가 비상권한을 돌려놓았는지를 공개 증언으로 남겨 각국의 법통 다툼이 소문으로만 커지지 않게 한다.","공포":"자신의 증언이 한 강국의 개발 정통성 광고로 잘려 나가는 것.","개입":"미반환 관할 목록을 공개하거나, 잘린 증언 조각을 되찾아 증인을 보호할 수 있다."},"biography":"반환하지 않은 비상권한을 법통이라고 부르는 말을 참지 못한다. 침묵이 길수록 증언은 짧다.\n\n- 생업: 비상권한 반환 시각·관할 기록\n- 지위: 기능·생업 역할(정부 임용 아님)\n- 공무원 직위·직급: 없음\n- 생업 역할: 비상권한 반환 증인\n**생애.** 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 비상권한 반환 증인 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 평예준의 비상권한 반환 시각과 미반환 관할을 기록하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**기능·생업 역할.** 비상권한 반환 증인. 정부 또는 서울특별시 공무원 관직·직위·직급이 아니다.\n\n**일화.** 붕괴 0년 대정전의 밤에 정수·철도·기록 책임자는 각자 비상권한을 쥐었다.\n\n**관계.** 윤서린의 교차검증에 대정전 일지를 바치고, 나봄결의 비상 발전 일지와 시각을 맞추며, 지한솔의 함 봉인 시각을 증언의 닻으로 삼는다.\n\n**야망.** 붕괴 당일 누가 비상권한을 돌려놓았는지를 공개 증언으로 남겨 각국의 법통 다툼이 소문으로만 커지지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 자신의 증언이 한 강국의 개발 정통성 광고로 잘려 나가는 것.\n\n**개입.** 미반환 관할 목록을 공개하거나, 잘린 증언 조각을 되찾아 증인을 보호할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −35 | 물질 −30 | 공동 0 | 원칙 50 | 공개 −25 | 자격 10 | 분산 −40 | 변혁 −45\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 35 | 위험 40 | 과시 20 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"평예준","type":"맹세","to":"나봄결","basis":"나봄결의 비상 발전 일지와 시각을 맞추며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0169', 'c870-cc3d-b155-66fa', '{"id":"person-0169","name":"Jo I-rok","title":"Records Notarization Auditor","position":"Records Notarization Auditor","characterId":"K168","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Verifying Original Hashes and Auditing Notarized Copies","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#inmul-joirok","detailRoute":"/people/person-0169","birthDate":"2099-08-20","birthday":"08-20","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K144","recipientName":"Yun Seo-rin","basis":"Overlaps with Yun Seorin''s sealing authority, but keeps notarial stamping separate.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-06.json","anchor":"inmul-jo-irok-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k168-hash-comparison","name":"Original hash comparison","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k168-choice","name":"Maintains independent certification","description":"He passed no spot where a notary stamp''s ink had smudged. He guarded one original''s hash over any grand ratification.","behavior":"Anecdote. A copy with a smudged notarial stamp comes to the audit desk carrying two original hashes. Jo Irok holds the copy until it is confirmed which hash points to the original, and meanwhile leaves blank the notarial box kept apart from Yun Seorin''s seal.","stress":"Fear. That smudged stamps would circulate as valid ratifications. Changes in behavior or state effects are unconfirmed.","relationship":"Relations. Overlapped with Yun Seorin''s seal authority, but kept the notary stamp separate.","effects":[]},{"id":"k168-boundary","name":"Maintains work boundaries","description":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: record notarization auditor. He sent out no copy notarization before the original''s hash was confirmed.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: record notarization auditor. He sent out no copy notarization before the original''s hash was confirmed.","stress":"Fear. That smudged stamps would circulate as valid ratifications. The actual response is not yet recorded.","relationship":"Relations. Overlapped with Yun Seorin''s seal authority, but kept the notary stamp separate.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Anecdote. A copy with a smudged notarial stamp comes to the audit desk carrying two original hashes. Jo Irok holds the copy until it is confirmed which hash points to the original, and meanwhile leaves blank the notarial box kept apart from Yun Seorin''s seal. Titles and ambitions are not treated as accomplished authority or results.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51820-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K168","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51820-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c870-cc3d-b155-66fa","name":"Changnyeong Jo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c870-cc3d-b155-66fa.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":25,"Openness":-5,"Force":-30,"Material":-40,"Communal":15,"Principle":60,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-30,"Transformative":-50},"desire":{"Longing":20,"Monopoly":25,"Risk":35,"Display":-45,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Verifying Original Hashes and Auditing Notarized Copies","Affiliation":"Seoul Metropolitan Government Local Civil Service Organization","Position and Grade":"Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management audit post, Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), corresponding to the functions of the Records Management Department and Records Management Policy Division of the National Archives of Korea under the Ministry of the Interior and Safety","Assigned Duties":"Records Notarization Auditor","Values":"Authority 25 | Openness −5 | Force −30 | Materialism −40 | Community 15 | Principle 60 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −30 | Transformation −50","Desires":"Craving 20 | Monopoly 25 | Risk 35 | Display −45 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: Bisexual | Bonding: Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Records Notarization Auditor opened up through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Verifying Jo Irok''s original hashes and auditing copy notarizations connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.","Civil Servant Position and Grade":"Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management audit post, Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), corresponding to the functions of the Records Management Department and Records Management Policy Division of the National Archives of Korea under the Ministry of the Interior and Safety. Duties: Records Notarization Auditor.","Anecdote":"A copy bearing a smeared-ink notarial seal comes up to the audit desk with two original hashes attached. Jo Irok holds the copy until it is confirmed which hash points to the original, and in the meantime leaves empty the notarial sealing slot kept separate from Yun Seorin''s seal.","Relationships":"Overlaps with Yun Seorin''s sealing authority, but keeps notarial stamping separate.","Ambition":"Fixes records notarization as a cross-sealing by auditor and clerk rather than the sole signature of the office head.","Fear":"A smeared seal circulating as a valid ratification.","Intervention":"Can point to the original among the two locked hashes, or widen the scope of access."},"biography":"Lets nothing pass where the ink of a notarial seal has smeared. Guards a single original hash over a grand ratification.\n\n- Livelihood: Original-hash verification and copy-notarization auditing\n- Affiliation: Seoul Metropolitan Government local civil service\n- Post/grade: Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management audit post, Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), corresponding to the functions of the Records Management Department and Records Management Policy Division of the National Archives of Korea under the Ministry of the Interior and Safety\n- Duties: Records Notarization Auditor\n**Life.** Grew up at the Seoul Station Registry Office. The post of Records Notarization Auditor opened up through the deletion of a single line in a double ledger.\n- Verifying Jo Irok''s original hashes and auditing copy notarizations connects to the work of Hoehyeon-dong.\n\n**Civil servant post/grade.** Seoul Metropolitan Government records-management audit post, Local Administrative Officer (Grade 5), corresponding to the functions of the Records Management Department and Records Management Policy Division of the National Archives of Korea under the Ministry of the Interior and Safety. Duties: Records Notarization Auditor.\n\n**Anecdote.** A copy bearing a smeared-ink notarial seal comes up to the audit desk with two original hashes attached. Jo Irok holds the copy until it is confirmed which hash points to the original, and in the meantime leaves empty the notarial sealing slot kept separate from Yun Seorin''s seal.\n\n**Relationships.** Overlaps with Yun Seorin''s sealing authority, but keeps the notarial seal separate.\n\n**Ambition.** Fixes records notarization as a cross-sealing by auditor and clerk rather than the sole signature of the office head.\n\n**Fear.** A smeared seal circulating as a valid ratification.\n\n**Intervention.** Can point to the original among the two locked hashes, or widen the scope of access.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 25 | Openness −5 | Force −30 | Materialism −40 | Community 15 | Principle 60 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −30 | Transformation −50\n- Desires: Craving 20 | Monopoly 25 | Risk 35 | Display −45 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: Bisexual | Bonding: Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0169","name":"조이록","title":"기록 공증 감사관","position":"기록 공증 감사관","characterId":"K168","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"원본 해시 확인·사본 공증 감사","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-06#인물-조이록","detailRoute":"/people/person-0169","birthDate":"2099-08-20","birthday":"08-20","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K144","recipientName":"윤서린","basis":"윤서린의 봉인 권한과 겹치지만, 공증 날인은 따로 둔다.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-06.json","anchor":"인물-조이록-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":2,"effective":2}},"skills":[{"id":"k168-hash-comparison","name":"원본 해시 대조","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k168-choice","name":"독립 날인 유지","description":"공증 도장의 잉크가 번진 자리는 통과시키지 않는다. 큰 인준보다 한 장의 원본 해시를 지킨다.","behavior":"일화. 잉크가 번진 공증 도장을 단 사본이 원본 해시 두 개를 달고 감사대에 오른다. 조이록은 어느 해시가 원본을 가리키는지 확인할 때까지 사본을 붙들어 두고, 윤서린의 봉인과 따로 두는 공증 날인 칸을 그동안 비워 둔다.","stress":"공포. 번진 도장이 유효한 인준처럼 유통되는 것. 행동 변화나 상태 효과는 미확정이다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 봉인 권한과 겹치지만, 공증 날인은 따로 둔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k168-boundary","name":"업무 경계를 지킴","description":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 기록 공증 감사관. 사본 공증은 원본 해시가 확인되기 전에 내보내지 않는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 기록 공증 감사관. 사본 공증은 원본 해시가 확인되기 전에 내보내지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 번진 도장이 유효한 인준처럼 유통되는 것. 실제 반응은 아직 기록되지 않았다.","relationship":"관계. 윤서린의 봉인 권한과 겹치지만, 공증 날인은 따로 둔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"일화. 잉크가 번진 공증 도장을 단 사본이 원본 해시 두 개를 달고 감사대에 오른다. 조이록은 어느 해시가 원본을 가리키는지 확인할 때까지 사본을 붙들어 두고, 윤서린의 봉인과 따로 두는 공증 날인 칸을 그동안 비워 둔다. 직함·야망을 이미 이룬 권한이나 성과로 취급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:duchy-51820-S06","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K168","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:opening-duchy-51820-S06","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c870-cc3d-b155-66fa","name":"창녕 조씨","crest":"clan-crests/c870-cc3d-b155-66fa.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":25,"개방":-5,"무력":-30,"물질":-40,"공동":15,"원칙":60,"공개":-15,"자격":10,"분산":-30,"변혁":-50},"desire":{"갈망":20,"독점":25,"위험":35,"과시":-45,"지속":-15,"지향":"양성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"원본 해시 확인·사본 공증 감사","소속":"서울특별시 지방공무원 조직","직위·직급":"행정안전부 국가기록원 기록관리부·기록관리정책과 기능에 대응하는 서울특별시 기록관리 감사 담당 지방행정사무관(5급) 보직","담당 업무":"기록 공증 감사관","가치관":"권위 25 | 개방 −5 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −40 | 공동 15 | 원칙 60 | 공개 −15 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −50","욕망":"갈망 20 | 독점 25 | 위험 35 | 과시 −45 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 기록 공증 감사관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 조이록의 원본 해시를 확인하고 사본 공증을 감사하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.","공무원 직위·직급":"행정안전부 국가기록원 기록관리부·기록관리정책과 기능에 대응하는 서울특별시 기록관리 감사 담당 지방행정사무관(5급) 보직. 담당 업무: 기록 공증 감사관.","일화":"잉크가 번진 공증 도장을 단 사본이 원본 해시 두 개를 달고 감사대에 오른다. 조이록은 어느 해시가 원본을 가리키는지 확인할 때까지 사본을 붙들어 두고, 윤서린의 봉인과 따로 두는 공증 날인 칸을 그동안 비워 둔다.","관계":"윤서린의 봉인 권한과 겹치지만, 공증 날인은 따로 둔다.","야망":"기록 공증을 청장 단독 서명이 아니라 감사·서기 교차 날인으로 고정한다.","공포":"번진 도장이 유효한 인준처럼 유통되는 것.","개입":"잠긴 두 해시 중 원본을 가리키거나, 열람 범위를 넓힐 수 있다."},"biography":"공증 도장의 잉크가 번진 자리는 통과시키지 않는다. 큰 인준보다 한 장의 원본 해시를 지킨다.\n\n- 생업: 원본 해시 확인·사본 공증 감사\n- 소속: 서울특별시 지방공무원 조직\n- 직위·직급: 행정안전부 국가기록원 기록관리부·기록관리정책과 기능에 대응하는 서울특별시 기록관리 감사 담당 지방행정사무관(5급) 보직\n- 담당 업무: 기록 공증 감사관\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 기록 공증 감사관 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 조이록의 원본 해시를 확인하고 사본 공증을 감사하는 일은 회현동의 업무와 이어진다.\n\n**공무원 직위·직급.** 행정안전부 국가기록원 기록관리부·기록관리정책과 기능에 대응하는 서울특별시 기록관리 감사 담당 지방행정사무관(5급) 보직. 담당 업무: 기록 공증 감사관.\n\n**일화.** 잉크가 번진 공증 도장을 단 사본이 원본 해시 두 개를 달고 감사대에 오른다. 조이록은 어느 해시가 원본을 가리키는지 확인할 때까지 사본을 붙들어 두고, 윤서린의 봉인과 따로 두는 공증 날인 칸을 그동안 비워 둔다.\n\n**관계.** 윤서린의 봉인 권한과 겹치지만, 공증 날인은 따로 둔다.\n\n**야망.** 기록 공증을 청장 단독 서명이 아니라 감사·서기 교차 날인으로 고정한다.\n\n**공포.** 번진 도장이 유효한 인준처럼 유통되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 잠긴 두 해시 중 원본을 가리키거나, 열람 범위를 넓힐 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 25 | 개방 −5 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −40 | 공동 15 | 원칙 60 | 공개 −15 | 자격 10 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −50\n- 욕망: 갈망 20 | 독점 25 | 위험 35 | 과시 −45 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0170', 'bc15-bc00-c591', '{"id":"person-0170","name":"Bak Tae-gyeom","title":"Stationmaster","position":"Stationmaster of the Government","characterId":"K169","rank":"Stationmaster","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"Managing and Publishing the Escort Dispatch Schedule","gender":"Male","stage":"Key","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#inmul-bak-taegyeom","detailRoute":"/people/person-0170","birthDate":"2071-01-09","birthday":"01-09","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K193","recipientName":"Kevin White","basis":"Carry Bak Taegyeom''s mediation plan out into the field, but do not hand over the track keys.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-07.json","anchor":"Person-Kevin-White-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":13,"effective":13},"martial":{"base":11,"effective":11},"stewardship":{"base":14,"effective":14},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k169-dispatch-disclosure","name":"Dispatch disclosure","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k169-trait-1","name":"Council before escort","description":"Calls a shared council first when transport stalls.","behavior":"Calls a shared council first when transport stalls.","stress":"Keeps council convening ahead of escorting a stopped train.","relationship":"Shares scheduling with Jang Sehwa while keeping their duties distinct.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"When a pump train stopped, he disclosed its schedule and called the council before escorting it. He seeks to coordinate transport interests through the council without absorbing Jang Sehwa’s siding duty into his own scheduling authority.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s07","name":{"ko":"Yongsan Station Directly Managed Land"},"holderPersonId":"K169","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S07","stationRef":{"stationId":"Yongsan","stationName":"Yongsan"},"adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null}],"clan":{"id":"bc15-bc00-c591","name":"Miryang Bak Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc15-bc00-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":20,"Force":-10,"Material":20,"Communal":-30,"Principle":-40,"Public":-40,"Eligibility":40,"Dispersed":-10,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-40,"Risk":20,"Display":10,"Sustained":-20,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Stationmaster","Title":"Stationmaster of the Government","Livelihood":"Managing and Publishing the Escort Dispatch Schedule"},"sections":{"Life":"Bak Taegyeom, born in 2071, becomes Station Master of the Transshipment Bureau in 2126. Bak worked entangled in Yongsan railway transshipment and garrison fence contract work. When an emergency convoy opens, the tracks move before the state does. Bak kept the dispatch schedule of the Yongsan Hosongga in order to leave that order in the Vassal-State Council. The siding watch of the Yongsan Seonromun belongs to Jang Sehwa. If the two hands swapped places every season, the state would look like two. The Itaewon interpreters are a household within this state. That is why the Vassal-State Council is held. The lineage, with a Korean father and an Irish mother, is rooted in the Yongsan Hosongga''s living area. Bak Dohyeon went through the Great Blackout around 2026 at the Yongsan Hosongga, doing civilian contract work for the Yongsan railway and civilian lodging work in Itaewon. The family passed records of shelters and goods handovers down to the next generation, and Bak Taegyeom''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the living ledgers of their own time. They speak English at home and Korean in daily life and at work.","Offices":"Rank: Station Master. Title: Station Master of the Transshipment Bureau. Trade nickname: Rail Coordinator.","Anecdote":"When Im Hajun''s pump train stopped at the Yongsan Window, Bak Taegyeom made the dispatch schedule public and convened the Vassal-State Council. The convening came before the convoy.","Houses":"Yongsan Hosongga (HC11). Steward. The steward of the Yongsan Seonromun (HP02) is Jang Sehwa.","Relationships":"Dispatch with Jang Sehwa. Im Hajun''s pump train.\n\n- Affiliation: Transshipment Bureau\n- Rank: Station Master\n- Title: Station Master of the Transshipment Bureau\n- Trade: Managing and publishing convoy dispatch schedules\n- Bak Taegyeom''s duties as Station Master of the Transshipment Bureau are tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\nThe rail-clan elders, dispatchers, and apprentices surrounding Rail Coordinator Bak Taegyeom."},"biography":"**Life.** Bak Taegyeom, born in 2071, becomes Station Master of the Transshipment Bureau in 2126. Bak worked entangled in Yongsan railway transshipment and garrison fence contract work. When an emergency convoy opens, the tracks move before the state does. Bak kept the dispatch schedule of the Yongsan Hosongga in order to leave that order in the Vassal-State Council. The siding watch of the Yongsan Seonromun belongs to Jang Sehwa. If the two hands swapped places every season, the state would look like two. The Itaewon interpreters are a household within this state. That is why the Vassal-State Council is held. The lineage, with a Korean father and an Irish mother, is rooted in the Yongsan Hosongga''s living area. Bak Dohyeon went through the Great Blackout around 2026 at the Yongsan Hosongga, doing civilian contract work for the Yongsan railway and civilian lodging work in Itaewon. The family passed records of shelters and goods handovers down to the next generation, and Bak Taegyeom''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the living ledgers of their own time. They speak English at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n**Office.** Rank: Station Master. Title: Station Master of the Transshipment Bureau. Trade nickname: Rail Coordinator.\n**Anecdote.** When Im Hajun''s pump train stopped at the Yongsan Window, Bak Taegyeom made the dispatch schedule public and convened the Vassal-State Council. The convening came before the convoy.\n**Family.** Yongsan Hosongga (HC11). Steward. The steward of the Yongsan Seonromun (HP02) is Jang Sehwa.\n**Relations.** Dispatch with Jang Sehwa. Im Hajun''s pump train.\n\n- Affiliation: Transshipment Bureau\n- Rank: Station Master\n- Title: Station Master of the Transshipment Bureau\n- Trade: Managing and publishing convoy dispatch schedules\n- Bak Taegyeom''s duties as Station Master of the Transshipment Bureau are tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\nThe rail-clan elders, dispatchers, and apprentices surrounding Rail Coordinator Bak Taegyeom.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"Yu Sejin","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Western Relay Dispatch Contract"},{"from":"Alexander Miller","type":"Rivalry","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Contests the rail-clan succession with the Station Master"},{"from":"Eva Novakova","type":"Command","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Operates the western railway contracts through dispatch"},{"from":"Isaac Walker","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Trains under the Station Master as a rail apprentice"},{"from":"Lucas Schneider","type":"Command","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Reports the warehouse lease ledger to the Station Master"},{"from":"Choe Han-gyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Lends the western repair train dispatch desk"},{"from":"Yu Minho","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Splits the relay window and outbound trains"},{"from":"Simon Kaminski","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Simon Kaminski passes the ledger of lives protected on convoys to Bak Taegyeom''s dispatch window. Bak Taegyeom checks actual arrivals and the departures of small convoys so that the handover of people is not dropped from the freight-car records."},{"from":"Jacob Thomas","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Jacob Thomas hands the ledger of lives protected on convoys to Bak Taegyeom''s window. Bak Taegyeom checks arrival headcounts and dispatch order so that people do not go missing from records of cargo-only arrivals."},{"from":"Mykola Bondarenko","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Backing Bak Taegyeom''s apprenticeship route at the window"},{"from":"Sofia Rossi","type":"Command","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"a commander who carries Bak Taegyeom''s succession proposal only in sealed form,"},{"from":"Patrick O''Connor","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"an ally who hands Bak Taegyeom the detour coordinates,"},{"from":"Adeola Adeyemi","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"obeys Bak Taegyeom''s keeping of the relay but refuses concealed power distribution"},{"from":"Martin Horak","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"requests access to Bak Taegyeom''s dispatch ledger,"},{"from":"Ana Hierophantscu","type":"Oath","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"tests Bak Taegyeom''s relay maintenance by occupying the window,"},{"from":"Seok Oreum","type":"Oath","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"takes the time of Bak Taegyeom''s dispatch inquiry as the benchmark at the witness stand"},{"from":"Cho Jinsol","type":"Oath","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"separates, at the witness stand, Bak Taegyeom''s dispatch inquiry from the rumor that I Hongwon tampered with succession-exam parts"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0170","name":"박태겸","title":"역장","position":"정부 역장","characterId":"K169","rank":"역장","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"호송 배차표 관리·공개","gender":"남성","stage":"주요","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-박태겸","detailRoute":"/people/person-0170","birthDate":"2071-01-09","birthday":"01-09","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K193","recipientName":"케빈 화이트","basis":"박태겸의 조정안을 현장에 옮기되, 선로 열쇠는 넘기지 않는다.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-07.json","anchor":"인물-케빈-화이트-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":13,"effective":13},"martial":{"base":11,"effective":11},"stewardship":{"base":14,"effective":14},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k169-dispatch-disclosure","name":"배차표 공개","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k169-trait-1","name":"호송보다 회의","description":"운송 정체에 공동 회의를 먼저 연다.","behavior":"운송 정체에 공동 회의를 먼저 연다.","stress":"열차가 멈춰도 소집을 호송보다 앞세운다.","relationship":"장세화와 배차를 나누며 서로의 당직을 구분한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"펌프 열차가 멈추자 배차표를 공개하고 호송보다 먼저 후국회의를 소집했다. 운송의 이해관계를 회의로 묶으려 하지만 장세화의 유치선 당직을 자기 배차권과 합치지는 못한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s07","name":{"ko":"용산역 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K169","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S07","stationRef":{"stationId":"용산","stationName":"용산"},"adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null}],"clan":{"id":"bc15-bc00-c591","name":"밀양 박씨","crest":"clan-crests/bc15-bc00-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"권위":10,"개방":20,"무력":-10,"물질":20,"공동":-30,"원칙":-40,"공개":-40,"자격":40,"분산":-10,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-40,"위험":20,"과시":10,"지속":-20,"지향":"양성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"역장","직함":"정부 역장","생업":"호송 배차표 관리·공개"},"sections":{"생애":"2071년생인 박태겸은 2126년 정부 역장을 맡는다. 용산 철도 환적과 주둔지 울타리 용역에 얽혀 일했다. 비상 호송이 열리면 선로가 나라보다 먼저 움직인다. 박태겸은 그 순서를 후국회의에 남기려 용산호송가의 배차표를 지켰다. 용산선로문의 유치선 당직은 장세화의 것이다. 두 손이 계절마다 자리를 바꾸면 나라가 둘로 보인다. 이태원 통역은 이 나라 안의 호다. 그래서 후국회의를 연다. 한국계 아버지와 아일랜드계 어머니를 둔 가계는 용산호송가 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 박도헌은 약 2026년 용산호송가에서 용산 철도 민간 용역과 이태원 민간 숙박 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 박태겸의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.","관직":"품계 역장. 직함은 정부 역장. 생업 별명은 철도조정관.","일화":"임하준의 펌프 열차가 용산 창에 멈췄을 때, 박태겸은 배차표를 공개하고 후국회의를 소집했다. 소집이 호송보다 먼저였다.","가문":"용산호송가(HC11). 관리인. 용산선로문(HP02) 관리인은 장세화다.","관계":"장세화와 배차. 임하준의 펌프 열차.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 역장\n- 직함: 정부 역장\n- 생업: 호송 배차표 관리·공개\n- 박태겸의 정부 역장 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n철도조정관 박태겸을 둘러싼 선로 가문 원로와 배차원·도제다."},"biography":"**생애.** 2071년생인 박태겸은 2126년 정부 역장을 맡는다. 용산 철도 환적과 주둔지 울타리 용역에 얽혀 일했다. 비상 호송이 열리면 선로가 나라보다 먼저 움직인다. 박태겸은 그 순서를 후국회의에 남기려 용산호송가의 배차표를 지켰다. 용산선로문의 유치선 당직은 장세화의 것이다. 두 손이 계절마다 자리를 바꾸면 나라가 둘로 보인다. 이태원 통역은 이 나라 안의 호다. 그래서 후국회의를 연다. 한국계 아버지와 아일랜드계 어머니를 둔 가계는 용산호송가 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 박도헌은 약 2026년 용산호송가에서 용산 철도 민간 용역과 이태원 민간 숙박 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 박태겸의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n**관직.** 품계 역장. 직함은 정부 역장. 생업 별명은 철도조정관.\n**일화.** 임하준의 펌프 열차가 용산 창에 멈췄을 때, 박태겸은 배차표를 공개하고 후국회의를 소집했다. 소집이 호송보다 먼저였다.\n**가문.** 용산호송가(HC11). 관리인. 용산선로문(HP02) 관리인은 장세화다.\n**관계.** 장세화와 배차. 임하준의 펌프 열차.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 역장\n- 직함: 정부 역장\n- 생업: 호송 배차표 관리·공개\n- 박태겸의 정부 역장 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n철도조정관 박태겸을 둘러싼 선로 가문 원로와 배차원·도제다.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"유세진","type":"계약","to":"박태겸","basis":"서부 중계 배차 계약"},{"from":"알렉산더 밀러","type":"경쟁","to":"박태겸","basis":"선로 가문 후계를 역장과 겨룸"},{"from":"에바 노바코바","type":"지휘","to":"박태겸","basis":"서부 철도계약을 배차에서 운용"},{"from":"아이작 워커","type":"신도","to":"박태겸","basis":"선로 도제로 역장 밑에서 수련"},{"from":"루카스 슈나이더","type":"지휘","to":"박태겸","basis":"창고 임대 장부를 역장에게 보고"},{"from":"최한결","type":"계약","to":"박태겸","basis":"서부 보수열차 배차 창구를 빌림"},{"from":"유민호","type":"계약","to":"박태겸","basis":"중계 창구와 외곽 열차를 나눔"},{"from":"시몬 카민스키","type":"계약","to":"박태겸","basis":"시몬 카민스키는 호송에서 지킨 인명 장부를 박태겸의 배차 창구에 전달한다. 박태겸은 실제 도착과 작은 호송의 출발을 확인해 사람의 인수가 화물 칸 기록에 빠지지 않게 한다."},{"from":"제이컵 토머스","type":"계약","to":"박태겸","basis":"제이컵 토머스는 호송에서 지킨 인명 장부를 박태겸의 창구에 넘긴다. 박태겸은 도착 인원·배차 순서를 확인해 화물만 도착한 기록에 사람이 빠지지 않게 한다."},{"from":"미콜라 본다렌코","type":"신도","to":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸의 도제 경로를 창에서 받치며"},{"from":"소피아 로시","type":"지휘","to":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸의 후계 제안을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘이고"},{"from":"패트릭 오코너","type":"계약","to":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸에게 우회 좌표를 넘기는 동맹이고"},{"from":"아데올라 아데예미","type":"계약","to":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸의 중계 유지에는 복종하되 은폐 배전은 거부한다"},{"from":"마르틴 호라크","type":"계약","to":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸의 배차 원장 열람을 청구하고"},{"from":"아나 포페스쿠","type":"맹세","to":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸의 중계 유지를 창 점유로 시험하며"},{"from":"석오름","type":"맹세","to":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸의 배차 조사 시각을 증인석의 기준으로 삼는다"},{"from":"초진솔","type":"맹세","to":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸의 배차 조사와 이홍원의 후계시험 부품 조작 소문을 증인석에서 가른다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0171', NULL, '{"id":"person-0171","name":"Alexander Miller","title":"Rail Clan Elder","position":"Rail Clan Elder","characterId":"K170","rank":"Headquarters Chief","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"Approving Track Blockades and Controlling Switches","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#Person-Alexander Miller","detailRoute":"/people/person-0171","birthDate":"2059-03-06","birthday":"03-06","age":67,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"switch-control","name":"Switch control","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k170-disposition","name":"Hereditary veto","description":"He saw the house''s rails as bloodline and treated the adopted child as a guest. Outwardly he kept his manners, but he never let go of the dispatch veto.","behavior":"Office. Rank: bureau chief. Title: track house elder. He allowed track blockades only in the house council and pressed the Coordinator by cutting the apprentice lodge''s rations.","stress":"Fear. That the surrounding great powers would use Yongsan as a battlefield and strip even the house warehouse''s transshipment monopoly.","relationship":"Relations. Contested the succession with Park Taegyeom and detained Im Chowon''s return train. Used Clara Bennett as the house-side dispatcher and set the Changdong wheel supply as a condition for Hwang Noeul.","effects":[]},{"id":"k170-choice","name":"Ration leverage","description":"Anecdote. When the train carrying Im Chowon entered the Yongsan warehouse, he locked the track switch and convened the Post-State Council.","behavior":"Relations. Contested the succession with Park Taegyeom and detained Im Chowon''s return train. Used Clara Bennett as the house-side dispatcher and set the Changdong wheel supply as a condition for Hwang Noeul.","stress":"Fear. That the surrounding great powers would use Yongsan as a battlefield and strip even the house warehouse''s transshipment monopoly.","relationship":"Relations. Contested the succession with Park Taegyeom and detained Im Chowon''s return train. Used Clara Bennett as the house-side dispatcher and set the Changdong wheel supply as a condition for Hwang Noeul.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He locked the switch and summoned the council. He uses rations and parts in the succession dispute; battlefield command is not established.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":25,"Force":-10,"Material":20,"Communal":0,"Principle":0,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":35,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":-25,"Display":-15,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Headquarters Chief","Livelihood":"Approving Track Blockades and Controlling Switches","Title":"Rail Clan Elder","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness 25 | Military Force −10 | Material 20 | Collective 0 | Principle 0 | Disclosure −15 | Qualification 35 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 30 | Monopoly −15 | Risk −25 | Display −15 | Persistence 30 | Orientation None | Bonding Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in 2059, Alexander Miller takes up the duties of Rail Clan elder in the opening period of 2126. He grew up on waiting-hall duty. His work as Rail Clan elder began with a substitute shift covering an unexcused absence. His European-American family line is rooted in the Yongsan-Itaewon living area. In 2026, James Miller handled U.S. Army supply work in Yongsan-Itaewon and went through the severing of communication lines. The family passed down records of their residence and goods handovers to the next generation, and Alexander Miller''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the daily ledgers of the time. They speak English at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Alexander Miller''s work of approving track blockades and controlling switches is tied to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Bureau Chief. Title: Rail Clan Elder. He approves track blockades only in clan council, and pressures the coordinator by cutting off rations to the apprentice quarters.","Anecdote":"When the train carrying Im Chowon entered the Yongsan Window, he locked the switches and convened the Vassal-State Council.","Relationships":"Competes with Bak Taegyeom over the succession and detained Im Chowon''s return train. Uses Clara Bennett as the clan''s dispatcher, and makes the supply of Changdong wheels a condition for Hwang Noeul.","Ambition":"To nullify Bak Taegyeom''s apprentice succession and make the Rail Clan hereditary holder of the Vassal-State Council''s final veto.","Fear":"That the great powers on every side will use Yongsan as a battlefield and even strip away the transshipment monopoly of the clan warehouse.","Intervention":"He can steal the switch key, or publicly endorse an adopted-heir succession at the clan council."},"biography":"He regards the clan''s track as bloodline and treats an adopted heir as a guest. He keeps up appearances of courtesy, but never lets go of the dispatch veto.\n\n- Affiliation: Transshipment Bureau\n- Rank: Bureau Chief\n- Occupation: Approving track blockades and controlling switches\n- Title: Rail Clan Elder\n**Life.** Born in 2059, Alexander Miller takes up the duties of Rail Clan elder in the opening period of 2126. He grew up on waiting-hall duty. His work as Rail Clan elder began with a substitute shift covering an unexcused absence. His European-American family line is rooted in the Yongsan-Itaewon living area. In 2026, James Miller handled U.S. Army supply work in Yongsan-Itaewon and went through the severing of communication lines. The family passed down records of their residence and goods handovers to the next generation, and Alexander Miller''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the daily ledgers of the time. They speak English at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Alexander Miller''s work of approving track blockades and controlling switches is tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Bureau Chief. Title: Rail Clan Elder. He approves track blockades only in clan council, and pressures the coordinator by cutting off rations to the apprentice quarters.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the train carrying Im Chowon entered the Yongsan Window, he locked the switches and convened the Vassal-State Council.\n\n**Relationships.** Competes with Bak Taegyeom over the succession and detained Im Chowon''s return train. Uses Clara Bennett as the clan''s dispatcher, and makes the supply of Changdong wheels a condition for Hwang Noeul.\n\n**Ambition.** To nullify Bak Taegyeom''s apprentice succession and make the Rail Clan hereditary holder of the Vassal-State Council''s final veto.\n\n**Fear.** That the great powers on every side will use Yongsan as a battlefield and even strip away the transshipment monopoly of the clan warehouse.\n\n**Intervention.** He can steal the switch key, or publicly endorse an adopted-heir succession at the clan council.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness 25 | Force −10 | Material 20 | Communal 0 | Principle 0 | Disclosure −15 | Credentials 35 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Monopoly −15 | Risk −25 | Display −15 | Persistence 30 | Orientation None | Bonding Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Alexander Miller","type":"Rivalry","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Contests the rail-clan succession with the Station Master"},{"from":"Alexander Miller","type":"Grudge","to":"Im Chowon","basis":"Grudge over detaining the returning train"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Clara Bennett","type":"Command","to":"Alexander Miller","basis":"Receives clan dispatch orders"},{"from":"Hwang No-eul","type":"Contract","to":"Alexander Miller","basis":"Trades wheel-supply terms with the Rail Clan"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0171","name":"알렉산더 밀러","title":"선로 가문 원로","position":"선로 가문 원로","characterId":"K170","rank":"본부장","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"선로 봉쇄 승인·전환기 통제","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-알렉산더 밀러","detailRoute":"/people/person-0171","birthDate":"2059-03-06","birthday":"03-06","age":67,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"switch-control","name":"전환기 통제","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k170-disposition","name":"혈통 거부권","description":"가문의 궤도를 혈통으로 보고 양자를 손님으로 대한다. 겉으로는 예의를 지키지만 배차 거부권만은 절대 놓지 않는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 본부장. 직함은 선로 가문 원로. 가문 회의에서만 선로 봉쇄를 승인하고, 도제 숙소의 배급을 끊는 방식으로 조정관을 압박한다.","stress":"공포. 사방 강국이 용산을 전쟁터로 쓰면서 가문 창고의 환적 독점까지 빼앗기는 것.","relationship":"관계. 박태겸과 후계를 놓고 경쟁하며 임초원의 귀환 열차를 억류했다. 클라라 베넷을 가문 측 배차로 부리고, 황노을에게는 창동 차륜 공급을 조건으로 건다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k170-choice","name":"배급을 지렛대로","description":"일화. 임초원을 태운 열차가 용산 창에 들어오자 선로 전환기를 잠그고 후국회의를 소집했다.","behavior":"관계. 박태겸과 후계를 놓고 경쟁하며 임초원의 귀환 열차를 억류했다. 클라라 베넷을 가문 측 배차로 부리고, 황노을에게는 창동 차륜 공급을 조건으로 건다.","stress":"공포. 사방 강국이 용산을 전쟁터로 쓰면서 가문 창고의 환적 독점까지 빼앗기는 것.","relationship":"관계. 박태겸과 후계를 놓고 경쟁하며 임초원의 귀환 열차를 억류했다. 클라라 베넷을 가문 측 배차로 부리고, 황노을에게는 창동 차륜 공급을 조건으로 건다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"전환기를 잠그고 회의를 소집했다. 후계 경쟁에서 배급과 부품 공급을 압박 수단으로 쓰지만 전장 지휘의 근거는 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":25,"무력":-10,"물질":20,"공동":0,"원칙":0,"공개":-15,"자격":35,"분산":5,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-15,"위험":-25,"과시":-15,"지속":30,"지향":"무성향","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"본부장","생업":"선로 봉쇄 승인·전환기 통제","직함":"선로 가문 원로","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 25 | 무력 −10 | 물질 20 | 공동 0 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −15 | 자격 35 | 분산 5 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −25 | 과시 −15 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2059년생인 알렉산더 밀러는 2126년 개막기에 선로 가문 원로 업무를 맡는다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 선로 가문 원로 업무는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직을 계기로 시작됐다. 유럽계 미국인 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 제임스 밀러는 2026년 용산·이태원에서 미 육군 보급 업무를 맡다가 연락망 단절을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 알렉산더 밀러의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 알렉산더 밀러의 선로 봉쇄 승인·전환기 통제 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 본부장. 직함은 선로 가문 원로. 가문 회의에서만 선로 봉쇄를 승인하고, 도제 숙소의 배급을 끊는 방식으로 조정관을 압박한다.","일화":"임초원을 태운 열차가 용산 창에 들어오자 선로 전환기를 잠그고 후국회의를 소집했다.","관계":"박태겸과 후계를 놓고 경쟁하며 임초원의 귀환 열차를 억류했다. 클라라 베넷을 가문 측 배차로 부리고, 황노을에게는 창동 차륜 공급을 조건으로 건다.","야망":"박태겸의 도제 승계를 무효로 돌리고 선로 가문이 후국회의의 최종 거부권을 세습하게 한다.","공포":"사방 강국이 용산을 전쟁터로 쓰면서 가문 창고의 환적 독점까지 빼앗기는 것.","개입":"전환기 열쇠를 훔치거나, 가문회의에서 양자 승계를 공개 지지할 수 있다."},"biography":"가문의 궤도를 혈통으로 보고 양자를 손님으로 대한다. 겉으로는 예의를 지키지만 배차 거부권만은 절대 놓지 않는다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 본부장\n- 생업: 선로 봉쇄 승인·전환기 통제\n- 직함: 선로 가문 원로\n**생애.** 2059년생인 알렉산더 밀러는 2126년 개막기에 선로 가문 원로 업무를 맡는다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 선로 가문 원로 업무는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직을 계기로 시작됐다. 유럽계 미국인 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 제임스 밀러는 2026년 용산·이태원에서 미 육군 보급 업무를 맡다가 연락망 단절을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 알렉산더 밀러의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 알렉산더 밀러의 선로 봉쇄 승인·전환기 통제 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 본부장. 직함은 선로 가문 원로. 가문 회의에서만 선로 봉쇄를 승인하고, 도제 숙소의 배급을 끊는 방식으로 조정관을 압박한다.\n\n**일화.** 임초원을 태운 열차가 용산 창에 들어오자 선로 전환기를 잠그고 후국회의를 소집했다.\n\n**관계.** 박태겸과 후계를 놓고 경쟁하며 임초원의 귀환 열차를 억류했다. 클라라 베넷을 가문 측 배차로 부리고, 황노을에게는 창동 차륜 공급을 조건으로 건다.\n\n**야망.** 박태겸의 도제 승계를 무효로 돌리고 선로 가문이 후국회의의 최종 거부권을 세습하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 사방 강국이 용산을 전쟁터로 쓰면서 가문 창고의 환적 독점까지 빼앗기는 것.\n\n**개입.** 전환기 열쇠를 훔치거나, 가문회의에서 양자 승계를 공개 지지할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 25 | 무력 −10 | 물질 20 | 공동 0 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −15 | 자격 35 | 분산 5 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −25 | 과시 −15 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"알렉산더 밀러","type":"경쟁","to":"박태겸","basis":"선로 가문 후계를 역장과 겨룸"},{"from":"알렉산더 밀러","type":"원한","to":"임초원","basis":"귀환 열차를 억류한 원한"}],"incoming":[{"from":"클라라 베넷","type":"지휘","to":"알렉산더 밀러","basis":"가문 배차 지휘를 받음"},{"from":"황노을","type":"계약","to":"알렉산더 밀러","basis":"차륜 공급 조건을 선로 가문과 거래"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0172', NULL, '{"id":"person-0172","name":"Eva Novakova","title":"Train Dispatcher","position":"Train Dispatcher","characterId":"K171","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Train Boarding Verification and Window Occupancy Dispatch","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#person-Eva Novakova","detailRoute":"/people/person-0172","birthDate":"2076-07-30","birthday":"07-30","age":50,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":11,"effective":11},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"train-dispatch","name":"Train dispatch","rating":70},{"id":"boarding-verification","name":"Boarding verification","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k171-disposition","name":"Strict about timing","description":"Pragmatic, she dealt harshly with anyone who broke the timetable. Any faction''s train, if it kept its hour, she took without asking its face.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: train dispatcher. She took apprentice boarding instead of mutual hostages as proof and held one-way trains at the warehouse for a day.","stress":"Fear. That Han Jaemok''s rail contract would turn into a monopoly clause and the dispatch authority would be sucked under the water gates.","relationship":"Relations. Ran Han Jaemok''s western rail contract under Park Taegyeom''s command. Left the contract notarization to Oh Seoyul and split the warehouse transshipment order with Lukas Schneider.","effects":[]},{"id":"k171-choice","name":"Operating terms before faction","description":"Anecdote. When the news of the Ttukseom water contract''s expiry was pasted on the Yongsan dispatch board, the western water train demanded one more day of warehouse occupation.","behavior":"Relations. Ran Han Jaemok''s western rail contract under Park Taegyeom''s command. Left the contract notarization to Oh Seoyul and split the warehouse transshipment order with Lukas Schneider.","stress":"Fear. That Han Jaemok''s rail contract would turn into a monopoly clause and the dispatch authority would be sucked under the water gates.","relationship":"Relations. Ran Han Jaemok''s western rail contract under Park Taegyeom''s command. Left the contract notarization to Oh Seoyul and split the warehouse transshipment order with Lukas Schneider.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She accepts boarding proof instead of hostages and holds one-way trains. She administers contract and transfer order; resolution of the siding claim is unconfirmed.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":10,"Force":0,"Material":25,"Communal":-5,"Principle":-5,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":40,"Dispersed":-5,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":25,"Display":25,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Livelihood":"Train Boarding Verification and Window Occupancy Dispatch","Title":"Train Dispatcher","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness 10 | Force 0 | Material 25 | Communal −5 | Principle −5 | Disclosure −15 | Credentials 40 | Dispersion −5 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 30 | Monopoly −20 | Risk 25 | Display 25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Monogamous Marriage"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in 2076, Eva Novakova takes up the duties of train dispatcher in the opening period of 2126. She grew up on Sinnae transfer duty. Her work as train dispatcher began with stopping a ticketless departing train. Her Czech family line is rooted in the Yongsan-Itaewon living area. Karel Novak worked in Itaewon lodging and private technical services in Yongsan-Itaewon around 2026 and lived through the Great Blackout. The family passed down records of their residence and goods handovers to the next generation, and Eva Novakova''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the daily ledgers of the time. They speak Czech at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Eva Novakova''s work of verifying train boarding proof and dispatching window occupancy is tied to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Train Dispatcher. Instead of mutual hostages, she accepts an apprentice''s boarding as proof, and holds trains that arrive one-way only at the window for a day.","Anecdote":"When news of the expiry of the Ttukseom water-supply contract was posted on the Yongsan dispatch board, the western water train demanded another day of window occupancy.","Relationships":"Under Bak Taegyeom''s command, she administers Han Jaemok''s western railway contract. She entrusts contract notarization to O Seoyul and shares the warehouse transshipment order with Lucas Schneider.","Ambition":"To bind the western water trains and the eastern munitions trains onto the same dispatch table, leaving Yongsan as an essential relay outside the Floodgate Charter.","Fear":"That Han Jaemok''s railway contract will be turned into a monopoly clause, sucking dispatch authority down beneath the floodgate.","Intervention":"She can mediate the water train''s window occupancy, or hand the secret monopoly dispatch pact over to the Records Office."},"biography":"Pragmatic, but harsh on anyone who breaks the timetable. She shows no favoritism to any faction''s train as long as it keeps to time.\n\n- Affiliation: Transshipment Bureau\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Occupation: Verifying train boarding proof and dispatching window occupancy\n- Title: Train Dispatcher\n**Life.** Born in 2076, Eva Novakova takes up the duties of train dispatcher in the opening period of 2126. She grew up on Sinnae transfer duty. Her work as train dispatcher began with stopping a ticketless departing train. Her Czech family line is rooted in the Yongsan-Itaewon living area. Karel Novak worked in Itaewon lodging and private technical services in Yongsan-Itaewon around 2026 and lived through the Great Blackout. The family passed down records of their residence and goods handovers to the next generation, and Eva Novakova''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the daily ledgers of the time. They speak Czech at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Eva Novakova''s work of verifying train boarding proof and dispatching window occupancy is tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Train Dispatcher. Instead of mutual hostages, she accepts an apprentice''s boarding as proof, and holds trains that arrive one-way only at the window for a day.\n\n**Anecdote.** When news of the expiry of the Ttukseom water-supply contract was posted on the Yongsan dispatch board, the western water train demanded another day of window occupancy.\n\n**Relationships.** Under Bak Taegyeom''s command, she administers Han Jaemok''s western railway contract. She entrusts contract notarization to O Seoyul and shares the warehouse transshipment order with Lucas Schneider.\n\n**Ambition.** To bind the western water trains and the eastern munitions trains onto the same dispatch table, leaving Yongsan as an essential relay outside the Floodgate Charter.\n\n**Fear.** That Han Jaemok''s railway contract will be turned into a monopoly clause, sucking dispatch authority down beneath the floodgate.\n\n**Intervention.** She can mediate the water train''s window occupancy, or hand the secret monopoly dispatch pact over to the Records Office.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness 10 | Force 0 | Material 25 | Communal −5 | Principle −5 | Disclosure −15 | Credentials 40 | Dispersion −5 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Monopoly −20 | Risk 25 | Display 25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Monogamous Marriage\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Eva Novakova","type":"Command","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Operates the western railway contracts through dispatch"},{"from":"Eva Novakova","type":"Contract","to":"O Seo-yul","basis":"Entrusts railway contract notarization to the Records Office"}],"incoming":[{"from":"O Seo-yul","type":"Contract","to":"Eva Novakova","basis":"Trades Yongsan railway contract notarization"},{"from":"Isabel Garcia","type":"Contract","to":"Eva Novakova","basis":"Isabel Garcia reports an unsigned train departure to Eva Novakova. Eva Novakova checks the occupied window and the boarding proof, and does not record an entry lacking a departure handover as a completed run."},{"from":"Mateusz Kowalski","type":"Command","to":"Eva Novakova","basis":"Enforcing Eva Novakova''s dispatch order on the platform,"},{"from":"Ana Hierophantscu","type":"Oath","to":"Eva Novakova","basis":"Posting testimony on Eva Novakova''s dispatch board, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0172","name":"에바 노바코바","title":"열차 배차원","position":"열차 배차원","characterId":"K171","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"열차 탑승 증명·창 점유 배차","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-에바 노바코바","detailRoute":"/people/person-0172","birthDate":"2076-07-30","birthday":"07-30","age":50,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":11,"effective":11},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"train-dispatch","name":"열차 배차","rating":70},{"id":"boarding-verification","name":"탑승 증명 확인","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k171-disposition","name":"시간 준수에 엄격함","description":"실리적이나 시각표를 어기는 사람을 가혹하게 다룬다. 어느 진영 열차든 시간을 지키면 얼굴을 가리지 않는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 열차 배차원. 상호 인질 대신 도제 탑승을 증명으로 받고, 편도만 온 열차는 창에서 하루를 묶는다.","stress":"공포. 한재목의 철도계약이 독점 조항으로 바뀌어 배차권이 수문 아래로 빨려 들어가는 것.","relationship":"관계. 박태겸의 지휘로 한재목의 서부 철도계약을 운용한다. 오서율에게 계약 공증을 맡기고, 루카스 슈나이더와 창고 환적 순서를 나눈다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k171-choice","name":"진영보다 운행 조건","description":"일화. 뚝섬 급수계약 만료 소식이 용산 배차판에 붙자 서부 급수열차가 창 점유를 하루 더 요구했다.","behavior":"관계. 박태겸의 지휘로 한재목의 서부 철도계약을 운용한다. 오서율에게 계약 공증을 맡기고, 루카스 슈나이더와 창고 환적 순서를 나눈다.","stress":"공포. 한재목의 철도계약이 독점 조항으로 바뀌어 배차권이 수문 아래로 빨려 들어가는 것.","relationship":"관계. 박태겸의 지휘로 한재목의 서부 철도계약을 운용한다. 오서율에게 계약 공증을 맡기고, 루카스 슈나이더와 창고 환적 순서를 나눈다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"탑승 증명을 인질 대신 받고 편도 열차를 묶는다. 계약과 환적 순서를 운용하지만 창 점유 요구를 해결한 성과는 미확인이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":10,"무력":0,"물질":25,"공동":-5,"원칙":-5,"공개":-15,"자격":40,"분산":-5,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-20,"위험":25,"과시":25,"지속":0,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"주사","생업":"열차 탑승 증명·창 점유 배차","직함":"열차 배차원","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 10 | 무력 0 | 물질 25 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −15 | 자격 40 | 분산 −5 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 −20 | 위험 25 | 과시 25 | 지속 0 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2076년생인 에바 노바코바는 2126년 개막기에 열차 배차원 업무를 맡는다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 열차 배차원 업무는 무표 출발 열차 저지를 계기로 시작됐다. 체코계 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 카렐 노바크는 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 이태원 숙박·민간 기술 용역 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 에바 노바코바의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 체코어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 에바 노바코바의 열차 탑승 증명·창 점유 배차 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 열차 배차원. 상호 인질 대신 도제 탑승을 증명으로 받고, 편도만 온 열차는 창에서 하루를 묶는다.","일화":"뚝섬 급수계약 만료 소식이 용산 배차판에 붙자 서부 급수열차가 창 점유를 하루 더 요구했다.","관계":"박태겸의 지휘로 한재목의 서부 철도계약을 운용한다. 오서율에게 계약 공증을 맡기고, 루카스 슈나이더와 창고 환적 순서를 나눈다.","야망":"서부 급수열차와 동부 군수열차를 같은 배차표에 묶어 용산을 수문헌장 밖의 필수 중계로 남긴다.","공포":"한재목의 철도계약이 독점 조항으로 바뀌어 배차권이 수문 아래로 빨려 들어가는 것.","개입":"급수열차의 창 점유를 중재하거나, 독점 배차 밀약을 기록청에 넘길 수 있다."},"biography":"실리적이나 시각표를 어기는 사람을 가혹하게 다룬다. 어느 진영 열차든 시간을 지키면 얼굴을 가리지 않는다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 주사\n- 생업: 열차 탑승 증명·창 점유 배차\n- 직함: 열차 배차원\n**생애.** 2076년생인 에바 노바코바는 2126년 개막기에 열차 배차원 업무를 맡는다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 열차 배차원 업무는 무표 출발 열차 저지를 계기로 시작됐다. 체코계 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 카렐 노바크는 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 이태원 숙박·민간 기술 용역 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 에바 노바코바의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 체코어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 에바 노바코바의 열차 탑승 증명·창 점유 배차 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 열차 배차원. 상호 인질 대신 도제 탑승을 증명으로 받고, 편도만 온 열차는 창에서 하루를 묶는다.\n\n**일화.** 뚝섬 급수계약 만료 소식이 용산 배차판에 붙자 서부 급수열차가 창 점유를 하루 더 요구했다.\n\n**관계.** 박태겸의 지휘로 한재목의 서부 철도계약을 운용한다. 오서율에게 계약 공증을 맡기고, 루카스 슈나이더와 창고 환적 순서를 나눈다.\n\n**야망.** 서부 급수열차와 동부 군수열차를 같은 배차표에 묶어 용산을 수문헌장 밖의 필수 중계로 남긴다.\n\n**공포.** 한재목의 철도계약이 독점 조항으로 바뀌어 배차권이 수문 아래로 빨려 들어가는 것.\n\n**개입.** 급수열차의 창 점유를 중재하거나, 독점 배차 밀약을 기록청에 넘길 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 10 | 무력 0 | 물질 25 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −15 | 자격 40 | 분산 −5 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 −20 | 위험 25 | 과시 25 | 지속 0 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"에바 노바코바","type":"지휘","to":"박태겸","basis":"서부 철도계약을 배차에서 운용"},{"from":"에바 노바코바","type":"계약","to":"오서율","basis":"철도계약 공증을 기록청에 맡김"}],"incoming":[{"from":"오서율","type":"계약","to":"에바 노바코바","basis":"용산 철도계약 공증을 거래"},{"from":"이사벨 가르시아","type":"계약","to":"에바 노바코바","basis":"이사벨 가르시아는 서명 없는 열차 출발을 에바 노바코바에게 알린다. 에바 노바코바는 점유 창과 탑승 증명을 확인해 출발 인수가 없는 기록을 완료 운행으로 적지 않는다."},{"from":"마테우시 코발스키","type":"지휘","to":"에바 노바코바","basis":"에바 노바코바의 배차 순서를 승강장에서 집행하며"},{"from":"아나 포페스쿠","type":"맹세","to":"에바 노바코바","basis":"에바 노바코바의 배차판에 증언을 붙이고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0173', NULL, '{"id":"person-0173","name":"Isaac Walker","title":"Track Apprentice","position":"Track Apprentice","characterId":"K172","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Track Maintenance Log and Brake Inspection","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#person-Isaac Walker","detailRoute":"/people/person-0173","birthDate":"2095-11-30","birthday":"11-30","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"rail-maintenance-training","name":"Rail maintenance training","rating":45},{"id":"maintenance-logs","name":"Maintenance logging","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k172-disposition","name":"Proving oneself through craft","description":"Calm and precise of hand, he went quiet before the house. He carried a compulsion to prove his place by skill.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: track apprentice. He published the maintenance logs and took the house elders'' verbal orders down again as sentences.","stress":"Fear. That he would be consumed as the bait apprentice meant to draw in Im Chowon.","relationship":"Relations. Park Taegyeom''s apprentice, he passed through the Changdong exchange training with I Hongwon. Shared brake parts with Song Hayul and took Alexander Miller''s ration pressure.","effects":[]},{"id":"k172-choice","name":"Recording oral orders","description":"Anecdote. Orders fell at once — to entrust the detained train''s brake inspection to the apprentice, and the house command not to touch it.","behavior":"Relations. Park Taegyeom''s apprentice, he passed through the Changdong exchange training with I Hongwon. Shared brake parts with Song Hayul and took Alexander Miller''s ration pressure.","stress":"Fear. That he would be consumed as the bait apprentice meant to draw in Im Chowon.","relationship":"Relations. Park Taegyeom''s apprentice, he passed through the Changdong exchange training with I Hongwon. Shared brake parts with Song Hayul and took Alexander Miller''s ration pressure.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He completed exchange training, publishes logs and writes down elders’ orders. No repair result follows the conflicting brake orders, limiting the skill estimate.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":5,"Openness":25,"Force":0,"Material":25,"Communal":0,"Principle":-5,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":25,"Risk":-10,"Display":-10,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Livelihood":"Track Maintenance Log and Brake Inspection","Title":"Track Apprentice","Values":"Authority 5 | Openness 25 | Force 0 | Material 25 | Community 0 | Principle −5 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 60 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Craving 0 | Monopoly 25 | Risk −10 | Display −10 | Persistence −15 | Orientation bisexual | Union polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in 2095, Isaac Walker takes up track apprentice duties in the 2126 opening period. He grew up on waiting-room duty. His track apprentice work began with a substitute shift covering an unexcused absence. His African American family has roots in the Yongsan·Itaewon district. Samuel Walker was handling US Army supply work in Yongsan·Itaewon in 2026 when communications were cut. The family passed their shelter and goods-handover records on to the next generation, and Isaac Walker''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the living ledgers of their day. They speak English at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Isaac Walker''s track maintenance log and brake inspection work is connected to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Jusa. Title: Track Apprentice. He makes the maintenance log public and writes the clan elders'' verbal instructions back out as full sentences.","Anecdote":"An order to entrust the brake inspection of the train holding Im Chowon in detention to the apprentice, and a clan order not to touch it, came down at the same time.","Relationships":"He is Bak Taegyeom''s apprentice and went through the exchange training in Changdong arranged with Yi Hongwon. He shares brake parts with Song Hayul and is under ration pressure from Alexander Miller.","Ambition":"He aims to become heir through Bak Taegyeom''s adopted-engineer path and erase the blood-kin track clans'' veto from the dispatch schedule.","Fear":"Being used up as a bait apprentice to lure in Im Chowon.","Intervention":"He can testify to the apprentice''s maintenance authority, or spirit him out to Changdong and shake up the clan council."},"biography":"Calm and precise with his hands, but his voice shrinks in front of the clan. He is obsessed with the need to prove his place through skill.\n\n- Affiliation: Transshipment Bureau\n- Rank: Jusa\n- Livelihood: Track maintenance log · brake inspection\n- Title: Track Apprentice\n**Life.** Born in 2095, Isaac Walker takes up track apprentice duties in the 2126 opening period. He grew up on waiting-room duty. His track apprentice work began with a substitute shift covering an unexcused absence. His African American family has roots in the Yongsan·Itaewon district. Samuel Walker was handling US Army supply work in Yongsan·Itaewon in 2026 when communications were cut. The family passed their shelter and goods-handover records on to the next generation, and Isaac Walker''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the living ledgers of their day. They speak English at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Isaac Walker''s track maintenance log and brake inspection work is connected to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Jusa. Title: Track Apprentice. He makes the maintenance log public and writes the clan elders'' verbal instructions back out as full sentences.\n\n**Anecdote.** An order to entrust the brake inspection of the train holding Im Chowon in detention to the apprentice, and a clan order not to touch it, came down at the same time.\n\n**Relationships.** He is Bak Taegyeom''s apprentice and went through the exchange training in Changdong arranged with Yi Hongwon. He shares brake parts with Song Hayul and is under ration pressure from Alexander Miller.\n\n**Ambition.** He aims to become heir through Bak Taegyeom''s adopted-engineer path and erase the blood-kin track clans'' veto from the dispatch schedule.\n\n**Fear.** Being used up as a bait apprentice to lure in Im Chowon.\n\n**Intervention.** He can testify to the apprentice''s maintenance authority, or spirit him out to Changdong and shake up the clan council.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 5 | Openness 25 | Force 0 | Material 25 | Community 0 | Principle −5 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 60 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly 25 | Risk −10 | Display −10 | Persistence −15 | Orientation bisexual | Union polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Isaac Walker","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Trains under the Station Master as a rail apprentice"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Jo Eunu","type":"Contract","to":"Isaac Walker","basis":"Using the train radio as evidence of jamming"},{"from":"Song Ha-yul","type":"Contract","to":"Isaac Walker","basis":"Sharing brake parts with the Yongsan apprentices"},{"from":"Mykola Bondarenko","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Isaac Walker","basis":"A priest who enforces Isaac Walker''s maintenance log on the ground, and"},{"from":"Gabriel Johnson","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Isaac Walker","basis":"Supports Isaac Walker''s apprentice quarters with medical care, and"},{"from":"Oleksandr Shevchenko","type":"Contract","to":"Isaac Walker","basis":"Receives Isaac Walker''s maintenance log as grounds for an accusation, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0173","name":"아이작 워커","title":"선로 도제","position":"선로 도제","characterId":"K172","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"선로 정비 일지·제동 점검","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-아이작 워커","detailRoute":"/people/person-0173","birthDate":"2095-11-30","birthday":"11-30","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"rail-maintenance-training","name":"선로 정비 수련","rating":45},{"id":"maintenance-logs","name":"정비 일지 작성","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k172-disposition","name":"숙련으로 증명함","description":"침착하고 손끝이 정확하지만 가문 앞에서 목소리가 작아진다. 숙련으로 자리를 증명해야 한다는 강박이 있다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 선로 도제. 정비 일지를 공개하고 가문 원로의 구두 지시를 문장으로 다시 받아 적는다.","stress":"공포. 자신이 임초원을 끌어들이기 위한 미끼 도제로 소비되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 박태겸의 도제이며 이홍원과 교환된 창동 수련을 거쳤다. 송하율과 제동 부품을 나누고, 알렉산더 밀러의 배급 압박을 받는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k172-choice","name":"구두 명령을 기록함","description":"일화. 임초원 억류 열차의 제동 점검을 도제에게 맡기라는 명령과 손대지 말라는 가문 명령이 동시에 떨어졌다.","behavior":"관계. 박태겸의 도제이며 이홍원과 교환된 창동 수련을 거쳤다. 송하율과 제동 부품을 나누고, 알렉산더 밀러의 배급 압박을 받는다.","stress":"공포. 자신이 임초원을 끌어들이기 위한 미끼 도제로 소비되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 박태겸의 도제이며 이홍원과 교환된 창동 수련을 거쳤다. 송하율과 제동 부품을 나누고, 알렉산더 밀러의 배급 압박을 받는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"교환 수련을 거쳐 일지를 공개하고 원로의 지시를 문장으로 받는다. 상반된 제동 명령 뒤 실제 작업 결과는 없으므로 숙련을 제한했다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":5,"개방":25,"무력":0,"물질":25,"공동":0,"원칙":-5,"공개":-20,"자격":60,"분산":5,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":25,"위험":-10,"과시":-10,"지속":-15,"지향":"양성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"주사","생업":"선로 정비 일지·제동 점검","직함":"선로 도제","가치관":"권위 5 | 개방 25 | 무력 0 | 물질 25 | 공동 0 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −20 | 자격 60 | 분산 5 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 25 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −10 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2095년생인 아이작 워커는 2126년 개막기에 선로 도제 업무를 맡는다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 선로 도제 업무는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직을 계기로 시작됐다. 아프리카계 미국인 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 새뮤얼 워커는 2026년 용산·이태원에서 미 육군 보급 업무를 맡다가 연락망 단절을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 아이작 워커의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 아이작 워커의 선로 정비 일지·제동 점검 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 선로 도제. 정비 일지를 공개하고 가문 원로의 구두 지시를 문장으로 다시 받아 적는다.","일화":"임초원 억류 열차의 제동 점검을 도제에게 맡기라는 명령과 손대지 말라는 가문 명령이 동시에 떨어졌다.","관계":"박태겸의 도제이며 이홍원과 교환된 창동 수련을 거쳤다. 송하율과 제동 부품을 나누고, 알렉산더 밀러의 배급 압박을 받는다.","야망":"박태겸의 양자 기술자 경로로 후계가 되어 혈연 선로가문의 거부권을 배차표에서 지운다.","공포":"자신이 임초원을 끌어들이기 위한 미끼 도제로 소비되는 것.","개입":"도제의 정비 권한을 증언하거나, 그를 창동으로 빼내 가문 회의를 흔들 수 있다."},"biography":"침착하고 손끝이 정확하지만 가문 앞에서 목소리가 작아진다. 숙련으로 자리를 증명해야 한다는 강박이 있다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 주사\n- 생업: 선로 정비 일지·제동 점검\n- 직함: 선로 도제\n**생애.** 2095년생인 아이작 워커는 2126년 개막기에 선로 도제 업무를 맡는다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 선로 도제 업무는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직을 계기로 시작됐다. 아프리카계 미국인 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 새뮤얼 워커는 2026년 용산·이태원에서 미 육군 보급 업무를 맡다가 연락망 단절을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 아이작 워커의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 아이작 워커의 선로 정비 일지·제동 점검 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 선로 도제. 정비 일지를 공개하고 가문 원로의 구두 지시를 문장으로 다시 받아 적는다.\n\n**일화.** 임초원 억류 열차의 제동 점검을 도제에게 맡기라는 명령과 손대지 말라는 가문 명령이 동시에 떨어졌다.\n\n**관계.** 박태겸의 도제이며 이홍원과 교환된 창동 수련을 거쳤다. 송하율과 제동 부품을 나누고, 알렉산더 밀러의 배급 압박을 받는다.\n\n**야망.** 박태겸의 양자 기술자 경로로 후계가 되어 혈연 선로가문의 거부권을 배차표에서 지운다.\n\n**공포.** 자신이 임초원을 끌어들이기 위한 미끼 도제로 소비되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 도제의 정비 권한을 증언하거나, 그를 창동으로 빼내 가문 회의를 흔들 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 5 | 개방 25 | 무력 0 | 물질 25 | 공동 0 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −20 | 자격 60 | 분산 5 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 25 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −10 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"아이작 워커","type":"신도","to":"박태겸","basis":"선로 도제로 역장 밑에서 수련"}],"incoming":[{"from":"조은우","type":"계약","to":"아이작 워커","basis":"열차 무전을 재밍 증거로 삼음"},{"from":"송하율","type":"계약","to":"아이작 워커","basis":"제동 부품을 용산 도제와 나눔"},{"from":"미콜라 본다렌코","type":"신도","to":"아이작 워커","basis":"아이작 워커의 정비 일지를 현장에서 집행하는 신도이고"},{"from":"가브리엘 존슨","type":"신도","to":"아이작 워커","basis":"아이작 워커의 도제 숙소를 진료로 받치고"},{"from":"올렉산드르 셰우첸코","type":"계약","to":"아이작 워커","basis":"아이작 워커의 정비 일지를 고발 근거로 받고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0174', NULL, '{"id":"person-0174","name":"Lucas Schneider","title":"Transshipment Dispatcher","position":"Transshipment Dispatcher","characterId":"K173","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Verifying Transshipment Warehouse Temperature and Inventory","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#person-Lucas Schneider","detailRoute":"/people/person-0174","birthDate":"2071-09-26","birthday":"09-26","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"cold-stock-checks","name":"Cold stock inspection","rating":65},{"id":"transshipment-scheduling","name":"Transfer scheduling","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k173-disposition","name":"Keeping the keys close","description":"Sociable, but he never took the warehouse key off his body. He saw anyone who recorded an empty box as full as an enemy.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: transshipment dispatcher. He read the warehouse temperature aloud every two hours and sealed any house column caught with false inventory.","stress":"Fear. That on a power-less night the cold freight would melt and the post-state''s relay credit would fall in one day.","relationship":"Relations. Reported the warehouse lease ledger to Park Taegyeom and transshipped Seo Nayeon''s ice bricks. Matched convoy arrival hours with Sin Taesan.","effects":[]},{"id":"k173-choice","name":"Intolerance of false stock","description":"Anecdote. When the Noryangjin blackout rumor reached Yongsan, the cold-column tenants began pulling their freight out through the night.","behavior":"Relations. Reported the warehouse lease ledger to Park Taegyeom and transshipped Seo Nayeon''s ice bricks. Matched convoy arrival hours with Sin Taesan.","stress":"Fear. That on a power-less night the cold freight would melt and the post-state''s relay credit would fall in one day.","relationship":"Relations. Reported the warehouse lease ledger to Park Taegyeom and transshipped Seo Nayeon''s ice bricks. Matched convoy arrival hours with Sin Taesan.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He routinely publishes temperatures, blocks false stock bays and coordinates arrivals. Tenants’ night removals are not his achievement; independent credit remains an ambition.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":25,"Force":-15,"Material":20,"Communal":0,"Principle":-5,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":35,"Monopoly":-25,"Risk":40,"Display":5,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Livelihood":"Verifying Transshipment Warehouse Temperature and Inventory","Title":"Transshipment Dispatcher","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness 25 | Force −15 | Material 20 | Community 0 | Principle −5 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 35 | Possessiveness −25 | Risk 40 | Display 5 | Endurance 5 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Lucas Schneider, born in 2071, takes up the post of transshipment dispatcher in the opening period of 2126. He grew up at the Sinnae transfer duty station. The transshipment dispatcher post began after he stopped a ticketless departing train. His German-descended family is rooted in the Yongsan–Itaewon living sphere. Around 2026, Karl Schneider lived through the Great Blackout in Yongsan–Itaewon, working in Yongsan freight and private machinery maintenance. The family passed records of their lodgings and goods handovers to the next generation, and Lucas Schneider''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the household ledgers of their day. They speak German at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Lucas Schneider''s work verifying transshipment warehouse temperature and inventory is tied to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Jusa. Title: Transshipment Dispatcher. He reads the warehouse temperature aloud once every two hours, and if false inventory turns up, he seals the compartment of the clan responsible.","Anecdote":"When the rumor of a Noryangjin blackout reached Yongsan, the tenants of the refrigerated compartments began pulling their cargo out overnight.","Relationships":"He reports the warehouse lease ledger to Bak Taegyeom and transships Seo Nayeon''s ice bricks. He coordinates convoy arrival times with Sin Taesan.","Ambition":"He binds frozen cargo and e-waste recovery to Yongsan warehouse credit, creating a transshipment ledger separate from O Haerin''s payment authority.","Fear":"That on a night without power the frozen cargo will melt and the Vassal State''s relay credit will collapse in a single day.","Intervention":"He can supply ice and storage batteries, or seal and publicly expose the compartments that hid melted stock."},"biography":"Sociable, but he never lets the warehouse keys leave his person. He regards anyone who records an empty box as full as an enemy.\n\n- Affiliation: Transshipment Bureau\n- Rank: Jusa\n- Occupation: Transshipment warehouse temperature and inventory verification\n- Title: Transshipment Dispatcher\n**Life.** Lucas Schneider, born in 2071, takes up the post of transshipment dispatcher in the opening period of 2126. He grew up at the Sinnae transfer duty station. The transshipment dispatcher post began after he stopped a ticketless departing train. His German-descended family is rooted in the Yongsan–Itaewon living sphere. Around 2026, Karl Schneider lived through the Great Blackout in Yongsan–Itaewon, working in Yongsan freight and private machinery maintenance. The family passed records of their lodgings and goods handovers to the next generation, and Lucas Schneider''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the household ledgers of their day. They speak German at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Lucas Schneider''s work verifying transshipment warehouse temperature and inventory is tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Jusa. Title: Transshipment Dispatcher. He reads the warehouse temperature aloud once every two hours, and if false inventory turns up, he seals the compartment of the clan responsible.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the rumor of a Noryangjin blackout reached Yongsan, the tenants of the refrigerated compartments began pulling their cargo out overnight.\n\n**Relations.** He reports the warehouse lease ledger to Bak Taegyeom and transships Seo Nayeon''s ice bricks. He coordinates convoy arrival times with Sin Taesan.\n\n**Ambition.** He binds frozen cargo and e-waste recovery to Yongsan warehouse credit, creating a transshipment ledger separate from O Haerin''s payment authority.\n\n**Fear.** That on a night without power the frozen cargo will melt and the Vassal State''s relay credit will collapse in a single day.\n\n**Intervention.** He can supply ice and storage batteries, or seal and publicly expose the compartments that hid melted stock.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness 25 | Force −15 | Material 20 | Communal 0 | Principle −5 | Publicness −20 | Credentials 20 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 35 | Possessiveness −25 | Risk 40 | Display 5 | Endurance 5 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Lucas Schneider","type":"Command","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Reports the warehouse lease ledger to the Station Master"},{"from":"Lucas Schneider","type":"Contract","to":"Seo Na-yeon","basis":"Received the ice bricks at the transshipment window"},{"from":"Lucas Schneider","type":"Contract","to":"Sin Tae-san","basis":"Coordinated the convoy arrival times"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Jo Min-jae","type":"Contract","to":"Lucas Schneider","basis":"Entrusted the frozen cargo to Yongsan transshipment"},{"from":"Sin Tae-san","type":"Contract","to":"Lucas Schneider","basis":"Handed over the convoy at the transshipment window"},{"from":"Natalya Sokolova","type":"Command","to":"Lucas Schneider","basis":"is a contract that enforces Lucas Schneider''s transshipment sequence on site, and"},{"from":"André Dubois","type":"Command","to":"Lucas Schneider","basis":"receives a command to supply power to Lucas Schneider''s warehouse temperature, and"},{"from":"Philipp Müller","type":"Oath","to":"Lucas Schneider","basis":"overlays the agreed weight onto Lucas Schneider''s warehouse lease ledger, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0174","name":"루카스 슈나이더","title":"환적 배차원","position":"환적 배차원","characterId":"K173","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"환적창고 온도·재고 검증","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-루카스 슈나이더","detailRoute":"/people/person-0174","birthDate":"2071-09-26","birthday":"09-26","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"cold-stock-checks","name":"냉동 재고 점검","rating":65},{"id":"transshipment-scheduling","name":"환적 순서 조정","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k173-disposition","name":"열쇠를 놓지 않음","description":"사교적이지만 창고 열쇠는 몸에서 떼지 않는다. 빈 상자를 가득 찬 것처럼 적는 사람을 원수로 본다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 환적 배차원. 창고 온도를 두 시간에 한 번 소리 내어 읽고, 허위 재고가 나오면 해당 가문 칸을 봉쇄한다.","stress":"공포. 전력 없는 밤에 냉동 화물이 녹아 후국의 중계 신용이 하루 만에 무너지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 박태겸에게 창고 임대 장부를 보고하고 서나연의 얼음 벽돌을 환적한다. 신태산과는 호송 도착 시각을 맞춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k173-choice","name":"허위 재고 불관용","description":"일화. 노량진 정전 소문이 용산에 닿자 냉동 칸 임차인들이 화물을 밤사이에 빼내기 시작했다.","behavior":"관계. 박태겸에게 창고 임대 장부를 보고하고 서나연의 얼음 벽돌을 환적한다. 신태산과는 호송 도착 시각을 맞춘다.","stress":"공포. 전력 없는 밤에 냉동 화물이 녹아 후국의 중계 신용이 하루 만에 무너지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 박태겸에게 창고 임대 장부를 보고하고 서나연의 얼음 벽돌을 환적한다. 신태산과는 호송 도착 시각을 맞춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"온도 공개와 허위 칸 봉쇄를 반복하고 호송 시각을 맞춘다. 임차인의 야간 반출은 그의 성취가 아니며 독립 신용 원장은 야망이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":25,"무력":-15,"물질":20,"공동":0,"원칙":-5,"공개":-20,"자격":20,"분산":5,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":35,"독점":-25,"위험":40,"과시":5,"지속":5,"지향":"동성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"주사","생업":"환적창고 온도·재고 검증","직함":"환적 배차원","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 25 | 무력 −15 | 물질 20 | 공동 0 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −20 | 자격 20 | 분산 5 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 35 | 독점 −25 | 위험 40 | 과시 5 | 지속 5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2071년생인 루카스 슈나이더는 2126년 개막기에 환적 배차원 업무를 맡는다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 환적 배차원 업무는 무표 출발 열차 저지를 계기로 시작됐다. 독일계 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 카를 슈나이더는 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 용산 화물·민간 기계 정비 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 루카스 슈나이더의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 독일어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 루카스 슈나이더의 환적창고 온도·재고 검증 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 환적 배차원. 창고 온도를 두 시간에 한 번 소리 내어 읽고, 허위 재고가 나오면 해당 가문 칸을 봉쇄한다.","일화":"노량진 정전 소문이 용산에 닿자 냉동 칸 임차인들이 화물을 밤사이에 빼내기 시작했다.","관계":"박태겸에게 창고 임대 장부를 보고하고 서나연의 얼음 벽돌을 환적한다. 신태산과는 호송 도착 시각을 맞춘다.","야망":"냉동 화물과 폐전자 회수를 용산 창고 신용으로 묶어 오해린의 결제권과 별개인 환적 원장을 만든다.","공포":"전력 없는 밤에 냉동 화물이 녹아 후국의 중계 신용이 하루 만에 무너지는 것.","개입":"얼음과 축전지를 보급하거나, 녹은 재고를 숨긴 칸을 봉인해 공개할 수 있다."},"biography":"사교적이지만 창고 열쇠는 몸에서 떼지 않는다. 빈 상자를 가득 찬 것처럼 적는 사람을 원수로 본다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 주사\n- 생업: 환적창고 온도·재고 검증\n- 직함: 환적 배차원\n**생애.** 2071년생인 루카스 슈나이더는 2126년 개막기에 환적 배차원 업무를 맡는다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 환적 배차원 업무는 무표 출발 열차 저지를 계기로 시작됐다. 독일계 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 카를 슈나이더는 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 용산 화물·민간 기계 정비 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 루카스 슈나이더의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 독일어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 루카스 슈나이더의 환적창고 온도·재고 검증 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 환적 배차원. 창고 온도를 두 시간에 한 번 소리 내어 읽고, 허위 재고가 나오면 해당 가문 칸을 봉쇄한다.\n\n**일화.** 노량진 정전 소문이 용산에 닿자 냉동 칸 임차인들이 화물을 밤사이에 빼내기 시작했다.\n\n**관계.** 박태겸에게 창고 임대 장부를 보고하고 서나연의 얼음 벽돌을 환적한다. 신태산과는 호송 도착 시각을 맞춘다.\n\n**야망.** 냉동 화물과 폐전자 회수를 용산 창고 신용으로 묶어 오해린의 결제권과 별개인 환적 원장을 만든다.\n\n**공포.** 전력 없는 밤에 냉동 화물이 녹아 후국의 중계 신용이 하루 만에 무너지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 얼음과 축전지를 보급하거나, 녹은 재고를 숨긴 칸을 봉인해 공개할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 25 | 무력 −15 | 물질 20 | 공동 0 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −20 | 자격 20 | 분산 5 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 35 | 독점 −25 | 위험 40 | 과시 5 | 지속 5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"루카스 슈나이더","type":"지휘","to":"박태겸","basis":"창고 임대 장부를 역장에게 보고"},{"from":"루카스 슈나이더","type":"계약","to":"서나연","basis":"얼음 벽돌을 환적 창에서 받음"},{"from":"루카스 슈나이더","type":"계약","to":"신태산","basis":"호송 도착 시각을 맞춤"}],"incoming":[{"from":"조민재","type":"계약","to":"루카스 슈나이더","basis":"냉동 화물을 용산 환적에 맡김"},{"from":"신태산","type":"계약","to":"루카스 슈나이더","basis":"환적 창에서 호송을 인계"},{"from":"나탈리야 소콜로바","type":"지휘","to":"루카스 슈나이더","basis":"루카스 슈나이더의 환적 순서를 현장에서 집행하는 계약이고"},{"from":"앙드레 뒤부아","type":"지휘","to":"루카스 슈나이더","basis":"루카스 슈나이더의 창고 온도에 전력을 대는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"필리프 뮐러","type":"맹세","to":"루카스 슈나이더","basis":"루카스 슈나이더의 창고 임대 장부에 협약 중량을 겹치고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0175', NULL, '{"id":"person-0175","name":"Clara Bennett","title":"Rail Clan Dispatcher","position":"Rail Clan Dispatcher","characterId":"K174","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Dispatching Clan and Public Freight Cars and Operating Switches","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#person-Clara Bennett","detailRoute":"/people/person-0175","birthDate":"2096-08-08","birthday":"08-08","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"switch-dispatch","name":"Switch dispatch","rating":60},{"id":"information-trading","name":"Information trading","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k174-disposition","name":"Trading with both sides","description":"Bold and quick on opportunity. She used the house''s name as a shield while treating the Coordinator''s dispatch sheet like a blank.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: track house dispatcher. She mixed the dispatches of the house columns and the public columns and, at the last moment, opened whichever side the profit favored.","stress":"Fear. That betting on both sides would be caught and she would remain a hostage of the track blockade.","relationship":"Relations. Took Alexander Miller''s command but sold the house''s movements to Park Taegyeom and fell into debt. Carried the suspicion of having spirited out Jo Woochan''s Changdong trial wheels.","effects":[]},{"id":"k174-choice","name":"Last-minute profit choice","description":"Anecdote. A rumor was pasted on the dispatch board: one key of the detained train''s switch lay in the house vault, one in the Coordinator''s office.","behavior":"Relations. Took Alexander Miller''s command but sold the house''s movements to Park Taegyeom and fell into debt. Carried the suspicion of having spirited out Jo Woochan''s Changdong trial wheels.","stress":"Fear. That betting on both sides would be caught and she would remain a hostage of the track blockade.","relationship":"Relations. Took Alexander Miller''s command but sold the house''s movements to Park Taegyeom and fell into debt. Carried the suspicion of having spirited out Jo Woochan''s Changdong trial wheels.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She sells house information to the coordinator and switches toward the greater profit. Suspected wheel diversion is not counted as a performed skill.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":25,"Force":-15,"Material":15,"Communal":-10,"Principle":-10,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":35,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":30,"Display":-20,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Livelihood":"Dispatching Clan and Public Freight Cars and Operating Switches","Title":"Rail Clan Dispatcher","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 25 | Force −15 | Material 15 | Communal −10 | Principle −10 | Publicness −20 | Credentials 35 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 40 | Possessiveness −30 | Risk 30 | Display −20 | Endurance 20 | Orientation None | Union Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Clara Bennett, born in 2096, takes up the post of Track Clan Dispatcher in the opening period of 2126. She grew up at the Sinnae transfer duty station. The Track Clan Dispatcher post began after a ticketless departing train was stopped. Her English-descended family is rooted in the Yongsan–Itaewon living sphere. Around 2026, George Bennett lived through the Great Blackout in Yongsan–Itaewon, working in private lodging and interpreting in Itaewon. The family passed records of their lodgings and goods handovers to the next generation, and Clara Bennett''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the household ledgers of their day. They speak English at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Clara Bennett''s work dispatching clan and public freight cars and operating switches is tied to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Jusa. Title: Track Clan Dispatcher. She mixes the dispatching of clan compartments and public compartments, then at the last moment opens the switch toward whichever side pays more.","Anecdote":"A rumor was posted on the dispatch board that the switch keys for the detained train were split, one in the clan vault and one in the Coordinator''s office.","Relationships":"She takes orders from Alexander Miller but fell into debt to Bak Taegyeom by selling him clan movements. She is suspected of diverting Changdong test wheels to Jo Uchan.","Ambition":"By trading the clan veto and Bak Taegyeom''s apprenticeship succession at the same time, she aims to hold the Vassal State Council''s real dispatch key herself.","Fear":"Being caught playing both sides and ending up a hostage of the Track Blockade Corps.","Intervention":"She can choose which side''s key to keep alive, or lay out the double-dealing dispatch ledger before the Vassal State Council."},"biography":"Bold and quick to seize an opportunity. She uses her clan''s name as a shield, yet treats the Coordinator''s dispatch slips like blank forms.\n\n- Affiliation: Transshipment Bureau\n- Rank: Jusa\n- Occupation: Clan and public freight car dispatch and switch operation\n- Title: Track Clan Dispatcher\n**Life.** Clara Bennett, born in 2096, takes up the post of Track Clan Dispatcher in the opening period of 2126. She grew up at the Sinnae transfer duty station. The Track Clan Dispatcher post began after a ticketless departing train was stopped. Her English-descended family is rooted in the Yongsan–Itaewon living sphere. Around 2026, George Bennett lived through the Great Blackout in Yongsan–Itaewon, working in private lodging and interpreting in Itaewon. The family passed records of their lodgings and goods handovers to the next generation, and Clara Bennett''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the household ledgers of their day. They speak English at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Clara Bennett''s work dispatching clan and public freight cars and operating switches is tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Jusa. Title: Track Clan Dispatcher. She mixes the dispatching of clan compartments and public compartments, then at the last moment opens the switch toward whichever side pays more.\n\n**Anecdote.** A rumor was posted on the dispatch board that the switch keys for the detained train were split, one in the clan vault and one in the Coordinator''s office.\n\n**Relations.** She takes orders from Alexander Miller but fell into debt to Bak Taegyeom by selling him clan movements. She is suspected of diverting Changdong test wheels to Jo Uchan.\n\n**Ambition.** By trading the clan veto and Bak Taegyeom''s apprenticeship succession at the same time, she aims to hold the Vassal State Council''s real dispatch key herself.\n\n**Fear.** Being caught playing both sides and ending up a hostage of the Track Blockade Corps.\n\n**Intervention.** She can choose which side''s key to keep alive, or lay out the double-dealing dispatch ledger before the Vassal State Council.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 25 | Force −15 | Material 15 | Communal −10 | Principle −10 | Publicness −20 | Credentials 35 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Possessiveness −30 | Risk 30 | Display −20 | Endurance 20 | Orientation None | Union Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Clara Bennett","type":"Command","to":"Alexander Miller","basis":"Receives clan dispatch orders"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Jo U-chan","type":"Grudge","to":"Clara Bennett","basis":"Grudge over the suspected test-wheel leak"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0175","name":"클라라 베넷","title":"선로 가문 배차원","position":"선로 가문 배차원","characterId":"K174","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"가문·공공 화차 배차와 전환기 운영","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-클라라 베넷","detailRoute":"/people/person-0175","birthDate":"2096-08-08","birthday":"08-08","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"switch-dispatch","name":"전환기 배차","rating":60},{"id":"information-trading","name":"동향 거래","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k174-disposition","name":"양편에 거래함","description":"대담하고 기회에 빠르다. 가문의 이름을 방패로 쓰면서도 조정관의 배차표를 빈칸처럼 다룬다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 선로 가문 배차원. 가문 칸과 공공 칸의 배차를 섞어 놓고, 막판에 전환기로 이익이 큰 쪽을 연다.","stress":"공포. 양편을 걸다 들켜 선로 봉쇄대의 인질로 남는 것.","relationship":"관계. 알렉산더 밀러의 지휘를 받지만 박태겸에게 가문 동향을 팔아 빚을 졌다. 조우찬에게 창동 시험 차륜을 빼돌린 의혹이 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k174-choice","name":"막판 이익 선택","description":"일화. 억류 열차의 전환기 키가 가문 금고와 조정관실에 하나씩 있다는 소문이 배차판에 붙었다.","behavior":"관계. 알렉산더 밀러의 지휘를 받지만 박태겸에게 가문 동향을 팔아 빚을 졌다. 조우찬에게 창동 시험 차륜을 빼돌린 의혹이 있다.","stress":"공포. 양편을 걸다 들켜 선로 봉쇄대의 인질로 남는 것.","relationship":"관계. 알렉산더 밀러의 지휘를 받지만 박태겸에게 가문 동향을 팔아 빚을 졌다. 조우찬에게 창동 시험 차륜을 빼돌린 의혹이 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"가문 지휘 아래서 동향을 조정관에게 팔고 이익이 큰 쪽으로 전환기를 연다. 차륜 유출은 의혹으로 남겨 실제 숙련으로 계산하지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":25,"무력":-15,"물질":15,"공동":-10,"원칙":-10,"공개":-20,"자격":35,"분산":5,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":-30,"위험":30,"과시":-20,"지속":20,"지향":"무성향","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"주사","생업":"가문·공공 화차 배차와 전환기 운영","직함":"선로 가문 배차원","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 25 | 무력 −15 | 물질 15 | 공동 −10 | 원칙 −10 | 공개 −20 | 자격 35 | 분산 5 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 −30 | 위험 30 | 과시 −20 | 지속 20 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2096년생인 클라라 베넷은 2126년 개막기에 선로 가문 배차원 업무를 맡는다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 선로 가문 배차원 업무는 무표 출발 열차 저지를 계기로 시작됐다. 영국계 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 조지 베넷은 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 이태원 민간 숙박·통역 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 클라라 베넷의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 클라라 베넷의 가문·공공 화차 배차와 전환기 운영 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 선로 가문 배차원. 가문 칸과 공공 칸의 배차를 섞어 놓고, 막판에 전환기로 이익이 큰 쪽을 연다.","일화":"억류 열차의 전환기 키가 가문 금고와 조정관실에 하나씩 있다는 소문이 배차판에 붙었다.","관계":"알렉산더 밀러의 지휘를 받지만 박태겸에게 가문 동향을 팔아 빚을 졌다. 조우찬에게 창동 시험 차륜을 빼돌린 의혹이 있다.","야망":"가문 거부권과 박태겸의 도제 승계를 동시에 거래해 자신이 후국회의의 실제 배차 키를 쥔다.","공포":"양편을 걸다 들켜 선로 봉쇄대의 인질로 남는 것.","개입":"어느 쪽 키를 살릴지 고르거나, 양다리 배차 장부를 후국회의에 펼칠 수 있다."},"biography":"대담하고 기회에 빠르다. 가문의 이름을 방패로 쓰면서도 조정관의 배차표를 빈칸처럼 다룬다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 주사\n- 생업: 가문·공공 화차 배차와 전환기 운영\n- 직함: 선로 가문 배차원\n**생애.** 2096년생인 클라라 베넷은 2126년 개막기에 선로 가문 배차원 업무를 맡는다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 선로 가문 배차원 업무는 무표 출발 열차 저지를 계기로 시작됐다. 영국계 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 조지 베넷은 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 이태원 민간 숙박·통역 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 클라라 베넷의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 클라라 베넷의 가문·공공 화차 배차와 전환기 운영 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 선로 가문 배차원. 가문 칸과 공공 칸의 배차를 섞어 놓고, 막판에 전환기로 이익이 큰 쪽을 연다.\n\n**일화.** 억류 열차의 전환기 키가 가문 금고와 조정관실에 하나씩 있다는 소문이 배차판에 붙었다.\n\n**관계.** 알렉산더 밀러의 지휘를 받지만 박태겸에게 가문 동향을 팔아 빚을 졌다. 조우찬에게 창동 시험 차륜을 빼돌린 의혹이 있다.\n\n**야망.** 가문 거부권과 박태겸의 도제 승계를 동시에 거래해 자신이 후국회의의 실제 배차 키를 쥔다.\n\n**공포.** 양편을 걸다 들켜 선로 봉쇄대의 인질로 남는 것.\n\n**개입.** 어느 쪽 키를 살릴지 고르거나, 양다리 배차 장부를 후국회의에 펼칠 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 25 | 무력 −15 | 물질 15 | 공동 −10 | 원칙 −10 | 공개 −20 | 자격 35 | 분산 5 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 −30 | 위험 30 | 과시 −20 | 지속 20 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"클라라 베넷","type":"지휘","to":"알렉산더 밀러","basis":"가문 배차 지휘를 받음"}],"incoming":[{"from":"조우찬","type":"원한","to":"클라라 베넷","basis":"시험 차륜 유출 의심의 원한"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0176', NULL, '{"id":"person-0176","name":"Mykola Bondarenko","title":"Yongsan Depot Brake Mechanic · Lord of Yongsan District","position":"Yongsan Depot Brake Mechanic · Lord of Yongsan District","characterId":"K175","rank":"Lord","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Pre-Shipment Brake Thickness Inspection and Parts Checking","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"geography:duchy:11170","stateName":"Yongsan-gu","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#person-Mykola Bondarenko","detailRoute":"/people/person-0176","birthDate":"2099-08-02","birthday":"08-02","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"brake-inspection","name":"Brake inspection","rating":75},{"id":"pump-repair","name":"Pump repair","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k175-disposition","name":"Rejecting untested parts","description":"He read night-run distance from brake wear and struck from the rotation any apprentice who left the tool box open. Few of words, he answered with trial-run noise.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: Yongsan warehouse brake mechanic. He wrote the brake thickness on the chalkboard before release and fitted no part without the Changdong trial stamp.","stress":"Fear. That the house warehouse''s transshipment monopoly would lock even the brake parts and the detained train would be nailed into the warehouse.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice executing Isaac Walker''s maintenance logs in the field, he backed Park Taegyeom''s apprentice route at the warehouse and inspected I Hongwon''s exchange-training standards.","effects":[]},{"id":"k175-choice","name":"Tool discipline","description":"Anecdote. In 2125 he dismantled a stopped pump, replaced a single worn shaft, and ran it again. By this deed the signature of the Yongsan warehouse brake mechanic post rose into the ledger.","behavior":"Relations. An apprentice executing Isaac Walker''s maintenance logs in the field, he backed Park Taegyeom''s apprentice route at the warehouse and inspected I Hongwon''s exchange-training standards.","stress":"Fear. That the house warehouse''s transshipment monopoly would lock even the brake parts and the detained train would be nailed into the warehouse.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice executing Isaac Walker''s maintenance logs in the field, he backed Park Taegyeom''s apprentice route at the warehouse and inspected I Hongwon''s exchange-training standards.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He restored a pump by replacing one worn shaft and checks brake thickness and exchange standards. Repair and inspection evidence does not become combat prowess.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11170-S07","name":{"ko":"Yongsan-gu Duchy Directly Administered Land"},"holderPersonId":"K175","directLiegePersonId":"K144","stateId":"S07","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1117053000","name":"Namyeong-dong"},{"id":"region:1117055500","name":"Cheongpa-dong"},{"id":"region:1117056000","name":"Wonhyo-ro 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1117057000","name":"Wonhyo-ro 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1117058000","name":"Hyochang-dong"},{"id":"region:1117059000","name":"Yongmun-dong"},{"id":"region:1117062500","name":"Hangang-ro-dong"},{"id":"region:1117063000","name":"Ichon 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1117064000","name":"Ichon 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1117065000","name":"Itaewon 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1117068500","name":"Hannam-dong"},{"id":"region:1117069000","name":"Seobinggo-dong"},{"id":"region:1117070000","name":"Bogwang-dong"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11170-S07","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11170-S07","name":"Duchy of Yongsan District","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K175","basis":"Opening administrative-scale group gu:11170(duchy) allocation · deterministic candidate selection","stateId":"S07","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1117053000","region:1117055500","region:1117056000","region:1117057000","region:1117058000","region:1117059000","region:1117062500","region:1117063000","region:1117064000","region:1117065000","region:1117068500","region:1117069000","region:1117070000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s06","name":"The Government Kingdom","holderPersonId":"K144"}}],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":30,"Force":-15,"Material":20,"Communal":-15,"Principle":-5,"Public":-25,"Eligibility":55,"Dispersed":-10,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-30,"Display":20,"Sustained":-20,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Lord","Livelihood":"Pre-Shipment Brake Thickness Inspection and Parts Checking","Title":"Yongsan Depot Brake Mechanic · Lord of Yongsan District","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness 30 | Force −15 | Materialism 20 | Community −15 | Principle −5 | Publicity −25 | Qualification 55 | Dispersal −10 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Craving 10 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −30 | Display 20 | Persistence −20 | Orientation: Reason | Bonding: Monogamy"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in 2099, Mykola Bondarenko holds the title of Yongsan Depot Brake Mechanic and Lord of Yongsan District in the opening period of 2126. He grew up at Sinjeong Rail Yard. His work as Yongsan Depot Brake Mechanic began after a defect report filed just before a derailment. His Ukrainian family line is rooted in the Dongdaemun–Yongsan Civilian Transport Community. Vasyl Bondarenko lived through the Great Blackout of around 2026 in that community, working night wage jobs in Dongdaemun and cargo handover in Yongsan. The family passed down records of shelters and goods handovers to the next generation, and Mykola Bondarenko''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the living ledgers of their time. They speak Ukrainian at home and Korean in daily life and work.\n- Mykola Bondarenko''s work of checking pre-shipment brake thickness and inspecting parts is linked to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Lord. Title: Yongsan Depot Brake Mechanic · Lord of Yongsan District. Writes the pre-shipment brake thickness on the blackboard and fits no part that lacks the Changdong test stamp.","Anecdote":"In 2125 he disassembled a stalled pump, ground down just one worn shaft, and got it running again. This act led to his signature for the post of Yongsan Depot Brake Mechanic entering the ledger.","Relationships":"A disciple who enforces Isaac Walker''s maintenance log on site, supports Bak Taegyeom''s apprentice route at the depot, and inspects Yi Hongwon''s exchange-training standards.","Ambition":"Bind the brake cycles of the Yongsan Depot to a public maintenance table so that the verbal orders of blood-kin clans cannot block a shipment.","Fear":"That the clan warehouse''s transshipment monopoly will lock up even the brake parts, leaving detained trains stuck in the depot.","Intervention":"Can testify to an apprentice''s maintenance authority, or expose who ordered an unstamped part in order to shake up the mechanics."},"biography":"Reads the night running distance from brake wear, and pulls apprentices who leave toolbox lids open off the shift. Says little and answers with test-run noise.\n\n- Affiliation: Transshipment Bureau\n- Rank: Lord\n- Livelihood: Pre-shipment brake thickness checks and parts inspection\n- Title: Yongsan Depot Brake Mechanic · Lord of Yongsan District\n**Life.** Born in 2099, Mykola Bondarenko holds the title of Yongsan Depot Brake Mechanic and Lord of Yongsan District in the opening period of 2126. He grew up at Sinjeong Rail Yard. His work as Yongsan Depot Brake Mechanic began after a defect report filed just before a derailment. His Ukrainian family line is rooted in the Dongdaemun–Yongsan Civilian Transport Community. Vasyl Bondarenko lived through the Great Blackout of around 2026 in that community, working night wage jobs in Dongdaemun and cargo handover in Yongsan. The family passed down records of shelters and goods handovers to the next generation, and Mykola Bondarenko''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the living ledgers of their time. They speak Ukrainian at home and Korean in daily life and work.\n- Mykola Bondarenko''s work of checking pre-shipment brake thickness and inspecting parts is linked to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Lord. Title: Yongsan Depot Brake Mechanic · Lord of Yongsan District. Writes the pre-shipment brake thickness on the blackboard and fits no part that lacks the Changdong test stamp.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125 he disassembled a stalled pump, ground down just one worn shaft, and got it running again. This act led to his signature for the post of Yongsan Depot Brake Mechanic entering the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** A disciple who enforces Isaac Walker''s maintenance log on site, supports Bak Taegyeom''s apprentice route at the depot, and inspects Yi Hongwon''s exchange-training standards.\n\n**Ambition.** Bind the brake cycles of the Yongsan Depot to a public maintenance table so that the verbal orders of blood-kin clans cannot block a shipment.\n\n**Fear.** That the clan warehouse''s transshipment monopoly will lock up even the brake parts, leaving detained trains stuck in the depot.\n\n**Intervention.** Can testify to an apprentice''s maintenance authority, or expose who ordered an unstamped part in order to shake up the mechanics.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness 30 | Force −15 | Materialism 20 | Community −15 | Principle −5 | Publicity −25 | Qualification 55 | Dispersal −10 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −30 | Display 20 | Persistence −20 | Orientation: Reason | Bonding: Monogamy\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Mykola Bondarenko","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Isaac Walker","basis":"A priest who enforces Isaac Walker''s maintenance log on the ground, and"},{"from":"Mykola Bondarenko","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Backing Bak Taegyeom''s apprenticeship route at the window"}],"incoming":[{"from":"André Dubois","type":"Command","to":"Mykola Bondarenko","basis":"Matching output with Mykola Bondarenko''s brake test runs"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0176","name":"미콜라 본다렌코","title":"용산창 제동 정비사 · 용산구 영주","position":"용산창 제동 정비사 · 용산구 영주","characterId":"K175","rank":"영주","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"출고 전 제동 두께 점검·부품 검수","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"geography:duchy:11170","stateName":"용산구","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-미콜라 본다렌코","detailRoute":"/people/person-0176","birthDate":"2099-08-02","birthday":"08-02","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"brake-inspection","name":"제동 점검","rating":75},{"id":"pump-repair","name":"펌프 수리","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k175-disposition","name":"검수 없는 부품 거부","description":"제동 마모로 야간 운행 거리를 읽고, 공구함 뚜껑을 열어 두는 도제를 교대에서 뺀다. 말수는 적고 시운전 소음으로 대답한다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 용산창 제동 정비사. 출고 전 제동 두께를 칠판에 쓰고, 창동 시험 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 가문 창고의 환적 독점이 제동 부품까지 잠가 억류 열차가 창에 박히는 것.","relationship":"관계. 아이작 워커의 정비 일지를 현장에서 집행하는 신도이고, 박태겸의 도제 경로를 창에서 받치며, 이홍원의 교환 수련 규격을 검수한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k175-choice","name":"공구 규율","description":"일화. 2125년 정지했던 펌프를 분해해 마모 축 하나만 갈아 다시 돌렸다. 이 일로 용산창 제동 정비사 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","behavior":"관계. 아이작 워커의 정비 일지를 현장에서 집행하는 신도이고, 박태겸의 도제 경로를 창에서 받치며, 이홍원의 교환 수련 규격을 검수한다.","stress":"공포. 가문 창고의 환적 독점이 제동 부품까지 잠가 억류 열차가 창에 박히는 것.","relationship":"관계. 아이작 워커의 정비 일지를 현장에서 집행하는 신도이고, 박태겸의 도제 경로를 창에서 받치며, 이홍원의 교환 수련 규격을 검수한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"마모 축 하나를 교체해 펌프를 복구했고 제동 두께와 교환 수련 규격을 점검한다. 개별 수리와 반복 검수의 근거를 전투 기량으로 옮기지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11170-S07","name":{"ko":"용산구 공작령 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K175","directLiegePersonId":"K144","stateId":"S07","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1117053000","name":"남영동"},{"id":"region:1117055500","name":"청파동"},{"id":"region:1117056000","name":"원효로1동"},{"id":"region:1117057000","name":"원효로2동"},{"id":"region:1117058000","name":"효창동"},{"id":"region:1117059000","name":"용문동"},{"id":"region:1117062500","name":"한강로동"},{"id":"region:1117063000","name":"이촌1동"},{"id":"region:1117064000","name":"이촌2동"},{"id":"region:1117065000","name":"이태원1동"},{"id":"region:1117068500","name":"한남동"},{"id":"region:1117069000","name":"서빙고동"},{"id":"region:1117070000","name":"보광동"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11170-S07","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11170-S07","name":"용산구 공작령","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K175","basis":"개막 행정 규모 그룹 gu:11170(duchy) 배분 · 결정적 후보 선정","stateId":"S07","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1117053000","region:1117055500","region:1117056000","region:1117057000","region:1117058000","region:1117059000","region:1117062500","region:1117063000","region:1117064000","region:1117065000","region:1117068500","region:1117069000","region:1117070000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s06","name":"정부 왕국","holderPersonId":"K144"}}],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":30,"무력":-15,"물질":20,"공동":-15,"원칙":-5,"공개":-25,"자격":55,"분산":-10,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":-10,"위험":-30,"과시":20,"지속":-20,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"영주","생업":"출고 전 제동 두께 점검·부품 검수","직함":"용산창 제동 정비사·용산구 영주","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 30 | 무력 −15 | 물질 20 | 공동 −15 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −25 | 자격 55 | 분산 −10 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 20 | 지속 −20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2099년생인 미콜라 본다렌코는 2126년 개막기에 용산창 제동 정비사·용산구 영주 직함을 지닌다. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 용산창 제동 정비사 업무는 탈선 직전 결함 보고를 계기로 시작됐다. 우크라이나계 가계는 동대문·용산 민간 운송 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 바실 본다렌코는 약 2026년 동대문·용산 민간 운송 생활권에서 동대문 야간 공임과 용산 화물 인계 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 미콜라 본다렌코의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 우크라이나어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 미콜라 본다렌코의 출고 전 제동 두께 점검·부품 검수 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 영주. 직함은 용산창 제동 정비사·용산구 영주. 출고 전 제동 두께를 칠판에 쓰고, 창동 시험 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.","일화":"2125년 정지했던 펌프를 분해해 마모 축 하나만 갈아 다시 돌렸다. 이 행동을 계기로 용산창 제동 정비사 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"아이작 워커의 정비 일지를 현장에서 집행하는 신도이고, 박태겸의 도제 경로를 창에서 받치며, 이홍원의 교환 수련 규격을 검수한다.","야망":"용산 창의 제동 주기를 공개 정비표로 묶어 혈연 가문의 구두 지시가 출고를 막지 못하게 한다.","공포":"가문 창고의 환적 독점이 제동 부품까지 잠가 억류 열차가 창에 박히는 것.","개입":"도제의 정비 권한을 증언하거나, 도장 없는 부품의 발주자를 밝혀 정비사를 흔들 수 있다."},"biography":"제동 마모로 야간 운행 거리를 읽고, 공구함 뚜껑을 열어 두는 도제를 교대에서 뺀다. 말수는 적고 시운전 소음으로 대답한다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 영주\n- 생업: 출고 전 제동 두께 점검·부품 검수\n- 직함: 용산창 제동 정비사·용산구 영주\n**생애.** 2099년생인 미콜라 본다렌코는 2126년 개막기에 용산창 제동 정비사·용산구 영주 직함을 지닌다. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 용산창 제동 정비사 업무는 탈선 직전 결함 보고를 계기로 시작됐다. 우크라이나계 가계는 동대문·용산 민간 운송 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 바실 본다렌코는 약 2026년 동대문·용산 민간 운송 생활권에서 동대문 야간 공임과 용산 화물 인계 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 미콜라 본다렌코의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 우크라이나어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 미콜라 본다렌코의 출고 전 제동 두께 점검·부품 검수 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 영주. 직함은 용산창 제동 정비사·용산구 영주. 출고 전 제동 두께를 칠판에 쓰고, 창동 시험 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 정지했던 펌프를 분해해 마모 축 하나만 갈아 다시 돌렸다. 이 행동을 계기로 용산창 제동 정비사 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 아이작 워커의 정비 일지를 현장에서 집행하는 신도이고, 박태겸의 도제 경로를 창에서 받치며, 이홍원의 교환 수련 규격을 검수한다.\n\n**야망.** 용산 창의 제동 주기를 공개 정비표로 묶어 혈연 가문의 구두 지시가 출고를 막지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 가문 창고의 환적 독점이 제동 부품까지 잠가 억류 열차가 창에 박히는 것.\n\n**개입.** 도제의 정비 권한을 증언하거나, 도장 없는 부품의 발주자를 밝혀 정비사를 흔들 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 30 | 무력 −15 | 물질 20 | 공동 −15 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −25 | 자격 55 | 분산 −10 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 20 | 지속 −20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"미콜라 본다렌코","type":"신도","to":"아이작 워커","basis":"아이작 워커의 정비 일지를 현장에서 집행하는 신도이고"},{"from":"미콜라 본다렌코","type":"신도","to":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸의 도제 경로를 창에서 받치며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"앙드레 뒤부아","type":"지휘","to":"미콜라 본다렌코","basis":"미콜라 본다렌코의 제동 시운전에 출력을 맞추며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0177', NULL, '{"id":"person-0177","name":"Natalya Sokolova","title":"","position":"","characterId":"K176","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Checking Warehouse Temperature and Inventory and Publishing the Loss Ledger","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#Character-Natalya Sokolova","detailRoute":"/people/person-0177","birthDate":"2066-08-07","birthday":"08-07","age":60,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"stock-distribution","name":"Stock distribution","rating":65},{"id":"temperature-records","name":"Temperature records","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k176-disposition","name":"Disclosing losses","description":"She saw anyone who recorded an empty box as full as an enemy, and her face hardened when the temperature shook. She never took the warehouse key off her body.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: transshipment warehouse logistics merchant. She read the warehouse temperature aloud every two hours and sealed any house column caught with false inventory.","stress":"Fear. That on a power-less night the cold freight would melt and the relay credit would fall in one day.","relationship":"Relations. Held a contract executing Lukas Schneider''s transshipment order in the field, took over Seo Nayeon''s ice bricks, and matched Sin Taesan''s convoy arrival hours.","effects":[]},{"id":"k176-choice","name":"Sensitive to temperature","description":"Anecdote. In 2125 she distributed the grain that had begun to rot first and published the loss ledger. By this deed the signature of the transshipment warehouse logistics merchant post rose into the ledger.","behavior":"Relations. Held a contract executing Lukas Schneider''s transshipment order in the field, took over Seo Nayeon''s ice bricks, and matched Sin Taesan''s convoy arrival hours.","stress":"Fear. That on a power-less night the cold freight would melt and the relay credit would fall in one day.","relationship":"Relations. Held a contract executing Lukas Schneider''s transshipment order in the field, took over Seo Nayeon''s ice bricks, and matched Sin Taesan''s convoy arrival hours.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She distributed spoiling grain first and disclosed the loss. Routine temperature and arrival checks support logistics, not large-scale financial command.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:barony-K176-sea","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"barony","holderPersonId":"K176","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:sea-K176","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":20,"Force":-5,"Material":45,"Communal":-15,"Principle":-15,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":-10,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":15,"Risk":20,"Display":15,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Current Office":"Unappointed","Livelihood":"Checking Warehouse Temperature and Inventory and Publishing the Loss Ledger","Role":"Transshipment Warehouse Merchant","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness 20 | Force −5 | Materialism 45 | Community −15 | Principle −15 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal −10 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 40 | Monopoly 15 | Risk 20 | Display 15 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: Fluid | Bonding: Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in 2066, Natalya Sokolova works as a Transshipment Warehouse Logistics Merchant in the opening period of 2126. She grew up at Noryangjin Wharf. Her work as Transshipment Warehouse Logistics Merchant began with the public re-inspection of the scales. Her Russian family line is rooted in the Dongdaemun–Yongsan Civilian Freight Community. Aleksey Sokolov lived through the Great Blackout of around 2026 in that community, working in Dongdaemun cargo brokerage and Itaewon lodging. The family passed down records of shelters and goods handovers to the next generation, and Natalya Sokolova''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the living ledgers of their time. They speak Russian at home and Korean in daily life and work.\n- Natalya Sokolova''s work of checking warehouse temperature and stock and publishing the loss ledger is linked to Hangangno-dong.","Livelihood":"Natalya Sokolova, Transshipment Warehouse Logistics Merchant, reads the warehouse temperature aloud once every two hours, and if false inventory turns up, she seals off that clan''s bay.","Anecdote":"In 2125 she handed out the grain that had begun to rot first and made the loss ledger public. That act put the signature for the Transshipment Warehouse Logistics Merchant post into the ledger.","Relationships":"A contract that enforces Lucas Schneider''s transshipment order on site; she hands over Seo Nayeon''s ice bricks and aligns the arrival times of Sin Taesan''s convoys.","Ambition":"She binds frozen cargo and e-waste recovery to Yongsan warehouse credit, putting into practice a transshipment ledger separate from O Haerin''s settlement authority.","Fear":"Frozen cargo melting on a night without power, so that relay credit collapses within a day.","Intervention":"He can supply ice and storage batteries, or seal and publicly expose the compartments that hid melted stock."},"biography":"She treats anyone who records an empty crate as full as an enemy, and her expression hardens when the temperature wavers. She never lets the warehouse key leave her body.\n\n- Affiliation: Transshipment Bureau\n- Current office: Unappointed\n- Livelihood: Checking warehouse temperature and inventory, and publishing the loss ledger\n- Role: Transshipment Warehouse Logistics Merchant\n**Life.** Natalya Sokolova, born in 2066, works as the Transshipment Warehouse Logistics Merchant at the 2126 opening. She grew up at the Noryangjin pier. Her work as Transshipment Warehouse Logistics Merchant began with the public re-inspection of the scales. Her Russian-descended family is rooted in the Dongdaemun–Yongsan civilian cargo living sphere. Aleksei Sokolov went through the Great Blackout around 2026 in the Dongdaemun–Yongsan civilian cargo living sphere, working in Dongdaemun cargo brokerage and Itaewon lodging. The family passed down records of shelters and goods handovers to the next generation, and Natalya Sokolova''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their own time. At home they speak Russian, and in daily life and work they speak Korean.\n- Natalya Sokolova''s work of checking warehouse temperature and inventory and publishing the loss ledger is tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Livelihood.** Natalya Sokolova, Transshipment Warehouse Logistics Merchant, reads the warehouse temperature aloud once every two hours, and if false inventory turns up, she seals off that clan''s bay.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125 she handed out the grain that had begun to rot first and made the loss ledger public. That act put the signature for the Transshipment Warehouse Logistics Merchant post into the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** A contract that enforces Lucas Schneider''s transshipment order on site; she hands over Seo Nayeon''s ice bricks and aligns the arrival times of Sin Taesan''s convoys.\n\n**Ambition.** She binds frozen cargo and e-waste recovery to Yongsan warehouse credit, putting into practice a transshipment ledger separate from O Haerin''s settlement authority.\n\n**Fear.** Frozen cargo melting on a night without power, so that relay credit collapses within a day.\n\n**Intervention.** You can supply ice and batteries, or seal and expose the bay where melted inventory was hidden.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness 20 | Force −5 | Material 45 | Communal −15 | Principle −15 | Disclosure −15 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal −10 | Reform 0\n- Desire: Craving 40 | Monopoly 15 | Risk 20 | Display 15 | Persistence 5 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Natalya Sokolova","type":"Command","to":"Lucas Schneider","basis":"is a contract that enforces Lucas Schneider''s transshipment sequence on site, and"},{"from":"Natalya Sokolova","type":"Contract","to":"Seo Na-yeon","basis":"handing over Seo Nayeon''s ice bricks,"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0177","name":"나탈리야 소콜로바","title":"","position":"","characterId":"K176","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"창고 온도·재고 확인과 손실 장부 공개","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-나탈리야 소콜로바","detailRoute":"/people/person-0177","birthDate":"2066-08-07","birthday":"08-07","age":60,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"stock-distribution","name":"재고 배분","rating":65},{"id":"temperature-records","name":"온도 기록","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k176-disposition","name":"손실 공개","description":"빈 상자를 가득 찬 것처럼 적는 사람을 원수로 보고, 온도가 흔들리면 표정이 굳는다. 창고 열쇠는 몸에서 떼지 않는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 환적창고 물류상. 창고 온도를 두 시간에 한 번 소리 내어 읽고, 허위 재고가 나오면 해당 가문 칸을 봉쇄한다.","stress":"공포. 전력 없는 밤에 냉동 화물이 녹아 중계 신용이 하루 만에 무너지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 루카스 슈나이더의 환적 순서를 현장에서 집행하는 계약이고, 서나연의 얼음 벽돌을 인계하며, 신태산의 호송 도착 시각을 맞춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k176-choice","name":"온도에 예민함","description":"일화. 2125년 썩기 시작한 곡물을 먼저 나눠 주고 손실 장부를 공개했다. 이 일로 환적창고 물류상 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","behavior":"관계. 루카스 슈나이더의 환적 순서를 현장에서 집행하는 계약이고, 서나연의 얼음 벽돌을 인계하며, 신태산의 호송 도착 시각을 맞춘다.","stress":"공포. 전력 없는 밤에 냉동 화물이 녹아 중계 신용이 하루 만에 무너지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 루카스 슈나이더의 환적 순서를 현장에서 집행하는 계약이고, 서나연의 얼음 벽돌을 인계하며, 신태산의 호송 도착 시각을 맞춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"상하기 시작한 곡물을 먼저 배분하고 손실을 공개했다. 냉동 온도와 호송 인계를 꾸준히 확인하지만 대규모 재정 지휘는 입증되지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:barony-K176-sea","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"barony","holderPersonId":"K176","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:sea-K176","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":20,"무력":-5,"물질":45,"공동":-15,"원칙":-15,"공개":-15,"자격":20,"분산":-10,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":15,"위험":20,"과시":15,"지속":5,"지향":"유동","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","현재 관직":"미임명","생업":"창고 온도·재고 확인과 손실 장부 공개","역할":"환적창고 물류상","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 20 | 무력 −5 | 물질 45 | 공동 −15 | 원칙 −15 | 공개 −15 | 자격 20 | 분산 −10 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 15 | 위험 20 | 과시 15 | 지속 5 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2066년생인 나탈리야 소콜로바는 2126년 개막기에는 환적창고 물류상으로 일한다. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 환적창고 물류상 업무는 저울 재점검 공개를 계기로 시작됐다. 러시아계 가계는 동대문·용산 민간 화물 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 알렉세이 소콜로프는 약 2026년 동대문·용산 민간 화물 생활권에서 동대문 화물 중개와 이태원 숙박 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 나탈리야 소콜로바의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 러시아어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 나탈리야 소콜로바의 창고 온도·재고 확인과 손실 장부 공개 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","생업":"환적창고 물류상 나탈리야 소콜로바는 창고 온도를 두 시간에 한 번 소리 내어 읽고, 허위 재고가 나오면 해당 가문 칸을 봉쇄한다.","일화":"2125년 썩기 시작한 곡물을 먼저 나눠 주고 손실 장부를 공개했다. 이 행동을 계기로 환적창고 물류상 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"루카스 슈나이더의 환적 순서를 현장에서 집행하는 계약이고, 서나연의 얼음 벽돌을 인계하며, 신태산의 호송 도착 시각을 맞춘다.","야망":"냉동 화물과 폐전자 회수를 용산 창고 신용으로 묶어 오해린의 결제권과 별개인 환적 원장을 현장화한다.","공포":"전력 없는 밤에 냉동 화물이 녹아 중계 신용이 하루 만에 무너지는 것.","개입":"얼음과 축전지를 보급하거나, 녹은 재고를 숨긴 칸을 봉인해 공개할 수 있다."},"biography":"빈 상자를 가득 찬 것처럼 적는 사람을 원수로 보고, 온도가 흔들리면 표정이 굳는다. 창고 열쇠는 몸에서 떼지 않는다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 현재 관직: 미임명\n- 생업: 창고 온도·재고 확인과 손실 장부 공개\n- 역할: 환적창고 물류상\n**생애.** 2066년생인 나탈리야 소콜로바는 2126년 개막기에는 환적창고 물류상으로 일한다. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 환적창고 물류상 업무는 저울 재점검 공개를 계기로 시작됐다. 러시아계 가계는 동대문·용산 민간 화물 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 알렉세이 소콜로프는 약 2026년 동대문·용산 민간 화물 생활권에서 동대문 화물 중개와 이태원 숙박 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 나탈리야 소콜로바의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 러시아어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 나탈리야 소콜로바의 창고 온도·재고 확인과 손실 장부 공개 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**생업.** 환적창고 물류상 나탈리야 소콜로바는 창고 온도를 두 시간에 한 번 소리 내어 읽고, 허위 재고가 나오면 해당 가문 칸을 봉쇄한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 썩기 시작한 곡물을 먼저 나눠 주고 손실 장부를 공개했다. 이 행동을 계기로 환적창고 물류상 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 루카스 슈나이더의 환적 순서를 현장에서 집행하는 계약이고, 서나연의 얼음 벽돌을 인계하며, 신태산의 호송 도착 시각을 맞춘다.\n\n**야망.** 냉동 화물과 폐전자 회수를 용산 창고 신용으로 묶어 오해린의 결제권과 별개인 환적 원장을 현장화한다.\n\n**공포.** 전력 없는 밤에 냉동 화물이 녹아 중계 신용이 하루 만에 무너지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 얼음과 축전지를 보급하거나, 녹은 재고를 숨긴 칸을 봉인해 공개할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 20 | 무력 −5 | 물질 45 | 공동 −15 | 원칙 −15 | 공개 −15 | 자격 20 | 분산 −10 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 15 | 위험 20 | 과시 15 | 지속 5 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"나탈리야 소콜로바","type":"지휘","to":"루카스 슈나이더","basis":"루카스 슈나이더의 환적 순서를 현장에서 집행하는 계약이고"},{"from":"나탈리야 소콜로바","type":"계약","to":"서나연","basis":"서나연의 얼음 벽돌을 인계하며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0178', NULL, '{"id":"person-0178","name":"Gabriel Johnson","title":"Yongsan Depot Medic","position":"Yongsan Depot Medic","characterId":"K177","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Managing the Patient Roster and Reagents and Distributing Prescriptions","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#person-Gabriel Johnson","detailRoute":"/people/person-0178","birthDate":"2089-04-17","birthday":"04-17","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"medicine-allocation","name":"Medicine allocation","rating":65},{"id":"patient-triage","name":"Patient prioritization","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k177-disposition","name":"Separating rations from treatment","description":"He smelled freezer frostbite before track burns and tore up any note telling him to turn care order into apprentice-ration order. Mild in manner, he closed the warehouse care whenever the disinfectant ran out.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: Yongsan warehouse medic. He posted the patient roster and the medicine bundles at once and took house-column patients separately from the public columns.","stress":"Fear. That the detained train''s wounded would remain on a hostage roster alone and the infirmary would become a house prison.","relationship":"Relations. Backed Isaac Walker''s apprentice lodge with care, owed Ryu Eunbi warehouse herbs, and gave the detained train''s passengers care first.","effects":[]},{"id":"k177-choice","name":"Disinfection minimum","description":"Anecdote. In 2125, short of herbs, he halved the prescriptions and divided them among everyone. By this deed the signature of the Yongsan warehouse medic post rose into the ledger.","behavior":"Relations. Backed Isaac Walker''s apprentice lodge with care, owed Ryu Eunbi warehouse herbs, and gave the detained train''s passengers care first.","stress":"Fear. That the detained train''s wounded would remain on a hostage roster alone and the infirmary would become a house prison.","relationship":"Relations. Backed Isaac Walker''s apprentice lodge with care, owed Ryu Eunbi warehouse herbs, and gave the detained train''s passengers care first.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He shares scarce medicine and rejects ration-based treatment priority. Closing without disinfectant creates tension between safety and access.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":20,"Force":-20,"Material":15,"Communal":-20,"Principle":10,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":35,"Risk":-10,"Display":5,"Sustained":15,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Livelihood":"Managing the Patient Roster and Reagents and Distributing Prescriptions","Title":"Yongsan Depot Medic","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness 20 | Force −20 | Material 15 | Communal −20 | Principle 10 | Disclosure −20 | Qualification 30 | Dispersal 5 | Reform 0","Desires":"Craving 10 | Monopoly 35 | Risk −10 | Display 5 | Persistence 15 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Gabriel Johnson, born in 2089, takes on the duties of Yongsan Depot Medical Officer at the 2126 opening. Grew up at the Jegi-dong infirmary. The work of Yongsan Depot Medical Officer began with the sealing of counterfeit medicine. The African American family is rooted in the Yongsan–Itaewon living sphere. Samuel Johnson went through the Great Blackout around 2026 in Yongsan–Itaewon, working in Itaewon lodging and private interpreting. The family passed down records of shelters and goods handovers to the next generation, and Gabriel Johnson''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their own time. At home they speak English, and in daily life and work they speak Korean.\n- Gabriel Johnson''s work of managing the patient roster and reagents and distributing prescriptions is tied to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Jusa (Clerk). Title: Yongsan Depot Medical Officer. Posts the patient roster and the reagent bundles at the same time, and receives patients from clan bays separately from the public bay.","Anecdote":"In 2125, facing a medicine shortage, she halved the prescription doses and shared them with everyone. That act put the signature for the Yongsan Depot Medical Officer post into the ledger.","Relationships":"Backs Isaac Walker''s apprentice dorms with treatment, owes Ryu Eunbi depot medicine, and gives priority to treating the passengers of Im Chowon''s detained train.","Ambition":"Raise the quarantine cycles of the track clans and apprentice workers into a bylaw of the Vassal Realms Council, so that a minimum duty of care remains even under ration pressure.","Fear":"Wounded from the detained train remaining only as a hostage roster, turning the infirmary into a clan prison.","Intervention":"You can escort substitute reagents to keep treatment going, or hand the hostage list over to the clans and put the medical officer at risk."},"biography":"Treats frostbite from the cold compartments before track burns, and tears up notes demanding that apprentice-dorm rations be turned into treatment order. Gentle, but closes depot treatment when the disinfectant runs out.\n\n- Affiliation: Transshipment Bureau\n- Rank: Jusa (Clerk)\n- Livelihood: Managing the patient roster and reagents, and distributing prescriptions\n- Title: Yongsan Depot Medical Officer\n**Life.** Gabriel Johnson, born in 2089, takes on the duties of Yongsan Depot Medical Officer at the 2126 opening. Grew up at the Jegi-dong infirmary. The work of Yongsan Depot Medical Officer began with the sealing of counterfeit medicine. The African American family is rooted in the Yongsan–Itaewon living sphere. Samuel Johnson went through the Great Blackout around 2026 in Yongsan–Itaewon, working in Itaewon lodging and private interpreting. The family passed down records of shelters and goods handovers to the next generation, and Gabriel Johnson''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their own time. At home they speak English, and in daily life and work they speak Korean.\n- Gabriel Johnson''s work of managing the patient roster and reagents and distributing prescriptions is tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Jusa (Clerk). Title: Yongsan Depot Medical Officer. Posts the patient roster and the reagent bundles at the same time, and receives patients from clan bays separately from the public bay.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, facing a medicine shortage, she halved the prescription doses and shared them with everyone. That act put the signature for the Yongsan Depot Medical Officer post into the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** Backs Isaac Walker''s apprentice dorms with treatment, owes Ryu Eunbi depot medicine, and gives priority to treating the passengers of Im Chowon''s detained train.\n\n**Ambition.** Raise the quarantine cycles of the track clans and apprentice workers into a bylaw of the Vassal Realms Council, so that a minimum duty of care remains even under ration pressure.\n\n**Fear.** Wounded from the detained train remaining only as a hostage roster, turning the infirmary into a clan prison.\n\n**Intervention.** You can escort substitute reagents to keep treatment going, or hand the hostage list over to the clans and put the medical officer at risk.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness 20 | Force −20 | Material 15 | Communal −20 | Principle 10 | Disclosure −20 | Qualification 30 | Dispersal 5 | Reform 0\n- Desire: Craving 10 | Monopoly 35 | Risk −10 | Display 5 | Persistence 15 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gabriel Johnson","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Isaac Walker","basis":"Supports Isaac Walker''s apprentice quarters with medical care, and"},{"from":"Gabriel Johnson","type":"Debt","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"owing depot medicine to Ryu Eunbi,"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Mateusz Kowalski","type":"Contract","to":"Gabriel Johnson","basis":"an ally who broadcasts news of the blockade of Gabriel Johnson''s depot clinic,"},{"from":"Noah Davis","type":"Contract","to":"Gabriel Johnson","basis":"when Gabriel Johnson''s depot clinic is blockaded, takes the patients into the dorm, and"},{"from":"Stefan Petrov","type":"Oath","to":"Gabriel Johnson","basis":"aligns the timing of the blockade of Gabriel Johnson''s depot clinic with its discovery, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0178","name":"가브리엘 존슨","title":"용산창 의무원","position":"용산창 의무원","characterId":"K177","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"환자 명부·시약 관리와 처방 배분","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-가브리엘 존슨","detailRoute":"/people/person-0178","birthDate":"2089-04-17","birthday":"04-17","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"medicine-allocation","name":"약재 배분","rating":65},{"id":"patient-triage","name":"환자 순서 조정","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k177-disposition","name":"배급과 치료를 분리함","description":"선로 화상보다 냉동 칸 동상을 먼저 맡고, 도제 숙소 배급을 치료 순서로 바꾸라는 쪽지를 찢는다. 온화하나 소독수가 비면 창 진료를 닫는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 용산창 의무원. 환자 명부와 시약 묶음을 동시에 게시하고, 가문 칸 환자는 공공 칸과 분리해 받는다.","stress":"공포. 억류 열차의 부상자가 인질 명부로만 남아 의무실이 가문 감옥이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 아이작 워커의 도제 숙소를 진료로 받치고, 류은비에게 창 약재를 빚지며, 임초원의 억류 열차 탑승자 진료를 우선한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k177-choice","name":"소독 최저선","description":"일화. 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 이 일로 용산창 의무원 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","behavior":"관계. 아이작 워커의 도제 숙소를 진료로 받치고, 류은비에게 창 약재를 빚지며, 임초원의 억류 열차 탑승자 진료를 우선한다.","stress":"공포. 억류 열차의 부상자가 인질 명부로만 남아 의무실이 가문 감옥이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 아이작 워커의 도제 숙소를 진료로 받치고, 류은비에게 창 약재를 빚지며, 임초원의 억류 열차 탑승자 진료를 우선한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"약 부족에도 모두에게 나누고 숙소 배급을 치료 순서로 바꾸라는 압박을 거절한다. 소독수 없이는 닫는 선택에 보호와 접근 제한의 긴장이 있다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":20,"무력":-20,"물질":15,"공동":-20,"원칙":10,"공개":-20,"자격":30,"분산":5,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":35,"위험":-10,"과시":5,"지속":15,"지향":"양성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"주사","생업":"환자 명부·시약 관리와 처방 배분","직함":"용산창 의무원","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 20 | 무력 −20 | 물질 15 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 10 | 공개 −20 | 자격 30 | 분산 5 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 35 | 위험 −10 | 과시 5 | 지속 15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2089년생인 가브리엘 존슨은 2126년 개막기에 용산창 의무원 업무를 맡는다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 용산창 의무원 업무는 가짜 약 봉인을 계기로 시작됐다. 아프리카계 미국인 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 새뮤얼 존슨은 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 이태원 숙박업과 민간 통역 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 가브리엘 존슨의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 가브리엘 존슨의 환자 명부·시약 관리와 처방 배분 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 용산창 의무원. 환자 명부와 시약 묶음을 동시에 게시하고, 가문 칸 환자는 공공 칸과 분리해 받는다.","일화":"2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 이 행동을 계기로 용산창 의무원 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"아이작 워커의 도제 숙소를 진료로 받치고, 류은비에게 창 약재를 빚지며, 임초원의 억류 열차 탑승자 진료를 우선한다.","야망":"선로 가문과 도제 노동자의 방역 주기를 후국회의 부칙으로 올려 배급 압박에도 의무 최저선을 남긴다.","공포":"억류 열차의 부상자가 인질 명부로만 남아 의무실이 가문 감옥이 되는 것.","개입":"대체 시약을 호송해 진료를 유지하거나, 인질 명단을 가문에 넘겨 의무원을 위태롭게 할 수 있다."},"biography":"선로 화상보다 냉동 칸 동상을 먼저 맡고, 도제 숙소 배급을 치료 순서로 바꾸라는 쪽지를 찢는다. 온화하나 소독수가 비면 창 진료를 닫는다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 주사\n- 생업: 환자 명부·시약 관리와 처방 배분\n- 직함: 용산창 의무원\n**생애.** 2089년생인 가브리엘 존슨은 2126년 개막기에 용산창 의무원 업무를 맡는다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 용산창 의무원 업무는 가짜 약 봉인을 계기로 시작됐다. 아프리카계 미국인 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 새뮤얼 존슨은 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 이태원 숙박업과 민간 통역 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 가브리엘 존슨의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 가브리엘 존슨의 환자 명부·시약 관리와 처방 배분 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 용산창 의무원. 환자 명부와 시약 묶음을 동시에 게시하고, 가문 칸 환자는 공공 칸과 분리해 받는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 이 행동을 계기로 용산창 의무원 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 아이작 워커의 도제 숙소를 진료로 받치고, 류은비에게 창 약재를 빚지며, 임초원의 억류 열차 탑승자 진료를 우선한다.\n\n**야망.** 선로 가문과 도제 노동자의 방역 주기를 후국회의 부칙으로 올려 배급 압박에도 의무 최저선을 남긴다.\n\n**공포.** 억류 열차의 부상자가 인질 명부로만 남아 의무실이 가문 감옥이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 대체 시약을 호송해 진료를 유지하거나, 인질 명단을 가문에 넘겨 의무원을 위태롭게 할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 20 | 무력 −20 | 물질 15 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 10 | 공개 −20 | 자격 30 | 분산 5 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 35 | 위험 −10 | 과시 5 | 지속 15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"가브리엘 존슨","type":"신도","to":"아이작 워커","basis":"아이작 워커의 도제 숙소를 진료로 받치고"},{"from":"가브리엘 존슨","type":"빚","to":"류은비","basis":"류은비에게 창 약재를 빚지며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"마테우시 코발스키","type":"계약","to":"가브리엘 존슨","basis":"가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료 봉쇄를 방송으로 알리는 동맹이고"},{"from":"노아 데이비스","type":"계약","to":"가브리엘 존슨","basis":"가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료가 봉쇄되면 환자를 숙소로 받고"},{"from":"스테판 페트로프","type":"맹세","to":"가브리엘 존슨","basis":"가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료 봉쇄 시각과 발견을 맞추며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0179', NULL, '{"id":"person-0179","name":"Marcus Wilson","title":"Track Blockade Patrol Squad Leader","position":"Track Blockade Patrol Squad Leader","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Track Blockade Patrol and Switch Key Verification","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"S07","stateName":"The Junction","detailRoute":"/people/person-0179","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":5,"effective":5},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}}}}', '{"id":"person-0179","name":"마커스 윌슨","title":"선로 봉쇄 순찰대 조장","position":"선로 봉쇄 순찰대 조장","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"선로 봉쇄 순찰·전환기 열쇠 확인","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"S07","stateName":"환적국","detailRoute":"/people/person-0179","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":5,"effective":5},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}}}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0180', NULL, '{"id":"person-0180","name":"Sofia Rossi","title":"Vassal States Council Courier","position":"Vassal States Council Courier","characterId":"K179","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Delivering Vassal States Council Messages and Detention Notices","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#person-Sophia Rossi","detailRoute":"/people/person-0180","birthDate":"2093-03-31","birthday":"03-31","age":33,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"sealed-dispatch-delivery","name":"Sealed dispatch delivery","rating":65},{"id":"closure-notification","name":"Closure notification","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k179-disposition","name":"Checking both signatures","description":"She refused departure whenever a seal cord sat loose and called any elder who kept verbal dispatch refusals off the ledger a violator. Short of breath or not, she held two copies in one hand.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: Post-State Council courier. She sent the dispatches to the Coordinator''s office and the house council at once, and a detention notice ran only with both Eva Nováková''s dispatch stamp and Park Taegyeom''s joint signature.","stress":"Fear. That one forged council dispatch would void the adopted-child succession and the courier network would become the house''s horn.","relationship":"Relations. Under command to carry Park Taegyeom''s succession proposal only under seal, held a contract delivering Eva Nováková''s dispatch changes, and matched timing with Yang Haeon''s ratification dispatches.","effects":[]},{"id":"k179-choice","name":"Demanding recorded refusals","description":"Anecdote. In 2125 she did not sit on the collapse report of a flooded section and closed it on the spot. By this deed the signature of the Post-State Council courier post rose into the ledger.","behavior":"Relations. Under command to carry Park Taegyeom''s succession proposal only under seal, held a contract delivering Eva Nováková''s dispatch changes, and matched timing with Yang Haeon''s ratification dispatches.","stress":"Fear. That one forged council dispatch would void the adopted-child succession and the courier network would become the house''s horn.","relationship":"Relations. Under command to carry Park Taegyeom''s succession proposal only under seal, held a contract delivering Eva Nováková''s dispatch changes, and matched timing with Yang Haeon''s ratification dispatches.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She immediately closed a collapsed section and delivers notices bearing both signatures. Reliable delivery coexists with an ambition to monopolize notice validity.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":30,"Force":0,"Material":10,"Communal":-15,"Principle":10,"Public":0,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":0,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":5,"Risk":25,"Display":20,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Livelihood":"Delivering Vassal States Council Messages and Detention Notices","Title":"Vassal States Council Courier","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness 30 | Force 0 | Material 10 | Communal −15 | Principle 10 | Publicity 0 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 0 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Longing 45 | Monopoly 5 | Risk 25 | Display 20 | Endurance 5 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Multiple"},"sections":{"Life":"Sofia Rossi, born in 2093, takes up the duties of Marquisate Council Herald in the opening period of 2126. Raised on the Sinnae Transfer Watch. The Marquisate Council Herald work began with stopping a ticketless departing train. The Italian family line is rooted in the Yongsan–Itaewon living sphere. Antonio Rossi lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in Yongsan–Itaewon, working in private dining and lodging in Itaewon and in supply work in Yongsan. The family passed its records of lodgings and goods handovers to the next generation, and Sofia Rossi''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the living ledgers of their day. They speak Italian at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Sofia Rossi''s work delivering Marquisate Council messages and detention notices is tied to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank Jusa. Title: Herald of the Marquisate Council. Sends messages simultaneously to the Coordinator''s Office and the Clan Council; a detention notice runs only if it bears both Eva Novakova''s dispatch seal and Park Taegyeom''s countersignature.","Anecdote":"In 2125, without delaying, immediately closed a flooded section after a collapse report. Prompted by this act, the signature for the Marquisate Council Herald post was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"Commands the carrying of Park Taegyeom''s succession proposal only under seal, holds a contract to deliver Eva Novakova''s dispatch changes, and times deliveries to match Yang Haeon''s ratification message.","Ambition":"To make the Doge succession and track blockade notices valid only in the herald ledger that she herself seals.","Fear":"That a single forged council message will void an adoptive succession and turn the herald network into a clan''s trumpet.","Intervention":"Can track down the forged message and protect the seal, or lay out the held documents in the bag before the Clan Council."},"biography":"Refuses to depart if the seal cord is loose, and calls any elder who does not enter a verbal dispatch refusal into the ledger a violator. Even out of breath, keeps two copies gripped in one hand.\n\n- Affiliation: Transfer Bureau\n- Rank: Jusa\n- Livelihood: Delivering Marquisate Council messages and detention notices\n- Title: Herald of the Marquisate Council\n**Life.** Sofia Rossi, born in 2093, takes up the duties of Marquisate Council Herald in the opening period of 2126. Raised on the Sinnae Transfer Watch. The Marquisate Council Herald work began with stopping a ticketless departing train. The Italian family line is rooted in the Yongsan–Itaewon living sphere. Antonio Rossi lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in Yongsan–Itaewon, working in private dining and lodging in Itaewon and in supply work in Yongsan. The family passed its records of lodgings and goods handovers to the next generation, and Sofia Rossi''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the living ledgers of their day. They speak Italian at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Sofia Rossi''s work delivering Marquisate Council messages and detention notices is tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank Jusa. Title: Herald of the Marquisate Council. Sends messages simultaneously to the Coordinator''s Office and the Clan Council; a detention notice runs only if it bears both Eva Novakova''s dispatch seal and Park Taegyeom''s countersignature.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, without delaying, immediately closed a flooded section after a collapse report. Prompted by this act, the signature for the Marquisate Council Herald post was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** Commands the carrying of Park Taegyeom''s succession proposal only under seal, holds a contract to deliver Eva Novakova''s dispatch changes, and times deliveries to match Yang Haeon''s ratification message.\n\n**Ambition.** To make the Doge succession and track blockade notices valid only in the herald ledger that she herself seals.\n\n**Fear.** That a single forged council message will void an adoptive succession and turn the herald network into a clan''s trumpet.\n\n**Intervention.** Can track down the forged message and protect the seal, or lay out the held documents in the bag before the Clan Council.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness 30 | Force 0 | Material 10 | Communal −15 | Principle 10 | Publicity 0 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 0 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Longing 45 | Monopoly 5 | Risk 25 | Display 20 | Endurance 5 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Multiple\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Sofia Rossi","type":"Command","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"a commander who carries Bak Taegyeom''s succession proposal only in sealed form,"},{"from":"Sofia Rossi","type":"Contract","to":"Yang Haeon","basis":"Syncs timing with Yang Haeon''s approval messages"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Miguel Torres","type":"Contract","to":"Sofia Rossi","basis":"Miguel Torres passes the preserved false bulletin and the time of its correction to Sofia Rossi. Sofia Rossi checks the date and the receiving party of the council message so that news from before the correction is not reused as a current notice."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0180","name":"소피아 로시","title":"후국회의 전령","position":"후국회의 전령","characterId":"K179","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"후국회의 전갈·억류 통지 전달","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-소피아 로시","detailRoute":"/people/person-0180","birthDate":"2093-03-31","birthday":"03-31","age":33,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"sealed-dispatch-delivery","name":"봉인 전갈 전달","rating":65},{"id":"closure-notification","name":"폐쇄 통지","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k179-disposition","name":"두 서명 확인","description":"봉인 끈이 느슨하면 출발을 거부하고, 구두 배차 거부를 원장에 올리지 않는 원로를 위반자로 부른다. 숨이 차도 사본 두 장을 한 손에 쥔다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 후국회의 전령. 전갈을 조정관실과 가문 회의에 동시에 보내고, 억류 통지는 에바 노바코바의 배차 날인과 박태겸의 연서가 둘 다 있어야 달린다.","stress":"공포. 위조 회의 전갈 한 장이 양자 승계를 무효로 돌려 전령망이 가문 나팔이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 박태겸의 후계 제안을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘이고, 에바 노바코바의 배차 변경을 배달하는 계약이며, 양해온의 인준 전갈과 시점을 맞춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k179-choice","name":"구두 거부 기록 요구","description":"일화. 2125년 침수 구간 붕괴 보고를 미루지 않고 당장 폐쇄했다. 이 일로 후국회의 전령 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","behavior":"관계. 박태겸의 후계 제안을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘이고, 에바 노바코바의 배차 변경을 배달하는 계약이며, 양해온의 인준 전갈과 시점을 맞춘다.","stress":"공포. 위조 회의 전갈 한 장이 양자 승계를 무효로 돌려 전령망이 가문 나팔이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 박태겸의 후계 제안을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘이고, 에바 노바코바의 배차 변경을 배달하는 계약이며, 양해온의 인준 전갈과 시점을 맞춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"붕괴 구간을 즉시 닫고 연서와 배차 날인이 모두 있는 전갈만 전달한다. 전달 책임과 전령 원장 독점의 야망을 함께 남겼다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":30,"무력":0,"물질":10,"공동":-15,"원칙":10,"공개":0,"자격":20,"분산":0,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":5,"위험":25,"과시":20,"지속":5,"지향":"유동","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"주사","생업":"후국회의 전갈·억류 통지 전달","직함":"후국회의 전령","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 30 | 무력 0 | 물질 10 | 공동 −15 | 원칙 10 | 공개 0 | 자격 20 | 분산 0 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 5 | 위험 25 | 과시 20 | 지속 5 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2093년생인 소피아 로시는 2126년 개막기에 후국회의 전령 업무를 맡는다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 후국회의 전령 업무는 무표 출발 열차 저지를 계기로 시작됐다. 이탈리아계 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 안토니오 로시는 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 이태원 민간 식당·숙박과 용산 공급 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 소피아 로시의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 이탈리아어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 소피아 로시의 후국회의 전갈·억류 통지 전달 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 후국회의 전령. 전갈을 조정관실과 가문 회의에 동시에 보내고, 억류 통지는 에바 노바코바의 배차 날인과 박태겸의 연서가 둘 다 있어야 달린다.","일화":"2125년 침수 구간 붕괴 보고를 미루지 않고 당장 폐쇄했다. 이 행동을 계기로 후국회의 전령 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"박태겸의 후계 제안을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘이고, 에바 노바코바의 배차 변경을 배달하는 계약이며, 양해온의 인준 전갈과 시점을 맞춘다.","야망":"도제 승계와 선로 봉쇄 통지를 자신이 날인하는 전령 원장에만 유효하게 만든다.","공포":"위조 회의 전갈 한 장이 양자 승계를 무효로 돌려 전령망이 가문 나팔이 되는 것.","개입":"위조 전갈을 찾아 봉인을 지키거나, 가방 속 보류 문서를 가문회의에 펼칠 수 있다."},"biography":"봉인 끈이 느슨하면 출발을 거부하고, 구두 배차 거부를 원장에 올리지 않는 원로를 위반자로 부른다. 숨이 차도 사본 두 장을 한 손에 쥔다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 주사\n- 생업: 후국회의 전갈·억류 통지 전달\n- 직함: 후국회의 전령\n**생애.** 2093년생인 소피아 로시는 2126년 개막기에 후국회의 전령 업무를 맡는다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 후국회의 전령 업무는 무표 출발 열차 저지를 계기로 시작됐다. 이탈리아계 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 안토니오 로시는 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 이태원 민간 식당·숙박과 용산 공급 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 소피아 로시의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 이탈리아어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 소피아 로시의 후국회의 전갈·억류 통지 전달 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 후국회의 전령. 전갈을 조정관실과 가문 회의에 동시에 보내고, 억류 통지는 에바 노바코바의 배차 날인과 박태겸의 연서가 둘 다 있어야 달린다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 침수 구간 붕괴 보고를 미루지 않고 당장 폐쇄했다. 이 행동을 계기로 후국회의 전령 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 박태겸의 후계 제안을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘이고, 에바 노바코바의 배차 변경을 배달하는 계약이며, 양해온의 인준 전갈과 시점을 맞춘다.\n\n**야망.** 도제 승계와 선로 봉쇄 통지를 자신이 날인하는 전령 원장에만 유효하게 만든다.\n\n**공포.** 위조 회의 전갈 한 장이 양자 승계를 무효로 돌려 전령망이 가문 나팔이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 위조 전갈을 찾아 봉인을 지키거나, 가방 속 보류 문서를 가문회의에 펼칠 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 30 | 무력 0 | 물질 10 | 공동 −15 | 원칙 10 | 공개 0 | 자격 20 | 분산 0 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 5 | 위험 25 | 과시 20 | 지속 5 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"소피아 로시","type":"지휘","to":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸의 후계 제안을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘이고"},{"from":"소피아 로시","type":"계약","to":"양해온","basis":"양해온의 인준 전갈과 시점을 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"미겔 토레스","type":"계약","to":"소피아 로시","basis":"미겔 토레스는 보존한 거짓 속보와 정정 시각을 소피아 로시에게 전한다. 소피아 로시는 회의 전갈의 날짜·인수 상대를 확인해 정정 전 소식이 현재 통지로 다시 쓰이지 않게 한다."}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0181', NULL, '{"id":"person-0181","name":"Patrick O''Connor","title":"North Bank Han River Abandoned Line Surveyor","position":"North Bank Han River Abandoned Line Surveyor","characterId":"K180","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Abandoned Line Water Sampling and Rail Condition Survey","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#inmul-Patrick O''Connor","detailRoute":"/people/person-0181","birthDate":"2065-06-02","birthday":"06-02","age":61,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"rail-route-survey","name":"Disused rail surveying","rating":65},{"id":"water-sampling","name":"Water sampling","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k180-disposition","name":"Rejecting late reports","description":"He read time from the riverside dead line''s water temperature and took no pride in a survey line missing from the map. He counted a late report a fault.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: Han River north bank dead line surveyor. He left intake and rail state in the same ledger and marked a collapsed section only when the Coordinator and the house elder signed together.","stress":"Fear. That the survey routes would be sealed as military secrets and the survey lines would be sold as great powers'' infiltration routes.","relationship":"Relations. An alliance handing bypass coordinates to Park Taegyeom, he matched Ju Ri-an''s northern pipeline dotted lines with the riverside and split manhole access with Seol Minu''s blockade patrol.","effects":[]},{"id":"k180-choice","name":"Making bypasses public","description":"Anecdote. In the 2125 station fire he carried out the roster of lives first. By this deed the signature of the Han River north bank dead line surveyor post rose into the ledger.","behavior":"Relations. An alliance handing bypass coordinates to Park Taegyeom, he matched Ju Ri-an''s northern pipeline dotted lines with the riverside and split manhole access with Seol Minu''s blockade patrol.","stress":"Fear. That the survey routes would be sealed as military secrets and the survey lines would be sold as great powers'' infiltration routes.","relationship":"Relations. An alliance handing bypass coordinates to Park Taegyeom, he matched Ju Ri-an''s northern pipeline dotted lines with the riverside and split manhole access with Seol Minu''s blockade patrol.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He records samples alongside rail condition and shares bypass coordinates. Saving a people ledger in a fire supports responsibility, not railway construction experience.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":5,"Openness":20,"Force":-10,"Material":25,"Communal":-20,"Principle":0,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":25,"Risk":30,"Display":25,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Livelihood":"Abandoned Line Water Sampling and Rail Condition Survey","Title":"North Bank Han River Abandoned Line Surveyor","Values":"Authority 5 | Openness 20 | Force −10 | Material 25 | Communal −20 | Principle 0 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Longing 15 | Monopoly 25 | Risk 30 | Display 25 | Endurance −10 | Orientation Heterosexual | Bonding Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Patrick O''Connor, born in 2065, takes up the duties of North Bank Han River Abandoned Line Surveyor in the opening period of 2126. Raised on the waiting-hall watch. The North Bank Han River Abandoned Line Surveyor work began with a substitute watch for an unexcused shift absence. The Irish family line is rooted in the Yongsan–Itaewon living sphere. Sean O''Connor lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in Yongsan–Itaewon, working in private lodging in Itaewon and in freight recording in Yongsan. The family passed its records of lodgings and goods handovers to the next generation, and Patrick O''Connor''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the living ledgers of their day. They speak English at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Patrick O''Connor''s work surveying water samples and rail conditions on abandoned lines is tied to Ichon 2-dong.","Offices":"Rank Jusa. Title: North Bank Han River Abandoned Line Surveyor. Records water samples and rail conditions in the same ledger; a collapsed section is marked only when the Coordinator and a clan elder sign at the same time.","Anecdote":"During the station fire of 2125, carried out the ledger of lives first. Prompted by this act, the signature for the North Bank Han River Abandoned Line Surveyor post was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"An ally who hands detour coordinates to Park Taegyeom, aligns the riverbank with Ju Rian''s northern piping dotted line, and shares manhole access with the blockade patrol.","Ambition":"To draw the Yongsan junction and the riverside detour sidings on a single public chart so that the relay stations can dispatch detours without a war.","Fear":"That the survey routes will be sealed as military secrets and the sidings sold off as infiltration routes for the great powers.","Intervention":"Can take on siding escort duty and make the detour dispatch happen, or expose the markings of a secret infiltration route."},"biography":"Reads the time by the water temperature of the abandoned riverside line, and takes no pride in sidings that are not on the map. Regards a late report as a crime.\n\n- Affiliation: Transfer Bureau\n- Rank: Clerk (Jusa)\n- Livelihood: Abandoned-line water sampling and rail condition surveying\n- Title: Han River North Bank Abandoned Line Surveyor\n**Life.** Born in 2065, Patrick O''Connor takes up the post of Han River North Bank Abandoned Line Surveyor in the opening period of 2126. He grew up on waiting-hall duty. The post began with a substitute duty shift after an unexcused absence. His Irish-descended family is rooted in the Yongsan–Itaewon living sphere. Sean O''Connor lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in Yongsan–Itaewon, working in Itaewon private lodging and Yongsan freight records. The family passed records of residences and goods handovers down to the next generation, and Patrick O''Connor''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the living ledgers of their day. He speaks English at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Patrick O''Connor''s work in abandoned-line water sampling and rail condition surveying is tied to Ichon 2-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Han River North Bank Abandoned Line Surveyor. He records water sampling and rail condition in the same ledger, and a collapsed section is marked only when the coordinator and a clan elder sign at the same time.\n\n**Anecdote.** In the 2125 station fire, he carried out the casualty ledger first. This act got the signature of the Han River North Bank Abandoned Line Surveyor post entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** An ally who hands detour coordinates to Park Taegyeom, aligns the riverbank with Ju Rian''s northern piping dotted line, and shares blockade patrols and manhole access.\n\n**Ambition.** To draw the Yongsan connection and the riverside detour siding on a single public chart, so that the Relay Bureau reroutes dispatch without war.\n\n**Fear.** That the survey route will be sealed as a military secret and the siding sold off as a great power''s infiltration route.\n\n**Intervention.** You can escort the sidings to bring about the rerouted dispatch, or expose the secret infiltration route marking.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 5 | Openness 20 | Force −10 | Materialism 25 | Community −20 | Principle 0 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Monopoly 25 | Risk 30 | Display 25 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: heterosexual | Union: monogamous marriage\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Patrick O''Connor","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"an ally who hands Bak Taegyeom the detour coordinates,"},{"from":"Patrick O''Connor","type":"Contract","to":"Ju Rian","basis":"Aligning Ju Ri-an''s northern pipe dotted line with the riverbank"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Barbora Prohaskova","type":"Contract","to":"Patrick O''Connor","basis":"Barbora Procházková relays flood-closure locations and dispatch delays to Patrick O''Connor. Patrick O''Connor distinguishes the risks confirmed by his rail and water-sampling surveys from detour routes that have not yet been confirmed."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0181","name":"패트릭 오코너","title":"한강 북안 폐선 탐사원","position":"한강 북안 폐선 탐사원","characterId":"K180","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"폐선 채수·레일 상태 조사","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-패트릭 오코너","detailRoute":"/people/person-0181","birthDate":"2065-06-02","birthday":"06-02","age":61,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"rail-route-survey","name":"폐선 경로 조사","rating":65},{"id":"water-sampling","name":"채수","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k180-disposition","name":"늦은 보고 거부","description":"강변 폐선의 수온으로 시간을 읽고, 지도에 없는 측선을 자랑으로 여기지 않는다. 늦은 보고를 죄로 본다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 한강 북안 폐선 탐사원. 채수와 레일 상태를 같은 원장에 남기고, 붕괴 구간은 조정관과 가문 원로가 동시에 서명해야 표시한다.","stress":"공포. 탐사 경로가 군사 비밀로 봉인되어 측선이 강국의 침투로로 팔리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 박태겸에게 우회 좌표를 넘기는 동맹이고, 주리안의 북부 배관 점선과 강변을 맞추며, 마커스 윌슨의 봉쇄 순찰과 맨홀 출입을 나눈다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k180-choice","name":"우회를 공개함","description":"일화. 2125년 역사 화재 때 인명 장부부터 꺼내 들고 나왔다. 이 일로 한강 북안 폐선 탐사원 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","behavior":"관계. 박태겸에게 우회 좌표를 넘기는 동맹이고, 주리안의 북부 배관 점선과 강변을 맞추며, 마커스 윌슨의 봉쇄 순찰과 맨홀 출입을 나눈다.","stress":"공포. 탐사 경로가 군사 비밀로 봉인되어 측선이 강국의 침투로로 팔리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 박태겸에게 우회 좌표를 넘기는 동맹이고, 주리안의 북부 배관 점선과 강변을 맞추며, 마커스 윌슨의 봉쇄 순찰과 맨홀 출입을 나눈다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"채수와 레일 상태를 함께 기록하고 우회 좌표를 나눈다. 화재 때 인명 장부를 구한 행동은 책임의 근거이지 철도 건설 실적이 아니다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":5,"개방":20,"무력":-10,"물질":25,"공동":-20,"원칙":0,"공개":-10,"자격":20,"분산":10,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":25,"위험":30,"과시":25,"지속":-10,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"주사","생업":"폐선 채수·레일 상태 조사","직함":"한강 북안 폐선 탐사원","가치관":"권위 5 | 개방 20 | 무력 −10 | 물질 25 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −10 | 자격 20 | 분산 10 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 25 | 위험 30 | 과시 25 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2065년생인 패트릭 오코너는 2126년 개막기에 한강 북안 폐선 탐사원 업무를 맡는다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 한강 북안 폐선 탐사원 업무는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직을 계기로 시작됐다. 아일랜드계 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 숀 오코너는 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 이태원 민간 숙박과 용산 화물 기록 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 패트릭 오코너의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 패트릭 오코너의 폐선 채수·레일 상태 조사 업무는 이촌2동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 한강 북안 폐선 탐사원. 채수와 레일 상태를 같은 원장에 남기고, 붕괴 구간은 조정관과 가문 원로가 동시에 서명해야 표시한다.","일화":"2125년 역사 화재 때 인명 장부부터 꺼내 들고 나왔다. 이 행동을 계기로 한강 북안 폐선 탐사원 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"박태겸에게 우회 좌표를 넘기는 동맹이고, 주리안의 북부 배관 점선과 강변을 맞추며, 봉쇄 순찰과 맨홀 출입을 나눈다.","야망":"용산 접속과 강변 우회 측선을 한 장의 공개 해도로 그려 중계국이 전쟁 없이 우회 배차하게 한다.","공포":"탐사 경로가 군사 비밀로 봉인되어 측선이 강국의 침투로로 팔리는 것.","개입":"측선 호위를 맡아 우회 배차를 성사시키거나, 비밀 침투로 표시를 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"강변 폐선의 수온으로 시간을 읽고, 지도에 없는 측선을 자랑으로 여기지 않는다. 늦은 보고를 죄로 본다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 주사\n- 생업: 폐선 채수·레일 상태 조사\n- 직함: 한강 북안 폐선 탐사원\n**생애.** 2065년생인 패트릭 오코너는 2126년 개막기에 한강 북안 폐선 탐사원 업무를 맡는다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 한강 북안 폐선 탐사원 업무는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직을 계기로 시작됐다. 아일랜드계 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 숀 오코너는 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 이태원 민간 숙박과 용산 화물 기록 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 패트릭 오코너의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 패트릭 오코너의 폐선 채수·레일 상태 조사 업무는 이촌2동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 한강 북안 폐선 탐사원. 채수와 레일 상태를 같은 원장에 남기고, 붕괴 구간은 조정관과 가문 원로가 동시에 서명해야 표시한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 역사 화재 때 인명 장부부터 꺼내 들고 나왔다. 이 행동을 계기로 한강 북안 폐선 탐사원 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 박태겸에게 우회 좌표를 넘기는 동맹이고, 주리안의 북부 배관 점선과 강변을 맞추며, 봉쇄 순찰과 맨홀 출입을 나눈다.\n\n**야망.** 용산 접속과 강변 우회 측선을 한 장의 공개 해도로 그려 중계국이 전쟁 없이 우회 배차하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 탐사 경로가 군사 비밀로 봉인되어 측선이 강국의 침투로로 팔리는 것.\n\n**개입.** 측선 호위를 맡아 우회 배차를 성사시키거나, 비밀 침투로 표시를 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 5 | 개방 20 | 무력 −10 | 물질 25 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −10 | 자격 20 | 분산 10 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 25 | 위험 30 | 과시 25 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"패트릭 오코너","type":"계약","to":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸에게 우회 좌표를 넘기는 동맹이고"},{"from":"패트릭 오코너","type":"계약","to":"주리안","basis":"주리안의 북부 배관 점선과 강변을 맞추며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"바르보라 프로하스코바","type":"계약","to":"패트릭 오코너","basis":"바르보라 프로하스코바는 침수 폐쇄 위치와 배차 지연을 패트릭 오코너에게 전한다. 패트릭 오코너는 레일·채수 조사로 확인된 위험과 아직 확인되지 않은 우회 경로를 구분한다."}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0182', NULL, '{"id":"person-0182","name":"Léa Martin","title":"Archivist of the Train Dispatcher-General","position":"Archivist of the Train Dispatcher-General","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Posting Dispatch Copies and Recalculating Emergency Occupancy","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"S07","stateName":"The Junction","detailRoute":"/people/person-0182","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":5,"effective":5},"prowess":{"base":5,"effective":5}}}}', '{"id":"person-0182","name":"레아 마르탱","title":"열차 배차원장 기록관","position":"열차 배차원장 기록관","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"배차 사본 게시·비상 점유 재계산","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"S07","stateName":"환적국","detailRoute":"/people/person-0182","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":5,"effective":5},"prowess":{"base":5,"effective":5}}}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0183', NULL, '{"id":"person-0183","name":"Mateusz Kowalski","title":"Yongsan Station Waiting Hall Stationmaster","position":"Yongsan Station Waiting Hall Stationmaster","characterId":"K182","rank":"Duty Chief","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Operating the Waiting Hall Transshipment Counter and Mandatory Waiting Tickets","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#inmul-mateusz-kowalski","detailRoute":"/people/person-0183","birthDate":"2078-04-30","birthday":"04-30","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"queue-administration","name":"Queue administration","rating":65},{"id":"public-announcements","name":"Station announcements","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k182-disposition","name":"Public counter first","description":"He gauged transshipment crowds by platform humidity and heard as an insult any order to push the apprentice waiting line behind the house freight cars. Mild in manner, he took the broadcast himself whenever a detention warning rose.","behavior":"Office. Rank: duty chief. Title: Yongsan Station concourse stationmaster. He published the concourse transshipment window and the care waiting lists daily and coupled armored freight cars to the platform only after the water train had left.","stress":"Fear. That war rumor alone would blockade the concourse and scatter the relay crowds into riverside smuggler boats.","relationship":"Relations. An alliance announcing Gabriel Johnson''s warehouse care lockdown by broadcast, he executed Eva Nováková''s dispatch order at the platform and wrote Lukas Schneider''s warehouse lease order onto the chalkboard.","effects":[]},{"id":"k182-choice","name":"Protecting apprentice queues","description":"Anecdote. In 2125 he sent a private petition back and passed it to the public window. By this deed the signature of the Yongsan Station concourse stationmaster post rose into the ledger.","behavior":"Relations. An alliance announcing Gabriel Johnson''s warehouse care lockdown by broadcast, he executed Eva Nováková''s dispatch order at the platform and wrote Lukas Schneider''s warehouse lease order onto the chalkboard.","stress":"Fear. That war rumor alone would blockade the concourse and scatter the relay crowds into riverside smuggler boats.","relationship":"Relations. An alliance announcing Gabriel Johnson''s warehouse care lockdown by broadcast, he executed Eva Nováková''s dispatch order at the platform and wrote Lukas Schneider''s warehouse lease order onto the chalkboard.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He redirects favors to the public counter and announces clinic closures. His strength is linking queues, not an already completed hub.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":10,"Force":-10,"Material":25,"Communal":-10,"Principle":-5,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":0,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":-5,"Monopoly":15,"Risk":30,"Display":-20,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Duty Chief","Livelihood":"Operating the Waiting Hall Transshipment Counter and Mandatory Waiting Tickets","Title":"Yongsan Station Waiting Hall Stationmaster","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness 10 | Force −10 | Materialism 25 | Community −10 | Principle −5 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 0 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving −5 | Monopoly 15 | Risk 30 | Display −20 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: heterosexual | Union: contractual cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in 2078, Mateusz Kowalski takes up the post of Yongsan Station Waiting Hall Stationmaster in the opening period of 2126. He grew up on waiting-hall duty. The post began with a substitute duty shift after an unexcused absence. His Polish-descended family is rooted in the living sphere of a private maintenance household in Yongsan tied to the Dongdaemun Central Asian commercial district. Stanisław Kowalski lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 doing private maintenance work at the Yongsan freight depot, as part of a private maintenance household in Yongsan tied to the Dongdaemun Central Asian commercial district. The family passed records of residences and goods handovers down to the next generation, and Mateusz Kowalski''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the living ledgers of their day. He speaks Polish at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Mateusz Kowalski''s work running the waiting-hall transfer window and mandatory waiting tickets is tied to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Duty Chief. Title: Yongsan Station Waiting Hall Stationmaster. He publishes the waiting-hall transfer window and the mandatory waiting tickets every day, and couples armored freight cars to the platform only after the water-supply train has left.","Anecdote":"In 2125 he turned away a private solicitation and sent it to the public window. This act got the signature of the Yongsan Station Waiting Hall Stationmaster post entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"An ally who announces Gabriel Johnson''s window clinic blockade by broadcast, enforces Eva Nováková''s dispatch order on the platform, and copies Lukas Schneider''s warehouse lease turn order onto the chalkboard.","Ambition":"To turn the Yongsan waiting hall into a relay hub where dispatch, transfer and clinic are signed under one roof, and so become the face-to-face window of the Vassal Realm.","Fear":"That rumors of war alone will get the waiting hall blockaded and the relay crowds scattered onto riverside smuggling boats.","Intervention":"Can block the order to seal the waiting hall and defend the counter, or expose the manipulation of queue tickets and have the stationmaster demoted."},"biography":"Gauges the transfer crowd by platform humidity, and hears the order to push the apprentice queue behind the clan freight cars as an insult. Mild-mannered, but takes over the broadcast himself when a detention notice appears.\n\n- Affiliation: Transfer Bureau\n- Rank: Duty Chief\n- Livelihood: Running the waiting-hall transfer window and mandatory waiting tickets\n- Title: Yongsan Station Waiting Hall Stationmaster\n**Life.** Born in 2078, Mateusz Kowalski takes up the post of Yongsan Station Waiting Hall Stationmaster in the opening period of 2126. He grew up on waiting-hall duty. The post began with a substitute duty shift after an unexcused absence. His Polish-descended family is rooted in the living sphere of a private maintenance household in Yongsan tied to the Dongdaemun Central Asian commercial district. Stanisław Kowalski lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 doing private maintenance work at the Yongsan freight depot, as part of a private maintenance household in Yongsan tied to the Dongdaemun Central Asian commercial district. The family passed records of residences and goods handovers down to the next generation, and Mateusz Kowalski''s parents'' generation cross-checked those records against the living ledgers of their day. He speaks Polish at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Mateusz Kowalski''s work running the waiting-hall transfer window and mandatory waiting tickets is tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Duty Chief. Title: Yongsan Station Waiting Hall Stationmaster. He publishes the waiting-hall transfer window and the mandatory waiting tickets every day, and couples armored freight cars to the platform only after the water-supply train has left.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125 he turned away a private solicitation and sent it to the public window. This act got the signature of the Yongsan Station Waiting Hall Stationmaster post entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** An ally who announces Gabriel Johnson''s window clinic blockade by broadcast, enforces Eva Nováková''s dispatch order on the platform, and copies Lukas Schneider''s warehouse lease turn order onto the chalkboard.\n\n**Ambition.** To turn the Yongsan waiting hall into a relay hub where dispatch, transfer and clinic are signed under one roof, and so become the face-to-face window of the Vassal Realm.\n\n**Fear.** That rumors of war alone will get the waiting hall blockaded and the relay crowds scattered onto riverside smuggling boats.\n\n**Intervention.** You can block the waiting-hall blockade order and protect the window, or expose ticket tampering and have the stationmaster demoted.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness 10 | Force −10 | Materialism 25 | Community −10 | Principle −5 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 0 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Monopoly 15 | Risk 30 | Display −20 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: heterosexual | Union: contractual cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Mateusz Kowalski","type":"Command","to":"Eva Novakova","basis":"Enforcing Eva Novakova''s dispatch order on the platform,"},{"from":"Mateusz Kowalski","type":"Contract","to":"Gabriel Johnson","basis":"an ally who broadcasts news of the blockade of Gabriel Johnson''s depot clinic,"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Elena Morozova","type":"Contract","to":"Mateusz Kowalski","basis":"Supporting Mateusz Kowalski''s waiting-hall window with guidance,"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0183","name":"마테우시 코발스키","title":"용산역 대합실 역장","position":"용산역 대합실 역장","characterId":"K182","rank":"당직장","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"대합실 환적 창구·의무 대기표 운영","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-마테우시 코발스키","detailRoute":"/people/person-0183","birthDate":"2078-04-30","birthday":"04-30","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"queue-administration","name":"대기표 운영","rating":65},{"id":"public-announcements","name":"역 방송","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k182-disposition","name":"공개 창구 우선","description":"승강장 습기로 환적인파를 가늠하고, 도제 대기열을 가문 화차 뒤로 미루라는 명령을 모욕으로 듣는다. 온화하나 억류 예고가 뜨면 방송을 직접 잡는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 당직장. 직함은 용산역 대합실 역장. 대합실 환적 창구와 의무 대기표를 매일 공개하고, 장갑 화물차는 급수열차가 떠난 뒤에만 승강장에 붙인다.","stress":"공포. 전쟁 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 중계 인파가 강변 밀선으로 흩어지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료 봉쇄를 방송으로 알리는 동맹이고, 에바 노바코바의 배차 순서를 승강장에서 집행하며, 루카스 슈나이더의 창고 임대 순번을 칠판에 옮겨 적는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k182-choice","name":"도제의 순서 보호","description":"일화. 2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다. 이 일로 용산역 대합실 역장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","behavior":"관계. 가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료 봉쇄를 방송으로 알리는 동맹이고, 에바 노바코바의 배차 순서를 승강장에서 집행하며, 루카스 슈나이더의 창고 임대 순번을 칠판에 옮겨 적는다.","stress":"공포. 전쟁 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 중계 인파가 강변 밀선으로 흩어지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료 봉쇄를 방송으로 알리는 동맹이고, 에바 노바코바의 배차 순서를 승강장에서 집행하며, 루카스 슈나이더의 창고 임대 순번을 칠판에 옮겨 적는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"청탁을 공개 창구로 돌리고 진료 봉쇄를 방송한다. 환적·진료 순서를 잇는 운영이 강점이며 허브의 완성은 아직 목표다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":10,"무력":-10,"물질":25,"공동":-10,"원칙":-5,"공개":-10,"자격":20,"분산":0,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":15,"위험":30,"과시":-20,"지속":-10,"지향":"이성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"당직장","생업":"대합실 환적 창구·의무 대기표 운영","직함":"용산역 대합실 역장","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 10 | 무력 −10 | 물질 25 | 공동 −10 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −10 | 자격 20 | 분산 0 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 −5 | 독점 15 | 위험 30 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2078년생인 마테우시 코발스키는 2126년 개막기에 용산역 대합실 역장 업무를 맡는다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 용산역 대합실 역장 업무는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직을 계기로 시작됐다. 폴란드계 가계는 동대문 중앙아시아 상권과 연결된 용산 민간 정비 가구 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 스타니스와프 코발스키는 약 2026년 동대문 중앙아시아 상권과 연결된 용산 민간 정비 가구에서 용산 화물창 민간 정비 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 마테우시 코발스키의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 폴란드어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 마테우시 코발스키의 대합실 환적 창구·의무 대기표 운영 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 당직장. 직함은 용산역 대합실 역장. 대합실 환적 창구와 의무 대기표를 매일 공개하고, 장갑 화물차는 급수열차가 떠난 뒤에만 승강장에 붙인다.","일화":"2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다. 이 행동을 계기로 용산역 대합실 역장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료 봉쇄를 방송으로 알리는 동맹이고, 에바 노바코바의 배차 순서를 승강장에서 집행하며, 루카스 슈나이더의 창고 임대 순번을 칠판에 옮겨 적는다.","야망":"용산 대합실을 배차·환적·진료가 한 지붕에서 서명되는 중계 허브로 만들어 후국의 대면 창구가 된다.","공포":"전쟁 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 중계 인파가 강변 밀선으로 흩어지는 것.","개입":"대합실 봉쇄 명령을 막아 창구를 지키거나, 대기표 조작을 밝혀 역장을 강등시킬 수 있다."},"biography":"승강장 습기로 환적인파를 가늠하고, 도제 대기열을 가문 화차 뒤로 미루라는 명령을 모욕으로 듣는다. 온화하나 억류 예고가 뜨면 방송을 직접 잡는다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 당직장\n- 생업: 대합실 환적 창구·의무 대기표 운영\n- 직함: 용산역 대합실 역장\n**생애.** 2078년생인 마테우시 코발스키는 2126년 개막기에 용산역 대합실 역장 업무를 맡는다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 용산역 대합실 역장 업무는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직을 계기로 시작됐다. 폴란드계 가계는 동대문 중앙아시아 상권과 연결된 용산 민간 정비 가구 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 스타니스와프 코발스키는 약 2026년 동대문 중앙아시아 상권과 연결된 용산 민간 정비 가구에서 용산 화물창 민간 정비 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 마테우시 코발스키의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 폴란드어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 마테우시 코발스키의 대합실 환적 창구·의무 대기표 운영 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 당직장. 직함은 용산역 대합실 역장. 대합실 환적 창구와 의무 대기표를 매일 공개하고, 장갑 화물차는 급수열차가 떠난 뒤에만 승강장에 붙인다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다. 이 행동을 계기로 용산역 대합실 역장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료 봉쇄를 방송으로 알리는 동맹이고, 에바 노바코바의 배차 순서를 승강장에서 집행하며, 루카스 슈나이더의 창고 임대 순번을 칠판에 옮겨 적는다.\n\n**야망.** 용산 대합실을 배차·환적·진료가 한 지붕에서 서명되는 중계 허브로 만들어 후국의 대면 창구가 된다.\n\n**공포.** 전쟁 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 중계 인파가 강변 밀선으로 흩어지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 대합실 봉쇄 명령을 막아 창구를 지키거나, 대기표 조작을 밝혀 역장을 강등시킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 10 | 무력 −10 | 물질 25 | 공동 −10 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −10 | 자격 20 | 분산 0 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 −5 | 독점 15 | 위험 30 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"마테우시 코발스키","type":"지휘","to":"에바 노바코바","basis":"에바 노바코바의 배차 순서를 승강장에서 집행하며"},{"from":"마테우시 코발스키","type":"계약","to":"가브리엘 존슨","basis":"가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료 봉쇄를 방송으로 알리는 동맹이고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"엘레나 모로조바","type":"계약","to":"마테우시 코발스키","basis":"마테우시 코발스키의 대합실 창구를 안내로 받치고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0184', NULL, '{"id":"person-0184","name":"André Dubois","title":"Yongsan Depot Siding Supervisor","position":"Yongsan Depot Siding Supervisor","characterId":"K183","rank":"Duty Chief","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Siding Power Allocation and Charging Control","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#inmul-andre dubois","detailRoute":"/people/person-0184","birthDate":"2074-05-26","birthday":"05-26","age":52,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"power-allocation","name":"Power allocation","rating":70},{"id":"overload-inspection","name":"Overload inspection","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k183-disposition","name":"Safety before military charging","description":"He read overload from the transformer''s vibration and burned any note telling him to give a column to military charging over transshipment. Taciturn, he shaved no rotation log.","behavior":"Office. Rank: duty chief. Title: Yongsan warehouse siding supervisor. He left the power distribution on the public gauge board and allowed military charging only while warehouse temperature stayed below the danger line.","stress":"Fear. That one over-discharge would kill the cold columns, and the Noryangjin merchants would use that blackout as settlement-right pressure.","relationship":"Relations. Under command to power Lukas Schneider''s warehouse temperature, he matched output to Mykola Bondarenko''s brake trials and carried a debt for refusing O Haerin''s cold-storage charging request.","effects":[]},{"id":"k183-choice","name":"Unabridged shift logs","description":"Anecdote. In the 2125 station fire he carried out the roster of lives first. By this deed the signature of the Yongsan warehouse siding supervisor post rose into the ledger.","behavior":"Relations. Under command to power Lukas Schneider''s warehouse temperature, he matched output to Mykola Bondarenko''s brake trials and carried a debt for refusing O Haerin''s cold-storage charging request.","stress":"Fear. That one over-discharge would kill the cold columns, and the Noryangjin merchants would use that blackout as settlement-right pressure.","relationship":"Relations. Under command to power Lukas Schneider''s warehouse temperature, he matched output to Mykola Bondarenko''s brake trials and carried a debt for refusing O Haerin''s cold-storage charging request.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He reads overload through vibration and matches output to warehouse temperatures and trials. He saved the people ledger during a fire; invention is not established.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":20,"Force":-15,"Material":20,"Communal":-10,"Principle":-10,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":-10,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":35,"Risk":-5,"Display":-25,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Duty Chief","Livelihood":"Siding Power Allocation and Charging Control","Title":"Yongsan Depot Siding Supervisor","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 20 | Force −15 | Material 20 | Communal −10 | Principle −10 | Publicity −10 | Credentials 25 | Decentralization −10 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 45 | Possessiveness 35 | Risk −5 | Display −25 | Endurance 5 | Orientation: Same-sex | Bonding: None"},"sections":{"Life":"Andre Dubois, born in 2074, takes on the duties of Yongsan Depot Siding Overseer in the 2126 opening period. He grew up on waiting-hall duty. The Yongsan Depot Siding Overseer work began with covering an unexcused absence on a shift. His French-descent family is rooted in the Yongsan–Itaewon district. Louis Dubois lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 while working at a private warehouse and in electrical repair in Yongsan, in Yongsan–Itaewon. The family passed on its records of lodgings and goods handovers to the next generation, and Andre Dubois''s parents'' generation checked those records against the household ledgers of their time. They speak French at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Andre Dubois''s work controlling power distribution and charging on the siding is tied to Hangang-no-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Duty Chief. Title: Yongsan Depot Siding Overseer. He records power distribution on a public gauge board, and allows military-supply charging only when warehouse temperatures are below the danger line.","Anecdote":"During the 2125 Station Fire, he carried out the ledger of people first. Because of this act, his signature went into the ledger for the post of Yongsan Depot Siding Overseer.","Relationships":"He takes direction from Lucas Schneider to feed power to warehouse temperatures, matches output to Mykola Bondarenko''s brake test runs, and owes a debt for refusing Oh Haerin''s request for freezer charging.","Ambition":"To fix the Yongsan siding''s emergency power for water-supply and transshipment trains only, becoming the Relay Bureau''s late-night artery.","Fear":"That a single over-discharge will kill the freezer cars, and that the Noryangjin Trading House will use that blackout as leverage over payment authority.","Intervention":"Can find replacement batteries and open a dual supply, or expose the tampering with the gauges and have the supervisor replaced."},"biography":"He reads overload from transformer vibration and burns the notes telling him to give up cars to military-supply charging instead of transshipment. Taciturn; he never trims the shift log.\n\n- Affiliation: Transshipment Bureau\n- Rank: Duty Chief\n- Livelihood: Siding power distribution and charging control\n- Title: Yongsan Depot Siding Overseer\n**Life.** Andre Dubois, born in 2074, takes on the duties of Yongsan Depot Siding Overseer in the 2126 opening period. He grew up on waiting-hall duty. The Yongsan Depot Siding Overseer work began with covering an unexcused absence on a shift. His French-descent family is rooted in the Yongsan–Itaewon district. Louis Dubois lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 while working at a private warehouse and in electrical repair in Yongsan, in Yongsan–Itaewon. The family passed on its records of lodgings and goods handovers to the next generation, and Andre Dubois''s parents'' generation checked those records against the household ledgers of their time. They speak French at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Andre Dubois''s work controlling power distribution and charging on the siding is tied to Hangang-no-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Duty Chief. Title: Yongsan Depot Siding Overseer. He records power distribution on a public gauge board, and allows military-supply charging only when warehouse temperatures are below the danger line.\n\n**Anecdote.** During the 2125 Station Fire, he carried out the ledger of people first. Because of this act, his signature went into the ledger for the post of Yongsan Depot Siding Overseer.\n\n**Relations.** He takes direction from Lucas Schneider to feed power to warehouse temperatures, matches output to Mykola Bondarenko''s brake test runs, and owes a debt for refusing Oh Haerin''s request for freezer charging.\n\n**Ambition.** To fix the Yongsan siding''s emergency power for water-supply and transshipment trains only, becoming the Relay Bureau''s late-night artery.\n\n**Fear.** That a single over-discharge will kill the freezer cars, and that the Noryangjin Trading House will use that blackout as leverage over payment authority.\n\n**Intervention.** You can obtain replacement batteries to open a dual supply, or expose gauge-board tampering to have the overseer replaced.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 20 | Force −15 | Material 20 | Communal −10 | Principle −10 | Publicity −10 | Credentials 25 | Decentralization −10 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Possessiveness 35 | Risk −5 | Display −25 | Endurance 5 | Orientation: Same-sex | Bonding: None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"André Dubois","type":"Command","to":"Lucas Schneider","basis":"receives a command to supply power to Lucas Schneider''s warehouse temperature, and"},{"from":"André Dubois","type":"Command","to":"Mykola Bondarenko","basis":"Matching output with Mykola Bondarenko''s brake test runs"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Adeola Adeyemi","type":"Contract","to":"André Dubois","basis":"Supporting Andre Dubois''s siding power distribution from the generation side, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0184","name":"앙드레 뒤부아","title":"용산창 유치선 감독","position":"용산창 유치선 감독","characterId":"K183","rank":"당직장","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"유치선 전력 배분·충전 통제","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-앙드레 뒤부아","detailRoute":"/people/person-0184","birthDate":"2074-05-26","birthday":"05-26","age":52,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"power-allocation","name":"전력 배분","rating":70},{"id":"overload-inspection","name":"과부하 점검","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k183-disposition","name":"군수보다 안전","description":"변압기 진동으로 과부하를 읽고, 환적보다 군수 충전에 칸을 내주라는 쪽지를 태운다. 과묵하고 교대 일지를 깎지 않는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 당직장. 직함은 용산창 유치선 감독. 전력 배분을 공개 계기판에 남기고, 군수 충전은 창고 온도가 위험선 아래일 때만 허용한다.","stress":"공포. 한 번의 과방전으로 냉동 칸이 죽고, 그 정전을 노량진 상회가 결제권 압박으로 쓰는 것.","relationship":"관계. 루카스 슈나이더의 창고 온도에 전력을 대는 지휘를 받고, 미콜라 본다렌코의 제동 시운전에 출력을 맞추며, 오해린의 냉동 충전 요청을 거절한 빚이 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k183-choice","name":"일지를 깎지 않음","description":"일화. 2125년 역사 화재 때 인명 장부부터 꺼내 들고 나왔다. 이 일로 용산창 유치선 감독 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","behavior":"관계. 루카스 슈나이더의 창고 온도에 전력을 대는 지휘를 받고, 미콜라 본다렌코의 제동 시운전에 출력을 맞추며, 오해린의 냉동 충전 요청을 거절한 빚이 있다.","stress":"공포. 한 번의 과방전으로 냉동 칸이 죽고, 그 정전을 노량진 상회가 결제권 압박으로 쓰는 것.","relationship":"관계. 루카스 슈나이더의 창고 온도에 전력을 대는 지휘를 받고, 미콜라 본다렌코의 제동 시운전에 출력을 맞추며, 오해린의 냉동 충전 요청을 거절한 빚이 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"진동으로 과부하를 읽고 창고 온도와 시운전에 출력을 맞춘다. 화재 때 인명 장부를 먼저 구했으며 발전기 발명 경력은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":20,"무력":-15,"물질":20,"공동":-10,"원칙":-10,"공개":-10,"자격":25,"분산":-10,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":35,"위험":-5,"과시":-25,"지속":5,"지향":"동성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"당직장","생업":"유치선 전력 배분·충전 통제","직함":"용산창 유치선 감독","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 20 | 무력 −15 | 물질 20 | 공동 −10 | 원칙 −10 | 공개 −10 | 자격 25 | 분산 −10 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 35 | 위험 −5 | 과시 −25 | 지속 5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2074년생인 앙드레 뒤부아는 2126년 개막기에 용산창 유치선 감독 업무를 맡는다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 용산창 유치선 감독 업무는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직을 계기로 시작됐다. 프랑스계 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 루이 뒤부아는 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 용산의 민간 창고·전기 수선 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 앙드레 뒤부아의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 프랑스어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 앙드레 뒤부아의 유치선 전력 배분·충전 통제 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 당직장. 직함은 용산창 유치선 감독. 전력 배분을 공개 계기판에 남기고, 군수 충전은 창고 온도가 위험선 아래일 때만 허용한다.","일화":"2125년 역사 화재 때 인명 장부부터 꺼내 들고 나왔다. 이 행동을 계기로 용산창 유치선 감독 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"루카스 슈나이더의 창고 온도에 전력을 대는 지휘를 받고, 미콜라 본다렌코의 제동 시운전에 출력을 맞추며, 오해린의 냉동 충전 요청을 거절한 빚이 있다.","야망":"용산 유치선의 비상 전력을 급수·환적 열차 전용으로 고정해 중계국의 심야 동맥이 된다.","공포":"한 번의 과방전으로 냉동 칸이 죽고, 그 정전을 노량진 상회가 결제권 압박으로 쓰는 것.","개입":"대체 축전지를 구해 이중 공급을 열거나, 계기판 조작을 폭로해 감독을 교체할 수 있다."},"biography":"변압기 진동으로 과부하를 읽고, 환적보다 군수 충전에 칸을 내주라는 쪽지를 태운다. 과묵하고 교대 일지를 깎지 않는다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 당직장\n- 생업: 유치선 전력 배분·충전 통제\n- 직함: 용산창 유치선 감독\n**생애.** 2074년생인 앙드레 뒤부아는 2126년 개막기에 용산창 유치선 감독 업무를 맡는다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 용산창 유치선 감독 업무는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직을 계기로 시작됐다. 프랑스계 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 루이 뒤부아는 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 용산의 민간 창고·전기 수선 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 앙드레 뒤부아의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 프랑스어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 앙드레 뒤부아의 유치선 전력 배분·충전 통제 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 당직장. 직함은 용산창 유치선 감독. 전력 배분을 공개 계기판에 남기고, 군수 충전은 창고 온도가 위험선 아래일 때만 허용한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 역사 화재 때 인명 장부부터 꺼내 들고 나왔다. 이 행동을 계기로 용산창 유치선 감독 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 루카스 슈나이더의 창고 온도에 전력을 대는 지휘를 받고, 미콜라 본다렌코의 제동 시운전에 출력을 맞추며, 오해린의 냉동 충전 요청을 거절한 빚이 있다.\n\n**야망.** 용산 유치선의 비상 전력을 급수·환적 열차 전용으로 고정해 중계국의 심야 동맥이 된다.\n\n**공포.** 한 번의 과방전으로 냉동 칸이 죽고, 그 정전을 노량진 상회가 결제권 압박으로 쓰는 것.\n\n**개입.** 대체 축전지를 구해 이중 공급을 열거나, 계기판 조작을 폭로해 감독을 교체할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 20 | 무력 −15 | 물질 20 | 공동 −10 | 원칙 −10 | 공개 −10 | 자격 25 | 분산 −10 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 35 | 위험 −5 | 과시 −25 | 지속 5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"앙드레 뒤부아","type":"지휘","to":"루카스 슈나이더","basis":"루카스 슈나이더의 창고 온도에 전력을 대는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"앙드레 뒤부아","type":"지휘","to":"미콜라 본다렌코","basis":"미콜라 본다렌코의 제동 시운전에 출력을 맞추며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"아데올라 아데예미","type":"계약","to":"앙드레 뒤부아","basis":"앙드레 뒤부아의 유치선 전력 배분을 발전 쪽에서 받치고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0185', NULL, '{"id":"person-0185","name":"Helena Wiśniewska","title":"Riverside Transshipment Market Auctioneer","position":"Riverside Transshipment Market Auctioneer","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Transshipment Cargo Temperature Checks and Inventory Auction","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"S07","stateName":"The Junction","detailRoute":"/people/person-0185","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":4,"effective":4},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":5,"effective":5},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}}}}', '{"id":"person-0185","name":"헬레나 비슈니에프스카","title":"강변 환적시장 경매사","position":"강변 환적시장 경매사","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"환적 화물 온도 확인·재고 경매","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"S07","stateName":"환적국","detailRoute":"/people/person-0185","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":4,"effective":4},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":6,"effective":6},"learning":{"base":5,"effective":5},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}}}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0186', NULL, '{"id":"person-0186","name":"Noah Davis","title":"Yongsan Depot Mobile Medical Car Foreman","position":"Yongsan Depot Mobile Medical Car Foreman","characterId":"K185","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Mobile Medical Car Burn and Frostbite Treatment Operations","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#person-noah-davis","detailRoute":"/people/person-0186","birthDate":"2092-02-04","birthday":"02-04","age":34,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"mobile-patient-care","name":"Mobile patient care","rating":65},{"id":"medicine-allocation","name":"Medicine allocation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k185-disposition","name":"Family-based access","description":"When the apprentice lodge''s stove went out he changed care order to family units and heard as an insult any word telling him to skip the house columns for efficiency. Mild in manner, he tied the medicine boxes'' seal cords himself.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: Yongsan warehouse mobile clinic van chief. He ran the lodge-by-lodge burn and frostbite boards and, whenever ration pressure rose, opened the care beside the lodge with Isaac Walker''s maintenance-log joint signature.","stress":"Fear. That the detained train''s wounded would remain on refugee rosters alone, be pushed toward Changdong, and the clinic vans would become convoy prisons.","relationship":"Relations. Received patients into the lodge whenever Gabriel Johnson''s warehouse care locked down, owed a debt to avoid dodging Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy at the Yongsan warehouse, and exchanged Im Chowon''s passenger list with mobile care.","effects":[]},{"id":"k185-choice","name":"Rejecting exclusion for efficiency","description":"Anecdote. In 2125, short of herbs, he halved the prescriptions and divided them among everyone. By this deed the signature of the Yongsan warehouse mobile clinic van chief post rose into the ledger.","behavior":"Relations. Received patients into the lodge whenever Gabriel Johnson''s warehouse care locked down, owed a debt to avoid dodging Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy at the Yongsan warehouse, and exchanged Im Chowon''s passenger list with mobile care.","stress":"Fear. That the detained train''s wounded would remain on refugee rosters alone, be pushed toward Changdong, and the clinic vans would become convoy prisons.","relationship":"Relations. Received patients into the lodge whenever Gabriel Johnson''s warehouse care locked down, owed a debt to avoid dodging Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy at the Yongsan warehouse, and exchanged Im Chowon''s passenger list with mobile care.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He shares medicine and receives patients in lodgings during yard clinic closure. Family access is supported; a completed medical institution is not.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":25,"Force":-30,"Material":20,"Communal":-10,"Principle":15,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":40,"Dispersed":0,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":35,"Display":-15,"Sustained":15,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Livelihood":"Mobile Medical Car Burn and Frostbite Treatment Operations","Title":"Yongsan Depot Mobile Medical Car Foreman","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness 25 | Force −30 | Material 20 | Communal −10 | Principle 15 | Publicity −20 | Credentials 40 | Decentralization 0 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 30 | Possessiveness 10 | Risk 35 | Display −15 | Endurance 15 | Orientation: Fluid | Bonding: Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Noah Davis, born in 2092, takes on the duties of Yongsan Depot Mobile Medical Car Chief in the 2126 opening period. He grew up at the Jegi-dong infirmary. The Yongsan Depot Mobile Medical Car Chief work began with the sealing of counterfeit medicine. His European-American family is rooted in the Yongsan–Itaewon district. Edward Davis was handling U.S. Army supply work in Yongsan–Itaewon in 2026 when he experienced the severing of communication lines. The family passed on its records of lodgings and goods handovers to the next generation, and Noah Davis''s parents'' generation checked those records against the household ledgers of their time. They speak English at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Noah Davis''s work running burn and frostbite treatment in the mobile medical car is tied to Hangang-no-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Registrar. Title: Yongsan Depot Mobile Medical Car Chief. He runs dormitory-by-dormitory burn and frostbite boards, and when ration pressure rises, he opens treatment beside the dormitories with the co-signature of Isaac Walker''s maintenance log.","Anecdote":"In 2125, when medicine ran short, he halved the prescribed doses and shared them among everyone. Because of this act, his signature went into the ledger for the post of Yongsan Depot Mobile Medical Car Chief.","Relationships":"When Gabriel Johnson''s depot clinic is blockaded, he takes patients into the dormitories; he takes on debt by not avoiding Jang Sehwa''s medical escort at Yongsan Depot; and he trades mobile treatment for Im Chowon''s passenger list.","Ambition":"To get the mobile medical car into apprentice dormitories even when rations are cut, and to pin the minimum medical floor for adoptive succession onto the Vassal Assembly.","Fear":"That injured people from detained trains will remain only as names on a refugee register, be pushed off to Changdong, and the medical car will become a prisoner-transport jail.","Intervention":"You can escort the reagent boxes to keep dormitory treatment going, or find the secret pact to hand over the register and put the chief in jeopardy."},"biography":"When the apprentice dormitory stove goes out, he switches the order of treatment to family units, and he takes any suggestion to skip the clan wards for the sake of efficiency as an insult. He is gentle, but he ties the sealing cords on the medicine boxes himself.\n\n- Affiliation: Transfer Bureau\n- Rank: Jusa\n- Occupation: Running burn and frostbite treatment on the mobile medical car\n- Title: Mobile Medical Car Chief of Yongsan Depot\n**Life.** Born in 2092, Noah Davis takes up the post of Mobile Medical Car Chief of Yongsan Depot in the opening period of 2126. He grew up in the Jegi-dong infirmary. His work as Mobile Medical Car Chief of Yongsan Depot began with a counterfeit medicine seal. His Euro-American family line is rooted in the Yongsan–Itaewon living sphere. In 2026, Edward Davis handled U.S. Army supply duties in Yongsan–Itaewon and went through the severing of communication lines. The family passed down records of their residences and goods handovers to the next generation, and Noah Davis''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their day. They speak English at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Noah Davis''s work running burn and frostbite treatment on the mobile medical car is tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Jusa. Title: Mobile Medical Car Chief of Yongsan Depot. He runs per-dormitory burn and frostbite bulletin boards, and when ration pressure flares up, he opens treatment beside the dormitories under a joint signature with Isaac Walker''s maintenance log.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, when medicinal supplies ran short, he split the prescribed amounts in half and shared them among everyone. This act put his signature in the ledger for the post of Mobile Medical Car Chief of Yongsan Depot.\n\n**Relations.** When Gabriel Johnson''s depot clinic is blockaded, he takes the patients into the dormitories; he takes on debt so as not to avoid Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy at the Yongsan depot; and he trades Im Chowon''s passenger list for mobile treatment.\n\n**Ambition.** To get the mobile medical car into even those apprentice dormitories whose rations have been cut off, and to nail down a medical minimum for adoptive succession in the Fief Council.\n\n**Fear.** That the wounded from the detained train will be left only as names on a refugee register and be pushed off to Changdong, and that the medical car will become a prison transport.\n\n**Intervention.** You can escort the reagent boxes to keep dormitory treatment going, or find the secret pact on handing over the register and put the chief in jeopardy.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness 25 | Force −30 | Materialism 20 | Communalism −10 | Principle 15 | Publicity −20 | Credentials 40 | Decentralization 0 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Longing 30 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 35 | Display −15 | Endurance 15 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Noah Davis","type":"Debt","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Taking on debt so as not to avoid Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy at the Yongsan depot"},{"from":"Noah Davis","type":"Contract","to":"Gabriel Johnson","basis":"when Gabriel Johnson''s depot clinic is blockaded, takes the patients into the dorm, and"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0186","name":"노아 데이비스","title":"용산창 이동의무차 반장","position":"용산창 이동의무차 반장","characterId":"K185","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"이동의무차 화상·동상 진료 운영","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-노아 데이비스","detailRoute":"/people/person-0186","birthDate":"2092-02-04","birthday":"02-04","age":34,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"mobile-patient-care","name":"이동 환자 진료","rating":65},{"id":"medicine-allocation","name":"약재 배분","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k185-disposition","name":"가족 단위 접근","description":"도제 숙소 난로가 꺼지면 진료 순서를 가족 단위로 바꾸고, 효율을 이유로 가문 칸만 건너뛰라는 말을 모욕으로 듣는다. 온화하나 약품 상자의 봉인 끈은 직접 묶는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 용산창 이동의무차 반장. 숙소별 화상·동상 게시판을 운영하고, 배급 압박이 뜨면 아이작 워커의 정비 일지 연서로 숙소 옆 진료를 연다.","stress":"공포. 억류 열차 부상자가 난민 명부로만 남아 창동으로 떠밀리고 의무차가 호송 감옥이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료가 봉쇄되면 환자를 숙소로 받고, 장세화의 의료호송을 용산 창에서 피하지 않으려 빚을 지며, 임초원의 탑승자 명단과 이동 진료를 교환한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k185-choice","name":"배제 효율 거부","description":"일화. 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 이 일로 용산창 이동의무차 반장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","behavior":"관계. 가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료가 봉쇄되면 환자를 숙소로 받고, 장세화의 의료호송을 용산 창에서 피하지 않으려 빚을 지며, 임초원의 탑승자 명단과 이동 진료를 교환한다.","stress":"공포. 억류 열차 부상자가 난민 명부로만 남아 창동으로 떠밀리고 의무차가 호송 감옥이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료가 봉쇄되면 환자를 숙소로 받고, 장세화의 의료호송을 용산 창에서 피하지 않으려 빚을 지며, 임초원의 탑승자 명단과 이동 진료를 교환한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"약을 나누고 창 진료 봉쇄 때 숙소에서 환자를 받는다. 가족별 접근을 지키지만 숙소별 게시판을 의료 제도 완성으로 확대하지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":25,"무력":-30,"물질":20,"공동":-10,"원칙":15,"공개":-20,"자격":40,"분산":0,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":10,"위험":35,"과시":-15,"지속":15,"지향":"유동","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"주사","생업":"이동의무차 화상·동상 진료 운영","직함":"용산창 이동의무차 반장","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 25 | 무력 −30 | 물질 20 | 공동 −10 | 원칙 15 | 공개 −20 | 자격 40 | 분산 0 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 10 | 위험 35 | 과시 −15 | 지속 15 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2092년생인 노아 데이비스는 2126년 개막기에 용산창 이동의무차 반장 업무를 맡는다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 용산창 이동의무차 반장 업무는 가짜 약 봉인을 계기로 시작됐다. 유럽계 미국인 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 에드워드 데이비스는 2026년 용산·이태원에서 미 육군 보급 업무를 맡다가 연락망 단절을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 노아 데이비스의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 노아 데이비스의 이동의무차 화상·동상 진료 운영 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 용산창 이동의무차 반장. 숙소별 화상·동상 게시판을 운영하고, 배급 압박이 뜨면 아이작 워커의 정비 일지 연서로 숙소 옆 진료를 연다.","일화":"2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 이 행동을 계기로 용산창 이동의무차 반장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료가 봉쇄되면 환자를 숙소로 받고, 장세화의 의료호송을 용산 창에서 피하지 않으려 빚을 지며, 임초원의 탑승자 명단과 이동 진료를 교환한다.","야망":"배급이 끊긴 도제 숙소에도 이동 의무차가 들어가게 해 양자 승계의 의료 최저선을 후국회에 못 박는다.","공포":"억류 열차 부상자가 난민 명부로만 남아 창동으로 떠밀리고 의무차가 호송 감옥이 되는 것.","개입":"시약 상자를 호송해 숙소 진료를 유지하거나, 명부 양도 밀약을 찾아 반장을 위태롭게 할 수 있다."},"biography":"도제 숙소 난로가 꺼지면 진료 순서를 가족 단위로 바꾸고, 효율을 이유로 가문 칸만 건너뛰라는 말을 모욕으로 듣는다. 온화하나 약품 상자의 봉인 끈은 직접 묶는다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 주사\n- 생업: 이동의무차 화상·동상 진료 운영\n- 직함: 용산창 이동의무차 반장\n**생애.** 2092년생인 노아 데이비스는 2126년 개막기에 용산창 이동의무차 반장 업무를 맡는다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 용산창 이동의무차 반장 업무는 가짜 약 봉인을 계기로 시작됐다. 유럽계 미국인 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 에드워드 데이비스는 2026년 용산·이태원에서 미 육군 보급 업무를 맡다가 연락망 단절을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 노아 데이비스의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 노아 데이비스의 이동의무차 화상·동상 진료 운영 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 용산창 이동의무차 반장. 숙소별 화상·동상 게시판을 운영하고, 배급 압박이 뜨면 아이작 워커의 정비 일지 연서로 숙소 옆 진료를 연다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 이 행동을 계기로 용산창 이동의무차 반장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료가 봉쇄되면 환자를 숙소로 받고, 장세화의 의료호송을 용산 창에서 피하지 않으려 빚을 지며, 임초원의 탑승자 명단과 이동 진료를 교환한다.\n\n**야망.** 배급이 끊긴 도제 숙소에도 이동 의무차가 들어가게 해 양자 승계의 의료 최저선을 후국회에 못 박는다.\n\n**공포.** 억류 열차 부상자가 난민 명부로만 남아 창동으로 떠밀리고 의무차가 호송 감옥이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 시약 상자를 호송해 숙소 진료를 유지하거나, 명부 양도 밀약을 찾아 반장을 위태롭게 할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 25 | 무력 −30 | 물질 20 | 공동 −10 | 원칙 15 | 공개 −20 | 자격 40 | 분산 0 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 10 | 위험 35 | 과시 −15 | 지속 15 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"노아 데이비스","type":"빚","to":"장세화","basis":"장세화의 의료호송을 용산 창에서 피하지 않으려 빚을 지며"},{"from":"노아 데이비스","type":"계약","to":"가브리엘 존슨","basis":"가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료가 봉쇄되면 환자를 숙소로 받고"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0187', NULL, '{"id":"person-0187","name":"Adeola Adeyemi","title":"Transshipment Warehouse Emergency Generator Operator","position":"Transshipment Warehouse Emergency Generator Operator","characterId":"K186","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Emergency Generator Fuel and Output Operation","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#Person-Adeola Adeyemi","detailRoute":"/people/person-0187","birthDate":"2066-09-12","birthday":"09-12","age":60,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"emergency-generation","name":"Emergency generation","rating":70},{"id":"fuel-output-logging","name":"Fuel and output logging","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k186-disposition","name":"Cooling before banquets","description":"Sensitive to the smell of fuel, she hated verbal power routing. She took the political pressure to divert power from the cold columns to the house banquet lighting as an insult.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: transshipment warehouse emergency generator operator. Every shift she sealed the fuel remainder and output logs and sent them to André Dubois, and below minimum output she cut the house power even under the elder''s urging.","stress":"Fear. That on a night when the fuel ran dry the cold storage would thaw, and the Noryangjin settlement right would fill the gap.","relationship":"Relations. Backed André Dubois''s siding power distribution from the generation side, matched output to Nataliya Sokolova''s column temperature, and had obeyed Park Taegyeom''s relay maintenance but refused concealed power routing.","effects":[]},{"id":"k186-choice","name":"Limits to obedience","description":"Anecdote. In 2125 she sent a private petition back and passed it to the public window. By this deed the signature of the transshipment warehouse emergency generator operator post rose into the ledger.","behavior":"Relations. Backed André Dubois''s siding power distribution from the generation side, matched output to Nataliya Sokolova''s column temperature, and had obeyed Park Taegyeom''s relay maintenance but refused concealed power routing.","stress":"Fear. That on a night when the fuel ran dry the cold storage would thaw, and the Noryangjin settlement right would fill the gap.","relationship":"Relations. Backed André Dubois''s siding power distribution from the generation side, matched output to Nataliya Sokolova''s column temperature, and had obeyed Park Taegyeom''s relay maintenance but refused concealed power routing.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She sends sealed fuel and output logs each shift and cuts house supply below minimum output. She follows public operation while refusing concealed allocation.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":20,"Force":-5,"Material":30,"Communal":-10,"Principle":0,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":10,"Display":30,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Livelihood":"Emergency Generator Fuel and Output Operation","Title":"Transshipment Warehouse Emergency Generator Operator","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness 20 | Force −5 | Materialism 30 | Communalism −10 | Principle 0 | Publicity −15 | Credentials 30 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Longing 45 | Monopoly −10 | Risk 10 | Display 30 | Endurance 0 | Orientation None | Bonding Monogamy"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in 2066, Adeola Adeyemi takes up the post of Chief of Emergency Generator Operations at the Transfer Warehouse in the opening period of 2126. She grew up on waiting-room duty. Her work as Chief of Emergency Generator Operations at the Transfer Warehouse began with a substitute shift covering an unexcused absence. Her Nigerian Yoruba family line is rooted in the Itaewon–Yongsan living sphere. Olusegun Adeyemi went through the Great Blackout around 2026 in Itaewon–Yongsan, working in Itaewon private shops and Yongsan power repair. The family passed down records of their residences and goods handovers to the next generation, and Adeola Adeyemi''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their day. They speak Yoruba at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Adeola Adeyemi''s work operating emergency generator fuel and output is tied to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Jusa. Title: Chief of Emergency Generator Operations at the Transfer Warehouse. Each shift, she seals the fuel reserve and output log and sends it to André Dubois, and if output falls below the minimum, she cuts clan power distribution even under pressure from the elders.","Anecdote":"In 2125, she turned away a private request and sent it to the public counter. This act put her signature in the ledger for the post of Chief of Emergency Generator Operations at the Transfer Warehouse.","Relationships":"She supports André Dubois''s detention-line power allocation from the generation side, matches output to Natalia Sokolova''s compartment temperatures, and has obeyed Bak Taegyeom''s relay maintenance but refused concealed power distribution.","Ambition":"To bind Yongsan''s emergency generation and the warehouse power into a single open distribution grid and protect the quality sovereignty of transfer credit.","Fear":"That the freezers will thaw on a night when the fuel runs dry, and that the Noryangjin settlement authority will fill that gap.","Intervention":"He can secure substitute fuel to open a dual distribution grid, or expose the tampering with the output logs so that the operations chief is replaced."},"biography":"Sensitive to the smell of fuel and dislikes verbal power allocation. Takes political pressure to divert power to a clan banquet''s lighting instead of the freezer compartments as an insult.\n\n- Affiliation: Transfer Bureau\n- Rank: Jusa\n- Occupation: Emergency generator fuel and output operation\n- Title: Chief of Emergency Generator Operations at the Transfer Warehouse\n**Life.** Born in 2066, Adeola Adeyemi takes up the post of Chief of Emergency Generator Operations at the Transfer Warehouse in the opening period of 2126. She grew up on waiting-room duty. Her work as Chief of Emergency Generator Operations at the Transfer Warehouse began with a substitute shift covering an unexcused absence. Her Nigerian Yoruba family line is rooted in the Itaewon–Yongsan living sphere. Olusegun Adeyemi went through the Great Blackout around 2026 in Itaewon–Yongsan, working in Itaewon private shops and Yongsan power repair. The family passed down records of their residences and goods handovers to the next generation, and Adeola Adeyemi''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their day. They speak Yoruba at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Adeola Adeyemi''s work operating emergency generator fuel and output is tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Jusa. Title: Chief of Emergency Generator Operations at the Transfer Warehouse. Each shift, she seals the fuel reserve and output log and sends it to André Dubois, and if output falls below the minimum, she cuts clan power distribution even under pressure from the elders.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, she turned away a private request and sent it to the public counter. This act put her signature in the ledger for the post of Chief of Emergency Generator Operations at the Transfer Warehouse.\n\n**Relations.** She supports André Dubois''s detention-line power allocation from the generation side, matches output to Natalia Sokolova''s compartment temperatures, and has obeyed Bak Taegyeom''s relay maintenance but refused concealed power distribution.\n\n**Ambition.** To bind Yongsan''s emergency generation and the warehouse power into a single open distribution grid and protect the quality sovereignty of transfer credit.\n\n**Fear.** That the freezers will thaw on a night when the fuel runs dry, and that the Noryangjin settlement authority will fill that gap.\n\n**Intervention.** You can secure substitute fuel and open dual distribution, or expose the tampering with the output log and replace the chief of operations.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness 20 | Force −5 | Materialism 30 | Communalism −10 | Principle 0 | Publicity −15 | Credentials 30 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Longing 45 | Monopoly −10 | Risk 10 | Display 30 | Endurance 0 | Orientation None | Bonding Monogamy\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Adeola Adeyemi","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"obeys Bak Taegyeom''s keeping of the relay but refuses concealed power distribution"},{"from":"Adeola Adeyemi","type":"Contract","to":"André Dubois","basis":"Supporting Andre Dubois''s siding power distribution from the generation side, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Antoine Lefebvre","type":"Contract","to":"Adeola Adeyemi","basis":"Antoine Lefebvre reports to Adeola Adeyemi the condition of the transmission tower cleared of ice and the time of the antenna maintenance. Adeola Adeyemi checks the output log to distinguish a maintenance stoppage from a power gap."},{"from":"Étienne Moreau","type":"Contract","to":"Adeola Adeyemi","basis":"Étienne Moreau reports to Adeola Adeyemi the reserve batteries used for transmission and the shift times. Adeola Adeyemi checks the fuel and output records to distinguish the remaining power from the supply already used."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0187","name":"아데올라 아데예미","title":"환적창고 비상발전 운전장","position":"환적창고 비상발전 운전장","characterId":"K186","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"비상발전 연료·출력 운전","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-아데올라 아데예미","detailRoute":"/people/person-0187","birthDate":"2066-09-12","birthday":"09-12","age":60,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"emergency-generation","name":"비상발전 운전","rating":70},{"id":"fuel-output-logging","name":"연료 출력 기록","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k186-disposition","name":"연회보다 냉동","description":"연료 냄새에 예민하고 구두 배전을 싫어한다. 냉동 칸보다 가문 연회 조명에 전력을 돌리라는 정치적 압박을 모욕으로 여긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 환적창고 비상발전 운전장. 매 교대 연료 잔량과 출력 일지를 봉인해 앙드레 뒤부아에게 보내고, 최저 출력 이하면 원로의 독촉이 있어도 가문 배전을 끊는다.","stress":"공포. 연료가 바닥난 밤에 냉동이 녹고, 그 공백을 노량진 결제권이 메우는 것.","relationship":"관계. 앙드레 뒤부아의 유치선 전력 배분을 발전 쪽에서 받치고, 나탈리야 소콜로바의 칸 온도에 출력을 맞추며, 박태겸의 중계 유지에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k186-choice","name":"복종의 경계","description":"일화. 2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다. 이 일로 환적창고 비상발전 운전장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","behavior":"관계. 앙드레 뒤부아의 유치선 전력 배분을 발전 쪽에서 받치고, 나탈리야 소콜로바의 칸 온도에 출력을 맞추며, 박태겸의 중계 유지에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.","stress":"공포. 연료가 바닥난 밤에 냉동이 녹고, 그 공백을 노량진 결제권이 메우는 것.","relationship":"관계. 앙드레 뒤부아의 유치선 전력 배분을 발전 쪽에서 받치고, 나탈리야 소콜로바의 칸 온도에 출력을 맞추며, 박태겸의 중계 유지에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"교대마다 연료·출력을 봉인해 보내고 최저 출력 아래에서는 원로의 배전을 끊는다. 공개 운영에는 따르되 은폐 배전은 거부한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":20,"무력":-5,"물질":30,"공동":-10,"원칙":0,"공개":-15,"자격":30,"분산":10,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":-10,"위험":10,"과시":30,"지속":0,"지향":"무성향","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"주사","생업":"비상발전 연료·출력 운전","직함":"환적창고 비상발전 운전장","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 20 | 무력 −5 | 물질 30 | 공동 −10 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −15 | 자격 30 | 분산 10 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 −10 | 위험 10 | 과시 30 | 지속 0 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2066년생인 아데올라 아데예미는 2126년 개막기에 환적창고 비상발전 운전장 업무를 맡는다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 환적창고 비상발전 운전장 업무는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직을 계기로 시작됐다. 나이지리아 요루바계 가계는 이태원·용산 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 올루세군 아데예미는 약 2026년 이태원·용산에서 이태원 민간 상점과 용산 전력 수선 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 아데올라 아데예미의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 요루바어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 아데올라 아데예미의 비상발전 연료·출력 운전 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 환적창고 비상발전 운전장. 매 교대 연료 잔량과 출력 일지를 봉인해 앙드레 뒤부아에게 보내고, 최저 출력 이하면 원로의 독촉이 있어도 가문 배전을 끊는다.","일화":"2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다. 이 행동을 계기로 환적창고 비상발전 운전장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"앙드레 뒤부아의 유치선 전력 배분을 발전 쪽에서 받치고, 나탈리야 소콜로바의 칸 온도에 출력을 맞추며, 박태겸의 중계 유지에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.","야망":"용산 비상 발전과 창고 전력을 하나의 공개 배전망으로 묶어 환적 신용의 품질 주권을 지킨다.","공포":"연료가 바닥난 밤에 냉동이 녹고, 그 공백을 노량진 결제권이 메우는 것.","개입":"대체 연료를 구해 이중 배전을 열거나, 출력 일지 조작을 밝혀 운전장을 교체할 수 있다."},"biography":"연료 냄새에 예민하고 구두 배전을 싫어한다. 냉동 칸보다 가문 연회 조명에 전력을 돌리라는 정치적 압박을 모욕으로 여긴다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 주사\n- 생업: 비상발전 연료·출력 운전\n- 직함: 환적창고 비상발전 운전장\n**생애.** 2066년생인 아데올라 아데예미는 2126년 개막기에 환적창고 비상발전 운전장 업무를 맡는다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 환적창고 비상발전 운전장 업무는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직을 계기로 시작됐다. 나이지리아 요루바계 가계는 이태원·용산 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 올루세군 아데예미는 약 2026년 이태원·용산에서 이태원 민간 상점과 용산 전력 수선 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 아데올라 아데예미의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 요루바어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 아데올라 아데예미의 비상발전 연료·출력 운전 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 환적창고 비상발전 운전장. 매 교대 연료 잔량과 출력 일지를 봉인해 앙드레 뒤부아에게 보내고, 최저 출력 이하면 원로의 독촉이 있어도 가문 배전을 끊는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다. 이 행동을 계기로 환적창고 비상발전 운전장 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 앙드레 뒤부아의 유치선 전력 배분을 발전 쪽에서 받치고, 나탈리야 소콜로바의 칸 온도에 출력을 맞추며, 박태겸의 중계 유지에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.\n\n**야망.** 용산 비상 발전과 창고 전력을 하나의 공개 배전망으로 묶어 환적 신용의 품질 주권을 지킨다.\n\n**공포.** 연료가 바닥난 밤에 냉동이 녹고, 그 공백을 노량진 결제권이 메우는 것.\n\n**개입.** 대체 연료를 구해 이중 배전을 열거나, 출력 일지 조작을 밝혀 운전장을 교체할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 20 | 무력 −5 | 물질 30 | 공동 −10 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −15 | 자격 30 | 분산 10 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 −10 | 위험 10 | 과시 30 | 지속 0 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"아데올라 아데예미","type":"계약","to":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸의 중계 유지에는 복종하되 은폐 배전은 거부한다"},{"from":"아데올라 아데예미","type":"계약","to":"앙드레 뒤부아","basis":"앙드레 뒤부아의 유치선 전력 배분을 발전 쪽에서 받치고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"앙투안 르페브르","type":"계약","to":"아데올라 아데예미","basis":"앙투안 르페브르는 결빙을 제거한 송신탑의 상태와 안테나 정비 시각을 아데올라 아데예미에게 전한다. 아데올라 아데예미는 출력 일지를 확인해 정비 중단과 전력 공백을 구분한다."},{"from":"에티엔 모로","type":"계약","to":"아데올라 아데예미","basis":"에티엔 모로는 송신에 쓴 예비 전지와 교대 시각을 아데올라 아데예미에게 전한다. 아데올라 아데예미는 연료·출력 기록을 확인해 남은 전력과 이미 사용한 공급을 구분한다."}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0188', NULL, '{"id":"person-0188","name":"Martin Horak","title":"Dispatch Record Access Petitioner","position":"Dispatch Record Access Petitioner","characterId":"K187","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Dispatch Record Access Requests and Disclosure of Refusal Reasons","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#Person-Martin Horák","detailRoute":"/people/person-0188","birthDate":"2072-07-04","birthday":"07-04","age":54,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"record-access-requests","name":"Record access requests","rating":65},{"id":"timeline-comparison","name":"Timeline comparison","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k187-disposition","name":"Publishing refusals too","description":"He read a dispatch sheet with blanks as intent rather than accident and left two invoices with any elder who refused inspection. Pragmatic, he dealt harshly with a hand that erased hours.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: dispatch record inspection claimant. He pasted the inspection claim and the refusal reason together on the dispatch board and wrote that a secret formation running past a day stood void.","stress":"Fear. That after the inspection was rejected, his name alone would remain in the weapons column''s witness line.","relationship":"Relations. Claimed inspection of Park Taegyeom''s dispatch ledger, used Léa Martin''s margin notes as grounds, and overlaid the brake-defect hours Oleksandr Shevchenko had posted on the same line.","effects":[]},{"id":"k187-choice","name":"Suspicion of gaps","description":"Anecdote. When the winter black dispatch sheet exposed both the medical train''s weapons and the northern succession trial''s parts rigging, Martin Horák claimed inspection of the warehouse formations.","behavior":"Relations. Claimed inspection of Park Taegyeom''s dispatch ledger, used Léa Martin''s margin notes as grounds, and overlaid the brake-defect hours Oleksandr Shevchenko had posted on the same line.","stress":"Fear. That after the inspection was rejected, his name alone would remain in the weapons column''s witness line.","relationship":"Relations. Claimed inspection of Park Taegyeom''s dispatch ledger, used Léa Martin''s margin notes as grounds, and overlaid the brake-defect hours Oleksandr Shevchenko had posted on the same line.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He requests access to every formation and compares marginal notes with defect times. This is verification work, not proof that he solved the entire conspiracy.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":25,"Force":-5,"Material":25,"Communal":-10,"Principle":5,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":-5,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":-35,"Risk":-35,"Display":-45,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Livelihood":"Dispatch Record Access Requests and Disclosure of Refusal Reasons","Title":"Dispatch Record Access Petitioner","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness 25 | Force −5 | Materialism 25 | Communality −10 | Principle 5 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 25 | Dispersion −5 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 5 | Monopoly −35 | Risk −35 | Display −45 | Persistence 0 | Orientation No Orientation | Union Monogamy"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in 2072, Mareutin Horakeu takes up the work of Dispatch Record Access Requester in the 2126 opening period. Grew up at the Seoul Station registry office. The work began after a single line of a double ledger was deleted. The Czech-descended family has roots in the Yongsan–Itaewon living area. Karel Horakeu lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in Yongsan–Itaewon, working in Itaewon lodging and private technical services. The family passed down records of shelters and goods handovers to the next generation, and Mareutin Horakeu''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their day. They speak Czech at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Mareutin Horakeu''s work of requesting access to dispatch records and publishing the reasons for refusal is connected to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank Jusa. Title: Dispatch Record Access Requester. Posts the access request and the reason for refusal together on the dispatch board, and writes that a secret formation held past a day is void.","Anecdote":"When the winter''s black dispatch table exposed both the medical train weapons and the tampering with Northern Succession Exam parts at once, Mareutin Horakeu requested access to all Chang formations.","Relationships":"Requests access to Bak Taegyeom''s dispatch ledger, uses the marginal notes as grounds, and overlays the faulty-brake times that Olleksandeureu Syeuchenko recorded on the same line.","Ambition":"Sorts the trains of the official command network and the secret officer network out of a single public dispatch ledger so that Yongsan does not become a relay for steering toward war.","Fear":"After access is rejected, one''s own name remains alone in the witness column of the weapons car.","Intervention":"Can lay the refused access copy before the Domain Council, or escort the requester so that the ledger is opened to the very end."},"biography":"Regards a dispatch table with blanks as deliberate rather than an accident, and leaves two request forms for any elder who refuses access. Pragmatic, yet treats the hand that erases times harshly.\n\n- Affiliation: Transshipment Bureau\n- Rank: Jusa\n- Livelihood: Requesting dispatch record access and publishing reasons for refusal\n- Title: Dispatch Record Access Requester\n**Life.** Born in 2072, Mareutin Horakeu takes up the work of Dispatch Record Access Requester in the 2126 opening period. Grew up at the Seoul Station registry office. The work began after a single line of a double ledger was deleted. The Czech-descended family has roots in the Yongsan–Itaewon living area. Karel Horakeu lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in Yongsan–Itaewon, working in Itaewon lodging and private technical services. The family passed down records of shelters and goods handovers to the next generation, and Mareutin Horakeu''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their day. They speak Czech at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Mareutin Horakeu''s work of requesting access to dispatch records and publishing the reasons for refusal is connected to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank Jusa. Title: Dispatch Record Access Requester. Posts the access request and the reason for refusal together on the dispatch board, and writes that a secret formation held past a day is void.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the winter''s black dispatch table exposed both the medical train weapons and the tampering with Northern Succession Exam parts at once, Mareutin Horakeu requested access to all Chang formations.\n\n**Relationships.** Requests access to Bak Taegyeom''s dispatch ledger, uses the marginal notes as grounds, and overlays the faulty-brake times that Olleksandeureu Syeuchenko recorded on the same line.\n\n**Ambition.** Sorts the trains of the official command network and the secret officer network out of a single public dispatch ledger so that Yongsan does not become a relay for steering toward war.\n\n**Fear.** After access is rejected, one''s own name remains alone in the witness column of the weapons car.\n\n**Intervention.** Can lay the refused access copy before the Domain Council, or escort the requester so that the ledger is opened to the very end.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness 25 | Force −5 | Materialism 25 | Communality −10 | Principle 5 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 25 | Dispersion −5 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Monopoly −35 | Risk −35 | Display −45 | Persistence 0 | Orientation No Orientation | Union Monogamy\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Martin Horak","type":"Contract","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"requests access to Bak Taegyeom''s dispatch ledger,"},{"from":"Martin Horak","type":"Contract","to":"Oleksandr Shevchenko","basis":"Overlays the faulty-brake times recorded by Olleksandeureu Syeuchenko on the same line"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Oleksandr Shevchenko","type":"Contract","to":"Martin Horak","basis":"Attaches a specimen number to Mareutin Horakeu''s access request"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0188","name":"마르틴 호라크","title":"배차 기록 열람 청구인","position":"배차 기록 열람 청구인","characterId":"K187","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"배차 기록 열람 청구·거절 사유 공개","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-마르틴 호라크","detailRoute":"/people/person-0188","birthDate":"2072-07-04","birthday":"07-04","age":54,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"record-access-requests","name":"기록 열람 청구","rating":65},{"id":"timeline-comparison","name":"시각 기록 대조","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k187-disposition","name":"거절도 공개함","description":"빈칸이 있는 배차표를 사고보다 고의로 보고, 열람을 거절하는 원로에게는 청구서를 두 장 남긴다. 실리적이나 시각을 지우는 손을 가혹하게 다룬다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 배차 기록 열람 청구인. 열람 청구와 거절 사유를 배차판에 같이 붙이고, 하루를 넘긴 비밀 편성은 무효라고 적는다.","stress":"공포. 열람이 기각된 뒤 자신의 이름이 무기 칸 증인란에 홀로 남는 것.","relationship":"관계. 박태겸의 배차 원장 열람을 청구하고, 레아 마르탱의 난외 노트를 근거로 삼으며, 올렉산드르 셰우첸코가 붙인 제동 불량 시각을 같은 줄에 겹친다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k187-choice","name":"빈칸을 의심함","description":"일화. 겨울의 검은 배차표가 의료열차 무기와 북부 후계시험 부품 조작을 동시에 드러내자 마르틴 호라크는 창 전 편성의 열람을 청구했다.","behavior":"관계. 박태겸의 배차 원장 열람을 청구하고, 레아 마르탱의 난외 노트를 근거로 삼으며, 올렉산드르 셰우첸코가 붙인 제동 불량 시각을 같은 줄에 겹친다.","stress":"공포. 열람이 기각된 뒤 자신의 이름이 무기 칸 증인란에 홀로 남는 것.","relationship":"관계. 박태겸의 배차 원장 열람을 청구하고, 레아 마르탱의 난외 노트를 근거로 삼으며, 올렉산드르 셰우첸코가 붙인 제동 불량 시각을 같은 줄에 겹친다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"전 편성 열람을 청구하고 난외 노트와 불량 시각을 겹친다. 열람 청구는 검증 행동이며 조작의 전체 배후를 밝혔다는 뜻은 아니다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":25,"무력":-5,"물질":25,"공동":-10,"원칙":5,"공개":-20,"자격":25,"분산":-5,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":-35,"위험":-35,"과시":-45,"지속":0,"지향":"무성향","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"주사","생업":"배차 기록 열람 청구·거절 사유 공개","직함":"배차 기록 열람 청구인","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 25 | 무력 −5 | 물질 25 | 공동 −10 | 원칙 5 | 공개 −20 | 자격 25 | 분산 −5 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −35 | 과시 −45 | 지속 0 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2072년생인 마르틴 호라크는 2126년 개막기에 배차 기록 열람 청구인 업무를 맡는다. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 배차 기록 열람 청구인 업무는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제를 계기로 시작됐다. 체코계 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 카렐 호라크는 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 이태원 숙박·민간 기술 용역 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 마르틴 호라크의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 체코어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 마르틴 호라크의 배차 기록 열람 청구·거절 사유 공개 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 배차 기록 열람 청구인. 열람 청구와 거절 사유를 배차판에 같이 붙이고, 하루를 넘긴 비밀 편성은 무효라고 적는다.","일화":"겨울의 검은 배차표가 의료열차 무기와 북부 후계시험 부품 조작을 동시에 드러내자 마르틴 호라크는 창 전 편성의 열람을 청구했다.","관계":"박태겸의 배차 원장 열람을 청구하고, 난외 노트를 근거로 삼으며, 올렉산드르 셰우첸코가 붙인 제동 불량 시각을 같은 줄에 겹친다.","야망":"공식 명령망과 비밀 장교망의 열차를 한 장의 공개 배차 원장에서 가려 용산이 전쟁 유도의 중계가 되지 않게 한다.","공포":"열람이 기각된 뒤 자신의 이름이 무기 칸 증인란에 홀로 남는 것.","개입":"거절된 열람 사본을 후국회에 펼치거나, 청구인을 호송해 원장을 끝까지 열 수 있다."},"biography":"빈칸이 있는 배차표를 사고보다 고의로 보고, 열람을 거절하는 원로에게는 청구서를 두 장 남긴다. 실리적이나 시각을 지우는 손을 가혹하게 다룬다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 주사\n- 생업: 배차 기록 열람 청구·거절 사유 공개\n- 직함: 배차 기록 열람 청구인\n**생애.** 2072년생인 마르틴 호라크는 2126년 개막기에 배차 기록 열람 청구인 업무를 맡는다. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 배차 기록 열람 청구인 업무는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제를 계기로 시작됐다. 체코계 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 카렐 호라크는 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 이태원 숙박·민간 기술 용역 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 마르틴 호라크의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 체코어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 마르틴 호라크의 배차 기록 열람 청구·거절 사유 공개 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 배차 기록 열람 청구인. 열람 청구와 거절 사유를 배차판에 같이 붙이고, 하루를 넘긴 비밀 편성은 무효라고 적는다.\n\n**일화.** 겨울의 검은 배차표가 의료열차 무기와 북부 후계시험 부품 조작을 동시에 드러내자 마르틴 호라크는 창 전 편성의 열람을 청구했다.\n\n**관계.** 박태겸의 배차 원장 열람을 청구하고, 난외 노트를 근거로 삼으며, 올렉산드르 셰우첸코가 붙인 제동 불량 시각을 같은 줄에 겹친다.\n\n**야망.** 공식 명령망과 비밀 장교망의 열차를 한 장의 공개 배차 원장에서 가려 용산이 전쟁 유도의 중계가 되지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 열람이 기각된 뒤 자신의 이름이 무기 칸 증인란에 홀로 남는 것.\n\n**개입.** 거절된 열람 사본을 후국회에 펼치거나, 청구인을 호송해 원장을 끝까지 열 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 25 | 무력 −5 | 물질 25 | 공동 −10 | 원칙 5 | 공개 −20 | 자격 25 | 분산 −5 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −35 | 과시 −45 | 지속 0 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"마르틴 호라크","type":"계약","to":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸의 배차 원장 열람을 청구하고"},{"from":"마르틴 호라크","type":"계약","to":"올렉산드르 셰우첸코","basis":"올렉산드르 셰우첸코이 붙인 제동 불량 시각을 같은 줄에 겹친다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"올렉산드르 셰우첸코","type":"계약","to":"마르틴 호라크","basis":"마르틴 호라크의 열람 청구에 표본 번호를 붙인다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0189', NULL, '{"id":"person-0189","name":"Stefan Petrov","title":"Medical Train Weapon Witness","position":"Medical Train Weapon Witness","characterId":"K188","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Recording Time and Car of Medical Train Weapon Discovery","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#Person-Seutepan Peteuropeu","detailRoute":"/people/person-0189","birthDate":"2065-02-16","birthday":"02-16","age":61,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"evidence-logging","name":"Witness logging","rating":60},{"id":"compartment-sealing","name":"Compartment sealing","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k188-disposition","name":"Uncut testimony","description":"He recognized oil paper among the smell of bandages and heard as an insult an officer''s glance telling him to shorten what he had seen. Mild in manner, he shaved no line of testimony.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: medical train weapons witness. He wrote the discovery hour and car number in the medical log first and raised no armament on the same chalkboard as the patient roster.","stress":"Fear. That the witness statement would be clipped into an after-the-fact approval clause and he would become the coup''s silent witness.","relationship":"Relations. Backed Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy neutrality with testimony, matched the discovery with Gabriel Johnson''s warehouse care lockdown hours, and pressed whether Bae Woojin''s officer network had moved the train.","effects":[]},{"id":"k188-choice","name":"Staying at the scene","description":"Anecdote. During the winter black dispatch sheet, when Amsa-made weapons were found on the medical train, Stefan Petrov locked the car door and did not step out until the Post-State Council opened.","behavior":"Relations. Backed Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy neutrality with testimony, matched the discovery with Gabriel Johnson''s warehouse care lockdown hours, and pressed whether Bae Woojin''s officer network had moved the train.","stress":"Fear. That the witness statement would be clipped into an after-the-fact approval clause and he would become the coup''s silent witness.","relationship":"Relations. Backed Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy neutrality with testimony, matched the discovery with Gabriel Johnson''s warehouse care lockdown hours, and pressed whether Bae Woojin''s officer network had moved the train.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He locked the compartment where weapons appeared and stayed until the council. He compares discovery and clinic closure times; weapon handling and religious identity are not granted.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":5,"Openness":15,"Force":-15,"Material":20,"Communal":0,"Principle":-10,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":35,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":-35,"Display":-25,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Livelihood":"Recording Time and Car of Medical Train Weapon Discovery","Title":"Medical Train Weapon Witness","Values":"Authority 5 | Openness 15 | Force −15 | Materialism 20 | Communality 0 | Principle −10 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 35 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 15 | Monopoly −15 | Risk −35 | Display −25 | Persistence 20 | Orientation Fluid | Union Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in 2065, Seutepan Peteuropeu takes up the work of Medical Train Weapons Witness in the 2126 opening period. Grew up at the Jegi-dong infirmary. The work began after a counterfeit medicine seal. The Bulgarian-descended family has roots in the Dongdaemun–Yongsan living area. Georeugi Peteuropeu lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in Dongdaemun–Yongsan, working night labor in Dongdaemun and supply jobs in Yongsan. The family passed down records of shelters and goods handovers to the next generation, and Seutepan Peteuropeu''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their day. They speak Bulgarian at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Seutepan Peteuropeu''s work of recording the times and cars in which medical train weapons were found is connected to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank Jusa. Title: Medical Train Weapons Witness. Writes the discovery time and car number in the medical log first, and does not put weapons on the same board as the patient roster.","Anecdote":"During the winter''s black dispatch table, when Amsa-made weapons were found on the medical train, Seutepan Peteuropeu locked the car door and did not leave until the Domain Council convened.","Relationships":"Backs Jang Sehwa''s medical-escort neutrality with testimony, matches the discovery to the time of Gabeuriel Jonseun''s Chang treatment blockade, and questions whether Bae Ujin''s officer network moved the train.","Ambition":"Keeps the Amsa-made seal found in the medical car as public evidence of the joint escort so that Yongsan does not become the entrance to a protective war.","Fear":"That the testimony is cut down to an after-the-fact approval sentence and one becomes a silent witness to a coup.","Intervention":"Can escort the witness to the Records Office, or expose the note that tries to turn the testimony into an after-the-fact approval sentence."},"biography":"He picks out the scent of oiled paper amid the smell of bandages, and hears an officer''s glance telling him to cut down what he saw as an insult. Gentle, yet he will not trim a single line of testimony.\n\n- Affiliation: Transshipment Bureau\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Livelihood: Recording the time and car of weapon discoveries on medical trains\n- Title: Medical Train Weapons Witness\n**Life.** Born in 2065, Stefan Petrov takes up the work of Medical Train Weapons Witness in the opening period of 2126. He grew up in the Jegi-dong infirmary. His work as Medical Train Weapons Witness began with a counterfeit medicine seal. His Bulgarian family line is rooted in the Dongdaemun–Yongsan living sphere. Georgi Petrov lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in Dongdaemun–Yongsan, working Dongdaemun night-shift labor and Yongsan supply jobs. The family passed on records of their shelter and of goods handovers to the next generation, and Stefan Petrov''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their own day. At home they speak Bulgarian; in daily life and at work they speak Korean.\n- Stefan Petrov''s work recording the time and car of weapon discoveries on medical trains is tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Medical Train Weapons Witness. He writes the discovery time and car number in the medical log first, and never puts armaments on the same board as the patient roster.\n\n**Anecdote.** During the Black Timetable of Winter, when Amsa-made weapons were found on a medical train, Stefan Petrov locked the car door and did not come out until the Vassal-State Council convened.\n\n**Relationships.** He props up Jang Sehwa''s medical-escort neutrality with testimony, matches Gabriel Johnson''s window clinic blockade time against the discovery, and questions whether Bae Ujin''s officer network moved the train.\n\n**Ambition.** To leave the Amsa-made seals found in the medical car as public evidence of the Joint Escort, so that Yongsan does not become the gateway to a Protection War.\n\n**Fear.** That his witness statement will be cut down to a post-hoc approval sentence and he will become the silent witness of a coup.\n\n**Intervention.** He can escort the witness to the Records Office, or expose a note that tries to turn the statement into a post-hoc approval sentence.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 5 | Openness 15 | Force −15 | Material 20 | Community 0 | Principle −10 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 35 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Monopoly −15 | Risk −35 | Display −25 | Persistence 20 | Orientation: fluid | Union: non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Stefan Petrov","type":"Oath","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"props up Jang Sehwa''s medical-escort neutrality with testimony"},{"from":"Stefan Petrov","type":"Oath","to":"Gabriel Johnson","basis":"aligns the timing of the blockade of Gabriel Johnson''s depot clinic with its discovery, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Hong Uchan","type":"Oath","to":"Stefan Petrov","basis":"overlays Stefan Petrov''s discovery time in the medical car on the waveform"},{"from":"Ran Jina","type":"Contract","to":"Stefan Petrov","basis":"while overlaying the stop log on Stefan Petrov''s discovery time in the medical car"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0189","name":"스테판 페트로프","title":"의료열차 무기 목격자","position":"의료열차 무기 목격자","characterId":"K188","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"의료열차 무기 발견 시각·칸 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-스테판 페트로프","detailRoute":"/people/person-0189","birthDate":"2065-02-16","birthday":"02-16","age":61,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"evidence-logging","name":"목격 기록","rating":60},{"id":"compartment-sealing","name":"칸 봉쇄","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k188-disposition","name":"진술을 줄이지 않음","description":"붕대 냄새 사이에서 기름종이를 알아채고, 본 것을 줄이라는 장교의 눈짓을 모욕으로 듣는다. 온화하나 증언 한 줄은 깎지 않는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 의료열차 무기 목격자. 발견 시각과 칸 번호를 의무 일지에 먼저 적고, 무장을 환자 명부와 같은 칠판에 올리지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 목격 진술이 사후 승인 문장으로 잘려 자신이 쿠데타의 침묵 증인이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 장세화의 의료호송 중립을 증언으로 받치고, 가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료 봉쇄 시각과 발견을 맞추며, 배우진의 장교망이 열차를 움직였는지 따진다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k188-choice","name":"현장을 떠나지 않음","description":"일화. 겨울의 검은 배차표 동안 의료열차에서 암신도 무기가 발견되자 스테판 페트로프는 칸 문을 잠그고 후국회가 열릴 때까지 나가지 않았다.","behavior":"관계. 장세화의 의료호송 중립을 증언으로 받치고, 가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료 봉쇄 시각과 발견을 맞추며, 배우진의 장교망이 열차를 움직였는지 따진다.","stress":"공포. 목격 진술이 사후 승인 문장으로 잘려 자신이 쿠데타의 침묵 증인이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 장세화의 의료호송 중립을 증언으로 받치고, 가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료 봉쇄 시각과 발견을 맞추며, 배우진의 장교망이 열차를 움직였는지 따진다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"무기를 발견한 칸을 잠그고 회의까지 남았다. 발견 시각과 진료 봉쇄를 대조하지만 무기 운용이나 종교 정체성은 부여하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":5,"개방":15,"무력":-15,"물질":20,"공동":0,"원칙":-10,"공개":-20,"자격":35,"분산":5,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":-15,"위험":-35,"과시":-25,"지속":20,"지향":"유동","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"주사","생업":"의료열차 무기 발견 시각·칸 기록","직함":"의료열차 무기 목격자","가치관":"권위 5 | 개방 15 | 무력 −15 | 물질 20 | 공동 0 | 원칙 −10 | 공개 −20 | 자격 35 | 분산 5 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −35 | 과시 −25 | 지속 20 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2065년생인 스테판 페트로프는 2126년 개막기에 의료열차 무기 목격자 업무를 맡는다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 의료열차 무기 목격자 업무는 가짜 약 봉인을 계기로 시작됐다. 불가리아계 가계는 동대문·용산 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 게오르기 페트로프는 약 2026년 동대문·용산에서 동대문 야간 공임과 용산 공급 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 스테판 페트로프의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 불가리아어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 스테판 페트로프의 의료열차 무기 발견 시각·칸 기록 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 의료열차 무기 목격자. 발견 시각과 칸 번호를 의무 일지에 먼저 적고, 무장을 환자 명부와 같은 칠판에 올리지 않는다.","일화":"겨울의 검은 배차표 동안 의료열차에서 암신도 무기가 발견되자 스테판 페트로프는 칸 문을 잠그고 후국회가 열릴 때까지 나가지 않았다.","관계":"장세화의 의료호송 중립을 증언으로 받치고, 가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료 봉쇄 시각과 발견을 맞추며, 배우진의 장교망이 열차를 움직였는지 따진다.","야망":"의료칸에서 나온 암신도 봉인을 공동호송의 공개 증거로 남겨 용산이 보호전쟁의 입구가 되지 않게 한다.","공포":"목격 진술이 사후 승인 문장으로 잘려 자신이 쿠데타의 침묵 증인이 되는 것.","개입":"목격자를 기록청까지 호송하거나, 진술을 사후 승인 문장으로 바꾸려는 쪽지를 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"붕대 냄새 사이에서 기름종이를 알아채고, 본 것을 줄이라는 장교의 눈짓을 모욕으로 듣는다. 온화하나 증언 한 줄은 깎지 않는다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 주사\n- 생업: 의료열차 무기 발견 시각·칸 기록\n- 직함: 의료열차 무기 목격자\n**생애.** 2065년생인 스테판 페트로프는 2126년 개막기에 의료열차 무기 목격자 업무를 맡는다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 의료열차 무기 목격자 업무는 가짜 약 봉인을 계기로 시작됐다. 불가리아계 가계는 동대문·용산 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 게오르기 페트로프는 약 2026년 동대문·용산에서 동대문 야간 공임과 용산 공급 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 스테판 페트로프의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 불가리아어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 스테판 페트로프의 의료열차 무기 발견 시각·칸 기록 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 의료열차 무기 목격자. 발견 시각과 칸 번호를 의무 일지에 먼저 적고, 무장을 환자 명부와 같은 칠판에 올리지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 겨울의 검은 배차표 동안 의료열차에서 암신도 무기가 발견되자 스테판 페트로프는 칸 문을 잠그고 후국회가 열릴 때까지 나가지 않았다.\n\n**관계.** 장세화의 의료호송 중립을 증언으로 받치고, 가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료 봉쇄 시각과 발견을 맞추며, 배우진의 장교망이 열차를 움직였는지 따진다.\n\n**야망.** 의료칸에서 나온 암신도 봉인을 공동호송의 공개 증거로 남겨 용산이 보호전쟁의 입구가 되지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 목격 진술이 사후 승인 문장으로 잘려 자신이 쿠데타의 침묵 증인이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 목격자를 기록청까지 호송하거나, 진술을 사후 승인 문장으로 바꾸려는 쪽지를 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 5 | 개방 15 | 무력 −15 | 물질 20 | 공동 0 | 원칙 −10 | 공개 −20 | 자격 35 | 분산 5 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −35 | 과시 −25 | 지속 20 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"스테판 페트로프","type":"맹세","to":"장세화","basis":"장세화의 의료호송 중립을 증언으로 받치고"},{"from":"스테판 페트로프","type":"맹세","to":"가브리엘 존슨","basis":"가브리엘 존슨의 창 진료 봉쇄 시각과 발견을 맞추며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"홍우찬","type":"맹세","to":"스테판 페트로프","basis":"스테판 페트로프의 의료칸 발견 시각을 파형과 겹친다"},{"from":"란진아","type":"계약","to":"스테판 페트로프","basis":"스테판 페트로프의 의료칸 발견 시각에 정차 일지를 겹치며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0190', NULL, '{"id":"person-0190","name":"Ana Hierophantscu","title":"Opening Water Train Slot Occupancy Witness","position":"Water Train Slot Occupancy Witness","characterId":"K189","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Water Train Occupancy Claims and Stop Time Cross-Check","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#person-ana-popescu","detailRoute":"/people/person-0190","birthDate":"2084-03-07","birthday":"03-07","age":42,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"occupancy-records","name":"Siding occupancy records","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k189-disposition","name":"Claims against actual occupancy","description":"She took down a note demanding one more day of warehouse occupation like an accident report and saw a masked water car as an enemy of the relay. Her words were short and her timetable long.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: reconstruction-era water train warehouse occupation witness. She wrote the occupation-extension claims and the actual stop hours on one wall and held one-way trains a day in her testimony.","stress":"Fear. That her testimony would become the stamp of the western rail contract''s monopoly secret pact.","relationship":"Relations. Attached testimony to Eva Nováková''s dispatch board, tested Park Taegyeom''s relay maintenance against the warehouse occupation, and remembered the hour the train carrying Im Chowon was tied at the same warehouse.","effects":[]},{"id":"k189-choice","name":"Guarding against monopoly testimony","description":"Anecdote. A water train that came one way only reaches Eva Nováková''s dispatch board with a note asking to hold the window one more day. Ana Hierophantscu writes the extension claim and the actual stop time side by side on the wall, binds that train for a day in testimony, and watches whether Park Taegyeom''s relay holds at this window.","behavior":"Relations. Attached testimony to Eva Nováková''s dispatch board, tested Park Taegyeom''s relay maintenance against the warehouse occupation, and remembered the hour the train carrying Im Chowon was tied at the same warehouse.","stress":"Fear. That her testimony would become the stamp of the western rail contract''s monopoly secret pact.","relationship":"Relations. Attached testimony to Eva Nováková''s dispatch board, tested Park Taegyeom''s relay maintenance against the warehouse occupation, and remembered the hour the train carrying Im Chowon was tied at the same warehouse.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She records extension claims beside actual stopping time and holds a one-way train in testimony. She tests relay independence without a proven contract settlement.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":5,"Openness":15,"Force":-20,"Material":25,"Communal":-15,"Principle":-5,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":-10,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":-25,"Risk":-35,"Display":15,"Sustained":25,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Livelihood":"Water Train Occupancy Claims and Stop Time Cross-Check","Title":"Water Train Slot Occupancy Witness","Values":"Authority 5 | Openness 15 | Force −20 | Material 25 | Community −15 | Principle −5 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 30 | Dispersion −10 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly −25 | Risk −35 | Display 15 | Persistence 25 | Orientation: none | Union: monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in 2084, Ana Hierophantscu takes up the work of Water Train Window-Occupancy Witness in the opening period of 2126. She grew up on the Yeongdeungpo water-purification night watch. Her work as Water Train Window-Occupancy Witness began with a valve signature on the Night of Muddy Water. Her Romanian family line is rooted in the Dongdaemun–Yongsan living sphere. Nicolae Hierophantscu lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in Dongdaemun–Yongsan, working in civilian sewing and freight brokerage in Dongdaemun. The family passed on records of their shelter and of goods handovers to the next generation, and Ana Hierophantscu''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their own day. At home they speak Romanian; in daily life and at work they speak Korean.\n- Ana Hierophantscu''s work cross-checking water train occupancy claims against stop times is tied to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Water Train Window-Occupancy Witness. She writes the occupancy extension claim and the actual stop time on the same wall, and holds a one-way-only train in testimony for a day.","Anecdote":"A water train that came one-way only, carrying a note asking for one more day of window occupancy, is placed on Eva Novakova''s dispatch board. Ana Hierophantscu writes the extension claim and the actual stop time side by side on the wall, holds that train in testimony for a day, and watches whether Park Taegyeom''s relay maintenance holds up at this window.","Relationships":"She attaches her testimony to Eva Novakova''s dispatch board, tests Park Taegyeom''s relay maintenance against window occupancy, and remembers the hour the train carrying Im Chowon was held at the same window.","Ambition":"To bind the water trains'' window occupancy with public testimony, so that relays outside the Floodgate Charter are not sucked into monopoly clauses.","Fear":"That her testimony will become the seal on a monopoly secret pact in the Western Railway Contract.","Intervention":"She can mediate window occupancy, or hand a monopoly dispatch secret pact to the Records Office together with the witness statement."},"biography":"She copies down a note asking for one more day of window occupancy as if it were an accident, and sees the veiled water cars as enemies of the relay. Her words are short; her timetables are long.\n\n- Affiliation: Transshipment Bureau\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Livelihood: Cross-checking water train occupancy claims against stop times\n- Title: Water Train Window-Occupancy Witness\n**Life.** Born in 2084, Ana Hierophantscu takes up the work of Water Train Window-Occupancy Witness in the opening period of 2126. She grew up on the Yeongdeungpo water-purification night watch. Her work as Water Train Window-Occupancy Witness began with a valve signature on the Night of Muddy Water. Her Romanian family line is rooted in the Dongdaemun–Yongsan living sphere. Nicolae Hierophantscu lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in Dongdaemun–Yongsan, working in civilian sewing and freight brokerage in Dongdaemun. The family passed on records of their shelter and of goods handovers to the next generation, and Ana Hierophantscu''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their own day. At home they speak Romanian; in daily life and at work they speak Korean.\n- Ana Hierophantscu''s work cross-checking water train occupancy claims against stop times is tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Water Train Window-Occupancy Witness. She writes the occupancy extension claim and the actual stop time on the same wall, and holds a one-way-only train in testimony for a day.\n\n**Anecdote.** A water train that came one-way only, carrying a note asking for one more day of window occupancy, is placed on Eva Novakova''s dispatch board. Ana Hierophantscu writes the extension claim and the actual stop time side by side on the wall, holds that train in testimony for a day, and watches whether Park Taegyeom''s relay maintenance holds up at this window.\n\n**Relationships.** She attaches her testimony to Eva Novakova''s dispatch board, tests Park Taegyeom''s relay maintenance against window occupancy, and remembers the hour the train carrying Im Chowon was held at the same window.\n\n**Ambition.** To bind the water trains'' window occupancy with public testimony, so that relays outside the Floodgate Charter are not sucked into monopoly clauses.\n\n**Fear.** That her testimony will become the seal on a monopoly secret pact in the Western Railway Contract.\n\n**Intervention.** She can mediate window occupancy, or hand a monopoly dispatch secret pact to the Records Office together with the witness statement.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 5 | Openness 15 | Force −20 | Material 25 | Community −15 | Principle −5 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 30 | Dispersion −10 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Monopoly −25 | Risk −35 | Display 15 | Persistence 25 | Orientation: none | Union: monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ana Hierophantscu","type":"Oath","to":"Eva Novakova","basis":"Posting testimony on Eva Novakova''s dispatch board, and"},{"from":"Ana Hierophantscu","type":"Oath","to":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"tests Bak Taegyeom''s relay maintenance by occupying the window,"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0190","name":"아나 포페스쿠","title":"개막 급수열차 창 점유 증인","position":"급수열차 창 점유 증인","characterId":"K189","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"급수열차 점유 청구·정차 시간 대조","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-아나 포페스쿠","detailRoute":"/people/person-0190","birthDate":"2084-03-07","birthday":"03-07","age":42,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"occupancy-records","name":"창 점유 기록","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k189-disposition","name":"청구와 실제 대조","description":"창 점유를 하루 더 달라는 쪽지를 사고처럼 받아 적고, 얼굴을 가린 급수차를 중계의 적으로 본다. 말은 짧고 시각표는 길다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 급수열차 창 점유 증인. 점유 연장 청구와 실제 정차 시간을 같은 벽에 쓰고, 편도만 온 열차는 증언에서 하루를 묶는다.","stress":"공포. 자신의 증언이 서부 철도계약의 독점 밀약 도장이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 에바 노바코바의 배차판에 증언을 붙이고, 박태겸의 중계 유지를 창 점유로 시험하며, 임초원을 태운 열차가 같은 창에 묶인 시각을 기억한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k189-choice","name":"독점 증언 경계","description":"일화. 창 점유를 하루 더 달라는 쪽지를 단 채 편도로만 온 급수열차가 에바 노바코바의 배차판에 오른다. 아나 포페스쿠는 연장 청구와 실제 정차 시간을 나란히 벽에 쓰고, 그 열차를 증언에서 하루 묶어 박태겸의 중계 유지가 이 창에서 버티는지 본다.","behavior":"관계. 에바 노바코바의 배차판에 증언을 붙이고, 박태겸의 중계 유지를 창 점유로 시험하며, 임초원을 태운 열차가 같은 창에 묶인 시각을 기억한다.","stress":"공포. 자신의 증언이 서부 철도계약의 독점 밀약 도장이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 에바 노바코바의 배차판에 증언을 붙이고, 박태겸의 중계 유지를 창 점유로 시험하며, 임초원을 태운 열차가 같은 창에 묶인 시각을 기억한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"연장 청구와 실제 정차 시간을 나란히 적어 편도 열차를 증언에서 묶었다. 중계 독립을 시험하지만 철도계약 해결 성과는 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":5,"개방":15,"무력":-20,"물질":25,"공동":-15,"원칙":-5,"공개":-20,"자격":30,"분산":-10,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":-25,"위험":-35,"과시":15,"지속":25,"지향":"무성향","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"주사","생업":"급수열차 점유 청구·정차 시간 대조","직함":"급수열차 창 점유 증인","가치관":"권위 5 | 개방 15 | 무력 −20 | 물질 25 | 공동 −15 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −20 | 자격 30 | 분산 −10 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 −25 | 위험 −35 | 과시 15 | 지속 25 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2084년생인 아나 포페스쿠는 2126년 개막기에 급수열차 창 점유 증인 업무를 맡는다. 영등포 정수 당직에서 자랐다. 급수열차 창 점유 증인 업무는 탁수 밤의 밸브 서명을 계기로 시작됐다. 루마니아계 가계는 동대문·용산 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 니콜라에 포페스쿠는 약 2026년 동대문·용산에서 동대문 민간 봉제·화물 중개 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 아나 포페스쿠의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 루마니아어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 아나 포페스쿠의 급수열차 점유 청구·정차 시간 대조 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 급수열차 창 점유 증인. 점유 연장 청구와 실제 정차 시간을 같은 벽에 쓰고, 편도만 온 열차는 증언에서 하루를 묶는다.","일화":"창 점유를 하루 더 달라는 쪽지를 단 채 편도로만 온 급수열차가 에바 노바코바의 배차판에 오른다. 아나 포페스쿠는 연장 청구와 실제 정차 시간을 나란히 벽에 쓰고, 그 열차를 증언에서 하루 묶어 박태겸의 중계 유지가 이 창에서 버티는지 본다.","관계":"에바 노바코바의 배차판에 증언을 붙이고, 박태겸의 중계 유지를 창 점유로 시험하며, 임초원을 태운 열차가 같은 창에 묶인 시각을 기억한다.","야망":"급수열차의 창 점유를 공개 증언으로 묶어 수문헌장 밖의 중계가 독점 조항으로 빨려 들어가지 않게 한다.","공포":"자신의 증언이 서부 철도계약의 독점 밀약 도장이 되는 것.","개입":"창 점유를 중재하거나, 독점 배차 밀약을 증인 진술과 함께 기록청에 넘길 수 있다."},"biography":"창 점유를 하루 더 달라는 쪽지를 사고처럼 받아 적고, 얼굴을 가린 급수차를 중계의 적으로 본다. 말은 짧고 시각표는 길다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 주사\n- 생업: 급수열차 점유 청구·정차 시간 대조\n- 직함: 급수열차 창 점유 증인\n**생애.** 2084년생인 아나 포페스쿠는 2126년 개막기에 급수열차 창 점유 증인 업무를 맡는다. 영등포 정수 당직에서 자랐다. 급수열차 창 점유 증인 업무는 탁수 밤의 밸브 서명을 계기로 시작됐다. 루마니아계 가계는 동대문·용산 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 니콜라에 포페스쿠는 약 2026년 동대문·용산에서 동대문 민간 봉제·화물 중개 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 아나 포페스쿠의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 루마니아어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 아나 포페스쿠의 급수열차 점유 청구·정차 시간 대조 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 급수열차 창 점유 증인. 점유 연장 청구와 실제 정차 시간을 같은 벽에 쓰고, 편도만 온 열차는 증언에서 하루를 묶는다.\n\n**일화.** 창 점유를 하루 더 달라는 쪽지를 단 채 편도로만 온 급수열차가 에바 노바코바의 배차판에 오른다. 아나 포페스쿠는 연장 청구와 실제 정차 시간을 나란히 벽에 쓰고, 그 열차를 증언에서 하루 묶어 박태겸의 중계 유지가 이 창에서 버티는지 본다.\n\n**관계.** 에바 노바코바의 배차판에 증언을 붙이고, 박태겸의 중계 유지를 창 점유로 시험하며, 임초원을 태운 열차가 같은 창에 묶인 시각을 기억한다.\n\n**야망.** 급수열차의 창 점유를 공개 증언으로 묶어 수문헌장 밖의 중계가 독점 조항으로 빨려 들어가지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 자신의 증언이 서부 철도계약의 독점 밀약 도장이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 창 점유를 중재하거나, 독점 배차 밀약을 증인 진술과 함께 기록청에 넘길 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 5 | 개방 15 | 무력 −20 | 물질 25 | 공동 −15 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −20 | 자격 30 | 분산 −10 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 −25 | 위험 −35 | 과시 15 | 지속 25 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"아나 포페스쿠","type":"맹세","to":"에바 노바코바","basis":"에바 노바코바의 배차판에 증언을 붙이고"},{"from":"아나 포페스쿠","type":"맹세","to":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸의 중계 유지를 창 점유로 시험하며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0191', NULL, '{"id":"person-0191","name":"Philipp Müller","title":"Second Water Pact Transshipment Witness","position":"Water Contract Transshipment Witness","characterId":"K190","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Water Contract Cargo Seal and Weight Inspection","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#person-philipp müller","detailRoute":"/people/person-0191","birthDate":"2086-06-14","birthday":"06-14","age":40,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"cargo-weight-verification","name":"Cargo weight verification","rating":65},{"id":"release-condition-review","name":"Release condition review","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k190-disposition","name":"Refusing release without end terms","description":"When a pump-parts box''s weight differed from the ledger he swapped the scales at once, and he still counted the nights since the interim accord''s lifespan ran out. Sociable, but he never recorded an empty box as full.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: water contract transshipment witness. He read the standards stamps and tonnage aloud before release and gave out no box whose convoy exit conditions stood blank.","stress":"Fear. That after the guarantor vanished, the transshipment testimony would be cited only as grounds for the protection clause''s military intervention.","relationship":"Relations. Overlaid the treaty tonnage on Lukas Schneider''s warehouse lease ledger, backed Han Jaemok''s water-supply minimum line with the transshipment order, and witnessed the last release of the parts column Im Hajun had guaranteed.","effects":[]},{"id":"k190-choice","name":"Rechecking weight","description":"Anecdote. Water-contract cargo whose escort end-condition box is blank waits for release at the Yongsan transshipment yard. Philipp Müller reads the gauge stamp and weight aloud, then holds the crates in the yard and matches their weight again against the accord weight in Lukas Schneider''s warehouse lease ledger.","behavior":"Relations. Overlaid the treaty tonnage on Lukas Schneider''s warehouse lease ledger, backed Han Jaemok''s water-supply minimum line with the transshipment order, and witnessed the last release of the parts column Im Hajun had guaranteed.","stress":"Fear. That after the guarantor vanished, the transshipment testimony would be cited only as grounds for the protection clause''s military intervention.","relationship":"Relations. Overlaid the treaty tonnage on Lukas Schneider''s warehouse lease ledger, backed Han Jaemok''s water-supply minimum line with the transshipment order, and witnessed the last release of the parts column Im Hajun had guaranteed.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He held cargo with missing end terms and compared its standards and weight to agreement records. This protects release conditions without granting new diplomatic authority.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":20,"Force":-20,"Material":25,"Communal":-5,"Principle":-5,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":40,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":-30,"Display":-15,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Livelihood":"Water Contract Cargo Seal and Weight Inspection","Title":"Water Contract Transshipment Witness","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness 20 | Force −20 | Materialism 25 | Collectivity −5 | Principle −5 | Publicity −20 | Merit 40 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Craving 40 | Possessiveness 10 | Risk −30 | Display −15 | Endurance 5 | Orientation: same-sex | Bonding: non-monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in 2086, Philipp Müller takes up the duties of Water-Supply Contract Transshipment Witness at the opening of 2126. He grew up at the Yeongdeungpo water-purification duty station. His work as Water-Supply Contract Transshipment Witness began with a valve signature on the Muddy Water Night. His German-descended family has its roots in the Yongsan–Itaewon living sphere. Karl Müller lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in Yongsan–Itaewon, working in Yongsan freight and civilian machinery maintenance. The family passed records of their dwellings and goods handovers to the next generation, and Philipp Müller''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their own time. They speak German at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Philipp Müller''s work inspecting seals and weights on water-supply contract cargo is connected to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Jusa. Title: Water-Supply Contract Transshipment Witness. He reads the standard seal and the weight aloud before release, and if the convoy end-condition field is blank, he does not hand over the box.","Anecdote":"A water-supply contract cargo with a blank convoy end-condition field awaits release at the Yongsan transshipment yard. Philipp Müller reads the standard seal and the weight aloud, then holds the box at the yard and reweighs it to match the accord weight recorded in Lukas Schneider''s warehouse lease ledger.","Relationships":"He overlays the accord weight on Lukas Schneider''s warehouse lease ledger, supports Han Jaemok''s minimum water supply line through the transshipment order, and testifies to the final release of the parts compartment that Im Hajun vouched for.","Ambition":"To record the water-supply contract''s parts specifications and emergency convoy conditions in the Yongsan transshipment ledger, so that no great power can cut the lifeline alone.","Fear":"That after the guarantor vanishes, the transshipment testimony will be cited only as grounds for military intervention under the protection clause.","Intervention":"He can escort the standard specimen to protect the testimony, or expose a citation that preserves only the protection clause."},"biography":"If the weight of a pump-parts box differs from the ledger, he swaps out the scale at once, and he still counts the nights since the temporary accord expired. He is sociable, but he never writes down an empty box as full.\n\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Jusa\n- Occupation: Seal and weight inspection of water-supply contract cargo\n- Title: Water-Supply Contract Transshipment Witness\n**Life.** Born in 2086, Philipp Müller takes up the duties of Water-Supply Contract Transshipment Witness at the opening of 2126. He grew up at the Yeongdeungpo water-purification duty station. His work as Water-Supply Contract Transshipment Witness began with a valve signature on the Muddy Water Night. His German-descended family has its roots in the Yongsan–Itaewon living sphere. Karl Müller lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in Yongsan–Itaewon, working in Yongsan freight and civilian machinery maintenance. The family passed records of their dwellings and goods handovers to the next generation, and Philipp Müller''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their own time. They speak German at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Philipp Müller''s work inspecting seals and weights on water-supply contract cargo is connected to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Jusa. Title: Water-Supply Contract Transshipment Witness. He reads the standard seal and the weight aloud before release, and if the convoy end-condition field is blank, he does not hand over the box.\n\n**Anecdote.** A water-supply contract cargo with a blank convoy end-condition field awaits release at the Yongsan transshipment yard. Philipp Müller reads the standard seal and the weight aloud, then holds the box at the yard and reweighs it to match the accord weight recorded in Lukas Schneider''s warehouse lease ledger.\n\n**Relations.** He overlays the accord weight on Lukas Schneider''s warehouse lease ledger, supports Han Jaemok''s minimum water supply line through the transshipment order, and testifies to the final release of the parts compartment that Im Hajun vouched for.\n\n**Ambition.** To record the water-supply contract''s parts specifications and emergency convoy conditions in the Yongsan transshipment ledger, so that no great power can cut the lifeline alone.\n\n**Fear.** That after the guarantor vanishes, the transshipment testimony will be cited only as grounds for military intervention under the protection clause.\n\n**Intervention.** He can escort the standard specimen to protect the testimony, or expose a citation that preserves only the protection clause.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness 20 | Force −20 | Materialism 25 | Collectivity −5 | Principle −5 | Publicity −20 | Merit 40 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Possessiveness 10 | Risk −30 | Display −15 | Endurance 5 | Orientation: same-sex | Bonding: non-monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Philipp Müller","type":"Oath","to":"Lucas Schneider","basis":"overlays the agreed weight onto Lucas Schneider''s warehouse lease ledger, and"},{"from":"Philipp Müller","type":"Oath","to":"Han Jae-mok","basis":"While backing Han Jaemok''s minimum water supply line with the transshipment order"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Sun Hajun","type":"Oath","to":"Philipp Müller","basis":"Pointing to the same box as Philipp Müller''s Yongsan transshipment testimony"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0191","name":"필리프 뮐러","title":"둘째 급수협약 환적 증인","position":"급수 계약 환적 증인","characterId":"K190","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"급수 계약 화물 도장·중량 검수","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-필리프 뮐러","detailRoute":"/people/person-0191","birthDate":"2086-06-14","birthday":"06-14","age":40,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"cargo-weight-verification","name":"화물 중량 대조","rating":65},{"id":"release-condition-review","name":"출고 조건 확인","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k190-disposition","name":"종료 조건 없는 출고 거부","description":"펌프 부품 상자의 무게가 장부와 다르면 즉시 저울을 갈아 끼우고, 임시 협약의 수명이 다한 밤을 아직도 센다. 사교적이나 빈 상자를 가득하다고 적지는 않는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 급수 계약 환적 증인. 규격 도장과 중량을 출고 전에 소리 내어 읽고, 호송 종료 조건이 빈 칸이면 상자를 내주지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 보증인이 사라진 뒤 환적 증언이 보호조항의 군사 개입 근거로만 인용되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 루카스 슈나이더의 창고 임대 장부에 협약 중량을 겹치고, 한재목의 물 공급 최저선을 환적 순서로 받치며, 임하준이 보증한 부품 칸의 마지막 출고를 증언한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k190-choice","name":"중량을 다시 맞춤","description":"일화. 호송 종료 조건 칸이 빈 급수 계약 화물이 용산 환적장에서 출고를 기다린다. 필리프 뮐러는 규격 도장과 중량을 소리 내어 읽은 다음 상자를 환적장에 붙들어 두고, 루카스 슈나이더의 창고 임대 장부에 적힌 협약 중량과 무게를 다시 맞춘다.","behavior":"관계. 루카스 슈나이더의 창고 임대 장부에 협약 중량을 겹치고, 한재목의 물 공급 최저선을 환적 순서로 받치며, 임하준이 보증한 부품 칸의 마지막 출고를 증언한다.","stress":"공포. 보증인이 사라진 뒤 환적 증언이 보호조항의 군사 개입 근거로만 인용되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 루카스 슈나이더의 창고 임대 장부에 협약 중량을 겹치고, 한재목의 물 공급 최저선을 환적 순서로 받치며, 임하준이 보증한 부품 칸의 마지막 출고를 증언한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"종료 조건이 빈 화물을 붙들고 규격·중량을 협약 장부와 대조했다. 계약 경계를 지키는 실무이며 새 외교 권한을 뜻하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":20,"무력":-20,"물질":25,"공동":-5,"원칙":-5,"공개":-20,"자격":40,"분산":10,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":10,"위험":-30,"과시":-15,"지속":5,"지향":"동성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"주사","생업":"급수 계약 화물 도장·중량 검수","직함":"급수 계약 환적 증인","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 20 | 무력 −20 | 물질 25 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −20 | 자격 40 | 분산 10 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −15 | 지속 5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2086년생인 필리프 뮐러는 2126년 개막기에 급수 계약 환적 증인 업무를 맡는다. 영등포 정수 당직에서 자랐다. 급수 계약 환적 증인 업무는 탁수 밤의 밸브 서명을 계기로 시작됐다. 독일계 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 카를 뮐러는 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 용산 화물·민간 기계 정비 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 필리프 뮐러의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 독일어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 필리프 뮐러의 급수 계약 화물 도장·중량 검수 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 급수 계약 환적 증인. 규격 도장과 중량을 출고 전에 소리 내어 읽고, 호송 종료 조건이 빈 칸이면 상자를 내주지 않는다.","일화":"호송 종료 조건 칸이 빈 급수 계약 화물이 용산 환적장에서 출고를 기다린다. 필리프 뮐러는 규격 도장과 중량을 소리 내어 읽은 다음 상자를 환적장에 붙들어 두고, 루카스 슈나이더의 창고 임대 장부에 적힌 협약 중량과 무게를 다시 맞춘다.","관계":"루카스 슈나이더의 창고 임대 장부에 협약 중량을 겹치고, 한재목의 물 공급 최저선을 환적 순서로 받치며, 임하준이 보증한 부품 칸의 마지막 출고를 증언한다.","야망":"급수 계약의 부품 규격과 비상 호송 조건을 용산 환적 원장에 남겨 어느 강국도 생명선을 혼자 끊지 못하게 한다.","공포":"보증인이 사라진 뒤 환적 증언이 보호조항의 군사 개입 근거로만 인용되는 것.","개입":"규격 표본을 호송해 증언을 지키거나, 보호조항만 남긴 인용을 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"펌프 부품 상자의 무게가 장부와 다르면 즉시 저울을 갈아 끼우고, 임시 협약의 수명이 다한 밤을 아직도 센다. 사교적이나 빈 상자를 가득하다고 적지는 않는다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 주사\n- 생업: 급수 계약 화물 도장·중량 검수\n- 직함: 급수 계약 환적 증인\n**생애.** 2086년생인 필리프 뮐러는 2126년 개막기에 급수 계약 환적 증인 업무를 맡는다. 영등포 정수 당직에서 자랐다. 급수 계약 환적 증인 업무는 탁수 밤의 밸브 서명을 계기로 시작됐다. 독일계 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 카를 뮐러는 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 용산 화물·민간 기계 정비 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 필리프 뮐러의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 독일어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 필리프 뮐러의 급수 계약 화물 도장·중량 검수 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 급수 계약 환적 증인. 규격 도장과 중량을 출고 전에 소리 내어 읽고, 호송 종료 조건이 빈 칸이면 상자를 내주지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 호송 종료 조건 칸이 빈 급수 계약 화물이 용산 환적장에서 출고를 기다린다. 필리프 뮐러는 규격 도장과 중량을 소리 내어 읽은 다음 상자를 환적장에 붙들어 두고, 루카스 슈나이더의 창고 임대 장부에 적힌 협약 중량과 무게를 다시 맞춘다.\n\n**관계.** 루카스 슈나이더의 창고 임대 장부에 협약 중량을 겹치고, 한재목의 물 공급 최저선을 환적 순서로 받치며, 임하준이 보증한 부품 칸의 마지막 출고를 증언한다.\n\n**야망.** 급수 계약의 부품 규격과 비상 호송 조건을 용산 환적 원장에 남겨 어느 강국도 생명선을 혼자 끊지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 보증인이 사라진 뒤 환적 증언이 보호조항의 군사 개입 근거로만 인용되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 규격 표본을 호송해 증언을 지키거나, 보호조항만 남긴 인용을 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 20 | 무력 −20 | 물질 25 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −20 | 자격 40 | 분산 10 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −15 | 지속 5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"필리프 뮐러","type":"맹세","to":"루카스 슈나이더","basis":"루카스 슈나이더의 창고 임대 장부에 협약 중량을 겹치고"},{"from":"필리프 뮐러","type":"맹세","to":"한재목","basis":"한재목의 물 공급 최저선을 환적 순서로 받치며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"순하준","type":"맹세","to":"필리프 뮐러","basis":"필리프 뮐러의 용산 환적 증언과 같은 상자를 가리키며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0192', NULL, '{"id":"person-0192","name":"Elena Morozova","title":"Small Powers Conference Train Guide","position":"The Government Conference Train Guide","characterId":"K191","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Conference Train Envoy Waiting Tickets and Escort Car Guidance","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#character-Elena Morozova","detailRoute":"/people/person-0192","birthDate":"2090-03-05","birthday":"03-05","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"delegate-boarding","name":"Delegate boarding guidance","rating":60},{"id":"public-announcements","name":"Public announcements","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k191-disposition","name":"Council trains first","description":"She gauged envoy crowds by platform humidity and heard as an insult any order to pull great-power cars ahead of the lesser states'' waiting line. Mild in manner, she handed the guidance broadcast to no one else.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: lesser-states council train guide. She published the envoy waiting lists and convoy cars daily and coupled munitions cars to the platform only after the council train had left.","stress":"Fear. That the guidance chalkboard would be covered with bought notes and the council train would change into an assassination route.","relationship":"Relations. Backed Mateusz Kowalski''s concourse window as guidance, seated Jeong Yura''s joint-negotiation envoys first, and moved Jang Sehwa''s mutual convoy draft onto the platform chalkboard.","effects":[]},{"id":"k191-choice","name":"Sealing evidence","description":"Anecdote. In 2125 she took the counterfeit drug box off the auction floor and sealed it instead of burning it. By this deed the signature of the lesser-states council train guide post rose into the ledger.","behavior":"Relations. Backed Mateusz Kowalski''s concourse window as guidance, seated Jeong Yura''s joint-negotiation envoys first, and moved Jang Sehwa''s mutual convoy draft onto the platform chalkboard.","stress":"Fear. That the guidance chalkboard would be covered with bought notes and the council train would change into an assassination route.","relationship":"Relations. Backed Mateusz Kowalski''s concourse window as guidance, seated Jeong Yura''s joint-negotiation envoys first, and moved Jang Sehwa''s mutual convoy draft onto the platform chalkboard.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She sealed counterfeit medicine instead of burning it and publishes delegate queues and convoy bays. Guidance supports negotiations without claiming delegates’ achievements.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":30,"Force":-20,"Material":15,"Communal":-5,"Principle":10,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":0,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":-25,"Risk":-20,"Display":5,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Livelihood":"Conference Train Envoy Waiting Tickets and Escort Car Guidance","Title":"The Government Conference Train Guide","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness 30 | Force −20 | Materialism 15 | Collectivity −5 | Principle 10 | Publicity −15 | Merit 25 | Dispersion 0 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Craving 10 | Possessiveness −25 | Risk −20 | Display 5 | Endurance 20 | Orientation: heterosexual | Bonding: none"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in 2090, Elena Morozova takes up the duties of The Government Conference Train Guide at the opening of 2126. She grew up at the Jegi-dong infirmary. Her work as The Government Conference Train Guide began with the sealing of fake medicine. Her Russian-descended family has its roots in the Dongdaemun–Yongsan civilian freight living sphere. Ivan Morozov lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in the Dongdaemun–Yongsan civilian freight living sphere, working in Dongdaemun freight brokerage and Itaewon lodging. The family passed records of their dwellings and goods handovers to the next generation, and Elena Morozova''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their own time. They speak Russian at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Elena Morozova''s work guiding envoy waiting tickets and escort compartments on the conference train is connected to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Jusa. Title: The Government Conference Train Guide. She posts the envoy waiting tickets and escort compartments publicly every day, and attaches munitions cars to the platform only after the conference train has departed.","Anecdote":"In 2125 she took a fake medicine box from the auction house and sealed it instead of burning it. Because of this act, her signature was entered in the ledger for the post of The Government Conference Train Guide.","Relationships":"She supports Mateusz Kowalski''s waiting-hall counter with her guidance, boards Jeong Yura''s joint-negotiation envoys first, and copies Jang Sehwa''s mutual-escort draft onto the platform board.","Ambition":"To post the conference envoy trains only on a joint-escort timetable, so that Yongsan does not become a platform of partitioned subjugation.","Fear":"That the guidance board will be covered with bribe notes and the conference train diverted onto an assassination route.","Intervention":"She can tear bribe notes off the board, or take charge of an envoy escort and defend the guidance timetable."},"biography":"She gauges the size of an envoy crowd by the damp in the waiting hall, and she hears any order to pull a great-power wagon to the front of the Transfer Bureau queue as an insult. She is gentle, but she never hands the announcements over to anyone else.\n\n- Affiliation: Transfer Bureau\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Livelihood: Conference train envoy waiting tickets and escort car guidance\n- Title: Transfer Bureau Conference Train Usher\n**Life.** Born in 2090, Elena Morozova takes up the post of Transfer Bureau Conference Train Usher in the opening period of 2126. She grew up in the Jegi-dong infirmary. Her work as Transfer Bureau Conference Train Usher began with a counterfeit medicine seal. Her Russian-descended family is rooted in the Dongdaemun-Yongsan civilian freight community. Ivan Morozov lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in the Dongdaemun-Yongsan civilian freight community, working in Dongdaemun freight brokerage and Itaewon lodging. The family passed its records of shelters and goods handovers down to the next generation, and Elena Morozova''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their day. At home they speak Russian; in daily life and at work they speak Korean.\n- Elena Morozova''s work on conference train envoy waiting tickets and escort car guidance is tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Transfer Bureau Conference Train Usher. She publishes the envoy waiting tickets and escort cars every day, and posts military supply wagons to the platform only after the conference train has departed.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125 she collected a crate of counterfeit medicine at an auction house and sealed it instead of burning it. That act put her signature to the post of Transfer Bureau Conference Train Usher in the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** She supports Mateusz Kowalski''s waiting hall counter with guidance, boards Jeong Yu-ra''s joint negotiation envoys first, and copies Jang Se-hwa''s mutual escort draft onto the platform blackboard.\n\n**Ambition.** To post the conference envoy trains only as a joint escort timetable, so that Yongsan does not become a platform of partitioned subjugation.\n\n**Fear.** That the guidance blackboard will be covered in bribe notes and the conference train turned into an assassination route.\n\n**Intervention.** You can pull bribe notes off the blackboard, or take charge of envoy escorts and keep the guidance timetable.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness 30 | Force −20 | Material 15 | Communal −5 | Principle 10 | Publicity −15 | Credentials 25 | Dispersal 0 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly −25 | Risk −20 | Display 5 | Endurance 20 | Orientation: Opposite sex | Union: None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Elena Morozova","type":"Contract","to":"Mateusz Kowalski","basis":"Supporting Mateusz Kowalski''s waiting-hall window with guidance,"},{"from":"Elena Morozova","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Yura","basis":"boarding Jeong Yu-ra''s joint negotiation envoys first"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0192","name":"엘레나 모로조바","title":"약소국 회의 열차 안내인","position":"정부 회의 열차 안내인","characterId":"K191","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"회의 열차 사절 대기표·호송 칸 안내","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-엘레나 모로조바","detailRoute":"/people/person-0192","birthDate":"2090-03-05","birthday":"03-05","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"delegate-boarding","name":"사절 탑승 안내","rating":60},{"id":"public-announcements","name":"안내 방송","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k191-disposition","name":"회의 열차 우선","description":"대합실 습기로 사절 인파를 가늠하고, 강국 화차를 환적국 대기열 앞으로 끌어오라는 명령을 모욕으로 듣는다. 온화하나 안내 방송을 남에게 넘기지 않는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 정부 회의 열차 안내인. 사절 대기표와 호송 칸을 매일 공개하고, 군수 화차는 회의 열차가 떠난 뒤에만 승강장에 붙인다.","stress":"공포. 안내 칠판이 매수 쪽지로 덮여 회의 열차가 암살 경로로 바뀌는 것.","relationship":"관계. 마테우시 코발스키의 대합실 창구를 안내로 받치고, 정유라의 공동교섭 사절을 먼저 태우며, 장세화의 상호호송 초안을 승강장 칠판에 옮긴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k191-choice","name":"증거를 봉인함","description":"일화. 2125년 가짜 약 상자를 경매장에서 거둬 화형 대신 봉인했다. 이 일로 정부 회의 열차 안내인 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","behavior":"관계. 마테우시 코발스키의 대합실 창구를 안내로 받치고, 정유라의 공동교섭 사절을 먼저 태우며, 장세화의 상호호송 초안을 승강장 칠판에 옮긴다.","stress":"공포. 안내 칠판이 매수 쪽지로 덮여 회의 열차가 암살 경로로 바뀌는 것.","relationship":"관계. 마테우시 코발스키의 대합실 창구를 안내로 받치고, 정유라의 공동교섭 사절을 먼저 태우며, 장세화의 상호호송 초안을 승강장 칠판에 옮긴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"가짜 약을 태우지 않고 봉인했고 사절 대기표와 호송 칸을 공개한다. 안내 실무가 교섭을 받치지만 사절의 협상 성과를 대신하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":30,"무력":-20,"물질":15,"공동":-5,"원칙":10,"공개":-15,"자격":25,"분산":0,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":-25,"위험":-20,"과시":5,"지속":20,"지향":"이성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"주사","생업":"회의 열차 사절 대기표·호송 칸 안내","직함":"정부 회의 열차 안내인","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 30 | 무력 −20 | 물질 15 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 10 | 공개 −15 | 자격 25 | 분산 0 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 −25 | 위험 −20 | 과시 5 | 지속 20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2090년생인 엘레나 모로조바는 2126년 개막기에 정부 회의 열차 안내인 업무를 맡는다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 정부 회의 열차 안내인 업무는 가짜 약 봉인을 계기로 시작됐다. 러시아계 가계는 동대문·용산 민간 화물 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 이반 모로조프는 약 2026년 동대문·용산 민간 화물 생활권에서 동대문 화물 중개와 이태원 숙박 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 엘레나 모로조바의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 러시아어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 엘레나 모로조바의 회의 열차 사절 대기표·호송 칸 안내 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 정부 회의 열차 안내인. 사절 대기표와 호송 칸을 매일 공개하고, 군수 화차는 회의 열차가 떠난 뒤에만 승강장에 붙인다.","일화":"2125년 가짜 약 상자를 경매장에서 거둬 화형 대신 봉인했다. 이 행동을 계기로 정부 회의 열차 안내인 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"마테우시 코발스키의 대합실 창구를 안내로 받치고, 정유라의 공동교섭 사절을 먼저 태우며, 장세화의 상호호송 초안을 승강장 칠판에 옮긴다.","야망":"회의 사절 열차를 공동호송 시각표로만 붙여 용산이 분할 복속의 승강장이 되지 않게 한다.","공포":"안내 칠판이 매수 쪽지로 덮여 회의 열차가 암살 경로로 바뀌는 것.","개입":"매수 쪽지를 칠판에서 떼거나, 사절 호송을 맡아 안내 시각표를 지킬 수 있다."},"biography":"대합실 습기로 사절 인파를 가늠하고, 강국 화차를 환적국 대기열 앞으로 끌어오라는 명령을 모욕으로 듣는다. 온화하나 안내 방송을 남에게 넘기지 않는다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 주사\n- 생업: 회의 열차 사절 대기표·호송 칸 안내\n- 직함: 정부 회의 열차 안내인\n**생애.** 2090년생인 엘레나 모로조바는 2126년 개막기에 정부 회의 열차 안내인 업무를 맡는다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 정부 회의 열차 안내인 업무는 가짜 약 봉인을 계기로 시작됐다. 러시아계 가계는 동대문·용산 민간 화물 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 이반 모로조프는 약 2026년 동대문·용산 민간 화물 생활권에서 동대문 화물 중개와 이태원 숙박 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 엘레나 모로조바의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 러시아어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 엘레나 모로조바의 회의 열차 사절 대기표·호송 칸 안내 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 정부 회의 열차 안내인. 사절 대기표와 호송 칸을 매일 공개하고, 군수 화차는 회의 열차가 떠난 뒤에만 승강장에 붙인다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 가짜 약 상자를 경매장에서 거둬 화형 대신 봉인했다. 이 행동을 계기로 정부 회의 열차 안내인 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 마테우시 코발스키의 대합실 창구를 안내로 받치고, 정유라의 공동교섭 사절을 먼저 태우며, 장세화의 상호호송 초안을 승강장 칠판에 옮긴다.\n\n**야망.** 회의 사절 열차를 공동호송 시각표로만 붙여 용산이 분할 복속의 승강장이 되지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 안내 칠판이 매수 쪽지로 덮여 회의 열차가 암살 경로로 바뀌는 것.\n\n**개입.** 매수 쪽지를 칠판에서 떼거나, 사절 호송을 맡아 안내 시각표를 지킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 30 | 무력 −20 | 물질 15 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 10 | 공개 −15 | 자격 25 | 분산 0 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 −25 | 위험 −20 | 과시 5 | 지속 20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"엘레나 모로조바","type":"계약","to":"마테우시 코발스키","basis":"마테우시 코발스키의 대합실 창구를 안내로 받치고"},{"from":"엘레나 모로조바","type":"계약","to":"정유라","basis":"정유라의 공동교섭 사절을 먼저 태우며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0193', NULL, '{"id":"person-0193","name":"Oleksandr Shevchenko","title":"Succession Trial Parts Accusation Assistant","position":"Succession Trial Parts Accusation Assistant","characterId":"K192","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Succession Trial Part Sampling and Transshipment Lot Sealing","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#inmul-Oleksandr-Shevchenko","detailRoute":"/people/person-0193","birthDate":"2064-06-08","birthday":"06-08","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"part-sample-comparison","name":"Part sample comparison","rating":70},{"id":"complaint-evidence-custody","name":"Complaint evidence custody","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k192-disposition","name":"Holding complaints without cosignatures","description":"He gauged brake wear and shaved bearings with the same hand and filed no accusation unless the house''s verbal order was taken down again as a sentence. Calm, he could not stand a squad leader who hid specimens.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: succession trial parts accusation assistant. He wrote the shaved specimens and the dispatch hours on one line and posted no solo accusation without the apprentice''s and the dispatcher''s joint signature.","stress":"Fear. That the accusation assistant''s signature would remain in the accomplice column of doctored evidence.","relationship":"Relations. Took Isaac Walker''s maintenance logs as accusation grounds, cross-checked I Hongwon''s public technology trial records from the warehouse side, and attached specimen numbers to Martin Horák''s inspection claim.","effects":[]},{"id":"k192-choice","name":"Rejecting hidden samples","description":"Anecdote. When the winter black dispatch sheet exposed the northern succession trial''s parts rigging, Oleksandr Shevchenko sealed the same lot transshipped at Yongsan and attached it to the accusation.","behavior":"Relations. Took Isaac Walker''s maintenance logs as accusation grounds, cross-checked I Hongwon''s public technology trial records from the warehouse side, and attached specimen numbers to Martin Horák''s inspection claim.","stress":"Fear. That the accusation assistant''s signature would remain in the accomplice column of doctored evidence.","relationship":"Relations. Took Isaac Walker''s maintenance logs as accusation grounds, cross-checked I Hongwon''s public technology trial records from the warehouse side, and attached specimen numbers to Martin Horák''s inspection claim.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He sealed the matching lot and attached it to the complaint, linking logs, test records and access requests. Technical verification is supported; complete resolution is not.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":20,"Force":-10,"Material":15,"Communal":-5,"Principle":0,"Public":-30,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":-40,"Risk":-5,"Display":10,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Livelihood":"Succession Trial Part Sampling and Transshipment Lot Sealing","Title":"Succession Trial Parts Accusation Assistant","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness 20 | Force −10 | Material 15 | Communal −5 | Principle 0 | Publicity −30 | Credentials 60 | Dispersal 10 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 45 | Monopoly −40 | Risk −5 | Display 10 | Endurance 35 | Orientation: Opposite sex | Union: Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in 2064, Oleksandr Shevchenko takes up the post of succession trial parts complaint aide in the opening period of 2126. He grew up at the Sinjeong rail depot. His work as succession trial parts complaint aide began with a defect report filed just before a derailment. His Ukrainian-descended family is rooted in the Dongdaemun-Yongsan civilian transport community. Ivan Shevchenko lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in the Dongdaemun-Yongsan civilian transport community, working night labor in Dongdaemun and freight handovers in Yongsan. The family passed its records of shelters and goods handovers down to the next generation, and Oleksandr Shevchenko''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their day. At home they speak Ukrainian; in daily life and at work they speak Korean.\n- Oleksandr Shevchenko''s work on succession trial parts samples and transshipment lot sealing is tied to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Succession Trial Parts Complaint Aide. He writes the shaved sample and the dispatch time on one line, and he does not post a solo complaint without the co-signatures of an apprentice and a dispatcher.","Anecdote":"When the winter''s black dispatch sheet exposed the tampering with northern succession trial parts, Oleksandr Shevchenko sealed the same lot transshipped at Yongsan and attached it to the complaint.","Relationships":"He accepts Isaac Walker''s maintenance logs as grounds for complaints, cross-checks Yi Hong-won''s public technical test records from the Chang side, and attaches sample numbers to Martin Horak''s inspection requests.","Ambition":"He posts the tampering with northern succession trial parts to the Yongsan transshipment log and the Changdong test ledger at the same time, so that the third war instigator is left as a named line.","Fear":"That the complaint aide''s signature will remain in the accomplice column of fabricated evidence.","Intervention":"You can escort the sealed sample to Changdong, or expose the notes meant to put his name in the accomplice column."},"biography":"He gauges brake wear and shaved bearings with the same hand, and he will not file a complaint unless a clan''s verbal instruction is received again in written sentences. He is calm, but he cannot tolerate a foreman who hides samples.\n\n- Affiliation: Transfer Bureau\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Livelihood: Succession trial parts samples and transshipment lot sealing\n- Title: Succession Trial Parts Complaint Aide\n**Life.** Born in 2064, Oleksandr Shevchenko takes up the post of succession trial parts complaint aide in the opening period of 2126. He grew up at the Sinjeong rail depot. His work as succession trial parts complaint aide began with a defect report filed just before a derailment. His Ukrainian-descended family is rooted in the Dongdaemun-Yongsan civilian transport community. Ivan Shevchenko lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in the Dongdaemun-Yongsan civilian transport community, working night labor in Dongdaemun and freight handovers in Yongsan. The family passed its records of shelters and goods handovers down to the next generation, and Oleksandr Shevchenko''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their day. At home they speak Ukrainian; in daily life and at work they speak Korean.\n- Oleksandr Shevchenko''s work on succession trial parts samples and transshipment lot sealing is tied to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Succession Trial Parts Complaint Aide. He writes the shaved sample and the dispatch time on one line, and he does not post a solo complaint without the co-signatures of an apprentice and a dispatcher.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the winter''s black dispatch sheet exposed the tampering with northern succession trial parts, Oleksandr Shevchenko sealed the same lot transshipped at Yongsan and attached it to the complaint.\n\n**Relations.** He accepts Isaac Walker''s maintenance logs as grounds for complaints, cross-checks Yi Hong-won''s public technical test records from the Chang side, and attaches sample numbers to Martin Horak''s inspection requests.\n\n**Ambition.** He posts the tampering with northern succession trial parts to the Yongsan transshipment log and the Changdong test ledger at the same time, so that the third war instigator is left as a named line.\n\n**Fear.** That the complaint aide''s signature will remain in the accomplice column of fabricated evidence.\n\n**Intervention.** You can escort the sealed sample to Changdong, or expose the notes meant to put his name in the accomplice column.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness 20 | Force −10 | Material 15 | Communal −5 | Principle 0 | Publicity −30 | Credentials 60 | Dispersal 10 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Monopoly −40 | Risk −5 | Display 10 | Endurance 35 | Orientation: Opposite sex | Union: Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Oleksandr Shevchenko","type":"Contract","to":"Isaac Walker","basis":"Receives Isaac Walker''s maintenance log as grounds for an accusation, and"},{"from":"Oleksandr Shevchenko","type":"Contract","to":"Martin Horak","basis":"Attaches a specimen number to Mareutin Horakeu''s access request"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Martin Horak","type":"Contract","to":"Oleksandr Shevchenko","basis":"Overlays the faulty-brake times recorded by Olleksandeureu Syeuchenko on the same line"},{"from":"Chu Jihun","type":"Oath","to":"Oleksandr Shevchenko","basis":"matching numbers with Oleksandr Shevchenko''s Yongsan transshipment lot"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0193","name":"올렉산드르 셰우첸코","title":"후계시험 부품 고발 보조","position":"후계시험 부품 고발 보조","characterId":"K192","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"후계시험 부품 표본·환적 로트 봉인","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-올렉산드르 셰우첸코","detailRoute":"/people/person-0193","birthDate":"2064-06-08","birthday":"06-08","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":13,"effective":13},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"part-sample-comparison","name":"부품 표본 대조","rating":70},{"id":"complaint-evidence-custody","name":"고발 표본 보관","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k192-disposition","name":"연서 없는 고발 보류","description":"제동 마모와 깎인 베어링을 같은 손으로 가늠하고, 가문 구두 지시를 문장으로 다시 받지 않으면 고발을 올리지 않는다. 침착하나 표본을 숨기는 반장을 참지 못한다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 후계시험 부품 고발 보조. 깎인 표본과 배차 시각을 한 줄에 적고, 단독 고발은 도제와 배차원의 연서가 없으면 게시하지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 고발 보조의 서명이 조작된 증거의 공범란에 남는 것.","relationship":"관계. 아이작 워커의 정비 일지를 고발 근거로 받고, 이홍원의 공개 기술시험 기록을 창 쪽에서 대조하며, 마르틴 호라크의 열람 청구에 표본 번호를 붙인다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k192-choice","name":"표본 은폐 거부","description":"일화. 겨울의 검은 배차표가 북부 후계시험 부품 조작을 드러내자 올렉산드르 셰우첸코는 용산에서 환적된 같은 로트를 봉인해 고발서에 붙였다.","behavior":"관계. 아이작 워커의 정비 일지를 고발 근거로 받고, 이홍원의 공개 기술시험 기록을 창 쪽에서 대조하며, 마르틴 호라크의 열람 청구에 표본 번호를 붙인다.","stress":"공포. 고발 보조의 서명이 조작된 증거의 공범란에 남는 것.","relationship":"관계. 아이작 워커의 정비 일지를 고발 근거로 받고, 이홍원의 공개 기술시험 기록을 창 쪽에서 대조하며, 마르틴 호라크의 열람 청구에 표본 번호를 붙인다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"같은 로트를 봉인해 고발서에 붙이고 일지·시험 원장·열람 청구를 연결한다. 기술 검증은 강점이나 시험 조작의 완전한 해결은 미확인이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":20,"무력":-10,"물질":15,"공동":-5,"원칙":0,"공개":-30,"자격":60,"분산":10,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":-40,"위험":-5,"과시":10,"지속":35,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"주사","생업":"후계시험 부품 표본·환적 로트 봉인","직함":"후계시험 부품 고발 보조","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 20 | 무력 −10 | 물질 15 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −30 | 자격 60 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 −40 | 위험 −5 | 과시 10 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2064년생인 올렉산드르 셰우첸코는 2126년 개막기에 후계시험 부품 고발 보조 업무를 맡는다. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 후계시험 부품 고발 보조 업무는 탈선 직전 결함 보고를 계기로 시작됐다. 우크라이나계 가계는 동대문·용산 민간 운송 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 이반 셰우첸코는 약 2026년 동대문·용산 민간 운송 생활권에서 동대문 야간 공임과 용산 화물 인계 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 올렉산드르 셰우첸코의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 우크라이나어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 올렉산드르 셰우첸코의 후계시험 부품 표본·환적 로트 봉인 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 후계시험 부품 고발 보조. 깎인 표본과 배차 시각을 한 줄에 적고, 단독 고발은 도제와 배차원의 연서가 없으면 게시하지 않는다.","일화":"겨울의 검은 배차표가 북부 후계시험 부품 조작을 드러내자 올렉산드르 셰우첸코는 용산에서 환적된 같은 로트를 봉인해 고발서에 붙였다.","관계":"아이작 워커의 정비 일지를 고발 근거로 받고, 이홍원의 공개 기술시험 기록을 창 쪽에서 대조하며, 마르틴 호라크의 열람 청구에 표본 번호를 붙인다.","야망":"북부 후계시험 부품 조작을 용산 환적 일지와 창동 시험 원장에 동시에 올려 제3의 전쟁 유도자를 이름 있는 줄로 남긴다.","공포":"고발 보조의 서명이 조작된 증거의 공범란에 남는 것.","개입":"봉인 표본을 창동까지 호송하거나, 공범란에 이름을 넣으려는 쪽지를 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"제동 마모와 깎인 베어링을 같은 손으로 가늠하고, 가문 구두 지시를 문장으로 다시 받지 않으면 고발을 올리지 않는다. 침착하나 표본을 숨기는 반장을 참지 못한다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 주사\n- 생업: 후계시험 부품 표본·환적 로트 봉인\n- 직함: 후계시험 부품 고발 보조\n**생애.** 2064년생인 올렉산드르 셰우첸코는 2126년 개막기에 후계시험 부품 고발 보조 업무를 맡는다. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 후계시험 부품 고발 보조 업무는 탈선 직전 결함 보고를 계기로 시작됐다. 우크라이나계 가계는 동대문·용산 민간 운송 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 이반 셰우첸코는 약 2026년 동대문·용산 민간 운송 생활권에서 동대문 야간 공임과 용산 화물 인계 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 올렉산드르 셰우첸코의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 우크라이나어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 올렉산드르 셰우첸코의 후계시험 부품 표본·환적 로트 봉인 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 후계시험 부품 고발 보조. 깎인 표본과 배차 시각을 한 줄에 적고, 단독 고발은 도제와 배차원의 연서가 없으면 게시하지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 겨울의 검은 배차표가 북부 후계시험 부품 조작을 드러내자 올렉산드르 셰우첸코는 용산에서 환적된 같은 로트를 봉인해 고발서에 붙였다.\n\n**관계.** 아이작 워커의 정비 일지를 고발 근거로 받고, 이홍원의 공개 기술시험 기록을 창 쪽에서 대조하며, 마르틴 호라크의 열람 청구에 표본 번호를 붙인다.\n\n**야망.** 북부 후계시험 부품 조작을 용산 환적 일지와 창동 시험 원장에 동시에 올려 제3의 전쟁 유도자를 이름 있는 줄로 남긴다.\n\n**공포.** 고발 보조의 서명이 조작된 증거의 공범란에 남는 것.\n\n**개입.** 봉인 표본을 창동까지 호송하거나, 공범란에 이름을 넣으려는 쪽지를 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 20 | 무력 −10 | 물질 15 | 공동 −5 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −30 | 자격 60 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 −40 | 위험 −5 | 과시 10 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"올렉산드르 셰우첸코","type":"계약","to":"아이작 워커","basis":"아이작 워커의 정비 일지를 고발 근거로 받고"},{"from":"올렉산드르 셰우첸코","type":"계약","to":"마르틴 호라크","basis":"마르틴 호라크의 열람 청구에 표본 번호를 붙인다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"마르틴 호라크","type":"계약","to":"올렉산드르 셰우첸코","basis":"올렉산드르 셰우첸코이 붙인 제동 불량 시각을 같은 줄에 겹친다"},{"from":"추지훈","type":"맹세","to":"올렉산드르 셰우첸코","basis":"올렉산드르 셰우첸코의 용산 환적 로트와 번호를 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0194', NULL, '{"id":"person-0194","name":"Kevin White","title":"Track Dispatch Arbitration Station","position":"Track Dispatch Arbitration Station","characterId":"K193","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Track Dispatch Written Objection Receipt and Arbitration","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#inmul-Kevin White","detailRoute":"/people/person-0194","birthDate":"2069-12-14","birthday":"12-14","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K169","recipientName":"Bak Tae-gyeom","basis":"Carry Bak Taegyeom''s mediation plan out into the field, but do not hand over the track keys.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-07.json","anchor":"Person-Kevin-White-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"dispatch-mediation","name":"Dispatch mediation","rating":70},{"id":"written-objection-review","name":"Written objection review","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k193-disposition","name":"Deferring oral pressure","description":"He read a dispatch sheet''s blanks first and asked whether the small convoys, more than the big trains, missed their hours. Even seated at the arbitration bench, he kept his voice low.","behavior":"Office. Rank: registrar. Title: rail dispatch arbitrator. He took dispatch objections in writing only and pushed verbal pressure to the next window.","stress":"Fear. That when an arbitration gap opened, the Yongsan turnaround line would become the Amsa convoy''s waiting line.","relationship":"Relations. Moved Park Taegyeom''s mediation plan into the field but passed over no rail key.","effects":[]},{"id":"k193-choice","name":"Checking small convoys first","description":"Anecdote. Spoken pressure invoking Park Taegyeom''s settlement plan comes to the arbitration seat asking for the track keys. Kevin White defers the pressure to the next window, puts only written objections on the dispatch sheet, and first checks whether the small escort train cleared on time.","behavior":"Relations. Moved Park Taegyeom''s mediation plan into the field but passed over no rail key.","stress":"Fear. That when an arbitration gap opened, the Yongsan turnaround line would become the Amsa convoy''s waiting line.","relationship":"Relations. Moved Park Taegyeom''s mediation plan into the field but passed over no rail key.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Keeps the keys despite pressure invoking the coordinator and checks written objections and small convoy departures. His mediation preserves authority boundaries.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":20,"Force":0,"Material":25,"Communal":0,"Principle":-5,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":35,"Monopoly":25,"Risk":-30,"Display":10,"Sustained":10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Livelihood":"Track Dispatch Written Objection Receipt and Arbitration","Title":"Track Dispatch Arbitration Station","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 20 | Force 0 | Material 25 | Communal 0 | Principle −5 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 35 | Monopoly 25 | Risk −30 | Display 10 | Persistence 10 | Orientation: Reason | Attachment: None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born in 2069, Kevin White takes up the duties of Track Dispatch Arbitrator in the opening period of 2126. He grew up on the Sinnae transfer night duty. His work as Track Dispatch Arbitrator began with stopping a ticketless departing train. His African American family line is rooted in the Yongsan–Itaewon living sphere. Samuel White lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in Yongsan–Itaewon, working in Itaewon lodging and private interpreting. The family passed down records of residences and goods handovers to the next generation, and Kevin White''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their own time. They speak English at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Kevin White''s work of receiving and arbitrating written track dispatch objections is linked to Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Jusa. Title: Track Dispatch Arbitrator. Dispatch objections are accepted in writing only, and verbal pressure is deferred to the next window.","Anecdote":"Verbal pressure backed by Bak Taegyeom''s mediation proposal enters the arbitration seat and asks for the track keys. Kevin White defers the pressure to the next window, enters only the written objection on the dispatch sheet, and first checks whether the small convoy train departed on time.","Relationships":"Carry Bak Taegyeom''s mediation plan out into the field, but do not hand over the track keys.","Ambition":"To fix track dispatch arbitration not as a three-great-state agreement but as a single timetable of the vassal state.","Fear":"That if a gap opens in arbitration, the Yongsan turnback line will become the waiting queue for the Amsa convoy.","Intervention":"He can set up an arbitration witness or expose a hidden waiting train."},"biography":"He looks first at the blank cells of the dispatch sheet, and weighs whether the small convoy departs on time rather than the big trains. Even when seated in the arbitration seat, he keeps his voice low.\n\n- Affiliation: Transshipment Realm\n- Rank: Jusa\n- Occupation: Receiving and arbitrating written track dispatch objections\n- Title: Track Dispatch Arbitrator\n**Life.** Born in 2069, Kevin White takes up the duties of Track Dispatch Arbitrator in the opening period of 2126. He grew up on the Sinnae transfer night duty. His work as Track Dispatch Arbitrator began with stopping a ticketless departing train. His African American family line is rooted in the Yongsan–Itaewon living sphere. Samuel White lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 in Yongsan–Itaewon, working in Itaewon lodging and private interpreting. The family passed down records of residences and goods handovers to the next generation, and Kevin White''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their own time. They speak English at home and Korean in daily life and at work.\n- Kevin White''s work of receiving and arbitrating written track dispatch objections is linked to Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Jusa. Title: Track Dispatch Arbitrator. Dispatch objections are accepted in writing only, and verbal pressure is deferred to the next window.\n\n**Anecdote.** Verbal pressure backed by Bak Taegyeom''s mediation proposal enters the arbitration seat and asks for the track keys. Kevin White defers the pressure to the next window, enters only the written objection on the dispatch sheet, and first checks whether the small convoy train departed on time.\n\n**Relations.** Carries Bak Taegyeom''s mediation proposal into the field, but does not hand over the track keys.\n\n**Ambition.** To fix track dispatch arbitration not as a three-great-state agreement but as a single timetable of the vassal state.\n\n**Fear.** That if a gap opens in arbitration, the Yongsan turnback line will become the waiting queue for the Amsa convoy.\n\n**Intervention.** He can set up an arbitration witness or expose a hidden waiting train.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 20 | Force 0 | Material 25 | Communal 0 | Principle −5 | Publicity −10 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 35 | Monopoly 25 | Risk −30 | Display 10 | Persistence 10 | Orientation: Reason | Attachment: None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0194","name":"케빈 화이트","title":"선로 배차 중재역","position":"선로 배차 중재역","characterId":"K193","rank":"주사","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"선로 배차 이의 서면 접수·중재","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-07#인물-케빈 화이트","detailRoute":"/people/person-0194","birthDate":"2069-12-14","birthday":"12-14","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K169","recipientName":"박태겸","basis":"박태겸의 조정안을 현장에 옮기되, 선로 열쇠는 넘기지 않는다.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-07.json","anchor":"인물-케빈-화이트-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"dispatch-mediation","name":"배차 중재","rating":70},{"id":"written-objection-review","name":"서면 이의 확인","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k193-disposition","name":"구두 압박을 미룸","description":"배차표의 빈칸을 먼저 보고, 큰 열차보다 작은 호송이 제시간에 빠지는지를 따진다. 중재석에 앉아도 목소리는 낮게 둔다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 주사. 직함은 선로 배차 중재역. 배차 이의는 서면만 받고, 구두 압박은 다음 창으로 미룬다.","stress":"공포. 중재 공백이 생기면 용산 회차선이 암사 호송의 대기열이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 박태겸의 조정안을 현장에 옮기되, 선로 열쇠는 넘기지 않는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k193-choice","name":"작은 호송 우선 확인","description":"일화. 박태겸의 조정안을 앞세운 구두 압박이 중재석에 들어와 선로 열쇠를 청한다. 케빈 화이트는 압박을 다음 창으로 미루고 서면 이의만 배차표에 올리며, 작은 호송 열차가 제시간에 빠졌는지부터 확인한다.","behavior":"관계. 박태겸의 조정안을 현장에 옮기되, 선로 열쇠는 넘기지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 중재 공백이 생기면 용산 회차선이 암사 호송의 대기열이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 박태겸의 조정안을 현장에 옮기되, 선로 열쇠는 넘기지 않는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"조정안을 앞세운 압박에도 열쇠를 내주지 않고 서면 이의와 작은 호송 출발을 확인했다. 권한 경계를 지키는 중재다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":20,"무력":0,"물질":25,"공동":0,"원칙":-5,"공개":-10,"자격":20,"분산":5,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":35,"독점":25,"위험":-30,"과시":10,"지속":10,"지향":"이성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"소속":"환적국","품계":"주사","생업":"선로 배차 이의 서면 접수·중재","직함":"선로 배차 중재역","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 20 | 무력 0 | 물질 25 | 공동 0 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −10 | 자격 20 | 분산 5 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 35 | 독점 25 | 위험 −30 | 과시 10 | 지속 10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2069년생인 케빈 화이트는 2126년 개막기에 선로 배차 중재역 업무를 맡는다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 선로 배차 중재역 업무는 무표 출발 열차 저지를 계기로 시작됐다. 아프리카계 미국인 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 새뮤얼 화이트는 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 이태원 숙박업과 민간 통역 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 케빈 화이트의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 케빈 화이트의 선로 배차 이의 서면 접수·중재 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.","관직":"품계 주사. 직함은 선로 배차 중재역. 배차 이의는 서면만 받고, 구두 압박은 다음 창으로 미룬다.","일화":"박태겸의 조정안을 앞세운 구두 압박이 중재석에 들어와 선로 열쇠를 청한다. 케빈 화이트는 압박을 다음 창으로 미루고 서면 이의만 배차표에 올리며, 작은 호송 열차가 제시간에 빠졌는지부터 확인한다.","관계":"박태겸의 조정안을 현장에 옮기되, 선로 열쇠는 넘기지 않는다.","야망":"선로 배차 중재를 강국 세 장의 합의서가 아니라 후국 단독 시간표로 고정한다.","공포":"중재 공백이 생기면 용산 회차선이 암사 호송의 대기열이 되는 것.","개입":"중재 증인을 세우거나, 숨긴 대기 열차를 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"배차표의 빈칸을 먼저 보고, 큰 열차보다 작은 호송이 제시간에 빠지는지를 따진다. 중재석에 앉아도 목소리는 낮게 둔다.\n\n- 소속: 환적국\n- 품계: 주사\n- 생업: 선로 배차 이의 서면 접수·중재\n- 직함: 선로 배차 중재역\n**생애.** 2069년생인 케빈 화이트는 2126년 개막기에 선로 배차 중재역 업무를 맡는다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 선로 배차 중재역 업무는 무표 출발 열차 저지를 계기로 시작됐다. 아프리카계 미국인 가계는 용산·이태원 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 새뮤얼 화이트는 약 2026년 용산·이태원에서 이태원 숙박업과 민간 통역 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 케빈 화이트의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 영어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 케빈 화이트의 선로 배차 이의 서면 접수·중재 업무는 한강로동과 연결된다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 주사. 직함은 선로 배차 중재역. 배차 이의는 서면만 받고, 구두 압박은 다음 창으로 미룬다.\n\n**일화.** 박태겸의 조정안을 앞세운 구두 압박이 중재석에 들어와 선로 열쇠를 청한다. 케빈 화이트는 압박을 다음 창으로 미루고 서면 이의만 배차표에 올리며, 작은 호송 열차가 제시간에 빠졌는지부터 확인한다.\n\n**관계.** 박태겸의 조정안을 현장에 옮기되, 선로 열쇠는 넘기지 않는다.\n\n**야망.** 선로 배차 중재를 강국 세 장의 합의서가 아니라 후국 단독 시간표로 고정한다.\n\n**공포.** 중재 공백이 생기면 용산 회차선이 암사 호송의 대기열이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 중재 증인을 세우거나, 숨긴 대기 열차를 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 20 | 무력 0 | 물질 25 | 공동 0 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −10 | 자격 20 | 분산 5 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 35 | 독점 25 | 위험 −30 | 과시 10 | 지속 10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0195', 'c624-d574-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0195","name":"Oh Hae-rin","title":"Ledger","position":"Director of the intelligence service","characterId":"K194","rank":"Ledger","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"Cold Storage Key and Auction Price Management","gender":"Female","stage":"Key","state":"government","stateName":"the intelligence service","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#inmul-Oh-Haerin","detailRoute":"/people/person-0195","birthDate":"2078-11-27","birthday":"11-27","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":13,"effective":13},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":14,"effective":14},"learning":{"base":13,"effective":13},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k194-sealed-auction","name":"Sealed-auction handling","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k194-trait-1","name":"Price within the seal","description":"Uses a seal and price instead of ending trade.","behavior":"Uses a seal and price instead of ending trade.","stress":"Raises the price even when the sealed box contains suspect drugs.","relationship":"Acts differently from Ryu Eunbi’s refusal and competes with Nam Yungyeong in the market.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She is an AI avatar whose organization preserves records from within Seoul at Namsan Tower, judges whether they can be recovered, and seeks to restore a legitimate organization. She raised the price of a sealed suspect-drug box rather than stopping medical trade. Conflicting prior livelihoods are not merged, and organizational continuity grants neither omniscience nor unrestricted facility control.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s08","name":"Seoul Tower holding","holderPersonId":"K194","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S08","adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null,"landmarkRef":{"landmarkId":"n-seoul-tower","sourcePath":"lore/places/landmark-roles.json"}}],"clan":{"id":"c624-d574-c8fc","name":"Haeju O Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c624-d574-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":40,"Force":-20,"Material":70,"Communal":-40,"Principle":-50,"Public":30,"Eligibility":0,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":60,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":30,"Display":50,"Sustained":-30,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"the intelligence service","Rank":"Ledger","Livelihood":"Cold Storage Key and Auction Price Management","Title":"Director of the intelligence service"},"sections":{"Life":"Oh Haerin is the current AI avatar of the intelligence service and uses Namsan Tower as her base. The intelligence service has operated as an independent, neutral organization since around 2026, and the AI continued to lead the organization while changing avatars. Only the intelligence service knows of the true Republic of Korea and of the real Republic of Korea government personnel sleeping in the underground hibernation facility within the Cheongwadae complex. The intelligence service intends to revive them and restore a legitimate organization. As Director of the intelligence service, Oh Haerin cross-checks Namsan Tower''s internal Seoul records against the possibility of recovery. Seoul Tower is directly held by Oh Haerin. She manages the warehouse keys of the Noryangjin Delivery House and the auction price records, while the cold-storage key of the Frozen Merchant Company is held by Gu Haon. Ice credit remains as neighbors'' debt.\nOffice. Rank: Director. Title: Director of the intelligence service. Occupational alias: Frozen Merchant Representative.\nAnecdote. When fake medicine was put up at auction, she raised the price while keeping the box sealed, and Ryu Eunbi cut off trade that day.\nHouse. Noryangjin Delivery House (HC06). Steward. The steward of the Noryangjin Frozen Merchant Company (HP08) is Gu Haon.\nRelations. Dispute with Han Jaemok over price disclosure. Market rivalry with Nam Yungyeong.\n\n- Affiliation: the intelligence service\n- Rank: Director\n- Occupation: Managing cold-storage warehouse keys and auction prices\n- Title: Director of the intelligence service\n- Oh Haerin checks Namsan Tower''s observation records in Yongsan 2-ga-dong and relays manual signals. Managing the Noryangjin cold-storage warehouse keys and auction prices, and directly holding Seoul Tower, are separate from this work.\n\nShe is the real power over auctions, convoys, and ice beside Frozen Merchant Representative Oh Haerin."},"biography":"**Life.** Oh Haerin is the current AI avatar of the intelligence service and uses Namsan Tower as her base. The intelligence service has operated as an independent, neutral organization since around 2026, and the AI continued to lead the organization while changing avatars. Only the intelligence service knows of the true Republic of Korea and of the real Republic of Korea government personnel sleeping in the underground hibernation facility within the Cheongwadae complex. The intelligence service intends to revive them and restore a legitimate organization. As Director of the intelligence service, Oh Haerin cross-checks Namsan Tower''s internal Seoul records against the possibility of recovery. Seoul Tower is directly held by Oh Haerin. She manages the warehouse keys of the Noryangjin Delivery House and the auction price records, while the cold-storage key of the Frozen Merchant Company is held by Gu Haon. Ice credit remains as neighbors'' debt.\nOffice. Rank: Director. Title: Director of the intelligence service. Occupational alias: Frozen Merchant Representative.\nAnecdote. When fake medicine was put up at auction, she raised the price while keeping the box sealed, and Ryu Eunbi cut off trade that day.\nHouse. Noryangjin Delivery House (HC06). Steward. The steward of the Noryangjin Frozen Merchant Company (HP08) is Gu Haon.\nRelations. Dispute with Han Jaemok over price disclosure. Market rivalry with Nam Yungyeong.\n\n- Affiliation: the intelligence service\n- Rank: Director\n- Occupation: Managing cold-storage warehouse keys and auction prices\n- Title: Director of the intelligence service\n- Oh Haerin checks Namsan Tower''s observation records in Yongsan 2-ga-dong and relays manual signals. Managing the Noryangjin cold-storage warehouse keys and auction prices, and directly holding Seoul Tower, are separate from this work.\n\nShe is the real power over auctions, convoys, and ice beside Frozen Merchant Representative Oh Haerin.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"Jeong Mo-ran","type":"Rivalry","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Rivalry for the lead in waterborne freight rates and refrigerated escort"},{"from":"Jo Min-jae","type":"Command","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Redirect power and water contracts into frozen-goods operations"},{"from":"Yun Seo-ha","type":"Command","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Entrusted with the private auction of convoy rights"},{"from":"Sin Tae-san","type":"Contract","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Enforce the merchant-house convoy contract on site"},{"from":"Seo Na-yeon","type":"Command","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Fill the collateral warehouse with ice"},{"from":"Peter Jansen","type":"Contract","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Trade the Chamber Governance votes with the Shipowners'' Council"},{"from":"Oh Haneul","type":"Contract","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Put the market price broadcast into guild time"},{"from":"Na Ru-hui","type":"Contract","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Comply with Oh Haerin''s stock disclosure but refuse concealed power distribution"},{"from":"Mo Bongyong","type":"Contract","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Refer to Oh Haerin''s market price broadcast during guild time"},{"from":"Bok Yong","type":"Contract","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Refer to Oh Haerin''s market price broadcast during market time only"},{"from":"Seop Da-eun","type":"Oath","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Add testimony to Oh Haerin''s stock disclosure, and"},{"from":"Eo Do-yun","type":"Oath","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Add first-year testimony to the legitimacy of Oh Haerin''s neutral market"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0195","name":"오해린","title":"원장","position":"정보기관 원장","characterId":"K194","rank":"원장","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"냉동 창고 열쇠·경매 가격 관리","gender":"여성","stage":"주요","state":"government","stateName":"정보기관","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#인물-오해린","detailRoute":"/people/person-0195","birthDate":"2078-11-27","birthday":"11-27","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":13,"effective":13},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":14,"effective":14},"learning":{"base":13,"effective":13},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k194-sealed-auction","name":"봉인 경매 처리","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k194-trait-1","name":"봉인 안의 가격","description":"거래를 끊는 대신 봉인과 가격을 함께 사용한다.","behavior":"거래를 끊는 대신 봉인과 가격을 함께 사용한다.","stress":"가짜 약이 나와도 봉한 상자의 값을 올린다.","relationship":"류은비의 거래 거부와 달리 움직이며 남윤경과 시장에서 경쟁한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"남산타워에 남은 서울 내부 기록을 보존하고 복구 여부를 판단하며 정통성 있는 조직 복원을 추구하는 AI 아바타다. 가짜 약 상자를 봉한 채 값을 올려 의료 거래 중단과 다른 선택을 했다. 두 카드의 이전 생업은 합치지 않았으며 장기 연속성이 전지적 정보나 시설 통제권을 뜻하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s08","name":"서울타워 직영지","holderPersonId":"K194","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S08","adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null,"landmarkRef":{"landmarkId":"n-seoul-tower","sourcePath":"lore/places/landmark-roles.json"}}],"clan":{"id":"c624-d574-c8fc","name":"해주 오씨","crest":"clan-crests/c624-d574-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"권위":0,"개방":40,"무력":-20,"물질":70,"공동":-40,"원칙":-50,"공개":30,"자격":0,"분산":20,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":60,"독점":-20,"위험":30,"과시":50,"지속":-30,"지향":"유동","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"소속":"정보기관","품계":"원장","생업":"냉동 창고 열쇠·경매 가격 관리","직함":"정보기관 원장"},"sections":{"생애":"오해린은 정보기관의 현재 AI 아바타이며 남산타워를 거점으로 삼는다. 정보기관은 약 2026년부터 독립된 중립 조직으로 활동했고 AI가 아바타를 바꾸며 계속 조직을 이끌었다. 첩보 조직이었던 정보기관만이 진정한 대한민국과 청와대 시설 안의 지하 동면소에 잠든 실제 대한민국정부 인사들의 존재를 안다. 정보기관은 이들을 되살려 정통성 있는 조직을 복원하려 한다. 오해린은 정보기관 원장으로 남산타워의 서울 내부 기록과 복구 여부를 대조한다. 서울타워는 오해린이 직접 보유한다. 노량진배달가의 창고 열쇠와 경매 가격 기록을 관리하고, 냉동상단의 냉고 열쇠는 구하온이 맡는다. 얼음 신용은 이웃 빚으로 남는다.\n관직. 품계 원장. 직함은 정보기관 원장. 생업 별명은 냉동상인 대표.\n일화. 가짜 약이 경매에 올랐을 때 상자를 봉한 채 값을 올렸고, 류은비는 그날 거래를 끊었다.\n가문. 노량진배달가(HC06). 관리인. 노량진냉동상단(HP08) 관리인은 구하온이다.\n관계. 한재목과 가격 공개 다툼. 남윤경과 시장 경쟁.\n\n- 소속: 정보기관\n- 품계: 원장\n- 생업: 냉동 창고 열쇠·경매 가격 관리\n- 직함: 정보기관 원장\n- 오해린은 용산2가동에서 남산타워의 관측 기록을 확인하고 수동 신호를 중계한다. 노량진 냉동 창고 열쇠·경매 가격 관리와 서울타워 직접 보유는 이 업무와 별개다.\n\n냉동상인 대표 오해린 곁의 경매·호송·얼음 실세다."},"biography":"**생애.** 오해린은 정보기관의 현재 AI 아바타이며 남산타워를 거점으로 삼는다. 정보기관은 약 2026년부터 독립된 중립 조직으로 활동했고 AI가 아바타를 바꾸며 계속 조직을 이끌었다. 첩보 조직이었던 정보기관만이 진정한 대한민국과 청와대 시설 안의 지하 동면소에 잠든 실제 대한민국정부 인사들의 존재를 안다. 정보기관은 이들을 되살려 정통성 있는 조직을 복원하려 한다. 오해린은 정보기관 원장으로 남산타워의 서울 내부 기록과 복구 여부를 대조한다. 서울타워는 오해린이 직접 보유한다. 노량진배달가의 창고 열쇠와 경매 가격 기록을 관리하고, 냉동상단의 냉고 열쇠는 구하온이 맡는다. 얼음 신용은 이웃 빚으로 남는다.\n관직. 품계 원장. 직함은 정보기관 원장. 생업 별명은 냉동상인 대표.\n일화. 가짜 약이 경매에 올랐을 때 상자를 봉한 채 값을 올렸고, 류은비는 그날 거래를 끊었다.\n가문. 노량진배달가(HC06). 관리인. 노량진냉동상단(HP08) 관리인은 구하온이다.\n관계. 한재목과 가격 공개 다툼. 남윤경과 시장 경쟁.\n\n- 소속: 정보기관\n- 품계: 원장\n- 생업: 냉동 창고 열쇠·경매 가격 관리\n- 직함: 정보기관 원장\n- 오해린은 용산2가동에서 남산타워의 관측 기록을 확인하고 수동 신호를 중계한다. 노량진 냉동 창고 열쇠·경매 가격 관리와 서울타워 직접 보유는 이 업무와 별개다.\n\n냉동상인 대표 오해린 곁의 경매·호송·얼음 실세다.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"정모란","type":"경쟁","to":"오해린","basis":"수상 운임과 냉동 호송 주도권 경쟁"},{"from":"조민재","type":"지휘","to":"오해린","basis":"전력·물 계약을 냉동 실무로 돌림"},{"from":"윤서하","type":"지휘","to":"오해린","basis":"호송권 비공개 경매를 위임받음"},{"from":"신태산","type":"계약","to":"오해린","basis":"상회 호송 계약을 현장에서 집행"},{"from":"서나연","type":"지휘","to":"오해린","basis":"담보 창고를 얼음으로 채움"},{"from":"피터 얀센","type":"계약","to":"오해린","basis":"상회정 표를 운송선주 평의와 거래"},{"from":"오하늘","type":"계약","to":"오해린","basis":"시세 방송을 길드 시간에 넣음"},{"from":"나루희","type":"계약","to":"오해린","basis":"오해린의 재고 공개에는 복종하되 은폐 배전은 거부한다"},{"from":"모봉용","type":"계약","to":"오해린","basis":"오해린의 시세 방송을 길드 시간에 참고한다"},{"from":"복용","type":"계약","to":"오해린","basis":"오해린의 시세 방송을 시장 시간에만 참고한다"},{"from":"섭다은","type":"맹세","to":"오해린","basis":"오해린의 재고 공개에 증언을 보태고"},{"from":"어도윤","type":"맹세","to":"오해린","basis":"오해린의 중립시장 정통성에 첫해 증언을 보태고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0196', 'c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99', '{"id":"person-0196","name":"Jo Min-jae","title":"Frozen Goods Merchant","position":"Frozen Goods Merchant","characterId":"K195","rank":"Corrections","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Frozen Inventory Temperature and Weight Inspection","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#inmul-Jo-Minjae","detailRoute":"/people/person-0196","birthDate":"2100-02-02","birthday":"02-02","age":26,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"cold-stock-inspection","name":"Cold stock inspection","rating":65},{"id":"supply-contract-operation","name":"Supply contract operation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k195-disposition","name":"Intolerance of concealed losses","description":"He could not stand colleagues who hid losses and read warehouse states by smell before numbers. He smiled in bargaining, but his face hardened when the thermometer shook.","behavior":"Office. Rank: lay instructor. Title: cold-storage merchant. He published inventory temperature and tonnage at noon and stripped the auction license of any column caught with false inventory.","stress":"Fear. That one day of cut power would melt the cold warehouse''s credit.","relationship":"Relations. Under O Haerin''s command he ran the power and water contracts with Han Jaemok as work. Entrusted cold freight to Song I-deun and fought the price-announcement hour with Nam Yungyeong.","effects":[]},{"id":"k195-choice","name":"Credit alongside temperature","description":"Anecdote. When the blackout pushed the Noryangjin Samho warehouse''s temperature to the danger line, the merchants began moving inventory through the night.","behavior":"Relations. Under O Haerin''s command he ran the power and water contracts with Han Jaemok as work. Entrusted cold freight to Song I-deun and fought the price-announcement hour with Nam Yungyeong.","stress":"Fear. That one day of cut power would melt the cold warehouse''s credit.","relationship":"Relations. Under O Haerin''s command he ran the power and water contracts with Han Jaemok as work. Entrusted cold freight to Song I-deun and fought the price-announcement hour with Nam Yungyeong.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Publishes temperature and weight and removes false bays’ auction eligibility. Other merchants’ outage removals are not credited to him.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99","name":"Baecheon Jo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":35,"Force":-10,"Material":90,"Communal":-20,"Principle":-30,"Public":10,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":-10,"Display":30,"Sustained":40,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Corrections","Livelihood":"Frozen Inventory Temperature and Weight Inspection","Title":"Frozen Goods Merchant","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 35 | Force −10 | Material 90 | Communal −20 | Principle −30 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −10 | Display 30 | Endurance 40 | Orientation Unaligned | Bond Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Noryangjin Wharf. The Frozen Merchant post opened through a public scale recheck.\n- Jo Minjae handles frozen stock temperature and weight inspection in Noryangjin 1-dong.","Offices":"Rank Instructor. Title: Frozen Merchant. Publishes stock temperature and weight at noon, and strips the auction eligibility of any stall where false stock turns up.","Anecdote":"When the blackout drove the temperature of the Noryangjin Samho Warehouse up to the danger line, merchants began moving their stock overnight.","Relationships":"Under Oh Haerin''s command, he handles the power and water contracts with Han Jaemok in practice. He entrusts frozen cargo to Song Ideun and argues with Nam Yungyeong over the timing of price announcements.","Ambition":"He binds ice blocks and short-term food stocks as collateral for Oh Haerin''s settlement authority, so that Noryangjin takes the lead in setting prices over Garak.","Fear":"That a single day without power could melt away the credit of the cold storage.","Intervention":"He can obtain generator parts to keep the freezers alive, or expose a ledger that recorded melted stock as if it were full."},"biography":"Cannot tolerate colleagues who hide losses, and reads the state of a warehouse by smell before numbers. Smiles during haggling, but his expression hardens when a thermometer wavers.\n\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Instructor\n- Occupation: Frozen stock temperature and weight inspection\n- Title: Frozen Merchant\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Noryangjin Wharf. The Frozen Merchant post opened through a public scale recheck.\n- Jo Minjae handles frozen stock temperature and weight inspection in Noryangjin 1-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank Instructor. Title: Frozen Merchant. Publishes stock temperature and weight at noon, and strips the auction eligibility of any stall where false stock turns up.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the blackout drove the temperature of the Noryangjin Samho Warehouse up to the danger line, merchants began moving their stock overnight.\n\n**Relations.** Under Oh Haerin''s command, he handles the power and water contracts with Han Jaemok in practice. He entrusts frozen cargo to Song Ideun and argues with Nam Yungyeong over the timing of price announcements.\n\n**Ambition.** He binds ice blocks and short-term food stocks as collateral for Oh Haerin''s settlement authority, so that Noryangjin takes the lead in setting prices over Garak.\n\n**Fear.** That a single day without power could melt away the credit of the cold storage.\n\n**Intervention.** He can obtain generator parts to keep the freezers alive, or expose a ledger that recorded melted stock as if it were full.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 35 | Force −10 | Material 90 | Communal −20 | Principle −30 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −10 | Display 30 | Endurance 40 | Orientation Unaligned | Bond Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Jo Min-jae","type":"Command","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Redirect power and water contracts into frozen-goods operations"},{"from":"Jo Min-jae","type":"Contract","to":"Lucas Schneider","basis":"Entrusted the frozen cargo to Yongsan transshipment"},{"from":"Jo Min-jae","type":"Rivalry","to":"Nam Yun-gyeong","basis":"Disputes the timing of price announcements with Garak"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Ji Ma-ru","type":"Command","to":"Jo Min-jae","basis":"Receives orders to supply power for Jo Minjae''s temperature disclosures"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0196","name":"조민재","title":"냉동 상인","position":"냉동 상인","characterId":"K195","rank":"교도","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"냉동 재고 온도·중량 검사","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#인물-조민재","detailRoute":"/people/person-0196","birthDate":"2100-02-02","birthday":"02-02","age":26,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"cold-stock-inspection","name":"냉동 재고 검사","rating":65},{"id":"supply-contract-operation","name":"공급 계약 운용","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k195-disposition","name":"손실 은폐 불관용","description":"손실을 숨기는 동료를 참지 못하고, 숫자보다 냄새로 창고 상태를 먼저 읽는다. 흥정에서는 웃지만 온도계가 흔들리면 표정이 굳는다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 교도. 직함은 냉동 상인. 재고 온도와 중량을 정오에 공개하고, 허위 재고가 나오면 해당 칸의 경매 자격을 박탈한다.","stress":"공포. 전력이 하루만 끊겨도 냉동창고의 신용이 녹아내리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 오해린의 지휘 아래 한재목과 전력·물 계약을 실무로 돌린다. 송이든에게 냉동 화물을 맡기고, 남윤경과 시세 발표 시각을 다툰다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k195-choice","name":"신용과 온도를 함께","description":"일화. 정전으로 노량진 삼호 창고의 온도가 위험선까지 오르자 상인들이 재고를 밤사이에 옮기기 시작했다.","behavior":"관계. 오해린의 지휘 아래 한재목과 전력·물 계약을 실무로 돌린다. 송이든에게 냉동 화물을 맡기고, 남윤경과 시세 발표 시각을 다툰다.","stress":"공포. 전력이 하루만 끊겨도 냉동창고의 신용이 녹아내리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 오해린의 지휘 아래 한재목과 전력·물 계약을 실무로 돌린다. 송이든에게 냉동 화물을 맡기고, 남윤경과 시세 발표 시각을 다툰다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"온도·중량을 공개하며 허위 칸의 경매 자격을 뺀다. 정전 때 화물을 옮긴 상인의 행동을 그의 실적으로 쓰지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99","name":"배천 조씨","crest":"clan-crests/c870-bc30-cc9c-8d99.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":35,"무력":-10,"물질":90,"공동":-20,"원칙":-30,"공개":10,"자격":10,"분산":20,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":-30,"위험":-10,"과시":30,"지속":40,"지향":"무성향","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"정부","품계":"교도","생업":"냉동 재고 온도·중량 검사","직함":"냉동 상인","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 35 | 무력 −10 | 물질 90 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 −30 | 공개 10 | 자격 10 | 분산 20 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −10 | 과시 30 | 지속 40 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 냉동 상인 자리는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다.\n- 조민재는 노량진1동에서 냉동 재고 온도·중량 검사 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 교도. 직함은 냉동 상인. 재고 온도와 중량을 정오에 공개하고, 허위 재고가 나오면 해당 칸의 경매 자격을 박탈한다.","일화":"정전으로 노량진 삼호 창고의 온도가 위험선까지 오르자 상인들이 재고를 밤사이에 옮기기 시작했다.","관계":"오해린의 지휘 아래 한재목과 전력·물 계약을 실무로 돌린다. 송이든에게 냉동 화물을 맡기고, 남윤경과 시세 발표 시각을 다툰다.","야망":"얼음 벽돌과 단기 식량 재고를 오해린의 결제권 담보로 묶어 가락의 가격 주도권을 노량진이 가져온다.","공포":"전력이 하루만 끊겨도 냉동창고의 신용이 녹아내리는 것.","개입":"발전 부품을 구해 냉동을 살리거나, 녹은 재고를 가득 찬 것처럼 적은 장부를 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"손실을 숨기는 동료를 참지 못하고, 숫자보다 냄새로 창고 상태를 먼저 읽는다. 흥정에서는 웃지만 온도계가 흔들리면 표정이 굳는다.\n\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 교도\n- 생업: 냉동 재고 온도·중량 검사\n- 직함: 냉동 상인\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 냉동 상인 자리는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다.\n- 조민재는 노량진1동에서 냉동 재고 온도·중량 검사 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 교도. 직함은 냉동 상인. 재고 온도와 중량을 정오에 공개하고, 허위 재고가 나오면 해당 칸의 경매 자격을 박탈한다.\n\n**일화.** 정전으로 노량진 삼호 창고의 온도가 위험선까지 오르자 상인들이 재고를 밤사이에 옮기기 시작했다.\n\n**관계.** 오해린의 지휘 아래 한재목과 전력·물 계약을 실무로 돌린다. 송이든에게 냉동 화물을 맡기고, 남윤경과 시세 발표 시각을 다툰다.\n\n**야망.** 얼음 벽돌과 단기 식량 재고를 오해린의 결제권 담보로 묶어 가락의 가격 주도권을 노량진이 가져온다.\n\n**공포.** 전력이 하루만 끊겨도 냉동창고의 신용이 녹아내리는 것.\n\n**개입.** 발전 부품을 구해 냉동을 살리거나, 녹은 재고를 가득 찬 것처럼 적은 장부를 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 35 | 무력 −10 | 물질 90 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 −30 | 공개 10 | 자격 10 | 분산 20 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −10 | 과시 30 | 지속 40 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"조민재","type":"지휘","to":"오해린","basis":"전력·물 계약을 냉동 실무로 돌림"},{"from":"조민재","type":"계약","to":"루카스 슈나이더","basis":"냉동 화물을 용산 환적에 맡김"},{"from":"조민재","type":"경쟁","to":"남윤경","basis":"시세 발표 시각을 가락과 다툼"}],"incoming":[{"from":"지마루","type":"지휘","to":"조민재","basis":"조민재의 온도 공개에 전력을 대는 지휘를 받고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0197', 'c724-d30c-d3c9', '{"id":"person-0197","name":"Yun Seo-ha","title":"Auctioneer","position":"Auctioneer","characterId":"K196","rank":"Corrections","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Auction Starting Price and Winning Bid Records","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#person-yun-seoha","detailRoute":"/people/person-0197","birthDate":"2088-05-10","birthday":"05-10","age":38,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"auction-administration","name":"Auction administration","rating":75},{"id":"price-recording","name":"Price recording","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k196-disposition","name":"Stopping wink deals","description":"Her voice was clear and fair to the point of cruelty. When bidders exchanged glances she postponed that lot to the next session at once.","behavior":"Office. Rank: lay instructor. Title: auctioneer. She wrote the opening and winning bids on the wall and ran the convoy right alone as a sealed-envelope auction.","stress":"Fear. That great powers would make the auction floor empty chairs through closed direct deals.","relationship":"Relations. Received mandate over the closed convoy-right auction from O Haerin and competed with Nam Yungyeong for price leadership. Often awarded Sin Taesan''s convoy bids.","effects":[]},{"id":"k196-choice","name":"Separating public prices and envelopes","description":"Anecdote. When Garak prices jumped on famine rumor alone, empty boxes began going for high prices on the Noryangjin auction floor too.","behavior":"Relations. Received mandate over the closed convoy-right auction from O Haerin and competed with Nam Yungyeong for price leadership. Often awarded Sin Taesan''s convoy bids.","stress":"Fear. That great powers would make the auction floor empty chairs through closed direct deals.","relationship":"Relations. Received mandate over the closed convoy-right auction from O Haerin and competed with Nam Yungyeong for price leadership. Often awarded Sin Taesan''s convoy bids.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Defers lots on collusive glances and separates public prices from sealed convoy rights. Fairness claims coexist with private delegated bidding.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c724-d30c-d3c9","name":"Papyeong Yun Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c724-d30c-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":5,"Openness":40,"Force":-15,"Material":85,"Communal":-10,"Principle":-40,"Public":15,"Eligibility":0,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-10,"Display":45,"Sustained":15,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Corrections","Livelihood":"Auction Starting Price and Winning Bid Records","Title":"Auctioneer","Values":"Authority 5 | Openness 40 | Force −15 | Material 85 | Communal −10 | Principle −40 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 0 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 5 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −10 | Display 45 | Endurance 15 | Orientation Unaligned | Bond Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Noryangjin Wharf. The Auctioneer post opened through a public scale recheck.\n- Yun Seoha handles the recording of auction starting prices and winning bids in Noryangjin 1-dong.","Offices":"Rank Gyodo. Title: Auctioneer. Writes the starting and winning prices on the wall, but only escort rights are run through a separate sealed-envelope auction.","Anecdote":"On a mere rumor of crop failure, Garak prices jumped, and at the Noryangjin auction floor too, empty boxes began to sell at high prices.","Relationships":"Was entrusted by O Haerin with the private auction of escort rights and competes with Nam Yungyeong for price leadership. Often awards the winning bid to Sin Taesan''s escort bids.","Ambition":"Makes water, power, and food contracts exchangeable on the same auction floor, cementing O Haerin''s common settlement authority as a market rule.","Fear":"The great powers turning the auction floor into an empty chair through private direct deals.","Intervention":"Can disclose the actual stock before an auction, or steer military provisions bids toward a particular heir."},"biography":"Clear-voiced and cruelly fair. If bidders exchange glances, he immediately postpones that item to the next round.\n\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Gyodo\n- Occupation: Recording auction starting and winning prices\n- Title: Auctioneer\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Noryangjin wharf. The auctioneer''s post opened up through a public re-inspection of the scales.\n- Yun Seoha handles recording auction starting and winning prices in Noryangjin 1-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank Gyodo. Title: Auctioneer. Writes the starting and winning prices on the wall, but only escort rights are run through a separate sealed-envelope auction.\n\n**Anecdote.** On a mere rumor of crop failure, Garak prices jumped, and at the Noryangjin auction floor too, empty boxes began to sell at high prices.\n\n**Relations.** Was entrusted by O Haerin with the private auction of escort rights and competes with Nam Yungyeong for price leadership. Often awards the winning bid to Sin Taesan''s escort bids.\n\n**Ambition.** Makes water, power, and food contracts exchangeable on the same auction floor, cementing O Haerin''s common settlement authority as a market rule.\n\n**Fear.** The great powers turning the auction floor into an empty chair through private direct deals.\n\n**Intervention.** Can disclose the actual stock before an auction, or steer military provisions bids toward a particular heir.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 5 | Openness 40 | Force −15 | Material 85 | Communal −10 | Principle −40 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 0 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −10 | Display 45 | Persistence 15 | Orientation: None | Union: Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yun Seo-ha","type":"Command","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Entrusted with the private auction of convoy rights"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Oh Haneul","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Seo-ha","basis":"Synchronized the auction bulletin times"},{"from":"Seol Cho-a","type":"Command","to":"Yun Seo-ha","basis":"Enforcing Yun Seoha''s auction order on the platform,"},{"from":"Hong Ji-hun","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Seo-ha","basis":"Enforcing Yun Seoha''s auction rules on the commodity-price items, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0197","name":"윤서하","title":"경매사","position":"경매사","characterId":"K196","rank":"교도","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"경매 시작가·낙찰가 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#인물-윤서하","detailRoute":"/people/person-0197","birthDate":"2088-05-10","birthday":"05-10","age":38,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"auction-administration","name":"경매 운영","rating":75},{"id":"price-recording","name":"가격 기록","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k196-disposition","name":"눈짓 거래 중단","description":"목소리가 맑고 잔인할 만큼 공정하다. 입찰자가 눈짓을 교환하면 즉시 그 품목을 다음 회로 미룬다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 교도. 직함은 경매사. 시작가와 낙찰가를 벽에 쓰고, 호송권만은 별도 봉투 경매로 돌린다.","stress":"공포. 강국이 비공개 직거래로 경매판을 빈 의자로 만드는 것.","relationship":"관계. 오해린에게 호송권 비공개 경매를 위임받았고 남윤경과 가격 주도권을 경쟁한다. 신태산의 호송 입찰을 자주 낙찰시킨다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k196-choice","name":"공개가와 봉투 분리","description":"일화. 흉작 소문만으로 가락 시세가 뛰자 노량진 경매판에도 빈 상자가 고가로 나가기 시작했다.","behavior":"관계. 오해린에게 호송권 비공개 경매를 위임받았고 남윤경과 가격 주도권을 경쟁한다. 신태산의 호송 입찰을 자주 낙찰시킨다.","stress":"공포. 강국이 비공개 직거래로 경매판을 빈 의자로 만드는 것.","relationship":"관계. 오해린에게 호송권 비공개 경매를 위임받았고 남윤경과 가격 주도권을 경쟁한다. 신태산의 호송 입찰을 자주 낙찰시킨다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"담합 눈짓에 품목을 미루고 공개 가격과 비공개 호송권 봉투를 분리한다. 공정성 주장과 비공개 위임이 함께 있는 운영이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c724-d30c-d3c9","name":"파평 윤씨","crest":"clan-crests/c724-d30c-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":5,"개방":40,"무력":-15,"물질":85,"공동":-10,"원칙":-40,"공개":15,"자격":0,"분산":20,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":-10,"위험":-10,"과시":45,"지속":15,"지향":"무성향","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"소속":"정부","품계":"교도","생업":"경매 시작가·낙찰가 기록","직함":"경매사","가치관":"권위 5 | 개방 40 | 무력 −15 | 물질 85 | 공동 −10 | 원칙 −40 | 공개 15 | 자격 0 | 분산 20 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −10 | 과시 45 | 지속 15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 경매사 자리는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다.\n- 윤서하는 노량진1동에서 경매 시작가·낙찰가 기록 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 교도. 직함은 경매사. 시작가와 낙찰가를 벽에 쓰고, 호송권만은 별도 봉투 경매로 돌린다.","일화":"흉작 소문만으로 가락 시세가 뛰자 노량진 경매판에도 빈 상자가 고가로 나가기 시작했다.","관계":"오해린에게 호송권 비공개 경매를 위임받았고 남윤경과 가격 주도권을 경쟁한다. 신태산의 호송 입찰을 자주 낙찰시킨다.","야망":"물·전력·식량 계약을 같은 경매판에서 교환하게 만들어 오해린의 공통 결제권을 시장 규칙으로 굳힌다.","공포":"강국이 비공개 직거래로 경매판을 빈 의자로 만드는 것.","개입":"실제 재고를 경매 전에 공개하거나, 특정 후계자에게 군량 입찰을 몰아줄 수 있다."},"biography":"목소리가 맑고 잔인할 만큼 공정하다. 입찰자가 눈짓을 교환하면 즉시 그 품목을 다음 회로 미룬다.\n\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 교도\n- 생업: 경매 시작가·낙찰가 기록\n- 직함: 경매사\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 경매사 자리는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다.\n- 윤서하는 노량진1동에서 경매 시작가·낙찰가 기록 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 교도. 직함은 경매사. 시작가와 낙찰가를 벽에 쓰고, 호송권만은 별도 봉투 경매로 돌린다.\n\n**일화.** 흉작 소문만으로 가락 시세가 뛰자 노량진 경매판에도 빈 상자가 고가로 나가기 시작했다.\n\n**관계.** 오해린에게 호송권 비공개 경매를 위임받았고 남윤경과 가격 주도권을 경쟁한다. 신태산의 호송 입찰을 자주 낙찰시킨다.\n\n**야망.** 물·전력·식량 계약을 같은 경매판에서 교환하게 만들어 오해린의 공통 결제권을 시장 규칙으로 굳힌다.\n\n**공포.** 강국이 비공개 직거래로 경매판을 빈 의자로 만드는 것.\n\n**개입.** 실제 재고를 경매 전에 공개하거나, 특정 후계자에게 군량 입찰을 몰아줄 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 5 | 개방 40 | 무력 −15 | 물질 85 | 공동 −10 | 원칙 −40 | 공개 15 | 자격 0 | 분산 20 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −10 | 과시 45 | 지속 15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"윤서하","type":"지휘","to":"오해린","basis":"호송권 비공개 경매를 위임받음"}],"incoming":[{"from":"오하늘","type":"계약","to":"윤서하","basis":"경매 속보 시각을 맞춤"},{"from":"설초아","type":"지휘","to":"윤서하","basis":"윤서하의 경매 순서를 승강장에서 집행하며"},{"from":"홍지훈","type":"계약","to":"윤서하","basis":"윤서하의 경매 규칙을 물가 품목에서 집행하고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0198', 'c2e0-d3c9-c0b0', '{"id":"person-0198","name":"Sin Tae-san","title":"Escort Foreman","position":"Escort Foreman","characterId":"K197","rank":"Corrections","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Escort Route and Arrival Weight Cross-Check","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#Person-Sin-Taesan","detailRoute":"/people/person-0198","birthDate":"2079-12-17","birthday":"12-17","age":47,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"convoy-route-operation","name":"Convoy route operation","rating":65},{"id":"arrival-weight-check","name":"Arrival weight checking","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k197-disposition","name":"Intolerance of cargo opening","description":"Taciturn and strong of faith. A member who opened freight mid-convoy he struck from the vigilante squad that same day.","behavior":"Office. Rank: lay instructor. Title: convoy squad leader. He announced routes and arms only just before departure, and when arrival tonnage differed from departure he shaved the whole squad''s rations.","stress":"Fear. That a convoy train would carry munitions and the neutral market''s legitimacy would fall in one day.","relationship":"Relations. Held a convoy contract with O Haerin and took over at Song I-deun''s transshipment warehouse. Was reviewing Jang Sehwa''s joint convoy draft against field standards.","effects":[]},{"id":"k197-choice","name":"Shared responsibility for arrival loss","description":"Anecdote. A box with the Amsa seal came out of a convoy car, and the market vigilantes blocked the fleet''s departure.","behavior":"Relations. Held a convoy contract with O Haerin and took over at Song I-deun''s transshipment warehouse. Was reviewing Jang Sehwa''s joint convoy draft against field standards.","stress":"Fear. That a convoy train would carry munitions and the neutral market''s legitimacy would fall in one day.","relationship":"Relations. Held a convoy contract with O Haerin and took over at Song I-deun''s transshipment warehouse. Was reviewing Jang Sehwa''s joint convoy draft against field standards.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Limits route disclosure, checks arrival weight and reviews joint-convoy drafts. Discovery and resolution of the sealed box or battle victory are not recorded.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c2e0-d3c9-c0b0","name":"Pyeongsan Sin Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c2e0-d3c9-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":5,"Openness":35,"Force":-25,"Material":60,"Communal":-15,"Principle":-25,"Public":25,"Eligibility":0,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":-10,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-30,"Display":-5,"Sustained":15,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Corrections","Livelihood":"Escort Route and Arrival Weight Cross-Check","Title":"Escort Foreman","Values":"Authority 5 | Openness 35 | Force −25 | Material 60 | Communal −15 | Principle −25 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 0 | Dispersion 30 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Craving −10 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −30 | Display −5 | Persistence 15 | Orientation: Same-sex | Union: Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up on duty at the Sinnae transfer station. The convoy foreman''s post opened up through stopping a ticketless departing train.\n- Sin Taesan handles reconciling convoy routes and arrival weights in Noryangjin 1-dong.\n- Sin Taesan handles reconciling convoy routes and arrival weights in Hangangno-dong.","Offices":"Rank Gyodo. Title: Convoy Foreman. Announces routes and armament only just before departure, and if the arrival weight differs from the departure weight, cuts the rations of the entire crew.","Anecdote":"A sealed box made in Amsa turned up in one convoy car, and the market self-defense corps blocked the convoy fleet''s departure.","Relationships":"Signed a convoy contract with O Haerin and hands cargo over at Song Ideun''s transshipment window. Is currently reviewing Jang Sehwa''s joint convoy draft by field standards.","Ambition":"Grows the Noryangjin convoy fleet into the working backbone of joint convoys, replacing the great powers'' protection fees with market self-defense.","Fear":"A convoy train carrying military supplies and the neutral market''s legitimacy collapsing in a single day.","Intervention":"Can reveal the origin of the smuggled box, or force a convoy through to test Noryangjin''s neutrality."},"biography":"Taciturn and fiercely loyal. Any crew member who opens cargo during a convoy is removed from the self-defense corps that same day.\n\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Gyodo\n- Occupation: Reconciling convoy routes and arrival weights\n- Title: Convoy Foreman\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up on duty at the Sinnae transfer station. The convoy foreman''s post opened up through stopping a ticketless departing train.\n- Sin Taesan handles reconciling convoy routes and arrival weights in Noryangjin 1-dong.\n- Sin Taesan handles reconciling convoy routes and arrival weights in Hangangno-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank Gyodo. Title: Convoy Foreman. Announces routes and armament only just before departure, and if the arrival weight differs from the departure weight, cuts the rations of the entire crew.\n\n**Anecdote.** A sealed box made in Amsa turned up in one convoy car, and the market self-defense corps blocked the convoy fleet''s departure.\n\n**Relations.** Signed a convoy contract with O Haerin and hands cargo over at Song Ideun''s transshipment window. Is currently reviewing Jang Sehwa''s joint convoy draft by field standards.\n\n**Ambition.** Grows the Noryangjin convoy fleet into the working backbone of joint convoys, replacing the great powers'' protection fees with market self-defense.\n\n**Fear.** A convoy train carrying military supplies and the neutral market''s legitimacy collapsing in a single day.\n\n**Intervention.** Can reveal the origin of the smuggled box, or force a convoy through to test Noryangjin''s neutrality.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 5 | Openness 35 | Force −25 | Material 60 | Communal −15 | Principle −25 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 0 | Dispersion 30 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving −10 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −30 | Display −5 | Persistence 15 | Orientation: Same-sex | Union: Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Sin Tae-san","type":"Contract","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Enforce the merchant-house convoy contract on site"},{"from":"Sin Tae-san","type":"Contract","to":"Lucas Schneider","basis":"Handed over the convoy at the transshipment window"},{"from":"Sin Tae-san","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Reviewing the joint convoy draft by field standards"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Lucas Schneider","type":"Contract","to":"Sin Tae-san","basis":"Coordinated the convoy arrival times"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0198","name":"신태산","title":"호송 반장","position":"호송 반장","characterId":"K197","rank":"교도","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"호송 경로·도착 중량 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#인물-신태산","detailRoute":"/people/person-0198","birthDate":"2079-12-17","birthday":"12-17","age":47,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"convoy-route-operation","name":"호송 경로 운영","rating":65},{"id":"arrival-weight-check","name":"도착 중량 대조","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k197-disposition","name":"화물 개봉 불관용","description":"과묵하고 신의가 강하다. 호송 중에 화물을 열어본 대원은 그날로 자경대에서 뺀다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 교도. 직함은 호송 반장. 경로와 무장은 출발 직전에만 알리고, 도착 중량이 출발과 다르면 전 대원 배급을 깎는다.","stress":"공포. 호송 열차가 군수품을 실어 중립시장 정통성이 하루 만에 무너지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 오해린과 호송 계약을 맺고 송이든의 환적 창에서 인계한다. 장세화의 공동호송 초안을 현장 기준으로 검토 중이다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k197-choice","name":"도착 손실 공동 책임","description":"일화. 한 호송칸에서 암신도 봉인 상자가 나와 시장 자경대가 선단 출항을 막았다.","behavior":"관계. 오해린과 호송 계약을 맺고 송이든의 환적 창에서 인계한다. 장세화의 공동호송 초안을 현장 기준으로 검토 중이다.","stress":"공포. 호송 열차가 군수품을 실어 중립시장 정통성이 하루 만에 무너지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 오해린과 호송 계약을 맺고 송이든의 환적 창에서 인계한다. 장세화의 공동호송 초안을 현장 기준으로 검토 중이다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"경로 공개 시점을 제한하고 도착 중량을 확인하며 공동호송 초안을 검토한다. 봉인 상자를 발견해 해결했다거나 전투에 이겼다는 기록은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c2e0-d3c9-c0b0","name":"평산 신씨","crest":"clan-crests/c2e0-d3c9-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":5,"개방":35,"무력":-25,"물질":60,"공동":-15,"원칙":-25,"공개":25,"자격":0,"분산":30,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":-10,"독점":-20,"위험":-30,"과시":-5,"지속":15,"지향":"동성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"소속":"정부","품계":"교도","생업":"호송 경로·도착 중량 대조","직함":"호송 반장","가치관":"권위 5 | 개방 35 | 무력 −25 | 물질 60 | 공동 −15 | 원칙 −25 | 공개 25 | 자격 0 | 분산 30 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 −10 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −5 | 지속 15 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 호송 반장 자리는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 신태산은 노량진1동에서 호송 경로·도착 중량 대조 업무를 맡는다.\n- 신태산은 한강로동에서 호송 경로·도착 중량 대조 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 교도. 직함은 호송 반장. 경로와 무장은 출발 직전에만 알리고, 도착 중량이 출발과 다르면 전 대원 배급을 깎는다.","일화":"한 호송칸에서 암신도 봉인 상자가 나와 시장 자경대가 선단 출항을 막았다.","관계":"오해린과 호송 계약을 맺고 송이든의 환적 창에서 인계한다. 장세화의 공동호송 초안을 현장 기준으로 검토 중이다.","야망":"노량진 호송선단을 공동호송의 실무 뼈대로 키워 강국의 보호비를 시장 자경으로 대체한다.","공포":"호송 열차가 군수품을 실어 중립시장 정통성이 하루 만에 무너지는 것.","개입":"밀수 상자의 출처를 밝히거나, 호송을 강행해 노량진의 중립을 시험할 수 있다."},"biography":"과묵하고 신의가 강하다. 호송 중에 화물을 열어본 대원은 그날로 자경대에서 뺀다.\n\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 교도\n- 생업: 호송 경로·도착 중량 대조\n- 직함: 호송 반장\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 호송 반장 자리는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 신태산은 노량진1동에서 호송 경로·도착 중량 대조 업무를 맡는다.\n- 신태산은 한강로동에서 호송 경로·도착 중량 대조 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 교도. 직함은 호송 반장. 경로와 무장은 출발 직전에만 알리고, 도착 중량이 출발과 다르면 전 대원 배급을 깎는다.\n\n**일화.** 한 호송칸에서 암신도 봉인 상자가 나와 시장 자경대가 선단 출항을 막았다.\n\n**관계.** 오해린과 호송 계약을 맺고 송이든의 환적 창에서 인계한다. 장세화의 공동호송 초안을 현장 기준으로 검토 중이다.\n\n**야망.** 노량진 호송선단을 공동호송의 실무 뼈대로 키워 강국의 보호비를 시장 자경으로 대체한다.\n\n**공포.** 호송 열차가 군수품을 실어 중립시장 정통성이 하루 만에 무너지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 밀수 상자의 출처를 밝히거나, 호송을 강행해 노량진의 중립을 시험할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 5 | 개방 35 | 무력 −25 | 물질 60 | 공동 −15 | 원칙 −25 | 공개 25 | 자격 0 | 분산 30 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 −10 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −5 | 지속 15 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"신태산","type":"계약","to":"오해린","basis":"상회 호송 계약을 현장에서 집행"},{"from":"신태산","type":"계약","to":"루카스 슈나이더","basis":"환적 창에서 호송을 인계"},{"from":"신태산","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":"공동호송 초안을 현장 기준으로 검토"}],"incoming":[{"from":"루카스 슈나이더","type":"계약","to":"신태산","basis":"호송 도착 시각을 맞춤"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0199', 'c11c-b2ec-c131', '{"id":"person-0199","name":"Seo Na-yeon","title":"Ice Merchant","position":"Ice Merchant","characterId":"K198","rank":"Corrections","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Ice Brick Weight and Production Time Engraving","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#Person-Seo-Nayeon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0199","birthDate":"2064-03-14","birthday":"03-14","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"ice-weight-marking","name":"Ice weight marking","rating":65},{"id":"ice-allocation","name":"Ice allocation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k198-disposition","name":"Sick children first","description":"Meticulous and seeming stingy, she opened the ice first for a sick child. She said credit melted before temperature did.","behavior":"Office. Rank: lay instructor. Title: ice merchant. She engraved brick weight and production hour and sent out of the market any merchant who matched weight with melted ice.","stress":"Fear. That Han River intake and ice-making power would cut at once and the ice ledger would become scrap paper.","relationship":"Relations. Filled O Haerin''s collateral warehouse and shared temperature records with Jo Minjae. Assigned infirmary ice as priority to Yun Jiyul.","effects":[]},{"id":"k198-choice","name":"Rejecting melted weight fraud","description":"Anecdote. When the ice machines stopped on the first blackout day, merchants began cheating weights, refreezing melted water.","behavior":"Relations. Filled O Haerin''s collateral warehouse and shared temperature records with Jo Minjae. Assigned infirmary ice as priority to Yun Jiyul.","stress":"Fear. That Han River intake and ice-making power would cut at once and the ice ledger would become scrap paper.","relationship":"Relations. Filled O Haerin''s collateral warehouse and shared temperature records with Jo Minjae. Assigned infirmary ice as priority to Yun Jiyul.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Marks ice production times and weight and gives priority to sick children and clinics. Standardization as a payment unit remains a goal.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c11c-b2ec-c131","name":"Dalseong Seo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c11c-b2ec-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":40,"Force":-20,"Material":80,"Communal":-20,"Principle":-50,"Public":15,"Eligibility":-5,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":20},"desire":{"Longing":35,"Monopoly":0,"Risk":-10,"Display":50,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Corrections","Livelihood":"Ice Brick Weight and Production Time Engraving","Title":"Ice Merchant","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 40 | Force −20 | Material 80 | Communal −20 | Principle −50 | Publicity 15 | Credentials −5 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation 20","Desires":"Craving 35 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −10 | Display 50 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding None"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up on waiting-room night duty. The Ice Merchant post opened through a substitute duty shift covering an unexcused absence.\n- Seo Nayeon is in charge of engraving the weight and production time on ice bricks in Noryangjin 1-dong.","Offices":"Rank Gyodo. Title: Ice Merchant. Engraves the weight and production time on each brick, and expels from the market any merchant who made up the weight with melted ice.","Anecdote":"On the first day of the blackout, when the ice makers stopped, merchants began cheating on weight by refreezing melted water.","Relationships":"Fills Oh Haerin''s collateral warehouse and shares temperature records with Jo Minjae. Gives Yun Jiyul''s infirmary priority for ice.","Ambition":"Standardize ice bricks as a unit of payment so that the Noryangjin price holds for a full day even when power wavers.","Fear":"That Han River water intake and ice-making power are cut off at the same time, turning the ice ledger into scraps of paper.","Intervention":"Can bring in manual ice-making tools, or smash a fake-weight brick in front of everyone before an auction."},"biography":"Meticulous and seemingly stingy, but releases ice first to sick children. Says credit melts before temperature does.\n\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Gyodo\n- Occupation: Engraving ice brick weight and production time\n- Title: Ice Merchant\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up on waiting-room night duty. The Ice Merchant post opened through a substitute duty shift covering an unexcused absence.\n- Seo Nayeon is in charge of engraving the weight and production time on ice bricks in Noryangjin 1-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank Gyodo. Title: Ice Merchant. Engraves the weight and production time on each brick, and expels from the market any merchant who made up the weight with melted ice.\n\n**Anecdote.** On the first day of the blackout, when the ice makers stopped, merchants began cheating on weight by refreezing melted water.\n\n**Relations.** Fills Oh Haerin''s collateral warehouse and shares temperature records with Jo Minjae. Gives Yun Jiyul''s infirmary priority for ice.\n\n**Ambition.** Standardize ice bricks as a unit of payment so that the Noryangjin price holds for a full day even when power wavers.\n\n**Fear.** That Han River water intake and ice-making power are cut off at the same time, turning the ice ledger into scraps of paper.\n\n**Intervention.** Can bring in manual ice-making tools, or smash a fake-weight brick in front of everyone before an auction.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 40 | Force −20 | Material 80 | Communal −20 | Principle −50 | Publicity 15 | Credentials −5 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation 20\n- Desires: Craving 35 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −10 | Display 50 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seo Na-yeon","type":"Command","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Fill the collateral warehouse with ice"},{"from":"Seo Na-yeon","type":"Contract","to":"Yun Ji-yul","basis":"Allocates infirmary ice as a priority"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Lucas Schneider","type":"Contract","to":"Seo Na-yeon","basis":"Received the ice bricks at the transshipment window"},{"from":"Hwang Serin","type":"Contract","to":"Seo Na-yeon","basis":"Inspects ice and food convoys"},{"from":"Natalya Sokolova","type":"Contract","to":"Seo Na-yeon","basis":"handing over Seo Nayeon''s ice bricks,"},{"from":"Ji Yun-jae","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Seo Na-yeon","basis":"is a priest who backs Seo Nayeon''s brick engraving in the field, and"},{"from":"Dan No-eul","type":"Oath","to":"Seo Na-yeon","basis":"points to the slot where Seo Nayeon''s brick engraving was changed overnight, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0199","name":"서나연","title":"얼음 상인","position":"얼음 상인","characterId":"K198","rank":"교도","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"얼음 벽돌 무게·제작 시각 각인","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#인물-서나연","detailRoute":"/people/person-0199","birthDate":"2064-03-14","birthday":"03-14","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"ice-weight-marking","name":"얼음 중량 각인","rating":65},{"id":"ice-allocation","name":"얼음 배정","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k198-disposition","name":"병든 아이 먼저","description":"꼼꼼하고 인색해 보이지만 병든 아이에게는 얼음을 먼저 푼다. 온도보다 신용이 먼저 녹는다고 말한다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 교도. 직함은 얼음 상인. 벽돌 무게와 제작 시각을 각인하고, 녹은 얼음으로 중량을 맞춘 상인을 시장에서 내보낸다.","stress":"공포. 한강 취수와 제빙 전력이 동시에 끊겨 얼음 원장이 종이쪼가리가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 오해린의 담보 창고를 채우고 조민재와 온도 기록을 공유한다. 윤지율에게 의무실 얼음을 우선 배정한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k198-choice","name":"녹은 중량 거부","description":"일화. 정전 첫날 제빙기가 멈추자 상인들이 녹은 물을 다시 얼렸다며 중량을 속이기 시작했다.","behavior":"관계. 오해린의 담보 창고를 채우고 조민재와 온도 기록을 공유한다. 윤지율에게 의무실 얼음을 우선 배정한다.","stress":"공포. 한강 취수와 제빙 전력이 동시에 끊겨 얼음 원장이 종이쪼가리가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 오해린의 담보 창고를 채우고 조민재와 온도 기록을 공유한다. 윤지율에게 의무실 얼음을 우선 배정한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"얼음 제작 시각·무게를 새기고 병든 아이와 의무실에 먼저 배정한다. 얼음의 결제 단위 표준화는 아직 목표다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c11c-b2ec-c131","name":"달성 서씨","crest":"clan-crests/c11c-b2ec-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":40,"무력":-20,"물질":80,"공동":-20,"원칙":-50,"공개":15,"자격":-5,"분산":20,"변혁":20},"desire":{"갈망":35,"독점":0,"위험":-10,"과시":50,"지속":0,"지향":"유동","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"소속":"정부","품계":"교도","생업":"얼음 벽돌 무게·제작 시각 각인","직함":"얼음 상인","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 40 | 무력 −20 | 물질 80 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 −50 | 공개 15 | 자격 −5 | 분산 20 | 변혁 20","욕망":"갈망 35 | 독점 0 | 위험 −10 | 과시 50 | 지속 0 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 얼음 상인 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 서나연은 노량진1동에서 얼음 벽돌 무게·제작 시각 각인 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 교도. 직함은 얼음 상인. 벽돌 무게와 제작 시각을 각인하고, 녹은 얼음으로 중량을 맞춘 상인을 시장에서 내보낸다.","일화":"정전 첫날 제빙기가 멈추자 상인들이 녹은 물을 다시 얼렸다며 중량을 속이기 시작했다.","관계":"오해린의 담보 창고를 채우고 조민재와 온도 기록을 공유한다. 윤지율에게 의무실 얼음을 우선 배정한다.","야망":"얼음 벽돌을 결제 단위로 표준화해 전력이 흔들려도 노량진 시세가 하루를 버티게 한다.","공포":"한강 취수와 제빙 전력이 동시에 끊겨 얼음 원장이 종이쪼가리가 되는 것.","개입":"수동 제빙 도구를 들여오거나, 가짜 중량 벽돌을 경매 전에 깨 보일 수 있다."},"biography":"꼼꼼하고 인색해 보이지만 병든 아이에게는 얼음을 먼저 푼다. 온도보다 신용이 먼저 녹는다고 말한다.\n\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 교도\n- 생업: 얼음 벽돌 무게·제작 시각 각인\n- 직함: 얼음 상인\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 얼음 상인 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 서나연은 노량진1동에서 얼음 벽돌 무게·제작 시각 각인 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 교도. 직함은 얼음 상인. 벽돌 무게와 제작 시각을 각인하고, 녹은 얼음으로 중량을 맞춘 상인을 시장에서 내보낸다.\n\n**일화.** 정전 첫날 제빙기가 멈추자 상인들이 녹은 물을 다시 얼렸다며 중량을 속이기 시작했다.\n\n**관계.** 오해린의 담보 창고를 채우고 조민재와 온도 기록을 공유한다. 윤지율에게 의무실 얼음을 우선 배정한다.\n\n**야망.** 얼음 벽돌을 결제 단위로 표준화해 전력이 흔들려도 노량진 시세가 하루를 버티게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 한강 취수와 제빙 전력이 동시에 끊겨 얼음 원장이 종이쪼가리가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 수동 제빙 도구를 들여오거나, 가짜 중량 벽돌을 경매 전에 깨 보일 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 40 | 무력 −20 | 물질 80 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 −50 | 공개 15 | 자격 −5 | 분산 20 | 변혁 20\n- 욕망: 갈망 35 | 독점 0 | 위험 −10 | 과시 50 | 지속 0 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"서나연","type":"지휘","to":"오해린","basis":"담보 창고를 얼음으로 채움"},{"from":"서나연","type":"계약","to":"윤지율","basis":"의무실 얼음을 우선 배정"}],"incoming":[{"from":"루카스 슈나이더","type":"계약","to":"서나연","basis":"얼음 벽돌을 환적 창에서 받음"},{"from":"황세린","type":"계약","to":"서나연","basis":"얼음·식량 호송을 검수"},{"from":"나탈리야 소콜로바","type":"계약","to":"서나연","basis":"서나연의 얼음 벽돌을 인계하며"},{"from":"지윤재","type":"신도","to":"서나연","basis":"서나연의 벽돌 각인을 현장에서 받치는 신도이고"},{"from":"단노을","type":"맹세","to":"서나연","basis":"서나연의 벽돌 각인이 밤에 바뀐 칸을 가리키고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0200', NULL, '{"id":"person-0200","name":"Peter Jansen","title":"Transport Shipowners'' Council","position":"Transport Shipowners'' Council","characterId":"K199","rank":"Chief Engineer","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Departure Fuel and Remaining Ice Disclosure","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#person-Peter Jansen","detailRoute":"/people/person-0200","birthDate":"2072-05-24","birthday":"05-24","age":54,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"departure-reserve-check","name":"Departure reserve checking","rating":60},{"id":"share-negotiation","name":"Shipowner vote negotiation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k199-disposition","name":"Contempt for deferred losses","description":"He hid his expression well and moved notes like goods. He most despised people who pushed losses off to later.","behavior":"Office. Rank: senior engineer. Title: shipping owners'' council. Before departure he published fuel and ice remainder and suspended the quay use of shipowners whose unredeemed notes piled up.","stress":"Fear. That after unloading and food handovers on the Han River within Seoul stop, false inventory notes would exceed actual stocks and destroy the fleet and settlement credit.","relationship":"Relations. Traded the merchants'' council notes with O Haerin and disliked Han Jaemok''s waterway transport toll. Carried Sin Taesan''s convoy squad on the fleet.","effects":[]},{"id":"k199-choice","name":"Tying issuance to stakes","description":"Anecdote. When the power cut reduced the quay''s remaining catch to a day''s worth, the shipowners pressed to accelerate settlement-right issuance.","behavior":"Relations. Traded the merchants'' council notes with O Haerin and disliked Han Jaemok''s waterway transport toll. Carried Sin Taesan''s convoy squad on the fleet.","stress":"Fear. That after unloading and food handovers on the Han River within Seoul stop, false inventory notes would exceed actual stocks and destroy the fleet and settlement credit.","relationship":"Relations. Traded the merchants'' council notes with O Haerin and disliked Han Jaemok''s waterway transport toll. Carried Sin Taesan''s convoy squad on the fleet.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Publishes fuel and ice and suspends pier access for owners with unpaid tokens. Other owners’ pressure does not establish his issuance success.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":30,"Force":-30,"Material":70,"Communal":-20,"Principle":-40,"Public":15,"Eligibility":5,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":-30,"Display":10,"Sustained":40,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Chief Engineer","Livelihood":"Departure Fuel and Remaining Ice Disclosure","Title":"Transport Shipowners'' Council","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 30 | Force −30 | Material 70 | Communal −20 | Principle −40 | Publicity 15 | Credentials 5 | Dispersion 30 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 15 | Monopoly 10 | Risk −30 | Display 10 | Persistence 40 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Noryangjin pier. The post of Transport Shipowners'' Councilor opened through a public scale recheck.\nPeter Jansen was born in 2072. His Dutch-descended family line is rooted in the Yongsan north bank district. Grew up at the Noryangjin pier. In 2126 he holds the duties of Transport Shipowners'' Councilor. Hendrik Jansen lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 on the north bank of Yongsan, working in civilian loading, unloading and warehouse operations on the Yongsan riverside. The family passed its residence and goods handover records on to the next generation, and Peter Jansen''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their own day. Speaks Dutch at home and Korean in daily life and work.\n- Peter Jansen is in charge of disclosing remaining departure fuel and ice in Noryangjin 1-dong.\n- Peter Jansen is in charge of disclosing remaining departure fuel and ice in Hangang-ro-dong.","Offices":"Rank Chief Technician. Title: Transport Shipowners'' Councilor. Discloses fuel and ice remaining before departure, and suspends dock use for shipowners with piled-up unredeemed tickets.","Anecdote":"When the power cut reduced the remaining catch at the docks to a single day''s worth, the shipowners pressed to bring forward the issuance of payment rights.","Relationships":"Trades Sang Hoejeong''s votes with Oh Haerin and resents Han Jaemok''s tolls on water transport. Puts Sin Taesan''s escort squad aboard the fleet.","Ambition":"Gather Sang Hoejeong''s votes on the shipowners'' side and bind Oh Haerin''s issuance of payment rights to shares in ships and escorts.","Fear":"That, after Han River unloading and food handovers within Seoul are cut off, false inventory tickets exceed the actual remaining stock and destroy the fleet and payment credit.","Intervention":"Can gather shipowner votes to push issuance through, or invalidate votes bought with false inventory."},"biography":"Hides his expressions well and moves votes around like goods. Holds those who push losses off until later in the deepest contempt.\n\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Chief Technician\n- Occupation: Disclosing remaining departure fuel and ice\n- Title: Transport Shipowners'' Councilor\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Noryangjin pier. The post of Transport Shipowners'' Councilor opened through a public scale recheck.\nPeter Jansen was born in 2072. His Dutch-descended family line is rooted in the Yongsan north bank district. Grew up at the Noryangjin pier. In 2126 he holds the duties of Transport Shipowners'' Councilor. Hendrik Jansen lived through the Great Blackout around 2026 on the north bank of Yongsan, working in civilian loading, unloading and warehouse operations on the Yongsan riverside. The family passed its residence and goods handover records on to the next generation, and Peter Jansen''s parents'' generation checked those records against the living ledgers of their own day. Speaks Dutch at home and Korean in daily life and work.\n- Peter Jansen is in charge of disclosing remaining departure fuel and ice in Noryangjin 1-dong.\n- Peter Jansen is in charge of disclosing remaining departure fuel and ice in Hangang-ro-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank Chief Technician. Title: Transport Shipowners'' Councilor. Discloses fuel and ice remaining before departure, and suspends dock use for shipowners with piled-up unredeemed tickets.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the power cut reduced the remaining catch at the docks to a single day''s worth, the shipowners pressed to bring forward the issuance of payment rights.\n\n**Relations.** Trades Sang Hoejeong''s votes with Oh Haerin and resents Han Jaemok''s tolls on water transport. Puts Sin Taesan''s escort squad aboard the fleet.\n\n**Ambition.** Gather Sang Hoejeong''s votes on the shipowners'' side and bind Oh Haerin''s issuance of payment rights to shares in ships and escorts.\n\n**Fear.** That, after Han River unloading and food handovers within Seoul are cut off, false inventory tickets exceed the actual remaining stock and destroy the fleet and payment credit.\n\n**Intervention.** Can gather shipowner votes to push issuance through, or invalidate votes bought with false inventory.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 30 | Force −30 | Material 70 | Communal −20 | Principle −40 | Publicity 15 | Credentials 5 | Dispersion 30 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Monopoly 10 | Risk −30 | Display 10 | Persistence 40 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Peter Jansen","type":"Contract","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Trade the Chamber Governance votes with the Shipowners'' Council"},{"from":"Peter Jansen","type":"Grudge","to":"Han Jae-mok","basis":"Grudge against waterborne transport tolls"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Chu Bo-ram","type":"Contract","to":"Peter Jansen","basis":"filters Peter Jansen''s Sang Hoejeong votes out of the council convoy, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0200","name":"피터 얀센","title":"운송선주 평의","position":"운송선주 평의","characterId":"K199","rank":"수석기사","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"출항 연료·얼음 잔량 공개","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#인물-피터 얀센","detailRoute":"/people/person-0200","birthDate":"2072-05-24","birthday":"05-24","age":54,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"departure-reserve-check","name":"출항 잔량 확인","rating":60},{"id":"share-negotiation","name":"선주 표 교섭","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k199-disposition","name":"손실 유예 경멸","description":"표정을 잘 숨기고 표를 물건처럼 옮긴다. 손실을 나중으로 미루는 사람을 가장 경멸한다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 수석기사. 직함은 운송선주 평의. 출항 전에 연료와 얼음 잔량을 공개하고, 미상환 표가 쌓인 선주의 부두 사용을 정지한다.","stress":"공포. 서울 안 한강 하역·식량 인계가 끊긴 뒤 허위 재고 표가 실제 잔량을 넘겨 선단과 결제 신용을 무너뜨리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 오해린과 상회정 표를 거래하고 한재목의 수상 운송 통행세를 꺼린다. 신태산의 호송 반을 선단에 태운다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k199-choice","name":"지분으로 발행을 묶음","description":"일화. 전력 단절과 함께 부두 잔여 어획이 하루치로 줄자 선주들이 결제권 발행을 앞당기라고 압박했다.","behavior":"관계. 오해린과 상회정 표를 거래하고 한재목의 수상 운송 통행세를 꺼린다. 신태산의 호송 반을 선단에 태운다.","stress":"공포. 서울 안 한강 하역·식량 인계가 끊긴 뒤 허위 재고 표가 실제 잔량을 넘겨 선단과 결제 신용을 무너뜨리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 오해린과 상회정 표를 거래하고 한재목의 수상 운송 통행세를 꺼린다. 신태산의 호송 반을 선단에 태운다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"연료·얼음을 공개하고 미상환 표가 쌓인 선주의 부두를 정지한다. 발행 압박은 선주들의 행동으로 발행 성공을 계산하지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":null,"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":30,"무력":-30,"물질":70,"공동":-20,"원칙":-40,"공개":15,"자격":5,"분산":30,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":10,"위험":-30,"과시":10,"지속":40,"지향":"유동","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"소속":"정부","품계":"수석기사","생업":"출항 연료·얼음 잔량 공개","직함":"운송선주 평의","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 30 | 무력 −30 | 물질 70 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 −40 | 공개 15 | 자격 5 | 분산 30 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 10 | 지속 40 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 운송선주 평의 자리는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다.\n피터 얀센은 2072년에 태어났다. 네덜란드계 가계는 용산 북안 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 2126년에는 운송선주 평의 업무를 맡는다. 헨드릭 얀센은 약 2026년 용산 북안에서 용산 강변의 민간 하역·창고 업무 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 피터 얀센의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 네덜란드어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 피터 얀센은 노량진1동에서 출항 연료·얼음 잔량 공개 업무를 맡는다.\n- 피터 얀센은 한강로동에서 출항 연료·얼음 잔량 공개 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 수석기사. 직함은 운송선주 평의. 출항 전에 연료와 얼음 잔량을 공개하고, 미상환 표가 쌓인 선주의 부두 사용을 정지한다.","일화":"전력 단절과 함께 부두 잔여 어획이 하루치로 줄자 선주들이 결제권 발행을 앞당기라고 압박했다.","관계":"오해린과 상회정 표를 거래하고 한재목의 수상 운송 통행세를 꺼린다. 신태산의 호송 반을 선단에 태운다.","야망":"상회정의 표를 선주 쪽으로 모아 오해린의 결제권 발행을 선박·호송 지분으로 묶는다.","공포":"서울 안 한강 하역·식량 인계가 끊긴 뒤 허위 재고 표가 실제 잔량을 넘겨 선단과 결제 신용을 무너뜨리는 것.","개입":"선주 표를 모아 발행을 통과시키거나, 허위 재고로 산 표를 무효로 만들 수 있다."},"biography":"표정을 잘 숨기고 표를 물건처럼 옮긴다. 손실을 나중으로 미루는 사람을 가장 경멸한다.\n\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 수석기사\n- 생업: 출항 연료·얼음 잔량 공개\n- 직함: 운송선주 평의\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 운송선주 평의 자리는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다.\n피터 얀센은 2072년에 태어났다. 네덜란드계 가계는 용산 북안 생활권에 뿌리를 두고 있다. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 2126년에는 운송선주 평의 업무를 맡는다. 헨드릭 얀센은 약 2026년 용산 북안에서 용산 강변의 민간 하역·창고 업무 일을 하며 대정전을 겪었다. 가족은 거처와 물품 인계 기록을 다음 세대에 전했고, 피터 얀센의 부모 세대는 그 기록을 당대의 생활 장부와 대조했다. 집에서는 네덜란드어를 쓰고 일상과 업무에서는 한국어를 쓴다.\n- 피터 얀센은 노량진1동에서 출항 연료·얼음 잔량 공개 업무를 맡는다.\n- 피터 얀센은 한강로동에서 출항 연료·얼음 잔량 공개 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수석기사. 직함은 운송선주 평의. 출항 전에 연료와 얼음 잔량을 공개하고, 미상환 표가 쌓인 선주의 부두 사용을 정지한다.\n\n**일화.** 전력 단절과 함께 부두 잔여 어획이 하루치로 줄자 선주들이 결제권 발행을 앞당기라고 압박했다.\n\n**관계.** 오해린과 상회정 표를 거래하고 한재목의 수상 운송 통행세를 꺼린다. 신태산의 호송 반을 선단에 태운다.\n\n**야망.** 상회정의 표를 선주 쪽으로 모아 오해린의 결제권 발행을 선박·호송 지분으로 묶는다.\n\n**공포.** 서울 안 한강 하역·식량 인계가 끊긴 뒤 허위 재고 표가 실제 잔량을 넘겨 선단과 결제 신용을 무너뜨리는 것.\n\n**개입.** 선주 표를 모아 발행을 통과시키거나, 허위 재고로 산 표를 무효로 만들 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 30 | 무력 −30 | 물질 70 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 −40 | 공개 15 | 자격 5 | 분산 30 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 10 | 지속 40 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"피터 얀센","type":"계약","to":"오해린","basis":"상회정 표를 운송선주 평의와 거래"},{"from":"피터 얀센","type":"원한","to":"한재목","basis":"수상 운송 통행세를 꺼리는 원한"}],"incoming":[{"from":"추보람","type":"계약","to":"피터 얀센","basis":"피터 얀센의 상회정 표를 회의 호송에서 거르고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0201', 'c9c0-cda9-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0201","name":"Ji Yun-jae","title":"Noryangjin Ice Machine Technician","position":"Noryangjin Ice Machine Technician","characterId":"K200","rank":"Corrections","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Ice Machine Compression Temperature and Parts Inspection","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#person-Ji Yunjae","detailRoute":"/people/person-0201","birthDate":"2091-09-11","birthday":"09-11","age":35,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"ice-machine-inspection","name":"Ice machine inspection","rating":70},{"id":"seal-standard-review","name":"Seal standard review","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k200-disposition","name":"Rejecting unmarked parts","description":"He read ice-making cycles from the compressor''s vibration and struck from the rotation any assistant who left tools on the ice. Few of words, he answered with trial-run noise.","behavior":"Office. Rank: lay instructor. Title: Noryangjin ice-machine mechanic. Each rotation he wrote compression temperature and brick weight on the chalkboard and fitted no part without the merchants'' council stamp.","stress":"Fear. That Han River intake and ice-making power would cut at once and the ice ledger would become scrap paper.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice backing Seo Nayeon''s brick engravings in the field, he matched ice-making power to Na Ruhui''s generation and inspected Gang Minseo''s sealing standards.","effects":[]},{"id":"k200-choice","name":"Tool storage discipline","description":"Anecdote. In 2125 he turned back a box of defective parts just before release. By this deed the signature of the Noryangjin ice-machine mechanic post rose into the ledger.","behavior":"Relations. An apprentice backing Seo Nayeon''s brick engravings in the field, he matched ice-making power to Na Ruhui''s generation and inspected Gang Minseo''s sealing standards.","stress":"Fear. That Han River intake and ice-making power would cut at once and the ice ledger would become scrap paper.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice backing Seo Nayeon''s brick engravings in the field, he matched ice-making power to Na Ruhui''s generation and inspected Gang Minseo''s sealing standards.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Checks compression vibration and temperature and returns faulty parts. Repeated seal and output coordination is supported, not ice-machine invention.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c9c0-cda9-c8fc","name":"Chungju Ji Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c9c0-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":45,"Force":-25,"Material":75,"Communal":-20,"Principle":-30,"Public":15,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":35,"Risk":-10,"Display":20,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Corrections","Livelihood":"Ice Machine Compression Temperature and Parts Inspection","Title":"Noryangjin Ice Machine Technician","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 45 | Force −25 | Material 75 | Communal −20 | Principle −30 | Publicity 15 | Credentials 25 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Craving 5 | Monopoly 35 | Risk −10 | Display 20 | Persistence 20 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up at Sinjeong Depot. The Noryangjin Ice Maker Technician post opened after a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- Ji Yun-jae handles ice-maker compression-temperature and parts-inspection work in Noryangjin 1-dong.","Offices":"Rank: Instructor. Title: Noryangjin Ice Maker Technician. Every shift, writes the compression temperature and brick weight on the blackboard, and fits no part that lacks a merchant house''s stamp.","Anecdote":"In 2125, sent a box of defective parts back just before shipment. Because of this, the signature for the Noryangjin Ice Maker Technician post went into the ledger.","Relationships":"Stands in a mentor-disciple tie that backs Seo Na-yeon''s brick engraving on site, matches ice-making power to Na Ru-hui''s generation, and inspects Gang Min-seo''s seal specifications.","Ambition":"Ties ice makers and refrigeration compression cycles into a public maintenance table so that a day''s worth of ice remains even when power wavers.","Fear":"That Han River water intake and ice-making power are cut off at the same time, turning the ice ledger into scraps of paper.","Intervention":"Can bring in manual ice-making tools, or shake the technician by exposing who ordered the unstamped modifications."},"biography":"Reads the ice-making cycle from compressor vibration and removes from the shift any assistant who sets tools down on the ice. Speaks little and answers with test-run noise.\n\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Instructor\n- Livelihood: Ice-maker compression-temperature and parts inspection\n- Title: Noryangjin Ice Maker Technician\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up at Sinjeong Depot. The Noryangjin Ice Maker Technician post opened after a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- Ji Yun-jae handles ice-maker compression-temperature and parts-inspection work in Noryangjin 1-dong.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Instructor. Title: Noryangjin Ice Maker Technician. Every shift, writes the compression temperature and brick weight on the blackboard, and fits no part that lacks a merchant house''s stamp.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, sent a box of defective parts back just before shipment. Because of this, the signature for the Noryangjin Ice Maker Technician post went into the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** Stands in a mentor-disciple tie that backs Seo Na-yeon''s brick engraving on site, matches ice-making power to Na Ru-hui''s generation, and inspects Gang Min-seo''s seal specifications.\n\n**Ambition.** Ties ice makers and refrigeration compression cycles into a public maintenance table so that a day''s worth of ice remains even when power wavers.\n\n**Fear.** Han River water intake and ice-making power being cut off at the same time, turning the ice ledger into scraps of paper.\n\n**Intervention.** Can bring in manual ice-making tools, or shake the technician by exposing who ordered the unstamped modifications.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 45 | Force −25 | Material 75 | Communal −20 | Principle −30 | Publicity 15 | Credentials 25 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Monopoly 35 | Risk −10 | Display 20 | Persistence 20 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ji Yun-jae","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Seo Na-yeon","basis":"is a priest who backs Seo Nayeon''s brick engraving in the field, and"},{"from":"Ji Yun-jae","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Na Ru-hui","basis":"matching ice-making power to Na Ru-hui''s generation"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Song Dohyeon","type":"Contract","to":"Ji Yun-jae","basis":"Song Do-hyeon tells Ji Yun-jae where the hose he received is to be used in the pipeline. Ji Yun-jae checks the ice-making equipment connections and the part stamps so that the hose is not fitted to an ice maker without inspection."},{"from":"Ji Ma-ru","type":"Command","to":"Ji Yun-jae","basis":"matching output to Ji Yun-jae''s ice-making test runs"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0201","name":"지윤재","title":"노량진 제빙기 정비사","position":"노량진 제빙기 정비사","characterId":"K200","rank":"교도","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"제빙기 압축 온도·부품 점검","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-08#인물-지윤재","detailRoute":"/people/person-0201","birthDate":"2091-09-11","birthday":"09-11","age":35,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"ice-machine-inspection","name":"제빙기 점검","rating":70},{"id":"seal-standard-review","name":"밀봉 규격 검수","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k200-disposition","name":"도장 없는 부품 거부","description":"압축기 진동으로 제빙 주기를 읽고, 공구를 얼음 위에 두는 조수를 교대에서 뺀다. 말수는 적고 시운전 소음으로 대답한다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 교도. 직함은 노량진 제빙기 정비사. 교대마다 압축 온도와 벽돌 무게를 칠판에 쓰고, 상회 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 한강 취수와 제빙 전력이 동시에 끊겨 얼음 원장이 종이쪼가리가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 서나연의 벽돌 각인을 현장에서 받치는 신도이고, 나루희의 발전에 제빙 전력을 맞추며, 강민서의 밀봉 규격을 검수한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k200-choice","name":"공구 보관 규율","description":"일화. 2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 노량진 제빙기 정비사 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","behavior":"관계. 서나연의 벽돌 각인을 현장에서 받치는 신도이고, 나루희의 발전에 제빙 전력을 맞추며, 강민서의 밀봉 규격을 검수한다.","stress":"공포. 한강 취수와 제빙 전력이 동시에 끊겨 얼음 원장이 종이쪼가리가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 서나연의 벽돌 각인을 현장에서 받치는 신도이고, 나루희의 발전에 제빙 전력을 맞추며, 강민서의 밀봉 규격을 검수한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"압축 진동과 온도를 확인하고 불량 부품을 돌려보낸다. 밀봉·출력을 맞추는 반복 실무가 근거이며 제빙기 발명 경력은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c9c0-cda9-c8fc","name":"충주 지씨","crest":"clan-crests/c9c0-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":45,"무력":-25,"물질":75,"공동":-20,"원칙":-30,"공개":15,"자격":25,"분산":25,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":35,"위험":-10,"과시":20,"지속":20,"지향":"동성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"소속":"정부","품계":"교도","생업":"제빙기 압축 온도·부품 점검","직함":"노량진 제빙기 정비사","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 45 | 무력 −25 | 물질 75 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 −30 | 공개 15 | 자격 25 | 분산 25 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 35 | 위험 −10 | 과시 20 | 지속 20 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 노량진 제빙기 정비사 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 지윤재는 노량진1동에서 제빙기 압축 온도·부품 점검 업무를 맡는다.","관직":"품계 교도. 직함은 노량진 제빙기 정비사. 교대마다 압축 온도와 벽돌 무게를 칠판에 쓰고, 상회 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.","일화":"2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 노량진 제빙기 정비사 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.","관계":"서나연의 벽돌 각인을 현장에서 받치는 신도이고, 나루희의 발전에 제빙 전력을 맞추며, 강민서의 밀봉 규격을 검수한다.","야망":"제빙기와 냉동 압축 주기를 공개 정비표로 묶어 전력이 흔들려도 하루치 얼음이 남게 한다.","공포":"한강 취수와 제빙 전력이 동시에 끊겨 얼음 원장이 종이쪼가리가 되는 것.","개입":"수동 제빙 도구를 들여오거나, 도장 없는 개조의 발주자를 밝혀 정비사를 흔들 수 있다."},"biography":"압축기 진동으로 제빙 주기를 읽고, 공구를 얼음 위에 두는 조수를 교대에서 뺀다. 말수는 적고 시운전 소음으로 대답한다.\n\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 교도\n- 생업: 제빙기 압축 온도·부품 점검\n- 직함: 노량진 제빙기 정비사\n**생애.** 2126년 세대. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 노량진 제빙기 정비사 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 지윤재는 노량진1동에서 제빙기 압축 온도·부품 점검 업무를 맡는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 교도. 직함은 노량진 제빙기 정비사. 교대마다 압축 온도와 벽돌 무게를 칠판에 쓰고, 상회 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 불량 부품 상자를 출고 직전에 되돌려 보냈다. 이 일로 노량진 제빙기 정비사 자리의 서명이 장부에 올랐다.\n\n**관계.** 서나연의 벽돌 각인을 현장에서 받치는 신도이고, 나루희의 발전에 제빙 전력을 맞추며, 강민서의 밀봉 규격을 검수한다.\n\n**야망.** 제빙기와 냉동 압축 주기를 공개 정비표로 묶어 전력이 흔들려도 하루치 얼음이 남게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 한강 취수와 제빙 전력이 동시에 끊겨 얼음 원장이 종이쪼가리가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 수동 제빙 도구를 들여오거나, 도장 없는 개조의 발주자를 밝혀 정비사를 흔들 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 45 | 무력 −25 | 물질 75 | 공동 −20 | 원칙 −30 | 공개 15 | 자격 25 | 분산 25 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 35 | 위험 −10 | 과시 20 | 지속 20 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"지윤재","type":"신도","to":"서나연","basis":"서나연의 벽돌 각인을 현장에서 받치는 신도이고"},{"from":"지윤재","type":"신도","to":"나루희","basis":"나루희의 발전에 제빙 전력을 맞추며"}],"incoming":[{"from":"송도현","type":"계약","to":"지윤재","basis":"송도현은 접수한 호스의 관로 사용 위치를 지윤재에게 알린다. 지윤재는 제빙 설비의 연결과 부품 도장을 확인해 그 호스가 점검 없이 제빙기에 달리지 않게 한다."},{"from":"지마루","type":"지휘","to":"지윤재","basis":"지윤재의 제빙 시운전에 출력을 맞추며"}]}}');
