traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: wheel mechanic, duty officer of Song Hayul. He pasted the maintenance logs directly on the Elder''s board and cut defective parts out as specimens.","stress":"Fear. That a hidden defect in a trial wheel would remain as his own tool marks and become the pretext for handing the base to the residents'' representatives.","relationship":"Relations. Took Song Hayul''s apprentice routine in the field and stood in rotation in Jo Woochan''s work squads. Tended I Hongwon''s trial wheels first only.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Dumo sealed his toolbox after a shaved bearing appeared, exposing his work accountability through samples and logs without a documented trial success.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b450-b450-b989","name":"Dureung Du Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b450-b450-b989.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":-20,"Force":-20,"Material":30,"Communal":10,"Principle":10,"Public":0,"Eligibility":90,"Dispersed":0,"Transformative":-25},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-10,"Display":10,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Wheel Maintenance Logs · Defective Parts Samples","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Employee","Title":"Seongha Electronics Wheel Mechanic, Song Ha-yul''s Practical Aide","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness −20 | Force −20 | Material 30 | Communal 10 | Principle 10 | Publicity 0 | Qualification 90 | Dispersion 0 | Reform −25","Desires":"Craving 40 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −10 | Display 10 | Persistence −15 | Orientation Same-sex | Bonding Multiple"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Gangnam Station rolling-stock depot. The post of Seongha Electronics wheel mechanic and Song Hayul''s practical aide opened up through a defect report made just before a derailment.\n- Dumo handles wheel maintenance logs and defective-part sample management in Yeoksam 1-dong. Seongha Electronics'' maintenance sample, weight, lot, measurement, work crew, and accident signature duties are refined to the Yeoksam 1-dong work-and-living area adjacent to Gangnam Station. The Yeoksam waiting-hall cargo handover is a reference only and does not confirm actual factory equipment, warehouse monopolies, or running trains. Takes over Song Hayul''s apprentice routine on site and is rotated into Jo Uchan''s work crew. Services only I Hongwon''s test wheel first","Offices":"Rank: Employee. Title: Seongha Electronics Wheel Mechanic, Song Hayul''s Practical Aide. Posts maintenance logs directly on the Chairman''s Office bulletin board and cuts defective parts apart to keep as samples.","Anecdote":"When an intentionally shaved bearing turned up in a leading heir''s test wheel, Dumo sealed their own toolbox.","Relationships":"Takes over Song Hayul''s apprentice routine on site and is rotated into Jo Uchan''s work crew. Services only I Hongwon''s test wheel first.","Ambition":"Completes the wheel for the public succession trial under their own signature, proving through field maintenance I Hongwon''s path of breaking the I Clan''s succession.","Fear":"The hidden defect in the test wheel remaining as marks of their own tools, becoming a pretext to hand the depot over to the staff-quarters representative.","Intervention":"Can open the sealed toolbox together with others, or trace the origin marks on defective parts."},"biography":"Quick-handed and sparing with words, regards snatching other people''s tools as the same offense as cheating on the test. Cannot stand a crew chief who passes along defective samples without cutting them.\n\n- Livelihood: Wheel maintenance logs and defective-part sample management\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Employee\n- Title: Seongha Electronics Wheel Mechanic, Song Hayul''s Practical Aide\n**Life.** Grew up at the Gangnam Station rolling-stock depot. The post of Seongha Electronics wheel mechanic and Song Hayul''s practical aide opened up through a defect report made just before a derailment.\n- Dumo handles wheel maintenance logs and defective-part sample management in Yeoksam 1-dong. Seongha Electronics'' maintenance sample, weight, lot, measurement, work crew, and accident signature duties are refined to the Yeoksam 1-dong work-and-living area adjacent to Gangnam Station. The Yeoksam waiting-hall cargo handover is a reference only and does not confirm actual factory equipment, warehouse monopolies, or running trains. Takes over Song Hayul''s apprentice routine on site and is rotated into Jo Uchan''s work crew. Services only I Hongwon''s test wheel first\n\n**Office.** Rank: Employee. Title: Seongha Electronics Wheel Mechanic, Song Hayul''s Practical Aide. Posts maintenance logs directly on the Chairman''s Office bulletin board and cuts defective parts apart to keep as samples.\n\n**Anecdote.** When an intentionally shaved bearing turned up in a leading heir''s test wheel, Dumo sealed their own toolbox.\n\n**Relations.** Takes over Song Hayul''s apprentice routine on site and is rotated into Jo Uchan''s work crew. Services only I Hongwon''s test wheel first.\n\n**Ambition.** Completes the wheel for the public succession trial under their own signature, proving through field maintenance I Hongwon''s path of breaking the I Clan''s succession.\n\n**Fear.** The hidden defect in the test wheel remaining as marks of their own tools, becoming a pretext to hand the depot over to the staff-quarters representative.\n\n**Intervention.** Can open the sealed toolbox together with others, or trace the origin marks on defective parts.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness −20 | Force −20 | Material 30 | Communal 10 | Principle 10 | Publicity 0 | Qualification 90 | Dispersion 0 | Reform −25\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −10 | Display 10 | Persistence −15 | Orientation Same-sex | Bonding Multiple\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Dumo","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Song Ha-yul","basis":"Receives Song Hayul''s apprentice daily work on site"},{"from":"Dumo","type":"Contract","to":"Jo U-chan","basis":"Is assigned by rotation to Jo Uchan''s work crew"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gukdu","type":"Contract","to":"Dumo","basis":"Attach Dumo''s maintenance sample number to the ledger"},{"from":"Yongdubong","type":"Contract","to":"Dumo","basis":"Use Dumo''s wheel sample in the cavalry car"},{"from":"Eo Yerin","type":"Oath","to":"Dumo","basis":"While jointly guarding Dumo''s sealed toolbox"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0278","name":"두모","title":"차륜 정비사, 송하율의 실무 담당자","position":"성하전자 차륜 정비사, 송하율의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K277","rank":"사원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"차륜 정비 일지·불량 부품 표본 관리","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-두모","detailRoute":"/people/person-0278","birthDate":"2079-12-17","birthday":"12-17","age":47,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k277-defect-sample-cutting","name":"불량 표본 절단","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k277-priority","name":"공구 흔적의 책임","description":"두모는 깎인 베어링이 나오자 공구함을 봉인했다. 표본과 일지로 자신의 작업 책임을 드러내되 시험 성공은 미확인이다.","behavior":"정비 일지를 회장실 게시판에 직접 붙이고, 불량 부품은 잘라 표본으로 남긴다.","stress":"시험 차륜의 숨은 결함이 자기 공구 자국으로 남아 사택 대표에게 기지를 내주는 명분이 되는 것.","relationship":"송하율의 도제 일과를 현장에서 받고, 조우찬의 작업 조에 순환 배치된다. 이홍원의 시험 차륜만 우선 손본다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k277-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 사원. 직함은 성하전자 차륜 정비사, 송하율의 실무 담당자. 정비 일지를 회장실 게시판에 직접 붙이고, 불량 부품은 잘라 표본으로 남긴다.","stress":"공포. 시험 차륜의 숨은 결함이 자기 공구 자국으로 남아 사택 대표에게 기지를 내주는 명분이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 송하율의 도제 일과를 현장에서 받고, 조우찬의 작업 조에 순환 배치된다. 이홍원의 시험 차륜만 우선 손본다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"두모는 깎인 베어링이 나오자 공구함을 봉인했다. 표본과 일지로 자신의 작업 책임을 드러내되 시험 성공은 미확인이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b450-b450-b989","name":"두릉 두씨","crest":"clan-crests/b450-b450-b989.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":-20,"무력":-20,"물질":30,"공동":10,"원칙":10,"공개":0,"자격":90,"분산":0,"변혁":-25},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":-10,"위험":-10,"과시":10,"지속":-15,"지향":"동성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"차륜 정비 일지·불량 부품 표본 관리","소속":"Arc","품계":"사원","직함":"성하전자 차륜 정비사, 송하율의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 −20 | 무력 −20 | 물질 30 | 공동 10 | 원칙 10 | 공개 0 | 자격 90 | 분산 0 | 변혁 −25","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −10 | 과시 10 | 지속 −15 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 성하전자 차륜 정비사, 송하율의 실무 담당자 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 두모는 역삼1동에서 차륜 정비 일지·불량 부품 표본 관리 업무를 맡는다. 성하전자 정비 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명 업무를 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권으로 정밀화한다. 역삼 대합실 화물 인계는 참고이며 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. 송하율의 도제 일과를 현장에서 받고, 조우찬의 작업 조에 순환 배치된다. 이홍원의 시험 차륜만 우선 손본다","관직":"품계 사원. 직함은 성하전자 차륜 정비사, 송하율의 실무 담당자. 정비 일지를 회장실 게시판에 직접 붙이고, 불량 부품은 잘라 표본으로 남긴다.","일화":"유력 후계자의 시험 차륜에서 의도적으로 깎인 베어링이 나오자 자기 공구함을 봉인했다.","관계":"송하율의 도제 일과를 현장에서 받고, 조우찬의 작업 조에 순환 배치된다. 이홍원의 시험 차륜만 우선 손본다.","야망":"공개 승계 시험의 차륜을 자기 서명으로 완성해 이씨 가문 승계를 끊는 이홍원의 길을 현장 정비로 증명한다.","공포":"시험 차륜의 숨은 결함이 자기 공구 자국으로 남아 사택 대표에게 기지를 내주는 명분이 되는 것.","개입":"봉인된 공구함을 함께 열거나, 결함 부품의 출처 자국을 추적할 수 있다."},"biography":"손이 빠르고 말이 적으며, 남의 공구를 빼돌리는 일을 시험 부정과 같은 죄로 본다. 결함 표본을 자르지 않고 넘기는 반장을 참지 못한다.\n\n- 생업: 차륜 정비 일지·불량 부품 표본 관리\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 사원\n- 직함: 성하전자 차륜 정비사, 송하율의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 성하전자 차륜 정비사, 송하율의 실무 담당자 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 두모는 역삼1동에서 차륜 정비 일지·불량 부품 표본 관리 업무를 맡는다. 성하전자 정비 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명 업무를 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권으로 정밀화한다. 역삼 대합실 화물 인계는 참고이며 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. 송하율의 도제 일과를 현장에서 받고, 조우찬의 작업 조에 순환 배치된다. 이홍원의 시험 차륜만 우선 손본다\n\n**관직.** 품계 사원. 직함은 성하전자 차륜 정비사, 송하율의 실무 담당자. 정비 일지를 회장실 게시판에 직접 붙이고, 불량 부품은 잘라 표본으로 남긴다.\n\n**일화.** 유력 후계자의 시험 차륜에서 의도적으로 깎인 베어링이 나오자 자기 공구함을 봉인했다.\n\n**관계.** 송하율의 도제 일과를 현장에서 받고, 조우찬의 작업 조에 순환 배치된다. 이홍원의 시험 차륜만 우선 손본다.\n\n**야망.** 공개 승계 시험의 차륜을 자기 서명으로 완성해 이씨 가문 승계를 끊는 이홍원의 길을 현장 정비로 증명한다.\n\n**공포.** 시험 차륜의 숨은 결함이 자기 공구 자국으로 남아 사택 대표에게 기지를 내주는 명분이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 봉인된 공구함을 함께 열거나, 결함 부품의 출처 자국을 추적할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 −20 | 무력 −20 | 물질 30 | 공동 10 | 원칙 10 | 공개 0 | 자격 90 | 분산 0 | 변혁 −25\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −10 | 과시 10 | 지속 −15 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"두모","type":"신도","to":"송하율","basis":"송하율의 도제 일과를 현장에서 받고"},{"from":"두모","type":"계약","to":"조우찬","basis":"조우찬의 작업 조에 순환 배치된다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"국두","type":"계약","to":"두모","basis":"두모의 정비 표본 번호를 원장에 붙인다"},{"from":"용두봉","type":"계약","to":"두모","basis":"두모의 차륜 표본을 기병 칸에 쓴다"},{"from":"어예린","type":"맹세","to":"두모","basis":"두모의 봉인된 공구함을 함께 지키며"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0279', 'baa8-d568-d3c9', '{"id":"person-0279","name":"Moso","title":"Wheel and Scrap Iron Logistics Merchant","position":"Seongha Electronics Wheel and Scrap Iron Logistics Merchant","characterId":"K278","rank":"Employee","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Wheel and Steel Intake Weight, Dispatch Verification","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#inmul-moso","detailRoute":"/people/person-0279","birthDate":"2099-04-18","birthday":"04-18","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k278-weight-invoice-recording","name":"Weight invoice recording","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k278-priority","name":"Trust in public scales","description":"Moso receives recovered lots and transfers repair weight tables to invoices. He blocks unapproved family orders without rejecting authority itself.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: wheel and steel logistics merchant. Two witnesses reported intake weights, and he blocked the release of any order stamped with a house seal before the seniority council''s ratification.","stress":"Fear. That salvage steel would leave as munitions-only and the civil trains would stop forever.","relationship":"Relations. Matched releases with Hwang Noeul''s salvage scales and took over lots at Bong Guk''s salvage yard. Moved Gang Minseo''s repair-standard weight tables onto the invoices.","effects":[]},{"id":"k278-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: wheel and steel logistics merchant. Two witnesses reported intake weights, and he blocked the release of any order stamped with a house seal before the seniority council''s ratification.","stress":"Fear. That salvage steel would leave as munitions-only and the civil trains would stop forever.","relationship":"Relations. Matched releases with Hwang Noeul''s salvage scales and took over lots at Bong Guk''s salvage yard. Moved Gang Minseo''s repair-standard weight tables onto the invoices.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Moso receives recovered lots and transfers repair weight tables to invoices. He blocks unapproved family orders without rejecting authority itself.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"baa8-d568-d3c9","name":"Hampyeong Mo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/baa8-d568-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":-15,"Force":-15,"Material":45,"Communal":20,"Principle":5,"Public":5,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":20,"Display":20,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Wheel and Steel Intake Weight, Dispatch Verification","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Employee","Title":"Seongha Electronics Wheel and Scrap Iron Logistics Merchant","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness −15 | Force −15 | Materiality 45 | Communal 20 | Principle 5 | Publicity 5 | Qualification 60 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 5 | Monopoly −20 | Risk 20 | Display 20 | Continuity −15 | Orientation Fluid | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Raised at the Gangnam Station Depot. The post of Seongha Electronics Wheel and Steel Logistics Merchant opened up through a defect report just before a derailment.\n- Moso handles wheel and steel receiving weights and dispatch checks in Yeoksam 1-dong. Seongha Electronics'' maintenance samples, weights, lots, measurements, work crews, and accident signature duties are refined into the Yeoksam 1-dong work-and-living area adjacent to Gangnam Station. The freight handover at the Yeoksam waiting hall is for reference only and does not confirm actual factory equipment, warehouse monopoly, or running trains. Matches dispatch against Hwang Noeul''s recovery scale and takes over lots at Bongguk''s recovery yard. Copies Gang Minseo''s repair-standard weight table onto the invoice","Offices":"Rank: Staff. Title: Seongha Electronics Wheel and Steel Logistics Merchant. Two witnesses observe the receiving weight, and orders stamped with a clan crest are blocked from dispatch until the Chairman''s Office ratifies them.","Anecdote":"A weight record emerged showing that steel from the same lot as the defective bearings had slipped off toward Yongsan.","Relationships":"Matches dispatch against Hwang Noeul''s recovery scale and takes over lots at Bongguk''s recovery yard. Copies Gang Minseo''s repair-standard weight table onto the invoice.","Ambition":"Bundles wheels and brake steel into Seongha Electronics standard stock so that no particular work crew can shake the succession by holding parts hostage.","Fear":"Recovered steel being diverted to military use, so that civilian trains stop for good.","Intervention":"Can recall a steel lot, or have the Chairman''s Office halt shipments on the clan''s side."},"biography":"Regards shipping that falsifies weight as no different from shaving down the rails, and harshly counts cargo that slips into cars reserved for the Yi clan. Trusts the public scale over market price.\n\n- Occupation: Wheel and steel receiving weight and dispatch checks\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Staff\n- Title: Seongha Electronics Wheel and Steel Logistics Merchant\n**Life.** Raised at the Gangnam Station Depot. The post of Seongha Electronics Wheel and Steel Logistics Merchant opened up through a defect report just before a derailment.\n- Moso handles wheel and steel receiving weights and dispatch checks in Yeoksam 1-dong. Seongha Electronics'' maintenance samples, weights, lots, measurements, work crews, and accident signature duties are refined into the Yeoksam 1-dong work-and-living area adjacent to Gangnam Station. The freight handover at the Yeoksam waiting hall is for reference only and does not confirm actual factory equipment, warehouse monopoly, or running trains. Matches dispatch against Hwang Noeul''s recovery scale and takes over lots at Bongguk''s recovery yard. Copies Gang Minseo''s repair-standard weight table onto the invoice\n\n**Office.** Rank: Staff. Title: Seongha Electronics Wheel and Steel Logistics Merchant. Two witnesses observe the receiving weight, and orders stamped with a clan crest are blocked from dispatch until the Chairman''s Office ratifies them.\n\n**Anecdote.** A weight record emerged showing that steel from the same lot as the defective bearings had slipped off toward Yongsan.\n\n**Relations.** Matches dispatch against Hwang Noeul''s recovery scale and takes over lots at Bongguk''s recovery yard. Copies Gang Minseo''s repair-standard weight table onto the invoice.\n\n**Ambition.** Bundles wheels and brake steel into Seongha Electronics standard stock so that no particular work crew can shake the succession by holding parts hostage.\n\n**Fear.** That recovered steel will be diverted exclusively to military use and civilian trains will stop for good.\n\n**Intervention.** Can recover steel lots, or have the Chairman''s Office halt dispatches on the clan side.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness −15 | Force −15 | Materiality 45 | Communal 20 | Principle 5 | Publicity 5 | Qualification 60 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Monopoly −20 | Risk 20 | Display 20 | Continuity −15 | Orientation Fluid | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Moso","type":"Contract","to":"Hwang No-eul","basis":"Matching shipments to Hwang Noeul''s recovery scale"},{"from":"Moso","type":"Contract","to":"Bongguk","basis":"Take over lots at Bongguk''s recovery yard"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Bongguk","type":"Contract","to":"Moso","basis":"Match lots to Moso''s logistics invoices"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0279","name":"모소","title":"차륜·철재 물류상","position":"성하전자 차륜·철재 물류상","characterId":"K278","rank":"사원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"차륜·철재 입고 중량·출고 확인","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-모소","detailRoute":"/people/person-0279","birthDate":"2099-04-18","birthday":"04-18","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k278-weight-invoice-recording","name":"중량 송장 작성","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k278-priority","name":"공개 저울 신뢰","description":"모소는 회수 로트를 인수하고 수리 중량표를 송장에 옮긴다. 가문 주문도 인준 전에는 막지만 독립적 반권위는 아니다.","behavior":"입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 가문 문장이 찍힌 주문서는 회장실 인준 전 출고를 막는다.","stress":"회수 철재가 군수 전용으로 빠져 민생 열차가 영영 멈추는 것.","relationship":"황노을의 회수 저울과 출고를 맞추고, 봉국의 회수장에서 로트를 인수한다. 강민서의 수리 규격 중량표를 송장에 옮긴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k278-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 사원. 직함은 성하전자 차륜·철재 물류상. 입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 가문 문장이 찍힌 주문서는 회장실 인준 전 출고를 막는다.","stress":"공포. 회수 철재가 군수 전용으로 빠져 민생 열차가 영영 멈추는 것.","relationship":"관계. 황노을의 회수 저울과 출고를 맞추고, 봉국의 회수장에서 로트를 인수한다. 강민서의 수리 규격 중량표를 송장에 옮긴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"모소는 회수 로트를 인수하고 수리 중량표를 송장에 옮긴다. 가문 주문도 인준 전에는 막지만 독립적 반권위는 아니다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"baa8-d568-d3c9","name":"함평 모씨","crest":"clan-crests/baa8-d568-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":-15,"무력":-15,"물질":45,"공동":20,"원칙":5,"공개":5,"자격":60,"분산":20,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":-20,"위험":20,"과시":20,"지속":-15,"지향":"유동","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"차륜·철재 입고 중량·출고 확인","소속":"Arc","품계":"사원","직함":"성하전자 차륜·철재 물류상","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −15 | 물질 45 | 공동 20 | 원칙 5 | 공개 5 | 자격 60 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 −20 | 위험 20 | 과시 20 | 지속 −15 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 성하전자 차륜·철재 물류상 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 모소는 역삼1동에서 차륜·철재 입고 중량·출고 확인 업무를 맡는다. 성하전자 정비 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명 업무를 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권으로 정밀화한다. 역삼 대합실 화물 인계는 참고이며 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. 황노을의 회수 저울과 출고를 맞추고, 봉국의 회수장에서 로트를 인수한다. 강민서의 수리 규격 중량표를 송장에 옮긴다","관직":"품계 사원. 직함은 성하전자 차륜·철재 물류상. 입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 가문 문장이 찍힌 주문서는 회장실 인준 전 출고를 막는다.","일화":"결함 베어링과 같은 로트의 철재가 용산 쪽으로 빠졌다는 중량 기록이 나왔다.","관계":"황노을의 회수 저울과 출고를 맞추고, 봉국의 회수장에서 로트를 인수한다. 강민서의 수리 규격 중량표를 송장에 옮긴다.","야망":"차륜과 제동 철재를 성하전자 표준 재고로 묶어 특정 작업 조가 부품을 볼모로 후계를 흔들지 못하게 한다.","공포":"회수 철재가 군수 전용으로 빠져 민생 열차가 영영 멈추는 것.","개입":"철재 로트를 회수하거나, 가문 쪽 출고를 회장실에서 정지시킬 수 있다."},"biography":"무게를 속이는 출고를 선로를 깎는 일과 같다고 보고, 이씨 가문 전용 칸으로 빠지는 짐을 가혹하게 세운다. 시세보다 공개 저울을 믿는다.\n\n- 생업: 차륜·철재 입고 중량·출고 확인\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 사원\n- 직함: 성하전자 차륜·철재 물류상\n**생애.** 강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 성하전자 차륜·철재 물류상 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 모소는 역삼1동에서 차륜·철재 입고 중량·출고 확인 업무를 맡는다. 성하전자 정비 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명 업무를 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권으로 정밀화한다. 역삼 대합실 화물 인계는 참고이며 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. 황노을의 회수 저울과 출고를 맞추고, 봉국의 회수장에서 로트를 인수한다. 강민서의 수리 규격 중량표를 송장에 옮긴다\n\n**관직.** 품계 사원. 직함은 성하전자 차륜·철재 물류상. 입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 가문 문장이 찍힌 주문서는 회장실 인준 전 출고를 막는다.\n\n**일화.** 결함 베어링과 같은 로트의 철재가 용산 쪽으로 빠졌다는 중량 기록이 나왔다.\n\n**관계.** 황노을의 회수 저울과 출고를 맞추고, 봉국의 회수장에서 로트를 인수한다. 강민서의 수리 규격 중량표를 송장에 옮긴다.\n\n**야망.** 차륜과 제동 철재를 성하전자 표준 재고로 묶어 특정 작업 조가 부품을 볼모로 후계를 흔들지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 회수 철재가 군수 전용으로 빠져 민생 열차가 영영 멈추는 것.\n\n**개입.** 철재 로트를 회수하거나, 가문 쪽 출고를 회장실에서 정지시킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −15 | 물질 45 | 공동 20 | 원칙 5 | 공개 5 | 자격 60 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 −20 | 위험 20 | 과시 20 | 지속 −15 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"모소","type":"계약","to":"황노을","basis":"황노을의 회수 저울과 출고를 맞추고"},{"from":"모소","type":"계약","to":"봉국","basis":"봉국의 회수장에서 로트를 인수한다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"봉국","type":"계약","to":"모소","basis":"모소의 물류 송장과 로트를 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0280', 'bd09-d558-c74c', '{"id":"person-0280","name":"Bongbok","title":"Base Medical Officer","position":"Gangnam Station Residence Medical Officer","characterId":"K279","rank":"Employee","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Residence Accident Vitals Recording, Night Surgery Signature Verification","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#inmul-bongbok","detailRoute":"/people/person-0280","birthDate":"2100-10-04","birthday":"10-04","age":26,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k279-injury-care","name":"Injury care","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k279-priority","name":"Injury before nationality","description":"Bongbok treats crew and patrol injuries and posts accident vital signs. Extended overnight duty supports endurance, not an assessment of bodily health.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: base medic. He pasted accident vital records on the infirmary door and started night surgery only with the squad leader''s and the apprentice''s signatures together.","stress":"Fear. That a casualty of bad brakes would be moved to a residential militia sickbed and a base accident would turn into a population dispute.","relationship":"Relations. Took Jo Woochan''s work-squad injuries and treated Gwon Doha''s north gate patrol rotations. Emptied sickbeds whenever Jeon Miri''s medical train stopped at Changdong.","effects":[]},{"id":"k279-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: base medic. He pasted accident vital records on the infirmary door and started night surgery only with the squad leader''s and the apprentice''s signatures together.","stress":"Fear. That a casualty of bad brakes would be moved to a residential militia sickbed and a base accident would turn into a population dispute.","relationship":"Relations. Took Jo Woochan''s work-squad injuries and treated Gwon Doha''s north gate patrol rotations. Emptied sickbeds whenever Jeon Miri''s medical train stopped at Changdong.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Bongbok treats crew and patrol injuries and posts accident vital signs. Extended overnight duty supports endurance, not an assessment of bodily health.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bd09-d558-c74c","name":"Haeum Bong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bd09-d558-c74c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":5,"Force":-40,"Material":40,"Communal":25,"Principle":10,"Public":0,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":-20},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":-35,"Risk":-10,"Display":-10,"Sustained":10,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Residence Accident Vitals Recording, Night Surgery Signature Verification","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Employee","Title":"Gangnam Station Residence Medical Officer","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness 5 | Force −40 | Materiality 40 | Communal 25 | Principle 10 | Publicity 0 | Qualification 60 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation −20","Desires":"Craving 45 | Monopoly −35 | Risk −10 | Display −10 | Continuity 10 | Orientation Fluid | Union Single Marriage"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Gangnam Station rail depot. The post of Gangnam Station Company Quarters medic opened up through a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- Bongbok handles recording of accident vitals and verifying night-surgery signatures at the quarters in Seocho 2-dong. Proposes the quarters'' petition, remaining water supply, water level and accident-record duties as a duty reference for the Seocho 2-dong living sphere. Preserves the existing auditor, foreman and apprentice signature conditions and does not presume personal residence or ownership of lodgings. Takes charge of injuries in Jo Uchan''s work crew and treats Gwon Doha''s North Gate patrol shift. Keeps sickbeds empty when Jeon Miri''s medical train stops at Gangnam Station","Offices":"Rank: Staff. Title: Gangnam Station Quarters medic. Posts accident vitals records on the infirmary door, and night surgery begins only when both the foreman''s and the apprentice''s signatures are present.","Anecdote":"Right after a test-wheel defect, the North Gate patrol car stopped because of brake failure, and the infirmary watch ran past a full night.","Relationships":"Takes on the injuries of Jo Uchan''s work crew and treats Gwon Doha''s north gate patrol shift. Keeps beds vacant for when Jeon Miri''s medical train stops at Gangnam Station.","Ambition":"Leave the Gangnam Station Quarters infirmary as an outpost opened jointly by the Chairman''s Office and the quarters auditor, so that concealing accidents never becomes test points.","Fear":"The fear that a brake-fault casualty will be moved to a Residence Militia sickbed, turning a depot accident into a population dispute.","Intervention":"Can raise injury records to the Chairman''s Office, or have the infirmary and the foreman each hold part of the stimulant seal."},"biography":"Looks at the hand caught under the wheel first and at nationality later. Refuses talk that packages stimulants taken during test periods as proof of skill.\n\n- Livelihood: Recording quarters accident vitals and verifying night-surgery signatures\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Staff\n- Title: Gangnam Station Quarters medic\n**Life.** Grew up at the Gangnam Station rail depot. The post of Gangnam Station Company Quarters medic opened up through a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- Bongbok handles recording of accident vitals and verifying night-surgery signatures at the quarters in Seocho 2-dong. Proposes the quarters'' petition, remaining water supply, water level and accident-record duties as a duty reference for the Seocho 2-dong living sphere. Preserves the existing auditor, foreman and apprentice signature conditions and does not presume personal residence or ownership of lodgings. Takes charge of injuries in Jo Uchan''s work crew and treats Gwon Doha''s North Gate patrol shift. Keeps sickbeds empty when Jeon Miri''s medical train stops at Gangnam Station\n\n**Office.** Rank: Staff. Title: Gangnam Station Quarters medic. Posts accident vitals records on the infirmary door, and night surgery begins only when both the foreman''s and the apprentice''s signatures are present.\n\n**Anecdote.** Right after a test-wheel defect, the North Gate patrol car stopped because of brake failure, and the infirmary watch ran past a full night.\n\n**Relationships.** Takes charge of injuries in Jo Uchan''s work crew and treats Gwon Doha''s North Gate patrol shift. Keeps sickbeds empty when Jeon Miri''s medical train stops at Gangnam Station.\n\n**Ambition.** Leave the Gangnam Station Quarters infirmary as an outpost opened jointly by the Chairman''s Office and the quarters auditor, so that concealing accidents never becomes test points.\n\n**Fear.** That those injured by the brake failure get moved to the quarters militia''s sickbeds, turning a depot accident into a population dispute.\n\n**Intervention.** Can raise injury records to the Chairman''s Office, or have the infirmary and the foreman each hold part of the stimulant seal.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness 5 | Force −40 | Material 40 | Communal 25 | Principle 10 | Publicity 0 | Credentials 60 | Dispersal 5 | Transformation −20\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Possessiveness −35 | Risk −10 | Display −10 | Endurance 10 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bongbok","type":"Contract","to":"Jo U-chan","basis":"Takes charge of injuries in Jo Uchan''s work crew"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0280","name":"봉복","title":"기지 의무원","position":"강남역 사택 의무원","characterId":"K279","rank":"사원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"사택 사고 활력 기록·야간 수술 서명 확인","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-봉복","detailRoute":"/people/person-0280","birthDate":"2100-10-04","birthday":"10-04","age":26,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k279-injury-care","name":"부상자 진료","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k279-priority","name":"부상 먼저","description":"봉복은 작업 조와 순찰 교대의 부상을 돌보고 사고 활력을 게시한다. 하룻밤 넘긴 당직은 체력 근거지만 신체 건강 판정은 아니다.","behavior":"사고 활력 기록을 의무실 문에 붙이고, 야간 수술은 반장과 도제의 서명이 함께 있어야 시작한다.","stress":"제동 불량 부상자가 사택 민병 병상으로 옮겨져 기지 사고가 인구 분쟁으로 바뀌는 것.","relationship":"조우찬의 작업 조 부상을 맡고, 권도하의 북문 순찰 교대를 진료한다. 전미리의 의료열차가 강남역에 설 때 병상을 비워 둔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k279-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 사택 의무원. 사고 활력 기록을 의무실 문에 붙이고, 야간 수술은 반장과 도제의 서명이 함께 있어야 시작한다.","stress":"공포. 제동 불량 부상자가 사택 민병 병상으로 옮겨져 기지 사고가 인구 분쟁으로 바뀌는 것.","relationship":"관계. 조우찬의 작업 조 부상을 맡고, 권도하의 북문 순찰 교대를 진료한다. 전미리의 의료열차가 강남역에 설 때 병상을 비워 둔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"봉복은 작업 조와 순찰 교대의 부상을 돌보고 사고 활력을 게시한다. 하룻밤 넘긴 당직은 체력 근거지만 신체 건강 판정은 아니다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bd09-d558-c74c","name":"하음 봉씨","crest":"clan-crests/bd09-d558-c74c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":5,"무력":-40,"물질":40,"공동":25,"원칙":10,"공개":0,"자격":60,"분산":5,"변혁":-20},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":-35,"위험":-10,"과시":-10,"지속":10,"지향":"유동","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"사택 사고 활력 기록·야간 수술 서명 확인","소속":"Arc","품계":"사원","직함":"강남역 사택 의무원","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 5 | 무력 −40 | 물질 40 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 0 | 자격 60 | 분산 5 | 변혁 −20","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −10 | 지속 10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 강남역 사택 의무원 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 봉복은 서초2동에서 사택 사고 활력 기록·야간 수술 서명 확인 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 사택의 청원·급수 잔량·수위·사고 기록 업무를 서초2동 생활권 근무 참조로 제안한다. 기존 감사·반장·도제 서명 조건을 보존하고 개인 거주·숙소 소유는 추정하지 않는다. 조우찬의 작업 조 부상을 맡고, 권도하의 북문 순찰 교대를 진료한다. 전미리의 의료열차가 강남역에 설 때 병상을 비워 둔다","관직":"품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 사택 의무원. 사고 활력 기록을 의무실 문에 붙이고, 야간 수술은 반장과 도제의 서명이 함께 있어야 시작한다.","일화":"시험 차륜 결함 직후 북문 순찰차가 제동 불량으로 정차해 의무실 당직이 하룻밤 넘었다.","관계":"조우찬의 작업 조 부상을 맡고, 권도하의 북문 순찰 교대를 진료한다. 전미리의 의료열차가 강남역에 설 때 병상을 비워 둔다.","야망":"강남역 사택 의무실을 회장실와 사택 감사가 함께 여는 거점으로 남겨, 사고 은폐가 시험 점수가 되지 않게 한다.","공포":"제동 불량 부상자가 사택 민병 병상으로 옮겨져 기지 사고가 인구 분쟁으로 바뀌는 것.","개입":"부상 기록을 회장실에 올리거나, 각성제 봉인을 의무실과 반장이 나눠 쥐게 할 수 있다."},"biography":"차륜 아래 끼인 손부터 보고 국적을 나중에 본다. 시험 기간의 각성제를 숙련의 증명으로 포장하는 말을 거부한다.\n\n- 생업: 사택 사고 활력 기록·야간 수술 서명 확인\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 사원\n- 직함: 강남역 사택 의무원\n**생애.** 강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 강남역 사택 의무원 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 봉복은 서초2동에서 사택 사고 활력 기록·야간 수술 서명 확인 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 사택의 청원·급수 잔량·수위·사고 기록 업무를 서초2동 생활권 근무 참조로 제안한다. 기존 감사·반장·도제 서명 조건을 보존하고 개인 거주·숙소 소유는 추정하지 않는다. 조우찬의 작업 조 부상을 맡고, 권도하의 북문 순찰 교대를 진료한다. 전미리의 의료열차가 강남역에 설 때 병상을 비워 둔다\n\n**관직.** 품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 사택 의무원. 사고 활력 기록을 의무실 문에 붙이고, 야간 수술은 반장과 도제의 서명이 함께 있어야 시작한다.\n\n**일화.** 시험 차륜 결함 직후 북문 순찰차가 제동 불량으로 정차해 의무실 당직이 하룻밤 넘었다.\n\n**관계.** 조우찬의 작업 조 부상을 맡고, 권도하의 북문 순찰 교대를 진료한다. 전미리의 의료열차가 강남역에 설 때 병상을 비워 둔다.\n\n**야망.** 강남역 사택 의무실을 회장실와 사택 감사가 함께 여는 거점으로 남겨, 사고 은폐가 시험 점수가 되지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 제동 불량 부상자가 사택 민병 병상으로 옮겨져 기지 사고가 인구 분쟁으로 바뀌는 것.\n\n**개입.** 부상 기록을 회장실에 올리거나, 각성제 봉인을 의무실과 반장이 나눠 쥐게 할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 5 | 무력 −40 | 물질 40 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 0 | 자격 60 | 분산 5 | 변혁 −20\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −10 | 지속 10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"봉복","type":"계약","to":"조우찬","basis":"조우찬의 작업 조 부상을 맡고"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0281', 'c6a9-d64d-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0281","name":"Yongmo","title":"Northern Gate Patrol, Operations Aide to Gwon Doha","position":"Gangnam Station Northern Gate Patrol, Operations Aide to Gwon Doha","characterId":"K280","rank":"Employee","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Northern Gate Sortie Wheel Inspection, Armament Loading Verification","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#inmul-yongmo","detailRoute":"/people/person-0281","birthDate":"2069-05-31","birthday":"05-31","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"k280-patrol-signal-coordination","name":"Patrol signal coordination","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k280-priority","name":"Inspection discipline","description":"Yongmo aligns gate patrol with corridor torches and records escort times. Practical patrol work is distinct from group command.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: north gate patrol, duty officer of Gwon Doha. He made wheel checks mandatory before sorties and recognized arms loading only with the Elder''s and the auditor''s joint signature.","stress":"Fear. That the rail cavalry would be absorbed into a residential militia and the base would become a barracks.","relationship":"Relations. Rounded the north gate under Gwon Doha''s command and matched the corridor torches with Kang Taesan. Moved Jang Sehwa''s northern convoy hours onto the patrol chalkboard.","effects":[]},{"id":"k280-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: north gate patrol, duty officer of Gwon Doha. He made wheel checks mandatory before sorties and recognized arms loading only with the Elder''s and the auditor''s joint signature.","stress":"Fear. That the rail cavalry would be absorbed into a residential militia and the base would become a barracks.","relationship":"Relations. Rounded the north gate under Gwon Doha''s command and matched the corridor torches with Kang Taesan. Moved Jang Sehwa''s northern convoy hours onto the patrol chalkboard.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Yongmo aligns gate patrol with corridor torches and records escort times. Practical patrol work is distinct from group command.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c6a9-d64d-cc9c","name":"Yong Clan of Hongcheon","crest":"clan-crests/c6a9-d64d-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":-30,"Force":10,"Material":25,"Communal":10,"Principle":5,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":55,"Dispersed":0,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":5,"Risk":10,"Display":-25,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"None","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Northern Gate Sortie Wheel Inspection, Armament Loading Verification","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Employee","Title":"Gangnam Station Northern Gate Patrol, Operations Aide to Gwon Doha","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness −30 | Force 10 | Material 25 | Communal 10 | Principle 5 | Publicity −10 | Credentials 55 | Dispersal 0 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving 0 | Possessiveness 5 | Risk 10 | Display −25 | Endurance 30 | Orientation No leaning | Bonding None"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Amsa guard post. The post of Gangnam Station North Gate Patrol, practical aide to Gwon Doha, opened up through catching an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- Yongmo handles inspecting North Gate sortie wheels and verifying armament loading in Seocho 4-dong. Links the Gangnam Station headquarters and Chairman''s Office bulletin boards, and the waiting-hall handover, entry and duty for living cargo, as neighborhood-level duty reference points. The North Gate is a Gangnam Station approach duty and does not create northern-region rule or a new fortress. Patrols the North Gate under Gwon Doha''s command and syncs corridor torches with Gang Taesan. Relays Jang Sehwa''s northern escort times onto the patrol blackboard","Offices":"Rank: Staff. Title: Gangnam Station North Gate Patrol, practical aide to Gwon Doha. Makes wheel inspection mandatory before sortie, and recognizes armament loading only with the joint signature of the managing director and the auditor.","Anecdote":"Right after a test wheel defect, the North Gate patrol car stopped due to faulty brakes, throwing off the escort timing.","Relationships":"Patrols the North Gate under Gwon Doha''s command and syncs corridor torches with Gang Taesan. Relays Jang Sehwa''s northern escort times onto the patrol blackboard.","Ambition":"Ties the North Gate patrol to the northern route of the Gangnam Station escort, moving Seongha Electronics trains according to Seoul''s internal contracts and duty rosters.","Fear":"Rail Cavalry being absorbed into the company housing militia, turning the base into barracks.","Intervention":"Can replace brake parts on the spot, or report unauthorized armament to the Chairman''s Office."},"biography":"Likes discipline and sees silence on the track as part of patrolling. Calls an assault without skill close to betrayal.\n\n- Livelihood: Inspecting North Gate sortie wheels and verifying armament loading\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Staff\n- Title: Gangnam Station North Gate Patrol, practical aide to Gwon Doha\n**Life.** Grew up at the Amsa guard post. The post of Gangnam Station North Gate Patrol, practical aide to Gwon Doha, opened up through catching an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- Yongmo handles inspecting North Gate sortie wheels and verifying armament loading in Seocho 4-dong. Links the Gangnam Station headquarters and Chairman''s Office bulletin boards, and the waiting-hall handover, entry and duty for living cargo, as neighborhood-level duty reference points. The North Gate is a Gangnam Station approach duty and does not create northern-region rule or a new fortress. Patrols the North Gate under Gwon Doha''s command and syncs corridor torches with Gang Taesan. Relays Jang Sehwa''s northern escort times onto the patrol blackboard\n\n**Office.** Rank: Staff. Title: Gangnam Station North Gate Patrol, practical aide to Gwon Doha. Makes wheel inspection mandatory before sortie, and recognizes armament loading only with the joint signature of the managing director and the auditor.\n\n**Anecdote.** Right after a test-wheel defect, the North Gate patrol car stopped because of brake failure, and the escort times slipped out of alignment.\n\n**Relationships.** Patrols the North Gate under Gwon Doha''s command and syncs corridor torches with Gang Taesan. Relays Jang Sehwa''s northern escort times onto the patrol blackboard.\n\n**Ambition.** Tie the North Gate patrol to Gangnam Station''s escort as its northern gate route, moving Seongha Electronics trains according to Seoul-internal contracts and duty rosters.\n\n**Fear.** That the rail cavalry gets absorbed into the quarters militia and the depot becomes a barracks.\n\n**Intervention.** Can replace brake parts on the spot, or report unauthorized armament to the Chairman''s Office.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness −30 | Force 10 | Material 25 | Communal 10 | Principle 5 | Publicity −10 | Credentials 55 | Dispersal 0 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Possessiveness 5 | Risk 10 | Display −25 | Endurance 30 | Orientation No leaning | Bonding None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yongmo","type":"Contract","to":"Gang Taesan","basis":"Syncing the corridor torches with Gang Taesan"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Duguk","type":"Contract","to":"Yongmo","basis":"Shares Yongmo''s shift rotations and torches"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0281","name":"용모","title":"북문 순찰대, 권도하의 실무 담당자","position":"강남역 북문 순찰대, 권도하의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K280","rank":"사원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"북문 출격 차륜 점검·무장 탑재 확인","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-용모","detailRoute":"/people/person-0281","birthDate":"2069-05-31","birthday":"05-31","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"k280-patrol-signal-coordination","name":"순찰 신호 맞춤","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k280-priority","name":"점검 규율","description":"용모는 북문 순찰과 회랑 횃불을 맞추고 호송 시각을 옮긴다. 실무 순찰과 집단 지휘는 구분한다.","behavior":"출격 전에 차륜 점검을 의무화하고, 무장 탑재는 상무와 감사의 공동 서명만 인정한다.","stress":"궤도기병이 사택 민병으로 흡수되어 기지가 병영이 되는 것.","relationship":"권도하의 지휘로 북문을 돌고, 강태산과 회랑 횃불을 맞춘다. 장세화의 북부 호송 시각을 순찰 칠판에 옮긴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k280-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 북문 순찰대, 권도하의 실무 담당자. 출격 전에 차륜 점검을 의무화하고, 무장 탑재는 상무와 감사의 공동 서명만 인정한다.","stress":"공포. 궤도기병이 사택 민병으로 흡수되어 기지가 병영이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 권도하의 지휘로 북문을 돌고, 강태산과 회랑 횃불을 맞춘다. 장세화의 북부 호송 시각을 순찰 칠판에 옮긴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"용모는 북문 순찰과 회랑 횃불을 맞추고 호송 시각을 옮긴다. 실무 순찰과 집단 지휘는 구분한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c6a9-d64d-cc9c","name":"홍천 용씨","crest":"clan-crests/c6a9-d64d-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":-30,"무력":10,"물질":25,"공동":10,"원칙":5,"공개":-10,"자격":55,"분산":0,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":5,"위험":10,"과시":-25,"지속":30,"지향":"무성향","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"북문 출격 차륜 점검·무장 탑재 확인","소속":"Arc","품계":"사원","직함":"강남역 북문 순찰대, 권도하의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 −30 | 무력 10 | 물질 25 | 공동 10 | 원칙 5 | 공개 −10 | 자격 55 | 분산 0 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 5 | 위험 10 | 과시 −25 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 강남역 북문 순찰대, 권도하의 실무 담당자 자리는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다.\n- 용모는 서초4동에서 북문 출격 차륜 점검·무장 탑재 확인 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 본사·회장실 게시판과 대합실 생활 화물 인계·출입·당직을 동 수준 근무 기준점으로 연결한다. 북문은 강남역 접근 당직이며 북부 권역 지배·새 요새를 만들지 않는다. 권도하의 지휘로 북문을 돌고, 강태산과 회랑 횃불을 맞춘다. 장세화의 북부 호송 시각을 순찰 칠판에 옮긴다","관직":"품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 북문 순찰대, 권도하의 실무 담당자. 출격 전에 차륜 점검을 의무화하고, 무장 탑재는 상무와 감사의 공동 서명만 인정한다.","일화":"시험 차륜 결함 직후 북문 순찰차가 제동 불량으로 정차해 호송 시각이 어긋났다.","관계":"권도하의 지휘로 북문을 돌고, 강태산과 회랑 횃불을 맞춘다. 장세화의 북부 호송 시각을 순찰 칠판에 옮긴다.","야망":"북문 순찰을 강남역 호송의 북문로 묶어 서울 내부 계약과 당직표에 따라 성하전자 열차를 움직인다.","공포":"궤도기병이 사택 민병으로 흡수되어 기지가 병영이 되는 것.","개입":"제동 부품을 현장에서 갈아 끼우거나, 무단 무장을 회장실에 보고할 수 있다."},"biography":"규율을 좋아하고 선로 위의 침묵을 순찰의 일부로 본다. 숙련 없는 돌격을 배신에 가깝다고 말한다.\n\n- 생업: 북문 출격 차륜 점검·무장 탑재 확인\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 사원\n- 직함: 강남역 북문 순찰대, 권도하의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 강남역 북문 순찰대, 권도하의 실무 담당자 자리는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다.\n- 용모는 서초4동에서 북문 출격 차륜 점검·무장 탑재 확인 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 본사·회장실 게시판과 대합실 생활 화물 인계·출입·당직을 동 수준 근무 기준점으로 연결한다. 북문은 강남역 접근 당직이며 북부 권역 지배·새 요새를 만들지 않는다. 권도하의 지휘로 북문을 돌고, 강태산과 회랑 횃불을 맞춘다. 장세화의 북부 호송 시각을 순찰 칠판에 옮긴다\n\n**관직.** 품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 북문 순찰대, 권도하의 실무 담당자. 출격 전에 차륜 점검을 의무화하고, 무장 탑재는 상무와 감사의 공동 서명만 인정한다.\n\n**일화.** 시험 차륜 결함 직후 북문 순찰차가 제동 불량으로 정차해 호송 시각이 어긋났다.\n\n**관계.** 권도하의 지휘로 북문을 돌고, 강태산과 회랑 횃불을 맞춘다. 장세화의 북부 호송 시각을 순찰 칠판에 옮긴다.\n\n**야망.** 북문 순찰을 강남역 호송의 북문로 묶어 서울 내부 계약과 당직표에 따라 성하전자 열차를 움직인다.\n\n**공포.** 궤도기병이 사택 민병으로 흡수되어 기지가 병영이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 제동 부품을 현장에서 갈아 끼우거나, 무단 무장을 회장실에 보고할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 −30 | 무력 10 | 물질 25 | 공동 10 | 원칙 5 | 공개 −10 | 자격 55 | 분산 0 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 5 | 위험 10 | 과시 −25 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"용모","type":"계약","to":"강태산","basis":"강태산과 회랑 횃불을 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"두국","type":"계약","to":"용모","basis":"용모의 교대와 횃불을 나눈다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0282', 'c18c-c9c4-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0282","name":"Sobong","title":"Yeongong Council Courier, Operations Aide to Jo Uchan","position":"Chairman''s Office Courier, Operations Aide to Jo Uchan","characterId":"K281","rank":"Employee","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Work Crew, Accident Ledger Recording, Courier Duty","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#inmul-sobong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0282","birthDate":"2078-03-25","birthday":"03-25","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k281-operating-notice-delivery","name":"Operating notice delivery","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k281-priority","name":"Insists on written approval","description":"Sobong posts operating and water notices on the same wall. His document accountability coexists with a bias toward technical logs.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: seniority council courier, duty officer of Jo Woochan. He wrote work-squad rotations and accident signatures in the same ledger and pasted notes demanding a trial postponement on the board as they came.","stress":"Fear. That the courier bag would turn into ration-window notes and the main gate would become a housing counter.","relationship":"Relations. Carried Jo Woochan''s start-up notices and pasted Seo Jina''s water-residue postings on the same wall. Posted I Hongwon''s trial schedule on the base gate first, not the camp.","effects":[]},{"id":"k281-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: seniority council courier, duty officer of Jo Woochan. He wrote work-squad rotations and accident signatures in the same ledger and pasted notes demanding a trial postponement on the board as they came.","stress":"Fear. That the courier bag would turn into ration-window notes and the main gate would become a housing counter.","relationship":"Relations. Carried Jo Woochan''s start-up notices and pasted Seo Jina''s water-residue postings on the same wall. Posted I Hongwon''s trial schedule on the base gate first, not the camp.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Sobong posts operating and water notices on the same wall. His document accountability coexists with a bias toward technical logs.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c18c-c9c4-c8fc","name":"Jinju So Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c18c-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":0,"Force":-5,"Material":25,"Communal":20,"Principle":0,"Public":15,"Eligibility":55,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":15,"Risk":20,"Display":25,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Work Crew, Accident Ledger Recording, Courier Duty","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Employee","Title":"Chairman''s Office Courier, Operations Aide to Jo Uchan","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness 0 | Force −5 | Material 25 | Communal 20 | Principle 0 | Publicity 15 | Credentials 55 | Dispersal 5 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving 0 | Possessiveness 15 | Risk 20 | Display 25 | Endurance −10 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Sinnae transfer duty post. The post of Chairman''s Office courier, practical aide to Jo Uchan, opened up through stopping a ticketless departing train.\n- Sobong handles work crews, accident ledger records and courier duties in Seocho 4-dong. Links the Gangnam Station headquarters and Chairman''s Office bulletin boards, and the waiting-hall handover, entry and duty for living cargo, as neighborhood-level duty reference points. The North Gate is a Gangnam Station approach duty and does not create northern-region rule or a new fortress. Carries Jo Uchan''s operation notices and posts Seo Jina''s remaining-water-supply announcements side by side on the same wall. Puts I Hongwon''s test schedule up at the depot main gate first","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Chairman''s Office Courier and Jo Uchan''s working-level aide. Records work-crew rotations and accident signatures in the same ledger, and posts notes demanding test delays on the bulletin board exactly as they are.","Anecdote":"When rumors of a defect in the test parts spread through the Gangnam Station housing compounds, the representatives demanded that the depot''s main gate be used as a ration window.","Relationships":"Carries Jo Uchan''s operation notices and posts Seo Jina''s remaining-water-supply announcements side by side on the same wall. Puts I Hongwon''s test schedule up at the depot main gate first, not at the encampment.","Ambition":"Turn the notice that makes the technician Chairman''s Office faction approve base operation before the residence petition into a fixed courier route.","Fear":"That the courier bag turns into a ration-window note and the main gate becomes a quarters window.","Intervention":"Can expose the bribed delay notes, or fix the test schedule onto the courier route."},"biography":"Remembers accident dates before people''s names, and will not open base operation until a verbal approval has been copied into the courier ledger. Snaps his chalk when a note from the residence side is posted above the technical log.\n\n- Occupation: Work Crew, Accident Ledger Records, Courier\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Chairman''s Office Courier, Jo Uchan''s working-level aide\n**Life.** Grew up on the Sinnae transfer duty roster. The post of Chairman''s Office Courier and Jo Uchan''s working-level aide opened after he stopped a ticketless departing train.\n- Sobong handles work-crew, accident-ledger recording and courier duties in Seocho 4-dong. He links the Gangnam Station headquarters and Chairman''s Office bulletin board, and the waiting-hall daily-life cargo handover, entry and duty, as neighborhood-level duty reference points. North Gate is a Gangnam Station access post and does not create northern-district rule or a new fortress. He carries Jo Uchan''s operation notices and posts Seo Jina''s remaining-water-supply notices side by side on the same wall. He posts I Hongwon''s test schedule at the base gate first\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Chairman''s Office Courier and Jo Uchan''s working-level aide. Records work-crew rotations and accident signatures in the same ledger, and posts notes demanding test delays on the bulletin board exactly as they are.\n\n**Anecdote.** When rumors of a defective test part spread through the Gangnam Station residences, representatives argued that the base gate should be used as a ration window.\n\n**Relationships.** Carries Jo Uchan''s operation notices and posts Seo Jina''s remaining-water-supply notices side by side on the same wall. Posts I Hongwon''s test schedule at the base gate first, not at the encampment.\n\n**Ambition.** Turn the notice that makes the technician Chairman''s Office faction approve base operation before the residence petition into a fixed courier route.\n\n**Fear.** That the courier bag will turn into a ration-window note and the gate become a residence window.\n\n**Intervention.** Can expose the bribed delay notes, or fix the test schedule onto the courier route.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness 0 | Force −5 | Material 25 | Communal 20 | Principle 0 | Transparency 15 | Qualification 55 | Decentralization 5 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly 15 | Risk 20 | Display 25 | Endurance −10 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Sobong","type":"Contract","to":"Jo U-chan","basis":"Carries Jo Uchan''s restart notices"},{"from":"Sobong","type":"Contract","to":"Seo Jin-a","basis":"Posts Seo Jina''s remaining water balance notice side by side on the same wall"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Mobok","type":"Contract","to":"Sobong","basis":"Pins Sobong''s courier slip and the water-level stick on the same nail."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0282","name":"소봉","title":"연공회의 전령, 조우찬의 실무 담당자","position":"회장실 전령, 조우찬의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K281","rank":"사원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"작업 조·사고 원장 기록·전령","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-소봉","detailRoute":"/people/person-0282","birthDate":"2078-03-25","birthday":"03-25","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k281-operating-notice-delivery","name":"가동 통지 전달","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k281-priority","name":"서면 승인 고수","description":"소봉은 가동 통지와 급수 공지를 같은 벽에 붙인다. 기술 일지를 위에 두려는 편향과 문서 책임을 함께 남긴다.","behavior":"작업 조 순환과 사고 서명을 같은 원장에 적고, 시험 연기를 요구하는 쪽지는 게시판에 그대로 붙인다.","stress":"전령 가방이 배급 창구 쪽지로 바뀌어 정문이 사택 창구가 되는 것.","relationship":"조우찬의 가동 통지를 나르고, 서진아의 급수 잔량 공지를 같은 벽에 나란히 붙인다. 이홍원의 시험 일정을 숙영이 아니라 기지 정문에 먼저 붙인다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k281-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 사원. 직함은 회장실 전령, 조우찬의 실무 담당자. 작업 조 순환과 사고 서명을 같은 원장에 적고, 시험 연기를 요구하는 쪽지는 게시판에 그대로 붙인다.","stress":"공포. 전령 가방이 배급 창구 쪽지로 바뀌어 정문이 사택 창구가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 조우찬의 가동 통지를 나르고, 서진아의 급수 잔량 공지를 같은 벽에 나란히 붙인다. 이홍원의 시험 일정을 숙영이 아니라 기지 정문에 먼저 붙인다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"소봉은 가동 통지와 급수 공지를 같은 벽에 붙인다. 기술 일지를 위에 두려는 편향과 문서 책임을 함께 남긴다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c18c-c9c4-c8fc","name":"진주 소씨","crest":"clan-crests/c18c-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":0,"무력":-5,"물질":25,"공동":20,"원칙":0,"공개":15,"자격":55,"분산":5,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":15,"위험":20,"과시":25,"지속":-10,"지향":"유동","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"작업 조·사고 원장 기록·전령","소속":"Arc","품계":"사원","직함":"회장실 전령, 조우찬의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 0 | 무력 −5 | 물질 25 | 공동 20 | 원칙 0 | 공개 15 | 자격 55 | 분산 5 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 15 | 위험 20 | 과시 25 | 지속 −10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 회장실 전령, 조우찬의 실무 담당자 자리는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 소봉은 서초4동에서 작업 조·사고 원장 기록·전령 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 본사·회장실 게시판과 대합실 생활 화물 인계·출입·당직을 동 수준 근무 기준점으로 연결한다. 북문은 강남역 접근 당직이며 북부 권역 지배·새 요새를 만들지 않는다. 조우찬의 가동 통지를 나르고, 서진아의 급수 잔량 공지를 같은 벽에 나란히 붙인다. 이홍원의 시험 일정을 기지 정문에 먼저 붙인다","관직":"품계 사원. 직함은 회장실 전령, 조우찬의 실무 담당자. 작업 조 순환과 사고 서명을 같은 원장에 적고, 시험 연기를 요구하는 쪽지는 게시판에 그대로 붙인다.","일화":"시험 부품 결함 소문이 강남역 사택에 퍼지자 대표들이 기지 정문을 배급 창구로 쓰자고 주장했다.","관계":"조우찬의 가동 통지를 나르고, 서진아의 급수 잔량 공지를 같은 벽에 나란히 붙인다. 이홍원의 시험 일정을 숙영이 아니라 기지 정문에 먼저 붙인다.","야망":"기술자 회장실가 사택 청원보다 먼저 기지 가동을 승인하게 하는 통지를 고정 전령로로 만든다.","공포":"전령 가방이 배급 창구 쪽지로 바뀌어 정문이 사택 창구가 되는 것.","개입":"매수된 연기 쪽지를 공개하거나, 시험 일정을 전령로에 고정할 수 있다."},"biography":"사고 날짜를 사람 이름보다 먼저 기억하고, 구두 승인을 전령 원장에 옮기기 전에 기지 가동을 열지 않는다. 사택 쪽 쪽지가 기술 일지보다 위에 붙으면 분필을 꺾는다.\n\n- 생업: 작업 조·사고 원장 기록·전령\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 사원\n- 직함: 회장실 전령, 조우찬의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 회장실 전령, 조우찬의 실무 담당자 자리는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 소봉은 서초4동에서 작업 조·사고 원장 기록·전령 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 본사·회장실 게시판과 대합실 생활 화물 인계·출입·당직을 동 수준 근무 기준점으로 연결한다. 북문은 강남역 접근 당직이며 북부 권역 지배·새 요새를 만들지 않는다. 조우찬의 가동 통지를 나르고, 서진아의 급수 잔량 공지를 같은 벽에 나란히 붙인다. 이홍원의 시험 일정을 기지 정문에 먼저 붙인다\n\n**관직.** 품계 사원. 직함은 회장실 전령, 조우찬의 실무 담당자. 작업 조 순환과 사고 서명을 같은 원장에 적고, 시험 연기를 요구하는 쪽지는 게시판에 그대로 붙인다.\n\n**일화.** 시험 부품 결함 소문이 강남역 사택에 퍼지자 대표들이 기지 정문을 배급 창구로 쓰자고 주장했다.\n\n**관계.** 조우찬의 가동 통지를 나르고, 서진아의 급수 잔량 공지를 같은 벽에 나란히 붙인다. 이홍원의 시험 일정을 숙영이 아니라 기지 정문에 먼저 붙인다.\n\n**야망.** 기술자 회장실가 사택 청원보다 먼저 기지 가동을 승인하게 하는 통지를 고정 전령로로 만든다.\n\n**공포.** 전령 가방이 배급 창구 쪽지로 바뀌어 정문이 사택 창구가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 매수된 연기 쪽지를 공개하거나, 시험 일정을 전령로에 고정할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 0 | 무력 −5 | 물질 25 | 공동 20 | 원칙 0 | 공개 15 | 자격 55 | 분산 5 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 15 | 위험 20 | 과시 25 | 지속 −10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"소봉","type":"계약","to":"조우찬","basis":"조우찬의 가동 통지를 나르고"},{"from":"소봉","type":"계약","to":"서진아","basis":"서진아의 급수 잔량 공지를 같은 벽에 나란히 붙인다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"모복","type":"계약","to":"소봉","basis":"소봉의 전령 종이와 수위 막대를 같은 못에 꽂는다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0283', 'bcf5-ba74-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0283","name":"Bokdu","title":"Northern Track Scout","position":"Northern Track Scout","characterId":"K282","rank":"Employee","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Northern Seoul Track Surveying and Sighting Cross-Check","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#inmul-bokdu","detailRoute":"/people/person-0283","birthDate":"2090-05-22","birthday":"05-22","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k282-track-surveying","name":"Track surveying","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k282-priority","name":"Direct verification","description":"Bokdu separates surveyed tracks from unverified dotted lines and passes gate detour information. A blank track section is not proof of a successful detour.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: northern line surveyor. He left unsurveyed lines only as dotted lines and raised nothing onto the master plate with fewer than two independent sightings.","stress":"Fear. That a forged track map would be used as a defect train''s convoy route and the train would enter under the residential shells.","relationship":"Relations. Handed the north gate bypasses to Gwon Doha and moved field measurements onto Du Guk''s north gate chalkboard. Matched the track state to Jang Sehwa''s joint convoy hours.","effects":[]},{"id":"k282-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: northern line surveyor. He left unsurveyed lines only as dotted lines and raised nothing onto the master plate with fewer than two independent sightings.","stress":"Fear. That a forged track map would be used as a defect train''s convoy route and the train would enter under the residential shells.","relationship":"Relations. Handed the north gate bypasses to Gwon Doha and moved field measurements onto Du Guk''s north gate chalkboard. Matched the track state to Jang Sehwa''s joint convoy hours.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Bokdu separates surveyed tracks from unverified dotted lines and passes gate detour information. A blank track section is not proof of a successful detour.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bcf5-ba74-cc9c","name":"Bok Clan of Myeoncheon","crest":"clan-crests/bcf5-ba74-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":-15,"Force":-20,"Material":30,"Communal":20,"Principle":15,"Public":5,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":-10,"Display":15,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Northern Seoul Track Surveying and Sighting Cross-Check","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Employee","Title":"Northern Track Scout","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness −15 | Force −20 | Material 30 | Communal 20 | Principle 15 | Transparency 5 | Qualification 60 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 0 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −10 | Display 15 | Endurance 5 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up on waiting-hall duty. The post of northern track scout opened through a substitute shift for an unexcused absence.\n- Bokdu handles surveying and sighting cross-checks of the northern Seoul tracks in Yeoksam 1-dong. He refines Seongha Electronics maintenance sampling, weight, lot, survey, work-crew and accident-signature work into the Yeoksam 1-dong work-and-living area adjacent to Gangnam Station. The Yeoksam waiting-hall cargo handover is only a reference and does not fix actual factory equipment, warehouse monopolies or running trains. He hands the North Gate detour to Gwon Doha and transfers survey results onto Duguk''s North Gate stronghold blackboard. He matches Jang Sehwa''s Gangnam Station escort times with track conditions","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Northern Track Scout. Lines not surveyed are left only as dotted lines, and nothing goes onto the master plate with fewer than two independent sightings.","Anecdote":"The track map for the stretch where a train stopped from brake failure still had a one-block gap.","Relationships":"Hands the North Gate detour to Gwon Doha and transfers survey results onto Duguk''s North Gate stronghold blackboard. Matches Jang Sehwa''s Gangnam Station escort times with track conditions.","Ambition":"Bind the northern railway''s detours to the public master plate so that residence occupations or water-supply unrest cannot block the base''s shipments.","Fear":"That a forged track map will be used as the escort route for test wheelsets, bringing a defective train beneath the Gangnam Station residences.","Intervention":"Can survey the gap section together, or have the forged master plate destroyed at the Chairman''s Office."},"biography":"When he sees a closed tunnel, he heads there on foot first, and he despises drawing detours from rumor alone. If a flood mark is even a day old, he redraws the map.\n\n- Occupation: Northern Seoul Track Surveying and Sighting Cross-Check\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Northern Track Scout\n**Life.** Grew up on waiting-hall duty. The post of northern track scout opened through a substitute shift for an unexcused absence.\n- Bokdu handles surveying and sighting cross-checks of the northern Seoul tracks in Yeoksam 1-dong. He refines Seongha Electronics maintenance sampling, weight, lot, survey, work-crew and accident-signature work into the Yeoksam 1-dong work-and-living area adjacent to Gangnam Station. The Yeoksam waiting-hall cargo handover is only a reference and does not fix actual factory equipment, warehouse monopolies or running trains. He hands the North Gate detour to Gwon Doha and transfers survey results onto Duguk''s North Gate stronghold blackboard. He matches Jang Sehwa''s Gangnam Station escort times with track conditions\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Northern Track Scout. Lines not surveyed are left only as dotted lines, and nothing goes onto the master plate with fewer than two independent sightings.\n\n**Anecdote.** The track map for the stretch where a train stopped from brake failure still had a one-block gap.\n\n**Relationships.** Hands the North Gate detour to Gwon Doha and transfers survey results onto Duguk''s North Gate stronghold blackboard. Matches Jang Sehwa''s Gangnam Station escort times with track conditions.\n\n**Ambition.** Bind the northern railway''s detours to the public master plate so that residence occupations or water-supply unrest cannot block the base''s shipments.\n\n**Fear.** That a forged track map will be used as the escort route for test wheelsets, bringing a defective train beneath the Gangnam Station residences.\n\n**Intervention.** Can survey the gap section together, or have the forged master plate destroyed at the Chairman''s Office.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness −15 | Force −20 | Material 30 | Communal 20 | Principle 15 | Transparency 5 | Qualification 60 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −10 | Display 15 | Endurance 5 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0283","name":"복두","title":"북부 선로 탐사원","position":"북부 선로 탐사원","characterId":"K282","rank":"사원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"서울 북부 선로 실측·목격 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-복두","detailRoute":"/people/person-0283","birthDate":"2090-05-22","birthday":"05-22","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k282-track-surveying","name":"선로 실측","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k282-priority","name":"직접 확인","description":"복두는 실측 선과 미확인 점선을 구분해 북문 우회 정보를 넘긴다. 공백 선로의 발견은 우회 성공과 다르다.","behavior":"실측하지 않은 선은 점선으로만 남기고, 독립 목격이 둘 미만이면 원판에 올리지 않는다.","stress":"위조 선로도가 시험 차륜 호송로로 쓰여 결함 열차가 강남역 사택 아래로 들어가는 것.","relationship":"권도하에게 북문 우회로를 넘기고, 두국의 북문 거점 칠판에 실측을 옮긴다. 장세화의 강남역 호송 시각과 선로 상태를 맞춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k282-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 사원. 직함은 바깥 작업장 선로 탐사원. 실측하지 않은 선은 점선으로만 남기고, 독립 목격이 둘 미만이면 원판에 올리지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 위조 선로도가 시험 차륜 호송로로 쓰여 결함 열차가 강남역 사택 아래로 들어가는 것.","relationship":"관계. 권도하에게 북문 우회로를 넘기고, 두국의 북문 거점 칠판에 실측을 옮긴다. 장세화의 강남역 호송 시각과 선로 상태를 맞춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"복두는 실측 선과 미확인 점선을 구분해 북문 우회 정보를 넘긴다. 공백 선로의 발견은 우회 성공과 다르다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bcf5-ba74-cc9c","name":"면천 복씨","crest":"clan-crests/bcf5-ba74-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":-15,"무력":-20,"물질":30,"공동":20,"원칙":15,"공개":5,"자격":60,"분산":15,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-30,"위험":-10,"과시":15,"지속":5,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"서울 북부 선로 실측·목격 대조","소속":"Arc","품계":"사원","직함":"북부 선로 탐사원","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −20 | 물질 30 | 공동 20 | 원칙 15 | 공개 5 | 자격 60 | 분산 15 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −10 | 과시 15 | 지속 5 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 북부 선로 탐사원 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 복두는 역삼1동에서 서울 북부 선로 실측·목격 대조 업무를 맡는다. 성하전자 정비 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명 업무를 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권으로 정밀화한다. 역삼 대합실 화물 인계는 참고이며 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. 권도하에게 북문 우회로를 넘기고, 두국의 북문 거점 칠판에 실측을 옮긴다. 장세화의 강남역 호송 시각과 선로 상태를 맞춘다","관직":"품계 사원. 직함은 북부 선로 탐사원. 실측하지 않은 선은 점선으로만 남기고, 독립 목격이 둘 미만이면 원판에 올리지 않는다.","일화":"제동 불량 정차 구간의 선로도가 한 칸 공백으로 남아 있었다.","관계":"권도하에게 북문 우회로를 넘기고, 두국의 북문 거점 칠판에 실측을 옮긴다. 장세화의 강남역 호송 시각과 선로 상태를 맞춘다.","야망":"북부 철도의 우회로를 공개 원판에 묶어 사택 점거나 급수 불안이 기지 출고를 막지 못하게 한다.","공포":"위조 선로도가 시험 차륜 호송로로 쓰여 결함 열차가 강남역 사택 아래로 들어가는 것.","개입":"공백 구간을 함께 실측하거나, 위조 원판을 회장실에서 폐기할 수 있다."},"biography":"닫힌 터널을 보면 발부터 향하고, 소문만으로 우회로를 그리는 일을 경멸한다. 침수 자국이 하루만 낡아도 지도를 다시 그린다.\n\n- 생업: 서울 북부 선로 실측·목격 대조\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 사원\n- 직함: 북부 선로 탐사원\n**생애.** 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 북부 선로 탐사원 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 복두는 역삼1동에서 서울 북부 선로 실측·목격 대조 업무를 맡는다. 성하전자 정비 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명 업무를 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권으로 정밀화한다. 역삼 대합실 화물 인계는 참고이며 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. 권도하에게 북문 우회로를 넘기고, 두국의 북문 거점 칠판에 실측을 옮긴다. 장세화의 강남역 호송 시각과 선로 상태를 맞춘다\n\n**관직.** 품계 사원. 직함은 북부 선로 탐사원. 실측하지 않은 선은 점선으로만 남기고, 독립 목격이 둘 미만이면 원판에 올리지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 제동 불량 정차 구간의 선로도가 한 칸 공백으로 남아 있었다.\n\n**관계.** 권도하에게 북문 우회로를 넘기고, 두국의 북문 거점 칠판에 실측을 옮긴다. 장세화의 강남역 호송 시각과 선로 상태를 맞춘다.\n\n**야망.** 북부 철도의 우회로를 공개 원판에 묶어 사택 점거나 급수 불안이 기지 출고를 막지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 위조 선로도가 시험 차륜 호송로로 쓰여 결함 열차가 강남역 사택 아래로 들어가는 것.\n\n**개입.** 공백 구간을 함께 실측하거나, 위조 원판을 회장실에서 폐기할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −20 | 물질 30 | 공동 20 | 원칙 15 | 공개 5 | 자격 60 | 분산 15 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −10 | 과시 15 | 지속 5 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0284', 'ad6d-b2f4-c591', '{"id":"person-0284","name":"Gukdu","title":"Work Accident Recorder, Operations Aide to Jo Uchan","position":"Seongha Electronics Work Accident Recorder, Operations Aide to Jo Uchan","characterId":"K283","rank":"Employee","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Work Accident Signatures, Defective Sample Number Recording","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#inmul-gukdu","detailRoute":"/people/person-0284","birthDate":"2074-09-01","birthday":"09-01","age":52,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k283-accident-ledger-reconciliation","name":"Accident ledger reconciliation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k283-priority","name":"Signature accountability","description":"Gukdu locked the ledger over a lot mismatch. Strong accountability tracking coexists with rigidity toward unsigned incidents.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: work accident registrar, duty officer of Jo Woochan. He demanded the squad leader''s and the apprentice''s signatures together for every accident and wrote the defective specimen numbers on the same line.","stress":"Fear. That a defect log would be copied into residential election posters and the base would be seized by the logic of population.","relationship":"Relations. Moved the logs under Jo Woochan''s command and pasted Du Mo''s maintenance specimen numbers into the ledger. He did not lock I Hongwon''s public technology trial records.","effects":[]},{"id":"k283-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: work accident registrar, duty officer of Jo Woochan. He demanded the squad leader''s and the apprentice''s signatures together for every accident and wrote the defective specimen numbers on the same line.","stress":"Fear. That a defect log would be copied into residential election posters and the base would be seized by the logic of population.","relationship":"Relations. Moved the logs under Jo Woochan''s command and pasted Du Mo''s maintenance specimen numbers into the ledger. He did not lock I Hongwon''s public technology trial records.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Gukdu locked the ledger over a lot mismatch. Strong accountability tracking coexists with rigidity toward unsigned incidents.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ad6d-b2f4-c591","name":"Damyang Guk Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ad6d-b2f4-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":5,"Openness":-10,"Force":-15,"Material":35,"Communal":25,"Principle":30,"Public":10,"Eligibility":55,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":-30},"desire":{"Longing":-20,"Monopoly":-5,"Risk":-40,"Display":-45,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Work Accident Signatures, Defective Sample Number Recording","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Employee","Title":"Seongha Electronics Work Accident Recorder, Operations Aide to Jo Uchan","Values":"Authority 5 | Openness −10 | Force −15 | Material 35 | Communal 25 | Principle 30 | Transparency 10 | Qualification 55 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation −30","Desires":"Craving −20 | Monopoly −5 | Risk −40 | Display −45 | Endurance 30 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Seoul Station registry office. The post of Seongha Electronics Work Accident Recorder, Jo Uchan''s working-level deputy, opened when a line in the double ledger was deleted.\n- Duguk handles recording work accident signatures and defective sample numbers in Seocho 4-dong. He links the Gangnam Station headquarters and Chairman''s Office bulletin board with the waiting hall''s living-cargo handover, entry and exit, and duty as dong-level duty reference points. The North Gate is an access duty post for Gangnam Station and creates no rule over the northern region and no new fortress. Under Jo Uchan''s command he transfers the logs and attaches Dumo''s maintenance sample numbers to the ledger. He does not lock I Hongwon''s public succession trial records","Offices":"Rank: Staff. Title: Seongha Electronics Work Accident Recorder, Jo Uchan''s working-level deputy. He requires the signatures of both the foreman and the apprentice for each accident, and writes the defective sample number on the same line.","Anecdote":"When the lot number of a shaved bearing diverged from the log in just one section, he locked the ledger.","Relationships":"Moves the logs under Jo Uchan''s direction and attaches Dumo''s maintenance sample numbers to the ledger. Does not lock I Hongwon''s public succession test records.","Ambition":"He means to keep work records and accident accountability as the Chairman''s Office bulletin board''s only grounds for operating, cutting off rumors of an I clan succession with the logs.","Fear":"That defect logs will be copied into residence petition posters and the base seized under population logic.","Intervention":"He can expose the mismatched line, or delay the log lock by a day to prevent a riot."},"biography":"He remembers accident accountability down to the date and treats unsigned logs as if they never existed. He trusts handwriting under the wheels more than meetings.\n\n- Livelihood: Recording work accident signatures and defective sample numbers\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Staff\n- Title: Seongha Electronics Work Accident Recorder, Jo Uchan''s working-level deputy\n**Life.** Grew up at the Seoul Station registry office. The post of Seongha Electronics Work Accident Recorder, Jo Uchan''s working-level deputy, opened when a line in the double ledger was deleted.\n- Duguk handles recording work accident signatures and defective sample numbers in Seocho 4-dong. He links the Gangnam Station headquarters and Chairman''s Office bulletin board with the waiting hall''s living-cargo handover, entry and exit, and duty as dong-level duty reference points. The North Gate is an access duty post for Gangnam Station and creates no rule over the northern region and no new fortress. Under Jo Uchan''s command he transfers the logs and attaches Dumo''s maintenance sample numbers to the ledger. He does not lock I Hongwon''s public succession trial records\n\n**Office.** Rank: Staff. Title: Seongha Electronics Work Accident Recorder, Jo Uchan''s working-level deputy. He requires the signatures of both the foreman and the apprentice for each accident, and writes the defective sample number on the same line.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the lot number of a shaved bearing diverged from the log in just one section, he locked the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** Under Jo Uchan''s command he transfers the logs and attaches Dumo''s maintenance sample numbers to the ledger. He does not lock I Hongwon''s public succession trial records.\n\n**Ambition.** He means to keep work records and accident accountability as the Chairman''s Office bulletin board''s only grounds for operating, cutting off rumors of an I clan succession with the logs.\n\n**Fear.** That a defect log will be copied onto company-housing petition posters and the base will be occupied by the logic of population.\n\n**Intervention.** He can expose the mismatched line, or delay the log lock by a day to prevent a riot.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 5 | Openness −10 | Force −15 | Materiality 35 | Community 25 | Principle 30 | Publicity 10 | Credentials 55 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation −30\n- Desires: Yearning −20 | Monopoly −5 | Risk −40 | Display −45 | Persistence 30 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gukdu","type":"Command","to":"Jo U-chan","basis":"Moves the logs under Jo Uchan''s command"},{"from":"Gukdu","type":"Contract","to":"Dumo","basis":"Attach Dumo''s maintenance sample number to the ledger"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0284","name":"국두","title":"작업 사고 기록관, 조우찬의 실무 담당자","position":"성하전자 작업 사고 기록관, 조우찬의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K283","rank":"사원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"작업 사고 서명·불량 표본 번호 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-국두","detailRoute":"/people/person-0284","birthDate":"2074-09-01","birthday":"09-01","age":52,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k283-accident-ledger-reconciliation","name":"사고 원장 대조","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k283-priority","name":"서명의 책임","description":"국두는 로트와 일지의 어긋남에 원장을 잠갔다. 책임 추적은 강하지만 무서명 사건을 없던 일로 돌리는 경직성도 있다.","behavior":"사고 한 건에 반장과 도제의 서명을 함께 요구하고, 불량 표본 번호를 같은 줄에 적는다.","stress":"결함 일지가 사택 청원 벽보로 복사되어 기지가 인구 논리로 점거되는 것.","relationship":"조우찬의 지휘로 일지를 옮기고, 두모의 정비 표본 번호를 원장에 붙인다. 이홍원의 공개 승계 시험 기록을 잠그지 않는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k283-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 사원. 직함은 성하전자 작업 사고 기록관, 조우찬의 실무 담당자. 사고 한 건에 반장과 도제의 서명을 함께 요구하고, 불량 표본 번호를 같은 줄에 적는다.","stress":"공포. 결함 일지가 사택 청원 벽보로 복사되어 기지가 인구 논리로 점거되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 조우찬의 지휘로 일지를 옮기고, 두모의 정비 표본 번호를 원장에 붙인다. 이홍원의 공개 승계 시험 기록을 잠그지 않는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"국두는 로트와 일지의 어긋남에 원장을 잠갔다. 책임 추적은 강하지만 무서명 사건을 없던 일로 돌리는 경직성도 있다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ad6d-b2f4-c591","name":"담양 국씨","crest":"clan-crests/ad6d-b2f4-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":5,"개방":-10,"무력":-15,"물질":35,"공동":25,"원칙":30,"공개":10,"자격":55,"분산":10,"변혁":-30},"desire":{"갈망":-20,"독점":-5,"위험":-40,"과시":-45,"지속":30,"지향":"양성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"작업 사고 서명·불량 표본 번호 기록","소속":"Arc","품계":"사원","직함":"성하전자 작업 사고 기록관, 조우찬의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 5 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −15 | 물질 35 | 공동 25 | 원칙 30 | 공개 10 | 자격 55 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −30","욕망":"갈망 −20 | 독점 −5 | 위험 −40 | 과시 −45 | 지속 30 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 성하전자 작업 사고 기록관, 조우찬의 실무 담당자 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 국두는 서초4동에서 작업 사고 서명·불량 표본 번호 기록 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 본사·회장실 게시판과 대합실 생활 화물 인계·출입·당직을 동 수준 근무 기준점으로 연결한다. 북문은 강남역 접근 당직이며 북부 권역 지배·새 요새를 만들지 않는다. 조우찬의 지휘로 일지를 옮기고, 두모의 정비 표본 번호를 원장에 붙인다. 이홍원의 공개 승계 시험 기록을 잠그지 않는다","관직":"품계 사원. 직함은 성하전자 작업 사고 기록관, 조우찬의 실무 담당자. 사고 한 건에 반장과 도제의 서명을 함께 요구하고, 불량 표본 번호를 같은 줄에 적는다.","일화":"깎인 베어링의 로트 번호가 일지와 한 구간에서만 어긋나자 원장을 잠갔다.","관계":"조우찬의 지휘로 일지를 옮기고, 두모의 정비 표본 번호를 원장에 붙인다. 이홍원의 공개 승계 시험 기록을 잠그지 않는다.","야망":"작업 기록과 사고 책임을 회장실 게시판의 유일한 가동 근거로 남겨 이씨 가문 승계 소문을 일지로 끊는다.","공포":"결함 일지가 사택 청원 벽보로 복사되어 기지가 인구 논리로 점거되는 것.","개입":"어긋난 줄을 공개하거나, 일지 잠금을 하루 늦춰 폭동을 막을 수 있다."},"biography":"사고 책임을 날짜까지 기억하고, 서명 없는 일지를 없던 일로 돌린다. 회의보다 차륜 아래의 필적을 믿는다.\n\n- 생업: 작업 사고 서명·불량 표본 번호 기록\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 사원\n- 직함: 성하전자 작업 사고 기록관, 조우찬의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 성하전자 작업 사고 기록관, 조우찬의 실무 담당자 자리는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 국두는 서초4동에서 작업 사고 서명·불량 표본 번호 기록 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 본사·회장실 게시판과 대합실 생활 화물 인계·출입·당직을 동 수준 근무 기준점으로 연결한다. 북문은 강남역 접근 당직이며 북부 권역 지배·새 요새를 만들지 않는다. 조우찬의 지휘로 일지를 옮기고, 두모의 정비 표본 번호를 원장에 붙인다. 이홍원의 공개 승계 시험 기록을 잠그지 않는다\n\n**관직.** 품계 사원. 직함은 성하전자 작업 사고 기록관, 조우찬의 실무 담당자. 사고 한 건에 반장과 도제의 서명을 함께 요구하고, 불량 표본 번호를 같은 줄에 적는다.\n\n**일화.** 깎인 베어링의 로트 번호가 일지와 한 구간에서만 어긋나자 원장을 잠갔다.\n\n**관계.** 조우찬의 지휘로 일지를 옮기고, 두모의 정비 표본 번호를 원장에 붙인다. 이홍원의 공개 승계 시험 기록을 잠그지 않는다.\n\n**야망.** 작업 기록과 사고 책임을 회장실 게시판의 유일한 가동 근거로 남겨 이씨 가문 승계 소문을 일지로 끊는다.\n\n**공포.** 결함 일지가 사택 청원 벽보로 복사되어 기지가 인구 논리로 점거되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 어긋난 줄을 공개하거나, 일지 잠금을 하루 늦춰 폭동을 막을 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 5 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −15 | 물질 35 | 공동 25 | 원칙 30 | 공개 10 | 자격 55 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −30\n- 욕망: 갈망 −20 | 독점 −5 | 위험 −40 | 과시 −45 | 지속 30 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"국두","type":"지휘","to":"조우찬","basis":"조우찬의 지휘로 일지를 옮기고"},{"from":"국두","type":"계약","to":"두모","basis":"두모의 정비 표본 번호를 원장에 붙인다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0285', 'ac10-cc3d-c6d0', '{"id":"person-0285","name":"Gamdu","title":"Changdong Rail Depot Duty Chief","position":"Gangnam Station Residence Duty Chief","rank":"Employee","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Residence Duty Roster, Dispatch Time Posting","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"S11","stateName":"Seongha Group","detailRoute":"/people/person-0285","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}}}}', '{"id":"person-0285","name":"감두","title":"창동 차량기지 당직장","position":"강남역 사택 당직장","rank":"사원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"사택 당직·출고 시각 게시","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"S11","stateName":"성하그룹","detailRoute":"/people/person-0285","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}}}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0286', 'b450-b450-b989', '{"id":"person-0286","name":"Duguk","title":"Gangnam Station Northern Gate Escort Outpost Chief · Lord of Nowon District","position":"Gangnam Station Northern Gate Escort Outpost Chief · Lord of Nowon District","characterId":"K285","rank":"Lord","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Northern Gate Escort Personnel, Wheel Inspection Sheet Posting","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"geography:duchy:11350","stateName":"Nowon-gu","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#Person-Duguk","detailRoute":"/people/person-0286","birthDate":"2078-01-13","birthday":"01-13","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":5,"effective":5}},"skills":[{"id":"k285-escort-connection-coordination","name":"Escort connection coordination","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k285-priority","name":"Rejects toll demands","description":"Duguk coordinates patrol shifts and light escort connections. He firmly rejects toll demands, while the missing slot’s actual cargo remains unknown.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: north gate convoy outpost chief. He pasted the convoy personnel and the wheel check table on one chalkboard and recognized arms loading only with the Elder''s and the auditor''s stamps.","stress":"Fear. That the north gate would turn into a military convoy route and the rail cavalry would be absorbed into a residential militia.","relationship":"Relations. Received Gwon Doha''s north gate patrol at the outpost and split the rotations and torches with Yong Mo. Matched the link hours with Ha Seon''s light convoys.","effects":[]},{"id":"k285-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: north gate convoy outpost chief. He pasted the convoy personnel and the wheel check table on one chalkboard and recognized arms loading only with the Elder''s and the auditor''s stamps.","stress":"Fear. That the north gate would turn into a military convoy route and the rail cavalry would be absorbed into a residential militia.","relationship":"Relations. Received Gwon Doha''s north gate patrol at the outpost and split the rotations and torches with Yong Mo. Matched the link hours with Ha Seon''s light convoys.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Duguk coordinates patrol shifts and light escort connections. He firmly rejects toll demands, while the missing slot’s actual cargo remains unknown.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11350-S11","name":{"ko":"Nowon-gu Ducal Direct Holdings"},"holderPersonId":"K285","directLiegePersonId":"K144","stateId":"S11","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1135056000","name":"Wolgye 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1135057000","name":"Wolgye 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1135058000","name":"Wolgye 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1135059500","name":"Gongneung 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1135060000","name":"Gongneung 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1135061100","name":"Hagye 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1135061200","name":"Hagye 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1135061900","name":"Junggye-bon-dong"},{"id":"region:1135062100","name":"Junggye 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1135062400","name":"Junggye 4-dong"},{"id":"region:1135062500","name":"Junggye 2·3-dong"},{"id":"region:1135063000","name":"Sanggye 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1135064000","name":"Sanggye 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1135066500","name":"Sanggye 3·4-dong"},{"id":"region:1135067000","name":"Sanggye 5-dong"},{"id":"region:1135069500","name":"Sanggye 6·7-dong"},{"id":"region:1135070000","name":"Sanggye 8-dong"},{"id":"region:1135071000","name":"Sanggye 9-dong"},{"id":"region:1135072000","name":"Sanggye 10-dong"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11350-S11","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11350-S11","name":"Nowon-gu Duchy","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K285","basis":"Opening administrative scale group gu:11350(duchy) allocation · decisive candidate selection","stateId":"S11","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1135056000","region:1135057000","region:1135058000","region:1135059500","region:1135060000","region:1135061100","region:1135061200","region:1135061900","region:1135062100","region:1135062400","region:1135062500","region:1135063000","region:1135064000","region:1135066500","region:1135067000","region:1135069500","region:1135070000","region:1135071000","region:1135072000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s06","name":"The Government Kingdom","holderPersonId":"K144"}}],"clan":{"id":"b450-b450-b989","name":"Dureung Du Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b450-b450-b989.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":-10,"Force":0,"Material":35,"Communal":35,"Principle":15,"Public":10,"Eligibility":65,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":-20},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":25,"Risk":-10,"Display":5,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"None","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Northern Gate Escort Personnel, Wheel Inspection Sheet Posting","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Employee","Title":"Gangnam Station North Gate Escort Post Chief","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force 0 | Materiality 35 | Community 35 | Principle 15 | Publicity 10 | Credentials 65 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation −20","Desires":"Yearning 0 | Monopoly 25 | Risk −10 | Display 5 | Persistence −15 | Orientation None | Union None"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up on the Sinnae transfer duty. The post of Gangnam Station North Gate Escort Post Chief opened when he stopped an unticketed departing train.\n- Duguk handles posting the North Gate escort headcount and wheel inspection sheet in Seocho 4-dong. He links the Gangnam Station headquarters and Chairman''s Office bulletin board with the waiting hall''s living-cargo handover, entry and exit, and duty as dong-level duty reference points. The North Gate is an access duty post for Gangnam Station and creates no rule over the northern region and no new fortress. He receives Gwon Doha''s North Gate patrol at the post, and shares Yongmo''s shift changes and torches. He aligns connection times with Ha Se-on''s light escorts","Offices":"Rank: Staff. Title: Gangnam Station North Gate Escort Post Chief. He posts the escort headcount and the wheel inspection sheet on the same blackboard, and recognizes armed loading only with the seals of the Managing Director and the Auditor.","Anecdote":"When a faulty-brake stop threw the escort times off, one slot on the North Gate blackboard went empty.","Relationships":"He receives Gwon Doha''s North Gate patrol at the post, and shares Yongmo''s shift changes and torches. He aligns connection times with Ha Se-on''s light escorts.","Ambition":"He means to keep the North Gate as Gangnam Station''s northern escort post, so that Seongha Electronics trains can leave without any separate toll.","Fear":"That the North Gate will turn into a military escort route and the rail cavalry be absorbed into company-housing militias.","Intervention":"He can verify the actual cargo in the empty slot, or spread the toll-demand note out before the elders."},"biography":"He remembers the blank in the escort times as an insult, and sends down off the tracks any officer who offers a toll as a condition of passage. He sees a dispatch that skipped the brake inspection as the start of an accident.\n\n- Livelihood: Posting North Gate escort headcounts and wheel inspection sheets\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Staff\n- Title: Gangnam Station North Gate Escort Post Chief\n**Life.** Grew up on the Sinnae transfer duty. The post of Gangnam Station North Gate Escort Post Chief opened when he stopped an unticketed departing train.\n- Duguk handles posting the North Gate escort headcount and wheel inspection sheet in Seocho 4-dong. He links the Gangnam Station headquarters and Chairman''s Office bulletin board with the waiting hall''s living-cargo handover, entry and exit, and duty as dong-level duty reference points. The North Gate is an access duty post for Gangnam Station and creates no rule over the northern region and no new fortress. He receives Gwon Doha''s North Gate patrol at the post, and shares Yongmo''s shift changes and torches. He aligns connection times with Ha Se-on''s light escorts\n\n**Office.** Rank: Staff. Title: Gangnam Station North Gate Escort Post Chief. He posts the escort headcount and the wheel inspection sheet on the same blackboard, and recognizes armed loading only with the seals of the Managing Director and the Auditor.\n\n**Anecdote.** When a faulty-brake stop threw the escort times off, one slot on the North Gate blackboard went empty.\n\n**Relations.** He receives Gwon Doha''s North Gate patrol at the post, and shares Yongmo''s shift changes and torches. He aligns connection times with Ha Se-on''s light escorts.\n\n**Ambition.** He means to keep the North Gate as Gangnam Station''s northern escort post, so that Seongha Electronics trains can leave without any separate toll.\n\n**Fear.** That the North Gate will turn into a military escort route and the rail cavalry be absorbed into company-housing militias.\n\n**Intervention.** He can verify the actual cargo in the empty slot, or spread the toll-demand note out before the elders.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force 0 | Materiality 35 | Community 35 | Principle 15 | Publicity 10 | Credentials 65 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation −20\n- Desires: Yearning 0 | Monopoly 25 | Risk −10 | Display 5 | Persistence −15 | Orientation None | Union None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Duguk","type":"Contract","to":"Yongmo","basis":"Shares Yongmo''s shift rotations and torches"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0286","name":"두국","title":"강남역 북문 호송 거점장 · 노원구 영주","position":"강남역 북문 호송 거점장 · 노원구 영주","characterId":"K285","rank":"영주","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"북문 호송 인원·차륜 점검표 게시","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"geography:duchy:11350","stateName":"노원구","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-두국","detailRoute":"/people/person-0286","birthDate":"2078-01-13","birthday":"01-13","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":5,"effective":5}},"skills":[{"id":"k285-escort-connection-coordination","name":"호송 접속 조정","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k285-priority","name":"통행세 거부","description":"두국은 순찰 교대와 경량 호송 접속을 맞춘다. 통행세 요구를 거부하는 강경함이 있고 실제 빈 칸 화물은 미확인이다.","behavior":"호송 인원과 차륜 점검표를 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 무장 탑재는 상무와 감사의 날인만 인정한다.","stress":"북문이 군사 호송로로 바뀌어 궤도기병이 사택 민병으로 흡수되는 것.","relationship":"권도하의 북문 순찰을 거점에서 받고, 용모의 교대와 횃불을 나눈다. 하세온의 경량 호송과 접속 시각을 맞춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k285-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 북문 호송 거점장. 호송 인원과 차륜 점검표를 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 무장 탑재는 상무와 감사의 날인만 인정한다.","stress":"공포. 북문이 군사 호송로로 바뀌어 궤도기병이 사택 민병으로 흡수되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 권도하의 북문 순찰을 거점에서 받고, 용모의 교대와 횃불을 나눈다. 하세온의 경량 호송과 접속 시각을 맞춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"두국은 순찰 교대와 경량 호송 접속을 맞춘다. 통행세 요구를 거부하는 강경함이 있고 실제 빈 칸 화물은 미확인이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11350-S11","name":{"ko":"노원구 공작령 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K285","directLiegePersonId":"K144","stateId":"S11","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1135056000","name":"월계1동"},{"id":"region:1135057000","name":"월계2동"},{"id":"region:1135058000","name":"월계3동"},{"id":"region:1135059500","name":"공릉1동"},{"id":"region:1135060000","name":"공릉2동"},{"id":"region:1135061100","name":"하계1동"},{"id":"region:1135061200","name":"하계2동"},{"id":"region:1135061900","name":"중계본동"},{"id":"region:1135062100","name":"중계1동"},{"id":"region:1135062400","name":"중계4동"},{"id":"region:1135062500","name":"중계2·3동"},{"id":"region:1135063000","name":"상계1동"},{"id":"region:1135064000","name":"상계2동"},{"id":"region:1135066500","name":"상계3·4동"},{"id":"region:1135067000","name":"상계5동"},{"id":"region:1135069500","name":"상계6·7동"},{"id":"region:1135070000","name":"상계8동"},{"id":"region:1135071000","name":"상계9동"},{"id":"region:1135072000","name":"상계10동"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11350-S11","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11350-S11","name":"노원구 공작령","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K285","basis":"개막 행정 규모 그룹 gu:11350(duchy) 배분 · 결정적 후보 선정","stateId":"S11","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1135056000","region:1135057000","region:1135058000","region:1135059500","region:1135060000","region:1135061100","region:1135061200","region:1135061900","region:1135062100","region:1135062400","region:1135062500","region:1135063000","region:1135064000","region:1135066500","region:1135067000","region:1135069500","region:1135070000","region:1135071000","region:1135072000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s06","name":"정부 왕국","holderPersonId":"K144"}}],"clan":{"id":"b450-b450-b989","name":"두릉 두씨","crest":"clan-crests/b450-b450-b989.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":-10,"무력":0,"물질":35,"공동":35,"원칙":15,"공개":10,"자격":65,"분산":20,"변혁":-20},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":25,"위험":-10,"과시":5,"지속":-15,"지향":"무성향","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"북문 호송 인원·차륜 점검표 게시","소속":"정부","품계":"사원","직함":"강남역 북문 호송 거점장","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 0 | 물질 35 | 공동 35 | 원칙 15 | 공개 10 | 자격 65 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −20","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 25 | 위험 −10 | 과시 5 | 지속 −15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 강남역 북문 호송 거점장 자리는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 두국은 서초4동에서 북문 호송 인원·차륜 점검표 게시 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 본사·회장실 게시판과 대합실 생활 화물 인계·출입·당직을 동 수준 근무 기준점으로 연결한다. 북문은 강남역 접근 당직이며 북부 권역 지배·새 요새를 만들지 않는다. 권도하의 북문 순찰을 거점에서 받고, 용모의 교대와 횃불을 나눈다. 하세온의 경량 호송과 접속 시각을 맞춘다","관직":"품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 북문 호송 거점장. 호송 인원과 차륜 점검표를 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 무장 탑재는 상무와 감사의 날인만 인정한다.","일화":"제동 불량 정차로 호송 시각이 어긋나자 북문 칠판의 한 칸이 비었다.","관계":"권도하의 북문 순찰을 거점에서 받고, 용모의 교대와 횃불을 나눈다. 하세온의 경량 호송과 접속 시각을 맞춘다.","야망":"북문을 강남역 호송의 북문 거점으로 남겨 별도 통행세 없이 성하전자 열차가 나가게 한다.","공포":"북문이 군사 호송로로 바뀌어 궤도기병이 사택 민병으로 흡수되는 것.","개입":"빈 칸의 실제 화물을 확인하거나, 통행세 요구 쪽지를 원로 앞에 펼 수 있다."},"biography":"호송 시각의 빈칸을 모욕처럼 기억하고, 통행세를 통행 조건으로 내미는 장교를 선로에서 내려보낸다. 제동 점검을 건너뛴 출고를 사고의 시작으로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 북문 호송 인원·차륜 점검표 게시\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 사원\n- 직함: 강남역 북문 호송 거점장\n**생애.** 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 강남역 북문 호송 거점장 자리는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 두국은 서초4동에서 북문 호송 인원·차륜 점검표 게시 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 본사·회장실 게시판과 대합실 생활 화물 인계·출입·당직을 동 수준 근무 기준점으로 연결한다. 북문은 강남역 접근 당직이며 북부 권역 지배·새 요새를 만들지 않는다. 권도하의 북문 순찰을 거점에서 받고, 용모의 교대와 횃불을 나눈다. 하세온의 경량 호송과 접속 시각을 맞춘다\n\n**관직.** 품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 북문 호송 거점장. 호송 인원과 차륜 점검표를 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 무장 탑재는 상무와 감사의 날인만 인정한다.\n\n**일화.** 제동 불량 정차로 호송 시각이 어긋나자 북문 칠판의 한 칸이 비었다.\n\n**관계.** 권도하의 북문 순찰을 거점에서 받고, 용모의 교대와 횃불을 나눈다. 하세온의 경량 호송과 접속 시각을 맞춘다.\n\n**야망.** 북문을 강남역 호송의 북문 거점으로 남겨 별도 통행세 없이 성하전자 열차가 나가게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 북문이 군사 호송로로 바뀌어 궤도기병이 사택 민병으로 흡수되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 빈 칸의 실제 화물을 확인하거나, 통행세 요구 쪽지를 원로 앞에 펼 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 0 | 물질 35 | 공동 35 | 원칙 15 | 공개 10 | 자격 65 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −20\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 25 | 위험 −10 | 과시 5 | 지속 −15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"두국","type":"계약","to":"용모","basis":"용모의 교대와 횃불을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0287', 'baa8-d568-d3c9', '{"id":"person-0287","name":"Mobok","title":"Gangnam Station Residence Water Supply Outpost Chief, Operations Aide to Seo Jina · Lord of Seocho District","position":"Gangnam Station Residence Water Supply Outpost Chief, Operations Aide to Seo Jina · Lord of Seocho District","characterId":"K286","rank":"Lord","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Residence Water Level Verification, Valve Adjustment","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"geography:duchy:11650","stateName":"Seocho-gu","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#Person-Mobok","detailRoute":"/people/person-0287","birthDate":"2098-08-27","birthday":"08-27","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k286-level-and-valve-recording","name":"Level and valve recording","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k286-priority","name":"Actual water level first","description":"Mobok split the queue after a pressure notice without posting trial postponement, judging the notice alongside actual water levels.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: residential shell water-supply outpost chief, duty officer of Seo Jina. When the water-level rod touched the lowest graduation, he split the bucket queue in two and allowed the next open-close only after the handle''s paint dried.","stress":"Fear. That the outpost valve would be bound to the technology-trial schedule and the handle would come off with the paint before the residential kettles cooled.","relationship":"Relations. Under command to execute Seo Jina''s housing audit at the outpost handle, he hung So Bong''s courier paper and the water-level rod on the same nail. Moved Han Jaemok''s water-talk hours onto the rod from the shell side.","effects":[]},{"id":"k286-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: residential shell water-supply outpost chief, duty officer of Seo Jina. When the water-level rod touched the lowest graduation, he split the bucket queue in two and allowed the next open-close only after the handle''s paint dried.","stress":"Fear. That the outpost valve would be bound to the technology-trial schedule and the handle would come off with the paint before the residential kettles cooled.","relationship":"Relations. Under command to execute Seo Jina''s housing audit at the outpost handle, he hung So Bong''s courier paper and the water-level rod on the same nail. Moved Han Jaemok''s water-talk hours onto the rod from the shell side.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Mobok split the queue after a pressure notice without posting trial postponement, judging the notice alongside actual water levels.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11650-S11","name":{"ko":"Seocho-gu Seongha Group Ducal Demesne"},"holderPersonId":"K286","directLiegePersonId":"K144","stateId":"S11","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1165051000","name":"Seocho 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1165053000","name":"Seocho 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1165053100","name":"Seocho 4-dong"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11650-S11","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11650-S11","name":"Seocho-gu Seongha Group Duchy","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K286","basis":"Opening administrative-scale group gu:11650(duchy) allocation · deterministic candidate selection","stateId":"S11","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1165051000","region:1165053000","region:1165053100"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s06","name":"Arc Kingdom","holderPersonId":"K144"}}],"clan":{"id":"baa8-d568-d3c9","name":"Hampyeong Mo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/baa8-d568-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":-10,"Force":-15,"Material":25,"Communal":20,"Principle":0,"Public":0,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":-30},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":30,"Display":20,"Sustained":-20,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Residence Water Level Verification, Valve Adjustment","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Employee","Title":"Hub Chief of Gangnam Station Residence Water Supply, Seo Jina''s Working-Level Aide","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness −10 | Force −15 | Materialism 25 | Communality 20 | Principle 0 | Publicity 0 | Qualification 60 | Dispersion 15 | Transformation −30","Desires":"Craving 30 | Monopoly −10 | Risk 30 | Display 20 | Continuity −20 | Orientation Heterosexual | Union Monogamy"},"sections":{"Life":"Raised at the Yeongdeungpo water-purification watch. The post of Hub Chief of Gangnam Station Residence Water Supply, Seo Jina''s Working-Level Aide, opened through a valve signature on the Night of Turbid Water.\n- Mobok handles residence water-level checks and valve-opening/closing coordination in Seocho 2-dong. He proposes the Gangnam Station residence''s petition, remaining water supply, water level, and incident record duties as a work reference for the Seocho 2-dong living sphere. The existing audit, squad leader, and apprentice signature conditions are preserved, and personal residence or lodging ownership is not presumed. He takes direction from Seo Jina to enforce her residence audits at the hub handle, and pins Sobong''s courier paper and the water-level rod on the same nail. Han Jaemok''s water-negotiation times are transferred from the shell side onto the rod","Offices":"Rank: Staff Member. Title: Hub Chief of Gangnam Station Residence Water Supply, Seo Jina''s Working-Level Aide. When the water-level rod touches the lowest mark, he splits the bucket line in two, and permits the next opening or closing only after the handle paint has dried.","Anecdote":"When only the paper saying northern piping pressure had dropped arrived first, Mobok split the bucket line in two and did not write the succession-test postponement on the hub wall.","Relationships":"He takes command from Seo Jina''s company-housing audit, carried out at the post handle, and pins Sobong''s messenger paper and the level rod to the same nail. He moves Han Jaemok''s water negotiation times from the shell side onto the rod.","Ambition":"Turn the hub valve only at the same time as the Chairman''s Office posting, before the bucket line scatters.","Fear":"That the post valve will be tied to the succession trial schedule, and the handle pulled off, paint and all, before the company-housing kettles have gone cold.","Intervention":"Can obtain a replacement water-level rod to restore the line to one, or expose the hand that wiped away the handle paint and replace the hub chief."},"biography":"Reads the night water level by the length of the bucket line, and records any moment when the kettles run empty for technical reasons as the hub''s failure. A verbal message to shut the valve is not written on the handle paint.\n\n- Occupation: Residence water-level checks and valve-opening/closing coordination\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Staff Member\n- Title: Hub Chief of Gangnam Station Residence Water Supply, Seo Jina''s Working-Level Aide\n**Life.** Raised at the Yeongdeungpo water-purification watch. The post of Hub Chief of Gangnam Station Residence Water Supply, Seo Jina''s Working-Level Aide, opened through a valve signature on the Night of Turbid Water.\n- Mobok handles residence water-level checks and valve-opening/closing coordination in Seocho 2-dong. He proposes the Gangnam Station residence''s petition, remaining water supply, water level, and incident record duties as a work reference for the Seocho 2-dong living sphere. The existing audit, squad leader, and apprentice signature conditions are preserved, and personal residence or lodging ownership is not presumed. He takes direction from Seo Jina to enforce her residence audits at the hub handle, and pins Sobong''s courier paper and the water-level rod on the same nail. Han Jaemok''s water-negotiation times are transferred from the shell side onto the rod\n\n**Office.** Rank: Staff Member. Title: Hub Chief of Gangnam Station Residence Water Supply, Seo Jina''s Working-Level Aide. When the water-level rod touches the lowest mark, he splits the bucket line in two, and permits the next opening or closing only after the handle paint has dried.\n\n**Anecdote.** When only the paper saying northern piping pressure had dropped arrived first, Mobok split the bucket line in two and did not write the succession-test postponement on the hub wall.\n\n**Relations.** Takes direction from Seo Jina to enforce her residence audits at the hub handle, and pins Sobong''s courier paper and the water-level rod on the same nail. Han Jaemok''s water-negotiation times are transferred from the shell side onto the rod.\n\n**Ambition.** Turn the hub valve only at the same time as the Chairman''s Office posting, before the bucket line scatters.\n\n**Fear.** That the hub valve will be tied to the succession-test schedule, and the handle pulled off, paint and all, before the residence kettles go cold.\n\n**Intervention.** Can obtain a replacement water-level rod to restore the line to one, or expose the hand that wiped away the handle paint and replace the hub chief.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness −10 | Force −15 | Materialism 25 | Communality 20 | Principle 0 | Publicity 0 | Qualification 60 | Dispersion 15 | Transformation −30\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Monopoly −10 | Risk 30 | Display 20 | Continuity −20 | Orientation Heterosexual | Union Monogamy\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Mobok","type":"Command","to":"Seo Jin-a","basis":"Receiving orders to carry out Seo Jina''s housing audit at the base handle,"},{"from":"Mobok","type":"Contract","to":"Sobong","basis":"Pins Sobong''s courier slip and the water-level stick on the same nail."}],"incoming":[{"from":"Pyeong Chaewon","type":"Contract","to":"Mobok","basis":"Read Mobok''s water-level rod overlaid with kettle time"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0287","name":"모복","title":"강남역 사택 급수 거점장, 서진아의 실무 담당자 · 서초구 영주","position":"강남역 사택 급수 거점장, 서진아의 실무 담당자 · 서초구 영주","characterId":"K286","rank":"영주","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"사택 급수 수위 확인·개폐 조정","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"geography:duchy:11650","stateName":"서초구","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-모복","detailRoute":"/people/person-0287","birthDate":"2098-08-27","birthday":"08-27","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k286-level-and-valve-recording","name":"수위·밸브 기록","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k286-priority","name":"실제 수위 우선","description":"모복은 압력 저하 통지에 줄을 둘로 나누되 시험 연기를 적지 않았다. 통지와 실제 수위를 함께 읽는 현장 판단이다.","behavior":"수위 막대가 최저 눈금에 닿으면 양동 줄을 둘로 나누고, 핸들 페인트가 마른 뒤에만 다음 개폐를 허용한다.","stress":"거점 밸브가 승계 시험 일정에 묶여 사택 주전자가 식기 전에 핸들이 페인트째 빠지는 것.","relationship":"서진아의 사택 감사를 거점 핸들에서 집행하는 지휘를 받고, 소봉의 전령 종이와 수위 막대를 같은 못에 꽂는다. 한재목의 물 협상 시각을 쉘 쪽에서 막대에 옮긴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k286-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 사택 급수 거점장, 서진아의 실무 담당자. 수위 막대가 최저 눈금에 닿으면 양동 줄을 둘로 나누고, 핸들 페인트가 마른 뒤에만 다음 개폐를 허용한다.","stress":"공포. 거점 밸브가 승계 시험 일정에 묶여 사택 주전자가 식기 전에 핸들이 페인트째 빠지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 서진아의 사택 감사를 거점 핸들에서 집행하는 지휘를 받고, 소봉의 전령 종이와 수위 막대를 같은 못에 꽂는다. 한재목의 물 협상 시각을 쉘 쪽에서 막대에 옮긴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"모복은 압력 저하 통지에 줄을 둘로 나누되 시험 연기를 적지 않았다. 통지와 실제 수위를 함께 읽는 현장 판단이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11650-S11","name":{"ko":"서초구 성하그룹 공작령 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K286","directLiegePersonId":"K144","stateId":"S11","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1165051000","name":"서초1동"},{"id":"region:1165053000","name":"서초3동"},{"id":"region:1165053100","name":"서초4동"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11650-S11","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11650-S11","name":"서초구 성하그룹 공작령","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K286","basis":"개막 행정 규모 그룹 gu:11650(duchy) 배분 · 결정적 후보 선정","stateId":"S11","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1165051000","region:1165053000","region:1165053100"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s06","name":"Arc 왕국","holderPersonId":"K144"}}],"clan":{"id":"baa8-d568-d3c9","name":"함평 모씨","crest":"clan-crests/baa8-d568-d3c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":-10,"무력":-15,"물질":25,"공동":20,"원칙":0,"공개":0,"자격":60,"분산":15,"변혁":-30},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-10,"위험":30,"과시":20,"지속":-20,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"사택 급수 수위 확인·개폐 조정","소속":"Arc","품계":"사원","직함":"강남역 사택 급수 거점장, 서진아의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −15 | 물질 25 | 공동 20 | 원칙 0 | 공개 0 | 자격 60 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −30","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 −10 | 위험 30 | 과시 20 | 지속 −20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"영등포 정수 당직에서 자랐다. 강남역 사택 급수 거점장, 서진아의 실무 담당자 자리는 탁수 밤의 밸브 서명으로 열렸다.\n- 모복은 서초2동에서 사택 급수 수위 확인·개폐 조정 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 사택의 청원·급수 잔량·수위·사고 기록 업무를 서초2동 생활권 근무 참조로 제안한다. 기존 감사·반장·도제 서명 조건을 보존하고 개인 거주·숙소 소유는 추정하지 않는다. 서진아의 사택 감사를 거점 핸들에서 집행하는 지휘를 받고, 소봉의 전령 종이와 수위 막대를 같은 못에 꽂는다. 한재목의 물 협상 시각을 쉘 쪽에서 막대에 옮긴다","관직":"품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 사택 급수 거점장, 서진아의 실무 담당자. 수위 막대가 최저 눈금에 닿으면 양동 줄을 둘로 나누고, 핸들 페인트가 마른 뒤에만 다음 개폐를 허용한다.","일화":"북부 배관 압력이 떨어졌다는 종이만 먼저 도착하자 모복은 양동 줄을 둘로 나누고 승계 시험 연기를 거점 벽에는 적지 않았다.","관계":"서진아의 사택 감사를 거점 핸들에서 집행하는 지휘를 받고, 소봉의 전령 종이와 수위 막대를 같은 못에 꽂는다. 한재목의 물 협상 시각을 쉘 쪽에서 막대에 옮긴다.","야망":"양동 줄이 흩어지기 전에 거점 밸브를 회장실 게시와 같은 시각에만 돌린다.","공포":"거점 밸브가 승계 시험 일정에 묶여 사택 주전자가 식기 전에 핸들이 페인트째 빠지는 것.","개입":"대체 수위 막대를 구해 줄을 하나로 되돌리거나, 핸들 페인트를 지운 손을 밝혀 거점장을 교체할 수 있다."},"biography":"양동 줄의 길이로 밤 수위를 읽고, 기술 탓에 주전자가 비는 순간을 거점의 실패로 적는다. 구두로 밸브를 잠그라는 전갈은 핸들 페인트에 적지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 사택 급수 수위 확인·개폐 조정\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 사원\n- 직함: 강남역 사택 급수 거점장, 서진아의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 영등포 정수 당직에서 자랐다. 강남역 사택 급수 거점장, 서진아의 실무 담당자 자리는 탁수 밤의 밸브 서명으로 열렸다.\n- 모복은 서초2동에서 사택 급수 수위 확인·개폐 조정 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 사택의 청원·급수 잔량·수위·사고 기록 업무를 서초2동 생활권 근무 참조로 제안한다. 기존 감사·반장·도제 서명 조건을 보존하고 개인 거주·숙소 소유는 추정하지 않는다. 서진아의 사택 감사를 거점 핸들에서 집행하는 지휘를 받고, 소봉의 전령 종이와 수위 막대를 같은 못에 꽂는다. 한재목의 물 협상 시각을 쉘 쪽에서 막대에 옮긴다\n\n**관직.** 품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 사택 급수 거점장, 서진아의 실무 담당자. 수위 막대가 최저 눈금에 닿으면 양동 줄을 둘로 나누고, 핸들 페인트가 마른 뒤에만 다음 개폐를 허용한다.\n\n**일화.** 북부 배관 압력이 떨어졌다는 종이만 먼저 도착하자 모복은 양동 줄을 둘로 나누고 승계 시험 연기를 거점 벽에는 적지 않았다.\n\n**관계.** 서진아의 사택 감사를 거점 핸들에서 집행하는 지휘를 받고, 소봉의 전령 종이와 수위 막대를 같은 못에 꽂는다. 한재목의 물 협상 시각을 쉘 쪽에서 막대에 옮긴다.\n\n**야망.** 양동 줄이 흩어지기 전에 거점 밸브를 회장실 게시와 같은 시각에만 돌린다.\n\n**공포.** 거점 밸브가 승계 시험 일정에 묶여 사택 주전자가 식기 전에 핸들이 페인트째 빠지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 대체 수위 막대를 구해 줄을 하나로 되돌리거나, 핸들 페인트를 지운 손을 밝혀 거점장을 교체할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −15 | 물질 25 | 공동 20 | 원칙 0 | 공개 0 | 자격 60 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −30\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 −10 | 위험 30 | 과시 20 | 지속 −20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"모복","type":"지휘","to":"서진아","basis":"서진아의 주거 감사를 거점 핸들에서 집행하는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"모복","type":"계약","to":"소봉","basis":"소봉의 전령 종이와 수위 막대를 같은 못에 꽂는다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"평채원","type":"계약","to":"모복","basis":"모복의 수위 막대를 주전자 시간과 겹쳐 읽는다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0288', 'bd09-d558-c74c', '{"id":"person-0288","name":"Bongguk","title":"Steel Salvage Yard Outpost Chief, Operations Aide to Hwang Noeul","position":"Seongha Electronics Steel Salvage Yard Outpost Chief, Operations Aide to Hwang Noeul","characterId":"K287","rank":"Sangmu","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Steel Salvage Weight Disclosure, Dispatch Verification","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#inmul-bongguk","detailRoute":"/people/person-0288","birthDate":"2080-12-26","birthday":"12-26","age":46,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k287-lot-reconciliation","name":"Lot reconciliation","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k287-priority","name":"Fair weights","description":"Bongguk reconciles recovered lots with Moso’s invoices and reserves trial metal, but remains harsh toward concealment.","behavior":"Office. Rank: section chief. Title: steel salvage yard outpost chief, duty officer of Hwang Noeul. He put salvage tonnage on the public scales and blocked the release of any steel that had entered a house-only column before the seniority council''s ratification.","stress":"Fear. That a defective lot would leave the salvage yard into a munitions column and the civil trains would stop.","relationship":"Relations. Kept the scales under Hwang Noeul''s command and matched the lots with Mo So''s freight invoices. Put the steel for Jo Woochan''s trial wheels in the priority column.","effects":[]},{"id":"k287-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: section chief. Title: steel salvage yard outpost chief, duty officer of Hwang Noeul. He put salvage tonnage on the public scales and blocked the release of any steel that had entered a house-only column before the seniority council''s ratification.","stress":"Fear. That a defective lot would leave the salvage yard into a munitions column and the civil trains would stop.","relationship":"Relations. Kept the scales under Hwang Noeul''s command and matched the lots with Mo So''s freight invoices. Put the steel for Jo Woochan''s trial wheels in the priority column.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Bongguk reconciles recovered lots with Moso’s invoices and reserves trial metal, but remains harsh toward concealment.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11320-S11","name":{"ko":"Dobong-gu Ducal Direct Holdings"},"holderPersonId":"K287","directLiegePersonId":"K144","stateId":"S11","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1132051100","name":"Chang 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1132051200","name":"Chang 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1132051300","name":"Chang 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1132051400","name":"Chang 4-dong"},{"id":"region:1132051500","name":"Chang 5-dong"},{"id":"region:1132052100","name":"Dobong 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1132052200","name":"Dobong 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1132066000","name":"Ssangmun 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1132067000","name":"Ssangmun 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1132068000","name":"Ssangmun 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1132068100","name":"Ssangmun 4-dong"},{"id":"region:1132069000","name":"Banghak 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1132070000","name":"Banghak 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1132071000","name":"Banghak 3-dong"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11320-S11","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11320-S11","name":"Dobong-gu Duchy","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K287","basis":"Opening administrative-scale group gu:11320(duchy) allocation · deterministic candidate selection","stateId":"S11","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1132051100","region:1132051200","region:1132051300","region:1132051400","region:1132051500","region:1132052100","region:1132052200","region:1132066000","region:1132067000","region:1132068000","region:1132068100","region:1132069000","region:1132070000","region:1132071000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s06","name":"Arc Kingdom","holderPersonId":"K144"}}],"clan":{"id":"bd09-d558-c74c","name":"Haeum Bong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bd09-d558-c74c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":-10,"Force":-5,"Material":35,"Communal":30,"Principle":15,"Public":0,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":-5,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":30,"Display":-5,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Steel Salvage Weight Disclosure, Dispatch Verification","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Sangmu","Title":"Seongha Electronics Steel Salvage Yard Outpost Chief, Operations Aide to Hwang Noeul","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness −10 | Force −5 | Materialism 35 | Communality 30 | Principle 15 | Publicity 0 | Qualification 60 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving −5 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 30 | Display −5 | Continuity 30 | Orientation Heterosexual | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Raised at the waiting-hall watch. The post of Hub Chief of the Seongha Electronics Steel Recovery Yard, Hwang Noeul''s Working-Level Aide, opened through a substitute watch after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Bongguk handles disclosure of recovered-steel weights and shipment confirmation in Yeoksam 1-dong. He refines Seongha Electronics'' maintenance sample, weight, lot, field measurement, work crew, and incident signature duties into the Yeoksam 1-dong work-and-living sphere adjacent to Gangnam Station. The Yeoksam waiting-hall cargo handover is for reference only and does not fix actual factory equipment, warehouse monopoly, or running trains. He guards the scale under Hwang Noeul''s command and matches Moso''s logistics invoices to the lots. He places the steel for Jo Uchan''s test wheels in the priority compartment","Offices":"Rank: Managing Director. Title: Hub Chief of the Seongha Electronics Steel Recovery Yard, Hwang Noeul''s Working-Level Aide. Puts recovered weights on the public scale, and blocks steel that has entered the Lee clan''s exclusive compartment from shipping before Chairman''s Office approval.","Anecdote":"A weight record emerged at the recovery yard showing that steel from the same lot as the defective bearings had slipped toward the Yongsan warehouse.","Relationships":"Guards the scale under Hwang Noeul''s command and matches Moso''s logistics invoices to the lots. Places the steel for Jo Uchan''s test wheels in the priority compartment.","Ambition":"Keep the recovery yard as the entrance to Seongha Electronics'' standard inventory, so that the Lee clan''s exclusive compartment cannot hold the test steel hostage.","Fear":"That a defective lot will slip from the recovery yard into the munitions compartment and stop the civilian trains.","Intervention":"Can recover the steel lots, or halt the clan side''s shipments on the hub blackboard."},"biography":"Pragmatic, but harsh toward those who hide scrap metal. He regards cheating the scale as the same as shaving down the rails.\n\n- Occupation: Disclosure of recovered-steel weights and shipment confirmation\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Managing Director\n- Title: Hub Chief of the Seongha Electronics Steel Recovery Yard, Hwang Noeul''s Working-Level Aide\n**Life.** Raised at the waiting-hall watch. The post of Hub Chief of the Seongha Electronics Steel Recovery Yard, Hwang Noeul''s Working-Level Aide, opened through a substitute watch after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Bongguk handles disclosure of recovered-steel weights and shipment confirmation in Yeoksam 1-dong. He refines Seongha Electronics'' maintenance sample, weight, lot, field measurement, work crew, and incident signature duties into the Yeoksam 1-dong work-and-living sphere adjacent to Gangnam Station. The Yeoksam waiting-hall cargo handover is for reference only and does not fix actual factory equipment, warehouse monopoly, or running trains. He guards the scale under Hwang Noeul''s command and matches Moso''s logistics invoices to the lots. He places the steel for Jo Uchan''s test wheels in the priority compartment\n\n**Office.** Rank: Managing Director. Title: Hub Chief of the Seongha Electronics Steel Recovery Yard, Hwang Noeul''s Working-Level Aide. Puts recovered weights on the public scale, and blocks steel that has entered the Lee clan''s exclusive compartment from shipping before Chairman''s Office approval.\n\n**Anecdote.** A weight record emerged at the recovery yard showing that steel from the same lot as the defective bearings had slipped toward the Yongsan warehouse.\n\n**Relations.** Guards the scale under Hwang Noeul''s command and matches Moso''s logistics invoices to the lots. Places the steel for Jo Uchan''s test wheels in the priority compartment.\n\n**Ambition.** Keep the recovery yard as the entrance to Seongha Electronics'' standard inventory, so that the Lee clan''s exclusive compartment cannot hold the test steel hostage.\n\n**Fear.** That a defective lot will slip from the recovery yard into the munitions compartment and stop the civilian trains.\n\n**Intervention.** Can recover the steel lots, or halt the clan side''s shipments on the hub blackboard.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness −10 | Force −5 | Materialism 35 | Communality 30 | Principle 15 | Publicity 0 | Qualification 60 | Dispersion 5 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 30 | Display −5 | Continuity 30 | Orientation Heterosexual | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bongguk","type":"Command","to":"Hwang No-eul","basis":"Guarding the scale under Hwang Noeul''s command"},{"from":"Bongguk","type":"Contract","to":"Moso","basis":"Match lots to Moso''s logistics invoices"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Moso","type":"Contract","to":"Bongguk","basis":"Take over lots at Bongguk''s recovery yard"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0288","name":"봉국","title":"철재 회수장 거점장, 황노을의 실무 담당자","position":"성하전자 철재 회수장 거점장, 황노을의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K287","rank":"상무","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"철재 회수 중량 공개·출고 확인","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-봉국","detailRoute":"/people/person-0288","birthDate":"2080-12-26","birthday":"12-26","age":46,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k287-lot-reconciliation","name":"로트 대조","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k287-priority","name":"중량의 공정성","description":"봉국은 모소의 송장과 회수 로트를 맞추며 시험 철재를 지킨다. 은닉에 대한 가혹함도 남는다.","behavior":"회수 중량을 공개 저울에 올리고, 이씨 가문 전용 칸으로 들어간 철재는 회장실 인준 전 출고를 막는다.","stress":"결함 로트가 회수장에서 군수 칸으로 빠져 민생 열차가 멈추는 것.","relationship":"황노을의 지휘로 저울을 지키고, 모소의 물류 송장과 로트를 맞춘다. 조우찬의 시험 차륜에 쓸 철재를 우선 칸에 둔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k287-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 상무. 직함은 성하전자 철재 회수장 거점장, 황노을의 실무 담당자. 회수 중량을 공개 저울에 올리고, 이씨 가문 전용 칸으로 들어간 철재는 회장실 인준 전 출고를 막는다.","stress":"공포. 결함 로트가 회수장에서 군수 칸으로 빠져 민생 열차가 멈추는 것.","relationship":"관계. 황노을의 지휘로 저울을 지키고, 모소의 물류 송장과 로트를 맞춘다. 조우찬의 시험 차륜에 쓸 철재를 우선 칸에 둔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"봉국은 모소의 송장과 회수 로트를 맞추며 시험 철재를 지킨다. 은닉에 대한 가혹함도 남는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11320-S11","name":{"ko":"도봉구 공작령 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K287","directLiegePersonId":"K144","stateId":"S11","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1132051100","name":"창1동"},{"id":"region:1132051200","name":"창2동"},{"id":"region:1132051300","name":"창3동"},{"id":"region:1132051400","name":"창4동"},{"id":"region:1132051500","name":"창5동"},{"id":"region:1132052100","name":"도봉1동"},{"id":"region:1132052200","name":"도봉2동"},{"id":"region:1132066000","name":"쌍문1동"},{"id":"region:1132067000","name":"쌍문2동"},{"id":"region:1132068000","name":"쌍문3동"},{"id":"region:1132068100","name":"쌍문4동"},{"id":"region:1132069000","name":"방학1동"},{"id":"region:1132070000","name":"방학2동"},{"id":"region:1132071000","name":"방학3동"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11320-S11","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11320-S11","name":"도봉구 공작령","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K287","basis":"개막 행정 규모 그룹 gu:11320(duchy) 배분 · 결정적 후보 선정","stateId":"S11","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1132051100","region:1132051200","region:1132051300","region:1132051400","region:1132051500","region:1132052100","region:1132052200","region:1132066000","region:1132067000","region:1132068000","region:1132068100","region:1132069000","region:1132070000","region:1132071000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s06","name":"Arc 왕국","holderPersonId":"K144"}}],"clan":{"id":"bd09-d558-c74c","name":"하음 봉씨","crest":"clan-crests/bd09-d558-c74c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":-10,"무력":-5,"물질":35,"공동":30,"원칙":15,"공개":0,"자격":60,"분산":5,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":10,"위험":30,"과시":-5,"지속":30,"지향":"이성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"철재 회수 중량 공개·출고 확인","소속":"Arc","품계":"상무","직함":"성하전자 철재 회수장 거점장, 황노을의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −5 | 물질 35 | 공동 30 | 원칙 15 | 공개 0 | 자격 60 | 분산 5 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 −5 | 독점 10 | 위험 30 | 과시 −5 | 지속 30 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 성하전자 철재 회수장 거점장, 황노을의 실무 담당자 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 봉국은 역삼1동에서 철재 회수 중량 공개·출고 확인 업무를 맡는다. 성하전자 정비 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명 업무를 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권으로 정밀화한다. 역삼 대합실 화물 인계는 참고이며 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. 황노을의 지휘로 저울을 지키고, 모소의 물류 송장과 로트를 맞춘다. 조우찬의 시험 차륜에 쓸 철재를 우선 칸에 둔다","관직":"품계 상무. 직함은 성하전자 철재 회수장 거점장, 황노을의 실무 담당자. 회수 중량을 공개 저울에 올리고, 이씨 가문 전용 칸으로 들어간 철재는 회장실 인준 전 출고를 막는다.","일화":"결함 베어링과 같은 로트의 철재가 용산 창고 쪽으로 빠졌다는 중량 기록이 회수장에서 나왔다.","관계":"황노을의 지휘로 저울을 지키고, 모소의 물류 송장과 로트를 맞춘다. 조우찬의 시험 차륜에 쓸 철재를 우선 칸에 둔다.","야망":"회수장을 성하전자 표준 재고의 입구로 남겨 이씨 가문 전용 칸이 시험 철재를 볼모로 잡지 못하게 한다.","공포":"결함 로트가 회수장에서 군수 칸으로 빠져 민생 열차가 멈추는 것.","개입":"철재 로트를 회수하거나, 가문 쪽 출고를 거점 칠판에서 정지시킬 수 있다."},"biography":"실리적이나 고철을 숨기는 사람을 가혹하게 다룬다. 저울을 속이는 일을 선로를 깎는 일과 같다고 본다.\n\n- 생업: 철재 회수 중량 공개·출고 확인\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 상무\n- 직함: 성하전자 철재 회수장 거점장, 황노을의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 성하전자 철재 회수장 거점장, 황노을의 실무 담당자 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 봉국은 역삼1동에서 철재 회수 중량 공개·출고 확인 업무를 맡는다. 성하전자 정비 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명 업무를 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권으로 정밀화한다. 역삼 대합실 화물 인계는 참고이며 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. 황노을의 지휘로 저울을 지키고, 모소의 물류 송장과 로트를 맞춘다. 조우찬의 시험 차륜에 쓸 철재를 우선 칸에 둔다\n\n**관직.** 품계 상무. 직함은 성하전자 철재 회수장 거점장, 황노을의 실무 담당자. 회수 중량을 공개 저울에 올리고, 이씨 가문 전용 칸으로 들어간 철재는 회장실 인준 전 출고를 막는다.\n\n**일화.** 결함 베어링과 같은 로트의 철재가 용산 창고 쪽으로 빠졌다는 중량 기록이 회수장에서 나왔다.\n\n**관계.** 황노을의 지휘로 저울을 지키고, 모소의 물류 송장과 로트를 맞춘다. 조우찬의 시험 차륜에 쓸 철재를 우선 칸에 둔다.\n\n**야망.** 회수장을 성하전자 표준 재고의 입구로 남겨 이씨 가문 전용 칸이 시험 철재를 볼모로 잡지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 결함 로트가 회수장에서 군수 칸으로 빠져 민생 열차가 멈추는 것.\n\n**개입.** 철재 로트를 회수하거나, 가문 쪽 출고를 거점 칠판에서 정지시킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −5 | 물질 35 | 공동 30 | 원칙 15 | 공개 0 | 자격 60 | 분산 5 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 −5 | 독점 10 | 위험 30 | 과시 −5 | 지속 30 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"봉국","type":"지휘","to":"황노을","basis":"황노을의 지휘로 저울을 지키고"},{"from":"봉국","type":"계약","to":"모소","basis":"모소의 물류 송장과 로트를 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"모소","type":"계약","to":"봉국","basis":"봉국의 회수장에서 로트를 인수한다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0289', 'c6a9-d64d-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0289","name":"Yongdubong","title":"Rail Cavalry Maintenance Yard Outpost Chief","position":"Gangnam Station Rail Cavalry Maintenance Yard Outpost Chief","characterId":"K288","rank":"Sangmu","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Rail Cavalry Pre-Sortie Maintenance, Armament Loading Verification","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#inmul-yongdubong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0289","birthDate":"2097-10-19","birthday":"10-19","age":29,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k288-predeparture-inspection","name":"Predeparture inspection","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k288-priority","name":"Inspection first","description":"Yongdubong connects departure lists and wheel samples to the maintenance queue, treating brake defects and unauthorized armament as approval problems.","behavior":"Office. Rank: section chief. Title: rail cavalry repair shop outpost chief. He made the pre-sortie inspection mandatory and allowed arms loading only with the joint stamp of the Elder and the auditor.","stress":"Fear. That one car with bad brakes would go out under the repair shop''s signature and the whole north gate convoy would stop.","relationship":"Relations. Received Gwon Doha''s sortie lists at the repair shop and used Du Mo''s wheel specimens in the cavalry cars. Repaired Yong Mo''s north gate patrol cars first only.","effects":[]},{"id":"k288-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: section chief. Title: rail cavalry repair shop outpost chief. He made the pre-sortie inspection mandatory and allowed arms loading only with the joint stamp of the Elder and the auditor.","stress":"Fear. That one car with bad brakes would go out under the repair shop''s signature and the whole north gate convoy would stop.","relationship":"Relations. Received Gwon Doha''s sortie lists at the repair shop and used Du Mo''s wheel specimens in the cavalry cars. Repaired Yong Mo''s north gate patrol cars first only.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Yongdubong connects departure lists and wheel samples to the maintenance queue, treating brake defects and unauthorized armament as approval problems.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c6a9-d64d-cc9c","name":"Yong Clan of Hongcheon","crest":"clan-crests/c6a9-d64d-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":30,"Openness":-30,"Force":20,"Material":35,"Communal":20,"Principle":10,"Public":0,"Eligibility":75,"Dispersed":0,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":35,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":-30,"Display":5,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Rail Cavalry Pre-Sortie Maintenance, Armament Loading Verification","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Sangmu","Title":"Gangnam Station Rail Cavalry Maintenance Yard Outpost Chief","Values":"Authority 30 | Openness −30 | Force 20 | Material 35 | Communal 20 | Principle 10 | Publicity 0 | Credentials 75 | Dispersal 0 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 35 | Possessiveness 30 | Risk −30 | Display 5 | Endurance 30 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Bonding: Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"He grew up at the Gangnam Station rail depot. The post of Gangnam Station Rail Cavalry Maintenance Depot Post Chief opened up after a defect report just before a derailment.\n- Yong Dubong handles pre-sortie maintenance and armament loading checks for the rail cavalry in Seocho 4-dong. He links the Gangnam Station headquarters and Chairman''s Office notice board, together with concourse daily-life cargo handover, access, and duty, as dong-level work reference points. North Gate is an access duty post for Gangnam Station and does not establish control over the northern district or a new fortress. He receives Gwon Doha''s sortie roster at the maintenance depot and uses Dumo''s wheel samples in the cavalry compartments. He repairs only Yongmo''s North Gate patrol cars first","Offices":"Rank: Managing Director. Title: Gangnam Station Rail Cavalry Maintenance Depot Post Chief. Pre-sortie inspections are made mandatory, and armament loading is permitted only with the joint seal of the Managing Director and the auditor.","Anecdote":"Right after the test wheel defect, brakes from the same lot were still left in the maintenance depot queue.","Relationships":"He receives Gwon Doha''s sortie roster at the maintenance depot and uses Dumo''s wheel samples in the cavalry compartments. He repairs only Yongmo''s North Gate patrol cars first.","Ambition":"He keeps the rail cavalry maintenance depot as the depot''s own specialist function, so that the company-housing militia cannot pick up tools and build a barracks.","Fear":"A single defective brake leaving on a maintenance depot signature and halting the entire North Gate convoy.","Intervention":"He can swap out queued brakes on site, or enter unauthorized armament in the maintenance depot ledger."},"biography":"He turns any cavalryman who has not examined the wheels before sortie away to an empty compartment, and records armament loading without skill as an accident. He regards the maintenance depot''s silence as part of the battle.\n\n- Livelihood: Pre-sortie maintenance and armament loading checks for the rail cavalry\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Managing Director\n- Title: Gangnam Station Rail Cavalry Maintenance Depot Post Chief\n**Life.** He grew up at the Gangnam Station rail depot. The post of Gangnam Station Rail Cavalry Maintenance Depot Post Chief opened up after a defect report just before a derailment.\n- Yong Dubong handles pre-sortie maintenance and armament loading checks for the rail cavalry in Seocho 4-dong. He links the Gangnam Station headquarters and Chairman''s Office notice board, together with concourse daily-life cargo handover, access, and duty, as dong-level work reference points. North Gate is an access duty post for Gangnam Station and does not establish control over the northern district or a new fortress. He receives Gwon Doha''s sortie roster at the maintenance depot and uses Dumo''s wheel samples in the cavalry compartments. He repairs only Yongmo''s North Gate patrol cars first\n\n**Office.** Rank: Managing Director. Title: Gangnam Station Rail Cavalry Maintenance Depot Post Chief. Pre-sortie inspections are made mandatory, and armament loading is permitted only with the joint seal of the Managing Director and the auditor.\n\n**Anecdote.** Right after the test wheel defect, brakes from the same lot were still left in the maintenance depot queue.\n\n**Relations.** He receives Gwon Doha''s sortie roster at the maintenance depot and uses Dumo''s wheel samples in the cavalry compartments. He repairs only Yongmo''s North Gate patrol cars first.\n\n**Ambition.** He keeps the rail cavalry maintenance depot as the depot''s own specialist function, so that the company-housing militia cannot pick up tools and build a barracks.\n\n**Fear.** A single defective brake leaving on a maintenance depot signature and halting the entire North Gate convoy.\n\n**Intervention.** He can swap out queued brakes on site, or enter unauthorized armament in the maintenance depot ledger.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 30 | Openness −30 | Force 20 | Material 35 | Communal 20 | Principle 10 | Publicity 0 | Credentials 75 | Dispersal 0 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 35 | Possessiveness 30 | Risk −30 | Display 5 | Endurance 30 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Bonding: Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yongdubong","type":"Contract","to":"Gwon Do-ha","basis":"Receiving Gwon Doha''s sortie list at the maintenance bay, and"},{"from":"Yongdubong","type":"Contract","to":"Dumo","basis":"Use Dumo''s wheel sample in the cavalry car"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0289","name":"용두봉","title":"궤도기병 정비창 거점장","position":"강남역 궤도기병 정비창 거점장","characterId":"K288","rank":"상무","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"궤도기병 출격 전 정비·무장 탑재 확인","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-용두봉","detailRoute":"/people/person-0289","birthDate":"2097-10-19","birthday":"10-19","age":29,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k288-predeparture-inspection","name":"출격 전 점검","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k288-priority","name":"점검을 앞세움","description":"용두봉은 출격 목록과 차륜 표본을 정비 대기열에 연결한다. 제동 불량과 무단 무장을 같은 승인 문제로 본다.","behavior":"출격 전 점검을 의무화하고, 무장 탑재는 상무와 감사의 공동 날인만 허용한다.","stress":"제동 불량 한 대가 정비창 서명으로 나가 북문 호송 전체가 멈추는 것.","relationship":"권도하의 출격 목록을 정비창에서 받고, 두모의 차륜 표본을 기병 칸에 쓴다. 용모의 북문 순찰차만 우선 고친다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k288-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 상무. 직함은 강남역 궤도기병 정비창 거점장. 출격 전 점검을 의무화하고, 무장 탑재는 상무와 감사의 공동 날인만 허용한다.","stress":"공포. 제동 불량 한 대가 정비창 서명으로 나가 북문 호송 전체가 멈추는 것.","relationship":"관계. 권도하의 출격 목록을 정비창에서 받고, 두모의 차륜 표본을 기병 칸에 쓴다. 용모의 북문 순찰차만 우선 고친다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"용두봉은 출격 목록과 차륜 표본을 정비 대기열에 연결한다. 제동 불량과 무단 무장을 같은 승인 문제로 본다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c6a9-d64d-cc9c","name":"홍천 용씨","crest":"clan-crests/c6a9-d64d-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":30,"개방":-30,"무력":20,"물질":35,"공동":20,"원칙":10,"공개":0,"자격":75,"분산":0,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":35,"독점":30,"위험":-30,"과시":5,"지속":30,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"궤도기병 출격 전 정비·무장 탑재 확인","소속":"Arc","품계":"상무","직함":"강남역 궤도기병 정비창 거점장","가치관":"권위 30 | 개방 −30 | 무력 20 | 물질 35 | 공동 20 | 원칙 10 | 공개 0 | 자격 75 | 분산 0 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 35 | 독점 30 | 위험 −30 | 과시 5 | 지속 30 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 강남역 궤도기병 정비창 거점장 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 용두봉은 서초4동에서 궤도기병 출격 전 정비·무장 탑재 확인 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 본사·회장실 게시판과 대합실 생활 화물 인계·출입·당직을 동 수준 근무 기준점으로 연결한다. 북문은 강남역 접근 당직이며 북부 권역 지배·새 요새를 만들지 않는다. 권도하의 출격 목록을 정비창에서 받고, 두모의 차륜 표본을 기병 칸에 쓴다. 용모의 북문 순찰차만 우선 고친다","관직":"품계 상무. 직함은 강남역 궤도기병 정비창 거점장. 출격 전 점검을 의무화하고, 무장 탑재는 상무와 감사의 공동 날인만 허용한다.","일화":"시험 차륜 결함 직후 같은 로트의 제동이 정비창 대기열에 남아 있었다.","관계":"권도하의 출격 목록을 정비창에서 받고, 두모의 차륜 표본을 기병 칸에 쓴다. 용모의 북문 순찰차만 우선 고친다.","야망":"궤도기병 정비창을 기지 고유 직능으로 남겨 사택 민병이 공구를 집어 병영을 만들지 못하게 한다.","공포":"제동 불량 한 대가 정비창 서명으로 나가 북문 호송 전체가 멈추는 것.","개입":"대기열 제동을 현장에서 갈아 끼우거나, 무단 무장을 정비창 원장에 올릴 수 있다."},"biography":"출격 전 차륜을 보지 않은 기병을 빈 칸으로 돌리고, 숙련 없는 무장 탑재를 사고로 기록한다. 정비창의 침묵을 전투의 일부로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 궤도기병 출격 전 정비·무장 탑재 확인\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 상무\n- 직함: 강남역 궤도기병 정비창 거점장\n**생애.** 강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 강남역 궤도기병 정비창 거점장 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 용두봉은 서초4동에서 궤도기병 출격 전 정비·무장 탑재 확인 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 본사·회장실 게시판과 대합실 생활 화물 인계·출입·당직을 동 수준 근무 기준점으로 연결한다. 북문은 강남역 접근 당직이며 북부 권역 지배·새 요새를 만들지 않는다. 권도하의 출격 목록을 정비창에서 받고, 두모의 차륜 표본을 기병 칸에 쓴다. 용모의 북문 순찰차만 우선 고친다\n\n**관직.** 품계 상무. 직함은 강남역 궤도기병 정비창 거점장. 출격 전 점검을 의무화하고, 무장 탑재는 상무와 감사의 공동 날인만 허용한다.\n\n**일화.** 시험 차륜 결함 직후 같은 로트의 제동이 정비창 대기열에 남아 있었다.\n\n**관계.** 권도하의 출격 목록을 정비창에서 받고, 두모의 차륜 표본을 기병 칸에 쓴다. 용모의 북문 순찰차만 우선 고친다.\n\n**야망.** 궤도기병 정비창을 기지 고유 직능으로 남겨 사택 민병이 공구를 집어 병영을 만들지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 제동 불량 한 대가 정비창 서명으로 나가 북문 호송 전체가 멈추는 것.\n\n**개입.** 대기열 제동을 현장에서 갈아 끼우거나, 무단 무장을 정비창 원장에 올릴 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 30 | 개방 −30 | 무력 20 | 물질 35 | 공동 20 | 원칙 10 | 공개 0 | 자격 75 | 분산 0 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 35 | 독점 30 | 위험 −30 | 과시 5 | 지속 30 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"용두봉","type":"계약","to":"권도하","basis":"권도하의 출격 목록을 정비창에서 받고"},{"from":"용두봉","type":"계약","to":"두모","basis":"두모의 차륜 표본을 기병 칸에 쓴다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0290', 'cd94-cd94-acc4', '{"id":"person-0290","name":"Chu Jihun","title":"Wheel Maintenance Defect Whistleblower","position":"Seongha Electronics Wheel Maintenance Defect Whistleblower","characterId":"K289","rank":"Employee","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Wheel Maintenance Log, Defective Part Sample Disclosure","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#character-Chujihun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0290","birthDate":"2105-10-20","birthday":"10-20","age":21,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k289-defect-lot-documentation","name":"Defect lot documentation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k289-priority","name":"Public defect disclosure","description":"Chu Jihun exposed manipulation by hanging a shaved bearing from the same lot at the gate, while fearing disclosure could justify occupation.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: wheel maintenance defect whistleblower. He pasted the maintenance logs directly on the Elder''s board and cut defective parts out as specimens.","stress":"Fear. That the exposure signature would be copied into residential election posters and the base would be seized by the logic of population.","relationship":"Relations. Took Song Hayul''s apprentice routine as exposure grounds, did not lock I Hongwon''s public technology trial records, and matched numbers with Ran Hayul''s Yongsan transshipment lots.","effects":[]},{"id":"k289-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: wheel maintenance defect whistleblower. He pasted the maintenance logs directly on the Elder''s board and cut defective parts out as specimens.","stress":"Fear. That the exposure signature would be copied into residential election posters and the base would be seized by the logic of population.","relationship":"Relations. Took Song Hayul''s apprentice routine as exposure grounds, did not lock I Hongwon''s public technology trial records, and matched numbers with Ran Hayul''s Yongsan transshipment lots.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Chu Jihun exposed manipulation by hanging a shaved bearing from the same lot at the gate, while fearing disclosure could justify occupation.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cd94-cd94-acc4","name":"Chugye Chu Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cd94-cd94-acc4.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":-10,"Force":-5,"Material":30,"Communal":25,"Principle":0,"Public":5,"Eligibility":85,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":-30},"desire":{"Longing":35,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":-30,"Display":20,"Sustained":25,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Wheel Maintenance Log, Defective Part Sample Disclosure","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Employee","Title":"Seongha Electronics Wheel Maintenance Defect Whistleblower","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness −10 | Force −5 | Material 30 | Communal 25 | Principle 0 | Publicity 5 | Credentials 85 | Dispersal 5 | Transformation −30","Desires":"Craving 35 | Possessiveness 10 | Risk −30 | Display 20 | Endurance 25 | Orientation: None | Bonding: Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"He grew up at the Gangnam Station rail depot. The post of Seongha Electronics Wheel Maintenance Defect Whistleblower opened up after a defect report just before a derailment.\n- Chu Jihun handles the disclosure of wheel maintenance logs and defective part samples in Yeoksam 1-dong. He refines Seongha Electronics maintenance samples, weights, lots, measurements, work crews, and accident signatures into the work-life zone of Yeoksam 1-dong, adjacent to Gangnam Station. Cargo handover at the Yeoksam concourse is for reference and does not fix actual factory equipment, warehouse monopolies, or running trains. He accepts Song Hayul''s apprentice daily routine as grounds for the exposure, does not lock away I Hongwon''s public succession exam records, and matches numbers with Ran Hayul''s Yongsan transshipment lot","Offices":"Rank: Staff Member. Title: Seongha Electronics Wheel Maintenance Defect Whistleblower. He posts maintenance logs directly on the Chairman''s Office notice board and cuts defective parts to keep as samples.","Anecdote":"When the winter''s black dispatch sheet revealed the tampering with parts for the northern succession trial, Chu Jihun exposed it by hanging a shaved bearing from the same lot at the depot''s main gate.","Relationships":"He accepts Song Hayul''s apprentice daily routine as grounds for the exposure, does not lock away I Hongwon''s public succession exam records, and matches numbers with Ran Hayul''s Yongsan transshipment lot.","Ambition":"He posts the shaved bearing and the defective brake on the Chairman''s Office notice board as the only operative evidence, cutting off rumors of the I clan succession with logs.","Fear":"That the whistleblowing signatures are copied onto company-housing petition posters and the depot is occupied on the logic of population.","Intervention":"He can trace the origin marks on defective parts, or delay the exposure by a day to prevent the company-housing occupation."},"biography":"He regards pilfering others'' tools as the same crime as cheating on an exam, and cannot tolerate a foreman who hands over defect samples without cutting them. His hands are quick and his words few.\n\n- Livelihood: Disclosure of wheel maintenance logs and defective part samples\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Staff Member\n- Title: Seongha Electronics Wheel Maintenance Defect Whistleblower\n**Life.** He grew up at the Gangnam Station rail depot. The post of Seongha Electronics Wheel Maintenance Defect Whistleblower opened up after a defect report just before a derailment.\n- Chu Jihun handles the disclosure of wheel maintenance logs and defective part samples in Yeoksam 1-dong. He refines Seongha Electronics maintenance samples, weights, lots, measurements, work crews, and accident signatures into the work-life zone of Yeoksam 1-dong, adjacent to Gangnam Station. Cargo handover at the Yeoksam concourse is for reference and does not fix actual factory equipment, warehouse monopolies, or running trains. He accepts Song Hayul''s apprentice daily routine as grounds for the exposure, does not lock away I Hongwon''s public succession exam records, and matches numbers with Ran Hayul''s Yongsan transshipment lot\n\n**Office.** Rank: Staff Member. Title: Seongha Electronics Wheel Maintenance Defect Whistleblower. He posts maintenance logs directly on the Chairman''s Office notice board and cuts defective parts to keep as samples.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the winter''s black dispatch sheet revealed the tampering with parts for the northern succession trial, Chu Jihun exposed it by hanging a shaved bearing from the same lot at the depot''s main gate.\n\n**Relations.** He accepts Song Hayul''s apprentice daily routine as grounds for the exposure, does not lock away I Hongwon''s public succession exam records, and matches numbers with Ran Hayul''s Yongsan transshipment lot.\n\n**Ambition.** He posts the shaved bearing and the defective brake on the Chairman''s Office notice board as the only operative evidence, cutting off rumors of the I clan succession with logs.\n\n**Fear.** That the whistleblowing signatures are copied onto company-housing petition posters and the depot is occupied on the logic of population.\n\n**Intervention.** He can trace the origin marks on defective parts, or delay the exposure by a day to prevent the company-housing occupation.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness −10 | Force −5 | Material 30 | Communal 25 | Principle 0 | Publicity 5 | Credentials 85 | Dispersal 5 | Transformation −30\n- Desires: Craving 35 | Possessiveness 10 | Risk −30 | Display 20 | Endurance 25 | Orientation: None | Bonding: Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Chu Jihun","type":"Oath","to":"Song Ha-yul","basis":"Receives Song Hayul''s apprentice daily work as grounds for exposure"},{"from":"Chu Jihun","type":"Oath","to":"Oleksandr Shevchenko","basis":"matching numbers with Oleksandr Shevchenko''s Yongsan transshipment lot"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0290","name":"추지훈","title":"차륜 정비 불량 폭로자","position":"성하전자 차륜 정비 불량 폭로자","characterId":"K289","rank":"사원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"차륜 정비 일지·불량 부품 표본 공개","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-추지훈","detailRoute":"/people/person-0290","birthDate":"2105-10-20","birthday":"10-20","age":21,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k289-defect-lot-documentation","name":"결함 로트 증빙","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k289-priority","name":"불량 공개","description":"추지훈은 같은 로트의 깎인 베어링을 정문에 걸어 조작을 폭로했다. 폭로가 사택 점거 명분으로 전용될 위험도 의식한다.","behavior":"정비 일지를 회장실 게시판에 직접 붙이고, 불량 부품은 잘라 표본으로 남긴다.","stress":"폭로 서명이 사택 청원 벽보로 복사되어 기지가 인구 논리로 점거되는 것.","relationship":"송하율의 도제 일과를 폭로 근거로 받고, 이홍원의 공개 승계 시험 기록을 잠그지 않으며, 란하율의 용산 환적 로트와 번호를 맞춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k289-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 사원. 직함은 성하전자 차륜 정비 불량 폭로자. 정비 일지를 회장실 게시판에 직접 붙이고, 불량 부품은 잘라 표본으로 남긴다.","stress":"공포. 폭로 서명이 사택 청원 벽보로 복사되어 기지가 인구 논리로 점거되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 송하율의 도제 일과를 폭로 근거로 받고, 이홍원의 공개 승계 시험 기록을 잠그지 않으며, 란하율의 용산 환적 로트와 번호를 맞춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"추지훈은 같은 로트의 깎인 베어링을 정문에 걸어 조작을 폭로했다. 폭로가 사택 점거 명분으로 전용될 위험도 의식한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cd94-cd94-acc4","name":"추계 추씨","crest":"clan-crests/cd94-cd94-acc4.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":-10,"무력":-5,"물질":30,"공동":25,"원칙":0,"공개":5,"자격":85,"분산":5,"변혁":-30},"desire":{"갈망":35,"독점":10,"위험":-30,"과시":20,"지속":25,"지향":"무성향","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"차륜 정비 일지·불량 부품 표본 공개","소속":"Arc","품계":"사원","직함":"성하전자 차륜 정비 불량 폭로자","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −5 | 물질 30 | 공동 25 | 원칙 0 | 공개 5 | 자격 85 | 분산 5 | 변혁 −30","욕망":"갈망 35 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 20 | 지속 25 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 성하전자 차륜 정비 불량 폭로자 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 추지훈은 역삼1동에서 차륜 정비 일지·불량 부품 표본 공개 업무를 맡는다. 성하전자 정비 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명 업무를 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권으로 정밀화한다. 역삼 대합실 화물 인계는 참고이며 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. 송하율의 도제 일과를 폭로 근거로 받고, 이홍원의 공개 승계 시험 기록을 잠그지 않으며, 란하율의 용산 환적 로트와 번호를 맞춘다","관직":"품계 사원. 직함은 성하전자 차륜 정비 불량 폭로자. 정비 일지를 회장실 게시판에 직접 붙이고, 불량 부품은 잘라 표본으로 남긴다.","일화":"겨울의 검은 배차표가 북부 후계시험 부품 조작을 드러내자 추지훈은 같은 로트의 깎인 베어링을 기지 정문에 걸어 폭로했다.","관계":"송하율의 도제 일과를 폭로 근거로 받고, 이홍원의 공개 승계 시험 기록을 잠그지 않으며, 란하율의 용산 환적 로트와 번호를 맞춘다.","야망":"깎인 베어링과 제동 불량을 회장실 게시판의 유일한 가동 근거로 올려 이씨 가문 승계 소문을 일지로 끊는다.","공포":"폭로 서명이 사택 청원 벽보로 복사되어 기지가 인구 논리로 점거되는 것.","개입":"결함 부품의 출처 자국을 추적하거나, 폭로를 하루 늦춰 사택 점거를 막을 수 있다."},"biography":"남의 공구를 빼돌리는 일을 시험 부정과 같은 죄로 보고, 결함 표본을 자르지 않고 넘기는 반장을 참지 못한다. 손이 빠르고 말은 적다.\n\n- 생업: 차륜 정비 일지·불량 부품 표본 공개\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 사원\n- 직함: 성하전자 차륜 정비 불량 폭로자\n**생애.** 강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 성하전자 차륜 정비 불량 폭로자 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 추지훈은 역삼1동에서 차륜 정비 일지·불량 부품 표본 공개 업무를 맡는다. 성하전자 정비 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명 업무를 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권으로 정밀화한다. 역삼 대합실 화물 인계는 참고이며 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. 송하율의 도제 일과를 폭로 근거로 받고, 이홍원의 공개 승계 시험 기록을 잠그지 않으며, 란하율의 용산 환적 로트와 번호를 맞춘다\n\n**관직.** 품계 사원. 직함은 성하전자 차륜 정비 불량 폭로자. 정비 일지를 회장실 게시판에 직접 붙이고, 불량 부품은 잘라 표본으로 남긴다.\n\n**일화.** 겨울의 검은 배차표가 북부 후계시험 부품 조작을 드러내자 추지훈은 같은 로트의 깎인 베어링을 기지 정문에 걸어 폭로했다.\n\n**관계.** 송하율의 도제 일과를 폭로 근거로 받고, 이홍원의 공개 승계 시험 기록을 잠그지 않으며, 란하율의 용산 환적 로트와 번호를 맞춘다.\n\n**야망.** 깎인 베어링과 제동 불량을 회장실 게시판의 유일한 가동 근거로 올려 이씨 가문 승계 소문을 일지로 끊는다.\n\n**공포.** 폭로 서명이 사택 청원 벽보로 복사되어 기지가 인구 논리로 점거되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 결함 부품의 출처 자국을 추적하거나, 폭로를 하루 늦춰 사택 점거를 막을 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −5 | 물질 30 | 공동 25 | 원칙 0 | 공개 5 | 자격 85 | 분산 5 | 변혁 −30\n- 욕망: 갈망 35 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 20 | 지속 25 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"추지훈","type":"맹세","to":"송하율","basis":"송하율의 도제 일과를 폭로 근거로 받고"},{"from":"추지훈","type":"맹세","to":"올렉산드르 셰우첸코","basis":"올렉산드르 셰우첸코의 용산 환적 로트와 번호를 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0291', 'c5b4-d568-c885', '{"id":"person-0291","name":"Eo Yerin","title":"Test Wheel Defect Witness","position":"Seongha Electronics Test Wheel Defect Witness","characterId":"K290","rank":"Employee","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Test Wheel Defect Sample, Accident Signature Verification","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#character-eoyerin","detailRoute":"/people/person-0291","birthDate":"2094-05-06","birthday":"05-06","age":32,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k290-defect-testimony-recording","name":"Defect testimony recording","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k290-priority","name":"Signed testimony","description":"Eo Yerin signed the defect witness field and helps guard the sealed toolbox. This establishes testimonial responsibility, not the culprit’s identity.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: trial wheel defect witness. She demanded the squad leader''s and the apprentice''s signatures together for every accident and wrote the defective specimen numbers on the same line.","stress":"Fear. That the testimony would become the residents'' representatives'' pretext for seizing the base and she would become the procession of a population dispute.","relationship":"Relations. Testified to the defect in Jo Woochan''s work squad, kept Du Mo''s sealed tool box with him, and left the mismatched line in Guk Du''s accident ledger.","effects":[]},{"id":"k290-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: trial wheel defect witness. She demanded the squad leader''s and the apprentice''s signatures together for every accident and wrote the defective specimen numbers on the same line.","stress":"Fear. That the testimony would become the residents'' representatives'' pretext for seizing the base and she would become the procession of a population dispute.","relationship":"Relations. Testified to the defect in Jo Woochan''s work squad, kept Du Mo''s sealed tool box with him, and left the mismatched line in Guk Du''s accident ledger.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Eo Yerin signed the defect witness field and helps guard the sealed toolbox. This establishes testimonial responsibility, not the culprit’s identity.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5b4-d568-c885","name":"Eo Clan of Hamjong","crest":"clan-crests/c5b4-d568-c885.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":-15,"Force":-5,"Material":30,"Communal":25,"Principle":15,"Public":-5,"Eligibility":80,"Dispersed":5,"Transformative":-25},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":5,"Display":-10,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Test Wheel Defect Sample, Accident Signature Verification","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Employee","Title":"Seongha Electronics Test Wheel Defect Witness","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness −15 | Force −5 | Materialism 30 | Communal 25 | Principle 15 | Publicity −5 | Credentials 80 | Decentralization 5 | Transformation −25","Desires":"Craving 30 | Exclusivity 30 | Risk 5 | Display −10 | Persistence 30 | Orientation None | Bonding Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"She grew up at the Gangnam Station rail depot. Her post as Seongha Electronics Test Wheel Defect Witness opened up after a defect report made just before a derailment.\n- In Yeoksam 1-dong, Eo Yerin handles the checking of test wheel defect samples and accident signatures. She refines Seongha Electronics'' maintenance sample, weight, lot, measurement, work crew, and accident signature duties into a working neighborhood in Yeoksam 1-dong, adjacent to Gangnam Station. The cargo handover at the Yeoksam Concourse is for reference only and does not establish actual factory facilities, warehouse monopolies, or operating trains. In Jo Uchan''s work crew she testifies to the defect, helps guard Dumo''s sealed toolbox, and leaves a mismatched line in Gukdu''s accident ledger","Offices":"Rank: Employee. Title: Seongha Electronics Test Wheel Defect Witness. She requires the signatures of both the foreman and the apprentice for every accident, and writes the defective sample number on the same line.","Anecdote":"In the same week as the Winter Black Timetable, when a deliberately shaved bearing turned up in a leading heir''s test wheel, Eo Yerin put her name in the witness column.","Relationships":"In Jo Uchan''s work crew she testifies to the defect, helps guard Dumo''s sealed toolbox, and leaves a mismatched line in Gukdu''s accident ledger.","Ambition":"To fix the defect in the leading heir''s test wheel as testimony, so that the Yi Clan succession cannot swallow the succession trial.","Fear":"That her testimony becomes the pretext for the company-housing representative to occupy the depot, making her a mere bystander in a population dispute.","Intervention":"She can make the mismatched line public, or take charge of the trial supervision to protect the witness."},"biography":"She remembers accident responsibility down to the date, and treats logs without signatures as though they never existed. She trusts the handwriting beneath the wheel more than any meeting.\n\n- Occupation: Checking test wheel defect samples and accident signatures\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Employee\n- Title: Seongha Electronics Test Wheel Defect Witness\n**Life.** She grew up at the Gangnam Station rail depot. Her post as Seongha Electronics Test Wheel Defect Witness opened up after a defect report made just before a derailment.\n- In Yeoksam 1-dong, Eo Yerin handles the checking of test wheel defect samples and accident signatures. She refines Seongha Electronics'' maintenance sample, weight, lot, measurement, work crew, and accident signature duties into a working neighborhood in Yeoksam 1-dong, adjacent to Gangnam Station. The cargo handover at the Yeoksam Concourse is for reference only and does not establish actual factory facilities, warehouse monopolies, or operating trains. In Jo Uchan''s work crew she testifies to the defect, helps guard Dumo''s sealed toolbox, and leaves a mismatched line in Gukdu''s accident ledger\n\n**Office.** Rank: Employee. Title: Seongha Electronics Test Wheel Defect Witness. She requires the signatures of both the foreman and the apprentice for every accident, and writes the defective sample number on the same line.\n\n**Anecdote.** In the same week as the Winter Black Timetable, when a deliberately shaved bearing turned up in a leading heir''s test wheel, Eo Yerin put her name in the witness column.\n\n**Relationships.** In Jo Uchan''s work crew she testifies to the defect, helps guard Dumo''s sealed toolbox, and leaves a mismatched line in Gukdu''s accident ledger.\n\n**Ambition.** To fix the defect in the leading heir''s test wheel as testimony, so that the Yi Clan succession cannot swallow the succession trial.\n\n**Fear.** That her testimony becomes the pretext for the company-housing representative to occupy the depot, making her a mere bystander in a population dispute.\n\n**Intervention.** She can make the mismatched line public, or take charge of the trial supervision to protect the witness.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness −15 | Force −5 | Materialism 30 | Communal 25 | Principle 15 | Publicity −5 | Credentials 80 | Decentralization 5 | Transformation −25\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Exclusivity 30 | Risk 5 | Display −10 | Persistence 30 | Orientation None | Bonding Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Eo Yerin","type":"Oath","to":"Jo U-chan","basis":"Testifies to the defect in Jo Uchan''s work crew"},{"from":"Eo Yerin","type":"Oath","to":"Dumo","basis":"While jointly guarding Dumo''s sealed toolbox"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0291","name":"어예린","title":"시험 차륜 결함 증인","position":"성하전자 시험 차륜 결함 증인","characterId":"K290","rank":"사원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"시험 차륜 결함 표본·사고 서명 확인","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-어예린","detailRoute":"/people/person-0291","birthDate":"2094-05-06","birthday":"05-06","age":32,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k290-defect-testimony-recording","name":"결함 증언 기록","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k290-priority","name":"서명한 증언","description":"어예린은 결함의 증인란에 이름을 올리고 봉인 공구함을 함께 지킨다. 증언 책임이지 조작 범인의 확정은 아니다.","behavior":"사고 한 건에 반장과 도제의 서명을 함께 요구하고, 불량 표본 번호를 같은 줄에 적는다.","stress":"증언이 사택 대표의 기지 점거 명분이 되어 자신이 인구 분쟁의 들러리가 되는 것.","relationship":"조우찬의 작업 조에서 결함을 증언하고, 두모의 봉인된 공구함을 함께 지키며, 국두의 사고 원장에 어긋난 줄을 남긴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k290-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 사원. 직함은 성하전자 시험 차륜 결함 증인. 사고 한 건에 반장과 도제의 서명을 함께 요구하고, 불량 표본 번호를 같은 줄에 적는다.","stress":"공포. 증언이 사택 대표의 기지 점거 명분이 되어 자신이 인구 분쟁의 들러리가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 조우찬의 작업 조에서 결함을 증언하고, 두모의 봉인된 공구함을 함께 지키며, 국두의 사고 원장에 어긋난 줄을 남긴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"어예린은 결함의 증인란에 이름을 올리고 봉인 공구함을 함께 지킨다. 증언 책임이지 조작 범인의 확정은 아니다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c5b4-d568-c885","name":"함종 어씨","crest":"clan-crests/c5b4-d568-c885.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":-15,"무력":-5,"물질":30,"공동":25,"원칙":15,"공개":-5,"자격":80,"분산":5,"변혁":-25},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":30,"위험":5,"과시":-10,"지속":30,"지향":"무성향","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"시험 차륜 결함 표본·사고 서명 확인","소속":"Arc","품계":"사원","직함":"성하전자 시험 차륜 결함 증인","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −5 | 물질 30 | 공동 25 | 원칙 15 | 공개 −5 | 자격 80 | 분산 5 | 변혁 −25","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 30 | 위험 5 | 과시 −10 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 성하전자 시험 차륜 결함 증인 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 어예린은 역삼1동에서 시험 차륜 결함 표본·사고 서명 확인 업무를 맡는다. 성하전자 정비 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명 업무를 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권으로 정밀화한다. 역삼 대합실 화물 인계는 참고이며 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. 조우찬의 작업 조에서 결함을 증언하고, 두모의 봉인된 공구함을 함께 지키며, 국두의 사고 원장에 어긋난 줄을 남긴다","관직":"품계 사원. 직함은 성하전자 시험 차륜 결함 증인. 사고 한 건에 반장과 도제의 서명을 함께 요구하고, 불량 표본 번호를 같은 줄에 적는다.","일화":"겨울의 검은 배차표와 같은 주, 유력 후계자의 시험 차륜에서 의도적으로 깎인 베어링이 나오자 어예린은 증인란에 이름을 올렸다.","관계":"조우찬의 작업 조에서 결함을 증언하고, 두모의 봉인된 공구함을 함께 지키며, 국두의 사고 원장에 어긋난 줄을 남긴다.","야망":"유력 후계자의 시험 차륜 결함을 증언으로 고정해 이씨 가문 승계가 승계 시험을 삼키지 못하게 한다.","공포":"증언이 사택 대표의 기지 점거 명분이 되어 자신이 인구 분쟁의 들러리가 되는 것.","개입":"어긋난 줄을 공개하거나, 시험 감독을 맡아 증인을 보호할 수 있다."},"biography":"사고 책임을 날짜까지 기억하고, 서명 없는 일지를 없던 일로 돌린다. 회의보다 차륜 아래의 필적을 믿는다.\n\n- 생업: 시험 차륜 결함 표본·사고 서명 확인\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 사원\n- 직함: 성하전자 시험 차륜 결함 증인\n**생애.** 강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 성하전자 시험 차륜 결함 증인 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 어예린은 역삼1동에서 시험 차륜 결함 표본·사고 서명 확인 업무를 맡는다. 성하전자 정비 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명 업무를 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권으로 정밀화한다. 역삼 대합실 화물 인계는 참고이며 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. 조우찬의 작업 조에서 결함을 증언하고, 두모의 봉인된 공구함을 함께 지키며, 국두의 사고 원장에 어긋난 줄을 남긴다\n\n**관직.** 품계 사원. 직함은 성하전자 시험 차륜 결함 증인. 사고 한 건에 반장과 도제의 서명을 함께 요구하고, 불량 표본 번호를 같은 줄에 적는다.\n\n**일화.** 겨울의 검은 배차표와 같은 주, 유력 후계자의 시험 차륜에서 의도적으로 깎인 베어링이 나오자 어예린은 증인란에 이름을 올렸다.\n\n**관계.** 조우찬의 작업 조에서 결함을 증언하고, 두모의 봉인된 공구함을 함께 지키며, 국두의 사고 원장에 어긋난 줄을 남긴다.\n\n**야망.** 유력 후계자의 시험 차륜 결함을 증언으로 고정해 이씨 가문 승계가 승계 시험을 삼키지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 증언이 사택 대표의 기지 점거 명분이 되어 자신이 인구 분쟁의 들러리가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 어긋난 줄을 공개하거나, 시험 감독을 맡아 증인을 보호할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 −15 | 무력 −5 | 물질 30 | 공동 25 | 원칙 15 | 공개 −5 | 자격 80 | 분산 5 | 변혁 −25\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 30 | 위험 5 | 과시 −10 | 지속 30 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"어예린","type":"맹세","to":"조우찬","basis":"조우찬의 작업 조에서 결함을 증언하고"},{"from":"어예린","type":"맹세","to":"두모","basis":"두모의 봉인된 공구함을 함께 지키며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0292', 'creative-b780-b3c4-bd09', '{"id":"person-0292","name":"Ran Jina","title":"Medical Train Northern Gate Mechanic","position":"Gangnam Station Medical Train Northern Gate Mechanic","characterId":"K291","rank":"Employee","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Medical Train Pre-Sortie Maintenance Inspection","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#person-ran-jina","detailRoute":"/people/person-0292","birthDate":"2067-10-25","birthday":"10-25","age":59,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k291-brake-maintenance","name":"Brake maintenance","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k291-priority","name":"Refuses unauthorized departure","description":"Ran Jina locked the brakes and refused departure after weapons were loaded aboard the medical train. Priority repair of patient cars is not combat proficiency.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: medical train north gate mechanic. She made the pre-sortie inspection mandatory and allowed arms loading only with the joint stamp of the Elder and the auditor.","stress":"Fear. That one car with bad brakes would go out under the maintenance signature and the whole north gate convoy would stop.","relationship":"Relations. Matched brakes to Gwon Doha''s north gate patrol cars, overlaid the stop logs on the discovery hour of Soon Gaon''s medical car, and repaired the sickbed cars'' brakes first whenever Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy stopped at Changdong.","effects":[]},{"id":"k291-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: medical train north gate mechanic. She made the pre-sortie inspection mandatory and allowed arms loading only with the joint stamp of the Elder and the auditor.","stress":"Fear. That one car with bad brakes would go out under the maintenance signature and the whole north gate convoy would stop.","relationship":"Relations. Matched brakes to Gwon Doha''s north gate patrol cars, overlaid the stop logs on the discovery hour of Soon Gaon''s medical car, and repaired the sickbed cars'' brakes first whenever Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy stopped at Changdong.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Ran Jina locked the brakes and refused departure after weapons were loaded aboard the medical train. Priority repair of patient cars is not combat proficiency.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"creative-b780-b3c4-bd09","name":"Ran Clan of Dobong","crest":"clan-crests/creative-b780-b3c4-bd09.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":-10,"Force":0,"Material":25,"Communal":10,"Principle":15,"Public":5,"Eligibility":80,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":-25},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":-25,"Display":25,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical Train Pre-Sortie Maintenance Inspection","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Employee","Title":"Gangnam Station Medical Train Northern Gate Mechanic","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness −10 | Force 0 | Materialism 25 | Communal 10 | Principle 15 | Publicity 5 | Credentials 80 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation −25","Desires":"Craving 40 | Exclusivity 10 | Risk −25 | Display 25 | Persistence −15 | Orientation Same-sex | Bonding Contract cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"She grew up at the Gangnam Station rail depot. Her post as Gangnam Station Medical Train North Gate Mechanic opened up after a defect report made just before a derailment.\n- In Seocho 4-dong, Ran Jina handles pre-sortie maintenance inspection for the medical train. She links the Gangnam Station headquarters and chairman''s office bulletin board with the concourse''s daily cargo handover, access, and duty rotation as a neighborhood-level work reference point. The North Gate is an access duty post for Gangnam Station and does not create dominion over the northern region or a new fortress. She matches the brakes to Gwon Doha''s North Gate patrol car, overlaps the stop log with the time Sun Gaon discovered the medical car, and, when Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy halts at Gangnam Station, repairs only the patient car''s brakes first","Offices":"Rank: Employee. Title: Gangnam Station Medical Train North Gate Mechanic. She mandates pre-sortie inspections and permits armament loading only with the joint seal of the Managing Director and the Auditor.","Anecdote":"In the Winter Black Timetable, when weapons were loaded onto the medical train, Ran Jina locked the brakes at the North Gate and refused to release it.","Relationships":"She matches the brakes to Gwon Doha''s North Gate patrol car, overlaps the stop log with the time Sun Gaon discovered the medical car, and, when Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy halts at Gangnam Station, repairs only the patient car''s brakes first.","Ambition":"To bind the medical train''s North Gate brakes into the northern wing of the Gangnam Station convoy, so that Seongha Electronics trains can depart without a separate toll.","Fear":"That a single defective brake goes out on a maintenance signature and halts the entire North Gate convoy.","Intervention":"She can swap out brakes on the spot, or report unauthorized armament to the chairman''s office."},"biography":"She sends cavalry who have not inspected their wheels before sortie off with empty cars, and regards any release that skipped the brake inspection as the start of an accident. She likes discipline and considers silence on the tracks part of maintenance.\n\n- Occupation: Pre-sortie maintenance inspection of the medical train\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Employee\n- Title: Gangnam Station Medical Train North Gate Mechanic\n**Life.** She grew up at the Gangnam Station rail depot. Her post as Gangnam Station Medical Train North Gate Mechanic opened up after a defect report made just before a derailment.\n- In Seocho 4-dong, Ran Jina handles pre-sortie maintenance inspection for the medical train. She links the Gangnam Station headquarters and chairman''s office bulletin board with the concourse''s daily cargo handover, access, and duty rotation as a neighborhood-level work reference point. The North Gate is an access duty post for Gangnam Station and does not create dominion over the northern region or a new fortress. She matches the brakes to Gwon Doha''s North Gate patrol car, overlaps the stop log with the time Sun Gaon discovered the medical car, and, when Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy halts at Gangnam Station, repairs only the patient car''s brakes first\n\n**Office.** Rank: Employee. Title: Gangnam Station Medical Train North Gate Mechanic. She mandates pre-sortie inspections and permits armament loading only with the joint seal of the Managing Director and the Auditor.\n\n**Anecdote.** In the Winter Black Timetable, when weapons were loaded onto the medical train, Ran Jina locked the brakes at the North Gate and refused to release it.\n\n**Relationships.** She matches the brakes to Gwon Doha''s North Gate patrol car, overlaps the stop log with the time Sun Gaon discovered the medical car, and, when Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy halts at Gangnam Station, repairs only the patient car''s brakes first.\n\n**Ambition.** To bind the medical train''s North Gate brakes into the northern wing of the Gangnam Station convoy, so that Seongha Electronics trains can depart without a separate toll.\n\n**Fear.** That a single defective brake goes out on a maintenance signature and halts the entire North Gate convoy.\n\n**Intervention.** She can swap out brakes on the spot, or report unauthorized armament to the chairman''s office.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness −10 | Force 0 | Materialism 25 | Communal 10 | Principle 15 | Publicity 5 | Credentials 80 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation −25\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Exclusivity 10 | Risk −25 | Display 25 | Persistence −15 | Orientation Same-sex | Bonding Contract cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ran Jina","type":"Contract","to":"Stefan Petrov","basis":"while overlaying the stop log on Stefan Petrov''s discovery time in the medical car"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0292","name":"란진아","title":"의료열차 북문 정비원","position":"강남역 의료열차 북문 정비원","characterId":"K291","rank":"사원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"의료열차 출격 전 정비 점검","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-란진아","detailRoute":"/people/person-0292","birthDate":"2067-10-25","birthday":"10-25","age":59,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k291-brake-maintenance","name":"제동 정비","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k291-priority","name":"무단 출고 거부","description":"란진아는 의료열차에 무기가 실리자 제동을 잠그고 출고를 거부했다. 병상 칸 우선 정비를 전투 숙련으로 환산하지 않는다.","behavior":"출격 전 점검을 의무화하고, 무장 탑재는 상무와 감사의 공동 날인만 허용한다.","stress":"제동 불량 한 대가 정비 서명으로 나가 북문 호송 전체가 멈추는 것.","relationship":"권도하의 북문 순찰차에 제동을 맞추고, 순가온의 의료칸 발견 시각에 정차 일지를 겹치며, 장세화의 의료호송이 강남역에 설 때 병상 칸의 제동만 우선 고친다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k291-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 의료열차 북문 정비원. 출격 전 점검을 의무화하고, 무장 탑재는 상무와 감사의 공동 날인만 허용한다.","stress":"공포. 제동 불량 한 대가 정비 서명으로 나가 북문 호송 전체가 멈추는 것.","relationship":"관계. 권도하의 북문 순찰차에 제동을 맞추고, 순가온의 의료칸 발견 시각에 정차 일지를 겹치며, 장세화의 의료호송이 강남역에 설 때 병상 칸의 제동만 우선 고친다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"란진아는 의료열차에 무기가 실리자 제동을 잠그고 출고를 거부했다. 병상 칸 우선 정비를 전투 숙련으로 환산하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"creative-b780-b3c4-bd09","name":"도봉 란씨","crest":"clan-crests/creative-b780-b3c4-bd09.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":-10,"무력":0,"물질":25,"공동":10,"원칙":15,"공개":5,"자격":80,"분산":15,"변혁":-25},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":10,"위험":-25,"과시":25,"지속":-15,"지향":"동성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"의료열차 출격 전 정비 점검","소속":"Arc","품계":"사원","직함":"강남역 의료열차 북문 정비원","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 −10 | 무력 0 | 물질 25 | 공동 10 | 원칙 15 | 공개 5 | 자격 80 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −25","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 10 | 위험 −25 | 과시 25 | 지속 −15 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 강남역 의료열차 북문 정비원 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 란진아는 서초4동에서 의료열차 출격 전 정비 점검 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 본사·회장실 게시판과 대합실 생활 화물 인계·출입·당직을 동 수준 근무 기준점으로 연결한다. 북문은 강남역 접근 당직이며 북부 권역 지배·새 요새를 만들지 않는다. 권도하의 북문 순찰차에 제동을 맞추고, 순가온의 의료칸 발견 시각에 정차 일지를 겹치며, 장세화의 의료호송이 강남역에 설 때 병상 칸의 제동만 우선 고친다","관직":"품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 의료열차 북문 정비원. 출격 전 점검을 의무화하고, 무장 탑재는 상무와 감사의 공동 날인만 허용한다.","일화":"겨울의 검은 배차표에서 의료열차에 무기가 실리자 란진아는 북문에서 제동을 잠그고 출고를 거부했다.","관계":"권도하의 북문 순찰차에 제동을 맞추고, 순가온의 의료칸 발견 시각에 정차 일지를 겹치며, 장세화의 의료호송이 강남역에 설 때 병상 칸의 제동만 우선 고친다.","야망":"의료열차의 북문 제동을 강남역 호송의 북부 날개로 묶어 별도 통행세 없이 성하전자 열차가 나가게 한다.","공포":"제동 불량 한 대가 정비 서명으로 나가 북문 호송 전체가 멈추는 것.","개입":"제동을 현장에서 갈아 끼우거나, 무단 무장을 회장실에 보고할 수 있다."},"biography":"출격 전 차륜을 보지 않은 기병을 빈 칸으로 돌리고, 제동 점검을 건너뛴 출고를 사고의 시작으로 본다. 규율을 좋아하고 선로 위의 침묵을 정비의 일부로 여긴다.\n\n- 생업: 의료열차 출격 전 정비 점검\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 사원\n- 직함: 강남역 의료열차 북문 정비원\n**생애.** 강남역 차량기지에서 자랐다. 강남역 의료열차 북문 정비원 자리는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 란진아는 서초4동에서 의료열차 출격 전 정비 점검 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 본사·회장실 게시판과 대합실 생활 화물 인계·출입·당직을 동 수준 근무 기준점으로 연결한다. 북문은 강남역 접근 당직이며 북부 권역 지배·새 요새를 만들지 않는다. 권도하의 북문 순찰차에 제동을 맞추고, 순가온의 의료칸 발견 시각에 정차 일지를 겹치며, 장세화의 의료호송이 강남역에 설 때 병상 칸의 제동만 우선 고친다\n\n**관직.** 품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 의료열차 북문 정비원. 출격 전 점검을 의무화하고, 무장 탑재는 상무와 감사의 공동 날인만 허용한다.\n\n**일화.** 겨울의 검은 배차표에서 의료열차에 무기가 실리자 란진아는 북문에서 제동을 잠그고 출고를 거부했다.\n\n**관계.** 권도하의 북문 순찰차에 제동을 맞추고, 순가온의 의료칸 발견 시각에 정차 일지를 겹치며, 장세화의 의료호송이 강남역에 설 때 병상 칸의 제동만 우선 고친다.\n\n**야망.** 의료열차의 북문 제동을 강남역 호송의 북부 날개로 묶어 별도 통행세 없이 성하전자 열차가 나가게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 제동 불량 한 대가 정비 서명으로 나가 북문 호송 전체가 멈추는 것.\n\n**개입.** 제동을 현장에서 갈아 끼우거나, 무단 무장을 회장실에 보고할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 −10 | 무력 0 | 물질 25 | 공동 10 | 원칙 15 | 공개 5 | 자격 80 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −25\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 10 | 위험 −25 | 과시 25 | 지속 −15 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"란진아","type":"계약","to":"스테판 페트로프","basis":"스테판 페트로프의 의료칸 발견 시각에 정차 일지를 겹치며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0293', 'c12d-acbd-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0293","name":"Seop Chaewon","title":"Bukhansan Bogungmun Procession Northern Gate Guide","position":"Gangnam Station Northern Gate Evacuation Guide","characterId":"K292","rank":"Employee","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Northern Gate Evacuation Passage Times, Family Ticket Guidance","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#person-seop-chaewon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0293","birthDate":"2064-11-25","birthday":"11-25","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k292-evacuation-queue-guidance","name":"Evacuation queue guidance","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k292-priority","name":"Family passage first","description":"Seop Chaewon removed water-token screening and admitted family slips, seeking to keep evacuation boards from becoming military signposts.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: Bukhansan Bogukmun column north gate guide. He wrote the passage hours and the family tables on one chalkboard and opened armed guidance only after reconnaissance reports.","stress":"Fear. That the guidance chalkboard would be painted over as a military convoy signpost and the refugee road would be erased.","relationship":"Relations. Guided the column at Du Guk''s north gate convoy outpost and matched the hours with Kang Taesan''s corridor torches. Sought to put Eo Haeun''s erased family names back into the guide roster.","effects":[]},{"id":"k292-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: Bukhansan Bogukmun column north gate guide. He wrote the passage hours and the family tables on one chalkboard and opened armed guidance only after reconnaissance reports.","stress":"Fear. That the guidance chalkboard would be painted over as a military convoy signpost and the refugee road would be erased.","relationship":"Relations. Guided the column at Du Guk''s north gate convoy outpost and matched the hours with Kang Taesan''s corridor torches. Sought to put Eo Haeun''s erased family names back into the guide roster.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Seop Chaewon removed water-token screening and admitted family slips, seeking to keep evacuation boards from becoming military signposts.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c12d-acbd-c8fc","name":"Gyeongju Seop Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c12d-acbd-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":-20,"Force":-10,"Material":20,"Communal":20,"Principle":10,"Public":5,"Eligibility":65,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":-20},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":35,"Display":30,"Sustained":40,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Northern Gate Evacuation Passage Times, Family Ticket Guidance","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Employee","Title":"Gangnam Station Northern Gate Evacuation Guide","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness −20 | Force −10 | Material 20 | Communal 20 | Principle 10 | Publicity 5 | Credential 65 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation −20","Desires":"Craving 0 | Possessiveness 30 | Risk 35 | Display 30 | Persistence 40 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Bonding: Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up on the waiting-hall watch. The post of Gangnam Station North Gate Evacuation Guide opened through a substitute watch after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Seop Chaewon handles North Gate evacuation passage-time and family-ticket guidance in Seocho 4-dong. She links the Gangnam Station headquarters and chairman''s office noticeboard, and the waiting-hall handover of living cargo, access, and watch duty, as a dong-level duty reference point. The North Gate is a Gangnam Station access watch and does not establish control of the northern district or a new fortress. At Du Guk''s North Gate escort base she guides the processions, matches times with Gang Taesan''s corridor torches, and means to restore Eo Haeun''s erased family names to the guidance register","Offices":"Rank: Staff. Title: Gangnam Station North Gate Evacuation Guide. She writes the passage times and family tickets on the same blackboard, and opens armed guidance only after a scouting report.","Anecdote":"In autumn, when the Bukhansan Bogungmun procession reached the North Gate, Seop Chaewon withdrew the checkpoint line that demanded water-ration iron tokens and let through the lane holding only family tickets.","Relationships":"At Du Guk''s North Gate escort base she guides the processions, matches times with Gang Taesan''s corridor torches, and means to restore Eo Haeun''s erased family names to the guidance register.","Ambition":"She means to keep the North Gate as a public guidance post for evacuation processions, so that the Eastern Patrol cannot use the camp entrance as a checkpoint.","Fear":"That the guidance blackboard will be painted over as a military escort milestone and the evacuation route erased.","Intervention":"She can block an officer trying to set up the checkpoint line again, or leave the original times on the guidance blackboard as testimony."},"biography":"She remembers the blank spaces in the escort schedule as an insult, and sends down off the tracks any officer who offers a passage toll as a condition of passage. She divides the road with words rather than with a knife that shaves milestones.\n\n- Livelihood: North Gate evacuation passage-time and family-ticket guidance\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Staff\n- Title: Gangnam Station North Gate Evacuation Guide\n**Life.** Grew up on the waiting-hall watch. The post of Gangnam Station North Gate Evacuation Guide opened through a substitute watch after an unexcused shift absence.\n- Seop Chaewon handles North Gate evacuation passage-time and family-ticket guidance in Seocho 4-dong. She links the Gangnam Station headquarters and chairman''s office noticeboard, and the waiting-hall handover of living cargo, access, and watch duty, as a dong-level duty reference point. The North Gate is a Gangnam Station access watch and does not establish control of the northern district or a new fortress. At Du Guk''s North Gate escort base she guides the processions, matches times with Gang Taesan''s corridor torches, and means to restore Eo Haeun''s erased family names to the guidance register\n\n**Office.** Rank: Staff. Title: Gangnam Station North Gate Evacuation Guide. She writes the passage times and family tickets on the same blackboard, and opens armed guidance only after a scouting report.\n\n**Anecdote.** In autumn, when the Bukhansan Bogungmun procession reached the North Gate, Seop Chaewon withdrew the checkpoint line that demanded water-ration iron tokens and let through the lane holding only family tickets.\n\n**Relations.** At Du Guk''s North Gate escort base she guides the processions, matches times with Gang Taesan''s corridor torches, and means to restore Eo Haeun''s erased family names to the guidance register.\n\n**Ambition.** She means to keep the North Gate as a public guidance post for evacuation processions, so that the Eastern Patrol cannot use the camp entrance as a checkpoint.\n\n**Fear.** That the guidance blackboard will be painted over as a military escort milestone and the evacuation route erased.\n\n**Intervention.** She can block an officer trying to set up the checkpoint line again, or leave the original times on the guidance blackboard as testimony.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness −20 | Force −10 | Material 20 | Communal 20 | Principle 10 | Publicity 5 | Credential 65 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation −20\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Possessiveness 30 | Risk 35 | Display 30 | Persistence 40 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Bonding: Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seop Chaewon","type":"Contract","to":"Eo Ha-eun","basis":"Tries to put Eo Ha-eun''s erased family names back into the guidance registry"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0293","name":"섭채원","title":"북한산보국문 행렬 북문 안내인","position":"강남역 북문 피난 안내인","characterId":"K292","rank":"사원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"북문 피난 통행 시각·가족 표 안내","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-섭채원","detailRoute":"/people/person-0293","birthDate":"2064-11-25","birthday":"11-25","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k292-evacuation-queue-guidance","name":"피난 행렬 안내","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k292-priority","name":"가족 통행 우선","description":"섭채원은 급수 철표 검문을 거두고 가족 표의 통행을 열었다. 피난 칠판을 군사 이정표로 바꾸지 않으려 한다.","behavior":"통행 시각과 가족 표를 같은 칠판에 적고, 무장 안내는 정찰 보고 뒤에만 연다.","stress":"안내 칠판이 군사 호송 이정표로 덧칠되어 피난로가 지워지는 것.","relationship":"두국의 북문 호송 거점에서 행렬을 안내하고, 강태산의 회랑 횃불과 시각을 맞추며, 어하은의 지워진 가족 이름을 안내 명부에 다시 넣으려 한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k292-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 북문 피난 안내인. 통행 시각과 가족 표를 같은 칠판에 적고, 무장 안내는 정찰 보고 뒤에만 연다.","stress":"공포. 안내 칠판이 군사 호송 이정표로 덧칠되어 피난로가 지워지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 두국의 북문 호송 거점에서 행렬을 안내하고, 강태산의 회랑 횃불과 시각을 맞추며, 어하은의 지워진 가족 이름을 안내 명부에 다시 넣으려 한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"섭채원은 급수 철표 검문을 거두고 가족 표의 통행을 열었다. 피난 칠판을 군사 이정표로 바꾸지 않으려 한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c12d-acbd-c8fc","name":"경주 섭씨","crest":"clan-crests/c12d-acbd-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":-20,"무력":-10,"물질":20,"공동":20,"원칙":10,"공개":5,"자격":65,"분산":10,"변혁":-20},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":30,"위험":35,"과시":30,"지속":40,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"북문 피난 통행 시각·가족 표 안내","소속":"Arc","품계":"사원","직함":"강남역 북문 피난 안내인","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 −20 | 무력 −10 | 물질 20 | 공동 20 | 원칙 10 | 공개 5 | 자격 65 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −20","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 30 | 위험 35 | 과시 30 | 지속 40 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 강남역 북문 피난 안내인 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 섭채원은 서초4동에서 북문 피난 통행 시각·가족 표 안내 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 본사·회장실 게시판과 대합실 생활 화물 인계·출입·당직을 동 수준 근무 기준점으로 연결한다. 북문은 강남역 접근 당직이며 북부 권역 지배·새 요새를 만들지 않는다. 두국의 북문 호송 거점에서 행렬을 안내하고, 강태산의 회랑 횃불과 시각을 맞추며, 어하은의 지워진 가족 이름을 안내 명부에 다시 넣으려 한다","관직":"품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 북문 피난 안내인. 통행 시각과 가족 표를 같은 칠판에 적고, 무장 안내는 정찰 보고 뒤에만 연다.","일화":"가을의 북한산보국문 행렬이 북문에 닿자 섭채원은 급수 철표를 든 검문 줄을 거두고 가족 표만 있는 칸을 통과시켰다.","관계":"두국의 북문 호송 거점에서 행렬을 안내하고, 강태산의 회랑 횃불과 시각을 맞추며, 어하은의 지워진 가족 이름을 안내 명부에 다시 넣으려 한다.","야망":"북문을 피난 행렬의 공개 안내 거점으로 남겨 동부 순찰이 숙영 입구를 검문소로 쓰지 못하게 한다.","공포":"안내 칠판이 군사 호송 이정표로 덧칠되어 피난로가 지워지는 것.","개입":"검문 줄을 다시 치려는 장교를 막거나, 안내 칠판의 원본 시각을 증언으로 남길 수 있다."},"biography":"호송 시각의 빈칸을 모욕처럼 기억하고, 통행세를 통행 조건으로 내미는 장교를 선로에서 내려보낸다. 이정표를 깎는 칼보다 말로 길을 나눈다.\n\n- 생업: 북문 피난 통행 시각·가족 표 안내\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 사원\n- 직함: 강남역 북문 피난 안내인\n**생애.** 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 강남역 북문 피난 안내인 자리는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 섭채원은 서초4동에서 북문 피난 통행 시각·가족 표 안내 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 본사·회장실 게시판과 대합실 생활 화물 인계·출입·당직을 동 수준 근무 기준점으로 연결한다. 북문은 강남역 접근 당직이며 북부 권역 지배·새 요새를 만들지 않는다. 두국의 북문 호송 거점에서 행렬을 안내하고, 강태산의 회랑 횃불과 시각을 맞추며, 어하은의 지워진 가족 이름을 안내 명부에 다시 넣으려 한다\n\n**관직.** 품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 북문 피난 안내인. 통행 시각과 가족 표를 같은 칠판에 적고, 무장 안내는 정찰 보고 뒤에만 연다.\n\n**일화.** 가을의 북한산보국문 행렬이 북문에 닿자 섭채원은 급수 철표를 든 검문 줄을 거두고 가족 표만 있는 칸을 통과시켰다.\n\n**관계.** 두국의 북문 호송 거점에서 행렬을 안내하고, 강태산의 회랑 횃불과 시각을 맞추며, 어하은의 지워진 가족 이름을 안내 명부에 다시 넣으려 한다.\n\n**야망.** 북문을 피난 행렬의 공개 안내 거점으로 남겨 동부 순찰이 숙영 입구를 검문소로 쓰지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 안내 칠판이 군사 호송 이정표로 덧칠되어 피난로가 지워지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 검문 줄을 다시 치려는 장교를 막거나, 안내 칠판의 원본 시각을 증언으로 남길 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 −20 | 무력 −10 | 물질 20 | 공동 20 | 원칙 10 | 공개 5 | 자격 65 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −20\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 30 | 위험 35 | 과시 30 | 지속 40 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"섭채원","type":"계약","to":"어하은","basis":"어하은의 지워진 가족 이름을 안내 명부에 다시 넣으려 한다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0294', 'd3c9-cda9-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0294","name":"Pyeong Chaewon","title":"Resident Affected by Water Pressure Drop","position":"Gangnam Station Company Housing Water Supply Party","characterId":"K293","rank":"Employee","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Company Housing Water Pressure Record · Co-signature Verification","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#person-pyeong-chaewon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0294","birthDate":"2080-10-12","birthday":"10-12","age":46,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k293-water-timing-testimony","name":"Water timing testimony","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"k293-priority","name":"Own testimony only","description":"Pyeong Chaewon testifies to thirst with a cold kettle and accepts only personal handprints. Pressure observation is not professional pipe maintenance.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: water pressure drop residential party. She wrote the hour the pressure needle stopped on the paper beside the kettle and put only her own handprint into the joint signature for Seo Jina''s audit box.","stress":"Fear. That the party testimony would turn into a procession roster of protected water supply and she would become the guarantor of a cutoff that never happened.","relationship":"Relations. Added the party handprint to Seo Jina''s housing audit box and read Mo Bok''s water-level rod overlaid with the kettle hours. Withdrew her testimony whenever Han Jaemok''s water talks borrowed the shell''s name.","effects":[]},{"id":"k293-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: water pressure drop residential party. She wrote the hour the pressure needle stopped on the paper beside the kettle and put only her own handprint into the joint signature for Seo Jina''s audit box.","stress":"Fear. That the party testimony would turn into a procession roster of protected water supply and she would become the guarantor of a cutoff that never happened.","relationship":"Relations. Added the party handprint to Seo Jina''s housing audit box and read Mo Bok''s water-level rod overlaid with the kettle hours. Withdrew her testimony whenever Han Jaemok''s water talks borrowed the shell''s name.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Pyeong Chaewon testifies to thirst with a cold kettle and accepts only personal handprints. Pressure observation is not professional pipe maintenance.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d3c9-cda9-c8fc","name":"Chungju Pyeong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/d3c9-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":15,"Openness":-10,"Force":-5,"Material":20,"Communal":30,"Principle":20,"Public":-5,"Eligibility":60,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":-20},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":-5,"Risk":10,"Display":20,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Company Housing Water Pressure Record · Co-signature Verification","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Employee","Title":"Gangnam Station Company Housing Water Supply Party","Values":"Authority 15 | Openness −10 | Force −5 | Material 20 | Communal 30 | Principle 20 | Publicity −5 | Credential 60 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation −20","Desires":"Craving 10 | Possessiveness −5 | Risk 10 | Display 20 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: Fluid | Bonding: None"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up on the Yeongdeungpo water-purification watch. The post of Gangnam Station residence water-supply stakeholder opened through a valve signature on the Night of Turbid Water.\n- Pyeong Chaewon handles residence water-supply pressure recording and co-signature confirmation in Seocho 2-dong. She proposes Gangnam Station''s residence petition, remaining water supply, water level, and incident record work as a Seocho 2-dong living-area duty reference. She preserves the existing auditor, squad leader, and apprentice signature conditions and does not presume personal residence or ownership of lodgings. She adds the stakeholder''s handprint to Seo Jina''s residence audit box, and reads Mo Bok''s water-level stick against the kettle''s time. If Han Jaemok''s water negotiation borrows the Shell''s name, she withdraws her testimony","Offices":"Rank: Staff. Title: Gangnam Station Residence Water-Supply Stakeholder. She writes the time the pressure-gauge needle stopped on a sheet of paper beside the kettle, and takes only her own handprint on the co-signature sheet, putting it into Seo Jina''s audit box.","Anecdote":"When the third water-supply contract expired and the northern pressure gauge trembled, Pyeong Chaewon set a cooled kettle on the chairman''s office table instead of talking about the succession exam.","Relationships":"She adds the stakeholder''s handprint to Seo Jina''s residence audit box, and reads Mo Bok''s water-level stick against the kettle''s time. If Han Jaemok''s water negotiation borrows the Shell''s name, she withdraws her testimony.","Ambition":"She means to leave on record, as public-gallery testimony in the chairman''s office, the thirst of the Shell whose water-supply contract has ended, so that the date of the succession exam does not come before the kettle.","Fear":"That a stakeholder''s testimony will be turned into a figurehead roster for protected water supply, making her the guarantor of a water cutoff she was never part of.","Intervention":"She can leave the kettle''s time as public testimony, or forge handprints and bind stakeholders into negotiations as figureheads."},"biography":"She uses the speed at which a kettle cools as her unit of testimony, and when the pressure-gauge needle trembles she stands up before any word is spoken at a meeting. She does not accept a handprint that someone else pressed for her as her own thirst.\n\n- Livelihood: Residence water-supply pressure recording and co-signature confirmation\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Staff\n- Title: Gangnam Station Residence Water-Supply Stakeholder\n**Life.** Grew up on the Yeongdeungpo water-purification watch. The post of Gangnam Station residence water-supply stakeholder opened through a valve signature on the Night of Turbid Water.\n- Pyeong Chaewon handles residence water-supply pressure recording and co-signature confirmation in Seocho 2-dong. She proposes Gangnam Station''s residence petition, remaining water supply, water level, and incident record work as a Seocho 2-dong living-area duty reference. She preserves the existing auditor, squad leader, and apprentice signature conditions and does not presume personal residence or ownership of lodgings. She adds the stakeholder''s handprint to Seo Jina''s residence audit box, and reads Mo Bok''s water-level stick against the kettle''s time. If Han Jaemok''s water negotiation borrows the Shell''s name, she withdraws her testimony\n\n**Office.** Rank: Staff. Title: Gangnam Station Residence Water-Supply Stakeholder. She writes the time the pressure-gauge needle stopped on a sheet of paper beside the kettle, and takes only her own handprint on the co-signature sheet, putting it into Seo Jina''s audit box.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the third water-supply contract expired and the northern pressure gauge trembled, Pyeong Chaewon set a cooled kettle on the chairman''s office table instead of talking about the succession exam.\n\n**Relations.** She adds the stakeholder''s handprint to Seo Jina''s residence audit box, and reads Mo Bok''s water-level stick against the kettle''s time. If Han Jaemok''s water negotiation borrows the Shell''s name, she withdraws her testimony.\n\n**Ambition.** She means to leave on record, as public-gallery testimony in the chairman''s office, the thirst of the Shell whose water-supply contract has ended, so that the date of the succession exam does not come before the kettle.\n\n**Fear.** That a stakeholder''s testimony will be turned into a figurehead roster for protected water supply, making her the guarantor of a water cutoff she was never part of.\n\n**Intervention.** She can leave the kettle''s time as public testimony, or forge handprints and bind stakeholders into negotiations as figureheads.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 15 | Openness −10 | Force −5 | Material 20 | Communal 30 | Principle 20 | Publicity −5 | Credential 60 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation −20\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Possessiveness −5 | Risk 10 | Display 20 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: Fluid | Bonding: None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Pyeong Chaewon","type":"Contract","to":"Seo Jin-a","basis":"and adding the party''s handprint to Seo Jina''s housing audit box"},{"from":"Pyeong Chaewon","type":"Contract","to":"Mobok","basis":"Read Mobok''s water-level rod overlaid with kettle time"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0294","name":"평채원","title":"급수 압력 저하 주거 당사자","position":"강남역 사택 급수 당사자","characterId":"K293","rank":"사원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"사택 급수 압력 기록·연서 확인","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-평채원","detailRoute":"/people/person-0294","birthDate":"2080-10-12","birthday":"10-12","age":46,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k293-water-timing-testimony","name":"급수 시각 증언","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"k293-priority","name":"본인 증언 고수","description":"평채원은 식은 주전자로 갈증을 증언하고 본인 손도장만 받는다. 압력 관찰은 전문 배관 정비 이력이 아니다.","behavior":"압력계 바늘이 멈춘 시각을 주전자 옆 종이에 적고, 연서에는 본인 손도장만 받아 서진아의 감사 함에 넣는다.","stress":"당사자 증언이 보호 급수의 들러리 명부로 바뀌어 자신이 없는 단수의 보증인이 되는 것.","relationship":"서진아의 사택 감사 함에 당사자 손도장을 보태고, 모복의 수위 막대를 주전자 시간과 겹쳐 읽는다. 한재목의 물 협상이 쉘 이름을 빌려 쓰면 증언을 거둔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k293-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 사택 급수 당사자. 압력계 바늘이 멈춘 시각을 주전자 옆 종이에 적고, 연서에는 본인 손도장만 받아 서진아의 감사 함에 넣는다.","stress":"공포. 당사자 증언이 보호 급수의 들러리 명부로 바뀌어 자신이 없는 단수의 보증인이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 서진아의 사택 감사 함에 당사자 손도장을 보태고, 모복의 수위 막대를 주전자 시간과 겹쳐 읽는다. 한재목의 물 협상이 쉘 이름을 빌려 쓰면 증언을 거둔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"평채원은 식은 주전자로 갈증을 증언하고 본인 손도장만 받는다. 압력 관찰은 전문 배관 정비 이력이 아니다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d3c9-cda9-c8fc","name":"충주 평씨","crest":"clan-crests/d3c9-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":15,"개방":-10,"무력":-5,"물질":20,"공동":30,"원칙":20,"공개":-5,"자격":60,"분산":10,"변혁":-20},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":-5,"위험":10,"과시":20,"지속":-15,"지향":"유동","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"사택 급수 압력 기록·연서 확인","소속":"Arc","품계":"사원","직함":"강남역 사택 급수 당사자","가치관":"권위 15 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −5 | 물질 20 | 공동 30 | 원칙 20 | 공개 −5 | 자격 60 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −20","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 −5 | 위험 10 | 과시 20 | 지속 −15 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"영등포 정수 당직에서 자랐다. 강남역 사택 급수 당사자 자리는 탁수 밤의 밸브 서명으로 열렸다.\n- 평채원은 서초2동에서 사택 급수 압력 기록·연서 확인 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 사택의 청원·급수 잔량·수위·사고 기록 업무를 서초2동 생활권 근무 참조로 제안한다. 기존 감사·반장·도제 서명 조건을 보존하고 개인 거주·숙소 소유는 추정하지 않는다. 서진아의 사택 감사 함에 당사자 손도장을 보태고, 모복의 수위 막대를 주전자 시간과 겹쳐 읽는다. 한재목의 물 협상이 쉘 이름을 빌려 쓰면 증언을 거둔다","관직":"품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 사택 급수 당사자. 압력계 바늘이 멈춘 시각을 주전자 옆 종이에 적고, 연서에는 본인 손도장만 받아 서진아의 감사 함에 넣는다.","일화":"세 번째 급수계약이 만료되며 북부 압력계가 떨리자 평채원은 승계 시험 이야기 대신 식은 주전자를 회장실 탁자에 올렸다.","관계":"서진아의 사택 감사 함에 당사자 손도장을 보태고, 모복의 수위 막대를 주전자 시간과 겹쳐 읽는다. 한재목의 물 협상이 쉘 이름을 빌려 쓰면 증언을 거둔다.","야망":"급수계약이 끝난 쉘의 갈증을 회장실 방청 증언으로 남겨, 승계 시험 날짜가 주전자보다 앞서지 않게 한다.","공포":"당사자 증언이 보호 급수의 들러리 명부로 바뀌어 자신이 없는 단수의 보증인이 되는 것.","개입":"주전자 시각을 공개 증언으로 남기거나, 손도장을 위조해 당사자를 협상 들러리로 묶을 수 있다."},"biography":"주전자가 식는 속도를 증언의 단위로 쓰고, 압력계 바늘이 떨리면 회의 말보다 먼저 일어선다. 남이 대신 눌러 준 손도장을 자신의 갈증으로 인정하지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 사택 급수 압력 기록·연서 확인\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 사원\n- 직함: 강남역 사택 급수 당사자\n**생애.** 영등포 정수 당직에서 자랐다. 강남역 사택 급수 당사자 자리는 탁수 밤의 밸브 서명으로 열렸다.\n- 평채원은 서초2동에서 사택 급수 압력 기록·연서 확인 업무를 맡는다. 강남역 사택의 청원·급수 잔량·수위·사고 기록 업무를 서초2동 생활권 근무 참조로 제안한다. 기존 감사·반장·도제 서명 조건을 보존하고 개인 거주·숙소 소유는 추정하지 않는다. 서진아의 사택 감사 함에 당사자 손도장을 보태고, 모복의 수위 막대를 주전자 시간과 겹쳐 읽는다. 한재목의 물 협상이 쉘 이름을 빌려 쓰면 증언을 거둔다\n\n**관직.** 품계 사원. 직함은 강남역 사택 급수 당사자. 압력계 바늘이 멈춘 시각을 주전자 옆 종이에 적고, 연서에는 본인 손도장만 받아 서진아의 감사 함에 넣는다.\n\n**일화.** 세 번째 급수계약이 만료되며 북부 압력계가 떨리자 평채원은 승계 시험 이야기 대신 식은 주전자를 회장실 탁자에 올렸다.\n\n**관계.** 서진아의 사택 감사 함에 당사자 손도장을 보태고, 모복의 수위 막대를 주전자 시간과 겹쳐 읽는다. 한재목의 물 협상이 쉘 이름을 빌려 쓰면 증언을 거둔다.\n\n**야망.** 급수계약이 끝난 쉘의 갈증을 회장실 방청 증언으로 남겨, 승계 시험 날짜가 주전자보다 앞서지 않게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 당사자 증언이 보호 급수의 들러리 명부로 바뀌어 자신이 없는 단수의 보증인이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 주전자 시각을 공개 증언으로 남기거나, 손도장을 위조해 당사자를 협상 들러리로 묶을 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 15 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −5 | 물질 20 | 공동 30 | 원칙 20 | 공개 −5 | 자격 60 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −20\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 −5 | 위험 10 | 과시 20 | 지속 −15 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"평채원","type":"계약","to":"서진아","basis":"서진아의 주거 감사 함에 당사자 손도장을 보태고"},{"from":"평채원","type":"계약","to":"모복","basis":"모복의 수위 막대를 주전자 시간과 겹쳐 읽는다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0295', 'b2e8-ac15-c74c', '{"id":"person-0295","name":"Dan Geonu","title":"Lesser States Council Northern Envoy Technician","position":"Lesser States Council Northern Envoy Technician","characterId":"K294","rank":"Employee","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Yeoksam 1-dong work crew and accident ledger records","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#person-dan-geonu","detailRoute":"/people/person-0295","birthDate":"2086-10-18","birthday":"10-18","age":40,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k294-technical-clause-drafting","name":"Technical clause drafting","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k294-priority","name":"Discloses private notes","description":"Dan Geonu disclosed the postponement note and brought work and accident records to negotiations. Submitting repair clauses is not concluding an agreement.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: lesser-states council northern envoy technician. He wrote work-squad rotations and accident signatures in the same ledger and pasted notes demanding a trial postponement on the board as they came.","stress":"Fear. That the envoy bag would turn into ration-window notes, the main gate would become a housing counter, and the council would end in partition.","relationship":"Relations. Cited I Hongwon''s technology trial schedule as the council envoys'' grounds, moved Gang Minseo''s repair standards into the draft, and raised the northern technical clause onto Jeong Yura''s joint-negotiation seat.","effects":[]},{"id":"k294-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: lesser-states council northern envoy technician. He wrote work-squad rotations and accident signatures in the same ledger and pasted notes demanding a trial postponement on the board as they came.","stress":"Fear. That the envoy bag would turn into ration-window notes, the main gate would become a housing counter, and the council would end in partition.","relationship":"Relations. Cited I Hongwon''s technology trial schedule as the council envoys'' grounds, moved Gang Minseo''s repair standards into the draft, and raised the northern technical clause onto Jeong Yura''s joint-negotiation seat.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Dan Geonu disclosed the postponement note and brought work and accident records to negotiations. Submitting repair clauses is not concluding an agreement.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b2e8-ac15-c74c","name":"Gangeum Dan Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b2e8-ac15-c74c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":20,"Openness":-10,"Force":-5,"Material":40,"Communal":25,"Principle":5,"Public":-5,"Eligibility":85,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":0,"Risk":-30,"Display":-5,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Yeoksam 1-dong work crew and accident ledger records","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Employee","Title":"Lesser States Council Northern Envoy Technician","Values":"Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force −5 | Materiality 40 | Communal 25 | Principle 5 | Publicity −5 | Credentials 85 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Longing 30 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −30 | Display −5 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Union: Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up at the Jegi-dong infirmary. The post of Northern Envoy Technician of the Weak Nations Council opened through a forged medicine seal.\n- Dan Geonu handles work-crew and accident ledger recording for Yeoksam 1-dong in Yeoksam 1-dong. He refines Seongha Electronics'' maintenance samples, weights, lots, measurements, work crews, and accident signatures to the Yeoksam 1-dong work-living area adjacent to Gangnam Station. The cargo handover at the Yeoksam waiting hall is for reference only and does not confirm actual factory equipment, warehouse monopolies, or running trains. Cite Yi Hongwon''s succession exam schedule as the basis for the council envoy, carry Gang Minseo''s repair standards into the text, and put the northern technical clause on Jeong Yura''s seat at the headquarters negotiations","Offices":"Rank: Employee. Title: Northern Envoy Technician of the Weak Nations Council. Records work-crew rotations and accident signatures in the same ledger, and posts notes demanding an exam postponement on the bulletin board exactly as they are.","Anecdote":"A company-housing note telling them to delay Yi Hongwon''s succession exam is pasted over the Yeoksam 1-dong technical log. Dan Geonu moves the note to the bulletin board and makes it public, then takes the ledger recording work-crew rotations and accident signatures to Jeong Yura''s headquarters negotiating table.","Relationships":"Cite Yi Hongwon''s succession exam schedule as the basis for the council envoy, carry Gang Minseo''s repair standards into the text, and put the northern technical clause on Jeong Yura''s seat at the headquarters negotiations.","Ambition":"At the work-living-area council, to put Seongha Electronics'' repair standards and labor mobility rights into the headquarters negotiation text, so that the Seongha Group is signed by the hand of the work-living-area envoy as well.","Fear":"The envoy''s bag turning into a ration-window note, the main gate becoming a company-housing window, and the council ending in divided subjugation.","Intervention":"Can make public a bribed postponement note, or escort the witness to the repair-rights draft all the way to the council hall."},"biography":"Remembers accident dates before people''s names, and does not open the base''s operations before transferring verbal approvals into the courier ledger. Snaps the chalk when a company-housing note is posted above the technical log.\n\n- Livelihood: Yeoksam 1-dong work-crew and accident ledger recording\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Employee\n- Title: Northern Envoy Technician of the Weak Nations Council\n**Life.** Grew up at the Jegi-dong infirmary. The post of Northern Envoy Technician of the Weak Nations Council opened through a forged medicine seal.\n- Dan Geonu handles work-crew and accident ledger recording for Yeoksam 1-dong in Yeoksam 1-dong. He refines Seongha Electronics'' maintenance samples, weights, lots, measurements, work crews, and accident signatures to the Yeoksam 1-dong work-living area adjacent to Gangnam Station. The cargo handover at the Yeoksam waiting hall is for reference only and does not confirm actual factory equipment, warehouse monopolies, or running trains. Cite Yi Hongwon''s succession exam schedule as the basis for the council envoy, carry Gang Minseo''s repair standards into the text, and put the northern technical clause on Jeong Yura''s seat at the headquarters negotiations\n\n**Office.** Rank: Employee. Title: Northern Envoy Technician of the Weak Nations Council. Records work-crew rotations and accident signatures in the same ledger, and posts notes demanding an exam postponement on the bulletin board exactly as they are.\n\n**Anecdote.** A company-housing note telling them to delay Yi Hongwon''s succession exam is pasted over the Yeoksam 1-dong technical log. Dan Geonu moves the note to the bulletin board and makes it public, then takes the ledger recording work-crew rotations and accident signatures to Jeong Yura''s headquarters negotiating table.\n\n**Relationships.** Cite Yi Hongwon''s succession exam schedule as the basis for the council envoy, carry Gang Minseo''s repair standards into the text, and put the northern technical clause on Jeong Yura''s seat at the headquarters negotiations.\n\n**Ambition.** At the work-living-area council, to put Seongha Electronics'' repair standards and labor mobility rights into the headquarters negotiation text, so that the Seongha Group is signed by the hand of the work-living-area envoy as well.\n\n**Fear.** The envoy''s bag turning into a ration-window note, the main gate becoming a company-housing window, and the council ending in divided subjugation.\n\n**Intervention.** Can make public a bribed postponement note, or escort the witness to the repair-rights draft all the way to the council hall.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 20 | Openness −10 | Force −5 | Materiality 40 | Communal 25 | Principle 5 | Publicity −5 | Credentials 85 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Longing 30 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −30 | Display −5 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Union: Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Dan Geonu","type":"Contract","to":"Yi Hong-won","basis":"Cites Yi Hongwon''s technical exam schedule as grounds for declining the meeting,"},{"from":"Dan Geonu","type":"Contract","to":"Gang Minseo","basis":"Transferring Gang Minseo''s repair standards into the text"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0295","name":"단건우","title":"약소국 회의 북부 사절 기술자","position":"약소국 회의 북부 사절 기술자","characterId":"K294","rank":"사원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"역삼1동 작업 조·사고 원장 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-단건우","detailRoute":"/people/person-0295","birthDate":"2086-10-18","birthday":"10-18","age":40,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k294-technical-clause-drafting","name":"기술 문안 작성","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k294-priority","name":"사적 쪽지 공개","description":"단건우는 연기 쪽지를 공개한 뒤 작업·사고 원장을 교섭 자리로 가져갔다. 수리권 문안 제출과 실제 협약 성립은 다르다.","behavior":"작업 조 순환과 사고 서명을 같은 원장에 적고, 시험 연기를 요구하는 쪽지는 게시판에 그대로 붙인다.","stress":"사절 가방이 배급 창구 쪽지로 바뀌어 정문이 사택 창구가 되고 회의가 분할 복속으로 끝나는 것.","relationship":"이홍원의 승계 시험 일정을 회의 사절의 근거로 들고, 강민서의 수리 규격을 문안에 옮기며, 정유라의 본사 교섭 좌석에 북부 기술 조항을 올린다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k294-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 사원. 직함은 성하전자 바깥 작업장 사절 기술자. 작업 조 순환과 사고 서명을 같은 원장에 적고, 시험 연기를 요구하는 쪽지는 게시판에 그대로 붙인다.","stress":"공포. 사절 가방이 배급 창구 쪽지로 바뀌어 정문이 사택 창구가 되고 회의가 분할 복속으로 끝나는 것.","relationship":"관계. 이홍원의 승계 시험 일정을 회의 사절의 근거로 들고, 강민서의 수리 규격을 문안에 옮기며, 정유라의 본사 교섭 좌석에 북부 기술 조항을 올린다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"단건우는 연기 쪽지를 공개한 뒤 작업·사고 원장을 교섭 자리로 가져갔다. 수리권 문안 제출과 실제 협약 성립은 다르다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b2e8-ac15-c74c","name":"강음 단씨","crest":"clan-crests/b2e8-ac15-c74c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":20,"개방":-10,"무력":-5,"물질":40,"공동":25,"원칙":5,"공개":-5,"자격":85,"분산":20,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":0,"위험":-30,"과시":-5,"지속":0,"지향":"이성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"역삼1동 작업 조·사고 원장 기록","소속":"Arc","품계":"사원","직함":"약소국 회의 북부 사절 기술자","가치관":"권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −5 | 물질 40 | 공동 25 | 원칙 5 | 공개 −5 | 자격 85 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 0 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −5 | 지속 0 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 약소국 회의 북부 사절 기술자 자리는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 단건우는 역삼1동에서 역삼1동 작업 조·사고 원장 기록 업무를 맡는다. 성하전자 정비 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명 업무를 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권으로 정밀화한다. 역삼 대합실 화물 인계는 참고이며 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. 이홍원의 승계 시험 일정을 회의 사절의 근거로 들고, 강민서의 수리 규격을 문안에 옮기며, 정유라의 본사 교섭 좌석에 북부 기술 조항을 올린다","관직":"품계 사원. 직함은 약소국 회의 북부 사절 기술자. 작업 조 순환과 사고 서명을 같은 원장에 적고, 시험 연기를 요구하는 쪽지는 게시판에 그대로 붙인다.","일화":"이홍원의 승계 시험을 미루라는 사택 쪽 쪽지가 역삼1동 기술 일지 위에 붙는다. 단건우는 쪽지를 게시판으로 옮겨 공개하고, 작업 조 순환과 사고 서명을 적은 원장을 들고 정유라의 본사 교섭 자리로 간다.","관계":"이홍원의 승계 시험 일정을 회의 사절의 근거로 들고, 강민서의 수리 규격을 문안에 옮기며, 정유라의 본사 교섭 좌석에 북부 기술 조항을 올린다.","야망":"작업 생활권 회의에서 성하전자의 수리 규격과 노동 이동권을 본사 교섭 문안에 넣어 성하그룹이 작업 생활권 사절의 손으로도 서명되게 한다.","공포":"사절 가방이 배급 창구 쪽지로 바뀌어 정문이 사택 창구가 되고 회의가 분할 복속으로 끝나는 것.","개입":"매수된 연기 쪽지를 공개하거나, 수리권 초안 증인을 회의장까지 호송할 수 있다."},"biography":"사고 날짜를 사람 이름보다 먼저 기억하고, 구두 승인을 전령 원장에 옮기기 전에 기지 가동을 열지 않는다. 사택 쪽 쪽지가 기술 일지보다 위에 붙으면 분필을 꺾는다.\n\n- 생업: 역삼1동 작업 조·사고 원장 기록\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 사원\n- 직함: 약소국 회의 북부 사절 기술자\n**생애.** 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 약소국 회의 북부 사절 기술자 자리는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 단건우는 역삼1동에서 역삼1동 작업 조·사고 원장 기록 업무를 맡는다. 성하전자 정비 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명 업무를 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권으로 정밀화한다. 역삼 대합실 화물 인계는 참고이며 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. 이홍원의 승계 시험 일정을 회의 사절의 근거로 들고, 강민서의 수리 규격을 문안에 옮기며, 정유라의 본사 교섭 좌석에 북부 기술 조항을 올린다\n\n**관직.** 품계 사원. 직함은 약소국 회의 북부 사절 기술자. 작업 조 순환과 사고 서명을 같은 원장에 적고, 시험 연기를 요구하는 쪽지는 게시판에 그대로 붙인다.\n\n**일화.** 이홍원의 승계 시험을 미루라는 사택 쪽 쪽지가 역삼1동 기술 일지 위에 붙는다. 단건우는 쪽지를 게시판으로 옮겨 공개하고, 작업 조 순환과 사고 서명을 적은 원장을 들고 정유라의 본사 교섭 자리로 간다.\n\n**관계.** 이홍원의 승계 시험 일정을 회의 사절의 근거로 들고, 강민서의 수리 규격을 문안에 옮기며, 정유라의 본사 교섭 좌석에 북부 기술 조항을 올린다.\n\n**야망.** 작업 생활권 회의에서 성하전자의 수리 규격과 노동 이동권을 본사 교섭 문안에 넣어 성하그룹이 작업 생활권 사절의 손으로도 서명되게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 사절 가방이 배급 창구 쪽지로 바뀌어 정문이 사택 창구가 되고 회의가 분할 복속으로 끝나는 것.\n\n**개입.** 매수된 연기 쪽지를 공개하거나, 수리권 초안 증인을 회의장까지 호송할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 20 | 개방 −10 | 무력 −5 | 물질 40 | 공동 25 | 원칙 5 | 공개 −5 | 자격 85 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 0 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −5 | 지속 0 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"단건우","type":"계약","to":"이홍원","basis":"이홍원의 기술시험 일정을 회의 사절의 근거로 들고"},{"from":"단건우","type":"계약","to":"강민서","basis":"강민서의 수리 규격을 문안에 옮기며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0296', 'c21c-d64d-c0b0', '{"id":"person-0296","name":"Sun Hajun","title":"Second Water Supply Pact Wheel Exchange Witness","position":"Seongha Electronics Wheel Exchange Witness","characterId":"K295","rank":"Employee","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Wheel Intake Weight · Dispatch Testimony","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#person-sun-hajun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0296","birthDate":"2064-03-06","birthday":"03-06","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k295-specification-and-weight-verification","name":"Specification and weight verification","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k295-priority","name":"Witness to exchange","description":"Sun Hajun weighed exhausted parts and checked specification seals. He fears his testimony will justify military shipments after the guarantor disappears.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: water contract wheel exchange witness. Two witnesses reported intake weights, and he blocked the release of any order stamped with a house seal before the seniority council''s ratification.","stress":"Fear. That after the guarantor vanished, the exchange testimony would be cited only as grounds for munitions-only releases.","relationship":"Relations. Overlaid the treaty tonnage on Hwang Noeul''s salvage scales, pointed to the same box as Choo Hangyeol''s Yongsan transshipment testimony, and witnessed the Changdong-side release of the parts column Im Hajun had guaranteed.","effects":[]},{"id":"k295-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: assistant manager. Title: water contract wheel exchange witness. Two witnesses reported intake weights, and he blocked the release of any order stamped with a house seal before the seniority council''s ratification.","stress":"Fear. That after the guarantor vanished, the exchange testimony would be cited only as grounds for munitions-only releases.","relationship":"Relations. Overlaid the treaty tonnage on Hwang Noeul''s salvage scales, pointed to the same box as Choo Hangyeol''s Yongsan transshipment testimony, and witnessed the Changdong-side release of the parts column Im Hajun had guaranteed.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Sun Hajun weighed exhausted parts and checked specification seals. He fears his testimony will justify military shipments after the guarantor disappears.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c21c-d64d-c0b0","name":"Hongsan Sun Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c21c-d64d-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":10,"Openness":0,"Force":-10,"Material":35,"Communal":10,"Principle":10,"Public":-5,"Eligibility":55,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":-20},"desire":{"Longing":-10,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":30,"Display":20,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Wheel Intake Weight · Dispatch Testimony","Affiliation":"Arc","Rank":"Employee","Title":"Seongha Electronics Wheel Exchange Witness","Values":"Authority 10 | Openness 0 | Force −10 | Materiality 35 | Communal 10 | Principle 10 | Publicity −5 | Credentials 55 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation −20","Desires":"Longing −10 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 30 | Display 20 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Monogamy"},"sections":{"Life":"Grew up on the water-purification night watch at Yeongdeungpo. The post of Seongha Electronics Wheel Exchange Witness opened through a valve signature on the night of the turbid water.\n- Sun Hajun handles wheel intake-weight and dispatch testimony work in Yeoksam 1-dong. He refines Seongha Electronics'' maintenance samples, weights, lots, measurements, work crews, and accident signatures to the Yeoksam 1-dong work-living area adjacent to Gangnam Station. The cargo handover at the Yeoksam waiting hall is for reference only and does not confirm actual factory equipment, warehouse monopolies, or running trains. Overlap the agreed weight on Hwang Noeul''s recovery scale, point to the same box as Chu Hangyeol''s Yongsan transshipment testimony, and testify to the Seongha Electronics-side dispatch of the parts compartment guaranteed by Im Hajun","Offices":"Rank: Employee. Title: Seongha Electronics Wheel Exchange Witness. Two witnesses observe the intake weight, and an order stamped with a family crest is blocked from dispatch before the chairman''s office approves it.","Anecdote":"When the water-supply contract was concluded, Sun Hajun placed the worn-out wheels and brake box on the Seongha Electronics scale and checked the standard seal.","Relationships":"Overlap the agreed weight on Hwang Noeul''s recovery scale, point to the same box as Chu Hangyeol''s Yongsan transshipment testimony, and testify to the Seongha Electronics-side dispatch of the parts compartment guaranteed by Im Hajun.","Ambition":"To leave the water-supply contract''s train parts exchange in Seongha Electronics'' standard inventory ledger, so that no particular work crew can shake the succession by holding parts hostage.","Fear":"That after the guarantor disappears, the exchange testimony will be cited only as grounds for military-exclusive dispatch.","Intervention":"Can recall a steel lot, or have the Chairman''s Office halt shipments on the clan''s side."},"biography":"Regards falsified-weight dispatch as the same as shaving down the rails, and harshly stands against cargo slipping into the Yi family''s exclusive compartments. Trusts the public scale over market prices.\n\n- Livelihood: Wheel intake weight and dispatch testimony\n- Affiliation: Arc\n- Rank: Employee\n- Title: Seongha Electronics Wheel Exchange Witness\n**Life.** Grew up on the water-purification night watch at Yeongdeungpo. The post of Seongha Electronics Wheel Exchange Witness opened through a valve signature on the night of the turbid water.\n- Sun Hajun handles wheel intake-weight and dispatch testimony work in Yeoksam 1-dong. He refines Seongha Electronics'' maintenance samples, weights, lots, measurements, work crews, and accident signatures to the Yeoksam 1-dong work-living area adjacent to Gangnam Station. The cargo handover at the Yeoksam waiting hall is for reference only and does not confirm actual factory equipment, warehouse monopolies, or running trains. Overlap the agreed weight on Hwang Noeul''s recovery scale, point to the same box as Chu Hangyeol''s Yongsan transshipment testimony, and testify to the Seongha Electronics-side dispatch of the parts compartment guaranteed by Im Hajun\n\n**Office.** Rank: Employee. Title: Seongha Electronics Wheel Exchange Witness. Two witnesses observe the intake weight, and an order stamped with a family crest is blocked from dispatch before the chairman''s office approves it.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the water-supply contract was concluded, Sun Hajun placed the worn-out wheels and brake box on the Seongha Electronics scale and checked the standard seal.\n\n**Relationships.** Overlap the agreed weight on Hwang Noeul''s recovery scale, point to the same box as Chu Hangyeol''s Yongsan transshipment testimony, and testify to the Seongha Electronics-side dispatch of the parts compartment guaranteed by Im Hajun.\n\n**Ambition.** To leave the water-supply contract''s train parts exchange in Seongha Electronics'' standard inventory ledger, so that no particular work crew can shake the succession by holding parts hostage.\n\n**Fear.** That after the guarantor disappears, the exchange testimony will be cited only as grounds for military-exclusive dispatch.\n\n**Intervention.** Can recover steel lots, or halt family-side dispatch at the chairman''s office.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 10 | Openness 0 | Force −10 | Materiality 35 | Communal 10 | Principle 10 | Publicity −5 | Credentials 55 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation −20\n- Desires: Longing −10 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 30 | Display 20 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Monogamy\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Sun Hajun","type":"Oath","to":"Hwang No-eul","basis":"Overlaying the agreed weight on Hwang Noeul''s recovery scale"},{"from":"Sun Hajun","type":"Oath","to":"Philipp Müller","basis":"Pointing to the same box as Philipp Müller''s Yongsan transshipment testimony"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0296","name":"순하준","title":"둘째 급수협약 차륜 교환 증인","position":"성하전자 차륜 교환 증인","characterId":"K295","rank":"사원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"차륜 입고 중량·출고 증언","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"arc","stateName":"Arc","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-11#인물-순하준","detailRoute":"/people/person-0296","birthDate":"2064-03-06","birthday":"03-06","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k295-specification-and-weight-verification","name":"규격·중량 확인","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k295-priority","name":"교환의 증인","description":"순하준은 수명이 다한 부품 상자를 저울에 올리고 규격 도장을 확인했다. 보증인 실종 뒤 증언이 군수 출고 근거로 바뀌는 것을 두려워한다.","behavior":"입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 가문 문장이 찍힌 주문서는 회장실 인준 전 출고를 막는다.","stress":"보증인이 사라진 뒤 교환 증언이 군수 전용 출고의 근거로만 인용되는 것.","relationship":"황노을의 회수 저울에 협약 중량을 겹치고, 추한결의 용산 환적 증언과 같은 상자를 가리키며, 임하준이 보증한 부품 칸의 성하전자 쪽 출고를 증언한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k295-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 사원. 직함은 성하전자 차륜 교환 증인. 입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 가문 문장이 찍힌 주문서는 회장실 인준 전 출고를 막는다.","stress":"공포. 보증인이 사라진 뒤 교환 증언이 군수 전용 출고의 근거로만 인용되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 황노을의 회수 저울에 협약 중량을 겹치고, 추한결의 용산 환적 증언과 같은 상자를 가리키며, 임하준이 보증한 부품 칸의 성하전자 쪽 출고를 증언한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"순하준은 수명이 다한 부품 상자를 저울에 올리고 규격 도장을 확인했다. 보증인 실종 뒤 증언이 군수 출고 근거로 바뀌는 것을 두려워한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c21c-d64d-c0b0","name":"홍산 순씨","crest":"clan-crests/c21c-d64d-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":10,"개방":0,"무력":-10,"물질":35,"공동":10,"원칙":10,"공개":-5,"자격":55,"분산":10,"변혁":-20},"desire":{"갈망":-10,"독점":10,"위험":30,"과시":20,"지속":5,"지향":"양성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"차륜 입고 중량·출고 증언","소속":"Arc","품계":"사원","직함":"성하전자 차륜 교환 증인","가치관":"권위 10 | 개방 0 | 무력 −10 | 물질 35 | 공동 10 | 원칙 10 | 공개 −5 | 자격 55 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −20","욕망":"갈망 −10 | 독점 10 | 위험 30 | 과시 20 | 지속 5 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"영등포 정수 당직에서 자랐다. 성하전자 차륜 교환 증인 자리는 탁수 밤의 밸브 서명으로 열렸다.\n- 순하준은 역삼1동에서 차륜 입고 중량·출고 증언 업무를 맡는다. 성하전자 정비 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명 업무를 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권으로 정밀화한다. 역삼 대합실 화물 인계는 참고이며 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. 황노을의 회수 저울에 협약 중량을 겹치고, 추한결의 용산 환적 증언과 같은 상자를 가리키며, 임하준이 보증한 부품 칸의 성하전자 쪽 출고를 증언한다","관직":"품계 사원. 직함은 성하전자 차륜 교환 증인. 입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 가문 문장이 찍힌 주문서는 회장실 인준 전 출고를 막는다.","일화":"급수 계약이 맺어질 때 순하준은 수명이 다한 차륜과 제동 상자를 성하전자 저울에 올리고 규격 도장을 확인했다.","관계":"황노을의 회수 저울에 협약 중량을 겹치고, 추한결의 용산 환적 증언과 같은 상자를 가리키며, 임하준이 보증한 부품 칸의 성하전자 쪽 출고를 증언한다.","야망":"급수 계약의 열차 부품 교환을 성하전자 표준 재고 원장에 남겨 특정 작업 조가 부품을 볼모로 후계를 흔들지 못하게 한다.","공포":"보증인이 사라진 뒤 교환 증언이 군수 전용 출고의 근거로만 인용되는 것.","개입":"철재 로트를 회수하거나, 가문 쪽 출고를 회장실에서 정지시킬 수 있다."},"biography":"무게를 속이는 출고를 선로를 깎는 일과 같다고 보고, 이씨 가문 전용 칸으로 빠지는 짐을 가혹하게 세운다. 시세보다 공개 저울을 믿는다.\n\n- 생업: 차륜 입고 중량·출고 증언\n- 소속: Arc\n- 품계: 사원\n- 직함: 성하전자 차륜 교환 증인\n**생애.** 영등포 정수 당직에서 자랐다. 성하전자 차륜 교환 증인 자리는 탁수 밤의 밸브 서명으로 열렸다.\n- 순하준은 역삼1동에서 차륜 입고 중량·출고 증언 업무를 맡는다. 성하전자 정비 표본·중량·로트·실측·작업 조·사고 서명 업무를 강남역 인접 역삼1동 작업 생활권으로 정밀화한다. 역삼 대합실 화물 인계는 참고이며 실제 공장 설비·창고 독점·운행 열차를 확정하지 않는다. 황노을의 회수 저울에 협약 중량을 겹치고, 추한결의 용산 환적 증언과 같은 상자를 가리키며, 임하준이 보증한 부품 칸의 성하전자 쪽 출고를 증언한다\n\n**관직.** 품계 사원. 직함은 성하전자 차륜 교환 증인. 입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 가문 문장이 찍힌 주문서는 회장실 인준 전 출고를 막는다.\n\n**일화.** 급수 계약이 맺어질 때 순하준은 수명이 다한 차륜과 제동 상자를 성하전자 저울에 올리고 규격 도장을 확인했다.\n\n**관계.** 황노을의 회수 저울에 협약 중량을 겹치고, 추한결의 용산 환적 증언과 같은 상자를 가리키며, 임하준이 보증한 부품 칸의 성하전자 쪽 출고를 증언한다.\n\n**야망.** 급수 계약의 열차 부품 교환을 성하전자 표준 재고 원장에 남겨 특정 작업 조가 부품을 볼모로 후계를 흔들지 못하게 한다.\n\n**공포.** 보증인이 사라진 뒤 교환 증언이 군수 전용 출고의 근거로만 인용되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 철재 로트를 회수하거나, 가문 쪽 출고를 회장실에서 정지시킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 10 | 개방 0 | 무력 −10 | 물질 35 | 공동 10 | 원칙 10 | 공개 −5 | 자격 55 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −20\n- 욕망: 갈망 −10 | 독점 10 | 위험 30 | 과시 20 | 지속 5 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"순하준","type":"맹세","to":"황노을","basis":"황노을의 회수 저울에 협약 중량을 겹치고"},{"from":"순하준","type":"맹세","to":"필리프 뮐러","basis":"필리프 뮐러의 용산 환적 증언과 같은 상자를 가리키며"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0297', 'c7a5-baa9-cc9c-5f35', '{"id":"person-0297","name":"Jang Sehwa","title":"President","position":"Sinnae Transport President","characterId":"K296","rank":"President","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"Dispatch Duty Officer","gender":"Male","stage":"Key","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#person-jang-sehwa","detailRoute":"/people/person-0297","birthDate":"2098-08-11","birthday":"08-11","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K321","recipientName":"Seo Ongyeol","basis":"Interlocks with Jang Sehwa''s dispatch duty, but the stretcher key is drawn only from the duty box.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-12.json","anchor":"character-seoongyeol-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":12,"effective":12},"stewardship":{"base":15,"effective":15},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k296-seasonal-dispatch","name":"Seasonal dispatch","rating":75}],"traits":[{"id":"k296-trait-1","name":"Transfers fitted to the season","description":"Divides different train services by season.","behavior":"Divides different train services by season.","stress":"Prepares operating conditions before the council escort.","relationship":"Distinguishes Park Taegyeom’s schedule from her siding duty.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She separated ordinary and medical train times by season before the council escort began. She manages the conditions for sustained neutral transfers; scheduling medical trains does not confer clinical skill.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s12","name":{"ko":"Sinnae Station Directly Held Land"},"holderPersonId":"K296","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S12","stationRef":{"stationId":"Sinnae","stationName":"Sinnae"},"adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null}],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:kingdom-geography:seoul:02","name":"Northeast Kingdom","rank":"kingdom","holderPersonId":"K296","stateId":"S12","geographicTitleId":"geography:kingdom:seoul:02","basis":"2026-10-22 territorial title allocation (owner:seoul-faction-consolidation-20261022). President of Sinnae Transit. Basis for holding the directly held land of Sinnae Station (Nowon), the only national capital within the Northeast Kingdom.","parentTitle":null}],"clan":{"id":"c7a5-baa9-cc9c-5f35","name":"Mokcheon Jang Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c7a5-baa9-cc9c-5f35.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":40,"Force":-30,"Material":0,"Communal":20,"Principle":10,"Public":20,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":40,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":0,"Display":-10,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Dispatch Duty Officer","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"President","Title":"Sinnae Transport President"},"sections":{},"biography":"Life. Jang Sehwa was born on 2098-08-11 and has carried on the transfer duty records of the Sinnae-Yongsan Trackgate living area. At the opening of 2126, as President of Sinnae Transit, she coordinates patient transport and daily-goods handovers together on the timetable of the Permanent Winter. She upholds the Jang family''s route license, her status as keeper of the Yongsan Trackgate (HP02), the dispatch relationship with the Yongsan Escort House (HC11) run by Bak Taegyeom, and the house motto of neutral escort. Jang Hyeonseok''s 2030 record remains a matter of the previous generation and is not transferred to Jang Sehwa''s own career. Office. Rank: President. Title: President of Sinnae Transit. Livelihood alias: Dispatch Duty Officer. Anecdote. In preparing Jeong Yura''s conference escort, she split the times of general transport and medical transport by season and wrote them into the timetable, and finalized the order after checking patients'' vital signs and departmental seals. House. She is the keeper of the Yongsan Trackgate (HP02). The keeper of the Yongsan Escort House (HC11) is Bak Taegyeom. Relationships. She negotiates the conference escort with Jeong Yura and aligns timetables with Bak Taegyeom. Ambition. She intends to bind the dispatch slots for patient transport and daily-goods handovers into a public cross-reference table, and to confirm the priority of neutral escort at every seasonal rotation.\n\n- Livelihood: Dispatch Duty Officer\n- Affiliation: Sinnae Transit\n- Rank: President\n- Title: President of Sinnae Transit\n- The dispatch, rotation, and maintenance record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as Jang Sehwa''s duty reference point. While the proposal is under review, only the records of freight handover, rationing, water supply, and handcart waiting at the Sinnae waiting hall are cross-checked; running trains, new depot facilities, armament, toll authority, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles, fiefs, and possession rights are not confirmed.\n\nJang Sehwa finalizes the dispatch order when the patient vitals sheet and the departmental seals match, and entries that conflict with Bak Taegyeom''s timetable are recorded side by side in Jeong Yura''s conference escort ledger.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"An Dohan","type":"Command","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Handles transfer dispatch operations under the president''s command"},{"from":"Jeon Miri","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Enforces the medical alliance on the ground"},{"from":"Mun Sion","type":"Command","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Seeks to keep neutrality as a screening checkpoint"},{"from":"Ha Seon","type":"Command","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Enforces the light escort order"},{"from":"Nam Hoseong","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Shares medical escort with Sinnae Transit"},{"from":"Mun Doyun","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Plants the joint escort plan in the bid conditions"},{"from":"I Yunseo","type":"Debt","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"A debt from leaving medical-train neutrality as the last exception"},{"from":"Han Bora","type":"Debt","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"a debt for avoiding Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy on the tracks"},{"from":"Sin Tae-san","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Reviewing the joint convoy draft by field standards"},{"from":"Gwon Do-ha","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Aligned the northern escort timing"},{"from":"Cha Yun-mok","type":"Debt","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Takes on debt so as not to avoid Jang Sehwa''s neutral car"},{"from":"Noah Davis","type":"Debt","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Taking on debt so as not to avoid Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy at the Yongsan depot"},{"from":"Yeon Eun-jae","type":"Debt","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"incurs debts so as not to avoid Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy in Noryangjin"},{"from":"Mo Guk","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Leaves Jang Sehwa''s medical-bulletin accord as the relay priority"},{"from":"Stefan Petrov","type":"Oath","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"props up Jang Sehwa''s medical-escort neutrality with testimony"},{"from":"Cho Naru","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Fair-copies Jang Sehwa''s joint escort draft, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0297","name":"장세화","title":"사장","position":"신내운수 사장","characterId":"K296","rank":"사장","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"배차의무관","gender":"남성","stage":"주요","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-장세화","detailRoute":"/people/person-0297","birthDate":"2098-08-11","birthday":"08-11","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K321","recipientName":"서온결","basis":"장세화의 배차 의무와 맞물리되, 들것 열쇠는 당직함에서만 꺼낸다.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-12.json","anchor":"인물-서온결-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":12,"effective":12},"martial":{"base":12,"effective":12},"stewardship":{"base":15,"effective":15},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k296-seasonal-dispatch","name":"계절 배차","rating":75}],"traits":[{"id":"k296-trait-1","name":"계절에 맞춘 환승","description":"서로 다른 열차의 시간을 계절별로 나눈다.","behavior":"서로 다른 열차의 시간을 계절별로 나눈다.","stress":"회의 호송 전에 운행 조건부터 표로 마련한다.","relationship":"박태겸의 배차표와 자신의 유치선 당직을 구분한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"일반 열차와 의료열차 시간을 계절별로 나누어 회의 호송 전에 배차표를 마련했다. 중립 환승의 지속 조건을 다루는 운영자이며 의료열차를 배차한다고 진료 숙련을 가진 것은 아니다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s12","name":{"ko":"신내역 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K296","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S12","stationRef":{"stationId":"신내","stationName":"신내"},"adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null}],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:kingdom-geography:seoul:02","name":"북동 왕국","rank":"kingdom","holderPersonId":"K296","stateId":"S12","geographicTitleId":"geography:kingdom:seoul:02","basis":"2026-10-22 영토 작위 배분(owner:seoul-faction-consolidation-20261022). 신내운수 사장. 북동 왕국 안 유일한 국가 수도 신내역(노원) 직영지 보유 근거.","parentTitle":null}],"clan":{"id":"c7a5-baa9-cc9c-5f35","name":"목천 장씨","crest":"clan-crests/c7a5-baa9-cc9c-5f35.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"권위":-20,"개방":40,"무력":-30,"물질":0,"공동":20,"원칙":10,"공개":20,"자격":30,"분산":40,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-10,"위험":0,"과시":-10,"지속":30,"지향":"양성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"배차의무관","소속":"정부","품계":"사장","직함":"신내운수 사장"},"sections":{},"biography":"생애. 장세화는 2098-08-11에 태어나 신내·용산선로문 생활권의 환승 당직 기록을 이어 왔다. 2126년 개막에는 신내운수 사장으로서 영구 겨울의 배차표에서 환자 이송과 생활 화물 인계를 함께 조정한다. 장씨 가문의 노선 면허, 용산선로문(HP02) 관리인 지위, 박태겸이 맡은 용산호송가(HC11) 배차 관계와 중립 호송 가훈을 지킨다. 장현석의 2030년 기록은 선대의 일로 남으며 장세화 자신의 경력으로 옮기지 않는다. 관직. 품계 사장. 직함은 신내운수 사장. 생업 별명은 배차의무관. 일화. 정유라의 회의 호송을 준비하며 일반 이송과 의료 이송의 시간을 계절별로 갈라 배차표에 적었고, 환자 활력과 부서 날인을 확인한 뒤 순서를 확정했다. 가문. 용산선로문(HP02) 관리인이다. 용산호송가(HC11) 관리인은 박태겸이다. 관계. 정유라와 회의 호송을 협의하고 박태겸과 배차표를 맞춘다. 야망. 환자 이송과 생활 화물 인계의 배차 칸을 공개 대조표로 묶어 중립 호송의 우선순위를 계절 교대마다 확인하려 한다.\n\n- 생업: 배차의무관\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 사장\n- 직함: 신내운수 사장\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비 기록대가 장세화의 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 제안 검토 동안에는 신내 대합실의 화물 인계·배급·급수·손수레 대기 기록만 대조하며, 운행 열차·새 차량기지 설비·무장·통행세 권한·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n장세화는 환자 활력표와 부서 날인이 맞을 때 배차 순서를 확정하고, 박태겸의 배차표와 충돌한 칸은 정유라의 회의 호송 원장에 병기한다.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"안도한","type":"지휘","to":"장세화","basis":"환승 배차 실무를 사장 지휘로 맡음"},{"from":"전미리","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":"의료동맹을 현장에서 집행"},{"from":"문시온","type":"지휘","to":"장세화","basis":"중립을 심사대로 지키려 함"},{"from":"하세온","type":"지휘","to":"장세화","basis":"경량 호송 명령을 집행"},{"from":"남호성","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":"의료호송을 신내운수와 나눔"},{"from":"문도윤","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":"공동호송안을 입찰 조건에 심음"},{"from":"이윤서","type":"빚","to":"장세화","basis":"의료열차 중립을 마지막 예외로 남긴 빚"},{"from":"한보라","type":"빚","to":"장세화","basis":"의료호송을 선로에서 피하려는 빚"},{"from":"신태산","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":"공동호송 초안을 현장 기준으로 검토"},{"from":"권도하","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":"북부 호송 시각을 맞춤"},{"from":"차윤목","type":"빚","to":"장세화","basis":"장세화의 중립 칸을 피하지 않으려 빚을 지고"},{"from":"노아 데이비스","type":"빚","to":"장세화","basis":"장세화의 의료호송을 용산 창에서 피하지 않으려 빚을 지며"},{"from":"연은재","type":"빚","to":"장세화","basis":"장세화의 의료호송을 노량진에서 피하지 않으려 빚을 지며"},{"from":"모국","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":"장세화의 의료속보 협약을 중계 우선으로 남긴다"},{"from":"스테판 페트로프","type":"맹세","to":"장세화","basis":"장세화의 의료호송 중립을 증언으로 받치고"},{"from":"초나루","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":"장세화의 공동호송 초안을 정서하고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0298', 'c548-c21c-d765', '{"id":"person-0298","name":"An Dohan","title":"Transfer Dispatch Crew Chief","position":"Transfer Dispatch Crew Chief","characterId":"K297","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Dispatch Schedule · Escort Roster Posting","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#character-andohan","detailRoute":"/people/person-0298","birthDate":"2082-02-01","birthday":"02-01","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k297-dispatch-personnel-allocation","name":"Dispatch personnel allocation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k297-priority","name":"Fills timetable gaps","description":"An Dohan publishes timetables and escort numbers and moved casualties through snow. His sole dispatch approval ambition conflicts with medical oversight.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: transfer dispatch crew leader. He published the dispatch sheet and convoy personnel on one chalkboard, but honored the medical train''s priority only when Jang Sehwa''s departmental stamp stood on it.","stress":"Fear. That the northeast branch would be cut and the transfer city would fall into a freight yard that only passed between Changdong and Amsa.","relationship":"Relations. Held Jang Sehwa''s dispatch work, contested the approval order with Jeon Miri at every seasonal rotation, and depended on I Hongwon for the northern wheel-exchange hours.","effects":[]},{"id":"k297-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: transfer dispatch crew leader. He published the dispatch sheet and convoy personnel on one chalkboard, but honored the medical train''s priority only when Jang Sehwa''s departmental stamp stood on it.","stress":"Fear. That the northeast branch would be cut and the transfer city would fall into a freight yard that only passed between Changdong and Amsa.","relationship":"Relations. Held Jang Sehwa''s dispatch work, contested the approval order with Jeon Miri at every seasonal rotation, and depended on I Hongwon for the northern wheel-exchange hours.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"An Dohan publishes timetables and escort numbers and moved casualties through snow. His sole dispatch approval ambition conflicts with medical oversight.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c548-c21c-d765","name":"Sunheung An Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c548-c21c-d765.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":45,"Force":-25,"Material":10,"Communal":25,"Principle":0,"Public":15,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":40,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":35,"Risk":-20,"Display":25,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Dispatch Schedule · Escort Roster Posting","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Transfer Dispatch Crew Chief","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 45 | Force −25 | Material 10 | Communal 25 | Principle 0 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 40 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Craving 0 | Monopoly 35 | Risk −20 | Display 25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Multilateral"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2082-02-01. He grew up on Sinnae transfer duty. At the opening of 2126 he holds the post of Transfer Dispatch Squad Leader, and the record of his taking over the post notes that it opened up after he stopped a ticketless departing train.\n- The dispatch, rotation, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handover, and duty key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as An Dohan''s duty reference point for posting timetables and escort rosters. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the Permanent Winter; running trains, new facilities, armament, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles, fiefs, and possession rights are not confirmed.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Transfer Dispatch Team Leader. Posts the dispatch schedule and escort headcount on the same blackboard, but recognizes medical-train priority only when it bears the seal of Jang Sehwa''s department.","Anecdote":"In the heavy snow of 2125, cleared a transfer passage blocked by snow and moved the wounded out first. That record remained as a cross-check reference for the next duty shift.","Relationships":"He handled Jang Sehwa''s dispatch operations, contends with Jeon Miri over the approval order at every seasonal rotation, and depends on Yi Hongwon for the northern wheel-exchange times.","Ambition":"Seeks to fix Sinnae depot dispatch authority as a sole approval of the Dispatch Team, so that the real timetable of the neutral escort accord is in their own hands.","Fear":"That the northeast terminus will be blocked and Sinnae Transit will become a mere unloading yard that trains only pass through between Changdong and Amsa.","Intervention":"Can verify the actual cargo on the sealed holding track, or expose the Dispatch Team sole-approval proposal in front of the Medical Team."},"biography":"An Dohan, born 2082-02-01, cannot stand blanks in a timetable and corrects the blackboard before the seasonal rotation approval even arrives. Delays on the end-of-line routes are remembered as insults.\n\n- Occupation: posting dispatch schedules and escort headcounts\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Transfer Dispatch Team Leader\n**Life.** Born on 2082-02-01. Grew up on Sinnae transfer duty. At the 2126 opening holds the post of Transfer Dispatch Team Leader, and the succession record notes that the post opened with the halting of a train departing without tickets.\n- The records desk for dispatch, rotation, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handover, and duty keys at Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as An Dohan''s reference post for posting dispatch schedules and escort headcounts. This is a proposal to cross-check permanent-winter handover records, and it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Transfer Dispatch Team Leader. Posts the dispatch schedule and escort headcount on the same blackboard, but recognizes medical-train priority only when it bears the seal of Jang Sehwa''s department.\n\n**Anecdote.** In the heavy snow of 2125, cleared a transfer passage blocked by snow and moved the wounded out first. That record remained as a cross-check reference for the next duty shift.\n\n**Relations.** Handles Jang Sehwa''s practical dispatch work, contends with Jeon Miri over approval order at every seasonal rotation, and depends on I Hongwon for the northern wheel-exchange times.\n\n**Ambition.** Seeks to fix Sinnae depot dispatch authority as a sole approval of the Dispatch Team, so that the real timetable of the neutral escort accord is in their own hands.\n\n**Fear.** That the northeastern terminus gets blocked and Sinnae Transport becomes a mere unloading yard that traffic only passes through between Changdong and Amsa.\n\n**Intervention.** Can verify the actual cargo on the sealed holding track, or expose the Dispatch Team sole-approval proposal in front of the Medical Team.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 45 | Force −25 | Material 10 | Communal 25 | Principle 0 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 40 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly 35 | Risk −20 | Display 25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Fluid | Bond Multi-party\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"An Dohan","type":"Command","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Handles transfer dispatch operations under the president''s command"},{"from":"An Dohan","type":"Contract","to":"Yi Hong-won","basis":"Depends on northern wheelset exchange times"}],"incoming":[{"from":"So Dugam","type":"Contract","to":"An Dohan","basis":"taking over An Dohan''s dispatch work at the holding track, and"},{"from":"Bok Bong","type":"Contract","to":"An Dohan","basis":"aligning the unloading order with An Dohan''s dispatch blackboard, and"},{"from":"Du Bok","type":"Contract","to":"An Dohan","basis":"carrying notes about the approval-order dispute between Jeon Miri and An Dohan, and"},{"from":"Guk So","type":"Contract","to":"An Dohan","basis":"placing An Dohan''s dispatch schedule at the very top of the blackboard."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0298","name":"안도한","title":"환승 배차조장","position":"환승 배차조장","characterId":"K297","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"배차표·호송 인원 게시","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-안도한","detailRoute":"/people/person-0298","birthDate":"2082-02-01","birthday":"02-01","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k297-dispatch-personnel-allocation","name":"배차 인원 배치","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k297-priority","name":"빈 시각표를 메움","description":"안도한은 시각표와 호송 인원을 공개하고 폭설 통로에서 부상자를 옮겼다. 배차조 단독 승인 야망은 의료조 견제와 충돌한다.","behavior":"배차표와 호송 인원을 같은 칠판에 공개하되, 의료열차 우선권은 장세화의 부서 날인이 있을 때만 인정한다.","stress":"동북 말단이 막혀 신내운수가 창동과 암사 사이를 통과만 하는 하역장이 되는 것.","relationship":"장세화의 배차 실무를 맡았고, 전미리와는 계절 교대마다 승인 순서를 다투며, 이홍원에게 북부 차륜 교환 시각을 의존한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k297-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 배차조장. 배차표와 호송 인원을 같은 칠판에 공개하되, 의료열차 우선권은 장세화의 부서 날인이 있을 때만 인정한다.","stress":"공포. 동북 말단이 막혀 신내운수가 창동과 암사 사이를 통과만 하는 하역장이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 장세화의 배차 실무를 맡았고, 전미리와는 계절 교대마다 승인 순서를 다투며, 이홍원에게 북부 차륜 교환 시각을 의존한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"안도한은 시각표와 호송 인원을 공개하고 폭설 통로에서 부상자를 옮겼다. 배차조 단독 승인 야망은 의료조 견제와 충돌한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c548-c21c-d765","name":"순흥 안씨","crest":"clan-crests/c548-c21c-d765.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":45,"무력":-25,"물질":10,"공동":25,"원칙":0,"공개":15,"자격":20,"분산":40,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":35,"위험":-20,"과시":25,"지속":0,"지향":"유동","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"배차표·호송 인원 게시","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"환승 배차조장","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 45 | 무력 −25 | 물질 10 | 공동 25 | 원칙 0 | 공개 15 | 자격 20 | 분산 40 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 35 | 위험 −20 | 과시 25 | 지속 0 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2082-02-01에 태어났다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 환승 배차조장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 안도한의 배차표·호송 인원 게시 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 배차조장. 배차표와 호송 인원을 같은 칠판에 공개하되, 의료열차 우선권은 장세화의 부서 날인이 있을 때만 인정한다.","일화":"2125년 폭설에 막힌 환승 통로를 뚫어 부상자를 먼저 옮겼다. 그 기록은 다음 당직의 대조 근거로 남았다.","관계":"장세화의 배차 실무를 맡았고, 전미리와는 계절 교대마다 승인 순서를 다투며, 이홍원에게 북부 차륜 교환 시각을 의존한다.","야망":"신내 기지 배차권을 배차조 단독 승인으로 고정해 중립 호송 약정의 실제 시각표를 자신이 쥐려 하려 한다.","공포":"동북 말단이 막혀 신내운수가 창동과 암사 사이를 통과만 하는 하역장이 되는 것.","개입":"봉쇄된 유치선의 실제 화물을 확인하거나, 배차조 단독 승인안을 의료조 앞에서 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"2082-02-01생인 안도한은 시각표의 빈칸을 참지 못하고, 계절 교대 결재가 오기 전에 이미 칠판을 고쳐 둔다. 말단 노선의 지연을 모욕처럼 기억한다.\n\n- 생업: 배차표·호송 인원 게시\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 환승 배차조장\n**생애.** 2082-02-01에 태어났다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 환승 배차조장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 안도한의 배차표·호송 인원 게시 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 배차조장. 배차표와 호송 인원을 같은 칠판에 공개하되, 의료열차 우선권은 장세화의 부서 날인이 있을 때만 인정한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 폭설에 막힌 환승 통로를 뚫어 부상자를 먼저 옮겼다. 그 기록은 다음 당직의 대조 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 장세화의 배차 실무를 맡았고, 전미리와는 계절 교대마다 승인 순서를 다투며, 이홍원에게 북부 차륜 교환 시각을 의존한다.\n\n**야망.** 신내 기지 배차권을 배차조 단독 승인으로 고정해 중립 호송 약정의 실제 시각표를 자신이 쥐려 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 동북 말단이 막혀 신내운수가 창동과 암사 사이를 통과만 하는 하역장이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 봉쇄된 유치선의 실제 화물을 확인하거나, 배차조 단독 승인안을 의료조 앞에서 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 45 | 무력 −25 | 물질 10 | 공동 25 | 원칙 0 | 공개 15 | 자격 20 | 분산 40 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 35 | 위험 −20 | 과시 25 | 지속 0 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"안도한","type":"지휘","to":"장세화","basis":"환승 배차 실무를 사장 지휘로 맡음"},{"from":"안도한","type":"계약","to":"이홍원","basis":"북부 차륜 교환 시각을 의존"}],"incoming":[{"from":"소두감","type":"계약","to":"안도한","basis":"안도한의 배차 실무를 유치선에서 받고"},{"from":"복봉","type":"계약","to":"안도한","basis":"안도한의 배차 칠판과 하역 순서를 맞추고"},{"from":"두복","type":"계약","to":"안도한","basis":"전미리와 안도한의 승인 순서 다툼을 쪽지로 나르고"},{"from":"국소","type":"계약","to":"안도한","basis":"안도한의 배차표를 칠판 맨 위에 둔다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0299', 'c804-c625-cc9c-5168', '{"id":"person-0299","name":"Jeon Miri","title":"Medical Crew Member","position":"Medical Crew Member","characterId":"K298","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Patient Severity · Transfer Time Record","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-jeonmiri","detailRoute":"/people/person-0299","birthDate":"2080-03-07","birthday":"03-07","age":46,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k298-prescription-allocation","name":"Prescription allocation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k298-priority","name":"Severity first","description":"Jeon Miri divided scarce prescriptions among everyone. She accepts dispatch requests after vital stabilization and puts stretcher order before nationality.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: medical assistant. She pasted the severity table and transfer hours in the medical crew''s duty room and took the dispatch crew''s empty-slot demands only after the patients'' vitals were stable.","stress":"Fear. That the patient cars would be mistaken for munitions cars and the whole convoy squad would be disarmed.","relationship":"Relations. Executed the medical alliance of Jang Sehwa and Ryu Eunbi in the field, checked An Dohan''s dispatch solo runs, and borrowed sickbeds from Eun Chaeyun in Jegi-dong.","effects":[]},{"id":"k298-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: medical assistant. She pasted the severity table and transfer hours in the medical crew''s duty room and took the dispatch crew''s empty-slot demands only after the patients'' vitals were stable.","stress":"Fear. That the patient cars would be mistaken for munitions cars and the whole convoy squad would be disarmed.","relationship":"Relations. Executed the medical alliance of Jang Sehwa and Ryu Eunbi in the field, checked An Dohan''s dispatch solo runs, and borrowed sickbeds from Eun Chaeyun in Jegi-dong.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Jeon Miri divided scarce prescriptions among everyone. She accepts dispatch requests after vital stabilization and puts stretcher order before nationality.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c804-c625-cc9c-5168","name":"Okcheon Jeon Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c804-c625-cc9c-5168.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":50,"Force":-30,"Material":0,"Communal":25,"Principle":20,"Public":15,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":40,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-10,"Display":-15,"Sustained":10,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Patient Severity · Transfer Time Record","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Medical Crew Member","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 50 | Force −30 | Material 0 | Communal 25 | Principle 20 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 40 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −10 | Display −15 | Persistence 10 | Orientation Fluid | Bond Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2080-03-07. Grew up at the Jegi-dong infirmary. At the 2126 opening holds the post of Medical Team Member, and the succession record notes that the post opened with a counterfeit-medicine seal.\n- The records desk for dispatch, rotation, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handover, and duty keys at Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as Jeon Miri''s reference post for recording patient severity and transfer times. This is a proposal to cross-check permanent-winter handover records, and it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Medical Team Member. Posts the severity chart and transfer times in the Medical Team duty room, and accepts the Dispatch Team''s requests for empty slots only after the patients'' vital signs have stabilized.","Anecdote":"In 2125, with medicinal herbs in short supply, split the prescription amounts in half and shared them with everyone. That record remained as a cross-check reference for the next duty shift.","Relationships":"Enforces on the ground the medical alliance of Jang Sehwa and Ryu Eunbi, checks An Dohan''s dispatch monopolizing, and borrows Jegi-dong''s admission beds from Eun Chaeyun.","Ambition":"Bind emergency transfers from Jungnang and Mangu to the Jegi-dong treatment contract in a single escort pass, creating a medical escort that carries no escort fee.","Fear":"That a patient car is mistaken for a military supply car and the entire escort convoy is disarmed.","Intervention":"Can cross-check the patient roster against the weapons loading record, or carry a draft of the medical escort pass to Jegi-dong."},"biography":"Jeon Miri, born 2080-03-07, looks at injury grade first and nationality later. Trusts stretcher order over neutral phrasing.\n\n- Occupation: recording patient severity and transfer times\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Medical Team Member\n**Life.** Born on 2080-03-07. Grew up at the Jegi-dong infirmary. At the 2126 opening holds the post of Medical Team Member, and the succession record notes that the post opened with a counterfeit-medicine seal.\n- The records desk for dispatch, rotation, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handover, and duty keys at Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as Jeon Miri''s reference post for recording patient severity and transfer times. This is a proposal to cross-check permanent-winter handover records, and it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Medical Team Member. Posts the severity chart and transfer times in the Medical Team duty room, and accepts the Dispatch Team''s requests for empty slots only after the patients'' vital signs have stabilized.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, with medicinal herbs in short supply, split the prescription amounts in half and shared them with everyone. That record remained as a cross-check reference for the next duty shift.\n\n**Relations.** Enforces on the ground the medical alliance of Jang Sehwa and Ryu Eunbi, checks An Dohan''s dispatch monopolizing, and borrows Jegi-dong''s admission beds from Eun Chaeyun.\n\n**Ambition.** Bind emergency transfers from Jungnang and Mangu to the Jegi-dong treatment contract in a single escort pass, creating a medical escort that carries no escort fee.\n\n**Fear.** That a patient car is mistaken for a military supply car and the entire escort convoy is disarmed.\n\n**Intervention.** Can cross-check the patient roster against the weapons loading record, or carry a draft of the medical escort pass to Jegi-dong.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 50 | Force −30 | Material 0 | Communal 25 | Principle 20 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 40 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −10 | Display −15 | Persistence 10 | Orientation Fluid | Bond Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Jeon Miri","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Enforces the medical alliance on the ground"}],"incoming":[{"from":"U Hajin","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"U Hajin separately records the medical escort runs that were pushed out of the seasonal schedule into ordinary train cars and passes them to Jeon Miri. Jeon Miri checks patient severity and transfer times and reflects them in the Medical Team duty room, so that stretcher order is not erased just because the schedule changed."},{"from":"Jeong Da-eun","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"Jeong Daeun sorts the medical escort runs that diverge between the two dispatch schedules by actual escort signatures and hands them to Jeon Miri. Jeon Miri checks patient severity and transfer times so that a run that never departed is not treated as having handed over arriving patients."},{"from":"Nam Reumeun","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"Nam Reumeun hands Jeon Miri the medical-train patient list, recounted just before departure. Jeon Miri checks severity and transfer times, distinguishes ordinary transferring passengers from patients actually in the medical car, and keeps the stretcher order continuous."},{"from":"Guk Yong","type":"Command","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"carrying out the stretcher order under Jeon Miri''s command, and"},{"from":"Du Bok","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"carrying notes about the approval-order dispute between Jeon Miri and An Dohan, and"},{"from":"Yong Bong","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"receiving Jeon Miri''s stretcher order on the platform, and"},{"from":"Gammo","type":"Command","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"carrying out the extension of Jeon Miri''s Medical Team in the duty room, and"},{"from":"Beom Ongyeol","type":"Oath","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"backing Jeon Miri''s patient line at the witness stand, and"},{"from":"Chang Dahin","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"placing the victims'' line on Jeon Miri''s severity chart, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0299","name":"전미리","title":"의료 조원","position":"의료 조원","characterId":"K298","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"환자 중증도·이송 시각 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-전미리","detailRoute":"/people/person-0299","birthDate":"2080-03-07","birthday":"03-07","age":46,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k298-prescription-allocation","name":"처방량 배분","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k298-priority","name":"중증도 우선","description":"전미리는 부족한 처방량을 나눠 모두에게 배분했다. 활력 안정 뒤에 배차 요구를 받으며 국적보다 들것 순서를 둔다.","behavior":"중증도 표와 이송 시각을 의료조 당직실에 붙이고, 배차조의 빈 슬롯 요구는 환자 활력이 안정된 뒤에만 받는다.","stress":"환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","relationship":"장세화와 류은비의 의료동맹을 현장에서 집행하고, 안도한의 배차 독주를 견제하며, 은채윤에게 제기동 수용 병상을 빌려 쓴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k298-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 의료 조원. 중증도 표와 이송 시각을 의료조 당직실에 붙이고, 배차조의 빈 슬롯 요구는 환자 활력이 안정된 뒤에만 받는다.","stress":"공포. 환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","relationship":"관계. 장세화와 류은비의 의료동맹을 현장에서 집행하고, 안도한의 배차 독주를 견제하며, 은채윤에게 제기동 수용 병상을 빌려 쓴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"전미리는 부족한 처방량을 나눠 모두에게 배분했다. 활력 안정 뒤에 배차 요구를 받으며 국적보다 들것 순서를 둔다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c804-c625-cc9c-5168","name":"옥천 전씨","crest":"clan-crests/c804-c625-cc9c-5168.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":50,"무력":-30,"물질":0,"공동":25,"원칙":20,"공개":15,"자격":20,"분산":40,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":-20,"위험":-10,"과시":-15,"지속":10,"지향":"유동","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"환자 중증도·이송 시각 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"의료 조원","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 50 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 25 | 원칙 20 | 공개 15 | 자격 20 | 분산 40 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −15 | 지속 10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2080-03-07에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 의료 조원 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 전미리의 환자 중증도·이송 시각 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 의료 조원. 중증도 표와 이송 시각을 의료조 당직실에 붙이고, 배차조의 빈 슬롯 요구는 환자 활력이 안정된 뒤에만 받는다.","일화":"2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 그 기록은 다음 당직의 대조 근거로 남았다.","관계":"장세화와 류은비의 의료동맹을 현장에서 집행하고, 안도한의 배차 독주를 견제하며, 은채윤에게 제기동 수용 병상을 빌려 쓴다.","야망":"중랑·망우 응급 이송을 제기동 치료계약과 한 장의 호송증으로 묶어, 호송료 없는 의료 호송을 만든다.","공포":"환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","개입":"환자 명부와 무기 적재 기록을 대조하거나, 의료 호송증 초안을 제기동까지 운반할 수 있다."},"biography":"2080-03-07생인 전미리는 부상 등급을 먼저 보고 국적을 나중에 본다. 중립 문구보다 들것 순서를 믿는다.\n\n- 생업: 환자 중증도·이송 시각 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 의료 조원\n**생애.** 2080-03-07에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 의료 조원 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 전미리의 환자 중증도·이송 시각 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 의료 조원. 중증도 표와 이송 시각을 의료조 당직실에 붙이고, 배차조의 빈 슬롯 요구는 환자 활력이 안정된 뒤에만 받는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 그 기록은 다음 당직의 대조 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 장세화와 류은비의 의료동맹을 현장에서 집행하고, 안도한의 배차 독주를 견제하며, 은채윤에게 제기동 수용 병상을 빌려 쓴다.\n\n**야망.** 중랑·망우 응급 이송을 제기동 치료계약과 한 장의 호송증으로 묶어, 호송료 없는 의료 호송을 만든다.\n\n**공포.** 환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.\n\n**개입.** 환자 명부와 무기 적재 기록을 대조하거나, 의료 호송증 초안을 제기동까지 운반할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 50 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 25 | 원칙 20 | 공개 15 | 자격 20 | 분산 40 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −15 | 지속 10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"전미리","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":"의료동맹을 현장에서 집행"}],"incoming":[{"from":"우하진","type":"계약","to":"전미리","basis":"우하진은 계절 배차표에서 일반 열차 칸으로 밀려난 의무호송 편을 따로 적어 전미리에게 전한다. 전미리는 환자 중증도와 이송 시각을 확인하고 의료조 당직실에 반영해, 배차표가 바뀌었다고 들것 순서가 지워지지 않게 한다."},{"from":"정다은","type":"계약","to":"전미리","basis":"정다은은 두 배차표에서 엇갈린 의무호송 편을 실제 호송원 서명으로 가려 전미리에게 넘긴다. 전미리는 환자 중증도와 이송 시각을 확인해, 떠나지 않은 편이 도착할 환자를 인계한 것으로 처리되지 않게 한다."},{"from":"남름은","type":"계약","to":"전미리","basis":"남름은은 출발 직전 다시 센 의료열차 환자 명단을 전미리에게 넘긴다. 전미리는 중증도와 이송 시각을 확인해 일반 환승객과 실제 의료칸 환자를 구분하며 들것 순서를 잇는다."},{"from":"국용","type":"지휘","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리의 지휘로 들것 순서를 집행하고"},{"from":"두복","type":"계약","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리와 안도한의 승인 순서 다툼을 쪽지로 나르고"},{"from":"용봉","type":"계약","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리의 들것 순서를 승강장에서 받고"},{"from":"감모","type":"지휘","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리의 의료조 연장을 당직실에서 집행하고"},{"from":"범온결","type":"맹세","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리의 환자 줄을 증인석에서 받치고"},{"from":"창다흰","type":"계약","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리의 중증도 표에 피해자 줄을 올리고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0300', 'bb38-b0a8-d3c9-6587', '{"id":"person-0300","name":"Mun Sion","title":"Passage Inspector","position":"Passage Inspector","characterId":"K299","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Identity Fragment · Cargo Seal Cross-check","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-munsion","detailRoute":"/people/person-0300","birthDate":"2075-05-26","birthday":"05-26","age":51,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k299-passage-evidence-checking","name":"Passage evidence checking","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k299-priority","name":"Double evidence","description":"Mun Sion cross-checks identity fragments and cargo seals, refusing external searches without joint seals. Snow rescue does not expand his inspection powers.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: passage examiner. He checked identity slips and freight seals doubly and refused any great power''s search warrant without the joint stamp of Jang Sehwa and the medical crew.","stress":"Fear. That armed men bypassing the stand would board the medical train and the neutrality declaration would become empty wording.","relationship":"Relations. Sought to hold Jang Sehwa''s neutrality at the examination stand, refused Bae Woojin''s protection searches, and cross-checked Go Seojun''s Achasan passage treaty.","effects":[]},{"id":"k299-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: passage examiner. He checked identity slips and freight seals doubly and refused any great power''s search warrant without the joint stamp of Jang Sehwa and the medical crew.","stress":"Fear. That armed men bypassing the stand would board the medical train and the neutrality declaration would become empty wording.","relationship":"Relations. Sought to hold Jang Sehwa''s neutrality at the examination stand, refused Bae Woojin''s protection searches, and cross-checked Go Seojun''s Achasan passage treaty.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Mun Sion cross-checks identity fragments and cargo seals, refusing external searches without joint seals. Snow rescue does not expand his inspection powers.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bb38-b0a8-d3c9-6587","name":"Nampyeong Mun Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bb38-b0a8-d3c9-6587.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":40,"Force":-35,"Material":0,"Communal":10,"Principle":0,"Public":30,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":35,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":-5,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":-30,"Display":-30,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Identity Fragment · Cargo Seal Cross-check","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Passage Inspector","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 40 | Force −35 | Materialism 0 | Community 10 | Principle 0 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Craving −5 | Possessiveness 30 | Risk −30 | Display −30 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: same-sex | Bonding: non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2075-05-26. Raised on the waiting-hall night watch. At the 2126 opening holds the Passage Inspector watch, and the post handover record shows the post opened through a substitute watch covering an unexcused shift absence.\n- The dispatch, shift, maintenance, passage inspection, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as the duty reference point for Mun Sion''s cross-checking of identity shards and cargo seals. This is a proposal to cross-check permanent-winter handover records, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Passage Inspector. Double-checks identity shards and cargo seals, and refuses search warrants issued under an outside crest unless they carry the joint seal of Jang Sehwa and the medical team.","Anecdote":"In the heavy snow of 2125, cleared a transfer passage blocked by snow and moved the wounded out first. That record remained as a cross-check reference for the next duty shift.","Relationships":"Seeks to protect Jang Sehwa''s neutrality through the inspection post, refuses Bae Ujin''s protective searches, and cross-checks Go Seojun''s Achasan passage agreement.","Ambition":"Seeks to elevate inspection on the Northeast Outer Road into a clause of the neutral escort agreement, cutting off the arbitrary searches of the Amsa Escort Corps.","Fear":"An armed party bypasses the inspection post and boards the medical train, turning neutral escort into an empty phrase.","Intervention":"Can restore the back-gate seal ledger, or pull out documents that use the refusal of inspection as a pretext to justify the entry of outside escorts."},"biography":"Born 2075-05-26, Mun Sion speaks little and relentlessly cross-checks evidence. Holds in contempt the practice of turning escort-fee receipts into passes.\n\n- Livelihood: Identity shard and cargo seal cross-checking\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Passage Inspector\n**Life.** Born 2075-05-26. Raised on the waiting-hall night watch. At the 2126 opening holds the Passage Inspector watch, and the post handover record shows the post opened through a substitute watch covering an unexcused shift absence.\n- The dispatch, shift, maintenance, passage inspection, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as the duty reference point for Mun Sion''s cross-checking of identity shards and cargo seals. This is a proposal to cross-check permanent-winter handover records, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Passage Inspector. Double-checks identity shards and cargo seals, and refuses search warrants issued under an outside crest unless they carry the joint seal of Jang Sehwa and the medical team.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, broke through a transfer passage blocked by heavy snow and moved the wounded first. That record remained as a cross-checking basis for the next watch.\n\n**Relations.** Seeks to protect Jang Sehwa''s neutrality through the inspection post, refuses Bae Ujin''s protective searches, and cross-checks Go Seojun''s Achasan passage agreement.\n\n**Ambition.** Seeks to elevate inspection on the Northeast Outer Road into a clause of the neutral escort agreement, cutting off the arbitrary searches of the Amsa Escort Corps.\n\n**Fear.** An armed party bypasses the inspection post and boards the medical train, turning neutral escort into an empty phrase.\n\n**Intervention.** Can restore the back-gate seal ledger, or pull out documents that use the refusal of inspection as a pretext to justify the entry of outside escorts.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 40 | Force −35 | Materialism 0 | Community 10 | Principle 0 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Possessiveness 30 | Risk −30 | Display −30 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: same-sex | Bonding: non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Mun Sion","type":"Command","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Seeks to keep neutrality as a screening checkpoint"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gwak Taesan","type":"Oath","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Share the witnessing of the medical train seal"},{"from":"Gam Guk","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Verify Mun Sion''s inspection post seal on the road"},{"from":"Bok Gam","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Hand the back-gate survey to Mun Sion, and"},{"from":"Bong Mo","type":"Command","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Move the inspection ledger under Mun Sion''s command, and"},{"from":"Gukgam","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Share the seal witnessing with Mun Sion"},{"from":"Tak Mireu","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Leave a statement at Mun Sion''s inspection post, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0300","name":"문시온","title":"통행 심사관","position":"통행 심사관","characterId":"K299","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"신분 조각·화물 봉인 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-문시온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0300","birthDate":"2075-05-26","birthday":"05-26","age":51,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k299-passage-evidence-checking","name":"통행 증빙 확인","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k299-priority","name":"이중 증빙","description":"문시온은 신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 대조하며 공동 날인 없는 외부 검색을 거부한다. 폭설 구조가 심사관 권한을 늘리지는 않는다.","behavior":"신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 이중으로 확인하고, 외부 문장의 검색 영장은 장세화와 의료조 공동 날인 없이 거부한다.","stress":"심사대를 우회한 무장이 의료열차에 타 중립 호송이 빈 문구가 되는 것.","relationship":"장세화의 중립을 심사대로 지키려 하고, 배우진의 보호 검색을 거부하며, 고서준의 아차산 통행 협약을 교차 확인한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k299-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 통행 심사관. 신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 이중으로 확인하고, 외부 문장의 검색 영장은 장세화와 의료조 공동 날인 없이 거부한다.","stress":"공포. 심사대를 우회한 무장이 의료열차에 타 중립 호송이 빈 문구가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 장세화의 중립을 심사대로 지키려 하고, 배우진의 보호 검색을 거부하며, 고서준의 아차산 통행 협약을 교차 확인한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"문시온은 신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 대조하며 공동 날인 없는 외부 검색을 거부한다. 폭설 구조가 심사관 권한을 늘리지는 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bb38-b0a8-d3c9-6587","name":"남평 문씨","crest":"clan-crests/bb38-b0a8-d3c9-6587.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":40,"무력":-35,"물질":0,"공동":10,"원칙":0,"공개":30,"자격":15,"분산":35,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":30,"위험":-30,"과시":-30,"지속":5,"지향":"동성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"신분 조각·화물 봉인 대조","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"통행 심사관","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 40 | 무력 −35 | 물질 0 | 공동 10 | 원칙 0 | 공개 30 | 자격 15 | 분산 35 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 −5 | 독점 30 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −30 | 지속 5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2075-05-26에 태어났다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 통행 심사관 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 문시온의 신분 조각·화물 봉인 대조 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 통행 심사관. 신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 이중으로 확인하고, 외부 문장의 검색 영장은 장세화와 의료조 공동 날인 없이 거부한다.","일화":"2125년 폭설에 막힌 환승 통로를 뚫어 부상자를 먼저 옮겼다. 그 기록은 다음 당직의 대조 근거로 남았다.","관계":"장세화의 중립을 심사대로 지키려 하고, 배우진의 보호 검색을 거부하며, 고서준의 아차산 통행 협약을 교차 확인한다.","야망":"동북 외곽로 심사를 중립 호송 약정 조항으로 격상시켜 암사 호위단의 임의 검색을 끊으려 한다.","공포":"심사대를 우회한 무장이 의료열차에 타 중립 호송이 빈 문구가 되는 것.","개입":"후문 봉인 장부를 복원하거나, 심사 거부를 구실로 외부 호위 진입을 정당화하는 문서를 빼낼 수 있다."},"biography":"2075-05-26생인 문시온은 말수가 적고 증빙을 집요하게 대조한다. 호송료 영수증을 통행증으로 바꾸는 관행을 경멸한다.\n\n- 생업: 신분 조각·화물 봉인 대조\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 통행 심사관\n**생애.** 2075-05-26에 태어났다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 통행 심사관 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 문시온의 신분 조각·화물 봉인 대조 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 통행 심사관. 신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 이중으로 확인하고, 외부 문장의 검색 영장은 장세화와 의료조 공동 날인 없이 거부한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 폭설에 막힌 환승 통로를 뚫어 부상자를 먼저 옮겼다. 그 기록은 다음 당직의 대조 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 장세화의 중립을 심사대로 지키려 하고, 배우진의 보호 검색을 거부하며, 고서준의 아차산 통행 협약을 교차 확인한다.\n\n**야망.** 동북 외곽로 심사를 중립 호송 약정 조항으로 격상시켜 암사 호위단의 임의 검색을 끊으려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 심사대를 우회한 무장이 의료열차에 타 중립 호송이 빈 문구가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 후문 봉인 장부를 복원하거나, 심사 거부를 구실로 외부 호위 진입을 정당화하는 문서를 빼낼 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 40 | 무력 −35 | 물질 0 | 공동 10 | 원칙 0 | 공개 30 | 자격 15 | 분산 35 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 −5 | 독점 30 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −30 | 지속 5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"문시온","type":"지휘","to":"장세화","basis":"중립을 심사대로 지키려 함"}],"incoming":[{"from":"곽태산","type":"맹세","to":"문시온","basis":"의료열차 봉인 입회를 공유"},{"from":"감국","type":"계약","to":"문시온","basis":"문시온의 심사대 봉인을 길에서 확인한다"},{"from":"복감","type":"계약","to":"문시온","basis":"문시온에게 후문 실측을 넘기고"},{"from":"봉모","type":"지휘","to":"문시온","basis":"문시온의 지휘로 심사 원장을 옮기고"},{"from":"국감","type":"계약","to":"문시온","basis":"문시온과 봉인 입회를 공유한다"},{"from":"탁미르","type":"계약","to":"문시온","basis":"문시온의 심사대에서 진술을 남기고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0301', 'd558-c9c4-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0301","name":"Ha Seon","title":"Light Escort Commander","position":"Light Escort Commander","characterId":"K300","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Medical · Cargo Escort Roster Assignment","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-haseon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0301","birthDate":"2095-03-17","birthday":"03-17","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"k300-escort-personnel-allocation","name":"Escort personnel allocation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k300-priority","name":"Restrains escalation","description":"Ha Seon distributes limited personnel along long trains and withholds fire before sealed orders. Closure is documented, victory over Amsa is not.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: light convoy leader. He mixed convoy personnel into the medical cars and the freight cars and granted firing authority only before Jang Sehwa''s sealed order.","stress":"Fear. That the convoy squad would meet the Amsa patrol train and one exchange of fire would turn neutrality into war.","relationship":"Relations. Executed Jang Sehwa''s convoy orders, split sections with Nam Hoseong''s Jegi-dong medical convoy, and matched the north gate link with I Hongwon''s rail cavalry.","effects":[]},{"id":"k300-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: light convoy leader. He mixed convoy personnel into the medical cars and the freight cars and granted firing authority only before Jang Sehwa''s sealed order.","stress":"Fear. That the convoy squad would meet the Amsa patrol train and one exchange of fire would turn neutrality into war.","relationship":"Relations. Executed Jang Sehwa''s convoy orders, split sections with Nam Hoseong''s Jegi-dong medical convoy, and matched the north gate link with I Hongwon''s rail cavalry.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Ha Seon distributes limited personnel along long trains and withholds fire before sealed orders. Closure is documented, victory over Amsa is not.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d558-c9c4-c8fc","name":"Jinju Ha Clan","crest":"clan-crests/d558-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":45,"Force":-30,"Material":0,"Communal":25,"Principle":10,"Public":15,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":35,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":-35,"Display":10,"Sustained":-5,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical · Cargo Escort Roster Assignment","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Light Escort Commander","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 45 | Force −30 | Materialism 0 | Community 25 | Principle 10 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 25 | Possessiveness −30 | Risk −35 | Display 10 | Persistence −5 | Orientation: same-sex | Bonding: none"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2095-03-17. Raised on the Sinnae transfer watch. At the 2126 opening holds the Light Escort Captain watch, and the post handover record shows the post opened through stopping a ticketless departing train.\n- The dispatch, shift, maintenance, passage inspection, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as the duty reference point for Ha Seon''s staffing of medical and cargo escort personnel. This is a proposal to cross-check permanent-winter handover records, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Light Escort Captain. Mixes escort personnel between the medical and cargo cars, and grants no firing authority before Jang Sehwa''s sealed order.","Anecdote":"In 2125, did not delay a collapse report on a flooded section and closed it immediately. That record remained as a cross-checking basis for the next watch.","Relationships":"Carries out Jang Sehwa''s escort orders, divides sectors with Nam Hoseong''s Jegi-dong medical escort, and aligns the north gate connection with I Hongwon''s Rail Cavalry.","Ambition":"Seeks to have the Sinnae escort unit take the lead car of the neutral escort, proving the strength of the Northeast Corridor without escort fees.","Fear":"The escort unit meets an Amsa patrol train, and a single exchange of fire turns neutrality into war.","Intervention":"Can pass along signal flags to avoid combat, or trace the party that forged the firing order."},"biography":"Born 2095-03-17, Ha Seon fills the gaps left by an optimistic superior in the field. Knows how to guard a long train with few troops.\n\n- Livelihood: Staffing of medical and cargo escort personnel\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Light Escort Captain\n**Life.** Born 2095-03-17. Raised on the Sinnae transfer watch. At the 2126 opening holds the Light Escort Captain watch, and the post handover record shows the post opened through stopping a ticketless departing train.\n- The dispatch, shift, maintenance, passage inspection, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as the duty reference point for Ha Seon''s staffing of medical and cargo escort personnel. This is a proposal to cross-check permanent-winter handover records, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Light Escort Captain. Mixes escort personnel between the medical and cargo cars, and grants no firing authority before Jang Sehwa''s sealed order.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, did not delay a collapse report on a flooded section and closed it immediately. That record remained as a cross-checking basis for the next watch.\n\n**Relations.** Carries out Jang Sehwa''s escort orders, divides sectors with Nam Hoseong''s Jegi-dong medical escort, and aligns the north gate connection with I Hongwon''s Rail Cavalry.\n\n**Ambition.** Seeks to have the Sinnae escort unit take the lead car of the neutral escort, proving the strength of the Northeast Corridor without escort fees.\n\n**Fear.** The escort unit meets an Amsa patrol train, and a single exchange of fire turns neutrality into war.\n\n**Intervention.** Can pass along signal flags to avoid combat, or trace the party that forged the firing order.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 45 | Force −30 | Materialism 0 | Community 25 | Principle 10 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Possessiveness −30 | Risk −35 | Display 10 | Persistence −5 | Orientation: same-sex | Bonding: none\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ha Seon","type":"Command","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Enforces the light escort order"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gam Guk","type":"Command","to":"Ha Seon","basis":"Circle the outer road under Ha Seon''s command, and"},{"from":"Seok Bomu","type":"Contract","to":"Ha Seon","basis":"Split the crowd line with Ha Seon''s escort unit, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0301","name":"하세온","title":"경량 호송대장","position":"경량 호송대장","characterId":"K300","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"의료·화물 호송 인원 편성","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-하세온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0301","birthDate":"2095-03-17","birthday":"03-17","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"k300-escort-personnel-allocation","name":"호송 인원 배치","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"k300-priority","name":"교전 억제","description":"하세온은 적은 인원을 긴 열차에 나누고 봉인 명령 전 발포를 막는다. 침수 구간 폐쇄는 확인되나 암사와의 교전 승리는 없다.","behavior":"호송 인원을 의료칸과 화물칸에 섞어 두고, 발포 권한은 장세화의 봉인된 명령 전에는 주지 않는다.","stress":"호송대가 암사 순찰열차와 마주쳐 교전 한 방으로 중립이 전쟁으로 바뀌는 것.","relationship":"장세화의 호송 명령을 집행하고, 남호성의 제기동 의무호송과 구간을 나누며, 이홍원의 궤도기병과 북문 접속을 맞춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k300-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 경량 호송대장. 호송 인원을 의료칸과 화물칸에 섞어 두고, 발포 권한은 장세화의 봉인된 명령 전에는 주지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 호송대가 암사 순찰열차와 마주쳐 교전 한 방으로 중립이 전쟁으로 바뀌는 것.","relationship":"관계. 장세화의 호송 명령을 집행하고, 남호성의 제기동 의무호송과 구간을 나누며, 이홍원의 궤도기병과 북문 접속을 맞춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"하세온은 적은 인원을 긴 열차에 나누고 봉인 명령 전 발포를 막는다. 침수 구간 폐쇄는 확인되나 암사와의 교전 승리는 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d558-c9c4-c8fc","name":"진주 하씨","crest":"clan-crests/d558-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":45,"무력":-30,"물질":0,"공동":25,"원칙":10,"공개":15,"자격":25,"분산":35,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":-30,"위험":-35,"과시":10,"지속":-5,"지향":"동성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"의료·화물 호송 인원 편성","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"경량 호송대장","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 45 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 15 | 자격 25 | 분산 35 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −35 | 과시 10 | 지속 −5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2095-03-17에 태어났다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 경량 호송대장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 하세온의 의료·화물 호송 인원 편성 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 경량 호송대장. 호송 인원을 의료칸과 화물칸에 섞어 두고, 발포 권한은 장세화의 봉인된 명령 전에는 주지 않는다.","일화":"2125년 침수 구간 붕괴 보고를 미루지 않고 당장 폐쇄했다. 그 기록은 다음 당직의 대조 근거로 남았다.","관계":"장세화의 호송 명령을 집행하고, 남호성의 제기동 의무호송과 구간을 나누며, 이홍원의 궤도기병과 북문 접속을 맞춘다.","야망":"중립 호송의 선두 칸을 신내 호송대가 맡아 호송료 없는 동북 회랑의 실력을 증명하려 한다.","공포":"호송대가 암사 순찰열차와 마주쳐 교전 한 방으로 중립이 전쟁으로 바뀌는 것.","개입":"교전을 피하도록 신호기를 전달하거나, 발포 명령을 위조한 쪽을 추적할 수 있다."},"biography":"2095-03-17생인 하세온은 낙관적인 상관의 공백을 현장에서 메운다. 적은 병력으로 긴 열차를 지키는 법을 안다.\n\n- 생업: 의료·화물 호송 인원 편성\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 경량 호송대장\n**생애.** 2095-03-17에 태어났다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 경량 호송대장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 하세온의 의료·화물 호송 인원 편성 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 경량 호송대장. 호송 인원을 의료칸과 화물칸에 섞어 두고, 발포 권한은 장세화의 봉인된 명령 전에는 주지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 침수 구간 붕괴 보고를 미루지 않고 당장 폐쇄했다. 그 기록은 다음 당직의 대조 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 장세화의 호송 명령을 집행하고, 남호성의 제기동 의무호송과 구간을 나누며, 이홍원의 궤도기병과 북문 접속을 맞춘다.\n\n**야망.** 중립 호송의 선두 칸을 신내 호송대가 맡아 호송료 없는 동북 회랑의 실력을 증명하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 호송대가 암사 순찰열차와 마주쳐 교전 한 방으로 중립이 전쟁으로 바뀌는 것.\n\n**개입.** 교전을 피하도록 신호기를 전달하거나, 발포 명령을 위조한 쪽을 추적할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 45 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 15 | 자격 25 | 분산 35 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −35 | 과시 10 | 지속 −5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"하세온","type":"지휘","to":"장세화","basis":"경량 호송 명령을 집행"}],"incoming":[{"from":"감국","type":"지휘","to":"하세온","basis":"하세온의 지휘로 외곽로를 돌고"},{"from":"석봄우","type":"계약","to":"하세온","basis":"하세온의 호송대와 인파 줄을 나누고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0302', 'acfd-d604-d48d', '{"id":"person-0302","name":"Gwak Taesan","title":"Medical Train Defense Commander","position":"Medical Train Defense Commander","characterId":"K301","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Medical Train Car Key · Weapons Locker Seal Management","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-gwaktaesan","detailRoute":"/people/person-0302","birthDate":"2086-05-03","birthday":"05-03","age":40,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":9,"effective":9}},"skills":[{"id":"k301-night-intrusion-restraint","name":"Night intrusion restraint","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k301-priority","name":"Restrained defense","description":"Gwak Taesan caught a night intruder and changed the token. Patient-car protection and separated keys keep defense from overshadowing escort.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: medical train defense chief. He kept the car keys and the weapons-box seal in separate custody and conducted searches only under the passage examiner''s attendance.","stress":"Fear. That someone hiding Amsa-made weapons inside the defense squad would break Jang Sehwa''s neutrality from within.","relationship":"Relations. Shared the sealing attendance with Mun Sion, guarded Jeon Miri''s patient cars, and suspected the officer network Bae Woojin had planted.","effects":[]},{"id":"k301-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: medical train defense chief. He kept the car keys and the weapons-box seal in separate custody and conducted searches only under the passage examiner''s attendance.","stress":"Fear. That someone hiding Amsa-made weapons inside the defense squad would break Jang Sehwa''s neutrality from within.","relationship":"Relations. Shared the sealing attendance with Mun Sion, guarded Jeon Miri''s patient cars, and suspected the officer network Bae Woojin had planted.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Gwak Taesan caught a night intruder and changed the token. Patient-car protection and separated keys keep defense from overshadowing escort.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"acfd-d604-d48d","name":"Hyeonpung Gwak Clan","crest":"clan-crests/acfd-d604-d48d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":20,"Force":-5,"Material":5,"Communal":20,"Principle":20,"Public":10,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":35,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":40,"Risk":5,"Display":5,"Sustained":25,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical Train Car Key · Weapons Locker Seal Management","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Medical Train Defense Commander","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 20 | Force −5 | Material 5 | Community 20 | Principle 20 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 25 | Dispersion 35 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 45 | Monopoly 40 | Risk 5 | Display 5 | Persistence 25 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2086-05-03. Raised at the Amsa guard post. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty of Medical Train Guard Captain, and the post handover record still notes that the post opened up after an unauthorized night river crossing was caught.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift, maintenance, transit inspection, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk is proposed as the reference post for Gwak Taesan''s work managing medical train car keys and armory seals. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records, and it does not confirm operating trains, new facilities, armament, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Medical Train Guard Captain. Keeps the car keys and the armory seals stored separately, and conducts searches only in the presence of a transit inspector.","Anecdote":"In 2125 he caught an unauthorized night crosser and replaced the guard cipher tags. That record remained as a basis for cross-checking at the next shift.","Relationships":"Shares seal witnessing with Mun Sion, protects Jeon Miri''s patient car, and is wary of the officer connections Bae Ujin has planted.","Ambition":"He wants to keep medical train defense as a function unique to Sinnae Transport and put an end to the practice of outside escort soldiers standing inside the cars.","Fear":"That someone hiding Amsa-made weapons will turn up within the guard, breaking Jang Sehwa''s neutrality from the inside.","Intervention":"You can find the missing duty officer, or swap the armory seal and pin the incident on Amsa-side tampering."},"biography":"Born on 2086-05-03, Gwak Taesan is taciturn and blocks access to the cars with his own body. He dislikes the guard standing out more than the escort corps.\n\n- Livelihood: Managing medical train car keys and armory seals\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Medical Train Guard Captain\n**Life.** Born on 2086-05-03. Raised at the Amsa guard post. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty of Medical Train Guard Captain, and the post handover record still notes that the post opened up after an unauthorized night river crossing was caught.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift, maintenance, transit inspection, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk is proposed as the reference post for Gwak Taesan''s work managing medical train car keys and armory seals. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records, and it does not confirm operating trains, new facilities, armament, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Medical Train Guard Captain. Keeps the car keys and the armory seals stored separately, and conducts searches only in the presence of a transit inspector.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125 he caught an unauthorized night crosser and replaced the guard cipher tags. That record remained as a basis for cross-checking at the next shift.\n\n**Relationships.** Shares seal witnessing with Mun Sion, protects Jeon Miri''s patient car, and is wary of the officer connections Bae Ujin has planted.\n\n**Ambition.** He wants to keep medical train defense as a function unique to Sinnae Transport and put an end to the practice of outside escort soldiers standing inside the cars.\n\n**Fear.** That someone hiding Amsa-made weapons will turn up within the guard, breaking Jang Sehwa''s neutrality from the inside.\n\n**Intervention.** You can find the missing duty officer, or swap the armory seal and pin the incident on Amsa-side tampering.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 20 | Force −5 | Material 5 | Community 20 | Principle 20 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 25 | Dispersion 35 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Monopoly 40 | Risk 5 | Display 5 | Persistence 25 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gwak Taesan","type":"Oath","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Share the witnessing of the medical train seal"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Nam Ramwon","type":"Contract","to":"Gwak Taesan","basis":"Nam Ramwon hands Gwak Taesan the patient car and escort car of the medical convoy, along with the times the escort was absent. Gwak Taesan checks the car keys and the armory seals separately so that taking over the escort does not get mixed up with taking over the patients."},{"from":"Gukgam","type":"Command","to":"Gwak Taesan","basis":"Takes charge of the guard depot under Gwak Taesan''s command, and"},{"from":"Tak Mireu","type":"Contract","to":"Gwak Taesan","basis":"Syncs times with Gwak Taesan''s guard duty shifts"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0302","name":"곽태산","title":"의료열차 수비대장","position":"의료열차 수비대장","characterId":"K301","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"의료열차 칸 열쇠·무기함 봉인 관리","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-곽태산","detailRoute":"/people/person-0302","birthDate":"2086-05-03","birthday":"05-03","age":40,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":9,"effective":9}},"skills":[{"id":"k301-night-intrusion-restraint","name":"야간 침입 제지","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k301-priority","name":"수비의 절제","description":"곽태산은 야간 침입자를 붙잡고 암호패를 갈았다. 환자 칸 보호와 열쇠 분리로 수비가 호송을 압도하지 않게 한다.","behavior":"칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 분리해 보관하고, 수색은 통행 심사관 입회 아래에서만 한다.","stress":"수비대 안에서 암신도 무기를 숨긴 자가 나와 장세화의 중립이 내부에서 깨지는 것.","relationship":"문시온과 봉인 입회를 공유하고, 전미리의 환자 칸을 지키며, 배우진이 심은 장교 인맥을 의심한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k301-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 의료열차 수비대장. 칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 분리해 보관하고, 수색은 통행 심사관 입회 아래에서만 한다.","stress":"공포. 수비대 안에서 암신도 무기를 숨긴 자가 나와 장세화의 중립이 내부에서 깨지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 문시온과 봉인 입회를 공유하고, 전미리의 환자 칸을 지키며, 배우진이 심은 장교 인맥을 의심한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"곽태산은 야간 침입자를 붙잡고 암호패를 갈았다. 환자 칸 보호와 열쇠 분리로 수비가 호송을 압도하지 않게 한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"acfd-d604-d48d","name":"현풍 곽씨","crest":"clan-crests/acfd-d604-d48d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":20,"무력":-5,"물질":5,"공동":20,"원칙":20,"공개":10,"자격":25,"분산":35,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":40,"위험":5,"과시":5,"지속":25,"지향":"양성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"의료열차 칸 열쇠·무기함 봉인 관리","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"의료열차 수비대장","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 20 | 무력 −5 | 물질 5 | 공동 20 | 원칙 20 | 공개 10 | 자격 25 | 분산 35 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 40 | 위험 5 | 과시 5 | 지속 25 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2086-05-03에 태어났다. 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 의료열차 수비대장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 곽태산의 의료열차 칸 열쇠·무기함 봉인 관리 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 의료열차 수비대장. 칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 분리해 보관하고, 수색은 통행 심사관 입회 아래에서만 한다.","일화":"2125년 야간 무단 도꾼을 붙잡아 경비 암호패를 갈았다. 그 기록은 다음 당직의 대조 근거로 남았다.","관계":"문시온과 봉인 입회를 공유하고, 전미리의 환자 칸을 지키며, 배우진이 심은 장교 인맥을 의심한다.","야망":"의료열차 수비를 신내운수 고유 직능으로 남겨 외부 호위병이 칸 안에 서는 관행을 없애려 한다.","공포":"수비대 안에서 암신도 무기를 숨긴 자가 나와 장세화의 중립이 내부에서 깨지는 것.","개입":"빠진 당직자를 찾거나, 무기함 봉인을 바꿔 사건을 암사 쪽 조작으로 몰 수 있다."},"biography":"2086-05-03생인 곽태산은 과묵하고 칸 출입을 몸으로 막는다. 수비대가 호송대보다 눈에 띄는 것을 싫어한다.\n\n- 생업: 의료열차 칸 열쇠·무기함 봉인 관리\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 의료열차 수비대장\n**생애.** 2086-05-03에 태어났다. 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 의료열차 수비대장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 곽태산의 의료열차 칸 열쇠·무기함 봉인 관리 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 의료열차 수비대장. 칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 분리해 보관하고, 수색은 통행 심사관 입회 아래에서만 한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 야간 무단 도꾼을 붙잡아 경비 암호패를 갈았다. 그 기록은 다음 당직의 대조 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 문시온과 봉인 입회를 공유하고, 전미리의 환자 칸을 지키며, 배우진이 심은 장교 인맥을 의심한다.\n\n**야망.** 의료열차 수비를 신내운수 고유 직능으로 남겨 외부 호위병이 칸 안에 서는 관행을 없애려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 수비대 안에서 암신도 무기를 숨긴 자가 나와 장세화의 중립이 내부에서 깨지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 빠진 당직자를 찾거나, 무기함 봉인을 바꿔 사건을 암사 쪽 조작으로 몰 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 20 | 무력 −5 | 물질 5 | 공동 20 | 원칙 20 | 공개 10 | 자격 25 | 분산 35 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 40 | 위험 5 | 과시 5 | 지속 25 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"곽태산","type":"맹세","to":"문시온","basis":"의료열차 봉인 입회를 공유"}],"incoming":[{"from":"남람원","type":"계약","to":"곽태산","basis":"남람원은 의료호송의 환자 칸과 호위 칸, 호위가 빠진 시각을 곽태산에게 넘긴다. 곽태산은 칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 따로 확인해 호위 인수가 환자 인수로 섞이지 않게 한다."},{"from":"국감","type":"지휘","to":"곽태산","basis":"곽태산의 지휘로 수비창을 맡고"},{"from":"탁미르","type":"계약","to":"곽태산","basis":"곽태산의 수비 당직과 시각을 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0303', 'c18c-c9c4-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0303","name":"So Dugam","title":"Siding Mechanic, An Dohan''s Deputy","position":"Siding Mechanic, An Dohan''s Deputy","characterId":"K302","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Siding Dispatch Schedule · Maintenance Log Cross-check","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-so-dugam","detailRoute":"/people/person-0303","birthDate":"2101-11-10","birthday":"11-10","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k302-coupler-maintenance","name":"Coupler maintenance","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k302-priority","name":"Requires maintenance signatures","description":"Sodugam locked the release switch after weapons were found and maintains couplers. Dispatch approval cannot replace maintenance.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: siding mechanic, duty officer of An Dohan. He pasted the dispatch sheet and the maintenance log on one chalkboard and honored the medical train''s priority only when Jang Sehwa''s departmental stamp and his maintenance signature stood together.","stress":"Fear. That an unmaintained car would go out as a medical train and the transfer city would fall into a freight yard between Changdong and Amsa.","relationship":"Relations. Received An Dohan''s dispatch work at the siding and shared the depot duty and tools with Guk So. Tuned the couplers to I Hongwon''s northern wheel-exchange hours.","effects":[]},{"id":"k302-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: siding mechanic, duty officer of An Dohan. He pasted the dispatch sheet and the maintenance log on one chalkboard and honored the medical train''s priority only when Jang Sehwa''s departmental stamp and his maintenance signature stood together.","stress":"Fear. That an unmaintained car would go out as a medical train and the transfer city would fall into a freight yard between Changdong and Amsa.","relationship":"Relations. Received An Dohan''s dispatch work at the siding and shared the depot duty and tools with Guk So. Tuned the couplers to I Hongwon''s northern wheel-exchange hours.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Sodugam locked the release switch after weapons were found and maintains couplers. Dispatch approval cannot replace maintenance.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c18c-c9c4-c8fc","name":"Jinju So Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c18c-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":30,"Force":-25,"Material":15,"Communal":20,"Principle":5,"Public":30,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":40,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":-35,"Display":-25,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Siding Dispatch Schedule · Maintenance Log Cross-check","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Siding Mechanic, An Dohan''s Deputy","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −25 | Material 15 | Community 20 | Principle 5 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 30 | Dispersion 40 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 15 | Monopoly 30 | Risk −35 | Display −25 | Persistence 20 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2101-11-10. Raised at the Sinjeong rail depot. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty of Siding Mechanic and An Dohan''s working-level aide, and the post handover record still notes that the post opened up after a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift, maintenance, transit inspection, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk is proposed as the reference post for So Dugam''s work cross-checking siding dispatch sheets and maintenance logs. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records, and it does not confirm operating trains, new facilities, armament, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Siding Mechanic and An Dohan''s working-level aide. Posts the dispatch sheet and the maintenance log on the same board, and recognizes medical train priority only when Jang Sehwa''s departmental seal and the maintenance signature are both present.","Anecdote":"When Amsa-made weapons turned up on a medical train, he sealed off the siding maintenance shop and locked the dispatch switch.","Relationships":"Takes over An Dohan''s dispatch duties at the siding, and shares depot duty and tools with Guk So. Services the couplers to match the time of Yi Hongwon''s northern wheel swap.","Ambition":"He means to open the maintenance of the Sinnae Depot''s stabling tracks with a maintenance signature, not on the dispatch crew''s say-so alone, and to hold up the actual timetable of the neutral escort agreement with tools on site.","Fear":"That an unmaintained car will go out as a medical train, and Sinnae Transport will fall to a freight yard between Changdong and Amsa.","Intervention":"He can verify the real cargo on the sealed stabling track, or expose a release made with a forged maintenance signature."},"biography":"Born 2101-11-10, Sodugam cannot stand blanks in a timetable and remembers releases that skipped the brakes and couplers as an insult. He refuses any talk that dresses up delays on remote lines as political ranking.\n\n- Occupation: Cross-checking stabling-track dispatch sheets and maintenance logs\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Stabling-Track Mechanic, Practical Aide to An Dohan\n**Life.** Born on 2101-11-10. Raised at the Sinjeong rail depot. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty of Stabling-Track Mechanic and Practical Aide to An Dohan; the post-succession record notes that the post opened with a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- The dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, passage-inspection, stretcher-handover and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as Sodugam''s duty reference point for cross-checking stabling-track dispatch sheets and maintenance logs. This is a proposal for cross-checking handover records in the permanent winter, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, passage tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles, fiefs or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Stabling-Track Mechanic, Practical Aide to An Dohan. He posts the dispatch sheet and maintenance log on the same blackboard, and recognizes medical-train priority only when Jang Sehwa''s department seal and a maintenance signature appear together.\n\n**Anecdote.** When Amsa-made weapons turned up on a medical train, he sealed off the stabling-track maintenance bay and locked the release switch.\n\n**Relations.** He receives An Dohan''s dispatch work at the stabling track and shares tools with Guk So''s depot duty. He adjusts couplers to match I Hongwon''s northern wheel-exchange times.\n\n**Ambition.** He means to open the maintenance of the Sinnae Depot''s stabling tracks with a maintenance signature, not on the dispatch crew''s say-so alone, and to hold up the actual timetable of the neutral escort agreement with tools on site.\n\n**Fear.** That an unmaintained car goes out as a medical train and Sinnae Transport falls to being an unloading yard between Changdong and Amsa.\n\n**Intervention.** He can verify the real cargo on the sealed stabling track, or expose a release made with a forged maintenance signature.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −25 | Material 15 | Communal 20 | Principle 5 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 30 | Dispersal 40 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Possessiveness 30 | Risk −35 | Display −25 | Persistence 20 | Orientation: same-sex | Union: contract cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"So Dugam","type":"Contract","to":"An Dohan","basis":"taking over An Dohan''s dispatch work at the holding track, and"},{"from":"So Dugam","type":"Contract","to":"Guk So","basis":"Shares tools with Guk So''s depot duty"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Min Gang-hyeon","type":"Contract","to":"So Dugam","basis":"Min Ganghyeon tells Sodugam the times the escort-duty cars stayed on the stabling track. Sodugam checks the dispatch sheet and maintenance log to distinguish time held for maintenance from the actual release time."},{"from":"Guk So","type":"Contract","to":"So Dugam","basis":"Shares duty with Sodugam''s maintenance bay, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0303","name":"소두감","title":"유치선 정비사, 안도한의 실무 담당자","position":"유치선 정비사, 안도한의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K302","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"유치선 배차표·정비 일지 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-소두감","detailRoute":"/people/person-0303","birthDate":"2101-11-10","birthday":"11-10","age":25,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k302-coupler-maintenance","name":"연결기 정비","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k302-priority","name":"정비 서명 필요","description":"소두감은 무기 발견 뒤 출고 스위치를 잠그고 연결기를 손본다. 배차 승인만으로 정비를 건너뛰는 것을 거부한다.","behavior":"배차표와 정비 일지를 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 의료열차 우선권은 장세화의 부서 날인과 정비 서명이 함께 있을 때만 인정한다.","stress":"정비 안 된 칸이 의료열차로 나가 신내운수가 창동과 암사 사이 하역장으로 떨어지는 것.","relationship":"안도한의 배차 실무를 유치선에서 받고, 국소의 기지 당직과 공구를 나눈다. 이홍원의 북부 차륜 교환 시각에 맞춰 연결기를 손본다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k302-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 유치선 정비사, 안도한의 실무 담당자. 배차표와 정비 일지를 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 의료열차 우선권은 장세화의 부서 날인과 정비 서명이 함께 있을 때만 인정한다.","stress":"공포. 정비 안 된 칸이 의료열차로 나가 신내운수가 창동과 암사 사이 하역장으로 떨어지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 안도한의 배차 실무를 유치선에서 받고, 국소의 기지 당직과 공구를 나눈다. 이홍원의 북부 차륜 교환 시각에 맞춰 연결기를 손본다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"소두감은 무기 발견 뒤 출고 스위치를 잠그고 연결기를 손본다. 배차 승인만으로 정비를 건너뛰는 것을 거부한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c18c-c9c4-c8fc","name":"진주 소씨","crest":"clan-crests/c18c-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":30,"무력":-25,"물질":15,"공동":20,"원칙":5,"공개":30,"자격":30,"분산":40,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":30,"위험":-35,"과시":-25,"지속":20,"지향":"동성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"유치선 배차표·정비 일지 대조","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"유치선 정비사, 안도한의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −25 | 물질 15 | 공동 20 | 원칙 5 | 공개 30 | 자격 30 | 분산 40 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 30 | 위험 −35 | 과시 −25 | 지속 20 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2101-11-10에 태어났다. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 유치선 정비사, 안도한의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 소두감의 유치선 배차표·정비 일지 대조 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 유치선 정비사, 안도한의 실무 담당자. 배차표와 정비 일지를 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 의료열차 우선권은 장세화의 부서 날인과 정비 서명이 함께 있을 때만 인정한다.","일화":"의료열차에서 암신도 무기가 나오자 유치선 정비창을 봉쇄하고 출고 스위치를 잠갔다.","관계":"안도한의 배차 실무를 유치선에서 받고, 국소의 기지 당직과 공구를 나눈다. 이홍원의 북부 차륜 교환 시각에 맞춰 연결기를 손본다.","야망":"신내 기지 유치선의 정비를 배차조 단독이 아니라 정비 서명과 함께 열어, 중립 호송 약정의 실제 시각표를 현장 공구로 지탱하려 한다.","공포":"정비 안 된 칸이 의료열차로 나가 신내운수가 창동과 암사 사이 하역장으로 떨어지는 것.","개입":"봉쇄된 유치선의 실제 화물을 확인하거나, 정비 서명을 위조한 출고를 폭로할 수 있다."},"biography":"2101-11-10생인 소두감은 시각표의 빈칸을 참지 못하고, 제동과 연결기를 건너뛴 출고를 모욕처럼 기억한다. 말단 노선의 지연을 정치 순위로 포장하는 말을 거부한다.\n\n- 생업: 유치선 배차표·정비 일지 대조\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 유치선 정비사, 안도한의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2101-11-10에 태어났다. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 유치선 정비사, 안도한의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 소두감의 유치선 배차표·정비 일지 대조 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 유치선 정비사, 안도한의 실무 담당자. 배차표와 정비 일지를 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 의료열차 우선권은 장세화의 부서 날인과 정비 서명이 함께 있을 때만 인정한다.\n\n**일화.** 의료열차에서 암신도 무기가 나오자 유치선 정비창을 봉쇄하고 출고 스위치를 잠갔다.\n\n**관계.** 안도한의 배차 실무를 유치선에서 받고, 국소의 기지 당직과 공구를 나눈다. 이홍원의 북부 차륜 교환 시각에 맞춰 연결기를 손본다.\n\n**야망.** 신내 기지 유치선의 정비를 배차조 단독이 아니라 정비 서명과 함께 열어, 중립 호송 약정의 실제 시각표를 현장 공구로 지탱하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 정비 안 된 칸이 의료열차로 나가 신내운수가 창동과 암사 사이 하역장으로 떨어지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 봉쇄된 유치선의 실제 화물을 확인하거나, 정비 서명을 위조한 출고를 폭로할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −25 | 물질 15 | 공동 20 | 원칙 5 | 공개 30 | 자격 30 | 분산 40 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 30 | 위험 −35 | 과시 −25 | 지속 20 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"소두감","type":"계약","to":"안도한","basis":"안도한의 배차 실무를 유치선에서 받고"},{"from":"소두감","type":"계약","to":"국소","basis":"국소의 기지 당직과 공구를 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"민강현","type":"계약","to":"소두감","basis":"민강현은 의무호송의 유치선 체류 시각을 소두감에게 전한다. 소두감은 배차표와 정비 일지를 확인해 정비로 머문 시간과 실제 출고 시간을 구분한다."},{"from":"국소","type":"계약","to":"소두감","basis":"소두감의 정비 창과 당직을 나누고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0304', 'bcf5-ba74-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0304","name":"Bok Bong","title":"Transfer Relay Merchant","position":"Transfer Relay Merchant","characterId":"K303","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Transfer Cargo Intake Weight · Invoice Verification","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-bokbong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0304","birthDate":"2071-11-24","birthday":"11-24","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k303-transfer-invoice-recording","name":"Transfer invoice recording","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k303-priority","name":"Waits for patient stability","description":"Bokbong aligns unloading with dispatch and does not sell empty slots before patient stability. The cause of invoice weight gaps is unknown.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: transfer relay logistics merchant. Two witnesses reported intake weights, and he blocked the unloading of any invoice suspected of arms loading until the medical crew posted it.","stress":"Fear. That a munitions clause would mix into patient-car invoices and the transfer city would sink into a freight yard.","relationship":"Relations. Matched the unloading order with An Dohan''s dispatch chalkboard and moved Bok Yong''s neutral-market prices onto the invoices. He sold no empty slots before Jeon Miri''s patient vitals were stable.","effects":[]},{"id":"k303-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: transfer relay logistics merchant. Two witnesses reported intake weights, and he blocked the unloading of any invoice suspected of arms loading until the medical crew posted it.","stress":"Fear. That a munitions clause would mix into patient-car invoices and the transfer city would sink into a freight yard.","relationship":"Relations. Matched the unloading order with An Dohan''s dispatch chalkboard and moved Bok Yong''s neutral-market prices onto the invoices. He sold no empty slots before Jeon Miri''s patient vitals were stable.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Bokbong aligns unloading with dispatch and does not sell empty slots before patient stability. The cause of invoice weight gaps is unknown.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bcf5-ba74-cc9c","name":"Bok Clan of Myeoncheon","crest":"clan-crests/bcf5-ba74-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":40,"Force":-20,"Material":20,"Communal":10,"Principle":-10,"Public":25,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":40,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-30,"Display":-25,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Transfer Cargo Intake Weight · Invoice Verification","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Transfer Relay Merchant","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 40 | Force −20 | Material 20 | Communal 10 | Principle −10 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 40 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Craving 15 | Possessiveness −20 | Risk −30 | Display −25 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: opposite-sex | Union: non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2071-11-24. Raised in the Sangam transmission room. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty of Transfer Relay Logistics Merchant; the post-succession record notes that the post opened with keeping the transmission going through a three-day blackout.\n- The Mangu transfer queue, patient and cargo separation, weight, invoice, price and public testimony record desk of Sangbong 1-dong is proposed as Bokbong''s duty reference point for checking inbound weights and invoices of transfer freight. This is a proposal for cross-checking handover records in the permanent winter, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, passage tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles, fiefs or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Transfer Relay Logistics Merchant. Two witnesses observe the inbound weight, and any invoice suspected of carrying weapons has its unloading blocked until the medical team posts its notice.","Anecdote":"When Amsa-made weapons turned up on a medical train, the relay invoices of the same hour showed two gaps in weight.","Relationships":"He aligns An Dohan''s dispatch blackboard with the unloading order and copies Bok Yong''s neutral-market prices onto the invoices. He does not sell empty slots until Jeon Miri''s patient vitals have stabilized.","Ambition":"He means to bind the transfer relay of the northeastern neutral market to public prices and so fix a freight order that carries no escort fee.","Fear":"That a military insignia gets mixed into the patient-car invoices and Sinnae Transport falls to being an unloading yard.","Intervention":"He can make the gapped invoices public, or turn unloading at the neutral market back to medical priority."},"biography":"Born 2071-11-24, Bokbong puts the weight on an invoice and the seal on a patient car on the same scale, and despises merchants who write escort fees in as a condition of passage. He fixes the unloading order well before the season''s shift change.\n\n- Occupation: Checking inbound weights and invoices of transfer freight\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Transfer Relay Logistics Merchant\n**Life.** Born on 2071-11-24. Raised in the Sangam transmission room. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty of Transfer Relay Logistics Merchant; the post-succession record notes that the post opened with keeping the transmission going through a three-day blackout.\n- The Mangu transfer queue, patient and cargo separation, weight, invoice, price and public testimony record desk of Sangbong 1-dong is proposed as Bokbong''s duty reference point for checking inbound weights and invoices of transfer freight. This is a proposal for cross-checking handover records in the permanent winter, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, passage tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles, fiefs or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Transfer Relay Logistics Merchant. Two witnesses observe the inbound weight, and any invoice suspected of carrying weapons has its unloading blocked until the medical team posts its notice.\n\n**Anecdote.** When Amsa-made weapons turned up on a medical train, the relay invoices of the same hour showed two gaps in weight.\n\n**Relations.** He aligns An Dohan''s dispatch blackboard with the unloading order and copies Bok Yong''s neutral-market prices onto the invoices. He does not sell empty slots until Jeon Miri''s patient vitals have stabilized.\n\n**Ambition.** He means to bind the transfer relay of the northeastern neutral market to public prices and so fix a freight order that carries no escort fee.\n\n**Fear.** That a military insignia gets mixed into the patient-car invoices and Sinnae Transport falls to being an unloading yard.\n\n**Intervention.** He can make the gapped invoices public, or turn unloading at the neutral market back to medical priority.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 40 | Force −20 | Material 20 | Communal 10 | Principle −10 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 40 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Possessiveness −20 | Risk −30 | Display −25 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: opposite-sex | Union: non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bok Bong","type":"Contract","to":"An Dohan","basis":"aligning the unloading order with An Dohan''s dispatch blackboard, and"},{"from":"Bok Bong","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Yong","basis":"Copies Bok Yong''s neutral-market prices onto the invoices"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Yong Bong","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Bong","basis":"Shares the unloading order and the queue with Bokbong"},{"from":"Bok Yong","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Bong","basis":"Matches Bokbong''s relay invoices to market prices, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0304","name":"복봉","title":"환승 중계 물류상","position":"환승 중계 물류상","characterId":"K303","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"환승 화물 입고 중량·송장 확인","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-복봉","detailRoute":"/people/person-0304","birthDate":"2071-11-24","birthday":"11-24","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k303-transfer-invoice-recording","name":"중계 송장 작성","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k303-priority","name":"환자 안정 전 대기","description":"복봉은 하역과 배차를 맞추고 환자 활력 전 빈 슬롯을 팔지 않는다. 송장 무게 공백의 범인은 미확인이다.","behavior":"입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 무기 적재가 의심되는 송장은 의료조 게시 전까지 하역을 막는다.","stress":"군수 문장이 환자 칸 송장에 섞여 신내운수가 하역장으로 전락하는 것.","relationship":"안도한의 배차 칠판과 하역 순서를 맞추고, 복용의 중립시장 시세를 송장에 옮긴다. 전미리의 환자 활력이 안정되기 전에는 빈 슬롯을 팔지 않는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k303-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 중계 물류상. 입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 무기 적재가 의심되는 송장은 의료조 게시 전까지 하역을 막는다.","stress":"공포. 군수 문장이 환자 칸 송장에 섞여 신내운수가 하역장으로 전락하는 것.","relationship":"관계. 안도한의 배차 칠판과 하역 순서를 맞추고, 복용의 중립시장 시세를 송장에 옮긴다. 전미리의 환자 활력이 안정되기 전에는 빈 슬롯을 팔지 않는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"복봉은 하역과 배차를 맞추고 환자 활력 전 빈 슬롯을 팔지 않는다. 송장 무게 공백의 범인은 미확인이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bcf5-ba74-cc9c","name":"면천 복씨","crest":"clan-crests/bcf5-ba74-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":40,"무력":-20,"물질":20,"공동":10,"원칙":-10,"공개":25,"자격":20,"분산":40,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":-20,"위험":-30,"과시":-25,"지속":-10,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"환승 화물 입고 중량·송장 확인","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"환승 중계 물류상","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 40 | 무력 −20 | 물질 20 | 공동 10 | 원칙 −10 | 공개 25 | 자격 20 | 분산 40 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −25 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2071-11-24에 태어났다. 상암 송신실에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 환승 중계 물류상 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 정전 사흘 송신 유지로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 복봉의 환승 화물 입고 중량·송장 확인 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 중계 물류상. 입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 무기 적재가 의심되는 송장은 의료조 게시 전까지 하역을 막는다.","일화":"의료열차에서 암신도 무기가 나오자 같은 시각의 중계 송장에 무게 공백이 두 칸 있었다.","관계":"안도한의 배차 칠판과 하역 순서를 맞추고, 복용의 중립시장 시세를 송장에 옮긴다. 전미리의 환자 활력이 안정되기 전에는 빈 슬롯을 팔지 않는다.","야망":"북동부 중립시장의 환승 중계를 공개 시세로 묶어 호송료 없는 화물 순서를 고정하려 한다.","공포":"군수 문장이 환자 칸 송장에 섞여 신내운수가 하역장으로 전락하는 것.","개입":"공백 송장을 공개하거나, 중립시장 하역을 의료 우선으로 되돌릴 수 있다."},"biography":"2071-11-24생인 복봉은 송장의 무게와 환자 칸의 봉인을 같은 저울에 올리고, 호송료를 통행 조건으로 적는 상인을 경멸한다. 계절 교대 전에 이미 하역 순서를 고쳐 둔다.\n\n- 생업: 환승 화물 입고 중량·송장 확인\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 환승 중계 물류상\n**생애.** 2071-11-24에 태어났다. 상암 송신실에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 환승 중계 물류상 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 정전 사흘 송신 유지로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 복봉의 환승 화물 입고 중량·송장 확인 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 중계 물류상. 입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 무기 적재가 의심되는 송장은 의료조 게시 전까지 하역을 막는다.\n\n**일화.** 의료열차에서 암신도 무기가 나오자 같은 시각의 중계 송장에 무게 공백이 두 칸 있었다.\n\n**관계.** 안도한의 배차 칠판과 하역 순서를 맞추고, 복용의 중립시장 시세를 송장에 옮긴다. 전미리의 환자 활력이 안정되기 전에는 빈 슬롯을 팔지 않는다.\n\n**야망.** 북동부 중립시장의 환승 중계를 공개 시세로 묶어 호송료 없는 화물 순서를 고정하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 군수 문장이 환자 칸 송장에 섞여 신내운수가 하역장으로 전락하는 것.\n\n**개입.** 공백 송장을 공개하거나, 중립시장 하역을 의료 우선으로 되돌릴 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 40 | 무력 −20 | 물질 20 | 공동 10 | 원칙 −10 | 공개 25 | 자격 20 | 분산 40 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −25 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"복봉","type":"계약","to":"안도한","basis":"안도한의 배차 칠판과 하역 순서를 맞추고"},{"from":"복봉","type":"계약","to":"복용","basis":"복용의 중립시장 시세를 송장에 옮긴다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"용봉","type":"계약","to":"복봉","basis":"복봉의 하역 순서와 줄을 나눈다"},{"from":"복용","type":"계약","to":"복봉","basis":"복봉의 중계 송장과 시세를 맞추고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0305', 'ad6d-b2f4-c591', '{"id":"person-0305","name":"Guk Yong","title":"Transfer Duty Medical Officer, Jeon Miri''s Deputy","position":"Transfer Duty Medical Officer, Jeon Miri''s Deputy","characterId":"K304","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Transfer Patient Severity · Transfer Time Record","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-gugyong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0305","birthDate":"2071-08-05","birthday":"08-05","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k304-stretcher-ordering","name":"Stretcher ordering","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k304-priority","name":"Extends duty","description":"Gukyong extended duty and refused dispatch rotation when crowds accumulated. Patient priority does not establish a completed medical escort system.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: transfer duty medic, duty officer of Jeon Miri. He pasted the severity table and transfer hours in the duty room and opened no car suspected of arms loading without the examiner''s attendance.","stress":"Fear. That the patient cars would be mistaken for munitions cars and the whole convoy squad would be disarmed.","relationship":"Relations. Executed the stretcher order under Jeon Miri''s command and shared the medical crew''s duty room and sickbeds with Gam Mo. Moved Ryu Eunbi''s medical alliance convoy passes into the duty ledger.","effects":[]},{"id":"k304-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: transfer duty medic, duty officer of Jeon Miri. He pasted the severity table and transfer hours in the duty room and opened no car suspected of arms loading without the examiner''s attendance.","stress":"Fear. That the patient cars would be mistaken for munitions cars and the whole convoy squad would be disarmed.","relationship":"Relations. Executed the stretcher order under Jeon Miri''s command and shared the medical crew''s duty room and sickbeds with Gam Mo. Moved Ryu Eunbi''s medical alliance convoy passes into the duty ledger.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Gukyong extended duty and refused dispatch rotation when crowds accumulated. Patient priority does not establish a completed medical escort system.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ad6d-b2f4-c591","name":"Damyang Guk Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ad6d-b2f4-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":60,"Force":-50,"Material":0,"Communal":20,"Principle":15,"Public":15,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":45,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":30,"Display":-10,"Sustained":10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Transfer Patient Severity · Transfer Time Record","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Transfer Duty Medical Officer, Jeon Miri''s Deputy","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 60 | Force −50 | Material 0 | Communal 20 | Principle 15 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 10 | Dispersal 45 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 25 | Possessiveness −20 | Risk 30 | Display −10 | Persistence 10 | Orientation: opposite-sex | Union: monogamous marriage"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2071-08-05. Raised in the Jegi-dong infirmary. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty of Transfer Duty Medical Orderly and Practical Aide to Jeon Miri; the post-succession record notes that the post opened with a counterfeit-medicine seal.\n- The dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, passage-inspection, stretcher-handover and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as Gugyong''s duty reference point for recording transfer patients'' severity and transport times. This is a proposal for cross-checking handover records in the permanent winter, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, passage tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles, fiefs or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort Officer. Title: Transfer Duty Medical Officer, Working-Level Aide to Jeon Miri. Posts the triage chart and transfer times in the duty room, and does not open any car suspected of carrying weapons without an inspector present.","Anecdote":"When the southbound procession from Bukhansan Bogungmun piled up on the Sinnae platform, he extended his duty shift and refused the dispatch crew''s shift change.","Relationships":"Under Jeon Miri''s command he enforces the stretcher order, and shares the duty room and sickbeds with Gam Mo''s medical team. He copies Ryu Eunbi''s Medical Alliance escort passes into the duty ledger.","Ambition":"He wants to bind the Jungnang and Mangu emergency transfers to the Jegi-dong treatment contract with a single escort permit, completing a medical escort with no escort fee from the duty room.","Fear":"That a patient car is mistaken for a military supply car and the entire escort convoy is disarmed.","Intervention":"He can cross-check the patient roster against the weapons loading records, or copy a draft medical escort permit in the duty room."},"biography":"Born 2071-08-05, Gugyong looks at the grade of injury first and nationality later. He trusts stretcher order over neutral wording, and does not accept the dispatch crew''s demand for empty slots until vitals have stabilized.\n\n- Livelihood: Recording transfer patients'' triage levels and transfer times\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort Officer\n- Title: Transfer Duty Medical Officer, Working-Level Aide to Jeon Miri\n**Life.** Born on 2071-08-05. Raised at the Jegi-dong infirmary. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty post of Transfer Duty Medical Officer, Working-Level Aide to Jeon Miri, and the post handover record still notes that the post opened with a fake-medicine seal.\n- The record desk of Sinnae 1-dong, covering dispatch, shift changes, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handovers and duty keys, is proposed as the service reference point for Gugyong''s recording of transfer patients'' triage levels and transfer times. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the Permanent Winter; it does not fix running trains, new facilities, armaments, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort Officer. Title: Transfer Duty Medical Officer, Working-Level Aide to Jeon Miri. Posts the triage chart and transfer times in the duty room, and does not open any car suspected of carrying weapons without an inspector present.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the southbound procession from Bukhansan Bogungmun piled up on the Sinnae platform, he extended his duty shift and refused the dispatch crew''s shift change.\n\n**Relations.** Enforces stretcher order under Jeon Miri''s command, and shares the duty room and beds with Gammo''s medical squad. Transfers Ryu Eunbi''s medical alliance escort permits into the duty ledger.\n\n**Ambition.** He wants to bind the Jungnang and Mangu emergency transfers to the Jegi-dong treatment contract with a single escort permit, completing a medical escort with no escort fee from the duty room.\n\n**Fear.** That a patient car will be mistaken for a munitions car and the entire escort will be disarmed.\n\n**Intervention.** He can cross-check the patient roster against the weapons loading records, or copy a draft medical escort permit in the duty room.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 60 | Force −50 | Material 0 | Communal 20 | Principle 15 | Disclosure 15 | Qualification 10 | Dispersion 45 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Possessiveness −20 | Risk 30 | Display −10 | Persistence 10 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Union: Monogamy\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Guk Yong","type":"Command","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"carrying out the stretcher order under Jeon Miri''s command, and"},{"from":"Guk Yong","type":"Command","to":"Gammo","basis":"Shares the duty room and beds with Gammo''s medical squad"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gammo","type":"Command","to":"Guk Yong","basis":"Shares the stretcher order and beds with Gugyong"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0305","name":"국용","title":"환승 당직 의무원, 전미리의 실무 담당자","position":"환승 당직 의무원, 전미리의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K304","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"환승 환자 중증도·이송 시각 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-국용","detailRoute":"/people/person-0305","birthDate":"2071-08-05","birthday":"08-05","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k304-stretcher-ordering","name":"들것 순서 집행","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k304-priority","name":"당직을 연장함","description":"국용은 행렬이 쌓이자 당직을 연장하고 배차 교대를 거부했다. 환자 우선이지만 완료된 의료호송 제도는 아니다.","behavior":"중증도 표와 이송 시각을 당직실에 붙이고, 무기 적재 의심 칸은 심사관 입회 없이 열지 않는다.","stress":"환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","relationship":"전미리의 지휘로 들것 순서를 집행하고, 감모의 의료조 당직실과 병상을 나눈다. 류은비의 의료동맹 호송증을 당직 원장에 옮긴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k304-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 당직 의무원, 전미리의 실무 담당자. 중증도 표와 이송 시각을 당직실에 붙이고, 무기 적재 의심 칸은 심사관 입회 없이 열지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","relationship":"관계. 전미리의 지휘로 들것 순서를 집행하고, 감모의 의료조 당직실과 병상을 나눈다. 류은비의 의료동맹 호송증을 당직 원장에 옮긴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"국용은 행렬이 쌓이자 당직을 연장하고 배차 교대를 거부했다. 환자 우선이지만 완료된 의료호송 제도는 아니다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ad6d-b2f4-c591","name":"담양 국씨","crest":"clan-crests/ad6d-b2f4-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":60,"무력":-50,"물질":0,"공동":20,"원칙":15,"공개":15,"자격":10,"분산":45,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":-20,"위험":30,"과시":-10,"지속":10,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"환승 환자 중증도·이송 시각 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"환승 당직 의무원, 전미리의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 60 | 무력 −50 | 물질 0 | 공동 20 | 원칙 15 | 공개 15 | 자격 10 | 분산 45 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 −20 | 위험 30 | 과시 −10 | 지속 10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2071-08-05에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 환승 당직 의무원, 전미리의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 국용의 환승 환자 중증도·이송 시각 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 당직 의무원, 전미리의 실무 담당자. 중증도 표와 이송 시각을 당직실에 붙이고, 무기 적재 의심 칸은 심사관 입회 없이 열지 않는다.","일화":"북한산보국문 남하 행렬이 신내 승강장에 쌓이자 당직을 연장하고 배차조 교대를 거부했다.","관계":"전미리의 지휘로 들것 순서를 집행하고, 감모의 의료조 당직실과 병상을 나눈다. 류은비의 의료동맹 호송증을 당직 원장에 옮긴다.","야망":"중랑·망우 응급 이송을 제기동 치료계약과 한 장의 호송증으로 묶어, 호송료 없는 의료 호송을 당직실에서 완성하려 한다.","공포":"환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","개입":"환자 명부와 무기 적재 기록을 대조하거나, 의료 호송증 초안을 당직실에서 복사할 수 있다."},"biography":"2071-08-05생인 국용은 부상 등급을 먼저 보고 국적을 나중에 본다. 중립 문구보다 들것 순서를 믿고, 배차조의 빈 슬롯 요구를 활력이 안정되기 전에는 받지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 환승 환자 중증도·이송 시각 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 환승 당직 의무원, 전미리의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2071-08-05에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 환승 당직 의무원, 전미리의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 국용의 환승 환자 중증도·이송 시각 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 당직 의무원, 전미리의 실무 담당자. 중증도 표와 이송 시각을 당직실에 붙이고, 무기 적재 의심 칸은 심사관 입회 없이 열지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 북한산보국문 남하 행렬이 신내 승강장에 쌓이자 당직을 연장하고 배차조 교대를 거부했다.\n\n**관계.** 전미리의 지휘로 들것 순서를 집행하고, 감모의 의료조 당직실과 병상을 나눈다. 류은비의 의료동맹 호송증을 당직 원장에 옮긴다.\n\n**야망.** 중랑·망우 응급 이송을 제기동 치료계약과 한 장의 호송증으로 묶어, 호송료 없는 의료 호송을 당직실에서 완성하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.\n\n**개입.** 환자 명부와 무기 적재 기록을 대조하거나, 의료 호송증 초안을 당직실에서 복사할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 60 | 무력 −50 | 물질 0 | 공동 20 | 원칙 15 | 공개 15 | 자격 10 | 분산 45 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 −20 | 위험 30 | 과시 −10 | 지속 10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"국용","type":"지휘","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리의 지휘로 들것 순서를 집행하고"},{"from":"국용","type":"지휘","to":"감모","basis":"감모의 의료조 당직실과 병상을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"감모","type":"지휘","to":"국용","basis":"국용의 들것 순서와 병상을 나눈다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0306', 'ac10-cc3d-c6d0', '{"id":"person-0306","name":"Gam Guk","title":"Northeast Outer Road Patrol, Ha Seon''s Deputy","position":"Northeast Outer Road Patrol, Ha Seon''s Deputy","characterId":"K305","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Outer Escort Roster · Firing Authority Verification","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-gamguk","detailRoute":"/people/person-0306","birthDate":"2082-07-04","birthday":"07-04","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":7,"effective":7}},"skills":[{"id":"k305-escort-patrol-allocation","name":"Escort patrol allocation","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k305-priority","name":"Rejects boasts about firing","description":"Gamguk distributes personnel by car and blocks fire before sealed orders. Meeting a patrol train does not mean winning a fight.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: northeast outer-road patrol, duty officer of Ha Seon. He mixed convoy personnel into the medical cars and the freight cars and granted firing authority only before Jang Sehwa''s sealed order.","stress":"Fear. That the patrol would meet the Amsa patrol train and one exchange of fire would turn neutrality into war.","relationship":"Relations. Rounded the outer road under Ha Seon''s command and confirmed Mun Sion''s examination-stand seals on the road. He left none of Bae Woojin''s protection searches in the patrol ledger.","effects":[]},{"id":"k305-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: northeast outer-road patrol, duty officer of Ha Seon. He mixed convoy personnel into the medical cars and the freight cars and granted firing authority only before Jang Sehwa''s sealed order.","stress":"Fear. That the patrol would meet the Amsa patrol train and one exchange of fire would turn neutrality into war.","relationship":"Relations. Rounded the outer road under Ha Seon''s command and confirmed Mun Sion''s examination-stand seals on the road. He left none of Bae Woojin''s protection searches in the patrol ledger.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Gamguk distributes personnel by car and blocks fire before sealed orders. Meeting a patrol train does not mean winning a fight.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ac10-cc3d-c6d0","name":"Changwon Gam Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ac10-cc3d-c6d0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":35,"Force":-15,"Material":5,"Communal":20,"Principle":0,"Public":25,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":45,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":-35,"Display":20,"Sustained":40,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Outer Escort Roster · Firing Authority Verification","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Northeast Outer Road Patrol, Ha Seon''s Deputy","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 35 | Force −15 | Material 5 | Communal 20 | Principle 0 | Disclosure 25 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 45 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 40 | Possessiveness −15 | Risk −35 | Display 20 | Persistence 40 | Orientation: Same-sex | Union: Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2082-07-04. Raised at the Amsa guard post. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty post of Northeast Outer Road Patrol, Working-Level Aide to Ha Seon, and the post handover record still notes that the post opened through catching an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- The record desk of Sinnae 1-dong, covering dispatch, shift changes, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handovers and duty keys, is proposed as the service reference point for Gamguk''s verification of outer escort headcount and firing authority. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the Permanent Winter; it does not fix running trains, new facilities, armaments, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort Officer. Title: Northeast Outer Road Patrol, Working-Level Aide to Ha Seon. Mixes escort personnel between medical cars and freight cars, and grants firing authority only on Jang Sehwa''s sealed order.","Anecdote":"During the winter dispatch survey, the escort convoy met an Amsa patrol train head-on outside Mangu.","Relationships":"Patrols the outer road under Ha Seon''s command, and checks Mun Sion''s screening-desk seals on the road. Does not leave Bae Ujin''s protective searches in the patrol ledger.","Ambition":"He wants the Sinnae escort to take over the outer patrol of the neutral escort, proving the strength of the toll-free Northeast Corridor.","Fear":"That the patrol meets an Amsa patrol train and a single exchange of fire turns neutrality into war.","Intervention":"Can pass along signal flags to avoid combat, or trace the party that forged the firing order."},"biography":"Born 2082-07-04, Gamguk fills in on site for the vacancy left by an optimistic superior, and knows the silence of guarding a long train with few troops. He takes anyone who boasts of firing off the escort.\n\n- Livelihood: Verifying outer escort headcount and firing authority\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort Officer\n- Title: Northeast Outer Road Patrol, Working-Level Aide to Ha Seon\n**Life.** Born on 2082-07-04. Raised at the Amsa guard post. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty post of Northeast Outer Road Patrol, Working-Level Aide to Ha Seon, and the post handover record still notes that the post opened through catching an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- The record desk of Sinnae 1-dong, covering dispatch, shift changes, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handovers and duty keys, is proposed as the service reference point for Gamguk''s verification of outer escort headcount and firing authority. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the Permanent Winter; it does not fix running trains, new facilities, armaments, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort Officer. Title: Northeast Outer Road Patrol, Working-Level Aide to Ha Seon. Mixes escort personnel between medical cars and freight cars, and grants firing authority only on Jang Sehwa''s sealed order.\n\n**Anecdote.** During the winter dispatch survey, the escort convoy met an Amsa patrol train head-on outside Mangu.\n\n**Relations.** Patrols the outer road under Ha Seon''s command, and checks Mun Sion''s screening-desk seals on the road. Does not leave Bae Ujin''s protective searches in the patrol ledger.\n\n**Ambition.** He wants the Sinnae escort to take over the outer patrol of the neutral escort, proving the strength of the toll-free Northeast Corridor.\n\n**Fear.** That the patrol meets an Amsa patrol train and a single exchange of fire turns neutrality into war.\n\n**Intervention.** He can relay signals to avoid an engagement, or track down whoever forged the firing order.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 35 | Force −15 | Material 5 | Communal 20 | Principle 0 | Disclosure 25 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 45 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Possessiveness −15 | Risk −35 | Display 20 | Persistence 40 | Orientation: Same-sex | Union: Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gam Guk","type":"Command","to":"Ha Seon","basis":"Circle the outer road under Ha Seon''s command, and"},{"from":"Gam Guk","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Verify Mun Sion''s inspection post seal on the road"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0306","name":"감국","title":"동북 외곽로 순찰대, 하세온의 실무 담당자","position":"동북 외곽로 순찰대, 하세온의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K305","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"외곽 호송 인원·발포 권한 확인","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-감국","detailRoute":"/people/person-0306","birthDate":"2082-07-04","birthday":"07-04","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":7,"effective":7}},"skills":[{"id":"k305-escort-patrol-allocation","name":"호송 순찰 배치","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k305-priority","name":"발포 자랑 거부","description":"감국은 칸별 인원을 나누고 봉인 명령 전 발포를 막는다. 순찰열차와 마주친 일화는 교전을 이겼다는 뜻이 아니다.","behavior":"호송 인원을 의료칸과 화물칸에 섞어 두고, 발포 권한은 장세화의 봉인된 명령 전에는 주지 않는다.","stress":"순찰이 암사 순찰열차와 마주쳐 교전 한 방으로 중립이 전쟁으로 바뀌는 것.","relationship":"하세온의 지휘로 외곽로를 돌고, 문시온의 심사대 봉인을 길에서 확인한다. 배우진의 보호 검색을 순찰 원장에 남기지 않는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k305-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 동북 외곽로 순찰대, 하세온의 실무 담당자. 호송 인원을 의료칸과 화물칸에 섞어 두고, 발포 권한은 장세화의 봉인된 명령 전에는 주지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 순찰이 암사 순찰열차와 마주쳐 교전 한 방으로 중립이 전쟁으로 바뀌는 것.","relationship":"관계. 하세온의 지휘로 외곽로를 돌고, 문시온의 심사대 봉인을 길에서 확인한다. 배우진의 보호 검색을 순찰 원장에 남기지 않는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"감국은 칸별 인원을 나누고 봉인 명령 전 발포를 막는다. 순찰열차와 마주친 일화는 교전을 이겼다는 뜻이 아니다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ac10-cc3d-c6d0","name":"창원 감씨","crest":"clan-crests/ac10-cc3d-c6d0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":35,"무력":-15,"물질":5,"공동":20,"원칙":0,"공개":25,"자격":20,"분산":45,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":-15,"위험":-35,"과시":20,"지속":40,"지향":"동성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"외곽 호송 인원·발포 권한 확인","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"동북 외곽로 순찰대, 하세온의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 35 | 무력 −15 | 물질 5 | 공동 20 | 원칙 0 | 공개 25 | 자격 20 | 분산 45 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −35 | 과시 20 | 지속 40 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2082-07-04에 태어났다. 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 동북 외곽로 순찰대, 하세온의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 감국의 외곽 호송 인원·발포 권한 확인 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 동북 외곽로 순찰대, 하세온의 실무 담당자. 호송 인원을 의료칸과 화물칸에 섞어 두고, 발포 권한은 장세화의 봉인된 명령 전에는 주지 않는다.","일화":"겨울 배차 조사 중 호송대가 암사 순찰열차와 망우 외곽에서 정면으로 마주쳤다.","관계":"하세온의 지휘로 외곽로를 돌고, 문시온의 심사대 봉인을 길에서 확인한다. 배우진의 보호 검색을 순찰 원장에 남기지 않는다.","야망":"중립 호송의 외곽 순찰을 신내 호송대가 맡아 호송료 없는 동북 회랑의 실력을 증명하려 한다.","공포":"순찰이 암사 순찰열차와 마주쳐 교전 한 방으로 중립이 전쟁으로 바뀌는 것.","개입":"교전을 피하도록 신호기를 전달하거나, 발포 명령을 위조한 쪽을 추적할 수 있다."},"biography":"2082-07-04생인 감국은 낙관적인 상관의 공백을 현장에서 메우고, 적은 병력으로 긴 열차를 지키는 침묵을 안다. 발포를 자랑하는 사람을 호송에서 내린다.\n\n- 생업: 외곽 호송 인원·발포 권한 확인\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 동북 외곽로 순찰대, 하세온의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2082-07-04에 태어났다. 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 동북 외곽로 순찰대, 하세온의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 감국의 외곽 호송 인원·발포 권한 확인 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 동북 외곽로 순찰대, 하세온의 실무 담당자. 호송 인원을 의료칸과 화물칸에 섞어 두고, 발포 권한은 장세화의 봉인된 명령 전에는 주지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 겨울 배차 조사 중 호송대가 암사 순찰열차와 망우 외곽에서 정면으로 마주쳤다.\n\n**관계.** 하세온의 지휘로 외곽로를 돌고, 문시온의 심사대 봉인을 길에서 확인한다. 배우진의 보호 검색을 순찰 원장에 남기지 않는다.\n\n**야망.** 중립 호송의 외곽 순찰을 신내 호송대가 맡아 호송료 없는 동북 회랑의 실력을 증명하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 순찰이 암사 순찰열차와 마주쳐 교전 한 방으로 중립이 전쟁으로 바뀌는 것.\n\n**개입.** 교전을 피하도록 신호기를 전달하거나, 발포 명령을 위조한 쪽을 추적할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 35 | 무력 −15 | 물질 5 | 공동 20 | 원칙 0 | 공개 25 | 자격 20 | 분산 45 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −35 | 과시 20 | 지속 40 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"감국","type":"지휘","to":"하세온","basis":"하세온의 지휘로 외곽로를 돌고"},{"from":"감국","type":"계약","to":"문시온","basis":"문시온의 심사대 봉인을 길에서 확인한다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0307', 'b450-b450-b989', '{"id":"person-0307","name":"Du Bok","title":"Seasonal Rotation Messenger, Jeon Miri''s Deputy","position":"Seasonal Rotation Messenger, Jeon Miri''s Deputy","characterId":"K306","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Seasonal Rotation Notice · Patient Vital Signs Record","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-dubok","detailRoute":"/people/person-0307","birthDate":"2066-08-08","birthday":"08-08","age":60,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k306-shift-notice-recording","name":"Shift notice recording","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k306-priority","name":"Preserves approval order","description":"Dubok posts shift seals to both boards simultaneously and preserves inspection refusals. Actual movements for the missing two times remain unknown.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: seasonal rotation courier, duty officer of Jeon Miri. He wrote the rotation notices and the patient vital table in the same ledger and pasted bought notes on the duty-room door.","stress":"Fear. That the courier bag would turn into an arms-loading notice and the rotation decree would become a protection force''s timetable.","relationship":"Relations. Carried the approval-order dispute between Jeon Miri and An Dohan by note and pasted Jang Sehwa''s seasonal rotation stamp on both chalkboards at once. Left Mun Sion''s examination refusal as courier copies.","effects":[]},{"id":"k306-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: seasonal rotation courier, duty officer of Jeon Miri. He wrote the rotation notices and the patient vital table in the same ledger and pasted bought notes on the duty-room door.","stress":"Fear. That the courier bag would turn into an arms-loading notice and the rotation decree would become a protection force''s timetable.","relationship":"Relations. Carried the approval-order dispute between Jeon Miri and An Dohan by note and pasted Jang Sehwa''s seasonal rotation stamp on both chalkboards at once. Left Mun Sion''s examination refusal as courier copies.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Dubok posts shift seals to both boards simultaneously and preserves inspection refusals. Actual movements for the missing two times remain unknown.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b450-b450-b989","name":"Dureung Du Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b450-b450-b989.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":40,"Force":-30,"Material":5,"Communal":20,"Principle":5,"Public":25,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":45,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":35,"Display":5,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Seasonal Rotation Notice · Patient Vital Signs Record","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Seasonal Rotation Messenger, Jeon Miri''s Deputy","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 40 | Force −30 | Material 5 | Communal 20 | Principle 5 | Disclosure 25 | Qualification 25 | Dispersion 45 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Craving 30 | Possessiveness −10 | Risk 35 | Display 5 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2066-08-08. Raised on the Sinnae transfer watch. At the opening of 2126, he holds the post of Seasonal Shift Courier and Jeon Miri''s Working-Level Aide; the post handover record notes that it opened with halting a ticketless departing train.\n- The dispatch, shift, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as Dubok''s duty reference point for seasonal shift notices and patient vital records. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, passage tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Seasonal Shift Courier, Jeon Miri''s Working-Level Aide. Writes shift notices and patient vital charts in the same ledger, and posts bribed slips on the duty-room door.","Anecdote":"Right after the discovery of weapons on the medical train, two time slots that were absent from the shift slips appeared.","Relationships":"Carries notes on the approval-order dispute between Jeon Miri and An Dohan, and posts Jang Sehwa''s seasonal shift seal on both blackboards at the same time. Keeps Mun Sion''s screening refusals as messenger copies.","Ambition":"Aims to keep the seasonal shifts of the dispatch team and the medical team on a fixed courier route so that escort fees outside the route license cannot buy the order of approvals.","Fear":"That the messenger''s bag turns into a weapons loading notice and shift approvals become an outside escort timetable.","Intervention":"Can expose the bribed slip, or fix medical-team-first shifts on the courier route."},"biography":"Dubok, born 2066-08-08, remembers approval shift slips down to the minute and never alters the dispatch table before moving a verbal approval into the courier ledger. If the medical team''s and dispatch team''s orders are crammed onto a single sheet, he snaps his chalk.\n\n- Occupation: Seasonal shift notices and patient vital records\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Seasonal Shift Courier, Jeon Miri''s Working-Level Aide\n**Life.** Born on 2066-08-08. Raised on the Sinnae transfer watch. At the opening of 2126, he holds the post of Seasonal Shift Courier and Jeon Miri''s Working-Level Aide; the post handover record notes that it opened with halting a ticketless departing train.\n- The dispatch, shift, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as Dubok''s duty reference point for seasonal shift notices and patient vital records. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, passage tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Seasonal Shift Courier, Jeon Miri''s Working-Level Aide. Writes shift notices and patient vital charts in the same ledger, and posts bribed slips on the duty-room door.\n\n**Anecdote.** Right after the discovery of weapons on the medical train, two time slots that were absent from the shift slips appeared.\n\n**Relations.** Carries the approval-order dispute between Jeon Miri and An Dohan by slip, and posts Jang Sehwa''s seasonal shift seal on both blackboards at the same time. Keeps Mun Sion''s screening refusal as a courier copy.\n\n**Ambition.** Aims to keep the seasonal shifts of the dispatch team and the medical team on a fixed courier route so that escort fees outside the route license cannot buy the order of approvals.\n\n**Fear.** That the courier bag turns into a weapons-loading notice and shift approvals become an external escort timetable.\n\n**Intervention.** Can expose the bribed slip, or fix medical-team-first shifts on the courier route.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 40 | Force −30 | Materialism 5 | Community 20 | Principle 5 | Transparency 25 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 45 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Longing 30 | Monopoly −10 | Risk 35 | Display 5 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Du Bok","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"carrying notes about the approval-order dispute between Jeon Miri and An Dohan, and"},{"from":"Du Bok","type":"Contract","to":"An Dohan","basis":"carrying notes about the approval-order dispute between Jeon Miri and An Dohan, and"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0307","name":"두복","title":"계절 교대 전령, 전미리의 실무 담당자","position":"계절 교대 전령, 전미리의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K306","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"계절 교대 통지·환자 활력 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-두복","detailRoute":"/people/person-0307","birthDate":"2066-08-08","birthday":"08-08","age":60,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k306-shift-notice-recording","name":"교대 통지 기록","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k306-priority","name":"승인 순서 보존","description":"두복은 교대 날인을 양쪽 칠판에 동시에 붙이고 심사 거부를 사본으로 남긴다. 없는 시각 두 칸의 실제 이동은 미확인이다.","behavior":"교대 통지와 환자 활력 표를 같은 원장에 적고, 매수된 쪽지는 당직실 문에 붙인다.","stress":"전령 가방이 무기 적재 통지로 바뀌어 교대 결재가 외부 호위 시간표가 되는 것.","relationship":"전미리와 안도한의 승인 순서 다툼을 쪽지로 나르고, 장세화의 계절 교대 날인을 양쪽 칠판에 동시에 붙인다. 문시온의 심사 거부를 전령 사본으로 남긴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k306-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 계절 교대 전령, 전미리의 실무 담당자. 교대 통지와 환자 활력 표를 같은 원장에 적고, 매수된 쪽지는 당직실 문에 붙인다.","stress":"공포. 전령 가방이 무기 적재 통지로 바뀌어 교대 결재가 외부 호위 시간표가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 전미리와 안도한의 승인 순서 다툼을 쪽지로 나르고, 장세화의 계절 교대 날인을 양쪽 칠판에 동시에 붙인다. 문시온의 심사 거부를 전령 사본으로 남긴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"두복은 교대 날인을 양쪽 칠판에 동시에 붙이고 심사 거부를 사본으로 남긴다. 없는 시각 두 칸의 실제 이동은 미확인이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b450-b450-b989","name":"두릉 두씨","crest":"clan-crests/b450-b450-b989.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":40,"무력":-30,"물질":5,"공동":20,"원칙":5,"공개":25,"자격":25,"분산":45,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-10,"위험":35,"과시":5,"지속":0,"지향":"양성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"계절 교대 통지·환자 활력 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"계절 교대 전령, 전미리의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 40 | 무력 −30 | 물질 5 | 공동 20 | 원칙 5 | 공개 25 | 자격 25 | 분산 45 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 −10 | 위험 35 | 과시 5 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2066-08-08에 태어났다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 계절 교대 전령, 전미리의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 두복의 계절 교대 통지·환자 활력 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 계절 교대 전령, 전미리의 실무 담당자. 교대 통지와 환자 활력 표를 같은 원장에 적고, 매수된 쪽지는 당직실 문에 붙인다.","일화":"의료열차 무기 발견 직후 교대 쪽지에 없는 시각이 두 칸 생겼다.","관계":"전미리와 안도한의 승인 순서 다툼을 쪽지로 나르고, 장세화의 계절 교대 날인을 양쪽 칠판에 동시에 붙인다. 문시온의 심사 거부를 전령 사본으로 남긴다.","야망":"배차조와 의료조의 계절 교대를 고정 전령로로 남겨 노선 면허 밖의 호송료가 결재 순서를 사지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"전령 가방이 무기 적재 통지로 바뀌어 교대 결재가 외부 호위 시간표가 되는 것.","개입":"매수 쪽지를 공개하거나, 의료조 우선 교대를 전령로에 고정할 수 있다."},"biography":"2066-08-08생인 두복은 결재 교대 쪽지를 분 단위로 기억하고, 구두 승인을 전령 원장에 옮기기 전에 배차표를 고치지 않는다. 의료조와 배차조의 순서를 한 장에 몰면 분필을 꺾는다.\n\n- 생업: 계절 교대 통지·환자 활력 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 계절 교대 전령, 전미리의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2066-08-08에 태어났다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 계절 교대 전령, 전미리의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 두복의 계절 교대 통지·환자 활력 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 계절 교대 전령, 전미리의 실무 담당자. 교대 통지와 환자 활력 표를 같은 원장에 적고, 매수된 쪽지는 당직실 문에 붙인다.\n\n**일화.** 의료열차 무기 발견 직후 교대 쪽지에 없는 시각이 두 칸 생겼다.\n\n**관계.** 전미리와 안도한의 승인 순서 다툼을 쪽지로 나르고, 장세화의 계절 교대 날인을 양쪽 칠판에 동시에 붙인다. 문시온의 심사 거부를 전령 사본으로 남긴다.\n\n**야망.** 배차조와 의료조의 계절 교대를 고정 전령로로 남겨 노선 면허 밖의 호송료가 결재 순서를 사지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 전령 가방이 무기 적재 통지로 바뀌어 교대 결재가 외부 호위 시간표가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 매수 쪽지를 공개하거나, 의료조 우선 교대를 전령로에 고정할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 40 | 무력 −30 | 물질 5 | 공동 20 | 원칙 5 | 공개 25 | 자격 25 | 분산 45 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 −10 | 위험 35 | 과시 5 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"두복","type":"계약","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리와 안도한의 승인 순서 다툼을 쪽지로 나르고"},{"from":"두복","type":"계약","to":"안도한","basis":"전미리와 안도한의 승인 순서 다툼을 쪽지로 나르고"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0308', 'bcf5-ba74-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0308","name":"Bok Gam","title":"Northeast Outer Road Surveyor","position":"Northeast Outer Road Surveyor","characterId":"K307","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Northeast Outer Road Measured Line · Search Warrant Record","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-bokgam","detailRoute":"/people/person-0308","birthDate":"2078-02-12","birthday":"02-12","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k307-outer-route-surveying","name":"Outer route surveying","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k307-priority","name":"Matches maps and seals","description":"Bokgam surveys the rear gate and posts coordinates. Map and seal gaps are documented, not successful prevention of bypass searches.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: northeast outer-road surveyor. He left unsurveyed lines only as dotted lines and moved no great power''s search warrant into the map margins.","stress":"Fear. That a forged bypass would link to the medical train''s rear gate and the neutrality declaration would become empty wording.","relationship":"Relations. Handed rear-gate measurements to Mun Sion and posted coordinates on Bong Mo''s examination-stand chalkboard. Left Jang Sehwa''s neutrality as the master plate''s title.","effects":[]},{"id":"k307-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: northeast outer-road surveyor. He left unsurveyed lines only as dotted lines and moved no great power''s search warrant into the map margins.","stress":"Fear. That a forged bypass would link to the medical train''s rear gate and the neutrality declaration would become empty wording.","relationship":"Relations. Handed rear-gate measurements to Mun Sion and posted coordinates on Bong Mo''s examination-stand chalkboard. Left Jang Sehwa''s neutrality as the master plate''s title.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Bokgam surveys the rear gate and posts coordinates. Map and seal gaps are documented, not successful prevention of bypass searches.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bcf5-ba74-cc9c","name":"Bok Clan of Myeoncheon","crest":"clan-crests/bcf5-ba74-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":40,"Force":-20,"Material":10,"Communal":15,"Principle":5,"Public":15,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":35,"Transformative":20},"desire":{"Longing":50,"Monopoly":-40,"Risk":35,"Display":-5,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Northeast Outer Road Measured Line · Search Warrant Record","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Northeast Outer Road Surveyor","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 40 | Force −20 | Materialism 10 | Community 15 | Principle 5 | Transparency 15 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation 20","Desires":"Longing 50 | Monopoly −40 | Risk 35 | Display −5 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: Fluid | Union: Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2078-02-12. Raised on the waiting-room watch. At the opening of 2126, he holds the post of Northeast Outer Road Surveyor; the post handover record notes that it opened with a substitute watch for an unexcused shift absence.\n- The dispatch, shift, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as Bokgam''s duty reference point for Northeast Outer Road survey lines and search warrant records. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, passage tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Northeast Outer Road Surveyor. Unsurveyed lines are left only as dotted lines, and search warrants from externally worded documents are not copied into the map margins.","Anecdote":"The trace of an Amsa officer skipping the Sinnae screening desk and entering through the base''s back gate was blank in both the sealed ledger and the map.","Relationships":"Hands the back-gate survey to Mun Sion, and posts the coordinates on Bongmo''s screening-desk base blackboard. Keeps Jang Sehwa''s neutrality as the master plate title.","Ambition":"Aims to bind the Northeast Outer Road and the back-gate bypass to the public master plate so that the Amsa Escort Corps'' arbitrary searches cannot skip the screening desk.","Fear":"That a forged bypass connects to the medical train''s back gate, turning neutral escort into an empty phrase.","Intervention":"Can restore the back-gate coordinates, or discard the forged bypass in front of the dispatch team."},"biography":"Bokgam, born 2078-02-12, heads feet first whenever he sees a closed dead-end track, and despises drawing bypasses from rumor alone. If a seal mark is even a day stale, he redraws the map.\n\n- Occupation: Northeast Outer Road survey lines and search warrant records\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Northeast Outer Road Surveyor\n**Life.** Born on 2078-02-12. Raised on the waiting-room watch. At the opening of 2126, he holds the post of Northeast Outer Road Surveyor; the post handover record notes that it opened with a substitute watch for an unexcused shift absence.\n- The dispatch, shift, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as Bokgam''s duty reference point for Northeast Outer Road survey lines and search warrant records. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, passage tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Northeast Outer Road Surveyor. Unsurveyed lines are left only as dotted lines, and search warrants from externally worded documents are not copied into the map margins.\n\n**Anecdote.** The trace of an Amsa officer skipping the Sinnae screening desk and entering through the base''s back gate was blank in both the sealed ledger and the map.\n\n**Relations.** Hands the back-gate survey to Mun Sion, and posts the coordinates on Bongmo''s screening-desk base blackboard. Keeps Jang Sehwa''s neutrality as the master plate title.\n\n**Ambition.** Aims to bind the Northeast Outer Road and the back-gate bypass to the public master plate so that the Amsa Escort Corps'' arbitrary searches cannot skip the screening desk.\n\n**Fear.** That a forged bypass connects to the medical train''s back gate, turning neutral escort into an empty phrase.\n\n**Intervention.** Can restore the back-gate coordinates, or discard the forged bypass in front of the dispatch team.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 40 | Force −20 | Materialism 10 | Community 15 | Principle 5 | Transparency 15 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation 20\n- Desires: Longing 50 | Monopoly −40 | Risk 35 | Display −5 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: Fluid | Union: Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bok Gam","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Hand the back-gate survey to Mun Sion, and"},{"from":"Bok Gam","type":"Contract","to":"Bong Mo","basis":"Posts the coordinates on Bongmo''s screening-desk base blackboard"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Bong Mo","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Gam","basis":"Writes Bokgam''s back-gate survey on the same line"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0308","name":"복감","title":"동북 외곽로 탐사원","position":"동북 외곽로 탐사원","characterId":"K307","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"동북 외곽로 실측 선·검색 영장 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-복감","detailRoute":"/people/person-0308","birthDate":"2078-02-12","birthday":"02-12","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k307-outer-route-surveying","name":"외곽로 실측","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k307-priority","name":"지도와 봉인 대조","description":"복감은 후문을 실측하고 좌표를 공개 칠판에 넘긴다. 지도와 봉인 공백은 확인하지만 검색 우회를 막은 성공은 없다.","behavior":"실측하지 않은 선은 점선으로만 남기고, 외부 문장의 검색 영장은 지도 여백에 옮기지 않는다.","stress":"위조 우회로가 의료열차 후문으로 연결되어 중립 호송이 빈 문구가 되는 것.","relationship":"문시온에게 후문 실측을 넘기고, 봉모의 심사대 거점 칠판에 좌표를 붙인다. 장세화의 중립을 원판 제목으로 남긴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k307-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 동북 외곽로 탐사원. 실측하지 않은 선은 점선으로만 남기고, 외부 문장의 검색 영장은 지도 여백에 옮기지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 위조 우회로가 의료열차 후문으로 연결되어 중립 호송이 빈 문구가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 문시온에게 후문 실측을 넘기고, 봉모의 심사대 거점 칠판에 좌표를 붙인다. 장세화의 중립을 원판 제목으로 남긴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"복감은 후문을 실측하고 좌표를 공개 칠판에 넘긴다. 지도와 봉인 공백은 확인하지만 검색 우회를 막은 성공은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bcf5-ba74-cc9c","name":"면천 복씨","crest":"clan-crests/bcf5-ba74-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":40,"무력":-20,"물질":10,"공동":15,"원칙":5,"공개":15,"자격":20,"분산":35,"변혁":20},"desire":{"갈망":50,"독점":-40,"위험":35,"과시":-5,"지속":35,"지향":"유동","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"동북 외곽로 실측 선·검색 영장 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"동북 외곽로 탐사원","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 40 | 무력 −20 | 물질 10 | 공동 15 | 원칙 5 | 공개 15 | 자격 20 | 분산 35 | 변혁 20","욕망":"갈망 50 | 독점 −40 | 위험 35 | 과시 −5 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2078-02-12에 태어났다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 동북 외곽로 탐사원 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 복감의 동북 외곽로 실측 선·검색 영장 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 동북 외곽로 탐사원. 실측하지 않은 선은 점선으로만 남기고, 외부 문장의 검색 영장은 지도 여백에 옮기지 않는다.","일화":"암사 장교가 신내 심사대를 건너뛰고 기지 후문으로 들어온 흔적이 봉인 장부와 지도에서 동시에 비었다.","관계":"문시온에게 후문 실측을 넘기고, 봉모의 심사대 거점 칠판에 좌표를 붙인다. 장세화의 중립을 원판 제목으로 남긴다.","야망":"동북 외곽로와 후문 우회로를 공개 원판에 묶어 암사 호위단의 임의 검색이 심사대를 건너뛰지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"위조 우회로가 의료열차 후문으로 연결되어 중립 호송이 빈 문구가 되는 것.","개입":"후문 좌표를 복원하거나, 위조 우회로를 배차조 앞에서 폐기할 수 있다."},"biography":"2078-02-12생인 복감은 닫힌 말단 선로를 보면 발부터 향하고, 소문만으로 우회로를 그리는 일을 경멸한다. 봉인 자국이 하루만 낡아도 지도를 다시 그린다.\n\n- 생업: 동북 외곽로 실측 선·검색 영장 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 동북 외곽로 탐사원\n**생애.** 2078-02-12에 태어났다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 동북 외곽로 탐사원 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 복감의 동북 외곽로 실측 선·검색 영장 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 동북 외곽로 탐사원. 실측하지 않은 선은 점선으로만 남기고, 외부 문장의 검색 영장은 지도 여백에 옮기지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 암사 장교가 신내 심사대를 건너뛰고 기지 후문으로 들어온 흔적이 봉인 장부와 지도에서 동시에 비었다.\n\n**관계.** 문시온에게 후문 실측을 넘기고, 봉모의 심사대 거점 칠판에 좌표를 붙인다. 장세화의 중립을 원판 제목으로 남긴다.\n\n**야망.** 동북 외곽로와 후문 우회로를 공개 원판에 묶어 암사 호위단의 임의 검색이 심사대를 건너뛰지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 위조 우회로가 의료열차 후문으로 연결되어 중립 호송이 빈 문구가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 후문 좌표를 복원하거나, 위조 우회로를 배차조 앞에서 폐기할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 40 | 무력 −20 | 물질 10 | 공동 15 | 원칙 5 | 공개 15 | 자격 20 | 분산 35 | 변혁 20\n- 욕망: 갈망 50 | 독점 −40 | 위험 35 | 과시 −5 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"복감","type":"계약","to":"문시온","basis":"문시온에게 후문 실측을 넘기고"},{"from":"복감","type":"계약","to":"봉모","basis":"봉모의 심사대 거점 칠판에 좌표를 붙인다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"봉모","type":"계약","to":"복감","basis":"복감의 후문 실측을 같은 줄에 적는다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0309', 'bd09-d558-c74c', '{"id":"person-0309","name":"Bong Mo","title":"Passage Inspection Recorder, Mun Sion''s Deputy","position":"Passage Inspection Recorder, Mun Sion''s Deputy","characterId":"K308","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Passage Identity Fragment · Cargo Seal Record","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-bongmo","detailRoute":"/people/person-0309","birthDate":"2074-05-29","birthday":"05-29","age":52,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k308-inspection-ledger-recording","name":"Inspection ledger recording","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k308-priority","name":"Ledger independence","description":"Bongmo records identity and seals with rear-gate coordinates on the same line, guarding against replacement of his ledger by external warrants.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: passage examination registrar, duty officer of Mun Sion. She recorded identity slips and freight seals doubly and refused great powers'' warrants without the joint stamp of Jang Sehwa and the medical crew.","stress":"Fear. That the examination ledger would be replaced by copies of a great power''s search warrant and neutrality would break from within.","relationship":"Relations. Moved the examination ledger under Mun Sion''s command and wrote Bok Gam''s rear-gate measurements on the same line. Left Gwak Taesan''s car-sealing attendance at the ledger''s tail.","effects":[]},{"id":"k308-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: passage examination registrar, duty officer of Mun Sion. She recorded identity slips and freight seals doubly and refused great powers'' warrants without the joint stamp of Jang Sehwa and the medical crew.","stress":"Fear. That the examination ledger would be replaced by copies of a great power''s search warrant and neutrality would break from within.","relationship":"Relations. Moved the examination ledger under Mun Sion''s command and wrote Bok Gam''s rear-gate measurements on the same line. Left Gwak Taesan''s car-sealing attendance at the ledger''s tail.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Bongmo records identity and seals with rear-gate coordinates on the same line, guarding against replacement of his ledger by external warrants.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bd09-d558-c74c","name":"Haeum Bong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bd09-d558-c74c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":30,"Force":-25,"Material":-10,"Communal":10,"Principle":30,"Public":30,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":45,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":-30,"Display":-40,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Passage Identity Fragment · Cargo Seal Record","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Passage Inspection Recorder, Mun Sion''s Deputy","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 30 | Force −25 | Materialism −10 | Community 10 | Principle 30 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 45 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Longing 5 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −30 | Display −40 | Persistence 30 | Orientation: Fluid | Union: Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2074-05-29. Grew up at the Seoul Station registry office. At the opening of 2126, Bongmo holds the duty post of Transit Inspection Recorder and Mun Sion''s Working-Level Deputy, and the record of taking over the post shows that it opened with the deletion of a single line from the dual ledger.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, transit inspection, stretcher handover and duty-key record desk is proposed as Bongmo''s duty reference point for transit identity shards and cargo seal records. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the Permanent Winter, and it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, armaments, transit tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Transit Inspection Recorder and Mun Sion''s Working-Level Deputy. Records identity shards and cargo seals twice over, and refuses outside warrants without the joint seal of Jang Sehwa and the Medical Team.","Anecdote":"When traces from the depot''s rear gate were left in the seal ledger, a line was found missing from the inspection ledger.","Relationships":"Moves the screening ledger under Mun Sion''s command and writes Bokgam''s back-gate survey on the same line. Leaves Gwak Taesan''s witnessing of the car seal at the end of the ledger.","Ambition":"Seeks to elevate the northeast outer road inspection into a clause of the neutral escort covenant, so as to cut the Amsa Escort Corps'' arbitrary searches out of the ledger.","Fear":"That the screening ledger is replaced by a copy of an externally worded search warrant, breaking neutrality from within.","Intervention":"Can restore the missing line, or pull out an entry document that used an inspection refusal as its pretext."},"biography":"Born 2074-05-29, Bongmo speaks little and tenaciously cross-checks evidence. Holds in contempt the practice of turning escort-fee receipts into passes.\n\n- Livelihood: Transit identity shard and cargo seal records\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Transit Inspection Recorder and Mun Sion''s Working-Level Deputy\n**Life.** Born 2074-05-29. Grew up at the Seoul Station registry office. At the opening of 2126, Bongmo holds the duty post of Transit Inspection Recorder and Mun Sion''s Working-Level Deputy, and the record of taking over the post shows that it opened with the deletion of a single line from the dual ledger.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, transit inspection, stretcher handover and duty-key record desk is proposed as Bongmo''s duty reference point for transit identity shards and cargo seal records. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the Permanent Winter, and it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, armaments, transit tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Transit Inspection Recorder and Mun Sion''s Working-Level Deputy. Records identity shards and cargo seals twice over, and refuses outside warrants without the joint seal of Jang Sehwa and the Medical Team.\n\n**Anecdote.** When traces from the depot''s rear gate were left in the seal ledger, a line was found missing from the inspection ledger.\n\n**Relations.** Under Mun Sion''s command, moves the inspection ledger and writes Bokgam''s rear-gate measurements on the same line. Leaves Gwak Taesan''s witnessing of the car seal at the end of the ledger.\n\n**Ambition.** Seeks to elevate the northeast outer road inspection into a clause of the neutral escort covenant, so as to cut the Amsa Escort Corps'' arbitrary searches out of the ledger.\n\n**Fear.** That the inspection ledger will be replaced by copies of search warrants bearing outside crests, breaking the neutrality from within.\n\n**Intervention.** Can restore the missing line, or pull out an entry document that used an inspection refusal as its pretext.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 30 | Force −25 | Materialism −10 | Community 10 | Principle 30 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 45 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Longing 5 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −30 | Display −40 | Persistence 30 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bong Mo","type":"Command","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Move the inspection ledger under Mun Sion''s command, and"},{"from":"Bong Mo","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Gam","basis":"Writes Bokgam''s back-gate survey on the same line"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Bok Gam","type":"Contract","to":"Bong Mo","basis":"Posts the coordinates on Bongmo''s screening-desk base blackboard"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0309","name":"봉모","title":"통행 심사 기록관, 문시온의 실무 담당자","position":"통행 심사 기록관, 문시온의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K308","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"통행 신분 조각·화물 봉인 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-봉모","detailRoute":"/people/person-0309","birthDate":"2074-05-29","birthday":"05-29","age":52,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k308-inspection-ledger-recording","name":"심사 원장 기록","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k308-priority","name":"원장의 독립","description":"봉모는 신분·봉인을 기록하고 후문 좌표를 같은 줄에 적는다. 외부 영장으로 원장이 대체될 위험을 경계한다.","behavior":"신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 이중으로 기록하고, 외부 영장은 장세화와 의료조 공동 날인 없이 거부한다.","stress":"심사 원장이 외부 문장의 검색 영장 사본으로 대체되어 중립이 내부에서 깨지는 것.","relationship":"문시온의 지휘로 심사 원장을 옮기고, 복감의 후문 실측을 같은 줄에 적는다. 곽태산의 칸 봉인 입회를 원장 말미에 남긴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k308-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 통행 심사 기록관, 문시온의 실무 담당자. 신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 이중으로 기록하고, 외부 영장은 장세화와 의료조 공동 날인 없이 거부한다.","stress":"공포. 심사 원장이 외부 문장의 검색 영장 사본으로 대체되어 중립이 내부에서 깨지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 문시온의 지휘로 심사 원장을 옮기고, 복감의 후문 실측을 같은 줄에 적는다. 곽태산의 칸 봉인 입회를 원장 말미에 남긴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"봉모는 신분·봉인을 기록하고 후문 좌표를 같은 줄에 적는다. 외부 영장으로 원장이 대체될 위험을 경계한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bd09-d558-c74c","name":"하음 봉씨","crest":"clan-crests/bd09-d558-c74c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":30,"무력":-25,"물질":-10,"공동":10,"원칙":30,"공개":30,"자격":15,"분산":45,"변혁":10},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":-30,"위험":-30,"과시":-40,"지속":30,"지향":"유동","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"통행 신분 조각·화물 봉인 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"통행 심사 기록관, 문시온의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 30 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −10 | 공동 10 | 원칙 30 | 공개 30 | 자격 15 | 분산 45 | 변혁 10","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −40 | 지속 30 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2074-05-29에 태어났다. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 통행 심사 기록관, 문시온의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 봉모의 통행 신분 조각·화물 봉인 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 통행 심사 기록관, 문시온의 실무 담당자. 신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 이중으로 기록하고, 외부 영장은 장세화와 의료조 공동 날인 없이 거부한다.","일화":"기지 후문 흔적이 봉인 장부에 남자 심사 원장의 한 줄이 빠져 있었다.","관계":"문시온의 지휘로 심사 원장을 옮기고, 복감의 후문 실측을 같은 줄에 적는다. 곽태산의 칸 봉인 입회를 원장 말미에 남긴다.","야망":"동북 외곽로 심사를 중립 호송 약정 조항으로 격상시켜 암사 호위단의 임의 검색을 원장에서 끊으려 한다.","공포":"심사 원장이 외부 문장의 검색 영장 사본으로 대체되어 중립이 내부에서 깨지는 것.","개입":"빠진 줄을 복원하거나, 심사 거부를 구실로 한 진입 문서를 빼낼 수 있다."},"biography":"2074-05-29생인 봉모는 말수가 적고 증빙을 집요하게 대조한다. 호송료 영수증을 통행증으로 바꾸는 관행을 경멸한다.\n\n- 생업: 통행 신분 조각·화물 봉인 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 통행 심사 기록관, 문시온의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2074-05-29에 태어났다. 서울역 등기소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 통행 심사 기록관, 문시온의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 봉모의 통행 신분 조각·화물 봉인 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 통행 심사 기록관, 문시온의 실무 담당자. 신분 조각과 화물 봉인을 이중으로 기록하고, 외부 영장은 장세화와 의료조 공동 날인 없이 거부한다.\n\n**일화.** 기지 후문 흔적이 봉인 장부에 남자 심사 원장의 한 줄이 빠져 있었다.\n\n**관계.** 문시온의 지휘로 심사 원장을 옮기고, 복감의 후문 실측을 같은 줄에 적는다. 곽태산의 칸 봉인 입회를 원장 말미에 남긴다.\n\n**야망.** 동북 외곽로 심사를 중립 호송 약정 조항으로 격상시켜 암사 호위단의 임의 검색을 원장에서 끊으려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 심사 원장이 외부 문장의 검색 영장 사본으로 대체되어 중립이 내부에서 깨지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 빠진 줄을 복원하거나, 심사 거부를 구실로 한 진입 문서를 빼낼 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 30 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −10 | 공동 10 | 원칙 30 | 공개 30 | 자격 15 | 분산 45 | 변혁 10\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −40 | 지속 30 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"봉모","type":"지휘","to":"문시온","basis":"문시온의 지휘로 심사 원장을 옮기고"},{"from":"봉모","type":"계약","to":"복감","basis":"복감의 후문 실측을 같은 줄에 적는다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"복감","type":"계약","to":"봉모","basis":"봉모의 심사대 거점 칠판에 좌표를 붙인다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0310', 'c6a9-d64d-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0310","name":"Yong Bong","title":"Mangu Transfer Platform Hub Chief","position":"Mangu Transfer Platform Hub Chief","characterId":"K309","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Platform Queue · Severity Chart Posting","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#character-yongbong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0310","birthDate":"2096-10-09","birthday":"10-09","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k309-platform-queue-allocation","name":"Platform queue allocation","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k309-priority","name":"Distinguishes people queues","description":"Yongbong separates stretcher and unloading order at the platform. Weapon-box rumors are not confirmed loading.","behavior":"Office. Rank: clerk. Title: Mangu transfer platform outpost chief. He pasted the platform queue and the severity table on one chalkboard and stood no armed waiting line without the examiner''s attendance.","stress":"Fear. That the platform piled with the southward column of Bukhansan Bogukmun would be mistaken for munitions unloading.","relationship":"Relations. Received Jeon Miri''s stretcher order at the platform and split the queue with Bok Bong''s unloading order. Pasted Jang Sehwa''s neutrality declaration on the platform wall.","effects":[]},{"id":"k309-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: clerk. Title: Mangu transfer platform outpost chief. He pasted the platform queue and the severity table on one chalkboard and stood no armed waiting line without the examiner''s attendance.","stress":"Fear. That the platform piled with the southward column of Bukhansan Bogukmun would be mistaken for munitions unloading.","relationship":"Relations. Received Jeon Miri''s stretcher order at the platform and split the queue with Bok Bong''s unloading order. Pasted Jang Sehwa''s neutrality declaration on the platform wall.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Yongbong separates stretcher and unloading order at the platform. Weapon-box rumors are not confirmed loading.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c6a9-d64d-cc9c","name":"Yong Clan of Hongcheon","crest":"clan-crests/c6a9-d64d-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":35,"Force":-25,"Material":-5,"Communal":25,"Principle":10,"Public":20,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":40,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":10,"Display":-15,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Platform Queue · Severity Chart Posting","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Mangu Transfer Platform Hub Chief","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 35 | Force −25 | Materialism −5 | Community 25 | Principle 10 | Transparency 20 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 40 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Longing 10 | Monopoly −10 | Risk 10 | Display −15 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Plural"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2096-10-09. Grew up on the Sinnae transfer duty roster. At the opening of 2126, Yongbong holds the duty post of Mangu Transfer Platform Hub Chief, and the record of taking over the post shows that it opened with the stopping of an unticketed departing train.\n- The Sangbong 1-dong Mangu transfer queue, patient, cargo classification, weight, invoice, market price and public testimony record desk is proposed as Yongbong''s duty reference point for posting platform queues and triage tags. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the Permanent Winter, and it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, armaments, transit tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Mangu Transfer Platform Hub Chief. Posts the platform queues and triage tags on the same blackboard, and does not set up an armed queue without an inspector present.","Anecdote":"When the southbound column from Bukhansan Bogukmun piled up on the Sinnae platform, rumors spread that even the queue on the Mangu side held crates full of weapons.","Relationships":"Receives Jeon Miri''s stretcher order on the platform and separates the queue from Bokbong''s unloading order. Posts Jang Sehwa''s neutral escort directive on the platform wall.","Ambition":"Seeks to keep the Mangu platform as the face of neutral transfer, so that no escort-fee counter outside the route license can be opened on the platform.","Fear":"That the platform, crowded with the southbound column from Bukhansan Bogukmun, will be mistaken for a military unloading site.","Intervention":"Can have platform cargo inspected publicly, or separate the patient queue from the military supply queue."},"biography":"Born 2096-10-09, Yongbong remembers delays on the minor lines as an insult, and sends merchants who call the platform a loading yard down from it without a microphone. Can tell the patient queue and the cargo queue apart at a glance.\n\n- Livelihood: Posting platform queues and triage tags\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Mangu Transfer Platform Hub Chief\n**Life.** Born 2096-10-09. Grew up on the Sinnae transfer duty roster. At the opening of 2126, Yongbong holds the duty post of Mangu Transfer Platform Hub Chief, and the record of taking over the post shows that it opened with the stopping of an unticketed departing train.\n- The Sangbong 1-dong Mangu transfer queue, patient, cargo classification, weight, invoice, market price and public testimony record desk is proposed as Yongbong''s duty reference point for posting platform queues and triage tags. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the Permanent Winter, and it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, armaments, transit tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Mangu Transfer Platform Hub Chief. Posts the platform queues and triage tags on the same blackboard, and does not set up an armed queue without an inspector present.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the southbound column from Bukhansan Bogukmun piled up on the Sinnae platform, rumors spread that even the queue on the Mangu side held crates full of weapons.\n\n**Relations.** Receives Jeon Miri''s stretcher order on the platform and separates the queue from Bokbong''s unloading order. Posts Jang Sehwa''s neutral escort directive on the platform wall.\n\n**Ambition.** Seeks to keep the Mangu platform as the face of neutral transfer, so that no escort-fee counter outside the route license can be opened on the platform.\n\n**Fear.** That the platform, crowded with the southbound column from Bukhansan Bogukmun, will be mistaken for a military unloading site.\n\n**Intervention.** Can have platform cargo inspected publicly, or separate the patient queue from the military supply queue.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 35 | Force −25 | Materialism −5 | Community 25 | Principle 10 | Transparency 20 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 40 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Longing 10 | Monopoly −10 | Risk 10 | Display −15 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Plural\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yong Bong","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"receiving Jeon Miri''s stretcher order on the platform, and"},{"from":"Yong Bong","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Bong","basis":"Shares the unloading order and the queue with Bokbong"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0310","name":"용봉","title":"망우 환승 승강장 거점장","position":"망우 환승 승강장 거점장","characterId":"K309","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"승강장 대기열·중증도 표 게시","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-용봉","detailRoute":"/people/person-0310","birthDate":"2096-10-09","birthday":"10-09","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k309-platform-queue-allocation","name":"승강장 줄 배치","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k309-priority","name":"사람 칸의 구분","description":"용봉은 들것과 하역 순서를 승강장에서 나눈다. 무기 상자 소문은 실제 적재 확인으로 바꾸지 않는다.","behavior":"승강장 줄과 중증도 표를 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 무장 대기열은 심사관 입회 없이 세우지 않는다.","stress":"북한산보국문 남하 행렬이 쌓인 승강장이 군수 하역으로 오인되는 것.","relationship":"전미리의 들것 순서를 승강장에서 받고, 복봉의 하역 순서와 줄을 나눈다. 장세화의 중립 호송 지시를 승강장 벽에 붙인다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k309-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 서기. 직함은 망우 환승 승강장 거점장. 승강장 줄과 중증도 표를 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 무장 대기열은 심사관 입회 없이 세우지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 북한산보국문 남하 행렬이 쌓인 승강장이 군수 하역으로 오인되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 전미리의 들것 순서를 승강장에서 받고, 복봉의 하역 순서와 줄을 나눈다. 장세화의 중립 호송 지시를 승강장 벽에 붙인다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"용봉은 들것과 하역 순서를 승강장에서 나눈다. 무기 상자 소문은 실제 적재 확인으로 바꾸지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c6a9-d64d-cc9c","name":"홍천 용씨","crest":"clan-crests/c6a9-d64d-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":35,"무력":-25,"물질":-5,"공동":25,"원칙":10,"공개":20,"자격":25,"분산":40,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":-10,"위험":10,"과시":-15,"지속":-10,"지향":"유동","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"승강장 대기열·중증도 표 게시","소속":"정부","품계":"서기","직함":"망우 환승 승강장 거점장","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 35 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −5 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 20 | 자격 25 | 분산 40 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 −10 | 위험 10 | 과시 −15 | 지속 −10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2096-10-09에 태어났다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 망우 환승 승강장 거점장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 용봉의 승강장 대기열·중증도 표 게시 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 서기. 직함은 망우 환승 승강장 거점장. 승강장 줄과 중증도 표를 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 무장 대기열은 심사관 입회 없이 세우지 않는다.","일화":"북한산보국문 남하 행렬이 신내 승강장에 쌓이자 망우 쪽 줄까지 무기가 든 상자처럼 소문이 퍼졌다.","관계":"전미리의 들것 순서를 승강장에서 받고, 복봉의 하역 순서와 줄을 나눈다. 장세화의 중립 호송 지시를 승강장 벽에 붙인다.","야망":"망우 승강장을 중립 환승의 얼굴로 남겨 노선 면허 밖의 호송료 창구를 승강장에 열지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"북한산보국문 남하 행렬이 쌓인 승강장이 군수 하역으로 오인되는 것.","개입":"승강장 화물을 공개 검수하거나, 환자 줄을 군수 대기열과 분리할 수 있다."},"biography":"2096-10-09생인 용봉은 말단 노선의 지연을 모욕처럼 기억하고, 승강장을 하역장으로 부르는 상인을 마이크 없이 내려보낸다. 환자 줄과 화물 줄을 한눈에 나눈다.\n\n- 생업: 승강장 대기열·중증도 표 게시\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 서기\n- 직함: 망우 환승 승강장 거점장\n**생애.** 2096-10-09에 태어났다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 망우 환승 승강장 거점장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 용봉의 승강장 대기열·중증도 표 게시 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 서기. 직함은 망우 환승 승강장 거점장. 승강장 줄과 중증도 표를 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 무장 대기열은 심사관 입회 없이 세우지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 북한산보국문 남하 행렬이 신내 승강장에 쌓이자 망우 쪽 줄까지 무기가 든 상자처럼 소문이 퍼졌다.\n\n**관계.** 전미리의 들것 순서를 승강장에서 받고, 복봉의 하역 순서와 줄을 나눈다. 장세화의 중립 호송 지시를 승강장 벽에 붙인다.\n\n**야망.** 망우 승강장을 중립 환승의 얼굴로 남겨 노선 면허 밖의 호송료 창구를 승강장에 열지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 북한산보국문 남하 행렬이 쌓인 승강장이 군수 하역으로 오인되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 승강장 화물을 공개 검수하거나, 환자 줄을 군수 대기열과 분리할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 35 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −5 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 20 | 자격 25 | 분산 40 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 −10 | 위험 10 | 과시 −15 | 지속 −10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"용봉","type":"계약","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리의 들것 순서를 승강장에서 받고"},{"from":"용봉","type":"계약","to":"복봉","basis":"복봉의 하역 순서와 줄을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0311', 'ad6d-b2f4-c591', '{"id":"person-0311","name":"Guk So","title":"Sinnae Depot Duty Chief","position":"Sinnae Depot Duty Chief","characterId":"K310","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Depot Duty Roster · Dispatch Time Posting","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-gukso","detailRoute":"/people/person-0311","birthDate":"2064-06-18","birthday":"06-18","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":5,"effective":5}},"skills":[{"id":"k310-release-duty-recording","name":"Release duty recording","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k310-priority","name":"Guards external entry","description":"Gukso publishes duty and release times and checks rear-gate defense shifts. A missing roster line does not prove collusion.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: Sinnae rolling-stock depot duty chief. He pasted the duty roster and release hours on one chalkboard and blocked armed outside approach without Mun Sion''s escort.","stress":"Fear. That base duty would become the footstool of arms loading and Jang Sehwa''s neutrality would break from within.","relationship":"Relations. Split the repair shop and duty with So Dugam and put An Dohan''s dispatch sheet at the top of the chalkboard. Confirmed Gwak Taesan''s defense rotations at the base rear gate.","effects":[]},{"id":"k310-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: Sinnae rolling-stock depot duty chief. He pasted the duty roster and release hours on one chalkboard and blocked armed outside approach without Mun Sion''s escort.","stress":"Fear. That base duty would become the footstool of arms loading and Jang Sehwa''s neutrality would break from within.","relationship":"Relations. Split the repair shop and duty with So Dugam and put An Dohan''s dispatch sheet at the top of the chalkboard. Confirmed Gwak Taesan''s defense rotations at the base rear gate.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Gukso publishes duty and release times and checks rear-gate defense shifts. A missing roster line does not prove collusion.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ad6d-b2f4-c591","name":"Damyang Guk Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ad6d-b2f4-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":40,"Force":-20,"Material":0,"Communal":25,"Principle":10,"Public":15,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":35,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":0,"Risk":40,"Display":5,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Depot Duty Roster · Dispatch Time Posting","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Sinnae Depot Duty Chief","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 40 | Force −20 | Materialism 0 | Community 25 | Principle 10 | Transparency 15 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 0 | Exclusivity 0 | Risk 40 | Display 5 | Persistence 0 | Orientation same-sex | Bonding non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2064-06-18. Raised at Sinjeong Rail Depot. At the 2126 opening, holds the duty post of Sinnae Depot Duty Chief, and the post-handover record remains, opened by a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong record desk for dispatch, shift changes, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handovers and duty keys is proposed as the duty reference point for Guk So''s depot duty roster and departure-time postings. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records; it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or occupancy rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Sinnae Depot Duty Chief. Posts duty names and departure times on the same blackboard, and bars armed outsiders from approaching without Mun Si-on''s accompaniment.","Anecdote":"In the medical train''s weapons locker, ammunition stamped with the Amsa crest was found, and the depot duty roster was missing one line.","Relationships":"Separates duty from So Dugam''s maintenance bay, and places An Dohan''s dispatch sheet at the very top of the blackboard. Confirms Gwak Taesan''s guard rotation at the depot''s rear gate.","Ambition":"Wants to keep Sinnae Depot as Sinnae Transport''s own base, ending the practice of outside guards standing on the holding tracks.","Fear":"That depot duty will become a foothold for loading weapons, breaking Jang Sehwa''s neutrality from within.","Intervention":"Can find the missing duty officer, or switch depot departures to a double-key system."},"biography":"Guk So, born 2064-06-18, treats holding-track duty like home and calls people who break shift changes by the time rather than by name. Locks the departure blackboard before the seasonal sign-off even arrives.\n\n- Livelihood: Posting depot duty rosters and departure times\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Sinnae Depot Duty Chief\n**Life.** Born on 2064-06-18. Raised at Sinjeong Rail Depot. At the 2126 opening, holds the duty post of Sinnae Depot Duty Chief, and the post-handover record remains, opened by a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong record desk for dispatch, shift changes, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handovers and duty keys is proposed as the duty reference point for Guk So''s depot duty roster and departure-time postings. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records; it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or occupancy rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Sinnae Depot Duty Chief. Posts duty names and departure times on the same blackboard, and bars armed outsiders from approaching without Mun Si-on''s accompaniment.\n\n**Anecdote.** In the medical train''s weapons locker, ammunition stamped with the Amsa crest was found, and the depot duty roster was missing one line.\n\n**Relationships.** Shares duty with So Du-gam''s maintenance bay, and places An Do-han''s dispatch chart at the very top of the blackboard. Checks Gwak Tae-san''s defensive shift changes at the depot''s rear gate.\n\n**Ambition.** Wants to keep Sinnae Depot as Sinnae Transport''s own base, ending the practice of outside guards standing on the holding tracks.\n\n**Fear.** That depot duty becomes a stepping stone for loading weapons, breaking Jang Se-hwa''s neutrality from the inside.\n\n**Intervention.** Can find the missing duty officer, or switch depot departures to a double-key system.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 40 | Force −20 | Materialism 0 | Community 25 | Principle 10 | Transparency 15 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Exclusivity 0 | Risk 40 | Display 5 | Persistence 0 | Orientation same-sex | Bonding non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Guk So","type":"Contract","to":"An Dohan","basis":"placing An Dohan''s dispatch schedule at the very top of the blackboard."},{"from":"Guk So","type":"Contract","to":"So Dugam","basis":"Shares duty with Sodugam''s maintenance bay, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"So Dugam","type":"Contract","to":"Guk So","basis":"Shares tools with Guk So''s depot duty"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0311","name":"국소","title":"신내 차량기지 당직장","position":"신내 차량기지 당직장","characterId":"K310","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"차량기지 당직 명부·출고 시각 게시","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-국소","detailRoute":"/people/person-0311","birthDate":"2064-06-18","birthday":"06-18","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":5,"effective":5}},"skills":[{"id":"k310-release-duty-recording","name":"출고 당직 기록","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k310-priority","name":"외부 진입 경계","description":"국소는 당직과 출고 시각을 공개하고 후문 수비 교대를 확인한다. 빠진 명단 한 줄에서 공모를 확정하지 않는다.","behavior":"당직 명과 출고 시각을 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 외부 무장 접근은 문시온의 동행 없이 막는다.","stress":"기지 당직이 무기 적재의 발판이 되어 장세화의 중립이 내부에서 깨지는 것.","relationship":"소두감의 정비 창과 당직을 나누고, 안도한의 배차표를 칠판 맨 위에 둔다. 곽태산의 수비 교대를 기지 후문에서 확인한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k310-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 신내 차량기지 당직장. 당직 명과 출고 시각을 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 외부 무장 접근은 문시온의 동행 없이 막는다.","stress":"공포. 기지 당직이 무기 적재의 발판이 되어 장세화의 중립이 내부에서 깨지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 소두감의 정비 창과 당직을 나누고, 안도한의 배차표를 칠판 맨 위에 둔다. 곽태산의 수비 교대를 기지 후문에서 확인한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"국소는 당직과 출고 시각을 공개하고 후문 수비 교대를 확인한다. 빠진 명단 한 줄에서 공모를 확정하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ad6d-b2f4-c591","name":"담양 국씨","crest":"clan-crests/ad6d-b2f4-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":40,"무력":-20,"물질":0,"공동":25,"원칙":10,"공개":15,"자격":15,"분산":35,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":0,"위험":40,"과시":5,"지속":0,"지향":"동성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"차량기지 당직 명부·출고 시각 게시","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"신내 차량기지 당직장","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 40 | 무력 −20 | 물질 0 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 15 | 자격 15 | 분산 35 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 0 | 위험 40 | 과시 5 | 지속 0 | 지향 동성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2064-06-18에 태어났다. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 신내 차량기지 당직장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 국소의 차량기지 당직 명부·출고 시각 게시 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 신내 차량기지 당직장. 당직 명과 출고 시각을 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 외부 무장 접근은 문시온의 동행 없이 막는다.","일화":"의료열차 무기함에서 암사 문장이 찍힌 탄약이 발견되고 기지 당직 명단이 한 줄 빠져 있었다.","관계":"소두감의 정비 창과 당직을 나누고, 안도한의 배차표를 칠판 맨 위에 둔다. 곽태산의 수비 교대를 기지 후문에서 확인한다.","야망":"신내 기지를 신내운수 고유 거점으로 남겨 외부 호위병이 유치선에 서는 관행을 끊으려 한다.","공포":"기지 당직이 무기 적재의 발판이 되어 장세화의 중립이 내부에서 깨지는 것.","개입":"빠진 당직자를 찾거나, 기지 출고를 이중 열쇠로 바꿀 수 있다."},"biography":"2064-06-18생인 국소는 유치선 당직을 집처럼 여기고, 교대를 어기는 사람을 이름 대신 시각으로 부른다. 계절 결재가 오기 전에 이미 출고 칠판을 잠근다.\n\n- 생업: 차량기지 당직 명부·출고 시각 게시\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 신내 차량기지 당직장\n**생애.** 2064-06-18에 태어났다. 신정 차량기지에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 신내 차량기지 당직장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 국소의 차량기지 당직 명부·출고 시각 게시 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 신내 차량기지 당직장. 당직 명과 출고 시각을 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 외부 무장 접근은 문시온의 동행 없이 막는다.\n\n**일화.** 의료열차 무기함에서 암사 문장이 찍힌 탄약이 발견되고 기지 당직 명단이 한 줄 빠져 있었다.\n\n**관계.** 소두감의 정비 창과 당직을 나누고, 안도한의 배차표를 칠판 맨 위에 둔다. 곽태산의 수비 교대를 기지 후문에서 확인한다.\n\n**야망.** 신내 기지를 신내운수 고유 거점으로 남겨 외부 호위병이 유치선에 서는 관행을 끊으려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 기지 당직이 무기 적재의 발판이 되어 장세화의 중립이 내부에서 깨지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 빠진 당직자를 찾거나, 기지 출고를 이중 열쇠로 바꿀 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 40 | 무력 −20 | 물질 0 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 15 | 자격 15 | 분산 35 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 0 | 위험 40 | 과시 5 | 지속 0 | 지향 동성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"국소","type":"계약","to":"안도한","basis":"안도한의 배차표를 칠판 맨 위에 둔다"},{"from":"국소","type":"계약","to":"소두감","basis":"소두감의 정비 창과 당직을 나누고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"소두감","type":"계약","to":"국소","basis":"국소의 기지 당직과 공구를 나눈다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0312', 'bcf5-ba74-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0312","name":"Bok Yong","title":"Northeast Neutral Market Hub Chief","position":"Northeast Neutral Market Hub Chief","characterId":"K311","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Market price, inventory posting, and shipment release confirmation","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#people-Bok-Yong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0312","birthDate":"2090-10-28","birthday":"10-28","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k311-market-inventory-posting","name":"Market inventory posting","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k311-priority","name":"Emergency supplies first","description":"Bogyong posts prices and inventory and prioritizes medical supplies. Cruelty toward concealing merchants remains alongside public standards.","behavior":"Office. Rank: clerk. Title: northeast neutral market outpost chief. He wrote the prices and inventory on the wall and blocked the release of any order stamped with a weapons clause until the medical crew posted it.","stress":"Fear. That the market inventory would leave as munitions-only and the medical train''s supply would stop.","relationship":"Relations. Matched the prices with Bok Bong''s relay invoices and put emergency supplies first for Guk Yong''s duty infirmary. Consulted O Haerin''s price broadcasts only at market hours.","effects":[]},{"id":"k311-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: clerk. Title: northeast neutral market outpost chief. He wrote the prices and inventory on the wall and blocked the release of any order stamped with a weapons clause until the medical crew posted it.","stress":"Fear. That the market inventory would leave as munitions-only and the medical train''s supply would stop.","relationship":"Relations. Matched the prices with Bok Bong''s relay invoices and put emergency supplies first for Guk Yong''s duty infirmary. Consulted O Haerin''s price broadcasts only at market hours.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Bogyong posts prices and inventory and prioritizes medical supplies. Cruelty toward concealing merchants remains alongside public standards.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11260-S12","name":{"ko":"Jungnang-gu Duchy Directly Administered Land"},"holderPersonId":"K311","directLiegePersonId":"K144","stateId":"S12","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1126052000","name":"Myeonmok 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1126054000","name":"Myeonmok 4-dong"},{"id":"region:1126055000","name":"Myeonmok 5-dong"},{"id":"region:1126056500","name":"Myeonmok-bon-dong"},{"id":"region:1126057000","name":"Myeonmok 7-dong"},{"id":"region:1126057500","name":"Myeonmok 3·8-dong"},{"id":"region:1126058000","name":"Sangbong 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1126059000","name":"Sangbong 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1126060000","name":"Junghwa 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1126061000","name":"Junghwa 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1126062000","name":"Muk 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1126063000","name":"Muk 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1126065500","name":"Mangu-bon-dong"},{"id":"region:1126066000","name":"Mangu 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1126068000","name":"Sinnae 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1126069000","name":"Sinnae 2-dong"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11260-S12","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11260-S12","name":"Jungnang-gu Duchy","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K311","basis":"Opening administrative scale group gu:11260(duchy) allocation · decisive candidate selection","stateId":"S12","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1126052000","region:1126054000","region:1126055000","region:1126056500","region:1126057000","region:1126057500","region:1126058000","region:1126059000","region:1126060000","region:1126061000","region:1126062000","region:1126063000","region:1126065500","region:1126066000","region:1126068000","region:1126069000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s06","name":"The Government Kingdom","holderPersonId":"K144"}}],"clan":{"id":"bcf5-ba74-cc9c","name":"Bok Clan of Myeoncheon","crest":"clan-crests/bcf5-ba74-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":45,"Force":-25,"Material":-5,"Communal":30,"Principle":15,"Public":15,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":40,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":35,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":-15,"Display":-20,"Sustained":-5,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Market price, inventory posting, and shipment release confirmation","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Northeast Neutral Market Hub Chief","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 45 | Force −25 | Materialism −5 | Community 30 | Principle 15 | Transparency 15 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 40 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 35 | Exclusivity 10 | Risk −15 | Display −20 | Persistence −5 | Orientation fluid | Bonding multi-partner"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2090-10-28. Raised at Noryangjin Wharf. At the 2126 opening, holds the post of Northeast Neutral Market Base Chief, and the post-handover record remains, opened by the public re-inspection of the scales.\n- The Sangbong 1-dong record desk for Mangu transfer queues, patient and cargo classification, weights, waybills, prices and public testimony is proposed as the duty reference point for Bok Yong''s market price posting, stock posting and shipment checking. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records; it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or occupancy rights.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Northeast Neutral Market Base Chief. Writes prices and stock on the wall, and blocks shipment of order slips stamped with a weapons crest until the medical team posts them.","Anecdote":"Right after the weapons were found, a single order slip bearing a military supply crest was wedged in the market scale.","Relationships":"Matches Bok Bong''s relay waybills with market prices, and supplies emergency goods first to Guk Yong''s duty infirmary. Consults Oh Hae-rin''s price broadcasts only during market hours.","Ambition":"Wants to keep the Neutral Market as a public-price base for transfer relays, so that escort fees from outside route licenses cannot buy up the market''s bays.","Fear":"That market stock is diverted to military use only and the medical train''s supplies stop.","Intervention":"Can make the order slip public, or fix the emergency-supplies-first bay in the market ledger."},"biography":"Bok Yong, born 2090-10-28, presses merchants who hide prices hardest, and drives out of the market anyone who talks of putting patient-transport bays up for auction. Regards the public scale as credit.\n\n- Livelihood: Market price posting, stock posting, shipment checking\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Northeast Neutral Market Base Chief\n**Life.** Born on 2090-10-28. Raised at Noryangjin Wharf. At the 2126 opening, holds the post of Northeast Neutral Market Base Chief, and the post-handover record remains, opened by the public re-inspection of the scales.\n- The Sangbong 1-dong record desk for Mangu transfer queues, patient and cargo classification, weights, waybills, prices and public testimony is proposed as the duty reference point for Bok Yong''s market price posting, stock posting and shipment checking. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records; it does not fix running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or occupancy rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Northeast Neutral Market Base Chief. Writes prices and stock on the wall, and blocks shipment of order slips stamped with a weapons crest until the medical team posts them.\n\n**Anecdote.** Right after the weapons were found, a single order slip bearing a military supply crest was wedged in the market scale.\n\n**Relationships.** Matches Bok Bong''s relay waybills with market prices, and supplies emergency goods first to Guk Yong''s duty infirmary. Consults Oh Hae-rin''s price broadcasts only during market hours.\n\n**Ambition.** Wants to keep the Neutral Market as a public-price base for transfer relays, so that escort fees from outside route licenses cannot buy up the market''s bays.\n\n**Fear.** That market stock is diverted to military use only and the medical train''s supplies stop.\n\n**Intervention.** Can make the order slip public, or fix the emergency-supplies-first bay in the market ledger.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 45 | Force −25 | Materialism −5 | Community 30 | Principle 15 | Transparency 15 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 40 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 35 | Exclusivity 10 | Risk −15 | Display −20 | Persistence −5 | Orientation fluid | Bonding multi-partner\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bok Yong","type":"Contract","to":"Oh Hae-rin","basis":"Refer to Oh Haerin''s market price broadcast during market time only"},{"from":"Bok Yong","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Bong","basis":"Matches Bokbong''s relay invoices to market prices, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Bok Bong","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Yong","basis":"Copies Bok Yong''s neutral-market prices onto the invoices"},{"from":"Geun Sori","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Yong","basis":"Matches Bok Yong''s neutral market prices with the failed-bid bell, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0312","name":"복용","title":"북동부 중립시장 거점장","position":"북동부 중립시장 거점장","characterId":"K311","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"시장 시세·재고 게시·출고 확인","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-복용","detailRoute":"/people/person-0312","birthDate":"2090-10-28","birthday":"10-28","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k311-market-inventory-posting","name":"시장 재고 게시","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k311-priority","name":"응급 물자 우선","description":"복용은 시세와 재고를 공개하고 의무실 물자를 우선 댄다. 숨기는 상인에 대한 잔인함도 공공 기준과 함께 남는다.","behavior":"시세와 재고를 벽에 적고, 무기 문장이 찍힌 주문서는 의료조 게시 전까지 출고를 막는다.","stress":"시장 재고가 군수 전용으로 빠져 의료열차 보급이 멈추는 것.","relationship":"복봉의 중계 송장과 시세를 맞추고, 국용의 당직 의무실에 응급 물자를 우선 댄다. 오해린의 시세 방송을 시장 시간에만 참고한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k311-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 서기. 직함은 북동부 중립시장 거점장. 시세와 재고를 벽에 적고, 무기 문장이 찍힌 주문서는 의료조 게시 전까지 출고를 막는다.","stress":"공포. 시장 재고가 군수 전용으로 빠져 의료열차 보급이 멈추는 것.","relationship":"관계. 복봉의 중계 송장과 시세를 맞추고, 국용의 당직 의무실에 응급 물자를 우선 댄다. 오해린의 시세 방송을 시장 시간에만 참고한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"복용은 시세와 재고를 공개하고 의무실 물자를 우선 댄다. 숨기는 상인에 대한 잔인함도 공공 기준과 함께 남는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11260-S12","name":{"ko":"중랑구 공작령 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K311","directLiegePersonId":"K144","stateId":"S12","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1126052000","name":"면목2동"},{"id":"region:1126054000","name":"면목4동"},{"id":"region:1126055000","name":"면목5동"},{"id":"region:1126056500","name":"면목본동"},{"id":"region:1126057000","name":"면목7동"},{"id":"region:1126057500","name":"면목3·8동"},{"id":"region:1126058000","name":"상봉1동"},{"id":"region:1126059000","name":"상봉2동"},{"id":"region:1126060000","name":"중화1동"},{"id":"region:1126061000","name":"중화2동"},{"id":"region:1126062000","name":"묵1동"},{"id":"region:1126063000","name":"묵2동"},{"id":"region:1126065500","name":"망우본동"},{"id":"region:1126066000","name":"망우3동"},{"id":"region:1126068000","name":"신내1동"},{"id":"region:1126069000","name":"신내2동"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11260-S12","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11260-S12","name":"중랑구 공작령","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K311","basis":"개막 행정 규모 그룹 gu:11260(duchy) 배분 · 결정적 후보 선정","stateId":"S12","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1126052000","region:1126054000","region:1126055000","region:1126056500","region:1126057000","region:1126057500","region:1126058000","region:1126059000","region:1126060000","region:1126061000","region:1126062000","region:1126063000","region:1126065500","region:1126066000","region:1126068000","region:1126069000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s06","name":"정부 왕국","holderPersonId":"K144"}}],"clan":{"id":"bcf5-ba74-cc9c","name":"면천 복씨","crest":"clan-crests/bcf5-ba74-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":45,"무력":-25,"물질":-5,"공동":30,"원칙":15,"공개":15,"자격":25,"분산":40,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":35,"독점":10,"위험":-15,"과시":-20,"지속":-5,"지향":"유동","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"시장 시세·재고 게시·출고 확인","소속":"정부","품계":"서기","직함":"북동부 중립시장 거점장","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 45 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −5 | 공동 30 | 원칙 15 | 공개 15 | 자격 25 | 분산 40 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 35 | 독점 10 | 위험 −15 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −5 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2090-10-28에 태어났다. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 북동부 중립시장 거점장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 복용의 시장 시세·재고 게시·출고 확인 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 서기. 직함은 북동부 중립시장 거점장. 시세와 재고를 벽에 적고, 무기 문장이 찍힌 주문서는 의료조 게시 전까지 출고를 막는다.","일화":"무기 발견 직후 시장 저울에 군수 문장 주문서가 한 장 끼어 있었다.","관계":"복봉의 중계 송장과 시세를 맞추고, 국용의 당직 의무실에 응급 물자를 우선 댄다. 오해린의 시세 방송을 시장 시간에만 참고한다.","야망":"중립시장을 환승 중계의 공개 시세 거점으로 남겨 노선 면허 밖의 호송료가 시장 칸을 사지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"시장 재고가 군수 전용으로 빠져 의료열차 보급이 멈추는 것.","개입":"주문서를 공개하거나, 응급 물자 우선 칸을 시장 원장에 고정할 수 있다."},"biography":"2090-10-28생인 복용은 가격을 숨기는 상인을 가장 잔인하게 몰아붙이고, 환자 이송 칸을 경매에 올리는 말을 시장에서 쫓아낸다. 공개 저울을 신용으로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 시장 시세·재고 게시·출고 확인\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 서기\n- 직함: 북동부 중립시장 거점장\n**생애.** 2090-10-28에 태어났다. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 북동부 중립시장 거점장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 복용의 시장 시세·재고 게시·출고 확인 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 서기. 직함은 북동부 중립시장 거점장. 시세와 재고를 벽에 적고, 무기 문장이 찍힌 주문서는 의료조 게시 전까지 출고를 막는다.\n\n**일화.** 무기 발견 직후 시장 저울에 군수 문장 주문서가 한 장 끼어 있었다.\n\n**관계.** 복봉의 중계 송장과 시세를 맞추고, 국용의 당직 의무실에 응급 물자를 우선 댄다. 오해린의 시세 방송을 시장 시간에만 참고한다.\n\n**야망.** 중립시장을 환승 중계의 공개 시세 거점으로 남겨 노선 면허 밖의 호송료가 시장 칸을 사지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 시장 재고가 군수 전용으로 빠져 의료열차 보급이 멈추는 것.\n\n**개입.** 주문서를 공개하거나, 응급 물자 우선 칸을 시장 원장에 고정할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 45 | 무력 −25 | 물질 −5 | 공동 30 | 원칙 15 | 공개 15 | 자격 25 | 분산 40 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 35 | 독점 10 | 위험 −15 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −5 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"복용","type":"계약","to":"오해린","basis":"오해린의 시세 방송을 시장 시간에만 참고한다"},{"from":"복용","type":"계약","to":"복봉","basis":"복봉의 중계 송장과 시세를 맞추고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"복봉","type":"계약","to":"복용","basis":"복용의 중립시장 시세를 송장에 옮긴다"},{"from":"근솔이","type":"계약","to":"복용","basis":"복용의 중립시장 시세와 유찰 종을 맞추고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0313', 'ad6d-b2f4-c591', '{"id":"person-0313","name":"Gukgam","title":"Gwak Taesan''s practical aide, Chief of the Medical Train Defense Depot Outpost","position":"Gwak Taesan''s practical aide, Chief of the Medical Train Defense Depot Outpost","characterId":"K312","rank":"Clerk","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Medical Train Car Key · Weapons Locker Seal Management","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#people-Guk-Gam","detailRoute":"/people/person-0313","birthDate":"2096-10-18","birthday":"10-18","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":7,"effective":7}},"skills":[{"id":"k312-separate-carriage-seal-custody","name":"Separate carriage seal custody","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k312-priority","name":"Separates authority","description":"Gukgam separates carriage keys from weapon-box seals and insists on witnessed searches. The missing duty worker is not identified.","behavior":"Office. Rank: clerk. Title: medical train defense shop outpost chief, duty officer of Gwak Taesan. He kept the car keys and the weapons-box seal in separate custody and conducted searches only under the passage examiner''s attendance.","stress":"Fear. That someone hiding Amsa-made weapons inside the defense shop would break Jang Sehwa''s neutrality from within.","relationship":"Relations. Held the defense shop under Gwak Taesan''s command and shared the sealing attendance with Mun Sion. Shielded Jeon Miri''s patient cars on the shop side.","effects":[]},{"id":"k312-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: clerk. Title: medical train defense shop outpost chief, duty officer of Gwak Taesan. He kept the car keys and the weapons-box seal in separate custody and conducted searches only under the passage examiner''s attendance.","stress":"Fear. That someone hiding Amsa-made weapons inside the defense shop would break Jang Sehwa''s neutrality from within.","relationship":"Relations. Held the defense shop under Gwak Taesan''s command and shared the sealing attendance with Mun Sion. Shielded Jeon Miri''s patient cars on the shop side.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Gukgam separates carriage keys from weapon-box seals and insists on witnessed searches. The missing duty worker is not identified.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ad6d-b2f4-c591","name":"Damyang Guk Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ad6d-b2f4-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":30,"Force":-5,"Material":10,"Communal":35,"Principle":5,"Public":10,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":50,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":25,"Risk":5,"Display":30,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical Train Car Key · Weapons Locker Seal Management","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Clerk","Title":"Gwak Taesan''s practical aide, Chief of the Medical Train Defense Depot Outpost","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 30 | Force −5 | Material 10 | Community 35 | Principle 5 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 30 | Dispersion 50 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 15 | Possessiveness 25 | Risk 5 | Display 30 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Heterosexual | Union Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2096-10-18. Raised at the Amsa guard post. At the 2126 opening holds the duty of Medical Train Guard Depot Post Chief, Gwak Taesan''s Working-Level Officer, and the post handover record notes that the post opened upon the detection of an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- The dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, transit-inspection, stretcher-handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as the duty reference point for Gukgam''s management of the medical train car keys and armory seal. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records and does not confirm running trains, new facilities, armament, transit fees, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Clerk. Title: Medical Train Guard Depot Post Chief, Gwak Taesan''s Working-Level Officer. Keeps the car keys and the armory seal stored separately, and searches only with a Transit Inspector present.","Anecdote":"Ammunition stamped with the Amsa crest was found in the medical train''s armory, and one line was missing from the guard duty roster.","Relationships":"Runs the Guard Depot under Gwak Taesan''s command and shares the seal witnessing with Mun Sion. Guards Jeon Miri''s patient car from the window side.","Ambition":"He wants to keep medical train defense as a function unique to Sinnae Transport and put an end to the practice of outside escort soldiers standing inside the cars.","Fear":"That someone inside the Guard Depot turns out to have hidden the Amsa-made weapons, breaking Jang Sehwa''s neutrality from within.","Intervention":"Can find the missing duty officer, or replace the armory seal to frame the incident as outside tampering."},"biography":"Born 2096-10-18, Gukgam is taciturn and physically bars entry to the cars. Gukgam dislikes the guard detail standing out more than the escort corps, and regards one person holding both the keys and the armory seal as an accident waiting to happen.\n\n- Livelihood: Medical train car key and armory seal management\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Clerk\n- Title: Medical Train Guard Depot Post Chief, Gwak Taesan''s Working-Level Officer\n**Life.** Born 2096-10-18. Raised at the Amsa guard post. At the 2126 opening holds the duty of Medical Train Guard Depot Post Chief, Gwak Taesan''s Working-Level Officer, and the post handover record notes that the post opened upon the detection of an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- The dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, transit-inspection, stretcher-handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as the duty reference point for Gukgam''s management of the medical train car keys and armory seal. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records and does not confirm running trains, new facilities, armament, transit fees, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Clerk. Title: Medical Train Guard Depot Post Chief, Gwak Taesan''s Working-Level Officer. Keeps the car keys and the armory seal stored separately, and searches only with a Transit Inspector present.\n\n**Anecdote.** Ammunition stamped with the Amsa crest was found in the medical train''s armory, and one line was missing from the guard duty roster.\n\n**Relations.** Runs the Guard Depot under Gwak Taesan''s command and shares the seal witnessing with Mun Sion. Guards Jeon Miri''s patient car from the window side.\n\n**Ambition.** Wants to keep medical train guarding as a distinct skill of Sinnae Transport, ending the practice of outside bodyguards standing inside the cars.\n\n**Fear.** That someone inside the Guard Depot turns out to have hidden the Amsa-made weapons, breaking Jang Sehwa''s neutrality from within.\n\n**Intervention.** Can find the missing duty officer, or replace the armory seal to frame the incident as outside tampering.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 30 | Force −5 | Material 10 | Community 35 | Principle 5 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 30 | Dispersion 50 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Possessiveness 25 | Risk 5 | Display 30 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Heterosexual | Union Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gukgam","type":"Command","to":"Gwak Taesan","basis":"Takes charge of the guard depot under Gwak Taesan''s command, and"},{"from":"Gukgam","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Share the seal witnessing with Mun Sion"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0313","name":"국감","title":"의료열차 수비창 거점장, 곽태산의 실무 담당자","position":"의료열차 수비창 거점장, 곽태산의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K312","rank":"서기","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"의료열차 칸 열쇠·무기함 봉인 관리","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-국감","detailRoute":"/people/person-0313","birthDate":"2096-10-18","birthday":"10-18","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":7,"effective":7}},"skills":[{"id":"k312-separate-carriage-seal-custody","name":"칸 봉인 분리 보관","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k312-priority","name":"권한 분리","description":"국감은 칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 나누고 입회 수색을 고수한다. 빠진 당직자는 아직 특정되지 않았다.","behavior":"칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 분리해 보관하고, 수색은 통행 심사관 입회 아래에서만 한다.","stress":"수비창 안에서 암신도 무기를 숨긴 자가 나와 장세화의 중립이 내부에서 깨지는 것.","relationship":"곽태산의 지휘로 수비창을 맡고, 문시온과 봉인 입회를 공유한다. 전미리의 환자 칸을 창 쪽에서 지킨다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k312-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 서기. 직함은 의료열차 수비창 거점장, 곽태산의 실무 담당자. 칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 분리해 보관하고, 수색은 통행 심사관 입회 아래에서만 한다.","stress":"공포. 수비창 안에서 암신도 무기를 숨긴 자가 나와 장세화의 중립이 내부에서 깨지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 곽태산의 지휘로 수비창을 맡고, 문시온과 봉인 입회를 공유한다. 전미리의 환자 칸을 창 쪽에서 지킨다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"국감은 칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 나누고 입회 수색을 고수한다. 빠진 당직자는 아직 특정되지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ad6d-b2f4-c591","name":"담양 국씨","crest":"clan-crests/ad6d-b2f4-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":30,"무력":-5,"물질":10,"공동":35,"원칙":5,"공개":10,"자격":30,"분산":50,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":25,"위험":5,"과시":30,"지속":-10,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"의료열차 칸 열쇠·무기함 봉인 관리","소속":"정부","품계":"서기","직함":"의료열차 수비창 거점장, 곽태산의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 30 | 무력 −5 | 물질 10 | 공동 35 | 원칙 5 | 공개 10 | 자격 30 | 분산 50 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 25 | 위험 5 | 과시 30 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2096-10-18에 태어났다. 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 의료열차 수비창 거점장, 곽태산의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 국감의 의료열차 칸 열쇠·무기함 봉인 관리 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 서기. 직함은 의료열차 수비창 거점장, 곽태산의 실무 담당자. 칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 분리해 보관하고, 수색은 통행 심사관 입회 아래에서만 한다.","일화":"의료열차 무기함에서 암사 문장이 찍힌 탄약이 발견되고 수비 당직 명단이 한 줄 빠져 있었다.","관계":"곽태산의 지휘로 수비창을 맡고, 문시온과 봉인 입회를 공유한다. 전미리의 환자 칸을 창 쪽에서 지킨다.","야망":"의료열차 수비를 신내운수 고유 직능으로 남겨 외부 호위병이 칸 안에 서는 관행을 없애려 한다.","공포":"수비창 안에서 암신도 무기를 숨긴 자가 나와 장세화의 중립이 내부에서 깨지는 것.","개입":"빠진 당직자를 찾거나, 무기함 봉인을 바꿔 사건을 외부 조작으로 몰 수 있다."},"biography":"2096-10-18생인 국감은 과묵하고 칸 출입을 몸으로 막는다. 수비대가 호송대보다 눈에 띄는 것을 싫어하고, 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 한 사람이 쥐는 일을 사고로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 의료열차 칸 열쇠·무기함 봉인 관리\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 서기\n- 직함: 의료열차 수비창 거점장, 곽태산의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2096-10-18에 태어났다. 암사 경비 초소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 의료열차 수비창 거점장, 곽태산의 실무 담당자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 국감의 의료열차 칸 열쇠·무기함 봉인 관리 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 서기. 직함은 의료열차 수비창 거점장, 곽태산의 실무 담당자. 칸 열쇠와 무기함 봉인을 분리해 보관하고, 수색은 통행 심사관 입회 아래에서만 한다.\n\n**일화.** 의료열차 무기함에서 암사 문장이 찍힌 탄약이 발견되고 수비 당직 명단이 한 줄 빠져 있었다.\n\n**관계.** 곽태산의 지휘로 수비창을 맡고, 문시온과 봉인 입회를 공유한다. 전미리의 환자 칸을 창 쪽에서 지킨다.\n\n**야망.** 의료열차 수비를 신내운수 고유 직능으로 남겨 외부 호위병이 칸 안에 서는 관행을 없애려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 수비창 안에서 암신도 무기를 숨긴 자가 나와 장세화의 중립이 내부에서 깨지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 빠진 당직자를 찾거나, 무기함 봉인을 바꿔 사건을 외부 조작으로 몰 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 30 | 무력 −5 | 물질 10 | 공동 35 | 원칙 5 | 공개 10 | 자격 30 | 분산 50 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 25 | 위험 5 | 과시 30 | 지속 −10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"국감","type":"지휘","to":"곽태산","basis":"곽태산의 지휘로 수비창을 맡고"},{"from":"국감","type":"계약","to":"문시온","basis":"문시온과 봉인 입회를 공유한다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0314', 'ac10-cc3d-c6d0', '{"id":"person-0314","name":"Gammo","title":"Chief of the Medical Team Duty Room Outpost","position":"Chief of the Medical Team Duty Room Outpost","characterId":"K313","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Medical team triage and transport time records","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#person-gammo","detailRoute":"/people/person-0314","birthDate":"2078-01-22","birthday":"01-22","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k313-transfer-timing-posting","name":"Transfer timing posting","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k313-priority","name":"Vital stability first","description":"Gammo posts severity and transfer times and implements medical duty extensions, rejecting the idea that extended duty substitutes for medicine.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: medical crew duty room outpost chief. He pasted the severity table and transfer hours on the duty-room door and corrected no arms-loading record without the examiner''s attendance.","stress":"Fear. That the duty room would be mistaken for a munitions waiting room and the whole convoy squad would be disarmed.","relationship":"Relations. Executed Jeon Miri''s medical crew extension in the duty room and split the stretcher order and sickbeds with Guk Yong. Put Jang Sehwa''s departmental stamp at the top of the duty ledger.","effects":[]},{"id":"k313-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: medical crew duty room outpost chief. He pasted the severity table and transfer hours on the duty-room door and corrected no arms-loading record without the examiner''s attendance.","stress":"Fear. That the duty room would be mistaken for a munitions waiting room and the whole convoy squad would be disarmed.","relationship":"Relations. Executed Jeon Miri''s medical crew extension in the duty room and split the stretcher order and sickbeds with Guk Yong. Put Jang Sehwa''s departmental stamp at the top of the duty ledger.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Gammo posts severity and transfer times and implements medical duty extensions, rejecting the idea that extended duty substitutes for medicine.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ac10-cc3d-c6d0","name":"Changwon Gam Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ac10-cc3d-c6d0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":35,"Force":-20,"Material":10,"Communal":40,"Principle":5,"Public":20,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":40,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":50,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-40,"Display":0,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical team triage and transport time records","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Chief of the Medical Team Duty Room Outpost","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 35 | Force −20 | Material 10 | Community 40 | Principle 5 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 10 | Dispersion 40 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 50 | Possessiveness −10 | Risk −40 | Display 0 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2078-01-22. Raised at the Jegi-dong aid station. At the 2126 opening holds the duty of Medical Unit Duty Room Post Chief, and the post handover record notes that the post opened with a counterfeit-medicine seal.\n- The dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, transit-inspection, stretcher-handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as the duty reference point for Gammo''s recording of Medical Unit triage levels and transfer times. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records and does not confirm running trains, new facilities, armament, transit fees, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Medical Unit Duty Room Post Chief. Posts the triage chart and transfer times on the duty room door, and does not alter weapons loading records without an inspector present.","Anecdote":"When the southbound procession of the Bukhansan Patriots'' Gate piled up on the platform, one duty room shift-change slip went missing.","Relationships":"Enforces Jeon Miri''s Medical Unit extensions in the duty room and shares stretcher order and beds with Gugyong. Places Jang Sehwa''s departmental seal at the top of the duty ledger.","Ambition":"Hopes to keep the Medical Unit duty room as one wing of the seasonal shift-change approval, so that emergency transfers without escort fees never stop.","Fear":"That the duty room is mistaken for a munitions waiting room and the entire escort corps is disarmed.","Intervention":"Can find the missing slip, or push a duty extension through in front of the Dispatch Unit."},"biography":"Born 2078-01-22, Gammo puts stretcher order ahead of nationality and accepts the Dispatch Unit''s demands for empty slots only after vitality has stabilized. Refuses any talk that packages a duty extension as medicine.\n\n- Livelihood: Medical Unit triage level and transfer time recording\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Medical Unit Duty Room Post Chief\n**Life.** Born 2078-01-22. Raised at the Jegi-dong aid station. At the 2126 opening holds the duty of Medical Unit Duty Room Post Chief, and the post handover record notes that the post opened with a counterfeit-medicine seal.\n- The dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, transit-inspection, stretcher-handover, and duty-key record desk of Sinnae 1-dong is proposed as the duty reference point for Gammo''s recording of Medical Unit triage levels and transfer times. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records and does not confirm running trains, new facilities, armament, transit fees, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Medical Unit Duty Room Post Chief. Posts the triage chart and transfer times on the duty room door, and does not alter weapons loading records without an inspector present.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the southbound procession of the Bukhansan Patriots'' Gate piled up on the platform, one duty room shift-change slip went missing.\n\n**Relations.** Enforces Jeon Miri''s Medical Unit extensions in the duty room and shares stretcher order and beds with Gugyong. Places Jang Sehwa''s departmental seal at the top of the duty ledger.\n\n**Ambition.** Hopes to keep the Medical Unit duty room as one wing of the seasonal shift-change approval, so that emergency transfers without escort fees never stop.\n\n**Fear.** That the duty room is mistaken for a munitions waiting room and the entire escort corps is disarmed.\n\n**Intervention.** Can find the missing slip, or push a duty extension through in front of the Dispatch Unit.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 35 | Force −20 | Material 10 | Community 40 | Principle 5 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 10 | Dispersion 40 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 50 | Possessiveness −10 | Risk −40 | Display 0 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gammo","type":"Command","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"carrying out the extension of Jeon Miri''s Medical Team in the duty room, and"},{"from":"Gammo","type":"Command","to":"Guk Yong","basis":"Shares the stretcher order and beds with Gugyong"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Guk Yong","type":"Command","to":"Gammo","basis":"Shares the duty room and beds with Gammo''s medical squad"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0314","name":"감모","title":"의료조 당직실 거점장","position":"의료조 당직실 거점장","characterId":"K313","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"의료조 중증도·이송 시각 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-감모","detailRoute":"/people/person-0314","birthDate":"2078-01-22","birthday":"01-22","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k313-transfer-timing-posting","name":"이송 시각 게시","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k313-priority","name":"활력 안정 우선","description":"감모는 중증도와 이송 시각을 게시하고 의료조 연장을 집행한다. 연장을 약으로 대신한다는 말을 거부한다.","behavior":"중증도 표와 이송 시각을 당직실 문에 붙이고, 무기 적재 기록은 심사관 입회 없이 고치지 않는다.","stress":"당직실이 군수 대기실로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","relationship":"전미리의 의료조 연장을 당직실에서 집행하고, 국용의 들것 순서와 병상을 나눈다. 장세화의 부서 날인을 당직 원장 맨 위에 둔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k313-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 의료조 당직실 거점장. 중증도 표와 이송 시각을 당직실 문에 붙이고, 무기 적재 기록은 심사관 입회 없이 고치지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 당직실이 군수 대기실로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","relationship":"관계. 전미리의 의료조 연장을 당직실에서 집행하고, 국용의 들것 순서와 병상을 나눈다. 장세화의 부서 날인을 당직 원장 맨 위에 둔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"감모는 중증도와 이송 시각을 게시하고 의료조 연장을 집행한다. 연장을 약으로 대신한다는 말을 거부한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"ac10-cc3d-c6d0","name":"창원 감씨","crest":"clan-crests/ac10-cc3d-c6d0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":35,"무력":-20,"물질":10,"공동":40,"원칙":5,"공개":20,"자격":10,"분산":40,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":50,"독점":-10,"위험":-40,"과시":0,"지속":0,"지향":"양성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"의료조 중증도·이송 시각 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"의료조 당직실 거점장","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 35 | 무력 −20 | 물질 10 | 공동 40 | 원칙 5 | 공개 20 | 자격 10 | 분산 40 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 50 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −40 | 과시 0 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2078-01-22에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 의료조 당직실 거점장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 감모의 의료조 중증도·이송 시각 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 의료조 당직실 거점장. 중증도 표와 이송 시각을 당직실 문에 붙이고, 무기 적재 기록은 심사관 입회 없이 고치지 않는다.","일화":"북한산보국문 남하 행렬이 승강장에 쌓이자 당직실 교대 쪽지가 한 장 사라졌다.","관계":"전미리의 의료조 연장을 당직실에서 집행하고, 국용의 들것 순서와 병상을 나눈다. 장세화의 부서 날인을 당직 원장 맨 위에 둔다.","야망":"의료조 당직실을 계절 교대 결재의 한쪽 날개로 남겨 호송료 없는 응급 이송이 끊기지 않게 하려 한다.","공포":"당직실이 군수 대기실로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","개입":"사라진 쪽지를 찾거나, 당직 연장을 배차조 앞에서 관철할 수 있다."},"biography":"2078-01-22생인 감모는 들것 순서를 국적보다 앞에 두고, 배차조의 빈 슬롯 요구를 활력이 안정된 뒤에만 받는다. 당직 연장을 약으로 포장하는 말을 거부한다.\n\n- 생업: 의료조 중증도·이송 시각 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 의료조 당직실 거점장\n**생애.** 2078-01-22에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 의료조 당직실 거점장 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 감모의 의료조 중증도·이송 시각 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 의료조 당직실 거점장. 중증도 표와 이송 시각을 당직실 문에 붙이고, 무기 적재 기록은 심사관 입회 없이 고치지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 북한산보국문 남하 행렬이 승강장에 쌓이자 당직실 교대 쪽지가 한 장 사라졌다.\n\n**관계.** 전미리의 의료조 연장을 당직실에서 집행하고, 국용의 들것 순서와 병상을 나눈다. 장세화의 부서 날인을 당직 원장 맨 위에 둔다.\n\n**야망.** 의료조 당직실을 계절 교대 결재의 한쪽 날개로 남겨 호송료 없는 응급 이송이 끊기지 않게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 당직실이 군수 대기실로 오인되어 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.\n\n**개입.** 사라진 쪽지를 찾거나, 당직 연장을 배차조 앞에서 관철할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 35 | 무력 −20 | 물질 10 | 공동 40 | 원칙 5 | 공개 20 | 자격 10 | 분산 40 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 50 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −40 | 과시 0 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"감모","type":"지휘","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리의 의료조 연장을 당직실에서 집행하고"},{"from":"감모","type":"지휘","to":"국용","basis":"국용의 들것 순서와 병상을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"국용","type":"지휘","to":"감모","basis":"감모의 의료조 당직실과 병상을 나눈다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0315', 'd0c1-ad11-c0b0', '{"id":"person-0315","name":"Tak Mireu","title":"Party involved in the transfer passage accident","position":"Party involved in the transfer passage accident","characterId":"K314","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Transfer accident time and cargo car records","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#person-tak-mireu","detailRoute":"/people/person-0315","birthDate":"2066-09-11","birthday":"09-11","age":60,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k314-collision-timing-testimony","name":"Collision timing testimony","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"k314-priority","name":"Preserves participant testimony","description":"Tak Mireu records the time and number of the car he occupied during collision. The experience supplies no injury severity or function assessment.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: transfer passage accident party. He wrote the collision hours and car numbers on one chalkboard and moved no freight stamped with the Amsa mark without the examiner''s attendance.","stress":"Fear. That his testimony would become the indulgence that buried the weapons box and Jang Sehwa''s neutrality would break from within.","relationship":"Relations. Left a statement at Mun Sion''s examination stand and matched the hours with Gwak Taesan''s defense duty. He had refused any settlement without Jang Sehwa''s departmental stamp.","effects":[]},{"id":"k314-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: transfer passage accident party. He wrote the collision hours and car numbers on one chalkboard and moved no freight stamped with the Amsa mark without the examiner''s attendance.","stress":"Fear. That his testimony would become the indulgence that buried the weapons box and Jang Sehwa''s neutrality would break from within.","relationship":"Relations. Left a statement at Mun Sion''s examination stand and matched the hours with Gwak Taesan''s defense duty. He had refused any settlement without Jang Sehwa''s departmental stamp.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Tak Mireu records the time and number of the car he occupied during collision. The experience supplies no injury severity or function assessment.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d0c1-ad11-c0b0","name":"Tak Clan of Gwangsan","crest":"clan-crests/d0c1-ad11-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-30,"Openness":45,"Force":-30,"Material":-10,"Communal":30,"Principle":10,"Public":20,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":35,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":-10,"Monopoly":5,"Risk":-20,"Display":-15,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Transfer accident time and cargo car records","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Party involved in the transfer passage accident","Values":"Authority −30 | Openness 45 | Force −30 | Materialism −10 | Communal 30 | Principle 10 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 30 | Dispersion 35 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving −10 | Monopoly 5 | Risk −20 | Display −15 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2066-09-11. Grew up on the Sinnae transfer watch. At the 2126 opening, holds the Transfer Passage Accident Party watch, and the post handover record notes that it began with stopping a ticketless departing train.\n- The Mangu transfer queue, patient, cargo classification, weight, invoice, price and public testimony desk in Sangbong 1-dong is proposed as Tak Mir''s duty reference point for transfer accident times and cargo car records. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the Permanent Winter, and it does not confirm operating trains, new facilities, armaments, passage tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Transfer Passage Accident Party. Writes the collision time and car number on the same blackboard, and does not move any cargo stamped with the Amsa crest without an inspector present.","Anecdote":"When winter''s black dispatch table opened, an Amsa-made weapon was found on a medical train, and the transfer car Tak Mir was riding collided with that train at the coupling.","Relationships":"Leaves a statement at Mun Sion''s inspection desk and aligns times with Gwak Taesan''s guard duty. Has refused agreements lacking Jang Sehwa''s departmental seal.","Ambition":"Intends to fix the party''s statement on the Mangu transfer collision in the neutral escort ledger so that the cargo car can never again crash into the passenger car.","Fear":"That their own testimony becomes an absolution for the armory cover-up, breaking Jang Sehwa''s neutrality from within.","Intervention":"Can escort the party''s statement to the Records Office, or find the dispatch slip that rigged the collision."},"biography":"Tak Mir, born 2066-09-11, remembers the shock of the platform coupling in the body and tears up slips insisting that an empty car was a medical car. Words are short, and times are exact.\n\n- Livelihood: Transfer accident times and cargo car records\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Transfer Passage Accident Party\n**Life.** Born on 2066-09-11. Grew up on the Sinnae transfer watch. At the 2126 opening, holds the Transfer Passage Accident Party watch, and the post handover record notes that it began with stopping a ticketless departing train.\n- The Mangu transfer queue, patient, cargo classification, weight, invoice, price and public testimony desk in Sangbong 1-dong is proposed as Tak Mir''s duty reference point for transfer accident times and cargo car records. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the Permanent Winter, and it does not confirm operating trains, new facilities, armaments, passage tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Transfer Passage Accident Party. Writes the collision time and car number on the same blackboard, and does not move any cargo stamped with the Amsa crest without an inspector present.\n\n**Anecdote.** When winter''s black dispatch table opened, an Amsa-made weapon was found on a medical train, and the transfer car Tak Mir was riding collided with that train at the coupling.\n\n**Relations.** Gives statements at Mun Sion''s inspection desk and synchronizes times with Gwak Taesan''s defense watch. Has refused agreements that lack Jang Sehwa''s department seal.\n\n**Ambition.** Intends to fix the party''s statement on the Mangu transfer collision in the neutral escort ledger so that the cargo car can never again crash into the passenger car.\n\n**Fear.** That their testimony becomes an absolution for the cover-up of the weapons locker, breaking Jang Sehwa''s neutrality from within.\n\n**Intervention.** Can escort the party''s statement to the Records Office, or find the dispatch slip that rigged the collision.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −30 | Openness 45 | Force −30 | Materialism −10 | Communal 30 | Principle 10 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 30 | Dispersion 35 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving −10 | Monopoly 5 | Risk −20 | Display −15 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Tak Mireu","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Sion","basis":"Leave a statement at Mun Sion''s inspection post, and"},{"from":"Tak Mireu","type":"Contract","to":"Gwak Taesan","basis":"Syncs times with Gwak Taesan''s guard duty shifts"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0315","name":"탁미르","title":"환승 통행 사고 당사자","position":"환승 통행 사고 당사자","characterId":"K314","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"환승 사고 시각·화물칸 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-탁미르","detailRoute":"/people/person-0315","birthDate":"2066-09-11","birthday":"09-11","age":60,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":7,"effective":7},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k314-collision-timing-testimony","name":"충돌 시각 진술","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"k314-priority","name":"당사자 진술 보존","description":"탁미르는 자신이 탄 칸의 충돌 시각과 번호를 기록한다. 충돌 경험을 부상 정도나 신체 기능 추정으로 바꾸지 않는다.","behavior":"충돌 시각과 칸 번호를 같은 칠판에 적고, 암사 문장이 찍힌 화물은 심사관 입회 없이 옮기지 않는다.","stress":"자신의 증언이 무기함 은폐의 면죄부가 되어 장세화의 중립이 내부에서 깨지는 것.","relationship":"문시온의 심사대에서 진술을 남기고, 곽태산의 수비 당직과 시각을 맞춘다. 장세화의 부서 날인이 없는 합의서는 거부해 왔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k314-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 통행 사고 당사자. 충돌 시각과 칸 번호를 같은 칠판에 적고, 암사 문장이 찍힌 화물은 심사관 입회 없이 옮기지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 자신의 증언이 무기함 은폐의 면죄부가 되어 장세화의 중립이 내부에서 깨지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 문시온의 심사대에서 진술을 남기고, 곽태산의 수비 당직과 시각을 맞춘다. 장세화의 부서 날인이 없는 합의서는 거부해 왔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"탁미르는 자신이 탄 칸의 충돌 시각과 번호를 기록한다. 충돌 경험을 부상 정도나 신체 기능 추정으로 바꾸지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d0c1-ad11-c0b0","name":"광산 탁씨","crest":"clan-crests/d0c1-ad11-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-30,"개방":45,"무력":-30,"물질":-10,"공동":30,"원칙":10,"공개":20,"자격":30,"분산":35,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":-10,"독점":5,"위험":-20,"과시":-15,"지속":35,"지향":"이성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"환승 사고 시각·화물칸 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"환승 통행 사고 당사자","가치관":"권위 −30 | 개방 45 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −10 | 공동 30 | 원칙 10 | 공개 20 | 자격 30 | 분산 35 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 −10 | 독점 5 | 위험 −20 | 과시 −15 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2066-09-11에 태어났다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 환승 통행 사고 당사자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 탁미르의 환승 사고 시각·화물칸 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 통행 사고 당사자. 충돌 시각과 칸 번호를 같은 칠판에 적고, 암사 문장이 찍힌 화물은 심사관 입회 없이 옮기지 않는다.","일화":"겨울의 검은 배차표가 열리자 의료열차에서 암신도 무기가 발견되고 탁미르가 탄 환승칸이 그 열차와 이음매에서 부딪쳤다.","관계":"문시온의 심사대에서 진술을 남기고, 곽태산의 수비 당직과 시각을 맞춘다. 장세화의 부서 날인이 없는 합의서는 거부해 왔다.","야망":"망우 환승 충돌의 당사자 진술을 중립 호송 원장에 고정해 화물칸이 사람 칸을 다시 덮치지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"자신의 증언이 무기함 은폐의 면죄부가 되어 장세화의 중립이 내부에서 깨지는 것.","개입":"당사자 진술을 기록청까지 호송하거나, 충돌을 조작한 배차 쪽지를 찾아낼 수 있다."},"biography":"2066-09-11생인 탁미르는 승강장 이음매의 충격을 몸으로 기억하고, 빈 칸을 의료칸이라 우기는 쪽지를 찢는다. 말은 짧고 시각은 정확하다.\n\n- 생업: 환승 사고 시각·화물칸 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 환승 통행 사고 당사자\n**생애.** 2066-09-11에 태어났다. 신내 환승 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 환승 통행 사고 당사자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 탁미르의 환승 사고 시각·화물칸 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 환승 통행 사고 당사자. 충돌 시각과 칸 번호를 같은 칠판에 적고, 암사 문장이 찍힌 화물은 심사관 입회 없이 옮기지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 겨울의 검은 배차표가 열리자 의료열차에서 암신도 무기가 발견되고 탁미르가 탄 환승칸이 그 열차와 이음매에서 부딪쳤다.\n\n**관계.** 문시온의 심사대에서 진술을 남기고, 곽태산의 수비 당직과 시각을 맞춘다. 장세화의 부서 날인이 없는 합의서는 거부해 왔다.\n\n**야망.** 망우 환승 충돌의 당사자 진술을 중립 호송 원장에 고정해 화물칸이 사람 칸을 다시 덮치지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 자신의 증언이 무기함 은폐의 면죄부가 되어 장세화의 중립이 내부에서 깨지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 당사자 진술을 기록청까지 호송하거나, 충돌을 조작한 배차 쪽지를 찾아낼 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −30 | 개방 45 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −10 | 공동 30 | 원칙 10 | 공개 20 | 자격 30 | 분산 35 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 −10 | 독점 5 | 위험 −20 | 과시 −15 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"탁미르","type":"계약","to":"문시온","basis":"문시온의 심사대에서 진술을 남기고"},{"from":"탁미르","type":"계약","to":"곽태산","basis":"곽태산의 수비 당직과 시각을 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0316', 'bc94-ae08-c131', '{"id":"person-0316","name":"Beom Ongyeol","title":"Passage witness at the northeastern outer gate","position":"Passage witness at the northeastern outer gate","characterId":"K315","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Outer gate passage time and stretcher count records","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-beom-ongyeol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0316","birthDate":"2069-09-07","birthday":"09-07","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k315-passage-headcount","name":"Passage headcount","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"k315-priority","name":"Guards use of family counts","description":"Beom Ongyeol cross-checks family lists and passage counts and witnessed forced registration. Missing duty notes cause him to stop testimony.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: northeast outer gate passage witness. He wrote the passage hours and stretcher counts in the same ledger and struck the Amsa escort''s searches from his testimony without the medical crew''s stamp.","stress":"Fear. That the family counts he tallied would become the numbers of a military-registry column.","relationship":"Relations. Backed Jeon Miri''s patient line from the witness stand and cross-checked Baek On''s southward family roster. When Gam Mo''s duty-room note vanished, he halted the testimony.","effects":[]},{"id":"k315-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: northeast outer gate passage witness. He wrote the passage hours and stretcher counts in the same ledger and struck the Amsa escort''s searches from his testimony without the medical crew''s stamp.","stress":"Fear. That the family counts he tallied would become the numbers of a military-registry column.","relationship":"Relations. Backed Jeon Miri''s patient line from the witness stand and cross-checked Baek On''s southward family roster. When Gam Mo''s duty-room note vanished, he halted the testimony.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Beom Ongyeol cross-checks family lists and passage counts and witnessed forced registration. Missing duty notes cause him to stop testimony.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc94-ae08-c131","name":"Geumseong Beom Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc94-ae08-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":45,"Force":-20,"Material":-5,"Communal":10,"Principle":10,"Public":20,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":50,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":10,"Display":-30,"Sustained":-5,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Outer gate passage time and stretcher count records","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Passage witness at the northeastern outer gate","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 45 | Force −20 | Materialism −5 | Communality 10 | Principle 10 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 30 | Dispersion 50 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 15 | Monopoly −30 | Risk 10 | Display −30 | Endurance −5 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2069-09-07. Raised on duty shifts in the waiting hall. At the opening of 2126, she holds the Northeast Outer Gate Passage Witness duty, and the post-handover record remains, opened by a substitute duty shift covering an unexcused absence at shift change.\n- The Mangu transfer queue, patient and cargo classification, weight, waybill, market price, and public testimony recording desk in Sangbong 1-dong is proposed as the duty reference point for Beom Ongyeol''s records of outer gate passage times and stretcher counts. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the Permanent Winter, and it does not fix running trains, new equipment, arms, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Northeast Outer Gate Passage Witness. She records passage times and stretcher counts in the same ledger, and omits the Amsa Guard Corps'' searches from her testimony unless they carry the medical corps'' seal.","Anecdote":"When the autumn procession through Bukhansan Bogungmun piled up on the Sinnae platform, Beom Ongyeol counted the people passing through and watched a forced-roster window open.","Relationships":"She backs Jeon Miri''s patient line from the witness stand and cross-checks Baek On''s roster of southbound families. When Gam Mo''s duty-room note disappeared, she stopped testifying.","Ambition":"She wants to preserve the passage counts of the southbound procession as public testimony, so that forced-service re-registration cannot swallow the platform.","Fear":"That the number of family members they counted becomes a figure in a column of the mobilization register.","Intervention":"She can stop any hand that tries to carry the witness ledger off to the representatives'' council or hand the numbers over to the watchword."},"biography":"Born on 2069-09-07, Beom Ongyeol counts the faces in the line and looks at the nationality table later. She cuts off, at the witness stand, any whisper telling her to turn passes into watchwords.\n\n- Livelihood: Recording outer gate passage times and stretcher counts\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Northeast Outer Gate Passage Witness\n**Life.** Born on 2069-09-07. Raised on duty shifts in the waiting hall. At the opening of 2126, she holds the Northeast Outer Gate Passage Witness duty, and the post-handover record remains, opened by a substitute duty shift covering an unexcused absence at shift change.\n- The Mangu transfer queue, patient and cargo classification, weight, waybill, market price, and public testimony recording desk in Sangbong 1-dong is proposed as the duty reference point for Beom Ongyeol''s records of outer gate passage times and stretcher counts. This is a proposal to cross-check the handover records of the Permanent Winter, and it does not fix running trains, new equipment, arms, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Northeast Outer Gate Passage Witness. She records passage times and stretcher counts in the same ledger, and omits the Amsa Guard Corps'' searches from her testimony unless they carry the medical corps'' seal.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the autumn procession through Bukhansan Bogungmun piled up on the Sinnae platform, Beom Ongyeol counted the people passing through and watched a forced-roster window open.\n\n**Relationships.** She backs Jeon Miri''s patient line from the witness stand and cross-checks Baek On''s roster of southbound families. When Gam Mo''s duty-room note disappeared, she stopped testifying.\n\n**Ambition.** She wants to preserve the passage counts of the southbound procession as public testimony, so that forced-service re-registration cannot swallow the platform.\n\n**Fear.** That the number of families she counted will become a figure in a column of the mobilization roster.\n\n**Intervention.** She can stop any hand that tries to carry the witness ledger off to the representatives'' council or hand the numbers over to the watchword.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 45 | Force −20 | Materialism −5 | Communality 10 | Principle 10 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 30 | Dispersion 50 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Monopoly −30 | Risk 10 | Display −30 | Endurance −5 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Beom Ongyeol","type":"Oath","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"backing Jeon Miri''s patient line at the witness stand, and"},{"from":"Beom Ongyeol","type":"Oath","to":"Baek On","basis":"Cross-checks Baek On''s register of southbound families."}],"incoming":[{"from":"Seok Raon","type":"Contract","to":"Beom Ongyeol","basis":"Match Beom Ongyeol''s passage counts against the stretcher counts"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0316","name":"범온결","title":"북동 외곽 관문 통행 증인","position":"북동 외곽 관문 통행 증인","characterId":"K315","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"외곽 관문 통과 시각·들것 수 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-범온결","detailRoute":"/people/person-0316","birthDate":"2069-09-07","birthday":"09-07","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":6,"effective":6},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k315-passage-headcount","name":"통행 인원 계수","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"k315-priority","name":"가족 수의 용도 경계","description":"범온결은 가족 명부와 통과 인원을 대조하며 강제 명부 창구를 목격했다. 당직 쪽지가 사라지면 증언을 멈춘다.","behavior":"통과 시각과 들것 수를 같은 원장에 적고, 암사 호위단의 검색은 의료조 날인 없이 증언에서 뺀다.","stress":"자신이 센 가족 수가 동원 명부 칸의 숫자가 되는 것.","relationship":"전미리의 환자 줄을 증인석에서 받치고, 백온의 남하 가족 명부를 대조한다. 감모의 당직실 쪽지가 사라지자 증언을 멈췄다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k315-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 북동 외곽 관문 통행 증인. 통과 시각과 들것 수를 같은 원장에 적고, 암사 호위단의 검색은 의료조 날인 없이 증언에서 뺀다.","stress":"공포. 자신이 센 가족 수가 동원 명부 칸의 숫자가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 전미리의 환자 줄을 증인석에서 받치고, 백온의 남하 가족 명부를 대조한다. 감모의 당직실 쪽지가 사라지자 증언을 멈췄다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"범온결은 가족 명부와 통과 인원을 대조하며 강제 명부 창구를 목격했다. 당직 쪽지가 사라지면 증언을 멈춘다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc94-ae08-c131","name":"금성 범씨","crest":"clan-crests/bc94-ae08-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":45,"무력":-20,"물질":-5,"공동":10,"원칙":10,"공개":20,"자격":30,"분산":50,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":-30,"위험":10,"과시":-30,"지속":-5,"지향":"양성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"외곽 관문 통과 시각·들것 수 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"북동 외곽 관문 통행 증인","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 45 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −5 | 공동 10 | 원칙 10 | 공개 20 | 자격 30 | 분산 50 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 −30 | 위험 10 | 과시 −30 | 지속 −5 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2069-09-07에 태어났다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 북동 외곽 관문 통행 증인 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 범온결의 외곽 관문 통과 시각·들것 수 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 북동 외곽 관문 통행 증인. 통과 시각과 들것 수를 같은 원장에 적고, 암사 호위단의 검색은 의료조 날인 없이 증언에서 뺀다.","일화":"가을의 북한산보국문 행렬이 신내 승강장에 쌓이자 범온결은 통행 인원을 세며 강제 명부 창구가 열리는 것을 보았다.","관계":"전미리의 환자 줄을 증인석에서 받치고, 백온의 남하 가족 명부를 대조한다. 감모의 당직실 쪽지가 사라지자 증언을 멈췄다.","야망":"남하 행렬의 통과 인원을 공개 증언으로 남겨 강제 복무 재등록이 승강장을 삼키지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"자신이 센 가족 수가 동원 명부 칸의 숫자가 되는 것.","개입":"증인 원장을 대표 회의로 가져가거나, 숫자를 군호에 넘기려는 손을 막을 수 있다."},"biography":"2069-09-07생인 범온결은 줄의 얼굴을 세고 국적 표는 나중에 본다. 통행증을 군호로 바꾸라는 속삭임을 증인석에서 잘라 낸다.\n\n- 생업: 외곽 관문 통과 시각·들것 수 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 북동 외곽 관문 통행 증인\n**생애.** 2069-09-07에 태어났다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 북동 외곽 관문 통행 증인 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 범온결의 외곽 관문 통과 시각·들것 수 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 북동 외곽 관문 통행 증인. 통과 시각과 들것 수를 같은 원장에 적고, 암사 호위단의 검색은 의료조 날인 없이 증언에서 뺀다.\n\n**일화.** 가을의 북한산보국문 행렬이 신내 승강장에 쌓이자 범온결은 통행 인원을 세며 강제 명부 창구가 열리는 것을 보았다.\n\n**관계.** 전미리의 환자 줄을 증인석에서 받치고, 백온의 남하 가족 명부를 대조한다. 감모의 당직실 쪽지가 사라지자 증언을 멈췄다.\n\n**야망.** 남하 행렬의 통과 인원을 공개 증언으로 남겨 강제 복무 재등록이 승강장을 삼키지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 자신이 센 가족 수가 동원 명부 칸의 숫자가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 증인 원장을 대표 회의로 가져가거나, 숫자를 군호에 넘기려는 손을 막을 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 45 | 무력 −20 | 물질 −5 | 공동 10 | 원칙 10 | 공개 20 | 자격 30 | 분산 50 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 −30 | 위험 10 | 과시 −30 | 지속 −5 | 지향 양성 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"범온결","type":"맹세","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리의 환자 줄을 증인석에서 받치고"},{"from":"범온결","type":"맹세","to":"백온","basis":"백온의 남하 가족 명부를 대조한다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"석라온","type":"계약","to":"범온결","basis":"범온결의 통행 숫자와 들것 수를 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0317', 'cc3d-ac70-cc3d', '{"id":"person-0317","name":"Chang Dahin","title":"Representative of victims of the contaminated medicine transport","position":"Representative of victims of the contaminated medicine transport","characterId":"K316","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Medicine dosing time and fever records","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#person-chang-dahin","detailRoute":"/people/person-0317","birthDate":"2096-01-24","birthday":"01-24","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k316-dose-and-fever-record-review","name":"Dose and fever record review","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"k316-priority","name":"Public harm records","description":"Chang Daheun matches dose times and fever records after family harm. A victims’ representative receives no prescription proficiency or presumed personal disease.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: herb contamination transfer victims'' representative. He overlaid dosage hours and fever records in one book and unloaded no box without origin inspection posts or the representative''s stamp.","stress":"Fear. That the victims'' list would be sold as a great power''s purchase ledger and he would become the face of the concealment.","relationship":"Relations. Raised the victims'' line onto Jeon Miri''s severity table and matched names with Mae Haru''s Jegi-dong harm ledger. Made Ryu Eunbi''s care principles the last standard of the transfer cars.","effects":[]},{"id":"k316-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: herb contamination transfer victims'' representative. He overlaid dosage hours and fever records in one book and unloaded no box without origin inspection posts or the representative''s stamp.","stress":"Fear. That the victims'' list would be sold as a great power''s purchase ledger and he would become the face of the concealment.","relationship":"Relations. Raised the victims'' line onto Jeon Miri''s severity table and matched names with Mae Haru''s Jegi-dong harm ledger. Made Ryu Eunbi''s care principles the last standard of the transfer cars.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Chang Daheun matches dose times and fever records after family harm. A victims’ representative receives no prescription proficiency or presumed personal disease.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc3d-ac70-cc3d","name":"Geochang Chang Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cc3d-ac70-cc3d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-35,"Openness":50,"Force":-30,"Material":0,"Communal":15,"Principle":0,"Public":20,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":60,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":-5,"Monopoly":5,"Risk":-10,"Display":5,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medicine dosing time and fever records","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Representative of victims of the contaminated medicine transport","Values":"Authority −35 | Openness 50 | Force −30 | Material 0 | Community 15 | Principle 0 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 10 | Dispersion 60 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving −5 | Monopoly 5 | Risk −10 | Display 5 | Persistence −15 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2096-01-24. Raised at the Jegi-dong infirmary. At the 2126 opening, holds the duty post of Representative of Victims of Contaminated Medicine Transport, and the post-handover record shows it was opened by a fake-medicine seal.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, passage-inspection, stretcher-handover and duty-key record desks are proposed as Chang Dahuin''s duty reference point for medicine dose-time and fever records. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Representative of Victims of Contaminated Medicine Transport. Overlay dose times and fever records in the same book, and never unload a crate that lacks an origin tally stake without the representative''s seal.","Anecdote":"In the week when summer''s muddy water and fake medicine spread, Chang Dahuin''s family collapsed after taking antipyretics on the Sinnae medical train.","Relationships":"Put the victim lines on Jeon Miri''s severity table and match the names against Mae Haru''s Jegi-dong victim ledger. Treat Ryu Eunbi''s treatment principle as the final standard for the transport car.","Ambition":"Seeks to bind the list of transfers felled by contaminated medicine into a public victim ledger, so that fake medicine can never again board the transfer car.","Fear":"That the victim list is sold into an outside purchase ledger and the representative becomes the face of the cover-up.","Intervention":"May seize contaminated medicine crates to fill the ledger, or be drawn into a cover-up deal as the victims'' representative."},"biography":"Born on 2096-01-24, Chang Dahuin still carries the bitterness of the antipyretic on the tongue and never puts medicine with merely clean packaging on a stretcher. Gentle, but will not rise from the seat when a fever curve is out of line.\n\n- Livelihood: Medicine dose-time and fever records\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Representative of Victims of Contaminated Medicine Transport\n**Life.** Born on 2096-01-24. Raised at the Jegi-dong infirmary. At the 2126 opening, holds the duty post of Representative of Victims of Contaminated Medicine Transport, and the post-handover record shows it was opened by a fake-medicine seal.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, passage-inspection, stretcher-handover and duty-key record desks are proposed as Chang Dahuin''s duty reference point for medicine dose-time and fever records. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Representative of Victims of Contaminated Medicine Transport. Overlay dose times and fever records in the same book, and never unload a crate that lacks an origin tally stake without the representative''s seal.\n\n**Anecdote.** In the week when summer''s muddy water and fake medicine spread, Chang Dahuin''s family collapsed after taking antipyretics on the Sinnae medical train.\n\n**Relationships.** Put the victim lines on Jeon Miri''s severity table and match the names against Mae Haru''s Jegi-dong victim ledger. Treat Ryu Eunbi''s treatment principle as the final standard for the transport car.\n\n**Ambition.** Seeks to bind the list of transfers felled by contaminated medicine into a public victim ledger, so that fake medicine can never again board the transfer car.\n\n**Fear.** That the victim list is sold into an outside purchase ledger and the representative becomes the face of the cover-up.\n\n**Intervention.** May seize contaminated medicine crates to fill the ledger, or be drawn into a cover-up deal as the victims'' representative.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −35 | Openness 50 | Force −30 | Material 0 | Community 15 | Principle 0 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 10 | Dispersion 60 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Monopoly 5 | Risk −10 | Display 5 | Persistence −15 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Chang Dahin","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Miri","basis":"placing the victims'' line on Jeon Miri''s severity chart, and"},{"from":"Chang Dahin","type":"Contract","to":"Mae Haru","basis":"Match names against Mae Haru''s Jegi-dong victim ledger"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Mae Haru","type":"Contract","to":"Chang Dahin","basis":"Match names against Chang Dahuin''s transfer victim list, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0317","name":"창다흰","title":"약재 오염 이송 피해자 대표","position":"약재 오염 이송 피해자 대표","characterId":"K316","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"약재 복용 시각·열 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-창다흰","detailRoute":"/people/person-0317","birthDate":"2096-01-24","birthday":"01-24","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":5,"effective":5},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k316-dose-and-fever-record-review","name":"복용·열 기록 대조","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"k316-priority","name":"피해 기록의 공개","description":"창다흰은 가족의 해열제 피해 뒤 복용 시각과 열 기록을 맞춘다. 피해자 대표에게 의료 처방 숙련이나 본인 질병은 부여하지 않는다.","behavior":"복용 시각과 열 기록을 같은 책에 겹치고, 원산지 말목이 없는 상자는 대표 날인 없이 내리지 않는다.","stress":"피해자 명단이 외부 구매 장부로 팔려 자신이 은폐의 얼굴이 되는 것.","relationship":"전미리의 중증도 표에 피해자 줄을 올리고, 매하루의 제기동 피해 원장과 이름을 맞춘다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 이송칸의 마지막 기준으로 둔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k316-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 약재 오염 이송 피해자 대표. 복용 시각과 열 기록을 같은 책에 겹치고, 원산지 말목이 없는 상자는 대표 날인 없이 내리지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 피해자 명단이 외부 구매 장부로 팔려 자신이 은폐의 얼굴이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 전미리의 중증도 표에 피해자 줄을 올리고, 매하루의 제기동 피해 원장과 이름을 맞춘다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 이송칸의 마지막 기준으로 둔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"창다흰은 가족의 해열제 피해 뒤 복용 시각과 열 기록을 맞춘다. 피해자 대표에게 의료 처방 숙련이나 본인 질병은 부여하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc3d-ac70-cc3d","name":"거창 창씨","crest":"clan-crests/cc3d-ac70-cc3d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-35,"개방":50,"무력":-30,"물질":0,"공동":15,"원칙":0,"공개":20,"자격":10,"분산":60,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":5,"위험":-10,"과시":5,"지속":-15,"지향":"양성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"약재 복용 시각·열 기록","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"약재 오염 이송 피해자 대표","가치관":"권위 −35 | 개방 50 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 15 | 원칙 0 | 공개 20 | 자격 10 | 분산 60 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 −5 | 독점 5 | 위험 −10 | 과시 5 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2096-01-24에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 약재 오염 이송 피해자 대표 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 창다흰의 약재 복용 시각·열 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 약재 오염 이송 피해자 대표. 복용 시각과 열 기록을 같은 책에 겹치고, 원산지 말목이 없는 상자는 대표 날인 없이 내리지 않는다.","일화":"여름의 탁수와 가짜 약이 퍼진 주간에 창다흰의 가족이 신내 의료열차에서 해열제를 먹고 쓰러졌다.","관계":"전미리의 중증도 표에 피해자 줄을 올리고, 매하루의 제기동 피해 원장과 이름을 맞춘다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 이송칸의 마지막 기준으로 둔다.","야망":"오염 약으로 쓰러진 이송 명단을 공개 피해 원장으로 묶어 가짜 약이 다시 환승칸에 타지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"피해자 명단이 외부 구매 장부로 팔려 자신이 은폐의 얼굴이 되는 것.","개입":"오염 약 상자를 압수해 원장을 채우거나, 피해자 대표를 은폐 거래에 끌어들일 수 있다."},"biography":"2096-01-24생인 창다흰은 해열제 쓴맛을 아직도 혀에 남기고, 포장만 깨끗한 약을 들것에 올리지 않는다. 온화하나 열 곡선이 어긋나면 자리에서 일어나지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 약재 복용 시각·열 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 약재 오염 이송 피해자 대표\n**생애.** 2096-01-24에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 약재 오염 이송 피해자 대표 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 창다흰의 약재 복용 시각·열 기록 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 약재 오염 이송 피해자 대표. 복용 시각과 열 기록을 같은 책에 겹치고, 원산지 말목이 없는 상자는 대표 날인 없이 내리지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 여름의 탁수와 가짜 약이 퍼진 주간에 창다흰의 가족이 신내 의료열차에서 해열제를 먹고 쓰러졌다.\n\n**관계.** 전미리의 중증도 표에 피해자 줄을 올리고, 매하루의 제기동 피해 원장과 이름을 맞춘다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 이송칸의 마지막 기준으로 둔다.\n\n**야망.** 오염 약으로 쓰러진 이송 명단을 공개 피해 원장으로 묶어 가짜 약이 다시 환승칸에 타지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 피해자 명단이 외부 구매 장부로 팔려 자신이 은폐의 얼굴이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 오염 약 상자를 압수해 원장을 채우거나, 피해자 대표를 은폐 거래에 끌어들일 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −35 | 개방 50 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 15 | 원칙 0 | 공개 20 | 자격 10 | 분산 60 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 −5 | 독점 5 | 위험 −10 | 과시 5 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"창다흰","type":"계약","to":"전미리","basis":"전미리의 중증도 표에 피해자 줄을 올리고"},{"from":"창다흰","type":"계약","to":"매하루","basis":"매하루의 제기동 피해 원장과 이름을 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"매하루","type":"계약","to":"창다흰","basis":"창다흰의 이송 피해자 명단과 이름을 맞추고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0318', 'cd08-c131-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0318","name":"Cho Naru","title":"Signing clerk of the Joint Escort Treaty","position":"Signing clerk of the Joint Escort Treaty","characterId":"K317","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Neutral escort signature and witness cross-check","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-chonaru","detailRoute":"/people/person-0318","birthDate":"2072-11-03","birthday":"11-03","age":54,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k317-agreement-transcription-review","name":"Agreement transcription review","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k317-priority","name":"Stops at missing clauses","description":"Cho Naru locked a draft with one seal and a blank clause, then compared another signature ledger. No validity is granted to the incomplete draft.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: joint convoy treaty signing clerk. He wrote the signing hour and the witness names on one line and locked the box with fewer than two stamps.","stress":"Fear. That one forged fair copy would go out first and he would become the procession of partition.","relationship":"Relations. Drafted Jang Sehwa''s joint convoy plan and matched the articles with Geun Juha''s Suseo signature ledger. Unfolded Jung Yura''s Lesser States Council notice only under seal.","effects":[]},{"id":"k317-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: joint convoy treaty signing clerk. He wrote the signing hour and the witness names on one line and locked the box with fewer than two stamps.","stress":"Fear. That one forged fair copy would go out first and he would become the procession of partition.","relationship":"Relations. Drafted Jang Sehwa''s joint convoy plan and matched the articles with Geun Juha''s Suseo signature ledger. Unfolded Jung Yura''s Lesser States Council notice only under seal.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Cho Naru locked a draft with one seal and a blank clause, then compared another signature ledger. No validity is granted to the incomplete draft.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cd08-c131-c8fc","name":"Cho Clan of Seongju","crest":"clan-crests/cd08-c131-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":30,"Force":-30,"Material":-5,"Communal":30,"Principle":0,"Public":25,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":5},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":-30,"Display":-15,"Sustained":-20,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Neutral escort signature and witness cross-check","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Signing clerk of the Joint Escort Treaty","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −30 | Material −5 | Community 30 | Principle 0 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 30 | Transformation 5","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly 10 | Risk −30 | Display −15 | Persistence −20 | Orientation Heterosexual | Bonding Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2072-11-03. Raised at the Jegi-dong infirmary. At the 2126 opening, holds the duty post of Joint Escort Treaty Signing Clerk, and the post-handover record shows it was opened by a fake-medicine seal.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, passage-inspection, stretcher-handover and duty-key record desks are proposed as Cho Naru''s duty reference point for neutral-escort signing and witness verification. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Neutral Escort Pact Signing Clerk. Write the signing time and the witness''s name on the same line, and lock the box if there are fewer than two seals.","Anecdote":"The fair copy of Jang Sehwa''s neutral escort draft comes back with only one seal and one clause-number slot left blank. Cho Naru sets down the brush, locks the box, then fetches Geun Juha''s Suseo signing ledger to cross-check the empty number.","Relationships":"Make a fair copy of Jang Sehwa''s neutral escort draft, and match its clauses against Geun Juha''s Suseo signing ledger. Open Jeong Yura''s meeting notice only in its sealed state.","Ambition":"Seeks to keep the neutral escort text valid only in the Sinnae clerk ledger, so that escort fees from outside the route license cannot buy the signature column.","Fear":"That a single forged fair copy goes out first and the clerk becomes a stooge for the route split.","Intervention":"May expose a locked note, or escort the signing witness to protect the clerk ledger."},"biography":"Born on 2072-11-03, Cho Naru does not count an oral agreement made before the ink dries as a record. Quiet, but sets down the brush whenever a clause number is missing.\n\n- Livelihood: Neutral escort signing and witness verification\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Joint Escort Treaty Signing Clerk\n**Life.** Born on 2072-11-03. Raised at the Jegi-dong infirmary. At the 2126 opening, holds the duty post of Joint Escort Treaty Signing Clerk, and the post-handover record shows it was opened by a fake-medicine seal.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift-change, maintenance, passage-inspection, stretcher-handover and duty-key record desks are proposed as Cho Naru''s duty reference point for neutral-escort signing and witness verification. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Neutral Escort Pact Signing Clerk. Write the signing time and the witness''s name on the same line, and lock the box if there are fewer than two seals.\n\n**Anecdote.** The fair copy of Jang Sehwa''s neutral escort draft comes back with only one seal and one clause-number slot left blank. Cho Naru sets down the brush, locks the box, then fetches Geun Juha''s Suseo signing ledger to cross-check the empty number.\n\n**Relationships.** Make a fair copy of Jang Sehwa''s neutral escort draft, and match its clauses against Geun Juha''s Suseo signing ledger. Open Jeong Yura''s meeting notice only in its sealed state.\n\n**Ambition.** Seeks to keep the neutral escort text valid only in the Sinnae clerk ledger, so that escort fees from outside the route license cannot buy the signature column.\n\n**Fear.** That a single forged fair copy goes out first and the clerk becomes a stooge for the route split.\n\n**Intervention.** May expose a locked note, or escort the signing witness to protect the clerk ledger.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −30 | Material −5 | Community 30 | Principle 0 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 20 | Dispersion 30 | Transformation 5\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Monopoly 10 | Risk −30 | Display −15 | Persistence −20 | Orientation Heterosexual | Bonding Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Cho Naru","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Fair-copies Jang Sehwa''s joint escort draft, and"},{"from":"Cho Naru","type":"Contract","to":"Geun Juha","basis":"Match clauses against Geun Juha''s Suseo signing ledger"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Chang Haeon","type":"Contract","to":"Cho Naru","basis":"Match Cho Naru''s escort clause against its number"},{"from":"Geun Ba-reum","type":"Contract","to":"Cho Naru","basis":"Match Cho Naru''s Sinnae clerk ledger against the clause number, and"},{"from":"Geun Juha","type":"Contract","to":"Cho Naru","basis":"Gather Cho Naru''s escort clause and Chang Goun''s food clause into a single ledger"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0318","name":"초나루","title":"공동호송조약 서명 서기","position":"공동호송조약 서명 서기","characterId":"K317","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"중립 호송 서명·증인 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-초나루","detailRoute":"/people/person-0318","birthDate":"2072-11-03","birthday":"11-03","age":54,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k317-agreement-transcription-review","name":"약정 정서 대조","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k317-priority","name":"빈 조항에 멈춤","description":"초나루는 인장 하나와 빈 조항 번호를 보고 함을 잠근 뒤 다른 서명 원장과 대조했다. 성립하지 않은 초안의 효력을 만들지 않는다.","behavior":"서명 시각과 증인 이름을 같은 줄에 적고, 인장이 둘 미만이면 함을 잠근다.","stress":"위조 정서본 한 장이 먼저 나가 자신이 노선 분할의 들러리가 되는 것.","relationship":"장세화의 중립 호송 초안을 정서하고, 근주하의 수서 서명 원장과 조항을 맞춘다. 정유라의 회의 통지를 봉인 상태로만 펼친다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k317-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 중립 호송 약정 서명 서기. 서명 시각과 증인 이름을 같은 줄에 적고, 인장이 둘 미만이면 함을 잠근다.","stress":"공포. 위조 정서본 한 장이 먼저 나가 자신이 노선 분할의 들러리가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 장세화의 중립 호송 초안을 정서하고, 근주하의 수서 서명 원장과 조항을 맞춘다. 정유라의 회의 통지를 봉인 상태로만 펼친다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"초나루는 인장 하나와 빈 조항 번호를 보고 함을 잠근 뒤 다른 서명 원장과 대조했다. 성립하지 않은 초안의 효력을 만들지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cd08-c131-c8fc","name":"성주 초씨","crest":"clan-crests/cd08-c131-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":30,"무력":-30,"물질":-5,"공동":30,"원칙":0,"공개":25,"자격":20,"분산":30,"변혁":5},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":10,"위험":-30,"과시":-15,"지속":-20,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"중립 호송 서명·증인 대조","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"공동호송조약 서명 서기","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −5 | 공동 30 | 원칙 0 | 공개 25 | 자격 20 | 분산 30 | 변혁 5","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −15 | 지속 −20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2072-11-03에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 공동호송조약 서명 서기 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 초나루의 중립 호송 서명·증인 대조 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 중립 호송 약정 서명 서기. 서명 시각과 증인 이름을 같은 줄에 적고, 인장이 둘 미만이면 함을 잠근다.","일화":"장세화의 중립 호송 초안 정서본이 인장 하나만 받고 조항 번호 한 칸을 공란으로 남긴 채 돌아온다. 초나루는 붓을 내려놓고 함을 잠근 뒤, 근주하의 수서 서명 원장을 가져와 빈 번호를 대조한다.","관계":"장세화의 중립 호송 초안을 정서하고, 근주하의 수서 서명 원장과 조항을 맞춘다. 정유라의 회의 통지를 봉인 상태로만 펼친다.","야망":"중립 호송 문안을 신내 서기 원장에만 유효하게 남겨 노선 면허 밖의 호송료가 서명란을 사지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"위조 정서본 한 장이 먼저 나가 자신이 노선 분할의 들러리가 되는 것.","개입":"잠긴 쪽지를 폭로하거나, 서명 증인을 호송해 서기 원장을 지킬 수 있다."},"biography":"2072-11-03생인 초나루는 먹물이 마르기 전의 구두 합의를 서기로 치지 않는다. 조용하나 조항 번호가 비면 붓을 내려놓는다.\n\n- 생업: 중립 호송 서명·증인 대조\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 공동호송조약 서명 서기\n**생애.** 2072-11-03에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 공동호송조약 서명 서기 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 초나루의 중립 호송 서명·증인 대조 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 중립 호송 약정 서명 서기. 서명 시각과 증인 이름을 같은 줄에 적고, 인장이 둘 미만이면 함을 잠근다.\n\n**일화.** 장세화의 중립 호송 초안 정서본이 인장 하나만 받고 조항 번호 한 칸을 공란으로 남긴 채 돌아온다. 초나루는 붓을 내려놓고 함을 잠근 뒤, 근주하의 수서 서명 원장을 가져와 빈 번호를 대조한다.\n\n**관계.** 장세화의 중립 호송 초안을 정서하고, 근주하의 수서 서명 원장과 조항을 맞춘다. 정유라의 회의 통지를 봉인 상태로만 펼친다.\n\n**야망.** 중립 호송 문안을 신내 서기 원장에만 유효하게 남겨 노선 면허 밖의 호송료가 서명란을 사지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 위조 정서본 한 장이 먼저 나가 자신이 노선 분할의 들러리가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 잠긴 쪽지를 폭로하거나, 서명 증인을 호송해 서기 원장을 지킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −30 | 물질 −5 | 공동 30 | 원칙 0 | 공개 25 | 자격 20 | 분산 30 | 변혁 5\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −15 | 지속 −20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"초나루","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":"장세화의 공동호송 초안을 정서하고"},{"from":"초나루","type":"계약","to":"근주하","basis":"근주하의 수서 서명 원장과 조항을 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"창해온","type":"계약","to":"초나루","basis":"초나루의 호송 조항과 번호를 맞춘다"},{"from":"근바름","type":"계약","to":"초나루","basis":"초나루의 신내 서기 원장과 조항 번호를 맞추고"},{"from":"근주하","type":"계약","to":"초나루","basis":"초나루의 호송 조항과 창고운의 식량 조항을 한 원장에 모은다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0319', 'c11d-cda9-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0319","name":"Seok Bomu","title":"Representative of the crowd conscripted at the Hegemony War opening","position":"Representative of the crowd conscripted at the Hegemony War opening","characterId":"K318","rank":"Squad Leader","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Conscription slip and entry headcount cross-check","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-seokbomu","detailRoute":"/people/person-0319","birthDate":"2072-08-07","birthday":"08-07","age":54,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k318-requisition-headcount-review","name":"Requisition headcount review","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k318-priority","name":"Verification before dispersal","description":"Seok Bomu checked actual entries and empty homes rather than the broadcast, retaining the crowd until escort orders. Shared refusal wording is not combat command.","behavior":"Office. Rank: squad leader. Title:  reconstruction-era requisition crowd representative. He checked requisition notes against actual entry numbers every evening and did not disperse the crowd before Jang Sehwa''s neutrality declaration came down.","stress":"Fear. That his own name, once he stepped out as representative, would top the protection force''s selection roster.","relationship":"Relations. Split the crowd queue with Ha Seon''s convoy squad and matched the refusal wording with Chang Eunchan''s Suseo requisition representatives. Sent Bae Woojin''s protection requisition back as a grudge.","effects":[]},{"id":"k318-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: squad leader. Title:  reconstruction-era requisition crowd representative. He checked requisition notes against actual entry numbers every evening and did not disperse the crowd before Jang Sehwa''s neutrality declaration came down.","stress":"Fear. That his own name, once he stepped out as representative, would top the protection force''s selection roster.","relationship":"Relations. Split the crowd queue with Ha Seon''s convoy squad and matched the refusal wording with Chang Eunchan''s Suseo requisition representatives. Sent Bae Woojin''s protection requisition back as a grudge.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Seok Bomu checked actual entries and empty homes rather than the broadcast, retaining the crowd until escort orders. Shared refusal wording is not combat command.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c11d-cda9-c8fc","name":"Seok Clan of Chungju","crest":"clan-crests/c11d-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":35,"Force":-30,"Material":0,"Communal":25,"Principle":10,"Public":25,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":45,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":-35,"Risk":10,"Display":-10,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Conscription slip and entry headcount cross-check","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Squad Leader","Title":"Representative of the crowd conscripted at the Hegemony War opening","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 35 | Force −30 | Material 0 | Community 25 | Principle 10 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 25 | Dispersion 45 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 45 | Monopoly −35 | Risk 10 | Display −10 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Multilateral"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2072-08-07. Raised on Waiting Hall duty. At the 2126 opening, he took the duty of Hegemony War Opening Requisition Crowd Representative; the post-handover record remains, opened as a substitute duty after an unexcused shift absence.\n- The Mangu transfer queue, patient and cargo classification, weight, waybill, price, and public testimony record desk in Sangbong 1-dong is proposed as Seok Bomu''s reference post for checking requisition slips against entry headcounts. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Squad Leader. Title: Requisition Crowd Representative. Check the requisition slips against actual entry headcounts every evening, and do not disperse the crowd until Jang Sehwa''s escort order comes down.","Anecdote":"The transfer station broadcast calls Ha Seon''s escort corps \"troops\" and announces the crowd''s dispersal. Seok Bomu, holding the requisition slips, counts the empty houses first and matches them against actual entry headcounts; keeping the crowd in place until Jang Sehwa''s escort order arrives, he aligns refusal wording with Chang Eunchan.","Relationships":"Keep the crowd line separate from Ha Seon''s escort corps, and align refusal wording with Chang Eunchan, the Suseo requisition representative. Turn Bae Ujin''s protective requisition away as a grievance.","Ambition":"He aims to bind the transfer crowd''s requisition list into a public refusal ledger so that the neutral escort does not turn into a mobilization window.","Fear":"That his own name, as the one who stepped forward as representative, will end up at the top of the mobilization draft roster.","Intervention":"He can bring the refusal ledger before the representative council, or disperse the crowd and let the requisition train pass."},"biography":"Seok Bomu, born on 2072-08-07, counts empty houses before reading the writing on requisition slips, and hears the broadcast calling the escort corps \"troops\" as an insult. The longer the line grows, the lower his voice gets.\n\n- Livelihood: Checking requisition slips against entry headcounts\n- Affiliation: Sinnae Transit\n- Rank: Squad Leader\n- Title: Hegemony War Opening Requisition Crowd Representative\n**Life.** Born on 2072-08-07. Raised on Waiting Hall duty. At the 2126 opening, he took the duty of Hegemony War Opening Requisition Crowd Representative; the post-handover record remains, opened as a substitute duty after an unexcused shift absence.\n- The Mangu transfer queue, patient and cargo classification, weight, waybill, price, and public testimony record desk in Sangbong 1-dong is proposed as Seok Bomu''s reference post for checking requisition slips against entry headcounts. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Squad Leader. Title: Requisition Crowd Representative. Check the requisition slips against actual entry headcounts every evening, and do not disperse the crowd until Jang Sehwa''s escort order comes down.\n\n**Anecdote.** The transfer station broadcast calls Ha Seon''s escort corps \"troops\" and announces the crowd''s dispersal. Seok Bomu, holding the requisition slips, counts the empty houses first and matches them against actual entry headcounts; keeping the crowd in place until Jang Sehwa''s escort order arrives, he aligns refusal wording with Chang Eunchan.\n\n**Relations.** Keep the crowd line separate from Ha Seon''s escort corps, and align refusal wording with Chang Eunchan, the Suseo requisition representative. Turn Bae Ujin''s protective requisition away as a grievance.\n\n**Ambition.** He aims to bind the transfer crowd''s requisition list into a public refusal ledger so that the neutral escort does not turn into a mobilization window.\n\n**Fear.** That his own name, as the one who stepped forward as representative, will end up at the top of the mobilization draft roster.\n\n**Intervention.** He can bring the refusal ledger before the representative council, or disperse the crowd and let the requisition train pass.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 35 | Force −30 | Material 0 | Community 25 | Principle 10 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 25 | Dispersion 45 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Monopoly −35 | Risk 10 | Display −10 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Multilateral\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seok Bomu","type":"Contract","to":"Ha Seon","basis":"Split the crowd line with Ha Seon''s escort unit, and"},{"from":"Seok Bomu","type":"Contract","to":"Chang Eunchan","basis":"Align refusal wording with Chang Eunchan, the Suseo requisition representative"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Heung Daon","type":"Contract","to":"Seok Bomu","basis":"Align the wording with Seok Bomu''s Sinnae refusal wording"},{"from":"Chang Ji-an","type":"Contract","to":"Seok Bomu","basis":"Align the wording with Seok Bomu''s Transfer Station refusal wording"},{"from":"Chang Eunchan","type":"Contract","to":"Seok Bomu","basis":"Align the wording with Seok Bomu''s Sinnae refusal wording"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0319","name":"석봄우","title":"패권전 개막 징발 인파 대표","position":"패권전 개막 징발 인파 대표","characterId":"K318","rank":"반장","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"징발 쪽지·출입 인원 대조","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-석봄우","detailRoute":"/people/person-0319","birthDate":"2072-08-07","birthday":"08-07","age":54,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k318-requisition-headcount-review","name":"징발 인원 대조","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k318-priority","name":"해산보다 확인","description":"석봄우는 방송보다 실제 출입과 빈집을 확인하고 호송 지시까지 인파를 유지했다. 거부 문구의 합의는 집단 전투 지휘와 다르다.","behavior":"징발 쪽지와 실제 출입 인원을 저녁마다 대조하고, 장세화의 호송 지시가 내려오기 전에는 인파를 해산시키지 않는다.","stress":"대표로 나선 자신의 이름이 동원 선발 명부의 맨 위가 되는 것.","relationship":"하세온의 호송대와 인파 줄을 나누고, 창은찬의 수서 징발 대표와 거부 문구를 맞춘다. 배우진의 보호 징발을 원한으로 돌려보낸다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k318-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 반장. 직함은 징발 인파 대표. 징발 쪽지와 실제 출입 인원을 저녁마다 대조하고, 장세화의 호송 지시가 내려오기 전에는 인파를 해산시키지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 대표로 나선 자신의 이름이 동원 선발 명부의 맨 위가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 하세온의 호송대와 인파 줄을 나누고, 창은찬의 수서 징발 대표와 거부 문구를 맞춘다. 배우진의 보호 징발을 원한으로 돌려보낸다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"석봄우는 방송보다 실제 출입과 빈집을 확인하고 호송 지시까지 인파를 유지했다. 거부 문구의 합의는 집단 전투 지휘와 다르다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c11d-cda9-c8fc","name":"충주 석씨","crest":"clan-crests/c11d-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":35,"무력":-30,"물질":0,"공동":25,"원칙":10,"공개":25,"자격":25,"분산":45,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":-35,"위험":10,"과시":-10,"지속":35,"지향":"유동","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"징발 쪽지·출입 인원 대조","소속":"정부","품계":"반장","직함":"패권전 개막 징발 인파 대표","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 35 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 25 | 자격 25 | 분산 45 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 −35 | 위험 10 | 과시 −10 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2072-08-07에 태어났다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 패권전 개막 징발 인파 대표 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 석봄우의 징발 쪽지·출입 인원 대조 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 반장. 직함은 징발 인파 대표. 징발 쪽지와 실제 출입 인원을 저녁마다 대조하고, 장세화의 호송 지시가 내려오기 전에는 인파를 해산시키지 않는다.","일화":"환승역 방송이 하세온의 호송대를 병력이라 부르며 인파 해산을 알린다. 석봄우는 징발 쪽지를 들고 빈집부터 세어 실제 출입 인원과 맞추고, 장세화의 호송 지시가 닿을 때까지 인파를 자리에 둔 채 창은찬과 거부 문구를 맞춘다.","관계":"하세온의 호송대와 인파 줄을 나누고, 창은찬의 수서 징발 대표와 거부 문구를 맞춘다. 배우진의 보호 징발을 원한으로 돌려보낸다.","야망":"환승 인파의 징발 명단을 공개 거부 원장으로 묶어 중립 호송이 동원 창구로 바뀌지 않게 하려 한다.","공포":"대표로 나선 자신의 이름이 동원 선발 명부의 맨 위가 되는 것.","개입":"거부 원장을 대표 회의에 올리거나, 인파를 해산시켜 징발 열차를 통과시킬 수 있다."},"biography":"2072-08-07생인 석봄우는 징발 쪽지의 글씨보다 빈집을 먼저 세고, 호송대를 병력으로 부르라는 방송을 모욕으로 듣는다. 줄이 길어질수록 목소리는 낮아진다.\n\n- 생업: 징발 쪽지·출입 인원 대조\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 반장\n- 직함: 패권전 개막 징발 인파 대표\n**생애.** 2072-08-07에 태어났다. 대합실 당직에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 패권전 개막 징발 인파 대표 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 석봄우의 징발 쪽지·출입 인원 대조 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 반장. 직함은 징발 인파 대표. 징발 쪽지와 실제 출입 인원을 저녁마다 대조하고, 장세화의 호송 지시가 내려오기 전에는 인파를 해산시키지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 환승역 방송이 하세온의 호송대를 병력이라 부르며 인파 해산을 알린다. 석봄우는 징발 쪽지를 들고 빈집부터 세어 실제 출입 인원과 맞추고, 장세화의 호송 지시가 닿을 때까지 인파를 자리에 둔 채 창은찬과 거부 문구를 맞춘다.\n\n**관계.** 하세온의 호송대와 인파 줄을 나누고, 창은찬의 수서 징발 대표와 거부 문구를 맞춘다. 배우진의 보호 징발을 원한으로 돌려보낸다.\n\n**야망.** 환승 인파의 징발 명단을 공개 거부 원장으로 묶어 중립 호송이 동원 창구로 바뀌지 않게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 대표로 나선 자신의 이름이 동원 선발 명부의 맨 위가 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 거부 원장을 대표 회의에 올리거나, 인파를 해산시켜 징발 열차를 통과시킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 35 | 무력 −30 | 물질 0 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 25 | 자격 25 | 분산 45 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 −35 | 위험 10 | 과시 −10 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"석봄우","type":"계약","to":"하세온","basis":"하세온의 호송대와 인파 줄을 나누고"},{"from":"석봄우","type":"계약","to":"창은찬","basis":"창은찬의 수서 징발 대표와 거부 문구를 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"흥다온","type":"계약","to":"석봄우","basis":"석봄우의 신내 거부 문구와 문장을 맞춘다"},{"from":"창지안","type":"계약","to":"석봄우","basis":"석봄우의 환승 거부 문구와 문장을 맞춘다"},{"from":"창은찬","type":"계약","to":"석봄우","basis":"석봄우의 신내 거부 문구와 문장을 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0320', 'adfc-ccad-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0320","name":"Geun Sori","title":"Party involved in the failed auction at the Neutral Market","position":"Party involved in the failed auction at the Neutral Market","characterId":"K319","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Market auction failure time and highest bid posting","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-geunsori","detailRoute":"/people/person-0320","birthDate":"2085-02-01","birthday":"02-01","age":41,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k319-failed-auction-item-review","name":"Failed auction item review","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k319-priority","name":"Public reauction before preemption","description":"Geun Sori sealed military bids and published failed auction times and top offers, comparing external items without a confirmed sale.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: neutral market auction failed-bid party. She wrote the failed-bid hours and top bids on the wall and sealed any bid sheet stamped with a weapons clause until Bok Yong''s market posting.","stress":"Fear. That after the failed-bid records were erased she would become the guarantor of auctions she never saw.","relationship":"Relations. Matched the failed-bid bell with Bok Yong''s neutral market prices and compared items with Heung Yena''s Garak failed-bid ledger. Consulted O Haerin''s price broadcasts only at market hours.","effects":[]},{"id":"k319-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: neutral market auction failed-bid party. She wrote the failed-bid hours and top bids on the wall and sealed any bid sheet stamped with a weapons clause until Bok Yong''s market posting.","stress":"Fear. That after the failed-bid records were erased she would become the guarantor of auctions she never saw.","relationship":"Relations. Matched the failed-bid bell with Bok Yong''s neutral market prices and compared items with Heung Yena''s Garak failed-bid ledger. Consulted O Haerin''s price broadcasts only at market hours.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Geun Sori sealed military bids and published failed auction times and top offers, comparing external items without a confirmed sale.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"adfc-ccad-c8fc","name":"Geun Clan of Cheongju","crest":"clan-crests/adfc-ccad-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":30,"Force":-30,"Material":10,"Communal":20,"Principle":0,"Public":15,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":35,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-25,"Display":30,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Market auction failure time and highest bid posting","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Party involved in the failed auction at the Neutral Market","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 30 | Force −30 | Material 10 | Community 20 | Principle 0 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 15 | Dispersion 35 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −25 | Display 30 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2085-02-01. Raised at the Noryangjin pier. At the 2126 opening, she took the duty of Neutral Market Auction Failed-Bid Official; the post-handover record remains, opened with the public re-check of the scales.\n- The Mangu transfer queue, patient and cargo classification, weight, waybill, price, and public testimony record desk in Sangbong 1-dong is proposed as Geun Sori''s reference post for posting market failed-bid times and highest prices. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records; it does not confirm running trains, new facilities, arms, tolls, market monopoly rights, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Neutral Market Auction Failed-Bid Official. Write the failed-bid times and highest prices on the wall, and seal any bid bearing a weapon crest until Bok Yong''s market posting.","Anecdote":"A bid bearing a weapon crest comes in, offering to buy the entire compartment of emergency supplies that failed to sell. Geun Sori seals the bid to await Bok Yong''s market posting, writes the failed-bid time and highest price on the wall, then compares items with Heung Yena''s Garak failed-bid ledger.","Relationships":"Align the failed-bid bell with Bok Yong''s Neutral Market prices, and compare items with Heung Yena''s Garak failed-bid ledger. Refer to Oh Haerin''s price broadcasts only during market hours.","Ambition":"She intends to release the unsold emergency-supply compartment only through open re-auction, so that outside pre-emptive purchase cannot buy up the floor price whole.","Fear":"That after the failed-bid records are erased, she will become the guarantor of a winning bid she had no part in.","Intervention":"She can make the failed-bid ledger public to block pre-emption, or seat an outside bid on the empty scale."},"biography":"Geunsol, born 2085-02-01, watches the empty scale longer than the failed-auction bell, and drives out brokers who dress up munitions-crest bids as market price. He reads the credit ledger before he reads a person''s face.\n\n- Occupation: Posting market failed-auction times and top bids\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Neutral Market Failed-Auction Officer\n**Life.** Born on 2085-02-01. Grew up at the Noryangjin wharf. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty of Neutral Market Failed-Auction Officer, and the post-handover record remains, opened by a public re-inspection of the scales.\n- The Mangu transfer queue, patient/cargo classification, weight, waybill, market price and public testimony record desk in Sangbong 1-dong is proposed as Geunsol''s duty reference point for posting market failed-auction times and top bids. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, armaments, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs or tenure rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Neutral Market Failed-Auction Officer. He writes failed-auction times and top bids on the wall, and seals any bid bearing a weapons crest until Bogyong posts it to the market.\n\n**Anecdote.** A bid bearing a weapons crest comes in, offering to buy the entire failed-auction emergency supply bay outright. Geunsol seals the bid and makes it wait for Bogyong''s market posting, writes the failed-auction time and top bid on the wall, and then compares the items against Heung Yena''s Garak failed-auction ledger.\n\n**Relations.** He matches the failed-auction bell to Bogyong''s Neutral Market prices, and compares items against Heung Yena''s Garak failed-auction ledger. He consults O Haerin''s price broadcasts only during market hours.\n\n**Ambition.** He wants to release the failed-auction emergency supply bay only through public re-auction, so that outside pre-purchasers cannot buy up the floor price wholesale.\n\n**Fear.** Becoming the guarantor of a winning bid he is absent from, after the failed-auction records have been erased.\n\n**Intervention.** You can publish the failed-auction ledger to block pre-purchase, or seat an outside bid at the empty scale.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 30 | Force −30 | Material 10 | Communal 20 | Principle 0 | Transparency 15 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Possessiveness −20 | Risk −25 | Display 30 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: Fluid | Bonding: Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Geun Sori","type":"Contract","to":"Bok Yong","basis":"Matches Bok Yong''s neutral market prices with the failed-bid bell, and"},{"from":"Geun Sori","type":"Contract","to":"Heung Yena","basis":"Compare items against Heung Yena''s Garak failed-auction ledger"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Heung Yena","type":"Contract","to":"Geun Sori","basis":"Compare items against Geunsol''s Sinnae failed-auction ledger"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0320","name":"근솔이","title":"중립시장 경매 유찰 관계자","position":"중립시장 경매 유찰 관계자","characterId":"K319","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"시장 유찰 시각·최고가 게시","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-근솔이","detailRoute":"/people/person-0320","birthDate":"2085-02-01","birthday":"02-01","age":41,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k319-failed-auction-item-review","name":"유찰 품목 대조","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"k319-priority","name":"선매보다 공개 재경매","description":"근솔이는 군수 입찰을 봉하고 유찰 시각과 최고가를 공개했다. 외부 유찰 원장과 품목을 비교하되 낙찰 결과는 미확인이다.","behavior":"유찰 시각과 최고가를 벽에 적고, 무기 문장이 찍힌 입찰서는 복용의 시장 게시 전까지 봉한다.","stress":"유찰 기록이 지워진 뒤 자신이 없는 낙찰의 보증인이 되는 것.","relationship":"복용의 중립시장 시세와 유찰 종을 맞추고, 흥예나의 가락 유찰 원장과 품목을 비교한다. 오해린의 시세 방송은 시장 시간에만 참고한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k319-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 중립시장 경매 유찰 관계자. 유찰 시각과 최고가를 벽에 적고, 무기 문장이 찍힌 입찰서는 복용의 시장 게시 전까지 봉한다.","stress":"공포. 유찰 기록이 지워진 뒤 자신이 없는 낙찰의 보증인이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 복용의 중립시장 시세와 유찰 종을 맞추고, 흥예나의 가락 유찰 원장과 품목을 비교한다. 오해린의 시세 방송은 시장 시간에만 참고한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"근솔이는 군수 입찰을 봉하고 유찰 시각과 최고가를 공개했다. 외부 유찰 원장과 품목을 비교하되 낙찰 결과는 미확인이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"adfc-ccad-c8fc","name":"청주 근씨","crest":"clan-crests/adfc-ccad-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":30,"무력":-30,"물질":10,"공동":20,"원칙":0,"공개":15,"자격":15,"분산":35,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":-20,"위험":-25,"과시":30,"지속":-10,"지향":"유동","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"시장 유찰 시각·최고가 게시","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"중립시장 경매 유찰 관계자","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 30 | 무력 −30 | 물질 10 | 공동 20 | 원칙 0 | 공개 15 | 자격 15 | 분산 35 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −25 | 과시 30 | 지속 −10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2085-02-01에 태어났다. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 중립시장 경매 유찰 관계자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 근솔이의 시장 유찰 시각·최고가 게시 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 중립시장 경매 유찰 관계자. 유찰 시각과 최고가를 벽에 적고, 무기 문장이 찍힌 입찰서는 복용의 시장 게시 전까지 봉한다.","일화":"무기 문장이 찍힌 입찰서가 유찰된 응급 물자 칸을 통째로 사겠다며 들어온다. 근솔이는 입찰서를 봉해 복용의 시장 게시를 기다리게 하고, 유찰 시각과 최고가를 벽에 적은 다음 흥예나의 가락 유찰 원장과 품목을 비교한다.","관계":"복용의 중립시장 시세와 유찰 종을 맞추고, 흥예나의 가락 유찰 원장과 품목을 비교한다. 오해린의 시세 방송은 시장 시간에만 참고한다.","야망":"유찰된 응급 물자 칸을 공개 재경매로만 풀어 외부 선매가 바닥 시세를 통째로 사지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"유찰 기록이 지워진 뒤 자신이 없는 낙찰의 보증인이 되는 것.","개입":"유찰 원장을 공개해 선매를 막거나, 빈 저울에 외부 입찰을 앉힐 수 있다."},"biography":"2085-02-01생인 근솔이는 유찰 종소리보다 빈 저울을 오래 보고, 군수 문장 입찰을 시세로 포장하는 중개인을 쫓아낸다. 외상 장부를 사람 얼굴보다 먼저 읽는다.\n\n- 생업: 시장 유찰 시각·최고가 게시\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 중립시장 경매 유찰 관계자\n**생애.** 2085-02-01에 태어났다. 노량진 선창에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 중립시장 경매 유찰 관계자 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 상봉1동의 망우 환승 대기열·환자·화물 구분·중량·송장·시세·공개 증언 기록대가 근솔이의 시장 유찰 시각·최고가 게시 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 중립시장 경매 유찰 관계자. 유찰 시각과 최고가를 벽에 적고, 무기 문장이 찍힌 입찰서는 복용의 시장 게시 전까지 봉한다.\n\n**일화.** 무기 문장이 찍힌 입찰서가 유찰된 응급 물자 칸을 통째로 사겠다며 들어온다. 근솔이는 입찰서를 봉해 복용의 시장 게시를 기다리게 하고, 유찰 시각과 최고가를 벽에 적은 다음 흥예나의 가락 유찰 원장과 품목을 비교한다.\n\n**관계.** 복용의 중립시장 시세와 유찰 종을 맞추고, 흥예나의 가락 유찰 원장과 품목을 비교한다. 오해린의 시세 방송은 시장 시간에만 참고한다.\n\n**야망.** 유찰된 응급 물자 칸을 공개 재경매로만 풀어 외부 선매가 바닥 시세를 통째로 사지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 유찰 기록이 지워진 뒤 자신이 없는 낙찰의 보증인이 되는 것.\n\n**개입.** 유찰 원장을 공개해 선매를 막거나, 빈 저울에 외부 입찰을 앉힐 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 30 | 무력 −30 | 물질 10 | 공동 20 | 원칙 0 | 공개 15 | 자격 15 | 분산 35 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −25 | 과시 30 | 지속 −10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"근솔이","type":"계약","to":"복용","basis":"복용의 중립시장 시세와 유찰 종을 맞추고"},{"from":"근솔이","type":"계약","to":"흥예나","basis":"흥예나의 가락 유찰 원장과 품목을 비교한다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"흥예나","type":"계약","to":"근솔이","basis":"근솔이의 신내 유찰 원장과 품목을 비교한다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0321', 'creative-d765-c218-c0c9', '{"id":"person-0321","name":"Heung Jiwan","title":"Representative of the transfer evacuation crowd","position":"Representative of the transfer evacuation crowd","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Evacuation time and jurisdiction return records","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"S12","stateName":"Sinnae Transport","detailRoute":"/people/person-0321","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}}}}', '{"id":"person-0321","name":"흥지완","title":"환승 피난 인파 대표","position":"환승 피난 인파 대표","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"피난 시각·관할 반환 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"S12","stateName":"신내운수","detailRoute":"/people/person-0321","sourceStatus":"ck3-table-derived","characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":3,"effective":3},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":7,"effective":7},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}}}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0322', 'c11c-b2ec-c131', '{"id":"person-0322","name":"Seo Ongyeol","title":"Medical Transport Duty Officer","position":"Medical Transport Duty Officer","characterId":"K321","rank":"Escort","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Medical transport roster cross-check and door key handover","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#inmul-seoongyeol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0322","birthDate":"2089-10-18","birthday":"10-18","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K296","recipientName":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Interlocks with Jang Sehwa''s dispatch duty, but the stretcher key is drawn only from the duty box.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-12.json","anchor":"character-seoongyeol-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k321-transfer-roster-reconciliation","name":"Transfer roster reconciliation","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k321-priority","name":"Refuses unnamed transfers","description":"Seo Ongyeol recorded the time he returned an unnamed request and searched dispatch and duty lists for the name. Patient identification is distinct from treatment.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: medical transfer duty officer. He took no unnamed transfer and opened the door only when two rosters matched.","stress":"Fear. That patient transport would mix into one line with quarantine waiting and the hours would be erased.","relationship":"Relations. Meshed with Jang Sehwa''s dispatch medical work, but drew the stretcher keys only from the duty box.","effects":[]},{"id":"k321-accountability","name":"Procedural accountability","description":"Makes responsibility traceable through the documented checks, records, and attendance conditions.","behavior":"Office. Rank: convoy hand. Title: medical transfer duty officer. He took no unnamed transfer and opened the door only when two rosters matched.","stress":"Fear. That patient transport would mix into one line with quarantine waiting and the hours would be erased.","relationship":"Relations. Meshed with Jang Sehwa''s dispatch medical work, but drew the stretcher keys only from the duty box.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Seo Ongyeol recorded the time he returned an unnamed request and searched dispatch and duty lists for the name. Patient identification is distinct from treatment.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c11c-b2ec-c131","name":"Dalseong Seo Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c11c-b2ec-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":55,"Force":-40,"Material":-10,"Communal":20,"Principle":10,"Public":25,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":5,"Display":15,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical transport roster cross-check and door key handover","Affiliation":"The Government","Rank":"Escort","Title":"Medical Transport Duty Officer","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 55 | Force −40 | Material −10 | Communal 20 | Principle 10 | Transparency 25 | Qualification 30 | Decentralization 30 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 30 | Possessiveness 30 | Risk 5 | Display 15 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Bonding: Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2089-10-18. Grew up at the Jegi-dong infirmary. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty of Medical Transfer Duty Officer, and the post-handover record remains, opened with a counterfeit-medicine seal.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handover and duty key record desk is proposed as Seo Ongyeol''s duty reference point for medical transfer roster cross-checks and door-key handovers. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, armaments, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs or tenure rights.","Offices":"Rank: Escort. Title: Medical Transfer Duty Officer. Takes no nameless transfers; opens the door only when two rosters match.","Anecdote":"A transfer request with a blank name field attaches itself to the end of the quarantine queue and asks for a stretcher. Seo Ongyeol writes down the minute the request was turned away, then lays Jang Sehwa''s dispatch roster and the duty roster side by side to find that patient''s name.","Relationships":"Interlocks with Jang Sehwa''s dispatch duty, but the stretcher key is drawn only from the duty box.","Ambition":"He wants to keep medical transfer duty as a separate single lane, apart from the transfer-window queue.","Fear":"The fear that patient escorts will be mixed into one line with the quarantine queue and the time will be erased.","Intervention":"You can find the roster of the patient who was turned away, or open the separate lane."},"biography":"Seo Ongyeol, born 2089-10-18, records transfer times to the minute and never leaves an empty stretcher at the station past the next window. Few words, long records.\n\n- Occupation: Medical transfer roster cross-checks and door-key handovers\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Escort\n- Title: Medical Transfer Duty Officer\n**Life.** Born on 2089-10-18. Grew up at the Jegi-dong infirmary. At the 2126 opening he holds the duty of Medical Transfer Duty Officer, and the post-handover record remains, opened with a counterfeit-medicine seal.\n- The Sinnae 1-dong dispatch, shift, maintenance, passage screening, stretcher handover and duty key record desk is proposed as Seo Ongyeol''s duty reference point for medical transfer roster cross-checks and door-key handovers. This is a proposal to cross-check Permanent Winter handover records, and it does not fix running trains, new facilities, armaments, tolls, market monopolies, residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs or tenure rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Escort. Title: Medical Transfer Duty Officer. Takes no nameless transfers; opens the door only when two rosters match.\n\n**Anecdote.** A transfer request with a blank name field attaches itself to the end of the quarantine queue and asks for a stretcher. Seo Ongyeol writes down the minute the request was turned away, then lays Jang Sehwa''s dispatch roster and the duty roster side by side to find that patient''s name.\n\n**Relations.** Works in tandem with Jang Sehwa''s dispatch duty, but takes the stretcher key only from the duty box.\n\n**Ambition.** He wants to keep medical transfer duty as a separate single lane, apart from the transfer-window queue.\n\n**Fear.** That patient escorts will be mixed into one line with the quarantine queue and the time will be erased.\n\n**Intervention.** You can find the roster of the patient who was turned away, or open the separate lane.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 55 | Force −40 | Material −10 | Communal 20 | Principle 10 | Transparency 25 | Qualification 30 | Decentralization 30 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Possessiveness 30 | Risk 5 | Display 15 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Bonding: Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0322","name":"서온결","title":"의무 이송 당직관","position":"의무 이송 당직관","characterId":"K321","rank":"호송원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"의무 이송 명부 대조·문 열쇠 인계","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-12#인물-서온결","detailRoute":"/people/person-0322","birthDate":"2089-10-18","birthday":"10-18","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K296","recipientName":"장세화","basis":"장세화의 배차 의무와 맞물리되, 들것 열쇠는 당직함에서만 꺼낸다.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-12.json","anchor":"인물-서온결-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":4,"effective":4},"martial":{"base":6,"effective":6},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k321-transfer-roster-reconciliation","name":"이송 명부 대조","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"k321-priority","name":"이름 없는 이송 거부","description":"서온결은 이름 없는 요청을 돌려보낸 시각을 적고 배차·당직 명부에서 이름을 찾았다. 환자를 찾는 확인 절차와 치료는 구분한다.","behavior":"이름 없는 이송은 받지 않고, 명부 두 장이 맞을 때만 문을 연다.","stress":"환자 호송이 검역 대기와 한 줄로 섞여 시간이 지워지는 것.","relationship":"장세화의 배차 의무와 맞물리되, 들것 열쇠는 당직함에서만 꺼낸다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k321-accountability","name":"절차를 통한 책임","description":"확인·기록·입회 조건으로 맡은 업무의 책임을 남긴다.","behavior":"관직. 품계 호송원. 직함은 의무 이송 당직관. 이름 없는 이송은 받지 않고, 명부 두 장이 맞을 때만 문을 연다.","stress":"공포. 환자 호송이 검역 대기와 한 줄로 섞여 시간이 지워지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 장세화의 배차 의무와 맞물리되, 들것 열쇠는 당직함에서만 꺼낸다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"서온결은 이름 없는 요청을 돌려보낸 시각을 적고 배차·당직 명부에서 이름을 찾았다. 환자를 찾는 확인 절차와 치료는 구분한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c11c-b2ec-c131","name":"달성 서씨","crest":"clan-crests/c11c-b2ec-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":55,"무력":-40,"물질":-10,"공동":20,"원칙":10,"공개":25,"자격":30,"분산":30,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":30,"위험":5,"과시":15,"지속":5,"지향":"이성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"의무 이송 명부 대조·문 열쇠 인계","소속":"정부","품계":"호송원","직함":"의무 이송 당직관","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 55 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −10 | 공동 20 | 원칙 10 | 공개 25 | 자격 30 | 분산 30 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 30 | 위험 5 | 과시 15 | 지속 5 | 지향 이성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2089-10-18에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 의무 이송 당직관 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 서온결의 의무 이송 명부 대조·문 열쇠 인계 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 호송원. 직함은 의무 이송 당직관. 이름 없는 이송은 받지 않고, 명부 두 장이 맞을 때만 문을 연다.","일화":"이름 칸이 빈 이송 요청이 검역 대기 줄 끝에 붙어 들것을 청한다. 서온결은 요청을 돌려보낸 시각을 분 단위로 적고, 장세화의 배차 명부와 당직 명부 두 장을 맞대 그 환자의 이름을 찾는다.","관계":"장세화의 배차 의무와 맞물리되, 들것 열쇠는 당직함에서만 꺼낸다.","야망":"의무 이송 당직을 환승 창구의 대기열과 분리된 단독 차로로 남기려 한다.","공포":"환자 호송이 검역 대기와 한 줄로 섞여 시간이 지워지는 것.","개입":"돌려보낸 환자의 명부를 찾거나, 단독 차로를 열 수 있다."},"biography":"2089-10-18생인 서온결은 이송 시각을 분 단위로 적고, 빈 들것은 다음 창 전까지 역에 두지 않는다. 말은 짧게, 기록은 길게.\n\n- 생업: 의무 이송 명부 대조·문 열쇠 인계\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 호송원\n- 직함: 의무 이송 당직관\n**생애.** 2089-10-18에 태어났다. 제기동 의무소에서 자랐다. 2126년 개막에는 의무 이송 당직관 당직을 맡으며, 직위 인수 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다이 남아 있다.\n- 신내1동의 배차·교대·정비·통행 심사·들것 인계·당직 열쇠 기록대가 서온결의 의무 이송 명부 대조·문 열쇠 인계 근무 기준점으로 제안되어 있다. 영구 겨울의 인계 기록을 대조하는 제안이며 운행 열차·새 설비·무장·통행세·시장 독점권·거주·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권은 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 호송원. 직함은 의무 이송 당직관. 이름 없는 이송은 받지 않고, 명부 두 장이 맞을 때만 문을 연다.\n\n**일화.** 이름 칸이 빈 이송 요청이 검역 대기 줄 끝에 붙어 들것을 청한다. 서온결은 요청을 돌려보낸 시각을 분 단위로 적고, 장세화의 배차 명부와 당직 명부 두 장을 맞대 그 환자의 이름을 찾는다.\n\n**관계.** 장세화의 배차 의무와 맞물리되, 들것 열쇠는 당직함에서만 꺼낸다.\n\n**야망.** 의무 이송 당직을 환승 창구의 대기열과 분리된 단독 차로로 남기려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 환자 호송이 검역 대기와 한 줄로 섞여 시간이 지워지는 것.\n\n**개입.** 돌려보낸 환자의 명부를 찾거나, 단독 차로를 열 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 55 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −10 | 공동 20 | 원칙 10 | 공개 25 | 자격 30 | 분산 30 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 30 | 위험 5 | 과시 15 | 지속 5 | 지향 이성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0323', 'b958-bb38-d654-67f3', '{"id":"person-0323","name":"Ryu Eunbi","title":"Corps Leader","position":"White Cross Corps Leader","characterId":"K322","rank":"Corps Leader","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"Medical Corps Leader","gender":"Male","stage":"Key","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-ryueunbi","detailRoute":"/people/person-0323","birthDate":"2070-09-16","birthday":"09-16","age":56,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K347","recipientName":"Baek Yeoul","basis":"Cooperates with Ryu Eunbi''s healing guild, but does not disclose the brokerage fee ledger.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-13.json","anchor":"inmul-baekyeoul-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":11,"effective":11},"martial":{"base":11,"effective":11},"stewardship":{"base":15,"effective":15},"intrigue":{"base":14,"effective":14},"learning":{"base":14,"effective":14},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k322-bed-allocation","name":"Bed allocation","rating":70},{"id":"k322-drug-trade-review","name":"Drug-trade review","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k322-trait-1","name":"Beds before trade","description":"Stops suspect-drug trade to address risks to bed operations.","behavior":"Stops suspect-drug trade to address risks to bed operations.","stress":"Ends trade without waiting for the auction seal.","relationship":"Connects specimens with Jeong Hojun and clashes with Nam Yungyeong’s drug prices.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"She maintains bed rosters and stopped trade when a suspect-drug box reached auction. The state card’s severity and clinical opinion guide bed decisions. A conflicting reference to public contribution becomes neither a merit score nor a newly issued specialist credential.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s13","name":{"ko":"Jegi-dong Station Directly Held Land"},"holderPersonId":"K322","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S13","stationRef":{"stationId":"Jegi-dong","stationName":"Jegi-dong"},"adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null}],"clan":{"id":"b958-bb38-d654-67f3","name":"Munhwa Ryu Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b958-bb38-d654-67f3.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"Authority":-30,"Openness":30,"Force":-60,"Material":-20,"Communal":10,"Principle":50,"Public":30,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":-20},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-40,"Display":-30,"Sustained":40,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical Corps Leader","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Corps Leader","Title":"White Cross Corps Leader"},"sections":{},"biography":"Life. Ryu Eunbi, born 2070-09-16, is a healer who carried on the Jegi-dong herbal ledger and the Cheongnyangni bed duty roster. As of the 2126 opening, as commander of the White Cross Order, she assigns beds by severity rather than by a patient''s affiliation, and cross-checks records of herb inspection, market scales, quarantine and treatment contracts. Under Permanent Winter across Seoul, the Government north of the Han River at Cheong Wa Dae, the Free Cities in the west south of the Han River, and Arc in the Gangnam area south of the Han River each keep their own center, and no single living sphere is monopolized by any of them.\n\n- Occupation: Medical corps commander\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: Commander\n- Title: Commander of the White Cross Order\n- The Jegi-dong herb inspection, market scale, severity assignment, quarantine, treatment contract and duty handover desk is Ryu Eunbi''s duty reference point. This duty reference point does not fix residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs or tenure rights.\n\nRyu Eunbi sets the bed ledger of the Jegi-dong Patient Council beside the duty roster of the Cheongnyangni Healing Network, and seeks to bind herb allocation, treatment order and escort handover into a single public record.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"Sim Dalho","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Supply treatment materials as medicinal herbs"},{"from":"Eun Chaeyun","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Works at the guild as a healer''s apprentice"},{"from":"Jeon Sol","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Share the Council of Deliberation vote with the commander"},{"from":"Yun Ji-yul","type":"Debt","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Owes the medicine allocation ledger to the Healing Guild"},{"from":"Hwang Serin","type":"Debt","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Owes a debt for the Bukhansan Bogungmun medicine-ration audit"},{"from":"Kim Sayeon","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Kim Sayeon stands beside the attending specialist and reports the lower-acuity cases and clinical findings to Ryu Eunbi. Ryu Eunbi checks the bed-assignment order and continues treatment on clinical grounds rather than a patient''s affiliation or wealth."},{"from":"Yeon Jiu","type":"Debt","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"owes Ryu Eunbi a bundle of medicines"},{"from":"Gabriel Johnson","type":"Debt","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"owing depot medicine to Ryu Eunbi,"},{"from":"Su Hyoeun","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Obeys Ryu Eunbi''s priority on treatment supplies but refuses concealed distribution"},{"from":"Bae Seoyul","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"She entrusts the samples to Ryu Eunbi''s treatment neutrality, and"},{"from":"Gi Seojin","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"She aligns the sample route with Ryu Eunbi''s medical charter"},{"from":"Pyeong Seo-a","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"demands efficacy verification from Ryu Eunbi,"},{"from":"Chang Haeon","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Fair-copies the text of Ryu Eunbi''s medical charter, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0323","name":"류은비","title":"단장","position":"흰십자단 단장","characterId":"K322","rank":"단장","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"의료단 단장","gender":"남성","stage":"주요","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-류은비","detailRoute":"/people/person-0323","birthDate":"2070-09-16","birthday":"09-16","age":56,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K347","recipientName":"백여울","basis":"류은비의 치료 길드와 협력하되, 중개 수수료 장부는 공개하지 않는다.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-13.json","anchor":"인물-백여울-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":11,"effective":11},"martial":{"base":11,"effective":11},"stewardship":{"base":15,"effective":15},"intrigue":{"base":14,"effective":14},"learning":{"base":14,"effective":14},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"k322-bed-allocation","name":"병상 배정","rating":70},{"id":"k322-drug-trade-review","name":"약 거래 검토","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k322-trait-1","name":"거래보다 침상","description":"의심 약의 거래를 중단해 침상 운영의 위험에 대응한다.","behavior":"의심 약의 거래를 중단해 침상 운영의 위험에 대응한다.","stress":"경매 봉인을 기다리지 않고 거래를 끊는다.","relationship":"정호준과 표본을 연결하고 남윤경의 약 시세와 충돌한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"침상 명부를 유지하고 가짜 약 상자가 경매에 오르자 거래를 끊었다. 국가 카드의 중증도·진료 소견을 병상 판단 근거로 삼는다. 공개 기여라는 다른 카드 표현을 공적 점수로 바꾸거나 전문의 자격을 새로 발급하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s13","name":{"ko":"제기동역 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K322","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S13","stationRef":{"stationId":"제기동","stationName":"제기동"},"adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null}],"clan":{"id":"b958-bb38-d654-67f3","name":"문화 류씨","crest":"clan-crests/b958-bb38-d654-67f3.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"권위":-30,"개방":30,"무력":-60,"물질":-20,"공동":10,"원칙":50,"공개":30,"자격":20,"분산":20,"변혁":-20},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":-20,"위험":-40,"과시":-30,"지속":40,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"의료단 단장","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"단장","직함":"흰십자단 단장"},"sections":{},"biography":"생애. 2070-09-16에 태어난 류은비는 제기동 약재 장부와 청량리 병상 당직표를 이어 온 치료자다. 2126년 개막 현재 흰십자단 단장으로서 환자의 소속보다 중증도를 앞세워 병상을 배정하고, 약재 검수·시장 저울·방역·치료 계약의 기록을 함께 대조한다. 서울 전역의 영구 겨울 아래 청와대와 한강 북부의 정부, 한강 이남 서부의 자유도시, 한강 이남 강남지역의 Arc은 각자의 중심을 두며 어느 한 생활권도 독점하지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 의료단 단장\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 단장\n- 직함: 흰십자단 단장\n- 제기동의 약재 검수·시장 저울·중증도 배정·방역·치료 계약·당직 인계 창구가 류은비의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n류은비는 제기동 환자회의의 병상 원장과 청량리 치료망의 당직표를 맞대어 약재 배정, 진료 순서, 호송 인계를 한 장의 공개 기록으로 묶으려 한다.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"심달호","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"치료 물자를 약재로 댐"},{"from":"은채윤","type":"신도","to":"류은비","basis":"치료사 도제로 길드에서 일함"},{"from":"전솔","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"의정회 표결을 단장와 공유"},{"from":"윤지율","type":"빚","to":"류은비","basis":"약품 배정 장부를 치료길드에 빚짐"},{"from":"황세린","type":"빚","to":"류은비","basis":"북한산보국문 약품 배급 감사를 빚짐"},{"from":"김사연","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"김사연은 담당 전문의 곁에서 적은 중증도·진료 소견을 류은비에게 올린다. 류은비는 병상 배정 순서를 확인해 환자의 소속이나 재산 대신 임상 근거로 치료를 잇는다."},{"from":"연지우","type":"빚","to":"류은비","basis":"류은비에게 약품 묶음을 빚지며"},{"from":"가브리엘 존슨","type":"빚","to":"류은비","basis":"류은비에게 창 약재를 빚지며"},{"from":"수효은","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"류은비의 치료 물자 우선에는 복종하되 은폐 배전은 거부한다"},{"from":"배서율","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"류은비의 치료 중립에 표본을 맡기고"},{"from":"기서진","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"류은비의 의료헌장에 표본 경로를 맞추고"},{"from":"평서아","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"류은비에게 약효 검증을 청구하며"},{"from":"창해온","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"류은비의 의료헌장 문안을 정서하고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0324', 'c2ec-ccad-c1a1', '{"id":"person-0324","name":"Sim Dalho","title":"Medicine Dealer","position":"Medicine Dealer","characterId":"K323","rank":"Resident","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Medicine origin and release seal cross-check","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#Person-Sim-Dalho","detailRoute":"/people/person-0324","birthDate":"2085-09-30","birthday":"09-30","age":41,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"herbal-medicine-allocation","name":"Herbal medicine allocation","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Patient allocation before advance purchase","description":"They divided scarce prescriptions and supply according to patient allocation. Apprenticeship is retained without turning the title into broad appraisal expertise.","behavior":"He spared words as much as the scale''s needle and remembered credit ledgers longer than faces. He did not count an envoy who recommended pre-buying as a guest.","stress":"Fear. That Amsa or Yeouisin would pre-buy the antibiotics and febrifuge herbs and lay the market floor bare.","relationship":"Relations. Staked care supplies for Ryu Eunbi, followed Jeon Sol''s patient allocation, and traded exchange ratios between Eun Taeho''s Garak prices and herbs.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: member. Title: herb merchant. He hung origin and drying dates on the inspection posts and made bulk pre-buying stand only with the stamps of Ryu Eunbi and Jeon Sol, the patients'' representative.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: member. Title: herb merchant. He hung origin and drying dates on the inspection posts and made bulk pre-buying stand only with the stamps of Ryu Eunbi and Jeon Sol, the patients'' representative.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That Amsa or Yeouisin would pre-buy the antibiotics and febrifuge herbs and lay the market floor bare.","relationship":"Relations. Staked care supplies for Ryu Eunbi, followed Jeon Sol''s patient allocation, and traded exchange ratios between Eun Taeho''s Garak prices and herbs.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"They divided scarce prescriptions and supply according to patient allocation. Apprenticeship is retained without turning the title into broad appraisal expertise.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c2ec-ccad-c1a1","name":"Cheongsong Sim Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c2ec-ccad-c1a1.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":30,"Force":-45,"Material":-25,"Communal":25,"Principle":40,"Public":20,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":-20,"Display":-10,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medicine origin and release seal cross-check","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Resident","Title":"Medicine Dealer","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −45 | Materialism −25 | Community 25 | Principle 40 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 30 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −20 | Display −10 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: same-sex | Bonding: polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2085-09-30. As of the opening in 2126, he holds the herbalist''s duties and carries on the existing watch and records. The succession record for that post opened through a counterfeit-medicine seizure.\n- The herb origin and dispatch seal checking window in Jegidong is Sim Dalho''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Resident. Title: Herb Identification Resident. Hangs the origin and drying date on the marker post, and a bulk dispatch takes effect only with the seal of the attending specialist Jeon Sol and the Order Head''s treatment-allocation seal.","Anecdote":"In 2125, amid a herb shortage, he halved the prescription quantities and shared them out to everyone. That day''s record remained as handover evidence for the next watch to verify.","Relationships":"Supplies Ryu Eunbi''s treatment materials, follows Jeon Sol''s patient allocation, and trades Eun Taeho''s bundle prices and herb exchange ratios.","Ambition":"Wants to take the Cheongnyangni herb auction away from closed monopoly bidding and turn it into acuity-based allocation under the medical command.","Fear":"Fears that Amsa or Yeouisin will pre-purchase antibiotics and fever-reducing herbal medicines, leaving the market floor bare.","Intervention":"Can recover the pre-purchase ledger, or expose a private pre-purchase agent at the auction house."},"biography":"Sparing with words as a scale''s graduations are sparing, he remembers a credit ledger longer than a person''s face. He does not regard an envoy urging pre-purchase as a customer.\n\n- Livelihood: checking herb origins and dispatch seals\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: Resident\n- Title: Herbalist Merchant\n**Life.** Born on 2085-09-30. As of the opening in 2126, he holds the herbalist''s duties and carries on the existing watch and records. The succession record for that post opened through a counterfeit-medicine seizure.\n- The herb origin and dispatch seal checking window in Jegidong is Sim Dalho''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Resident. Title: Herb Identification Resident. Hangs the origin and drying date on the marker post, and a bulk dispatch takes effect only with the seal of the attending specialist Jeon Sol and the Order Head''s treatment-allocation seal.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, amid a herb shortage, he halved the prescription quantities and shared them out to everyone. That day''s record remained as handover evidence for the next watch to verify.\n\n**Relationships.** Supplies Ryu Eunbi''s treatment materials, follows Jeon Sol''s patient allocation, and trades Eun Taeho''s bundle prices and herb exchange ratios.\n\n**Ambition.** Wants to take the Cheongnyangni herb auction away from closed monopoly bidding and turn it into acuity-based allocation under the medical command.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that Amsa or Yeouisin will pre-purchase antibiotics and fever-reducing herbal medicines, leaving the market floor bare.\n\n**Intervention.** Can recover the pre-purchase ledger, or expose a private pre-purchase agent at the auction house.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −45 | Materialism −25 | Community 25 | Principle 40 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 30 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Monopoly −20 | Risk −20 | Display −10 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: same-sex | Bonding: polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Sim Dalho","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Supply treatment materials as medicinal herbs"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Cheon Daum","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Sim Dalho","basis":"A priest who backs Sim Dalho''s origin marker post in the field, and"},{"from":"Dong Neulsol","type":"Contract","to":"Sim Dalho","basis":"Enters a transport contract with Sim Dalho, and"},{"from":"Dong Juha","type":"Command","to":"Sim Dalho","basis":"Enforces Sim Dalho''s auction rules at the scale, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0324","name":"심달호","title":"약재상","position":"약재상","characterId":"K323","rank":"수련의","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"약재 원산지·출고 날인 대조","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-심달호","detailRoute":"/people/person-0324","birthDate":"2085-09-30","birthday":"09-30","age":41,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"herbal-medicine-allocation","name":"약재 배분","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"선매보다 환자 할당","description":"부족한 처방량을 나눴고 환자 할당에 따라 물자를 댄다. 도제 학습은 보존하되 직함만으로 감별 숙련을 확대하지 않는다.","behavior":"저울눈만큼 말을 아끼고, 외상 장부를 사람 얼굴보다 오래 기억한다. 선매를 권하는 사신을 손님으로 보지 않는다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 담당 전문의의 도제로 배우며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 암사나 여의신이 항생제와 해열 생약을 선매해 시장 바닥이 드러나는 것.","relationship":"관계. 류은비의 치료 물자를 대고, 전솔의 환자 할당을 따르며, 은태호의 가락 가격과 약재 교환 비율을 거래한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 감별 수련의. 원산지와 건조 일자를 말목에 걸고, 대량 출고는 담당 전문의 전솔과 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있어야 성립시킨다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 감별 수련의. 원산지와 건조 일자를 말목에 걸고, 대량 출고는 담당 전문의 전솔과 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있어야 성립시킨다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 암사나 여의신이 항생제와 해열 생약을 선매해 시장 바닥이 드러나는 것.","relationship":"관계. 류은비의 치료 물자를 대고, 전솔의 환자 할당을 따르며, 은태호의 가락 가격과 약재 교환 비율을 거래한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"부족한 처방량을 나눴고 환자 할당에 따라 물자를 댄다. 도제 학습은 보존하되 직함만으로 감별 숙련을 확대하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c2ec-ccad-c1a1","name":"청송 심씨","crest":"clan-crests/c2ec-ccad-c1a1.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":30,"무력":-45,"물질":-25,"공동":25,"원칙":40,"공개":20,"자격":20,"분산":30,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":-20,"위험":-20,"과시":-10,"지속":35,"지향":"동성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"약재 원산지·출고 날인 대조","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"수련의","직함":"약재상","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −45 | 물질 −25 | 공동 25 | 원칙 40 | 공개 20 | 자격 20 | 분산 30 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −20 | 과시 −10 | 지속 35 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2085-09-30에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 약재상 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 약재 원산지·출고 날인 대조 창구가 심달호의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 감별 수련의. 원산지와 건조 일자를 말목에 걸고, 대량 출고는 담당 전문의 전솔과 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있어야 성립시킨다.","일화":"2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.","관계":"류은비의 치료 물자를 대고, 전솔의 환자 할당을 따르며, 은태호의 가락 가격과 약재 교환 비율을 거래한다.","야망":"청량리 약재 경매를 비공개 독점 입찰에서 떼어내 의료 지휘부 중증도 배정으로 바꾼다.","공포":"암사나 여의신이 항생제와 해열 생약을 선매해 시장 바닥이 드러나는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"선매 장부를 되찾거나, 비공개 선매 대리인을 경매장에서 공개할 수 있다."},"biography":"저울눈만큼 말을 아끼고, 외상 장부를 사람 얼굴보다 오래 기억한다. 선매를 권하는 사신을 손님으로 보지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 약재 원산지·출고 날인 대조\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 수련의\n- 직함: 약재상\n**생애.** 2085-09-30에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 약재상 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 약재 원산지·출고 날인 대조 창구가 심달호의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 감별 수련의. 원산지와 건조 일자를 말목에 걸고, 대량 출고는 담당 전문의 전솔과 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있어야 성립시킨다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 류은비의 치료 물자를 대고, 전솔의 환자 할당을 따르며, 은태호의 가락 가격과 약재 교환 비율을 거래한다.\n\n**야망.** 청량리 약재 경매를 비공개 독점 입찰에서 떼어내 의료 지휘부 중증도 배정으로 바꾼다.\n\n**공포.** 암사나 여의신이 항생제와 해열 생약을 선매해 시장 바닥이 드러나는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 선매 장부를 되찾거나, 비공개 선매 대리인을 경매장에서 공개할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −45 | 물질 −25 | 공동 25 | 원칙 40 | 공개 20 | 자격 20 | 분산 30 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 −20 | 위험 −20 | 과시 −10 | 지속 35 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"심달호","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"치료 물자를 약재로 댐"}],"incoming":[{"from":"천다움","type":"신도","to":"심달호","basis":"심달호의 원산지 말목을 현장에서 받치는 신도이고"},{"from":"동늘솔","type":"계약","to":"심달호","basis":"심달호와 운송 계약을 맺고"},{"from":"동주하","type":"지휘","to":"심달호","basis":"심달호의 경매 규칙을 저울에서 집행하고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0325', 'c740-d589-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0325","name":"Eun Chaeyun","title":"Healer","position":"Healer","characterId":"K324","rank":"Specialist","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"Triage assignment and priority treatment request report","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#Person-Eun-Chaeyun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0325","birthDate":"2094-02-23","birthday":"02-23","age":32,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"care-under-isolation","name":"Care under isolation","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Unbending treatment order","description":"Isolation of a suspected infectious patient did not end home visits, and officer priority requests are refused. Continuity of care and severity judgment are supported strengths.","behavior":"Her hands moved gently, but she turned cold to any pressure to change the care order. An enemy''s wound stood in the same line before the severity table.","stress":"Fear. That the care room would become a war-booty sorting hall and Jegi-dong''s legitimacy would fall in a season.","relationship":"Relations. Worked as Ryu Eunbi''s apprentice, received Baek On''s refugees, and matched sickbeds with Jeon Miri''s Sinnae transfers.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: member. Title: healer. She assigned beds with the severity table and contribution labor written side by side and raised a great power''s officer''s priority care request to the guild council.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: member. Title: healer. She assigned beds with the severity table and contribution labor written side by side and raised a great power''s officer''s priority care request to the guild council.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the care room would become a war-booty sorting hall and Jegi-dong''s legitimacy would fall in a season.","relationship":"Relations. Worked as Ryu Eunbi''s apprentice, received Baek On''s refugees, and matched sickbeds with Jeon Miri''s Sinnae transfers.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Isolation of a suspected infectious patient did not end home visits, and officer priority requests are refused. Continuity of care and severity judgment are supported strengths.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c740-d589-c8fc","name":"Eun Clan of Haengju","crest":"clan-crests/c740-d589-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-30,"Openness":35,"Force":-65,"Material":-20,"Communal":10,"Principle":60,"Public":25,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":25,"Display":-5,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Triage assignment and priority treatment request report","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Specialist","Title":"Healer","Values":"Authority −30 | Openness 35 | Force −65 | Material −20 | Communal 10 | Principle 60 | Publicity 25 | Credentials 15 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 0 | Possessiveness −10 | Risk 25 | Display −5 | Endurance 35 | Orientation None | Union Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2094-02-23. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Healer, continuing the existing duty rota and records. The succession record of that post opened with a counterfeit medicine seal.\n- The triage assignment and priority-treatment request reporting desk in Jegidong is Eun Chaeyun''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or occupancy rights.","Offices":"Rank: Specialist Physician. Title: Triage Specialist. Assigns patients by writing the triage chart and clinical findings side by side, and reports priority-treatment requests from armed duty chiefs to the Order Leader, then refuses them under the triage principle.","Anecdote":"In 2125, kept a suspected-contagion patient in an isolation compartment and never stopped making house calls. That day''s record remained as a handover basis for the next duty shift to verify.","Relationships":"Works as Ryu Eunbi''s apprentice, takes in Baek On''s refugees, and matches Sinnae transfer beds with Jeon Miri.","Ambition":"To leave behind, as the body of the Seoul Medical Charter, a treatment record that accepts even enemy wounded on severity alone.","Fear":"Fears that the clinic will become a sorting yard for spoils and that Jegidong''s legitimacy will collapse within a single season.","Intervention":"Can cross-check capsule seals, or hide enemy wounded in order to frame someone for a charter violation."},"biography":"The hands are gentle, but cold toward pressure to change the treatment order. Even an enemy''s wounds are seen on the same line before the triage chart.\n\n- Occupation: Triage assignment and priority-treatment request reporting\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: Specialist Physician\n- Title: Healer\n**Life.** Born 2094-02-23. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Healer, continuing the existing duty rota and records. The succession record of that post opened with a counterfeit medicine seal.\n- The triage assignment and priority-treatment request reporting desk in Jegidong is Eun Chaeyun''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or occupancy rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Specialist Physician. Title: Triage Specialist. Assigns patients by writing the triage chart and clinical findings side by side, and reports priority-treatment requests from armed duty chiefs to the Order Leader, then refuses them under the triage principle.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, kept a suspected-contagion patient in an isolation compartment and never stopped making house calls. That day''s record remained as a handover basis for the next duty shift to verify.\n\n**Relationships.** Works as Ryu Eunbi''s apprentice, takes in Baek On''s refugees, and matches Sinnae transfer beds with Jeon Miri.\n\n**Ambition.** To leave behind, as the body of the Seoul Medical Charter, a treatment record that accepts even enemy wounded on severity alone.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that the clinic will become a sorting yard for spoils and that Jegidong''s legitimacy will collapse within a single season.\n\n**Intervention.** Can cross-check capsule seals, or hide enemy wounded in order to frame someone for a charter violation.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −30 | Openness 35 | Force −65 | Material −20 | Communal 10 | Principle 60 | Publicity 25 | Credentials 15 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Possessiveness −10 | Risk 25 | Display −5 | Endurance 35 | Orientation None | Union Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Eun Chaeyun","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Works at the guild as a healer''s apprentice"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gu Reumgyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"Gureumgyeol redirects requests to change the treatment order to the public desk and passes the prescription records and request details to Eun Chaeyun. Eun Chaeyun assigns by clinical findings and the triage chart so that a request does not push aside the turn of a more critical patient."},{"from":"Kang Soljun","type":"Contract","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"Gang Soljun redirects requests to change the treatment order to the public desk and passes the prescription records to Eun Chaeyun. Eun Chaeyun assigns by triage level and clinical findings so that a request does not push aside critical patients."},{"from":"Seong Sol-hyeon","type":"Contract","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"Seong Solhyeon hands the records of the reopened prescription duty over to Eun Chaeyun. Eun Chaeyun checks the triage level and clinical findings and continues the treatment of patients who were dropped during the shift-change gap."},{"from":"Bak Byeoryun","type":"Contract","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"Bak Byeolyun redirects requests to change the treatment order to the public desk and passes the prescription records to Eun Chaeyun. Eun Chaeyun assigns by triage level and clinical findings so that a private request does not jump ahead of patients in line."},{"from":"Cha Bahwan","type":"Contract","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"Cha Bahwan redirects treatment-order requests to the public desk and passes the prescription records to Eun Chaeyun. Eun Chaeyun assigns by triage level and clinical findings so that critical patients are not pushed aside by requests."},{"from":"Bang Hanul","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"a protégé who, as Eun Chaeyun''s apprentice, enforces the order of the sickbeds, and"},{"from":"Won Miru","type":"Contract","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"receives the medicines on Eun Chaeyun''s shelf as reference samples"},{"from":"Bang Misan","type":"Command","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"divides the sickbeds under Eun Chaeyun''s command, and"},{"from":"Seok Raon","type":"Contract","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"opens Eun Chaeyun''s sickbeds to the refugee line, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0325","name":"은채윤","title":"치료사","position":"치료사","characterId":"K324","rank":"전문의","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"중증도 배정·우선 치료 요청 보고","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-은채윤","detailRoute":"/people/person-0325","birthDate":"2094-02-23","birthday":"02-23","age":32,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"care-under-isolation","name":"격리 진료","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"치료 순서를 굽히지 않는다","description":"의심 환자를 격리하면서 왕진을 이어갔고 장교의 우선 요청을 거절한다. 치료 지속과 중증도 판단이 강점이다.","behavior":"손놀림은 부드러우나 치료 순서를 바꾸라는 압력에는 차갑다. 적의 부상도 중증도 표 앞에서는 같은 줄로 본다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 수련의를 지도하고 후계자를 지정하며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 진료실이 전리품 분류장이 되어 제기동의 정통성이 한 계절에 무너지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 류은비의 도제로 일하며, 백온의 피난민을 받고, 전미리와 신내 이송 병상을 맞춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 전문의. 직함은 중증도 진료 전문의. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 적어 배정하고, 강국 장교의 우선 치료 요청은 단장에게 보고하고 중증도 원칙에 따라 거절한다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 전문의. 직함은 중증도 진료 전문의. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 적어 배정하고, 강국 장교의 우선 치료 요청은 단장에게 보고하고 중증도 원칙에 따라 거절한다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 진료실이 전리품 분류장이 되어 제기동의 정통성이 한 계절에 무너지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 류은비의 도제로 일하며, 백온의 피난민을 받고, 전미리와 신내 이송 병상을 맞춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"의심 환자를 격리하면서 왕진을 이어갔고 장교의 우선 요청을 거절한다. 치료 지속과 중증도 판단이 강점이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c740-d589-c8fc","name":"행주 은씨","crest":"clan-crests/c740-d589-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-30,"개방":35,"무력":-65,"물질":-20,"공동":10,"원칙":60,"공개":25,"자격":15,"분산":25,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-10,"위험":25,"과시":-5,"지속":35,"지향":"무성향","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"중증도 배정·우선 치료 요청 보고","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"전문의","직함":"치료사","가치관":"권위 −30 | 개방 35 | 무력 −65 | 물질 −20 | 공동 10 | 원칙 60 | 공개 25 | 자격 15 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −10 | 위험 25 | 과시 −5 | 지속 35 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2094-02-23에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 치료사 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 중증도 배정·우선 치료 요청 보고 창구가 은채윤의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 전문의. 직함은 중증도 진료 전문의. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 적어 배정하고, 무장 당직 책임자의 우선 치료 요청은 단장에게 보고하고 중증도 원칙에 따라 거절한다.","일화":"2125년 전염 의심 환자를 격리 칸에 두고 왕진을 멈추지 않았다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.","관계":"류은비의 도제로 일하며, 백온의 피난민을 받고, 전미리와 신내 이송 병상을 맞춘다.","야망":"적군 부상자도 중증도만으로 받는 진료 기록을 서울 의료헌장의 본문으로 남긴다.","공포":"진료실이 전리품 분류장이 되어 제기동의 정통성이 한 계절에 무너지는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"캡슐 인장을 대조하거나, 적군 부상자를 숨겨 헌장 위반 누명을 씌울 수 있다."},"biography":"손놀림은 부드러우나 치료 순서를 바꾸라는 압력에는 차갑다. 적의 부상도 중증도 표 앞에서는 같은 줄로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 중증도 배정·우선 치료 요청 보고\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 전문의\n- 직함: 치료사\n**생애.** 2094-02-23에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 치료사 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 중증도 배정·우선 치료 요청 보고 창구가 은채윤의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 전문의. 직함은 중증도 진료 전문의. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 적어 배정하고, 무장 당직 책임자의 우선 치료 요청은 단장에게 보고하고 중증도 원칙에 따라 거절한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 전염 의심 환자를 격리 칸에 두고 왕진을 멈추지 않았다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 류은비의 도제로 일하며, 백온의 피난민을 받고, 전미리와 신내 이송 병상을 맞춘다.\n\n**야망.** 적군 부상자도 중증도만으로 받는 진료 기록을 서울 의료헌장의 본문으로 남긴다.\n\n**공포.** 진료실이 전리품 분류장이 되어 제기동의 정통성이 한 계절에 무너지는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 캡슐 인장을 대조하거나, 적군 부상자를 숨겨 헌장 위반 누명을 씌울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −30 | 개방 35 | 무력 −65 | 물질 −20 | 공동 10 | 원칙 60 | 공개 25 | 자격 15 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −10 | 위험 25 | 과시 −5 | 지속 35 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"은채윤","type":"신도","to":"류은비","basis":"치료사 도제로 길드에서 일함"}],"incoming":[{"from":"구름결","type":"계약","to":"은채윤","basis":"구름결은 치료 순서를 바꿔 달라는 청탁을 공개 창구로 돌리고 은채윤에게 처방 기록과 요청 내용을 전한다. 은채윤은 진료 소견과 중증도 표로 배정해, 청탁이 더 위중한 환자의 순서를 밀어내지 않게 한다."},{"from":"강솔준","type":"계약","to":"은채윤","basis":"강솔준은 치료 순서를 바꾸라는 청탁을 공개 창구로 돌리고 은채윤에게 처방 기록을 전한다. 은채윤은 중증도와 진료 소견으로 배정해 청탁이 위중한 환자를 밀어내지 않게 한다."},{"from":"성솔현","type":"계약","to":"은채윤","basis":"성솔현은 다시 열린 처방 당직의 기록을 은채윤에게 넘긴다. 은채윤은 중증도와 진료 소견을 확인해 교대 공백 중 빠진 환자의 치료를 잇는다."},{"from":"박별윤","type":"계약","to":"은채윤","basis":"박별윤은 치료 순서를 바꾸라는 청탁을 공개 창구로 돌리고 은채윤에게 처방 기록을 전한다. 은채윤은 중증도와 진료 소견에 따라 배정해 사적 요청이 환자 순서를 앞지르지 않게 한다."},{"from":"차바환","type":"계약","to":"은채윤","basis":"차바환은 치료 순서 청탁을 공개 창구로 돌리고 은채윤에게 처방 기록을 전한다. 은채윤은 중증도·진료 소견으로 배정해 위중한 환자가 청탁에 밀리지 않게 한다."},{"from":"방한울","type":"신도","to":"은채윤","basis":"은채윤의 도제로서 침상 순서를 집행하는 신도이고"},{"from":"원미루","type":"계약","to":"은채윤","basis":"은채윤의 선반 약을 대조 표본으로 받는다"},{"from":"방미산","type":"지휘","to":"은채윤","basis":"은채윤의 지휘로 병상을 나누고"},{"from":"석라온","type":"계약","to":"은채윤","basis":"은채윤의 병상을 피난 줄에 열고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0326', 'b77c-ae08-c131-7f85', '{"id":"person-0326","name":"Ra Seyeong","title":"Epidemic Prevention Manager","position":"Epidemic Prevention Manager","characterId":"K325","rank":"Specialist","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"Quarantine entry stamp and release records","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#person-ra-seyeong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0326","birthDate":"2083-09-06","birthday":"09-06","age":43,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"isolation-access-control","name":"Isolation access control","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"No release before records","description":"Release waits for water and efficacy records; a fire prompted rescue of the people ledger first. Procedure management and preservation of records are evaluated separately.","behavior":"She turned principles into numbers and trusted isolation days over rumor. She wrote a political blockade lift down as a cause of accidents.","stress":"Fear. That turbid water and counterfeit drugs would spread at once and the quarantine squad would be cut apart between the water state and the market.","relationship":"Relations. Shared drug-efficacy verification with Jeong Hojun, took Ryu Eunbi''s pressure to hold neutrality, and carried a debt for demanding Ha Yunmok''s Achasan gate quarantine pass.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: member. Title: quarantine manager. She kept the isolation curtain and the entry stamps doubled and declared a lift only after Jeong Hojun''s water-quality and drug-efficacy records arrived.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: member. Title: quarantine manager. She kept the isolation curtain and the entry stamps doubled and declared a lift only after Jeong Hojun''s water-quality and drug-efficacy records arrived.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That turbid water and counterfeit drugs would spread at once and the quarantine squad would be cut apart between the water state and the market.","relationship":"Relations. Shared drug-efficacy verification with Jeong Hojun, took Ryu Eunbi''s pressure to hold neutrality, and carried a debt for demanding Ha Yunmok''s Achasan gate quarantine pass.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Release waits for water and efficacy records; a fire prompted rescue of the people ledger first. Procedure management and preservation of records are evaluated separately.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b77c-ae08-c131-7f85","name":"Ra Clan of Geumseong","crest":"clan-crests/b77c-ae08-c131-7f85.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":35,"Force":-70,"Material":-20,"Communal":20,"Principle":60,"Public":15,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":-35,"Risk":15,"Display":-30,"Sustained":25,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Quarantine entry stamp and release records","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Specialist","Title":"Epidemic Prevention Manager","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 35 | Force −70 | Material −20 | Communal 20 | Principle 60 | Publicity 15 | Credentials 15 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving 45 | Possessiveness −35 | Risk 15 | Display −30 | Endurance 25 | Orientation Fluid | Union Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2083-09-06. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Epidemic Control Officer, continuing the existing duty rota and records. The succession record of that post opened with a replacement shift for an unexcused shift-change absence.\n- The quarantine entry stamp and release record desk in Jegidong is Ra Seyeong''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or occupancy rights.","Offices":"Rank: Specialist Physician. Title: Epidemic Control Specialist. Keeps a double layer of isolation barrier and entry stamps, and declares release only after Jeong Hojun''s water-quality and efficacy records arrive.","Anecdote":"In the 2125 station fire, carried out the register of lives first. That day''s record remained as a handover basis for the next duty shift to verify.","Relationships":"Shares efficacy verification with Jeong Hojun, is under Ryu Eunbi''s pressure to stay neutral, and owes a debt for having repeatedly demanded Ha Yunmok''s Achasan checkpoint quarantine pass.","Ambition":"To let the quarantine corps invoke the Dongdaemun-Cheongnyangni quarantine blockade authority on its own, preventing non-medical lifting.","Fear":"Fears that tainted water and counterfeit medicine will spread at the same time and the quarantine corps will be cut off between the Water Supply Bureau and the market.","Intervention":"Can carry samples of the contamination source to Magok, or strike a deal to lift the blockade and resume shipments of medicinal herbs."},"biography":"Turns principles into numbers and trusts quarantine days over rumors. Writes political lifting of a blockade down as the cause of an accident.\n\n- Occupation: Quarantine entry stamps and release records\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: Specialist Physician\n- Title: Epidemic Control Officer\n**Life.** Born 2083-09-06. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Epidemic Control Officer, continuing the existing duty rota and records. The succession record of that post opened with a replacement shift for an unexcused shift-change absence.\n- The quarantine entry stamp and release record desk in Jegidong is Ra Seyeong''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or occupancy rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Specialist Physician. Title: Epidemic Control Specialist. Keeps a double layer of isolation barrier and entry stamps, and declares release only after Jeong Hojun''s water-quality and efficacy records arrive.\n\n**Anecdote.** In the 2125 station fire, carried out the register of lives first. That day''s record remained as a handover basis for the next duty shift to verify.\n\n**Relationships.** Shares efficacy verification with Jeong Hojun, is under Ryu Eunbi''s pressure to stay neutral, and owes a debt for having repeatedly demanded Ha Yunmok''s Achasan checkpoint quarantine pass.\n\n**Ambition.** To let the quarantine corps invoke the Dongdaemun-Cheongnyangni quarantine blockade authority on its own, preventing non-medical lifting.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that tainted water and counterfeit medicine will spread at the same time and the quarantine corps will be cut off between the Water Supply Bureau and the market.\n\n**Intervention.** Can carry samples of the contamination source to Magok, or strike a deal to lift the blockade and resume shipments of medicinal herbs.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 35 | Force −70 | Material −20 | Communal 20 | Principle 60 | Publicity 15 | Credentials 15 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Possessiveness −35 | Risk 15 | Display −30 | Endurance 25 | Orientation Fluid | Union Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"Sim Dahyeon","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Sim Dahyeon, when handing over the quarantine duty shift, brings the entry records and the transcript preserved from the soaked documents to Ra Seyeong. Ra Seyeong checks the quarantine entry seals and release records, searches for omissions together with Sim Dahyeon, and decides on release only after the water-quality and medicinal-efficacy records arrive."},{"from":"Gu Sohui","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Gu Sohui brings the original quarantine records and the entry seal to Ra Seyeong to check a suspicious copy. Ra Seyeong examines the quarantine entry and release records to confirm whether a forged seal got through, and does not declare a release before the water-quality and medicinal-efficacy records arrive."},{"from":"Gang Bayu","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Gang Bayu brings the original quarantine records to Ra Seyeong to check a suspicious entry seal. Ra Seyeong examines the quarantine and release records so that quarantined patients are not freed early because of a forged copy, and waits for the water-quality and medicinal-efficacy records to arrive."},{"from":"Sim Pahyeon","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Sim Pahyeon continues treating patients in the quarantine ward and hands the medicine management and entry records over to Ra Seyeong. Ra Seyeong checks the quarantine seal and release records so that the fact that house calls continued is not mistaken for a quarantine release."},{"from":"Sim Bahyeon","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Sim Bahyeon brings the original quarantine records and the suspicious seal to Ra Seyeong. Ra Seyeong checks the quarantine entry and release records so that a forged copy is not used as grounds for release."},{"from":"Im Ba-na","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Im Bana hands the corrected quarantine ledger and the handover signature to Ra Seyeong. Ra Seyeong checks the quarantine entry and release records to distinguish duplicated lines from actual patient movement."},{"from":"Sim Nayang","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Sim Nayang delivers the preserved quarantine transcript to Ra Seyeong. Ra Seyeong checks the quarantine entry and release records so that an illegible seal is not used as grounds for release."},{"from":"O Taho","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"O Taho delivers the correction of the duplicate quarantine issuance and the signature to Ra Seyeong. Ra Seyeong checks the actual quarantine entries and releases to distinguish ledger duplication from patient movement."},{"from":"Su Choreong","type":"Command","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Circles the eastern alley under Ra Seyeong''s command and"},{"from":"Won Miru","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"is a contract to hand contamination coordinates to Ra Seyeong and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0326","name":"라세영","title":"방역 관리","position":"방역 관리","characterId":"K325","rank":"전문의","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"격리 출입 도장·해제 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-라세영","detailRoute":"/people/person-0326","birthDate":"2083-09-06","birthday":"09-06","age":43,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"isolation-access-control","name":"격리 출입 관리","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"기록 전에는 해제하지 않는다","description":"수질·약효 기록을 기다려 해제를 결정하고 화재에서는 인명 장부를 먼저 구했다. 방역 절차 운영과 기록 보존을 분리해 평가한다.","behavior":"원칙을 숫자로 바꾸고, 소문보다 격리 일수를 믿는다. 정치적 봉쇄 해제를 사고 원인으로 적는다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 수련의를 지도하고 후계자를 지정하며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 탁수와 가짜 약이 동시에 퍼져 방역대가 급수국과 시장 사이에서 잘리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 정호준과 약효 검증을 공유하고, 류은비의 중립 유지 압력을 받으며, 하윤목의 아차산 관문 검역 통과증을 요구해 온 빚이 있다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 전문의. 직함은 방역 전문의. 격리 막과 출입 도장을 이중으로 두고, 해제 선언은 정호준의 수질·약효 기록이 도착한 뒤에만 한다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 전문의. 직함은 방역 전문의. 격리 막과 출입 도장을 이중으로 두고, 해제 선언은 정호준의 수질·약효 기록이 도착한 뒤에만 한다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 탁수와 가짜 약이 동시에 퍼져 방역대가 급수국과 시장 사이에서 잘리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 정호준과 약효 검증을 공유하고, 류은비의 중립 유지 압력을 받으며, 하윤목의 아차산 관문 검역 통과증을 요구해 온 빚이 있다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"수질·약효 기록을 기다려 해제를 결정하고 화재에서는 인명 장부를 먼저 구했다. 방역 절차 운영과 기록 보존을 분리해 평가한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b77c-ae08-c131-7f85","name":"금성 라씨","crest":"clan-crests/b77c-ae08-c131-7f85.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":35,"무력":-70,"물질":-20,"공동":20,"원칙":60,"공개":15,"자격":15,"분산":15,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":-35,"위험":15,"과시":-30,"지속":25,"지향":"유동","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"격리 출입 도장·해제 기록","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"전문의","직함":"방역 관리","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 35 | 무력 −70 | 물질 −20 | 공동 20 | 원칙 60 | 공개 15 | 자격 15 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 −35 | 위험 15 | 과시 −30 | 지속 25 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2083-09-06에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 방역 관리 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 격리 출입 도장·해제 기록 창구가 라세영의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 전문의. 직함은 방역 전문의. 격리 막과 출입 도장을 이중으로 두고, 해제 선언은 정호준의 수질·약효 기록이 도착한 뒤에만 한다.","일화":"2125년 역사 화재 때 인명 장부부터 꺼내 들고 나왔다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.","관계":"정호준과 약효 검증을 공유하고, 류은비의 중립 유지 압력을 받으며, 하윤목의 아차산 관문 검역 통과증을 요구해 온 빚이 있다.","야망":"동대문·청량리 방역 봉쇄권을 방역대가 단독 발동하게 해 비의료적 해제를 막는다.","공포":"탁수와 가짜 약이 동시에 퍼져 방역대가 급수국과 시장 사이에서 잘리는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"오염원 표본을 마곡으로 나르거나, 봉쇄를 풀어 약재 출하를 재개시키는 거래를 할 수 있다."},"biography":"원칙을 숫자로 바꾸고, 소문보다 격리 일수를 믿는다. 정치적 봉쇄 해제를 사고 원인으로 적는다.\n\n- 생업: 격리 출입 도장·해제 기록\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 전문의\n- 직함: 방역 관리\n**생애.** 2083-09-06에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 방역 관리 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 격리 출입 도장·해제 기록 창구가 라세영의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 전문의. 직함은 방역 전문의. 격리 막과 출입 도장을 이중으로 두고, 해제 선언은 정호준의 수질·약효 기록이 도착한 뒤에만 한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 역사 화재 때 인명 장부부터 꺼내 들고 나왔다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 정호준과 약효 검증을 공유하고, 류은비의 중립 유지 압력을 받으며, 하윤목의 아차산 관문 검역 통과증을 요구해 온 빚이 있다.\n\n**야망.** 동대문·청량리 방역 봉쇄권을 방역대가 단독 발동하게 해 비의료적 해제를 막는다.\n\n**공포.** 탁수와 가짜 약이 동시에 퍼져 방역대가 급수국과 시장 사이에서 잘리는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 오염원 표본을 마곡으로 나르거나, 봉쇄를 풀어 약재 출하를 재개시키는 거래를 할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 35 | 무력 −70 | 물질 −20 | 공동 20 | 원칙 60 | 공개 15 | 자격 15 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 −35 | 위험 15 | 과시 −30 | 지속 25 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"심다현","type":"계약","to":"라세영","basis":"심다현은 방역 당직을 넘길 때 출입 기록과 젖은 문서에서 보존한 필사본을 라세영에게 가져간다. 라세영은 격리 출입 도장과 해제 기록을 확인하며 심다현과 함께 누락을 찾고, 수질·약효 기록이 도착한 뒤 해제를 판단한다."},{"from":"구소희","type":"계약","to":"라세영","basis":"구소희는 방역 기록의 원본과 출입 도장을 라세영에게 가져가 의심스러운 사본을 확인한다. 라세영은 격리 출입과 해제 기록을 살펴 위조 날인이 통과했는지 확인하고, 수질·약효 기록이 도착하기 전에는 해제를 선언하지 않는다."},{"from":"강바유","type":"계약","to":"라세영","basis":"강바유는 방역 기록 원본을 라세영에게 가져가 의심스러운 출입 날인을 확인한다. 라세영은 격리와 해제 기록을 살펴 위조 사본 때문에 격리 환자가 먼저 풀려나지 않게 하고 수질·약효 기록의 도착을 기다린다."},{"from":"심파현","type":"계약","to":"라세영","basis":"심파현은 격리 칸의 환자 진료를 이어가며 약재 관리와 출입 기록을 라세영에게 넘긴다. 라세영은 격리 도장과 해제 기록을 확인해 왕진이 계속된 사실을 격리 해제로 오인하지 않게 한다."},{"from":"심바현","type":"계약","to":"라세영","basis":"심바현은 방역 원본과 의심 날인을 라세영에게 가져간다. 라세영은 격리 출입·해제 기록을 확인해 위조 사본이 해제 근거로 쓰이지 않게 한다."},{"from":"임바나","type":"계약","to":"라세영","basis":"임바나는 정정한 방역 장부와 인수 서명을 라세영에게 넘긴다. 라세영은 격리 출입과 해제 기록을 확인해 중복된 줄을 실제 환자 이동과 구분한다."},{"from":"심나양","type":"계약","to":"라세영","basis":"심나양은 보존한 방역 필사본을 라세영에게 전한다. 라세영은 격리 출입·해제 기록을 확인해 읽히지 않는 날인이 해제 근거로 쓰이지 않게 한다."},{"from":"오타호","type":"계약","to":"라세영","basis":"오타호는 방역 중복 지급 정정과 서명을 라세영에게 전한다. 라세영은 실제 격리 출입·해제를 확인해 장부 중복과 환자 이동을 구분한다."},{"from":"수초롱","type":"지휘","to":"라세영","basis":"라세영의 지휘로 동측 골목을 돌고"},{"from":"원미루","type":"계약","to":"라세영","basis":"라세영에게 오염 좌표를 넘기는 계약이고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0327', 'b0a8-c758-b839', '{"id":"person-0327","name":"Nam Hoseong","title":"Medical Escort Captain","position":"Medical Escort Captain","characterId":"K326","rank":"Specialist","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"Medical escort pass patient and medicine weight records","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#person-nam-hoseong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0327","birthDate":"2089-11-08","birthday":"11-08","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"medical-transport-coordination","name":"Medical transport coordination","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Late destination disclosure","description":"Section changes and bridge permissions are coordinated each time, with destinations disclosed late. Route confidentiality and patient allocation do not prove combat performance.","behavior":"His faith was strong, but he did not announce convoy routes in advance. He refused armed escort inside the care cars.","stress":"Fear. That a convoy train would be mistaken for a munitions train and stopped on the Guui bridge.","relationship":"Relations. Split medical convoys with Jang Sehwa, exchanged section rotations with Ha Seon, and took Go Seojun''s bridge passage permit fresh each time.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: member. Title: medical convoy leader. He wrote only patient counts and herb weights on the convoy pass and published the destination''s state name just before arrival.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: member. Title: medical convoy leader. He wrote only patient counts and herb weights on the convoy pass and published the destination''s state name just before arrival.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That a convoy train would be mistaken for a munitions train and stopped on the Guui bridge.","relationship":"Relations. Split medical convoys with Jang Sehwa, exchanged section rotations with Ha Seon, and took Go Seojun''s bridge passage permit fresh each time.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Section changes and bridge permissions are coordinated each time, with destinations disclosed late. Route confidentiality and patient allocation do not prove combat performance.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b0a8-c758-b839","name":"Uiryeong Nam Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b0a8-c758-b839.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":50,"Force":-65,"Material":-25,"Communal":15,"Principle":60,"Public":25,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":-5,"Risk":15,"Display":-25,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical escort pass patient and medicine weight records","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Specialist","Title":"Medical Escort Captain","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 50 | Force −65 | Material −25 | Community 15 | Principle 60 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 25 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 45 | Monopoly −5 | Risk 15 | Display −25 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: Positive | Attachment: None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2089-11-08. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Medical Convoy Captain, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opened with a forged medicine seal.\n- The desk in Cheongnyangni-dong that records patients and medicine weights on medical convoy passes is Nam Hoseong''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or tenure.","Offices":"Rank: specialist. Title: Medical Convoy Specialist. Writes only the patient count and medicine weight on the convoy pass, and reveals the destination state''s name just before arrival.","Anecdote":"In 2125, amid a herb shortage, he halved the prescription quantities and shared them out to everyone. That day''s record remained as handover evidence for the next watch to verify.","Relationships":"Shares medical convoys with Jang Sehwa, takes turns on sections with Ha Seon, and obtains Go Seojun''s bridge-crossing permit anew each time.","Ambition":"Sets the Sinnae–Jegidong–Achasan triangular medical convoy as the first article of the Joint Convoy Treaty.","Fear":"Fears the convoy train being mistaken for a munitions train and blocked at the Guui bridge.","Intervention":"Can correct the misidentification signal, or reroute the convoy and deepen the division among the gateway states."},"biography":"Strongly faithful to their word, yet does not announce the convoy route in advance. Refuses to admit armed escorts into the treatment car.\n\n- Livelihood: recording patients and medicine weights on medical convoy passes\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: Specialist\n- Title: Medical Convoy Captain\n**Life.** Born on 2089-11-08. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Medical Convoy Captain, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opened with a forged medicine seal.\n- The desk in Cheongnyangni-dong that records patients and medicine weights on medical convoy passes is Nam Hoseong''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or tenure.\n\n**Office.** Rank: specialist. Title: Medical Convoy Specialist. Writes only the patient count and medicine weight on the convoy pass, and reveals the destination state''s name just before arrival.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, amid a medicine shortage, split the prescribed amount in half and shared it among everyone. That day''s record remained as handover evidence for the next duty shift to verify.\n\n**Relationships.** Shares medical convoys with Jang Sehwa, takes turns on sections with Ha Seon, and obtains Go Seojun''s bridge-crossing permit anew each time.\n\n**Ambition.** Sets the Sinnae–Jegidong–Achasan triangular medical convoy as the first article of the Joint Convoy Treaty.\n\n**Fear.** Fears the convoy train being mistaken for a munitions train and blocked at the Guui bridge.\n\n**Intervention.** Can correct the misidentification signal, or reroute the convoy and deepen the division among the gateway states.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 50 | Force −65 | Material −25 | Community 15 | Principle 60 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 25 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Monopoly −5 | Risk 15 | Display −25 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: Positive | Attachment: None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Nam Hoseong","type":"Contract","to":"Jang Sehwa","basis":"Shares medical escort with Sinnae Transit"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Pan Handeul","type":"Contract","to":"Nam Hoseong","basis":"Receives Nam Hoseong''s convoy stop at the platform and"},{"from":"Cheon Daol","type":"Command","to":"Nam Hoseong","basis":"Takes the dispatch duty under Nam Hoseong''s command and"},{"from":"Yeong Seogon","type":"Contract","to":"Nam Hoseong","basis":"Copies Nam Hoseong''s convoy pass into the duty ledger"},{"from":"Yeong Han-moe","type":"Contract","to":"Nam Hoseong","basis":"Uses Nam Hoseong''s medical convoy for arrival confirmation"},{"from":"Beom Choi","type":"Command","to":"Nam Hoseong","basis":"Boarded the car under Nam Hoseong''s convoy order and"},{"from":"Heung Daon","type":"Contract","to":"Nam Hoseong","basis":"Separates Nam Hoseong''s medical convoy from the crowd lines and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0327","name":"남호성","title":"의무호송대장","position":"의무호송대장","characterId":"K326","rank":"전문의","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-남호성","detailRoute":"/people/person-0327","birthDate":"2089-11-08","birthday":"11-08","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":10,"effective":10},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"medical-transport-coordination","name":"의무호송 조정","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"목적지를 늦게 밝힌다","description":"구간 교대와 교량 허가를 매번 맞추며 목적지를 늦게 공개한다. 경로 기밀과 환자 배분은 전투 수행을 증명하지 않는다.","behavior":"신의가 강하지만 호송 경로를 미리 말하지 않는다. 무장 호위를 치료 칸에 들이는 것을 거부한다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 수련의를 지도하고 후계자를 지정하며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 호송 열차가 군수 열차로 오인되어 구의 교량에서 막히는 것.","relationship":"관계. 장세화와 의료호송을 나누고, 하세온과 구간 교대를 하며, 고서준의 교량 통과 허가를 매번 새로 받는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 전문의. 직함은 의무호송 전문의. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적고 목적지 국호는 도착 직전에 공개한다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 전문의. 직함은 의무호송 전문의. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적고 목적지 국호는 도착 직전에 공개한다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 호송 열차가 군수 열차로 오인되어 구의 교량에서 막히는 것.","relationship":"관계. 장세화와 의료호송을 나누고, 하세온과 구간 교대를 하며, 고서준의 교량 통과 허가를 매번 새로 받는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"구간 교대와 교량 허가를 매번 맞추며 목적지를 늦게 공개한다. 경로 기밀과 환자 배분은 전투 수행을 증명하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b0a8-c758-b839","name":"의령 남씨","crest":"clan-crests/b0a8-c758-b839.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":50,"무력":-65,"물질":-25,"공동":15,"원칙":60,"공개":25,"자격":25,"분산":20,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":-5,"위험":15,"과시":-25,"지속":-10,"지향":"양성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"전문의","직함":"의무호송대장","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 50 | 무력 −65 | 물질 −25 | 공동 15 | 원칙 60 | 공개 25 | 자격 25 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 −5 | 위험 15 | 과시 −25 | 지속 −10 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2089-11-08에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의무호송대장 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록 창구가 남호성의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 전문의. 직함은 의무호송 전문의. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적고 목적지 국호는 도착 직전에 공개한다.","일화":"2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.","관계":"장세화와 의료호송을 나누고, 하세온과 구간 교대를 하며, 고서준의 교량 통과 허가를 매번 새로 받는다.","야망":"신내·제기동·아차산 삼각 의무호송을 공동호송조약의 첫 조항으로 못 박는다.","공포":"호송 열차가 군수 열차로 오인되어 구의 교량에서 막히는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"오인 신호를 바로잡거나, 호송을 우회시켜 관문국의 분열을 키울 수 있다."},"biography":"신의가 강하지만 호송 경로를 미리 말하지 않는다. 무장 호위를 치료 칸에 들이는 것을 거부한다.\n\n- 생업: 의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 전문의\n- 직함: 의무호송대장\n**생애.** 2089-11-08에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의무호송대장 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록 창구가 남호성의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 전문의. 직함은 의무호송 전문의. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적고 목적지 국호는 도착 직전에 공개한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 장세화와 의료호송을 나누고, 하세온과 구간 교대를 하며, 고서준의 교량 통과 허가를 매번 새로 받는다.\n\n**야망.** 신내·제기동·아차산 삼각 의무호송을 공동호송조약의 첫 조항으로 못 박는다.\n\n**공포.** 호송 열차가 군수 열차로 오인되어 구의 교량에서 막히는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 오인 신호를 바로잡거나, 호송을 우회시켜 관문국의 분열을 키울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 50 | 무력 −65 | 물질 −25 | 공동 15 | 원칙 60 | 공개 25 | 자격 25 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 −5 | 위험 15 | 과시 −25 | 지속 −10 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"남호성","type":"계약","to":"장세화","basis":"의료호송을 신내운수와 나눔"}],"incoming":[{"from":"판한들","type":"계약","to":"남호성","basis":"남호성의 호송 정차를 승강장에서 받고"},{"from":"천다올","type":"지휘","to":"남호성","basis":"남호성의 지휘로 출고 당직을 맡고"},{"from":"영석온","type":"계약","to":"남호성","basis":"남호성의 호송증을 당직 원장에 옮긴다"},{"from":"영한뫼","type":"계약","to":"남호성","basis":"남호성의 의무호송을 도착 확인에 쓴다"},{"from":"범초이","type":"지휘","to":"남호성","basis":"남호성의 호송 명령 아래 칸에 탔고"},{"from":"흥다온","type":"계약","to":"남호성","basis":"남호성의 의무호송과 인파 줄을 나누고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0328', 'c804-cc9c-c548', '{"id":"person-0328","name":"Jeon Sol","title":"Patient Representative of the Medical Affairs Council","position":"Patient Representative of the Medical Affairs Council","characterId":"K327","rank":"Specialist","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"Hospital bed waiting list and confidential treatment contract review","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#person-jeon-sol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0328","birthDate":"2093-01-07","birthday":"01-07","age":33,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"triage-care","name":"Triage care","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Defender of clinical judgment","description":"Dividing scarce prescriptions preserves access while triage constrains refusal of care. Clinical judgment and allocation are supported; combat experience is not recorded.","behavior":"Quiet of voice, he did not step back at a vote. He liked to recast the guild''s charity as a right.","stress":"Fear. That he would be branded a great power''s puppet patient and expelled from the council.","relationship":"Relations. Shared the vote with Ryu Eunbi, watched Sim Dalho''s pre-buying, and promised Baek On the Bukhansan Bogukmun sickbed allocation.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: section chief. Title: patients'' council representative. He posted the sickbed waiting list at the market gate and declared every private care contract void without three trade stamps.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: section chief. Title: patients'' council representative. He posted the sickbed waiting list at the market gate and declared every private care contract void without three trade stamps.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That he would be branded a great power''s puppet patient and expelled from the council.","relationship":"Relations. Shared the vote with Ryu Eunbi, watched Sim Dalho''s pre-buying, and promised Baek On the Bukhansan Bogukmun sickbed allocation.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Dividing scarce prescriptions preserves access while triage constrains refusal of care. Clinical judgment and allocation are supported; combat experience is not recorded.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c804-cc9c-c548","name":"Cheonan Jeon Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c804-cc9c-c548.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-45,"Openness":35,"Force":-70,"Material":-25,"Communal":15,"Principle":40,"Public":15,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":-10,"Monopoly":5,"Risk":-10,"Display":25,"Sustained":-5,"Orientation":"None","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Hospital bed waiting list and confidential treatment contract review","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Specialist","Title":"Patient Representative of the Medical Affairs Council","Values":"Authority −45 | Openness 35 | Force −70 | Materialism −25 | Community 15 | Principle 40 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 30 | Decentralization 30 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving −10 | Monopoly 5 | Risk −10 | Display 25 | Persistence −5 | Orientation: none | Bonding: none"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2093-01-07. As of the 2126 opening, Jeon Sol holds the post of Patient Representative of the Medical Council, continuing the existing watch and its records. The succession record for that post opened with a substitute shift covering an unauthorized absence at shift change.\n- The bed waitlist roster and private treatment contract review desk in Jegi-dong is Jeon Sol''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, title of nobility, fief, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Specialist. Title: Triage Care Specialist. Posts the bed waitlist roster at the market entrance and declares private treatment contracts void without the clinical approval of the attending specialist and the corps leader.","Anecdote":"In 2125, amid a herb shortage, he halved the prescription quantities and shared them out to everyone. That day''s record remained as handover evidence for the next watch to verify.","Relationships":"Shares votes with Ryu Eunbi, watches Sim Dalho''s pre-emptive purchases, and promised Baek On bed allocations at Bukhansan Bogungmun.","Ambition":"Keeps the attending specialist''s right to refuse care tied to the triage-first principle, blocking secret deals that push out the wounded who bear a patron''s crest.","Fear":"Fears being branded a favored patient and expelled from the medical command.","Intervention":"Can expose the handwriting on a forged consent form, or publicly back Jeon Sol''s right to refuse care to prevent confusion in the medical command."},"biography":"Even with a quiet voice, Jeon Sol never backs down on clinical judgment and likes to rephrase medical neutrality as a right.\n\n- Livelihood: Reviewing the bed waitlist roster and private treatment contracts\n- Affiliation: White Cross Corps\n- Rank: Specialist\n- Title: Patient Representative of the Medical Council\n**Life.** Born on 2093-01-07. As of the 2126 opening, Jeon Sol holds the post of Patient Representative of the Medical Council, continuing the existing watch and its records. The succession record for that post opened with a substitute shift covering an unauthorized absence at shift change.\n- The bed waitlist roster and private treatment contract review desk in Jegi-dong is Jeon Sol''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, title of nobility, fief, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Specialist. Title: Triage Care Specialist. Posts the bed waitlist roster at the market entrance and declares private treatment contracts void without the clinical approval of the attending specialist and the corps leader.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, during a shortage of medicinal herbs, Jeon Sol halved the prescription quantities and shared them among everyone. That day''s record remained as handover evidence for the next watch to verify.\n\n**Relationships.** Shares votes with Ryu Eunbi, watches Sim Dalho''s pre-emptive purchases, and promised Baek On bed allocations at Bukhansan Bogungmun.\n\n**Ambition.** Keeps the attending specialist''s right to refuse care tied to the triage-first principle, blocking secret deals that push out the wounded who bear a patron''s crest.\n\n**Fear.** Fears being branded a favored patient and expelled from the medical command.\n\n**Intervention.** Can expose the handwriting on a forged consent form, or publicly back Jeon Sol''s right to refuse care to prevent confusion in the medical command.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −45 | Openness 35 | Force −70 | Materialism −25 | Community 15 | Principle 40 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 30 | Decentralization 30 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving −10 | Monopoly 5 | Risk −10 | Display 25 | Persistence −5 | Orientation: none | Bonding: none\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Jeon Sol","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Share the Council of Deliberation vote with the commander"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Sin Seungmin","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"Sin Seungmin cross-checks prescription records against Jeon Sol''s bed waitlist roster to distinguish requests that came in through private solicitation from the actual treatment order. Requests whose records do not match are verified with Jeon Sol, so that even when medicinal herbs run short, treatment by severity is not pushed aside by solicitation."},{"from":"Mun Cheolmin","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"Mun Cheolmin hands over the ledger of lives rescued from the fire, together with the prescription records, to Jeon Sol. Jeon Sol finds the patients missing from the bed waitlist roster and confirms the treatment order by severity, so that no one is dropped from treatment merely because the ledger was lost."},{"from":"Sim Tae-yang","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"Sim Taeyang hands over the ledger of lives rescued from the fire and the prescription records to Jeon Sol. Jeon Sol identifies the patients missing from the bed waitlist roster and sets the treatment order by severity, so that the loss of records does not lead to anyone being dropped from treatment."},{"from":"Sin Bungmin","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"Sin Bungmin confronts the conflicting testimonies about a prescription and relays the result to Jeon Sol. Jeon Sol reviews the bed roster and severity, so that a message passed on wrongly does not change the treatment order."},{"from":"Yang Namtae","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"Yang Namtae hands over the patient roster and prescription records he has kept to Jeon Sol. Jeon Sol checks the bed waitlist and severity to find the missing names, so that the loss of records does not lead to anyone being dropped from treatment."},{"from":"Seo Dalseo","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"Seo Dalseo passes the patient roster and prescription records she has kept to Jeon Sol. Jeon Sol checks the bed waitlist and severity to find the patients who were left out because of the lost records."},{"from":"Bae Summin","type":"Contract","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"Bae Summin verifies conflicting testimonies about prescriptions through confrontation and relays them to Jeon Sol. Jeon Sol checks the sickbed roster and severity levels so that wrongly relayed words do not change the order of treatment."},{"from":"Seon Nahwi","type":"Command","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"Under orders to carry Jeon Sol''s voting slips only in a sealed state,"},{"from":"Yeong Neulbit","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"is the disciple who transfers Jeon Sol''s veto into the ledger, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0328","name":"전솔","title":"의정회 환자대표","position":"의정회 환자대표","characterId":"K327","rank":"전문의","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"병상 대기 명부·비공개 치료 계약 심사","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-전솔","detailRoute":"/people/person-0328","birthDate":"2093-01-07","birthday":"01-07","age":33,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":12,"effective":12},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"triage-care","name":"중증도 진료","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"진료권을 지키는 의사","description":"처방량을 나눠 치료 접근을 유지하고 진료 거부권을 중증도 원칙에 묶는다. 임상 판단과 배분은 확인되지만 전투 경력은 없다.","behavior":"목소리가 작아도 임상 판단에서 물러서지 않는다. 진료의 중립 원칙을 권리로 바꿔 말하길 좋아한다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 수련의를 지도하고 후계자를 지정하며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 자신이 강국의 꼭두각시 환자로 낙인찍혀 의료 지휘부에서 축출되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 류은비와 표결을 공유하고, 심달호의 선매를 감시하며, 백온에게 북한산보국문 병상 할당을 약속했다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 전문의. 직함은 중증도 진료 전문의. 병상 대기 명부를 시장 입구에 붙이고, 비공개 치료 계약은 담당 전문의와 단장의 임상 승인 없이 무효라고 선언한다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 전문의. 직함은 중증도 진료 전문의. 병상 대기 명부를 시장 입구에 붙이고, 비공개 치료 계약은 담당 전문의와 단장의 임상 승인 없이 무효라고 선언한다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 자신이 강국의 꼭두각시 환자로 낙인찍혀 의료 지휘부에서 축출되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 류은비와 표결을 공유하고, 심달호의 선매를 감시하며, 백온에게 북한산보국문 병상 할당을 약속했다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"처방량을 나눠 치료 접근을 유지하고 진료 거부권을 중증도 원칙에 묶는다. 임상 판단과 배분은 확인되지만 전투 경력은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c804-cc9c-c548","name":"천안 전씨","crest":"clan-crests/c804-cc9c-c548.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-45,"개방":35,"무력":-70,"물질":-25,"공동":15,"원칙":40,"공개":15,"자격":30,"분산":30,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":-10,"독점":5,"위험":-10,"과시":25,"지속":-5,"지향":"무성향","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"병상 대기 명부·비공개 치료 계약 심사","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"전문의","직함":"의정회 환자대표","가치관":"권위 −45 | 개방 35 | 무력 −70 | 물질 −25 | 공동 15 | 원칙 40 | 공개 15 | 자격 30 | 분산 30 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 −10 | 독점 5 | 위험 −10 | 과시 25 | 지속 −5 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2093-01-07에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의정회 환자대표 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 병상 대기 명부·비공개 치료 계약 심사 창구가 전솔의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 전문의. 직함은 중증도 진료 전문의. 병상 대기 명부를 시장 입구에 붙이고, 비공개 치료 계약은 담당 전문의와 단장의 임상 승인 없이 무효라고 선언한다.","일화":"2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.","관계":"류은비와 표결을 공유하고, 심달호의 선매를 감시하며, 백온에게 북한산보국문 병상 할당을 약속했다.","야망":"담당 전문의의 진료 거부권을 중증도 우선 원칙으로 남겨 후원 문장이 붙은 부상자를 밀어내는 밀약을 막는다.","공포":"자신이 특혜 환자로 낙인찍혀 의료 지휘부에서 축출되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"허위 동의서의 필적을 가리거나, 전솔의 진료 거부권을 공개 지지해 진료 지휘 혼선을 막을 수 있다."},"biography":"목소리가 작아도 임상 판단에서 물러서지 않는다. 진료의 중립 원칙을 권리로 바꿔 말하길 좋아한다.\n\n- 생업: 병상 대기 명부·비공개 치료 계약 심사\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 전문의\n- 직함: 의정회 환자대표\n**생애.** 2093-01-07에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의정회 환자대표 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 병상 대기 명부·비공개 치료 계약 심사 창구가 전솔의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 전문의. 직함은 중증도 진료 전문의. 병상 대기 명부를 시장 입구에 붙이고, 비공개 치료 계약은 담당 전문의와 단장의 임상 승인 없이 무효라고 선언한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 약재 부족으로 처방량을 반으로 나눠 모두에게 나눴다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 류은비와 표결을 공유하고, 심달호의 선매를 감시하며, 백온에게 북한산보국문 병상 할당을 약속했다.\n\n**야망.** 담당 전문의의 진료 거부권을 중증도 우선 원칙으로 남겨 후원 문장이 붙은 부상자를 밀어내는 밀약을 막는다.\n\n**공포.** 자신이 특혜 환자로 낙인찍혀 의료 지휘부에서 축출되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 허위 동의서의 필적을 가리거나, 전솔의 진료 거부권을 공개 지지해 진료 지휘 혼선을 막을 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −45 | 개방 35 | 무력 −70 | 물질 −25 | 공동 15 | 원칙 40 | 공개 15 | 자격 30 | 분산 30 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 −10 | 독점 5 | 위험 −10 | 과시 25 | 지속 −5 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"전솔","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"의정회 표결을 단장와 공유"}],"incoming":[{"from":"신승민","type":"계약","to":"전솔","basis":"신승민은 처방 기록을 전솔의 병상 대기 명부와 대조해 사적 청탁으로 들어온 요청과 진료 순서를 구분한다. 기록이 맞지 않는 요청은 전솔에게 확인하여, 약재가 부족한 때에도 중증도에 따른 치료가 청탁에 밀리지 않게 한다."},{"from":"문철민","type":"계약","to":"전솔","basis":"문철민은 화재에서 구한 인명 장부를 처방 기록과 함께 전솔에게 넘긴다. 전솔은 병상 대기 명부에서 빠진 환자를 찾아 중증도로 진료 순서를 확인하고, 장부가 소실됐다는 이유만으로 치료에서 누락되지 않게 한다."},{"from":"심태양","type":"계약","to":"전솔","basis":"심태양은 화재에서 구한 인명 장부와 처방 기록을 전솔에게 인계한다. 전솔은 병상 대기 명부에서 빠진 환자를 확인하고 중증도에 따라 진료 순서를 잡아, 기록 손실이 치료 누락으로 이어지지 않게 한다."},{"from":"신북민","type":"계약","to":"전솔","basis":"신북민은 처방에 관한 갈린 증언을 대질로 확인해 전솔에게 전한다. 전솔은 병상 명부와 중증도를 살펴 잘못 전달된 말이 치료 순서를 바꾸지 않게 한다."},{"from":"양남태","type":"계약","to":"전솔","basis":"양남태는 보관한 환자 명부와 처방 기록을 전솔에게 넘긴다. 전솔은 병상 대기와 중증도를 확인해 빠진 이름을 찾고 기록 손실이 진료 누락으로 이어지지 않게 한다."},{"from":"서달서","type":"계약","to":"전솔","basis":"서달서는 보관한 환자 명부와 처방 기록을 전솔에게 전한다. 전솔은 병상 대기와 중증도를 확인해 기록 손실 때문에 빠진 환자를 찾는다."},{"from":"배숲민","type":"계약","to":"전솔","basis":"배숲민은 처방에 관한 갈린 증언을 대질로 확인해 전솔에게 전한다. 전솔은 병상 명부와 중증도를 확인해 잘못 전해진 말이 진료 순서를 바꾸지 않게 한다."},{"from":"선나휘","type":"지휘","to":"전솔","basis":"전솔의 표결 쪽지를 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"영늘빛","type":"신도","to":"전솔","basis":"전솔의 거부권을 원장으로 옮기는 신도이고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0329', 'cc9c-c601-c591', '{"id":"person-0329","name":"Cheon Daum","title":"Medicine dryer mechanic, Sim Dalho''s practical aide","position":"Medicine dryer mechanic, Sim Dalho''s practical aide","characterId":"K328","rank":"Resident","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Medicinal Herb Drying Temperature and Filter Log","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-cheondaum","detailRoute":"/people/person-0329","birthDate":"2069-03-17","birthday":"03-17","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"drying-room-condition-logging","name":"Drying room condition logging","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"No skipped seal check","description":"Temperature and filters are logged each shift; a missing seal check stops shipment. Two absent log days are not recast as successful repairs.","behavior":"She heard the drying room''s temperature and fan sound before human words and took a repair later than the posted date as an insult. If the tool-box seal skipped even one day, she stopped that day''s release.","stress":"Fear. That one night of cut power would rot the summer herbs, and the Amsa protection warehouse would fill the gap.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice backing Sim Dalho''s origin inspection posts in the field, he matched drying power to Su Hyoeun''s emergency generators. Opened the drying room before Ryu Eunbi''s care supplies ran dry.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: member. Title: herb dryer mechanic, duty officer of Sim Dalho. Each rotation he wrote temperature and filter thickness on the inspection posts and fitted no part without the guild stamp.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: member. Title: herb dryer mechanic, duty officer of Sim Dalho. Each rotation he wrote temperature and filter thickness on the inspection posts and fitted no part without the guild stamp.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That one night of cut power would rot the summer herbs, and the Amsa protection warehouse would fill the gap.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice backing Sim Dalho''s origin inspection posts in the field, he matched drying power to Su Hyoeun''s emergency generators. Opened the drying room before Ryu Eunbi''s care supplies ran dry.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Temperature and filters are logged each shift; a missing seal check stops shipment. Two absent log days are not recast as successful repairs.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc9c-c601-c591","name":"Yeongyang Cheon Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cc9c-c601-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":25,"Force":-40,"Material":-5,"Communal":20,"Principle":30,"Public":10,"Eligibility":45,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":-15,"Display":20,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medicinal Herb Drying Temperature and Filter Log","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Resident","Title":"Medicine dryer mechanic, Sim Dalho''s practical aide","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 25 | Force −40 | Material −5 | Communal 20 | Principle 30 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 45 | Dispersion 25 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 10 | Monopoly 30 | Risk −15 | Display 20 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Bisexual | Bond Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2069-03-17. As of the 2126 opening, holds the duties of herb dryer mechanic and Sim Dalho''s practical aide, carrying on the existing duty rosters and records. In the succession record for that post, it opened through a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- The herb-drying temperature and filter record desk in Cheongnyangni-dong is Cheon Daum''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, title of nobility, fief, or right of possession.","Offices":"Rank: trainee physician. Title: Medicinal Herb Drying Management Trainee. Writes the temperature and filter thickness on the tally stake every shift, and does not install any part lacking a medical-duty stamp.","Anecdote":"When counterfeit summer medicine flowed out through Bukhansan Bogungmun, the temperature log for one drying room was blank for two days.","Relationships":"She is the field priest who backs Sim Dalho''s origin-marking stake, and she matches drying power to Su Hyoeun''s emergency generation. She opens the drying room before Ryu Eunbi''s treatment supplies dry out.","Ambition":"She wants to bind the Cheongnyangni dryers under the Medical Command''s public maintenance schedule, so that private pre-purchases cannot sweep up the damp raw herbs at a low price.","Fear":"She fears that power will fail for even a single night, spoiling the summer herbs, and that Amsa Protected Warehouse will fill the gap.","Intervention":"She can identify who entered during the blank log, or find replacement parts to bring drying back."},"biography":"She listens to the drying room''s temperature and fan sounds before she listens to people, and she regards any repair later than the date written on the marker stake as an insult. If the toolbox seal is skipped even for a single day, she halts that day''s shipment.\n\n- Livelihood: Herb-drying temperature and filter records\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: Resident\n- Title: Herb dryer maintenance technician, Sim Dalho''s working-level contact\n**Life.** Born on 2069-03-17. As of the 2126 opening, she holds the post of herb dryer maintenance technician and Sim Dalho''s working-level contact, continuing the existing duty rota and records. The succession record for that post opens with a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- The herb-drying temperature and filter record desk in Cheongnyangni-dong is Cheon Daum''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Resident. Title: Herb Drying Management Resident. At every shift change she writes the temperature and filter thickness on the marker stake, and she does not install any part lacking the clinical duty stamp.\n\n**Anecdote.** When counterfeit summer medicine flowed out through Bukhansan Bogungmun, the temperature log for one drying room was blank for two days.\n\n**Relationships.** She is the field priest who backs Sim Dalho''s origin-marking stake, and she matches drying power to Su Hyoeun''s emergency generation. She opens the drying room before Ryu Eunbi''s treatment supplies dry out.\n\n**Ambition.** She wants to bind the Cheongnyangni dryers under the Medical Command''s public maintenance schedule, so that private pre-purchases cannot sweep up the damp raw herbs at a low price.\n\n**Fear.** She fears that power will fail for even a single night, spoiling the summer herbs, and that Amsa Protected Warehouse will fill the gap.\n\n**Intervention.** She can identify who entered during the blank log, or find replacement parts to bring drying back.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 25 | Force −40 | Materialism −5 | Community 20 | Principle 30 | Transparency 10 | Qualification 45 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly 30 | Risk −15 | Display 20 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: bisexual | Bonding: non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Cheon Daum","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Sim Dalho","basis":"A priest who backs Sim Dalho''s origin marker post in the field, and"},{"from":"Cheon Daum","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Su Hyoeun","basis":"She matches drying power to Su Hyoeun''s emergency generation."}],"incoming":[{"from":"Su Hyoeun","type":"Contract","to":"Cheon Daum","basis":"She matches output to Cheon Daum''s dryer, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0329","name":"천다움","title":"약재 건조기 정비사, 심달호의 실무 담당자","position":"약재 건조기 정비사, 심달호의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K328","rank":"수련의","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"약재 건조 온도·필터 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-천다움","detailRoute":"/people/person-0329","birthDate":"2069-03-17","birthday":"03-17","age":57,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"drying-room-condition-logging","name":"건조실 상태 기록","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"봉인을 건너뛰지 않는다","description":"교대마다 온도와 필터를 기록하고 봉인 공백에는 출하를 멈춘다. 이틀의 빈 일지는 정비 성공으로 바꾸지 않는다.","behavior":"건조실 온도와 팬 소리를 사람 말보다 먼저 듣고, 말목에 적힌 일자보다 늦은 수리를 모욕으로 본다. 공구함 봉인을 하루라도 건너뛰면 그날 출하를 멈춘다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 담당 전문의의 도제로 배우며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 전력이 한 밤만 끊겨 여름 생약이 썩고, 그 공백을 암사 보호창고가 메우는 것.","relationship":"관계. 심달호의 원산지 말목을 현장에서 받치는 신도이고, 수효은의 비상 발전에 건조 전력을 맞춘다. 류은비의 치료 물자가 마르기 전에 건조실을 연다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 건조 관리 수련의. 교대마다 온도와 필터 두께를 말목에 쓰고, 진료 당직 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 건조 관리 수련의. 교대마다 온도와 필터 두께를 말목에 쓰고, 진료 당직 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 전력이 한 밤만 끊겨 여름 생약이 썩고, 그 공백을 암사 보호창고가 메우는 것.","relationship":"관계. 심달호의 원산지 말목을 현장에서 받치는 신도이고, 수효은의 비상 발전에 건조 전력을 맞춘다. 류은비의 치료 물자가 마르기 전에 건조실을 연다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"교대마다 온도와 필터를 기록하고 봉인 공백에는 출하를 멈춘다. 이틀의 빈 일지는 정비 성공으로 바꾸지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc9c-c601-c591","name":"영양 천씨","crest":"clan-crests/cc9c-c601-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":25,"무력":-40,"물질":-5,"공동":20,"원칙":30,"공개":10,"자격":45,"분산":25,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":30,"위험":-15,"과시":20,"지속":0,"지향":"양성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"약재 건조 온도·필터 기록","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"수련의","직함":"약재 건조기 정비사, 심달호의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 25 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −5 | 공동 20 | 원칙 30 | 공개 10 | 자격 45 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 30 | 위험 −15 | 과시 20 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2069-03-17에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 약재 건조기 정비사, 심달호의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 약재 건조 온도·필터 기록 창구가 천다움의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 건조 관리 수련의. 교대마다 온도와 필터 두께를 말목에 쓰고, 진료 당직 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.","일화":"여름 가짜 약이 북한산보국문으로 흘러가자 건조실 한 칸의 온도 일지가 이틀분 비어 있었다.","관계":"심달호의 원산지 말목을 현장에서 받치는 신도이고, 수효은의 비상 발전에 건조 전력을 맞춘다. 류은비의 치료 물자가 마르기 전에 건조실을 연다.","야망":"청량리 건조기를 의료 지휘부 공개 정비표 아래로 묶어 비공개 선매가 습기 많은 생약을 싸게 쓸어가지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"전력이 한 밤만 끊겨 여름 생약이 썩고, 그 공백을 암사 보호창고가 메우는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"빈 일지의 출입자를 밝히거나, 대체 부품을 구해 건조를 되살릴 수 있다."},"biography":"건조실 온도와 팬 소리를 사람 말보다 먼저 듣고, 말목에 적힌 일자보다 늦은 수리를 모욕으로 본다. 공구함 봉인을 하루라도 건너뛰면 그날 출하를 멈춘다.\n\n- 생업: 약재 건조 온도·필터 기록\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 수련의\n- 직함: 약재 건조기 정비사, 심달호의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2069-03-17에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 약재 건조기 정비사, 심달호의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 약재 건조 온도·필터 기록 창구가 천다움의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 건조 관리 수련의. 교대마다 온도와 필터 두께를 말목에 쓰고, 진료 당직 도장 없는 부품은 달지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 여름 가짜 약이 북한산보국문으로 흘러가자 건조실 한 칸의 온도 일지가 이틀분 비어 있었다.\n\n**관계.** 심달호의 원산지 말목을 현장에서 받치는 신도이고, 수효은의 비상 발전에 건조 전력을 맞춘다. 류은비의 치료 물자가 마르기 전에 건조실을 연다.\n\n**야망.** 청량리 건조기를 의료 지휘부 공개 정비표 아래로 묶어 비공개 선매가 습기 많은 생약을 싸게 쓸어가지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 전력이 한 밤만 끊겨 여름 생약이 썩고, 그 공백을 암사 보호창고가 메우는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 빈 일지의 출입자를 밝히거나, 대체 부품을 구해 건조를 되살릴 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 25 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −5 | 공동 20 | 원칙 30 | 공개 10 | 자격 45 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 30 | 위험 −15 | 과시 20 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"천다움","type":"신도","to":"심달호","basis":"심달호의 원산지 말목을 현장에서 받치는 신도이고"},{"from":"천다움","type":"신도","to":"수효은","basis":"수효은의 비상 발전에 건조 전력을 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"수효은","type":"계약","to":"천다움","basis":"천다움의 건조기에 출력을 맞추고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0330', 'b3d9-ad11-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0330","name":"Dong Neulsol","title":"Medicinal Herb Transport Logistics Merchant","position":"Medicinal Herb Transport Logistics Merchant","characterId":"K329","rank":"Resident","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Medicinal Herb Intake Weight and Outbound Invoice Check","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-dongneulsol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0330","birthDate":"2075-03-13","birthday":"03-13","age":51,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"shipment-weight-reconciliation","name":"Shipment weight reconciliation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"No verbal freight rates","description":"Receiving weight is checked before two witnesses and unsealed invoices are not loaded. The cause of missing weights is not established.","behavior":"He put box weights and drying dates on the same scales and did not admit as a guest any envoy who arrived with pre-buying receipts alone. He cut bargains short and honored no verbal freight.","stress":"Fear. That a munitions clause would mix into febrifuge invoices and lay the market floor bare for a season.","relationship":"Relations. Held a transport contract with Sim Dalho and matched weights on Dong Juha''s market scales. Wrote the exchange ratio between Eun Taeho''s Garak food and herbs into the invoice tail.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: member. Title: herb transport logistics merchant. Two witnesses reported intake weights, and he loaded no bulk pre-buying invoice before the stamps of Sim Dalho and Jeon Sol.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: member. Title: herb transport logistics merchant. Two witnesses reported intake weights, and he loaded no bulk pre-buying invoice before the stamps of Sim Dalho and Jeon Sol.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That a munitions clause would mix into febrifuge invoices and lay the market floor bare for a season.","relationship":"Relations. Held a transport contract with Sim Dalho and matched weights on Dong Juha''s market scales. Wrote the exchange ratio between Eun Taeho''s Garak food and herbs into the invoice tail.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Receiving weight is checked before two witnesses and unsealed invoices are not loaded. The cause of missing weights is not established.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b3d9-ad11-cc9c","name":"Gwangcheon Dong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b3d9-ad11-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":35,"Force":-45,"Material":5,"Communal":15,"Principle":40,"Public":30,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":10,"Display":-10,"Sustained":40,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medicinal Herb Intake Weight and Outbound Invoice Check","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Resident","Title":"Medicinal Herb Transport Logistics Merchant","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 35 | Force −45 | Materialism 5 | Community 15 | Principle 40 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 10 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 10 | Display −10 | Persistence 40 | Orientation: fluid | Bonding: non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2075-03-13. As of the 2126 opening, he holds the post of herb transport logistics merchant, continuing the existing duty rota and records. The succession record for that post opened through the counterfeit medicine seal.\n- The desk for checking incoming herb weights and outgoing invoices in Jegi-dong is Dong Neulsol''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Resident. Title: Herb Transport Resident. Two witnesses observe the incoming weight, and a bulk outgoing invoice is not loaded until it bears the treatment-allocation seal of the attending specialist and the Order''s chief.","Anecdote":"On the day the pre-purchase ledger vanished, the transport invoice for the same hour had three weight gaps.","Relationships":"Holds a transport contract with Sim Dalho and matches weights to Dong Juha''s market scale. Writes the exchange ratio between Eun Taeho''s Garak grain and medicinal herbs at the end of the invoice.","Ambition":"Wants to open Jegi-dong and Cheongnyangni herb transport only at public market prices and severity-assigned weights, so that private monopoly bids cannot buy up the carts.","Fear":"Fears that a military crest will get mixed into the fever-herb invoices and lay the market floor bare within a single season.","Intervention":"Can make the gap invoices public, or stop a private pre-purchase agent''s cart in front of the scale."},"biography":"Puts the weight of each crate and its drying date on the same scale, and does not admit as a guest any envoy who comes holding only a pre-purchase receipt. Haggling is kept short, and verbal freight charges are not recognized.\n\n- Livelihood: Checking incoming herb weights and outgoing invoices\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: Resident\n- Title: Herb transport logistics merchant\n**Life.** Born on 2075-03-13. As of the 2126 opening, he holds the post of herb transport logistics merchant, continuing the existing duty rota and records. The succession record for that post opened through the counterfeit medicine seal.\n- The desk for checking incoming herb weights and outgoing invoices in Jegi-dong is Dong Neulsol''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Resident. Title: Herb Transport Resident. Two witnesses observe the incoming weight, and a bulk outgoing invoice is not loaded until it bears the treatment-allocation seal of the attending specialist and the Order''s chief.\n\n**Anecdote.** On the day the pre-purchase ledger vanished, the transport invoice for the same hour had three weight gaps.\n\n**Relationships.** Holds a transport contract with Sim Dalho and matches weights to Dong Juha''s market scale. Writes the exchange ratio between Eun Taeho''s Garak grain and medicinal herbs at the end of the invoice.\n\n**Ambition.** Wants to open Jegi-dong and Cheongnyangni herb transport only at public market prices and severity-assigned weights, so that private monopoly bids cannot buy up the carts.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that a military crest will get mixed into the fever-herb invoices and lay the market floor bare within a single season.\n\n**Intervention.** Can make the gap invoices public, or stop a private pre-purchase agent''s cart in front of the scale.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 35 | Force −45 | Materialism 5 | Community 15 | Principle 40 | Transparency 30 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 10 | Display −10 | Persistence 40 | Orientation: fluid | Bonding: non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Dong Neulsol","type":"Contract","to":"Sim Dalho","basis":"Enters a transport contract with Sim Dalho, and"},{"from":"Dong Neulsol","type":"Contract","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"Matches weights to Dong Juha''s market scale"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Dong Juha","type":"Command","to":"Dong Neulsol","basis":"Sets Dong Neulsol''s transport weights to the same scale marks"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0330","name":"동늘솔","title":"약재 운송 물류상","position":"약재 운송 물류상","characterId":"K329","rank":"수련의","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"약재 입고 중량·출고 송장 확인","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-동늘솔","detailRoute":"/people/person-0330","birthDate":"2075-03-13","birthday":"03-13","age":51,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"shipment-weight-reconciliation","name":"운송 중량 대조","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"구두 운임을 인정하지 않는다","description":"두 증인 앞에서 입고 중량을 확인하고 날인 없는 송장을 싣지 않는다. 무게 공백의 원인 규명은 아직 없다.","behavior":"상자 무게와 건조 일자를 같은 저울에 올리고, 선매 영수증만 들고 온 사신을 손님으로 들이지 않는다. 흥정은 짧게 끝내고 구두 운임을 인정하지 않는다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 담당 전문의의 도제로 배우며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 군수 문장이 해열 생약 송장에 섞여 시장 바닥이 한 계절에 드러나는 것.","relationship":"관계. 심달호와 운송 계약을 맺고, 동주하의 시장 저울에 무게를 맞춘다. 은태호의 가락 식량과 약재 교환 비율을 송장 말미에 적는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 운송 수련의. 입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 대량 출고 송장은 담당 전문의와 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있기 전에는 싣지 않는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 운송 수련의. 입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 대량 출고 송장은 담당 전문의와 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있기 전에는 싣지 않는다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 군수 문장이 해열 생약 송장에 섞여 시장 바닥이 한 계절에 드러나는 것.","relationship":"관계. 심달호와 운송 계약을 맺고, 동주하의 시장 저울에 무게를 맞춘다. 은태호의 가락 식량과 약재 교환 비율을 송장 말미에 적는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"두 증인 앞에서 입고 중량을 확인하고 날인 없는 송장을 싣지 않는다. 무게 공백의 원인 규명은 아직 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b3d9-ad11-cc9c","name":"광천 동씨","crest":"clan-crests/b3d9-ad11-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":35,"무력":-45,"물질":5,"공동":15,"원칙":40,"공개":30,"자격":20,"분산":15,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":10,"위험":10,"과시":-10,"지속":40,"지향":"유동","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"약재 입고 중량·출고 송장 확인","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"수련의","직함":"약재 운송 물류상","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 35 | 무력 −45 | 물질 5 | 공동 15 | 원칙 40 | 공개 30 | 자격 20 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 10 | 위험 10 | 과시 −10 | 지속 40 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2075-03-13에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 약재 운송 물류상 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 약재 입고 중량·출고 송장 확인 창구가 동늘솔의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 운송 수련의. 입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 대량 출고 송장은 담당 전문의와 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있기 전에는 싣지 않는다.","일화":"선매 장부가 사라진 날, 같은 시각의 운송 송장에 무게 공백이 세 칸 있었다.","관계":"심달호와 운송 계약을 맺고, 동주하의 시장 저울에 무게를 맞춘다. 은태호의 가락 식량과 약재 교환 비율을 송장 말미에 적는다.","야망":"제기동·청량리 약재 운송을 공개 시세와 중증도 배정 무게로만 열어 비공개 독점 입찰이 마차를 사지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"군수 문장이 해열 생약 송장에 섞여 시장 바닥이 한 계절에 드러나는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"공백 송장을 공개하거나, 비공개 선매 대리인의 마차를 저울 앞에서 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"상자 무게와 건조 일자를 같은 저울에 올리고, 선매 영수증만 들고 온 사신을 손님으로 들이지 않는다. 흥정은 짧게 끝내고 구두 운임을 인정하지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 약재 입고 중량·출고 송장 확인\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 수련의\n- 직함: 약재 운송 물류상\n**생애.** 2075-03-13에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 약재 운송 물류상 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 약재 입고 중량·출고 송장 확인 창구가 동늘솔의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 운송 수련의. 입고 중량을 두 증인이 보고, 대량 출고 송장은 담당 전문의와 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있기 전에는 싣지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 선매 장부가 사라진 날, 같은 시각의 운송 송장에 무게 공백이 세 칸 있었다.\n\n**관계.** 심달호와 운송 계약을 맺고, 동주하의 시장 저울에 무게를 맞춘다. 은태호의 가락 식량과 약재 교환 비율을 송장 말미에 적는다.\n\n**야망.** 제기동·청량리 약재 운송을 공개 시세와 중증도 배정 무게로만 열어 비공개 독점 입찰이 마차를 사지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 군수 문장이 해열 생약 송장에 섞여 시장 바닥이 한 계절에 드러나는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 공백 송장을 공개하거나, 비공개 선매 대리인의 마차를 저울 앞에서 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 35 | 무력 −45 | 물질 5 | 공동 15 | 원칙 40 | 공개 30 | 자격 20 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 10 | 위험 10 | 과시 −10 | 지속 40 | 지향 유동 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"동늘솔","type":"계약","to":"심달호","basis":"심달호와 운송 계약을 맺고"},{"from":"동늘솔","type":"계약","to":"동주하","basis":"동주하의 시장 저울에 무게를 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"동주하","type":"지휘","to":"동늘솔","basis":"동늘솔의 운송 무게를 같은 눈금에 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0331', 'bc29-c628-c591', '{"id":"person-0331","name":"Bang Hanul","title":"Triage Clinic Medical Officer, Eun Chaeyun''s Working-Level Aide","position":"Triage Clinic Medical Officer, Eun Chaeyun''s Working-Level Aide","characterId":"K330","rank":"Resident","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Triage Chart and Medical Findings Posting","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-banghanul","detailRoute":"/people/person-0331","birthDate":"2093-01-06","birthday":"01-06","age":33,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"bed-order-administration","name":"Bed order administration","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Stops priority pressure","description":"Priority requests wait for the supervising clinician and bed order is enforced. Discovery of medicine on a shelf does not establish successful identification.","behavior":"Quiet of hand, he locked the sickbeds whenever he received a note to change the care order. An enemy''s wound stood in the same line before the severity table.","stress":"Fear. That the care room would become a war-booty sorting hall and the severity table he stamped would become scrap paper in a season.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice executing the sickbed order as Eun Chaeyun''s apprentice, he shared sickbeds with Bang Misan''s clinic. Put Ryu Eunbi''s care principles at the top of the duty ledger.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: member. Title: severity ward medic, duty officer of Eun Chaeyun. He pasted the severity table and contribution labor side by side and accepted no great-power officer''s priority care note before the guild posted it.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: member. Title: severity ward medic, duty officer of Eun Chaeyun. He pasted the severity table and contribution labor side by side and accepted no great-power officer''s priority care note before the guild posted it.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the care room would become a war-booty sorting hall and the severity table he stamped would become scrap paper in a season.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice executing the sickbed order as Eun Chaeyun''s apprentice, he shared sickbeds with Bang Misan''s clinic. Put Ryu Eunbi''s care principles at the top of the duty ledger.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Priority requests wait for the supervising clinician and bed order is enforced. Discovery of medicine on a shelf does not establish successful identification.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc29-c628-c591","name":"Onyang Bang Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc29-c628-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":40,"Force":-60,"Material":-15,"Communal":15,"Principle":60,"Public":30,"Eligibility":30,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-40,"Risk":-10,"Display":5,"Sustained":40,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Triage Chart and Medical Findings Posting","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Resident","Title":"Triage Clinic Medical Officer, Eun Chaeyun''s Working-Level Aide","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 40 | Force −60 | Material −15 | Communal 15 | Principle 60 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 30 | Dispersal 15 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving 0 | Monopoly −40 | Risk −10 | Display 5 | Endurance 40 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2093-01-06. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Triage Medical Officer, working-level aide to Eun Chaeyun, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opened with a counterfeit-drug seal.\n- The triage chart and clinical findings posting window in Jegi-dong is Bang Hanul''s working reference point. This working reference point does not fix residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, domain, or right of possession.","Offices":"Rank: Resident. Title: Triage Clinic Resident. Posts triage charts and clinical findings side by side, and does not accept an armed duty chief''s priority-treatment note until the attending specialist approves it.","Anecdote":"After a counterfeit fever reducer was used on a child of Bukhansan Bogukmun, another tin of the same capsule-shaped medicine turned up on the clinic shelf.","Relationships":"As Eun Chaeyun''s apprentice, a disciple who enforces the bed order, and shares Bang Misan''s clinic beds. Puts Ryu Eunbi''s treatment principle at the top of the duty ledger.","Ambition":"Leaves a clinical record of accepting enemy wounded by severity alone as the field original of the Medical Command Charter Addendum.","Fear":"Fears the clinic turning into a plunder-sorting yard, so that the triage charts they stamped become scrap paper within a season.","Intervention":"Can cross-check the shelf drugs, or hide enemy wounded so as to frame someone for a charter violation."},"biography":"Quiet-handed, but locks the bed whenever handed a note ordering the treatment sequence changed. Even an enemy''s wounds stand on the same line before the triage chart.\n\n- Livelihood: Posting triage charts and clinical findings\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: Resident\n- Title: Triage Medical Officer, Eun Chaeyun''s Working-Level Aide\n**Life.** Born on 2093-01-06. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Triage Medical Officer, working-level aide to Eun Chaeyun, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opened with a counterfeit-drug seal.\n- The triage chart and clinical findings posting window in Jegi-dong is Bang Hanul''s working reference point. This working reference point does not fix residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, domain, or right of possession.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Resident. Title: Triage Clinic Resident. Posts triage charts and clinical findings side by side, and does not accept an armed duty chief''s priority-treatment note until the attending specialist approves it.\n\n**Anecdote.** After a counterfeit fever reducer was used on a child of Bukhansan Bogukmun, another tin of the same capsule-shaped medicine turned up on the clinic shelf.\n\n**Relations.** As Eun Chaeyun''s apprentice, a disciple who enforces the bed order, and shares Bang Misan''s clinic beds. Puts Ryu Eunbi''s treatment principle at the top of the duty ledger.\n\n**Ambition.** Leaves a clinical record of accepting enemy wounded by severity alone as the field original of the Medical Command Charter Addendum.\n\n**Fear.** Fears the clinic turning into a plunder-sorting yard, so that the triage charts they stamped become scrap paper within a season.\n\n**Intervention.** Can cross-check the shelf drugs, or hide enemy wounded so as to frame someone for a charter violation.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 40 | Force −60 | Material −15 | Communal 15 | Principle 60 | Publicity 30 | Qualification 30 | Dispersal 15 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly −40 | Risk −10 | Display 5 | Endurance 40 | Orientation Bisexual | Bonding None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bang Hanul","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"a protégé who, as Eun Chaeyun''s apprentice, enforces the order of the sickbeds, and"},{"from":"Bang Hanul","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Bang Misan","basis":"Shares Bang Misan''s clinic beds"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Bang Misan","type":"Contract","to":"Bang Hanul","basis":"Posts Bang Hanul''s duty ledger on the door"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0331","name":"방한울","title":"중증도 진료 의무원, 은채윤의 실무 담당자","position":"중증도 진료 의무원, 은채윤의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K330","rank":"수련의","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"중증도 표·진료 소견 게시","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-방한울","detailRoute":"/people/person-0331","birthDate":"2093-01-06","birthday":"01-06","age":33,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"bed-order-administration","name":"병상 순서 집행","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"우선 치료 압박을 멈춘다","description":"담당 전문의의 승인 전 우선 요청을 막고 침상 순서를 집행한다. 선반 약의 발견이 감별 성공을 뜻하지 않는다.","behavior":"손놀림은 조용하나 치료 순서를 바꾸라는 쪽지를 받으면 침상을 잠근다. 적의 부상도 중증도 표 앞에서는 같은 줄로 본다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 담당 전문의의 도제로 배우며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 진료실이 전리품 분류장이 되어 자신이 찍은 중증도 표가 한 계절에 휴지가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 은채윤의 도제로서 침상 순서를 집행하는 신도이고, 방미산의 진료소 병상을 나눈다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 당직 원장 맨 위에 둔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 중증도 진료 수련의. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 붙이고, 강국 장교의 우선 치료 쪽지는 담당 전문의의 승인 전까지 받지 않는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 중증도 진료 수련의. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 붙이고, 강국 장교의 우선 치료 쪽지는 담당 전문의의 승인 전까지 받지 않는다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 진료실이 전리품 분류장이 되어 자신이 찍은 중증도 표가 한 계절에 휴지가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 은채윤의 도제로서 침상 순서를 집행하는 신도이고, 방미산의 진료소 병상을 나눈다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 당직 원장 맨 위에 둔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"담당 전문의의 승인 전 우선 요청을 막고 침상 순서를 집행한다. 선반 약의 발견이 감별 성공을 뜻하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc29-c628-c591","name":"온양 방씨","crest":"clan-crests/bc29-c628-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":40,"무력":-60,"물질":-15,"공동":15,"원칙":60,"공개":30,"자격":30,"분산":15,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-40,"위험":-10,"과시":5,"지속":40,"지향":"양성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"중증도 표·진료 소견 게시","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"수련의","직함":"중증도 진료 의무원, 은채윤의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 40 | 무력 −60 | 물질 −15 | 공동 15 | 원칙 60 | 공개 30 | 자격 30 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −40 | 위험 −10 | 과시 5 | 지속 40 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2093-01-06에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 중증도 진료 의무원, 은채윤의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 중증도 표·진료 소견 게시 창구가 방한울의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수련의. 직함은 중증도 진료 수련의. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 붙이고, 무장 당직 책임자의 우선 치료 쪽지는 담당 전문의의 승인 전까지 받지 않는다.","일화":"가짜 해열제가 북한산보국문 어린이에게 쓰인 뒤, 같은 캡슐 모양의 약이 진료소 선반에서 한 통 더 나왔다.","관계":"은채윤의 도제로서 침상 순서를 집행하는 신도이고, 방미산의 진료소 병상을 나눈다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 당직 원장 맨 위에 둔다.","야망":"적군 부상자도 중증도만으로 받는 진료 기록을 의료 지휘부 헌장 부칙의 현장 원본으로 남긴다.","공포":"진료실이 전리품 분류장이 되어 자신이 찍은 중증도 표가 한 계절에 휴지가 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"선반 약을 대조하거나, 적군 부상자를 숨겨 헌장 위반 누명을 씌울 수 있다."},"biography":"손놀림은 조용하나 치료 순서를 바꾸라는 쪽지를 받으면 침상을 잠근다. 적의 부상도 중증도 표 앞에서는 같은 줄로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 중증도 표·진료 소견 게시\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 수련의\n- 직함: 중증도 진료 의무원, 은채윤의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2093-01-06에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 중증도 진료 의무원, 은채윤의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 중증도 표·진료 소견 게시 창구가 방한울의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수련의. 직함은 중증도 진료 수련의. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 붙이고, 무장 당직 책임자의 우선 치료 쪽지는 담당 전문의의 승인 전까지 받지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 가짜 해열제가 북한산보국문 어린이에게 쓰인 뒤, 같은 캡슐 모양의 약이 진료소 선반에서 한 통 더 나왔다.\n\n**관계.** 은채윤의 도제로서 침상 순서를 집행하는 신도이고, 방미산의 진료소 병상을 나눈다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 당직 원장 맨 위에 둔다.\n\n**야망.** 적군 부상자도 중증도만으로 받는 진료 기록을 의료 지휘부 헌장 부칙의 현장 원본으로 남긴다.\n\n**공포.** 진료실이 전리품 분류장이 되어 자신이 찍은 중증도 표가 한 계절에 휴지가 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 선반 약을 대조하거나, 적군 부상자를 숨겨 헌장 위반 누명을 씌울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 40 | 무력 −60 | 물질 −15 | 공동 15 | 원칙 60 | 공개 30 | 자격 30 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −40 | 위험 −10 | 과시 5 | 지속 40 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"방한울","type":"신도","to":"은채윤","basis":"은채윤의 도제로서 침상 순서를 집행하는 신도이고"},{"from":"방한울","type":"신도","to":"방미산","basis":"방미산의 진료소 병상을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"방미산","type":"계약","to":"방한울","basis":"방한울의 당직 원장을 문에 붙인다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0332', 'c218-d55c-c591', '{"id":"person-0332","name":"Su Choreong","title":"Jegi-dong East Quarantine Patrol, Ra Seyeong''s Working-Level Aide","position":"Jegi-dong East Quarantine Patrol, Ra Seyeong''s Working-Level Aide","characterId":"K331","rank":"Resident","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Quarantine Check and Release Patrol","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-su-chorong","detailRoute":"/people/person-0332","birthDate":"2098-03-16","birthday":"03-16","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"sanitation-patrol","name":"Sanitation patrol","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Checks before reopening","description":"They placed eastern closure markers after diarrheal spread and double-check entry seals. Field closure judgment is not expanded into comprehensive public health expertise.","behavior":"She trusted isolation days over rumor and wrote a political blockade lift into the patrol log as a cause of accidents. When an entry stamp ran faint, she turned back at the alley.","stress":"Fear. That turbid water and counterfeit drugs would spread in the same week and the patrol squad would be cut apart between the water state and the market.","relationship":"Relations. Rounded the east-side alleys under Ra Seyeong''s command and checked Ha Yunmok''s Achasan quarantine passes on the road. He pulled no inspection post before Seon Nahwi''s blockade dispatch arrived.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: member. Title: Jegi-dong east-side quarantine patrol, duty officer of Ra Seyeong. He checked the isolation curtain and entry stamps doubly and ran the lift patrol only after Jeong Hojun''s water-quality and drug-efficacy records arrived.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: member. Title: Jegi-dong east-side quarantine patrol, duty officer of Ra Seyeong. He checked the isolation curtain and entry stamps doubly and ran the lift patrol only after Jeong Hojun''s water-quality and drug-efficacy records arrived.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That turbid water and counterfeit drugs would spread in the same week and the patrol squad would be cut apart between the water state and the market.","relationship":"Relations. Rounded the east-side alleys under Ra Seyeong''s command and checked Ha Yunmok''s Achasan quarantine passes on the road. He pulled no inspection post before Seon Nahwi''s blockade dispatch arrived.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"They placed eastern closure markers after diarrheal spread and double-check entry seals. Field closure judgment is not expanded into comprehensive public health expertise.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c218-d55c-c591","name":"Hanyang Su Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c218-d55c-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":0,"Openness":30,"Force":-45,"Material":-20,"Communal":30,"Principle":45,"Public":15,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":0,"Risk":-20,"Display":-20,"Sustained":-20,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Quarantine Check and Release Patrol","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Resident","Title":"Jegi-dong East Quarantine Patrol, Ra Seyeong''s Working-Level Aide","Values":"Authority 0 | Openness 30 | Force −45 | Material −20 | Communal 30 | Principle 45 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 20 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 40 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −20 | Display −20 | Endurance −20 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2098-03-16. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of working-level aide to Ra Seyeong in the Jegi-dong East Quarantine Patrol, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opened with the catching of an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- The quarantine confirmation and release patrol window in Jegi-dong is Su Chorong''s working reference point. This working reference point does not fix residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, domain, or right of possession.","Offices":"Rank: Resident. Title: Jegi-dong Quarantine Resident. Double-checks isolation screens and entry stamps, and release patrols run only after Jeong Hojun''s water-quality and drug-efficacy records arrive.","Anecdote":"After a downpour, when diarrheal illness spread in Guui''s restricted water-supply section, Su Chorong was the first to drive the stakes blockading the east side of Jegi-dong Market for three days.","Relationships":"Patrols the east-side alleys under Ra Seyeong''s command and cross-checks Ha Yunmok''s Achasan quarantine pass on the road. Does not pull the stakes until Seon Nahwi''s blockade message arrives.","Ambition":"Has the patrol alone trigger the on-site activation of the Dongdaemun–Cheongnyangni quarantine blockade, preventing its non-medical lifting.","Fear":"Fears turbid water and counterfeit drugs spreading in the same week, so that the patrol is cut off between the water bureau and the market.","Intervention":"Can carry contamination-source samples to Magok, or pull the blockade stakes to restart medicinal herb shipments."},"biography":"Trusts quarantine days over rumors and records the political lifting of a blockade as the cause of the incident in the patrol log. If an entry stamp is smudged, turns back through the alley.\n\n- Livelihood: Quarantine confirmation and release patrol\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: Resident\n- Title: Jegi-dong East Quarantine Patrol, Ra Seyeong''s Working-Level Aide\n**Life.** Born on 2098-03-16. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of working-level aide to Ra Seyeong in the Jegi-dong East Quarantine Patrol, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opened with the catching of an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- The quarantine confirmation and release patrol window in Jegi-dong is Su Chorong''s working reference point. This working reference point does not fix residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, domain, or right of possession.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Resident. Title: Jegi-dong Quarantine Resident. Double-checks isolation screens and entry stamps, and release patrols run only after Jeong Hojun''s water-quality and drug-efficacy records arrive.\n\n**Anecdote.** After a downpour, when diarrheal illness spread in Guui''s restricted water-supply section, Su Chorong was the first to drive the stakes blockading the east side of Jegi-dong Market for three days.\n\n**Relations.** Patrols the east-side alleys under Ra Seyeong''s command and cross-checks Ha Yunmok''s Achasan quarantine pass on the road. Does not pull the stakes until Seon Nahwi''s blockade message arrives.\n\n**Ambition.** Has the patrol alone trigger the on-site activation of the Dongdaemun–Cheongnyangni quarantine blockade, preventing its non-medical lifting.\n\n**Fear.** Fears turbid water and counterfeit drugs spreading in the same week, so that the patrol is cut off between the water bureau and the market.\n\n**Intervention.** Can carry contamination-source samples to Magok, or pull the blockade stakes to restart medicinal herb shipments.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 0 | Openness 30 | Force −45 | Material −20 | Communal 30 | Principle 45 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 20 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −20 | Display −20 | Endurance −20 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Su Choreong","type":"Command","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"Circles the eastern alley under Ra Seyeong''s command and"},{"from":"Su Choreong","type":"Contract","to":"Seon Nahwi","basis":"I do not pull the stakes until Seon Nahwi''s blockade message arrives."}],"incoming":[{"from":"Sin Nabin","type":"Contract","to":"Su Choreong","basis":"Sin Nabin passes Su Chorong the signature that corrected the double payment in the quarantine ledger. Su Chorong examines the quarantine entry stamps and on-site checks to find places where the same entry or release was recorded twice, and does not make release rounds before the water-quality and efficacy records."},{"from":"Mun Baeun","type":"Contract","to":"Su Choreong","basis":"Mun Baeun hands the preserved quarantine transcript to Su Chorong''s entry check. Su Chorong checks the quarantine screens and stamps on site and does not accept blurred records as grounds for release."},{"from":"Jin Sup-hyeok","type":"Contract","to":"Su Choreong","basis":"Jin Suphyeok hands Su Chorong the duplicate-payment correction and the takeover signature for the quarantine records. Su Chorong checks the on-site entry stamps and quarantine status to find places where the same entry was recorded twice."},{"from":"Ryu Doryeon","type":"Contract","to":"Su Choreong","basis":"Ryu Dolyeon hands the quarantine transcript over to Su Chorong. Su Chorong checks the quarantine screens and entry stamps on site so that blurred records are not used as grounds for release."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0332","name":"수초롱","title":"제기동 동측 방역 순찰대, 라세영의 실무 담당자","position":"제기동 동측 방역 순찰대, 라세영의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K331","rank":"수련의","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"격리 확인·해제 순찰","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-수초롱","detailRoute":"/people/person-0332","birthDate":"2098-03-16","birthday":"03-16","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"sanitation-patrol","name":"방역 순찰","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"해제보다 확인","description":"설사병 확산 뒤 동측 봉쇄 말목을 먼저 박고 도장을 이중 확인한다. 현장 차단 판단을 전면적인 방역 전문성으로 확대하지 않는다.","behavior":"소문보다 격리 일수를 믿고, 정치적 봉쇄 해제를 사고 원인으로 순찰 일지에 적는다. 출입 도장이 흐리면 골목을 되돌아간다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 담당 전문의의 도제로 배우며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 탁수와 가짜 약이 같은 주에 퍼져 순찰대가 급수국과 시장 사이에서 잘리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 라세영의 지휘로 동측 골목을 돌고, 하윤목의 아차산 검역 통과증을 길에서 대조한다. 선나휘의 봉쇄 전갈이 오기 전에는 말목을 뽑지 않는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 제기동 방역 수련의. 격리 막과 출입 도장을 이중으로 확인하고, 해제 순찰은 정호준의 수질·약효 기록이 도착한 뒤에만 돈다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 제기동 방역 수련의. 격리 막과 출입 도장을 이중으로 확인하고, 해제 순찰은 정호준의 수질·약효 기록이 도착한 뒤에만 돈다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 탁수와 가짜 약이 같은 주에 퍼져 순찰대가 급수국과 시장 사이에서 잘리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 라세영의 지휘로 동측 골목을 돌고, 하윤목의 아차산 검역 통과증을 길에서 대조한다. 선나휘의 봉쇄 전갈이 오기 전에는 말목을 뽑지 않는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"설사병 확산 뒤 동측 봉쇄 말목을 먼저 박고 도장을 이중 확인한다. 현장 차단 판단을 전면적인 방역 전문성으로 확대하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c218-d55c-c591","name":"한양 수씨","crest":"clan-crests/c218-d55c-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":0,"개방":30,"무력":-45,"물질":-20,"공동":30,"원칙":45,"공개":15,"자격":20,"분산":20,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":0,"위험":-20,"과시":-20,"지속":-20,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"격리 확인·해제 순찰","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"수련의","직함":"제기동 동측 방역 순찰대, 라세영의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 0 | 개방 30 | 무력 −45 | 물질 −20 | 공동 30 | 원칙 45 | 공개 15 | 자격 20 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 0 | 위험 −20 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2098-03-16에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 제기동 동측 방역 순찰대, 라세영의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 격리 확인·해제 순찰 창구가 수초롱의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수련의. 직함은 제기동 방역 수련의. 격리 막과 출입 도장을 이중으로 확인하고, 해제 순찰은 정호준의 수질·약효 기록이 도착한 뒤에만 돈다.","일화":"폭우 뒤 구의 제한 급수 구간에서 설사병이 번지자 제기동시장 동측을 사흘 봉쇄하는 말목을 수초롱이 먼저 박았다.","관계":"라세영의 지휘로 동측 골목을 돌고, 하윤목의 아차산 검역 통과증을 길에서 대조한다. 선나휘의 봉쇄 전갈이 오기 전에는 말목을 뽑지 않는다.","야망":"동대문·청량리 방역 봉쇄의 현장 발동을 순찰대가 단독으로 걸어 비의료적 해제를 막는다.","공포":"탁수와 가짜 약이 같은 주에 퍼져 순찰대가 급수국과 시장 사이에서 잘리는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"오염원 표본을 마곡으로 나르거나, 봉쇄 말목을 뽑아 약재 출하를 재개시킬 수 있다."},"biography":"소문보다 격리 일수를 믿고, 정치적 봉쇄 해제를 사고 원인으로 순찰 일지에 적는다. 출입 도장이 흐리면 골목을 되돌아간다.\n\n- 생업: 격리 확인·해제 순찰\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 수련의\n- 직함: 제기동 동측 방역 순찰대, 라세영의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2098-03-16에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 제기동 동측 방역 순찰대, 라세영의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 야간 무단 도하 적발로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 격리 확인·해제 순찰 창구가 수초롱의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수련의. 직함은 제기동 방역 수련의. 격리 막과 출입 도장을 이중으로 확인하고, 해제 순찰은 정호준의 수질·약효 기록이 도착한 뒤에만 돈다.\n\n**일화.** 폭우 뒤 구의 제한 급수 구간에서 설사병이 번지자 제기동시장 동측을 사흘 봉쇄하는 말목을 수초롱이 먼저 박았다.\n\n**관계.** 라세영의 지휘로 동측 골목을 돌고, 하윤목의 아차산 검역 통과증을 길에서 대조한다. 선나휘의 봉쇄 전갈이 오기 전에는 말목을 뽑지 않는다.\n\n**야망.** 동대문·청량리 방역 봉쇄의 현장 발동을 순찰대가 단독으로 걸어 비의료적 해제를 막는다.\n\n**공포.** 탁수와 가짜 약이 같은 주에 퍼져 순찰대가 급수국과 시장 사이에서 잘리는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 오염원 표본을 마곡으로 나르거나, 봉쇄 말목을 뽑아 약재 출하를 재개시킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 0 | 개방 30 | 무력 −45 | 물질 −20 | 공동 30 | 원칙 45 | 공개 15 | 자격 20 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 0 | 위험 −20 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −20 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"수초롱","type":"지휘","to":"라세영","basis":"라세영의 지휘로 동측 골목을 돌고"},{"from":"수초롱","type":"계약","to":"선나휘","basis":"선나휘의 봉쇄 전갈이 오기 전에는 말목을 뽑지 않는다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"신나빈","type":"계약","to":"수초롱","basis":"신나빈은 방역 장부의 이중 지급을 정정한 서명을 수초롱에게 전한다. 수초롱은 격리 출입 도장과 현장 확인을 살펴 같은 출입이나 해제가 중복 기록된 곳을 찾고, 수질·약효 기록 전에는 해제 순찰을 돌지 않는다."},{"from":"문바은","type":"계약","to":"수초롱","basis":"문바은은 보존한 방역 필사본을 수초롱의 출입 확인에 넘긴다. 수초롱은 현장의 격리 막과 도장을 확인해 흐린 기록을 해제 근거로 받아들이지 않는다."},{"from":"진숲혁","type":"계약","to":"수초롱","basis":"진숲혁은 방역 기록의 중복 지급 정정과 인수 서명을 수초롱에게 넘긴다. 수초롱은 현장 출입 도장과 격리 상태를 확인해 같은 출입이 두 번 기록된 곳을 찾는다."},{"from":"류돌연","type":"계약","to":"수초롱","basis":"류돌연은 방역 필사본을 수초롱에게 인계한다. 수초롱은 현장의 격리 막과 출입 도장을 확인해 흐린 기록이 해제 근거로 쓰이지 않게 한다."}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0333', 'c120-bcf4-c131', '{"id":"person-0333","name":"Seon Nahwi","title":"Medical Council Vote Messenger, Jeon Sol''s Working-Level Aide","position":"Medical Council Vote Messenger, Jeon Sol''s Working-Level Aide","characterId":"K332","rank":"Resident","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Medical Message and Contract Notice Delivery","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#character-seon-nahwi","detailRoute":"/people/person-0333","birthDate":"2071-05-13","birthday":"05-13","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"sealed-notice-delivery","name":"Sealed notice delivery","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Withholds verbal consent","description":"A false consent message is held pending handwriting comparison and copies reach both desks. Delivery procedure is supported, not independent handwriting expertise.","behavior":"She refused departure whenever a seal cord sat loose and honored no verbal consent in the patient representative''s name as a dispatch. Short of breath or not, she held two copies in one hand.","stress":"Fear. That one forged consent dispatch would pass the secret pact that pushed out the wounded of great powers, and the courier network would become a puppet''s horn.","relationship":"Relations. Under command to carry Jeon Sol''s vote notes only under seal, he shared order with Yeong Neulbit''s council ledger. Pasted Sim Dalho''s voided pre-buying at the market gate.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: member. Title: patients'' council vote courier, duty officer of Jeon Sol. He posted the dispatches on the guild board and the patient waiting list at once and locked any private care contract notice in his bag without three trade stamps.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: member. Title: patients'' council vote courier, duty officer of Jeon Sol. He posted the dispatches on the guild board and the patient waiting list at once and locked any private care contract notice in his bag without three trade stamps.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That one forged consent dispatch would pass the secret pact that pushed out the wounded of great powers, and the courier network would become a puppet''s horn.","relationship":"Relations. Under command to carry Jeon Sol''s vote notes only under seal, he shared order with Yeong Neulbit''s council ledger. Pasted Sim Dalho''s voided pre-buying at the market gate.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"A false consent message is held pending handwriting comparison and copies reach both desks. Delivery procedure is supported, not independent handwriting expertise.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c120-bcf4-c131","name":"Seon Clan of Boseong","crest":"clan-crests/c120-bcf4-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":30,"Force":-50,"Material":-30,"Communal":10,"Principle":35,"Public":40,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":-30,"Display":-5,"Sustained":10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical Message and Contract Notice Delivery","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Resident","Title":"Medical Council Vote Messenger, Jeon Sol''s Working-Level Aide","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −50 | Material −30 | Communal 10 | Principle 35 | Publicity 40 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 30 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 10 | Monopoly 10 | Risk −30 | Display −5 | Persistence 10 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Multi-partner"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2071-05-13. As of the 2126 opening, holds the posts of Council Vote Messenger and Jeon Sol''s operations aide, continuing the existing duty and records. In the succession record of that post, the position opened when a ticketless departing train was stopped.\n- The window for delivering medical messages and contract notices in Jegi-dong is Seon Nahwi''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank of nobility, domain, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: trainee physician. Title: Medical Directive Messenger Trainee. Posts messages simultaneously on the clinic duty board and the clinic waiting list, and locks private treatment-contract notices in the bag unless they bear the seals of the attending specialist and the Order Head.","Anecdote":"When a manufacturer under the protection of a Seoul internal patron faction appeared with a false consent form in the name of the attending specialist, Seon Nahwi locked the consent message until the handwriting comparison was finished.","Relationships":"Takes command from Jeon Sol to carry vote slips only under seal, and shares turns with Yeong Neulbit''s council ledger. Posts Sim Dalho''s pre-purchase nullification at the market entrance.","Ambition":"Makes the attending specialist''s right to refuse treatment and the pre-purchase nullification notices valid only in the messenger ledger that Seon Nahwi seals, killing the false consent form on the road.","Fear":"Fears that a single forged consent message will get through a secret pact that pushes out the wounded bearing a patron''s crest, turning the messenger network into a puppet trumpet.","Intervention":"Can find the forged message and protect the seal, or expose the withheld document in the bag to neutralize the right to refuse treatment."},"biography":"If the seal cord is loose, refuses to depart, and does not accept a verbal consent in the name of the attending specialist as a message. Even out of breath, holds two copies in one hand.\n\n- Livelihood: delivering medical messages and contract notices\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: trainee physician\n- Title: Council Vote Messenger, Jeon Sol''s operations aide\n**Life.** Born on 2071-05-13. As of the 2126 opening, holds the posts of Council Vote Messenger and Jeon Sol''s operations aide, continuing the existing duty and records. In the succession record of that post, the position opened when a ticketless departing train was stopped.\n- The window for delivering medical messages and contract notices in Jegi-dong is Seon Nahwi''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank of nobility, domain, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: trainee physician. Title: Medical Directive Messenger Trainee. Posts messages simultaneously on the clinic duty board and the clinic waiting list, and locks private treatment-contract notices in the bag unless they bear the seals of the attending specialist and the Order Head.\n\n**Anecdote.** When a manufacturer under the protection of a Seoul internal patron faction appeared with a false consent form in the name of the attending specialist, Seon Nahwi locked the consent message until the handwriting comparison was finished.\n\n**Relationships.** Takes command from Jeon Sol to carry vote slips only under seal, and shares turns with Yeong Neulbit''s council ledger. Posts Sim Dalho''s pre-purchase nullification at the market entrance.\n\n**Ambition.** Makes the attending specialist''s right to refuse treatment and the pre-purchase nullification notices valid only in the messenger ledger that Seon Nahwi seals, killing the false consent form on the road.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that a single forged consent message will get through a secret pact that pushes out the wounded bearing a patron''s crest, turning the messenger network into a puppet trumpet.\n\n**Intervention.** Can find the forged message and protect the seal, or expose the withheld document in the bag to neutralize the right to refuse treatment.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −50 | Material −30 | Communal 10 | Principle 35 | Publicity 40 | Qualification 20 | Dispersal 30 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly 10 | Risk −30 | Display −5 | Persistence 10 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Multi-partner\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seon Nahwi","type":"Command","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"Under orders to carry Jeon Sol''s voting slips only in a sealed state,"},{"from":"Seon Nahwi","type":"Command","to":"Yeong Neulbit","basis":"Shares turns with Yeong Neulbit''s council ledger"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Su Choreong","type":"Contract","to":"Seon Nahwi","basis":"I do not pull the stakes until Seon Nahwi''s blockade message arrives."},{"from":"Yeong Neulbit","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Seon Nahwi","basis":"Leaves a copy of Seon Nahwi''s message on the same line"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0333","name":"선나휘","title":"의정회 표결 전령, 전솔의 실무 담당자","position":"의정회 표결 전령, 전솔의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K332","rank":"수련의","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"의료 전갈·계약 통지 배달","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-선나휘","detailRoute":"/people/person-0333","birthDate":"2071-05-13","birthday":"05-13","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"sealed-notice-delivery","name":"봉인 전갈 전달","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"구두 동의를 잠근다","description":"허위 동의 전갈을 필적 대조까지 잠그고 사본을 두 창구에 남긴다. 전달 절차는 확인되지만 직접 필적 감정 경력은 없다.","behavior":"봉인 끈이 느슨하면 출발을 거부하고, 담당 전문의 명의의 구두 동의를 전갈로 인정하지 않는다. 숨이 차도 사본 두 장을 한 손에 쥔다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 담당 전문의의 도제로 배우며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 위조 동의 전갈 한 장이 강국 부상자를 밀어내는 밀약을 통과시켜 전령망이 꼭두각시 나팔이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 전솔의 표결 쪽지를 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고, 영늘빛의 의정 원장과 순번을 나눈다. 심달호의 선매 무효를 시장 입구에 붙인다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 의료 지침 전령 수련의. 전갈을 진료 당직 게시판과 진료 대기 명부에 동시에 붙이고, 비공개 치료 계약 통지는 담당 전문의와 단장의 날인 없이 가방에 잠근다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 의료 지침 전령 수련의. 전갈을 진료 당직 게시판과 진료 대기 명부에 동시에 붙이고, 비공개 치료 계약 통지는 담당 전문의와 단장의 날인 없이 가방에 잠근다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 위조 동의 전갈 한 장이 강국 부상자를 밀어내는 밀약을 통과시켜 전령망이 꼭두각시 나팔이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 전솔의 표결 쪽지를 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고, 영늘빛의 의정 원장과 순번을 나눈다. 심달호의 선매 무효를 시장 입구에 붙인다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"허위 동의 전갈을 필적 대조까지 잠그고 사본을 두 창구에 남긴다. 전달 절차는 확인되지만 직접 필적 감정 경력은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c120-bcf4-c131","name":"보성 선씨","crest":"clan-crests/c120-bcf4-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":30,"무력":-50,"물질":-30,"공동":10,"원칙":35,"공개":40,"자격":20,"분산":30,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":10,"위험":-30,"과시":-5,"지속":10,"지향":"이성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"의료 전갈·계약 통지 배달","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"수련의","직함":"의정회 표결 전령, 전솔의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −50 | 물질 −30 | 공동 10 | 원칙 35 | 공개 40 | 자격 20 | 분산 30 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −5 | 지속 10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2071-05-13에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의정회 표결 전령, 전솔의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 의료 전갈·계약 통지 배달 창구가 선나휘의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수련의. 직함은 의료 지침 전령 수련의. 전갈을 진료 당직 게시판과 진료 대기 명부에 동시에 붙이고, 비공개 치료 계약 통지는 담당 전문의와 단장의 날인 없이 가방에 잠근다.","일화":"서울 내부 후원 세력 보호를 받는 제조자가 담당 전문의 명의의 허위 동의서를 들고 나타나자 선나휘는 동의 전갈을 필적 대조가 끝날 때까지 잠갔다.","관계":"전솔의 표결 쪽지를 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고, 영늘빛의 의정 원장과 순번을 나눈다. 심달호의 선매 무효를 시장 입구에 붙인다.","야망":"담당 전문의의 진료 거부권과 선매 무효 통지를 자신이 날인하는 전령 원장에만 유효하게 만들어 허위 동의서를 길에서 죽인다.","공포":"위조 동의 전갈 한 장이 후원 문장이 붙은 부상자를 밀어내는 밀약을 통과시켜 전령망이 꼭두각시 나팔이 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"위조 전갈을 찾아 봉인을 지키거나, 가방 속 보류 문서를 폭로해 진료 거부권을 무력화할 수 있다."},"biography":"봉인 끈이 느슨하면 출발을 거부하고, 담당 전문의 명의의 구두 동의를 전갈로 인정하지 않는다. 숨이 차도 사본 두 장을 한 손에 쥔다.\n\n- 생업: 의료 전갈·계약 통지 배달\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 수련의\n- 직함: 의정회 표결 전령, 전솔의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2071-05-13에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의정회 표결 전령, 전솔의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 무표 출발 열차 저지로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 의료 전갈·계약 통지 배달 창구가 선나휘의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수련의. 직함은 의료 지침 전령 수련의. 전갈을 진료 당직 게시판과 진료 대기 명부에 동시에 붙이고, 비공개 치료 계약 통지는 담당 전문의와 단장의 날인 없이 가방에 잠근다.\n\n**일화.** 서울 내부 후원 세력 보호를 받는 제조자가 담당 전문의 명의의 허위 동의서를 들고 나타나자 선나휘는 동의 전갈을 필적 대조가 끝날 때까지 잠갔다.\n\n**관계.** 전솔의 표결 쪽지를 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고, 영늘빛의 의정 원장과 순번을 나눈다. 심달호의 선매 무효를 시장 입구에 붙인다.\n\n**야망.** 담당 전문의의 진료 거부권과 선매 무효 통지를 자신이 날인하는 전령 원장에만 유효하게 만들어 허위 동의서를 길에서 죽인다.\n\n**공포.** 위조 동의 전갈 한 장이 후원 문장이 붙은 부상자를 밀어내는 밀약을 통과시켜 전령망이 꼭두각시 나팔이 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 위조 전갈을 찾아 봉인을 지키거나, 가방 속 보류 문서를 폭로해 진료 거부권을 무력화할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −50 | 물질 −30 | 공동 10 | 원칙 35 | 공개 40 | 자격 20 | 분산 30 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 10 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −5 | 지속 10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"선나휘","type":"지휘","to":"전솔","basis":"전솔의 표결 쪽지를 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"선나휘","type":"지휘","to":"영늘빛","basis":"영늘빛의 의정 원장과 순번을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"수초롱","type":"계약","to":"선나휘","basis":"선나휘의 봉쇄 전갈이 오기 전에는 말목을 뽑지 않는다"},{"from":"영늘빛","type":"신도","to":"선나휘","basis":"선나휘의 전갈 사본을 같은 줄에 남긴다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0334', 'c6d0-c6d0-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0334","name":"Won Miru","title":"Origin and Counterfeit Medicine Surveyor","position":"Origin and Counterfeit Medicine Surveyor","characterId":"K333","rank":"Resident","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Counterfeit Medicine Identification and Origin Record","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#character-won-miru","detailRoute":"/people/person-0334","birthDate":"2070-08-28","birthday":"08-28","age":56,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"field-surveying","name":"Field surveying","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Dotted lines before measurement","description":"They surveyed the rear entrance after counterfeit testimony and leave unmeasured origins dotted. Suspicion of provenance stays distinct from a confirmed finding.","behavior":"He read origins from the smell of crude herbs and the seams of capsules and despised drawing an origin as a solid line from rumor alone. He counted a late specimen a fault.","stress":"Fear. That the survey specimens would vanish with the pre-buying ledger, and the counterfeit drugs would be fixed as the children''s medicine of Bukhansan Bogukmun.","relationship":"Relations. Held a contract handing contamination coordinates to Ra Seyeong and received Eun Chaeyun''s shelf drugs as comparison specimens. Moved Baek On''s Bukhansan Bogukmun testimony into the margin of the master plate.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: member. Title: origin and counterfeit-drug surveyor. He left unsurveyed growing grounds only as dotted lines, and a capsule stamp became a solid line only when overlaid with Jeong Hojun''s drug-efficacy records.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: member. Title: origin and counterfeit-drug surveyor. He left unsurveyed growing grounds only as dotted lines, and a capsule stamp became a solid line only when overlaid with Jeong Hojun''s drug-efficacy records.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the survey specimens would vanish with the pre-buying ledger, and the counterfeit drugs would be fixed as the children''s medicine of Bukhansan Bogukmun.","relationship":"Relations. Held a contract handing contamination coordinates to Ra Seyeong and received Eun Chaeyun''s shelf drugs as comparison specimens. Moved Baek On''s Bukhansan Bogukmun testimony into the margin of the master plate.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"They surveyed the rear entrance after counterfeit testimony and leave unmeasured origins dotted. Suspicion of provenance stays distinct from a confirmed finding.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c6d0-c6d0-c8fc","name":"Won Clan of Wonju","crest":"clan-crests/c6d0-c6d0-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":30,"Force":-55,"Material":-20,"Communal":15,"Principle":45,"Public":25,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":-40,"Risk":5,"Display":25,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Counterfeit Medicine Identification and Origin Record","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Resident","Title":"Origin and Counterfeit Medicine Surveyor","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 30 | Force −55 | Materialism −20 | Communal 15 | Principle 45 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 15 | Monopoly −40 | Risk 5 | Display 25 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: Opposite Sex | Bonding: Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2070-08-28. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Origin and Counterfeit Medicine Surveyor, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post was opened with a fake-medicine seal.\n- The counterfeit medicine identification and origin record desk in Jegi-dong is Won Miru''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Resident. Title: Counterfeit Medicine Identification Resident. Origins that have not been physically surveyed remain only as dotted lines, and a capsule seal becomes a solid line only when it overlaps with Jeong Hojun''s efficacy records.","Anecdote":"When testimony came in that the fake fever-reducer capsules matched the seal of the Seoul Interior protection warehouse, Won Miru surveyed the Cheongnyangni rear gate alone.","Relationships":"A contract to hand contamination coordinates to Ra Seyeong, in return for receiving Eun Chaeyun''s shelf medicines as comparison samples. Transcribes Baek On''s testimony about Bukhansanbogukmun into the margin of the master plate.","Ambition":"Seeks to bind the eastern herbal-medicine origins and the counterfeit capsule route to a public master plate, so that the Seoul Interior protection warehouse seal cannot come down to the market floor.","Fear":"Fears that the survey samples will vanish along with the advance-purchase ledger, and that the fake medicine will be confirmed as Bukhansanbogukmun children''s medicine.","Intervention":"Can keep the dotted line of the counterfeit origin, or pull out the seal''s master plate and frame it as manipulation by the Protectorate side."},"biography":"Reads provenance from the smell of herbal medicines and the seams of capsules, and despises drawing an origin as a solid line on rumor alone. Regards a late sample as a sin.\n\n- Livelihood: Counterfeit medicine identification and origin records\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: Resident\n- Title: Origin and Counterfeit Medicine Surveyor\n**Life.** Born 2070-08-28. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Origin and Counterfeit Medicine Surveyor, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post was opened with a fake-medicine seal.\n- The counterfeit medicine identification and origin record desk in Jegi-dong is Won Miru''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Resident. Title: Counterfeit Medicine Identification Resident. Origins that have not been physically surveyed remain only as dotted lines, and a capsule seal becomes a solid line only when it overlaps with Jeong Hojun''s efficacy records.\n\n**Anecdote.** When testimony came in that the fake fever-reducer capsules matched the seal of the Seoul Interior protection warehouse, Won Miru surveyed the Cheongnyangni rear gate alone.\n\n**Relations.** A contract to hand contamination coordinates to Ra Seyeong, in return for receiving Eun Chaeyun''s shelf medicines as comparison samples. Transcribes Baek On''s testimony about Bukhansanbogukmun into the margin of the master plate.\n\n**Ambition.** Seeks to bind the eastern herbal-medicine origins and the counterfeit capsule route to a public master plate, so that the Seoul Interior protection warehouse seal cannot come down to the market floor.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that the survey samples will vanish along with the advance-purchase ledger, and that the fake medicine will be confirmed as Bukhansanbogukmun children''s medicine.\n\n**Intervention.** Can keep the dotted line of the counterfeit origin, or pull out the seal''s master plate and frame it as manipulation by the Protectorate side.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 30 | Force −55 | Materialism −20 | Communal 15 | Principle 45 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Monopoly −40 | Risk 5 | Display 25 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: Opposite Sex | Bonding: Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Won Miru","type":"Contract","to":"Ra Seyeong","basis":"is a contract to hand contamination coordinates to Ra Seyeong and"},{"from":"Won Miru","type":"Contract","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"receives the medicines on Eun Chaeyun''s shelf as reference samples"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gu Jahui","type":"Contract","to":"Won Miru","basis":"Gu Jahui seals suspect medicinal herbs and hands them to Won Miru along with custody records. Won Miru examines the samples and capsule seals, investigates the distribution route, and leaves unconfirmed origins as dotted lines."},{"from":"Ju Kain","type":"Contract","to":"Won Miru","basis":"Ju Kain seals suspect medicinal herbs and hands them to Won Miru along with custody records. Won Miru examines the samples and capsule seals, investigates the route, and leaves unidentified origins as dotted lines."},{"from":"Gang Payu","type":"Contract","to":"Won Miru","basis":"Gang Payu hands the sealed suspect medicinal herbs to Won Miru along with custody records. Won Miru examines the capsule seals and samples, investigates the distribution route, and leaves unidentified origins as dotted lines."},{"from":"Nam Bichwon","type":"Contract","to":"Won Miru","basis":"Nam Bichwon hands the sealed suspect medicinal herbs to Won Miru along with custody records. Won Miru examines the capsule seals and samples, investigates the route, and leaves unidentified origins as dotted lines."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0334","name":"원미루","title":"원산지·위조약 탐사원","position":"원산지·위조약 탐사원","characterId":"K333","rank":"수련의","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"위조약 감별·산지 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-원미루","detailRoute":"/people/person-0334","birthDate":"2070-08-28","birthday":"08-28","age":56,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"field-surveying","name":"현장 측량","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"측정 전에는 점선","description":"위조약 증언 뒤 후문을 직접 측량하고 미실측 산지는 점선으로 남긴다. 출처 의심과 확정 판정을 구분한다.","behavior":"생약의 냄새와 캡슐 이음새로 출처를 읽고, 소문만으로 원산지를 실선으로 그리는 일을 경멸한다. 늦은 표본을 죄로 본다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 담당 전문의의 도제로 배우며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 탐사 표본이 선매 장부와 함께 사라져 가짜 약이 북한산보국문 어린이 약으로 확정되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 라세영에게 오염 좌표를 넘기는 계약이고, 은채윤의 선반 약을 대조 표본으로 받는다. 백온의 북한산보국문 증언을 원판 여백에 옮긴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 위조약 감별 수련의. 실측하지 않은 산지는 점선으로만 남기고, 캡슐 인장은 정호준의 약효 기록과 겹쳐야 실선이 된다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 위조약 감별 수련의. 실측하지 않은 산지는 점선으로만 남기고, 캡슐 인장은 정호준의 약효 기록과 겹쳐야 실선이 된다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 탐사 표본이 선매 장부와 함께 사라져 가짜 약이 북한산보국문 어린이 약으로 확정되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 라세영에게 오염 좌표를 넘기는 계약이고, 은채윤의 선반 약을 대조 표본으로 받는다. 백온의 북한산보국문 증언을 원판 여백에 옮긴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"위조약 증언 뒤 후문을 직접 측량하고 미실측 산지는 점선으로 남긴다. 출처 의심과 확정 판정을 구분한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c6d0-c6d0-c8fc","name":"원주 원씨","crest":"clan-crests/c6d0-c6d0-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":30,"무력":-55,"물질":-20,"공동":15,"원칙":45,"공개":25,"자격":10,"분산":25,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":-40,"위험":5,"과시":25,"지속":35,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"위조약 감별·산지 기록","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"수련의","직함":"원산지·위조약 탐사원","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 30 | 무력 −55 | 물질 −20 | 공동 15 | 원칙 45 | 공개 25 | 자격 10 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 −40 | 위험 5 | 과시 25 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2070-08-28에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 원산지·위조약 탐사원 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 위조약 감별·산지 기록 창구가 원미루의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수련의. 직함은 위조약 감별 수련의. 실측하지 않은 산지는 점선으로만 남기고, 캡슐 인장은 정호준의 약효 기록과 겹쳐야 실선이 된다.","일화":"가짜 해열제 캡슐이 서울 내부 보호창고 인장과 같다는 증언이 들어오자 원미루는 청량리 후문을 단독 측량했다.","관계":"라세영에게 오염 좌표를 넘기는 계약이고, 은채윤의 선반 약을 대조 표본으로 받는다. 백온의 북한산보국문 증언을 원판 여백에 옮긴다.","야망":"동부 생약 원산지와 위조 캡슐 경로를 공개 원판에 묶어 서울 내부 보호창고 인장이 시장 바닥에 내려오지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"탐사 표본이 선매 장부와 함께 사라져 가짜 약이 북한산보국문 어린이 약으로 확정되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"위조 산지 점선을 지키거나, 인장 원판을 빼내 보호국 쪽 조작으로 몰 수 있다."},"biography":"생약의 냄새와 캡슐 이음새로 출처를 읽고, 소문만으로 원산지를 실선으로 그리는 일을 경멸한다. 늦은 표본을 죄로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 위조약 감별·산지 기록\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 수련의\n- 직함: 원산지·위조약 탐사원\n**생애.** 2070-08-28에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 원산지·위조약 탐사원 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 위조약 감별·산지 기록 창구가 원미루의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수련의. 직함은 위조약 감별 수련의. 실측하지 않은 산지는 점선으로만 남기고, 캡슐 인장은 정호준의 약효 기록과 겹쳐야 실선이 된다.\n\n**일화.** 가짜 해열제 캡슐이 서울 내부 보호창고 인장과 같다는 증언이 들어오자 원미루는 청량리 후문을 단독 측량했다.\n\n**관계.** 라세영에게 오염 좌표를 넘기는 계약이고, 은채윤의 선반 약을 대조 표본으로 받는다. 백온의 북한산보국문 증언을 원판 여백에 옮긴다.\n\n**야망.** 동부 생약 원산지와 위조 캡슐 경로를 공개 원판에 묶어 서울 내부 보호창고 인장이 시장 바닥에 내려오지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 탐사 표본이 선매 장부와 함께 사라져 가짜 약이 북한산보국문 어린이 약으로 확정되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 위조 산지 점선을 지키거나, 인장 원판을 빼내 보호국 쪽 조작으로 몰 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 30 | 무력 −55 | 물질 −20 | 공동 15 | 원칙 45 | 공개 25 | 자격 10 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 −40 | 위험 5 | 과시 25 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"원미루","type":"계약","to":"라세영","basis":"라세영에게 오염 좌표를 넘기는 계약이고"},{"from":"원미루","type":"계약","to":"은채윤","basis":"은채윤의 선반 약을 대조 표본으로 받는다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"구자희","type":"계약","to":"원미루","basis":"구자희는 의심 약재를 봉인해 원미루에게 관리 기록과 함께 넘긴다. 원미루는 표본과 캡슐 인장을 살펴 유통 경로를 조사하고 확인되지 않은 산지는 점선으로 남긴다."},{"from":"주카인","type":"계약","to":"원미루","basis":"주카인은 의심 약재를 봉인해 원미루에게 관리 기록과 함께 넘긴다. 원미루는 표본·캡슐 인장을 살펴 경로를 조사하고 미확인 산지는 점선으로 남긴다."},{"from":"강파유","type":"계약","to":"원미루","basis":"강파유는 봉인한 의심 약재를 관리 기록과 함께 원미루에게 넘긴다. 원미루는 캡슐 인장·표본을 살펴 유통 경로를 조사하고 미확인 산지는 점선으로 남긴다."},{"from":"남빛원","type":"계약","to":"원미루","basis":"남빛원은 봉인한 의심 약재를 원미루에게 관리 기록과 함께 넘긴다. 원미루는 캡슐 인장·표본을 살펴 경로를 조사하고 미확인 산지는 점선으로 남긴다."}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0335', 'c601-c601-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0335","name":"Yeong Neulbit","title":"Medical Council Sickbed Recorder, Jeon Sol''s Working-Level Aide","position":"Medical Council Sickbed Recorder, Jeon Sol''s Working-Level Aide","characterId":"K334","rank":"Resident","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Sickbed Waiting List and Contract Margin Notes","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-yeongneulbit","detailRoute":"/people/person-0335","birthDate":"2078-09-23","birthday":"09-23","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"bed-ledger-administration","name":"Bed ledger administration","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Suspect papers in the margin","description":"A false consent entry goes into the margin and sealing waits for comparison. Document administration is the strength, not an additional claim of clinical ability.","behavior":"She filled the waiting list''s blanks before the people and called any merchant who kept private care contracts off the ledger a violator. She published the numbers but left the readings in the margin.","stress":"Fear. That one false consent form would paste itself mid-ledger and the patients'' council would become a great power''s puppet window.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice moving Jeon Sol''s veto into the ledger, she left Seon Nahwi''s dispatch copies on the same line. Put Ryu Eunbi''s vote stamp at the top of the ledger.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: member. Title: patients'' council sickbed registrar, duty officer of Jeon Sol. She pasted the sickbed waiting list on the market gate and the guild duty room at once and wrote contracts without three trade stamps into the void margin.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: member. Title: patients'' council sickbed registrar, duty officer of Jeon Sol. She pasted the sickbed waiting list on the market gate and the guild duty room at once and wrote contracts without three trade stamps into the void margin.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That one false consent form would paste itself mid-ledger and the patients'' council would become a great power''s puppet window.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice moving Jeon Sol''s veto into the ledger, she left Seon Nahwi''s dispatch copies on the same line. Put Ryu Eunbi''s vote stamp at the top of the ledger.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"A false consent entry goes into the margin and sealing waits for comparison. Document administration is the strength, not an additional claim of clinical ability.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c601-c601-cc9c","name":"Yeongcheon Yeong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c601-c601-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":35,"Force":-50,"Material":-30,"Communal":30,"Principle":50,"Public":15,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":-20},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":-10,"Display":-30,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Sickbed Waiting List and Contract Margin Notes","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Resident","Title":"Medical Council Sickbed Recorder, Jeon Sol''s Working-Level Aide","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 35 | Force −50 | Materialism −30 | Communal 30 | Principle 50 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation −20","Desires":"Craving 5 | Monopoly −15 | Risk −10 | Display −30 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Fluid | Bonding: Multi-partner"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2078-09-23. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Deliberative Council Bed Recorder and Jeon Sol''s working-level aide, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post was opened by the deletion of a single line from a double ledger.\n- The sickbed waiting list and contract margin-note record desk in Jegi-dong is Yeong Neulbit''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Resident. Title: Bed Record Resident. Posts the bed waiting list simultaneously at the market entrance and the clinic duty room, and records any contract lacking the seals of the attending specialist and the order''s commander in the void margin.","Anecdote":"When a false consent form appeared in the medical command, Yeong Neulbit moved that line to the margin and did not open the seal before the handwriting comparison was finished.","Relationships":"A priest who transfers Jeon Sol''s veto into the ledger, and leaves a copy of Seon Nahwi''s message on the same line. Places Ryu Eunbi''s voting seal at the very top of the ledger.","Ambition":"Kills on paper the secret pact that would make the attending specialist''s right to refuse treatment and the severity vote valid only in ledgers they themselves have taken on, pushing out wounded people who bear a patron''s crest.","Fear":"Fears that a single false consent form will be pasted into the middle of the ledger and the medical command will become a puppet window for Seoul Interior patron powers.","Intervention":"Can publish the marginal handwriting, or erase one ledger line to leave the right to refuse treatment blank."},"biography":"Fills the blanks in the waiting list before the people, and calls undisclosed buyers who do not enter private treatment contracts into the ledger violators. Publishes the numbers but leaves interpretation in the margin.\n\n- Livelihood: Sickbed waiting list and contract margin-note records\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: Resident\n- Title: Deliberative Council Bed Recorder, Jeon Sol''s working-level aide\n**Life.** Born 2078-09-23. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Deliberative Council Bed Recorder and Jeon Sol''s working-level aide, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post was opened by the deletion of a single line from a double ledger.\n- The sickbed waiting list and contract margin-note record desk in Jegi-dong is Yeong Neulbit''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Resident. Title: Bed Record Resident. Posts the bed waiting list simultaneously at the market entrance and the clinic duty room, and records any contract lacking the seals of the attending specialist and the order''s commander in the void margin.\n\n**Anecdote.** When a false consent form appeared in the medical command, Yeong Neulbit moved that line to the margin and did not open the seal before the handwriting comparison was finished.\n\n**Relations.** A priest who transfers Jeon Sol''s veto into the ledger, and leaves a copy of Seon Nahwi''s message on the same line. Places Ryu Eunbi''s voting seal at the very top of the ledger.\n\n**Ambition.** Kills on paper the secret pact that would make the attending specialist''s right to refuse treatment and the severity vote valid only in ledgers they themselves have taken on, pushing out wounded people who bear a patron''s crest.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that a single false consent form will be pasted into the middle of the ledger and the medical command will become a puppet window for Seoul Interior patron powers.\n\n**Intervention.** Can publish the marginal handwriting, or erase one ledger line to leave the right to refuse treatment blank.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 35 | Force −50 | Materialism −30 | Communal 30 | Principle 50 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation −20\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Monopoly −15 | Risk −10 | Display −30 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Fluid | Bonding: Multi-partner\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yeong Neulbit","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Jeon Sol","basis":"is the disciple who transfers Jeon Sol''s veto into the ledger, and"},{"from":"Yeong Neulbit","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Seon Nahwi","basis":"Leaves a copy of Seon Nahwi''s message on the same line"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Seon Nahwi","type":"Command","to":"Yeong Neulbit","basis":"Shares turns with Yeong Neulbit''s council ledger"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0335","name":"영늘빛","title":"의정회 병상 기록관, 전솔의 실무 담당자","position":"의정회 병상 기록관, 전솔의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K334","rank":"수련의","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"병상 대기 명부·계약 난외 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-영늘빛","detailRoute":"/people/person-0335","birthDate":"2078-09-23","birthday":"09-23","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"bed-ledger-administration","name":"병상 원장 정리","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"의심 문서는 난외로","description":"허위 동의서 줄을 난외로 내리고 대조 전 날인을 보류한다. 문서 운영이 강점이며 임상 능력을 같은 근거로 올리지 않는다.","behavior":"대기 명부의 빈칸을 사람보다 먼저 메우고, 비공개 치료 계약을 원장에 올리지 않는 외부 구매자를 위반자로 부른다. 숫자는 공개하되 해석은 난외에 남긴다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 담당 전문의의 도제로 배우며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 허위 동의서 한 장이 원장 한가운데 붙어 의료 지휘부가 강국의 꼭두각시 창구가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 전솔의 거부권을 원장으로 옮기는 신도이고, 선나휘의 전갈 사본을 같은 줄에 남긴다. 류은비의 표결 날인을 원장 맨 위에 둔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 병상 기록 수련의. 병상 대기 명부를 시장 입구와 진료 당직실에 동시에 붙이고, 담당 전문의와 단장의 날인 없는 계약은 무효 난외에 적는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 병상 기록 수련의. 병상 대기 명부를 시장 입구와 진료 당직실에 동시에 붙이고, 담당 전문의와 단장의 날인 없는 계약은 무효 난외에 적는다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 허위 동의서 한 장이 원장 한가운데 붙어 의료 지휘부가 강국의 꼭두각시 창구가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 전솔의 거부권을 원장으로 옮기는 신도이고, 선나휘의 전갈 사본을 같은 줄에 남긴다. 류은비의 표결 날인을 원장 맨 위에 둔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"허위 동의서 줄을 난외로 내리고 대조 전 날인을 보류한다. 문서 운영이 강점이며 임상 능력을 같은 근거로 올리지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c601-c601-cc9c","name":"영천 영씨","crest":"clan-crests/c601-c601-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":35,"무력":-50,"물질":-30,"공동":30,"원칙":50,"공개":15,"자격":15,"분산":10,"변혁":-20},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":-15,"위험":-10,"과시":-30,"지속":0,"지향":"유동","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"병상 대기 명부·계약 난외 기록","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"수련의","직함":"의정회 병상 기록관, 전솔의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 35 | 무력 −50 | 물질 −30 | 공동 30 | 원칙 50 | 공개 15 | 자격 15 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −20","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −30 | 지속 0 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2078-09-23에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의정회 병상 기록관, 전솔의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 병상 대기 명부·계약 난외 기록 창구가 영늘빛의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수련의. 직함은 병상 기록 수련의. 병상 대기 명부를 시장 입구와 진료 당직실에 동시에 붙이고, 담당 전문의와 단장의 날인 없는 계약은 무효 난외에 적는다.","일화":"허위 동의서가 의료 지휘부에 나타나자 영늘빛은 해당 줄을 난외로 내리고 필적 대조가 끝나기 전에 날인을 열지 않았다.","관계":"전솔의 거부권을 원장으로 옮기는 신도이고, 선나휘의 전갈 사본을 같은 줄에 남긴다. 류은비의 표결 날인을 원장 맨 위에 둔다.","야망":"담당 전문의의 진료 거부권과 중증도 표를 자신이 감수한 원장에만 유효하게 해 후원 문장이 붙은 부상자를 밀어내는 밀약을 종이에서 죽인다.","공포":"허위 동의서 한 장이 원장 한가운데 붙어 의료 지휘부가 서울 내부 후원 세력의 꼭두각시 창구가 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"난외 필적을 공개하거나, 원장 한 줄을 지워 진료 거부권을 빈칸으로 만들 수 있다."},"biography":"대기 명부의 빈칸을 사람보다 먼저 메우고, 비공개 치료 계약을 원장에 올리지 않는 비공개 구매자를 위반자로 부른다. 숫자는 공개하되 해석은 난외에 남긴다.\n\n- 생업: 병상 대기 명부·계약 난외 기록\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 수련의\n- 직함: 의정회 병상 기록관, 전솔의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2078-09-23에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의정회 병상 기록관, 전솔의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 이중 장부 한 줄 삭제로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 병상 대기 명부·계약 난외 기록 창구가 영늘빛의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수련의. 직함은 병상 기록 수련의. 병상 대기 명부를 시장 입구와 진료 당직실에 동시에 붙이고, 담당 전문의와 단장의 날인 없는 계약은 무효 난외에 적는다.\n\n**일화.** 허위 동의서가 의료 지휘부에 나타나자 영늘빛은 해당 줄을 난외로 내리고 필적 대조가 끝나기 전에 날인을 열지 않았다.\n\n**관계.** 전솔의 거부권을 원장으로 옮기는 신도이고, 선나휘의 전갈 사본을 같은 줄에 남긴다. 류은비의 표결 날인을 원장 맨 위에 둔다.\n\n**야망.** 담당 전문의의 진료 거부권과 중증도 표를 자신이 감수한 원장에만 유효하게 해 후원 문장이 붙은 부상자를 밀어내는 밀약을 종이에서 죽인다.\n\n**공포.** 허위 동의서 한 장이 원장 한가운데 붙어 의료 지휘부가 서울 내부 후원 세력의 꼭두각시 창구가 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 난외 필적을 공개하거나, 원장 한 줄을 지워 진료 거부권을 빈칸으로 만들 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 35 | 무력 −50 | 물질 −30 | 공동 30 | 원칙 50 | 공개 15 | 자격 15 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −20\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −30 | 지속 0 | 지향 유동 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"영늘빛","type":"신도","to":"전솔","basis":"전솔의 거부권을 원장으로 옮기는 신도이고"},{"from":"영늘빛","type":"신도","to":"선나휘","basis":"선나휘의 전갈 사본을 같은 줄에 남긴다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"선나휘","type":"지휘","to":"영늘빛","basis":"영늘빛의 의정 원장과 순번을 나눈다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0336', 'd310-d574-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0336","name":"Pan Handeul","title":"Cheongnyangni Station Concourse Outpost Chief","position":"Cheongnyangni Station Concourse Outpost Chief","characterId":"K335","rank":"Specialist","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"Concourse Medical Waiting Tickets and Medicinal Herb Unloading Order Posting","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-panhandeul","detailRoute":"/people/person-0336","birthDate":"2094-12-30","birthday":"12-30","age":32,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"waiting-hall-scheduling","name":"Waiting hall scheduling","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Patient lines first","description":"Published queues and unloading order put military freight behind medical transport. The record does not establish that the mixed-in crate was resolved.","behavior":"She gauged patient crowds by platform humidity and heard the order to pull munitions cars ahead of the medical convoy as an insult. Mild in manner, she took the broadcast herself whenever a counterfeit-drug rumor rose.","stress":"Fear. That the summer counterfeit-drug rumor alone would blockade the concourse and scatter the patients into back-gate handcars.","relationship":"Relations. Received Nam Hoseong''s convoy stops at the platform and split the queue with Dong Juha''s market unloading. Put Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy hours at the top of the chalkboard.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: supervisor. Title: Cheongnyangni Station concourse outpost chief. She published the concourse medical waiting lists and the herb unloading order daily and coupled munitions cars to the platform only after the medical convoy had left.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: supervisor. Title: Cheongnyangni Station concourse outpost chief. She published the concourse medical waiting lists and the herb unloading order daily and coupled munitions cars to the platform only after the medical convoy had left.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the summer counterfeit-drug rumor alone would blockade the concourse and scatter the patients into back-gate handcars.","relationship":"Relations. Received Nam Hoseong''s convoy stops at the platform and split the queue with Dong Juha''s market unloading. Put Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy hours at the top of the chalkboard.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Published queues and unloading order put military freight behind medical transport. The record does not establish that the mixed-in crate was resolved.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d310-d574-c8fc","name":"Pan Clan of Haeju","crest":"clan-crests/d310-d574-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":30,"Force":-55,"Material":-20,"Communal":25,"Principle":50,"Public":30,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":15,"Risk":20,"Display":5,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Concourse Medical Waiting Tickets and Medicinal Herb Unloading Order Posting","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Specialist","Title":"Cheongnyangni Station Concourse Outpost Chief","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 30 | Force −55 | Materialism −20 | Community 25 | Principle 50 | Publicity 30 | Credentials 20 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving 30 | Monopoly 15 | Risk 20 | Display 5 | Persistence 20 | Orientation bisexual | Union contract cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2094-12-30. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Cheongnyangni Station Waiting Hall Chief, continuing the existing duty shifts and records. The succession record for that post opened with a substitute shift covering an unexcused absence from rotation.\n- The window in Cheongnyangni-dong where medical queue tickets and the medicine unloading order are posted is Pan Handeul''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Specialist. Title: Cheongnyangni Waiting Hall Clinical Specialist. Publishes the medical queue tickets and medicine unloading order every day, and couples military wagons to the platform only after the medical convoy has departed.","Anecdote":"The week the pre-purchase ledger vanished, a crate bearing a military insignia turned up wedged in as a single line on the Cheongnyangni waiting hall queue tickets.","Relationships":"Receives Nam Hoseong''s convoy stops at the platform and shares the line with Dong Juha''s market unloading. Puts Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy times at the top of the blackboard.","Ambition":"Aims to keep the Cheongnyangni waiting hall as an eastern medical window where medicine auctions, treatment, and convoys are all signed under one roof, so that no private pre-purchase window can be opened on the platform.","Fear":"Fears that a summer fake-medicine rumor alone will get the waiting hall sealed off and the patients scattered onto back-gate handcarts.","Intervention":"Can openly inspect waiting hall cargo, or separate the patient line from the military queue."},"biography":"Gauges the patient crowd by the humidity on the platform, and hears an order to bring military wagons ahead of the medical convoy as an insult. Mild-mannered, but takes over the broadcast himself when a fake-medicine rumor surfaces.\n\n- Livelihood: Posting medical queue tickets and medicine unloading order at the waiting hall\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: Specialist\n- Title: Cheongnyangni Station Waiting Hall Chief\n**Life.** Born on 2094-12-30. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Cheongnyangni Station Waiting Hall Chief, continuing the existing duty shifts and records. The succession record for that post opened with a substitute shift covering an unexcused absence from rotation.\n- The window in Cheongnyangni-dong where medical queue tickets and the medicine unloading order are posted is Pan Handeul''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Specialist. Title: Cheongnyangni Waiting Hall Clinical Specialist. Publishes the medical queue tickets and medicine unloading order every day, and couples military wagons to the platform only after the medical convoy has departed.\n\n**Anecdote.** The week the pre-purchase ledger vanished, a crate bearing a military insignia turned up wedged in as a single line on the Cheongnyangni waiting hall queue tickets.\n\n**Relationships.** Receives Nam Hoseong''s convoy stops at the platform and shares the line with Dong Juha''s market unloading. Puts Jang Sehwa''s medical convoy times at the top of the blackboard.\n\n**Ambition.** Aims to keep the Cheongnyangni waiting hall as an eastern medical window where medicine auctions, treatment, and convoys are all signed under one roof, so that no private pre-purchase window can be opened on the platform.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that a summer fake-medicine rumor alone will get the waiting hall sealed off and the patients scattered onto back-gate handcarts.\n\n**Intervention.** Can openly inspect waiting hall cargo, or separate the patient line from the military queue.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 30 | Force −55 | Materialism −20 | Community 25 | Principle 50 | Publicity 30 | Credentials 20 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Monopoly 15 | Risk 20 | Display 5 | Persistence 20 | Orientation bisexual | Union contract cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Pan Handeul","type":"Contract","to":"Nam Hoseong","basis":"Receives Nam Hoseong''s convoy stop at the platform and"},{"from":"Pan Handeul","type":"Contract","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"Shares the line with Dong Juha''s market unloading"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Cheon Daol","type":"Contract","to":"Pan Handeul","basis":"Aligns stop times with Pan Handeul''s waiting hall stops"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0336","name":"판한들","title":"청량리역 대합실 거점장","position":"청량리역 대합실 거점장","characterId":"K335","rank":"전문의","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"대합실 의무 대기표·약재 하역 순서 게시","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-판한들","detailRoute":"/people/person-0336","birthDate":"2094-12-30","birthday":"12-30","age":32,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"waiting-hall-scheduling","name":"대합실 일정 조정","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"환자 줄 우선","description":"의무 대기표와 하역 순서를 공개하고 군수 화차를 뒤로 둔다. 혼입 상자를 해결한 결과까지는 기록되지 않았다.","behavior":"승강장 습기로 환자 인파를 가늠하고, 군수 화차를 의무호송 앞으로 끌어오라는 명령을 모욕으로 듣는다. 온화하나 가짜 약 소문이 뜨면 방송을 직접 잡는다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 수련의를 지도하고 후계자를 지정하며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 여름 가짜 약 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 환자들이 후문 밀차로 흩어지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 남호성의 호송 정차를 승강장에서 받고, 동주하의 시장 하역과 줄을 나눈다. 장세화의 의료호송 시각을 칠판 맨 위에 둔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 전문의. 직함은 청량리 대합실 진료 전문의. 대합실 의무 대기표와 약재 하역 순서를 매일 공개하고, 군수 화차는 의무호송이 떠난 뒤에만 승강장에 붙인다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 전문의. 직함은 청량리 대합실 진료 전문의. 대합실 의무 대기표와 약재 하역 순서를 매일 공개하고, 군수 화차는 의무호송이 떠난 뒤에만 승강장에 붙인다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 여름 가짜 약 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 환자들이 후문 밀차로 흩어지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 남호성의 호송 정차를 승강장에서 받고, 동주하의 시장 하역과 줄을 나눈다. 장세화의 의료호송 시각을 칠판 맨 위에 둔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"의무 대기표와 하역 순서를 공개하고 군수 화차를 뒤로 둔다. 혼입 상자를 해결한 결과까지는 기록되지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d310-d574-c8fc","name":"해주 판씨","crest":"clan-crests/d310-d574-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":30,"무력":-55,"물질":-20,"공동":25,"원칙":50,"공개":30,"자격":20,"분산":25,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":15,"위험":20,"과시":5,"지속":20,"지향":"양성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"대합실 의무 대기표·약재 하역 순서 게시","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"전문의","직함":"청량리역 대합실 거점장","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 30 | 무력 −55 | 물질 −20 | 공동 25 | 원칙 50 | 공개 30 | 자격 20 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 15 | 위험 20 | 과시 5 | 지속 20 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2094-12-30에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 청량리역 대합실 거점장 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 대합실 의무 대기표·약재 하역 순서 게시 창구가 판한들의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 전문의. 직함은 청량리 대합실 진료 전문의. 대합실 의무 대기표와 약재 하역 순서를 매일 공개하고, 군수 화차는 의무호송이 떠난 뒤에만 승강장에 붙인다.","일화":"선매 장부가 사라진 주, 청량리 대합실 대기표에 군수 문장 상자가 한 줄 끼어 있었다.","관계":"남호성의 호송 정차를 승강장에서 받고, 동주하의 시장 하역과 줄을 나눈다. 장세화의 의료호송 시각을 칠판 맨 위에 둔다.","야망":"청량리 대합실을 약재 경매·진료·호송이 한 지붕에서 서명되는 동부 의료 창구로 남겨 비공개 선매 창구를 승강장에 열지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"여름 가짜 약 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 환자들이 후문 밀차로 흩어지는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"대합실 화물을 공개 검수하거나, 환자 줄을 군수 대기열과 분리할 수 있다."},"biography":"승강장 습기로 환자 인파를 가늠하고, 군수 화차를 의무호송 앞으로 끌어오라는 명령을 모욕으로 듣는다. 온화하나 가짜 약 소문이 뜨면 방송을 직접 잡는다.\n\n- 생업: 대합실 의무 대기표·약재 하역 순서 게시\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 전문의\n- 직함: 청량리역 대합실 거점장\n**생애.** 2094-12-30에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 청량리역 대합실 거점장 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 대합실 의무 대기표·약재 하역 순서 게시 창구가 판한들의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 전문의. 직함은 청량리 대합실 진료 전문의. 대합실 의무 대기표와 약재 하역 순서를 매일 공개하고, 군수 화차는 의무호송이 떠난 뒤에만 승강장에 붙인다.\n\n**일화.** 선매 장부가 사라진 주, 청량리 대합실 대기표에 군수 문장 상자가 한 줄 끼어 있었다.\n\n**관계.** 남호성의 호송 정차를 승강장에서 받고, 동주하의 시장 하역과 줄을 나눈다. 장세화의 의료호송 시각을 칠판 맨 위에 둔다.\n\n**야망.** 청량리 대합실을 약재 경매·진료·호송이 한 지붕에서 서명되는 동부 의료 창구로 남겨 비공개 선매 창구를 승강장에 열지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 여름 가짜 약 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 환자들이 후문 밀차로 흩어지는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 대합실 화물을 공개 검수하거나, 환자 줄을 군수 대기열과 분리할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 30 | 무력 −55 | 물질 −20 | 공동 25 | 원칙 50 | 공개 30 | 자격 20 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 15 | 위험 20 | 과시 5 | 지속 20 | 지향 양성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"판한들","type":"계약","to":"남호성","basis":"남호성의 호송 정차를 승강장에서 받고"},{"from":"판한들","type":"계약","to":"동주하","basis":"동주하의 시장 하역과 줄을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"천다올","type":"계약","to":"판한들","basis":"판한들의 대합실 정차와 시각을 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0337', 'cc9c-c601-c591', '{"id":"person-0337","name":"Cheon Daol","title":"Medical Escort Base Duty Chief, Nam Hoseong''s Working-Level Aide","position":"Medical Escort Base Duty Chief, Nam Hoseong''s Working-Level Aide","characterId":"K336","rank":"Resident","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Medical escort pass patient and medicine weight records","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-cheon-daol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0337","birthDate":"2095-06-03","birthday":"06-03","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"pump-shaft-replacement","name":"Pump shaft replacement","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Separates care from weapons","description":"Replacing one worn shaft restarted a pump; dispatch checks accompany transport duty. The repair does not become medical escort combat experience.","behavior":"He kept in the field a superior''s silence that never announced convoy routes. He burned any note that told him to bring armed guards into the care cars.","stress":"Fear. That a convoy out of the base would be stopped on the Guui bridge and the patient cars stamped munitions cars.","relationship":"Relations. Held the release duty under Nam Hoseong''s command and confirmed Go Seojun''s bridge passage permit before release. Matched hours with Pan Handeul''s concourse stops.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: member. Title: medical convoy base duty chief, duty officer of Nam Hoseong. He wrote only patient counts and herb weights on the convoy pass and wrote the destination''s state name on the chalkboard just before release. He kept armed guards separate from the care-car keys.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: member. Title: medical convoy base duty chief, duty officer of Nam Hoseong. He wrote only patient counts and herb weights on the convoy pass and wrote the destination''s state name on the chalkboard just before release. He kept armed guards separate from the care-car keys.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That a convoy out of the base would be stopped on the Guui bridge and the patient cars stamped munitions cars.","relationship":"Relations. Held the release duty under Nam Hoseong''s command and confirmed Go Seojun''s bridge passage permit before release. Matched hours with Pan Handeul''s concourse stops.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Replacing one worn shaft restarted a pump; dispatch checks accompany transport duty. The repair does not become medical escort combat experience.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc9c-c601-c591","name":"Yeongyang Cheon Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cc9c-c601-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":30,"Force":-80,"Material":-10,"Communal":30,"Principle":50,"Public":15,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":-20,"Display":15,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical escort pass patient and medicine weight records","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Resident","Title":"Medical Escort Base Duty Chief, Nam Hoseong''s Working-Level Aide","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −80 | Materialism −10 | Community 30 | Principle 50 | Publicity 15 | Credentials 25 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 45 | Monopoly −15 | Risk −20 | Display 15 | Persistence −15 | Orientation bisexual | Union polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2095-06-03. As of the 2126 opening, holds the posts of Medical Convoy Depot Shift Chief and Nam Hoseong''s working-level aide, continuing the existing duty shifts and records. The succession record for that post opened with a defect report filed just before a derailment.\n- The window in Cheongnyangni-dong for recording patient and medicine weights on medical convoy passes is Cheon Daol''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Resident. Title: Medical Convoy Duty Resident. Writes only the patient count and medicine weight on the convoy pass, and chalks the destination''s state name on the blackboard just before dispatch. Keeps armed guards separate from the treatment car key.","Anecdote":"In 2125 took apart a pump that had stopped, ground down just one worn shaft, and ran it again. That day''s record remained as the handover basis for the next shift to verify.","Relationships":"Takes the dispatch duty under Nam Hoseong''s command, and confirms Go Seojun''s bridge passage permit before dispatch. Aligns stop times with Pan Handeul''s waiting hall stops.","Ambition":"Aims to keep the depot dispatch of the Sinnae–Jegi-dong–Achasan triangular medical convoy as the working practice of the first clause of the Joint Convoy Treaty, ending the mistaking of medical convoys for military trains.","Fear":"Fears that a convoy leaving the depot will be stopped at the Guui bridge and its patient car stamped as a military car.","Intervention":"Can correct the misidentified signal on the depot blackboard, or reroute the convoy to deepen the split among the Gateway States."},"biography":"Keeps, on the ground, the silence of a superior who does not announce the convoy route in advance. Burns a note telling the staff to let armed guards into the treatment car.\n\n- Livelihood: Recording patients and medicine weights on medical convoy passes\n- Affiliation: White Cross Corps\n- Rank: Resident\n- Title: Medical Convoy Depot Duty Officer, Nam Hoseong''s working-level aide\n**Life.** Born on 2095-06-03. As of the 2126 opening, takes up the post of Medical Convoy Depot Duty Officer and working-level aide to Nam Hoseong, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post opened with a defect report just before a derailment.\n- The desk in Cheongnyangni-dong that records patients and medicine weights on medical convoy passes is Cheon Daol''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Resident. Title: Medical Convoy Duty Resident. Writes only the number of patients and the weight of medicine on the convoy pass, and writes the name of the destination polity on the blackboard just before dispatch. Keeps armed guards separate from the keys to the treatment car.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, took apart a pump that had stopped, ground down only one worn shaft, and got it running again. That day''s record remained as the handover evidence for the next duty shift to verify.\n\n**Relations.** Takes the dispatch duty under Nam Hoseong''s command, and confirms Go Seojun''s bridge passage permit before dispatch. Matches the timing with Pan Handeul''s waiting-room stops.\n\n**Ambition.** To make the depot dispatch of the Sinnae–Jegi-dong–Achasan triangular medical convoy the first working-level clause of the Joint Convoy Treaty, ending the misidentification of convoys as munitions trains.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that a convoy that has left the depot will be stopped at the bridge in Guui and its patient cars stamped as munitions cars.\n\n**Intervention.** Can correct the misidentified signal on the depot blackboard, or reroute the convoy to deepen the split among the Gateway States.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −80 | Material −10 | Communal 30 | Principle 50 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 10 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Longing 45 | Exclusivity −15 | Risk −20 | Display 15 | Persistence −15 | Orientation: Bisexual | Union: Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Cheon Daol","type":"Command","to":"Nam Hoseong","basis":"Takes the dispatch duty under Nam Hoseong''s command and"},{"from":"Cheon Daol","type":"Contract","to":"Pan Handeul","basis":"Aligns stop times with Pan Handeul''s waiting hall stops"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0337","name":"천다올","title":"의무호송 기지 당직장, 남호성의 실무 담당자","position":"의무호송 기지 당직장, 남호성의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K336","rank":"수련의","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-천다올","detailRoute":"/people/person-0337","birthDate":"2095-06-03","birthday":"06-03","age":31,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"pump-shaft-replacement","name":"펌프 축 교체","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"치료 칸과 무장을 분리","description":"마모 축 하나를 바꿔 펌프를 재가동했고 호송 출고를 확인한다. 확인된 수리를 의료호송 전투 경력으로 바꾸지 않는다.","behavior":"호송 경로를 미리 말하지 않는 상관의 침묵을 현장에서 지킨다. 치료 칸에 무장 수비를 들이라는 쪽지를 태운다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 담당 전문의의 도제로 배우며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 기지에서 나간 호송이 구의 교량에서 막혀 환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 찍히는 것.","relationship":"관계. 남호성의 지휘로 출고 당직을 맡고, 고서준의 교량 통과 허가를 출고 전에 확인한다. 판한들의 대합실 정차와 시각을 맞춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 의무호송 당직 수련의. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적고 목적지 국호는 출고 직전에 칠판에 쓴다. 무장 수비는 치료 칸 열쇠와 분리한다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 의무호송 당직 수련의. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적고 목적지 국호는 출고 직전에 칠판에 쓴다. 무장 수비는 치료 칸 열쇠와 분리한다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 기지에서 나간 호송이 구의 교량에서 막혀 환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 찍히는 것.","relationship":"관계. 남호성의 지휘로 출고 당직을 맡고, 고서준의 교량 통과 허가를 출고 전에 확인한다. 판한들의 대합실 정차와 시각을 맞춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"마모 축 하나를 바꿔 펌프를 재가동했고 호송 출고를 확인한다. 확인된 수리를 의료호송 전투 경력으로 바꾸지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc9c-c601-c591","name":"영양 천씨","crest":"clan-crests/cc9c-c601-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":30,"무력":-80,"물질":-10,"공동":30,"원칙":50,"공개":15,"자격":25,"분산":10,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":45,"독점":-15,"위험":-20,"과시":15,"지속":-15,"지향":"양성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"수련의","직함":"의무호송 기지 당직장, 남호성의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −80 | 물질 −10 | 공동 30 | 원칙 50 | 공개 15 | 자격 25 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 45 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −20 | 과시 15 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2095-06-03에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의무호송 기지 당직장, 남호성의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록 창구가 천다올의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수련의. 직함은 의무호송 당직 수련의. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적고 목적지 국호는 출고 직전에 칠판에 쓴다. 무장 수비는 치료 칸 열쇠와 분리한다.","일화":"2125년 정지했던 펌프를 분해해 마모 축 하나만 갈아 다시 돌렸다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.","관계":"남호성의 지휘로 출고 당직을 맡고, 고서준의 교량 통과 허가를 출고 전에 확인한다. 판한들의 대합실 정차와 시각을 맞춘다.","야망":"신내·제기동·아차산 삼각 의무호송의 기지 출고를 공동호송조약의 첫 조항 실무로 남겨 군수 열차 오인을 끊는다.","공포":"기지에서 나간 호송이 구의 교량에서 막혀 환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 찍히는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"오인 신호를 기지 칠판에서 바로잡거나, 호송을 우회시켜 관문국의 분열을 키울 수 있다."},"biography":"호송 경로를 미리 말하지 않는 상관의 침묵을 현장에서 지킨다. 치료 칸에 무장 수비를 들이라는 쪽지를 태운다.\n\n- 생업: 의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 수련의\n- 직함: 의무호송 기지 당직장, 남호성의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2095-06-03에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의무호송 기지 당직장, 남호성의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 탈선 직전 결함 보고로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록 창구가 천다올의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수련의. 직함은 의무호송 당직 수련의. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적고 목적지 국호는 출고 직전에 칠판에 쓴다. 무장 수비는 치료 칸 열쇠와 분리한다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 정지했던 펌프를 분해해 마모 축 하나만 갈아 다시 돌렸다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 남호성의 지휘로 출고 당직을 맡고, 고서준의 교량 통과 허가를 출고 전에 확인한다. 판한들의 대합실 정차와 시각을 맞춘다.\n\n**야망.** 신내·제기동·아차산 삼각 의무호송의 기지 출고를 공동호송조약의 첫 조항 실무로 남겨 군수 열차 오인을 끊는다.\n\n**공포.** 기지에서 나간 호송이 구의 교량에서 막혀 환자 칸이 군수 칸으로 찍히는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 오인 신호를 기지 칠판에서 바로잡거나, 호송을 우회시켜 관문국의 분열을 키울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −80 | 물질 −10 | 공동 30 | 원칙 50 | 공개 15 | 자격 25 | 분산 10 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 45 | 독점 −15 | 위험 −20 | 과시 15 | 지속 −15 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"천다올","type":"지휘","to":"남호성","basis":"남호성의 지휘로 출고 당직을 맡고"},{"from":"천다올","type":"계약","to":"판한들","basis":"판한들의 대합실 정차와 시각을 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0338', 'b3d9-ad11-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0338","name":"Dong Juha","title":"Jegi-dong Market Scale Outpost Chief","position":"Jegi-dong Market Scale Outpost Chief","characterId":"K337","rank":"Specialist","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"Medicinal Herb Origin and Drying Date Inspection","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#person-dong-juha","detailRoute":"/people/person-0338","birthDate":"2089-01-31","birthday":"01-31","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":11,"effective":11},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"herbal-cargo-inspection","name":"Herbal cargo inspection","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Refusal at the scales","description":"Reading provenance and weight supports withholding shipments pending clinical seals. Recovery of ledgers lost during closure is not established.","behavior":"He read origin inspection posts and box weights at a glance and sent away from the scales any envoy who recommended pre-buying. He remembered credit ledgers longer than faces.","stress":"Fear. That counterfeit drugs would flow, together with the scale marks, toward Bukhansan Bogukmun and the market would be sealed for a season.","relationship":"Relations. Executed Sim Dalho''s auction rules at the scales and matched Dong Neulsol''s transport weights on the same graduation. Pasted Jeon Sol''s patient allocation onto the release order.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: supervisor. Title: Jegi-dong market scales outpost chief. She hung origin and drying dates on the inspection posts and opened the scales for bulk pre-buying only with the stamps of Ryu Eunbi and Jeon Sol.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: supervisor. Title: Jegi-dong market scales outpost chief. She hung origin and drying dates on the inspection posts and opened the scales for bulk pre-buying only with the stamps of Ryu Eunbi and Jeon Sol.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That counterfeit drugs would flow, together with the scale marks, toward Bukhansan Bogukmun and the market would be sealed for a season.","relationship":"Relations. Executed Sim Dalho''s auction rules at the scales and matched Dong Neulsol''s transport weights on the same graduation. Pasted Jeon Sol''s patient allocation onto the release order.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Reading provenance and weight supports withholding shipments pending clinical seals. Recovery of ledgers lost during closure is not established.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11230-S13","name":{"ko":"Dongdaemun-gu Duchy Directly Administered Land"},"holderPersonId":"K337","directLiegePersonId":"K144","stateId":"S13","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1123051500","name":"Sinseol-dong"},{"id":"region:1123053300","name":"Yongdu-dong"},{"id":"region:1123054500","name":"Jegi-dong"},{"id":"region:1123056000","name":"Jeonnong 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1123057000","name":"Jeonnong 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1123060000","name":"Dapsimni 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1123061000","name":"Dapsimni 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1123065000","name":"Jangan 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1123066000","name":"Jangan 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1123070500","name":"Cheongnyangni-dong"},{"id":"region:1123071000","name":"Hoegi-dong"},{"id":"region:1123072000","name":"Hwigyeong 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1123073000","name":"Hwigyeong 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1123074000","name":"Imun 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1123075000","name":"Imun 2-dong"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11230-S13","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11230-S13","name":"Dongdaemun-gu Duchy","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K337","basis":"Opening administrative scale group gu:11230(duchy) allocation · decisive candidate selection","stateId":"S13","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1123051500","region:1123053300","region:1123054500","region:1123056000","region:1123057000","region:1123060000","region:1123061000","region:1123065000","region:1123066000","region:1123070500","region:1123071000","region:1123072000","region:1123073000","region:1123074000","region:1123075000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s06","name":"The Government Kingdom","holderPersonId":"K144"}}],"clan":{"id":"b3d9-ad11-cc9c","name":"Gwangcheon Dong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b3d9-ad11-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":30,"Force":-45,"Material":-25,"Communal":40,"Principle":35,"Public":25,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-10,"Display":-25,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medicinal Herb Origin and Drying Date Inspection","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Specialist","Title":"Jegi-dong Market Scale Outpost Chief","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 30 | Force −45 | Material −25 | Communal 40 | Principle 35 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Longing 0 | Exclusivity −10 | Risk −10 | Display −25 | Persistence 20 | Orientation: Fluid | Union: Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2089-01-31. As of the 2126 opening, takes up the post of Jegi-dong Market Scale Station Chief, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post opened with the public re-check of the scales.\n- The medicinal herb origin and drying date inspection desk in Jegi-dong is Dong Juha''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Specialist. Title: Jegi-dong Medicinal Herb Inspection Specialist. Hangs origin and drying date on the tally post, and opens the scale for bulk dispatch only with the treatment assignment seal of the attending specialist and the Corps chief.","Anecdote":"That summer, when counterfeit medicine flowed out through the Bukhansan Boguk Gate, Yakjae-dong blockaded itself, and the advance-purchase ledger and the scale seal vanished together.","Relationships":"Enforces Sim Dalho''s auction rules at the scale, and matches Dong Neulsol''s transport weights to the same markings. Ties Jeon Sol''s patient allocations to the dispatch order.","Ambition":"Wants to keep the Jegi-dong Market auction scale as the public face of the medical command''s severity-based allocation, so that closed monopoly bidding cannot buy up the floor price.","Fear":"Fears that counterfeit medicine will flow out through the Bukhansan Boguk Gate along with the scale markings, and the market will be blockaded for a season.","Intervention":"Can recover the scale seal, or expose the hidden advance-purchase agents at the auction floor."},"biography":"Reads the origin tally post and the crate weight at a glance, and turns away emissaries urging advance purchases right at the scale. Remembers the credit ledger longer than a person''s face.\n\n- Livelihood: Inspecting medicinal herb origins and drying dates\n- Affiliation: White Cross Corps\n- Rank: Specialist\n- Title: Jegi-dong Market Scale Station Chief\n**Life.** Born on 2089-01-31. As of the 2126 opening, takes up the post of Jegi-dong Market Scale Station Chief, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post opened with the public re-check of the scales.\n- The medicinal herb origin and drying date inspection desk in Jegi-dong is Dong Juha''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Specialist. Title: Jegi-dong Medicinal Herb Inspection Specialist. Hangs origin and drying date on the tally post, and opens the scale for bulk dispatch only with the treatment assignment seal of the attending specialist and the Corps chief.\n\n**Anecdote.** That summer, when counterfeit medicine flowed out through the Bukhansan Boguk Gate, Yakjae-dong blockaded itself, and the advance-purchase ledger and the scale seal vanished together.\n\n**Relations.** Enforces Sim Dalho''s auction rules at the scale, and matches Dong Neulsol''s transport weights to the same markings. Ties Jeon Sol''s patient allocations to the dispatch order.\n\n**Ambition.** Wants to keep the Jegi-dong Market auction scale as the public face of the medical command''s severity-based allocation, so that closed monopoly bidding cannot buy up the floor price.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that counterfeit medicine will flow out through the Bukhansan Boguk Gate along with the scale markings, and the market will be blockaded for a season.\n\n**Intervention.** Can recover the scale seal, or expose the hidden advance-purchase agents at the auction floor.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 30 | Force −45 | Material −25 | Communal 40 | Principle 35 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Longing 0 | Exclusivity −10 | Risk −10 | Display −25 | Persistence 20 | Orientation: Fluid | Union: Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Dong Juha","type":"Command","to":"Sim Dalho","basis":"Enforces Sim Dalho''s auction rules at the scale, and"},{"from":"Dong Juha","type":"Command","to":"Dong Neulsol","basis":"Sets Dong Neulsol''s transport weights to the same scale marks"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Gang Daryu","type":"Contract","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"Gang Daryu brings the origins and drying dates of the medicinal herbs he manages to Dong Juha for inspection. Dong Juha checks the dates and origins on the tally posts and verifies the treatment assignment seal, so that herbs meant for quarantined patients are not mixed into unverified bulk dispatches."},{"from":"Sin Habin","type":"Contract","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"Sin Habin hands the custody records of the medicinal herbs used in surgery to Dong Juha and has the next supply inspected. Dong Juha checks origin and drying date and arranges the dispatch order to match the treatment assignment seal, so that care after the blackout is not cut off again by a shortage of herbs."},{"from":"An Cha-min","type":"Contract","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"An Chamin hands the herb usage amounts and the remaining custody records to Dong Juha. Dong Juha checks origin, drying date, and the treatment assignment seal, and bridges the shortfall with verified supply in the next dispatch."},{"from":"Heo Tau","type":"Contract","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"Heo Tau hands the custody records of the herbs for quarantined patients to Dong Juha. Dong Juha checks origin, drying date, and the treatment assignment seal, and inspects the supply needed for house calls."},{"from":"An Seomin","type":"Contract","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"An Seomin hands the herb usage amounts and the remaining custody records to Dong Juha. Dong Juha checks origin, drying date, and the treatment assignment seal, and inspects the next supply."},{"from":"Dong Neulsol","type":"Contract","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"Matches weights to Dong Juha''s market scale"},{"from":"Pan Handeul","type":"Contract","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"Shares the line with Dong Juha''s market unloading"},{"from":"Tak Eunsol","type":"Oath","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"overlapping Dong Juha''s scale seal with the testimony, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0338","name":"동주하","title":"제기동시장 저울 거점장","position":"제기동시장 저울 거점장","characterId":"K337","rank":"전문의","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"약재 원산지·건조 일자 검수","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-동주하","detailRoute":"/people/person-0338","birthDate":"2089-01-31","birthday":"01-31","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":11,"effective":11},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"herbal-cargo-inspection","name":"약재 검수","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"저울 앞의 거절","description":"출처와 중량을 읽고 진료 배정 날인 전 출고를 막는다. 봉쇄 중 사라진 장부를 되찾았다는 근거는 없다.","behavior":"원산지 말목과 상자 무게를 한눈에 읽고, 선매를 권하는 사신을 저울 앞에서 돌려보낸다. 외상 장부를 사람 얼굴보다 오래 기억한다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 수련의를 지도하고 후계자를 지정하며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 가짜 약이 저울 눈금과 함께 북한산보국문으로 흘러 시장이 한 계절에 봉쇄되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 심달호의 경매 규칙을 저울에서 집행하고, 동늘솔의 운송 무게를 같은 눈금에 맞춘다. 전솔의 환자 할당을 출하 순서로 붙인다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 전문의. 직함은 제기동 약재 검수 전문의. 원산지와 건조 일자를 말목에 걸고, 대량 출고는 담당 전문의와 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있어야 저울을 연다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 전문의. 직함은 제기동 약재 검수 전문의. 원산지와 건조 일자를 말목에 걸고, 대량 출고는 담당 전문의와 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있어야 저울을 연다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 가짜 약이 저울 눈금과 함께 북한산보국문으로 흘러 시장이 한 계절에 봉쇄되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 심달호의 경매 규칙을 저울에서 집행하고, 동늘솔의 운송 무게를 같은 눈금에 맞춘다. 전솔의 환자 할당을 출하 순서로 붙인다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"출처와 중량을 읽고 진료 배정 날인 전 출고를 막는다. 봉쇄 중 사라진 장부를 되찾았다는 근거는 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11230-S13","name":{"ko":"동대문구 공작령 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K337","directLiegePersonId":"K144","stateId":"S13","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1123051500","name":"신설동"},{"id":"region:1123053300","name":"용두동"},{"id":"region:1123054500","name":"제기동"},{"id":"region:1123056000","name":"전농1동"},{"id":"region:1123057000","name":"전농2동"},{"id":"region:1123060000","name":"답십리1동"},{"id":"region:1123061000","name":"답십리2동"},{"id":"region:1123065000","name":"장안1동"},{"id":"region:1123066000","name":"장안2동"},{"id":"region:1123070500","name":"청량리동"},{"id":"region:1123071000","name":"회기동"},{"id":"region:1123072000","name":"휘경1동"},{"id":"region:1123073000","name":"휘경2동"},{"id":"region:1123074000","name":"이문1동"},{"id":"region:1123075000","name":"이문2동"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11230-S13","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11230-S13","name":"동대문구 공작령","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K337","basis":"개막 행정 규모 그룹 gu:11230(duchy) 배분 · 결정적 후보 선정","stateId":"S13","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1123051500","region:1123053300","region:1123054500","region:1123056000","region:1123057000","region:1123060000","region:1123061000","region:1123065000","region:1123066000","region:1123070500","region:1123071000","region:1123072000","region:1123073000","region:1123074000","region:1123075000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s06","name":"정부 왕국","holderPersonId":"K144"}}],"clan":{"id":"b3d9-ad11-cc9c","name":"광천 동씨","crest":"clan-crests/b3d9-ad11-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":30,"무력":-45,"물질":-25,"공동":40,"원칙":35,"공개":25,"자격":10,"분산":15,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-10,"위험":-10,"과시":-25,"지속":20,"지향":"유동","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"약재 원산지·건조 일자 검수","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"전문의","직함":"제기동시장 저울 거점장","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 30 | 무력 −45 | 물질 −25 | 공동 40 | 원칙 35 | 공개 25 | 자격 10 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −25 | 지속 20 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2089-01-31에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 제기동시장 저울 거점장 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 약재 원산지·건조 일자 검수 창구가 동주하의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 전문의. 직함은 제기동 약재 검수 전문의. 원산지와 건조 일자를 말목에 걸고, 대량 출고는 담당 전문의와 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있어야 저울을 연다.","일화":"여름 가짜 약이 북한산보국문으로 흘러가자 약재동이 자체 봉쇄되고 선매 장부와 저울 봉인이 함께 사라졌다.","관계":"심달호의 경매 규칙을 저울에서 집행하고, 동늘솔의 운송 무게를 같은 눈금에 맞춘다. 전솔의 환자 할당을 출하 순서로 붙인다.","야망":"제기동시장 경매 저울을 의료 지휘부 중증도 배정의 얼굴로 남겨 비공개 독점 입찰이 바닥 시세를 사지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"가짜 약이 저울 눈금과 함께 북한산보국문으로 흘러 시장이 한 계절에 봉쇄되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"저울 봉인을 되찾거나, 비공개 선매 대리인을 경매장에서 공개할 수 있다."},"biography":"원산지 말목과 상자 무게를 한눈에 읽고, 선매를 권하는 사신을 저울 앞에서 돌려보낸다. 외상 장부를 사람 얼굴보다 오래 기억한다.\n\n- 생업: 약재 원산지·건조 일자 검수\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 전문의\n- 직함: 제기동시장 저울 거점장\n**생애.** 2089-01-31에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 제기동시장 저울 거점장 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 저울 재점검 공개로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 약재 원산지·건조 일자 검수 창구가 동주하의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 전문의. 직함은 제기동 약재 검수 전문의. 원산지와 건조 일자를 말목에 걸고, 대량 출고는 담당 전문의와 단장의 진료 배정 날인이 있어야 저울을 연다.\n\n**일화.** 여름 가짜 약이 북한산보국문으로 흘러가자 약재동이 자체 봉쇄되고 선매 장부와 저울 봉인이 함께 사라졌다.\n\n**관계.** 심달호의 경매 규칙을 저울에서 집행하고, 동늘솔의 운송 무게를 같은 눈금에 맞춘다. 전솔의 환자 할당을 출하 순서로 붙인다.\n\n**야망.** 제기동시장 경매 저울을 의료 지휘부 중증도 배정의 얼굴로 남겨 비공개 독점 입찰이 바닥 시세를 사지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 가짜 약이 저울 눈금과 함께 북한산보국문으로 흘러 시장이 한 계절에 봉쇄되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 저울 봉인을 되찾거나, 비공개 선매 대리인을 경매장에서 공개할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 30 | 무력 −45 | 물질 −25 | 공동 40 | 원칙 35 | 공개 25 | 자격 10 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −10 | 과시 −25 | 지속 20 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"동주하","type":"지휘","to":"심달호","basis":"심달호의 경매 규칙을 저울에서 집행하고"},{"from":"동주하","type":"지휘","to":"동늘솔","basis":"동늘솔의 운송 무게를 같은 눈금에 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"강달유","type":"계약","to":"동주하","basis":"강달유는 관리하는 약재의 출처와 건조 일자를 동주하에게 가져가 검수받는다. 동주하는 말목의 날짜와 원산지를 살피고 진료 배정 날인을 확인해, 격리 환자에게 쓸 약재가 확인되지 않은 대량 출고에 섞이지 않게 한다."},{"from":"신하빈","type":"계약","to":"동주하","basis":"신하빈은 수술에 쓴 약재의 관리 기록을 동주하에게 넘겨 다음 공급을 검수받는다. 동주하는 원산지와 건조 일자를 확인하고 진료 배정 날인에 맞춰 출하 순서를 잡아 정전 뒤의 진료가 약재 공백으로 다시 끊기지 않게 한다."},{"from":"안차민","type":"계약","to":"동주하","basis":"안차민은 약재 사용량과 남은 관리 기록을 동주하에게 넘긴다. 동주하는 원산지·건조 일자와 진료 배정 날인을 확인해 부족한 물자를 다음 출하에서 확인된 공급으로 잇는다."},{"from":"허타우","type":"계약","to":"동주하","basis":"허타우는 격리 환자에게 쓸 약재의 관리 기록을 동주하에게 넘긴다. 동주하는 원산지·건조 일자와 진료 배정 날인을 확인해 왕진에 필요한 공급을 검수한다."},{"from":"안서민","type":"계약","to":"동주하","basis":"안서민은 약재 사용량과 남은 관리 기록을 동주하에게 넘긴다. 동주하는 원산지·건조 일자와 진료 배정 날인을 확인해 다음 공급을 검수한다."},{"from":"동늘솔","type":"계약","to":"동주하","basis":"동주하의 시장 저울에 무게를 맞춘다"},{"from":"판한들","type":"계약","to":"동주하","basis":"동주하의 시장 하역과 줄을 나눈다"},{"from":"탁은솔","type":"맹세","to":"동주하","basis":"동주하의 저울 봉인과 증언을 겹치고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0339', 'bc29-b0a8-c591-623f', '{"id":"person-0339","name":"Bang Misan","title":"Cheongnyangni Clinic Outpost Chief, Eun Chaeyun''s Working-Level Aide","position":"Cheongnyangni Clinic Outpost Chief, Eun Chaeyun''s Working-Level Aide","characterId":"K338","rank":"Specialist","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"Triage Chart and Medical Findings Posting","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#person-bang-misan","detailRoute":"/people/person-0339","birthDate":"2084-01-16","birthday":"01-16","age":42,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"triage-bed-allocation","name":"Triage bed allocation","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Enemies remain patients","description":"Enemy casualties enter by severity and beds open on clinical judgment. Successful resolution of the loosened seal and medicine provenance issue remains unconfirmed.","behavior":"He took even an enemy''s wounded in by severity alone and tore up any note that called the clinic a war-booty window. He pasted the contribution-labor table at the foot of the sickbeds.","stress":"Fear. That after counterfeit febrifuges were used at the sickbeds the clinic would be stamped a protection-warehouse subcontract.","relationship":"Relations. Divided the sickbeds under Eun Chaeyun''s command and pasted Bang Hanul''s duty roster on the door. Received Baek On''s refugees in severity order.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: supervisor. Title: Cheongnyangni clinic outpost chief, duty officer of Eun Chaeyun. She posted the severity table and contribution labor side by side and opened a sickbed for a priority care request only after it rose to the guild council.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: supervisor. Title: Cheongnyangni clinic outpost chief, duty officer of Eun Chaeyun. She posted the severity table and contribution labor side by side and opened a sickbed for a priority care request only after it rose to the guild council.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That after counterfeit febrifuges were used at the sickbeds the clinic would be stamped a protection-warehouse subcontract.","relationship":"Relations. Divided the sickbeds under Eun Chaeyun''s command and pasted Bang Hanul''s duty roster on the door. Received Baek On''s refugees in severity order.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Enemy casualties enter by severity and beds open on clinical judgment. Successful resolution of the loosened seal and medicine provenance issue remains unconfirmed.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc29-b0a8-c591-623f","name":"Namyang Bang Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc29-b0a8-c591-623f.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":40,"Force":-60,"Material":-15,"Communal":25,"Principle":40,"Public":15,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":35,"Risk":20,"Display":-15,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Triage Chart and Medical Findings Posting","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Specialist","Title":"Cheongnyangni Clinic Outpost Chief, Eun Chaeyun''s Working-Level Aide","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 40 | Force −60 | Material −15 | Communal 25 | Principle 40 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 15 | Monopoly 35 | Risk 20 | Display −15 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2084-01-16. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Cheongnyangni Clinic Site Chief and Eun Chaeyun''s working-level officer, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post opened with a substitute shift covering an unexcused shift absence.\n- The severity chart and clinical findings posting desk in Cheongnyangni-dong is Bang Misan''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble rank, fiefs, or tenure rights.","Offices":"Rank: Specialist. Title: Cheongnyangni Clinic Specialist. The severity chart and clinical findings are posted side by side, and a priority-treatment request opens a bed only after the attending specialist''s clinical judgment.","Anecdote":"On the night testimony came in that the manufacturing capsule matched the seal of the Protection Depot inside Seoul, one sealing cord on the clinic shelf had come undone.","Relationships":"Under Eun Chaeyun''s command the beds are divided, and Bang Hanul''s duty ledger is posted on the door. Baek On''s refugees are admitted in order of severity.","Ambition":"Intends to keep the Cheongnyangni Clinic as the on-site text of the Seoul Medical Charter, so that an armed duty commander''s priority treatment stops at the door.","Fear":"Fears that after counterfeit fever medicine is used at the bedside, the clinic will be branded a subcontractor of the Protection Depot.","Intervention":"Can restore the shelf seal, or hide wounded enemy soldiers to frame the clinic for a charter violation."},"biography":"Admits even enemy wounded by severity alone, and tears up the note that told the clinic to call itself a spoils window. Posts the clinical findings chart at the foot of each bed.\n\n- Livelihood: Posting the severity chart and clinical findings\n- Affiliation: White Cross Corps\n- Rank: Specialist\n- Title: Cheongnyangni Clinic Site Chief, Eun Chaeyun''s working-level officer\n**Life.** Born on 2084-01-16. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Cheongnyangni Clinic Site Chief and Eun Chaeyun''s working-level officer, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post opened with a substitute shift covering an unexcused shift absence.\n- The severity chart and clinical findings posting desk in Cheongnyangni-dong is Bang Misan''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble rank, fiefs, or tenure rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Specialist. Title: Cheongnyangni Clinic Specialist. The severity chart and clinical findings are posted side by side, and a priority-treatment request opens a bed only after the attending specialist''s clinical judgment.\n\n**Anecdote.** On the night testimony came in that the manufacturing capsule matched the seal of the Protection Depot inside Seoul, one sealing cord on the clinic shelf had come undone.\n\n**Relations.** Under Eun Chaeyun''s command the beds are divided, and Bang Hanul''s duty ledger is posted on the door. Baek On''s refugees are admitted in order of severity.\n\n**Ambition.** Intends to keep the Cheongnyangni Clinic as the on-site text of the Seoul Medical Charter, so that an armed duty commander''s priority treatment stops at the door.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that after counterfeit fever medicine is used at the bedside, the clinic will be branded a subcontractor of the Protection Depot.\n\n**Intervention.** Can restore the shelf seal, or hide wounded enemy soldiers to frame the clinic for a charter violation.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 40 | Force −60 | Material −15 | Communal 25 | Principle 40 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Monopoly 35 | Risk 20 | Display −15 | Persistence 35 | Orientation Bisexual | Union Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bang Misan","type":"Command","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"divides the sickbeds under Eun Chaeyun''s command, and"},{"from":"Bang Misan","type":"Contract","to":"Bang Hanul","basis":"Posts Bang Hanul''s duty ledger on the door"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Bang Hanul","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Bang Misan","basis":"Shares Bang Misan''s clinic beds"},{"from":"Mae Haru","type":"Contract","to":"Bang Misan","basis":"Reviews Bang Misan''s clinic sealing cord together"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0339","name":"방미산","title":"청량리 진료소 거점장, 은채윤의 실무 담당자","position":"청량리 진료소 거점장, 은채윤의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K338","rank":"전문의","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"중증도 표·진료 소견 게시","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-방미산","detailRoute":"/people/person-0339","birthDate":"2084-01-16","birthday":"01-16","age":42,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"triage-bed-allocation","name":"중증도 병상 배정","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"적도 환자로 본다","description":"적의 부상자를 중증도로 받고 임상 판단으로 병상을 연다. 풀린 봉인과 약품 출처 문제의 수습 성공은 미확인이다.","behavior":"적의 부상도 중증도만으로 들이고, 진료소를 전리품 창구로 부르라는 쪽지를 찢는다. 진료 소견 표를 침상 발치에 붙인다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 수련의를 지도하고 후계자를 지정하며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 가짜 해열제가 침상에서 쓰인 뒤 진료소가 보호창고 하청으로 찍히는 것.","relationship":"관계. 은채윤의 지휘로 병상을 나누고, 방한울의 당직 원장을 문에 붙인다. 백온의 피난민을 중증도 순으로 받는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 전문의. 직함은 청량리 진료소 전문의. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 게시하고, 우선 치료 요청은 담당 전문의의 임상 판단을 거친 뒤에만 침상을 연다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 전문의. 직함은 청량리 진료소 전문의. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 게시하고, 우선 치료 요청은 담당 전문의의 임상 판단을 거친 뒤에만 침상을 연다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 가짜 해열제가 침상에서 쓰인 뒤 진료소가 보호창고 하청으로 찍히는 것.","relationship":"관계. 은채윤의 지휘로 병상을 나누고, 방한울의 당직 원장을 문에 붙인다. 백온의 피난민을 중증도 순으로 받는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"적의 부상자를 중증도로 받고 임상 판단으로 병상을 연다. 풀린 봉인과 약품 출처 문제의 수습 성공은 미확인이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc29-b0a8-c591-623f","name":"남양 방씨","crest":"clan-crests/bc29-b0a8-c591-623f.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":40,"무력":-60,"물질":-15,"공동":25,"원칙":40,"공개":15,"자격":25,"분산":20,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":35,"위험":20,"과시":-15,"지속":35,"지향":"양성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"중증도 표·진료 소견 게시","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"전문의","직함":"청량리 진료소 거점장, 은채윤의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 40 | 무력 −60 | 물질 −15 | 공동 25 | 원칙 40 | 공개 15 | 자격 25 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 35 | 위험 20 | 과시 −15 | 지속 35 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2084-01-16에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 청량리 진료소 거점장, 은채윤의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 중증도 표·진료 소견 게시 창구가 방미산의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 전문의. 직함은 청량리 진료소 전문의. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 게시하고, 우선 치료 요청은 담당 전문의의 임상 판단을 거친 뒤에만 침상을 연다.","일화":"제조 캡슐이 서울 내부 보호창고 인장과 같다는 증언이 들어온 밤, 진료소 선반의 봉인 끈이 한 줄 풀어져 있었다.","관계":"은채윤의 지휘로 병상을 나누고, 방한울의 당직 원장을 문에 붙인다. 백온의 피난민을 중증도 순으로 받는다.","야망":"청량리 진료소를 서울 의료헌장의 현장 본문으로 남겨 무장 당직 책임자의 우선 치료가 문 앞에서 멈추게 하려 한다.","공포":"가짜 해열제가 침상에서 쓰인 뒤 진료소가 보호창고 하청으로 찍히는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"선반 봉인을 복원하거나, 적군 부상자를 숨겨 헌장 위반 누명을 씌울 수 있다."},"biography":"적의 부상도 중증도만으로 들이고, 진료소를 전리품 창구로 부르라는 쪽지를 찢는다. 진료 소견 표를 침상 발치에 붙인다.\n\n- 생업: 중증도 표·진료 소견 게시\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 전문의\n- 직함: 청량리 진료소 거점장, 은채윤의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2084-01-16에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 청량리 진료소 거점장, 은채윤의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 중증도 표·진료 소견 게시 창구가 방미산의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 전문의. 직함은 청량리 진료소 전문의. 중증도 표와 진료 소견을 나란히 게시하고, 우선 치료 요청은 담당 전문의의 임상 판단을 거친 뒤에만 침상을 연다.\n\n**일화.** 제조 캡슐이 서울 내부 보호창고 인장과 같다는 증언이 들어온 밤, 진료소 선반의 봉인 끈이 한 줄 풀어져 있었다.\n\n**관계.** 은채윤의 지휘로 병상을 나누고, 방한울의 당직 원장을 문에 붙인다. 백온의 피난민을 중증도 순으로 받는다.\n\n**야망.** 청량리 진료소를 서울 의료헌장의 현장 본문으로 남겨 무장 당직 책임자의 우선 치료가 문 앞에서 멈추게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 가짜 해열제가 침상에서 쓰인 뒤 진료소가 보호창고 하청으로 찍히는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 선반 봉인을 복원하거나, 적군 부상자를 숨겨 헌장 위반 누명을 씌울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 40 | 무력 −60 | 물질 −15 | 공동 25 | 원칙 40 | 공개 15 | 자격 25 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 35 | 위험 20 | 과시 −15 | 지속 35 | 지향 양성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"방미산","type":"지휘","to":"은채윤","basis":"은채윤의 지휘로 병상을 나누고"},{"from":"방미산","type":"계약","to":"방한울","basis":"방한울의 당직 원장을 문에 붙인다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"방한울","type":"신도","to":"방미산","basis":"방미산의 진료소 병상을 나눈다"},{"from":"매하루","type":"계약","to":"방미산","basis":"방미산의 진료소 봉인 끈을 함께 본다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0340', 'c218-d55c-c591', '{"id":"person-0340","name":"Su Hyoeun","title":"Medicinal Herb Drying and Refrigeration Emergency Generator Operator","position":"Medicinal Herb Drying and Refrigeration Emergency Generator Operator","characterId":"K339","rank":"Resident","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Medicinal Herb Storage Output Log and Seal","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-suhyoeun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0340","birthDate":"2090-03-18","birthday":"03-18","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"emergency-power-allocation","name":"Emergency power allocation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Reserves power for care","description":"During an outage they preserved power for drying and care and switched off auction lighting. Fuel and output records support the allocation judgment.","behavior":"Sensitive to the smell of fuel, she hated verbal power routing. She took the pressure to divert power from the dryers to the auction lighting as an insult.","stress":"Fear. That on a night when the fuel ran dry the crude herbs would rot, and the Amsa protection warehouse would fill the gap.","relationship":"Relations. Matched output to Cheon Daum''s dryers and kept Bang Misan''s clinic power on the same log. She had obeyed Ryu Eunbi''s care-supply priority but refused concealed power routing.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: member. Title: herb drying and refrigeration emergency generator operator. Every shift she sealed the fuel remainder and output logs and sent them to Cheon Daum, and below minimum output she cut the auction power even under the merchants'' urging.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: member. Title: herb drying and refrigeration emergency generator operator. Every shift she sealed the fuel remainder and output logs and sent them to Cheon Daum, and below minimum output she cut the auction power even under the merchants'' urging.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That on a night when the fuel ran dry the crude herbs would rot, and the Amsa protection warehouse would fill the gap.","relationship":"Relations. Matched output to Cheon Daum''s dryers and kept Bang Misan''s clinic power on the same log. She had obeyed Ryu Eunbi''s care-supply priority but refused concealed power routing.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"During an outage they preserved power for drying and care and switched off auction lighting. Fuel and output records support the allocation judgment.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c218-d55c-c591","name":"Hanyang Su Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c218-d55c-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":25,"Force":-40,"Material":-10,"Communal":30,"Principle":50,"Public":10,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-10,"Risk":-40,"Display":10,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medicinal Herb Storage Output Log and Seal","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Resident","Title":"Medicinal Herb Drying and Refrigeration Emergency Generator Operator","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 25 | Force −40 | Material −10 | Communal 30 | Principle 50 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving 0 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −40 | Display 10 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Bisexual | Union None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2090-03-18. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Herb Drying and Cold-Storage Emergency Generator Operations Chief, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post opened with a counterfeit-drug seal.\n- The herb storage output log and sealing desk in Cheongnyangni-dong is Su Hyoeun''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble rank, fiefs, or tenure rights.","Offices":"Rank: Resident. Title: Herb Storage Resident. Seals the fuel remainder and output log every shift and sends it to Cheon Daum, and if output falls below the minimum, cuts auction power distribution even under pressure from other duty lines.","Anecdote":"When the blackout struck in the week the presale ledger vanished, Su Hyoeun locked the emergency generation to the drying room and the clinic and switched off the auction lighting.","Relationships":"Matches output to Cheon Daum''s dryers and records Bang Misan''s clinic power in the same log. Has obeyed Ryu Eunbi''s priority for treatment supplies but has refused concealed power distribution.","Ambition":"Intends to bind the drying room and clinic power into a single public distribution grid and so protect sovereignty over medicine quality.","Fear":"Fears that on a night when fuel runs out the raw herbs will rot, and the Amsa Protection Depot will fill that gap.","Intervention":"He can secure substitute fuel to open a dual distribution grid, or expose the tampering with the output logs so that the operations chief is replaced."},"biography":"Sensitive to the smell of fuel and dislikes verbal power allocation. Regards pressure to divert power to the auction lighting rather than the dryers as an insult.\n\n- Livelihood: Herb storage output log and sealing\n- Affiliation: White Cross Corps\n- Rank: Resident\n- Title: Herb Drying and Cold-Storage Emergency Generator Operations Chief\n**Life.** Born on 2090-03-18. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Herb Drying and Cold-Storage Emergency Generator Operations Chief, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record for that post opened with a counterfeit-drug seal.\n- The herb storage output log and sealing desk in Cheongnyangni-dong is Su Hyoeun''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble rank, fiefs, or tenure rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Resident. Title: Herb Storage Resident. Seals the fuel remainder and output log every shift and sends it to Cheon Daum, and if output falls below the minimum, cuts auction power distribution even under pressure from other duty lines.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the blackout struck in the week the presale ledger vanished, Su Hyoeun locked the emergency generation to the drying room and the clinic and switched off the auction lighting.\n\n**Relations.** Matches output to Cheon Daum''s dryers and records Bang Misan''s clinic power in the same log. Has obeyed Ryu Eunbi''s priority for treatment supplies but has refused concealed power distribution.\n\n**Ambition.** Intends to bind the drying room and clinic power into a single public distribution grid and so protect sovereignty over medicine quality.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that on a night when fuel runs out the raw herbs will rot, and the Amsa Protection Depot will fill that gap.\n\n**Intervention.** Can obtain substitute fuel and open a dual distribution line, or expose tampering with the output log and replace the operations chief.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 25 | Force −40 | Material −10 | Communal 30 | Principle 50 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly −10 | Risk −40 | Display 10 | Persistence 0 | Orientation Bisexual | Union None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Su Hyoeun","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Obeys Ryu Eunbi''s priority on treatment supplies but refuses concealed distribution"},{"from":"Su Hyoeun","type":"Contract","to":"Cheon Daum","basis":"She matches output to Cheon Daum''s dryer, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Mun Dongeun","type":"Contract","to":"Su Hyoeun","basis":"Mun Dongeun informs Su Hyoeun of the herbs used in surgery and their storage condition after the blackout. Su Hyoeun checks the fuel remainder and output log to review the supply to the drying room and clinic, and Mun Dongeun records in the management log that damaged herbs must not be mixed into later treatment."},{"from":"Jo Awon","type":"Contract","to":"Su Hyoeun","basis":"Jo Awon informs Su Hyoeun of the condition of the herbs under her care and the quantity needed during treatment. Su Hyoeun checks the drying room and clinic output logs to find where a gap in storage power led to herb damage."},{"from":"Cheon Daum","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Su Hyoeun","basis":"She matches drying power to Su Hyoeun''s emergency generation."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0340","name":"수효은","title":"약재 건조·냉장 비상발전 운전장","position":"약재 건조·냉장 비상발전 운전장","characterId":"K339","rank":"수련의","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"약재 보관 출력 일지·봉인","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-수효은","detailRoute":"/people/person-0340","birthDate":"2090-03-18","birthday":"03-18","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"emergency-power-allocation","name":"비상 배전","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"치료 전력을 먼저 잠근다","description":"정전 때 건조실과 진료소 전력을 남기고 경매 조명을 껐다. 연료·출력 기록과 우선 배전 판단에 근거한다.","behavior":"연료 냄새에 예민하고 구두 배전을 싫어한다. 건조기보다 경매 조명에 전력을 돌리라는 압박을 모욕으로 여긴다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 담당 전문의의 도제로 배우며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 연료가 바닥난 밤에 생약이 썩고, 그 공백을 암사 보호창고가 메우는 것.","relationship":"관계. 천다움의 건조기에 출력을 맞추고, 방미산의 진료소 전력을 같은 일지에 남긴다. 류은비의 치료 물자 우선에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 보관 수련의. 매 교대 연료 잔량과 출력 일지를 봉인해 천다움에게 보내고, 최저 출력 이하면 외부 독촉이 있어도 경매 배전을 끊는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 보관 수련의. 매 교대 연료 잔량과 출력 일지를 봉인해 천다움에게 보내고, 최저 출력 이하면 외부 독촉이 있어도 경매 배전을 끊는다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 연료가 바닥난 밤에 생약이 썩고, 그 공백을 암사 보호창고가 메우는 것.","relationship":"관계. 천다움의 건조기에 출력을 맞추고, 방미산의 진료소 전력을 같은 일지에 남긴다. 류은비의 치료 물자 우선에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"정전 때 건조실과 진료소 전력을 남기고 경매 조명을 껐다. 연료·출력 기록과 우선 배전 판단에 근거한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c218-d55c-c591","name":"한양 수씨","crest":"clan-crests/c218-d55c-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":25,"무력":-40,"물질":-10,"공동":30,"원칙":50,"공개":10,"자격":15,"분산":25,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-10,"위험":-40,"과시":10,"지속":0,"지향":"양성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"약재 보관 출력 일지·봉인","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"수련의","직함":"약재 건조·냉장 비상발전 운전장","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 25 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −10 | 공동 30 | 원칙 50 | 공개 10 | 자격 15 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −40 | 과시 10 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2090-03-18에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 약재 건조·냉장 비상발전 운전장 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 약재 보관 출력 일지·봉인 창구가 수효은의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 보관 수련의. 매 교대 연료 잔량과 출력 일지를 봉인해 천다움에게 보내고, 최저 출력 이하면 다른 당직선 독촉이 있어도 경매 배전을 끊는다.","일화":"선매 장부가 사라진 주 정전이 겹치자 수효은은 비상 발전을 건조실과 진료소에 잠그고 경매 조명을 껐다.","관계":"천다움의 건조기에 출력을 맞추고, 방미산의 진료소 전력을 같은 일지에 남긴다. 류은비의 치료 물자 우선에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.","야망":"건조실과 진료소 전력을 하나의 공개 배전망으로 묶어 의약 품질의 주권을 지킨다.","공포":"연료가 바닥난 밤에 생약이 썩고, 그 공백을 암사 보호창고가 메우는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"대체 연료를 구해 이중 배전을 열거나, 출력 일지 조작을 밝혀 운전장을 교체할 수 있다."},"biography":"연료 냄새에 예민하고 구두 배전을 싫어한다. 건조기보다 경매 조명에 전력을 돌리라는 압박을 모욕으로 여긴다.\n\n- 생업: 약재 보관 출력 일지·봉인\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 수련의\n- 직함: 약재 건조·냉장 비상발전 운전장\n**생애.** 2090-03-18에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 약재 건조·냉장 비상발전 운전장 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 약재 보관 출력 일지·봉인 창구가 수효은의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 보관 수련의. 매 교대 연료 잔량과 출력 일지를 봉인해 천다움에게 보내고, 최저 출력 이하면 다른 당직선 독촉이 있어도 경매 배전을 끊는다.\n\n**일화.** 선매 장부가 사라진 주 정전이 겹치자 수효은은 비상 발전을 건조실과 진료소에 잠그고 경매 조명을 껐다.\n\n**관계.** 천다움의 건조기에 출력을 맞추고, 방미산의 진료소 전력을 같은 일지에 남긴다. 류은비의 치료 물자 우선에는 복종해 왔지만 은폐 배전은 거부해 왔다.\n\n**야망.** 건조실과 진료소 전력을 하나의 공개 배전망으로 묶어 의약 품질의 주권을 지킨다.\n\n**공포.** 연료가 바닥난 밤에 생약이 썩고, 그 공백을 암사 보호창고가 메우는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 대체 연료를 구해 이중 배전을 열거나, 출력 일지 조작을 밝혀 운전장을 교체할 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 25 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −10 | 공동 30 | 원칙 50 | 공개 10 | 자격 15 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −10 | 위험 −40 | 과시 10 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"수효은","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"류은비의 치료 물자 우선에는 복종하되 은폐 배전은 거부한다"},{"from":"수효은","type":"계약","to":"천다움","basis":"천다움의 건조기에 출력을 맞추고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"문동은","type":"계약","to":"수효은","basis":"문동은은 수술 때 쓴 약재와 정전 뒤의 보관 상태를 수효은에게 알린다. 수효은은 연료 잔량과 출력 일지를 확인해 건조실·진료소 공급을 살피고, 문동은은 손상된 약재가 다음 진료에 섞이지 않도록 관리 기록에 남긴다."},{"from":"조아원","type":"계약","to":"수효은","basis":"조아원은 관리하는 약재의 상태와 진료 중 필요한 양을 수효은에게 알린다. 수효은은 건조실·진료소 출력 일지를 확인해 보관 전력 공백이 약재 손상으로 이어진 곳을 찾는다."},{"from":"천다움","type":"신도","to":"수효은","basis":"수효은의 비상 발전에 건조 전력을 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0341', 'b9e4-cda9-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0341","name":"Mae Haru","title":"Medicinal Herb Contamination Victims'' Representative","position":"Medicinal Herb Contamination Victims'' Representative","characterId":"K340","rank":"Resident","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Medicinal Herb Contamination Dosage and Fever Record","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-maeharu","detailRoute":"/people/person-0341","birthDate":"2082-03-21","birthday":"03-21","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"affected-patient-documentation","name":"Affected patient documentation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Brings affected people to the scales","description":"They organized affected people to stop advance-purchase weighing and post dose histories and fever curves. Anger and care are present; treatment outcomes are not recorded.","behavior":"She remembered even the grains of a bitter powder and let no box with a clean package clause alone into the care cars. Mercy and anger breathed in the same rhythm.","stress":"Fear. That the representative''s stamp would become the procession of a protection-warehouse subcontract.","relationship":"Relations. Matched names with Chang Da-huin''s transfer victim list and watched the seal cord of Bang Misan''s clinic together. Made Ryu Eunbi''s care principles the frame of the harm ledger.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: member. Title: herb contamination victims'' representative. He pasted dosage records and fever curves at the foot of the sickbeds and opened no box with a blank origin without Ryu Eunbi''s stamp.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: member. Title: herb contamination victims'' representative. He pasted dosage records and fever curves at the foot of the sickbeds and opened no box with a blank origin without Ryu Eunbi''s stamp.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the representative''s stamp would become the procession of a protection-warehouse subcontract.","relationship":"Relations. Matched names with Chang Da-huin''s transfer victim list and watched the seal cord of Bang Misan''s clinic together. Made Ryu Eunbi''s care principles the frame of the harm ledger.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"They organized affected people to stop advance-purchase weighing and post dose histories and fever curves. Anger and care are present; treatment outcomes are not recorded.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b9e4-cda9-c8fc","name":"Chungju Mae Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b9e4-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-35,"Openness":35,"Force":-55,"Material":-15,"Communal":25,"Principle":45,"Public":20,"Eligibility":25,"Dispersed":35,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":25,"Risk":-25,"Display":25,"Sustained":10,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medicinal Herb Contamination Dosage and Fever Record","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Resident","Title":"Medicinal Herb Contamination Victims'' Representative","Values":"Authority −35 | Openness 35 | Force −55 | Materialism −15 | Communal 25 | Principle 45 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 5 | Monopoly 25 | Risk −25 | Display 25 | Endurance 10 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2082-03-21. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Representative of Herb-Contamination Victims, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opens with a fake-medicine seal.\n- The herb-contamination dosage and fever record desk in Jegidong is Mae Haru''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, fief, or tenure rights.","Offices":"Rank: Medical Trainee. Title: Herb-Contamination Treatment Trainee. Posts dosage records and fever curves at the foot of each bed, and does not open any crate with a blank origin without Ryu Eunbi''s seal.","Anecdote":"When the summer''s muddy water and fake medicine flowed toward Bukhansan Bogungmun, Mae Haru lined up the victims in front of Yakjae-dong and had the Advance-Purchase Scale halted.","Relationships":"Matches names against Chang Dahin''s list of transferred victims, and examines Bang Misan''s clinic seal cord together with her. Takes Ryu Eunbi''s treatment principles as the backbone of the victim ledger.","Ambition":"Intends to bind the list of contaminated-medicine victims into a public ledger of the Medical Command so that exclusive purchasing by Seoul''s Inner Patron Faction cannot cover up the quality incident.","Fear":"Fears that the clinic seal will become a mere decoration for the Protective Warehouse subcontract.","Intervention":"Can hand the victim ledger over to the Magok Inspection Network, or bribe an official to lift the blockade."},"biography":"Remembers even the particles of the bitter powder, and admits no crate into the treatment ward whose only clean part is its packaging statement. Mercy and anger coexist.\n\n- Livelihood: Herb-contamination dosage and fever records\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: Medical Trainee\n- Title: Representative of Herb-Contamination Victims\n**Life.** Born 2082-03-21. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Representative of Herb-Contamination Victims, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opens with a fake-medicine seal.\n- The herb-contamination dosage and fever record desk in Jegidong is Mae Haru''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, fief, or tenure rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Medical Trainee. Title: Herb-Contamination Treatment Trainee. Posts dosage records and fever curves at the foot of each bed, and does not open any crate with a blank origin without Ryu Eunbi''s seal.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the summer''s muddy water and fake medicine flowed toward Bukhansan Bogungmun, Mae Haru lined up the victims in front of Yakjae-dong and had the Advance-Purchase Scale halted.\n\n**Relationships.** Matches names against Chang Dahin''s list of transferred victims, and examines Bang Misan''s clinic seal cord together with her. Takes Ryu Eunbi''s treatment principles as the backbone of the victim ledger.\n\n**Ambition.** Intends to bind the list of contaminated-medicine victims into a public ledger of the Medical Command so that exclusive purchasing by Seoul''s Inner Patron Faction cannot cover up the quality incident.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that the clinic seal will become a mere decoration for the Protective Warehouse subcontract.\n\n**Intervention.** Can hand the victim ledger over to the Magok Inspection Network, or bribe an official to lift the blockade.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −35 | Openness 35 | Force −55 | Materialism −15 | Communal 25 | Principle 45 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 25 | Decentralization 35 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Monopoly 25 | Risk −25 | Display 25 | Endurance 10 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding Polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Mae Haru","type":"Contract","to":"Bang Misan","basis":"Reviews Bang Misan''s clinic sealing cord together"},{"from":"Mae Haru","type":"Contract","to":"Chang Dahin","basis":"Match names against Chang Dahuin''s transfer victim list, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Chang Dahin","type":"Contract","to":"Mae Haru","basis":"Match names against Mae Haru''s Jegi-dong victim ledger"},{"from":"Mae Riul","type":"Contract","to":"Mae Haru","basis":"Hopes that Mae Haru''s list of contaminated-medicine victims will not get mixed in with the Garak crates."}]}}', '{"id":"person-0341","name":"매하루","title":"약재 오염 피해자 대표","position":"약재 오염 피해자 대표","characterId":"K340","rank":"수련의","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"약재 오염 복용·열 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-매하루","detailRoute":"/people/person-0341","birthDate":"2082-03-21","birthday":"03-21","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"affected-patient-documentation","name":"피해 환자 기록","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"피해자를 저울 앞에 세운다","description":"피해자 줄을 세워 선매 저울을 멈추게 하고 복용 기록과 열 곡선을 붙인다. 분노와 돌봄은 있지만 치료 결과는 적혀 있지 않다.","behavior":"쓴 가루의 입자까지 기억하고, 포장 문장만 깨끗한 상자를 치료 칸에 들이지 않는다. 자비와 분노가 함께 있다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 담당 전문의의 도제로 배우며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 진료 인장이 보호창고 하청 계약의 들러리가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 창다흰의 이송 피해자 명단과 이름을 맞추고, 방미산의 진료소 봉인 끈을 함께 본다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 피해 원장의 뼈대로 삼는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 오염 진료 수련의. 복용 기록과 열 곡선을 침상 발치에 붙이고, 원산지가 빈 상자는 류은비의 날인 없이 열지 않는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 오염 진료 수련의. 복용 기록과 열 곡선을 침상 발치에 붙이고, 원산지가 빈 상자는 류은비의 날인 없이 열지 않는다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 진료 인장이 보호창고 하청 계약의 들러리가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 창다흰의 이송 피해자 명단과 이름을 맞추고, 방미산의 진료소 봉인 끈을 함께 본다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 피해 원장의 뼈대로 삼는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"피해자 줄을 세워 선매 저울을 멈추게 하고 복용 기록과 열 곡선을 붙인다. 분노와 돌봄은 있지만 치료 결과는 적혀 있지 않다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b9e4-cda9-c8fc","name":"충주 매씨","crest":"clan-crests/b9e4-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-35,"개방":35,"무력":-55,"물질":-15,"공동":25,"원칙":45,"공개":20,"자격":25,"분산":35,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":25,"위험":-25,"과시":25,"지속":10,"지향":"이성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"약재 오염 복용·열 기록","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"수련의","직함":"약재 오염 피해자 대표","가치관":"권위 −35 | 개방 35 | 무력 −55 | 물질 −15 | 공동 25 | 원칙 45 | 공개 20 | 자격 25 | 분산 35 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 25 | 위험 −25 | 과시 25 | 지속 10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2082-03-21에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 약재 오염 피해자 대표 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 약재 오염 복용·열 기록 창구가 매하루의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 오염 진료 수련의. 복용 기록과 열 곡선을 침상 발치에 붙이고, 원산지가 빈 상자는 류은비의 날인 없이 열지 않는다.","일화":"여름의 탁수와 가짜 약이 북한산보국문으로 흘러가자 매하루는 약재동 앞에서 피해자 줄을 세우고 선매 저울을 멈추게 했다.","관계":"창다흰의 이송 피해자 명단과 이름을 맞추고, 방미산의 진료소 봉인 끈을 함께 본다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 피해 원장의 뼈대로 삼는다.","야망":"오염 약 피해 명단을 의료 지휘부 공개 원장으로 묶어 서울 내부 후원 세력 독점 구매가 품질 사고를 덮지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"진료 인장이 보호창고 하청 계약의 들러리가 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"피해 원장을 마곡 검사망에 넘기거나, 담당자를 매수해 봉쇄를 풀 수 있다."},"biography":"쓴 가루의 입자까지 기억하고, 포장 문장만 깨끗한 상자를 치료 칸에 들이지 않는다. 자비와 분노가 함께 있다.\n\n- 생업: 약재 오염 복용·열 기록\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 수련의\n- 직함: 약재 오염 피해자 대표\n**생애.** 2082-03-21에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 약재 오염 피해자 대표 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 약재 오염 복용·열 기록 창구가 매하루의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 오염 진료 수련의. 복용 기록과 열 곡선을 침상 발치에 붙이고, 원산지가 빈 상자는 류은비의 날인 없이 열지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 여름의 탁수와 가짜 약이 북한산보국문으로 흘러가자 매하루는 약재동 앞에서 피해자 줄을 세우고 선매 저울을 멈추게 했다.\n\n**관계.** 창다흰의 이송 피해자 명단과 이름을 맞추고, 방미산의 진료소 봉인 끈을 함께 본다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 피해 원장의 뼈대로 삼는다.\n\n**야망.** 오염 약 피해 명단을 의료 지휘부 공개 원장으로 묶어 서울 내부 후원 세력 독점 구매가 품질 사고를 덮지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 진료 인장이 보호창고 하청 계약의 들러리가 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 피해 원장을 마곡 검사망에 넘기거나, 담당자를 매수해 봉쇄를 풀 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −35 | 개방 35 | 무력 −55 | 물질 −15 | 공동 25 | 원칙 45 | 공개 20 | 자격 25 | 분산 35 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 25 | 위험 −25 | 과시 25 | 지속 10 | 지향 이성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"매하루","type":"계약","to":"방미산","basis":"방미산의 진료소 봉인 끈을 함께 본다"},{"from":"매하루","type":"계약","to":"창다흰","basis":"창다흰의 이송 피해자 명단과 이름을 맞추고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"창다흰","type":"계약","to":"매하루","basis":"매하루의 제기동 피해 원장과 이름을 맞춘다"},{"from":"매리울","type":"계약","to":"매하루","basis":"매하루의 오염 약 명단이 가락 상자에 섞이지 않기를 바란다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0342', 'd0c1-ad11-c0b0', '{"id":"person-0342","name":"Tak Eunsol","title":"Fake Medicine Distribution Witness","position":"Fake Medicine Distribution Witness","characterId":"K341","rank":"Resident","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Counterfeit Medicine Distribution Time and Witness Record","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#inmul-tak-eunsol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0342","birthDate":"2090-08-29","birthday":"08-29","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"distribution-testimony-recording","name":"Distribution testimony recording","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Waits for two witnesses","description":"They notice capsule misalignment, pair time with weight, and close the stamp without enough witnesses. A sighting is not expanded into a completed investigation.","behavior":"He read the misalignment of capsule seams at a glance and sent down from the witness stand any broker who proposed changing the origin verbally. He trusted numbers but not blank clauses.","stress":"Fear. That his testimony would be clipped into one broadcast and leave only a pretext for the market blockade.","relationship":"Relations. Overlaid testimony with Dong Juha''s scales seal and made Jeong Hojun''s public water and herb inspections the standard of the witness stand. Allowed Choi Jiwoo''s exposure only after the testimony.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: member. Title: counterfeit drug circulation witness. He wrote circulation hours and box weights in the same book and covered the stamp with fewer than two independent witnesses.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: member. Title: counterfeit drug circulation witness. He wrote circulation hours and box weights in the same book and covered the stamp with fewer than two independent witnesses.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That his testimony would be clipped into one broadcast and leave only a pretext for the market blockade.","relationship":"Relations. Overlaid testimony with Dong Juha''s scales seal and made Jeong Hojun''s public water and herb inspections the standard of the witness stand. Allowed Choi Jiwoo''s exposure only after the testimony.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"They notice capsule misalignment, pair time with weight, and close the stamp without enough witnesses. A sighting is not expanded into a completed investigation.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d0c1-ad11-c0b0","name":"Tak Clan of Gwangsan","crest":"clan-crests/d0c1-ad11-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":35,"Force":-50,"Material":-20,"Communal":30,"Principle":30,"Public":20,"Eligibility":20,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":40,"Risk":5,"Display":25,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Counterfeit Medicine Distribution Time and Witness Record","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Resident","Title":"Fake Medicine Distribution Witness","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 35 | Force −50 | Materialism −20 | Communal 30 | Principle 30 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 40 | Monopoly 40 | Risk 5 | Display 25 | Endurance 0 | Orientation None | Bonding Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2090-08-29. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Fake-Medicine Distribution Witness, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opens with a fake-medicine seal.\n- The counterfeit-medicine distribution time and witness record desk in Jegidong is Tak Eunsol''s work reference point. This work reference point does not confirm residence, exact facility boundaries, rank, fief, or tenure rights.","Offices":"Rank: Medical Trainee. Title: Counterfeit-Medicine Identification Trainee. Records the distribution time and crate weight in the same book, and covers the stamp if there are fewer than two independent witnesses.","Anecdote":"During the week when the summer''s muddy water and fake medicine spread, Tak Eunsol saw, in the back room behind the auction hall, a capsule identical to the Protective Warehouse seal.","Relationships":"Overlaps their testimony with Dong Juha''s scale seal, and sets Jeong Hojun''s public water-quality and herb tests as the standard of the witness stand. Permits Choe Jiu''s exposé timing only after the testimony.","Ambition":"Intends to fix the fake-medicine distribution route through public testimony so that the fact that the manufacturing statement matches Seoul''s internal Protective Warehouse cannot be erased.","Fear":"Fears that their testimony will be cut down to a single broadcast, leaving only a pretext for a market blockade.","Intervention":"Can escort a second witness, or broadcast the testimony first and open a blockade riot."},"biography":"Reads the misalignment of a capsule seam at a glance and sends down from the witness stand any broker who proposes changing the origin by word of mouth. Trusts numbers, but not sentences with blanks.\n\n- Occupation: Counterfeit-drug distribution time and witness records\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: Resident\n- Title: Counterfeit Drug Distribution Witness\n**Life.** Born on 2090-08-29. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Counterfeit Drug Distribution Witness, continuing the existing duty shifts and records. The succession record for that post opened with the counterfeit-drug seal.\n- The counterfeit-drug distribution time and witness record desk in Jegi-dong is Tak Eunsol''s work reference point. This work reference point does not establish residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or right of occupancy.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Resident. Title: Counterfeit Drug Appraisal Resident. Writes the distribution time and the crate weight in the same book, and withholds the seal if there are fewer than two independent witnesses.\n\n**Anecdote.** During the summer of muddy water and the week the counterfeit drugs spread, Tak Eunsol saw a capsule identical to the protected-warehouse seal in the back room of the auction house.\n\n**Relations.** Overlaps testimony with Dong Juha''s scale seal, and takes Jeong Hojun''s public water-quality and medicinal-herb inspection as the standard for the witness stand. Allows Choe Jiu''s timing of exposure only after the testimony.\n\n**Ambition.** Wants to fix the counterfeit-drug distribution route through public testimony so that the fact that the manufacturing seal is identical to the protected warehouse inside Seoul cannot be erased.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that their testimony will be cut down to a single broadcast, leaving only a pretext for a market blockade.\n\n**Intervention.** Can escort a second witness, or broadcast the testimony first and open a blockade riot.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 35 | Force −50 | Material −20 | Communal 30 | Principle 30 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 20 | Decentralization 20 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Monopoly 40 | Risk 5 | Display 25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation None | Bonding Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Tak Eunsol","type":"Oath","to":"Dong Juha","basis":"overlapping Dong Juha''s scale seal with the testimony, and"},{"from":"Tak Eunsol","type":"Oath","to":"Jeong Hojun","basis":"Setting Jeong Hojun''s public inspection of water quality and medicinal herbs as the standard for the witness stand"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0342","name":"탁은솔","title":"가짜 약 유통 증인","position":"가짜 약 유통 증인","characterId":"K341","rank":"수련의","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"위조약 유통 시각·증인 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-탁은솔","detailRoute":"/people/person-0342","birthDate":"2090-08-29","birthday":"08-29","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"distribution-testimony-recording","name":"유통 증언 기록","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"두 증인을 기다린다","description":"캡슐 어긋남을 읽고 시각과 무게를 함께 적으며 증인이 부족하면 날인을 덮는다. 보았다는 진술을 완결된 수사로 확대하지 않는다.","behavior":"캡슐 이음매의 어긋남을 한눈에 읽고, 구두로 원산지를 바꾸자는 중개인을 증인석에서 내려보낸다. 숫자는 믿되 빈칸 문장은 믿지 않는다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 담당 전문의의 도제로 배우며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 자신의 증언이 한 장의 방송으로 잘려 시장 봉쇄의 구실만 남는 것.","relationship":"관계. 동주하의 저울 봉인과 증언을 겹치고, 정호준의 수질·약재 공개 검사를 증인석의 기준으로 둔다. 최지우의 폭로 시점을 증언 뒤에만 허용한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 위조약 감별 수련의. 유통 시각과 상자 무게를 같은 책에 적고, 독립 증인이 둘 미만이면 도장을 덮는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 위조약 감별 수련의. 유통 시각과 상자 무게를 같은 책에 적고, 독립 증인이 둘 미만이면 도장을 덮는다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 자신의 증언이 한 장의 방송으로 잘려 시장 봉쇄의 구실만 남는 것.","relationship":"관계. 동주하의 저울 봉인과 증언을 겹치고, 정호준의 수질·약재 공개 검사를 증인석의 기준으로 둔다. 최지우의 폭로 시점을 증언 뒤에만 허용한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"캡슐 어긋남을 읽고 시각과 무게를 함께 적으며 증인이 부족하면 날인을 덮는다. 보았다는 진술을 완결된 수사로 확대하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d0c1-ad11-c0b0","name":"광산 탁씨","crest":"clan-crests/d0c1-ad11-c0b0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":35,"무력":-50,"물질":-20,"공동":30,"원칙":30,"공개":20,"자격":20,"분산":20,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":40,"위험":5,"과시":25,"지속":0,"지향":"무성향","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"위조약 유통 시각·증인 기록","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"수련의","직함":"가짜 약 유통 증인","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 35 | 무력 −50 | 물질 −20 | 공동 30 | 원칙 30 | 공개 20 | 자격 20 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 40 | 위험 5 | 과시 25 | 지속 0 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2090-08-29에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 가짜 약 유통 증인 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 위조약 유통 시각·증인 기록 창구가 탁은솔의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수련의. 직함은 위조약 감별 수련의. 유통 시각과 상자 무게를 같은 책에 적고, 독립 증인이 둘 미만이면 도장을 덮는다.","일화":"여름의 탁수와 가짜 약이 퍼진 주간에 탁은솔은 보호창고 인장과 같은 캡슐을 경매장 뒤칸에서 보았다.","관계":"동주하의 저울 봉인과 증언을 겹치고, 정호준의 수질·약재 공개 검사를 증인석의 기준으로 둔다. 최지우의 폭로 시점을 증언 뒤에만 허용한다.","야망":"가짜 약 유통 경로를 공개 증언으로 고정해 제조 문장이 서울 내부 보호창고와 같다는 사실을 지우지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"자신의 증언이 한 장의 방송으로 잘려 시장 봉쇄의 구실만 남는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"두 번째 증인을 호송하거나, 증언을 먼저 방송해 봉쇄 폭동을 열 수 있다."},"biography":"캡슐 이음매의 어긋남을 한눈에 읽고, 구두로 원산지를 바꾸자는 중개인을 증인석에서 내려보낸다. 숫자는 믿되 빈칸 문장은 믿지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 위조약 유통 시각·증인 기록\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 수련의\n- 직함: 가짜 약 유통 증인\n**생애.** 2090-08-29에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 가짜 약 유통 증인 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 위조약 유통 시각·증인 기록 창구가 탁은솔의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수련의. 직함은 위조약 감별 수련의. 유통 시각과 상자 무게를 같은 책에 적고, 독립 증인이 둘 미만이면 도장을 덮는다.\n\n**일화.** 여름의 탁수와 가짜 약이 퍼진 주간에 탁은솔은 보호창고 인장과 같은 캡슐을 경매장 뒤칸에서 보았다.\n\n**관계.** 동주하의 저울 봉인과 증언을 겹치고, 정호준의 수질·약재 공개 검사를 증인석의 기준으로 둔다. 최지우의 폭로 시점을 증언 뒤에만 허용한다.\n\n**야망.** 가짜 약 유통 경로를 공개 증언으로 고정해 제조 문장이 서울 내부 보호창고와 같다는 사실을 지우지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 자신의 증언이 한 장의 방송으로 잘려 시장 봉쇄의 구실만 남는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 두 번째 증인을 호송하거나, 증언을 먼저 방송해 봉쇄 폭동을 열 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 35 | 무력 −50 | 물질 −20 | 공동 30 | 원칙 30 | 공개 20 | 자격 20 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 40 | 위험 5 | 과시 25 | 지속 0 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"탁은솔","type":"맹세","to":"동주하","basis":"동주하의 저울 봉인과 증언을 겹치고"},{"from":"탁은솔","type":"맹세","to":"정호준","basis":"정호준의 수질·약재 공개 검사를 증인석의 기준으로 둔다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0343', 'bc94-ae08-c131', '{"id":"person-0343","name":"Beom Choi","title":"Medical Escort Accident Party","position":"Medical Escort Accident Party","characterId":"K342","rank":"Resident","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Medical escort pass patient and medicine weight records","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#person-beom-choi","detailRoute":"/people/person-0343","birthDate":"2076-05-04","birthday":"05-04","age":50,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"medical-transport-handover","name":"Medical transport handover","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Keeps the patient carriage key","description":"When transport was mistaken for hostile movement, they stopped while keeping the key. Field handover and endurance under pressure do not imply a combat victory.","behavior":"He remembered the tremor of a stop on the bridge with his body and burned any note that told him to call the care cars munitions cars. Taciturn, he locked the door whenever the convoy pass came up light.","stress":"Fear. That the patient cars would be stamped hostile movement and the whole convoy squad would be disarmed.","relationship":"Relations. He rode the car under Nam Hoseong''s convoy orders and matched the hours with Mae Seodam''s gate testimony. When Go Seojun''s bridge permit ran late, he halted the statement.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: member. Title: medical convoy accident party. He wrote only patient counts and herb weights on the convoy pass and wrote the destination''s state name only on the release chalkboard.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: member. Title: medical convoy accident party. He wrote only patient counts and herb weights on the convoy pass and wrote the destination''s state name only on the release chalkboard.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the patient cars would be stamped hostile movement and the whole convoy squad would be disarmed.","relationship":"Relations. He rode the car under Nam Hoseong''s convoy orders and matched the hours with Mae Seodam''s gate testimony. When Go Seojun''s bridge permit ran late, he halted the statement.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"When transport was mistaken for hostile movement, they stopped while keeping the key. Field handover and endurance under pressure do not imply a combat victory.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc94-ae08-c131","name":"Geumseong Beom Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc94-ae08-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-25,"Openness":30,"Force":-70,"Material":-30,"Communal":25,"Principle":50,"Public":15,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":35,"Display":-15,"Sustained":-20,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical escort pass patient and medicine weight records","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Resident","Title":"Medical Escort Accident Party","Values":"Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −70 | Material −30 | Communal 25 | Principle 50 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 10 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 35 | Display −15 | Persistence −20 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2076-05-04. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Medical Escort Incident Party, continuing the existing duty shifts and records. The succession record for that post opened with the counterfeit-drug seal.\n- The medical escort pass patient and medicine weight record desk in Cheongnyangni-dong is Beom Choi''s work reference point. This work reference point does not establish residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or right of occupancy.","Offices":"Rank: Resident. Title: Medical Escort Resident. Writes only the patient count and medicine weight on the escort pass, and writes the destination''s state name on the blackboard only just before dispatch.","Anecdote":"During the winter''s Black Timetable investigation, when the medical escort was mistaken for a hostile movement on the Achasan bridge, Beom Choi stopped with the treatment car key held to the chest.","Relationships":"Boarded the car under Nam Hoseong''s escort order, and aligns times with Mae Seodam''s gate testimony. Stopped giving their statement when Go Seojun''s bridge-crossing permit came late.","Ambition":"Wants to preserve the party''s statement about the escort blocked at the Guui bridge as working practice of the Joint Escort clause, so that mistaken fire does not happen again.","Fear":"Fears that the patient car will be marked as a hostile movement and the entire escort convoy disarmed.","Intervention":"Can correct the mistaken signal through the party''s statement, or divert the escort and deepen the split in the gate state."},"biography":"Remembers in the body the sway of the stop on the bridge, and burns the note telling them to call the treatment car a supply car. Taciturn, but locks the door if the escort pass weight is short.\n\n- Occupation: Recording patient and medicine weights on medical escort passes\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: Resident\n- Title: Medical Escort Incident Party\n**Life.** Born on 2076-05-04. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Medical Escort Incident Party, continuing the existing duty shifts and records. The succession record for that post opened with the counterfeit-drug seal.\n- The medical escort pass patient and medicine weight record desk in Cheongnyangni-dong is Beom Choi''s work reference point. This work reference point does not establish residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or right of occupancy.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Resident. Title: Medical Escort Resident. Writes only the patient count and medicine weight on the escort pass, and writes the destination''s state name on the blackboard only just before dispatch.\n\n**Anecdote.** During the winter''s Black Timetable investigation, when the medical escort was mistaken for a hostile movement on the Achasan bridge, Beom Choi stopped with the treatment car key held to the chest.\n\n**Relations.** Boarded the car under Nam Hoseong''s escort order, and aligns times with Mae Seodam''s gate testimony. Stopped giving their statement when Go Seojun''s bridge-crossing permit came late.\n\n**Ambition.** Wants to preserve the party''s statement about the escort blocked at the Guui bridge as working practice of the Joint Escort clause, so that mistaken fire does not happen again.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that the patient car will be marked as a hostile movement and the entire escort convoy disarmed.\n\n**Intervention.** Can correct the mistaken signal through the party''s statement, or divert the escort and deepen the split in the gate state.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −25 | Openness 30 | Force −70 | Material −30 | Communal 25 | Principle 50 | Publicity 15 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly 10 | Risk 35 | Display −15 | Persistence −20 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Beom Choi","type":"Command","to":"Nam Hoseong","basis":"Boarded the car under Nam Hoseong''s convoy order and"},{"from":"Beom Choi","type":"Contract","to":"Mae Seo-dam","basis":"Aligns times with Mae Seodam''s gate testimony"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Mae Seo-dam","type":"Oath","to":"Beom Choi","basis":"Aligns times with Beom Choi''s statement on the escort incident"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0343","name":"범초이","title":"의무호송 사고 당사자","position":"의무호송 사고 당사자","characterId":"K342","rank":"수련의","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-범초이","detailRoute":"/people/person-0343","birthDate":"2076-05-04","birthday":"05-04","age":50,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"medical-transport-handover","name":"의무호송 인계","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"환자 칸 열쇠를 지킨다","description":"적대 이동으로 오인된 호송에서 열쇠를 품고 정차했다. 현장 인계와 긴장 감내를 반영하되 교전 승리를 만들지 않는다.","behavior":"교량 위 정차의 흔들림을 몸으로 기억하고, 치료 칸을 군수 칸으로 부르라는 쪽지를 태운다. 과묵하나 호송증 무게가 비면 문을 잠근다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 담당 전문의의 도제로 배우며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 환자 칸이 적대 이동으로 찍혀 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","relationship":"관계. 남호성의 호송 명령 아래 칸에 탔고, 매서담의 관문 증언과 시각을 맞춘다. 고서준의 교량 통과 허가가 늦자 진술을 멈췄다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 의무호송 수련의. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적고, 목적지 국호는 출고 직전 칠판에만 쓴다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 의무호송 수련의. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적고, 목적지 국호는 출고 직전 칠판에만 쓴다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 환자 칸이 적대 이동으로 찍혀 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 것.","relationship":"관계. 남호성의 호송 명령 아래 칸에 탔고, 매서담의 관문 증언과 시각을 맞춘다. 고서준의 교량 통과 허가가 늦자 진술을 멈췄다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"적대 이동으로 오인된 호송에서 열쇠를 품고 정차했다. 현장 인계와 긴장 감내를 반영하되 교전 승리를 만들지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc94-ae08-c131","name":"금성 범씨","crest":"clan-crests/bc94-ae08-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-25,"개방":30,"무력":-70,"물질":-30,"공동":25,"원칙":50,"공개":15,"자격":10,"분산":15,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":10,"위험":35,"과시":-15,"지속":-20,"지향":"유동","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"수련의","직함":"의무호송 사고 당사자","가치관":"권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −70 | 물질 −30 | 공동 25 | 원칙 50 | 공개 15 | 자격 10 | 분산 15 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 10 | 위험 35 | 과시 −15 | 지속 −20 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2076-05-04에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의무호송 사고 당사자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록 창구가 범초이의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수련의. 직함은 의무호송 수련의. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적고, 목적지 국호는 출고 직전 칠판에만 쓴다.","일화":"겨울의 검은 배차표 조사 중 의무호송이 아차산 교량에서 적대 이동으로 오인되자 범초이는 치료 칸 열쇠를 품고 정차했다.","관계":"남호성의 호송 명령 아래 칸에 탔고, 매서담의 관문 증언과 시각을 맞춘다. 고서준의 교량 통과 허가가 늦자 진술을 멈췄다.","야망":"구의 교량에서 막힌 호송의 당사자 진술을 공동호송 조항의 실무로 남겨 오인 발포가 다시 나지 않게 하려 한다.","공포":"환자 칸이 적대 이동으로 찍혀 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"당사자 진술로 오인 신호를 바로잡거나, 호송을 우회시켜 관문국의 분열을 키울 수 있다."},"biography":"교량 위 정차의 흔들림을 몸으로 기억하고, 치료 칸을 군수 칸으로 부르라는 쪽지를 태운다. 과묵하나 호송증 무게가 비면 문을 잠근다.\n\n- 생업: 의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 수련의\n- 직함: 의무호송 사고 당사자\n**생애.** 2076-05-04에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의무호송 사고 당사자 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 청량리동의 의무호송증 환자·약재 중량 기록 창구가 범초이의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수련의. 직함은 의무호송 수련의. 호송증에 환자 수와 약재 무게만 적고, 목적지 국호는 출고 직전 칠판에만 쓴다.\n\n**일화.** 겨울의 검은 배차표 조사 중 의무호송이 아차산 교량에서 적대 이동으로 오인되자 범초이는 치료 칸 열쇠를 품고 정차했다.\n\n**관계.** 남호성의 호송 명령 아래 칸에 탔고, 매서담의 관문 증언과 시각을 맞춘다. 고서준의 교량 통과 허가가 늦자 진술을 멈췄다.\n\n**야망.** 구의 교량에서 막힌 호송의 당사자 진술을 공동호송 조항의 실무로 남겨 오인 발포가 다시 나지 않게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 환자 칸이 적대 이동으로 찍혀 호송대 전체가 무장 해제를 당하는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 당사자 진술로 오인 신호를 바로잡거나, 호송을 우회시켜 관문국의 분열을 키울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −25 | 개방 30 | 무력 −70 | 물질 −30 | 공동 25 | 원칙 50 | 공개 15 | 자격 10 | 분산 15 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 10 | 위험 35 | 과시 −15 | 지속 −20 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"범초이","type":"지휘","to":"남호성","basis":"남호성의 호송 명령 아래 칸에 탔고"},{"from":"범초이","type":"계약","to":"매서담","basis":"매서담의 관문 증언과 시각을 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"매서담","type":"맹세","to":"범초이","basis":"범초이의 호송 사고 진술과 시각을 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0344', 'cc3d-cc3d-b155-660c', '{"id":"person-0344","name":"Chang Haeon","title":"Medical Charter Agreement Signing Clerk","position":"Medical Charter Agreement Signing Clerk","characterId":"K343","rank":"Resident","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Medical Charter Signature and Seal Verification","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#person-chang-haeon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0344","birthDate":"2090-08-27","birthday":"08-27","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"charter-clause-comparison","name":"Charter clause comparison","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Text that will not become a military code","description":"They identified an inserted treatment priority phrase by comparing charter wording and transport clause numbers. Document comparison and preservation of neutral wording are supported.","behavior":"He drafted first the clause that did not separate friend from foe, and stood at the door any envoy who told him to turn the priority care clause into a military seal. Short of breath or not, he carried two copies.","stress":"Fear. That a forged care-priority clause would mix into the fair copy and he would become the hand of a charter violation.","relationship":"Relations. Drafted Ryu Eunbi''s medical charter wording and matched numbers with Cho Naru''s convoy articles. Backed only Jeong Yura''s joint negotiation forms.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: member. Title: medical charter treaty signing clerk. He wrote the signing hour and the guild stamps on one line and locked the box with fewer than three seals.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: member. Title: medical charter treaty signing clerk. He wrote the signing hour and the guild stamps on one line and locked the box with fewer than three seals.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That a forged care-priority clause would mix into the fair copy and he would become the hand of a charter violation.","relationship":"Relations. Drafted Ryu Eunbi''s medical charter wording and matched numbers with Cho Naru''s convoy articles. Backed only Jeong Yura''s joint negotiation forms.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"They identified an inserted treatment priority phrase by comparing charter wording and transport clause numbers. Document comparison and preservation of neutral wording are supported.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc3d-cc3d-b155-660c","name":"Changnyeong Chang Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cc3d-cc3d-b155-660c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-15,"Openness":30,"Force":-60,"Material":-20,"Communal":25,"Principle":35,"Public":20,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":20,"Monopoly":15,"Risk":10,"Display":-20,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medical Charter Signature and Seal Verification","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Resident","Title":"Medical Charter Agreement Signing Clerk","Values":"Authority −15 | Openness 30 | Force −60 | Material −20 | Communal 25 | Principle 35 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 20 | Monopoly 15 | Risk 10 | Display −20 | Persistence 5 | Orientation Opposite-sex | Bonding None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2090-08-27. As of the 2126 opening, takes up the post of Medical Charter Accord Signature Clerk, continuing the existing duty roster and records. The succession record for that post opened with a counterfeit medicine seal.\n- The Medical Charter signature-and-seal verification desk in Jegidong is Changhaeon''s work reference point. This work reference point does not fix residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or occupancy rights.","Offices":"Rank: Resident. Title: Medical Charter Clerk-Resident. Writes the signing time and the Order Chief''s seal on the same line, and locks the case if the seals of the attending specialist and the Order Chief are missing.","Anecdote":"First, an envoy comes to the White Cross Order''s clerk''s office carrying the fair copy of the Medical Charter, asking that the priority-treatment clause be turned into a watchword. Changhaeon keeps the envoy standing at the door and, matching Ryu Eunbi''s charter draft against the clause numbers of Cho Naru''s escort provisions, sorts out the treatment-priority wording mixed into the fair copy.","Relationships":"Fair-copies Ryu Eunbi''s draft of the Medical Charter and matches numbers with Cho Naru''s escort clauses. Supports only Jeong Yura''s joint negotiation form.","Ambition":"Aims to make the medical neutrality clause valid only in the Jegidong clerk''s ledger, so that exclusive purchasing by Seoul''s internal patron powers cannot split the signature column.","Fear":"Fears that a forged treatment-priority right will be mixed into the fair copy and make oneself the hand of a charter violation.","Intervention":"Can pull out the note under the case and expose it, or escort the signing witness to uphold the charter."},"biography":"Fair-copies first the sentence that makes no distinction between enemy and ally, and keeps standing at the door the envoy who demands that the priority-treatment clause be turned into a watchword. Even out of breath, there are two copies.\n\n- Occupation: Medical Charter signature-and-seal verification\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: Resident\n- Title: Medical Charter Accord Signature Clerk\n**Life.** Born on 2090-08-27. As of the 2126 opening, takes up the post of Medical Charter Accord Signature Clerk, continuing the existing duty roster and records. The succession record for that post opened with a counterfeit medicine seal.\n- The Medical Charter signature-and-seal verification desk in Jegidong is Changhaeon''s work reference point. This work reference point does not fix residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or occupancy rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Resident. Title: Medical Charter Clerk-Resident. Writes the signing time and the Order Chief''s seal on the same line, and locks the case if the seals of the attending specialist and the Order Chief are missing.\n\n**Anecdote.** First, an envoy comes to the White Cross Order''s clerk''s office carrying the fair copy of the Medical Charter, asking that the priority-treatment clause be turned into a watchword. Changhaeon keeps the envoy standing at the door and, matching Ryu Eunbi''s charter draft against the clause numbers of Cho Naru''s escort provisions, sorts out the treatment-priority wording mixed into the fair copy.\n\n**Relationships.** Fair-copies Ryu Eunbi''s draft of the Medical Charter and matches numbers with Cho Naru''s escort clauses. Supports only Jeong Yura''s joint negotiation form.\n\n**Ambition.** Aims to make the medical neutrality clause valid only in the Jegidong clerk''s ledger, so that exclusive purchasing by Seoul''s internal patron powers cannot split the signature column.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that a forged treatment-priority right will be mixed into the fair copy and make oneself the hand of a charter violation.\n\n**Intervention.** Can pull out the note under the case and expose it, or escort the signing witness to uphold the charter.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −15 | Openness 30 | Force −60 | Materialism −20 | Communal 25 | Principle 35 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 15 | Dispersion 25 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 20 | Monopoly 15 | Risk 10 | Display −20 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: opposite sex | Union: none\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Chang Haeon","type":"Contract","to":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Fair-copies the text of Ryu Eunbi''s medical charter, and"},{"from":"Chang Haeon","type":"Contract","to":"Cho Naru","basis":"Match Cho Naru''s escort clause against its number"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0344","name":"창해온","title":"의료헌장 협약 서명 서기","position":"의료헌장 협약 서명 서기","characterId":"K343","rank":"수련의","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"의료헌장 서명·인장 대조","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-창해온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0344","birthDate":"2090-08-27","birthday":"08-27","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"charter-clause-comparison","name":"헌장 조항 대조","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"군호로 바꾸지 않는 문안","description":"치료 우선권 문구를 헌장과 호송 조항 번호에 맞춰 가려냈다. 문서 대조와 중립 문안 보존에 강점이 있다.","behavior":"적과 아군을 가리지 않는 문장을 먼저 정서하고, 우선 치료 조항을 군호로 바꾸라는 사신을 문 앞에 세운다. 숨이 차도 사본은 두 장이다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 담당 전문의의 도제로 배우며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 위조 치료 우선권이 정서본에 섞여 자신이 헌장 위반의 손이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 류은비의 의료헌장 문안을 정서하고, 초나루의 호송 조항과 번호를 맞춘다. 정유라의 공동교섭 서식만 받친다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 의료헌장 서기 수련의. 서명 시각과 단장 날인을 같은 줄에 적고, 담당 전문의와 단장의 인장이 없으면 함을 잠근다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 의료헌장 서기 수련의. 서명 시각과 단장 날인을 같은 줄에 적고, 담당 전문의와 단장의 인장이 없으면 함을 잠근다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 위조 치료 우선권이 정서본에 섞여 자신이 헌장 위반의 손이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 류은비의 의료헌장 문안을 정서하고, 초나루의 호송 조항과 번호를 맞춘다. 정유라의 공동교섭 서식만 받친다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"치료 우선권 문구를 헌장과 호송 조항 번호에 맞춰 가려냈다. 문서 대조와 중립 문안 보존에 강점이 있다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc3d-cc3d-b155-660c","name":"창녕 창씨","crest":"clan-crests/cc3d-cc3d-b155-660c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-15,"개방":30,"무력":-60,"물질":-20,"공동":25,"원칙":35,"공개":20,"자격":15,"분산":25,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":20,"독점":15,"위험":10,"과시":-20,"지속":5,"지향":"이성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"의료헌장 서명·인장 대조","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"수련의","직함":"의료헌장 협약 서명 서기","가치관":"권위 −15 | 개방 30 | 무력 −60 | 물질 −20 | 공동 25 | 원칙 35 | 공개 20 | 자격 15 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 20 | 독점 15 | 위험 10 | 과시 −20 | 지속 5 | 지향 이성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2090-08-27에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의료헌장 협약 서명 서기 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 의료헌장 서명·인장 대조 창구가 창해온의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수련의. 직함은 의료헌장 서기 수련의. 서명 시각과 단장 날인을 같은 줄에 적고, 담당 전문의와 단장의 인장이 없으면 함을 잠근다.","일화":"우선 치료 조항을 군호로 바꿔 달라는 사신이 의료헌장 정서본을 들고 흰십자단 서기실에 온다. 창해온은 사신을 문 앞에 세워 두고, 류은비의 헌장 문안과 초나루의 호송 조항 번호를 맞춰 정서본에 섞인 치료 우선권 문구를 가려낸다.","관계":"류은비의 의료헌장 문안을 정서하고, 초나루의 호송 조항과 번호를 맞춘다. 정유라의 공동교섭 서식만 받친다.","야망":"의약 중립 조항을 제기동 서기 원장에만 유효하게 해 서울 내부 후원 세력 독점 구매가 서명란을 쪼개지 못하게 하려 한다.","공포":"위조 치료 우선권이 정서본에 섞여 자신이 헌장 위반의 손이 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"함 아래 쪽지를 꺼내 폭로하거나, 서명 증인을 호송해 헌장을 지킬 수 있다."},"biography":"적과 아군을 가리지 않는 문장을 먼저 정서하고, 우선 치료 조항을 군호로 바꾸라는 사신을 문 앞에 세운다. 숨이 차도 사본은 두 장이다.\n\n- 생업: 의료헌장 서명·인장 대조\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 수련의\n- 직함: 의료헌장 협약 서명 서기\n**생애.** 2090-08-27에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의료헌장 협약 서명 서기 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 의료헌장 서명·인장 대조 창구가 창해온의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수련의. 직함은 의료헌장 서기 수련의. 서명 시각과 단장 날인을 같은 줄에 적고, 담당 전문의와 단장의 인장이 없으면 함을 잠근다.\n\n**일화.** 우선 치료 조항을 군호로 바꿔 달라는 사신이 의료헌장 정서본을 들고 흰십자단 서기실에 온다. 창해온은 사신을 문 앞에 세워 두고, 류은비의 헌장 문안과 초나루의 호송 조항 번호를 맞춰 정서본에 섞인 치료 우선권 문구를 가려낸다.\n\n**관계.** 류은비의 의료헌장 문안을 정서하고, 초나루의 호송 조항과 번호를 맞춘다. 정유라의 공동교섭 서식만 받친다.\n\n**야망.** 의약 중립 조항을 제기동 서기 원장에만 유효하게 해 서울 내부 후원 세력 독점 구매가 서명란을 쪼개지 못하게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 위조 치료 우선권이 정서본에 섞여 자신이 헌장 위반의 손이 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 함 아래 쪽지를 꺼내 폭로하거나, 서명 증인을 호송해 헌장을 지킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −15 | 개방 30 | 무력 −60 | 물질 −20 | 공동 25 | 원칙 35 | 공개 20 | 자격 15 | 분산 25 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 20 | 독점 15 | 위험 10 | 과시 −20 | 지속 5 | 지향 이성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"창해온","type":"계약","to":"류은비","basis":"류은비의 의료헌장 문안을 정서하고"},{"from":"창해온","type":"계약","to":"초나루","basis":"초나루의 호송 조항과 번호를 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0345', 'c11d-cda9-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0345","name":"Seok Raon","title":"Southbound Refugee Patients'' Representative","position":"Southbound Refugee Patients'' Representative","characterId":"K344","rank":"Resident","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Evacuee Patient Triage Posting","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#person-seok-raon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0345","birthDate":"2096-02-12","birthday":"02-12","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"displaced-patient-roster-reconciliation","name":"Displaced patient roster reconciliation","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Care without registration","description":"When arrivals crowded the clinic, they pushed compulsory registration outside and retained triage. Roster and stretcher reconciliation support field management.","behavior":"He put stretcher order ahead of nationality and heard as an insult any order to paste service re-registration on the care window. He remembered the faces in the queue for a long time.","stress":"Fear. That the sickbeds he handed out would become military-registry bait and the clinic would be stamped a protection window.","relationship":"Relations. Opened Eun Chaeyun''s sickbeds to the refugee line and cross-checked Baek On''s southward family roster at the foot of the beds. Matched stretcher counts with Beom Ongyeol''s passage numbers.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: member. Title: southward refugee patient representative. He posted the refugee patients and the contribution-labor table side by side and accepted priority care requests only after the guild council.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: member. Title: southward refugee patient representative. He posted the refugee patients and the contribution-labor table side by side and accepted priority care requests only after the guild council.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the sickbeds he handed out would become military-registry bait and the clinic would be stamped a protection window.","relationship":"Relations. Opened Eun Chaeyun''s sickbeds to the refugee line and cross-checked Baek On''s southward family roster at the foot of the beds. Matched stretcher counts with Beom Ongyeol''s passage numbers.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"When arrivals crowded the clinic, they pushed compulsory registration outside and retained triage. Roster and stretcher reconciliation support field management.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c11d-cda9-c8fc","name":"Seok Clan of Chungju","crest":"clan-crests/c11d-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-40,"Openness":55,"Force":-65,"Material":-25,"Communal":40,"Principle":40,"Public":25,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":-10,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":-20,"Display":25,"Sustained":50,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Evacuee Patient Triage Posting","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Resident","Title":"Southbound Refugee Patients'' Representative","Values":"Authority −40 | Openness 55 | Force −65 | Materialism −25 | Communal 40 | Principle 40 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 10 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving −10 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −20 | Display 25 | Persistence 50 | Orientation: opposite sex | Union: contract cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2096-02-12. As of the 2126 opening, takes up the post of Southbound Refugee Patient Representative, continuing the existing duty roster and records. The succession record for that post opened through the orphan-register citizenship line.\n- The refugee-patient triage posting desk in Jegidong is Seok Raon''s work reference point. This work reference point does not fix residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or occupancy rights.","Offices":"Rank: Resident. Title: Refugee Patient Care Resident. Posts refugee patients and the triage chart side by side, and accepts priority-treatment requests only after the attending specialist''s clinical judgment.","Anecdote":"In autumn, when the procession from Bukhansan Bogungmun filled the front of the Jegidong clinic, Seok Raon pushed the forced-registration desk out the door and left only the triage chart.","Relationships":"Opens Eun Chaeyun''s sickbeds to the refugee line, and cross-checks Baek On''s southbound family register at the foot of the bed. Matches Beom Ongyeol''s passage counts with stretcher counts.","Ambition":"Aims to bind the families of patients who came down from Bukhansan Bogungmun into a ledger of triage alone, so that treatment without citizenship is not cut off.","Fear":"Fears that the beds one has allocated will become bait for the military household register, and the clinic will be marked as a protection desk.","Intervention":"Can protect the refugee ledger to keep treatment going, or hand the line over to the watchword desk."},"biography":"Puts stretcher order ahead of nationality, and hears the order to attach service re-registration to the treatment desk as an insult. Remembers the faces in line for a long time.\n\n- Occupation: Refugee patient triage posting\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: Resident\n- Title: Southbound Refugee Patient Representative\n**Life.** Born on 2096-02-12. As of the 2126 opening, takes up the post of Southbound Refugee Patient Representative, continuing the existing duty roster and records. The succession record for that post opened through the orphan-register citizenship line.\n- The refugee-patient triage posting desk in Jegidong is Seok Raon''s work reference point. This work reference point does not fix residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or occupancy rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Resident. Title: Refugee Patient Care Resident. Posts refugee patients and the triage chart side by side, and accepts priority-treatment requests only after the attending specialist''s clinical judgment.\n\n**Anecdote.** In autumn, when the procession from Bukhansan Bogungmun filled the front of the Jegidong clinic, Seok Raon pushed the forced-registration desk out the door and left only the triage chart.\n\n**Relationships.** Opens Eun Chaeyun''s sickbeds to the refugee line, and cross-checks Baek On''s southbound family register at the foot of the bed. Matches Beom Ongyeol''s passage counts with stretcher counts.\n\n**Ambition.** Aims to bind the families of patients who came down from Bukhansan Bogungmun into a ledger of triage alone, so that treatment without citizenship is not cut off.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that the beds one has allocated will become bait for the military household register, and the clinic will be marked as a protection desk.\n\n**Intervention.** Can protect the refugee ledger to keep treatment going, or hand the line over to the watchword desk.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −40 | Openness 55 | Force −65 | Materialism −25 | Communal 40 | Principle 40 | Publicity 25 | Qualification 10 | Dispersion 20 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving −10 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −20 | Display 25 | Persistence 50 | Orientation: opposite sex | Union: contract cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seok Raon","type":"Contract","to":"Eun Chaeyun","basis":"opens Eun Chaeyun''s sickbeds to the refugee line, and"},{"from":"Seok Raon","type":"Contract","to":"Beom Ongyeol","basis":"Match Beom Ongyeol''s passage counts against the stretcher counts"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0345","name":"석라온","title":"남하 피난 환자 대표","position":"남하 피난 환자 대표","characterId":"K344","rank":"수련의","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"피난 환자 중증도 게시","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-석라온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0345","birthDate":"2096-02-12","birthday":"02-12","age":30,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"displaced-patient-roster-reconciliation","name":"피난 환자 명부 대조","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"등록 없이 치료","description":"행렬이 몰리자 강제등록 창구를 밖으로 밀고 중증도 표를 남겼다. 가족 명부와 들것 수를 맞추는 현장 운영을 반영한다.","behavior":"들것 순서를 국적보다 앞에 두고, 복무 재등록을 진료 창구에 붙이라는 명령을 모욕으로 듣는다. 줄 선 얼굴을 오래 기억한다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 담당 전문의의 도제로 배우며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 자신이 나눈 침상이 군사호적 미끼가 되어 진료소가 보호 창구로 찍히는 것.","relationship":"관계. 은채윤의 병상을 피난 줄에 열고, 백온의 남하 가족 명부를 침상 발치에서 대조한다. 범온결의 통행 숫자와 들것 수를 맞춘다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 피난 환자 진료 수련의. 피난 환자와 중증도 표를 나란히 게시하고, 우선 치료 요청은 담당 전문의의 임상 판단 뒤에만 받는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 피난 환자 진료 수련의. 피난 환자와 중증도 표를 나란히 게시하고, 우선 치료 요청은 담당 전문의의 임상 판단 뒤에만 받는다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 자신이 나눈 침상이 군사호적 미끼가 되어 진료소가 보호 창구로 찍히는 것.","relationship":"관계. 은채윤의 병상을 피난 줄에 열고, 백온의 남하 가족 명부를 침상 발치에서 대조한다. 범온결의 통행 숫자와 들것 수를 맞춘다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"행렬이 몰리자 강제등록 창구를 밖으로 밀고 중증도 표를 남겼다. 가족 명부와 들것 수를 맞추는 현장 운영을 반영한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c11d-cda9-c8fc","name":"충주 석씨","crest":"clan-crests/c11d-cda9-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-40,"개방":55,"무력":-65,"물질":-25,"공동":40,"원칙":40,"공개":25,"자격":10,"분산":20,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":-10,"독점":-30,"위험":-20,"과시":25,"지속":50,"지향":"이성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"피난 환자 중증도 게시","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"수련의","직함":"남하 피난 환자 대표","가치관":"권위 −40 | 개방 55 | 무력 −65 | 물질 −25 | 공동 40 | 원칙 40 | 공개 25 | 자격 10 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 −10 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −20 | 과시 25 | 지속 50 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2096-02-12에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 남하 피난 환자 대표 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 고아 명부 시민권 줄로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 피난 환자 중증도 게시 창구가 석라온의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수련의. 직함은 피난 환자 진료 수련의. 피난 환자와 중증도 표를 나란히 게시하고, 우선 치료 요청은 담당 전문의의 임상 판단 뒤에만 받는다.","일화":"가을의 북한산보국문 행렬이 제기동 진료소 앞을 메우자 석라온은 강제등록 창구를 문 밖으로 밀어내고 중증도 표만 남겼다.","관계":"은채윤의 병상을 피난 줄에 열고, 백온의 남하 가족 명부를 침상 발치에서 대조한다. 범온결의 통행 숫자와 들것 수를 맞춘다.","야망":"북한산보국문에서 내려온 환자 가족을 중증도만의 원장으로 묶어 시민권 없는 치료가 끊기지 않게 하려 한다.","공포":"자신이 나눈 침상이 군사호적 미끼가 되어 진료소가 보호 창구로 찍히는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"피난 원장을 지켜 치료를 이어가거나, 줄을 군호 창구로 넘길 수 있다."},"biography":"들것 순서를 국적보다 앞에 두고, 복무 재등록을 진료 창구에 붙이라는 명령을 모욕으로 듣는다. 줄 선 얼굴을 오래 기억한다.\n\n- 생업: 피난 환자 중증도 게시\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 수련의\n- 직함: 남하 피난 환자 대표\n**생애.** 2096-02-12에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 남하 피난 환자 대표 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 고아 명부 시민권 줄로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 피난 환자 중증도 게시 창구가 석라온의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수련의. 직함은 피난 환자 진료 수련의. 피난 환자와 중증도 표를 나란히 게시하고, 우선 치료 요청은 담당 전문의의 임상 판단 뒤에만 받는다.\n\n**일화.** 가을의 북한산보국문 행렬이 제기동 진료소 앞을 메우자 석라온은 강제등록 창구를 문 밖으로 밀어내고 중증도 표만 남겼다.\n\n**관계.** 은채윤의 병상을 피난 줄에 열고, 백온의 남하 가족 명부를 침상 발치에서 대조한다. 범온결의 통행 숫자와 들것 수를 맞춘다.\n\n**야망.** 북한산보국문에서 내려온 환자 가족을 중증도만의 원장으로 묶어 시민권 없는 치료가 끊기지 않게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 자신이 나눈 침상이 군사호적 미끼가 되어 진료소가 보호 창구로 찍히는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 피난 원장을 지켜 치료를 이어가거나, 줄을 군호 창구로 넘길 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −40 | 개방 55 | 무력 −65 | 물질 −25 | 공동 40 | 원칙 40 | 공개 25 | 자격 10 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 −10 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −20 | 과시 25 | 지속 50 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"석라온","type":"계약","to":"은채윤","basis":"은채윤의 병상을 피난 줄에 열고"},{"from":"석라온","type":"계약","to":"범온결","basis":"범온결의 통행 숫자와 들것 수를 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0346', 'adfc-ccad-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0346","name":"Geun Uram","title":"Military Household Register Treatment Refusal Witness","position":"Military Household Register Treatment Refusal Witness","characterId":"K345","rank":"Resident","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Treatment Refusal Time and Re-signature Record","gender":"Female","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#person-geun-uram","detailRoute":"/people/person-0346","birthDate":"2064-06-23","birthday":"06-23","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"care-refusal-testimony-preparation","name":"Care refusal testimony preparation","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Will not alter dates","description":"They removed an officer from bedside and aligned refusal times with patient allocation for testimony. Accuracy of records and rejection of coerced registration are retained.","behavior":"He read a family-unit service registration note as evidence of a care refusal and sent down any officer who told him to read the registry at the foot of the sickbeds. He kept his manners but never forgave a hand that changed a date.","stress":"Fear. That the testimony would be clipped into a deserters'' list and he would become the compass of a hunt.","relationship":"Relations. Made Gang Minseo''s restoration-service citizenship solidarity the frame of his testimony and had refused Bae Woojin''s family service demand at the sickbeds. Split the refusal line with Jeon Sol''s patient allocation.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: member. Title: military registry care refusal witness. He wrote the refusal hour and the sickbed number in the same ledger and accepted a later correction only with the two duty hands of the day signing again.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: member. Title: military registry care refusal witness. He wrote the refusal hour and the sickbed number in the same ledger and accepted a later correction only with the two duty hands of the day signing again.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the testimony would be clipped into a deserters'' list and he would become the compass of a hunt.","relationship":"Relations. Made Gang Minseo''s restoration-service citizenship solidarity the frame of his testimony and had refused Bae Woojin''s family service demand at the sickbeds. Split the refusal line with Jeon Sol''s patient allocation.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"They removed an officer from bedside and aligned refusal times with patient allocation for testimony. Accuracy of records and rejection of coerced registration are retained.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"adfc-ccad-c8fc","name":"Geun Clan of Cheongju","crest":"clan-crests/adfc-ccad-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":45,"Force":-75,"Material":-15,"Communal":10,"Principle":50,"Public":10,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":20,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":-25,"Display":25,"Sustained":15,"Orientation":"None","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Treatment Refusal Time and Re-signature Record","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Resident","Title":"Military Household Register Treatment Refusal Witness","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 45 | Force −75 | Materialism −15 | Communal 10 | Principle 50 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 15 | Dispersal 20 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving 15 | Monopoly 30 | Risk −25 | Display 25 | Persistence 15 | Orientation: None | Bonding: None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2064-06-23. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Military Register Treatment Refusal Witness, continuing the records of the existing duty shift. The succession record for that post opened with a fake medicine seal.\n- The treatment refusal time and re-signature record desk in Jegi-dong is Geun U-ram''s work reference point. This work reference point does not fix residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or tenure.","Offices":"Rank: Resident. Title: Treatment Refusal Record Resident. Writes the refusal time and bed number in the same ledger, and accepts later corrections only with the re-signatures of the two officers on duty at the time.","Anecdote":"An officer reads a patient''s household register at a ward bedside and thrusts out a family-unit service registration slip. Geun U-ram sends the officer away, enters the refusal time and bed number in the ledger, and matches them against Jeon Sol''s patient allocation line to organize testimony for Gang Min-seo''s Restoration Service Citizenship Solidarity.","Relationships":"Takes Gang Min-seo''s Restoration Service Citizenship Solidarity as the backbone of testimony, and has refused Bae U-jin''s demand for family service at the bedside. Shares the refusal line with Jeon Sol''s patient allocation.","Ambition":"Aims to leave treatment records that refused forced registration as public testimony, so that voluntary restoration service and citizenship contracts become a door for medicine.","Fear":"Fears that testimony will be cut into a deserter roster, making oneself the compass of pursuit.","Intervention":"Can publish the refusal ledger to aid the solidarity, or hand the testimony to the officer network and open the pursuit."},"biography":"Sees the family-unit service registration slip as evidence of treatment refusal, and sends away officers who tell them to read the household register at the bedside. Keeps courtesy, but does not forgive the hand that alters dates.\n\n- Livelihood: Treatment refusal times and re-signature records\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: Resident\n- Title: Military Register Treatment Refusal Witness\n**Life.** Born 2064-06-23. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Military Register Treatment Refusal Witness, continuing the records of the existing duty shift. The succession record for that post opened with a fake medicine seal.\n- The treatment refusal time and re-signature record desk in Jegi-dong is Geun U-ram''s work reference point. This work reference point does not fix residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or tenure.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Resident. Title: Treatment Refusal Record Resident. Writes the refusal time and bed number in the same ledger, and accepts later corrections only with the re-signatures of the two officers on duty at the time.\n\n**Anecdote.** An officer reads a patient''s household register at a ward bedside and thrusts out a family-unit service registration slip. Geun U-ram sends the officer away, enters the refusal time and bed number in the ledger, and matches them against Jeon Sol''s patient allocation line to organize testimony for Gang Min-seo''s Restoration Service Citizenship Solidarity.\n\n**Relations.** Takes Gang Min-seo''s Restoration Service Citizenship Solidarity as the backbone of testimony, and has refused Bae U-jin''s demand for family service at the bedside. Shares the refusal line with Jeon Sol''s patient allocation.\n\n**Ambition.** Aims to leave treatment records that refused forced registration as public testimony, so that voluntary restoration service and citizenship contracts become a door for medicine.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that testimony will be cut into a deserter roster, making oneself the compass of pursuit.\n\n**Intervention.** Can publish the refusal ledger to aid the solidarity, or hand the testimony to the officer network and open the pursuit.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 45 | Force −75 | Materialism −15 | Communal 10 | Principle 50 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 15 | Dispersal 20 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Monopoly 30 | Risk −25 | Display 25 | Persistence 15 | Orientation: None | Bonding: None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Geun Uram","type":"Oath","to":"Gang Minseo","basis":"Taking Gang Minseo''s restoration-service citizenship solidarity as the basis of the testimony"},{"from":"Geun Uram","type":"Oath","to":"Bae Ujin","basis":"Refuses Bae Ujin''s demand for family service at the bedside"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0346","name":"근우람","title":"군사호적 치료 거부 증인","position":"군사호적 치료 거부 증인","characterId":"K345","rank":"수련의","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"치료 거부 시각·재서명 기록","gender":"여성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-근우람","detailRoute":"/people/person-0346","birthDate":"2064-06-23","birthday":"06-23","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"care-refusal-testimony-preparation","name":"치료 거부 증언 정리","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"날짜를 고치지 않는다","description":"장교를 침상 앞에서 돌려보내고 거부 시각을 환자 할당과 맞춰 증언을 정리했다. 기록의 정확성과 등록 강요 거부를 보존한다.","behavior":"가족 단위 복무등록 쪽지를 치료 거부의 증거로 보고, 침상 앞에서 호적을 읽으라는 장교를 내려보낸다. 예의는 지키되 날짜를 고치는 손은 용서하지 않는다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 담당 전문의의 도제로 배우며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 증언이 탈주자 명부로 잘려 자신이 추적의 나침반이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 강민서의 복구복무 시민권 연대를 증언의 뼈대로 삼고, 배우진의 가족 복무 요구를 침상 앞에서 거부해 왔다. 전솔의 환자 할당과 거부 줄을 나눈다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 치료 거부 기록 수련의. 거부 시각과 침상 번호를 같은 원장에 적고, 후일 수정은 당시 당직 두 명의 재서명만 받는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 치료 거부 기록 수련의. 거부 시각과 침상 번호를 같은 원장에 적고, 후일 수정은 당시 당직 두 명의 재서명만 받는다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 증언이 탈주자 명부로 잘려 자신이 추적의 나침반이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 강민서의 복구복무 시민권 연대를 증언의 뼈대로 삼고, 배우진의 가족 복무 요구를 침상 앞에서 거부해 왔다. 전솔의 환자 할당과 거부 줄을 나눈다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"장교를 침상 앞에서 돌려보내고 거부 시각을 환자 할당과 맞춰 증언을 정리했다. 기록의 정확성과 등록 강요 거부를 보존한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"adfc-ccad-c8fc","name":"청주 근씨","crest":"clan-crests/adfc-ccad-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-20,"개방":45,"무력":-75,"물질":-15,"공동":10,"원칙":50,"공개":10,"자격":15,"분산":20,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":30,"위험":-25,"과시":25,"지속":15,"지향":"무성향","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"치료 거부 시각·재서명 기록","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"수련의","직함":"군사호적 치료 거부 증인","가치관":"권위 −20 | 개방 45 | 무력 −75 | 물질 −15 | 공동 10 | 원칙 50 | 공개 10 | 자격 15 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 30 | 위험 −25 | 과시 25 | 지속 15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2064-06-23에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 군사호적 치료 거부 증인 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 치료 거부 시각·재서명 기록 창구가 근우람의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 확정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수련의. 직함은 치료 거부 기록 수련의. 거부 시각과 침상 번호를 같은 원장에 적고, 후일 수정은 당시 당직 두 명의 재서명만 받는다.","일화":"장교 하나가 병동 침상 앞에서 환자의 호적을 읽으며 가족 단위 복무등록 쪽지를 내민다. 근우람은 장교를 내려보내고 거부 시각과 침상 번호를 원장에 올리고, 전솔의 환자 할당 줄과 맞춰 강민서의 복구복무 시민권 연대에 낼 증언을 정리한다.","관계":"강민서의 복구복무 시민권 연대를 증언의 뼈대로 삼고, 배우진의 가족 복무 요구를 침상 앞에서 거부해 왔다. 전솔의 환자 할당과 거부 줄을 나눈다.","야망":"강제등록을 거부한 치료 기록을 공개 증언으로 남겨 자발 복구복무와 시민권 계약이 의약의 문이 되게 하려 한다.","공포":"증언이 탈주자 명부로 잘려 자신이 추적의 나침반이 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"거부 원장을 공개해 연대를 돕거나, 증언을 장교망에 넘겨 추적을 열 수 있다."},"biography":"가족 단위 복무등록 쪽지를 치료 거부의 증거로 보고, 침상 앞에서 호적을 읽으라는 장교를 내려보낸다. 예의는 지키되 날짜를 고치는 손은 용서하지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 치료 거부 시각·재서명 기록\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 수련의\n- 직함: 군사호적 치료 거부 증인\n**생애.** 2064-06-23에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 군사호적 치료 거부 증인 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 치료 거부 시각·재서명 기록 창구가 근우람의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 확정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수련의. 직함은 치료 거부 기록 수련의. 거부 시각과 침상 번호를 같은 원장에 적고, 후일 수정은 당시 당직 두 명의 재서명만 받는다.\n\n**일화.** 장교 하나가 병동 침상 앞에서 환자의 호적을 읽으며 가족 단위 복무등록 쪽지를 내민다. 근우람은 장교를 내려보내고 거부 시각과 침상 번호를 원장에 올리고, 전솔의 환자 할당 줄과 맞춰 강민서의 복구복무 시민권 연대에 낼 증언을 정리한다.\n\n**관계.** 강민서의 복구복무 시민권 연대를 증언의 뼈대로 삼고, 배우진의 가족 복무 요구를 침상 앞에서 거부해 왔다. 전솔의 환자 할당과 거부 줄을 나눈다.\n\n**야망.** 강제등록을 거부한 치료 기록을 공개 증언으로 남겨 자발 복구복무와 시민권 계약이 의약의 문이 되게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 증언이 탈주자 명부로 잘려 자신이 추적의 나침반이 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 거부 원장을 공개해 연대를 돕거나, 증언을 장교망에 넘겨 추적을 열 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −20 | 개방 45 | 무력 −75 | 물질 −15 | 공동 10 | 원칙 50 | 공개 10 | 자격 15 | 분산 20 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 30 | 위험 −25 | 과시 25 | 지속 15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"근우람","type":"맹세","to":"강민서","basis":"강민서의 복구복무 시민권 연대를 증언의 바탕으로 삼고"},{"from":"근우람","type":"맹세","to":"배우진","basis":"배우진의 가족 복무 요구를 침상 앞에서 거부한다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0347', 'creative-d765-c218-c0c9', '{"id":"person-0347","name":"Heung Daon","title":"Representative of the crowd conscripted at the Hegemony War opening","position":"Representative of the crowd conscripted at the Hegemony War opening","characterId":"K346","rank":"Specialist","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"Conscription slip and entry headcount cross-check","gender":"Male","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#person-heung-da-on","detailRoute":"/people/person-0347","birthDate":"2082-01-16","birthday":"01-16","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"attendance-reconciliation","name":"Attendance reconciliation","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Organizer who rejects requisition","description":"Tearing up an altered requisition, they separate escort and crowd lines and recount arrivals. The management strength is confined to this response.","behavior":"He heard as an insult any broadcast that called the quarantine squad a requisition force, and tore up any note that wrote the herb column as military rations. The longer the line grew, the lower his voice fell.","stress":"Fear. That his own name, once he stepped out as representative, would top the protection force''s medical draft.","relationship":"Relations. Split the crowd queue with Nam Hoseong''s medical convoy and matched the wording with Seok Bomwoo''s Sinnae refusal clause. Sent Bae Woojin''s water-protection requisition back as a grudge.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: section chief. Title:  reconstruction-era requisition crowd representative. He checked requisition notes against actual entry numbers every evening and did not disperse the crowd before Ryu Eunbi''s neutrality declaration came down.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: section chief. Title:  reconstruction-era requisition crowd representative. He checked requisition notes against actual entry numbers every evening and did not disperse the crowd before Ryu Eunbi''s neutrality declaration came down.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That his own name, once he stepped out as representative, would top the protection force''s medical draft.","relationship":"Relations. Split the crowd queue with Nam Hoseong''s medical convoy and matched the wording with Seok Bomwoo''s Sinnae refusal clause. Sent Bae Woojin''s water-protection requisition back as a grudge.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Tearing up an altered requisition, they separate escort and crowd lines and recount arrivals. The management strength is confined to this response.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"creative-d765-c218-c0c9","name":"Heung Clan of Susaek","crest":"clan-crests/creative-d765-c218-c0c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-35,"Openness":20,"Force":-40,"Material":-25,"Communal":15,"Principle":35,"Public":10,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":30,"Transformative":-20},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":35,"Risk":-40,"Display":-25,"Sustained":0,"Orientation":"Bisexual","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Conscription slip and entry headcount cross-check","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Specialist","Title":"Representative of the crowd conscripted at the Hegemony War opening","Values":"Authority −35 | Openness 20 | Force −40 | Materialism −25 | Communal 15 | Principle 35 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 10 | Dispersal 30 | Transformation −20","Desires":"Craving 15 | Monopoly 35 | Risk −40 | Display −25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Bisexual | Bonding: None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2082-01-16. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Hegemony War Opening Requisition Crowd Representative, continuing the records of the existing duty shift. The succession record for that post opened with a substitute shift covering an unauthorized shift absence.\n- The requisition slip and entry headcount reconciliation desk in Jegi-dong is Heung Da-on''s work reference point. This work reference point does not set residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or tenure.","Offices":"Rank: Specialist. Title: Epidemic-Control and Medical-Mobilization Specialist. Reconciles requisition slips against the actual entry headcount every evening, and does not disperse the crowd until Ryu Eun-bi''s neutrality declaration comes down.","Anecdote":"A requisition slip with the medicine compartment rewritten as army provisions is posted at the Jegi-dong quarantine unit. Heung Da-on tears up the slip, recounts the actual entries through the evening reconciliation, and keeps Nam Ho-seong''s medical convoy line and the crowd counted separately until Ryu Eun-bi''s neutrality declaration comes down.","Relationships":"Keeps Nam Ho-seong''s medical convoy and the crowd in separate lines, and aligns wording with Seok Bom-u''s Sinnae refusal text. Sends Bae U-jin''s Sangsu Protection requisition back as a grievance.","Ambition":"Aims to bind the requisition roster of the medical crowd into a public refusal ledger, so that treatment neutrality does not turn into a mobilization window.","Fear":"Fears that one''s own name, having stepped forward on the scene, will top the Protection Army''s medical draft list.","Intervention":"Can bring the refusal ledger to the council, or disperse the crowd and let the requisition wagons through."},"biography":"Hears the broadcast calling the quarantine unit a requisition force as an insult, and tears up slips that record the medicine compartment as army provisions. The longer the line grows, the lower the voice becomes.\n\n- Livelihood: Reconciling requisition slips and entry headcounts\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: Specialist\n- Title: Hegemony War Opening Requisition Crowd Representative\n**Life.** Born 2082-01-16. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Hegemony War Opening Requisition Crowd Representative, continuing the records of the existing duty shift. The succession record for that post opened with a substitute shift covering an unauthorized shift absence.\n- The requisition slip and entry headcount reconciliation desk in Jegi-dong is Heung Da-on''s work reference point. This work reference point does not set residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or tenure.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Specialist. Title: Epidemic-Control and Medical-Mobilization Specialist. Reconciles requisition slips against the actual entry headcount every evening, and does not disperse the crowd until Ryu Eun-bi''s neutrality declaration comes down.\n\n**Anecdote.** A requisition slip with the medicine compartment rewritten as army provisions is posted at the Jegi-dong quarantine unit. Heung Da-on tears up the slip, recounts the actual entries through the evening reconciliation, and keeps Nam Ho-seong''s medical convoy line and the crowd counted separately until Ryu Eun-bi''s neutrality declaration comes down.\n\n**Relations.** Keeps Nam Ho-seong''s medical convoy and the crowd in separate lines, and aligns wording with Seok Bom-u''s Sinnae refusal text. Sends Bae U-jin''s Sangsu Protection requisition back as a grievance.\n\n**Ambition.** Aims to bind the requisition roster of the medical crowd into a public refusal ledger, so that treatment neutrality does not turn into a mobilization window.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that one''s own name, having stepped forward on the scene, will top the Protection Army''s medical draft list.\n\n**Intervention.** Can bring the refusal ledger to the council, or disperse the crowd and let the requisition wagons through.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −35 | Openness 20 | Force −40 | Materialism −25 | Communal 15 | Principle 35 | Publicity 10 | Qualification 10 | Dispersal 30 | Transformation −20\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Monopoly 35 | Risk −40 | Display −25 | Persistence 0 | Orientation: Bisexual | Bonding: None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Heung Daon","type":"Contract","to":"Nam Hoseong","basis":"Separates Nam Hoseong''s medical convoy from the crowd lines and"},{"from":"Heung Daon","type":"Contract","to":"Seok Bomu","basis":"Align the wording with Seok Bomu''s Sinnae refusal wording"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Beom Chaeon","type":"Contract","to":"Heung Daon","basis":"Aligns wording with Heung Da-on''s Jegi-dong refusal statement"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0347","name":"흥다온","title":"패권전 개막 징발 인파 대표","position":"패권전 개막 징발 인파 대표","characterId":"K346","rank":"전문의","commonTier":"T2","occupation":"징발 쪽지·출입 인원 대조","gender":"남성","stage":"S3","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-흥다온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0347","birthDate":"2082-01-16","birthday":"01-16","age":44,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"attendance-reconciliation","name":"출입 인원 대조","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"징발을 거부하는 조정자","description":"변조된 징발 쪽지를 찢고 호송과 인파를 나누어 다시 센다. 인원 운영의 강점은 이 현장 대응에 한정한다.","behavior":"방역대를 징발 병력으로 부르라는 방송을 모욕으로 듣고, 약재 칸을 군량으로 적는 쪽지를 찢는다. 줄이 길어질수록 목소리는 낮아진다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 수련의를 지도하고 후계자를 지정하며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 현장에 나선 자신의 이름이 보호군 의무 선발의 맨 위가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 남호성의 의무호송과 인파 줄을 나누고, 석봄우의 신내 거부 문구와 문장을 맞춘다. 배우진의 상수보호 징발을 원한으로 돌려보낸다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 전문의. 직함은 방역·의무동원 전문의. 징발 쪽지와 실제 출입 인원을 저녁마다 대조하고, 류은비의 중립 선언이 내려오기 전에는 인파를 해산시키지 않는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 전문의. 직함은 방역·의무동원 전문의. 징발 쪽지와 실제 출입 인원을 저녁마다 대조하고, 류은비의 중립 선언이 내려오기 전에는 인파를 해산시키지 않는다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 현장에 나선 자신의 이름이 보호군 의무 선발의 맨 위가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 남호성의 의무호송과 인파 줄을 나누고, 석봄우의 신내 거부 문구와 문장을 맞춘다. 배우진의 상수보호 징발을 원한으로 돌려보낸다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"변조된 징발 쪽지를 찢고 호송과 인파를 나누어 다시 센다. 인원 운영의 강점은 이 현장 대응에 한정한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"creative-d765-c218-c0c9","name":"수색 흥씨","crest":"clan-crests/creative-d765-c218-c0c9.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-35,"개방":20,"무력":-40,"물질":-25,"공동":15,"원칙":35,"공개":10,"자격":10,"분산":30,"변혁":-20},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":35,"위험":-40,"과시":-25,"지속":0,"지향":"양성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"징발 쪽지·출입 인원 대조","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"전문의","직함":"패권전 개막 징발 인파 대표","가치관":"권위 −35 | 개방 20 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −25 | 공동 15 | 원칙 35 | 공개 10 | 자격 10 | 분산 30 | 변혁 −20","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 35 | 위험 −40 | 과시 −25 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2082-01-16에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 패권전 개막 징발 인파 대표 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 징발 쪽지·출입 인원 대조 창구가 흥다온의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 전문의. 직함은 방역·의무동원 전문의. 징발 쪽지와 실제 출입 인원을 저녁마다 대조하고, 류은비의 중립 선언이 내려오기 전에는 인파를 해산시키지 않는다.","일화":"약재 칸을 군량으로 고쳐 적은 징발 쪽지가 제기동 방역대에 붙는다. 흥다온은 쪽지를 찢고 저녁 대조로 실제 출입 인원을 다시 세며, 류은비의 중립 선언이 내려올 때까지 남호성의 의무호송 줄과 인파를 나누어 세워 둔다.","관계":"남호성의 의무호송과 인파 줄을 나누고, 석봄우의 신내 거부 문구와 문장을 맞춘다. 배우진의 상수보호 징발을 원한으로 돌려보낸다.","야망":"의약 인파의 징발 명단을 공개 거부 원장으로 묶어 치료 중립이 동원 창구로 바뀌지 않게 하려 한다.","공포":"현장에 나선 자신의 이름이 보호군 의무 선발의 맨 위가 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"거부 원장을 회의에 올리거나, 인파를 해산시켜 징발 마차를 통과시킬 수 있다."},"biography":"방역대를 징발 병력으로 부르라는 방송을 모욕으로 듣고, 약재 칸을 군량으로 적는 쪽지를 찢는다. 줄이 길어질수록 목소리는 낮아진다.\n\n- 생업: 징발 쪽지·출입 인원 대조\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 전문의\n- 직함: 패권전 개막 징발 인파 대표\n**생애.** 2082-01-16에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 패권전 개막 징발 인파 대표 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 교대 무단 결근 대체 당직으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 징발 쪽지·출입 인원 대조 창구가 흥다온의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 전문의. 직함은 방역·의무동원 전문의. 징발 쪽지와 실제 출입 인원을 저녁마다 대조하고, 류은비의 중립 선언이 내려오기 전에는 인파를 해산시키지 않는다.\n\n**일화.** 약재 칸을 군량으로 고쳐 적은 징발 쪽지가 제기동 방역대에 붙는다. 흥다온은 쪽지를 찢고 저녁 대조로 실제 출입 인원을 다시 세며, 류은비의 중립 선언이 내려올 때까지 남호성의 의무호송 줄과 인파를 나누어 세워 둔다.\n\n**관계.** 남호성의 의무호송과 인파 줄을 나누고, 석봄우의 신내 거부 문구와 문장을 맞춘다. 배우진의 상수보호 징발을 원한으로 돌려보낸다.\n\n**야망.** 의약 인파의 징발 명단을 공개 거부 원장으로 묶어 치료 중립이 동원 창구로 바뀌지 않게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 현장에 나선 자신의 이름이 보호군 의무 선발의 맨 위가 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 거부 원장을 회의에 올리거나, 인파를 해산시켜 징발 마차를 통과시킬 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −35 | 개방 20 | 무력 −40 | 물질 −25 | 공동 15 | 원칙 35 | 공개 10 | 자격 10 | 분산 30 | 변혁 −20\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 35 | 위험 −40 | 과시 −25 | 지속 0 | 지향 양성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"흥다온","type":"계약","to":"남호성","basis":"남호성의 의무호송과 인파 줄을 나누고"},{"from":"흥다온","type":"계약","to":"석봄우","basis":"석봄우의 신내 거부 문구와 문장을 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"범채온","type":"계약","to":"흥다온","basis":"흥다온의 제기동 거부 문구와 문장을 맞춘다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0348', 'bc31-c218-c6d0', '{"id":"person-0348","name":"Baek Yeoul","title":"Medicine Brokerage Appraiser","position":"Medicine Brokerage Appraiser","characterId":"K347","rank":"Resident","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Medicinal Herb Appraisal Cross-check and Shipment Hold","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#person-baek-yeo-ul","detailRoute":"/people/person-0348","birthDate":"2098-03-17","birthday":"03-17","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K322","recipientName":"Ryu Eunbi","basis":"Cooperates with Ryu Eunbi''s healing guild, but does not disclose the brokerage fee ledger.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-13.json","anchor":"inmul-baekyeoul-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"surgical-procedure","name":"Surgical procedure","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Requires two matching scales","description":"They halt shipment when two scales disagree and continued surgery during an outage. Private commission ledgers coexist with an emphasis on appraisal papers.","behavior":"She weighed herb weights on two scales and refused any trade that balanced on only one. She left appraisal papers over loud bargaining.","stress":"Fear. That counterfeit herbs would bind to the minimum-line water supply and enter the patient roster.","relationship":"Relations. Cooperated with Ryu Eunbi''s healing guild, but kept the brokerage fee ledger private.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: member. Title: medicine brokerage appraiser. An appraisal mismatch stopped the release until the prescription was double-checked.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: member. Title: medicine brokerage appraiser. An appraisal mismatch stopped the release until the prescription was double-checked.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That counterfeit herbs would bind to the minimum-line water supply and enter the patient roster.","relationship":"Relations. Cooperated with Ryu Eunbi''s healing guild, but kept the brokerage fee ledger private.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"They halt shipment when two scales disagree and continued surgery during an outage. Private commission ledgers coexist with an emphasis on appraisal papers.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc31-c218-c6d0","name":"Suwon Baek Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc31-c218-c6d0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":30,"Force":-45,"Material":-25,"Communal":30,"Principle":50,"Public":25,"Eligibility":15,"Dispersed":15,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":0,"Risk":-35,"Display":0,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Medicinal Herb Appraisal Cross-check and Shipment Hold","Affiliation":"White Cross Order","Rank":"Resident","Title":"Medicine Brokerage Appraiser","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness 30 | Force −45 | Materiality −25 | Community 30 | Principle 50 | Transparency 25 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving 0 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −35 | Display 0 | Persistence 30 | Orientation: opposite sex | Bonding: non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2098-03-17. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of medicine brokerage appraiser, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opened with a counterfeit-medicine seal.\n- The herb appraisal reconciliation and shipment hold desk in Jegi-dong is Baek Yeoul''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles, domains, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Resident. Title: Herb Identification Resident. When appraisals disagree, shipment is halted until the double-check of the prescription is finished.","Anecdote":"In 2125, when the power went out during surgery, continued operating by the light of a handheld phone. That day''s record remained as the handover basis for the next shift to verify.","Relationships":"Cooperates with Ryu Eunbi''s healing guild, but does not disclose the brokerage fee ledger.","Ambition":"Separates herb identification results from treatment priority and enters them only in the medical corps ledger.","Fear":"Fears counterfeit herbs being tied to baseline water supply and entering the patient roster.","Intervention":"Can open the original of an appraisal discrepancy, or lift a shipment halt."},"biography":"Weighs herbs on two scales and refuses any deal that balances on only one. Leaves an appraisal certificate rather than loud haggling.\n\n- Livelihood: herb appraisal reconciliation and shipment hold\n- Affiliation: White Cross Order\n- Rank: Resident\n- Title: Medicine Brokerage Appraiser\n**Life.** Born on 2098-03-17. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of medicine brokerage appraiser, continuing the existing duty rosters and records. The succession record of that post opened with a counterfeit-medicine seal.\n- The herb appraisal reconciliation and shipment hold desk in Jegi-dong is Baek Yeoul''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles, domains, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Resident. Title: Herb Identification Resident. When appraisals disagree, shipment is halted until the double-check of the prescription is finished.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, when the power went out during surgery, continued operating by the light of a handheld phone. That day''s record remained as the handover basis for the next shift to verify.\n\n**Relations.** Cooperates with Ryu Eunbi''s healing guild, but does not disclose the brokerage fee ledger.\n\n**Ambition.** Separates herb identification results from treatment priority and enters them only in the medical corps ledger.\n\n**Fear.** Fears counterfeit herbs being tied to baseline water supply and entering the patient roster.\n\n**Intervention.** Can open the original of an appraisal discrepancy, or lift a shipment halt.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness 30 | Force −45 | Materiality −25 | Community 30 | Principle 50 | Transparency 25 | Qualification 15 | Decentralization 15 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −35 | Display 0 | Persistence 30 | Orientation: opposite sex | Bonding: non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0348","name":"백여울","title":"의약 중개 감정인","position":"의약 중개 감정인","characterId":"K347","rank":"수련의","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"약재 감정 대조·출고 보류","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-13#인물-백여울","detailRoute":"/people/person-0348","birthDate":"2098-03-17","birthday":"03-17","age":28,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[{"recipientId":"K322","recipientName":"류은비","basis":"류은비의 치료 길드와 협력하되, 중개 수수료 장부는 공개하지 않는다.","sourceRef":{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-13.json","anchor":"인물-백여울-p5"}}],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"surgical-procedure","name":"수술 수행","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"두 저울을 맞춘다","description":"두 저울이 어긋나면 출고를 멈추고 정전 중 수술을 이어간 기록이 있다. 중개 수수료 비공개는 감정서 중시와 함께 남긴다.","behavior":"약재 무게를 두 저울로 재고, 한 저울만 맞는 거래는 거절한다. 큰소리 흥정보다 감정서를 남긴다. 제기동의 중립 의료국 흰십자단에서 담당 전문의의 도제로 배우며, 적아 구분 없이 중증도만으로 치료한다.","stress":"공포. 가짜 약재가 최저선 급수와 묶여 환자 명부에 들어가는 것.","relationship":"관계. 류은비의 치료 길드와 협력하되, 중개 수수료 장부는 공개하지 않는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 감별 수련의. 감정 불일치는 처방 이중확인이 끝날 때까지 출고를 멈춘다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 감별 수련의. 감정 불일치는 처방 이중확인이 끝날 때까지 출고를 멈춘다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 가짜 약재가 최저선 급수와 묶여 환자 명부에 들어가는 것.","relationship":"관계. 류은비의 치료 길드와 협력하되, 중개 수수료 장부는 공개하지 않는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"두 저울이 어긋나면 출고를 멈추고 정전 중 수술을 이어간 기록이 있다. 중개 수수료 비공개는 감정서 중시와 함께 남긴다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc31-c218-c6d0","name":"수원 백씨","crest":"clan-crests/bc31-c218-c6d0.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":-10,"개방":30,"무력":-45,"물질":-25,"공동":30,"원칙":50,"공개":25,"자격":15,"분산":15,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":0,"위험":-35,"과시":0,"지속":30,"지향":"이성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"약재 감정 대조·출고 보류","소속":"흰십자단","품계":"수련의","직함":"의약 중개 감정인","가치관":"권위 −10 | 개방 30 | 무력 −45 | 물질 −25 | 공동 30 | 원칙 50 | 공개 25 | 자격 15 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 0 | 위험 −35 | 과시 0 | 지속 30 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2098-03-17에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의약 중개 감정인 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 약재 감정 대조·출고 보류 창구가 백여울의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 감별 수련의. 감정 불일치는 처방 이중확인이 끝날 때까지 출고를 멈춘다.","일화":"2125년 수술 중 정전이 되자 손전화 아래에서 칼을 계속했다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.","관계":"류은비의 치료 길드와 협력하되, 중개 수수료 장부는 공개하지 않는다.","야망":"약재 감별 결과를 진료 우선순위와 분리해 의료단 장부에만 올린다.","공포":"가짜 약재가 최저선 급수와 묶여 환자 명부에 들어가는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"감정 불일치의 원본을 열거나, 출고 중지를 풀 수 있다."},"biography":"약재 무게를 두 저울로 재고, 한 저울만 맞는 거래는 거절한다. 큰소리 흥정보다 감정서를 남긴다.\n\n- 생업: 약재 감정 대조·출고 보류\n- 소속: 흰십자단\n- 품계: 수련의\n- 직함: 의약 중개 감정인\n**생애.** 2098-03-17에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 의약 중개 감정인 직무를 맡아 기존 당직과 기록을 잇는다. 그 직무의 승계 기록에는 가짜 약 봉인으로 열렸다.\n- 제기동의 약재 감정 대조·출고 보류 창구가 백여울의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수련의. 직함은 약재 감별 수련의. 감정 불일치는 처방 이중확인이 끝날 때까지 출고를 멈춘다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 수술 중 정전이 되자 손전화 아래에서 칼을 계속했다. 그날의 기록은 다음 당직이 확인할 인계 근거로 남았다.\n\n**관계.** 류은비의 치료 길드와 협력하되, 중개 수수료 장부는 공개하지 않는다.\n\n**야망.** 약재 감별 결과를 진료 우선순위와 분리해 의료단 장부에만 올린다.\n\n**공포.** 가짜 약재가 최저선 급수와 묶여 환자 명부에 들어가는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 감정 불일치의 원본을 열거나, 출고 중지를 풀 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 −10 | 개방 30 | 무력 −45 | 물질 −25 | 공동 30 | 원칙 50 | 공개 25 | 자격 15 | 분산 15 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 0 | 위험 −35 | 과시 0 | 지속 30 | 지향 이성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0349', 'ace0-d55c-c591', '{"id":"person-0349","name":"Go Seojun","title":"Agwansa Gate Commander","position":"Agwansa Commander","characterId":"K348","rank":"Commander","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"Ridge Garrison Commander","gender":"Male","stage":"Key","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#Character-Go-Seojun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0349","birthDate":"2099-07-06","birthday":"07-06","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":13,"effective":13},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"k348-ridge-permits","name":"Ridge-access review","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k348-trait-1","name":"Early controls with joint approval","description":"Tightens access conditions early in response to risk reports.","behavior":"Tightens access conditions early in response to risk reports.","stress":"Places ridge travel under permits when water interruption is rumored.","relationship":"Cannot bypass Tak Seoyun’s approval on war or water.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"He introduced ridge-access permits after rumors of interrupted water purification. His command and Tak Seoyun’s are independently elected and monitor each other; war and water require joint approval. Early action does not grant unilateral authority.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s14","name":{"ko":"Guui Station Directly Managed Land"},"holderPersonId":"K348","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S14","stationRef":{"stationId":"Guui","stationName":"Guui"},"adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null}],"clan":{"id":"ace0-d55c-c591","name":"Hanyang Go Clan","crest":"clan-crests/ace0-d55c-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"Authority":40,"Openness":-20,"Force":50,"Material":10,"Communal":30,"Principle":-10,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":-10,"Dispersed":-30,"Transformative":-20},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":20,"Display":10,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Ridge Garrison Commander","Affiliation":"Russian Legation Command","Rank":"Commander","Title":"Agwansa Commander","Work Location":"Area of Guui 1-dong administrative district. Livelihood: Ridge Defense Captain; the work reference point for water supply postings, passage queues, waybills, exemption screening, testimony, and joint escort signatures at the Guui waiting hall. It does not determine the actual boundaries of the station premises or facilities, nor ownership of the whole dong. Relations. Bae Ujin and escort. Han Jaemok and sluice tactics. It does not determine residence or exact facility boundaries, and grants no new titles, domains, or possession rights."},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Agwansa and the Guui Garrison each choose commanders from their own troops and divide command authority. Go Seojun was elected Agwansa commander after protecting the Hangangjin Bridge Guild''s ridge passage. He co-signs war and water supply orders with Guui Garrison Captain Tak Seoyun and monitors each other''s signatures. The Geondae Koryo-in Corridor lies on the edge of this state, and Han Jaemok''s sluice records mesh with the bridge passage records.\nOffice. Rank: Commander. Title: Agwansa Commander. Livelihood alias: Ridge Defense Captain. War and water supply require the joint approval of both armies'' commanders.\nAnecdote. In the permanent winter cold, when the residual pressure records of Guui''s water pipes and the ridge passage records disagreed, Go Seojun cross-checked the bridge permit roster and verified the water supply records together with Tak Seoyun. After the two commanders'' confirmation, the permit time was transcribed onto Han Jaemok''s sluice gate blackboard.\nClan. Hangangjin Bridge Guild (HP07). Steward. Ridge passage is the clan''s key.\nRelations. Tak Seoyun and dual command. Bae Ujin and escort. Han Jaemok and sluice tactics.\n\n- Livelihood: Ridge Defense Captain\n- Affiliation: Agwansa\n- Rank: Commander\n- Title: Agwansa Commander\n- Work location: Area of Guui 1-dong administrative district. Livelihood: Ridge Defense Captain; the work reference point for water supply postings, passage queues, waybills, exemption screening, testimony, and joint escort signatures at the Guui waiting hall. It does not determine the actual boundaries of the station premises or facilities, nor ownership of the whole dong. Relations. Bae Ujin and escort. Han Jaemok and sluice tactics. It does not determine residence or exact facility boundaries, and grants no new titles, domains, or possession rights.\n\nAgwansa is a weak state in which Agwansa and the Guui Garrison each choose their commanders from their own troops. War and water supply are jointly approved by the two commands, who constantly check each other, and neither side alone can become a strong state."},"biography":"**Life.** Generation of 2126. Agwansa and the Guui Garrison each choose commanders from their own troops and divide command authority. Go Seojun was elected Agwansa commander after protecting the Hangangjin Bridge Guild''s ridge passage. He co-signs war and water supply orders with Guui Garrison Captain Tak Seoyun and monitors each other''s signatures. The Geondae Koryo-in Corridor lies on the edge of this state, and Han Jaemok''s sluice records mesh with the bridge passage records.\nOffice. Rank: Commander. Title: Agwansa Commander. Livelihood alias: Ridge Defense Captain. War and water supply require the joint approval of both armies'' commanders.\nAnecdote. In the permanent winter cold, when the residual pressure records of Guui''s water pipes and the ridge passage records disagreed, Go Seojun cross-checked the bridge permit roster and verified the water supply records together with Tak Seoyun. After the two commanders'' confirmation, the permit time was transcribed onto Han Jaemok''s sluice gate blackboard.\nClan. Hangangjin Bridge Guild (HP07). Steward. Ridge passage is the clan''s key.\nRelations. Tak Seoyun and dual command. Bae Ujin and escort. Han Jaemok and sluice tactics.\n\n- Livelihood: Ridge Defense Captain\n- Affiliation: Agwansa\n- Rank: Commander\n- Title: Agwansa Commander\n- Work location: Area of Guui 1-dong administrative district. Livelihood: Ridge Defense Captain; the work reference point for water supply postings, passage queues, waybills, exemption screening, testimony, and joint escort signatures at the Guui waiting hall. It does not determine the actual boundaries of the station premises or facilities, nor ownership of the whole dong. Relations. Bae Ujin and escort. Han Jaemok and sluice tactics. It does not determine residence or exact facility boundaries, and grants no new titles, domains, or possession rights.\n\nAgwansa is a weak state in which Agwansa and the Guui Garrison each choose their commanders from their own troops. War and water supply are jointly approved by the two commands, who constantly check each other, and neither side alone can become a strong state.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"Tak Seoyun","type":"Command","to":"Go Seojun","basis":"Dual Accord Between the Guui Garrison Captain and the Gate Commander"},{"from":"Mun Hayul","type":"Command","to":"Go Seojun","basis":"Carries out defense orders as a ridge sentry"},{"from":"An Gijun","type":"Command","to":"Go Seojun","basis":"Enforces the passage agreement at the bridge"},{"from":"Gwak Minjae","type":"Rivalry","to":"Go Seojun","basis":"Contests authority over Guui''s restricted water supply"},{"from":"Sim Gaeun","type":"Command","to":"Go Seojun","basis":"Reports bridge scouting directly to the captain"},{"from":"I Yunseo","type":"Rivalry","to":"Go Seojun","basis":"Competes over ridge reconnaissance and bridge passage"},{"from":"Sin Jong-mok","type":"Command","to":"Go Seojun","basis":"Under Agwansa Gate Commander Go Seojun"},{"from":"Ma Gilsang","type":"Rivalry","to":"Go Seojun","basis":"competes with Go Seojun''s ridge reconnaissance over passage coordinates"},{"from":"Pan Cho-dam","type":"Command","to":"Go Seojun","basis":"Obeys Go Seojun''s wartime command but refuses concealed power distribution"},{"from":"Mae Seo-dam","type":"Oath","to":"Go Seojun","basis":"Overlaps Go Seojun''s bridge permits and testimony,"},{"from":"Geun Ba-reum","type":"Contract","to":"Go Seojun","basis":"Keeps only Go Seojun''s joint-rule seal as the key to the auxiliary lockbox"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0349","name":"고서준","title":"아관사 관문사령관","position":"아관사 사령관","characterId":"K348","rank":"사령관","commonTier":"T1","occupation":"능선수비대장","gender":"남성","stage":"주요","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-고서준","detailRoute":"/people/person-0349","birthDate":"2099-07-06","birthday":"07-06","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":13,"effective":13},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"k348-ridge-permits","name":"능선 통행 심사","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"k348-trait-1","name":"먼저 막고 함께 승인","description":"위험 소문에 통행 조건을 먼저 강화한다.","behavior":"위험 소문에 통행 조건을 먼저 강화한다.","stress":"정수 중단 소문이 돌면 능선 통행을 허가제로 묶는다.","relationship":"탁서윤의 결재를 건너뛰어 전쟁·급수를 결정할 수 없다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"정수 중단 소문이 돌자 능선 통행을 허가제로 바꾸었다. 고서준과 탁서윤의 지휘부는 별도로 선출되어 서로를 감시하며 전쟁과 급수는 공동 승인을 거친다. 선제 대응이 단독 결정권을 뜻하지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:capital-s14","name":{"ko":"구의역 직영지"},"holderPersonId":"K348","directLiegePersonId":null,"stateId":"S14","stationRef":{"stationId":"구의","stationName":"구의"},"adminRefs":[],"geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":null}],"clan":{"id":"ace0-d55c-c591","name":"한양 고씨","crest":"clan-crests/ace0-d55c-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","locked":true,"values":{"권위":40,"개방":-20,"무력":50,"물질":10,"공동":30,"원칙":-10,"공개":-10,"자격":-10,"분산":-30,"변혁":-20},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":30,"위험":20,"과시":10,"지속":20,"지향":"이성","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"능선수비대장","소속":"아관사","품계":"사령관","직함":"아관사 사령관","업무 위치":"구의1동 행정동 범위. 생업: 능선수비대장; 구의 대합실의 급수 게시·통행 대기·송장·면제 심사·증언·공동호송 서명의 근무 기준점이다. 역점·시설 실제 경계나 동 전체 소유를 확정하지 않는다. 관계. 배우진과 호위. 한재목과 수문 전술. 거주지나 정확한 시설 경계를 확정하지 않으며 새 작위·영지·점유권을 부여하지 않는다."},"sections":{"생애":"2126년 세대. 아관사와 구의수비대는 각자의 병력에서 지휘관을 뽑고 지휘권을 나눈다. 고서준은 한강진교량공회의 능선 통행을 지킨 뒤 아관사 사령관으로 선출되었다. 구의수비대장 탁서윤과 전쟁·급수 명령에 함께 결재하고 서로의 결재를 감시한다. 건대 고려인 회랑은 이 나라의 가장자리에 있고 한재목의 수문 기록은 교량 통행 기록과 맞물린다.\n관직. 품계 사령관. 직함은 아관사 사령관. 생업 별명은 능선수비대장. 전쟁과 급수에는 양군 지휘관의 공동 승인이 필요하다.\n일화. 영구 겨울 추위에 구의 급수관 잔압 기록과 능선 통행 기록이 어긋나자 고서준은 교량 허가 명부를 대조하고 탁서윤과 급수 기록을 함께 확인하였다. 두 지휘관의 확인 뒤 허가 시각이 한재목의 수문 칠판에 옮겨졌다.\n가문. 한강진교량공회(HP07). 관리인. 능선 통행이 가문의 키다.\n관계. 탁서윤과 이원 지휘. 배우진과 호위. 한재목과 수문 전술.\n\n- 생업: 능선수비대장\n- 소속: 아관사\n- 품계: 사령관\n- 직함: 아관사 사령관\n- 업무 위치: 구의1동 행정동 범위. 생업: 능선수비대장; 구의 대합실의 급수 게시·통행 대기·송장·면제 심사·증언·공동호송 서명의 근무 기준점이다. 역점·시설 실제 경계나 동 전체 소유를 확정하지 않는다. 관계. 배우진과 호위. 한재목과 수문 전술. 거주지나 정확한 시설 경계를 확정하지 않으며 새 작위·영지·점유권을 부여하지 않는다.\n\n아관사는 아관사와 구의수비대가 각자 자기 병력에서 지휘관을 뽑는 약국이다. 전쟁과 급수는 두 지휘부가 함께 승인하고 서로를 상시 견제하며, 어느 한쪽도 단독으로 강국이 될 수 없다."},"biography":"**생애.** 2126년 세대. 아관사와 구의수비대는 각자의 병력에서 지휘관을 뽑고 지휘권을 나눈다. 고서준은 한강진교량공회의 능선 통행을 지킨 뒤 아관사 사령관으로 선출되었다. 구의수비대장 탁서윤과 전쟁·급수 명령에 함께 결재하고 서로의 결재를 감시한다. 건대 고려인 회랑은 이 나라의 가장자리에 있고 한재목의 수문 기록은 교량 통행 기록과 맞물린다.\n관직. 품계 사령관. 직함은 아관사 사령관. 생업 별명은 능선수비대장. 전쟁과 급수에는 양군 지휘관의 공동 승인이 필요하다.\n일화. 영구 겨울 추위에 구의 급수관 잔압 기록과 능선 통행 기록이 어긋나자 고서준은 교량 허가 명부를 대조하고 탁서윤과 급수 기록을 함께 확인하였다. 두 지휘관의 확인 뒤 허가 시각이 한재목의 수문 칠판에 옮겨졌다.\n가문. 한강진교량공회(HP07). 관리인. 능선 통행이 가문의 키다.\n관계. 탁서윤과 이원 지휘. 배우진과 호위. 한재목과 수문 전술.\n\n- 생업: 능선수비대장\n- 소속: 아관사\n- 품계: 사령관\n- 직함: 아관사 사령관\n- 업무 위치: 구의1동 행정동 범위. 생업: 능선수비대장; 구의 대합실의 급수 게시·통행 대기·송장·면제 심사·증언·공동호송 서명의 근무 기준점이다. 역점·시설 실제 경계나 동 전체 소유를 확정하지 않는다. 관계. 배우진과 호위. 한재목과 수문 전술. 거주지나 정확한 시설 경계를 확정하지 않으며 새 작위·영지·점유권을 부여하지 않는다.\n\n아관사는 아관사와 구의수비대가 각자 자기 병력에서 지휘관을 뽑는 약국이다. 전쟁과 급수는 두 지휘부가 함께 승인하고 서로를 상시 견제하며, 어느 한쪽도 단독으로 강국이 될 수 없다.","relations":{"outgoing":[],"incoming":[{"from":"탁서윤","type":"지휘","to":"고서준","basis":"구의수비대장과 관문사령관의 이원 합의"},{"from":"문하율","type":"지휘","to":"고서준","basis":"능선 초병으로 수비 명령을 수행"},{"from":"안기준","type":"지휘","to":"고서준","basis":"통행 협약을 교량에서 집행"},{"from":"곽민재","type":"경쟁","to":"고서준","basis":"구의 제한급수 권한을 다툼"},{"from":"심가은","type":"지휘","to":"고서준","basis":"교량 척후를 대장에게 직보"},{"from":"이윤서","type":"경쟁","to":"고서준","basis":"능선 정찰과 교량 통행을 겨룸"},{"from":"신종목","type":"지휘","to":"고서준","basis":"아관사 관문사령관 고서준의 산하"},{"from":"마길상","type":"경쟁","to":"고서준","basis":"고서준의 능선 정찰과 통행 좌표를 경쟁하며"},{"from":"판초담","type":"지휘","to":"고서준","basis":"고서준의 전시 지휘에는 복종하되 은폐 배전은 거부한다"},{"from":"매서담","type":"맹세","to":"고서준","basis":"고서준의 교량 허가와 증언을 겹치고"},{"from":"근바름","type":"계약","to":"고서준","basis":"고서준의 공동통치 날인만 보조 함의 열쇠로 둔다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0350', 'bb38-b0a8-d3c9-6587', '{"id":"person-0350","name":"Mun Hayul","title":"Ridge Sentry","position":"The Government Ridge Sentry","characterId":"K349","rank":"Sergeant","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Beacon and Whistle Blocking and Incident Report","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#Character-Mun-Hayul","detailRoute":"/people/person-0350","birthDate":"2091-11-19","birthday":"11-19","age":35,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"shift-condition-negotiation","name":"Shift condition negotiation","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Reports before nationality","description":"Lights are reported before nationality and an overnight crew negotiation opened a shift. Independent closure is an ambition, not proof of eliminating command delays.","behavior":"Direct, he hated meeting rooms more than mountain wind. A light he had seen once he reported before its nationality.","stress":"Fear. That the hill would be pierced and the Guui purification works and the eastern bridges would open on the same night.","relationship":"Relations. Carried out Go Seojun''s defense orders at the front line, read Gwak Minjae''s water inspections as a watch gap, and heard Bae Woojin''s guardianship offer before Go Seojun did.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: ridge sentry. He blocked first with beacon and whistle and took after-approval from Go Seojun. He kept no peacetime joint-approval papers at the outpost.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: ridge sentry. He blocked first with beacon and whistle and took after-approval from Go Seojun. He kept no peacetime joint-approval papers at the outpost.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the hill would be pierced and the Guui purification works and the eastern bridges would open on the same night.","relationship":"Relations. Carried out Go Seojun''s defense orders at the front line, read Gwak Minjae''s water inspections as a watch gap, and heard Bae Woojin''s guardianship offer before Go Seojun did.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Lights are reported before nationality and an overnight crew negotiation opened a shift. Independent closure is an ambition, not proof of eliminating command delays.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bb38-b0a8-d3c9-6587","name":"Nampyeong Mun Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bb38-b0a8-d3c9-6587.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":45,"Openness":-25,"Force":40,"Material":0,"Communal":15,"Principle":-5,"Public":0,"Eligibility":-20,"Dispersed":-30,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":0,"Risk":-30,"Display":-20,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Monogamy"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Beacon and Whistle Blocking and Incident Report","Affiliation":"Russian Legation Command","Rank":"Sergeant","Title":"The Government Ridge Sentry","Values":"Authority 45 | Openness −25 | Force 40 | Material 0 | Communal 15 | Principle −5 | Publicity 0 | Qualification −20 | Dispersion −30 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving 15 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −30 | Display −20 | Endurance 35 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Monogamous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2091-11-19. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of The Government Ridge Sentry and carries on the records of beacon fires, whistle blockades, and incident reports. The prior selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The beacon fire, whistle blockade, and incident report window of Guui 2-dong is Mun Hayul''s duty reference point. This duty reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, peerage, fief, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Sergeant. Title: The Government Ridge Sentry. Handles the records of beacon fires, whistle blockades, and incident reports, and watch handovers, within the scope of the current post.","Anecdote":"In 2125, spent the night negotiating terms with the slowdown work crew and opened the next shift. The records left that day became the handover basis for the next watch to cross-check.","Relationships":"Carries out Go Seojun''s defense orders at the front line, regards Gwak Minjae''s water supply inspections as a gap in surveillance, and hears Bae Ujin''s patronage offer before Go Seojun does.","Ambition":"In the post of The Government Ridge Sentry, Mun Hayul seeks to make the records of beacon fires, whistle blockades, and incident reports mesh with the public handover table.","Fear":"Fears that gaps in the records of the Government Ridge Sentry watch will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.","Intervention":"Can correct a mistaken beacon fire, or use a sentry''s unilateral blockade as evidence of one side''s expanding command authority. By cross-checking Mun Hayul''s ledger of beacon fires, whistle blockades, and incident reports, can establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Mun Hayul is The Government figure practiced in the records of beacon fires, whistle blockades, and incident reports. Blunt, and dislikes meeting rooms even more than mountain winds. A light once seen is reported before its nationality.\n\n- Occupation: Beacon fires, whistle blockades, and incident reports\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Sergeant\n- Title: The Government Ridge Sentry\n**Life.** Born on 2091-11-19. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of The Government Ridge Sentry and carries on the records of beacon fires, whistle blockades, and incident reports. The prior selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The beacon fire, whistle blockade, and incident report window of Guui 2-dong is Mun Hayul''s duty reference point. This duty reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, peerage, fief, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Sergeant. Title: The Government Ridge Sentry. Handles the records of beacon fires, whistle blockades, and incident reports, and watch handovers, within the scope of the current post.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, spent the night negotiating terms with the slowdown work crew and opened the next shift. The records left that day became the handover basis for the next watch to cross-check.\n\n**Relationships.** Carries out Go Seojun''s defense orders at the front line, regards Gwak Minjae''s water supply inspections as a gap in surveillance, and hears Bae Ujin''s patronage offer before Go Seojun does.\n\n**Ambition.** In the post of The Government Ridge Sentry, Mun Hayul seeks to make the records of beacon fires, whistle blockades, and incident reports mesh with the public handover table.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that gaps in the records of the Government Ridge Sentry watch will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.\n\n**Intervention.** Can correct a mistaken beacon fire, or use a sentry''s unilateral blockade as evidence of one side''s expanding command authority. By cross-checking Mun Hayul''s ledger of beacon fires, whistle blockades, and incident reports, can establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 45 | Openness −25 | Force 40 | Material 0 | Communal 15 | Principle −5 | Publicity 0 | Qualification −20 | Dispersion −30 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Monopoly 0 | Risk −30 | Display −20 | Endurance 35 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding Monogamous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Mun Hayul","type":"Command","to":"Go Seojun","basis":"Carries out defense orders as a ridge sentry"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Seon Soru","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Hayul","basis":"Adjusts opening and closing times to fit Mun Hayul''s ridge surveillance schedule"},{"from":"Pan Neulsaem","type":"Command","to":"Mun Hayul","basis":"Patrols the ridge under Mun Hayul''s command,"},{"from":"Seon Neul-bom","type":"Command","to":"Mun Hayul","basis":"enforces Mun Hayul''s sentry orders at the base, and"},{"from":"Chang Ji-an","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Hayul","basis":"divides the crowd lines with Mun Hayul''s post watch"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0350","name":"문하율","title":"능선 초병","position":"정부 능선 초병","characterId":"K349","rank":"병장","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"봉화·호각 차단·경위 보고","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-문하율","detailRoute":"/people/person-0350","birthDate":"2091-11-19","birthday":"11-19","age":35,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":6,"effective":6}},"skills":[{"id":"shift-condition-negotiation","name":"교대 조건 협의","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"보고는 국적보다 먼저","description":"불빛을 먼저 보고하고 태업 작업반과 밤새 조건을 나눴다. 독자 차단 야망은 있으나 지휘 지연을 없앴다는 성과는 없다.","behavior":"직선적이고 산바람보다 회의실을 싫어한다. 한 번 본 불빛은 국적보다 먼저 보고한다.","stress":"공포. 고지가 뚫려 구의 정수와 동부 교량이 같은 밤에 열리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 고서준의 수비 명령을 최전에서 수행하고, 곽민재의 급수 점검을 감시 공백으로 여기며, 배우진의 후견 제의를 고서준보다 먼저 듣는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 병장. 직함은 정부 능선 초병. 봉화와 호각으로 먼저 막고 차단 경위를 양군에 보고한다. 전쟁·급수 공동승인 문서를 초소 당직 원장에도 남긴다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 병장. 직함은 정부 능선 초병. 봉화와 호각으로 먼저 막고 차단 경위를 양군에 보고한다. 전쟁·급수 공동승인 문서를 초소 당직 원장에도 남긴다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 고지가 뚫려 구의 정수와 동부 교량이 같은 밤에 열리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 고서준의 수비 명령을 최전에서 수행하고, 곽민재의 급수 점검을 감시 공백으로 여기며, 배우진의 후견 제의를 고서준보다 먼저 듣는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"불빛을 먼저 보고하고 태업 작업반과 밤새 조건을 나눴다. 독자 차단 야망은 있으나 지휘 지연을 없앴다는 성과는 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bb38-b0a8-d3c9-6587","name":"남평 문씨","crest":"clan-crests/bb38-b0a8-d3c9-6587.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":45,"개방":-25,"무력":40,"물질":0,"공동":15,"원칙":-5,"공개":0,"자격":-20,"분산":-30,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":15,"독점":0,"위험":-30,"과시":-20,"지속":35,"지향":"유동","결합":"단혼"},"fields":{"생업":"봉화·호각 차단·경위 보고","소속":"아관사","품계":"병장","직함":"정부 능선 초병","가치관":"권위 45 | 개방 −25 | 무력 40 | 물질 0 | 공동 15 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 0 | 자격 −20 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 15 | 독점 0 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −20 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼"},"sections":{"생애":"2091-11-19에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 정부 능선 초병 직무를 맡아 봉화·호각 차단·경위 보고 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의2동의 봉화·호각 차단·경위 보고 창구가 문하율의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 병장. 직함은 정부 능선 초병. 봉화·호각 차단·경위 보고 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.","일화":"2125년 태업 작업반과 밤새 조건을 나눠 다음 교대를 열었다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.","관계":"고서준의 수비 명령을 최전에서 수행하고, 곽민재의 급수 점검을 감시 공백으로 여기며, 배우진의 후견 제의를 고서준보다 먼저 듣는다.","야망":"문하율은 정부 능선 초병 직무에서 봉화·호각 차단·경위 보고 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.","공포":"정부 능선 초병 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"오인 봉화를 정정하거나, 초병의 단독 차단을 일방의 지휘권 확대의 증거로 이용할 수 있다. 문하율의 봉화·호각 차단·경위 보고 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"문하율은 봉화·호각 차단·경위 보고 기록을 손에 익힌 정부 인물이다. 직선적이고 산바람보다 회의실을 싫어한다. 한 번 본 불빛은 국적보다 먼저 보고한다.\n\n- 생업: 봉화·호각 차단·경위 보고\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 병장\n- 직함: 정부 능선 초병\n**생애.** 2091-11-19에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 정부 능선 초병 직무를 맡아 봉화·호각 차단·경위 보고 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의2동의 봉화·호각 차단·경위 보고 창구가 문하율의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 병장. 직함은 정부 능선 초병. 봉화·호각 차단·경위 보고 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 태업 작업반과 밤새 조건을 나눠 다음 교대를 열었다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.\n\n**관계.** 고서준의 수비 명령을 최전에서 수행하고, 곽민재의 급수 점검을 감시 공백으로 여기며, 배우진의 후견 제의를 고서준보다 먼저 듣는다.\n\n**야망.** 문하율은 정부 능선 초병 직무에서 봉화·호각 차단·경위 보고 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 정부 능선 초병 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 오인 봉화를 정정하거나, 초병의 단독 차단을 일방의 지휘권 확대의 증거로 이용할 수 있다. 문하율의 봉화·호각 차단·경위 보고 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 45 | 개방 −25 | 무력 40 | 물질 0 | 공동 15 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 0 | 자격 −20 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 15 | 독점 0 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −20 | 지속 35 | 지향 유동 | 결합 단혼\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"문하율","type":"지휘","to":"고서준","basis":"능선 초병으로 수비 명령을 수행"}],"incoming":[{"from":"선솔우","type":"계약","to":"문하율","basis":"문하율의 능선 감시 일정에 맞춰 개폐 시각을 조정한다"},{"from":"판늘샘","type":"지휘","to":"문하율","basis":"문하율의 지휘로 능선을 돌고"},{"from":"선늘봄","type":"지휘","to":"문하율","basis":"문하율의 초병 명령을 기지에서 집행하고"},{"from":"창지안","type":"계약","to":"문하율","basis":"문하율의 초소 당직과 인파 줄을 나누고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0351', 'c548-c21c-d765', '{"id":"person-0351","name":"An Gijun","title":"Bridge Supervisor","position":"Agwansa Bridge Supervisor","characterId":"K350","rank":"Company Commander","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Pier Crack, Transit Weight Disclosure, and Double Seal Verification","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#inmul-an-gijun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0351","birthDate":"2100-05-17","birthday":"05-17","age":26,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":9,"effective":9}},"skills":[{"id":"bridge-inspection","name":"Bridge inspection","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Rejects unsupported closure","description":"Cracks and weights are published; an armed intruder was restrained for roster review. Bridge verification and limited restraint are supported, not large-scale battle.","behavior":"He trusted an inspection hammer more than a contract, but saw a baseless blockade as a waste of troops. He remembered pier cracks the way he remembered people''s names.","stress":"Fear. That the bridges would pass to the water-supply escort under a protection-government pretext.","relationship":"Relations. Executed the passage treaty of Go Seojun and Jang Sehwa at the bridge, verified Sim Gaeun''s reconnaissance reports, and passed Nam Hoseong''s medical convoy through first.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: company commander. Title: bridge supervisor. He published the pier cracks and passage weights daily and demanded the double stamp of Go Seojun and the water engineers'' council for military passage.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: company commander. Title: bridge supervisor. He published the pier cracks and passage weights daily and demanded the double stamp of Go Seojun and the water engineers'' council for military passage.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the bridges would pass to the water-supply escort under a protection-government pretext.","relationship":"Relations. Executed the passage treaty of Go Seojun and Jang Sehwa at the bridge, verified Sim Gaeun''s reconnaissance reports, and passed Nam Hoseong''s medical convoy through first.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Cracks and weights are published; an armed intruder was restrained for roster review. Bridge verification and limited restraint are supported, not large-scale battle.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c548-c21c-d765","name":"Sunheung An Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c548-c21c-d765.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":45,"Openness":-25,"Force":35,"Material":15,"Communal":30,"Principle":0,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":-10,"Dispersed":-25,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":-35,"Risk":30,"Display":-10,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Pier Crack, Transit Weight Disclosure, and Double Seal Verification","Affiliation":"Russian Legation Command","Rank":"Company Commander","Title":"Agwansa Bridge Supervisor","Values":"Authority 45 | Openness −25 | Force 35 | Material 15 | Communal 30 | Principle 0 | Publicity −15 | Qualification −10 | Dispersion −25 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving 10 | Monopoly −35 | Risk 30 | Display −10 | Persistence 30 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2100-05-17. As of the 2126 opening, he holds the post of The Government Bridge Overseer and carries on the records of pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification. The earlier history of how the post was filled and handed over is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The Guui 3-dong desk for pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification is An Gijun''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or rights of possession.","Offices":"Rank: Company Commander. Title: The Government Bridge Overseer. He handles the records of pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification, along with duty handovers, within the scope of his current post.","Anecdote":"In 2125 he stopped an armed intruder outside the door and opened a re-check of the roster. The records left from that day became the handover evidence for the next duty shift to collate.","Relationships":"He enforces the passage agreement between Go Seojun and Jang Sehwa at the bridge, verifies Sim Gaeun''s scout reports, and gives Nam Hoseong''s medical convoys priority passage.","Ambition":"In his post as The Government Bridge Overseer, An Gijun intends to mesh the records of pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification with the public handover table.","Fear":"He fears that gaps in the Government Bridge Overseer duty record will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.","Intervention":"He can prove the cause of the damage from the pier side, or refuse to hand over the bridge keys without the joint approval of both armies. By collating An Gijun''s ledger of pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification, he can establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"An Gijun is The Government figure practiced in the records of pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification. He trusts an inspection hammer more than a contract, but regards a blockade without grounds as a waste of troops. He remembers pier cracks the way one remembers people''s names.\n\n- Occupation: pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Company Commander\n- Title: The Government Bridge Overseer\n**Life.** Born on 2100-05-17. As of the 2126 opening, he holds the post of The Government Bridge Overseer and carries on the records of pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification. The earlier history of how the post was filled and handed over is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The Guui 3-dong desk for pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification is An Gijun''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or rights of possession.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Company Commander. Title: The Government Bridge Overseer. He handles the records of pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification, along with duty handovers, within the scope of his current post.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125 he stopped an armed intruder outside the door and opened a re-check of the roster. The records left from that day became the handover evidence for the next duty shift to collate.\n\n**Relations.** He enforces the passage agreement between Go Seojun and Jang Sehwa at the bridge, verifies Sim Gaeun''s scout reports, and gives Nam Hoseong''s medical convoys priority passage.\n\n**Ambition.** In his post as The Government Bridge Overseer, An Gijun intends to mesh the records of pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification with the public handover table.\n\n**Fear.** He fears that gaps in the Government Bridge Overseer duty record will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.\n\n**Intervention.** He can prove the cause of the damage from the pier side, or refuse to hand over the bridge keys without the joint approval of both armies. By collating An Gijun''s ledger of pier cracks, traffic weight disclosure, and double-seal verification, he can establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 45 | Openness −25 | Force 35 | Material 15 | Communal 30 | Principle 0 | Publicity −15 | Qualification −10 | Dispersal −25 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly −35 | Risk 30 | Display −10 | Persistence 30 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"An Gijun","type":"Command","to":"Go Seojun","basis":"Enforces the passage agreement at the bridge"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Won Yena","type":"Command","to":"An Gijun","basis":"is a contract that enforces An Gijun''s bridge schedule in cargo order,"},{"from":"Dong Saebom","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"An Gijun","basis":"writes the names of An Gijun''s pier cracks in the margin of the original plate,"},{"from":"Su Ji-wan","type":"Contract","to":"An Gijun","basis":"copies An Gijun''s bridge schedule onto the platform chalkboard, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0351","name":"안기준","title":"교량 감독","position":"정부 교량 감독","characterId":"K350","rank":"중대장","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-안기준","detailRoute":"/people/person-0351","birthDate":"2100-05-17","birthday":"05-17","age":26,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":9,"effective":9}},"skills":[{"id":"bridge-inspection","name":"교량 점검","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"근거 없는 봉쇄를 싫어한다","description":"균열과 무게를 공개하며 무장 난입자를 붙들어 명부를 재점검했다. 교량 검증과 제한된 현장 제압은 보이나 대규모 전투는 없다.","behavior":"점검 해머를 계약서보다 믿지만, 근거 없는 봉쇄는 병력 낭비라고 본다. 교각 균열을 사람 이름처럼 기억한다.","stress":"공포. 교량이 일방의 군령으로 상수호위단에 넘어가는 것.","relationship":"관계. 고서준과 장세화의 통행 협약을 교량에서 집행하고, 심가은의 척후 보고를 검증하며, 남호성의 의무호송을 우선 통과시킨다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 중대장. 직함은 정부 교량 감독. 교각 균열과 통행 무게를 매일 공개하고, 군 통행은 아관사와 구의수비대의 이중 날인을 요구한다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 중대장. 직함은 정부 교량 감독. 교각 균열과 통행 무게를 매일 공개하고, 군 통행은 아관사와 구의수비대의 이중 날인을 요구한다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 교량이 일방의 군령으로 상수호위단에 넘어가는 것.","relationship":"관계. 고서준과 장세화의 통행 협약을 교량에서 집행하고, 심가은의 척후 보고를 검증하며, 남호성의 의무호송을 우선 통과시킨다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"균열과 무게를 공개하며 무장 난입자를 붙들어 명부를 재점검했다. 교량 검증과 제한된 현장 제압은 보이나 대규모 전투는 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c548-c21c-d765","name":"순흥 안씨","crest":"clan-crests/c548-c21c-d765.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":45,"개방":-25,"무력":35,"물질":15,"공동":30,"원칙":0,"공개":-15,"자격":-10,"분산":-25,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":-35,"위험":30,"과시":-10,"지속":30,"지향":"유동","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인","소속":"아관사","품계":"중대장","직함":"정부 교량 감독","가치관":"권위 45 | 개방 −25 | 무력 35 | 물질 15 | 공동 30 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −15 | 자격 −10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 −35 | 위험 30 | 과시 −10 | 지속 30 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2100-05-17에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 정부 교량 감독 직무를 맡아 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 창구가 안기준의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 중대장. 직함은 정부 교량 감독. 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.","일화":"2125년 무장 난입자를 문 밖에서 붙들어 명부 재점검을 열었다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.","관계":"고서준과 장세화의 통행 협약을 교량에서 집행하고, 심가은의 척후 보고를 검증하며, 남호성의 의무호송을 우선 통과시킨다.","야망":"안기준은 정부 교량 감독 직무에서 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.","공포":"정부 교량 감독 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"파손 원인을 교각 쪽에서 증명하거나, 교량 열쇠를 양군의 공동 승인 없이는 넘기지 않는다. 안기준의 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"안기준은 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 기록을 손에 익힌 정부 인물이다. 점검 해머를 계약서보다 믿지만, 근거 없는 봉쇄는 병력 낭비라고 본다. 교각 균열을 사람 이름처럼 기억한다.\n\n- 생업: 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 중대장\n- 직함: 정부 교량 감독\n**생애.** 2100-05-17에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 정부 교량 감독 직무를 맡아 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 창구가 안기준의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 중대장. 직함은 정부 교량 감독. 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 무장 난입자를 문 밖에서 붙들어 명부 재점검을 열었다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.\n\n**관계.** 고서준과 장세화의 통행 협약을 교량에서 집행하고, 심가은의 척후 보고를 검증하며, 남호성의 의무호송을 우선 통과시킨다.\n\n**야망.** 안기준은 정부 교량 감독 직무에서 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 정부 교량 감독 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 파손 원인을 교각 쪽에서 증명하거나, 교량 열쇠를 양군의 공동 승인 없이는 넘기지 않는다. 안기준의 교각 균열·통행 무게 공개·이중 날인 확인 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 45 | 개방 −25 | 무력 35 | 물질 15 | 공동 30 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −15 | 자격 −10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 −35 | 위험 30 | 과시 −10 | 지속 30 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"안기준","type":"지휘","to":"고서준","basis":"통행 협약을 교량에서 집행"}],"incoming":[{"from":"원예나","type":"지휘","to":"안기준","basis":"안기준의 교량 일정을 화물 순서로 집행하는 계약이고"},{"from":"동새봄","type":"신도","to":"안기준","basis":"안기준의 교각 균열 이름을 원판 여백에 적는다"},{"from":"수지완","type":"계약","to":"안기준","basis":"안기준의 교량 일정을 승강장 칠판에 옮기고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0352', 'd558-c9c4-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0352","name":"Ha Yunmok","title":"Gate Tax Collector","position":"Joint Forces Gate Tax Collector","characterId":"K351","rank":"Joint Staff Officer","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Inspection of Transit Goods, Water Supply Schedule Ledger, and Exemption Passes","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#person-ha-yunmok","detailRoute":"/people/person-0352","birthDate":"2099-11-21","birthday":"11-21","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"transit-tax-calculation","name":"Transit tax calculation","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Wary of blank exemptions","description":"Cargo and water times share a ledger; private requests go to the public desk. Tax administration and negotiating goals do not become military authority.","behavior":"He liked numbers and stamps and remembered officers who shaved headcounts by force as an insult. He read empty exemption columns as danger signals.","stress":"Fear. That the customs officer would sink into a protection-money collector and be excluded from Jeong Yura''s standard treaty.","relationship":"Relations. Sought to put Jeong Yura''s loss-compensation clause into the tariff, refused Bae Woojin''s protection-tax demand, and linked Ra Seyoung''s quarantine stamps to the toll arithmetic.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: gate customs officer. He wrote the passage items and the water-supply hours in the same ledger and honored military exemptions only with passage permits bearing an audit clause.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: gate customs officer. He wrote the passage items and the water-supply hours in the same ledger and honored military exemptions only with passage permits bearing an audit clause.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the customs officer would sink into a protection-money collector and be excluded from Jeong Yura''s standard treaty.","relationship":"Relations. Sought to put Jeong Yura''s loss-compensation clause into the tariff, refused Bae Woojin''s protection-tax demand, and linked Ra Seyoung''s quarantine stamps to the toll arithmetic.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Cargo and water times share a ledger; private requests go to the public desk. Tax administration and negotiating goals do not become military authority.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d558-c9c4-c8fc","name":"Jinju Ha Clan","crest":"clan-crests/d558-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":45,"Openness":-10,"Force":35,"Material":5,"Communal":25,"Principle":-5,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":0,"Dispersed":-20,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":-5,"Monopoly":-20,"Risk":0,"Display":-30,"Sustained":-5,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Inspection of Transit Goods, Water Supply Schedule Ledger, and Exemption Passes","Affiliation":"The Government Joint Two-Army Working Group","Rank":"Joint Staff Officer","Title":"Joint Forces Gate Tax Collector","Values":"Authority 45 | Openness −10 | Force 35 | Material 5 | Communal 25 | Principle −5 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 0 | Dispersal −20 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving −5 | Monopoly −20 | Risk 0 | Display −30 | Persistence −5 | Orientation None | Bonding Plural"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2099-11-21. As of the 2126 opening, he holds the post of Two-Army Gate Tax Collector and carries on the records of passing goods, water supply time ledgers, and exemption pass inspection. The earlier history of how the post was filled and handed over is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The Guui 1-dong desk for passing goods, water supply time ledgers, and exemption pass inspection is Ha Yunmok''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or rights of possession.","Offices":"Rank: Joint Working Officer. Title: Two-Army Gate Tax Collector. He handles the records of passing goods, water supply time ledgers, and exemption pass inspection, along with duty handovers, within the scope of his current post.","Anecdote":"In 2125 he turned away a private solicitation and sent it to the public desk. The records left from that day became the handover evidence for the next duty shift to collate.","Relationships":"He seeks to build Jeong Yura''s loss-compensation clause into the tax rate, rejects Bae Ujin''s protection-tax demand, and ties Ra Seyeong''s quarantine seal to the tax calculation.","Ambition":"In his post as Two-Army Gate Tax Collector, Ha Yunmok intends to mesh the records of passing goods, water supply time ledgers, and exemption pass inspection with the public handover table.","Fear":"He fears that gaps in the Two-Army Gate Tax Collector duty record will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.","Intervention":"He can identify the authentic copy of an exemption document, or carry the gate ledger into the Suseo agreement draft. By collating Ha Yunmok''s ledger of passing goods, water supply time ledgers, and exemption pass inspection, he can establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Ha Yunmok is The Government Joint Two-Army Working Group figure practiced in the records of passing goods, water supply time ledgers, and exemption pass inspection. He likes numbers and seals, and remembers officers who cut taxes by force as an insult. He sees a blank exemption field as a warning sign.\n\n- Occupation: passing goods, water supply time ledgers, and exemption pass inspection\n- Affiliation: The Government Joint Two-Army Working Group\n- Rank: Joint Working Officer\n- Title: Two-Army Gate Tax Collector\n**Life.** Born on 2099-11-21. As of the 2126 opening, he holds the post of Two-Army Gate Tax Collector and carries on the records of passing goods, water supply time ledgers, and exemption pass inspection. The earlier history of how the post was filled and handed over is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The Guui 1-dong desk for passing goods, water supply time ledgers, and exemption pass inspection is Ha Yunmok''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or rights of possession.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Joint Working Officer. Title: Two-Army Gate Tax Collector. He handles the records of passing goods, water supply time ledgers, and exemption pass inspection, along with duty handovers, within the scope of his current post.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125 he turned away a private solicitation and sent it to the public desk. The records left from that day became the handover evidence for the next duty shift to collate.\n\n**Relations.** He seeks to build Jeong Yura''s loss-compensation clause into the tax rate, rejects Bae Ujin''s protection-tax demand, and ties Ra Seyeong''s quarantine seal to the tax calculation.\n\n**Ambition.** In his post as Two-Army Gate Tax Collector, Ha Yunmok intends to mesh the records of passing goods, water supply time ledgers, and exemption pass inspection with the public handover table.\n\n**Fear.** He fears that gaps in the Two-Army Gate Tax Collector duty record will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.\n\n**Intervention.** He can identify the authentic copy of an exemption document, or carry the gate ledger into the Suseo agreement draft. By collating Ha Yunmok''s ledger of passing goods, water supply time ledgers, and exemption pass inspection, he can establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 45 | Openness −10 | Force 35 | Material 5 | Communal 25 | Principle −5 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 0 | Dispersal −20 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving −5 | Monopoly −20 | Risk 0 | Display −30 | Persistence −5 | Orientation None | Bonding Plural\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ha Yunmok","type":"Contract","to":"Jeong Yura","basis":"seeks to build the loss-compensation clause into the gate tax rate"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Cheon Choyun","type":"Command","to":"Ha Yunmok","basis":"takes orders to carry Ha Yunmok''s gate ledger only under seal,"},{"from":"Bang Ma-reum","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Ha Yunmok","basis":"is a priest who transfers Ha Yunmok''s tax calculations into the ledger"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0352","name":"하윤목","title":"관문 세리","position":"양군 관문 세리","characterId":"K351","rank":"공동실무원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"통과 품목·급수 시간 장부·면제 통행증 검사","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-하윤목","detailRoute":"/people/person-0352","birthDate":"2099-11-21","birthday":"11-21","age":27,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"transit-tax-calculation","name":"통과세 계산","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"빈 면제 칸을 경계","description":"통과품과 급수 시간을 함께 기록하고 사적 청탁을 공개 창구로 보낸다. 세금 실무와 협상 목표를 군사 권한으로 바꾸지 않는다.","behavior":"숫자와 인장을 좋아하고, 무력으로 세를 깎는 장교를 모욕으로 기억한다. 빈 면제 칸을 위험 신호로 본다.","stress":"공포. 세리가 일방의 군사 비용 징수원으로 전락해 정유라의 표준 조약에서 제외되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 정유라의 손실보상 조항을 세율에 넣으려 하고, 배우진의 보호세 요구를 거부하며, 라세영의 검역 도장을 세 계산에 연동한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 공동실무원. 직함은 양군 관문 세리. 통과 품목과 급수 시간을 같은 장부에 적고, 군사 면제는 양군 결재와 계약감사 문구가 있는 통행증만 인정한다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 공동실무원. 직함은 양군 관문 세리. 통과 품목과 급수 시간을 같은 장부에 적고, 군사 면제는 양군 결재와 계약감사 문구가 있는 통행증만 인정한다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 세리가 일방의 군사 비용 징수원으로 전락해 정유라의 표준 조약에서 제외되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 정유라의 손실보상 조항을 세율에 넣으려 하고, 배우진의 보호세 요구를 거부하며, 라세영의 검역 도장을 세 계산에 연동한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"통과품과 급수 시간을 함께 기록하고 사적 청탁을 공개 창구로 보낸다. 세금 실무와 협상 목표를 군사 권한으로 바꾸지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d558-c9c4-c8fc","name":"진주 하씨","crest":"clan-crests/d558-c9c4-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":45,"개방":-10,"무력":35,"물질":5,"공동":25,"원칙":-5,"공개":-15,"자격":0,"분산":-20,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":-5,"독점":-20,"위험":0,"과시":-30,"지속":-5,"지향":"무성향","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"통과 품목·급수 시간 장부·면제 통행증 검사","소속":"아관사 양군 공동실무","품계":"공동실무원","직함":"양군 관문 세리","가치관":"권위 45 | 개방 −10 | 무력 35 | 물질 5 | 공동 25 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −15 | 자격 0 | 분산 −20 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 −5 | 독점 −20 | 위험 0 | 과시 −30 | 지속 −5 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2099-11-21에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 양군 관문 세리 직무를 맡아 통과 품목·급수 시간 장부·면제 통행증 검사 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의1동의 통과 품목·급수 시간 장부·면제 통행증 검사 창구가 하윤목의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 공동실무원. 직함은 양군 관문 세리. 통과 품목·급수 시간 장부·면제 통행증 검사 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.","일화":"2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.","관계":"정유라의 손실보상 조항을 세율에 넣으려 하고, 배우진의 보호세 요구를 거부하며, 라세영의 검역 도장을 세 계산에 연동한다.","야망":"하윤목은 양군 관문 세리 직무에서 통과 품목·급수 시간 장부·면제 통행증 검사 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.","공포":"양군 관문 세리 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"면제 문서의 진본을 가리거나, 관문 원장을 수서 협약 초안에 실어 나를 수 있다. 하윤목의 통과 품목·급수 시간 장부·면제 통행증 검사 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"하윤목은 통과 품목·급수 시간 장부·면제 통행증 검사 기록을 손에 익힌 정부 양군 공동실무 인물이다. 숫자와 인장을 좋아하고, 무력으로 세를 깎는 장교를 모욕으로 기억한다. 빈 면제 칸을 위험 신호로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 통과 품목·급수 시간 장부·면제 통행증 검사\n- 소속: 정부 양군 공동실무\n- 품계: 공동실무원\n- 직함: 양군 관문 세리\n**생애.** 2099-11-21에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 양군 관문 세리 직무를 맡아 통과 품목·급수 시간 장부·면제 통행증 검사 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의1동의 통과 품목·급수 시간 장부·면제 통행증 검사 창구가 하윤목의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 공동실무원. 직함은 양군 관문 세리. 통과 품목·급수 시간 장부·면제 통행증 검사 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 사적 청탁을 돌려보내고 공개 창구로 보냈다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.\n\n**관계.** 정유라의 손실보상 조항을 세율에 넣으려 하고, 배우진의 보호세 요구를 거부하며, 라세영의 검역 도장을 세 계산에 연동한다.\n\n**야망.** 하윤목은 양군 관문 세리 직무에서 통과 품목·급수 시간 장부·면제 통행증 검사 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 양군 관문 세리 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 면제 문서의 진본을 가리거나, 관문 원장을 수서 협약 초안에 실어 나를 수 있다. 하윤목의 통과 품목·급수 시간 장부·면제 통행증 검사 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 45 | 개방 −10 | 무력 35 | 물질 5 | 공동 25 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −15 | 자격 0 | 분산 −20 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 −5 | 독점 −20 | 위험 0 | 과시 −30 | 지속 −5 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"하윤목","type":"계약","to":"정유라","basis":"손실보상 조항을 관문 세율에 넣으려 함"}],"incoming":[{"from":"천초윤","type":"지휘","to":"하윤목","basis":"하윤목의 관문 원장을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"방마름","type":"신도","to":"하윤목","basis":"하윤목의 세 계산을 원장으로 옮기는 신도이고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0353', 'acfd-d604-d48d', '{"id":"person-0353","name":"Gwak Minjae","title":"Guui Water Rationing Technician","position":"Guui Garrison Water Rationing Technician","characterId":"K352","rank":"Garrison Commander","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Water Supply Schedule, Residual Pressure Posting, and Joint Approval Verification","gender":"Male","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#person-gwak-minjae","detailRoute":"/people/person-0353","birthDate":"2068-12-02","birthday":"12-02","age":58,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":11,"effective":11},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"residual-pressure-calculation","name":"Residual pressure calculation","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Stops opening without numbers","description":"A numberless opening order was stopped through joint approval, and pressure recalculated from pump logs. Water management and technical judgment are clear strengths.","behavior":"He loved procedure and read the mountain militia''s speed as a cause of accidents. He accepted no order without residual-pressure numbers.","stress":"Fear. That the ridge defense would put the pump room under wartime command and the purification records would break off.","relationship":"Relations. Contested authority with Go Seojun, used Im Chowon''s pump logs for the Guui residual-pressure arithmetic, and feared Mun Hayul''s outpost blockade freezing the pipes.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: Guui restricted-water technician. He posted the water-supply hours and residual pressure on the board and blocked the defense squad''s solitary open-close with the engineers'' council veto.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: Guui restricted-water technician. He posted the water-supply hours and residual pressure on the board and blocked the defense squad''s solitary open-close with the engineers'' council veto.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the ridge defense would put the pump room under wartime command and the purification records would break off.","relationship":"Relations. Contested authority with Go Seojun, used Im Chowon''s pump logs for the Guui residual-pressure arithmetic, and feared Mun Hayul''s outpost blockade freezing the pipes.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"A numberless opening order was stopped through joint approval, and pressure recalculated from pump logs. Water management and technical judgment are clear strengths.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"acfd-d604-d48d","name":"Hyeonpung Gwak Clan","crest":"clan-crests/acfd-d604-d48d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":35,"Openness":-15,"Force":35,"Material":10,"Communal":30,"Principle":5,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-25,"Transformative":-20},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":40,"Risk":-30,"Display":-30,"Sustained":35,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Water Supply Schedule, Residual Pressure Posting, and Joint Approval Verification","Affiliation":"Guui Garrison","Rank":"Garrison Commander","Title":"Guui Garrison Water Rationing Technician","Values":"Authority 35 | Openness −15 | Force 35 | Material 10 | Community 30 | Principle 5 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −25 | Change −20","Desires":"Craving 30 | Monopoly 40 | Risk −30 | Display −30 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Union: None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2068-12-02. As of the opening of 2126, he holds the post of Restricted-Supply Technician of the Guui Garrison and carries on the records of water-supply times, residual-pressure postings, and joint-approval checks. The earlier selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The window for water-supply times, residual-pressure postings, and joint-approval checks in Guui 3-dong is Gwak Minjae''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, domain, or right of possession.","Offices":"Rank: Garrison Commander. Title: Restricted-Supply Technician of the Guui Garrison. Handles the records of water-supply times, residual-pressure postings, and joint-approval checks, and the handover of watches, within the scope of his current duties.","Anecdote":"The Agwansa issues a pump-room opening order with the residual-pressure figure omitted to the Guui Garrison''s bulletin board. Gwak Minjae invokes the Guui Garrison''s approval and the joint-approval procedure to block unilateral opening and closing, recalculates the residual pressure from Im Chowon''s pump log, and posts it beside the water-supply timetable. The record left that day became the handover basis for the next watch to cross-check.","Relationships":"He contends with Go Seojun over authority, uses Im Chowon''s pump log in Guui''s residual-pressure calculations, and fears that Mun Hayul''s checkpoint blockade will freeze the pipes.","Ambition":"In his post as Restricted-Supply Technician of the Guui Garrison, Gwak Minjae seeks to make the records of water-supply times, residual-pressure postings, and joint-approval checks mesh with the public handover table.","Fear":"He fears that a gap in the records of the Guui Garrison''s Restricted-Supply Technician watch will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.","Intervention":"Using the residual-pressure records, he can establish whether damage came from internal overpressure or from a strike by an armed watch, or refuse to hand over the keys without the joint approval of both armies. By cross-checking Gwak Minjae''s ledger of water-supply times, residual-pressure postings, and joint-approval checks, he can establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Gwak Minjae is a Guui Garrison figure practiced in the records of water-supply times, residual-pressure postings, and joint-approval checks. He loves procedure and sees the speed of the mountain militia as a cause of accidents. He does not accept orders without a residual-pressure figure.\n\n- Livelihood: water-supply times, residual-pressure postings, joint-approval checks\n- Affiliation: Guui Garrison\n- Rank: Garrison Commander\n- Title: Restricted-Supply Technician of the Guui Garrison\n**Life.** Born on 2068-12-02. As of the opening of 2126, he holds the post of Restricted-Supply Technician of the Guui Garrison and carries on the records of water-supply times, residual-pressure postings, and joint-approval checks. The earlier selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The window for water-supply times, residual-pressure postings, and joint-approval checks in Guui 3-dong is Gwak Minjae''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, domain, or right of possession.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Garrison Commander. Title: Restricted-Supply Technician of the Guui Garrison. Handles the records of water-supply times, residual-pressure postings, and joint-approval checks, and the handover of watches, within the scope of his current duties.\n\n**Anecdote.** The Agwansa issues a pump-room opening order with the residual-pressure figure omitted to the Guui Garrison''s bulletin board. Gwak Minjae invokes the Guui Garrison''s approval and the joint-approval procedure to block unilateral opening and closing, recalculates the residual pressure from Im Chowon''s pump log, and posts it beside the water-supply timetable. The record left that day became the handover basis for the next watch to cross-check.\n\n**Relationships.** He contends with Go Seojun over authority, uses Im Chowon''s pump log in Guui''s residual-pressure calculations, and fears that Mun Hayul''s checkpoint blockade will freeze the pipes.\n\n**Ambition.** In his post as Restricted-Supply Technician of the Guui Garrison, Gwak Minjae seeks to make the records of water-supply times, residual-pressure postings, and joint-approval checks mesh with the public handover table.\n\n**Fear.** He fears that a gap in the records of the Guui Garrison''s Restricted-Supply Technician watch will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.\n\n**Intervention.** Using the residual-pressure records, he can establish whether damage came from internal overpressure or from a strike by an armed watch, or refuse to hand over the keys without the joint approval of both armies. By cross-checking Gwak Minjae''s ledger of water-supply times, residual-pressure postings, and joint-approval checks, he can establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 35 | Openness −15 | Force 35 | Material 10 | Community 30 | Principle 5 | Publicity −15 | Qualification 10 | Decentralization −25 | Change −20\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Monopoly 40 | Risk −30 | Display −30 | Persistence 35 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Union: None\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Gwak Minjae","type":"Rivalry","to":"Go Seojun","basis":"Contests authority over Guui''s restricted water supply"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Seon Soru","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Gwak Minjae","basis":"A disciple who fits Gwak Minjae''s residual-pressure formula to the impeller teeth, and"},{"from":"Beom Han-deul","type":"Oath","to":"Gwak Minjae","basis":"backs Gwak Minjae''s water-supply inspection from the witness stand, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0353","name":"곽민재","title":"구의 제한급수 기술자","position":"구의수비대 제한급수 기술자","characterId":"K352","rank":"수비대장","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"급수 시간·잔압 게시·공동 승인 확인","gender":"남성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-곽민재","detailRoute":"/people/person-0353","birthDate":"2068-12-02","birthday":"12-02","age":58,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":11,"effective":11},"stewardship":{"base":13,"effective":13},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"residual-pressure-calculation","name":"잔압 계산","rating":70}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"숫자 없는 개방을 막는다","description":"잔압 없는 개방 명령을 공동 승인 절차로 막고 펌프 일지로 다시 계산했다. 급수 운영과 기술 판단이 명확한 강점이다.","behavior":"절차를 사랑하고 산악 민병의 속도를 사고 원인으로 본다. 잔압 숫자 없는 명령을 받지 않는다.","stress":"공포. 아관사가 구의수비대의 결재 없이 펌프실을 장악해 정수 기록이 끊기는 것.","relationship":"관계. 고서준과 권한을 다투고, 임초원의 펌프 일지를 구의 잔압 계산에 쓰며, 문하율의 초소 차단이 배관을 얼게 만들까 두려워한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수비대장. 직함은 구의수비대 제한급수 기술자. 급수 시간과 잔압을 게시판에 붙이고, 아관사의 단독 개폐는 구의수비대의 결재와 공동 승인 절차로 막는다. 전쟁과 급수는 아관사와 구의수비대가 각각 병력에서 뽑은 지휘관의 공동 승인을 거치며, 양군은 서로의 결재를 계속 감시한다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수비대장. 직함은 구의수비대 제한급수 기술자. 급수 시간과 잔압을 게시판에 붙이고, 아관사의 단독 개폐는 구의수비대의 결재와 공동 승인 절차로 막는다. 전쟁과 급수는 아관사와 구의수비대가 각각 병력에서 뽑은 지휘관의 공동 승인을 거치며, 양군은 서로의 결재를 계속 감시한다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 아관사가 구의수비대의 결재 없이 펌프실을 장악해 정수 기록이 끊기는 것.","relationship":"관계. 고서준과 권한을 다투고, 임초원의 펌프 일지를 구의 잔압 계산에 쓰며, 문하율의 초소 차단이 배관을 얼게 만들까 두려워한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"잔압 없는 개방 명령을 공동 승인 절차로 막고 펌프 일지로 다시 계산했다. 급수 운영과 기술 판단이 명확한 강점이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"acfd-d604-d48d","name":"현풍 곽씨","crest":"clan-crests/acfd-d604-d48d.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":35,"개방":-15,"무력":35,"물질":10,"공동":30,"원칙":5,"공개":-15,"자격":10,"분산":-25,"변혁":-20},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":40,"위험":-30,"과시":-30,"지속":35,"지향":"이성","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"급수 시간·잔압 게시·공동 승인 확인","소속":"구의수비대","품계":"수비대장","직함":"구의수비대 제한급수 기술자","가치관":"권위 35 | 개방 −15 | 무력 35 | 물질 10 | 공동 30 | 원칙 5 | 공개 −15 | 자격 10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −20","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 40 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −30 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2068-12-02에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 구의수비대 제한급수 기술자 직무를 맡아 급수 시간·잔압 게시·공동 승인 확인 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 급수 시간·잔압 게시·공동 승인 확인 창구가 곽민재의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수비대장. 직함은 구의수비대 제한급수 기술자. 급수 시간·잔압 게시·공동 승인 확인 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.","일화":"아관사가 잔압 숫자를 뺀 펌프실 개방 명령을 구의수비대 게시판에 내린다. 곽민재는 구의수비대의 결재와 공동 승인 절차를 걸어 단독 개폐를 막고, 임초원의 펌프 일지로 잔압을 다시 계산해 급수 시간표 옆에 붙인다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.","관계":"고서준과 권한을 다투고, 임초원의 펌프 일지를 구의 잔압 계산에 쓰며, 문하율의 초소 차단이 배관을 얼게 만들까 두려워한다.","야망":"곽민재는 구의수비대 제한급수 기술자 직무에서 급수 시간·잔압 게시·공동 승인 확인 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.","공포":"구의수비대 제한급수 기술자 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"잔압 기록으로 파손이 내부 과압인지 무장 당직의 타격인지 밝히거나, 열쇠를 양군의 공동 승인 없이는 넘기지 않는다. 곽민재의 급수 시간·잔압 게시·공동 승인 확인 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"곽민재는 급수 시간·잔압 게시·공동 승인 확인 기록을 손에 익힌 구의수비대 인물이다. 절차를 사랑하고 산악 민병의 속도를 사고 원인으로 본다. 잔압 숫자 없는 명령을 받지 않는다.\n\n- 생업: 급수 시간·잔압 게시·공동 승인 확인\n- 소속: 구의수비대\n- 품계: 수비대장\n- 직함: 구의수비대 제한급수 기술자\n**생애.** 2068-12-02에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 구의수비대 제한급수 기술자 직무를 맡아 급수 시간·잔압 게시·공동 승인 확인 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 급수 시간·잔압 게시·공동 승인 확인 창구가 곽민재의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수비대장. 직함은 구의수비대 제한급수 기술자. 급수 시간·잔압 게시·공동 승인 확인 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.\n\n**일화.** 아관사가 잔압 숫자를 뺀 펌프실 개방 명령을 구의수비대 게시판에 내린다. 곽민재는 구의수비대의 결재와 공동 승인 절차를 걸어 단독 개폐를 막고, 임초원의 펌프 일지로 잔압을 다시 계산해 급수 시간표 옆에 붙인다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.\n\n**관계.** 고서준과 권한을 다투고, 임초원의 펌프 일지를 구의 잔압 계산에 쓰며, 문하율의 초소 차단이 배관을 얼게 만들까 두려워한다.\n\n**야망.** 곽민재는 구의수비대 제한급수 기술자 직무에서 급수 시간·잔압 게시·공동 승인 확인 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 구의수비대 제한급수 기술자 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 잔압 기록으로 파손이 내부 과압인지 무장 당직의 타격인지 밝히거나, 열쇠를 양군의 공동 승인 없이는 넘기지 않는다. 곽민재의 급수 시간·잔압 게시·공동 승인 확인 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 35 | 개방 −15 | 무력 35 | 물질 10 | 공동 30 | 원칙 5 | 공개 −15 | 자격 10 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −20\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 40 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −30 | 지속 35 | 지향 이성 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"곽민재","type":"경쟁","to":"고서준","basis":"구의 제한급수 권한을 다툼"}],"incoming":[{"from":"선솔우","type":"신도","to":"곽민재","basis":"곽민재의 잔압 식을 임펠러 이빨에 맞추는 신도이고"},{"from":"범한들","type":"맹세","to":"곽민재","basis":"곽민재의 급수 점검을 증인석에서 받치고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0354', 'c2ec-ccad-c1a1', '{"id":"person-0354","name":"Sim Gaeun","title":"Bridge Scout Captain","position":"The Government Bridge Scout Captain","characterId":"K353","rank":"Sergeant","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Sighting and Inference Distinction Record and Wisi Sighting Report","gender":"Female","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#person-sim-gaeun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0354","birthDate":"2081-09-16","birthday":"09-16","age":45,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"scout-reporting","name":"Scout reporting","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Fast reports and interpretive tension","description":"A poacher was caught and passwords changed; reports separate observation and inference. A habit of adding interpretation coexists with fear of mistaken reporting.","behavior":"He wrote reports fast but had a habit of adding interpretation. He sought to repay Go Seojun''s trust.","stress":"Fear. That one mistaken report would spread into an eastern-bridge war and he would become its object of grudges.","relationship":"Relations. Reported directly to Go Seojun, obstructed An Giun''s bridge schedule, and exchanged transfer information with Jang Sehwa.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: bridge reconnaissance chief. He had sightings and conjectures written in different inks, but in a crisis he erased the conjecture column and raised sightings only.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: bridge reconnaissance chief. He had sightings and conjectures written in different inks, but in a crisis he erased the conjecture column and raised sightings only.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That one mistaken report would spread into an eastern-bridge war and he would become its object of grudges.","relationship":"Relations. Reported directly to Go Seojun, obstructed An Giun''s bridge schedule, and exchanged transfer information with Jang Sehwa.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"A poacher was caught and passwords changed; reports separate observation and inference. A habit of adding interpretation coexists with fear of mistaken reporting.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c2ec-ccad-c1a1","name":"Cheongsong Sim Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c2ec-ccad-c1a1.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":30,"Openness":-5,"Force":30,"Material":0,"Communal":15,"Principle":0,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":-15,"Dispersed":-25,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":20,"Display":-15,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Sighting and Inference Distinction Record and Wisi Sighting Report","Affiliation":"Russian Legation Command","Rank":"Sergeant","Title":"The Government Bridge Scout Captain","Values":"Authority 30 | Openness −5 | Force 30 | Material 0 | Community 15 | Principle 0 | Publicity −15 | Qualification −15 | Decentralization −25 | Change −10","Desires":"Craving 40 | Monopoly −15 | Risk 20 | Display −15 | Persistence 20 | Orientation: Fluid | Union: Contractual cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2081-09-16. As of the opening of 2126, holds the post of The Government Bridge Scout Captain and carries on the records of sighting/inference distinction and Wisi sighting reports. The earlier selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The window for sighting/inference distinction records and Wisi sighting reports in Guui 3-dong is Sim Gaeun''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, domain, or right of possession.","Offices":"Rank: Sergeant. Title: The Government Bridge Scout Captain. Handles the records of sighting/inference distinction and Wisi sighting reports, and the handover of watches, within the scope of current duties.","Anecdote":"In 2125, caught an unauthorized night crosser and changed the guard cipher tags. The record left that day became the handover basis for the next watch to cross-check.","Relationships":"Reports directly to Go Seojun, obstructs An Gijun''s bridge schedule, and trades transfer information with Jang Sehwa.","Ambition":"In the post of The Government Bridge Scout Captain, Sim Gaeun seeks to make the records of sighting/inference distinction and Wisi sighting reports mesh with the public handover table.","Fear":"Fears that a gap in the records of the Government Bridge Scout Captain''s watch will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.","Intervention":"Can make the original of the inference column public, or cover up a misreport and accelerate one side''s expansion of command. By cross-checking Sim Gaeun''s ledger of sighting/inference distinction records and Wisi sighting reports, can establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Sim Gaeun is The Government figure practiced in keeping records that separate sightings from assumptions, and in Wish sighting reports. Sim Gaeun writes reports quickly but has a habit of adding interpretation. Sim Gaeun wants to repay Go Seojun''s good faith.\n\n- Occupation: Sighting/assumption-separated records and Wish sighting reports\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Sergeant\n- Title: The Government Bridge Scout Captain\n**Life.** Born on 2081-09-16. As of the 2126 opening, Sim Gaeun holds the post of The Government Bridge Scout Captain and continues the records of sighting/assumption-separated records and Wish sighting reports. The prior selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The sighting/assumption-separated records and Wish sighting report desk in Guui 3-dong is Sim Gaeun''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, domain, or occupancy rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Sergeant. Title: The Government Bridge Scout Captain. Handles the sighting/assumption-separated records, Wish sighting reports, and watch handovers within the scope of the current post.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, Sim Gaeun caught an unauthorized night crosser and changed the guard cipher tag. The record left that day became handover evidence for the next watch to cross-check.\n\n**Relations.** Reports directly to Go Seojun, obstructs An Gijun''s bridge schedule, and trades Jang Sehwa''s transfer information in exchange for their own.\n\n**Ambition.** In the post of The Government Bridge Scout Captain, Sim Gaeun aims to make the sighting/assumption-separated records and Wish sighting reports mesh with the public handover table.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that a record gap in the Government Bridge Scout Captain''s watch will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.\n\n**Intervention.** Can disclose the original of the assumption column, or cover a misreport and thereby accelerate one side''s expansion of command. By cross-checking Sim Gaeun''s ledger of sighting/assumption-separated records and Wish sighting reports, can establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 30 | Openness −5 | Force 30 | Materialism 0 | Communal 15 | Principle 0 | Transparency −15 | Credentials −15 | Decentralization −25 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Possessiveness −15 | Risk 20 | Display −15 | Endurance 20 | Orientation: Fluid | Union: Contract cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Sim Gaeun","type":"Command","to":"Go Seojun","basis":"Reports bridge scouting directly to the captain"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Dong Saebom","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Sim Gaeun","basis":"is a mentor–protégé pair who translate Sim Gaeun''s scout reports into coordinates, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0354","name":"심가은","title":"교량 척후대장","position":"정부 교량 척후대장","characterId":"K353","rank":"병장","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고","gender":"여성","stage":"S1","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-심가은","detailRoute":"/people/person-0354","birthDate":"2081-09-16","birthday":"09-16","age":45,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":8,"effective":8},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":9,"effective":9},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":8,"effective":8}},"skills":[{"id":"scout-reporting","name":"척후 보고","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"빠른 보고와 해석의 긴장","description":"도꾼을 붙잡아 암호패를 갈았고 목격·추정 구분을 지시한다. 해석을 보태는 버릇과 오인 보고 공포를 함께 남긴다.","behavior":"보고를 빨리 쓰지만 해석을 보태는 버릇이 있다. 고서준의 신의에 보답하려 한다.","stress":"공포. 오인 보고 한 장이 동부 교량 전쟁으로 번져 자신이 원한의 대상이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 고서준에게 직보하고, 안기준의 교량 일정을 방해하며, 장세화의 환승 정보를 맞교환한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 병장. 직함은 정부 교량 척후대장. 목격과 추정을 다른 색 먹으로 적게 하지만, 위기 때는 추정 칸을 지우고 목격만 올린다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 병장. 직함은 정부 교량 척후대장. 목격과 추정을 다른 색 먹으로 적게 하지만, 위기 때는 추정 칸을 지우고 목격만 올린다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 오인 보고 한 장이 동부 교량 전쟁으로 번져 자신이 원한의 대상이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 고서준에게 직보하고, 안기준의 교량 일정을 방해하며, 장세화의 환승 정보를 맞교환한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"도꾼을 붙잡아 암호패를 갈았고 목격·추정 구분을 지시한다. 해석을 보태는 버릇과 오인 보고 공포를 함께 남긴다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c2ec-ccad-c1a1","name":"청송 심씨","crest":"clan-crests/c2ec-ccad-c1a1.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":30,"개방":-5,"무력":30,"물질":0,"공동":15,"원칙":0,"공개":-15,"자격":-15,"분산":-25,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":-15,"위험":20,"과시":-15,"지속":20,"지향":"유동","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고","소속":"아관사","품계":"병장","직함":"정부 교량 척후대장","가치관":"권위 30 | 개방 −5 | 무력 30 | 물질 0 | 공동 15 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −15 | 자격 −15 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 −15 | 위험 20 | 과시 −15 | 지속 20 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2081-09-16에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 정부 교량 척후대장 직무를 맡아 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 창구가 심가은의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 병장. 직함은 정부 교량 척후대장. 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.","일화":"2125년 야간 무단 도꾼을 붙잡아 경비 암호패를 갈았다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.","관계":"고서준에게 직보하고, 안기준의 교량 일정을 방해하며, 장세화의 환승 정보를 맞교환한다.","야망":"심가은은 정부 교량 척후대장 직무에서 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.","공포":"정부 교량 척후대장 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"추정 칸의 원본을 공개하거나, 오인 보고를 덮어 일방의 지휘권 확대를 가속할 수 있다. 심가은의 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"심가은은 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 기록을 손에 익힌 정부 인물이다. 보고를 빨리 쓰지만 해석을 보태는 버릇이 있다. 고서준의 신의에 보답하려 한다.\n\n- 생업: 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 병장\n- 직함: 정부 교량 척후대장\n**생애.** 2081-09-16에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 정부 교량 척후대장 직무를 맡아 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 창구가 심가은의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 병장. 직함은 정부 교량 척후대장. 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.\n\n**일화.** 2125년 야간 무단 도꾼을 붙잡아 경비 암호패를 갈았다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.\n\n**관계.** 고서준에게 직보하고, 안기준의 교량 일정을 방해하며, 장세화의 환승 정보를 맞교환한다.\n\n**야망.** 심가은은 정부 교량 척후대장 직무에서 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 정부 교량 척후대장 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 추정 칸의 원본을 공개하거나, 오인 보고를 덮어 일방의 지휘권 확대를 가속할 수 있다. 심가은의 목격·추정 구분 기록·위시 목격 보고 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 30 | 개방 −5 | 무력 30 | 물질 0 | 공동 15 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −15 | 자격 −15 | 분산 −25 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 −15 | 위험 20 | 과시 −15 | 지속 20 | 지향 유동 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"심가은","type":"지휘","to":"고서준","basis":"교량 척후를 대장에게 직보"}],"incoming":[{"from":"동새봄","type":"신도","to":"심가은","basis":"심가은의 척후 보고를 좌표로 번역하는 신도이고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0355', 'c120-bcf4-c131', '{"id":"person-0355","name":"Seon Soru","title":"Guui Pump Room Mechanic, Gwak Minjae''s Aide","position":"Guui Garrison Guui Pump Room Mechanic, Gwak Minjae''s Aide","characterId":"K354","rank":"Garrison Soldier","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Pump Room Wear Chart and Maintenance Key Management","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#inmul-seonsolu","detailRoute":"/people/person-0355","birthDate":"2078-04-11","birthday":"04-11","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"pump-wear-inspection","name":"Pump wear inspection","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Keeps keys until approval","description":"They read wear and packing conditions and recorded the failure time without releasing a demanded key. Maintenance observation does not imply invention.","behavior":"He read impeller-tooth wear with his fingers and hung no verbal open-close on the key hook. He knew the pier''s metal sound by heart as a packing-replacement order.","stress":"Fear. That a ridge sentry would empty the hook with a whistle and the purification log would become blank for a night.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice fitting Gwak Minjae''s residual-pressure formula to the impeller teeth, he matched the open-close hours before Mun Hayul''s ridge watch froze the pipes. When Go Seojun''s gate repairs borrowed the pump-room key, he left a blank in the wear table.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: Guui pump-room mechanic, duty officer of Gwak Minjae. He hung the wear table and the packing schedule on the wall, and the defense squad''s solitary open-close was possible only while the maintenance key stayed on the hook.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: Guui pump-room mechanic, duty officer of Gwak Minjae. He hung the wear table and the packing schedule on the wall, and the defense squad''s solitary open-close was possible only while the maintenance key stayed on the hook.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That a ridge sentry would empty the hook with a whistle and the purification log would become blank for a night.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice fitting Gwak Minjae''s residual-pressure formula to the impeller teeth, he matched the open-close hours before Mun Hayul''s ridge watch froze the pipes. When Go Seojun''s gate repairs borrowed the pump-room key, he left a blank in the wear table.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"They read wear and packing conditions and recorded the failure time without releasing a demanded key. Maintenance observation does not imply invention.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c120-bcf4-c131","name":"Seon Clan of Boseong","crest":"clan-crests/c120-bcf4-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":45,"Openness":-20,"Force":45,"Material":10,"Communal":15,"Principle":0,"Public":-5,"Eligibility":10,"Dispersed":-15,"Transformative":-10},"desire":{"Longing":30,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":25,"Display":-20,"Sustained":25,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Pump Room Wear Chart and Maintenance Key Management","Affiliation":"Guui Garrison","Rank":"Garrison Soldier","Title":"Guui Garrison Guui Pump Room Mechanic, Gwak Minjae''s Aide","Values":"Authority 45 | Openness −20 | Force 45 | Materialism 10 | Communal 15 | Principle 0 | Transparency −5 | Credentials 10 | Decentralization −15 | Transformation −10","Desires":"Craving 30 | Possessiveness −30 | Risk 25 | Display −20 | Endurance 25 | Orientation: Same-sex | Union: Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2078-04-11. As of the 2126 opening, Seon Solu holds the post of Guui Garrison''s Guui Pump Room Mechanic and Gwak Minjae''s Working-Level Aide and continues the records of pump-room wear charts and maintenance key management. The prior selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The pump-room wear chart and maintenance key management desk in Guui 3-dong is Seon Solu''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, domain, or occupancy rights.","Offices":"Rank: Garrison Member. Title: Guui Garrison''s Guui Pump Room Mechanic and Gwak Minjae''s Working-Level Aide. Handles the pump-room wear chart and maintenance key management records and watch handovers within the scope of the current post.","Anecdote":"Right after a water main burst, when the garrison demanded the key, Seon Solu did not empty the peg and wrote only the time of the breakage on the wear chart. The record left that day became handover evidence for the next watch to cross-check.","Relationships":"In a mentor–protégé tie with Gwak Minjae, fits Gwak Minjae''s residual-pressure formula to the impeller teeth, and syncs opening and closing times before Mun Hayul''s ridge watch freezes the piping. When Go Seojun''s gate repairs borrow the pump room key, leaves a blank on the wear chart.","Ambition":"In the post of Guui Garrison''s Guui Pump Room Mechanic and Gwak Minjae''s Working-Level Aide, Seon Solu aims to make the pump-room wear chart and maintenance key management records mesh with the public handover table.","Fear":"Fears that a record gap in the watch of the Guui Garrison''s Guui Pump Room Mechanic and Gwak Minjae''s Working-Level Aide will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.","Intervention":"Can read the tooth wear chart overlaid with the breakage time, or decide whether to hang the peg key on a peg that both armies have jointly designated. By cross-checking Seon Solu''s ledger of pump-room wear charts and maintenance key management, can establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Seon Solu is a Guui Garrison figure practiced in keeping pump-room wear charts and managing maintenance keys. Seon Solu reads the wear on impeller teeth by finger, and never hangs a verbally ordered opening or closing on the key peg. Memorizes the metallic sounds of the bridge piers as the packing replacement sequence.\n\n- Occupation: Pump-room wear chart and maintenance key management\n- Affiliation: Guui Garrison\n- Rank: Garrison Member\n- Title: Guui Garrison''s Guui Pump Room Mechanic and Gwak Minjae''s Working-Level Aide\n**Life.** Born on 2078-04-11. As of the 2126 opening, Seon Solu holds the post of Guui Garrison''s Guui Pump Room Mechanic and Gwak Minjae''s Working-Level Aide and continues the records of pump-room wear charts and maintenance key management. The prior selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The pump-room wear chart and maintenance key management desk in Guui 3-dong is Seon Solu''s working reference point. This working reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, domain, or occupancy rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Garrison Member. Title: Guui Garrison''s Guui Pump Room Mechanic and Gwak Minjae''s Working-Level Aide. Handles the pump-room wear chart and maintenance key management records and watch handovers within the scope of the current post.\n\n**Anecdote.** Right after a water main burst, when the garrison demanded the key, Seon Solu did not empty the peg and wrote only the time of the breakage on the wear chart. The record left that day became handover evidence for the next watch to cross-check.\n\n**Relations.** In a mentor–protégé tie with Gwak Minjae, fits Gwak Minjae''s residual-pressure formula to the impeller teeth, and syncs opening and closing times before Mun Hayul''s ridge watch freezes the piping. When Go Seojun''s gate repairs borrow the pump room key, leaves a blank on the wear chart.\n\n**Ambition.** In the post of Guui Garrison''s Guui Pump Room Mechanic and Gwak Minjae''s Working-Level Aide, Seon Solu aims to make the pump-room wear chart and maintenance key management records mesh with the public handover table.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that a record gap in the watch of the Guui Garrison''s Guui Pump Room Mechanic and Gwak Minjae''s Working-Level Aide will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.\n\n**Intervention.** Can read the tooth wear chart overlaid with the breakage time, or decide whether to hang the peg key on a peg that both armies have jointly designated. By cross-checking Seon Solu''s ledger of pump-room wear charts and maintenance key management, can establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 45 | Openness −20 | Force 45 | Materialism 10 | Communal 15 | Principle 0 | Transparency −5 | Credentials 10 | Decentralization −15 | Transformation −10\n- Desires: Craving 30 | Possessiveness −30 | Risk 25 | Display −20 | Endurance 25 | Orientation: Same-sex | Union: Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seon Soru","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Gwak Minjae","basis":"A disciple who fits Gwak Minjae''s residual-pressure formula to the impeller teeth, and"},{"from":"Seon Soru","type":"Contract","to":"Mun Hayul","basis":"Adjusts opening and closing times to fit Mun Hayul''s ridge surveillance schedule"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Pan Cho-dam","type":"Contract","to":"Seon Soru","basis":"matches output to Seon Solu''s pump, and"},{"from":"Tak Yun-jae","type":"Contract","to":"Seon Soru","basis":"matches residual pressure to Seon Solu''s pump log, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0355","name":"선솔우","title":"구의 펌프실 정비사, 곽민재의 실무 담당자","position":"구의수비대 구의 펌프실 정비사, 곽민재의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K354","rank":"수비대원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"펌프실 마모표·정비 키 관리","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-선솔우","detailRoute":"/people/person-0355","birthDate":"2078-04-11","birthday":"04-11","age":48,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":11,"effective":11},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"pump-wear-inspection","name":"펌프 마모 점검","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"승인 전에는 키를 남긴다","description":"마모와 패킹을 읽고 파손 직후 키 요구에도 시각만 기록했다. 정비 관찰은 확인되지만 광범위한 기계 발명은 없다.","behavior":"임펠러 이빨의 마모를 손가락으로 읽고, 구두 개폐는 키 걸이못에 걸지 않는다. 교각 금속음을 패킹 교체 순서로 외운다.","stress":"공포. 능선 초병이 걸이못을 호각으로 비워 정수 일지가 한 밤에 공백이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 곽민재의 잔압 식을 임펠러 이빨에 맞추는 신도이고, 문하율의 능선 감시가 배관을 얼리기 전에 개폐 시각을 맞춘다. 고서준의 관문 수리가 펌프실 키를 빌려 가면 마모표에 빈칸을 남긴다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수비대원. 직함은 구의수비대 구의 펌프실 정비사, 곽민재의 실무 담당자. 마모표와 패킹 날을 벽에 걸고, 아관사의 단독 개폐를 막고 정비 키는 양군 승인 때만 걸이못에서 꺼낸다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수비대원. 직함은 구의수비대 구의 펌프실 정비사, 곽민재의 실무 담당자. 마모표와 패킹 날을 벽에 걸고, 아관사의 단독 개폐를 막고 정비 키는 양군 승인 때만 걸이못에서 꺼낸다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 능선 초병이 걸이못을 호각으로 비워 정수 일지가 한 밤에 공백이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 곽민재의 잔압 식을 임펠러 이빨에 맞추는 신도이고, 문하율의 능선 감시가 배관을 얼리기 전에 개폐 시각을 맞춘다. 고서준의 관문 수리가 펌프실 키를 빌려 가면 마모표에 빈칸을 남긴다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"마모와 패킹을 읽고 파손 직후 키 요구에도 시각만 기록했다. 정비 관찰은 확인되지만 광범위한 기계 발명은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c120-bcf4-c131","name":"보성 선씨","crest":"clan-crests/c120-bcf4-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":45,"개방":-20,"무력":45,"물질":10,"공동":15,"원칙":0,"공개":-5,"자격":10,"분산":-15,"변혁":-10},"desire":{"갈망":30,"독점":-30,"위험":25,"과시":-20,"지속":25,"지향":"동성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"펌프실 마모표·정비 키 관리","소속":"구의수비대","품계":"수비대원","직함":"구의수비대 구의 펌프실 정비사, 곽민재의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 45 | 개방 −20 | 무력 45 | 물질 10 | 공동 15 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −5 | 자격 10 | 분산 −15 | 변혁 −10","욕망":"갈망 30 | 독점 −30 | 위험 25 | 과시 −20 | 지속 25 | 지향 동성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2078-04-11에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 구의수비대 구의 펌프실 정비사, 곽민재의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 펌프실 마모표·정비 키 관리 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 펌프실 마모표·정비 키 관리 창구가 선솔우의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수비대원. 직함은 구의수비대 구의 펌프실 정비사, 곽민재의 실무 담당자. 펌프실 마모표·정비 키 관리 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.","일화":"상수관이 터진 직후 수비대가 키를 요구하자 선솔우는 걸이못을 비우지 않고 마모표에 파손 시각만 적었다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.","관계":"곽민재의 잔압 식을 임펠러 이빨에 맞추는 신도이고, 문하율의 능선 감시가 배관을 얼리기 전에 개폐 시각을 맞춘다. 고서준의 관문 수리가 펌프실 키를 빌려 가면 마모표에 빈칸을 남긴다.","야망":"선솔우는 구의수비대 구의 펌프실 정비사, 곽민재의 실무 담당자 직무에서 펌프실 마모표·정비 키 관리 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.","공포":"구의수비대 구의 펌프실 정비사, 곽민재의 실무 담당자 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"이빨 마모표를 파손 시각과 겹쳐 읽거나, 걸이못의 키를 양군이 함께 정한 걸이못에 걸지 정할 수 있다. 선솔우의 펌프실 마모표·정비 키 관리 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"선솔우는 펌프실 마모표·정비 키 관리 기록을 손에 익힌 구의수비대 인물이다. 임펠러 이빨의 마모를 손가락으로 읽고, 구두 개폐는 키 걸이못에 걸지 않는다. 교각 금속음을 패킹 교체 순서로 외운다.\n\n- 생업: 펌프실 마모표·정비 키 관리\n- 소속: 구의수비대\n- 품계: 수비대원\n- 직함: 구의수비대 구의 펌프실 정비사, 곽민재의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2078-04-11에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 구의수비대 구의 펌프실 정비사, 곽민재의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 펌프실 마모표·정비 키 관리 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 펌프실 마모표·정비 키 관리 창구가 선솔우의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수비대원. 직함은 구의수비대 구의 펌프실 정비사, 곽민재의 실무 담당자. 펌프실 마모표·정비 키 관리 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.\n\n**일화.** 상수관이 터진 직후 수비대가 키를 요구하자 선솔우는 걸이못을 비우지 않고 마모표에 파손 시각만 적었다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.\n\n**관계.** 곽민재의 잔압 식을 임펠러 이빨에 맞추는 신도이고, 문하율의 능선 감시가 배관을 얼리기 전에 개폐 시각을 맞춘다. 고서준의 관문 수리가 펌프실 키를 빌려 가면 마모표에 빈칸을 남긴다.\n\n**야망.** 선솔우는 구의수비대 구의 펌프실 정비사, 곽민재의 실무 담당자 직무에서 펌프실 마모표·정비 키 관리 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 구의수비대 구의 펌프실 정비사, 곽민재의 실무 담당자 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 이빨 마모표를 파손 시각과 겹쳐 읽거나, 걸이못의 키를 양군이 함께 정한 걸이못에 걸지 정할 수 있다. 선솔우의 펌프실 마모표·정비 키 관리 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 45 | 개방 −20 | 무력 45 | 물질 10 | 공동 15 | 원칙 0 | 공개 −5 | 자격 10 | 분산 −15 | 변혁 −10\n- 욕망: 갈망 30 | 독점 −30 | 위험 25 | 과시 −20 | 지속 25 | 지향 동성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"선솔우","type":"신도","to":"곽민재","basis":"곽민재의 잔압 식을 임펠러 이빨에 맞추는 신도이고"},{"from":"선솔우","type":"계약","to":"문하율","basis":"문하율의 능선 감시 일정에 맞춰 개폐 시각을 조정한다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"판초담","type":"계약","to":"선솔우","basis":"선솔우의 펌프에 출력을 맞추고"},{"from":"탁윤재","type":"계약","to":"선솔우","basis":"선솔우의 펌프 일지와 잔압을 맞추고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0356', 'c6d0-c6d0-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0356","name":"Won Yena","title":"","position":"","characterId":"K355","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Pier Crack and Transit Invoice Double Seal Verification","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#inmul-wonyena","detailRoute":"/people/person-0356","birthDate":"2074-04-29","birthday":"04-29","age":52,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"bridge-freight-scheduling","name":"Bridge freight scheduling","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"No loading before both seals","description":"A hostile interpretation of damage prompted sealing military invoices and keeping inspection weights. Cargo administration and restraint in reporting are supported.","behavior":"She put passage weight and pier cracks on the same scales and saw a baseless blockade as a waste of troops. She read an invoice stamped with an empty exemption column as a danger signal.","stress":"Fear. That the bridge freight would pass to the water-supply escort under a protection-government pretext and the customs ledger would become empty paper.","relationship":"Relations. Held a contract executing An Giun''s bridge schedule as freight order and matched weights on Won Dagyeol''s gate scales. Passed Nam Hoseong''s medical convoy through first.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: bridge passage logistics merchant. She published the pier cracks and passage weights daily and loaded no military invoice before the double stamp of Go Seojun and the water engineers'' council.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: bridge passage logistics merchant. She published the pier cracks and passage weights daily and loaded no military invoice before the double stamp of Go Seojun and the water engineers'' council.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the bridge freight would pass to the water-supply escort under a protection-government pretext and the customs ledger would become empty paper.","relationship":"Relations. Held a contract executing An Giun''s bridge schedule as freight order and matched weights on Won Dagyeol''s gate scales. Passed Nam Hoseong''s medical convoy through first.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"A hostile interpretation of damage prompted sealing military invoices and keeping inspection weights. Cargo administration and restraint in reporting are supported.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:barony-K355-sea","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"barony","holderPersonId":"K355","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:sea-K355","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c6d0-c6d0-c8fc","name":"Won Clan of Wonju","crest":"clan-crests/c6d0-c6d0-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":50,"Openness":-25,"Force":40,"Material":35,"Communal":20,"Principle":-15,"Public":-10,"Eligibility":-20,"Dispersed":-10,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":10,"Monopoly":0,"Risk":15,"Display":10,"Sustained":30,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Pier Crack and Transit Invoice Double Seal Verification","Affiliation":"The Government Joint Two-Army Working Group","Rank":"Joint Staff Officer","Title":"Two-Army Bridge Transit Logistics Officer","Values":"Authority 50 | Openness −25 | Force 40 | Material 35 | Communal 20 | Principle −15 | Publicity −10 | Qualification −20 | Dispersal −10 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving 10 | Monopoly 0 | Risk 15 | Display 10 | Persistence 30 | Orientation same-sex | Bonding multi-party"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2074-04-29. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Two-Army Bridge Transit Logistics Officer, continuing the records of pier-crack and transit-invoice double-seal verification. The post''s prior selection and handover history is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The pier-crack and transit-invoice double-seal verification desk in Guui 3-dong is Won Yena''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of rank, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Joint Working Member. Title: Two-Army Bridge Transit Logistics Officer. Handles the pier-crack and transit-invoice double-seal verification records and the watch handover within the scope of the current post.","Anecdote":"When a scout unit reported the water main damage as a hostile act, Won Yena sealed the military transit invoices and left only the inspection weight. The record left that day became the handover basis for the next watch to cross-check.","Relationships":"A contract that enforces An Gijun''s bridge schedule in cargo order and matches weights to Won Dagyeol''s gate scale. Gives priority passage to Nam Hoseong''s mandatory escorts.","Ambition":"In the post of Two-Army Bridge Transit Logistics Officer, Won Yena seeks to mesh the pier-crack and transit-invoice double-seal verification records with the public handover table.","Fear":"Fears that a record gap in the Two-Army Bridge Transit Logistics Officer''s watch will become a passage for a unilateral order bearing a patron''s crest.","Intervention":"Can prove the cause of damage by cargo weight, or refuse to hand over the bridge keys without the joint approval of both armies. Can cross-check Won Yena''s pier-crack and transit-invoice double-seal verification ledger to establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Won Yena is a Two-Army joint-operations figure of The Government who is practiced in pier-crack and transit-invoice double-seal verification records. Puts transit weight and pier cracks on the same scale, and regards a blockade without grounds as a waste of troops. Treats an invoice stamped with a blank exemption box as a danger signal.\n\n- Livelihood: pier-crack and transit-invoice double-seal verification\n- Affiliation: The Government Two-Army Joint Operations\n- Rank: Joint Working Member\n- Title: Two-Army Bridge Transit Logistics Officer\n**Life.** Born 2074-04-29. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Two-Army Bridge Transit Logistics Officer, continuing the records of pier-crack and transit-invoice double-seal verification. The post''s prior selection and handover history is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The pier-crack and transit-invoice double-seal verification desk in Guui 3-dong is Won Yena''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of rank, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Joint Working Member. Title: Two-Army Bridge Transit Logistics Officer. Handles the pier-crack and transit-invoice double-seal verification records and the watch handover within the scope of the current post.\n\n**Anecdote.** When a scout unit reported the water main damage as a hostile act, Won Yena sealed the military transit invoices and left only the inspection weight. The record left that day became the handover basis for the next watch to cross-check.\n\n**Relations.** A contract that enforces An Gijun''s bridge schedule in cargo order and matches weights to Won Dagyeol''s gate scale. Gives priority passage to Nam Hoseong''s mandatory escorts.\n\n**Ambition.** In the post of Two-Army Bridge Transit Logistics Officer, Won Yena seeks to mesh the pier-crack and transit-invoice double-seal verification records with the public handover table.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that a record gap in the Two-Army Bridge Transit Logistics Officer''s watch will become a passage for a unilateral order bearing a patron''s crest.\n\n**Intervention.** Can prove the cause of damage by cargo weight, or refuse to hand over the bridge keys without the joint approval of both armies. Can cross-check Won Yena''s pier-crack and transit-invoice double-seal verification ledger to establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 50 | Openness −25 | Force 40 | Material 35 | Communal 20 | Principle −15 | Publicity −10 | Qualification −20 | Dispersal −10 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 10 | Monopoly 0 | Risk 15 | Display 10 | Persistence 30 | Orientation same-sex | Bonding multi-party\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Won Yena","type":"Command","to":"An Gijun","basis":"is a contract that enforces An Gijun''s bridge schedule in cargo order,"},{"from":"Won Yena","type":"Contract","to":"Won Da-gyeol","basis":"matches weights to Won Dagyeol''s gate scale"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Won Da-gyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Won Yena","basis":"matches the bridge invoices and market rates with Won Yena''s, and"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0356","name":"원예나","title":"","position":"","characterId":"K355","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"교각 균열·통행 송장 이중 날인 확인","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-원예나","detailRoute":"/people/person-0356","birthDate":"2074-04-29","birthday":"04-29","age":52,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"bridge-freight-scheduling","name":"교량 화물 배치","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"이중 날인 전에는 싣지 않는다","description":"파손이 적대행위로 보고되자 군 송장을 봉인하고 점검 무게만 남겼다. 화물 운영과 보고의 절제를 반영한다.","behavior":"통행 무게와 교각 균열을 같은 저울에 올리고, 근거 없는 봉쇄를 병력 낭비라고 본다. 빈 면제 칸이 찍힌 송장을 위험 신호로 본다.","stress":"공포. 교량 화물이 일방의 군령으로 상수호위단에 넘어가 세리 원장이 빈 종이가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 안기준의 교량 일정을 화물 순서로 집행하는 계약이고, 원다결의 관문 저울에 무게를 맞춘다. 남호성의 의무호송을 우선 통과시킨다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 공동실무원. 직함은 양군 교량 통과 물류상. 교각 균열과 통행 무게를 매일 공개하고, 군 통행 송장은 아관사와 구의수비대의 이중 날인이 있기 전에는 싣지 않는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 공동실무원. 직함은 양군 교량 통과 물류상. 교각 균열과 통행 무게를 매일 공개하고, 군 통행 송장은 아관사와 구의수비대의 이중 날인이 있기 전에는 싣지 않는다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 교량 화물이 일방의 군령으로 상수호위단에 넘어가 세리 원장이 빈 종이가 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 안기준의 교량 일정을 화물 순서로 집행하는 계약이고, 원다결의 관문 저울에 무게를 맞춘다. 남호성의 의무호송을 우선 통과시킨다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"파손이 적대행위로 보고되자 군 송장을 봉인하고 점검 무게만 남겼다. 화물 운영과 보고의 절제를 반영한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:barony-K355-sea","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"barony","holderPersonId":"K355","stateId":"S06","politicalParentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:sea-K355","directLiegePersonId":"K144"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c6d0-c6d0-c8fc","name":"원주 원씨","crest":"clan-crests/c6d0-c6d0-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":50,"개방":-25,"무력":40,"물질":35,"공동":20,"원칙":-15,"공개":-10,"자격":-20,"분산":-10,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":10,"독점":0,"위험":15,"과시":10,"지속":30,"지향":"동성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"교각 균열·통행 송장 이중 날인 확인","소속":"아관사 양군 공동실무","품계":"공동실무원","직함":"양군 교량 통과 물류상","가치관":"권위 50 | 개방 −25 | 무력 40 | 물질 35 | 공동 20 | 원칙 −15 | 공개 −10 | 자격 −20 | 분산 −10 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 10 | 독점 0 | 위험 15 | 과시 10 | 지속 30 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2074-04-29에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 양군 교량 통과 물류상 직무를 맡아 교각 균열·통행 송장 이중 날인 확인 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 교각 균열·통행 송장 이중 날인 확인 창구가 원예나의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 공동실무원. 직함은 양군 교량 통과 물류상. 교각 균열·통행 송장 이중 날인 확인 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.","일화":"척후대가 상수관 파손을 적대행위로 보고하자 원예나는 군 통행 송장을 봉인하고 점검 무게만 남겼다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.","관계":"안기준의 교량 일정을 화물 순서로 집행하는 계약이고, 원다결의 관문 저울에 무게를 맞춘다. 남호성의 의무호송을 우선 통과시킨다.","야망":"원예나는 양군 교량 통과 물류상 직무에서 교각 균열·통행 송장 이중 날인 확인 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.","공포":"양군 교량 통과 물류상 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"파손 원인을 화물 무게로 증명하거나, 교량 열쇠를 양군의 공동 승인 없이는 넘기지 않는다. 원예나의 교각 균열·통행 송장 이중 날인 확인 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"원예나는 교각 균열·통행 송장 이중 날인 확인 기록을 손에 익힌 정부 양군 공동실무 인물이다. 통행 무게와 교각 균열을 같은 저울에 올리고, 근거 없는 봉쇄를 병력 낭비라고 본다. 빈 면제 칸이 찍힌 송장을 위험 신호로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 교각 균열·통행 송장 이중 날인 확인\n- 소속: 정부 양군 공동실무\n- 품계: 공동실무원\n- 직함: 양군 교량 통과 물류상\n**생애.** 2074-04-29에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 양군 교량 통과 물류상 직무를 맡아 교각 균열·통행 송장 이중 날인 확인 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 교각 균열·통행 송장 이중 날인 확인 창구가 원예나의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 공동실무원. 직함은 양군 교량 통과 물류상. 교각 균열·통행 송장 이중 날인 확인 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.\n\n**일화.** 척후대가 상수관 파손을 적대행위로 보고하자 원예나는 군 통행 송장을 봉인하고 점검 무게만 남겼다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.\n\n**관계.** 안기준의 교량 일정을 화물 순서로 집행하는 계약이고, 원다결의 관문 저울에 무게를 맞춘다. 남호성의 의무호송을 우선 통과시킨다.\n\n**야망.** 원예나는 양군 교량 통과 물류상 직무에서 교각 균열·통행 송장 이중 날인 확인 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 양군 교량 통과 물류상 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 파손 원인을 화물 무게로 증명하거나, 교량 열쇠를 양군의 공동 승인 없이는 넘기지 않는다. 원예나의 교각 균열·통행 송장 이중 날인 확인 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 50 | 개방 −25 | 무력 40 | 물질 35 | 공동 20 | 원칙 −15 | 공개 −10 | 자격 −20 | 분산 −10 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 10 | 독점 0 | 위험 15 | 과시 10 | 지속 30 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"원예나","type":"지휘","to":"안기준","basis":"안기준의 교량 일정을 화물 순서로 집행하는 계약이고"},{"from":"원예나","type":"계약","to":"원다결","basis":"원다결의 관문 저울에 무게를 맞춘다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"원다결","type":"계약","to":"원예나","basis":"원예나의 교량 송장과 시세를 맞추고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0357', 'c601-c120-cc9c-5f71', '{"id":"person-0357","name":"Yeong Seogon","title":"Ridge and Bridge Duty Medic","position":"Guui Garrison Ridge and Bridge Duty Medic","characterId":"K356","rank":"Garrison Soldier","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Triage Chart, Water Supply Schedule Posting, and War Order Approval Verification","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#inmul-yeongseokon","detailRoute":"/people/person-0357","birthDate":"2071-04-19","birthday":"04-19","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"duty-triage-documentation","name":"Duty triage documentation","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Looks at wounds first","description":"Heat and vitality shape attention to casualties, and transport papers enter the duty ledger. Resolution of armed queues and independent medical experience are unconfirmed.","behavior":"He read a wound''s heat before the hill wind and wrote a sentry''s solitary blockade down as a cause of interrupted care. An enemy''s wound, when the pulse fell, rode the same stretcher.","stress":"Fear. That on the night the hill was pierced the clinic would become a war-booty window and the residual-pressure record and the sickbeds would empty together.","relationship":"Relations. Shared sickbeds with Yeong Hanmoe''s bridge clinic and moved Nam Hoseong''s convoy passes into the duty ledger. Pasted Ryu Eunbi''s care principles on the hill sickbeds too.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: ridge and bridge duty medic. He posted the severity table and the water-supply hours on the same chalkboard and let no wartime sole-command note reach the sickbeds before the engineers'' council veto lifted.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: ridge and bridge duty medic. He posted the severity table and the water-supply hours on the same chalkboard and let no wartime sole-command note reach the sickbeds before the engineers'' council veto lifted.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That on the night the hill was pierced the clinic would become a war-booty window and the residual-pressure record and the sickbeds would empty together.","relationship":"Relations. Shared sickbeds with Yeong Hanmoe''s bridge clinic and moved Nam Hoseong''s convoy passes into the duty ledger. Pasted Ryu Eunbi''s care principles on the hill sickbeds too.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Heat and vitality shape attention to casualties, and transport papers enter the duty ledger. Resolution of armed queues and independent medical experience are unconfirmed.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c601-c120-cc9c-5f71","name":"Yeong Clan by Birth","crest":"clan-crests/c601-c120-cc9c-5f71.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":45,"Openness":-10,"Force":10,"Material":5,"Communal":15,"Principle":5,"Public":-5,"Eligibility":-5,"Dispersed":-30,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":-25,"Risk":10,"Display":5,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Triage Chart, Water Supply Schedule Posting, and War Order Approval Verification","Affiliation":"Guui Garrison","Rank":"Garrison Soldier","Title":"Guui Garrison Ridge and Bridge Duty Medic","Values":"Authority 45 | Openness −10 | Force 10 | Material 5 | Communal 15 | Principle 5 | Publicity −5 | Qualification −5 | Dispersal −30 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly −25 | Risk 10 | Display 5 | Persistence 5 | Orientation same-sex | Bonding multi-party"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2071-04-19. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Ridge-and-Bridge Watch Medic of the Guui Garrison, continuing the records of triage charts, water-time postings, and war-order approval checks. The post''s prior selection and handover history is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The triage chart, water-time posting, and war-order approval check desk in Guui 3-dong is Yeong Seokon''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of rank, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Garrison Member. Title: Ridge-and-Bridge Watch Medic of the Guui Garrison. Handles the records of triage charts, water-time postings, and war-order approval checks and the watch handover within the scope of the current post.","Anecdote":"On the night smoke from the water main damage on the bridge side was mistaken for a hostile beacon, an armed queue had been wedged as a single line into the infirmary waiting list. The record left that day became the handover basis for the next watch to cross-check.","Relationships":"Shares the bridge infirmary and its beds with Yeong Hanmoe, and transfers Nam Hoseong''s escort passes into the watch ledger. Also applies Ryu Eunbi''s treatment principles to the highland beds.","Ambition":"In the post of Ridge-and-Bridge Watch Medic of the Guui Garrison, Yeong Seokon seeks to mesh the records of triage charts, water-time postings, and war-order approval checks with the public handover table.","Fear":"Fears that a record gap in the Guui Garrison Ridge-and-Bridge Watch Medic''s watch will become a passage for a unilateral order bearing a patron''s crest.","Intervention":"Can separate the armed line from the patient line, or carry the escort pass draft as far as Jegi-dong. Can cross-check Yeong Seokon''s ledger of triage charts, water-time postings, and war-order approval checks to establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Yeong Seok-on is a Guui Garrison figure who has made triage charts, water-supply schedule postings and war-order sign-off verification records second nature. He reads the heat of a wound before the wind on the heights, and he records a sentry''s unilateral blockade as the cause of a treatment halt. Even an enemy''s wounded are treated as the same stretcher case once their vitality drops.\n\n- Trade: Triage charts, water-supply schedule postings, war-order sign-off verification\n- Affiliation: Guui Garrison\n- Rank: Garrison Member\n- Title: Ridge-and-Bridge Duty Medic of the Guui Garrison\n**Life.** Born on 2071-04-19. As of the 2126 opening, he holds the post of Ridge-and-Bridge Duty Medic of the Guui Garrison and continues the records of triage charts, water-supply schedule postings and war-order sign-off verification. The earlier selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The triage chart, water-supply schedule posting and war-order sign-off verification window in Guui 3-dong is Yeong Seok-on''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles, fiefs or tenure.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Garrison Member. Title: Ridge-and-Bridge Duty Medic of the Guui Garrison. He handles the records of triage charts, water-supply schedule postings and war-order sign-off verification, along with duty handovers, within the scope of his current post.\n\n**Anecdote.** On the night he mistook smoke from a broken water main near the bridge for a hostile beacon, an armed queue had slipped in as one line in the infirmary waiting list. The record left from that day became the handover evidence for the next duty shift to cross-check.\n\n**Relationships.** He shares beds with Yeong Hanmoe''s bridge infirmary and copies Nam Hoseong''s escort passes into the duty ledger. He applies Ryu Eunbi''s treatment principles to the beds on the heights as well.\n\n**Ambition.** In his post as Ridge-and-Bridge Duty Medic of the Guui Garrison, Yeong Seok-on seeks to make the records of triage charts, water-supply schedule postings and war-order sign-off verification mesh with the public handover table.\n\n**Fear.** He fears that a gap in the Ridge-and-Bridge Duty Medic''s duty records will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.\n\n**Intervention.** He can separate the armed line from the patient line, or carry a draft escort pass as far as Jegi-dong. By cross-checking Yeong Seok-on''s ledger of triage charts, water-supply schedule postings and war-order sign-off verification, he can establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 45 | Openness −10 | Force 10 | Materialism 5 | Community 15 | Principle 5 | Publicity −5 | Credentials −5 | Dispersion −30 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Exclusivity −25 | Risk 10 | Display 5 | Endurance 5 | Orientation same-sex | Bonding polyamorous\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Yeong Seogon","type":"Contract","to":"Nam Hoseong","basis":"Copies Nam Hoseong''s convoy pass into the duty ledger"},{"from":"Yeong Seogon","type":"Contract","to":"Yeong Han-moe","basis":"Shares beds with Yeong Hanmoe''s bridge infirmary"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Yeong Han-moe","type":"Contract","to":"Yeong Seogon","basis":"Shares the ward with Yeong Seok-on''s duty cot"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0357","name":"영석온","title":"능선·교량 당직 의무원","position":"구의수비대 능선·교량 당직 의무원","characterId":"K356","rank":"수비대원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"중증도 표·급수 시간 게시·전쟁명령 결재 확인","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-영석온","detailRoute":"/people/person-0357","birthDate":"2071-04-19","birthday":"04-19","age":55,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"duty-triage-documentation","name":"당직 중증도 기록","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"상처를 먼저 본다","description":"상처의 열과 활력으로 부상자를 보고 호송증을 당직 원장에 옮긴다. 혼입된 무장 줄의 해결이나 독립 의료 경력은 미확인이다.","behavior":"고지 바람보다 상처의 열을 먼저 읽고, 초병의 단독 차단을 진료 중단의 원인으로 적는다. 적의 부상도 활력이 떨어지면 같은 들것으로 본다.","stress":"공포. 고지가 뚫린 밤에 의무소가 전리품 창구로 바뀌고 잔압 기록과 병상이 함께 비는 것.","relationship":"관계. 영한뫼의 교량 의무소와 병상을 나누고, 남호성의 호송증을 당직 원장에 옮긴다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 고지 침상에도 붙인다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 수비대원. 직함은 구의수비대 능선·교량 당직 의무원. 중증도 표와 급수 시간을 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 단독 전쟁명령 쪽지는 구의수비대의 결재이 풀리기 전에는 침상에 들이지 않는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 수비대원. 직함은 구의수비대 능선·교량 당직 의무원. 중증도 표와 급수 시간을 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 단독 전쟁명령 쪽지는 구의수비대의 결재이 풀리기 전에는 침상에 들이지 않는다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 고지가 뚫린 밤에 의무소가 전리품 창구로 바뀌고 잔압 기록과 병상이 함께 비는 것.","relationship":"관계. 영한뫼의 교량 의무소와 병상을 나누고, 남호성의 호송증을 당직 원장에 옮긴다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 고지 침상에도 붙인다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"상처의 열과 활력으로 부상자를 보고 호송증을 당직 원장에 옮긴다. 혼입된 무장 줄의 해결이나 독립 의료 경력은 미확인이다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c601-c120-cc9c-5f71","name":"선천 영씨","crest":"clan-crests/c601-c120-cc9c-5f71.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":45,"개방":-10,"무력":10,"물질":5,"공동":15,"원칙":5,"공개":-5,"자격":-5,"분산":-30,"변혁":-5},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":-25,"위험":10,"과시":5,"지속":5,"지향":"동성","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"중증도 표·급수 시간 게시·전쟁명령 결재 확인","소속":"구의수비대","품계":"수비대원","직함":"구의수비대 능선·교량 당직 의무원","가치관":"권위 45 | 개방 −10 | 무력 10 | 물질 5 | 공동 15 | 원칙 5 | 공개 −5 | 자격 −5 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −5","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 −25 | 위험 10 | 과시 5 | 지속 5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2071-04-19에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 구의수비대 능선·교량 당직 의무원 직무를 맡아 중증도 표·급수 시간 게시·전쟁명령 결재 확인 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 중증도 표·급수 시간 게시·전쟁명령 결재 확인 창구가 영석온의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 수비대원. 직함은 구의수비대 능선·교량 당직 의무원. 중증도 표·급수 시간 게시·전쟁명령 결재 확인 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.","일화":"교량 쪽 상수관 파손 연기를 적대 봉화로 오인한 밤, 의무소 대기표에 무장 대기열이 한 줄 끼어 있었다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.","관계":"영한뫼의 교량 의무소와 병상을 나누고, 남호성의 호송증을 당직 원장에 옮긴다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 고지 침상에도 붙인다.","야망":"영석온은 구의수비대 능선·교량 당직 의무원 직무에서 중증도 표·급수 시간 게시·전쟁명령 결재 확인 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.","공포":"구의수비대 능선·교량 당직 의무원 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"무장 줄을 환자 줄과 분리하거나, 호송증 초안을 제기동까지 운반할 수 있다. 영석온의 중증도 표·급수 시간 게시·전쟁명령 결재 확인 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"영석온은 중증도 표·급수 시간 게시·전쟁명령 결재 확인 기록을 손에 익힌 구의수비대 인물이다. 고지 바람보다 상처의 열을 먼저 읽고, 초병의 단독 차단을 진료 중단의 원인으로 적는다. 적의 부상도 활력이 떨어지면 같은 들것으로 본다.\n\n- 생업: 중증도 표·급수 시간 게시·전쟁명령 결재 확인\n- 소속: 구의수비대\n- 품계: 수비대원\n- 직함: 구의수비대 능선·교량 당직 의무원\n**생애.** 2071-04-19에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 구의수비대 능선·교량 당직 의무원 직무를 맡아 중증도 표·급수 시간 게시·전쟁명령 결재 확인 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 중증도 표·급수 시간 게시·전쟁명령 결재 확인 창구가 영석온의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 수비대원. 직함은 구의수비대 능선·교량 당직 의무원. 중증도 표·급수 시간 게시·전쟁명령 결재 확인 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.\n\n**일화.** 교량 쪽 상수관 파손 연기를 적대 봉화로 오인한 밤, 의무소 대기표에 무장 대기열이 한 줄 끼어 있었다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.\n\n**관계.** 영한뫼의 교량 의무소와 병상을 나누고, 남호성의 호송증을 당직 원장에 옮긴다. 류은비의 치료 원칙을 고지 침상에도 붙인다.\n\n**야망.** 영석온은 구의수비대 능선·교량 당직 의무원 직무에서 중증도 표·급수 시간 게시·전쟁명령 결재 확인 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 구의수비대 능선·교량 당직 의무원 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 무장 줄을 환자 줄과 분리하거나, 호송증 초안을 제기동까지 운반할 수 있다. 영석온의 중증도 표·급수 시간 게시·전쟁명령 결재 확인 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 45 | 개방 −10 | 무력 10 | 물질 5 | 공동 15 | 원칙 5 | 공개 −5 | 자격 −5 | 분산 −30 | 변혁 −5\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 −25 | 위험 10 | 과시 5 | 지속 5 | 지향 동성 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"영석온","type":"계약","to":"남호성","basis":"남호성의 호송증을 당직 원장에 옮긴다"},{"from":"영석온","type":"계약","to":"영한뫼","basis":"영한뫼의 교량 의무소와 병상을 나누고"}],"incoming":[{"from":"영한뫼","type":"계약","to":"영석온","basis":"영석온의 당직 침상과 병상을 나누고"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0358', 'd310-d574-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0358","name":"Pan Neulsaem","title":"Achasan Ridge Patrol, Mun Hayul''s Aide","position":"The Government Achasan Ridge Patrol, Mun Hayul''s Aide","characterId":"K357","rank":"Sergeant","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Beacon and Whistle Blocking and Joint Approval Document Record","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#person-pan-neulsaem","detailRoute":"/people/person-0358","birthDate":"2064-02-08","birthday":"02-08","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":5,"effective":5}},"skills":[{"id":"ridge-patrol","name":"Ridge patrol","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Blocks before approval","description":"Pipe smoke was mistaken for a hostile beacon and closure came first. Patrol performance is recognized without treating the mistake as successful insight.","behavior":"A light he had seen once he reported before its nationality, and he kept no meeting-room after-approvals at the outpost. Direct, he hated stamps more than mountain wind.","stress":"Fear. That the hill would be pierced and the Guui purification works and the eastern bridges would open on the same night.","relationship":"Relations. Rounded the ridge under Mun Hayul''s command and shared the whistle with Seon Neulbom''s outpost duty. He did not hear Bae Woojin''s guardianship offer before Go Seojun did.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: Achasan ridge patrol, duty officer of Mun Hayul. He blocked first with beacon and whistle and took after-approval from Go Seojun, but he pasted no peacetime joint-approval papers on the outpost wall.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: Achasan ridge patrol, duty officer of Mun Hayul. He blocked first with beacon and whistle and took after-approval from Go Seojun, but he pasted no peacetime joint-approval papers on the outpost wall.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the hill would be pierced and the Guui purification works and the eastern bridges would open on the same night.","relationship":"Relations. Rounded the ridge under Mun Hayul''s command and shared the whistle with Seon Neulbom''s outpost duty. He did not hear Bae Woojin''s guardianship offer before Go Seojun did.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Pipe smoke was mistaken for a hostile beacon and closure came first. Patrol performance is recognized without treating the mistake as successful insight.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d310-d574-c8fc","name":"Pan Clan of Haeju","crest":"clan-crests/d310-d574-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":45,"Openness":-25,"Force":60,"Material":15,"Communal":10,"Principle":10,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":-20,"Dispersed":-20,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-15,"Risk":10,"Display":25,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Beacon and Whistle Blocking and Joint Approval Document Record","Affiliation":"Russian Legation Command","Rank":"Sergeant","Title":"The Government Achasan Ridge Patrol, Mun Hayul''s Aide","Values":"Authority 45 | Openness −25 | Force 60 | Materialism 15 | Community 10 | Principle 10 | Publicity −15 | Credentials −20 | Dispersion −20 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 0 | Exclusivity −15 | Risk 10 | Display 25 | Endurance −15 | Orientation none | Bonding non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2064-02-08. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of The Government Achasan Ridge Patrol, Mun Hayul''s working-level aide, and continues the records of beacon and whistle blockades and joint-approval documents. The earlier selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The beacon, whistle blockade and joint-approval document record window in Guui 2-dong is Pan Neulsaem''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles, fiefs or tenure.","Offices":"Rank: Sergeant. Title: The Government Achasan Ridge Patrol, Mun Hayul''s working-level aide. Handles beacon and whistle blockade and joint-approval document records, along with duty handovers, within the scope of the current post.","Anecdote":"Pan Neulsaem mistook smoke from a broken water main near the bridge for a hostile beacon and ordered the ridge blockade first. The record left from that day became the handover evidence for the next duty shift to cross-check.","Relationships":"Walks the ridge under Mun Hayul''s command and shares whistles with Seon Neulbom''s post duty. Does not hear Bae Ujin''s patronage offer before Go Seojun does.","Ambition":"In the post of The Government Achasan Ridge Patrol, Mun Hayul''s working-level aide, Pan Neulsaem seeks to make the records of beacon and whistle blockades and joint-approval documents mesh with the public handover table.","Fear":"Fears that a gap in the duty records of the Government Achasan Ridge Patrol, Mun Hayul''s working-level aide, will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.","Intervention":"Can correct a mistaken beacon, or use a sentry''s unilateral blockade as evidence of one side''s expanded command authority. By cross-checking Pan Neulsaem''s ledger of beacon and whistle blockade and joint-approval document records, can establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Pan Neulsaem is an Agwansa figure who has made beacon and whistle blockade and joint-approval document records second nature. A light seen once is reported before nationality is considered, and a meeting room''s after-the-fact approval is not brought to the post. Blunt, and dislikes seals more than mountain wind.\n\n- Trade: Beacon and whistle blockades, joint-approval document records\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Sergeant\n- Title: The Government Achasan Ridge Patrol, Mun Hayul''s working-level aide\n**Life.** Born on 2064-02-08. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of The Government Achasan Ridge Patrol, Mun Hayul''s working-level aide, and continues the records of beacon and whistle blockades and joint-approval documents. The earlier selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The beacon, whistle blockade and joint-approval document record window in Guui 2-dong is Pan Neulsaem''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles, fiefs or tenure.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Sergeant. Title: The Government Achasan Ridge Patrol, Mun Hayul''s working-level aide. Handles beacon and whistle blockade and joint-approval document records, along with duty handovers, within the scope of the current post.\n\n**Anecdote.** Pan Neulsaem mistook smoke from a broken water main near the bridge for a hostile beacon and ordered the ridge blockade first. The record left from that day became the handover evidence for the next duty shift to cross-check.\n\n**Relationships.** Walks the ridge under Mun Hayul''s command and shares whistles with Seon Neulbom''s post duty. Does not hear Bae Ujin''s patronage offer before Go Seojun does.\n\n**Ambition.** In the post of The Government Achasan Ridge Patrol, Mun Hayul''s working-level aide, Pan Neulsaem seeks to make the records of beacon and whistle blockades and joint-approval documents mesh with the public handover table.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that a gap in the duty records of the Government Achasan Ridge Patrol, Mun Hayul''s working-level aide, will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.\n\n**Intervention.** Can correct a mistaken beacon, or use a sentry''s unilateral blockade as evidence of one side''s expanded command authority. By cross-checking Pan Neulsaem''s ledger of beacon and whistle blockade and joint-approval document records, can establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 45 | Openness −25 | Force 60 | Materialism 15 | Community 10 | Principle 10 | Publicity −15 | Credentials −20 | Dispersion −20 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Exclusivity −15 | Risk 10 | Display 25 | Endurance −15 | Orientation none | Bonding non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Pan Neulsaem","type":"Command","to":"Mun Hayul","basis":"Patrols the ridge under Mun Hayul''s command,"},{"from":"Pan Neulsaem","type":"Contract","to":"Seon Neul-bom","basis":"Shares whistles with Seon Neulbom''s post duty"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Seon Neul-bom","type":"Command","to":"Pan Neulsaem","basis":"Shares Pan Neulsaem''s patrol whistle with the duty shift"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0358","name":"판늘샘","title":"아차산 능선 순찰대, 문하율의 실무 담당자","position":"정부 아차산 능선 순찰대, 문하율의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K357","rank":"병장","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"봉화·호각 차단·공동승인 문서 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-판늘샘","detailRoute":"/people/person-0358","birthDate":"2064-02-08","birthday":"02-08","age":62,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":5,"effective":5},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":8,"effective":8},"learning":{"base":7,"effective":7},"prowess":{"base":5,"effective":5}},"skills":[{"id":"ridge-patrol","name":"능선 순찰","rating":50}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"승인보다 먼저 차단한다","description":"상수관 연기를 적대 봉화로 오인해 먼저 차단했다. 순찰 수행은 인정하되 오판을 통찰의 성공으로 바꾸지 않는다.","behavior":"한 번 본 불빛은 국적보다 먼저 보고하고, 회의실의 사후 승인을 초소에 두지 않는다. 직선적이고 산바람보다 인장을 싫어한다.","stress":"공포. 고지가 뚫려 구의 정수와 동부 교량이 같은 밤에 열리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 문하율의 지휘로 능선을 돌고, 선늘봄의 초소 당직과 호각을 나눈다. 배우진의 후견 제의를 고서준보다 먼저 듣지 않는다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 병장. 직함은 정부 아차산 능선 순찰대, 문하율의 실무 담당자. 봉화와 호각으로 먼저 막고 차단 경위를 양군에 보고하되, 전쟁·급수 공동승인 문서를 초소 당직 원장에도 남긴다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 병장. 직함은 정부 아차산 능선 순찰대, 문하율의 실무 담당자. 봉화와 호각으로 먼저 막고 차단 경위를 양군에 보고하되, 전쟁·급수 공동승인 문서를 초소 당직 원장에도 남긴다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 고지가 뚫려 구의 정수와 동부 교량이 같은 밤에 열리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 문하율의 지휘로 능선을 돌고, 선늘봄의 초소 당직과 호각을 나눈다. 배우진의 후견 제의를 고서준보다 먼저 듣지 않는다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"상수관 연기를 적대 봉화로 오인해 먼저 차단했다. 순찰 수행은 인정하되 오판을 통찰의 성공으로 바꾸지 않는다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"d310-d574-c8fc","name":"해주 판씨","crest":"clan-crests/d310-d574-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":45,"개방":-25,"무력":60,"물질":15,"공동":10,"원칙":10,"공개":-15,"자격":-20,"분산":-20,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-15,"위험":10,"과시":25,"지속":-15,"지향":"무성향","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"봉화·호각 차단·공동승인 문서 기록","소속":"아관사","품계":"병장","직함":"정부 아차산 능선 순찰대, 문하율의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 45 | 개방 −25 | 무력 60 | 물질 15 | 공동 10 | 원칙 10 | 공개 −15 | 자격 −20 | 분산 −20 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −15 | 위험 10 | 과시 25 | 지속 −15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2064-02-08에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 정부 아차산 능선 순찰대, 문하율의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 봉화·호각 차단·공동승인 문서 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의2동의 봉화·호각 차단·공동승인 문서 기록 창구가 판늘샘의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 병장. 직함은 정부 아차산 능선 순찰대, 문하율의 실무 담당자. 봉화·호각 차단·공동승인 문서 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.","일화":"교량 쪽 상수관 파손 연기를 적대 봉화로 오인해 판늘샘이 능선 차단을 먼저 내렸다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.","관계":"문하율의 지휘로 능선을 돌고, 선늘봄의 초소 당직과 호각을 나눈다. 배우진의 후견 제의를 고서준보다 먼저 듣지 않는다.","야망":"판늘샘은 정부 아차산 능선 순찰대, 문하율의 실무 담당자 직무에서 봉화·호각 차단·공동승인 문서 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.","공포":"정부 아차산 능선 순찰대, 문하율의 실무 담당자 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"오인 봉화를 정정하거나, 초병의 단독 차단을 일방의 지휘권 확대의 증거로 이용할 수 있다. 판늘샘의 봉화·호각 차단·공동승인 문서 기록 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"판늘샘은 봉화·호각 차단·공동승인 문서 기록을 손에 익힌 정부 인물이다. 한 번 본 불빛은 국적보다 먼저 보고하고, 회의실의 사후 승인을 초소에 두지 않는다. 직선적이고 산바람보다 인장을 싫어한다.\n\n- 생업: 봉화·호각 차단·공동승인 문서 기록\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 병장\n- 직함: 정부 아차산 능선 순찰대, 문하율의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2064-02-08에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 정부 아차산 능선 순찰대, 문하율의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 봉화·호각 차단·공동승인 문서 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의2동의 봉화·호각 차단·공동승인 문서 기록 창구가 판늘샘의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 병장. 직함은 정부 아차산 능선 순찰대, 문하율의 실무 담당자. 봉화·호각 차단·공동승인 문서 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.\n\n**일화.** 교량 쪽 상수관 파손 연기를 적대 봉화로 오인해 판늘샘이 능선 차단을 먼저 내렸다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.\n\n**관계.** 문하율의 지휘로 능선을 돌고, 선늘봄의 초소 당직과 호각을 나눈다. 배우진의 후견 제의를 고서준보다 먼저 듣지 않는다.\n\n**야망.** 판늘샘은 정부 아차산 능선 순찰대, 문하율의 실무 담당자 직무에서 봉화·호각 차단·공동승인 문서 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 정부 아차산 능선 순찰대, 문하율의 실무 담당자 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 오인 봉화를 정정하거나, 초병의 단독 차단을 일방의 지휘권 확대의 증거로 이용할 수 있다. 판늘샘의 봉화·호각 차단·공동승인 문서 기록 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 45 | 개방 −25 | 무력 60 | 물질 15 | 공동 10 | 원칙 10 | 공개 −15 | 자격 −20 | 분산 −20 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −15 | 위험 10 | 과시 25 | 지속 −15 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"판늘샘","type":"지휘","to":"문하율","basis":"문하율의 지휘로 능선을 돌고"},{"from":"판늘샘","type":"계약","to":"선늘봄","basis":"선늘봄의 초소 당직과 호각을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"선늘봄","type":"지휘","to":"판늘샘","basis":"판늘샘의 순찰 호각을 당직과 나눈다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0359', 'cc9c-c601-c591', '{"id":"person-0359","name":"Cheon Choyun","title":"Gate Joint Approval Messenger, Ha Yunmok''s Aide","position":"Joint Forces Approval Messenger, Ha Yunmok''s Aide","characterId":"K358","rank":"Joint Staff Officer","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Delivery of Transit Messages and Exemption Passes","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#person-cheon-choyun","detailRoute":"/people/person-0359","birthDate":"2092-09-15","birthday":"09-15","age":34,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"approval-notice-delivery","name":"Approval notice delivery","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Carries verified notices","description":"Conflicting exemption notices were locked away pending authenticity comparison. Sealed delivery and scrutiny are supported, not a final authenticity finding.","behavior":"She refused departure whenever a seal cord sat loose and read a dispatch stamped with an empty exemption column as a cause of accidents. She trusted numbers and stamps over people''s words.","stress":"Fear. That three great powers'' different exemption dispatches, pasted in the same week, would stamp the customs officer a protection-money collector.","relationship":"Relations. Under command to carry Ha Yunmok''s gate ledger only under seal, he shared order with Yeong Hanmoe''s passage ledger. Sought to move Jeong Yura''s loss-compensation clause into the tail of the dispatches.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: gate joint-approval courier, duty officer of Ha Yunmok. He wrote the passage items and the water-supply hours on the same dispatch and delivered military exemptions only on passage permits bearing an audit clause.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: gate joint-approval courier, duty officer of Ha Yunmok. He wrote the passage items and the water-supply hours on the same dispatch and delivered military exemptions only on passage permits bearing an audit clause.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That three great powers'' different exemption dispatches, pasted in the same week, would stamp the customs officer a protection-money collector.","relationship":"Relations. Under command to carry Ha Yunmok''s gate ledger only under seal, he shared order with Yeong Hanmoe''s passage ledger. Sought to move Jeong Yura''s loss-compensation clause into the tail of the dispatches.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Conflicting exemption notices were locked away pending authenticity comparison. Sealed delivery and scrutiny are supported, not a final authenticity finding.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc9c-c601-c591","name":"Yeongyang Cheon Clan","crest":"clan-crests/cc9c-c601-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":35,"Openness":-10,"Force":35,"Material":10,"Communal":10,"Principle":10,"Public":10,"Eligibility":-5,"Dispersed":-15,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":35,"Risk":-15,"Display":-20,"Sustained":-15,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Delivery of Transit Messages and Exemption Passes","Affiliation":"The Government Joint Two-Army Working Group","Rank":"Joint Staff Officer","Title":"Joint Forces Approval Messenger, Ha Yunmok''s Aide","Values":"Authority 35 | Openness −10 | Force 35 | Material 10 | Communal 10 | Principle 10 | Publicity 10 | Qualification −5 | Dispersal −15 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving 25 | Possessiveness 35 | Risk −15 | Display −20 | Endurance −15 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Union: Contract Cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2092-09-15. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Two-Army Approved Herald, Ha Yunmok''s Working Aide, and continues the delivery records for passage dispatches and exemption passes. The post''s prior selection and handover history is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The passage dispatch and exemption pass delivery desk in Guui 1-dong is Cheon Choyun''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs, or tenure rights.","Offices":"Rank: Joint Working Officer. Title: Two-Army Approved Herald, Ha Yunmok''s Working Aide. Handles the passage dispatch and exemption pass delivery records and duty handovers within the scope of the current post.","Anecdote":"When the command staff bearing the crests of three patrons pushed differing water-supply and passage exemption documents on him in the same week, Cheon Choyun locked the exemption dispatches in his bag and demanded an authenticity check. The record left that day became the handover basis for the next duty shift to cross-check.","Relationships":"Takes direction to carry Ha Yunmok''s gate ledger only while sealed, and shares Yeong Hanmoe''s passage ledger and rota. Intends to copy Jeong Yura''s loss-compensation clause onto the end of the dispatch.","Ambition":"In the post of Two-Army Approved Herald, Ha Yunmok''s Working Aide, Cheon Choyun intends to mesh the passage dispatch and exemption pass delivery records with the public handover table.","Fear":"Fears that gaps in the records of the Two-Army Approved Herald, Ha Yunmok''s Working Aide duty shift will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.","Intervention":"Can obscure the authentic copy of an exemption document, or carry the gate ledger in the Suseo Accord draft. Can cross-check Cheon Choyun''s passage dispatch and exemption pass delivery ledger to establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Cheon Choyun is The Government Two-Army Joint Operations figure practiced in the delivery records for passage dispatches and exemption passes. Refuses to depart if the seal cord is slack, and treats a dispatch stamped with a blank exemption field as the cause of an accident. Trusts numbers and seals over what people say.\n\n- Occupation: Delivery of passage dispatches and exemption passes\n- Affiliation: The Government Two-Army Joint Operations\n- Rank: Joint Working Officer\n- Title: Two-Army Approved Herald, Ha Yunmok''s Working Aide\n**Life.** Born 2092-09-15. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Two-Army Approved Herald, Ha Yunmok''s Working Aide, and continues the delivery records for passage dispatches and exemption passes. The post''s prior selection and handover history is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The passage dispatch and exemption pass delivery desk in Guui 1-dong is Cheon Choyun''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs, or tenure rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Joint Working Officer. Title: Two-Army Approved Herald, Ha Yunmok''s Working Aide. Handles the passage dispatch and exemption pass delivery records and duty handovers within the scope of the current post.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the command staff bearing the crests of three patrons pushed differing water-supply and passage exemption documents on him in the same week, Cheon Choyun locked the exemption dispatches in his bag and demanded an authenticity check. The record left that day became the handover basis for the next duty shift to cross-check.\n\n**Relationships.** Takes direction to carry Ha Yunmok''s gate ledger only while sealed, and shares Yeong Hanmoe''s passage ledger and rota. Intends to copy Jeong Yura''s loss-compensation clause onto the end of the dispatch.\n\n**Ambition.** In the post of Two-Army Approved Herald, Ha Yunmok''s Working Aide, Cheon Choyun intends to mesh the passage dispatch and exemption pass delivery records with the public handover table.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that gaps in the records of the Two-Army Approved Herald, Ha Yunmok''s Working Aide duty shift will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.\n\n**Intervention.** Can obscure the authentic copy of an exemption document, or carry the gate ledger in the Suseo Accord draft. Can cross-check Cheon Choyun''s passage dispatch and exemption pass delivery ledger to establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 35 | Openness −10 | Force 35 | Material 10 | Communal 10 | Principle 10 | Publicity 10 | Qualification −5 | Dispersal −15 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Possessiveness 35 | Risk −15 | Display −20 | Endurance −15 | Orientation: Opposite-sex | Union: Contract Cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Cheon Choyun","type":"Command","to":"Ha Yunmok","basis":"takes orders to carry Ha Yunmok''s gate ledger only under seal,"},{"from":"Cheon Choyun","type":"Command","to":"Yeong Han-moe","basis":"Shares Yeong Hanmoe''s passage ledger and rota"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Bang Ma-reum","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Cheon Choyun","basis":"Leaves a copy of Cheon Choyun''s dispatch on the same line"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0359","name":"천초윤","title":"관문 공동승인 전령, 하윤목의 실무 담당자","position":"양군 승인 전령, 하윤목의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K358","rank":"공동실무원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"통과 전갈·면제 통행증 배달","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-천초윤","detailRoute":"/people/person-0359","birthDate":"2092-09-15","birthday":"09-15","age":34,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":11,"effective":11},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":9,"effective":9},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"approval-notice-delivery","name":"승인 전갈 전달","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"진본 전갈만 나른다","description":"서로 다른 면제 전갈을 잠그고 진본 대조를 요구했다. 봉인 운송과 문서 분별은 확인되지만 최종 진위 판정은 없다.","behavior":"봉인 끈이 느슨하면 출발을 거부하고, 빈 면제 칸이 찍힌 전갈을 사고 원인으로 본다. 숫자와 인장을 사람 말보다 믿는다.","stress":"공포. 세 강국의 서로 다른 면제 전갈이 같은 주에 붙어 세리가 일방의 군사 비용 징수원으로 찍히는 것.","relationship":"관계. 하윤목의 관문 원장을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고, 영한뫼의 통과 원장과 순번을 나눈다. 정유라의 손실보상 조항을 전갈 말미에 옮기려 한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 공동실무원. 직함은 양군 승인 전령, 하윤목의 실무 담당자. 통과 품목과 급수 시간을 같은 전갈에 적고, 군사 면제는 양군 결재와 계약감사 문구가 있는 통행증만 배달한다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 공동실무원. 직함은 양군 승인 전령, 하윤목의 실무 담당자. 통과 품목과 급수 시간을 같은 전갈에 적고, 군사 면제는 양군 결재와 계약감사 문구가 있는 통행증만 배달한다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 세 강국의 서로 다른 면제 전갈이 같은 주에 붙어 세리가 일방의 군사 비용 징수원으로 찍히는 것.","relationship":"관계. 하윤목의 관문 원장을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고, 영한뫼의 통과 원장과 순번을 나눈다. 정유라의 손실보상 조항을 전갈 말미에 옮기려 한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"서로 다른 면제 전갈을 잠그고 진본 대조를 요구했다. 봉인 운송과 문서 분별은 확인되지만 최종 진위 판정은 없다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"cc9c-c601-c591","name":"영양 천씨","crest":"clan-crests/cc9c-c601-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":35,"개방":-10,"무력":35,"물질":10,"공동":10,"원칙":10,"공개":10,"자격":-5,"분산":-15,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":35,"위험":-15,"과시":-20,"지속":-15,"지향":"이성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"통과 전갈·면제 통행증 배달","소속":"아관사 양군 공동실무","품계":"공동실무원","직함":"양군 승인 전령, 하윤목의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 35 | 개방 −10 | 무력 35 | 물질 10 | 공동 10 | 원칙 10 | 공개 10 | 자격 −5 | 분산 −15 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 35 | 위험 −15 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −15 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2092-09-15에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 양군 승인 전령, 하윤목의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 통과 전갈·면제 통행증 배달 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의1동의 통과 전갈·면제 통행증 배달 창구가 천초윤의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 공동실무원. 직함은 양군 승인 전령, 하윤목의 실무 담당자. 통과 전갈·면제 통행증 배달 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.","일화":"세 후원 문장이 붙은 지휘부가 서로 다른 급수·통과 면제 문서를 같은 주에 들이밀자 천초윤은 면제 전갈을 가방에 잠그고 진본 대조를 요구했다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.","관계":"하윤목의 관문 원장을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고, 영한뫼의 통과 원장과 순번을 나눈다. 정유라의 손실보상 조항을 전갈 말미에 옮기려 한다.","야망":"천초윤은 양군 승인 전령, 하윤목의 실무 담당자 직무에서 통과 전갈·면제 통행증 배달 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.","공포":"양군 승인 전령, 하윤목의 실무 담당자 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"면제 문서의 진본을 가리거나, 관문 원장을 수서 협약 초안에 실어 나를 수 있다. 천초윤의 통과 전갈·면제 통행증 배달 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"천초윤은 통과 전갈·면제 통행증 배달 기록을 손에 익힌 정부 양군 공동실무 인물이다. 봉인 끈이 느슨하면 출발을 거부하고, 빈 면제 칸이 찍힌 전갈을 사고 원인으로 본다. 숫자와 인장을 사람 말보다 믿는다.\n\n- 생업: 통과 전갈·면제 통행증 배달\n- 소속: 정부 양군 공동실무\n- 품계: 공동실무원\n- 직함: 양군 승인 전령, 하윤목의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2092-09-15에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 양군 승인 전령, 하윤목의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 통과 전갈·면제 통행증 배달 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의1동의 통과 전갈·면제 통행증 배달 창구가 천초윤의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 공동실무원. 직함은 양군 승인 전령, 하윤목의 실무 담당자. 통과 전갈·면제 통행증 배달 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.\n\n**일화.** 세 후원 문장이 붙은 지휘부가 서로 다른 급수·통과 면제 문서를 같은 주에 들이밀자 천초윤은 면제 전갈을 가방에 잠그고 진본 대조를 요구했다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.\n\n**관계.** 하윤목의 관문 원장을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고, 영한뫼의 통과 원장과 순번을 나눈다. 정유라의 손실보상 조항을 전갈 말미에 옮기려 한다.\n\n**야망.** 천초윤은 양군 승인 전령, 하윤목의 실무 담당자 직무에서 통과 전갈·면제 통행증 배달 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 양군 승인 전령, 하윤목의 실무 담당자 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 면제 문서의 진본을 가리거나, 관문 원장을 수서 협약 초안에 실어 나를 수 있다. 천초윤의 통과 전갈·면제 통행증 배달 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 35 | 개방 −10 | 무력 35 | 물질 10 | 공동 10 | 원칙 10 | 공개 10 | 자격 −5 | 분산 −15 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 35 | 위험 −15 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −15 | 지향 이성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"천초윤","type":"지휘","to":"하윤목","basis":"하윤목의 관문 원장을 봉인 상태로만 나르는 지휘를 받고"},{"from":"천초윤","type":"지휘","to":"영한뫼","basis":"영한뫼의 통과 원장과 순번을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"방마름","type":"신도","to":"천초윤","basis":"천초윤의 전갈 사본을 같은 줄에 남긴다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0360', 'b3d9-ad11-cc9c', '{"id":"person-0360","name":"Dong Saebom","title":"Under-Bridge Surveyor, Sim Gaeun''s Aide","position":"Practical Aide to Sim Ga-eun, Under-Bridge Surveyor of The Government","characterId":"K359","rank":"Sergeant","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Under-Bridge Survey Measurements and Hostile Emblem Comparison","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#Person-Dong-Saebom","detailRoute":"/people/person-0360","birthDate":"2090-08-02","birthday":"08-02","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"damage-coordinate-recording","name":"Damage coordinate recording","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Publishes observation only","description":"As hostile reports spread, inference was removed and only cracked pipes published. Information restraint is a strength, not proof of the cause.","behavior":"He had sightings and conjectures written in different inks, but in a crisis he erased the conjecture column and left only the cracked pipe. He pared down in the field a superior''s habit of adding interpretation to fast reports.","stress":"Fear. That one mistaken solid line would spread into an eastern-bridge war and he would become its object of grudges.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice translating Sim Gaeun''s reconnaissance reports into coordinates, he wrote An Giun''s pier-crack names in the margin of the master plate. Exchanged transfer information with Jang Sehwa in dotted lines only.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: bridge underside surveyor, duty officer of Sim Gaeun. He left unsurveyed damage only as dotted lines and moved no hostile-action clause onto the master plate before Go Seojun''s direct report.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: bridge underside surveyor, duty officer of Sim Gaeun. He left unsurveyed damage only as dotted lines and moved no hostile-action clause onto the master plate before Go Seojun''s direct report.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That one mistaken solid line would spread into an eastern-bridge war and he would become its object of grudges.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice translating Sim Gaeun''s reconnaissance reports into coordinates, he wrote An Giun''s pier-crack names in the margin of the master plate. Exchanged transfer information with Jang Sehwa in dotted lines only.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"As hostile reports spread, inference was removed and only cracked pipes published. Information restraint is a strength, not proof of the cause.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b3d9-ad11-cc9c","name":"Gwangcheon Dong Clan","crest":"clan-crests/b3d9-ad11-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":35,"Openness":-15,"Force":35,"Material":0,"Communal":25,"Principle":5,"Public":-20,"Eligibility":0,"Dispersed":-10,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":0,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":-25,"Display":-30,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"None","Union":"Polyamorous"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Under-Bridge Survey Measurements and Hostile Emblem Comparison","Affiliation":"Russian Legation Command","Rank":"Sergeant","Title":"Practical Aide to Sim Ga-eun, Under-Bridge Surveyor of The Government","Values":"Authority 35 | Openness −15 | Force 35 | Material 0 | Communal 25 | Principle 5 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 0 | Dispersal −10 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 0 | Possessiveness −30 | Risk −25 | Display −30 | Endurance −10 | Orientation: None | Union: Polyamorous"},"sections":{"Life":"Born 2090-08-02. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of The Government Under-Bridge Surveyor, Sim Gaeun''s Working Aide, and continues the records of under-bridge surveying and hostile-crest cross-checking. The post''s prior selection and handover history is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The under-bridge surveying and hostile-crest cross-checking desk in Guui 3-dong is Dong Saebom''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble titles, fiefs, or tenure rights.","Offices":"Rank: Sergeant. Title: The Government Under-Bridge Surveyor, Sim Gaeun''s Working Aide. Handles the under-bridge surveying and hostile-crest cross-checking records and duty handovers within the scope of the current post.","Anecdote":"When a scout report recording the water main damage as a hostile act spread across the ridge and the bridges at the same time, Dong Saebom erased the speculation column and disclosed only the cracked pipe. The record left that day became the handover basis for the next duty shift to cross-check.","Relationships":"A scribe who translates Sim Gaeun''s scout reports into coordinates, and writes An Gijun''s names for pier cracks in the margin of the master plate. Exchanges Jang Sehwa''s transfer information only as dotted lines.","Ambition":"In the post of The Government Under-Bridge Surveyor, Sim Gaeun''s Working Aide, Dong Saebom intends to mesh the under-bridge surveying and hostile-crest cross-checking records with the public handover table.","Fear":"Fears that gaps in the records of the Government Under-Bridge Surveyor, Sim Gaeun''s Working Aide duty shift will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.","Intervention":"Can disclose the original of the speculation column, or cover over a misidentified solid line and so accelerate one side''s expansion of command authority. Can cross-check Dong Saebom''s under-bridge surveying and hostile-crest cross-checking ledger to establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Dong Saebom is The Government figure practiced in under-bridge measurement and hostile-crest cross-checking records. Dong has sightings and conjecture written in different colors of ink, but in a crisis erases the conjecture column and leaves only the cracked pipe. Dong trims on site the habit of superiors who write reports quickly but add their own interpretation.\n\n- Livelihood: under-bridge measurement and hostile-crest cross-checking\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Sergeant\n- Title: The Government Under-Bridge Surveyor, Sim Gaeun''s Working-Level Officer\n**Life.** Born on 2090-08-02. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of The Government Under-Bridge Surveyor, Sim Gaeun''s Working-Level Officer, and continues the under-bridge measurement and hostile-crest cross-checking records. The earlier selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The under-bridge measurement and hostile-crest cross-checking desk in Guui 3-dong is Dong Saebom''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Sergeant. Title: The Government Under-Bridge Surveyor, Sim Gaeun''s Working-Level Officer. Handles the under-bridge measurement and hostile-crest cross-checking records and the duty handover within the scope of the current post.\n\n**Anecdote.** When a scout report that recorded water-main damage as a hostile act spread to the ridge and the bridge at the same time, Dong Saebom erased the conjecture column and disclosed only the cracked pipe. The record left that day became the handover basis for the next duty shift to cross-check.\n\n**Relations.** Is the disciple who translates Sim Gaeun''s scout reports into coordinates, and writes An Gijun''s names for pier cracks in the margin of the original plate. Exchanges Jang Sehwa''s transfer information only along dotted lines.\n\n**Ambition.** In the post of The Government Under-Bridge Surveyor, Sim Gaeun''s Working-Level Officer, Dong Saebom intends to mesh the under-bridge measurement and hostile-crest cross-checking records with the public handover table.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that a gap in the records of the Government Under-Bridge Surveyor, Sim Gaeun''s Working-Level Officer, duty shift will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.\n\n**Intervention.** Can release the original of the conjecture column, or cover a mistaken solid line and accelerate one side''s expansion of command authority. Can cross-check Dong Saebom''s under-bridge measurement and hostile-crest cross-checking ledger to establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 35 | Openness −15 | Force 35 | Material 0 | Communal 25 | Principle 5 | Publicity −20 | Qualification 0 | Dispersion −10 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 0 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −25 | Display −30 | Persistence −10 | Orientation None | Union Multi-partner\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Dong Saebom","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Sim Gaeun","basis":"is a mentor–protégé pair who translate Sim Gaeun''s scout reports into coordinates, and"},{"from":"Dong Saebom","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"An Gijun","basis":"writes the names of An Gijun''s pier cracks in the margin of the original plate,"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0360","name":"동새봄","title":"교량 하부 탐사원, 심가은의 실무 담당자","position":"정부 교량 하부 탐사원, 심가은의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K359","rank":"병장","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"교량 하부 실측·적대 문장 대조","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-동새봄","detailRoute":"/people/person-0360","birthDate":"2090-08-02","birthday":"08-02","age":36,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":12,"effective":12},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"damage-coordinate-recording","name":"파손 좌표 기록","rating":60}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"목격만 공개한다","description":"적대 보고가 퍼지자 추정 칸을 지우고 금 간 관만 공개했다. 정보 절제는 강점이며 실제 공격 원인을 확정한 것은 아니다.","behavior":"목격과 추정을 다른 색 먹으로 적게 하지만, 위기 때는 추정 칸을 지우고 금이 간 관만 남긴다. 보고를 빨리 쓰되 해석을 보태는 상관의 버릇을 현장에서 깎는다.","stress":"공포. 오인 실선 한 줄이 동부 교량 전쟁으로 번져 자신이 원한의 대상이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 심가은의 척후 보고를 좌표로 번역하는 신도이고, 안기준의 교각 균열 이름을 원판 여백에 적는다. 장세화의 환승 정보를 점선으로만 맞교환한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 병장. 직함은 정부 교량 하부 탐사원, 심가은의 실무 담당자. 실측하지 않은 파손은 점선으로만 남기고, 적대행위 문장은 양군의 확인 전에는 원판에 옮기지 않는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 병장. 직함은 정부 교량 하부 탐사원, 심가은의 실무 담당자. 실측하지 않은 파손은 점선으로만 남기고, 적대행위 문장은 양군의 확인 전에는 원판에 옮기지 않는다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 오인 실선 한 줄이 동부 교량 전쟁으로 번져 자신이 원한의 대상이 되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 심가은의 척후 보고를 좌표로 번역하는 신도이고, 안기준의 교각 균열 이름을 원판 여백에 적는다. 장세화의 환승 정보를 점선으로만 맞교환한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"적대 보고가 퍼지자 추정 칸을 지우고 금 간 관만 공개했다. 정보 절제는 강점이며 실제 공격 원인을 확정한 것은 아니다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"b3d9-ad11-cc9c","name":"광천 동씨","crest":"clan-crests/b3d9-ad11-cc9c.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":35,"개방":-15,"무력":35,"물질":0,"공동":25,"원칙":5,"공개":-20,"자격":0,"분산":-10,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":0,"독점":-30,"위험":-25,"과시":-30,"지속":-10,"지향":"무성향","결합":"다자"},"fields":{"생업":"교량 하부 실측·적대 문장 대조","소속":"아관사","품계":"병장","직함":"정부 교량 하부 탐사원, 심가은의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 35 | 개방 −15 | 무력 35 | 물질 0 | 공동 25 | 원칙 5 | 공개 −20 | 자격 0 | 분산 −10 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 0 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −25 | 과시 −30 | 지속 −10 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 다자"},"sections":{"생애":"2090-08-02에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 정부 교량 하부 탐사원, 심가은의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 교량 하부 실측·적대 문장 대조 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 교량 하부 실측·적대 문장 대조 창구가 동새봄의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 병장. 직함은 정부 교량 하부 탐사원, 심가은의 실무 담당자. 교량 하부 실측·적대 문장 대조 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.","일화":"상수관 파손을 적대행위로 적은 척후 보고가 능선과 교량에 동시에 퍼지자 동새봄은 추정 칸을 지우고 금 간 관만 공개했다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.","관계":"심가은의 척후 보고를 좌표로 번역하는 신도이고, 안기준의 교각 균열 이름을 원판 여백에 적는다. 장세화의 환승 정보를 점선으로만 맞교환한다.","야망":"동새봄은 정부 교량 하부 탐사원, 심가은의 실무 담당자 직무에서 교량 하부 실측·적대 문장 대조 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.","공포":"정부 교량 하부 탐사원, 심가은의 실무 담당자 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"추정 칸의 원본을 공개하거나, 오인 실선을 덮어 일방의 지휘권 확대를 가속할 수 있다. 동새봄의 교량 하부 실측·적대 문장 대조 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"동새봄은 교량 하부 실측·적대 문장 대조 기록을 손에 익힌 정부 인물이다. 목격과 추정을 다른 색 먹으로 적게 하지만, 위기 때는 추정 칸을 지우고 금이 간 관만 남긴다. 보고를 빨리 쓰되 해석을 보태는 상관의 버릇을 현장에서 깎는다.\n\n- 생업: 교량 하부 실측·적대 문장 대조\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 병장\n- 직함: 정부 교량 하부 탐사원, 심가은의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2090-08-02에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 정부 교량 하부 탐사원, 심가은의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 교량 하부 실측·적대 문장 대조 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의3동의 교량 하부 실측·적대 문장 대조 창구가 동새봄의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 병장. 직함은 정부 교량 하부 탐사원, 심가은의 실무 담당자. 교량 하부 실측·적대 문장 대조 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.\n\n**일화.** 상수관 파손을 적대행위로 적은 척후 보고가 능선과 교량에 동시에 퍼지자 동새봄은 추정 칸을 지우고 금 간 관만 공개했다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.\n\n**관계.** 심가은의 척후 보고를 좌표로 번역하는 신도이고, 안기준의 교각 균열 이름을 원판 여백에 적는다. 장세화의 환승 정보를 점선으로만 맞교환한다.\n\n**야망.** 동새봄은 정부 교량 하부 탐사원, 심가은의 실무 담당자 직무에서 교량 하부 실측·적대 문장 대조 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 정부 교량 하부 탐사원, 심가은의 실무 담당자 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 추정 칸의 원본을 공개하거나, 오인 실선을 덮어 일방의 지휘권 확대를 가속할 수 있다. 동새봄의 교량 하부 실측·적대 문장 대조 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 35 | 개방 −15 | 무력 35 | 물질 0 | 공동 25 | 원칙 5 | 공개 −20 | 자격 0 | 분산 −10 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 0 | 독점 −30 | 위험 −25 | 과시 −30 | 지속 −10 | 지향 무성향 | 결합 다자\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"동새봄","type":"신도","to":"심가은","basis":"심가은의 척후 보고를 좌표로 번역하는 신도이고"},{"from":"동새봄","type":"신도","to":"안기준","basis":"안기준의 교각 균열 이름을 원판 여백에 적는다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0361', 'bc29-c628-c591', '{"id":"person-0361","name":"Bang Ma-reum","title":"Practical Aide to Ha Yun-mok, Gate Passage Recorder","position":"Practical Aide to Ha Yun-mok, Gate Passage Recorder of Both Armies","characterId":"K360","rank":"Joint Staff Officer","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Recording Passage Items and Valid Slots on Exemption Passes","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#Character-Bang-Mareum","detailRoute":"/people/person-0361","birthDate":"2102-03-19","birthday":"03-19","age":24,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"transit-ledger-administration","name":"Transit ledger administration","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Exemptions in the margin","description":"Three exemption documents went into margins and sealing waited for comparison. Transit ledger management and preservation of joint authorization support the profile.","behavior":"He read an empty exemption column as a danger signal and kept an officer''s name long in the ledger margin when the officer shaved headcounts by force. He liked numbers and stamps.","stress":"Fear. That the ledger would sink into a protection-money book and be excluded from the lesser states'' joint negotiation.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice moving Ha Yunmok''s toll arithmetic into the ledger, he left Cheon Choyun''s dispatch copies on the same line. Linked Ra Seyoung''s quarantine stamps to the toll columns.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: gate passage registrar, duty officer of Ha Yunmok. He wrote the passage items and the water-supply hours in the same ledger and raised military exemptions into the valid column only on passage permits bearing an audit clause.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: gate passage registrar, duty officer of Ha Yunmok. He wrote the passage items and the water-supply hours in the same ledger and raised military exemptions into the valid column only on passage permits bearing an audit clause.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the ledger would sink into a protection-money book and be excluded from the lesser states'' joint negotiation.","relationship":"Relations. An apprentice moving Ha Yunmok''s toll arithmetic into the ledger, he left Cheon Choyun''s dispatch copies on the same line. Linked Ra Seyoung''s quarantine stamps to the toll columns.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Three exemption documents went into margins and sealing waited for comparison. Transit ledger management and preservation of joint authorization support the profile.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc29-c628-c591","name":"Onyang Bang Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc29-c628-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":40,"Openness":-10,"Force":35,"Material":10,"Communal":10,"Principle":20,"Public":-5,"Eligibility":0,"Dispersed":-15,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":5,"Monopoly":-40,"Risk":15,"Display":-45,"Sustained":10,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Recording Passage Items and Valid Slots on Exemption Passes","Affiliation":"The Government Joint Two-Army Working Group","Rank":"Joint Staff Officer","Title":"Practical Aide to Ha Yun-mok, Gate Passage Recorder of Both Armies","Values":"Authority 40 | Openness −10 | Force 35 | Material 10 | Communal 10 | Principle 20 | Publicity −5 | Qualification 0 | Dispersion −15 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving 5 | Monopoly −40 | Risk 15 | Display −45 | Persistence 10 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Contract cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2102-03-19. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Two-Army Gate Passage Recorder, Ha Yunmok''s Working-Level Officer, and continues the records of passage items and valid columns of exemption passes. The earlier selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The desk for recording passage items and valid columns of exemption passes in Guui 1-dong is Bang Mareum''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.","Offices":"Rank: Joint Working Staff Member. Title: Two-Army Gate Passage Recorder, Ha Yunmok''s Working-Level Officer. Handles the records of passage items and valid columns of exemption passes and the duty handover within the scope of the current post.","Anecdote":"When commands bearing the crests of three patrons thrust different water-supply and passage exemption documents at Bang Mareum, Bang lowered all three to the margin and did not open the seal before the authentication cross-check was finished. The record left that day became the handover basis for the next duty shift to cross-check.","Relationships":"Is the disciple who transfers Ha Yunmok''s three calculations into the ledger, and leaves copies of Cheon Choyun''s messages on the same line. Links Ra Seyeong''s quarantine stamp to three columns.","Ambition":"In the post of Two-Army Gate Passage Recorder, Ha Yunmok''s Working-Level Officer, Bang Mareum intends to mesh the records of passage items and valid columns of exemption passes with the public handover table.","Fear":"Fears that a gap in the records of the Two-Army Gate Passage Recorder, Ha Yunmok''s Working-Level Officer, duty shift will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.","Intervention":"Can release the margin exemption sheet, or erase one line of the ledger to brand the tax collector a protection-racket collector. Can cross-check Bang Mareum''s ledger of passage items and valid columns of exemption passes to establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Bang Mareum is The Government Two-Army Joint Working Staff figure practiced in recording passage items and valid columns of exemption passes. Bang sees an empty exemption column as a danger signal, and keeps the names of officers who cut levies by force in the ledger margin for a long time. Bang likes numbers and seals.\n\n- Livelihood: recording passage items and valid columns of exemption passes\n- Affiliation: The Government Two-Army Joint Working Staff\n- Rank: Joint Working Staff Member\n- Title: Two-Army Gate Passage Recorder, Ha Yunmok''s Working-Level Officer\n**Life.** Born on 2102-03-19. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Two-Army Gate Passage Recorder, Ha Yunmok''s Working-Level Officer, and continues the records of passage items and valid columns of exemption passes. The earlier selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The desk for recording passage items and valid columns of exemption passes in Guui 1-dong is Bang Mareum''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, titles of nobility, fiefs, or possession rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Joint Working Staff Member. Title: Two-Army Gate Passage Recorder, Ha Yunmok''s Working-Level Officer. Handles the records of passage items and valid columns of exemption passes and the duty handover within the scope of the current post.\n\n**Anecdote.** When commands bearing the crests of three patrons thrust different water-supply and passage exemption documents at Bang Mareum, Bang lowered all three to the margin and did not open the seal before the authentication cross-check was finished. The record left that day became the handover basis for the next duty shift to cross-check.\n\n**Relations.** Is the disciple who transfers Ha Yunmok''s three calculations into the ledger, and leaves copies of Cheon Choyun''s messages on the same line. Links Ra Seyeong''s quarantine stamp to three columns.\n\n**Ambition.** In the post of Two-Army Gate Passage Recorder, Ha Yunmok''s Working-Level Officer, Bang Mareum intends to mesh the records of passage items and valid columns of exemption passes with the public handover table.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that a gap in the records of the Two-Army Gate Passage Recorder, Ha Yunmok''s Working-Level Officer, duty shift will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.\n\n**Intervention.** Can release the margin exemption sheet, or erase one line of the ledger to brand the tax collector a protection-racket collector. Can cross-check Bang Mareum''s ledger of passage items and valid columns of exemption passes to establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 40 | Openness −10 | Force 35 | Material 10 | Communal 10 | Principle 20 | Publicity −5 | Qualification 0 | Dispersion −15 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 5 | Monopoly −40 | Risk 15 | Display −45 | Persistence 10 | Orientation Same-sex | Union Contract cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bang Ma-reum","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Ha Yunmok","basis":"is a priest who transfers Ha Yunmok''s tax calculations into the ledger"},{"from":"Bang Ma-reum","type":"Master and Disciple","to":"Cheon Choyun","basis":"Leaves a copy of Cheon Choyun''s dispatch on the same line"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0361","name":"방마름","title":"관문 통과 기록관, 하윤목의 실무 담당자","position":"양군 관문 통과 기록관, 하윤목의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K360","rank":"공동실무원","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"통과 품목·면제 통행증 유효 칸 기록","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-방마름","detailRoute":"/people/person-0361","birthDate":"2102-03-19","birthday":"03-19","age":24,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":7,"effective":7},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"transit-ledger-administration","name":"통과 원장 정리","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"면제는 난외로","description":"세 장의 면제 문서를 난외로 내리고 대조 전 날인을 보류했다. 통과 원장의 운영과 공동 결재 보존에 근거한다.","behavior":"빈 면제 칸을 위험 신호로 보고, 무력으로 세를 깎는 장교의 이름을 원장 난외에 오래 남긴다. 숫자와 인장을 좋아한다.","stress":"공포. 원장이 일방의 군사 비용 징수 장부로 전락해 공동교섭에서 제외되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 하윤목의 세 계산을 원장으로 옮기는 신도이고, 천초윤의 전갈 사본을 같은 줄에 남긴다. 라세영의 검역 도장을 세 칸에 연동한다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 공동실무원. 직함은 양군 관문 통과 기록관, 하윤목의 실무 담당자. 통과 품목과 급수 시간을 같은 장부에 적고, 군사 면제는 양군 결재와 계약감사 문구가 있는 통행증만 유효 칸에 올린다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 공동실무원. 직함은 양군 관문 통과 기록관, 하윤목의 실무 담당자. 통과 품목과 급수 시간을 같은 장부에 적고, 군사 면제는 양군 결재와 계약감사 문구가 있는 통행증만 유효 칸에 올린다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 원장이 일방의 군사 비용 징수 장부로 전락해 공동교섭에서 제외되는 것.","relationship":"관계. 하윤목의 세 계산을 원장으로 옮기는 신도이고, 천초윤의 전갈 사본을 같은 줄에 남긴다. 라세영의 검역 도장을 세 칸에 연동한다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"세 장의 면제 문서를 난외로 내리고 대조 전 날인을 보류했다. 통과 원장의 운영과 공동 결재 보존에 근거한다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc29-c628-c591","name":"온양 방씨","crest":"clan-crests/bc29-c628-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":40,"개방":-10,"무력":35,"물질":10,"공동":10,"원칙":20,"공개":-5,"자격":0,"분산":-15,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":5,"독점":-40,"위험":15,"과시":-45,"지속":10,"지향":"동성","결합":"계약동거"},"fields":{"생업":"통과 품목·면제 통행증 유효 칸 기록","소속":"아관사 양군 공동실무","품계":"공동실무원","직함":"양군 관문 통과 기록관, 하윤목의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 40 | 개방 −10 | 무력 35 | 물질 10 | 공동 10 | 원칙 20 | 공개 −5 | 자격 0 | 분산 −15 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 5 | 독점 −40 | 위험 15 | 과시 −45 | 지속 10 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거"},"sections":{"생애":"2102-03-19에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 양군 관문 통과 기록관, 하윤목의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 통과 품목·면제 통행증 유효 칸 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의1동의 통과 품목·면제 통행증 유효 칸 기록 창구가 방마름의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 공동실무원. 직함은 양군 관문 통과 기록관, 하윤목의 실무 담당자. 통과 품목·면제 통행증 유효 칸 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.","일화":"세 후원 문장이 붙은 지휘부가 서로 다른 급수·통과 면제 문서를 들이밀자 방마름은 세 장을 난외로 내리고 진본 대조가 끝나기 전에 날인을 열지 않았다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.","관계":"하윤목의 세 계산을 원장으로 옮기는 신도이고, 천초윤의 전갈 사본을 같은 줄에 남긴다. 라세영의 검역 도장을 세 칸에 연동한다.","야망":"방마름은 양군 관문 통과 기록관, 하윤목의 실무 담당자 직무에서 통과 품목·면제 통행증 유효 칸 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.","공포":"양군 관문 통과 기록관, 하윤목의 실무 담당자 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"난외 면제 장을 공개하거나, 원장 한 줄을 지워 세리를 보호 징수원으로 몰 수 있다. 방마름의 통과 품목·면제 통행증 유효 칸 기록 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"방마름은 통과 품목·면제 통행증 유효 칸 기록을 손에 익힌 정부 양군 공동실무 인물이다. 빈 면제 칸을 위험 신호로 보고, 무력으로 세를 깎는 장교의 이름을 원장 난외에 오래 남긴다. 숫자와 인장을 좋아한다.\n\n- 생업: 통과 품목·면제 통행증 유효 칸 기록\n- 소속: 정부 양군 공동실무\n- 품계: 공동실무원\n- 직함: 양군 관문 통과 기록관, 하윤목의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2102-03-19에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 양군 관문 통과 기록관, 하윤목의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 통과 품목·면제 통행증 유효 칸 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의1동의 통과 품목·면제 통행증 유효 칸 기록 창구가 방마름의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 공동실무원. 직함은 양군 관문 통과 기록관, 하윤목의 실무 담당자. 통과 품목·면제 통행증 유효 칸 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.\n\n**일화.** 세 후원 문장이 붙은 지휘부가 서로 다른 급수·통과 면제 문서를 들이밀자 방마름은 세 장을 난외로 내리고 진본 대조가 끝나기 전에 날인을 열지 않았다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.\n\n**관계.** 하윤목의 세 계산을 원장으로 옮기는 신도이고, 천초윤의 전갈 사본을 같은 줄에 남긴다. 라세영의 검역 도장을 세 칸에 연동한다.\n\n**야망.** 방마름은 양군 관문 통과 기록관, 하윤목의 실무 담당자 직무에서 통과 품목·면제 통행증 유효 칸 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 양군 관문 통과 기록관, 하윤목의 실무 담당자 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 난외 면제 장을 공개하거나, 원장 한 줄을 지워 세리를 보호 징수원으로 몰 수 있다. 방마름의 통과 품목·면제 통행증 유효 칸 기록 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 40 | 개방 −10 | 무력 35 | 물질 10 | 공동 10 | 원칙 20 | 공개 −5 | 자격 0 | 분산 −15 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 5 | 독점 −40 | 위험 15 | 과시 −45 | 지속 10 | 지향 동성 | 결합 계약동거\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"방마름","type":"신도","to":"하윤목","basis":"하윤목의 세 계산을 원장으로 옮기는 신도이고"},{"from":"방마름","type":"신도","to":"천초윤","basis":"천초윤의 전갈 사본을 같은 줄에 남긴다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0362', 'c218-d55c-c591', '{"id":"person-0362","name":"Su Ji-wan","title":"Guui Station Concourse Outpost Chief","position":"Guui Station Concourse Outpost Chief of the Guui Garrison","characterId":"K361","rank":"Site Supervisor","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"Posting Concourse Water Supply Times and Passage Waiting Tickets","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#Character-Su-Jiwan","detailRoute":"/people/person-0362","birthDate":"2083-10-12","birthday":"10-12","age":43,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"transit-queue-administration","name":"Transit queue administration","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Medical transport first","description":"Water and transit order are published, with military freight behind medical transport. Resolution of the mixed-in crate is not recorded.","behavior":"She gauged a bridge''s weight by the platform''s vibration and heard the order to pull munitions cars ahead of the restricted-water waiting line as an insult. Mild in manner, she took the broadcast herself whenever the beacon rose.","stress":"Fear. That rumor of a water-main break alone would blockade the concourse and scatter the residents into back-gate handcars.","relationship":"Relations. Moved An Giun''s bridge schedule onto the platform chalkboard and split the queue with Yeong Hanmoe''s medical wait. Put Nam Hoseong''s convoy stops in the priority column.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: company commander. Title: Guui Station concourse outpost chief. She published the concourse water-supply hours and the passage waiting lists daily and coupled munitions cars to the platform only after the medical convoy had left.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: company commander. Title: Guui Station concourse outpost chief. She published the concourse water-supply hours and the passage waiting lists daily and coupled munitions cars to the platform only after the medical convoy had left.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That rumor of a water-main break alone would blockade the concourse and scatter the residents into back-gate handcars.","relationship":"Relations. Moved An Giun''s bridge schedule onto the platform chalkboard and split the queue with Yeong Hanmoe''s medical wait. Put Nam Hoseong''s convoy stops in the priority column.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Water and transit order are published, with military freight behind medical transport. Resolution of the mixed-in crate is not recorded.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c218-d55c-c591","name":"Hanyang Su Clan","crest":"clan-crests/c218-d55c-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":50,"Openness":-20,"Force":40,"Material":20,"Communal":35,"Principle":-5,"Public":-15,"Eligibility":-5,"Dispersed":-15,"Transformative":-15},"desire":{"Longing":25,"Monopoly":-35,"Risk":-30,"Display":-10,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Same-Sex","Union":"Non-Exclusive"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Posting Concourse Water Supply Times and Passage Waiting Tickets","Affiliation":"Guui Garrison","Rank":"Site Supervisor","Title":"Guui Station Concourse Outpost Chief of the Guui Garrison","Values":"Authority 50 | Openness −20 | Force 40 | Material 20 | Communal 35 | Principle −5 | Publicity −15 | Qualification −5 | Dispersion −15 | Transformation −15","Desires":"Craving 25 | Monopoly −35 | Risk −30 | Display −10 | Persistence 20 | Orientation Same-sex | Bonding Non-exclusive"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2083-10-12. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Concourse Post Chief of Guui Station, Guui Garrison, continuing the records of posting concourse water-supply hours and passage queue tickets. The prior selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The posting window for concourse water-supply hours and passage queue tickets in Guui 1-dong is Su Jiwan''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or tenure.","Offices":"Rank: Field Supervisor. Title: Concourse Post Chief of Guui Station, Guui Garrison. Handles the records of posting concourse water-supply hours and passage queue tickets, and the duty handover, within the scope of the current post.","Anecdote":"On the day a scout report spread as an act of hostility, a line from a military-supply crest box was wedged into the Guui concourse queue tickets. The record left from that day became handover evidence for the next duty watch to cross-check.","Relationships":"Copies An Gijun''s bridge schedule onto the platform chalkboard and separates the line from Yeong Hanmoe''s mandatory wait. Places Nam Hoseong''s escort stop in the priority slot.","Ambition":"From the post of Concourse Post Chief of Guui Station, Guui Garrison, Su Jiwan seeks to mesh the records of posting concourse water-supply hours and passage queue tickets with a public handover table.","Fear":"Fears that a gap in the records of the Concourse Post Chief''s duty watch at Guui Station, Guui Garrison, will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.","Intervention":"Can openly inspect concourse cargo, or separate the water-supply line from the military supply queue. By cross-checking Su Jiwan''s ledger of posted concourse water-supply hours and passage queue tickets, can establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Su Jiwan is a figure of the Guui Garrison who is practiced in posting concourse water-supply hours and passage queue tickets. Gauges a bridge''s load by platform vibrations, and takes an order to pull military supply freight cars ahead of the restricted water-supply queue as an insult. Mild-mannered, but when a beacon flares, personally takes hold of the broadcast.\n\n- Occupation: Posting concourse water-supply hours and passage queue tickets\n- Affiliation: Guui Garrison\n- Rank: Field Supervisor\n- Title: Concourse Post Chief of Guui Station, Guui Garrison\n**Life.** Born on 2083-10-12. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of Concourse Post Chief of Guui Station, Guui Garrison, continuing the records of posting concourse water-supply hours and passage queue tickets. The prior selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The posting window for concourse water-supply hours and passage queue tickets in Guui 1-dong is Su Jiwan''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or tenure.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Field Supervisor. Title: Concourse Post Chief of Guui Station, Guui Garrison. Handles the records of posting concourse water-supply hours and passage queue tickets, and the duty handover, within the scope of the current post.\n\n**Anecdote.** On the day a scout report spread as an act of hostility, a line from a military-supply crest box was wedged into the Guui concourse queue tickets. The record left from that day became handover evidence for the next duty watch to cross-check.\n\n**Relations.** Copies An Gijun''s bridge schedule onto the platform chalkboard and separates the line from Yeong Hanmoe''s mandatory wait. Places Nam Hoseong''s escort stop in the priority slot.\n\n**Ambition.** From the post of Concourse Post Chief of Guui Station, Guui Garrison, Su Jiwan seeks to mesh the records of posting concourse water-supply hours and passage queue tickets with a public handover table.\n\n**Fear.** Fears that a gap in the records of the Concourse Post Chief''s duty watch at Guui Station, Guui Garrison, will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.\n\n**Intervention.** Can openly inspect concourse cargo, or separate the water-supply line from the military supply queue. By cross-checking Su Jiwan''s ledger of posted concourse water-supply hours and passage queue tickets, can establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority 50 | Openness −20 | Force 40 | Material 20 | Communal 35 | Principle −5 | Publicity −15 | Qualification −5 | Dispersion −15 | Transformation −15\n- Desires: Craving 25 | Monopoly −35 | Risk −30 | Display −10 | Persistence 20 | Orientation Same-sex | Bonding Non-exclusive\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Su Ji-wan","type":"Contract","to":"An Gijun","basis":"copies An Gijun''s bridge schedule onto the platform chalkboard, and"},{"from":"Su Ji-wan","type":"Contract","to":"Yeong Han-moe","basis":"Separates the line from Yeong Hanmoe''s mandatory wait"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0362","name":"수지완","title":"구의역 대합실 거점장","position":"구의수비대 구의역 대합실 거점장","characterId":"K361","rank":"현장책임자","commonTier":"T4","occupation":"대합실 급수 시간·통행 대기표 게시","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-수지완","detailRoute":"/people/person-0362","birthDate":"2083-10-12","birthday":"10-12","age":43,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":9,"effective":9},"martial":{"base":9,"effective":9},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"transit-queue-administration","name":"통행 대기표 운영","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"의무호송 먼저","description":"급수와 통행 순서를 공개하고 군수 화차를 의무호송 뒤에 둔다. 혼입 상자의 해결 결과는 적혀 있지 않다.","behavior":"승강장 진동으로 교량 무게를 가늠하고, 군수 화차를 제한 급수 대기열 앞으로 끌어오라는 명령을 모욕으로 듣는다. 온화하나 봉화가 뜨면 방송을 직접 잡는다.","stress":"공포. 상수관 파손 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 주민이 후문 밀차로 흩어지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 안기준의 교량 일정을 승강장 칠판에 옮기고, 영한뫼의 의무 대기와 줄을 나눈다. 남호성의 호송 정차를 우선 칸에 둔다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 현장책임자. 직함은 구의수비대 구의역 대합실 거점장. 대합실 급수 시간과 통행 대기표를 매일 공개하고, 군수 화차는 의무호송이 떠난 뒤에만 승강장에 붙인다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 현장책임자. 직함은 구의수비대 구의역 대합실 거점장. 대합실 급수 시간과 통행 대기표를 매일 공개하고, 군수 화차는 의무호송이 떠난 뒤에만 승강장에 붙인다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 상수관 파손 소문만으로 대합실이 봉쇄되고 주민이 후문 밀차로 흩어지는 것.","relationship":"관계. 안기준의 교량 일정을 승강장 칠판에 옮기고, 영한뫼의 의무 대기와 줄을 나눈다. 남호성의 호송 정차를 우선 칸에 둔다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"급수와 통행 순서를 공개하고 군수 화차를 의무호송 뒤에 둔다. 혼입 상자의 해결 결과는 적혀 있지 않다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c218-d55c-c591","name":"한양 수씨","crest":"clan-crests/c218-d55c-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":50,"개방":-20,"무력":40,"물질":20,"공동":35,"원칙":-5,"공개":-15,"자격":-5,"분산":-15,"변혁":-15},"desire":{"갈망":25,"독점":-35,"위험":-30,"과시":-10,"지속":20,"지향":"동성","결합":"비독점"},"fields":{"생업":"대합실 급수 시간·통행 대기표 게시","소속":"구의수비대","품계":"현장책임자","직함":"구의수비대 구의역 대합실 거점장","가치관":"권위 50 | 개방 −20 | 무력 40 | 물질 20 | 공동 35 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −15 | 자격 −5 | 분산 −15 | 변혁 −15","욕망":"갈망 25 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −10 | 지속 20 | 지향 동성 | 결합 비독점"},"sections":{"생애":"2083-10-12에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 구의수비대 구의역 대합실 거점장 직무를 맡아 대합실 급수 시간·통행 대기표 게시 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의1동의 대합실 급수 시간·통행 대기표 게시 창구가 수지완의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 현장책임자. 직함은 구의수비대 구의역 대합실 거점장. 대합실 급수 시간·통행 대기표 게시 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.","일화":"척후 보고가 적대행위로 퍼진 날, 구의 대합실 대기표에 군수 문장 상자가 한 줄 끼어 있었다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.","관계":"안기준의 교량 일정을 승강장 칠판에 옮기고, 영한뫼의 의무 대기와 줄을 나눈다. 남호성의 호송 정차를 우선 칸에 둔다.","야망":"수지완은 구의수비대 구의역 대합실 거점장 직무에서 대합실 급수 시간·통행 대기표 게시 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.","공포":"구의수비대 구의역 대합실 거점장 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"대합실 화물을 공개 검수하거나, 급수 줄을 군수 대기열과 분리할 수 있다. 수지완의 대합실 급수 시간·통행 대기표 게시 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"수지완은 대합실 급수 시간·통행 대기표 게시 기록을 손에 익힌 구의수비대 인물이다. 승강장 진동으로 교량 무게를 가늠하고, 군수 화차를 제한 급수 대기열 앞으로 끌어오라는 명령을 모욕으로 듣는다. 온화하나 봉화가 뜨면 방송을 직접 잡는다.\n\n- 생업: 대합실 급수 시간·통행 대기표 게시\n- 소속: 구의수비대\n- 품계: 현장책임자\n- 직함: 구의수비대 구의역 대합실 거점장\n**생애.** 2083-10-12에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 구의수비대 구의역 대합실 거점장 직무를 맡아 대합실 급수 시간·통행 대기표 게시 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의1동의 대합실 급수 시간·통행 대기표 게시 창구가 수지완의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 현장책임자. 직함은 구의수비대 구의역 대합실 거점장. 대합실 급수 시간·통행 대기표 게시 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.\n\n**일화.** 척후 보고가 적대행위로 퍼진 날, 구의 대합실 대기표에 군수 문장 상자가 한 줄 끼어 있었다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.\n\n**관계.** 안기준의 교량 일정을 승강장 칠판에 옮기고, 영한뫼의 의무 대기와 줄을 나눈다. 남호성의 호송 정차를 우선 칸에 둔다.\n\n**야망.** 수지완은 구의수비대 구의역 대합실 거점장 직무에서 대합실 급수 시간·통행 대기표 게시 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 구의수비대 구의역 대합실 거점장 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 대합실 화물을 공개 검수하거나, 급수 줄을 군수 대기열과 분리할 수 있다. 수지완의 대합실 급수 시간·통행 대기표 게시 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 50 | 개방 −20 | 무력 40 | 물질 20 | 공동 35 | 원칙 −5 | 공개 −15 | 자격 −5 | 분산 −15 | 변혁 −15\n- 욕망: 갈망 25 | 독점 −35 | 위험 −30 | 과시 −10 | 지속 20 | 지향 동성 | 결합 비독점\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"수지완","type":"계약","to":"안기준","basis":"안기준의 교량 일정을 승강장 칠판에 옮기고"},{"from":"수지완","type":"계약","to":"영한뫼","basis":"영한뫼의 의무 대기와 줄을 나눈다"}],"incoming":[]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0363', 'c120-bcf4-c131', '{"id":"person-0363","name":"Seon Neul-bom","title":"Practical Aide to Mun Ha-yul, Ridge Guardpost Base Duty Officer","position":"Practical Aide to Mun Ha-yul, Ridge Guardpost Base Duty Officer of Agwansa","characterId":"K362","rank":"Sergeant","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"Posting Ridge Guardpost Duty Roster and Beacon Times","gender":"Female","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"The Government","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#person-seon-neulbom","detailRoute":"/people/person-0363","birthDate":"2089-10-11","birthday":"10-11","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":5,"effective":5}},"skills":[{"id":"outpost-duty-handover","name":"Outpost duty handover","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Treats the outpost as home","description":"Duty and beacon times are posted together, yet a note requiring joint approval papers was burned. Stated joint checks conflict with a desire for a distinct outpost.","behavior":"He treated the outpost duty post as home and burned any note that told him to keep joint-approval papers at the outpost. A light he had seen once he wrote into the rotation log first.","stress":"Fear. That outpost duty would become the footstool of a mistaken beacon and the hill and the bridges would open on the same night.","relationship":"Relations. Executed Mun Hayul''s sentry orders at the base and shared the whistle with Pan Neulsaem''s patrol. He overlapped the logs so Gwak Minjae''s water inspections would not read as a watch gap.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: ridge outpost base duty chief, duty officer of Mun Hayul. He posted the duty roster and the beacon hours on one chalkboard and blocked armed outside approach without Go Seojun''s escort.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: sergeant. Title: ridge outpost base duty chief, duty officer of Mun Hayul. He posted the duty roster and the beacon hours on one chalkboard and blocked armed outside approach without Go Seojun''s escort.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That outpost duty would become the footstool of a mistaken beacon and the hill and the bridges would open on the same night.","relationship":"Relations. Executed Mun Hayul''s sentry orders at the base and shared the whistle with Pan Neulsaem''s patrol. He overlapped the logs so Gwak Minjae''s water inspections would not read as a watch gap.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Duty and beacon times are posted together, yet a note requiring joint approval papers was burned. Stated joint checks conflict with a desire for a distinct outpost.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c120-bcf4-c131","name":"Seon Clan of Boseong","crest":"clan-crests/c120-bcf4-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":50,"Openness":-25,"Force":50,"Material":20,"Communal":25,"Principle":10,"Public":0,"Eligibility":0,"Dispersed":-20,"Transformative":0},"desire":{"Longing":40,"Monopoly":30,"Risk":-35,"Display":-20,"Sustained":-10,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Posting Ridge Guardpost Duty Roster and Beacon Times","Affiliation":"Russian Legation Command","Rank":"Sergeant","Title":"Practical Aide to Mun Ha-yul, Ridge Guardpost Base Duty Officer of Agwansa","Values":"Authority 50 | Openness −25 | Force 50 | Material 20 | Communal 25 | Principle 10 | Publicity 0 | Qualification 0 | Dispersion −20 | Transformation 0","Desires":"Craving 40 | Monopoly 30 | Risk −35 | Display −20 | Persistence −10 | Orientation Fluid | Bonding None"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2089-10-11. As of the 2126 opening, holds the post of The Government Ridge Outpost Base Duty Chief and Mun Hayul''s operations aide, continuing the records of the ridge outpost duty roster and beacon-time postings. The prior selection and handover history of the post is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The posting window for the ridge outpost duty roster and beacon times in Guui 2-dong is Seon Neulbom''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble title, fief, or tenure.","Offices":"Rank: Sergeant. Title: The Government Ridge Outpost Base Duty Chief, Mun Hayul''s operations aide. Handles the records of the ridge outpost duty roster and beacon-time postings, and the duty handover, within the scope of the current post.","Anecdote":"On the night smoke from a ruptured water main was mistaken for a hostile beacon, one line was missing from the outpost duty roster. The record left from that day became handover evidence for the next duty watch to cross-check.","Relationships":"Carries out Mun Hayul''s sentry orders at the base, and shares Pan Neulsaem''s patrol whistle with the duty watch. Overlaps the logs so as not to treat Gwak Minjae''s water-supply inspection as a surveillance gap.","Ambition":"From the post of The Government Ridge Outpost Base Duty Chief and Mun Hayul''s operations aide, Seon Neulbom seeks to mesh the records of the ridge outpost duty roster and beacon-time postings with a public handover table.","Fear":"Fears that a gap in the records of the duty watch of the Government Ridge Outpost Base Duty Chief and Mun Hayul''s operations aide will become a passage for unilateral orders bearing a patron''s crest.","Intervention":"Can find the missing duty personnel, or change the outpost beacon to a dual-key system. By cross-checking Seon Neulbom''s ledger of the ridge outpost duty roster and beacon-time postings, can establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Seon Neulbom is an Agwansa figure well versed in the ridge outpost duty roster and beacon-time posting records. She treats outpost duty like home, and she burns notes telling her to leave joint-approval documents at the outpost. She always writes a light she has seen once into the shift log first.\n\n- Livelihood: ridge outpost duty roster and beacon-time posting\n- Affiliation: The Government\n- Rank: Sergeant\n- Title: Duty Chief of the Government Ridge Outpost Base, Mun Hayul''s working-level officer\n**Life.** Born on 2089-10-11. As of the 2126 opening, she holds the post of Duty Chief of the Government Ridge Outpost Base and Mun Hayul''s working-level officer, and she continues the ridge outpost duty roster and beacon-time posting records. How the post was previously filled and handed over is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The ridge outpost duty roster and beacon-time posting desk in Guui 2-dong is Seon Neulbom''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble rank, fief, or tenure rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Sergeant. Title: Duty Chief of the Government Ridge Outpost Base, Mun Hayul''s working-level officer. She handles the ridge outpost duty roster and beacon-time posting records and duty handovers within the scope of her current post.\n\n**Anecdote.** On the night when smoke from a burst water main was mistaken for a hostile beacon, one line was missing from the outpost duty roster. The record that remained that day became the handover evidence for the next duty watch to cross-check.\n\n**Relations.** She carries out Mun Hayul''s sentry orders at the base and shares patrol whistles on duty with Pan Neulsaem. She overlaps logs so that Gwak Minjae''s water-supply inspections are not treated as a surveillance gap.\n\n**Ambition.** In her post as Duty Chief of the Government Ridge Outpost Base and Mun Hayul''s working-level officer, Seon Neulbom aims to make the ridge outpost duty roster and beacon-time posting records mesh with the public handover table.\n\n**Fear.** She fears that a record gap in the duty watch of the Duty Chief of the Government Ridge Outpost Base and Mun Hayul''s working-level officer will become a passage for a unilateral order bearing a patron''s crest.\n\n**Intervention.** She can look for the missing duty member or change the outpost beacon to a double-key system. She can cross-check Seon Neulbom''s ridge outpost duty roster and beacon-time posting ledger to establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 50 | Openness −25 | Force 50 | Material 20 | Communal 25 | Principle 10 | Publicity 0 | Qualification 0 | Dispersion −20 | Transformation 0\n- Desires: Craving 40 | Monopoly 30 | Risk −35 | Display −20 | Persistence −10 | Orientation: fluid | Bond: none\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Seon Neul-bom","type":"Command","to":"Mun Hayul","basis":"enforces Mun Hayul''s sentry orders at the base, and"},{"from":"Seon Neul-bom","type":"Command","to":"Pan Neulsaem","basis":"Shares Pan Neulsaem''s patrol whistle with the duty shift"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Pan Neulsaem","type":"Contract","to":"Seon Neul-bom","basis":"Shares whistles with Seon Neulbom''s post duty"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0363","name":"선늘봄","title":"능선 초소 기지 당직장, 문하율의 실무 담당자","position":"정부 능선 초소 기지 당직장, 문하율의 실무 담당자","characterId":"K362","rank":"병장","commonTier":"T5","occupation":"능선 초소 당직 명부·봉화 시각 게시","gender":"여성","stage":"S2","state":"government","stateName":"정부","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#인물-선늘봄","detailRoute":"/people/person-0363","birthDate":"2089-10-11","birthday":"10-11","age":37,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":10,"effective":10},"intrigue":{"base":9,"effective":9},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":5,"effective":5}},"skills":[{"id":"outpost-duty-handover","name":"초소 당직 인계","rating":55}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"초소를 집처럼 여긴다","description":"당직과 봉화 시각을 함께 게시하나 공동승인 문서를 두라는 쪽지를 태운다. 공동 승인 준수 문장과 독자 거점 욕구의 충돌을 남긴다.","behavior":"초소 당직을 집처럼 여기고, 공동승인 문서를 초소에 두라는 쪽지를 태운다. 한 번 본 불빛을 교대 일지에 먼저 적는다.","stress":"공포. 초소 당직이 오인 봉화의 발판이 되어 고지와 교량이 같은 밤에 열리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 문하율의 초병 명령을 기지에서 집행하고, 판늘샘의 순찰 호각을 당직과 나눈다. 곽민재의 급수 점검을 감시 공백으로 여기지 않으려 일지를 겹친다.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"자기 당직의 경계","description":"관직. 품계 병장. 직함은 정부 능선 초소 기지 당직장, 문하율의 실무 담당자. 당직 명과 봉화 시각을 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 외부 무장 접근은 양군의 공동 승인 없이 막는다.","behavior":"확인된 당직 수행과 제한: 관직. 품계 병장. 직함은 정부 능선 초소 기지 당직장, 문하율의 실무 담당자. 당직 명과 봉화 시각을 같은 칠판에 붙이고, 외부 무장 접근은 양군의 공동 승인 없이 막는다.","stress":"이 경계가 흔들릴 때 카드에 명시된 우려: 공포. 초소 당직이 오인 봉화의 발판이 되어 고지와 교량이 같은 밤에 열리는 것.","relationship":"관계. 문하율의 초병 명령을 기지에서 집행하고, 판늘샘의 순찰 호각을 당직과 나눈다. 곽민재의 급수 점검을 감시 공백으로 여기지 않으려 일지를 겹친다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"당직과 봉화 시각을 함께 게시하나 공동승인 문서를 두라는 쪽지를 태운다. 공동 승인 준수 문장과 독자 거점 욕구의 충돌을 남긴다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"c120-bcf4-c131","name":"보성 선씨","crest":"clan-crests/c120-bcf4-c131.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"권위":50,"개방":-25,"무력":50,"물질":20,"공동":25,"원칙":10,"공개":0,"자격":0,"분산":-20,"변혁":0},"desire":{"갈망":40,"독점":30,"위험":-35,"과시":-20,"지속":-10,"지향":"유동","결합":"없음"},"fields":{"생업":"능선 초소 당직 명부·봉화 시각 게시","소속":"아관사","품계":"병장","직함":"정부 능선 초소 기지 당직장, 문하율의 실무 담당자","가치관":"권위 50 | 개방 −25 | 무력 50 | 물질 20 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 0 | 자격 0 | 분산 −20 | 변혁 0","욕망":"갈망 40 | 독점 30 | 위험 −35 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음"},"sections":{"생애":"2089-10-11에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 정부 능선 초소 기지 당직장, 문하율의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 능선 초소 당직 명부·봉화 시각 게시 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의2동의 능선 초소 당직 명부·봉화 시각 게시 창구가 선늘봄의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.","관직":"품계 병장. 직함은 정부 능선 초소 기지 당직장, 문하율의 실무 담당자. 능선 초소 당직 명부·봉화 시각 게시 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.","일화":"상수관 파손 연기를 적대 봉화로 오인한 밤, 초소 당직 명단이 한 줄 빠져 있었다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.","관계":"문하율의 초병 명령을 기지에서 집행하고, 판늘샘의 순찰 호각을 당직과 나눈다. 곽민재의 급수 점검을 감시 공백으로 여기지 않으려 일지를 겹친다.","야망":"선늘봄은 정부 능선 초소 기지 당직장, 문하율의 실무 담당자 직무에서 능선 초소 당직 명부·봉화 시각 게시 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.","공포":"정부 능선 초소 기지 당직장, 문하율의 실무 담당자 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.","개입":"빠진 당직자를 찾거나, 초소 봉화를 이중 열쇠로 바꿀 수 있다. 선늘봄의 능선 초소 당직 명부·봉화 시각 게시 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다."},"biography":"선늘봄은 능선 초소 당직 명부·봉화 시각 게시 기록을 손에 익힌 정부 인물이다. 초소 당직을 집처럼 여기고, 공동승인 문서를 초소에 두라는 쪽지를 태운다. 한 번 본 불빛을 교대 일지에 먼저 적는다.\n\n- 생업: 능선 초소 당직 명부·봉화 시각 게시\n- 소속: 정부\n- 품계: 병장\n- 직함: 정부 능선 초소 기지 당직장, 문하율의 실무 담당자\n**생애.** 2089-10-11에 태어났다. 2126년 개막 현재 정부 능선 초소 기지 당직장, 문하율의 실무 담당자 직무를 맡아 능선 초소 당직 명부·봉화 시각 게시 기록을 잇는다. 직무의 기존 선발·인계 경위는 현재 원장에 보존한다.\n- 구의2동의 능선 초소 당직 명부·봉화 시각 게시 창구가 선늘봄의 업무 기준점이다. 이 업무 기준점은 거주지·정확한 시설 경계·작위·영지·점유권을 정하지 않는다.\n\n**관직.** 품계 병장. 직함은 정부 능선 초소 기지 당직장, 문하율의 실무 담당자. 능선 초소 당직 명부·봉화 시각 게시 기록과 당직 인계를 현재 직무 범위 안에서 다룬다.\n\n**일화.** 상수관 파손 연기를 적대 봉화로 오인한 밤, 초소 당직 명단이 한 줄 빠져 있었다. 그날 남은 기록은 다음 당직이 대조할 인계 근거가 되었다.\n\n**관계.** 문하율의 초병 명령을 기지에서 집행하고, 판늘샘의 순찰 호각을 당직과 나눈다. 곽민재의 급수 점검을 감시 공백으로 여기지 않으려 일지를 겹친다.\n\n**야망.** 선늘봄은 정부 능선 초소 기지 당직장, 문하율의 실무 담당자 직무에서 능선 초소 당직 명부·봉화 시각 게시 기록을 공개 인계표와 맞물리게 하려 한다.\n\n**공포.** 정부 능선 초소 기지 당직장, 문하율의 실무 담당자 당직의 기록 공백이 후원 문장이 붙은 단독 명령의 통행로가 되는 일을 두려워한다.\n\n**개입.** 빠진 당직자를 찾거나, 초소 봉화를 이중 열쇠로 바꿀 수 있다. 선늘봄의 능선 초소 당직 명부·봉화 시각 게시 원장을 대조해 다음 인계의 증거를 세울 수 있다.\n\n::: details 부록 — 장부 숫자\n\n- 가치관: 권위 50 | 개방 −25 | 무력 50 | 물질 20 | 공동 25 | 원칙 10 | 공개 0 | 자격 0 | 분산 −20 | 변혁 0\n- 욕망: 갈망 40 | 독점 30 | 위험 −35 | 과시 −20 | 지속 −10 | 지향 유동 | 결합 없음\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"선늘봄","type":"지휘","to":"문하율","basis":"문하율의 초병 명령을 기지에서 집행하고"},{"from":"선늘봄","type":"지휘","to":"판늘샘","basis":"판늘샘의 순찰 호각을 당직과 나눈다"}],"incoming":[{"from":"판늘샘","type":"계약","to":"선늘봄","basis":"선늘봄의 초소 당직과 호각을 나눈다"}]}}');
INSERT INTO person_detail (person_id, clan_id, json, json_ko) VALUES ('person-0364', 'c6d0-c6d0-c8fc', '{"id":"person-0364","name":"Won Da-gyeol","title":"Gate Passage Market Outpost Chief of Both Armies · Lord of Gwangjin District","position":"Gate Passage Market Outpost Chief of Both Armies · Lord of Gwangjin District","characterId":"K363","rank":"Lord","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"Posting Market Prices and Passage Items · Confirming Shipments","gender":"Male","stage":"S2","state":"geography:duchy:11215","stateName":"Gwangjin-gu","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-14#inmul-won-dagyeol","detailRoute":"/people/person-0364","birthDate":"2079-09-29","birthday":"09-29","age":47,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"excluded"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":10,"effective":10},"martial":{"base":8,"effective":8},"stewardship":{"base":12,"effective":12},"intrigue":{"base":11,"effective":11},"learning":{"base":10,"effective":10},"prowess":{"base":3,"effective":3}},"skills":[{"id":"market-stock-inspection","name":"Market stock inspection","rating":65}],"traits":[{"id":"stated-priority","name":"Only real stock on the scales","description":"Even a rush of great-power exemptions did not secure military shipment; only actual stock was weighed. Public prices and residents’ supplies shape judgment.","behavior":"She sent merchants who hid passage tolls away from the scales and drove out of the market any voice that sold military exemption columns for prices. She read the public scales as credit.","stress":"Fear. That the market inventory would leave as munitions-only and the restricted-water residents'' daily ration would become an empty box.","relationship":"Relations. Matched the prices with Won Yena''s bridge invoices and moved Bang Mareum''s toll columns into the market ledger. Sent Nam Yungyeong''s emergency price offer back as a grudge.","effects":[]},{"id":"bounded-duty","name":"Boundaries of personal duty","description":"Office. Rank: company commander. Title: gate passage market outpost chief. She wrote the prices and the passage items on the wall and blocked the release of any order stamped with an exemption clause until Ha Yunmok''s ledger was posted.","behavior":"Recorded duty and limits: Office. Rank: company commander. Title: gate passage market outpost chief. She wrote the prices and the passage items on the wall and blocked the release of any order stamped with an exemption clause until Ha Yunmok''s ledger was posted.","stress":"The card states this concern when those boundaries fail: Fear. That the market inventory would leave as munitions-only and the restricted-water residents'' daily ration would become an empty box.","relationship":"Relations. Matched the prices with Won Yena''s bridge invoices and moved Bang Mareum''s toll columns into the market ledger. Sent Nam Yungyeong''s emergency price offer back as a grudge.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"Even a rush of great-power exemptions did not secure military shipment; only actual stock was weighed. Public prices and residents’ supplies shape judgment.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"confirmedHoldings":[{"id":"holding:opening-duchy-gu-11215-S14","name":{"ko":"Gwangjin-gu Duchy Directly Administered Land"},"holderPersonId":"K363","directLiegePersonId":"K144","stateId":"S14","adminRefs":[{"id":"region:1121571000","name":"Hwayang-dong"},{"id":"region:1121573000","name":"Gunja-dong"},{"id":"region:1121574000","name":"Junggok 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1121575000","name":"Junggok 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1121576000","name":"Junggok 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1121577000","name":"Junggok 4-dong"},{"id":"region:1121578000","name":"Neung-dong"},{"id":"region:1121581000","name":"Gwangjang-dong"},{"id":"region:1121582000","name":"Jayang 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1121583000","name":"Jayang 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1121584000","name":"Jayang 3-dong"},{"id":"region:1121584700","name":"Jayang 4-dong"},{"id":"region:1121585000","name":"Guui 1-dong"},{"id":"region:1121586000","name":"Guui 2-dong"},{"id":"region:1121587000","name":"Guui 3-dong"}],"componentRefs":[],"titleId":"title:duchy-gu-11215-S14","geometrySource":null,"territorialScale":null,"formalTitleRank":"duchy"}],"subordinateHoldings":[],"openingTitles":[{"id":"title:duchy-gu-11215-S14","name":"Gwangjin-gu Duchy","rank":"duchy","holderPersonId":"K363","basis":"Opening administrative-scale group gu:11215(duchy) allocation · deterministic candidate selection","stateId":"S14","parentTitleId":"title:kingdom-s06","jurisdictionRefs":["region:1121571000","region:1121573000","region:1121574000","region:1121575000","region:1121576000","region:1121577000","region:1121578000","region:1121581000","region:1121582000","region:1121583000","region:1121584000","region:1121584700","region:1121585000","region:1121586000","region:1121587000"],"parentTitle":{"id":"title:kingdom-s06","name":"The Government Kingdom","holderPersonId":"K144"}}],"clan":{"id":"c6d0-c6d0-c8fc","name":"Won Clan of Wonju","crest":"clan-crests/c6d0-c6d0-c8fc.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":45,"Openness":-30,"Force":40,"Material":5,"Communal":35,"Principle":-5,"Public":0,"Eligibility":-15,"Dispersed":-20,"Transformative":-5},"desire":{"Longing":-10,"Monopoly":40,"Risk":-40,"Display":5,"Sustained":20,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"Contract Cohabitation"},"fields":{"Livelihood":"Posting Market Prices and Passage Items · Confirming Shipments","Affiliation":"The Government Joint Two-Army Working Group","Rank":"Joint Staff Officer","Title":"Market Base Chief of the Two-Army Gate Transit Market","Values":"Authority 45 | Openness −30 | Force 40 | Material 5 | Communal 35 | Principle −5 | Publicity 0 | Qualification −15 | Dispersion −20 | Transformation −5","Desires":"Craving −10 | Monopoly 40 | Risk −40 | Display 5 | Persistence 20 | Orientation: heterosexual | Bond: contract cohabitation"},"sections":{"Life":"Born on 2079-09-29. As of the 2126 opening, he holds the post of Market Base Chief of the Two-Army Gate Transit Market and continues the records of market prices, transit-item postings, and shipment checks. How the post was previously filled and handed over is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The market price, transit-item posting, and shipment check desk in Guui 1-dong is Won Dagyeol''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble rank, fief, or tenure rights.","Offices":"Rank: Joint Operative. Title: Market Base Chief of the Two-Army Gate Transit Market. He handles the records of market prices, transit-item postings, and shipment checks and duty handovers within the scope of his current post.","Anecdote":"When command exemption documents bearing three patrons'' crests arrived in the same week, Won Dagyeol refused shipments made in the name of military supply and put only the actual stock on the scales. The record that remained that day became the handover evidence for the next duty watch to cross-check.","Relationships":"He matches prices with Won Yena''s bridge invoices and moves Bang Mareum''s three columns into the market ledger. He sends Nam Yungyeong''s emergency price proposal back with resentment.","Ambition":"In his post as Market Base Chief of the Two-Army Gate Transit Market, Won Dagyeol aims to make the records of market prices, transit-item postings, and shipment checks mesh with the public handover table.","Fear":"He fears that a record gap in the duty watch of the Market Base Chief of the Two-Army Gate Transit Market will become a passage for a unilateral order bearing a patron''s crest.","Intervention":"He can make exemption orders public or fix the water-supply priority column in the market ledger. He can cross-check Won Dagyeol''s ledger of market prices, transit-item postings, and shipment checks to establish evidence for the next handover."},"biography":"Won Dagyeol is a Two-Army joint working figure of The Government who is well versed in the records of market prices, transit-item postings, and shipment checks. He turns away merchants who hide transit tax at the scales, and he drives out of the market any talk of selling military exemption slots at market price. He regards the public scale as credit.\n\n- Livelihood: market prices, transit-item postings, and shipment checks\n- Affiliation: The Government Two-Army Joint Working Group\n- Rank: Joint Operative\n- Title: Market Base Chief of the Two-Army Gate Transit Market\n**Life.** Born on 2079-09-29. As of the 2126 opening, he holds the post of Market Base Chief of the Two-Army Gate Transit Market and continues the records of market prices, transit-item postings, and shipment checks. How the post was previously filled and handed over is preserved in the current ledger.\n- The market price, transit-item posting, and shipment check desk in Guui 1-dong is Won Dagyeol''s work reference point. This work reference point does not determine residence, exact facility boundaries, noble rank, fief, or tenure rights.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Joint Operative. Title: Market Base Chief of the Two-Army Gate Transit Market. He handles the records of market prices, transit-item postings, and shipment checks and duty handovers within the scope of his current post.\n\n**Anecdote.** When command exemption documents bearing three patrons'' crests arrived in the same week, Won Dagyeol refused shipments made in the name of military supply and put only the actual stock on the scales. The record that remained that day became the handover evidence for the next duty watch to cross-check.\n\n**Relations.** He matches prices with Won Yena''s bridge invoices and moves Bang Mareum''s three columns into the market ledger. He sends Nam Yungyeong''s emergency price proposal back with resentment.\n\n**Ambition.** In his post as Market Base Chief of the Two-Army Gate Transit Market, Won Dagyeol aims to make the records of market prices, transit-item postings, and shipment checks mesh with the public handover table.\n\n**Fear.** He fears that a record gap in the duty watch of the Market Base Chief of the Two-Army Gate Transit Market will become a passage for a unilateral order bearing a patron''s crest.\n\n**Intervention.** He can make exemption orders public or fix the water-supply priority column in the market ledger. He can cross-check Won Dagyeol''s ledger of market prices, transit-item postings, and shipment checks to establish evidence for the next handover.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Figures\n\n- Values: Authority 45 | Openness −30 | Force 40 | Material 5 | Communal 35 | Principle −5 | Publicity 0 | Qualification −15 | Dispersion −20 | Transformation −5\n- Desires: Craving −10 | Monopoly 40 | Risk −40 | Display 5 | Persistence 20 | Orientation: heterosexual | Bond: contract cohabitation\n:::","relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Won Da-gyeol","type":"Grudge","to":"Nam Yun-gyeong","basis":"He sends Nam Yungyeong''s emergency price proposal back with resentment"},{"from":"Won Da-gyeol","type":"Contract","to":"Won Yena","basis":"matches the bridge invoices and market rates with Won Yena''s, and"}],"incoming":[{"from":"Won Yena","type":"Contract","to":"Won Da-gyeol","basis":"matches weights to Won Dagyeol''s gate scale"}]}}', '{"id":"person-0364","name":"원다결","title":"양군 관문 통과 시장 거점장 · 광진구 영주","position":"양군 관문 통과 시장 거점장 · 광진구 영주","characterId":"K363","rank":"영주","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"시장 시세·통과 품목 게시·출고 확인","gender":"남성","stage":"S2","state":"geography:duchy:11215","stateName":"광진구","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-S