liticalParentTitleId":"title:duchy-chungcheong-k998","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:chungcheong-3611057000","directLiegePersonId":"K998"}],"directOwnership":false},{"id":"title:barony-chungcheong-3611058000","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"barony","holderPersonId":"K425","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:duchy-chungcheong-k998","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:chungcheong-3611058000","directLiegePersonId":"K998"}],"directOwnership":false}],"confirmedHoldings":[],"clan":{"id":"bc15-bc00-c591","name":"Miryang Bak Clan","crest":"clan-crests/bc15-bc00-c591.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-20,"Openness":30,"Force":-10,"Material":35,"Communal":35,"Principle":10,"Public":45,"Eligibility":40,"Dispersed":10,"Transformative":15},"desire":{"Longing":15,"Monopoly":10,"Risk":-15,"Display":-20,"Sustained":5,"Orientation":"Fluid","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Transfer Message Delivery","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Work Crew Courier","Work Location":"Oryu 2-dong. At the First Branch Workshop in Oryu 2-dong, Bak Doyun receives Lee Ilseop''s seed-payment proposal and checks the Council receipt slot. If a message is late in the frozen passage, he does not hide the receipt time but writes it in the next shift ledger and passes it on to his successor.","Values":"Authority −20 | Openness 30 | Force −10 | Material 35 | Communal 35 | Principle 10 | Publicity 45 | Qualification 40 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation 15","Desires":"Craving 15 | Monopoly 10 | Risk −15 | Display −20 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: Fluid | Bonding: None"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Raised in the Sinnae transfer watch. The Work Crew Courier post opened when he stopped a ticketless departing train.\n- Work location: Oryu 2-dong. At the First Branch Workshop in Oryu 2-dong, Bak Doyun receives Lee Ilseop''s seed-payment proposal and checks the Council receipt slot. If a message is late in the frozen passage, he does not hide the receipt time but writes it in the next shift ledger and passes it on to his successor.","Offices":"Rank: Union Member. Title: Work Crew Courier. If a message is late in the frozen passage, he does not hide the receipt time but writes it in the next shift ledger and passes it on to his successor.","Anecdote":"In 2125, upon receiving a report that the sleepers had sunk from a leak beneath the frozen track in Oryu 2-dong, he immediately closed the dispatch section. Because of this, the signature for the Work Crew Courier post was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"Bak Doyun is Lee Ilseop''s direct courier, in charge of delivering messages and confirming receipt.","Ambition":"Bak Doyun intends to follow each message through to the end so that Lee Ilseop''s seed-payment proposal remains in the Council receipt ledger down to the time.","Fear":"That the receipt time of the seed-payment proposal goes missing and Lee Ilseop''s handover to the Council is cut off.","Intervention":"The player can cross-check the proposal receipt slot with Bak Doyun, or also record in the next shift ledger the time of a message delayed in the frozen passage."},"biography":"Even when a message is late, Bak Doyun does not erase the receipt time to speed up the proposal''s handover.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Occupation: Transfer message delivery\n- Rank: Union Member\n- Title: Work Crew Courier\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Raised in the Sinnae transfer watch. The Work Crew Courier post opened when he stopped a ticketless departing train.\n- Work location: Oryu 2-dong. At the First Branch Workshop in Oryu 2-dong, Bak Doyun receives Lee Ilseop''s seed-payment proposal and checks the Council receipt slot. If a message is late in the frozen passage, he does not hide the receipt time but writes it in the next shift ledger and passes it on to his successor.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Union Member. Title: Work Crew Courier. If a message is late in the frozen passage, he does not hide the receipt time but writes it in the next shift ledger and passes it on to his successor.\n\n**Anecdote.** In 2125, upon receiving a report that the sleepers had sunk from a leak beneath the frozen track in Oryu 2-dong, he immediately closed the dispatch section. Because of this, the signature for the Work Crew Courier post was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relationships.** Bak Doyun is Lee Ilseop''s direct courier, in charge of delivering messages and confirming receipt.\n\n**Ambition.** Bak Doyun intends to follow each message through to the end so that Lee Ilseop''s seed-payment proposal remains in the Council receipt ledger down to the time.\n\n**Fear.** That the receipt time of the seed-payment proposal goes missing and Lee Ilseop''s handover to the Council is cut off.\n\n**Intervention.** The player can cross-check the proposal receipt slot with Bak Doyun, or also record in the next shift ledger the time of a message delayed in the frozen passage.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −20 | Openness 30 | Force −10 | Material 35 | Communal 35 | Principle 10 | Publicity 45 | Qualification 40 | Dispersion 10 | Transformation 15\n- Desires: Craving 15 | Monopoly 10 | Risk −15 | Display −20 | Persistence 5 | Orientation: Fluid | Bonding: None\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K998","name":"I Ilseop","courtId":"court:K998","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Bak Doyun","type":"Command","to":"I Ilseop","basis":"Serves as Lee Ilseop''s direct courier, in charge of delivering messages and confirming receipt"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0425","name":"박도윤","title":"작업반 전령","position":"작업반 전령","characterId":"K425","rank":"","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"환승 전갈 전달","gender":"남성","stage":"S4","state":"free-city","stateName":"자유도시","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-박도윤","detailRoute":"/people/person-0425","birthDate":"2082-07-05","birthday":"07-05","age":44,"ageAsOf"