est":"clan-crests/b958-bb38-d654-67f3.svg"},"generation":"opening","minors":false,"sourceKind":"proposal","values":{"Authority":-10,"Openness":-10,"Force":5,"Material":35,"Communal":50,"Principle":5,"Public":20,"Eligibility":40,"Dispersed":25,"Transformative":10},"desire":{"Longing":45,"Monopoly":-30,"Risk":-25,"Display":-20,"Sustained":-5,"Orientation":"Reason","Union":"None"},"fields":{"Affiliation":"Free City","Livelihood":"Guard & Patrol","Rank":"Guild Member","Title":"Power Device Patrol","Work Location":"Oryu 2-dong. Ryu Donghyeon passes the patrol records of the power unit at Oryu 2-dong First Sub-Workshop to I Ilseop. If he finds a power fault in front of the ice-blocked handover door, he writes down the guard cipher tag and the time of occurrence, but leaves grain stock and ration decisions to his successor.","Values":"Authority −10 | Openness −10 | Force 5 | Material 35 | Communal 50 | Principle 5 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 40 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 10","Desires":"Craving 45 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −25 | Display −20 | Persistence −5 | Orientation Opposite sex | Union None"},"sections":{"Life":"Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Amsa guard post. The Power Unit Patrol post opened after he caught an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- Work location: Oryu 2-dong. Ryu Donghyeon passes the patrol records of the power unit at Oryu 2-dong First Sub-Workshop to I Ilseop. If he finds a power fault in front of the ice-blocked handover door, he writes down the guard cipher tag and the time of occurrence, but leaves grain stock and ration decisions to his successor.","Offices":"Rank: Member. Title: Power Unit Patrol. If he finds a power fault in front of the ice-blocked handover door, he writes down the guard cipher tag and the time of occurrence, but leaves grain stock and ration decisions to his successor.","Anecdote":"When the initial report turned out to be wrong during the 2125 bridge raid drill, he reopened the observation car. Because of this, his signature for the Power Unit Patrol post was entered in the ledger.","Relationships":"Ryu Donghyeon is I Ilseop''s direct guard, in charge of power unit patrols and anomaly reports.","Ambition":"Ryu Donghyeon intends to record power faults at the First Sub-Workshop with the time of occurrence and guard records, and report them to I Ilseop in time.","Fear":"That, because a power fault was not reported in time, the First Sub-Workshop''s guard records and the state of its work area fall out of agreement.","Intervention":"The player can join Ryu Donghyeon in writing down the time of the power fault in front of the frozen handover door and report it to I Ilseop, or cross-check the guard cipher tag records."},"biography":"Ryu Donghyeon reports power faults but leaves grain stock and ration judgments to I Ilseop.\n\n- Affiliation: Free City\n- Occupation: Guard and patrol\n- Rank: Member\n- Title: Power Unit Patrol\n**Life.** Generation of 2126. Grew up at the Amsa guard post. The Power Unit Patrol post opened after he caught an unauthorized night river crossing.\n- Work location: Oryu 2-dong. Ryu Donghyeon passes the patrol records of the power unit at Oryu 2-dong First Sub-Workshop to I Ilseop. If he finds a power fault in front of the ice-blocked handover door, he writes down the guard cipher tag and the time of occurrence, but leaves grain stock and ration decisions to his successor.\n\n**Office.** Rank: Member. Title: Power Unit Patrol. If he finds a power fault in front of the ice-blocked handover door, he writes down the guard cipher tag and the time of occurrence, but leaves grain stock and ration decisions to his successor.\n\n**Anecdote.** When the initial report turned out to be wrong during the 2125 bridge raid drill, he reopened the observation car. Because of this, his signature for the Power Unit Patrol post was entered in the ledger.\n\n**Relations.** Ryu Donghyeon is I Ilseop''s direct guard, in charge of power unit patrols and anomaly reports.\n\n**Ambition.** Ryu Donghyeon intends to record power faults at the First Sub-Workshop with the time of occurrence and guard records, and report them to I Ilseop in time.\n\n**Fear.** That, because a power fault was not reported in time, the First Sub-Workshop''s guard records and the state of its work area fall out of agreement.\n\n**Intervention.** The player can join Ryu Donghyeon in writing down the time of the power fault in front of the frozen handover door and report it to I Ilseop, or cross-check the guard cipher tag records.\n\n::: details Appendix — Ledger Numbers\n\n- Values: Authority −10 | Openness −10 | Force 5 | Material 35 | Communal 50 | Principle 5 | Publicity 20 | Qualification 40 | Decentralization 25 | Transformation 10\n- Desires: Craving 45 | Monopoly −30 | Risk −25 | Display −20 | Persistence −5 | Orientation Opposite sex | Union None\n:::","directLiege":{"personId":"K998","name":"I Ilseop","courtId":"court:K998","effectiveYear":2126},"relations":{"outgoing":[{"from":"Ryu Donghyeon","type":"Command","to":"I Ilseop","basis":"Direct guard of I Ilseop, in charge of power unit patrols and anomaly reports"}],"incoming":[]}}', '{"id":"person-0441","name":"류동현","title":"전력장치 순찰대 · 동작구 영주","position":"전력장치 순찰대 · 동작구 영주","characterId":"K441","rank":"영주","commonTier":"T3","occupation":"경비·순찰","gender":"여성","stage":"S4","state":"geography:duchy:11590","stateName":"동작구","sourceRoute":"/world/Cast-State-02#인물-류동현","detailRoute":"/people/person-0441","birthDate":"2083-12-17","birthday":"12-17","age":43,"ageAsOf":"2126-12-31","sourceStatus":"owner-authored","proseContacts":[],"household":{"personFaith":"unknown","houseFaith":"unknown","humanoidAdmission":"deferred"},"characterProfile":{"abilities":{"diplomacy":{"base":6,"effective":6},"martial":{"base":7,"effective":7},"stewardship":{"base":8,"effective":8},"intrigue":{"base":10,"effective":10},"learning":{"base":8,"effective":8},"prowess":{"base":4,"effective":4}},"skills":[{"id":"k441-training-report-review","name":"훈련 보고 재검토","rating":45}],"traits":[{"id":"k441-action-priority","name":"오보를 다시 연다","description":"2125년 교량 습격 훈련에서 최초 보고가 틀리자 참관 칸을 다시 열었다.","behavior":"2125년 교량 습격 훈련에서 최초 보고가 틀리자 참관 칸을 다시 열었다.","stress":"전력장치 순찰대 당직이 비면 규격맹의 통행이 강국 볼모가 되는 것.","relationship":"같은 생활권 선배 당직과 인수인계로 묶인다.","effects":[]},{"id":"k441-bounded-handover","name":"기록으로 잇는 당직","description":"열쇠와 기록을 다음 당직에 넘기며 권한을 늘리지 않는다.","behavior":"열쇠와 기록을 다음 당직에 넘기며 권한을 늘리지 않는다.","stress":"전력장치 순찰대 당직이 비면 규격맹의 통행이 강국 볼모가 되는 것.","relationship":"같은 생활권 선배 당직과 인수인계로 묶인다.","effects":[]}],"narrative":"2125년 교량 습격 훈련에서 최초 보고가 틀리자 참관 칸을 다시 열었다. 짧은 행위와 인수인계가 근거여서 다른 분야의 숙련이나 보정은 발급하지 않았다.","health":{"status":"unassessed","bodyParts":[{"id":"left-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-arm","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"left-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"right-leg","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"head","severity":null,"function":null},{"id":"torso","severity":null,"function":null}],"diseases":[]}},"politicalIdentities":[{"id":"title:barony-chungcheong-4420025000","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"barony","holderPersonId":"K441","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:duchy-chungcheong-k998","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:chungcheong-4420025000","directLiegePersonId":"K998"}],"directOwnership":false},{"id":"title:barony-chungcheong-4420025300","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"barony","holderPersonId":"K441","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:duchy-chungcheong-k998","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:chungcheong-4420025300","directLiegePersonId":"K998"}],"directOwnership":false},{"id":"title:barony-chungcheong-4420031000","kind":"nonterritorial-political-identity","rank":"barony","holderPersonId":"K441","stateId":"S02","politicalParentTitleId":"title:duchy-chungcheong-k998","personalLieges":[{"holdingId":"holding:chungcheong-4420031000","directLiegePersonId":"K998"}],"directOwnership":false},{"id"